@ 10:07am....cost me $1.15 first class  :grin: \r\nthe Delivery Confirmation # is:\r\n03047990000415738341\r\n\r\n[b:7aeec84993]take your time sending me mine....I mean it!! [/b:7aeec84993] :) \r\n\r\nI have had many surgeries including a knee replacement, got shot in the left knee in a convienient store robbery....so I know what its like.\r\n\r\nI figured out I\'m only 4 hours away from you...and I gots some ppls in St.Louis....we\'ll have to race or somethin\'..... 8) \r\n\r\nagain....no rush...and just to let you know....I\'m workin a deal right now to get us both an 8-ball and a Big Spooky....yeah thats right...I\'m a pimp...don\'t get \'em anywhere else till I let you know.......\r\n\r\npeace[/quote:7aeec84993]\r\ndamn dude, with all the medication all I can say is you fuckin rock home-boy. thanks for understanding.\r\nsounds like you been through some crazy shit too!\r\nand hell yea, let me know whenever you plan a trip to st. louis - I gots the ghetto track all ready!\r\n\r\ntalk to ya soon playa');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2594,'c970155a90','What up dog?\r\n\r\nKwik got his Gloria today....you still want the clear one?....if not I\'m gonna start masking it soon.....I still want the Accord and the rims....if you want more than the Gloria...let me know...I got $$, bodies...2.2s, tires, heatsinks...etc....\r\npeace......'),(8691,'581466ddbb','That\'s cool, I think Richie hooded me up but I\'m okay now.\r\n\r\nI just talked to Smack &amp; Richie (admins) about our Car Of Da Week post I want to do and they have no problem with me borrowing pics from their site.  So is it a go?  Just something I wanna do to spice things up a lil.\r\n\r\nThanx'),(6910,'7f083dbf62','i know :-D they are kinda chinsey tho. i prefer bit chassis with clone pcbs.'),(6880,'33b750a56a','[quote:33b750a56a=\"Watch_Yo_Back\"]Hey I see that your good at this stuff if I sent you one of my cars would you do the mod for me?\r\n\r\nI tried it before and ruined the car Ill pay you if you want but if you would I owuld be very happy or I would buy a car off you that you did it too thanks.[/quote:33b750a56a]right now I\'d rather not - I don\'t usually sell my cars or offer up my services, there\'s just too many hassles for both sides to deal with. I might eventually start offering my services or selling modified cars, but until then - I\'m affraid the best I can offer you is advice.\r\n- CaboWabo'),(2597,'6bd499fe39','Hell yeah dude...  I\'m all over that Gloria..  Sorry for the delayed reply, but it\'s not easy being a pimp... LOL\r\n\r\nI drive a limo for a job, and it\'s crazy hours..  What other bodies you got to trade?  The only reason I ask is cause you pretty much have to drop $15 on a clone to get those rims..  \r\n\r\nI\'ll just send you the body, and the rims, and you toss in something with the Gloria..\r\n\r\nIs that cool?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2598,'5de0e327fd','Hey.....I understand about tha crazy hours...I work 7days a week..3 jobs....ridiculous....the only cool thing is at my full time job I work @ night and have access to a computer...friday-monday...7pm-5am \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\ncheck my pics and tell me which body/bodies you want...if you need parts ..holla....\r\nI already sent Cabo the clear WRX and the clear RX-7......other than that...whatever you want...check my yahoo pics....I knew them rims were $$...they\'re off tha hook.....\r\n\r\nhttp://www.PictureTrail.com/gid2173555\r\n\r\nI got some Homies too, if you need any......\r\n\r\nhttp://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=659\r\n\r\nhit me back....\r\nwith an address too...heres mine, don\'t remember if I gave it to you yet:\r\n\r\nWayne Simard\r\n1422 West Monon Drive\r\nBloomington, IN 47403\r\n\r\n\r\nI hate livin here....I\'m from tha city...representin\' Boston....'),(2970,'39c94c7220','No problem man I can be patient when I gotta. I erased the pm with your address so shoot it over to me again man. :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2971,'39c94c7220','No problem man I can be patient when I gotta. I erased the pm with your address so shoot it over to me again man. :-)'),(2600,'f462ca646f','Yeah I know.....I\'m da man....and that went thru...as soon as I get \'em, I\'ll be shippin you out 8-Ball and Big Spooky.....\r\nYou owe me good for this one...\r\nI am the finder of lost treasure \r\n:grin:\r\n\r\nOh yeah....did I tell you I sent Kwik his Gloria body in a T.P roll?\r\ntaped up the ends...shipped it out....he told me he laughed for 5 mins....\r\npeace.....'),(2810,'6a7c606956','Ready to get me some of those rims yet? I need a couple sets of the 5 spoke. PLEASE!'),(4259,'4e826f5eb3','[quote:4e826f5eb3=\"noxorc\"]Oh well I should offer the other solution...\r\n\r\nyou want your money back? $50 beans back in your pocket? Just an option?\r\n\r\nI didn\'t think so... I can tell.    as I said in the thread, I put a piece of black vinal in the PKG.\r\n\r\n-n[/quote:4e826f5eb3]\r\nyea, you keep the $50! lol\r\nI want my rims :lol: \r\nhaven\'t seen the post yet, gonna go check her now.'),(2969,'ccdd9f53c1','lol no shit.\r\nI got it.\r\n\r\nseriously, I\'m wondering why they didn\'t deliver, it had to have an address on there or UPS would of even taken it in the first place whenever they originally scanned the label. weird.\r\nsucks that everytime I\'ve shipped to you, some how there\'s been a delay on my end and you getting the stuff.\r\nI\'m even using UPS instead of the PO! lol\r\n\r\nI\'ll give you the new, new tracking number when the package comes back and I ship it back out.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10808,'4b483bb1f1','hay cabo-\r\n\r\nGot this Skyline ready to mail, but i want to confirm your address. The return label from the homie yo sent me says:\r\n\r\n11822 Borman Drive\r\nSt. Louis, MO 63146\r\n\r\nIs that correct? Lemme know soon and I\'ll get it out today.'),(2608,'31887538f0','[quote:31887538f0=\"Havok\"]Yeah I know.....I\'m da man....and that went thru...as soon as I get \'em, I\'ll be shippin you out 8-Ball and Big Spooky.....\r\nYou owe me good for this one...\r\nI am the finder of lost treasure \r\n:grin:\r\n\r\nOh yeah....did I tell you I sent Kwik his Gloria body in a T.P roll?\r\ntaped up the ends...shipped it out....he told me he laughed for 5 mins....\r\npeace.....[/quote:31887538f0]\r\n\r\n :D  :cool: \r\n\r\nT.P. roll, that\'s funny, nox sent me some shit that looked like a brick of cocaine. I sent sessiz 2 homies, they didn\'t get there so I had to resend another set and had em boxed up in a fuckin toaster oven box with bubble wrap! lol nice huge box for 2 little ole homies.\r\n\r\nwe\'re all cooked :lol:'),(2609,'70bd010779','I have a hard time deciding too..  We\'re alot alike..  Just suprise me, and toos something in with it..\r\n\r\nI\'ll send out the goods mañana..  Here\'s my addy.\r\n\r\nSteve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn Lake circle south Apt C\r\nSt. Petersburg FL 33712\r\n\r\nThanks man...   -Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2610,'457b208e8e','[quote:457b208e8e=\"Stoli\"]Ney man ! sry to keep buggin ya but your the only guy I know that gets paid to do WWW shit so your opinion reall counts.\r\n\r\nCheck out\r\n\r\nhttp://members.rogers.com/stoli and tell me what you think.\r\n\r\nTook me like 3 hours just to get it to save properly!  :cool:\r\n\r\nIf ya could try all the links and make sure they work and the frames work etc etc ! Thanx Dood![/quote:457b208e8e]\r\nI didn\'t go to town, I can\'t concentrate, but everything looked and worked fine for me'),(2613,'70bd010779','I have a hard time deciding too..  We\'re alot alike..  Just suprise me, and toos something in with it..\r\n\r\nI\'ll send out the goods mañana..  Here\'s my addy.\r\n\r\nSteve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn Lake circle south Apt C\r\nSt. Petersburg FL 33712\r\n\r\nThanks man...   -Steve'),(2614,'31887538f0','[quote:31887538f0=\"Havok\"]Yeah I know.....I\'m da man....and that went thru...as soon as I get \'em, I\'ll be shippin you out 8-Ball and Big Spooky.....\r\nYou owe me good for this one...\r\nI am the finder of lost treasure \r\n:grin:\r\n\r\nOh yeah....did I tell you I sent Kwik his Gloria body in a T.P roll?\r\ntaped up the ends...shipped it out....he told me he laughed for 5 mins....\r\npeace.....[/quote:31887538f0]\r\n\r\n :D  :cool: \r\n\r\nT.P. roll, that\'s funny, nox sent me some shit that looked like a brick of cocaine. I sent sessiz 2 homies, they didn\'t get there so I had to resend another set and had em boxed up in a fuckin toaster oven box with bubble wrap! lol nice huge box for 2 little ole homies.\r\n\r\nwe\'re all cooked :lol:'),(2615,'008c2b8c3a','Dog,\r\nI used to live in Florida....1st Ft.Lauderdale, 2nd Naples, 3rd Orlando.....and I was born and raised in LYNN Massachusetts.......I plan on moving back to Florida eventually....(gotta convince the wife)... I hate Indiana.... :( \r\n\r\nI got sumptin fo you.......I think you\'ll like it....and its hard to find....rare and shit... you be  :-D ....\r\nI\'ll send yours out tomorrow too...\r\n\r\npeace..........');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2616,'c18d63d867','yo just decided to sign up to the site and when i checked my conformation email heliman86@fastmail.ca i saw you wrote somethin to me. i\'m sorry about how long it\'s taken to say anything back well it\'s only been like 10 days but hell if i didn\'t signup to this site it coulda been months. but the only thing i use that addy for is stuff like conformation emails and anytime i signup to any site that may start spammin. in the letta you mentioned that babykilla posted a busted pic of you\'re bb, if it\'s the pic i\'m thinking of i didn\'t mean for it to get public. i only posted it in the amc thread and linked to it on my web space (i guess he lurks the amc thread). well i don got anything against you hell i like you\'re work and you also.\r\n\r\nps. you said that you wanted to pm me on another issue? if you wanna reach me via msn i\'m at heliman86@hotmail.com\r\n-^-_-^'),(2617,'4921a8d25e','It\'s all good Pimp!\r\n\r\nHe actually posted a Pic of my 1st bB (with tires smokin&amp; tailpipes flamin) burnin in flames.  He copied the Pic and set it on fire.  I PM\'d him bout it.  Told him I live about 25 minute from him, if it happens again, I\'ll have to meet him in Da Alley!\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=313&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight=mug%20shots&amp;start=195\r\n\r\nHolla Atcha Soon!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (4164,'f099361265','about a month together working on and off the s2000 has shaved door handles and accepts Zip Zap wings one included\r\n\r\ni took extra care in the Rx-7 because that chamelion mid coat is very soft i used drafting tape as not to tear the soft mid coat while detailing and then applied a durable clear coat'),(2619,'0d7f694e43','I don\'t have enough space to host,\r\n\r\ndo yo want... Tone Loc\r\nwild thing\r\nFunky old medina\r\ncheeba cheeba\r\nthe Homies                \r\n\r\n-n'),(4513,'e1fcf12bad','Hi, I still havnt recieved the prize. Is there a way i could perhaps track it? Sorry to bother... :lol:'),(4514,'b24ff15b5e','Hey man.... \r\nSorry I didn\'t get back atcha sooner...life is hectic :eek: \r\n\r\nI finally found a computer at work that I could see your videos on...they\'re tight...I like the one where you went up the ramp, flipped, landed right side up, took off and came back just to crash into the wall....I was hoping for a reverse flip and upright landing :driving: \r\n\r\nI don\'t know how long I\'ll have access to this particular computer, but I\'ll be able to see movies now...at least for a little while  :grin:\r\n\r\n\r\nI thought about your dual cell Thunder Charger idea.....at first I thought it would be better to go with a Bit to dual....but I like the internal antenna of the TC....I have plenty of 1/4AAA....so if you want....dual cell me a TC and I can send you more batts.....I can get them real easy now...Todd @ Extreme Micros is 1-1/2 hours away from me...very cool...or I can send you a chassis with batts. to dual, either way...pm me if you want to or have the time to do this...and we\'ll work out the fine print.. 8-)'),(4356,'331db63c8a','Got the homie today, mang.   :eek:  \r\n\r\nnow dat is one cool homie.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get chef.  (Everybody want\'s some!)\r\n\r\nProps, biggun.   :cool: \r\n\r\nLates,   :D \r\n\r\nDoc');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (4357,'331db63c8a','Got the homie today, mang.   :eek:  \r\n\r\nnow dat is one cool homie.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get chef.  (Everybody want\'s some!)\r\n\r\nProps, biggun.   :cool: \r\n\r\nLates,   :D \r\n\r\nDoc'),(4358,'4c20fde55f','[quote:4c20fde55f=\"lovedoctor\"]Got the homie today, mang.   :eek:  \r\n\r\nnow dat is one cool homie.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get chef.  (Everybody want\'s some!)\r\n\r\nProps, biggun.   :cool: \r\n\r\nLates,   :D \r\n\r\nDoc[/quote:4c20fde55f]\r\ncool mang, glad ya like him.\r\nI\'ll let ya know when the chef gets here.'),(2622,'0d7f694e43','I don\'t have enough space to host,\r\n\r\ndo yo want... Tone Loc\r\nwild thing\r\nFunky old medina\r\ncheeba cheeba\r\nthe Homies                \r\n\r\n-n'),(2657,'2e742651a2','Any particular reason why you gotta buy from NKOK?\r\n\r\nI did a quick Google and found HobbyPeople has the Hummer OR Escalade with Ocean Runner for $39.99\r\n\r\nhttp://www.hobbypeople.net/mfr/nkok01.asp\r\n\r\nDo it up man...I\'m gonna have to get a pair myself, Father Day is comin and this would be KICK-ASS for my Dad and his pool.\r\n\r\nGood luck!'),(2624,'f15f4a9ffe','Should have the visa card this week from bank( im hoping) I think i explained the problem to everyone, if not heres what happened. Basically the place only takes Visa cards, no Mastercard which is what i have. They do not take paypal or western union or anything just visa so only solution was for me to get a visa debit card from my bank which im hopin will be here very soon. Prolly delayed a little from holiday. As for extras... IDB311 (sp?) cancelled his order so his styles are available and i ordered extra of different BBS loch styles as well as the ?? ( i think it was the toyota 8 loch). I would have to actually check for exacts.  Just look at the list of whos payed in the \"time to pay\" thread on page one, for idb311 styles and anyone who hasnt paid so far , there styles may be available if they donot pay for the rims within reasonable time once they are here.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (4163,'b7948ed8a3','cool man....I\'ll have kwik send yours............\r\npeace........'),(2626,'008c2b8c3a','Dog,\r\nI used to live in Florida....1st Ft.Lauderdale, 2nd Naples, 3rd Orlando.....and I was born and raised in LYNN Massachusetts.......I plan on moving back to Florida eventually....(gotta convince the wife)... I hate Indiana.... :( \r\n\r\nI got sumptin fo you.......I think you\'ll like it....and its hard to find....rare and shit... you be  :-D ....\r\nI\'ll send yours out tomorrow too...\r\n\r\npeace..........'),(2627,'f2e141308c','what up dog?\r\n\r\nI sent out your package about an hour ago....\r\nhit me back when you get it....and tell me if you like it....\r\n\r\npeace'),(2628,'f2e141308c','what up dog?\r\n\r\nI sent out your package about an hour ago....\r\nhit me back when you get it....and tell me if you like it....\r\n\r\npeace'),(2630,'aeddd48068','I\'m heading to the PO in a little bit to send yours out..  Thanks man..\r\n\r\nLet me know when you\'re ready to move back.. I\'ll get you a job if you need it..\r\n\r\nToday feels like a Sat. or Sun.  lol'),(2673,'5cc1ebb822','Nope, I get the feeling NKOK didn\'t put a lot of money in the budget for HTML man...Pretty goddamned ammature shit if you ask me.\r\n\r\nRule of thumb though, you usually don\'t get the best price from the Manufacturers site, it tends to put retailers off from buying shit from them...If you see what I\'m sayin.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2634,'049e4562b3','Did you ever get that combo? I want to buy it this week, but my dumb ass can\'t figure out how to register on this site so it gives me a price..\r\n\r\nhttp://www.nkok.com/productdetl.asp?pid=153&amp;catscale=1:64\r\n\r\nAm I missing something here? Like a secret handshake or something?\r\n\r\nI\'d really like to purchase 2 or 3.. Can you help a fellow pimp out on the down low???\r\nThanks man\r\n-Steve'),(2635,'178b70d5bf','[quote:178b70d5bf=\"noxorc\"]I don\'t have enough space to host,\r\n\r\ndo yo want... Tone Loc\r\nwild thing\r\nFunky old medina\r\ncheeba cheeba\r\nthe Homies                \r\n\r\n-n[/quote:178b70d5bf]\r\nI don\'t understand, for the bitPimps Radio?'),(2636,'d25f84e252','[quote:d25f84e252=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:d25f84e252=\"noxorc\"]I don\'t have enough space to host,\r\n\r\ndo yo want... Tone Loc\r\nwild thing\r\nFunky old medina\r\ncheeba cheeba\r\nthe Homies                \r\n\r\n-n[/quote:d25f84e252]\r\nI don\'t understand, for the bitPimps Radio?[/quote:d25f84e252]\r\n\r\nsorry, yea...for the bitradio...\r\nI never really listen to \"the Homies\"....it fits us...\r\n\r\n\r\ncheeba....cheeba.....got that cheeba...'),(2637,'d25f84e252','[quote:d25f84e252=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:d25f84e252=\"noxorc\"]I don\'t have enough space to host,\r\n\r\ndo yo want... Tone Loc\r\nwild thing\r\nFunky old medina\r\ncheeba cheeba\r\nthe Homies                \r\n\r\n-n[/quote:d25f84e252]\r\nI don\'t understand, for the bitPimps Radio?[/quote:d25f84e252]\r\n\r\nsorry, yea...for the bitradio...\r\nI never really listen to \"the Homies\"....it fits us...\r\n\r\n\r\ncheeba....cheeba.....got that cheeba...');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2639,'cd1aa287b3','let\'s do it then!\r\nI\'ll try and find the song on Kazaa and put it up in the next playlist.'),(2640,'6e26758f84','[quote:6e26758f84=\"CaboWabo\"]let\'s do it then!\r\nI\'ll try and find the song on Kazaa and put it up in the next playlist.[/quote:6e26758f84]\r\n\r\n\r\nI have the WIndow\'s media player version. if you want it.. whole albumn'),(2641,'6e26758f84','[quote:6e26758f84=\"CaboWabo\"]let\'s do it then!\r\nI\'ll try and find the song on Kazaa and put it up in the next playlist.[/quote:6e26758f84]\r\n\r\n\r\nI have the WIndow\'s media player version. if you want it.. whole albumn'),(2656,'2e742651a2','Any particular reason why you gotta buy from NKOK?\r\n\r\nI did a quick Google and found HobbyPeople has the Hummer OR Escalade with Ocean Runner for $39.99\r\n\r\nhttp://www.hobbypeople.net/mfr/nkok01.asp\r\n\r\nDo it up man...I\'m gonna have to get a pair myself, Father Day is comin and this would be KICK-ASS for my Dad and his pool.\r\n\r\nGood luck!'),(2643,'3ae025f9c0','are they .wmv or .wma files or something?\r\nI\'ll need the .mp3 versions');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2644,'4957e293e8','[quote:4957e293e8=\"CaboWabo\"]are they .wmv or .wma files or something?\r\nI\'ll need the .mp3 versions[/quote:4957e293e8]\r\n\r\nthey are .wma\'s....I\'ll see about converting them over to .mp3.\r\n\r\n-n'),(2645,'4957e293e8','[quote:4957e293e8=\"CaboWabo\"]are they .wmv or .wma files or something?\r\nI\'ll need the .mp3 versions[/quote:4957e293e8]\r\n\r\nthey are .wma\'s....I\'ll see about converting them over to .mp3.\r\n\r\n-n'),(2647,'c5391c0d2d','cool, lemme know.'),(2650,'84ff7ef013','What\'s up dude.... Welcome to the forums... I also live in St. Pete.. Where are you?\r\n\r\n\r\npayaso :D'),(2651,'358b49ff0d','I\'ve got:\r\nWild Thing\r\nFunky Cold Medina\r\nCheeba Cheeba\r\nBust A Move\r\nAce Is In The House\r\n\r\n\r\nneed the others, wanna hear that \"homies\" song.'),(2652,'a7a043ffbf','i\'m downtown st. pete like 6 blocks from baywalk i noticed somewhere you said you were talking about this area which is one of the reasons i joined this crazy forum'),(2754,'e7cfde8de9','[quote:e7cfde8de9=\"DarkTari\"]Hey C-Dub\r\n\r\nHaving a problem FTP\'ing files. I know it\'s something that I\'m not doing.\r\n\r\nI have Windows XP.  Got this from NOX:\r\n\r\nBut, I believe, and I can check with cabo.\r\nYou should have your own ftp area on lixlink.com.\r\nftp://darktari.lixlink.com/\r\nhttp://darktari.lixlink.com/   &lt;-- this didn\'t fail..so I think so.\r\n\r\njust need to get the password from cabo.\r\n\r\nfrom your file explorer or internet explorer, type in...\r\nftp://darktari:password@lixlink.com   (note the : (colon)  between your\r\nusername and password)\r\nthen click on sub-directory \"Web\"\r\nthen drag and drop any files you want into this window.\r\n\r\nfiles will be availabile to view on the web\r\nhttp://darktari.lixlink.com/filename.(html,jpg.gif,wmv,etc)\r\n\r\nIs this the proper proceedure.  I get to this directory but when I drag file, pic shows up on an MSN screen but not in directory. What am I doing wrong????\r\n\r\nThanx[/quote:e7cfde8de9]\r\nIt could be a limitation of the MSN browser, I\'m not sure, it should work if you are inside the \"web\" directory and drag a file into the browser window.\r\nI\'m guessing that your MSN browser is seeing you drag this file in to the the browser window and just thinks you want to open the file, so it does and you see the picture. In your address bar, you probably see the path to this file you see, on your hard drive.\r\n\r\nYou have a bunch of options as far as being able to FTP, it\'s just up to you to  pick which ever you feel is the easiest and makes you the most comfortable. Here\'s a few other options you can try, or if you don\'t like these options or have trouble with them, PM me back and we\'ll keep going till we get it working for you how you like it. (like Burger King or somethin) :lol: \r\n\r\n- Instead of using your MSN browser, use your Internet Explorer browser.\r\n- Instead of using your MSN browser, use an FTP program like CuteFTP, DreamWeaver, etc.\r\n- Instead of using your MSN browser, use DOS command prompt to FTP (this is by far the hardest way to ftp because everything is a manual and typed command, you have to know the commands to talk to the computer)\r\n\r\nlet me know how you fare and if you need help with anything or need other options or whatever - we can get you FTPing no doubt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2654,'bf947956f3','[quote:bf947956f3=\"CaboWabo\"]I\'ve got:\r\nWild Thing\r\nFunky Cold Medina\r\nCheeba Cheeba\r\nBust A Move\r\nAce Is In The House\r\n\r\n\r\nneed the others, wanna hear that \"homies\" song.[/quote:bf947956f3]\r\n\r\nso I don\'t need to convert? just downloaded the tool.\r\n\r\npersonally, I like (wildthing, funky cold, cheeba, homies)\r\nI don\'t know the other two.\r\n\r\nDo what you want...I just thought on your next round of change\r\nyou could include ONE of these..'),(2658,'bf947956f3','[quote:bf947956f3=\"CaboWabo\"]I\'ve got:\r\nWild Thing\r\nFunky Cold Medina\r\nCheeba Cheeba\r\nBust A Move\r\nAce Is In The House\r\n\r\n\r\nneed the others, wanna hear that \"homies\" song.[/quote:bf947956f3]\r\n\r\nso I don\'t need to convert? just downloaded the tool.\r\n\r\npersonally, I like (wildthing, funky cold, cheeba, homies)\r\nI don\'t know the other two.\r\n\r\nDo what you want...I just thought on your next round of change\r\nyou could include ONE of these..'),(2685,'010e7e1717','[quote:010e7e1717=\"payaso\"]\r\n\r\nI even have some car kits from time to time.. Tomy Bit Char-G\r\n\r\nLet me know what kind of motors you want.. All the motors I have are bad to the bone, and run awesome..\r\n\r\nWe should race in my tennis courts  Let me know...  I\'m glad to see some local people getting involved with this hobby..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:010e7e1717]\r\n\r\ncar kits as in actual cars as of right now i don\'t want to get any motors from you cause i don\'t actually have anything but once i start going with these bad boys i\'ll be ringin you');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2672,'be67c7bcc4','[quote:be67c7bcc4=\"CaboWabo\"]yea dude, for sure.\r\n\r\nno I still need you to convert at least the \"homies\" song. I don\'t have that one. I was just trying to make life easier for you by downloading the mp3s before you had to convert them all, this way you only have to convert a few.[/quote:be67c7bcc4]\r\n\r\n\r\nok...i\'ll convert the homies song.'),(2660,'40a459c08d','LOL... that\'s crazy. I live on 54th ave S.. by the beach.. I was just at Bay Walk..  How old are you? I\'m 29..\r\n\r\nWhere did you hear about us?'),(2661,'312be1d18b','[quote:312be1d18b=\"Namuna\"]Any particular reason why you gotta buy from NKOK?\r\n\r\nI did a quick Google and found HobbyPeople has the Hummer OR Escalade with Ocean Runner for $39.99\r\n\r\nhttp://www.hobbypeople.net/mfr/nkok01.asp\r\n\r\nDo it up man...I\'m gonna have to get a pair myself, Father Day is comin and this would be KICK-ASS for my Dad and his pool.\r\n\r\nGood luck![/quote:312be1d18b]\r\n\r\nNKOK were the only place I could find.. I thought they might have the best price.. I fuond one on eGay for $29, but I couldn\'t hit the buy button in time...lol\r\n\r\nI\'m getting one of those bad boys..  \r\n\r\nDid you figure out how to register on NKOK?  I\'m slippin today..\r\nThanks for the link dude..'),(3168,'0043828abf','so what do u have for bits??? :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2663,'655e163672','i\'m 16 i go to school at lakewood on 54th ave south'),(2665,'828caaed9f','i heard about all this sutff about a year ago from ign.com and i just now bought my first one its an lxx modelista supra i haven\'t gotten it yet though :( i got a r spec motor and 160 mah battery on the way too'),(2666,'65e5540962','yea dude, for sure.\r\n\r\nno I still need you to convert at least the \"homies\" song. I don\'t have that one. I was just trying to make life easier for you by downloading the mp3s before you had to convert them all, this way you only have to convert a few.'),(2753,'f05ee4ea3b','[quote:f05ee4ea3b=\"Havok\"]What up Dog?\r\n\r\ncoolness yo......I\'ll let you know when they get to the heezey....do the same....peace........... :cool:[/quote:f05ee4ea3b]\r\ncoo - will do mang. :D'),(2669,'be67c7bcc4','[quote:be67c7bcc4=\"CaboWabo\"]yea dude, for sure.\r\n\r\nno I still need you to convert at least the \"homies\" song. I don\'t have that one. I was just trying to make life easier for you by downloading the mp3s before you had to convert them all, this way you only have to convert a few.[/quote:be67c7bcc4]\r\n\r\n\r\nok...i\'ll convert the homies song.'),(2670,'5cc1ebb822','Nope, I get the feeling NKOK didn\'t put a lot of money in the budget for HTML man...Pretty goddamned ammature shit if you ask me.\r\n\r\nRule of thumb though, you usually don\'t get the best price from the Manufacturers site, it tends to put retailers off from buying shit from them...If you see what I\'m sayin.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2674,'b2c4ae1cbf','Cool man... I live right next to that school in Lynn Lake Apartments..\r\n\r\nDo you drive to school?   Did you hear about us in another forum?'),(2675,'0d6d7e1afa','[quote:0d6d7e1afa=\"stergh\"]i heard about all this sutff about a year ago from ign.com and i just now bought my first one its an lxx modelista supra i haven\'t gotten it yet though :( i got a r spec motor and 160 mah battery on the way too[/quote:0d6d7e1afa]\r\n\r\nIf you ever need any parts, just let me know.. I have shit loads..lol'),(2676,'8a54b96a53','alright i\'ll take you up on that i used to have a friend who lived in lynn lake apartments i gotta go catch my dog right now cause it got out brb'),(4499,'230124b8f9','Heres his address...its at the begining of the order #2 thread also..\r\n\r\nErnie Barrett \r\n1658 Cranberry Lane \r\nWarren, OH. 44483 \r\n\r\ntell you what....decide what you want....if EZ wants to put the order in before your friend/friends get here....Tell me and I\'ll order and pay for them and you can have one of your friends send me the money order when they get here and I\'ll overnite or priority mail the rims to them, you can pay me back for the shipping to them, no problem.......If shit happens, oh well I get more rims :grin:\r\n\r\nWhatcha think? Cool? 8-)'),(2679,'95387519e1','[quote:95387519e1=\"Namuna\"]Rule of thumb though, you usually don\'t get the best price from the Manufacturers site, it tends to put retailers off from buying shit from them...If you see what I\'m sayin.[/quote:95387519e1]\r\n\r\nI see, said the blind man to his deaf son....  lol  I hear that, said the deaf son..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2680,'8ba94b4112','i just got my engine i found out about you guys through the pimp car contest through tinyrc and i have no idea how i found out about tiny i just happen upon these things all the time i have my own car i actually have to go down to lakewood tomorrow for football practice'),(14507,'be592896e0','[quote:be592896e0=\"crazydave\"]Yeah you know that\'s cool with me. I gots da FETs! :cool: \r\n\r\nI never know what to ask for FET mods, so if you could just cover the shipping, and if you want to throw me anthing extra that\'s cool too. ;)\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:be592896e0]you\'re the shit dude.\r\nthanks man, you\'re helping out in a huge way...\r\n\r\nlemme let the other pimps know its a go and I\'ll get payaso to send you the chassis and either him or I will get you the shipping money and some extra.\r\n\r\nthanks again man, get back with you soon'),(3954,'5023585b7e','whasup dog?\r\n\r\nI got the guy holdin the bottle yesterday......\r\n\r\nWait till you see what I\'m doin with your decals...they are water decals right?...any special instructions?...say this out loud 3 times fast....\r\n\r\nI\'m Sofa King We Todd Did \r\n\r\nthats me. :-)'),(2683,'9fdbb87d4c','[quote:9fdbb87d4c=\"stergh\"]i just got my engine i found out about you guys through the pimp car contest through tinyrc and i have no idea how i found out about tiny i just happen upon these things all the time i have my own car i actually have to go down to lakewood tomorrow for football practice[/quote:9fdbb87d4c]\r\n\r\nI even have some car kits from time to time.. Tomy Bit Char-G\r\n\r\nLet me know what kind of motors you want.. All the motors I have are bad to the bone, and run awesome..\r\n\r\nWe should race in my tennis courts  Let me know...  I\'m glad to see some local people getting involved with this hobby..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2684,'a7be6b8bb2','damn dude my names steve too i\'ll race you actually i was planning on building a race track as soon as i get my baby and find out the turning radius and shit like that i can get a couple of my friends into i beleive we can get together and have a big bit race if it all works out what do you do for a livin mr steve'),(2689,'ba33ba1eec','[quote:ba33ba1eec=\"stergh\"]damn dude my names steve too i\'ll race you actually i was planning on building a race track as soon as i get my baby and find out the turning radius and shit like that i can get a couple of my friends into i beleive we can get together and have a big bit race if it all works out what do you do for a livin mr steve[/quote:ba33ba1eec]\r\n\r\nThat\'s funny.. I have about 20 different cars..\r\n\r\nI have a few that aren\'t open yet.. Just sittin in the box..  I drive a limo..\r\n\r\nIf we could get some people to race, that would be tight..  When is your car supposed to be here?\r\n\r\nA friend of mine is coming down from Tampa today to race..\r\n\r\nGimme a ring sometime when you wanna get a race goin..  727-906-3343\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(2724,'91a558c9da','Cool. the one I use the most is 57Mhz');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2712,'a4726d0c23','[quote:a4726d0c23=\"stergh\"]how can you have a track without hills and bridges and dips and angled curves and all that fun stuff i was thinking of something like daytona with a round oval track but then at like the middle of one of the straightaways in goes down into an actual race track and then it spits it back out on to the oval and you go around one of the big turns and then it all gets started over. that way you could have big like daytona 500 races and every like 50 laps you could make a mock pit stop where you change the rear gear and put a different shell on it or something i dont know i\'m crazy we\'ll see what we can do[/quote:a4726d0c23]\r\n\r\nExactly what I was thinking.. Something fun, and technical..'),(2691,'bc900d3b21','Once you get your car and drive it, you\'ll be hooked on them.. They\'re so addictive.. They run great, and you can modify the shit out of them too..  I\'ve got some cool customs with gold plated suspention and stuff like that..\r\n\r\nLet me know if you wanna see some pics..\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(2692,'c4c34294f7','i\'m already addicted to them and i haven\'t even driven one yet i\'m not sure i got from hong kong last tuesday i beleive i hope within the next week or two i love pictures you can just send em to me th eonly thing is the more you send me the more i\'m going to want to do so either send them all to me at once so i will be overwhelmed and will only do one or two things to them or send me your favorite one i wanna see that limo it sounds cool and prior to this i was hooked on painting models and doing crap to toys i used to own just about every gundam model kit there was back before all these new ones come out spanning all the different shows. but i\'ll call you when i get my car and we can race stock cars do you have any that haven\'t been tampered with or can you not hold yourself back');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14509,'1d5e80bdf4','[quote:1d5e80bdf4=\"micromatch\"]i accidently told you that my car was 49 mhz. i am sorryi ment to say 45 mhz. \r\n\r\nTHanks agian\r\nmicro[/quote:1d5e80bdf4]\r\n\r\nthat\'s fine, I\'ve got all the freq\'s for the controllers dude. \r\n\r\nAlso, I\'ve only seen the one payment from you.  Pimpike is wondering where his payment is.  Are you paying for him as well?   let me know when you send the chassis.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(2694,'d246bf5c94','You da man...Just got \'em dog....let me know when you get yours......\r\npeace'),(2695,'c4593bae0e','You da man...Just got \'em dog....let me know when you get yours......\r\npeace'),(2696,'44713c79db','and about the track my dad is an electrician and i have like an endless supply of wood and tools and i\'m on summer break looking for a job so i have nothing better to do so i should have a nice sized track by the end of june or so so we can get our groove on in something a lil more curvy do you have any track ideas or thoughts i\'m thinking almost about not even putting up big walls and stuff cause it would be fun racing on a track like a real racetrack where you can\'t bounce off the walls and keep going but have to actually slow down maybe put like astroturf on the parts that aren\'t roadways\' i don\'t know whats your opinion on stuff like this'),(2699,'4921a8d25e','It\'s all good Pimp!\r\n\r\nHe actually posted a Pic of my 1st bB (with tires smokin&amp; tailpipes flamin) burnin in flames.  He copied the Pic and set it on fire.  I PM\'d him bout it.  Told him I live about 25 minute from him, if it happens again, I\'ll have to meet him in Da Alley!\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=313&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight=mug%20shots&amp;start=195\r\n\r\nHolla Atcha Soon!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2700,'20101ea36b','I have plenty of stock cars.. I only mod a few, so if I wanna have a fair race, I still have cars to race with..    I have every motor from a 1.0 to a 3.8..\r\n\r\nWe\'ll get your car runnin great..  I\'d also like to build a track.. The tennis courts work perfect cause the lines are already marked...\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(2701,'4df4b8bc34','do you draw a race track with chalk or do you just drive around the edges and have like drag races?'),(2726,'d07b991b5f','I use MSN, or ICQ.. My ICQ # is 161401045\r\n\r\nMy msn is alxdav420@hotmail.com'),(2727,'804607dbee','i\'ll get a new icq number its been a while since i used it i actually like it better but i dont know to many people who use it so i moved away from it'),(2704,'cc273f66ef','As long as you have some kind of barrier to keep the cars on the track. It works..\r\n\r\nI\'ll help you build a track. I\'ve got some ideas flowin in my head.. We should put some hills in it too.. My cars climb like a mo fo..lol'),(2747,'fc68c69c7c','Hey C-Dub\r\n\r\nHaving a problem FTP\'ing files. I know it\'s something that I\'m not doing.\r\n\r\nI have Windows XP.  Got this from NOX:\r\n\r\nBut, I believe, and I can check with cabo.\r\nYou should have your own ftp area on lixlink.com.\r\nftp://darktari.lixlink.com/\r\nhttp://darktari.lixlink.com/   &lt;-- this didn\'t fail..so I think so.\r\n\r\njust need to get the password from cabo.\r\n\r\nfrom your file explorer or internet explorer, type in...\r\nftp://darktari:password@lixlink.com   (note the : (colon)  between your\r\nusername and password)\r\nthen click on sub-directory \"Web\"\r\nthen drag and drop any files you want into this window.\r\n\r\nfiles will be availabile to view on the web\r\nhttp://darktari.lixlink.com/filename.(html,jpg.gif,wmv,etc)\r\n\r\nIs this the proper proceedure.  I get to this directory but when I drag file, pic shows up on an MSN screen but not in directory. What am I doing wrong????\r\n\r\nThanx');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2706,'dae8fcd806','how can you have a track without hills and bridges and dips and angled curves and all that fun stuff i was thinking of something like daytona with a round oval track but then at like the middle of one of the straightaways in goes down into an actual race track and then it spits it back out on to the oval and you go around one of the big turns and then it all gets started over. that way you could have big like daytona 500 races and every like 50 laps you could make a mock pit stop where you change the rear gear and put a different shell on it or something i dont know i\'m crazy we\'ll see what we can do'),(2707,'5525682bb1','[quote:5525682bb1=\"stergh\"]do you draw a race track with chalk or do you just drive around the edges and have like drag races?[/quote:5525682bb1]\r\n\r\nRight now I just set up little obstacle courses, and try to drive through them with out hittin anything..\r\n\r\nSometimes we set up like a battle course to see who can knock who out of the ring.. Like sumo wrestlers..lol  It\'s a blast.'),(2749,'54ed132fde','What up Dog?\r\n\r\ncoolness yo......I\'ll let you know when they get to the heezey....do the same....peace........... :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3956,'2d1333f58b',':cool: hey whatcha doin?'),(3957,'2d1333f58b',':cool: hey whatcha doin?'),(3958,'ffd12dbc39','Just chillin myself.. Doin a little question answering for the peeps..lol  \r\n\r\nFell free to stop by dude..      Thanks for registering man.'),(2709,'4f26db821d','haha sounds like it i\'m about to go hop in a plane and fly to hong kong to pick up my baby. where do you get your bits from?'),(2714,'e1a1b45744','[quote:e1a1b45744=\"stergh\"]haha sounds like it i\'m about to go hop in a plane and fly to hong kong to pick up my baby. where do you get your bits from?[/quote:e1a1b45744]\r\n\r\nSome from Hong Kong, and all over the USA.. Toys R Us have them on sale right now for $25 if you want a 2 speed one.. If you want a one speed one, they\'re like $12\r\n\r\nI bought a few off ebay too.'),(2715,'15012e9b2c','a two speed one is the one with the booster on it right? if so thats what i have on the way you shoudn\'t have told me about that 12 dollar one cause now i want to go get it but i gotta save my money cause i gotta get a new paint job for my actual car ahhh'),(2720,'a68c0b2c43','do you have aim or something that would be easier to talk?\\\r\nscubasteve2967 if so');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2718,'370c4c7835','What MHZ is the car you are waiting for?'),(2719,'7c952f56e0','the picture of the box the guy took says 27 but he says 35 so i\'m not exactly sure'),(2730,'8c048418c0','I think ICQ has alot of cool things..'),(2731,'36d2b47e5c','so do hacked versions of aim like transparency'),(4359,'4c20fde55f','[quote:4c20fde55f=\"lovedoctor\"]Got the homie today, mang.   :eek:  \r\n\r\nnow dat is one cool homie.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get chef.  (Everybody want\'s some!)\r\n\r\nProps, biggun.   :cool: \r\n\r\nLates,   :D \r\n\r\nDoc[/quote:4c20fde55f]\r\ncool mang, glad ya like him.\r\nI\'ll let ya know when the chef gets here.'),(2734,'91014a7a8d','I gots mine today to, thanks.\r\nWhat sucks is that I spent $1 on the homies machine sturday and the 2 homies I got out of the machine were the vato with the suspenders and mastablasta. :-?'),(2737,'ed9a8f2dea','awww...that does suck.....well if its any comfort to you.....there are only 5 places to get them here and 3 of those machines are broken........and one of them only has series 1 &amp; 2.....\r\nsorry man....\r\nlater.......'),(4271,'1f65fb3403','What up dog?\r\n\r\nI got your package today....\r\n2 things....I\'m not mad or anything...the cars look good...but you need to wrap stuff like that in bubblewrap or paper....someone else you send stuff to like that might get mad.\r\n\r\nand you forgot to give me the rear spoiler for the F&amp;F Eclipse...if you still have it...send it next time you go to the Post Office...thanks...and let me know when you get yours....\r\n\r\nPeace..........');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (4270,'a8ea9a14cd','yea man, I don\'t mind at all.\r\n\r\nwell let me know if you want me to ship him to ya - I can.\r\n\r\ngotta jet now'),(2762,'60e4e4b662','[quote:60e4e4b662=\"sessiz\"]I gots 2 more that I wanna do and I was thinking that I could zip them up and send them to you. You then could put them up as a download. The next 2 I\'m thinking will have much more eyecandy than the others. Any suggestions would be highly apreciated. I also wanna know what font you used for the bitpimps.\r\nLater\r\nYahya[/quote:60e4e4b662]\r\ncool mang, sounds great.\r\nI don\'t have any real suggestions, design\'s subjective to the viewer anyways. My personal preferences are dark backgrounds with minimal \"punchiness\" and line work.\r\n\r\nI used a PC Font (TTF) called \"Kilroy Was Here\".\r\nI can send that to you if you like.\r\nPlease don\'t let anyone know the font and don\'t give them the font.'),(2763,'4a1d34b658','Cool, Thanks for telling me the font and you don\'t gotta worry about it getting out what font it is. I think the wallpapers would look more official with the font. :cool: \r\nThanks again man.\r\nLater.\r\nYahya\r\n\r\nPS. How ya feelin? Your op went well I hope.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2764,'36d2b47e5c','so do hacked versions of aim like transparency'),(2765,'4a1d34b658','Cool, Thanks for telling me the font and you don\'t gotta worry about it getting out what font it is. I think the wallpapers would look more official with the font. :cool: \r\nThanks again man.\r\nLater.\r\nYahya\r\n\r\nPS. How ya feelin? Your op went well I hope.'),(4268,'6459af575f','[quote:6459af575f=\"CaboWabo\"]I got an extra I think I can send ya.[/quote:6459af575f]\r\n\r\nup to you....\r\n\r\nwhen I look at the package with Wolfe in it...I don\'t have the rest.\r\nso, I don\'t mind picking it up.\r\n\r\nthank though.\r\n\r\n-n\r\nyou ok with me tell Hog about Noodles?  My fingers were letting loose and my head wasn\'t catching up.'),(2767,'1a5b09a3ea','[quote:1a5b09a3ea=\"sessiz\"]Cool, Thanks for telling me the font and you don\'t gotta worry about it getting out what font it is. I think the wallpapers would look more official with the font. :cool: \r\nThanks again man.\r\nLater.\r\nYahya\r\n\r\nPS. How ya feelin? Your op went well I hope.[/quote:1a5b09a3ea]\r\nlet me know if ya need me to email you the font :wink:\r\n\r\nstill in some pretty major pain, but getting better - thanks for asking homie :-)'),(2768,'e6c3329823','Hope ya feel better soon man. I allready found the font and downloaded it. \r\nThanks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2769,'e6c3329823','Hope ya feel better soon man. I allready found the font and downloaded it. \r\nThanks.'),(3980,'e38fef94c4','well i definatly want em all but i dont wana leave you hangin either. definatly hold onto the wm01 and the wt46. ill try to come up with the $$ within a few weeks to get all 3 but if you need to sell one or two of em go ahead. ill try to send out a mo on monday.'),(2771,'5da01a67b5','let me know if you need anything from me graphics wise or anything else.\r\nI\'ve still got all my original design files from Photoshop, layered PSD\'s, etc.'),(2772,'185fbdd5c5','Cool Beans'),(4266,'442e8d21bb','I got an extra I think I can send ya.'),(4267,'6459af575f','[quote:6459af575f=\"CaboWabo\"]I got an extra I think I can send ya.[/quote:6459af575f]\r\n\r\nup to you....\r\n\r\nwhen I look at the package with Wolfe in it...I don\'t have the rest.\r\nso, I don\'t mind picking it up.\r\n\r\nthank though.\r\n\r\n-n\r\nyou ok with me tell Hog about Noodles?  My fingers were letting loose and my head wasn\'t catching up.'),(3047,'d45f074e79','Hey Pig,\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna take the lead in making the BitPimp decals we were talking about last week.  Now my Pimp this is where you cone in, I know you\'re pretty damn good with sizing and modifying web pics (just ask my bB)\r\n\r\nI was hoping you could have our backs on this and lend us a hand.\r\n\r\nCan you see what you can do with the The BitPimp logo?\r\n\r\n\r\nCan you clearly shrink it down to the following sizes:\r\n\r\n1 inch\r\n1/2 inch\r\n1/4 inch\r\n\r\nAnd send a sample to....\r\n\r\nDarkTari@msn.com\r\n\r\nI\'ll see how it turns out  then we can go from there.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2933,'a7687ee9ef','cool.....I was hoping you\'d like that Bb.....I\'ve never seen one like it. You gotta lemme see both when you\'re done......\r\nlovin da rims....and the Accord is phatter than I thought....gonna hook it up too...............\r\npeace.......'),(2776,'951d4477f1','yo mang, got the homies today in da mail - thanks pimp :cool: \r\nyour stuff got shipped off today through UPS:\r\n12 665 412 03 4089 2177\r\n\r\nlet me know when ya get your stuff'),(2777,'a531e6819f','yo, you still selling the custom cars? Stretched chassis and custom body? I\'m interested.\r\n\r\nSuperFly'),(2778,'5abea69873','yo pimp, got my bodies today :cool: \r\nhella thanks playa!\r\n\r\nyour stuff got shipped out today through UPS:\r\n12 665 412 03 4064 0180\r\n\r\nlet me know when ya get your stuff'),(2796,'83f2918565','sillly bugger, lol!\r\n\r\nno sweats man, ph2t@prahranpianos.com.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(2797,'83f2918565','sillly bugger, lol!\r\n\r\nno sweats man, ph2t@prahranpianos.com.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2780,'2a62f08c1a','Say Word to dat!\r\nI\'ll hit ya up when it happens....\r\npeace dog......'),(2781,'2a62f08c1a','Say Word to dat!\r\nI\'ll hit ya up when it happens....\r\npeace dog......'),(2782,'1df632ae4e','just an FYI,\r\nit\'s not advisable to use spaces in file names either, it makes it harder for you later on.\r\n\r\nuse \"_\" underscores or capiTols for a naming convention.\r\nexamples would be:\r\n\r\nmy_image_file.jpg\r\nor\r\nmyImageFile.jpg\r\n\r\nif you do use spaces (which you shouldn\'t), you\'ll need to use: \r\n%20\r\nin the URL.\r\n%20 = \" \"\r\na space.'),(2783,'0cfb4578da','Thanx C-Dub\r\n\r\nI found that out the hard way.....\r\n\r\nGot it down Now Pimp...'),(9200,'35107127aa','Yep, done, no problem, email is titled FET MOD PAYMENT.\r\nall the best,\r\nRoland'),(6781,'1e6f22a8c6','I was just talkin shit brotha....I guess you need to know my personality to get me...and I don\'t feel too bad for ya on the camera situation....I have a slow ass webtv and an ancient 8mm camcorder (early 90\'s) I have to wait 10 mins for the camera to \"warm up\" before I get a picture....ridiculous... :lol:\r\n\r\nwhenevers clever man...\r\npeace.. 8-)'),(2795,'683874f6b5','I\'m goofy today.. I need your paypal addy again.. So I can send scottys money..  Thanks\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2786,'98f2734e61','my computer is being a bitch so i\'m going over to a friends house at lynn lake apt\'s to see if i can get it to work and i\'m chilling there for a while what kind of computer do you have cause i gotta find a way to check if it is my proc or motherboard that is being a bitch i\'m checking my vid card on his computer and if you have and older comp with 133 sdram i can hook you up cause i got no use for it anymore. call my cell 687-1839 if you got a later model athlon xp around 2200-2800 thanks man i\'ll ttyl\r\n\r\nchuck d'),(2787,'5dbcd5b54b','i\'m going there today wednesday soryr i didn\'t realize it was so late/early i gotta go try to get some sleep ttyl'),(2788,'98f2734e61','my computer is being a bitch so i\'m going over to a friends house at lynn lake apt\'s to see if i can get it to work and i\'m chilling there for a while what kind of computer do you have cause i gotta find a way to check if it is my proc or motherboard that is being a bitch i\'m checking my vid card on his computer and if you have and older comp with 133 sdram i can hook you up cause i got no use for it anymore. call my cell 687-1839 if you got a later model athlon xp around 2200-2800 thanks man i\'ll ttyl\r\n\r\nchuck d'),(2789,'5dbcd5b54b','i\'m going there today wednesday soryr i didn\'t realize it was so late/early i gotta go try to get some sleep ttyl');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2790,'e658e09007','[quote:e658e09007=\"DarkTari\"]Thanx C-Dub\r\n\r\nI found that out the hard way.....\r\n\r\nGot it down Now Pimp...[/quote:e658e09007]\r\nthat\'s how I learned too man - good luck!'),(2792,'14241df580','haaaaawg!'),(2793,'beb4d67ae3','If you haven\'t been offered yet.\r\nYou can send your images to me, I\'ll host them and give you the link and then you can make your post in the contest thread.\r\n\r\nLet me know.\r\n\r\nCaboWabo'),(2798,'3dd7590e1d','I\'m about to order from RaidenTech, the 2 boats for $28.70 package...Gotta be a cool gift for my pops for Father\'s Day'),(2799,'3dd7590e1d','I\'m about to order from RaidenTech, the 2 boats for $28.70 package...Gotta be a cool gift for my pops for Father\'s Day'),(2801,'00b117218b','I still can\'t decide on the 2 boats package or the Hummer boat deal.. I might get em both.. The cool part is my wife actually wants one too... \r\n\r\nI\'ll be ordering tonight or tomorrow afternoon....'),(2802,'5c26618173','Just ordered it myself...2 boats, with UPS ground was $35.69 not too shabby.\r\n\r\nIf it\'s gonna be for you and the wife bro, I\'d suggest going with the 2-boats deal.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2803,'5c26618173','Just ordered it myself...2 boats, with UPS ground was $35.69 not too shabby.\r\n\r\nIf it\'s gonna be for you and the wife bro, I\'d suggest going with the 2-boats deal.'),(3865,'a3617e2e5d','ya ive only botched it up bad once so hopefully looking dumb will make me remember. hehe'),(3866,'a3617e2e5d','ya ive only botched it up bad once so hopefully looking dumb will make me remember. hehe'),(11651,'7e320e281a','Cool, I\'ll have an eye out. \r\n\r\nThe FETS showed yesterday, so I\'m all set to go. I\'ll be trying to get them right back out after I get \'em.\r\n\r\nDave'),(2808,'fa557df896','[quote:fa557df896=\"Namuna\"]Just ordered it myself...2 boats, with UPS ground was $35.69 not too shabby.\r\n\r\nIf it\'s gonna be for you and the wife bro, I\'d suggest going with the 2-boats deal.[/quote:fa557df896]\r\n\r\nThat\'s a great price.. You talked me into it.. lol  I\'m ordering tonight.. I can\'t have you floatin shit before me..\r\n\r\nWhich did you get? The cigarette boat, or the other?'),(2813,'66a502119d','So, I tried to track it...to see if it was coming today....gotta work tonight.....and heres what I got:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTICE: \r\nUPS authorizes you to use UPS tracking systems solely to track shipments tendered by or for you to UPS for delivery and for no other purpose. Any other use of UPS tracking systems and information is strictly prohibited. \r\nTracking results provided by UPS: Jun 5, 2003 8:00 A.M. Eastern Time (USA) \r\nTRACKING RESULT \r\nTracking Number: 1266 5412 034 064 0180 \r\nStatus:           This is not a valid UPS tracking number(11999) \r\n--------------------------------------\r\n\r\n\r\nyou sure thats the right #?\r\nyou are on drugs you know :lol:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2815,'4ed3dd8d47','hey homie, i got sometin up my sleeve, and it ain\'t no ballin\' bB. betta wait and find out.....'),(3862,'eba4f4c076','probably or i could pay more attention but sometimes thats hard to do.'),(3864,'0397ece90a','I know, but for now, try to please.\r\nI guess that\'s one downside to being a moderator. lol'),(2840,'3b19a781bf','cool mon.....\r\nI knew it was the drugs!!!!!\r\nI didn\'t get it today, probably tomorrow....I\'ll let you know...\r\npeace.....'),(2841,'3b19a781bf','cool mon.....\r\nI knew it was the drugs!!!!!\r\nI didn\'t get it today, probably tomorrow....I\'ll let you know...\r\npeace.....'),(2842,'534ec2a45e','what up dog?\r\n\r\nI\'ve got a situation, and I need a little advice.....\r\nYou probably saw in Kwik\'s thread about his ZZ cars, where we traded a gloria for a civic, I told him that I got burned on another civic.....\r\nThe guy that burned me is a member of this site and tinyrc..his name is Chris Day....he goes by the name Aquarius....I sent him a perfect Bb body....he sent me a black civic body that was all scratched up on the top and it is missing a side mirror....it looks like shit.....I contacted him, told him it was wrong of him to do that.....he says oops...thought you knew.....he told me he\'d send me a 350Z zipzap body....that was awhile ago, I\'ve tried to\r\ncontact him 3 times...nothin......this kid is 14 years old.....I know his address....what do you think I should do?....I know its just a body..and I could call it a loss....but its on the principle of this I don\'t want to......I gave him a good referral on tinyrc....which I\'m going to change soon.....\r\nhelp me out here man....what do you think?\r\npeace.......'),(2818,'66a502119d','So, I tried to track it...to see if it was coming today....gotta work tonight.....and heres what I got:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTICE: \r\nUPS authorizes you to use UPS tracking systems solely to track shipments tendered by or for you to UPS for delivery and for no other purpose. Any other use of UPS tracking systems and information is strictly prohibited. \r\nTracking results provided by UPS: Jun 5, 2003 8:00 A.M. Eastern Time (USA) \r\nTRACKING RESULT \r\nTracking Number: 1266 5412 034 064 0180 \r\nStatus:           This is not a valid UPS tracking number(11999) \r\n--------------------------------------\r\n\r\n\r\nyou sure thats the right #?\r\nyou are on drugs you know :lol:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2934,'719ec46225','Frig man. I cannot believe how many hits my sites gettin from here. Holy Shitballs. I have aver 100 hits just on the Forbitpimps and almost 200 on the reg site. and no of them are me!?\r\n\r\nyou make a brotha popular. LOL'),(3861,'eba4f4c076','probably or i could pay more attention but sometimes thats hard to do.'),(2822,'27e8fcc15a','Hehe, hope you didn\'t order yet...\r\n\r\nhttp://tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;threadid=11421'),(8422,'947a3b50cb','I was just wondering if I am allowed to print some of my own bitPimps decals?  just the same ones you print, using the bitPimps logo.  let me know if you don\'t want me to.  Thanks.\r\n\r\nNick'),(2824,'27e8fcc15a','Hehe, hope you didn\'t order yet...\r\n\r\nhttp://tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;threadid=11421'),(2825,'5d8283f30c','Hey CW-\r\n\r\nI saw a discussion about getting some bitPimp decals in Midgetman\'s dual cell thread. One idea for getting these done nicely and inexpensively would be to contact Supracruza and see if he would do a batch for you. I\'ve looked into decals a bit, and unless you get a shitload printed or have just the right printer, the cost is way up there. I\'ve also tried the decal paper from the hobby store and it only works so-so. \r\n\r\nI ordered some decals from Supracruza off eBay (a couple skyline GT-R sets), and the quality is high and the price reasonable. He\'s in Hawaii, but sending electronic files and receiving decals by mail aint no thang. Whatever printer he\'s using seems to work pretty nicely.\r\n\r\nSuperFly'),(2960,'45e6636c6f','[quote:45e6636c6f=\"Havok\"]I need a little more help......I have crap for motors and want the best.....where do I go, who do I talk to, or what kind should I get?\r\nthanks dog...........\r\npeace.......[/quote:45e6636c6f]\r\nI\'ve been getting my motors through Kyle at www.bitchar-gmotors.com, but he\'s getting out of the game, so his stock won\'t last long I\'m sure. However, you can probably still contact him and see if he has any motors left, his email is: kyleclemmons@msn.com\r\n\r\nI\'ve got another new connection that I\'ve been using now that Kyle\'s going out, and he\'s a member here too, extrememicros (www.extrememicros.com), I\'ve gotten like 5 or 6 motors from him plus other stuff, all was good.\r\n\r\nYou might wanna ask on the boards too, some folks have some TinyRC motors that they say rock, and I\'ve heard others from there suck, but I\'ve never gotten one from there so I have no clue.\r\n\r\nAs to what motor you should get, it depends on the type of driving you like to do.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2961,'a6e9a477ca','Thanks dog......I went wit extreme micros......I like his site and hes only 1-1/2 hours away from me in Evansville Indiana......\r\npeace.........'),(2962,'a6e9a477ca','Thanks dog......I went wit extreme micros......I like his site and hes only 1-1/2 hours away from me in Evansville Indiana......\r\npeace.........'),(2829,'5d8283f30c','Hey CW-\r\n\r\nI saw a discussion about getting some bitPimp decals in Midgetman\'s dual cell thread. One idea for getting these done nicely and inexpensively would be to contact Supracruza and see if he would do a batch for you. I\'ve looked into decals a bit, and unless you get a shitload printed or have just the right printer, the cost is way up there. I\'ve also tried the decal paper from the hobby store and it only works so-so. \r\n\r\nI ordered some decals from Supracruza off eBay (a couple skyline GT-R sets), and the quality is high and the price reasonable. He\'s in Hawaii, but sending electronic files and receiving decals by mail aint no thang. Whatever printer he\'s using seems to work pretty nicely.\r\n\r\nSuperFly'),(7900,'196ca36893','Cool. I may need to run the page by you to make sure I do it right, but I\'ll get that in there tomorrow.\r\n\r\nAs for the car, think of it as thanks for hosting/managing bitpimps, as well as the web help. I\'ll bill it back to my client  :wink: \r\n\r\nYou want a white Skyline or yellow Lancer? BTW, it will probably be a couple weeks before I can get it to you, but it will be coming.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (7901,'196ca36893','Cool. I may need to run the page by you to make sure I do it right, but I\'ll get that in there tomorrow.\r\n\r\nAs for the car, think of it as thanks for hosting/managing bitpimps, as well as the web help. I\'ll bill it back to my client  :wink: \r\n\r\nYou want a white Skyline or yellow Lancer? BTW, it will probably be a couple weeks before I can get it to you, but it will be coming.'),(3860,'ae4cfa352e','lol\r\nwell you can see the differences after you push the buttons can\'t ya?\r\n\r\nyou\'re just gonna have to pay attention to what you\'re doing.\r\nbe careful not to edit when you wanna quote, and vice versa.\r\n\r\nI\'ll go home and screw with the graphic, if it looks okay being all bright orange, then I\'ll do it - will that be enough of a change though?'),(3858,'a23852c81d','just a different color so i dont accidentally edit someones post when i wana quote it. hehe\r\n\r\n/me is a big idiot'),(34265,'1f2fae3056','No worries dude. I aint no TE, cheap and quick shipping :-D .\r\n\r\nCan\'t wait to see some cool paint jobs - I suspect we could see some entries for the end of year comp!.\r\n\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nDerek');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3959,'d12486f5d2',':lol: whats up man.\r\numm only thing with the decals...\r\nyou might wanna put another coat of clear coat on them - some of mine bled. :( \r\nthey are water slide, just leave them in water long enough to get the decal to slide off, any longer and it\'ll probably bleed. (20 seconds seems to be working for me)\r\n\r\nthat should be it...\r\ncan\'t wait to see what you gots up your sleeve! lol'),(2839,'955e4fb090','[quote:955e4fb090=\"Havok\"]So, I tried to track it...to see if it was coming today....gotta work tonight.....and heres what I got:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNOTICE: \r\nUPS authorizes you to use UPS tracking systems solely to track shipments tendered by or for you to UPS for delivery and for no other purpose. Any other use of UPS tracking systems and information is strictly prohibited. \r\nTracking results provided by UPS: Jun 5, 2003 8:00 A.M. Eastern Time (USA) \r\nTRACKING RESULT \r\nTracking Number: 1266 5412 034 064 0180 \r\nStatus:           This is not a valid UPS tracking number(11999) \r\n--------------------------------------\r\n\r\n\r\nyou sure thats the right #?\r\nyou are on drugs you know :lol:[/quote:955e4fb090]\r\nIt was the drugs lol\r\n\r\nI fargged up the tracking number by 1 digit. here\'s the good\'n:\r\n\r\n1Z 665 412 03 4064 0180\r\n\r\nit\'s in Bloomington, IN right now.'),(2833,'27b3672c7c','[quote:27b3672c7c=\"SuperFly\"]Hey CW-\r\n\r\nI saw a discussion about getting some bitPimp decals in Midgetman\'s dual cell thread. One idea for getting these done nicely and inexpensively would be to contact Supracruza and see if he would do a batch for you. I\'ve looked into decals a bit, and unless you get a shitload printed or have just the right printer, the cost is way up there. I\'ve also tried the decal paper from the hobby store and it only works so-so. \r\n\r\nI ordered some decals from Supracruza off eBay (a couple skyline GT-R sets), and the quality is high and the price reasonable. He\'s in Hawaii, but sending electronic files and receiving decals by mail aint no thang. Whatever printer he\'s using seems to work pretty nicely.\r\n\r\nSuperFly[/quote:27b3672c7c]\r\nExcellent SuperFly! Thanks for the heads up. I\'m gonna check into this for sure!\r\nGood lookin out pimp :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2925,'380d59bfb2','My address is\r\nMichael Chen\r\n41 Applegate Way \r\nAlameda, CA 94502\r\n\r\nsend ur package on tuesday, cuse my dad leaves for a trip on wedsday, so i can recieve pack\'s on days my dad ain\'t here. Ill send mine wedsnday night or thursday mornin ok?'),(2926,'1cd4193a8d','They were just ordered today. I might hav esome extras but need to wait till they come in to see as some people already have \"dibs\" on extras, but i will put you on the list. They are $15 per set of 4 shipped to your house ( more if outside US )'),(2958,'2451529c46','I need a little more help......I have crap for motors and want the best.....where do I go, who do I talk to, or what kind should I get?\r\nthanks dog...........\r\npeace.......'),(3022,'d4dc2c5920','I searched my sams high and low with no friggin luck..  Did yours have em?  I guess I\'m stuck ordering online..\r\n\r\nLet me know if you found em. I was gonna ask ugh from TRC if he could pick some up for me, but he\'s like 14, so he\'s at the mercy of his parental figures....lol\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(3016,'419d77131b','[quote:419d77131b=\"Havok\"]I almost forgot........I have a medical condition called Xerodoma Pigmentosum&lt;sp?\r\n\r\nXP for short......I get intense migraines from the sun, and flourescent, halogen, and sodium chloride bulbs.....I have too many rods in my eyes which make them super sensitive......\r\n\r\nand to top it off.....my skin doesn\'t have the regenerative properties to heal after exposure to UVA and UVB rays.....so, they say I\'ll eventually die of skin cancer if I don\'t wear a strong ass sunblock everyday....which I do.....even in the winter....real winter here lol.....\r\n\r\nSo I am the closest thing to an actual Vampire....that is if you don\'t believe in them....Muah ah ha ha ha[/quote:419d77131b]\r\n\r\nWow.. Are you kidding?  I\'ve seen some cases of XP so serious that light bulbs give em sun burns....  How did you get by down in the DR with that intense ass sun?  I\'m just a night person cause the cool shit always happens at night...lol  \r\n\r\nBut I\'ll always be a slave to playing frisbee in the sun');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2966,'9d63bee784','Sounds good man. \r\nYou want my address again? ;)  LOL'),(2967,'9d63bee784','Sounds good man. \r\nYou want my address again? ;)  LOL'),(2847,'b9f8b7213e','It is 274-1583  coaxial DC Power Jack with switch.  Has 3 tabs. 2 goto inside and in th epicture on back ar elabeled shell and grouped together it says normally closed switch. The other is kinda on the outside and goes to the center pin ( accorcing to pic on back this one is labeled center pin) I think i would wire it up the same as the mod in the group but wanted to make sure since its a different type ( mines \"n\" his was \"m\" )'),(2848,'534ec2a45e','what up dog?\r\n\r\nI\'ve got a situation, and I need a little advice.....\r\nYou probably saw in Kwik\'s thread about his ZZ cars, where we traded a gloria for a civic, I told him that I got burned on another civic.....\r\nThe guy that burned me is a member of this site and tinyrc..his name is Chris Day....he goes by the name Aquarius....I sent him a perfect Bb body....he sent me a black civic body that was all scratched up on the top and it is missing a side mirror....it looks like shit.....I contacted him, told him it was wrong of him to do that.....he says oops...thought you knew.....he told me he\'d send me a 350Z zipzap body....that was awhile ago, I\'ve tried to\r\ncontact him 3 times...nothin......this kid is 14 years old.....I know his address....what do you think I should do?....I know its just a body..and I could call it a loss....but its on the principle of this I don\'t want to......I gave him a good referral on tinyrc....which I\'m going to change soon.....\r\nhelp me out here man....what do you think?\r\npeace.......'),(4162,'cbe66363da','I guess there is this one.\r\n\r\nExtend charge time on TX.\r\n[url]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=539[/url]\r\n\r\nAnd this one:\r\n\r\nCrip cap in car:\r\n[url]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=494[/url]\r\n\r\nLet me know if these are OK.  I believe I\'ve written them from the point of a tutorial but if you want me to edit (pics/words).\r\n\r\nJust let me know.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (7628,'377d43f52f','[quote:377d43f52f=\"Havok\"]I haven\'t had time either...work has called me in early the last few days...and one of my ferretts died...total bummer...haven\'t gotten back into it yet...I\'m still body modding....hoping we\'ll have a contest I can enter it in....and I was waiting for the rims too :)[/quote:377d43f52f]\r\n\r\nIm thinking, since we didnt win in the last contest.  why not enter RC mods\' contest?  :eek: Im also planning on a chevy pick up :eek:'),(2940,'cd8bfe00fa',':grin:'),(3923,'a7a8f78176','I got all of those man. :( \r\nI posted a reply to havok\'s thread, I need that raza cat.\r\n :???: \r\nYou know what. I sorta \"owe you one\" for the decals you sent me, so tell me what homies you want and I\'ll send ya them. ;)'),(2945,'2979f7a82f','musta been the pain medication lol\r\nhere\'s the right tracking #:\r\n1Z 665 412 03 4089 2177\r\n\r\nyou can enter that on UPS.com\r\n\r\nshould be there monday for ya'),(2946,'e228e4dabc','I figured as much ...LOL\r\nThanks.\r\nYo I also got a few series 6 doubles if you\'re intrested. I\'ll be posting a pic later.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2947,'838cfe24e8','Read on playa, Takin off of the ups site.\r\n\r\nJun 7, 2003    6:43 A.M.    BUFFALO, NY, US    DEPARTURE SCAN \r\n     6:16 A.M.    BUFFALO, NY, US    ARRIVAL SCAN \r\n     3:20 A.M.    E. SYRACUSE, NY, US    DEPARTURE SCAN \r\n     12:54 A.M.    E. SYRACUSE, NY, US    ARRIVAL SCAN \r\nJun 6, 2003    10:00 P.M.    COLONIE, LATHAM, NY, US    DEPARTURE SCAN \r\n     6:39 P.M.    COLONIE, LATHAM, NY, US    INCOMPLETE ADDRESS, NOT DELIVERED;PACKAGE RETURNED TO SENDER \r\n     1:20 P.M.    COLONIE, LATHAM, NY, US    CORRECT STREET # NEEDED, NOT DELIVERED \r\n     3:29 A.M.    COLONIE, LATHAM, NY, US    OUT FOR DELIVERY \r\n     1:31 A.M.    COLONIE, LATHAM, NY, US    ARRIVAL SCAN \r\nJun 5, 2003    10:47 P.M.    SECAUCUS, NJ, US    DEPARTURE SCAN \r\n     12:49 P.M.    SECAUCUS, NJ, US    ARRIVAL SCAN \r\n     8:47 A.M.    HARRISBURG, PA, US    DEPARTURE SCAN \r\n     6:10 A.M.    HARRISBURG, PA, US    ARRIVAL SCAN \r\n     3:03 A.M.    NEW STANTON, PA, US    DEPARTURE SCAN \r\n     12:45 A.M.    NEW STANTON, PA, US    ARRIVAL SCAN \r\nJun 4, 2003    7:52 P.M.    COLUMBUS, OH, US    DEPARTURE SCAN \r\n     6:17 P.M.    COLUMBUS, OH, US    ARRIVAL SCAN \r\n     7:20 A.M.    EARTH CITY, MO, US    DEPARTURE SCAN \r\nJun 3, 2003    9:01 P.M.    EARTH CITY, MO, US    ORIGIN SCAN \r\n     3:56 P.M.    US    BILLING INFORMATION RECEIVED \r\n\r\nSo when You get the package back send it to\r\n\r\nYahya Mangir\r\n113 kent street\r\nAlbany NY 12206\r\n\r\nThat must be some good shit they gave ya for the pain....LOL\r\nOr did I make a mistake in giving you the right address :???:'),(2877,'a3d9602fe4','yeah....keep your fingers crossed on the body.......\r\nand I got somethin else from dude and he tossed those in cheap....cool huh?....got some bodies...he asked if I needed parts or homies or anything....I was like hell yeah, you got 8-ball and BigSpooky? he said he\'d toss them in for 2 bucks for all 4..which made them 50 cents each.....just like the machines...cool huh?...so. I had to get yours too.....so don\'t worry about it....lol.........\r\npeace..............');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2954,'12a1205135','No doubt man. My homies get around  :-)'),(5408,'078068d0e9','You got anything else to trade? Let me know, and I need you address, so i can send it out..\r\n\r\n\r\npayaso'),(5409,'e645035945','you said you had a 4 band controller and you were going to sell some of your tomy controllers, well i was just wondering how good is the 4 band controller, and do you need a special chassis or engine to use the boost button and how good\'s the boost?\r\n\r\nthanks for listening,\r\n           jeenyus'),(3873,'f1801da01f','[quote:f1801da01f=\"DarkTari\"]Got the decals yesterday, sprayed a clear on them and will test them on a new paint job soon\r\n\r\nThanx\r\n\r\nHow about sending me the file you printed it from\r\n\r\ndarktari@msn.com[/quote:f1801da01f]\r\n\r\nyea no prob.\r\nokay, let me add more variations to the file and send it to you. it\'s very bare bones right, only things in the file are what you got for decals. so I\'ll add more stuff to make it more worth while and then send it to you.\r\n\r\nremember, the chicks probably won\'t work on dark colors, they have transparancies in them. I need to find vector based graphics not rastor graphics.\r\n\r\nmore later.'),(3857,'60c171fbcd','[quote:60c171fbcd=\"payaso\"]Steve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn Lake circle south Apt C\r\nSt Petersburg FL 33712\r\n\r\nThanks Nigel.. I think the decals that scott made have too much clear coat on em.. They need the thinnest coat you can put on.. I reccomend a airbrush.. They lay down the thinnest coats..  \r\nJust a thought..\r\n-Steve[/quote:60c171fbcd]\r\n\r\nScott used ink jet, I am using laser.  I did a test with and without clear coat.\r\nno different, except the process of adding clear coat.\r\nThe laser ink is different than inkjet.\r\nI let a set of non treated decals in water for a good 5 minutes.\r\nno bleeding.\r\nWell, now I got your addy again.. I\'ll drop them in the post.\r\nit\'s just a trial run, like scotts.  Let me know about size, good or bad.\r\nThe font changed at the last moment and changed the size.\r\n\r\n-nigel');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2857,'311e66f3f0','[quote:311e66f3f0=\"Havok\"]what up dog?\r\n\r\nI\'ve got a situation, and I need a little advice.....\r\nYou probably saw in Kwik\'s thread about his ZZ cars, where we traded a gloria for a civic, I told him that I got burned on another civic.....\r\nThe guy that burned me is a member of this site and tinyrc..his name is Chris Day....he goes by the name Aquarius....I sent him a perfect Bb body....he sent me a black civic body that was all scratched up on the top and it is missing a side mirror....it looks like shit.....I contacted him, told him it was wrong of him to do that.....he says oops...thought you knew.....he told me he\'d send me a 350Z zipzap body....that was awhile ago, I\'ve tried to\r\ncontact him 3 times...nothin......this kid is 14 years old.....I know his address....what do you think I should do?....I know its just a body..and I could call it a loss....but its on the principle of this I don\'t want to......I gave him a good referral on tinyrc....which I\'m going to change soon.....\r\nhelp me out here man....what do you think?\r\npeace.......[/quote:311e66f3f0]\r\nfirst off - let me say that sucks!\r\n\r\nsecond off - thanks for the heads up on this kid, I\'ll make sure I never do any trades or anything with him, I\'ll let a few of my peeps know too. definetally change your positive referal post asap, otherwise some others that get burned off him will be leary of you too.\r\n\r\nand third - if it were me, and for such a low dollar amount ($20.00 and under), I\'d personally let it go. Why? Because its worth my 20.00 to not let that asshole get me any more pissed than I already would be. It\'s not worth the time and especially the efforts. For the price of that body, you just bought yourself proof positive that you don\'t want to deal with this moron, and the other thing you purchased was a right to let other people know how your transactions went.\r\nFuck him - you\'ll be getting more, you\'ll be better off, etc. etc.\r\nKarma [i:311e66f3f0]really[/i:311e66f3f0] is out there man and he we get what he deserves and so will you. All things come full circle grasshoppa :wink: lol\r\nseriously though.\r\n\r\nJust to give you a little comfort, or maybe it won\'t... but I\'m in a sticky situation right now too, and what sucks is I wasn\'t even going to be until I made myself feel bad for turning the whole thing down, so I changed my mind and now here I am - in the situation that I originally thought I\'d be in until I talked myself into it. (so basically I shoulda trusted my first instincts).\r\nanyways, the situation is that I have  $50.00 floating around right now, and have for the past month or so with no results yet... no nothing... and even if it all does work out, best case scenario I get my shit in about another 2 months.\r\nyea that pisses the fuck outta me baby, but I\'m willing to wait a certain period of time. the moment I feel for sure I\'ve gotten the ole \"fuck you\", I\'m gonna get my 50.00 worth somehow.\r\n\r\nSo there you see how I handle things.\r\nUnder 20.00 and I get burned, lesson learned, whatever.\r\nOver 20.00 and I get burned, lesson learned, and I\'m coming for your ass somehow to get what\'s owed. lol\r\n\r\nhope that helps homie.'),(2858,'a68ca103c2','Very well said my friend....and I agree with your over or under $20.00 philosphy...and I will be changing the positive post as soon as I\'m done writing this.....\r\nI was thinking of this last night after I wrote to you.......\r\nMy dad was a strict dude with strong business ethics....what if I wrote a letter to dear ol\' dad....but after reading what you wrote...I feel better about the whole thing...and I will drop it.....but if he enters that Bb in the Most Pimped Out Ride Contest I gotta blast him........ if its cool wit chu mang......\r\npeace......');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2859,'1c172c033b','I hope he sees it....that\'ll be fun. :-D \r\n\r\nhttp://www.tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=39873b4e19e13b8b75b8aa9f0f973730&amp;postid=102845'),(2860,'a68ca103c2','Very well said my friend....and I agree with your over or under $20.00 philosphy...and I will be changing the positive post as soon as I\'m done writing this.....\r\nI was thinking of this last night after I wrote to you.......\r\nMy dad was a strict dude with strong business ethics....what if I wrote a letter to dear ol\' dad....but after reading what you wrote...I feel better about the whole thing...and I will drop it.....but if he enters that Bb in the Most Pimped Out Ride Contest I gotta blast him........ if its cool wit chu mang......\r\npeace......'),(5407,'89afe50b5f','[quote:89afe50b5f=\"laanguiano\"]its just that others want the same ones you want..... and they have more rare homies that they will trade for... but i wanted to trade with you cause we talked first... so i wanted 3 for 2..\r\n\r\nlmk[/quote:89afe50b5f]\r\n\r\nThat 3 for 2 shit is out. Homie for homie is all I\'m willing to do.\r\nSomeone else has a homie you want go ahead and trade with them, it\'s all good over here. :cool:'),(2950,'e228e4dabc','I figured as much ...LOL\r\nThanks.\r\nYo I also got a few series 6 doubles if you\'re intrested. I\'ll be posting a pic later.');
