 philosphy...and I will be changing the positive post as soon as I\'m done writing this.....\r\nI was thinking of this last night after I wrote to you.......\r\nMy dad was a strict dude with strong business ethics....what if I wrote a letter to dear ol\' dad....but after reading what you wrote...I feel better about the whole thing...and I will drop it.....but if he enters that Bb in the Most Pimped Out Ride Contest I gotta blast him........ if its cool wit chu mang......\r\npeace......[/quote:0b9af7a6ea]\r\nyou do what you gotta do, whatever makes you feel better.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2865,'91381190fb','[quote:91381190fb=\"Havok\"]I hope he sees it....that\'ll be fun. :-D \r\n\r\nhttp://www.tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=39873b4e19e13b8b75b8aa9f0f973730&amp;postid=102845[/quote:91381190fb]\r\n\r\nwell put.\r\nthat\'ll be in front of a lot of eyes.\r\nI think you just did more damage to him than if you were to publicly blast him with words or whatever.'),(2866,'46fcaa69df','I think you\'re right....if he does show up again...I\'ll PM him and let him know how I feel......and if he rectifies the problem....I\'ll post that in there too.\r\nThanks again.....I get a little hostile sometimes :x \r\n\r\n&lt;-Havok-&gt;\r\nnot just a nic....a way of life  :grin: \r\n\r\npeace.......\r\n\r\np.s. my UPS driver is sick...it should have been here yesterday, but the sub changed the zip code....moron....I called and they said it\'ll be here today....\r\nlater......'),(2867,'46fcaa69df','I think you\'re right....if he does show up again...I\'ll PM him and let him know how I feel......and if he rectifies the problem....I\'ll post that in there too.\r\nThanks again.....I get a little hostile sometimes :x \r\n\r\n&lt;-Havok-&gt;\r\nnot just a nic....a way of life  :grin: \r\n\r\npeace.......\r\n\r\np.s. my UPS driver is sick...it should have been here yesterday, but the sub changed the zip code....moron....I called and they said it\'ll be here today....\r\nlater......'),(2869,'ca77ee0537','no worries man, we all have our limits.\r\n\r\ncool mang, have fun with the goods. :wink:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2870,'49c8712b62','First...I just got \'em....lovin it....second....suprise, suprise...look who e-mailed me....\r\nthis is what he said:\r\n(direct quote from e-mail)\r\n\"I\'m really sorry I haven\'t been near a computer in 2 weeks. My family just moved to Flordia and I just got internet today. I would have sent it out before I left Texas but I forgot your address and I had no computer to talk to you on. I have the car all packaged and everything I just need your address. And if you dont believe the moving thing just check out the return address when I ship it. Once again I\'m very sorry.\"\r\n\r\nhmmmm think this has anything to do with my post ...lol....like I said, if he does good, I\'ll change it....but not before I gets mines......\r\n\r\nand I sent the guy with 8-ball and big spooky a personal check. I told him he can wait till it clears before sending them....I know he hasn\'t cashed the check yet.....and I trust him, so it should be soon \r\n :smile: \r\nthanks dog........\r\npeace.....'),(2871,'49c8712b62','First...I just got \'em....lovin it....second....suprise, suprise...look who e-mailed me....\r\nthis is what he said:\r\n(direct quote from e-mail)\r\n\"I\'m really sorry I haven\'t been near a computer in 2 weeks. My family just moved to Flordia and I just got internet today. I would have sent it out before I left Texas but I forgot your address and I had no computer to talk to you on. I have the car all packaged and everything I just need your address. And if you dont believe the moving thing just check out the return address when I ship it. Once again I\'m very sorry.\"\r\n\r\nhmmmm think this has anything to do with my post ...lol....like I said, if he does good, I\'ll change it....but not before I gets mines......\r\n\r\nand I sent the guy with 8-ball and big spooky a personal check. I told him he can wait till it clears before sending them....I know he hasn\'t cashed the check yet.....and I trust him, so it should be soon \r\n :smile: \r\nthanks dog........\r\npeace.....');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2873,'a41d3c9be0','[quote:a41d3c9be0=\"Havok\"]First...I just got \'em....lovin it....second....suprise, suprise...look who e-mailed me....\r\nthis is what he said:\r\n(direct quote from e-mail)\r\n\"I\'m really sorry I haven\'t been near a computer in 2 weeks. My family just moved to Flordia and I just got internet today. I would have sent it out before I left Texas but I forgot your address and I had no computer to talk to you on. I have the car all packaged and everything I just need your address. And if you dont believe the moving thing just check out the return address when I ship it. Once again I\'m very sorry.\"\r\n\r\nhmmmm think this has anything to do with my post ...lol....like I said, if he does good, I\'ll change it....but not before I gets mines......\r\n\r\nand I sent the guy with 8-ball and big spooky a personal check. I told him he can wait till it clears before sending them....I know he hasn\'t cashed the check yet.....and I trust him, so it should be soon \r\n :smile: \r\nthanks dog........\r\npeace.....[/quote:a41d3c9be0]\r\ncool man, sounds like you\'ll get your body.\r\ngood work.\r\n\r\nyou had to buy 8-ball and spooky off someone?\r\ndamn man.'),(2874,'a3d9602fe4','yeah....keep your fingers crossed on the body.......\r\nand I got somethin else from dude and he tossed those in cheap....cool huh?....got some bodies...he asked if I needed parts or homies or anything....I was like hell yeah, you got 8-ball and BigSpooky? he said he\'d toss them in for 2 bucks for all 4..which made them 50 cents each.....just like the machines...cool huh?...so. I had to get yours too.....so don\'t worry about it....lol.........\r\npeace..............');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2965,'c4e675a8e1','since the package I sent before is coming back, I\'ll add the homies you want to that and send it right back out.\r\n\r\nI think you want:\r\nSqueeky\r\nWolfe\r\n\r\nI want:\r\nTennishoe Pimp\r\nBig Dopey\r\n\r\n\r\nsound cool?'),(3893,'15da9b7076','ya i got enough pcbs to run an army of 27mhz cars.'),(3894,'0963bf174e','Hey man Instead of sedning me a big logo can you just send me the red text portion blown up?\r\n\r\nThanx dude'),(15741,'2266f8ad8b','[quote:2266f8ad8b=\"Havok\"]Wassup brotha\'?\r\n\r\nIt is gooood to be back. I have the next 3 days off.....and besides the SuperBowl (GO PATS!!!!)(I am from Boston you know), I\'m not doing a damn thing except getting my track together and cleaning up my \"bit\" work area. \r\n\r\nThat means I\'m gonna need some pimpin rides to roll out on that track soon :cool: \r\n\r\n :driving: \r\n\r\nlemme know wassup....and congrats on being \"made\" :lol:....\r\n\r\nand just in case....heres my address again  :lol: \r\n\r\nWayne Simard\r\n1422 West Monon Drive\r\nBloomington, IN\r\n47403-3020\r\n\r\nlater.........[/quote:2266f8ad8b]Well here\'s what\'s up with your cars... I think I pretty much got them all FETed. I got one set of alloys on. I went to put the alloys on the Zip Zap, and discovered one of the cells blew. So I got a mess in that one to clean up, and I\'m gonna re-dual cell it for ya. So I\'m saving that one for last. I was installing the alloys on your Micro Speed and ran into a couple issues, for one I threw the things from the pens on top of the trash, and the cat knocked it over, and got ink everywhere, by thte time I cleaned that up I was getting frustrated, and then I ended up loosing the steering spring on that car. I have no spare steering springs, so I\'m not sure what to do now. Do you have spare steering springs?\r\n\r\nSo anyways, most of your cars are done, just been putting off shipping them, \'cause I keep thinking, \"this weekend I\'m going to do those last 2 wheel mods, so I can ship everything at once.\"\r\n\r\n...but knowing you\'re back in action, I want to get you some of your cars back, so I\'ll get down to the post office tomorrow, and ship most of them back, except the 2 that need the wheels installed.\r\n\r\n...and I\'m glad to hear your back, it hasn\'t been the same witout you. VDM became my partner, and he\'s cool, but he don\'t smoke up, so it\'s not the same. ;)  :lol: \r\n\r\nAlso I have to tell you, you\'re the one to pushed me to try FET mods when I didn\'t have the confidence. You also supplied me with the materials needed to experiment, and figure how to FET other cars. I\'ve recieved a great deal of recognition because of that, and I\'m really grateful to you for pushing me to try the mod in the first place.\r\n\r\nI mean you gotta know how it is when someone has faith in you, so thanks man.\r\n\r\nDave'),(2953,'c8a213bec0','whoa!\r\nThat\'s the address I have written down, I guess I coulda screwed that up too though. lol\r\n\r\nanyways, when it gets back I\'ll send it back again.\r\nthese homies are gonna have some milage under their belts.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2955,'12a1205135','No doubt man. My homies get around  :-)'),(2956,'24ab0916e1','Did you ever get the pcbs I sent ya?'),(2957,'2451529c46','I need a little more help......I have crap for motors and want the best.....where do I go, who do I talk to, or what kind should I get?\r\nthanks dog...........\r\npeace.......'),(2919,'d86a648ca9','Hell yeah dog... I got it on thursday.. Totally kick ass. I already painted the Gloria, but still don\'t know what to paint on the Bb.. Very cool. \r\n\r\nI\'m glad you like the goods..     If you need a job, just let me know..\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(2920,'a7687ee9ef','cool.....I was hoping you\'d like that Bb.....I\'ve never seen one like it. You gotta lemme see both when you\'re done......\r\nlovin da rims....and the Accord is phatter than I thought....gonna hook it up too...............\r\npeace.......'),(2887,'0940f827cb','[quote:0940f827cb=\"Havok\"]yeah....keep your fingers crossed on the body.......\r\nand I got somethin else from dude and he tossed those in cheap....cool huh?....got some bodies...he asked if I needed parts or homies or anything....I was like hell yeah, you got 8-ball and BigSpooky? he said he\'d toss them in for 2 bucks for all 4..which made them 50 cents each.....just like the machines...cool huh?...so. I had to get yours too.....so don\'t worry about it....lol.........\r\npeace..............[/quote:0940f827cb]\r\ncool deal mang, I\'ll be sure to remember, maybe one day I can return the favor :wink:'),(8423,'41046c7d19','Cabo,  TE is out of the Z pullbacks.  I\'m ordering right now, if you want to substitute something and can get back to me in the next 15 minutes, I\'ll add it on.  10:45 EST');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (5410,'771f5b7f66','ClownPrince \r\nSpider \r\nSyco \r\nMastaBlasta \r\nTear Drop \r\n\r\nThen the ones on the first picture of this post.  Thats all i got.  LMK what you want.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?p=16299#16299'),(2895,'652e1dc85c','What the fuck\'s up namuna?\r\nI piss on you in any way?\r\nThat shit aint appreciated man.'),(3856,'60c171fbcd','[quote:60c171fbcd=\"payaso\"]Steve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn Lake circle south Apt C\r\nSt Petersburg FL 33712\r\n\r\nThanks Nigel.. I think the decals that scott made have too much clear coat on em.. They need the thinnest coat you can put on.. I reccomend a airbrush.. They lay down the thinnest coats..  \r\nJust a thought..\r\n-Steve[/quote:60c171fbcd]\r\n\r\nScott used ink jet, I am using laser.  I did a test with and without clear coat.\r\nno different, except the process of adding clear coat.\r\nThe laser ink is different than inkjet.\r\nI let a set of non treated decals in water for a good 5 minutes.\r\nno bleeding.\r\nWell, now I got your addy again.. I\'ll drop them in the post.\r\nit\'s just a trial run, like scotts.  Let me know about size, good or bad.\r\nThe font changed at the last moment and changed the size.\r\n\r\n-nigel'),(2914,'766a25616b','Hey EZ,\r\n     If you wouldn\'t mind telling me what all of those aluminum bit rims you have left and how much they would be, I would be much appreciative.  Thansk for your time.\r\n\r\n-=Gfunk=-');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2915,'1cd4193a8d','They were just ordered today. I might hav esome extras but need to wait till they come in to see as some people already have \"dibs\" on extras, but i will put you on the list. They are $15 per set of 4 shipped to your house ( more if outside US )'),(2916,'9aa12e8420','What up Dog?\r\n\r\nI gots yo package today....phat!....did you gets mines yet?\r\n\r\nHit me back when you do....\r\nHolla.....\r\npeace.....\r\n\r\noh yeah.....I might hold you to that job offer dog...If I can convince da wife it aint 100 degrees there 24-7-365..... 8-)'),(3891,'b995664a26','[quote:b995664a26=\"hogjowlz\"]word. ill let you know when it comes[/quote:b995664a26]\r\n\r\nsendin ya a 27MHz, that\'s ok?'),(4161,'460caf9143','hey man, welcome to tha boards.... :-)'),(2910,'65cef1af1f','you deleted the \"web\" directory, that\'s why you got the error.\r\neverything is fixed now and you should have to do nothing.'),(2913,'9aa12e8420','What up Dog?\r\n\r\nI gots yo package today....phat!....did you gets mines yet?\r\n\r\nHit me back when you do....\r\nHolla.....\r\npeace.....\r\n\r\noh yeah.....I might hold you to that job offer dog...If I can convince da wife it aint 100 degrees there 24-7-365..... 8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3822,'f806e20f24','I forgot.......if you agree....let me know and I\'ll give you kwik\'s address...he knows that too...8-)'),(2978,'94c63f2cb6','Allright man I\'ll send em out tuesday.'),(2980,'80335f163d','[quote:80335f163d=\"CaboWabo\"]I\'m shipping to you at:\r\n\r\nYahya Mangir \r\n113 kent street \r\nAlbany NY 12206 \r\n\r\n\r\nthere\'s no apartment number or anything like that right?[/quote:80335f163d]\r\n\r\nI don\'t think it\'ll make a differance but you could put in apt.1\r\n\r\nI live in a two story aka 2 apts first and second floors.'),(2981,'ae1eb3b9a1','no rush, I probably wont get that package back from NY UPS until like wed. or something, so take your time.'),(2982,'ec9d81f0c3','Hey C-Dub,\r\nGot a few ideas I want to bounce off ya after the contest.  Gotta have some summer goin ons in Da Hood!'),(2983,'afeb2613b6','good deal. he\'s got some great stuff.\r\nlove that vanquish, can\'t get enough of it!'),(2984,'2a1ecc5195','glad to hear that about the Vanquish.....I got the MIT-02 Mod in a tube.....\"Insane\"....:lol:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11949,'31decd7551','hey man, if you want some lights I\'m still sellin\' the light pcb kits.   I can whip one up if you want. \r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(3854,'a23852c81d','just a different color so i dont accidentally edit someones post when i wana quote it. hehe\r\n\r\n/me is a big idiot'),(2987,'2a1ecc5195','glad to hear that about the Vanquish.....I got the MIT-02 Mod in a tube.....\"Insane\"....:lol:'),(2989,'0f4cd17255','[quote:0f4cd17255=\"DarkTari\"]Hey C-Dub,\r\nGot a few ideas I want to bounce off ya after the contest.  Gotta have some summer goin ons in Da Hood![/quote:0f4cd17255]\r\nCool mang, you know where to find me.  :grin:'),(4147,'429ccb8af9','send me pics to ebarrett@neo.rr.com   thanx'),(4141,'c4757e7e02','you still want the rims you ordered? Its no biggy either way, i got peeps that want them so if you dont let me know so i can sell them.'),(7046,'d74606471b','i only got the message with your name.... i got it all now i will have it in the mail monday, Post office is closed now. This is th esecond pm that i havent received. I think the pm system is a little buggy.'),(3978,'1193ba159b','d.t., \r\n \r\n      Thanks man, I recieved your package today. The body is sweet, and I can\'t thank you enough for supplying the 2nd ad 3rd place prizes. \r\n\r\n                                                                              hoboman');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3979,'5f069d05fa','You\'re quite welcomed HoBoMan! \r\n\r\n Yellow is your winning color, at least for Bits!  Can\'t wait to see what you do to this !!!!!'),(2992,'4bc3c8fc6b','I may be wrong but isn\'t it wierd that there are 2 users are named soooo close?\r\n\r\nsm2osley and\r\nkm2osley   ????????????\r\n\r\nJust thought I\'d let ya know if it is two different ppl sorry for causing shit\r\nif its 1 person 2 names they have 4 entry\'s in contest!\r\n\r\nCheeck it man\r\n\r\nI know I\'m being an idiot but hey. someones gotta do it :-)'),(2997,'f8452e19e9','hey Vato....whatcha doin up so late?\r\n\r\njust wanted to holla....saw you were online\r\npeace'),(2998,'f8452e19e9','hey Vato....whatcha doin up so late?\r\n\r\njust wanted to holla....saw you were online\r\npeace'),(3024,'fc5c86485d','I gots your Homies ready to go....\r\n\r\n1-BigSpooky\r\n1-8-Ball\r\nand if you still need it.....\r\n\r\n1- Chato the dog\r\n\r\nlemme know if you still need the dog......I can give you 1-Devildog too if you need it......\r\n\r\nI want a body.......haven\'t decided what yet.....maybe I\'ll have you chop a couple of ZZ bodies to fit bits or somethin.....\r\nlemme know...\r\npeace................'),(3000,'41fcd68b18','Chillin like a mofo.. Buzzin..lol  I keep day and nigt hours. I\'m what you would call a multy fasceted diamond..lol\r\n\r\nI was gonna do some painting but my wife ruined all my brushes putting them away for me.. Maybe now she\'ll understand why they were the way they were.. Women..\r\n\r\n\r\nadios');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (2995,'507c2b30e7','[quote:507c2b30e7=\"Stoli\"]I may be wrong but isn\'t it wierd that there are 2 users are named soooo close?\r\n\r\nsm2osley and\r\nkm2osley   ????????????\r\n\r\nJust thought I\'d let ya know if it is two different ppl sorry for causing shit\r\nif its 1 person 2 names they have 4 entry\'s in contest!\r\n\r\nCheeck it man\r\n\r\nI know I\'m being an idiot but hey. someones gotta do it :-)[/quote:507c2b30e7]\r\nnaw mang, that\'s a legit question/bitch (whatever you wanna call it)\r\n\r\nYea I was skeptical on that too.\r\nI\'ve done some research and both those names are registered at tinyrc.com too. I\'ve read some of the posts here and there to see if it it gave any clues to if it were 1 or 2 people...\r\nseems legit, though I could be wrong.\r\nAt any rate, I don\'t think I\'d worry, those so many good entries, I dunno if any of those will be making the top 3.'),(2996,'519ff7e44b','dats true. I even looked at his post too to see if any similar sayings. tag lines etc but nothing. The writing similar though on his entryes but its just kinda strange that the k guy joined posted his shiat and never posted again.\r\n\r\nI shouldn\'t worry anyways he or I will not be makin it into tha top 3 fo sho.\r\n\r\nMine are good but ib311\'s are kick arse'),(3001,'efe56ff40e','LMAO dog.....my wife threw out my hose for the airbrush a couple days ago.....too funny.....I keep strictly night hours......\r\n\r\nSoy Vampiro!\r\n\r\nbuenos noches');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3002,'efe56ff40e','LMAO dog.....my wife threw out my hose for the airbrush a couple days ago.....too funny.....I keep strictly night hours......\r\n\r\nSoy Vampiro!\r\n\r\nbuenos noches'),(3004,'fc5c86485d','I gots your Homies ready to go....\r\n\r\n1-BigSpooky\r\n1-8-Ball\r\nand if you still need it.....\r\n\r\n1- Chato the dog\r\n\r\nlemme know if you still need the dog......I can give you 1-Devildog too if you need it......\r\n\r\nI want a body.......haven\'t decided what yet.....maybe I\'ll have you chop a couple of ZZ bodies to fit bits or somethin.....\r\nlemme know...\r\npeace................'),(3005,'e534d374d0','soy vampiro tambien, pero a veces me gusta el sol..  todo el dia estoy soleando frente de la piscina&lt;sp?  donde aprendiste español? eres latino?\r\n\r\nque apero que hay otro pimps aqui hablando español..\r\n\r\nholla'),(14440,'96ab938a6b','[quote:96ab938a6b=\"JdmHatchback\"][quote:96ab938a6b=\"ph2t\"]hey dude,\r\n unfortunately I now have four dudes.  But if you wish to still do it I\'m happy to do it for $12USD.   \'cause I need to buy the fets.  If you want that I\'ll happily do all three of the other mods in section two.\r\n\r\ncheers and let me know.\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:96ab938a6b]\r\n\r\n\r\nHey ph2t,\r\n\r\nNot sure if you got my other PM, but Im still interested in getting the mosfet for $12. Email me at tinn446158@aol.com to work out the paypal payment. I need your email address so I can send the money to your paypal account.  THanks!\r\n\r\nJdmhatchback[/quote:96ab938a6b]\r\n\r\nhey man, sorry I didn\'t respond to your other PM.  paypal me the $12USD at matt.marcos@bigpond.com.\r\n\r\nSend your chassis to this address:\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nBENTLEIGH EAST   VIC   3165\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(3007,'677986f4bd','Ningún hombre, yo no soy latina. ...my fomenta a padres son dominicano tan hablo algún español. Soy la clase de áspero en escribir en el español. ..too difícil de recordar el todo. ..lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3008,'677986f4bd','Ningún hombre, yo no soy latina. ...my fomenta a padres son dominicano tan hablo algún español. Soy la clase de áspero en escribir en el español. ..too difícil de recordar el todo. ..lol'),(3014,'ff5aaabbf9','thats great....I used to live there too....for a year....with mi familia...lol\r\npeace'),(3010,'f3c9dad925','I almost forgot........I have a medical condition called Xerodoma Pigmentosum&lt;sp?\r\n\r\nXP for short......I get intense migraines from the sun, and flourescent, halogen, and sodium chloride bulbs.....I have too many rods in my eyes which make them super sensitive......\r\n\r\nand to top it off.....my skin doesn\'t have the regenerative properties to heal after exposure to UVA and UVB rays.....so, they say I\'ll eventually die of skin cancer if I don\'t wear a strong ass sunblock everyday....which I do.....even in the winter....real winter here lol.....\r\n\r\nSo I am the closest thing to an actual Vampire....that is if you don\'t believe in them....Muah ah ha ha ha'),(3011,'1e67547c3f','That\'s fuckin weird man....  I lived in the Dominican Republic for 5 years.. I just moved here to FL. I gots me a dominican wife and family.... What a trip dude.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3012,'ff5aaabbf9','thats great....I used to live there too....for a year....with mi familia...lol\r\npeace'),(3013,'f3c9dad925','I almost forgot........I have a medical condition called Xerodoma Pigmentosum&lt;sp?\r\n\r\nXP for short......I get intense migraines from the sun, and flourescent, halogen, and sodium chloride bulbs.....I have too many rods in my eyes which make them super sensitive......\r\n\r\nand to top it off.....my skin doesn\'t have the regenerative properties to heal after exposure to UVA and UVB rays.....so, they say I\'ll eventually die of skin cancer if I don\'t wear a strong ass sunblock everyday....which I do.....even in the winter....real winter here lol.....\r\n\r\nSo I am the closest thing to an actual Vampire....that is if you don\'t believe in them....Muah ah ha ha ha'),(3018,'202ee65674','I\'m not that bad (lightbulbs)...natural lighting...or regular bulbs don\'t affect me at all as long as they are 60watt or less.....I got 15 watt bulbs all over the house...living room...bedroom, bathroom..etc....they\'re about half the size of a normal bulb....\r\n\r\nI had to get prescription sunblock while I was in DR....I had it sent to me by my real dad who lived in FL...he picked it up and mailed it to me....customs was a mofo....I once went 2 weeks without being able to go outside during the day cuz I had to wait for my shit to clear thru customs....they bullshit alot down there....but I liked the women  :grin:  :grin:  :grin:  :-D  :-D  :D  :D  :D  :)  :) so it was worth it.....and I married a pureblood Italian girl....go figure....\r\n\r\n\r\nin case you\'re wondering....Dad was a Hell\'s Angel...so they wouldn\'t give him custody...mom was a biatch, child abuser....Department of Social Services put me in my Foster home....from 13-18....I lived in DR 18-19 (they wouldn\'t let them move and take me till I was an adult)......\r\n\r\n\r\ngotta go....\r\nsystems analysis at work....\r\nwon\'t be able to log back in for a few hours....\r\npeace............'),(3019,'e037629c06','What part did you live in?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3020,'202ee65674','I\'m not that bad (lightbulbs)...natural lighting...or regular bulbs don\'t affect me at all as long as they are 60watt or less.....I got 15 watt bulbs all over the house...living room...bedroom, bathroom..etc....they\'re about half the size of a normal bulb....\r\n\r\nI had to get prescription sunblock while I was in DR....I had it sent to me by my real dad who lived in FL...he picked it up and mailed it to me....customs was a mofo....I once went 2 weeks without being able to go outside during the day cuz I had to wait for my shit to clear thru customs....they bullshit alot down there....but I liked the women  :grin:  :grin:  :grin:  :-D  :-D  :D  :D  :D  :)  :) so it was worth it.....and I married a pureblood Italian girl....go figure....\r\n\r\n\r\nin case you\'re wondering....Dad was a Hell\'s Angel...so they wouldn\'t give him custody...mom was a biatch, child abuser....Department of Social Services put me in my Foster home....from 13-18....I lived in DR 18-19 (they wouldn\'t let them move and take me till I was an adult)......\r\n\r\n\r\ngotta go....\r\nsystems analysis at work....\r\nwon\'t be able to log back in for a few hours....\r\npeace............'),(3021,'2da1b409c3','right near the Haitian border outside of Tocino, right near the river....I\'m pretty sure thats where mi abuela lived....\r\n\r\nWe stayed right in downtown Santiago too....some relatives lived there.....\r\n\r\n\r\nThat was about 10 years ago...so I\'m a little hazy on where exactly.... :???: . I remember those places.......\r\n\r\nbrings back memories :) \r\n\r\nI am 1/4 Irish-English 1/4 French-Canadian 1/4 Blackfoot and 1/4 Sioux............100% Warrior....Thats why they call me Havok!!!  8-) \r\n\r\npeace................');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3025,'5b00de631b','[quote:5b00de631b=\"Havok\"]I gots your Homies ready to go....\r\n\r\n1-BigSpooky\r\n1-8-Ball\r\nand if you still need it.....\r\n\r\n1- Chato the dog\r\n\r\nlemme know if you still need the dog......I can give you 1-Devildog too if you need it......\r\n\r\nI want a body.......haven\'t decided what yet.....maybe I\'ll have you chop a couple of ZZ bodies to fit bits or somethin.....\r\nlemme know...\r\npeace................[/quote:5b00de631b]\r\nyup, I need Chato too! lol\r\nThat Challenger was the first ZZ body I chopped to fit a bit.\r\nAlls good, and looks good, but I would be worried I\'d screw it up since I\'ve only done 1, let me get a few more practice chops on ZZ bodies and I\'ll be ready to chop for trade.\r\nI\'ve got some bodies I would be willing to trade ya for the homies.\r\n...or since you\'ve been hooking me up, I would be open to chopping up a Bb body in to a truck for ya for a trade too. I\'ve done 2 of those, so I\'m less worried about screwing that up. lol\r\n\r\nlet me know how ya wanna work it out.'),(3026,'e559114fea','Looks like the hunt is on.\r\n\r\nNo Sams in my area, but we\'ve got Costco. I wanted to go check them out yesterday but didn\'t get the chance. I\'m gonna try to get the wife to make a run and see if she can find any.\r\n\r\nI\'ll keep you posted.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3027,'9736f9d3c2','[quote:9736f9d3c2=\"DarkTari\"]C-Dub,\r\n\r\nDon\'t mean to bitch or anything but Sinned still hasn\'t done a paper signature with his entry.  I see a computer generated hand signature but hey, you know!   Whadaya think?[/quote:9736f9d3c2]\r\nI hear ya, I\'ve sent him PMs and told him publicly in the forums, as well as the others who\'ve missed that detail.\r\nI think it\'s the language barrier thing - he\'s just not understanding he needs to write it by hand.\r\nHe\'s gotta follow the rules like everyone else, so if his stuff isn\'t changed by the deadline, he\'s screwed since it\'s not a valid entry.'),(3028,'5b00de631b','[quote:5b00de631b=\"Havok\"]I gots your Homies ready to go....\r\n\r\n1-BigSpooky\r\n1-8-Ball\r\nand if you still need it.....\r\n\r\n1- Chato the dog\r\n\r\nlemme know if you still need the dog......I can give you 1-Devildog too if you need it......\r\n\r\nI want a body.......haven\'t decided what yet.....maybe I\'ll have you chop a couple of ZZ bodies to fit bits or somethin.....\r\nlemme know...\r\npeace................[/quote:5b00de631b]\r\nyup, I need Chato too! lol\r\nThat Challenger was the first ZZ body I chopped to fit a bit.\r\nAlls good, and looks good, but I would be worried I\'d screw it up since I\'ve only done 1, let me get a few more practice chops on ZZ bodies and I\'ll be ready to chop for trade.\r\nI\'ve got some bodies I would be willing to trade ya for the homies.\r\n...or since you\'ve been hooking me up, I would be open to chopping up a Bb body in to a truck for ya for a trade too. I\'ve done 2 of those, so I\'m less worried about screwing that up. lol\r\n\r\nlet me know how ya wanna work it out.'),(3029,'5831f72c88','Hello Sinned,\r\n\r\nCould you please take 1 more photo of your entry with your username and bitPimps hand written on something in the same shot of your car?\r\nLook at other contest entries for examples.\r\n\r\nHere is your entry:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?p=9301&amp;highlight=#9301\r\n\r\nThat entry will not be valid until you submit a photo with your username and bitPimps handwritten on something in the same shot as your car.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nCaboWabo');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3030,'af6fbde75f','ok....so do you need Devil Dog too?\r\n\r\nI\'ve got 2 (as you saw)....I want to attempt the Bb mod myself...if I kill it...I\'ll scream help..:lol:\r\n\r\n\r\nwhat you got for bodies......maybe I\'ll like somethin in your garage....how about something older....I don\'t know....just hit me back....I gotta mail some shiat to my sis in Boston...so I\'ll mail yours out too....\r\n\r\nlemme know \'bout Devil Dog....\r\npeace.... 8-)\r\n\r\nand I already wrapped it up and its ready to mail....I addressed it to your wife\'s work again if thats cool.....\r\n\r\npeace......'),(3031,'af6fbde75f','ok....so do you need Devil Dog too?\r\n\r\nI\'ve got 2 (as you saw)....I want to attempt the Bb mod myself...if I kill it...I\'ll scream help..:lol:\r\n\r\n\r\nwhat you got for bodies......maybe I\'ll like somethin in your garage....how about something older....I don\'t know....just hit me back....I gotta mail some shiat to my sis in Boston...so I\'ll mail yours out too....\r\n\r\nlemme know \'bout Devil Dog....\r\npeace.... 8-)\r\n\r\nand I already wrapped it up and its ready to mail....I addressed it to your wife\'s work again if thats cool.....\r\n\r\npeace......'),(3032,'577b6d8f4a','Yea, I need Devil Dog too. lol\r\nI\'m needy huh?\r\n\r\nanyways, that\'s cool, ship it to her, I\'ll get it.\r\n\r\nLet me get the body list together and I\'ll shoot ya another PM.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3033,'577b6d8f4a','Yea, I need Devil Dog too. lol\r\nI\'m needy huh?\r\n\r\nanyways, that\'s cool, ship it to her, I\'ll get it.\r\n\r\nLet me get the body list together and I\'ll shoot ya another PM.'),(3034,'2965390c2f','cool....I\'m out...be back in an hour or so.....\r\npeace....'),(3035,'2965390c2f','cool....I\'m out...be back in an hour or so.....\r\npeace....'),(3036,'0ac03ea98f','Hey,  the guys at work want to know how you\'re doing... when you coming back!'),(3037,'0ac03ea98f','Hey,  the guys at work want to know how you\'re doing... when you coming back!'),(3038,'94b17263fc','I was going to try to get in the last half today.\r\nI\'ve got a dentist appointment (big surprise) today, it was supposed to be at 10 but they said it\'s gonna take so long so they wanted to go to lunch first so now my appt. is at noon, so I probably won\'t be in today.\r\nI\'ll be in tomorrow.\r\n\r\nI\'m doing better, still got some swelling and shit.\r\nShit hurts in new spots daily and it just plain sucks a dick.\r\nI\'ve got a shitload of \"fitting\" appointments ahead of me to get these fuckers to fit, feel, and function right.\r\nI haven\'t been able to chew since I got the surgeory done, I\'m about sick of shakes and soup!\r\nSo, all in all, I\'m getting better and better, but I have a lot to do before I talk and eat like I used to.\r\n\r\nI got my \"pathetic\" picture, and a shit load of fucked up stories to tell about this crap! lol'),(3039,'94b17263fc','I was going to try to get in the last half today.\r\nI\'ve got a dentist appointment (big surprise) today, it was supposed to be at 10 but they said it\'s gonna take so long so they wanted to go to lunch first so now my appt. is at noon, so I probably won\'t be in today.\r\nI\'ll be in tomorrow.\r\n\r\nI\'m doing better, still got some swelling and shit.\r\nShit hurts in new spots daily and it just plain sucks a dick.\r\nI\'ve got a shitload of \"fitting\" appointments ahead of me to get these fuckers to fit, feel, and function right.\r\nI haven\'t been able to chew since I got the surgeory done, I\'m about sick of shakes and soup!\r\nSo, all in all, I\'m getting better and better, but I have a lot to do before I talk and eat like I used to.\r\n\r\nI got my \"pathetic\" picture, and a shit load of fucked up stories to tell about this crap! lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3040,'e79acbd44c','Cool brother, we\'ll see ya tomorrow!'),(3041,'1726488ba4','Aight, here\'s the bodies I have:\r\n\r\n- Honda S-2000 (1 silver and 1 yellow)\r\n- Nissan Skyline 2000 GT-R (1 silver)\r\n- Mazda RX-7 (clear)\r\n- Honda Accord Wagon (1 white)\r\n- Toyota Bb (1 silver)\r\n\r\nI\'d be willing to paint one of those for you since they\'re just normal bodies and you\'re hooking me up, etc.\r\nHere\'s the paints I have to choose from if you wanted me to paint you one:\r\n\r\n- Black (flat)\r\n- White (flat)\r\n- Light Grey (flat)\r\n- Metallic Black\r\n- Silver Leaf\r\n- Gold\r\n- Metallic Blue\r\n- Deep Metallic Blue\r\n- Racing Green (darker)\r\n- Dark Green (lighter)\r\n- Metallic Red\r\n- Brilliant Orange (almost a yellow)'),(3042,'e79acbd44c','Cool brother, we\'ll see ya tomorrow!'),(3043,'1726488ba4','Aight, here\'s the bodies I have:\r\n\r\n- Honda S-2000 (1 silver and 1 yellow)\r\n- Nissan Skyline 2000 GT-R (1 silver)\r\n- Mazda RX-7 (clear)\r\n- Honda Accord Wagon (1 white)\r\n- Toyota Bb (1 silver)\r\n\r\nI\'d be willing to paint one of those for you since they\'re just normal bodies and you\'re hooking me up, etc.\r\nHere\'s the paints I have to choose from if you wanted me to paint you one:\r\n\r\n- Black (flat)\r\n- White (flat)\r\n- Light Grey (flat)\r\n- Metallic Black\r\n- Silver Leaf\r\n- Gold\r\n- Metallic Blue\r\n- Deep Metallic Blue\r\n- Racing Green (darker)\r\n- Dark Green (lighter)\r\n- Metallic Red\r\n- Brilliant Orange (almost a yellow)'),(3044,'3efb784b2f','I don\'t want any of those...:lol:\r\n\r\nI gave you the clear rx-7...even funnier...tryin to give it back and shit... :smile: \r\n\r\nI\'ll think about it......\r\n\r\nmeanwhile in another part of Gotham........\r\n\r\nYou\'re gonna get 2 packages...1 little white box...and a manilla envelope...I forgot to put DevilDog in the box..oops....hes in the envelope....\r\nlemme know when you get \'em so I don\'t have to go postal!! :eek:...I crack me up ...\r\n\r\npeace.......\r\ngoin to bed...be back on after 7pm (cst)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3045,'09243eb8a5','If the going gets desperate, I just found out that the Discovery Store has the boats...$19.99\r\n\r\nAin\'t the best price, but if\'n yur fiendin to get yur mitts on em I suppose that one way to go.\r\n\r\nI\'m makin a run to Costco tonight, I\'m keeping my expectations low though. \r\n\r\nI\'ll keep ya posted.'),(3046,'95f62cbcee','C-Dub\r\n\r\nFix my profile pimp,  I look an awful lot like Hogjowlz\r\n\r\nThanx'),(3055,'c74f79437a','Hey Sinned,  maybe there is a Language Barrier here,  You will need to Hand Write your name on a piece of paper in the picture of your entry to make it legal.  You cannot create a soft signature and post to you entry. Please do this before the deadline June 12th at midnight or your entry will be disqualified. You make some very nice Micros and I would hate to see them disqualified for this reason.'),(3056,'3efb784b2f','I don\'t want any of those...:lol:\r\n\r\nI gave you the clear rx-7...even funnier...tryin to give it back and shit... :smile: \r\n\r\nI\'ll think about it......\r\n\r\nmeanwhile in another part of Gotham........\r\n\r\nYou\'re gonna get 2 packages...1 little white box...and a manilla envelope...I forgot to put DevilDog in the box..oops....hes in the envelope....\r\nlemme know when you get \'em so I don\'t have to go postal!! :eek:...I crack me up ...\r\n\r\npeace.......\r\ngoin to bed...be back on after 7pm (cst)'),(3057,'c8d2316f79','[quote:c8d2316f79=\"Havok\"]I don\'t want any of those...:lol:\r\n\r\nI gave you the clear rx-7...even funnier...tryin to give it back and shit... :smile: \r\n\r\nI\'ll think about it......\r\n\r\nmeanwhile in another part of Gotham........\r\n\r\nYou\'re gonna get 2 packages...1 little white box...and a manilla envelope...I forgot to put DevilDog in the box..oops....hes in the envelope....\r\nlemme know when you get \'em so I don\'t have to go postal!! :eek:...I crack me up ...\r\n\r\npeace.......\r\ngoin to bed...be back on after 7pm (cst)[/quote:c8d2316f79]\r\naight, well what do ya want? :wink:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3855,'4c19b6b6ee','Steve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn Lake circle south Apt C\r\nSt Petersburg FL 33712\r\n\r\nThanks Nigel.. I think the decals that scott made have too much clear coat on em.. They need the thinnest coat you can put on.. I reccomend a airbrush.. They lay down the thinnest coats..  \r\nJust a thought..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(3502,'9e2dbd0bfc','I got dems today....\r\n\r\nMy wife is a recycling fanatic.....I love these boxes....I got 3 of them.....and I\'m keepin one for a pattern...\r\n\r\nI love the decals....you is the pimp....my wife rolled her eyes when she saw the chicas....:smile:\r\n\r\nthanks dog....I sent out Mastablasta and Mr.Raza this morning.....\"special packaging\"...:grin:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDo you like my new Avatar?\r\n\r\n[img:9e2dbd0bfc]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2167259/27461661.jpg[/img:9e2dbd0bfc]\r\n\r\n\r\nDon\'t get caught in the crosshairs!\r\n\r\n\r\nJust Kiddin\'.....I would never put that out there.... I was high and thought it was funny....the things I think of in my inebriated state...:grin:'),(3965,'ffd12dbc39','Just chillin myself.. Doin a little question answering for the peeps..lol  \r\n\r\nFell free to stop by dude..      Thanks for registering man.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3966,'f0235210b0','no, you\'re probably good to go.\r\nthe way I try and judge if I need more or not is to hold the strip of decals up to where I can see the finish on the decals (is it smooth and glossy or is it kind of speckled and dusty?)\r\nyou want smooth and glossy\r\nif you see speckled and dusty, you need more clear coat.\r\n\r\nyou\'re probably good to go though'),(3967,'b939e386d2','Coo meng.....You\'ll be the first to know when its done.....\r\npeace.......'),(3968,'b939e386d2','Coo meng.....You\'ll be the first to know when its done.....\r\npeace.......'),(3969,'2799104ee5','What up dog?\r\n\r\nI sent the package to Kwik yesterday..he\'ll let me know when he gets both and sends them...If he doesn\'t tell you...I will...and I threw in Smokey and Pinoy too...\r\n\r\nIf nobody buys your ZZ bodies I\'ll give you $5 each for the Challenger, Yenko and green Eclipse....or I\'ve got these:\r\n\r\n[img:2799104ee5]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2242190/27745797.jpg[/img:2799104ee5]   \r\n\r\n[b:2799104ee5]Honda S2000[/b:2799104ee5]\r\n1-clear\r\n1-yellow \r\n1-smokey clear\r\n\r\nMine are in perfect condition....if yours aint...tell me..so I know\r\n\r\ncar for car or $5 each...or both 8-)\r\npeace........'),(4500,'3b536ca056','Welcome to the hood....whats up? I know I haven\'t been around tinyrc lately....been here...tis all good....just wanted to say wassup!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (4501,'230124b8f9','Heres his address...its at the begining of the order #2 thread also..\r\n\r\nErnie Barrett \r\n1658 Cranberry Lane \r\nWarren, OH. 44483 \r\n\r\ntell you what....decide what you want....if EZ wants to put the order in before your friend/friends get here....Tell me and I\'ll order and pay for them and you can have one of your friends send me the money order when they get here and I\'ll overnite or priority mail the rims to them, you can pay me back for the shipping to them, no problem.......If shit happens, oh well I get more rims :grin:\r\n\r\nWhatcha think? Cool? 8-)'),(4363,'1580ba273c','Hmmmmmm :???: I wonder why they came back....oh well....\r\nI haven\'t paid cuz I wasn\'t sure if $30.00 was what you wanted....if it is....I\'ll pay it today no problem....\r\n\r\nlemme know...and heres my address again.....I always tell people to write it out the way I do with no abbreviations....I seem to get more mail that way :grin:\r\n\r\n\r\nWayne Simard\r\n1422 West Monon Drive\r\nBloomington, IN 47403-3020\r\n\r\nDamn redneck, backwoods, post office.....thats what I get for moving to the country.... :lol:'),(3973,'36d3c1e363','ya. did i say i wanted two or 3? $$ is a little tite but i could probably send enough for one or two this week.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3975,'3ed7020e25','no problem dawg, you ordered wt46, wt33, wm01.   Just let me know which you still want and ill hold them and ill just sell the others you dont want.'),(3063,'b179a7395e','Dude, I saw a green gloria I want fo\' sho.\r\ndo you want any bodies? more homies?\r\nmaybe trade a couple of bodies for a painted body?\r\n\r\nlet me know what you might be interested in and I\'ll put out a list for ya of what I gots to offer.'),(3064,'104518c21f','I might be interested in a body for body trade. Tell me what you got.'),(3065,'104518c21f','I might be interested in a body for body trade. Tell me what you got.'),(4256,'ce8e961f95','k, thx bro.'),(4257,'1f65fb3403','What up dog?\r\n\r\nI got your package today....\r\n2 things....I\'m not mad or anything...the cars look good...but you need to wrap stuff like that in bubblewrap or paper....someone else you send stuff to like that might get mad.\r\n\r\nand you forgot to give me the rear spoiler for the F&amp;F Eclipse...if you still have it...send it next time you go to the Post Office...thanks...and let me know when you get yours....\r\n\r\nPeace..........'),(3067,'5f33118242','S-2000 (1 silver and 1 yellow)\r\nSkyline GT-R 2000 (1 silver)\r\nMazda RX-7 (1 clear)\r\nToyota Bb (1 silver)\r\nHonda Accord Wagon (1 white)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3068,'9a679b358d','I\'ll take the gtr 2000 for the gloria. I have one but ONLY one and I\'ve been aching to paint her up.\r\nYou haven\'t modded her at all right?'),(3069,'9a679b358d','I\'ll take the gtr 2000 for the gloria. I have one but ONLY one and I\'ve been aching to paint her up.\r\nYou haven\'t modded her at all right?'),(3071,'3605d1ef04','she\'s your\'s - the silver GT-R 2000\r\nnope, haven\'t touched here....\r\nwell I\'ve fondled, but only with my fingers  :lol:'),(3072,'0f6a64275b','Cool, the gloria is yours.\r\nI\'ll send her out with your homies.'),(3073,'0f6a64275b','Cool, the gloria is yours.\r\nI\'ll send her out with your homies.'),(4255,'cc608ca009','yeah, true.   The higher you go the less current you get for the output.   the best thing to do is to try and see what happens....'),(3075,'9f41f867c0','cool, I\'ll be sending out your GT-R 2000 with the package that\'s coming back and forth. lol\r\n\r\ndamn man, anything else we can trade before we put these packages off? lol'),(3076,'37c29f939c','I dunno about trading anything else man, but since i got your attn. here, You gots to put up some hindu hiphop man.\r\nI did a search on kaaza and came up with \"punjabi mc\" the mutha fucka exists  :eek: \r\nYo I wanna put together a vid and might need some help with getting the file size down and hosting it. I\'ve got premier 6.0 but I\'m still learning how to use it so it aint gonna be too soon.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3077,'37c29f939c','I dunno about trading anything else man, but since i got your attn. here, You gots to put up some hindu hiphop man.\r\nI did a search on kaaza and came up with \"punjabi mc\" the mutha fucka exists  :eek: \r\nYo I wanna put together a vid and might need some help with getting the file size down and hosting it. I\'ve got premier 6.0 but I\'m still learning how to use it so it aint gonna be too soon.'),(3079,'b36f33b39a','[quote:b36f33b39a=\"sessiz\"]I dunno about trading anything else man, but since i got your attn. here, You gots to put up some hindu hiphop man.\r\nI did a search on kaaza and came up with \"punjabi mc\" the mutha fucka exists  :eek: \r\nYo I wanna put together a vid and might need some help with getting the file size down and hosting it. I\'ve got premier 6.0 but I\'m still learning how to use it so it aint gonna be too soon.[/quote:b36f33b39a]\r\nyea I saw he really does exist, haven\'t heard anything, but he\'s an entity lol\r\n\r\nwe\'ll put him up - I\'ll have to kazaa something from him.\r\n\r\nwhenever, just let me know, I can help ya out.'),(5103,'de355e0736','yo...I\'m ording more alloys...\r\n\r\nyou want in with my order? or you on your own?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (5110,'d14ef1320f','Well the homies u got arent really the ones i was looking for.  But if you get any more or wanna make a diff offer let me know.  And ill let u know if i change my mind :)\r\n\r\nThanks bro'),(5105,'0cfc29df75','I was gonna try sellin a couple rims on ebay. I would like to post a pic or 2 on the auction off of the bitpimp site to show the wheels on bits/zips. Obviously i would not take credit for the pics but will you allow this? And what kind of rules would you want me to follow? I wasnt gonna link to them, rather dl them to my comp and then upload to the auction.'),(5228,'47d0a86700','Hey mang. Can I setup my account up here so that the post I make don\'t show up as new? \r\n\r\nWhenever I make or reply to a post it shows as orange in the main listing? ARRGGG'),(5213,'ad44420d36','I just been chillin.. I met some people at the pool that also have these cars, and we\'ve been raacing..  Plus, I\'ve been working some weird hours...\r\n\r\nI\'ll be up in here with some new creations ASAP..\r\n\r\nHow\'s everything up north? How\'s the family doin? Hope all is well.\r\n\r\n\r\npeace out G'),(3925,'2bd8388e84','ah naw man you don\'t owe me, those were just a test run - I\'ll end up getting more dups, I gotta get to TRU for my fix anyways lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3869,'ccc866db41','No problem! Thanks! :eek:'),(3870,'6064b9ac51','Got the decals yesterday, sprayed a clear on them and will test them on a new paint job soon\r\n\r\nThanx\r\n\r\nHow about sending me the file you printed it from\r\n\r\ndarktari@msn.com'),(3083,'93021fef4c','Hello Sinned, greetings from Australia.\r\n\r\nLove your shell work, you clearly are a step ahead of the pack! 8) \r\n\r\nI\'m interested on a comment you made about \"Polymer Cell with 4,2V! \".\r\n\r\nHow does the car handle?   You need to mosfet mod for this yes?  I take it the normal transistors burn out @ 4.2V?  Where can you get these Polymer cells you speak of?  Are they rechargeble?\r\n\r\nSorry about so many questions.....lol!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(3945,'55043498d3','You still want dees rims im holdin for ya? its kewl if not , i just wanna know so i can re-sell them if you dont want anymore.'),(3501,'640e920865','[quote:640e920865=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:640e920865=\"noxorc\"]\r\nmy wife and kid (girl) like the PINK car that comes in the Radio shack\r\n2Fast2Furious.\r\n\r\nWow, that just gave me an idea...Which I will share with you..\r\nI have not seen this done...and it\'s killer..\r\n\r\nPut a Bra on the nose of the car.    Sweet....\r\nGet some back canvus, cuts some headlight holes...\r\n\r\nbling !! ! \r\n-n[/quote:640e920865]\r\nyea dude, you should definetaly do that!\r\nthat sounds cool as shit!\r\n\r\nby the way, don\'t ever feel like you can\'t borrow ideas, at least from me - I don\'t mind if anyone does. not saying that I have the best shit, just saying I don\'t care.[/quote:640e920865]\r\n\r\nI ain\'t worried about taking your idea....and using them..\r\nShit... i\'ll give ya credit when I do.\r\n\r\nI like taking your ideas.....they\'re bent, like me. (not stright, normal, everyday)\r\n\r\nand I hope I give you ideas too.... like the bra...\r\nthe race is on...you make one and I\'ll make one..\r\nwe\'ll post and check each other\'s out...\r\n\r\n-n'),(3085,'93021fef4c','Hello Sinned, greetings from Australia.\r\n\r\nLove your shell work, you clearly are a step ahead of the pack! 8) \r\n\r\nI\'m interested on a comment you made about \"Polymer Cell with 4,2V! \".\r\n\r\nHow does the car handle?   You need to mosfet mod for this yes?  I take it the normal transistors burn out @ 4.2V?  Where can you get these Polymer cells you speak of?  Are they rechargeble?\r\n\r\nSorry about so many questions.....lol!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3087,'c8d2316f79','[quote:c8d2316f79=\"Havok\"]I don\'t want any of those...:lol:\r\n\r\nI gave you the clear rx-7...even funnier...tryin to give it back and shit... :smile: \r\n\r\nI\'ll think about it......\r\n\r\nmeanwhile in another part of Gotham........\r\n\r\nYou\'re gonna get 2 packages...1 little white box...and a manilla envelope...I forgot to put DevilDog in the box..oops....hes in the envelope....\r\nlemme know when you get \'em so I don\'t have to go postal!! :eek:...I crack me up ...\r\n\r\npeace.......\r\ngoin to bed...be back on after 7pm (cst)[/quote:c8d2316f79]\r\naight, well what do ya want? :wink:'),(3088,'c9ae4537d7','I have no idea........\r\n :???:  :lol:'),(3090,'c9ae4537d7','I have no idea........\r\n :???:  :lol:'),(3091,'e5d4b38e45','yellow auto modellista body? (supra I believe)'),(3092,'7bf3f5095a','Hello!\r\n\r\nThis Cell is recharable and you can get it in Germany!Here..thats a Picture!A Friend have buy it for me!!Sorry about my bad English!\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:7bf3f5095a]http://land.heim.at/toskana/211863/Polymer.jpg[/img:7bf3f5095a]\r\n\r\nGreetings from germany..Dennis Leusmann'),(3093,'e5d4b38e45','yellow auto modellista body? (supra I believe)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (7657,'0720426b1b','C-Dubs avatar is PAZ.\r\n\r\nI also want clownprince. \r\n\r\nYou send me Clown Prince ,PAZ and Mastablasta and a dog or cop and  I\'ll send you LOC Striper and a 2.6 BCG motor Brand new.'),(3095,'6d77e7232a','I likes the Supras....If thats what it is I\'ll take it...... :) \r\npeace........'),(5405,'65bb7e4f7a','I want bruja and papichulo. :-) \r\nGet back to me with the ones you want and gimme an adress if we got a deal.'),(3097,'a7d3964e56','Just got back from my local Costco. Didn\'t have the car/boats and didn\'t have any Altoids Sours either (something I\'m looking for a source for).\r\n\r\nFuck em, the sorry bastards!'),(3816,'85ff91a41b','You know you have \"moderators\" privilages now right?\r\nyou should be able to see the \"moderators\" forum now at the bottom of the forum index.\r\n\r\nwe\'re trying to iron out details for the next contest\r\nyou should get up in there and put your 2 cents in.'),(3101,'6d77e7232a','I likes the Supras....If thats what it is I\'ll take it...... :) \r\npeace........');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (9665,'eb440a6557','yeah , as long as theirs enuff in balance its all good.'),(3103,'548f72f4ac','it\'s the yellow car in this picture, pretty sure it\'s a supra\r\nhttp://tinyrc.com/shop/product.php?pid=495'),(7662,'40da209e9a','yo wut is ICQ number'),(7632,'f837e9c46b','hey never mind about witch clowns u have i want striper for mastablata ok thats all i want thanz my name is chris laudenslager and my address is 219 east pine street selinsgrove pa (pennsylvania)17870 ok and whats ur address u send striper then when i get him i will send mastablasta and a surprise homie just for u :)  :cool:  :-D  :-('),(7624,'91f4c68388','thanx man where do u live i live in pa'),(3814,'ccb78b497b','[quote:ccb78b497b=\"Havok\"]shit....give me your work address again...I accidentally hit the delete all button in my in-box...I\'ll pm him and give it to him too..\r\n[/quote:ccb78b497b]\r\nNo problem bro,\r\nSantagata Bros.\r\nAttn: Ben\r\n379 Shippan Ave.\r\nStamford, Ct 06902\r\n[quote:ccb78b497b=\"Havok\"]\r\nThanks alot man...I really appreciate this...and let me know what you\'re lookin for...parts, body...need cash for a deal...If I don\'t have it...I\'ll get it..I won\'t take no for an answer..8-)[/quote:ccb78b497b]\r\nNo cash needed man... so i guess surprise me lol. :cool: \r\n\r\n-word'),(3109,'ad8877ce38','[quote:ad8877ce38=\"DarkTari\"]C-Dub\r\n\r\nFix my profile pimp,  I look an awful lot like Hogjowlz\r\n\r\nThanx[/quote:ad8877ce38]\r\nI\'ll get on it, sorry bout that pimp - payaso was gonna shoot your profile for me but never did. I\'ll do it by tonite fo sho!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3110,'df05df634e','[quote:df05df634e=\"DarkTari\"]Cabo,\r\n\r\nLet me hit you with this,  I was thinking of 2 summer car contests, one in July 31st and one for August 31st, and 2 contests between those two.\r\nLet me go into detail:\r\n\r\n The July 31st Contest will be the [b:df05df634e]Baddest/Dopest Pimp Car Contest[/b:df05df634e]\r\n1st - MicroSizer Sport. We\'ll call it a [i:df05df634e]Pimp Street Sport[/i:df05df634e].  The body will be custom painted with a motor &amp; antenna upgrade. \r\n\r\n2nd - Dremel Set\r\n\r\n3rd - A Limited Edition BitPimp Body from the C-Dub Pit, You\'ve become famous with them.\r\n\r\nThe August 31st Contest will be the [b:df05df634e]Baddest/Dopest Pimp Car Contest II[/b:df05df634e]\r\n1st - Standard MicroSizer. (model to be determined)\r\n\r\n2nd - Air Brush Kit\r\n\r\n3rd - A Limited Edition BitPimp Bosy from the C-Dub Pit\r\n\r\nWhen Target had the Sports for $9.99, I picked up 8 of \'em.  I have one left which will be 1st pl for Contest #1.  When KB had the Standard Microsizers for $9.99 I picked up 5 which all are still unopened, one of these will be 1st pl for Contest #2.  I also picked up an Air Brush &amp; Dremel Set just for this contest idea for 2nd place.  Now Third place was just a suggestion but you &amp; the Inner Circle can determine how this should be handled.  I think that one of your Custom Bodies would be an excellent prize, a new one of course, I wouldn\'t ask you to part with one of your present ones. And I can add some Cat5 Antenna\'s to it.\r\nI would like to post July\'s contest before the end of the month (June)\r\n\r\nThe in between contest can be trivia oriented.  I have a set of Precision Screwdrivers as one of the prizes, the other can be donated by the Inner Circle.  Something small, one prize only.  Also thought about a Hoopty Bit Contest. All this is an idea that can happen.  We can discuss and finalize things later.\r\n\r\nHolla  ![/quote:df05df634e]\r\nhell yes, I wanna do all that!\r\ndude, we gotta get you in the moderators forum. you\'re missing some discussion that you need to know about. :wink:\r\n\r\nthere\'s an issue we have to work out though with these contests.\r\nExtrememicros.com contacted me awhile back.\r\nHe wanted to sponsor our next contest, I told him sure.\r\nSo the IC Pimps came up with a contest where we list 3 body styles:\r\n- S-2000\r\n- Gloria\r\n- Skyline (could change)\r\n\r\nThe contest is who can do the best of any of those cars.\r\nEM.com will supply 1st, 2nd, and 3rd places. \r\n\r\nSo, I definetally want to do all your contest ideas, but we gotta figure some details out, it would be a lot easier if you could join the moderators and post this discussion to the moderators forum so there\'s no middle-man, and all the IC pimps can get the details worked out.\r\n\r\nlet me know.'),(3111,'35fcfcb85a','Set It Up !  That\'s A Helluva Idea Cabo!  I like It.\r\n\r\nTodd\'s real cool Peeps man.  His latest motors rock !!!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3112,'4029d53493','first off i think you are giving me more credit than i think i deserve but i can still help yall out.\r\ni have a couple of questions about you\'re offer first of all when do you want this done by. i have some grade 12 diploma exams comeing up these next 2 weeks but after that i think i\'m free so if you need them like tomorrow or something you\'re outta luck man (sorry). also do you want me to makeup my own version of the bitpimps logo? if so what do you want on it just the same old stuff as the current one with the bitpimps and custom modifications underneith it or should i do something compleatly different? do you have anything in mind that you would like to see on them?\r\nc\'mon man fill me in with some info lol\r\n\r\nother than that i\'ll work on it in my spare time when i\'d usually be moddin. \r\n\r\n\r\n     -^-_-^'),(3113,'32601e66e2','No rush Pimp, Whenever you can get to it tomorrow!!  Just Kiddn!\r\nThe logo should be the original BitPimps logo.  When you get a chance, school work is ALWAYS more important!'),(4143,'fe2c516059','I dont need them any more so you can sell them  :D  my dad has a lathe\r\nso he can make me some thanks anyways');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3947,'5023585b7e','whasup dog?\r\n\r\nI got the guy holdin the bottle yesterday......\r\n\r\nWait till you see what I\'m doin with your decals...they are water decals right?...any special instructions?...say this out loud 3 times fast....\r\n\r\nI\'m Sofa King We Todd Did \r\n\r\nthats me. :-)'),(3117,'010dec0941','\"set it up\" as in give ya the moderator privilages?'),(3118,'c1cab62e5c','As long as I\'m still legal in da contest, if not it can wait til Friday.  I can catch up on the dialog.\r\nThanx!'),(3121,'a7d3964e56','Just got back from my local Costco. Didn\'t have the car/boats and didn\'t have any Altoids Sours either (something I\'m looking for a source for).\r\n\r\nFuck em, the sorry bastards!'),(3122,'548f72f4ac','it\'s the yellow car in this picture, pretty sure it\'s a supra\r\nhttp://tinyrc.com/shop/product.php?pid=495'),(3123,'e0de78e77f','Yup thats a Supra.....I\'ll take it.....and more advice...:lol:\r\n\r\nWhat do you use to mask your cars? I\'ve tried masking tape...with and without plastic wrap....pinstripe tape.....and electrical tape.....none have worked very well.....and since you\'re the pimp mac daddy super painter....you\'re the one I turn to for help....... :)\r\n\r\npeace........'),(3124,'cb865f0363','aight, we\'re gonna have to wait, if you were a moderator, you\'d have to help judge :)\r\n\r\nwell, it\'s not that long of a wait, so in the mean time - should I post your suggestions for the other IC pimps to think about or should I wait till you have access and can post it?\r\n\r\nI can\'t wait to start ironing out all these contest ideas, we\'re gonna keep the community on their toes! You got some great ideas rolled up in those sleeves DT!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3125,'30b71bacb2','And more where that came from.  I can wait, like you said it\'s not that long so that\'ll be no problem.  \r\n\r\nI really like the idea of customizing certain models for a contest. Sheer Brilliance !  No one has ever done it like that before.  It take a good Pimp to stand out!'),(3126,'e0de78e77f','Yup thats a Supra.....I\'ll take it.....and more advice...:lol:\r\n\r\nWhat do you use to mask your cars? I\'ve tried masking tape...with and without plastic wrap....pinstripe tape.....and electrical tape.....none have worked very well.....and since you\'re the pimp mac daddy super painter....you\'re the one I turn to for help....... :)\r\n\r\npeace........'),(3127,'e40f5eaea0','the supra\'s yours - I\'ll get it shipped off.\r\n\r\nI used regular masking tape for some areas and liquid mask for others.\r\nIf you use masking tape, you\'ll want to get a rounded toothpick or something and go over the tape rubbing on it with the rounded toothpick to get it to stick more. Otherwise you\'ll get a lot of bleeding. Masking tape usually leaves some bleeding no matter what, but you\'re just trying to limit that as much as possible so there\'s less \"touch-up\" work to do.\r\n\r\nLiquid mask doesn\'t bleed at all, but it\'s hard to get perfectly straight lines with.\r\n\r\nSo I use a combo of the two.'),(3951,'2799104ee5','What up dog?\r\n\r\nI sent the package to Kwik yesterday..he\'ll let me know when he gets both and sends them...If he doesn\'t tell you...I will...and I threw in Smokey and Pinoy too...\r\n\r\nIf nobody buys your ZZ bodies I\'ll give you $5 each for the Challenger, Yenko and green Eclipse....or I\'ve got these:\r\n\r\n[img:2799104ee5]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2242190/27745797.jpg[/img:2799104ee5]   \r\n\r\n[b:2799104ee5]Honda S2000[/b:2799104ee5]\r\n1-clear\r\n1-yellow \r\n1-smokey clear\r\n\r\nMine are in perfect condition....if yours aint...tell me..so I know\r\n\r\ncar for car or $5 each...or both 8-)\r\npeace........');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3129,'e40f5eaea0','the supra\'s yours - I\'ll get it shipped off.\r\n\r\nI used regular masking tape for some areas and liquid mask for others.\r\nIf you use masking tape, you\'ll want to get a rounded toothpick or something and go over the tape rubbing on it with the rounded toothpick to get it to stick more. Otherwise you\'ll get a lot of bleeding. Masking tape usually leaves some bleeding no matter what, but you\'re just trying to limit that as much as possible so there\'s less \"touch-up\" work to do.\r\n\r\nLiquid mask doesn\'t bleed at all, but it\'s hard to get perfectly straight lines with.\r\n\r\nSo I use a combo of the two.'),(3130,'e2d5e79f46','Hey Cabo, for some reason I always saw your url as \'lixlinx\' with an x, anyway I fixed the pics that are posted on the contest thread. Not that it really matters, but you could swap them with the pics in the gallery and the url will be correct. I am anal as all fuck dude, so I had to fix that shit. \r\n\r\nhue35'),(3131,'963591051b','Hey Bro,\r\n\r\nYou got any connection to Extreme Micro motors? I\'m only askin cause you started the thread about their motors and how much you like them.\r\n\r\nI think you saw my test results, that their RPMs are QUITE a bit below what you\'d hope for. Before I go shit talking about it, because people are already making comments in my thread about the results, I didn\'t want to put you off if you had any special connection.\r\n\r\nLovely.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3132,'a215005ccb','Just received my 2 boats...But 2 BIG problems...\r\n\r\n1. The FUCKERS sent 2 \'Ocean Runners\', a red and a yellow (27MHz and 49MHz). I\'m actually cool with that, but the pictures on their website showed the 2 boat package as getting the red and white boats.\r\n\r\n2. SHIT packing (actually no packing at all). They just put the 2 boxes in a lame ass US Priority mail big envelope.\r\n\r\nI shant be doing business with them again, I should\'ve clue\'d in when I originally wanted to do a phone order and the fucking guy barely spoke english so I did web purchase instead.'),(3133,'a215005ccb','Just received my 2 boats...But 2 BIG problems...\r\n\r\n1. The FUCKERS sent 2 \'Ocean Runners\', a red and a yellow (27MHz and 49MHz). I\'m actually cool with that, but the pictures on their website showed the 2 boat package as getting the red and white boats.\r\n\r\n2. SHIT packing (actually no packing at all). They just put the 2 boxes in a lame ass US Priority mail big envelope.\r\n\r\nI shant be doing business with them again, I should\'ve clue\'d in when I originally wanted to do a phone order and the fucking guy barely spoke english so I did web purchase instead.'),(14437,'392f93af88','Hey dude can I get access for the photoshop?\r\n\r\n  BTW if you ever want movies let me know I can upload them for yea :)\r\n\r\n  I just got hackers 2 (great movie), the new matrix, Gothica, Cat in the Hat and a few others :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3135,'e2d5e79f46','Hey Cabo, for some reason I always saw your url as \'lixlinx\' with an x, anyway I fixed the pics that are posted on the contest thread. Not that it really matters, but you could swap them with the pics in the gallery and the url will be correct. I am anal as all fuck dude, so I had to fix that shit. \r\n\r\nhue35'),(16073,'a689bc31ad','hey man, how are ya? you got msn messenger sorted out? my email is betty.k@telstra.com\r\nseeya, trent.'),(16074,'e2af98e9f0','[quote:e2af98e9f0=\"CaboWabo\"]cool man.\r\nyea I hear ya - wish I knew what hue knows when it comes to taking pictures lol[/quote:e2af98e9f0]No shit. \r\n\r\nI really think the lense on my camera is FU\'ed, but if Hue says to get a halogen lamp, then I\'m getting a damn halogen desk lamp.  :lol: \r\n\r\nTaking the pics from 12\" away, like he said seemed to help. Your pics are pretty clear. I can always see the spokes in the alloys. If I could get mine at least that clear I would be happy.'),(3137,'963591051b','Hey Bro,\r\n\r\nYou got any connection to Extreme Micro motors? I\'m only askin cause you started the thread about their motors and how much you like them.\r\n\r\nI think you saw my test results, that their RPMs are QUITE a bit below what you\'d hope for. Before I go shit talking about it, because people are already making comments in my thread about the results, I didn\'t want to put you off if you had any special connection.\r\n\r\nLovely.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3138,'3cf6edaf99','[quote:3cf6edaf99=\"hue35\"]Hey Cabo, for some reason I always saw your url as \'lixlinx\' with an x, anyway I fixed the pics that are posted on the contest thread. Not that it really matters, but you could swap them with the pics in the gallery and the url will be correct. I am anal as all fuck dude, so I had to fix that shit. \r\n\r\nhue35[/quote:3cf6edaf99]\r\nyou and me both, thanks for the heads up homie - I\'ll swap it out tonite when I get home.'),(14429,'06954223c1','word to ya mutha'),(14431,'a2b2f72f6f','Are you able to extract a .rar file?'),(14433,'a2b2f72f6f','Are you able to extract a .rar file?'),(14435,'6a1085acae','[quote:6a1085acae=\"sessiz\"]Are you able to extract a .rar file?[/quote:6a1085acae]\r\n\r\nShould be able to if not I\'ll DL a .rar extractor.'),(14436,'e4a799a425','Have not heard from you in a while and would like to know what info you have on the competitions for Xmods.'),(3140,'d24fb75e63','thanks for understanding. Again dude, that drop top Challenger is beautiful... it has inspired me to start choppin\' up a Camaro. God damn, I love these little fucking cars.\r\n\r\nhue35');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3141,'d24fb75e63','thanks for understanding. Again dude, that drop top Challenger is beautiful... it has inspired me to start choppin\' up a Camaro. God damn, I love these little fucking cars.\r\n\r\nhue35'),(16569,'8b8ed7506b','[quote:8b8ed7506b=\"SuperEMAXX\"]Do you think you could throw in a dip switch with the wires on it for the car to?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nTyler[/quote:8b8ed7506b]\r\n\r\nsure, no sweats...'),(3143,'ef4abc78a3','That sucks man...  What would you reccomend I do?   I want the boat that looks like a scarab cigarette boat..\r\n\r\nHow do they run..  Are they worth buying?  Do they look like they could be modded..\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(3144,'7677e5d25d','[quote:7677e5d25d=\"Namuna\"]Hey Bro,\r\n\r\nYou got any connection to Extreme Micro motors? I\'m only askin cause you started the thread about their motors and how much you like them.\r\n\r\nI think you saw my test results, that their RPMs are QUITE a bit below what you\'d hope for. Before I go shit talking about it, because people are already making comments in my thread about the results, I didn\'t want to put you off if you had any special connection.\r\n\r\nLovely.[/quote:7677e5d25d]\r\nnah, no real connection yet. He\'s a good guy, gave me some free shit. He scratched my back so I scratched his. I don\'t mind man. Matter of fact I\'d prefer it - the more input and info (which your info is like none other - fucking excellent), all the better for the community and bit world in general.\r\nSay whatchya feel mang.\r\nWe don\'t have to worry about slobbin knobs around here, this aint MRCC lol (I couldn\'t resist the jab)'),(3145,'0f3d730d4f','thanks man.\r\n\r\nlol - hue\'s caught the chop bug... you\'ll never stop now!\r\n\r\nI loved your camaro too dude. I haven\'t had the balls to cut in to that baby yet though.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3146,'c54fa889cf','[quote:c54fa889cf=\"CaboWabo\"]\r\nnah, no real connection yet. He\'s a good guy, gave me some free shit. He scratched my back so I scratched his. I don\'t mind man. Matter of fact I\'d prefer it - the more input and info (which your info is like none other - fucking excellent), all the better for the community and bit world in general.\r\nSay whatchya feel mang.\r\nWe don\'t have to worry about slobbin knobs around here, this aint MRCC lol (I couldn\'t resist the jab)[/quote:c54fa889cf]\r\n\r\nGlad to hear, I think I\'m starting to look not so appealing to some folks as far as sending me their Motors.\r\n\r\nThe boyz over at RCMod have been promising to send me their PHAST motor to test...But they\'re takin their sweet ass time in sending and I think it\'s cause they\'re scared to find out the results.'),(3147,'c54fa889cf','[quote:c54fa889cf=\"CaboWabo\"]\r\nnah, no real connection yet. He\'s a good guy, gave me some free shit. He scratched my back so I scratched his. I don\'t mind man. Matter of fact I\'d prefer it - the more input and info (which your info is like none other - fucking excellent), all the better for the community and bit world in general.\r\nSay whatchya feel mang.\r\nWe don\'t have to worry about slobbin knobs around here, this aint MRCC lol (I couldn\'t resist the jab)[/quote:c54fa889cf]\r\n\r\nGlad to hear, I think I\'m starting to look not so appealing to some folks as far as sending me their Motors.\r\n\r\nThe boyz over at RCMod have been promising to send me their PHAST motor to test...But they\'re takin their sweet ass time in sending and I think it\'s cause they\'re scared to find out the results.'),(14425,'85cb8b8c1c','I gotta get some High Speed access soon, right now I\'m working with 52.0 dial up and this will take awhile.  I\'ll send it from work this week, promise!\r\n\r\nThanx!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14479,'df0e4a39f5','I should be able to.  I\'m running XP, do you foresee a problem?'),(14480,'8883358434','Thanx Sess!'),(14427,'778cf1f3f2','Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nIf you\'re still offering the CD, I\'d like a copy....\r\n\r\nGH Sims\r\n7815 Quill Point Dr.\r\nBowie, Md. 20720\r\n\r\nThanx Sess!'),(3149,'71ac621c7f','[quote:71ac621c7f=\"Namuna\"]\r\nGlad to hear, I think I\'m starting to look not so appealing to some folks as far as sending me their Motors.\r\n\r\nThe boyz over at RCMod have been promising to send me their PHAST motor to test...But they\'re takin their sweet ass time in sending and I think it\'s cause they\'re scared to find out the results.[/quote:71ac621c7f]\r\nI think you\'re right.\r\nThey\'ve contacted me for some things...\r\nThey\'re kind of rubbing me the wrong way so I don\'t think anything will be coming my way from them.\r\n\r\nI think your motor tests are brilliant man.\r\nIf I were them, I\'d still want to know if they were shit - gotta improve somehow unless they just wanna be average or less than - at that point I\'d feel like I was ripping people off lol'),(3150,'04fa785338','[quote:04fa785338=\"CaboWabo\"]\r\n...If I were them, I\'d still want to know if they were shit - gotta improve somehow unless they just wanna be average or less than - at that point I\'d feel like I was ripping people off lol[/quote:04fa785338]\r\n\r\nYeah, that was the guy at Gizmo-Guru\'s thought too. Before making the commitment to buy a batch of 4.0s, he sent me 1 to test. Good thing he did, that fucking thing didnt\' break 32,000 rpm.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3151,'04fa785338','[quote:04fa785338=\"CaboWabo\"]\r\n...If I were them, I\'d still want to know if they were shit - gotta improve somehow unless they just wanna be average or less than - at that point I\'d feel like I was ripping people off lol[/quote:04fa785338]\r\n\r\nYeah, that was the guy at Gizmo-Guru\'s thought too. Before making the commitment to buy a batch of 4.0s, he sent me 1 to test. Good thing he did, that fucking thing didnt\' break 32,000 rpm.'),(3153,'beb4d67ae3','If you haven\'t been offered yet.\r\nYou can send your images to me, I\'ll host them and give you the link and then you can make your post in the contest thread.\r\n\r\nLet me know.\r\n\r\nCaboWabo'),(3154,'2866a1a47b','I got doubles out the ass man (series 6). I got a pic up in the swap forum but I got a few more in the last couple a days. I\'ll put up a new pic. Post a pic or tell me the names of what doubles you got. I\'m very interested in swapping. \r\nLater.'),(3155,'2866a1a47b','I got doubles out the ass man (series 6). I got a pic up in the swap forum but I got a few more in the last couple a days. I\'ll put up a new pic. Post a pic or tell me the names of what doubles you got. I\'m very interested in swapping. \r\nLater.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3157,'a3ba1fd8e5','I\'ll slap up a pic of my dubs..\r\n\r\nI\'m definetly up for some trading..\r\n\r\n\r\npeace'),(3158,'e3f4284505','if you have a meg or two to spare...can I have my quota upped?'),(3159,'e3f4284505','if you have a meg or two to spare...can I have my quota upped?'),(3467,'1a6062a33e','Hey Havok, what\'s up? I know I told you to PM or email me, in my last post, but I didn\'t see in your post you said for me to PM you.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, it\'s no problem, they\'re right up the road, and I can have my wife have the mailman pick it up from her work. They\'re $5, and I\'m pretty sure i can shove the package in a $3.50 priorty mail envelope. If you wanted more, I\'m pretty sure the shipping would be about the same, as they don\'t weigh much.\r\n\r\nYou can Paypal me at davesmoejoe@yahoo.com , or if you want to send a money order or something, let me know and I\'ll give you my address. (My zip code is 85033, BTW, in case you wanted to calculate shipping.)\r\n\r\nLet me know what\'s up. \r\n\r\nDave'),(3167,'09ee66f34a','I was wondering if you sale custom paint jobs? If you do how much would a clear skyline painted a wicked orange paint job. I\'m willing to pay up to $20. Thanks Bye.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3161,'60f53eb709','yea, you\'re up to 20 mb now.\r\njust an fyi, remember to try and optimize your images as much as possible so you can put more images up with less space.'),(3162,'a975c9941e','[quote:a975c9941e=\"CaboWabo\"]yea, you\'re up to 20 mb now.\r\njust an fyi, remember to try and optimize your images as much as possible so you can put more images up with less space.[/quote:a975c9941e]\r\n\r\nmeaning crop or filetype?\r\n\r\ncrop = cut away wasted noise.\r\nfiletype = .gif vs .jpg vs .tif\r\n\r\nyea...I know do both..\r\nthanks for the space.'),(3163,'a975c9941e','[quote:a975c9941e=\"CaboWabo\"]yea, you\'re up to 20 mb now.\r\njust an fyi, remember to try and optimize your images as much as possible so you can put more images up with less space.[/quote:a975c9941e]\r\n\r\nmeaning crop or filetype?\r\n\r\ncrop = cut away wasted noise.\r\nfiletype = .gif vs .jpg vs .tif\r\n\r\nyea...I know do both..\r\nthanks for the space.'),(3171,'ced915d14e','Cool, Now do my Turn-ons &amp; Turn-offs and I\'m straight!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3172,'09ee66f34a','I was wondering if you sale custom paint jobs? If you do how much would a clear skyline painted a wicked orange paint job. I\'m willing to pay up to $20. Thanks Bye.'),(3165,'9be6ff7313','yea all that. and if you\'re using a program that exports for the web, like adobe photoshop, that\'d be the ideal.\r\nwhat it basically does for optimization is saves the image file with only the required color information. So instead of saving a picture with millions of colors (most unused), it would save it with maybe hundreds of colors. Same quality image, just dramatic file size savings.'),(6802,'3b4cca71b4','not much diznatch lol'),(6850,'0f4d63ebb9','i dont have much to trade but can i buy em from you?'),(6832,'19438921d0','not a one do I need :grin:\r\nits all good.... :cool:'),(4498,'6a9b6b7b29','Hey Thanks Mang!  My friend is going to L.A and San Francisco by July 20 i think, and he\'s staying there for ten days to cover a boxing event in L.A.  If he doesnt make the cut for the rims...i got an officemate who\'s going there by September...this time IOWA to attend a weding there...im just not sure if he\'s going to a different state after the wedding.  How\'s the payment?  We dont have Paypal here, so i thought maybe give those guys the money instead and let them pay thru money order.  But i still dont know the addresses.'),(3176,'6c67fe6128','damn, I\'m sorry DT, I can\'t believe I keep farging up your profile.\r\n\r\ncan you please send me the turn ons and turn offs again, I can\'t seem to find them.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3177,'333b773ced','Hey Cabo,  Hear Ya Go\r\n\r\nHere\'s my profile as promised. Go over it and let me know if there needs to be any changes...... \r\n\r\nAKA The Smuth1\" This is one Mean Ass Pimp! Hes known as the Enforcer of the Pimp Gang. \r\nDont let the muscle fool you, hes a crafty mastermind of devious goin ons in the \r\nhood, schoold in 101 ways to take an enemy down. Dont take shit from nobody. \r\nThe babes cant keep their bodies to themselves around him and they love the Fly Azz Custom \r\npainted Bits he sports. He always has his Homies back. So if you ever try to get the lowdown \r\non one of the Inner Circle gang members, dont bother to turn around, \r\nDarkTaris there, and its lights out! \r\n\r\nTurn Ons: Fine babes with Big Azz\'s \r\n&amp; Fast, Fly Azz Bits \r\nTurn Offs: Fine babes with Noazzatol\r\n\r\n\r\nNow Hook A Pimp Up!'),(11959,'89bdd967a5','aight cool\r\n\r\n  Yea the cars I sent prolly got delayed a bit since its thankgiving here and no mail(plus no mail on weekends).\r\n\r\n  But yea I ordered in a super bit and some other LXX and zipzap stuff.\r\n\r\nso down the road I can see them wanting fets aswell.\r\n\r\n  Havok sent me a nice like suprise package with a thunder charger in it so I might get that done aswell.\r\n\r\n  Heres a questing for you. I imagine you are familer with TC\'s so here goes.\r\n\r\n  I notice that they get bettter range but have a strange antena on teh pbc.  Is the range due to the controller or the antena on the car?\r\n\r\n  Would I get bettter range if I switch that antena with the stock ones on tomy,lxx or zipzaps?\r\n\r\n  Pete'),(3949,'c2b8ba1d8f','I sent the package for pimp_c yesterday...it\'s small...white..and say from: Havok and to: Pimp_C on the back......\r\n\r\nYou know what to do......\r\n\r\nI\'m not gonna send your \"suprise me\" package for a few days....I\'ll let you know when I do....8-)\r\n\r\nThanks again bro.......\r\npeace......');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3180,'d50a74bc33','you\'re hooked up pimp :wink:'),(3182,'37e81cfca9','Thanx Dog !'),(3284,'6bd5e4aae0','ok the resized (that\'s all u wanted right) pics can be downloaded in zip format from here\r\nhttp://members.shaw.ca/dabigpig/stuff/resized_bitpimps_logos.zip\r\n\r\ni also made a background of white black and transparent from each size\r\n\r\nheh also included while i was tinkering with photoshop i made my own little bitpimps logo it looks kinda cheezy tho'),(11799,'10db408169','[quote:10db408169=\"hogjowlz\"]yo just a heads up. ill be back. i just needed to take a vacation from bits for a minute while i reorganize my head and get shit done that needs it. ill try to pop in every coupla days if i can. \r\n\r\nsorry bout the crazy shit.[/quote:10db408169]hey man, thanks for poppin in and giving a heads up.\r\ndon\'t push yourself man, we know you\'re going through some serious crap right now - take your time and deal with what ya gotta deal with.\r\n\r\nyou know your spot will be just the same as you left it, poop stains and all.\r\ndont feel obligated to have to stop on the boards - do it for you. we do miss ya, but we also want you to have a good life away from here too, like any friends would.\r\n\r\none thing I did want to mention to you though...\r\nI know the contest prizes aren\'t due for another 2 months, but I just wanted to let ya know, if you gotta back away from modding the chassis - that\'s totally understandable. just give us plenty of notice so we can coordinate the efforts.\r\n\r\nanyways, I hope things start looking up for you (if they haven\'t already) and let us pimps know if there\'s anything we can do to help ya out.'),(12288,'e4d1b11339','Ahh5hit,\r\n\r\nCongratulations,  Your Skyline has been chosen as this weeks \r\n\"Ride of Da Week\"');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11157,'8ef1fd8f84','[quote:8ef1fd8f84=\"DarkTari\"]Damn Pimp, I just posted my bB last night and already someone made this offer:\r\n\r\n[quote:8ef1fd8f84]wow great truck woundering if u want to trade it for a rtr complete micro rs4 (hpi) get back[/quote:8ef1fd8f84]\r\n\r\nWhat the hell is a RTR Micro RS4 hpi ??  And who Da hell is this dude Joe2872 ?\r\n\r\nI\'ll see what he\'s talkin about......[/quote:8ef1fd8f84]lol dude made me the same offer.\r\nI believe the Micro RS4 hpi is similar in size to the mini-z\'s.\r\nmaybe even bigger.\r\nI think its a carpet racer (all flat surfaces).\r\nprobably pretty much a whole new hobby lol\r\n\r\nyou\'ll have more delima\'s, do ya sell or do ya hang on to it cuz you like it so much? lol'),(3186,'8486e51ed6','just an FYI,\r\n\r\nyou can use these two links to post your images in the contest thread.\r\njust replace the current link you\'re using with the ones below.\r\n\r\nIMAGE #1:\r\nhttp://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwDhAk4XYZ1efNcfxCpmj4P4sY7dw6!MDLGMx168XGqQKkIVHWyDsCfAdbWjYJBBTVkB0Nutt*zPU3l!iVHlT!Hzc03*up1o0JFsfXlaacxl*!z78JQKPOZPiHa*JTUH/8735800-R1-007-2.jpg?dc=4675425750540929489\r\n\r\nIMAGE #2:\r\nhttp://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0UwDjAk4XXJ1efNcfxCpmjxLDR9eMG7CIu1qXDeJNocmsvjiobVE0kXTRq84TP8k78F4xvhDpPrhQ7DFysQwhDapw4fv3ZbAqbdxbdu9Cmd3qPF*sMrGxxoMimiU3ARcF/8735800-R1-013-5.jpg?dc=4675425750562970624'),(3225,'ad19dae8aa','ok....I must have got them, cuz I have Big Hopper and I remember I got him from you.....what were the rest of them????\r\n\r\nI already deleted the PMs with that info......');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3188,'d355cf1d9e','Thanks Cabo!\r\n\r\nHow\'d you do that?\r\nI\'m going to need a couple more links for my next car.\r\n\r\nI\'ll post it in a minute.'),(3190,'aed432af51','dude, I need ya to send me an address to ship to ya at, I can\'t find it.\r\nGonna get that Supra sent off tomorrow.\r\nyou see any homie doubles of mine you need/want?'),(3192,'dda6726069','no problem homie.\r\n\r\nyou know those links you were using and how they led you to the page with the photo and not the photo itself?\r\nwell if you\'re on that page, right click on the photo.\r\nchoose \"properties\".\r\nyou should see the \"Address (URL):\" in the middle.\r\nhighlight that entire URL, you\'ll have to select and drag your cursor to grab the entire URL, it\'s long.\r\nor you can click 3 times quick and it should select the entire URL for you.\r\n\r\nthat\'s the URL to the image.\r\nCopy and paste it where ya need it.'),(3193,'7626a6227d','Here you go.....\r\n\r\nWayne Simard\r\n1422 West Monon Drive\r\nBloomington,IN 47403-3020\r\n\r\nI haven\'t looked at your list of homies yet...what list is up to date?..and I just listed more doubles too 8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3194,'7626a6227d','Here you go.....\r\n\r\nWayne Simard\r\n1422 West Monon Drive\r\nBloomington,IN 47403-3020\r\n\r\nI haven\'t looked at your list of homies yet...what list is up to date?..and I just listed more doubles too 8-)'),(3196,'952baeaf46','http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=665\r\n\r\nI just keep updating the same image.'),(3224,'414b4579ae','Too many to list  :smoking: \r\nWhat type of car do you like? (for a bit)\r\nEuro sport, american muscle, street rides, etc.'),(3198,'271338cd1a','who is the guy wearing suglasses, standing next to jokachild?\r\n\r\nand the guy with double zeros on his shirt?'),(3199,'1b7902d886','did you ever get those other homies I sent yet?\r\n\r\nI think I got your package today, my wife said there\'s a package there for me - I\'m guessing it\'s what you sent.'),(3200,'271338cd1a','who is the guy wearing suglasses, standing next to jokachild?\r\n\r\nand the guy with double zeros on his shirt?'),(3201,'adf7c41ace',':lol: what Homies did you send?......I\'m burnt');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3202,'adf7c41ace',':lol: what Homies did you send?......I\'m burnt'),(3203,'6bd5e4aae0','ok the resized (that\'s all u wanted right) pics can be downloaded in zip format from here\r\nhttp://members.shaw.ca/dabigpig/stuff/resized_bitpimps_logos.zip\r\n\r\ni also made a background of white black and transparent from each size\r\n\r\nheh also included while i was tinkering with photoshop i made my own little bitpimps logo it looks kinda cheezy tho'),(7623,'28b7414802','[quote:28b7414802=\"eclipse98\"]thanx man ur my idol[/quote:28b7414802]aww shucks :lol:'),(5403,'b74c46bcfa','let me know what u want to do cause there are some of yours that i want... so try to wait off trading with others if possible'),(3205,'36a8935983','shit man, you\'re talking to mr. toast - I don\'t remember what I sent lol\r\n\r\nbig boy in double 00\'s is:\r\nBig Buddha\r\n\r\nto the right of Jokachild is:\r\nFlaco\r\n\r\nhttp://www.homies.tv/figures_06.htm'),(3206,'e252f1a862','I like both of them....send \'em....\r\ndid you open your package yet? and remember...Devil Dog is in the manilla envelope...the rest in the box....2 packages.....');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3207,'e252f1a862','I like both of them....send \'em....\r\ndid you open your package yet? and remember...Devil Dog is in the manilla envelope...the rest in the box....2 packages.....'),(3209,'d21b1dd1d3','cool, I\'ll send em with the supra body.\r\n\r\nnah, don\'t have the package yet, should have it in about an hour or so.\r\nit\'s gotta make the drive from my wifes work to home :)'),(3210,'d10c650cea','alright....let me know which one you get, when you get it....and I\'ll make up for the 2 homies....\r\n\r\nAnd did you check out my garage yet?\r\nTis cool.....'),(3211,'d10c650cea','alright....let me know which one you get, when you get it....and I\'ll make up for the 2 homies....\r\n\r\nAnd did you check out my garage yet?\r\nTis cool.....'),(4524,'e64ba7655c','Cool thanks, but I\'m not sure of how we would go about doing that.\r\n\r\nAt any rate I\'ve only got the video I already posted, I\'m just making plans for future vids. If you want to convert the \"Wheelie Poppin\' Mama\" one that\'d be cool. :grin:'),(3889,'5e05b80771','word. ill let you know when it comes');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3213,'8216bb4e1a','yea I checked out your garage, sweet man - got a big lot!'),(3216,'e25a9a41c4','the package I sent before came back, I tossed in the body and other homies and sent it back out.\r\nhere\'s the tracking # (UPS again):\r\n\r\n1Z 665 412 03 4080 0480'),(3217,'64cc675dc3','Got big spooky, 8-ball and the 2 pooches :)'),(3232,'ad19dae8aa','ok....I must have got them, cuz I have Big Hopper and I remember I got him from you.....what were the rest of them????\r\n\r\nI already deleted the PMs with that info......'),(3233,'c608760d9e','I really don\'t remember man.\r\nthose PMs are long gone in box too.'),(3227,'a8788ca7ab','musclecars / trucks  do have pics  ,,,,,,,,, :-)'),(3229,'3ef6ef672b','cool, thanks cabo.\r\nI\'ve been procrastinatin the past couple of years so i\'ll probably ship your shit out friday afternoon. I gotta pull a dbl shift tomorrow at work so the whole days shot. :x'),(4254,'eacb4b009d','[quote:eacb4b009d=\"crazydave\"]Really I was just more or less asking you for the diplomatic way to tell them no. I considered for minute, just because I didn\'t want to be an ass, but really your right I have found a new home. On other forums people can can insult and cut others down as long as they don\'t cuss, but here it\'s the opposite. We just homies kickin\' it in the hood playing with our little cars, we cuss, and rib each other but no one gets hurts, \'cause it\'s all good in \'da hood. Genious little plan you worked out.\r\n\r\nI see we feel the same about RCMod. ;)\r\n\r\nI think I\'m just going to say, \"I did it as favor for BitPimps, so I\'d like for them to have it as an exclusive for now, I\'ll consider it for the future though.\";);) You know don\'t call me, I\'ll call you. Unless you have a more diplomatic suggestion?\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:eacb4b009d]\r\nnope, I think you put it perfectly man.\r\nthanks for keepin it here too - that\'s an article that everyone will be reading!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3236,'5fa000a46b','cool man, you\'ve had to wait longer on my shit so don\'t sweat it.'),(3239,'0a1ec69421','I got an escalade and a cuda body that are custom. I have a pic up in here ......\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=155&amp;start=75'),(8219,'4b2c1f1422','Just got back from my visit with the family and came back with a few extra items I picked up.   I Curently have 6 K.I.T. Racing cars NIB  they are \r\n\r\n2 Yellow MPH/KPH w/2.6 motor, Green 3.43:1 gears, Hard White tires\r\n2 Silver RPM  w/2.6 motor, Blue 4.57:1 gears, Soft Orange tires\r\n2 Purple SLALOM w/2.2 motor, Red 3.95:1 gears, Medium Front and Back tires\r\n\r\nI have seen these on ebay for $11 each and I will part with them for $4 each including shipping.\r\n\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3544140480&amp;category=45352[/url]\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3544141294&amp;category=45352[/url]\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3544141660&amp;category=45352[/url]'),(7942,'301cb365d3','can you take pics of the pcb of a thunder charger and post them here\r\n[url]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=1484[/url]');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (6867,'4bd1df0687','i was reading a forum you posted about you receiving the new super bit char-gs, can i ask you one question about them though, do you know if the buttons on the shoulder of the controller are a turbo boost button like ms pros or do they serve any purpose at all?'),(3242,'1ab65569fc','I made a lil vid today while under the influence of my good old friend 151.\r\nI was like  :-D  Ima race me some cars on da track. It was freakin hilarious so I called the wife over and told her to bring the pos digicam.\r\nAnyways man I put some music too it and that\'s about it. I think my fucked up drivin could be a good public service  for the other pimps. You think you could host it up?\r\nIf so where would I send it?\r\nThe file\'s a lil over 3megs, smallest I could get it, and the vid\'s like 2mins.'),(3243,'b4184343e6','nice collection  god i thought i had a lot of bits lol///  its hard to see the caddy tho...  u have any monster bit mods ? i think we can work sumthing out here ,,, i like the the  bd bodys u  ,,,,, gert back can i have a full list of what u have basically only bit stuff no zz'),(3244,'1ab65569fc','I made a lil vid today while under the influence of my good old friend 151.\r\nI was like  :-D  Ima race me some cars on da track. It was freakin hilarious so I called the wife over and told her to bring the pos digicam.\r\nAnyways man I put some music too it and that\'s about it. I think my fucked up drivin could be a good public service  for the other pimps. You think you could host it up?\r\nIf so where would I send it?\r\nThe file\'s a lil over 3megs, smallest I could get it, and the vid\'s like 2mins.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3245,'e22f34522e','nice collection  god i thought i had a lot of bits lol///  its hard to see the caddy tho...  u have any monster bit mods ? i think we can work sumthing out here ,,, i like the the  bd bodys u  ,,,,, gert back can i have a full list of what u have basically only bit stuff no zz  :cool:'),(4346,'6c426990c4','yes got the db on one right now ,,,  let me know what kind of  $$ u looking for and will work it out ,,iam just dieing to get  a killer body but dont have the skills for that stuff,,,lol,,,  i know your  the pro so iam asking u ,,, :-)  :cool:'),(4347,'c88cde1630','[quote:c88cde1630=\"joez2872\"]yes got the db on one right now ,,,  let me know what kind of  $$ u looking for and will work it out ,,iam just dieing to get  a killer body but dont have the skills for that stuff,,,lol,,,  i know your  the pro so iam asking u ,,, :-)  :cool:[/quote:c88cde1630]\r\nwell, I\'m not really sure what I\'d charge until it\'s done.\r\nso why don\'t I do this...\r\nI\'m going to build a truck, paint and all.\r\nThen I\'ll probably put that truck up for sale on the bitPimps forums.\r\nYou can then view it and if ya like it, you can purchase it and I\'ll know what to charge and have that listed with the truck.\r\nDon\'t feel like you have to buy when I post it either, I\'ve had several other offers and if none of them want it either, I\'ll just race with it! lol\r\n\r\nsound okay?'),(3248,'831f8067ea','sure man, I\'ll host it for ya.\r\nemail it to me\r\ncabowabo@lixlink.com');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3249,'f5e749010b','I\'m pretty sure I won\'t be able too, I only gots hotmail and they got a cap on filesize for attachments. I\'ll see if there\'s any other way. :???:'),(3250,'f5e749010b','I\'m pretty sure I won\'t be able too, I only gots hotmail and they got a cap on filesize for attachments. I\'ll see if there\'s any other way. :???:'),(3252,'94fd145943','well, you could temporarily host it at a freebie shithole, then I could download it from there.'),(3253,'3ea76ebdf6','Thanks man but the freebie shithole I use don\'t like wmv files. I\'m passin her off to payaso and he\'s gonna get it too you.'),(3254,'3ea76ebdf6','Thanks man but the freebie shithole I use don\'t like wmv files. I\'m passin her off to payaso and he\'s gonna get it too you.'),(3256,'a4c9cb8255','cool, I\'ll PM ya the link to it when its ready'),(3257,'d4314990eb','Very cool thanks man.'),(3258,'d4314990eb','Very cool thanks man.'),(3259,'a63da871e7','I could probably cast ya or get ya the escalade body, but the chassis is gonna need to be stretched, and I can get ya that too. I got a zz monster truck towards the back of the pic and i\'ll see if I can\'t get ya a better pic of that. One thing I gotta tell ya though man, I\'m not really into any other RC cars so I\'ll be passing on a trade for the rs4.\r\nI only asked questions in the thread you posted for clarity as to what you were looking for.\r\nLater.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3260,'b58160853b','[quote:b58160853b=\"Aquarius\"]I was wondering if you sale custom paint jobs? If you do how much would a clear skyline painted a wicked orange paint job. I\'m willing to pay up to $20. Thanks Bye.[/quote:b58160853b]\r\nIt really depends on the intricacy of the paint job.\r\nCould you describe what you want in more detail?\r\nLike, do you want just orange paint and detailing? Two-toned paint scheme with 2 different oranges? A faded paint scheme with 2 oranges? An orange and another color of stripes?\r\n\r\nThe reason I need to know more specifics to price it is so I know how much paint I\'ll be needing, what kinds of paint and how long I expect it to take.'),(3261,'1ad1ff244b','I was thinking a darker orange in the front fadding back to a white with white strips down the Sunday with a painted black wing.'),(3262,'1ad1ff244b','I was thinking a darker orange in the front fadding back to a white with white strips down the Sunday with a painted black wing.'),(3263,'aab63b9905','the contest ends tonite at midnight central time.\r\n\r\nhey man, you wanna trade your Mr. Raza and Mastablasta?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3264,'c608760d9e','I really don\'t remember man.\r\nthose PMs are long gone in box too.'),(6852,'1fca0b3d67','for future refrence its Rob Vocke'),(6798,'6c7ae0a0b1','nope...too late....I had to go out earlier and had a bunch of stuff to mail...yours was included...so, its coming to you with the soldier guy...sorry \'bout dat :grin:'),(3267,'3a6d413842','well right now I don\'t have the orange.\r\nI\'ll eventually get some though I\'m sure.\r\n\r\nwe\'ll have to hold off for now.'),(3268,'bee72ff2e1','ok thanks'),(3269,'cf9436e790','I thought you were gettin Mastablasta before....either way....they\'re both yours....\r\nthey\'ll probably be in the mail today(thursday).....\r\n\r\nman...I finished that new mod I was talkin about, like an hour after the contest ended......I thought you guys meant @ 11:59pm on the 12th...not the 11th....oh well....\r\n\r\nwe\'ll need another contest soon :)'),(3270,'08b1bd232a','thats cool dog....\r\nI think I figured out which ones I got from you....\r\n\r\nBig Hopper\r\nIce Cream\r\nWillie G\r\nand\r\nChino Loco\r\nyou might have sent me Wolfe too....not sure.....\r\nall I had to do was look @ your pic of homies again.....:lol:\r\n\r\nno brain, no pain...\r\n\r\npeace....\r\n\r\np.s.....you didn\'t answer the question......does the face go wit da name??? :)\r\nand I\'d provide better back than DT any day......\r\njust to let you know.....\r\n\r\nTae-Kwon-Do\r\nJeet-Kun-Do\r\nKung-Fu\r\nHapkido\r\nKenpo Karate\r\nAkido\r\n\r\nand I\'m a former Marine....he he');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3273,'944a443a7c','here\'s the link to the video man.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/movies/sessiz_151_run.wmv'),(3274,'bee72ff2e1','ok thanks'),(3275,'cf9436e790','I thought you were gettin Mastablasta before....either way....they\'re both yours....\r\nthey\'ll probably be in the mail today(thursday).....\r\n\r\nman...I finished that new mod I was talkin about, like an hour after the contest ended......I thought you guys meant @ 11:59pm on the 12th...not the 11th....oh well....\r\n\r\nwe\'ll need another contest soon :)'),(3276,'5688d2b6e6','[quote:5688d2b6e6=\"Havok\"]I thought you were gettin Mastablasta before....either way....they\'re both yours....\r\nthey\'ll probably be in the mail today(thursday).....\r\n\r\nman...I finished that new mod I was talkin about, like an hour after the contest ended......I thought you guys meant @ 11:59pm on the 12th...not the 11th....oh well....\r\n\r\nwe\'ll need another contest soon :)[/quote:5688d2b6e6]\r\nyea I was supposed to get Mastablasta but it\'s never even been shipped, so I said screw it, I\'ll get it from a source I know can get it to me (you). lol\r\nno rush, whenever.\r\n\r\ndon\'t sweat not getting the other entry in or whatever, we do have more contests coming up, very soon. :wink:'),(3277,'08b1bd232a','thats cool dog....\r\nI think I figured out which ones I got from you....\r\n\r\nBig Hopper\r\nIce Cream\r\nWillie G\r\nand\r\nChino Loco\r\nyou might have sent me Wolfe too....not sure.....\r\nall I had to do was look @ your pic of homies again.....:lol:\r\n\r\nno brain, no pain...\r\n\r\npeace....\r\n\r\np.s.....you didn\'t answer the question......does the face go wit da name??? :)\r\nand I\'d provide better back than DT any day......\r\njust to let you know.....\r\n\r\nTae-Kwon-Do\r\nJeet-Kun-Do\r\nKung-Fu\r\nHapkido\r\nKenpo Karate\r\nAkido\r\n\r\nand I\'m a former Marine....he he');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3278,'514f9430a7','[quote:514f9430a7=\"Havok\"]thats cool dog....\r\nI think I figured out which ones I got from you....\r\n\r\nBig Hopper\r\nIce Cream\r\nWillie G\r\nand\r\nChino Loco\r\nyou might have sent me Wolfe too....not sure.....\r\nall I had to do was look @ your pic of homies again.....:lol:\r\n\r\nno brain, no pain...\r\n\r\npeace....\r\n\r\np.s.....you didn\'t answer the question......does the face go wit da name??? :)\r\nand I\'d provide better back than DT any day......\r\njust to let you know.....\r\n\r\nTae-Kwon-Do\r\nJeet-Kun-Do\r\nKung-Fu\r\nHapkido\r\nKenpo Karate\r\nAkido\r\n\r\nand I\'m a former Marine....he he[/quote:514f9430a7]\r\nyea definetally, that\'s why I was saying you looked like Edward Norton in American History X... I guess people wouldn\'t step to you, all they could think of would be the scene where the guy gets his teeth kicked in on the curb (ouch!).\r\nwe could always use more muscle around here :cool:'),(3279,'5688d2b6e6','[quote:5688d2b6e6=\"Havok\"]I thought you were gettin Mastablasta before....either way....they\'re both yours....\r\nthey\'ll probably be in the mail today(thursday).....\r\n\r\nman...I finished that new mod I was talkin about, like an hour after the contest ended......I thought you guys meant @ 11:59pm on the 12th...not the 11th....oh well....\r\n\r\nwe\'ll need another contest soon :)[/quote:5688d2b6e6]\r\nyea I was supposed to get Mastablasta but it\'s never even been shipped, so I said screw it, I\'ll get it from a source I know can get it to me (you). lol\r\nno rush, whenever.\r\n\r\ndon\'t sweat not getting the other entry in or whatever, we do have more contests coming up, very soon. :wink:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3280,'514f9430a7','[quote:514f9430a7=\"Havok\"]thats cool dog....\r\nI think I figured out which ones I got from you....\r\n\r\nBig Hopper\r\nIce Cream\r\nWillie G\r\nand\r\nChino Loco\r\nyou might have sent me Wolfe too....not sure.....\r\nall I had to do was look @ your pic of homies again.....:lol:\r\n\r\nno brain, no pain...\r\n\r\npeace....\r\n\r\np.s.....you didn\'t answer the question......does the face go wit da name??? :)\r\nand I\'d provide better back than DT any day......\r\njust to let you know.....\r\n\r\nTae-Kwon-Do\r\nJeet-Kun-Do\r\nKung-Fu\r\nHapkido\r\nKenpo Karate\r\nAkido\r\n\r\nand I\'m a former Marine....he he[/quote:514f9430a7]\r\nyea definetally, that\'s why I was saying you looked like Edward Norton in American History X... I guess people wouldn\'t step to you, all they could think of would be the scene where the guy gets his teeth kicked in on the curb (ouch!).\r\nwe could always use more muscle around here :cool:'),(3281,'30358fec18','I\'m on the homies....probably in the mail today....going there anyway......\r\n\r\nIf you havent seen it yet....check my post in Flossin\'\r\n\r\npeace......');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3282,'30358fec18','I\'m on the homies....probably in the mail today....going there anyway......\r\n\r\nIf you havent seen it yet....check my post in Flossin\'\r\n\r\npeace......'),(3283,'a005650917','anytime mang.'),(10783,'5a0101b494','Sup Pimp,\r\n\r\nI know you deal with ZZ\'s on a regular basis, this is what I\'m doing.\r\n\r\nI\'m taking the rear ZZ hubs off the axle and want to mount them on Tomy knuckles.  When I finally get the Tomy hubs off the knuckles and fit the ZZ hubs, the pin (front axle) is too short.  Now should I cut down the ZZ hubs or find something longer for the pin?\r\nWhat is your method for removing the pins from the knuckles?\r\nIs there an easy way?\r\n\r\nThanx Ahh5hit!'),(3287,'0fe961f69a','got your stuff shipped out today, here\'s the tracking number\r\nUPS\r\n\r\n1Z 665 412 03 4083 2526'),(3288,'c8633452ff','Thanks for the host bro. :cool:'),(3289,'19a2b5868e','NEWS FLASH ---------}\r\n\r\nPimp City Police officers were called to the Checkers Fast Food Joint on 13th &amp; Homie Ave. in response to a Dept. Of Defense Armored Car Robbery.  When Police arrived at the scene the robbers had gotten away with an undisclosed amount of cash and other items.  Pimp City Police Chief,  I. Gotcha said that it looks like the work of the BitPimp Gang.  These thugs have been reeking havoc in the uptown  areas in a\r\ntake-over plot with the rival TRC gang.  We dont have any one particular suspect at this time but a parking lot surveillance camera caught a glimps of the getaway Bit.  Apparently the DOD drivers had made their last pickup and decided to stop and get something to eat before clocking back to the station.  There were large amounts of cash and certain DOT hardware that were stolen.  DOT Officials declined to comment only saying that This BitPimp Gang has stepped over the line this time. \r\n\r\nAccording to Checker workers, two guys, one muscular and the other slim &amp; spooky strapped a chain to the rear door of the Armored Car and the rear of the getaway Bit and pulled the door open.  Then they dumped large bags &amp; some boxes in the trunk of the Bit and took off down the street.  They took off so fast, he hadda be runnin Nitros one witness said.\r\n\r\n[img:19a2b5868e]http://sc.groups.msn.com/tn/E4/90/DTMicro/1/2.jpg[/img:19a2b5868e]'),(3290,'c8633452ff','Thanks for the host bro. :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3499,'9e2dbd0bfc','I got dems today....\r\n\r\nMy wife is a recycling fanatic.....I love these boxes....I got 3 of them.....and I\'m keepin one for a pattern...\r\n\r\nI love the decals....you is the pimp....my wife rolled her eyes when she saw the chicas....:smile:\r\n\r\nthanks dog....I sent out Mastablasta and Mr.Raza this morning.....\"special packaging\"...:grin:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDo you like my new Avatar?\r\n\r\n[img:9e2dbd0bfc]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2167259/27461661.jpg[/img:9e2dbd0bfc]\r\n\r\n\r\nDon\'t get caught in the crosshairs!\r\n\r\n\r\nJust Kiddin\'.....I would never put that out there.... I was high and thought it was funny....the things I think of in my inebriated state...:grin:'),(3500,'13f79cce64','[quote:13f79cce64=\"noxorc\"]\r\nmy wife and kid (girl) like the PINK car that comes in the Radio shack\r\n2Fast2Furious.\r\n\r\nWow, that just gave me an idea...Which I will share with you..\r\nI have not seen this done...and it\'s killer..\r\n\r\nPut a Bra on the nose of the car.    Sweet....\r\nGet some back canvus, cuts some headlight holes...\r\n\r\nbling !! ! \r\n-n[/quote:13f79cce64]\r\nyea dude, you should definetaly do that!\r\nthat sounds cool as shit!\r\n\r\nby the way, don\'t ever feel like you can\'t borrow ideas, at least from me - I don\'t mind if anyone does. not saying that I have the best shit, just saying I don\'t care.'),(3294,'0e0b3ae816','no problem dudeman.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3813,'f7335e70dd','shit....give me your work address again...I accidentally hit the delete all button in my in-box...I\'ll pm him and give it to him too..\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks alot man...I really appreciate this...and let me know what you\'re lookin for...parts, body...need cash for a deal...If I don\'t have it...I\'ll get it..I won\'t take no for an answer..8-)'),(3298,'d510007af3','Where in TN do you live? Im in Gallatin, and you look like someone that works there.'),(3299,'26fb9bb199','Nope not there I live closer to Bonnaroo.  In Estill Springs and work in Tullahoma.'),(4072,'9b0fafc311','w00t! Good news, I am goin to the P.O. today with my dad. Paypal addy is...\r\n\r\nadmin@quikboard.com \r\n\r\nHey, can I please sell you one more body? Lol.'),(3303,'59b1bcce51','reply to my PM plz'),(3304,'3e06e14585','dangit nm, sry about that pm i just sent u'),(3305,'0fe961f69a','got your stuff shipped out today, here\'s the tracking number\r\nUPS\r\n\r\n1Z 665 412 03 4083 2526'),(3306,'4c78970f87','cool.....I shipped yours out thru USPS today(thurs)....no tracking.:lol:...but its all good...\r\n\r\npeace......');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3307,'4c78970f87','cool.....I shipped yours out thru USPS today(thurs)....no tracking.:lol:...but its all good...\r\n\r\npeace......'),(3308,'9d311e9293','what up dog?\r\n\r\nDid you know that Todd from Extreme Micros is opening a clothing and accessories store? \r\n\r\nI know big deal right......yes it is...hes 1-1/2 hours away from me........and hes going to have tracks and races twice a month....he told me in an e-mail...I\'m all over it....I\'m gettin pole position @ the first race 8-)\r\n\r\npeace...........'),(3309,'9d311e9293','what up dog?\r\n\r\nDid you know that Todd from Extreme Micros is opening a clothing and accessories store? \r\n\r\nI know big deal right......yes it is...hes 1-1/2 hours away from me........and hes going to have tracks and races twice a month....he told me in an e-mail...I\'m all over it....I\'m gettin pole position @ the first race 8-)\r\n\r\npeace...........'),(3310,'76aaf50e30','yea, I knew he was opening up a shop, didn\'t know it was gonna have cloths and shiat too though...\r\n\r\n :???: and we\'re working the possibility of BitPimps shirts... :smile:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (5400,'16f21daf5e','3 of mine for 2 of yours? :???:'),(9352,'089ca08b5e','2 Duel cells and depending on what the jbweld on the chassie does and the cost for that.\r\n\r\n I will buy just the plain old clone if you want to sell it I can use it to fool around on and for parts'),(5402,'0d7c31a2e9','its just that others want the same ones you want..... and they have more rare homies that they will trade for... but i wanted to trade with you cause we talked first... so i wanted 3 for 2..\r\n\r\nlmk'),(3312,'76aaf50e30','yea, I knew he was opening up a shop, didn\'t know it was gonna have cloths and shiat too though...\r\n\r\n :???: and we\'re working the possibility of BitPimps shirts... :smile:'),(3313,'e90ef0f9c9','I know....his shop will be chillen....I\'ll let you know when I\'m gonna go.....\r\n\r\nAnd dog......\r\n\r\nYou know I\'m down on tha\' shirts\r\nAnd you should offer an option to have our nics on da\' back or somethin....for a few bucks more.....\r\n\r\nIf you need any help in that department....I have been in sales for almost 15 years....and I minored in business management....\r\n\r\nbelieve it or not.....with this face.......I\'m a great salesman...:smile:\r\n\r\npeace.......'),(3314,'e90ef0f9c9','I know....his shop will be chillen....I\'ll let you know when I\'m gonna go.....\r\n\r\nAnd dog......\r\n\r\nYou know I\'m down on tha\' shirts\r\nAnd you should offer an option to have our nics on da\' back or somethin....for a few bucks more.....\r\n\r\nIf you need any help in that department....I have been in sales for almost 15 years....and I minored in business management....\r\n\r\nbelieve it or not.....with this face.......I\'m a great salesman...:smile:\r\n\r\npeace.......');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3315,'d0e1d5e526','cool man, when we\'re ready, we may come calling on ya.\r\n\r\nright now we\'re trying to figure out the how\'s, where\'s, etc.\r\nit hasn\'t gone past discussion yet.'),(3316,'d043bd5175','Sorry about annoying you but after looking around I decided that I wanted the skyline to be green like Superfly\'s entry with gold flames like in Crazydave\'s entry. Give me a shout if you could do that if not just keep the orignal plan. Thanks and Sorry :grin:'),(3317,'d043bd5175','Sorry about annoying you but after looking around I decided that I wanted the skyline to be green like Superfly\'s entry with gold flames like in Crazydave\'s entry. Give me a shout if you could do that if not just keep the orignal plan. Thanks and Sorry :grin:'),(6795,'bfa4d809a2','Thanx for lookin out Pimp.  I did try to post again but didn\'t spot that!  I\'ll give it a shot'),(6796,'bfa4d809a2','Thanx for lookin out Pimp.  I did try to post again but didn\'t spot that!  I\'ll give it a shot'),(3319,'877fd5cb01','that\'s okay man, no sweats.\r\n\r\nHere\'s my dilema.\r\nAs it stands right now, it would cost me more in materials and time that what you\'d like to pay. For me to make it less of an expense on my end, I need to be stocked up with all kinds of primers, paints, clear coats, liquid mask, bodies, etc.\r\nSo as I\'m sure you know, all that gets quite expensive.\r\nI\'m always buying new or re-stocking stuff, so when I do reach the point of having all I need, I\'ll hit you up on a PM and see if you\'re still interested.\r\nSound good?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3320,'1a6edf096c','Ok kool man just give me a shout.'),(3321,'1a6edf096c','Ok kool man just give me a shout.'),(5844,'de8148d563','[quote:de8148d563=\"crazydave\"][quote:de8148d563=\"CaboWabo\"]normally I\'d say no - 1 for 1 is my thang...\r\nbut...  :lol: \r\n\r\nI got 2 tan jacket ho\'s, so fark it - I\'ll do it - you got a deal crazydave.[/quote:de8148d563]  :lol: I like the pigeon so I wanted to kind of make a deal for him. I\'ve got too many chicks, but you don\'t have much else, so I figured I\'d ask for a 2nd, just so I can say I got some kind of deal for the pigeon. ;)\r\n\r\nActually I understand your position on the one to one thing, your goal seems to be to collect them all. I\'m willing to trade several \'cause I\'m just after some key players.\r\n\r\nAnyways, cool, I send it out tomorrow. If it makes you feel better I\'ll throw in the freckle face girl.\r\nDave[/quote:de8148d563]\r\nnaw dude, dont worry bout it - I got freckles anyways, s\'all good - I\'m not concerned at all.\r\nI\'ll get your homies shipped out tomorrow as well.\r\n\r\nyou\'re right, I\'m tryin to get 1 of each - want em all lol'),(3592,'ec09aa2aac','The boats are fun man, I think the \'itch\' to mod a boat is getting too intense to ignore...I\'m gonna have to order up and few more and rip that shit apart and put MONSTER motors in there.\r\n\r\nThe steering on them things is TIGHT, adding high speed to the mix would make for some fun ASS SHIT.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3810,'76e7f66500','sure...I\'ll have the font.'),(3811,'76e7f66500','sure...I\'ll have the font.'),(3326,'d0e1d5e526','cool man, when we\'re ready, we may come calling on ya.\r\n\r\nright now we\'re trying to figure out the how\'s, where\'s, etc.\r\nit hasn\'t gone past discussion yet.'),(3329,'a4a6e6f56d','payaso said he paid you through paypal for those springs you were gonna make for me, did you ever get payment?\r\njust wondering cuz I haven\'t gotten any springs yet.'),(3330,'99963a5dda','Yeah dude got the payment no sweats.   Been busy this week with work projects so I apologise for not gettin back to you earlier.  The springs will be shipped on Monday 16/6.   Aussie post doesn\'t work over the weekend.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(3331,'99963a5dda','Yeah dude got the payment no sweats.   Been busy this week with work projects so I apologise for not gettin back to you earlier.  The springs will be shipped on Monday 16/6.   Aussie post doesn\'t work over the weekend.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(3333,'d62eab32ee','cool man, no super rush - just wanted to check on the status and make sure they weren\'t lost with the good ole USPS (they suck)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (4046,'a537a1e403','[quote:a537a1e403=\"Havok\"]Heres what we\'ll do....send Kwik my Homies.....when he gets them I\'ll pay you the $15 as soon as he tells me, it should only be a few days if you mailed it today.......Paypal will give you my home address....include your address when you send the cars and I\'ll send you Droopy....\r\n\r\nThat way we only have to send stuff to Kwik this once.....\r\nI\'m paying him a fee and paying for both of our shipping...so I only want to do that once.....\r\n\r\ntell me what you think......\r\npeace.......[/quote:a537a1e403]\r\n\r\n\r\nCrap dude, I didnt have time to send. I will try to get  this crap sent out tomorrow.  So, you want the bodies sent to your house?'),(3464,'1a6062a33e','Hey Havok, what\'s up? I know I told you to PM or email me, in my last post, but I didn\'t see in your post you said for me to PM you.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, it\'s no problem, they\'re right up the road, and I can have my wife have the mailman pick it up from her work. They\'re $5, and I\'m pretty sure i can shove the package in a $3.50 priorty mail envelope. If you wanted more, I\'m pretty sure the shipping would be about the same, as they don\'t weigh much.\r\n\r\nYou can Paypal me at davesmoejoe@yahoo.com , or if you want to send a money order or something, let me know and I\'ll give you my address. (My zip code is 85033, BTW, in case you wanted to calculate shipping.)\r\n\r\nLet me know what\'s up. \r\n\r\nDave'),(3336,'0dab73273a','hey man....didnt want to holla this in the open.......\r\nI still got alot of people out in Lynn....if you don\'t feel you\'re gettin hooked up....I\'ll hook you up with my cousin or one of my boys....\r\n\r\npeace................');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3337,'3fd9b7ec28','tanks...let ya know when I\'m down.\r\n\r\n-nox'),(3338,'3fd9b7ec28','tanks...let ya know when I\'m down.\r\n\r\n-nox'),(4219,'c04223ce8b','I know I\'m being a lil impatient here but still no rims for me man. I was wondering if you did any kind of delivery confirmation on the packages you sent. If I don\'t get the rims by wendsday I\'m gonna start thinking that they\'re lost. :sad:'),(3340,'5232d47290','cool man....no problem'),(3341,'d2d3421c49','Hey man, sorry for a late response.   Yes I got the PCB just  few days ago!!  I\'ll send you out some springs next week.   Thanks once again dude.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(3343,'7c9ece8763','hey man, if you want - send me a snap shot of your movie and I\'ll put it up in our Galleries (main site link).\r\n\r\neasy way to get a cool, clear frame is going in to Premiere, find the spot in the timeline, export frame.'),(3344,'c75bfaa922','Will do.'),(3345,'c75bfaa922','Will do.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (3346,'73ab9e1305','Here ya go cabo.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.imagestation.com/picture/sraid65/pee58b23ebb5c092e828694e8701d424b/fbeec047.jpg.orig.jpg\r\n\r\nThanks man.'),(3347,'73ab9e1305','Here ya go cabo.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.imagestation.com/picture/sraid65/pee58b23ebb5c092e828694e8701d424b/fbeec047.jpg.orig.jpg\r\n\r\nThanks man.'),(4253,'23862d85dc','that\'s cool! gl on the rcmod contest!'),(3349,'8daaf3cf87','coo - got it in the galleries G money'),(3350,'98465ae69c','why lie?\r\n\r\npimp_c said:\r\n\r\n\" Hey, im spaz2k3 from TinyRc just so ya know.\"\r\n\r\nI ain\'t talkin to him.....but just thought you should know.......there is no spaz2k3 at tinyrc....I checked the members list... :???:'),(3351,'7a6c3327ed','his e-mail is lilc466@yahoo.com ....at least thats what comes up when you click the e-mail link in his profile......it doesn\'t exist...got curious after the tinyrc thing.....did a people search at yahoo.......... :???: \r\n\r\nI\'m not trying to be a punk....just warning you...like that Chris/Aquarius kid....lookin out fo\' my peeps.... 8-)'),(3352,'98465ae69c','why lie?\r\n\r\npimp_c said:\r\n\r\n\" Hey, im spaz2k3 from TinyRc just so ya know.\"\r\n\r\nI ain\'t talkin to him.....but just thought you should know.......there is no spaz2k3 at tinyrc....I checked the members list... :???:');
