ave payaso do the paypal thing tonite.\r\nI don\'t want to screw ya.\r\n\r\nand  no problem man, you\'re doing good for me too![/quote:cb6c993ab2]\r\n\r\nYou can\'t screw me, I\'m half greek so I prolly won\'t even feel it, lol.\r\nIf it makes you feel better you can pp me $5USD for my shipping costs, but it ain\'t a requirement.   :)\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10517,'5ad46b9ee7','hey man, hope things are keepin you well.\r\n\r\nJust a holla to say that I\'m currently doin a fet mod for Cabo and I thought I might as well offer my services to yourself as well.  I gots me some spare fets and are more then happy to do it for you.   Did you end up getting a car from microamps?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(10518,'5ad46b9ee7','hey man, hope things are keepin you well.\r\n\r\nJust a holla to say that I\'m currently doin a fet mod for Cabo and I thought I might as well offer my services to yourself as well.  I gots me some spare fets and are more then happy to do it for you.   Did you end up getting a car from microamps?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(15742,'f6a8dc62d9','Ima looking brother, no doubt I\'ll share. :-)'),(11694,'bdb1cf240a','hey thanks alot'),(11695,'7cccead6f3','hey can i email u the wallpapers instead... and if  i do r u going to put them in the wall gall on the homepage&gt;?'),(11620,'aa153ce415','alright its all good il send 15$ in the mail on itsway later today');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11622,'a2890abb76','Hey Havok i was wondering if you had any spare bodies or any skyline bodies, by skylines bodies, i mean the 2000gt, the R32 and the newer R34 or a Trueno body.\r\n\r\nPM me back if you do have them, if not still PM just to tell me.'),(11623,'c8a4aae182','Ah cool, I\'m in Mechanicsville. I was just in Chester tonight helping a friend set up his computer. He gave me 2 unopened retired Zips he had bought for his kids for helping. How old are you?'),(23014,'a3305040ee','Are you selling bodies and chasis separate?'),(11625,'','i am 13 what about u'),(11626,'239c197a27','Heh, I\'m an old man....30.'),(11627,'cd5f14c6ec','thx bro, sry bout that.'),(10521,'1d320ab3ac','[quote:1d320ab3ac=\"ph2t\"]hey man, hope things are keepin you well.\r\n\r\nJust a holla to say that I\'m currently doin a fet mod for Cabo and I thought I might as well offer my services to yourself as well.  I gots me some spare fets and are more then happy to do it for you.   Did you end up getting a car from microamps?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:1d320ab3ac]\r\n\r\n\r\nNaw, I haven\'t had a chance to get one from him.  What do I need to send you to get it done? Can you do a 57mhz Fairlady PCB?  And do the steering fets too?\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(10522,'2f598802a9','[quote:2f598802a9=\"payaso\"][quote:2f598802a9=\"ph2t\"]hey man, hope things are keepin you well.\r\n\r\nJust a holla to say that I\'m currently doin a fet mod for Cabo and I thought I might as well offer my services to yourself as well.  I gots me some spare fets and are more then happy to do it for you.   Did you end up getting a car from microamps?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:2f598802a9]\r\n\r\n\r\nNaw, I haven\'t had a chance to get one from him.  What do I need to send you to get it done? Can you do a 57mhz Fairlady PCB?  And do the steering fets too?\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:2f598802a9]\r\n\r\nHey Steve, you can just send me the pcb if you\'d like but usally the whole chassis is easier to be able to test.    Yeah I can do the 57mhz booster no sweats, also the steering mod won\'t be a problem.   So you can just send the chassis with no motor/heatsink/rear axle and I can take it from there no sweats.   All I ask is that you pay for the return shipping of $5USD.  Is that OK?  \r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10523,'2f598802a9','[quote:2f598802a9=\"payaso\"][quote:2f598802a9=\"ph2t\"]hey man, hope things are keepin you well.\r\n\r\nJust a holla to say that I\'m currently doin a fet mod for Cabo and I thought I might as well offer my services to yourself as well.  I gots me some spare fets and are more then happy to do it for you.   Did you end up getting a car from microamps?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:2f598802a9]\r\n\r\n\r\nNaw, I haven\'t had a chance to get one from him.  What do I need to send you to get it done? Can you do a 57mhz Fairlady PCB?  And do the steering fets too?\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:2f598802a9]\r\n\r\nHey Steve, you can just send me the pcb if you\'d like but usally the whole chassis is easier to be able to test.    Yeah I can do the 57mhz booster no sweats, also the steering mod won\'t be a problem.   So you can just send the chassis with no motor/heatsink/rear axle and I can take it from there no sweats.   All I ask is that you pay for the return shipping of $5USD.  Is that OK?  \r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(10524,'981f24d6ac','have you seen those boat/escalade packages at costco.  It comes with a trailer for the boat.  the escalade is a dual cell.  it has a diecast body.  The parts are not compatible with bits.  It is cool for glamour.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10526,'981f24d6ac','have you seen those boat/escalade packages at costco.  It comes with a trailer for the boat.  the escalade is a dual cell.  it has a diecast body.  The parts are not compatible with bits.  It is cool for glamour.'),(10527,'66eb40f5c8','Are you saying that you\'ll do it for me, and all I have to send you is $5 for return postage? Cause if you are, you\'re a saint..\r\n\r\nIf I gotta pay, I\'ll still do it.\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks man..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(10528,'145f24aed3','[quote:145f24aed3=\"payaso\"]Are you saying that you\'ll do it for me, and all I have to send you is $5 for return postage? Cause if you are, you\'re a saint..\r\n\r\nIf I gotta pay, I\'ll still do it.\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks man..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:145f24aed3]\r\n\r\nSame offer to you as Scotty, more than happy to do it as I got spares......\r\nBut if you\'re conscience prevails than pay me what ever you feel, lol!   Either way man I\'m happy to help.\r\n\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(10529,'867b579891','myaaiko@comcast.net');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10530,'3b22063e98','Hey Max,\r\n\r\nYou are aware that you won first place in out contest?  I haven\'t heard from you or seen a post.  You must contact me with your shipping information (mailing address) so that I can get your prize out to you.\r\n\r\nCongratulations!'),(24335,'f61bfb0692','yeh i may be getting a new xmod.. bassicaly i wanna know if u can hook me up? and how much it would cost bassicaly heres my wish list:\r\n\r\nxmod starter kit.. dont mind what one.. although i would really love a camero or a stang\r\nawd\r\nsuspention kit\r\ndrift kit\r\nstage 2 heatsink and gears (if i have 2 buy the whole set so be it)\r\n\r\nalso tell me if i forgot ne thing would want except bearings (gonna get properones RS ones suk)\r\nif we work this out i will pay before u buy it .. save u being down on cash'),(10532,'145f24aed3','[quote:145f24aed3=\"payaso\"]Are you saying that you\'ll do it for me, and all I have to send you is $5 for return postage? Cause if you are, you\'re a saint..\r\n\r\nIf I gotta pay, I\'ll still do it.\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks man..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:145f24aed3]\r\n\r\nSame offer to you as Scotty, more than happy to do it as I got spares......\r\nBut if you\'re conscience prevails than pay me what ever you feel, lol!   Either way man I\'m happy to help.\r\n\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(10533,'867b579891','myaaiko@comcast.net');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10535,'c684790171','Hey, what\'s up?\r\n\r\nGot your flames done.\r\n\r\nHit me with your address, and I\'ll be sending you these:\r\n\r\n[img:c684790171]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/pmask.jpg[/img:c684790171]\r\n\r\n 8-) \r\n\r\nI\'ll make you a placement diagram, sometime before you get them.\r\n\r\nKeep an eye out, finished up my Beetle, you\'ll be seeing it soon.\r\n\r\nDave'),(10536,'bb8237301d',':???: \r\ngot any ideas?'),(10537,'75cc098745','Thought maybe cj, but he don\'t seem the type. I\'m in the dark man :???:'),(10538,'c684790171','Hey, what\'s up?\r\n\r\nGot your flames done.\r\n\r\nHit me with your address, and I\'ll be sending you these:\r\n\r\n[img:c684790171]http://members.cox.net/crazylittlecars/pmask.jpg[/img:c684790171]\r\n\r\n 8-) \r\n\r\nI\'ll make you a placement diagram, sometime before you get them.\r\n\r\nKeep an eye out, finished up my Beetle, you\'ll be seeing it soon.\r\n\r\nDave'),(10539,'152cc9bcf6','Wow... Those look great man. Thanks a million. You can send em to \r\n\r\nSteve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn Lake circle south Apt C\r\nSt. Petersburg FL 33712\r\n\r\n\r\nI hope I can get em to turn out like yours do..');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10541,'75cc098745','Thought maybe cj, but he don\'t seem the type. I\'m in the dark man :???:'),(10615,'7feb6ba627','I\'m not on a mac.\r\nbut if you have Illustrator, I can make the vector graphic there and you should still be able to open the .ai file.\r\nyou just wouldn\'t be able to edit or add text because of the missing font'),(10543,'11d297afcc','[size=24:11d297afcc]BOO!!![/size:11d297afcc]'),(10544,'e417628c96','word'),(10545,'e417628c96','word'),(10546,'b7b5408473','I realize this is quite a while after your post, but are you still interested in some mosfets? If so, I just need $4 for each set of four and your address. Let me know.\r\n\r\nSuperFly'),(10547,'251f80c4a4','You got it.  \r\n\r\nMy addy is\r\n\r\nChad Ellis\r\n51 Briarwood Ct\r\nEstill Springs, Tn 37330\r\n\r\nI\'ll ship it out tomorow.'),(10549,'e0fc8a63ff','REALLLLYYYYYYYYYYYYYY!!!!!!!!!!!!!!1\r\n\r\nThanx guys, i really didn\'t expect to win. My internet was disconnected for a while that is why i did not post.\r\n\r\nmy address:\r\n\r\nRasheed Sabir\r\nBannister Land,\r\nMartindales Road,\r\nSt.Michael,\r\nBarbados W.I.\r\n\r\nThanx again  :grin:'),(10604,'b04ea455f1','Allright man, just let me know when you want one. I\'ll probably be sending out the chassis tomorrow, If I get a friggen chance that is. :(');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10551,'44c2fcd4e6','Same here man, tuesday afternoon...thanks again  8-)'),(10552,'cf0f8c86f7','Just got the following reply from Maximum....\r\n\r\n[b:cf0f8c86f7]REALLLLYYYYYYYYYYYYYY!!!!!!!!!!!!!!1 \r\n\r\nThanx guys, i really didn\'t expect to win. My internet was disconnected for a while that is why i did not post. \r\n\r\nmy address: \r\n\r\nRasheed Sabir \r\nBannister Land, \r\nMartindales Road, \r\nSt.Michael, \r\nBarbados W.I. \r\n\r\nThanx again [/b:cf0f8c86f7]\r\n\r\nGot his prize in the mail this morning.....Barbados???  Man we are certainly international now!!!!'),(10553,'1ae5242135','I never knew you were from Indiana.  I am originaly from Fort Wayne and travel back there one a year.'),(10554,'152cc9bcf6','Wow... Those look great man. Thanks a million. You can send em to \r\n\r\nSteve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn Lake circle south Apt C\r\nSt. Petersburg FL 33712\r\n\r\n\r\nI hope I can get em to turn out like yours do..'),(10555,'cf0f8c86f7','Just got the following reply from Maximum....\r\n\r\n[b:cf0f8c86f7]REALLLLYYYYYYYYYYYYYY!!!!!!!!!!!!!!1 \r\n\r\nThanx guys, i really didn\'t expect to win. My internet was disconnected for a while that is why i did not post. \r\n\r\nmy address: \r\n\r\nRasheed Sabir \r\nBannister Land, \r\nMartindales Road, \r\nSt.Michael, \r\nBarbados W.I. \r\n\r\nThanx again [/b:cf0f8c86f7]\r\n\r\nGot his prize in the mail this morning.....Barbados???  Man we are certainly international now!!!!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (26673,'b5db95f33d','Thanks for the thanks hs2000.\r\n\r\nYes those clones are really fast, and you do need to replace the rear tyres to get a reasonable amount of control.\r\n\r\nenjoy\r\n\r\nTB'),(26674,'b5db95f33d','Thanks for the thanks hs2000.\r\n\r\nYes those clones are really fast, and you do need to replace the rear tyres to get a reasonable amount of control.\r\n\r\nenjoy\r\n\r\nTB'),(10847,'0e67b79733','Holy Shit that is one sweet Bug!!!!!! I missed it before......... I used to have a Beetle with a whale tail.....it was orange with green fenders....it looked ridiculous....but I loved her  :lol: \r\n\r\nI know what you mean about these kids....shit I started working when I was 13.....tell \'em to get a job :lol:\r\n\r\nI found 2-3 more cars I\'d like mosfetted..I think they\'re all Cyclona Char-G...but I don\'t know what frequency they are yet.....I have to match chassis with controller, I know...silly...........Pimp_C still hasn\'t got back to me yet.....I\'ll let you know on that and my cars......  8-)'),(10557,'9fa908f4f7','hey man, just wanted to let you know that I scored some nice \'n bright blue and red smd leds for various projects.   I noticed that you\'re still trying to find some appropriate leds so I\'d thought I\'d pass this opportunity by you.    I\'m happy to send off 2 of each (2*blue &amp; 2*red) to you if you\'d like.\r\n\r\nI\'m still trying to finalise the circuit for the cop lights, again it\'s tricky to keep it small with the goal being a low component count.  I\'m tossing between using a 555 timer and some transistors or just an all transistor design.   The pros of the 555 timer based circuit are lower component count, but the con is circuit complexity.   The all transistor approach is a simpler circuit but a higher component count.   Once I properly move on this I\'ll post more info in your wiered science thread.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11783,'d92081559f','Nice I will hunt down the mail lady even more now as everything I ordered should be in this week so this package will keep me buggin her all through next week YAY she loves me.\r\n\r\nPete'),(11784,'e995411b56','Hey man, your car has been modded and shipped out.   It will take approx 7-10 working days to deliver.   If you could paysluts me the $10USD to ph2t@prahranpianos.com that would be cool.\r\n\r\nthanks dude,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(11785,'8b3d39f400','[quote:8b3d39f400=\"ph2t\"]Hey man, your car has gone out today.  Expect approx 7-10 working days for delivery.   Shipping costed 7.50 AUS so if you could get Steve to paysluts me the $4.50USD to ph2t@prahranpianos.com I\'d appreciate it.\r\n\r\nI\'ve got some video of the biatch which I\'ll post for you tonight.\r\n\r\nCheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:8b3d39f400]cool man, I\'ll have him paypal ya.\r\nthanks dood!'),(10559,'c199f42c06','Is the total $8 greenbacks?  I\'ll send it out today, Tue.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks man..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(10560,'cd5d3f5a40','you can send me the $8. I\'ll take that.\r\nit was $6 for 2 boxes and $5 to ship.\r\nbut your close enough.\r\n\r\n-nige');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10561,'b395c2af0d','[quote:b395c2af0d=\"DarkTari\"]Just got the following reply from Maximum....\r\n\r\n[b:b395c2af0d]REALLLLYYYYYYYYYYYYYY!!!!!!!!!!!!!!1 \r\n\r\nThanx guys, i really didn\'t expect to win. My internet was disconnected for a while that is why i did not post. \r\n\r\nmy address: \r\n\r\nRasheed Sabir \r\nBannister Land, \r\nMartindales Road, \r\nSt.Michael, \r\nBarbados W.I. \r\n\r\nThanx again [/b:b395c2af0d]\r\n\r\nGot his prize in the mail this morning.....Barbados???  Man we are certainly international now!!!![/quote:b395c2af0d]cool!\r\ndamn man, no shit - our reach is getting further!\r\nthanks for hookin this guy up DT and helpin us IC boys out'),(11837,'ebb369dcca','[quote:ebb369dcca=\"jeenyus\"]what colours are your R32 skyline and newer version of the R34 skyline.\r\n\r\ni just need the 1.6 engine, so if you can tell me the colours of the skylines i\'ll offer you a trade.[/quote:ebb369dcca]\r\n\r\n I have added a pic of the skyline bodies.  The 1.6 has only been used for about 2 minutes then was replaces with the yellow zip zap motor.\r\n\r\n  The bodies aswell are in mint condition no scratches.\r\n\r\n  Do you have a pic showing the damage to the AE86?  also I know that body came with extra hoods and shit do you still have those?\r\n\r\n[img:ebb369dcca]http://www.rcpics.net/media/skyline_bodies.jpg[/img:ebb369dcca]'),(10563,'cd5d3f5a40','you can send me the $8. I\'ll take that.\r\nit was $6 for 2 boxes and $5 to ship.\r\nbut your close enough.\r\n\r\n-nige');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10564,'6d8c580da3','That\'s the way it is in Da Hood Pimp, expect the unexpected!\r\n\r\nCongratulations Pimp on your 1st Place win.  You car was very nicely done, clean &amp; smooth.  There was a lot on confusion of course with those that didn\'t win but the rules has a twist and your car twisted itself right into 1st place.  I\'ll take your prize over to the post office right now for shipping.\r\n\r\nKeep cruisin through Da Hood for more goin ons this year.......'),(10679,'d1113124f9','[quote:d1113124f9=\"CaboWabo\"]I knew you would, I just felt bad bothering you with it after all the info you\'ve shared with us.\r\nI was trying to get this bitch:\r\nINITIAL D ENFINI MAZDA RX7 60-7032\r\n\r\nso how would that work?\r\ndo I pay you? them?\r\nyou need my shipping address?[/quote:d1113124f9]\r\n\r\nOne way we could do this is you send me to my paypal money equal to the items you are after And Ill ring it up here at work and have it shiped straight to you. \r\n\r\nUnfortunatly this sates tax is 9% so for that $24.99 car you\'d add $2.25 for a total of $27.24. \r\n\r\nI will be at work tomorow at 12:00 Central time if you want to order it.'),(10566,'2507eb4cec','I hope you are not gone yet. :(\r\n\r\nI want to ask you a favor, can you send me a couple sheets of decal paper with my prize?(just a couple) And maybe some old moddeling putty that you have lying around? (I\'ll take scrapings...anything once it is useable). You see i can\'t get that stuff on the island. There are no hobby shops here and the art supply stores only sell paints and stuff like that. Ppl always look at me like...what is he talking about  :?  .\r\n\r\nThis one might be a streach but it can\'t hurt to ask. Can you put a clear skyline body on the bit that I won?( If you have one of course) \r\n\r\nThank you\r\n+ thanx for picking me as the winner :grin:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10568,'7402e7ace6','Cabo,\r\nWhat\'s wrong with these muthafuckas ????\r\n[b:7402e7ace6]I hope you are not gone yet.  \r\n\r\nI want to ask you a favor, can you send me a couple sheets of decal paper with my prize?(just a couple) And maybe some old moddeling putty that you have lying around? (I\'ll take scrapings...anything once it is useable). You see i can\'t get that stuff on the island. There are no hobby shops here and the art supply stores only sell paints and stuff like that. Ppl always look at me like...what is he talking about  . \r\n\r\nThis one might be a streach but it can\'t hurt to ask. Can you put a clear skyline body on the bit that I won?( If you have one of course) \r\n\r\nThank you \r\n+ thanx for picking me as the winner [/b:7402e7ace6]\r\n\r\nIf I didn\'t send it like 5hrs ago, I\'d be on the verge of rennig\'n\r\n\r\nI know he lives in Barbados and stuff is hard to get so I\'m gonna try and help him out.'),(10569,'7402e7ace6','Cabo,\r\nWhat\'s wrong with these muthafuckas ????\r\n[b:7402e7ace6]I hope you are not gone yet.  \r\n\r\nI want to ask you a favor, can you send me a couple sheets of decal paper with my prize?(just a couple) And maybe some old moddeling putty that you have lying around? (I\'ll take scrapings...anything once it is useable). You see i can\'t get that stuff on the island. There are no hobby shops here and the art supply stores only sell paints and stuff like that. Ppl always look at me like...what is he talking about  . \r\n\r\nThis one might be a streach but it can\'t hurt to ask. Can you put a clear skyline body on the bit that I won?( If you have one of course) \r\n\r\nThank you \r\n+ thanx for picking me as the winner [/b:7402e7ace6]\r\n\r\nIf I didn\'t send it like 5hrs ago, I\'d be on the verge of rennig\'n\r\n\r\nI know he lives in Barbados and stuff is hard to get so I\'m gonna try and help him out.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10571,'399dd97c67','I think i made a mistake on the style of the alloys as that set is sold.( glad you didnt post it yet) but i will offer up style wm01 in its place. ( that is not a typo its WM01 not wt01) those are more of a \"pewter \" looking rim that would prolly need painting and some drilling. DT i know has some so he could provide better support answers on working with them.  \r\n\r\nHope this is OK, i mean, they are offered free for a prize in a contest so ya cant be too picky  :-)'),(10572,'57339b8cf3','[quote:57339b8cf3=\"DarkTari\"]Cabo,\r\nWhat\'s wrong with these muthafuckas ????\r\n[b:57339b8cf3]I hope you are not gone yet.  \r\n\r\nI want to ask you a favor, can you send me a couple sheets of decal paper with my prize?(just a couple) And maybe some old moddeling putty that you have lying around? (I\'ll take scrapings...anything once it is useable). You see i can\'t get that stuff on the island. There are no hobby shops here and the art supply stores only sell paints and stuff like that. Ppl always look at me like...what is he talking about  . \r\n\r\nThis one might be a streach but it can\'t hurt to ask. Can you put a clear skyline body on the bit that I won?( If you have one of course) \r\n\r\nThank you \r\n+ thanx for picking me as the winner [/b:57339b8cf3]\r\n\r\nIf I didn\'t send it like 5hrs ago, I\'d be on the verge of rennig\'n\r\n\r\nI know he lives in Barbados and stuff is hard to get so I\'m gonna try and help him out.[/quote:57339b8cf3]holy shit dude, this is ridiculous!\r\ntalk about un-greatful!\r\nthis makes me sick!\r\nI understand his position, but god damn!\r\nhe\'s asking for a completely different prize pretty much...\r\n\r\nI think we need to make a public post about this, what do you think?'),(10573,'8b6d11d892','Let\'s just wait til we announce the next contest, then we can elaborate on the subject at that time.  Let\'s not bust anyone out!  Damn who said that???');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10574,'b26317b39c','sure, I\'ll take some surface LEDs...thanks.. what do you want for em?\r\n\r\nI was in a big electronic\'s store the other day...to pick up any surface LEDs.\r\nand they didn\'t have ANY!   I yelled at the guy..saying, I drove all this way..and your out!\r\ndipshit salesman..\r\n\r\nanyway...they had this DIGITAL RPM kit.  it was a home project for kids to read RPMs through a digital interface....\r\nSo I\'ve been thinking about the kit for our Motor Testing...\r\nThe only problem was, the kit only supported RPMs up to 10,000.\r\nWhere as our motors can go beyond that....40,000+.\r\nI\'m still thinking about return to the store and buying it...\r\nsee if I can MOD it to work for us.\r\n\r\n-nigel'),(10577,'44b8a41544','[quote:44b8a41544=\"payaso\"]Are you saying that you\'ll do it for me, and all I have to send you is $5 for return postage? Cause if you are, you\'re a saint..\r\n\r\nIf I gotta pay, I\'ll still do it.\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks man..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:44b8a41544]\r\n\r\nhey Steve, as I said all is good to go here, I\'ve got access to a 57mhz controller(boost) so I can test the mod before shipping back so that\'s no sweats.\r\n\r\nmy details are\r\n\r\npaysluts:   ph2t@prahranpianos.com\r\n\r\naddy:\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nBENTLEIGH EAST   VIC   3165\r\nAUSTRALIA\r\n\r\ncoolies\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(10578,'028af610f3','The ones available as of Sept 16th for order are.\r\n\r\nINITIAL D MAZDA SAVANNAH  60-7026 \r\nINITIAL D ENFINI MAZDA RX7 60-7032\r\nINITIAL D BOOKS   60-7535');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10579,'2818d43d4d','Hey Dave,\r\n\r\nI hear tell you got some madd MosFet\'n skilz.  How much per car do you charge?\r\nWhere do you get your Mosfets and how can I get them direct?\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!\r\n\r\nDid U check out the Ride Of Da Week ????'),(11617,'','i live around chester virginia 20 mins from richmound'),(11618,'c8a4aae182','Ah cool, I\'m in Mechanicsville. I was just in Chester tonight helping a friend set up his computer. He gave me 2 unopened retired Zips he had bought for his kids for helping. How old are you?'),(11619,'1414a4c7a8','hey\r\n\r\n\r\nhey cabo hows it goin...as i was brooowsin flossin in da city i noticed that for your back rounds you have a peice  binder paperthat says your name and yor site name. but me..i travel to cabo wabo cantina alot and it so peneds i have ons andtons of cabo wabo emblums and like i found in my room a abo wao bg that says cabo wabo and you know its got like the sinset n the back and stuff and i wasjust wandering maye if you wantedit for asweet ass back round or sumthing.\r\nkent'),(10581,'399dd97c67','I think i made a mistake on the style of the alloys as that set is sold.( glad you didnt post it yet) but i will offer up style wm01 in its place. ( that is not a typo its WM01 not wt01) those are more of a \"pewter \" looking rim that would prolly need painting and some drilling. DT i know has some so he could provide better support answers on working with them.  \r\n\r\nHope this is OK, i mean, they are offered free for a prize in a contest so ya cant be too picky  :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10582,'44b8a41544','[quote:44b8a41544=\"payaso\"]Are you saying that you\'ll do it for me, and all I have to send you is $5 for return postage? Cause if you are, you\'re a saint..\r\n\r\nIf I gotta pay, I\'ll still do it.\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks man..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:44b8a41544]\r\n\r\nhey Steve, as I said all is good to go here, I\'ve got access to a 57mhz controller(boost) so I can test the mod before shipping back so that\'s no sweats.\r\n\r\nmy details are\r\n\r\npaysluts:   ph2t@prahranpianos.com\r\n\r\naddy:\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nBENTLEIGH EAST   VIC   3165\r\nAUSTRALIA\r\n\r\ncoolies\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(11761,'dcd66bd3af','Thats a good deal but I\'m broke at the moment. Let me get paid and I\'ll drop you a line.'),(11825,'1a8fb58989','any mofsets left?'),(11826,'9f39570d97','Sounds like a good idea to me...  I\'d be more than happy to help.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ve never used \"Modifier\" wheels before, so I\'m not sure how the performance is.. They look fantastic though.  If you want some wheels/tires that look great, and handle even better, you should get yourself 1 or 2 TOMY Pullbacks.\r\n\r\nThey come with a \"Bit Char-G\" body on top, and a phat set of wheels.\r\n\r\n\r\nOn the body work, I\'d make sure that everything is sanded nice, and clean before you paint it.  \r\n\r\nI also use a base coat of primer. It helps the paint to stick better.\r\n\r\nIf you have a digi cam handy, I\'d take some progression photos. Makes for a great tutorial..\r\n\r\nHope this helps, and if you need something else, just holla.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(11764,'4e828e09d4','One left');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11766,'b02051d384','that is pretty ironic....but hey, whatever works right?\r\n\r\nI recently made another stupid purchase. I bought a \"new in the box\" Digi-Q from ucfdan. This is me smacking myself upside my head.. :-) :-) :-) :-)\r\n\r\nit all fucked up, I can\'t get it to hold a charge...and the steering is weird.....you wanna take a peek at one? I\'ll send it to you for analysis, study, and possible repair if you want to check it out. :lol:\r\nshit, you may be able to mosfet it too...and its already screwed, so I\'m not worried about you hurting it or anything....\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\nlemme know whatcha think....\r\nlater.....'),(10584,'8b6d11d892','Let\'s just wait til we announce the next contest, then we can elaborate on the subject at that time.  Let\'s not bust anyone out!  Damn who said that???'),(10625,'32a43484be','[quote:32a43484be=\"DarkTari\"]Hey Dave,\r\n\r\nI hear tell you got some madd MosFet\'n skilz.  How much per car do you charge?\r\nWhere do you get your Mosfets and how can I get them direct?\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!\r\n\r\nDid U check out the Ride Of Da Week ????[/quote:32a43484be]I\'m gonna eventually charge 15 bucks per car, mosfets included, but here\'s the deal I\'m giving to pimps only; make an offer.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ve got some mosfets that Havok hooked me up with, I\'d have to charge you something like 3 bucks a set, so I can pay Havok back, or if you want to order a bunch you can get them from http://www.digikey.com/ , I\'ll have to look up the part number for you.\r\n\r\n...and yeah, I saw the car of the week, hella cool, thanks man. :grin: \r\n\r\nKeep an eye out over in \"Custom Jobs\", I\'m getting ready to debut my Beetle.\r\n\r\nDave'),(10586,'028af610f3','The ones available as of Sept 16th for order are.\r\n\r\nINITIAL D MAZDA SAVANNAH  60-7026 \r\nINITIAL D ENFINI MAZDA RX7 60-7032\r\nINITIAL D BOOKS   60-7535');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11923,'d0814b4ea1','o yeah  lol i got the money the other day the rims will go out monday. sorry bout the confusion.'),(11929,'79fa30bb24','[quote:79fa30bb24=\"ezenterprises\"]Wife said she mailed the package a while ago, give it this week and it dont show by friday lemme know and ill contact the post to see whats up.[/quote:79fa30bb24]\r\n\r\nNo worries mate, thanks for following it up.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(11926,'4af098cb36','hey man, good to see you back.... :-) \r\nHope all is well with you.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(11927,'6de3c7c14a','OK cool payment sent\r\n\r\nWould it be possible to send it to this address instead?\r\n\r\n20 Water St\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nL2V 2K3\r\nCanada\r\n\r\n\r\n I am at that address more right now, I only make it to the office a few times a week.\r\n\r\n  Thanks'),(13770,'de38654205','np man anytime u want to trade more im up for it, i have a few heat sinks i think if u want them, ill trow in a crap load of other zz stuff cuz i have no more,\r\nand no i dint get it yet but im expecting tomaro or saturday!'),(10589,'1ae5242135','I never knew you were from Indiana.  I am originaly from Fort Wayne and travel back there one a year.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10590,'fb3be274cb','[quote:fb3be274cb=\"noxorc\"]sure, I\'ll take some surface LEDs...thanks.. what do you want for em?\r\n\r\nI was in a big electronic\'s store the other day...to pick up any surface LEDs.\r\nand they didn\'t have ANY!   I yelled at the guy..saying, I drove all this way..and your out!\r\ndipshit salesman..\r\n\r\nanyway...they had this DIGITAL RPM kit.  it was a home project for kids to read RPMs through a digital interface....\r\nSo I\'ve been thinking about the kit for our Motor Testing...\r\nThe only problem was, the kit only supported RPMs up to 10,000.\r\nWhere as our motors can go beyond that....40,000+.\r\nI\'m still thinking about return to the store and buying it...\r\nsee if I can MOD it to work for us.\r\n\r\n-nigel[/quote:fb3be274cb]\r\n\r\nJust paypal me, like $2.50 for the shipping and shit.  That\'s it.   they\'re going out today.\r\n\r\nThat mod sounds cool, I\'ve been meaning to get back into it but the bloody hall effect sensors never arrived!!!  I only got three of one type so I\'ll continue development of that.   Let us know how you go mate.\r\n\r\nregards,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(12548,'9a796e713b','[quote:9a796e713b=\"noxorc\"][quote:9a796e713b=\"ph2t\"][quote:9a796e713b=\"noxorc\"]Im about to pick yours up today or tomorrow.\r\nse White rx7.\r\n\r\nabout this deal...I really don\'t need anything of your end.\r\nI was just doing the deal to help you out...figuring you could not get\r\nthis car.\r\n\r\nSo, how would  you like to just pay for what it costs me to buy and ship to you?\r\nI\'ll ship anyway you want...since your paying in the end...do you want insurance?\r\ntalk to me...[/quote:9a796e713b]\r\nOK then that\'s cool.   Find out how much it is for insurance to be added and if it\'s less than $5 more of the shipping cost go with it.\r\nI have paypal, but it\'s a paypal linked to a CC.  Is your pp account just a personal one (like EZ) or a premier/business one?  If it\'s the former I will have to work a deal with a local mate to get my pp account in the + credit for the cost from your end so the transaction goes through smoothly.\r\nagain thanks for this man, I appreciate it.\r\nMatt.[/quote:9a796e713b]\r\n\r\n\r\nOk, I have the car, in my greedy little hands....Hmm, maybe I should just keep it? hmmm\r\njust kidding, it\'s yours...   (since I recently bought the X-mod for $50. I can\'t afford another $25 for the SE zipzips.)\r\n\r\nI will go to the post office and check the prices and let you know.\r\nas to my Paypal account.  it\'s a regular person account with Verification.\r\n\r\n-nigel[/quote:9a796e713b]\r\n\r\nExcellent, thanks Nigel.   Find out the total price and I\'ll paypal you the amount.  I\'ve sold a few things so my paypal is slowly getting to the amount I approximately need.  Once againn thanks dude.  With this I hope to figure out the fet mod once and for all.\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10592,'81f04f5732','[quote:81f04f5732=\"ph2t\"][quote:81f04f5732=\"noxorc\"]sure, I\'ll take some surface LEDs...thanks.. what do you want for em?\r\n\r\nI was in a big electronic\'s store the other day...to pick up any surface LEDs.\r\nand they didn\'t have ANY!   I yelled at the guy..saying, I drove all this way..and your out!\r\ndipshit salesman..\r\n\r\nanyway...they had this DIGITAL RPM kit.  it was a home project for kids to read RPMs through a digital interface....\r\nSo I\'ve been thinking about the kit for our Motor Testing...\r\nThe only problem was, the kit only supported RPMs up to 10,000.\r\nWhere as our motors can go beyond that....40,000+.\r\nI\'m still thinking about return to the store and buying it...\r\nsee if I can MOD it to work for us.\r\n\r\n-nigel[/quote:81f04f5732]\r\n\r\nJust paypal me, like $2.50 for the shipping and shit.  That\'s it.   they\'re going out today.\r\n\r\nThat mod sounds cool, I\'ve been meaning to get back into it but the bloody hall effect sensors never arrived!!!  I only got three of one type so I\'ll continue development of that.   Let us know how you go mate.\r\n\r\nregards,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:81f04f5732]\r\n\r\nwhat is your paypal account name?\r\n\r\n-n'),(11611,'da87ac1366','Where in VA are you?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (22874,'62863fe7cf','I was wondering if you would sell an Xmod with out the body for pretty cheap, let me know.'),(12354,'60934cc4bf','[quote:60934cc4bf=\"payaso\"]Did you get the stuff I sent yet? I put a extra bonus gift in there for ya since you\'re a true pimp, and supporter of the boards.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get it.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:60934cc4bf]\r\n\r\nAfter I got this I checked and not there, but what was there was the one I sent you with a return to sender stamp.\r\n\r\n  They said it was not the full address but it was they put the fucking airmail sticker over the zip and USA part.\r\n\r\n  I changed the lable and took it back in and sent it off they said 4-5 days.'),(11614,'218694aadc','OK dude I mailed off the package today :)\r\n\r\n  Again sorry for the coins LOL My mom works at the casino and gets alot of US tips but when I went there all she had was coins.\r\n\r\n  And I figure since she gives me the cash at par I would take the coins.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Pete'),(11648,'af381ec48a','Your package didn\'t show yesterday, hopefully it does today.\r\n\r\nI got the orange Subaru modded, I set it up to run off a Microsizer controller.\r\n\r\nI tested out the Microspeed car, and it handled really good. I had to do something for it, so I put a Thunder Charger PCB in it, so I could get some FETs in that car too. It\'s cool because this car works with either the Microsizer controller, or it\'s own.\r\n\r\nI\'ll keep you updated with my progress.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11616,'59b9616259','[quote:59b9616259=\"VooDooMafia\"]OK dude I mailed off the package today :)\r\n\r\n  Again sorry for the coins LOL My mom works at the casino and gets alot of US tips but when I went there all she had was coins.\r\n\r\n  And I figure since she gives me the cash at par I would take the coins.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Pete[/quote:59b9616259]Alright man, I\'ll keep my eye out. Let you know as soon as I get it.\r\n\r\nDave'),(10594,'8cd9c82941','[quote:8cd9c82941=\"cj\"]The ones available as of Sept 16th for order are.\r\n\r\nINITIAL D MAZDA SAVANNAH  60-7026 \r\nINITIAL D ENFINI MAZDA RX7 60-7032\r\nINITIAL D BOOKS   60-7535[/quote:8cd9c82941]what is BOOKS?\r\n\r\nI take it you\'ve probably seen pics of these bad boys?\r\nwhich looks the coolest?'),(10595,'4044cc6498','[quote:4044cc6498=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:4044cc6498=\"cj\"]The ones available as of Sept 16th for order are.\r\n\r\nINITIAL D MAZDA SAVANNAH  60-7026 \r\nINITIAL D ENFINI MAZDA RX7 60-7032\r\nINITIAL D BOOKS   60-7535[/quote:4044cc6498]what is BOOKS?\r\n\r\nI take it you\'ve probably seen pics of these bad boys?\r\nwhich looks the coolest?[/quote:4044cc6498]\r\n\r\nDon\'t know what the books are but I ordered one for myself.'),(10596,'f385c61dd8','[quote:f385c61dd8=\"ezenterprises\"]I think i made a mistake on the style of the alloys as that set is sold.( glad you didnt post it yet) but i will offer up style wm01 in its place. ( that is not a typo its WM01 not wt01) those are more of a \"pewter \" looking rim that would prolly need painting and some drilling. DT i know has some so he could provide better support answers on working with them.  \r\n\r\nHope this is OK, i mean, they are offered free for a prize in a contest so ya cant be too picky  :-)[/quote:f385c61dd8]yea that\'s fine man, we\'re not picky...\r\nto be honest, I think we might already have it squared away and probably don\'t need the alloys - at least not at this time.\r\nthanks for offering them up though - very cool of you to do.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10597,'079fc866d6','Package went in the mail 5 hrs. ago   Sorry!  Exactly what are you looking for?  List!'),(10598,'4044cc6498','[quote:4044cc6498=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:4044cc6498=\"cj\"]The ones available as of Sept 16th for order are.\r\n\r\nINITIAL D MAZDA SAVANNAH  60-7026 \r\nINITIAL D ENFINI MAZDA RX7 60-7032\r\nINITIAL D BOOKS   60-7535[/quote:4044cc6498]what is BOOKS?\r\n\r\nI take it you\'ve probably seen pics of these bad boys?\r\nwhich looks the coolest?[/quote:4044cc6498]\r\n\r\nDon\'t know what the books are but I ordered one for myself.'),(10600,'e14c4a3fbc','hey man, hold off on getin me the zz se for the moment, I wanna make sure I can pay you before you pick it up so I gotta work some things to get the balance in paysluts correct first.\r\n\r\nas to the mosfet mod things are all ready to go here, just give me a holla when it\'s on its way.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\nph2t.'),(10678,'d1113124f9','[quote:d1113124f9=\"CaboWabo\"]I knew you would, I just felt bad bothering you with it after all the info you\'ve shared with us.\r\nI was trying to get this bitch:\r\nINITIAL D ENFINI MAZDA RX7 60-7032\r\n\r\nso how would that work?\r\ndo I pay you? them?\r\nyou need my shipping address?[/quote:d1113124f9]\r\n\r\nOne way we could do this is you send me to my paypal money equal to the items you are after And Ill ring it up here at work and have it shiped straight to you. \r\n\r\nUnfortunatly this sates tax is 9% so for that $24.99 car you\'d add $2.25 for a total of $27.24. \r\n\r\nI will be at work tomorow at 12:00 Central time if you want to order it.'),(10606,'32c4e4e13d','[quote:32c4e4e13d=\"sessiz\"]Allright man, just let me know when you want one. I\'ll probably be sending out the chassis tomorrow, If I get a friggen chance that is. :([/quote:32c4e4e13d]\r\n\r\ncool, shamon brother...\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10607,'edf4846e64','First, awesome freakin job man, I\'m more than impressed I think I\'m in love. :eek: \r\nI want to make a wallpaper featuring your car. I dunno if you\'ve seen the wallpaper thread in the uncensored forum but I\'ld like to ask for your permision to use the pics of your car and to post up the wall once it\'s done. I plan on starting it right now so get back to me as soon as you can man.\r\nThanks.'),(13041,'6304af5276','Sorry to hear about the wife, she have plans on were to look for work or something lined up?\r\n\r\n  By chance did you end up posting a car on ebay?\r\n\r\n  As for the package going out thanks but there was no rush, I got my bithed order today with some cool shit in it like the super bit speed sets with gold bling rims(front and back).\r\n\r\n\r\n  well if I can help in anyway let me know I can see what I can do :)'),(10609,'26c8190c97','[quote:26c8190c97=\"sessiz\"]First, awesome freakin job man, I\'m more than impressed I think I\'m in love. :eek: \r\nI want to make a wallpaper featuring your car. I dunno if you\'ve seen the wallpaper thread in the uncensored forum but I\'ld like to ask for your permision to use the pics of your car and to post up the wall once it\'s done. I plan on starting it right now so get back to me as soon as you can man.\r\nThanks.[/quote:26c8190c97]Thanks man. She is one hot bitch, aint she?\r\n\r\nYeah, have at it with the wallpaper. Can\'t wait to see it.  :-D \r\n\r\nDave'),(10611,'7e97bb9ede','[quote:7e97bb9ede=\"noxorc\"][quote:7e97bb9ede=\"ph2t\"][quote:7e97bb9ede=\"noxorc\"]sure, I\'ll take some surface LEDs...thanks.. what do you want for em?\r\n\r\nI was in a big electronic\'s store the other day...to pick up any surface LEDs.\r\nand they didn\'t have ANY!   I yelled at the guy..saying, I drove all this way..and your out!\r\ndipshit salesman..\r\n\r\nanyway...they had this DIGITAL RPM kit.  it was a home project for kids to read RPMs through a digital interface....\r\nSo I\'ve been thinking about the kit for our Motor Testing...\r\nThe only problem was, the kit only supported RPMs up to 10,000.\r\nWhere as our motors can go beyond that....40,000+.\r\nI\'m still thinking about return to the store and buying it...\r\nsee if I can MOD it to work for us.\r\n\r\n-nigel[/quote:7e97bb9ede]\r\n\r\nJust paypal me, like $2.50 for the shipping and shit.  That\'s it.   they\'re going out today.\r\n\r\nThat mod sounds cool, I\'ve been meaning to get back into it but the bloody hall effect sensors never arrived!!!  I only got three of one type so I\'ll continue development of that.   Let us know how you go mate.\r\n\r\nregards,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:7e97bb9ede]\r\n\r\nwhat is your paypal account name?\r\n\r\n-n[/quote:7e97bb9ede]\r\n\r\nph2t@prahranpianos.com\r\n\r\ncheers dude.\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10612,'292f8e6208','[quote=\"crazydave\"\r\nThanks man. She is one hot bitch, aint she?\r\n\r\nYeah, have at it with the wallpaper. Can\'t wait to see it.  :-D \r\n\r\nDave[/quote]\r\n\r\nThat\'s a freakin understatement man, she\'s a beauty for real.\r\nI should have the wallpaper done in a lil while.\r\nThanks.'),(10614,'10ecbd2baf','if ya do and you want a part in the bitpimps video send em to myaaiko@comcast.net or post em up.\r\n\r\nthat beetle is something else.'),(10621,'d9ad0bdd55','i heard i can transfer money from my bank account into a paypal account .. 2 questions do u no how n if so whats ur paypal... this is for the 33 my freind couldnt post the cash to u so i need them shiped to aus...'),(10623,'882d10cb4a','once you have a paypal account and also have verified your bank account thru them, all you do is send money to a person and it will automatically take it from your bank account.  racerboy@dwp.net  is my paypal address if you ever get it working.'),(10624,'b6c3bc8ae5','[quote:b6c3bc8ae5=\"DarkTari\"]Let\'s just wait til we announce the next contest, then we can elaborate on the subject at that time.  Let\'s not bust anyone out!  Damn who said that???[/quote:b6c3bc8ae5]LOL\r\nno shit, where\'s DT? bring him back! lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10626,'829afda310','Cool, lemme know when you get a part number.\r\n\r\nHavoc is the one that informed me and said to contact you.\r\n\r\nI\'ll be lookin for your bug.  I finished mine a couple of weeks ago but still haven\'t posted yet.  I\'m putting that in the AusMicro contest but I\'ll post it in [b:829afda310]Custom[/b:829afda310] before I do.\r\n\r\nSo let me know how much per car you\'ll charge.  I\'ll ship to you and pay for return.\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!'),(35222,'ac0bef9f53','[quote:ac0bef9f53=\"chrome\"]I\'m sorry CJ, I interpreted on my own that the parts would be shipping sometme early December, so I sent my school address.  Since I saw your post about the shipment on Dec. 15th, I\'m going to need the parts shipped home.\r\n\r\nSean Dill\r\n301 Dominic Drive\r\nScott Depot, WV 25560\r\n\r\nIf you\'d like to refuse payment and have me send it again with the other address, that\'s fine too.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...[/quote:ac0bef9f53]\r\n\r\nAs long as you will be at an address you give me that it\'s fine.  I may not get ALL the parts in December.'),(28423,'a60db89a31','I will email you tonight okay');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10629,'436102eeb2','Maxx,\r\n\r\nYou can check here for the decal paper &amp; putty or just about anything else\r\nyou need for modding.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.micromark.com\r\n\r\nYour cousin can check at Toys-R-Us, they sell body kits (2) for $4.99ea\r\nor you can get them thru here\r\n\r\nhttp://www.towerhobbies.com/products/hobbico/microsizers/micro_hopups.html#bodysets'),(10630,'e2f29e85d4','yessir, outlined .ai file would be great!'),(10677,'93ba1f4fb2','[quote:93ba1f4fb2=\"cj\"]What are you looking for Cabo?  If it is available you know I can have it shiped to you at the regular price plus tax and no shipping.[/quote:93ba1f4fb2]lol dude I have the shittiest luck with RS\'s. :lol: \r\nI knew you would, I just felt bad bothering you with it after all the info you\'ve shared with us.\r\nI was trying to get this bitch:\r\nINITIAL D ENFINI MAZDA RX7 60-7032\r\n\r\nso how would that work?\r\ndo I pay you? them?\r\nyou need my shipping address?'),(10632,'10ecbd2baf','if ya do and you want a part in the bitpimps video send em to myaaiko@comcast.net or post em up.\r\n\r\nthat beetle is something else.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10634,'4c32b601f6','My 2 cars that you did are holding up great.... :grin: I haven\'t had alot of opportunity to play lately...cuz I\'m trying to build a track.....\r\n\r\nI\'ve been having layout problems...the space I have available is on a 6\'x30\" banquet table.....kinda narrow....and I wanted more than a Nascar type dog-leg track....I\'ll send a pic soon....\r\n\r\nok, I sent the package to your wife\'s work this afternoon....priority mail, so 2-3 days....and it was $7.85....not a bad guess huh?...pretty close anyway..... I put $7.00 cash into the box.....have fun finding it in the peanuts :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get it.....  8-)'),(10635,'1ac8b73a28','[quote:1ac8b73a28=\"Havok\"]My 2 cars that you did are holding up great.... :grin: I haven\'t had alot of opportunity to play lately...cuz I\'m trying to build a track.....\r\n\r\nI\'ve been having layout problems...the space I have available is on a 6\'x30\" banquet table.....kinda narrow....and I wanted more than a Nascar type dog-leg track....I\'ll send a pic soon....\r\n\r\nok, I sent the package to your wife\'s work this afternoon....priority mail, so 2-3 days....and it was $7.85....not a bad guess huh?...pretty close anyway..... I put $7.00 cash into the box.....have fun finding it in the peanuts :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get it.....  8-)[/quote:1ac8b73a28]Cool, it\'s good to hear the cars are holding up.\r\n\r\nI hear you on the track situation, but I\'m jealous you got 6ft straights. My track is 4\'x4\'. Which is great for around a 2.6 motor, and 12:1 gears, but any more than that, and it seems right when my cars get wound up, I hit the corner. Be nice to have 6-8ft.. Then I\'ll have a few feet at top speed. \r\n\r\nKeep thinking at it, you\'ll come up with something. I didn\'t think I was going to be able to come up with a track with what I had to work with, but I did, and I love it. You know, I\'ve been thinking a flat figure 8 would be fun to race with a friend.\r\n\r\nI let you know when I get the package.  :-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(10636,'829afda310','Cool, lemme know when you get a part number.\r\n\r\nHavoc is the one that informed me and said to contact you.\r\n\r\nI\'ll be lookin for your bug.  I finished mine a couple of weeks ago but still haven\'t posted yet.  I\'m putting that in the AusMicro contest but I\'ll post it in [b:829afda310]Custom[/b:829afda310] before I do.\r\n\r\nSo let me know how much per car you\'ll charge.  I\'ll ship to you and pay for return.\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11915,'40d694d778','Yea man thats cool\r\n\r\n  Can you send a paypal invoice to \r\n\r\nbabastoybox@cogeco.ca\r\n\r\nwith the title\r\n\r\n  ZipZap Se\r\n\r\nThanks'),(11916,'c566de793a','refresh my memory on what you orderdd and your address'),(11918,'3159999269','wm01\r\nwt33\r\n4 houghton st north balwyn 3104 vic australia'),(11921,'41e834f961','Wife said she mailed the package a while ago, give it this week and it dont show by friday lemme know and ill contact the post to see whats up.'),(10638,'e1e7b760d9','[quote:e1e7b760d9=\"hogjowlz\"]if ya do and you want a part in the bitpimps video send em to myaaiko@comcast.net or post em up.\r\n\r\nthat beetle is something else.[/quote:e1e7b760d9]Naw, no more vids right now. I\'ll try to make more this week.\r\n\r\n...and thanks for the compliment on the Beetle, I\'m proud of that thing.\r\n\r\nDave'),(11128,'965c699837','[quote:965c699837=\"Havok\"]no shit? cool I\'m glad VooDoo came to you...thats my boy...he just sent me the whole series 7 set of Homies(palmeros)...just because I\'ve hooked him up with some free homies....he\'s a pimp :cool:...... don\'t tell him, but I\'m gonna send him some more free shit.....poor guy can only get Walmart clones...he can\'t get anything else unless he drives for 2-3 hours....and even then he gets raped on the prices.....I gotta hook him up....:grin:\r\n\r\n\r\nI wanted to ask you,....and I thought I already did....but I must not have sent the PM I wrote yesterday....again I\'m a burnout :lol:............,\r\n\r\nI have a Cyclona BCG thats 57mhz.....is one of my controllers I sent you a 57mhz? if not I have to find it.....and I have a 27mhz MS complete with the controller to send.....lemme know if you have the 57 and I\'ll send \'em.....other than that....I think thats all I\'ll need FET modded until I get a ZZ SE......I\'ll let you know on that too.... 8-)[/quote:965c699837]Wow, I didn\'t even know series 7 is out. Yeah, VDMs cool. I gave him the Pimp\'s deal.\r\n\r\nNope, you didn\'t send me a 57mhz controller. I do not have one either. guess you\'re gonna have to look harder. ;)\r\n\r\nNo need to send the controller with the 27mhz microsizer. I\'ve got plenty of those.\r\n\r\ndave'),(10640,'b2f782d445','Thats cool, you probably go right by me when you go back. We\'re only 5-6 hours apart.\r\n\r\nbut..... I\'m from Boston originally. I moved to Indiana in \'97. I\'ve lived all over NW Indiana....the region....started in Portage,then Lakestation, Gary, Crown Pointe, Merrillville....and I know alot of people in the South Bend/Elkhart area... you\'ll have to stop by and race my track sometime....also....Extreme Micros (from here), is opening a shop with some tracks in Princeton, IN. Thats by Evansville....hes going to hold races a few times a week, I\'ll be there alot...its only 2 hours away from me....Cabo Wabo and Payaso will also be going sometimes......I figured you may want to know 8-)\r\n\r\nand.... I sent your homies today....they\'re in a white bubble wrap envelope, sent 1st class....so 3-4 days....\r\n\r\nlater man..... :grin:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10641,'7c8b9951bd','well you should be proud of it because its original and it looks a zillion times better than stock.\r\n\r\nget as much footage of your stuff so i can give you a bigger part in the video. im gona do it kinda like a skate video'),(10642,'943316a3b8','ok it happened to one of my posts last night and i happened to one of hue35s today.\r\n\r\nit seems to be when you post in a thread thats at the end of a page length. after posting the thread shows that the post was entered and the number of posts are correct, but when you display the thread the new post is not there. but later on someone else posted in the thread and mine showed up. \r\n\r\nwith hue35s post in the crazydave vw thread i did a test post and his showed and then after i deleted my post his was gone again but it shows him as the last poster. \r\n\r\nuh or something'),(10643,'943316a3b8','ok it happened to one of my posts last night and i happened to one of hue35s today.\r\n\r\nit seems to be when you post in a thread thats at the end of a page length. after posting the thread shows that the post was entered and the number of posts are correct, but when you display the thread the new post is not there. but later on someone else posted in the thread and mine showed up. \r\n\r\nwith hue35s post in the crazydave vw thread i did a test post and his showed and then after i deleted my post his was gone again but it shows him as the last poster. \r\n\r\nuh or something'),(10695,'f9a44a479d','great, pm me when you get it so we can exchange our addresses and send our stuff to each other.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10696,'ee60894f19','[quote:ee60894f19=\"CaboWabo\"]I don\'t know if I\'m just totally please with the mosfet and making shit up in my head or if ya did something, but...\r\nit seems I get much better range now with that chassis after you did the mosfet.\r\n\r\nI fuckin love this thing\r\nthanks again for the hook up dude.\r\nI haven\'t said anything about it in the forums yet because I\'m hoping to get some video of it in action - that\'s when I was gonna lay it out for everyone whatchya did for me.[/quote:ee60894f19]Oh yeah, I did do something. I untied that knot from your antenna, that was hidden under the PCB. I do that to all my antennas, I did it to yours without thinking. \r\n\r\nIt does help range, puts about a 1/2\" more antenna outside the car.\r\n\r\nCool, glad your happy with it. \r\n\r\nIt seems to add power more than speed, so try your fastest gear ratios, with your fastest motors, and you shouldn\'t be disappointed.\r\n\r\nDave'),(10645,'fe6f4c0f4b','[quote:fe6f4c0f4b=\"DarkTari\"]Cool, lemme know when you get a part number.\r\n\r\nHavoc is the one that informed me and said to contact you.\r\n\r\nI\'ll be lookin for your bug.  I finished mine a couple of weeks ago but still haven\'t posted yet.  I\'m putting that in the AusMicro contest but I\'ll post it in [b:fe6f4c0f4b]Custom[/b:fe6f4c0f4b] before I do.\r\n\r\nSo let me know how much per car you\'ll charge.  I\'ll ship to you and pay for return.\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp![/quote:fe6f4c0f4b]The part number is, IRLML2502. Here\'s a link to the the page at digikey.com, http://www.digikey.com/scripts/us/dksus.dll?Detail?Ref=14374&amp;Row=201279\r\n\r\nYeah I couldn\'t wait to see your Beetle any longer, so I got mine together. ;)\r\n\r\nSo you don\'t want to make an offer? You going to force me to set a price? :roll: \r\n\r\nOk then, but you\'re still getting a deal, 4 bucks+shipping, per car. If you\'re ordering the FETs, and want to throw some of those my way that would be cool too. I\'m also in need of PCB covers, steering knuckles, and steering springs. I\'ll knock dollars off for any trade you want to make.\r\n\r\nSound good?\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11127,'59a28daf97','woohoo!\r\nawesome, made it by the weekend!\r\nthanks for the heads up.'),(11300,'a6226218ab','hey how are ya.i was wondering how u hook that battry holder up to the charging deck.'),(11301,'5a4daf2d53','Thats cool bro, but now I\'m thinking my shit is too big. I also made ph2t, voodoo, and that lil aussie kid sigs. I\'m gonna microsize my shit out of pity for the dialup users :lol: \r\nI\'ll also redo all them other cats sigs.\r\nLater.'),(10649,'6ff5b94d1b','[quote:6ff5b94d1b=\"hogjowlz\"]ok it happened to one of my posts last night and i happened to one of hue35s today.\r\n\r\nit seems to be when you post in a thread thats at the end of a page length. after posting the thread shows that the post was entered and the number of posts are correct, but when you display the thread the new post is not there. but later on someone else posted in the thread and mine showed up. \r\n\r\nwith hue35s post in the crazydave vw thread i did a test post and his showed and then after i deleted my post his was gone again but it shows him as the last poster. \r\n\r\nuh or something[/quote:6ff5b94d1b]yea I noticed this last night when the server barfed...\r\nI had made a post to crazydaves beetle thread, it started a 2nd page, but never gave a link to that 2nd page. It happened because the post was made right in the middle of the server going down, so the server only got to update portions of the database table and not the others.\r\nAfter the server was restored, making another post corrected the issue.\r\n\r\nHopefully this won\'t happen again.\r\nCan you show me the thread where it happened today?\r\nand do you remember, when the post was being made, was the server extremely slow?'),(10650,'2a0c110a2b','it was hughs post on the crazydave beetle thread. so i dono if it was slow. but when i added a msg his appeared and wehn i removed mine his vanished again.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10652,'2a0c110a2b','it was hughs post on the crazydave beetle thread. so i dono if it was slow. but when i added a msg his appeared and wehn i removed mine his vanished again.'),(10692,'f9a44a479d','great, pm me when you get it so we can exchange our addresses and send our stuff to each other.'),(10693,'da4af662b9','I don\'t know if I\'m just totally please with the mosfet and making shit up in my head or if ya did something, but...\r\nit seems I get much better range now with that chassis after you did the mosfet.\r\n\r\nI fuckin love this thing\r\nthanks again for the hook up dude.\r\nI haven\'t said anything about it in the forums yet because I\'m hoping to get some video of it in action - that\'s when I was gonna lay it out for everyone whatchya did for me.'),(10694,'ee60894f19','[quote:ee60894f19=\"CaboWabo\"]I don\'t know if I\'m just totally please with the mosfet and making shit up in my head or if ya did something, but...\r\nit seems I get much better range now with that chassis after you did the mosfet.\r\n\r\nI fuckin love this thing\r\nthanks again for the hook up dude.\r\nI haven\'t said anything about it in the forums yet because I\'m hoping to get some video of it in action - that\'s when I was gonna lay it out for everyone whatchya did for me.[/quote:ee60894f19]Oh yeah, I did do something. I untied that knot from your antenna, that was hidden under the PCB. I do that to all my antennas, I did it to yours without thinking. \r\n\r\nIt does help range, puts about a 1/2\" more antenna outside the car.\r\n\r\nCool, glad your happy with it. \r\n\r\nIt seems to add power more than speed, so try your fastest gear ratios, with your fastest motors, and you shouldn\'t be disappointed.\r\n\r\nDave'),(10654,'842c13f0c8','Oakee Dokey Pokey!  Great deal Pimp, I\'ll let ya know!\r\n\r\nThanx for the info!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10655,'6842c7b7cc','What are you looking for Cabo?  If it is available you know I can have it shiped to you at the regular price plus tax and no shipping.'),(10656,'64f3e15b89','Check out the [b:64f3e15b89]Styrene[/b:64f3e15b89] at MicroMark, it\'s what we use to make the body kits:\r\n\r\n[img:64f3e15b89]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0RADWAkkUpb0XUT6brNvlmll0UJ34DezgSVM20KiJ1BKQwxEArYUlMSihRqOPlsAGffbFOOoT2nDZmTpzhVWzc!8*vnAPWjcrQzc!xoETP8U/LilMatrix2.jpg?dc=4675436847425539477[/img:64f3e15b89]'),(10657,'263cde0082','Did you ever find more springs?  If so are you selling them if tnot thats cool.\r\n\r\n  I only sent this as PM cause I thought it would start people asking for free shit again lol\r\n\r\n  How did you end up liking the thunder fighter'),(11460,'128f7c07c4','ya i almost got my stuff adjusted. i still pop on and read every day or so. i shall return. and i shall send you your stuff. soon hopefully.'),(10659,'9621e25dc2','[quote:9621e25dc2=\"hogjowlz\"]it was hughs post on the crazydave beetle thread. so i dono if it was slow. but when i added a msg his appeared and wehn i removed mine his vanished again.[/quote:9621e25dc2]that was the particular thread that got issues when the server went down.\r\nwhat happens is when a new page is created because of the number of posts, the database thinks that those posts are actually 3 posts up, so it doesn\'t recognize that there needs to be another page until it reaches a certain number. Normally that number would 15, but as that table didn\'t get updated, the 15th post is actually given the 12th ID, so by post 18, we see a link to the next page because the 18th post has the 15th ID.\r\nbasically, there\'s nothing I can do to fix it, this thread will always be a little wonky when it comes to creating another page and having only 1 or 2 posts to be displayed on the new page, by the 3rd new post, you\'ll get a link to the next page.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10660,'e5ee53a57f','that makes sense. oh well we got a thread with its own personality i guess.'),(10661,'5a9d619506','i tell ya what ill hook ya up with some springs on one of your cars.\r\n\r\nthunderfighter = ok but the battery dont hold a charge so i havnt messed with it much.'),(10664,'392f4696fd','ok thanks dude :)'),(14071,'abe0ab38e6','ok im cool, i got the package yesterday,and i am plesed, thank you very much. And im not really interesterested in that stuff.'),(10666,'92100d398c','Hey what\'s up?\r\n\r\nYour wall paper with my car is pretty cool, wish I had that beach when I took the pictures of it.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I was thinking, I reduce my pictures quite a bit when I post them. Would you like a larger image of the car to work with?\r\n\r\nDave'),(10668,'6842c7b7cc','What are you looking for Cabo?  If it is available you know I can have it shiped to you at the regular price plus tax and no shipping.'),(13766,'c32b8dbfd1','i got  an e-mail saying the package was delivered, was it?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13767,'c32b8dbfd1','i got  an e-mail saying the package was delivered, was it?'),(13769,'f2911489f8','Yea I got it thanks dude, I forgot you said there was no heat sinks lol so I had to find some.\r\n\r\n  You get the package yet?  if not should be any day now.'),(10670,'e5ee53a57f','that makes sense. oh well we got a thread with its own personality i guess.'),(10690,'ca029316d6','dude, im not paypal. Ask paypal.'),(10691,'bf5797738e','Sure ordered it already hope to see it soon so I can get your address and send it to you.'),(10673,'adbc23c184','Yep. :-) \r\nShoot me the pics to sessiz10@hotmail.com or if you got msn messenger add me on with that email addy.\r\nThanks man.'),(10674,'a8f4d2b2a1','[quote:a8f4d2b2a1=\"hogjowlz\"]that makes sense. oh well we got a thread with its own personality i guess.[/quote:a8f4d2b2a1]lol good way to look at it'),(10675,'837e5b7603','hey cj, over at tiny rc i just read that the efini rx-7s are now available, so  could you try to order one as soon as possible if they are in stock so we can get this long awaited trade over'),(34771,'4d05c63ba6','Hey DT, how you doing man? Remember this thread:\r\n\r\n[url]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=6183[/url]\r\n\r\nI have two of those sets, open box, never run, collecting dust. I need money right now, so I need to sell these. I bought one set from Bithed a long time ago, and the other came from JDMHatchback a few months ago. \r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in one or both of these, holler at your boy. I can give you more details, and probably even pics this weekend.\r\n\r\nI\'d like to see you have these if you want them. Not offering to anybody else for now. Just let me know if you\'re interested, and then I\'ll offer you a great deal. \r\n\r\nLater,\r\n\r\nMichael Graham');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35918,'beaaf140bc','Hey, I was looking at your thread about your ZZ rally car and absolutley loved it.  I was wondering how you made the rear suspension and increased the front suspension.  I\'d love to do a rally car like yours, first I\'ll try it with a regular ZZ, then maybe a ZZSE for a propo (swap electronics for MicroZ electronics) rally car.\r\n\r\nI look at your pictures, but I couldn\'t really see much.  Do you have progress pictures on how you made it, or design plans?  Send me what you have to my e-mail: kiss_of_death_biker@yahoo.ca\r\nIf you don\'t have a whole lot of pics, maybe if you could explain it (or maybe give it to me?)?'),(34795,'f768c85804','Never mind....I just wanted to throw in an MT seeing as how all my entries are bits. I just finished a kick ass MT and thought it would fit in well, but I\'ll just wait for the next one. No big deal, just thought I\'d ask...... :-o'),(10688,'3698ddd7a6','can you do it with australian bank accounts if so how..?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11126,'624c594be7','well if we didnt have a kid together she woulda been long gone. we make ok friends but there was no relationship there forever and well we tried to stick it out for the kids sake but well i got fed up supporting someone who didnt wana be there and was a total bitch. i get along with her family fine and i get to see the kid on the weekends so fuck her mom. haha that felt good.\r\n\r\nso in a way it sucks but in other ways i feel like i have been unshackled. once i get my bills together, ill be the best ive been in years probably. \r\n\r\nthanks for lookin out holmes'),(10698,'f37214da9e','yea I still haven\'t had the time to go full bore with it yet, I\'m having fun with just that whimpy stock 2.2 in it! lol\r\nI\'ll be tinkering this weekend'),(10699,'d5154fffeb','hey superfly i was thinkin of buying your white 49 mhz skyline for 30.00 if you still have it because my car from micro amps al the suddenly died and i really admire the mosfet cars please pm me back or email me at \r\nkodiakmonky1776@yahoo.com\r\nor   my screenname for aol is    k77562'),(10700,'d5154fffeb','hey superfly i was thinkin of buying your white 49 mhz skyline for 30.00 if you still have it because my car from micro amps al the suddenly died and i really admire the mosfet cars please pm me back or email me at \r\nkodiakmonky1776@yahoo.com\r\nor   my screenname for aol is    k77562');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10701,'1775d59f13','Yes, the white Skyline is available. My paypal e-mail is greg@grymttr.com\r\n$30, shipping included. It\'s a brand new car except for having taken it out of the package to do the mod. The only other difference is we keep the collector\'s point tab from the box, hope that\'s not a problem. As a bonus, though, I can give you either a 27mhz or 49mhz, your choice. The car is naturally 49, but I can swap it with a 27 if you want. Lemme know.\r\n\r\nThanks.'),(10703,'1775d59f13','Yes, the white Skyline is available. My paypal e-mail is greg@grymttr.com\r\n$30, shipping included. It\'s a brand new car except for having taken it out of the package to do the mod. The only other difference is we keep the collector\'s point tab from the box, hope that\'s not a problem. As a bonus, though, I can give you either a 27mhz or 49mhz, your choice. The car is naturally 49, but I can swap it with a 27 if you want. Lemme know.\r\n\r\nThanks.'),(13827,'a9a8853957','Hey C-Dub\r\n\r\nI finished the body mod tutorial from Golden Rod.  How can I post it or should I send it to you?  It\'s in MS Works Word Processor format.\r\n\r\nThanx,\r\n\r\nGotta find time to do the motor comparison.\r\n\r\nAre we straight on the prizes yet?  Can Hog still do the chassis?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10705,'6c1ae44467','hey man, next time you do one of those, do me a favor and take a pic of it\r\nI\'d like to put it up in our articles section (with full credits to you) if that\'s okay with you?'),(10706,'019e47ca4a','[quote:019e47ca4a=\"CaboWabo\"]hey man, next time you do one of those, do me a favor and take a pic of it\r\nI\'d like to put it up in our articles section (with full credits to you) if that\'s okay with you?[/quote:019e47ca4a]Yeah sure I can take a pic. You can give me credit for the pic, but credit for the mod should go to the originator. I wouldn\'t want anyone to think I ripped them iff. ;)\r\n\r\nThat anti-boost mod is da bomb, aint it?\r\n\r\nI don\'t know WTH that one guy was talking with that gear shift thing, The anti boost mod is super simple, and works great. K.I.S.S. theory in action.\r\n\r\nDave'),(10707,'6cdee7494a','well i am originally a 27 mhz man so all my cars a 27 mhzand there range is terrible so im trying to convet to 49 mhz there range isnt limited'),(10708,'369ee89c1d','Got your package today. Let me go over what I got, make sure it\'s all there and tell you what I can and can not do.\r\n\r\nMicro Speed - How funny you sent this. I\'ve been hitting BigLots every weekend looking for these. I didn\'t really want one, but I wanted to buy one to check out. So you did me a favor, and gave me a chance to check it out.\r\n\r\nNow the bad new about this car, it has a totally unique PCB, I\'ve never seen, and the bastards covered the markings on the transistors with something, so I have no way to figure out how to do this cAR.\r\n\r\nThunder Charger- well you know I was saying I was having issues with this car, I\'ll try it again, and see if I was being stupid that day, but worse comes to worse, I can half mosfet mod it, and then stack those FETs. That might not be as effecient as the full mosfet mod, but would still be way better than stock.\r\n\r\nMini Cooper - This is a cool car, thanks for sending this one, it\'ll be cool to check out.\r\n\r\nbut again bad news. Another oddball PCB, but this one still has the markings on the transistors, so I can do the same as I described for the Thunder Charger.\r\n\r\n...now a little good new before I get to the Nakamichi\r\n\r\nOrange Subaru clone- Definate can do\r\nClone with no body- definate can do\r\nBit Char-G - definate can do\r\nNakamichi - I can do something, but I\'m not sure what. There\'s like 8 transistors on that board that I can potentially swap straight out for FETs, but if any or all of them make a difference I don\'t know. Seems like a lot of mosfets for a maybe, but it\'s your call.\r\n\r\nlet me know if I missed anything.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10709,'019e47ca4a','[quote:019e47ca4a=\"CaboWabo\"]hey man, next time you do one of those, do me a favor and take a pic of it\r\nI\'d like to put it up in our articles section (with full credits to you) if that\'s okay with you?[/quote:019e47ca4a]Yeah sure I can take a pic. You can give me credit for the pic, but credit for the mod should go to the originator. I wouldn\'t want anyone to think I ripped them iff. ;)\r\n\r\nThat anti-boost mod is da bomb, aint it?\r\n\r\nI don\'t know WTH that one guy was talking with that gear shift thing, The anti boost mod is super simple, and works great. K.I.S.S. theory in action.\r\n\r\nDave'),(10711,'369ee89c1d','Got your package today. Let me go over what I got, make sure it\'s all there and tell you what I can and can not do.\r\n\r\nMicro Speed - How funny you sent this. I\'ve been hitting BigLots every weekend looking for these. I didn\'t really want one, but I wanted to buy one to check out. So you did me a favor, and gave me a chance to check it out.\r\n\r\nNow the bad new about this car, it has a totally unique PCB, I\'ve never seen, and the bastards covered the markings on the transistors with something, so I have no way to figure out how to do this cAR.\r\n\r\nThunder Charger- well you know I was saying I was having issues with this car, I\'ll try it again, and see if I was being stupid that day, but worse comes to worse, I can half mosfet mod it, and then stack those FETs. That might not be as effecient as the full mosfet mod, but would still be way better than stock.\r\n\r\nMini Cooper - This is a cool car, thanks for sending this one, it\'ll be cool to check out.\r\n\r\nbut again bad news. Another oddball PCB, but this one still has the markings on the transistors, so I can do the same as I described for the Thunder Charger.\r\n\r\n...now a little good new before I get to the Nakamichi\r\n\r\nOrange Subaru clone- Definate can do\r\nClone with no body- definate can do\r\nBit Char-G - definate can do\r\nNakamichi - I can do something, but I\'m not sure what. There\'s like 8 transistors on that board that I can potentially swap straight out for FETs, but if any or all of them make a difference I don\'t know. Seems like a lot of mosfets for a maybe, but it\'s your call.\r\n\r\nlet me know if I missed anything.\r\n\r\nDave'),(12022,'afaecb81ae','if they approve, tellm not to put it up till Christmas eve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12023,'e76d18ed44','is it still ok for me to use the same couple pics in my ebay auctions when i auction a set of rims? I use same exact listing as you saw i ust change the rim name and pic of the exact style. I beleive it was 2 or 3 pics of your bits wit rims and a link to bitpimps site in the description with a thanks to you for allowing me to use the pics. Thought i would re-ask as some shit has been stirred up.'),(10713,'8626dfb3ec','Sup dude\r\n\r\nnot sure what you have left but I can use:\r\n\r\nThe forth one from the left on top row\r\n5,6,7 from left on second row\r\n4th from left on third row\r\n&amp;\r\nall the guys from last row\r\n\r\nAt the bottom of you pic is the link to my doubles.   If there is anything lese you are loooking for let me know. (I should have series 7 doubles soon)\r\n\r\n[img:8626dfb3ec]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2167259/32746434.jpg[/img:8626dfb3ec]\r\n\r\n[img:8626dfb3ec]http://www3.sympatico.ca/voodoomafia/homies.jpg[/img:8626dfb3ec]'),(10714,'9319308696','ok i am in the midst of paying for the car right now here is my shipping info\r\n\r\nmail to:\r\nkent killeen\r\n2953 marlboro wy\r\nsan ramon CA,94583\r\n\r\nmy email: kodiakmonky1776@yahoo.com\r\n\r\nmy aol screenname: k77652');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10715,'8626dfb3ec','Sup dude\r\n\r\nnot sure what you have left but I can use:\r\n\r\nThe forth one from the left on top row\r\n5,6,7 from left on second row\r\n4th from left on third row\r\n&amp;\r\nall the guys from last row\r\n\r\nAt the bottom of you pic is the link to my doubles.   If there is anything lese you are loooking for let me know. (I should have series 7 doubles soon)\r\n\r\n[img:8626dfb3ec]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2167259/32746434.jpg[/img:8626dfb3ec]\r\n\r\n[img:8626dfb3ec]http://www3.sympatico.ca/voodoomafia/homies.jpg[/img:8626dfb3ec]'),(29219,'86c8be268a','[quote:86c8be268a=\"ezenterprises\"]Thanks for the advice/links.... i had already eyed the nelly site and his stuff is always tite.... And yeah i still need controller... problem is i don tknow which freq i need LOL   all i remember its in 30\'s or 40\'s so that is still quite a few possibilities.\r\n\r\nThe stock xmod is bulky and plastic, and to shav eweight im sure there are lighter/stronger components.... is it a waste on time/money to buy a stock xmod to start with? OR should i just piece on etogether from parts?[/quote:86c8be268a]\r\n\r\nYou could peice it together.  I\'d suggest checking out the forums to see who\'s selling stuff. You could probably find a deal on a pile of Xmod stuff and use it as experimentation and development.  \r\n\r\nHere\'s one that comes to mind...he\'s down to $100 for all of it.  You could get your Xmod stuff and some other goodies as well.\r\n\r\n[url]http://ripper7racing.com/forums/index.php?showtopic=3329&amp;hl=[/url]\r\n\r\nIf your not into shopping the forums or Ebay, just go buy one for $50 and start with a fresh new ride.\r\n\r\nAs far as lightening your Xmod, RS just started selling a clear plastic chassis with CF upper decks.  If you have access to CF, you could make a whole chassis like what tiny.com sells for a fortune.\r\n\r\nAfter that there is the aluminum stuff.  If your looking for performance and less weight, pick and choose your parts wisely.  Start with the parts that carry the bearings and then the drive axles and cups. I have nyloks for Xmods and Z-class racers, let me know if you\'d like a set of 5 for $4.50 shipped. Via Paypal.\r\n\r\nGo see CJ \"The former Shack Pimp\" about some alloy stuff.  His shop is usually out of stock, but if you PM him here at BP, he\'ll hook you up with whatever he may have in stock or on the way.\r\n\r\nHere is his site...\r\n\r\n[url]http://www.cjshobbies.net/phpBB2/[/url]\r\n\r\nI hope this helps you a bit more.  \r\n\r\n :-)'),(10717,'0e94e054ab','Need any before I post this in my xtra thread?\r\n\r\n[img:0e94e054ab]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2167259/34061294.jpg[/img:0e94e054ab]\r\n\r\n\r\nand some more shit :grin: .......\r\n\r\nhow\'s the mosfet car(s)? Just curious...mine are tight...\r\n\r\nI\'m going to transfer departments/ get promoted at my job soon....my shift will change to days..7:30am-4:00pm, at least for awhile...I might go back to nights...not sure yet.... I\'m telling you this so we can both go to Todd\'s shop in Princeton....I will be able to any evening...I\'ll be working days Saturday, Sun, and 3 weekdays...that I have to choose when I get there\r\n\r\n\r\nand.....thanks for the vote @ rcmod....you and Voodoo Mafia both voted for me :grin: I\'m just lovin that I got votes...screw winning...this is good enuff... :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10718,'8a18f992e2','hey man,\r\nI wanted to ask you if you would mind if I posted this mod in our Articles section? (giving you full credits of course)'),(10719,'85cdf7e94d','Please do! I wanted to contribute something to bitpimps other than wisecracks.'),(10720,'6cdee7494a','well i am originally a 27 mhz man so all my cars a 27 mhzand there range is terrible so im trying to convet to 49 mhz there range isnt limited'),(10721,'9319308696','ok i am in the midst of paying for the car right now here is my shipping info\r\n\r\nmail to:\r\nkent killeen\r\n2953 marlboro wy\r\nsan ramon CA,94583\r\n\r\nmy email: kodiakmonky1776@yahoo.com\r\n\r\nmy aol screenname: k77652'),(10722,'8a6de209ec','Hi! good news! I got the package in today!!! woooohooo!!! Thanks so much! and 8 homies!!! It was worth the wait, and just in time...i needed new shoes for my new projects :eek:   I really took a month to get here.. :sad:   Anyway, as soon as im done, ill take pics of my cars with the homies. :eek:  thanks mang!!'),(10723,'8cecb587a1','[quote:8cecb587a1=\"micromatch\"]hey i wanted to know if you have a spare trueno body you might be willing to put up for trade...\r\nthanks \r\nmicro[/quote:8cecb587a1]\r\n\r\nSorry i just read your message...ya, i got some truenos...you have some beetles?  what do you have to trade with?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10724,'8a6de209ec','Hi! good news! I got the package in today!!! woooohooo!!! Thanks so much! and 8 homies!!! It was worth the wait, and just in time...i needed new shoes for my new projects :eek:   I really took a month to get here.. :sad:   Anyway, as soon as im done, ill take pics of my cars with the homies. :eek:  thanks mang!!'),(10725,'8997f5b032',':D :D :D :D :D :D :D :D :D :D\r\n\r\n\r\nMan thats the best news I\'ve heard all week.....\r\nYesterday(Wednesday) I went to the Post Office and the guy there told me some scary shit about your postal system man. He said they steal people\'s mail all the time and that they\'re really corrupt there. And if they don\'t steal it......anything from the U.S. could legally sit in customs for 10 months.....I was like....damn, I don\'t want to tell John that.....\r\n\r\nHe also told me that it should have been there 10-12 days after I sent it....so it probably did sit in customs this long.....he said the girl I talked to before was new and she was thinking I sent it by boat instead of by Air Letter post.\r\n\r\nHe said the safest way is to send it registered mail....but thats not really safe either....he said that may just draw attention to the package and it would have cost me another $9.75 to register it.\r\n\r\nI\'m really glad you finally got it.....and I hope you like the extra homies....I figured 4 is not a hood, but 8 sounds better.\r\n\r\nLater man.....have fun \r\n  :-D :D :-D :D :-D :D :-D :D :-D'),(10726,'8997f5b032',':D :D :D :D :D :D :D :D :D :D\r\n\r\n\r\nMan thats the best news I\'ve heard all week.....\r\nYesterday(Wednesday) I went to the Post Office and the guy there told me some scary shit about your postal system man. He said they steal people\'s mail all the time and that they\'re really corrupt there. And if they don\'t steal it......anything from the U.S. could legally sit in customs for 10 months.....I was like....damn, I don\'t want to tell John that.....\r\n\r\nHe also told me that it should have been there 10-12 days after I sent it....so it probably did sit in customs this long.....he said the girl I talked to before was new and she was thinking I sent it by boat instead of by Air Letter post.\r\n\r\nHe said the safest way is to send it registered mail....but thats not really safe either....he said that may just draw attention to the package and it would have cost me another $9.75 to register it.\r\n\r\nI\'m really glad you finally got it.....and I hope you like the extra homies....I figured 4 is not a hood, but 8 sounds better.\r\n\r\nLater man.....have fun \r\n  :-D :D :-D :D :-D :D :-D :D :-D');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10727,'0e94e054ab','Need any before I post this in my xtra thread?\r\n\r\n[img:0e94e054ab]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2167259/34061294.jpg[/img:0e94e054ab]\r\n\r\n\r\nand some more shit :grin: .......\r\n\r\nhow\'s the mosfet car(s)? Just curious...mine are tight...\r\n\r\nI\'m going to transfer departments/ get promoted at my job soon....my shift will change to days..7:30am-4:00pm, at least for awhile...I might go back to nights...not sure yet.... I\'m telling you this so we can both go to Todd\'s shop in Princeton....I will be able to any evening...I\'ll be working days Saturday, Sun, and 3 weekdays...that I have to choose when I get there\r\n\r\n\r\nand.....thanks for the vote @ rcmod....you and Voodoo Mafia both voted for me :grin: I\'m just lovin that I got votes...screw winning...this is good enuff... :cool:'),(10728,'8ed0df2024','[quote:8ed0df2024=\"Havok\"]Need any before I post this in my xtra thread?\r\n\r\n[img:8ed0df2024]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2167259/34061294.jpg[/img:8ed0df2024]\r\n\r\n\r\nand some more shit :grin: .......\r\n\r\nhow\'s the mosfet car(s)? Just curious...mine are tight...\r\n\r\nI\'m going to transfer departments/ get promoted at my job soon....my shift will change to days..7:30am-4:00pm, at least for awhile...I might go back to nights...not sure yet.... I\'m telling you this so we can both go to Todd\'s shop in Princeton....I will be able to any evening...I\'ll be working days Saturday, Sun, and 3 weekdays...that I have to choose when I get there\r\n\r\n\r\nand.....thanks for the vote @ rcmod....you and Voodoo Mafia both voted for me :grin: I\'m just lovin that I got votes...screw winning...this is good enuff... :cool:[/quote:8ed0df2024]I might need the mail carrier dude - not sure, I\'ll have to check tonite when I get home.\r\n\r\nI still haven\'t had the time I\'d like to play with the mosfet dave did for me yet, I have played a little, but haven\'t even had a chance to change motors in it.\r\nand yea, so far the thing is fucking awesome! lol\r\nI love the power gain without the weight gain of an extra battery.\r\n\r\nglad to hear things are looking up for you man (promotion!) - gotta dig that!\r\ndid todd ever hold his other race?\r\nwonder how that went?\r\nI still got plans to get up there someday.\r\n\r\nyea no prob on the votes, you deserve em, that shaggin wagon was off the hook!'),(10729,'85cdf7e94d','Please do! I wanted to contribute something to bitpimps other than wisecracks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10731,'0bb93a698b','I\'m witchya all the way mang'),(10732,'caa5f4c159','Hey, \r\ncan you sign on to messenger?...I\'m on now.... havok74@webtv.net\r\nIf you don\'t I\'ll PM you in a bit.......'),(10733,'a8bcf2c178','Just so I\'m sure, these are the ones you need?\r\n[img:a8bcf2c178]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2167259/34061299.jpg[/img:a8bcf2c178]\r\n\r\n\r\nI don\'t need any of your\'s now, and I haven\'t found any series 7 yet, so if it\' cool....give me first dibbs on your xtras....thanks man....let me know..... 8-)'),(10734,'92b4bf1f27','[quote:92b4bf1f27=\"Havok\"]Hey, \r\ncan you sign on to messenger?...I\'m on now.... havok74@webtv.net\r\nIf you don\'t I\'ll PM you in a bit.......[/quote:92b4bf1f27]Hey sorry I missed you, but my wife owns the computer at night. :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(10735,'111383e744','yea man thats not a prob\r\n\r\n those ones in the pic are all ones I need'),(10736,'8ed0df2024','[quote:8ed0df2024=\"Havok\"]Need any before I post this in my xtra thread?\r\n\r\n[img:8ed0df2024]http://pic7.picturetrail.com/VOL197/1135699/2167259/34061294.jpg[/img:8ed0df2024]\r\n\r\n\r\nand some more shit :grin: .......\r\n\r\nhow\'s the mosfet car(s)? Just curious...mine are tight...\r\n\r\nI\'m going to transfer departments/ get promoted at my job soon....my shift will change to days..7:30am-4:00pm, at least for awhile...I might go back to nights...not sure yet.... I\'m telling you this so we can both go to Todd\'s shop in Princeton....I will be able to any evening...I\'ll be working days Saturday, Sun, and 3 weekdays...that I have to choose when I get there\r\n\r\n\r\nand.....thanks for the vote @ rcmod....you and Voodoo Mafia both voted for me :grin: I\'m just lovin that I got votes...screw winning...this is good enuff... :cool:[/quote:8ed0df2024]I might need the mail carrier dude - not sure, I\'ll have to check tonite when I get home.\r\n\r\nI still haven\'t had the time I\'d like to play with the mosfet dave did for me yet, I have played a little, but haven\'t even had a chance to change motors in it.\r\nand yea, so far the thing is fucking awesome! lol\r\nI love the power gain without the weight gain of an extra battery.\r\n\r\nglad to hear things are looking up for you man (promotion!) - gotta dig that!\r\ndid todd ever hold his other race?\r\nwonder how that went?\r\nI still got plans to get up there someday.\r\n\r\nyea no prob on the votes, you deserve em, that shaggin wagon was off the hook!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10737,'92b4bf1f27','[quote:92b4bf1f27=\"Havok\"]Hey, \r\ncan you sign on to messenger?...I\'m on now.... havok74@webtv.net\r\nIf you don\'t I\'ll PM you in a bit.......[/quote:92b4bf1f27]Hey sorry I missed you, but my wife owns the computer at night. :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(10738,'111383e744','yea man thats not a prob\r\n\r\n those ones in the pic are all ones I need'),(10739,'9b9f2aa791','No mail carrier for you man....I know I remember sending him to you last month...maybe July...and hey...this is between you and I only.....for now.......use this link to see what I\'ve been doing......  :shock: \r\nIt is very far from done, but I figured I\'d give you a tease.....and there will be a story about the Homies... but that will be later...\r\n\r\n:grin:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttp://www.picturetrail.com/gallery/view?p=999&amp;gid=2790418&amp;uid=1135699'),(10740,'e85ec8cc3d','hay, i just recived the parcel this morning, thanks a lot and it was good doin a trade with you.\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks again si'),(10741,'e85ec8cc3d','hay, i just recived the parcel this morning, thanks a lot and it was good doin a trade with you.\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks again si');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10742,'9b9f2aa791','No mail carrier for you man....I know I remember sending him to you last month...maybe July...and hey...this is between you and I only.....for now.......use this link to see what I\'ve been doing......  :shock: \r\nIt is very far from done, but I figured I\'d give you a tease.....and there will be a story about the Homies... but that will be later...\r\n\r\n:grin:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttp://www.picturetrail.com/gallery/view?p=999&amp;gid=2790418&amp;uid=1135699'),(10743,'e6a2aab8f8','[quote:e6a2aab8f8=\"Havok\"]No mail carrier for you man....I know I remember sending him to you last month...maybe July...and hey...this is between you and I only.....for now.......use this link to see what I\'ve been doing......  :shock: \r\nIt is very far from done, but I figured I\'d give you a tease.....and there will be a story about the Homies... but that will be later...\r\n\r\n:grin:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttp://www.picturetrail.com/gallery/view?p=999&amp;gid=2790418&amp;uid=1135699[/quote:e6a2aab8f8]lol good thing you can remember, cuz I can\'t lol\r\n\r\nholy fucking shit dude!\r\nthat things gonna be awesome!\r\nthose pics are sweet, I love the light trim, god I gotta do that'),(10744,'8cecb587a1','[quote:8cecb587a1=\"micromatch\"]hey i wanted to know if you have a spare trueno body you might be willing to put up for trade...\r\nthanks \r\nmicro[/quote:8cecb587a1]\r\n\r\nSorry i just read your message...ya, i got some truenos...you have some beetles?  what do you have to trade with?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11953,'d3375f2e70','ya, i want em.  problem is i dont have paypal.  :(   any ideas on how i could pay for em? have you got those cop blinkers yet?'),(10749,'9a2015f36b','[quote:9a2015f36b=\"SuperFly\"]Please do! I wanted to contribute something to bitpimps other than wisecracks.[/quote:9a2015f36b] :lol: well both are appreciated'),(11688,'96c32181cb','hey do u have a tut on installing a fet?'),(12359,'3febebb6c8','[quote:3febebb6c8=\"ezenterprises\"]sorry bout such the delay man, glad it got there. take yer time gettin it back...... lemme know when u can do the zz SE fet mod like micro amps and maybe we can deal some more.[/quote:3febebb6c8]\r\n\r\nWill do, let you know that is, lol.   At the \'mo micro is keeping this close to his chest and won\'t share :(.  But hog, crazy and myself are workin\' on it!'),(10751,'0d89ce0d8e','no i apologize. its in my friends shop and he was away for a week and ive been broke and had a bunch of stuff goin on so i forgot. i still have it and its ready to go. ill try to get it out this weekend. again sorry about the delay.'),(11662,'1aec0d24f4','you funny  :eek:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11663,'7fe4200490','sounds good \r\n\r\n  how much are your springs?  Do they need to be cut?\r\n\r\n  I figure I might aswell get some now'),(11664,'d6c936023a','OK cool well as soon as it comes in I will play around with it and open her up to see what shes got in her.\r\n\r\n  BTW I know you were asking about the eLXX beetle light setup, well that was one of the cars I sent.\r\n\r\n  I am not sure on teh PBC layout but it looks like you need the whole PBC, thats whats making it a pain to fit other bodies on that chassie.'),(11660,'8e088124b3','did u see the wallpaper yet i posted it in the sugestion box tell me if u like em i gots some more and if u do are you goibg to put them in wallpaper area?'),(10780,'c095a753d8','Hey man i got me prize today, thanks'),(10764,'0ac5e00823','yo man, I\'m going through finally and sifting through all the modifications that are actual articles.\r\nI found another one of yours I\'d like to use if that\'s okay with you?\r\nits the Lo Pro PCB Cover mod found here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=943\r\n\r\nany chance you still have those pics laying around somewhere?\r\n\r\nI\'ve been thinking, I might be able to squeeze out 10 MB of space.\r\nif I could, and I gave you that space, could you upload your \"important\" pics there so the threads stay valid with the pictures?\r\nthis way you don\'t have to delete the images from your server (saving space) and the thread stay valid with imagery.\r\nThe only problem I could see is if you didn\'t optimize images to the fullest, you\'d fill up the 10 mb rather quickly, but it seems you know how to optimize so I\'m thinking you\'d get a lot of use outta the space.\r\n\r\nobviously I\'d prefer not to have to provide the space for it, but for something as legitamate as a modification article that helps others, I\'m willing to bend the rules a bit.\r\n\r\nlet me know what you think.'),(11123,'371dba6bb5','hey dudesup\r\n\r\nhey i got my car on the 25th and i drove it arond an dit was awsome but the longest wire connecting 2 fets broke..so i went and bought a soldering iron with a smaller tip and i tyed to resolder it but now i onlyhave fsat in fowwards and the back wards has a constant idletype thing how do i fix it??');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11124,'9f69620cb6','hey wel i tryed to fixit agian and the long enamled wire broke off, i go fast forwards and i go so slowback wards that my car doesn even have enuff power to turn..isthere any way i can fix this..or get a new one or sumthing?'),(11125,'0cdf07ffb3','dude.\r\nI wasn\'t sure how to respond to your post.\r\nI\'m sorry to hear you\'re a bachelor again (unless that\'s what you wanted).\r\nJust wanted to drop you a line and let you know that it\'s okay if you can\'t do the stuff for the contest or whatever else.\r\ntake your time, deal with your real life first - your spot is always here.\r\n\r\njust let me know if we need to do something or whatever.'),(10756,'44253a8153','ya i had to splurge on one today. get one go now!! hehe. the control is 500% better. plus the lights are cool and stuff but man propo is so much better than a magnet sandwich.'),(11661,'8b58904122','got them yesterday! find any you want?\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks a bunch!!! peewee is so sweet!'),(10760,'62421b8265','ah just lie and say it cost 8$');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10765,'8f3f0b2086','[quote:8f3f0b2086=\"CaboWabo\"]yo man, I\'m going through finally and sifting through all the modifications that are actual articles.\r\nI found another one of yours I\'d like to use if that\'s okay with you?\r\nits the Lo Pro PCB Cover mod found here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=943\r\n\r\nany chance you still have those pics laying around somewhere?\r\n\r\nI\'ve been thinking, I might be able to squeeze out 10 MB of space.\r\nif I could, and I gave you that space, could you upload your \"important\" pics there so the threads stay valid with the pictures?\r\nthis way you don\'t have to delete the images from your server (saving space) and the thread stay valid with imagery.\r\nThe only problem I could see is if you didn\'t optimize images to the fullest, you\'d fill up the 10 mb rather quickly, but it seems you know how to optimize so I\'m thinking you\'d get a lot of use outta the space.\r\n\r\nobviously I\'d prefer not to have to provide the space for it, but for something as legitamate as a modification article that helps others, I\'m willing to bend the rules a bit.\r\n\r\nlet me know what you think.[/quote:8f3f0b2086]You know, I thought my Lo-Pro PCB cover was a good idea, but it didn\'t seem to get much interest.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I still got the pictures somewhere on my harddrive. I\'ve got plenty of space, my old pictures are broken because my wife decided not to renew that domain. I havn\'t even used the first 10mb of my 60mb that came with my Cox service, but I haven\'t fixed the old pictures because, honestly, I\'m too lazy to set up the FTP on that Cox service, and been uploading my pictures one by one. Also I have to go through all my old post, here and at TRC. What a nightmare.\r\n\r\nSo I decided to fix pictures as people ask about them.  :grin: \r\n\r\nI\'ll go ahead and set up my FTP so I can upload everything at once, then if you come across anything you want fixed, you\'ll just have to change the erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/ to members.cox.net/crazylittlecars.\r\n\r\nI\'ll let you know when I get that done.\r\n\r\nDave'),(10766,'8f3f0b2086','[quote:8f3f0b2086=\"CaboWabo\"]yo man, I\'m going through finally and sifting through all the modifications that are actual articles.\r\nI found another one of yours I\'d like to use if that\'s okay with you?\r\nits the Lo Pro PCB Cover mod found here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=943\r\n\r\nany chance you still have those pics laying around somewhere?\r\n\r\nI\'ve been thinking, I might be able to squeeze out 10 MB of space.\r\nif I could, and I gave you that space, could you upload your \"important\" pics there so the threads stay valid with the pictures?\r\nthis way you don\'t have to delete the images from your server (saving space) and the thread stay valid with imagery.\r\nThe only problem I could see is if you didn\'t optimize images to the fullest, you\'d fill up the 10 mb rather quickly, but it seems you know how to optimize so I\'m thinking you\'d get a lot of use outta the space.\r\n\r\nobviously I\'d prefer not to have to provide the space for it, but for something as legitamate as a modification article that helps others, I\'m willing to bend the rules a bit.\r\n\r\nlet me know what you think.[/quote:8f3f0b2086]You know, I thought my Lo-Pro PCB cover was a good idea, but it didn\'t seem to get much interest.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I still got the pictures somewhere on my harddrive. I\'ve got plenty of space, my old pictures are broken because my wife decided not to renew that domain. I havn\'t even used the first 10mb of my 60mb that came with my Cox service, but I haven\'t fixed the old pictures because, honestly, I\'m too lazy to set up the FTP on that Cox service, and been uploading my pictures one by one. Also I have to go through all my old post, here and at TRC. What a nightmare.\r\n\r\nSo I decided to fix pictures as people ask about them.  :grin: \r\n\r\nI\'ll go ahead and set up my FTP so I can upload everything at once, then if you come across anything you want fixed, you\'ll just have to change the erinsbaby.com/davesstuff/ to members.cox.net/crazylittlecars.\r\n\r\nI\'ll let you know when I get that done.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10768,'27b9d2818c','hey man,\r\nI was wondering if you minded if I put up your Dip Switch mod in our Articles section?\r\n(giving you full credits of course)\r\n\r\nlet me know if that\'s okay.\r\non a side note, please let me know when you get the package I sent just so I know it made it there.'),(10769,'fb6ec981a6','[quote:fb6ec981a6=\"CaboWabo\"]hey man,\r\nI was wondering if you minded if I put up your Dip Switch mod in our Articles section?\r\n(giving you full credits of course)\r\n\r\nlet me know if that\'s okay.\r\non a side note, please let me know when you get the package I sent just so I know it made it there.[/quote:fb6ec981a6]\r\n\r\nThat\'s an affirmative to both action points dude.....\r\n\r\nI\'m starting to get worried though about my alloys package from ez, he sent it two mondays ago and still nada.  Maybee he did the cheaper 3 week option in shipping you were telling me about. hmmmmm......\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(10770,'fb6ec981a6','[quote:fb6ec981a6=\"CaboWabo\"]hey man,\r\nI was wondering if you minded if I put up your Dip Switch mod in our Articles section?\r\n(giving you full credits of course)\r\n\r\nlet me know if that\'s okay.\r\non a side note, please let me know when you get the package I sent just so I know it made it there.[/quote:fb6ec981a6]\r\n\r\nThat\'s an affirmative to both action points dude.....\r\n\r\nI\'m starting to get worried though about my alloys package from ez, he sent it two mondays ago and still nada.  Maybee he did the cheaper 3 week option in shipping you were telling me about. hmmmmm......\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11681,'75490dcca6','hey sessiz who is the person who puts the wallpapers in the wallpaper gally on the home page?'),(11686,'9be792a534','OK Matt $$ sent :)\r\n\r\n  Hey I know you made the knight rider lights, how hard would it be to have to white leds that blinked?\r\n\r\n  I am still thinking cop car idea...I have these colored see through cop lights from a diecast and they would light up nice with just while leds.\r\n\r\n  Let me know if its something you could do.'),(11684,'543c28951d','CaboWabo a.k.a. Admin of this site.'),(11685,'7cccead6f3','hey can i email u the wallpapers instead... and if  i do r u going to put them in the wall gall on the homepage&gt;?'),(10775,'64edb09a6b','sounds good.'),(10867,'6f099785b8','[quote:6f099785b8=\"Havok\"]Alright......I suck...at anything mechanical apparently...sure I can program a computer..knock your ass out with my martial arts experience....shoot ya from a mile away with a sniper rifle....\r\n\r\nbut I just cannot seem to get these damn rims mounted...I tried with 1 set...3 times...I suck :lol:\r\n\r\n\r\nand now I will get to the point....I think you still owe me $15.00 for the alloys....\r\n\r\nIf I supply all the necessary parts, wil you put together 3 sets of alloy rims for me?...and we\'ll call us even on the $15?\r\n\r\nI have the rims, 2-5 packs (10) of the Pentel RSVP medium line pens(all they had a few days ago) , and some axles and knuckles...I\'ll \r\nget anything else needed....\r\n\r\n\r\nI am pretty confident in my body modding abilities...and I seem to be doing pretty well on my track....but the electronics and mechanics......thats another story....a funny one :lol:\r\n\r\nlet me know whatcha think... :grin:[/quote:6f099785b8]Sounds like  a heluva good deal to me. \r\n\r\nSounds like you got everything I need. \r\n\r\n..and don\'t feel bad, those rims are bitch and a half to mount, notice how many people have bought them, and how few you actually see on cars?\r\n\r\nOh yeah, and you got a picture of that bug w/ a whale tail you had? I\'ve been looking all over for one.\r\n\r\ndave'),(10777,'e6a2aab8f8','[quote:e6a2aab8f8=\"Havok\"]No mail carrier for you man....I know I remember sending him to you last month...maybe July...and hey...this is between you and I only.....for now.......use this link to see what I\'ve been doing......  :shock: \r\nIt is very far from done, but I figured I\'d give you a tease.....and there will be a story about the Homies... but that will be later...\r\n\r\n:grin:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttp://www.picturetrail.com/gallery/view?p=999&amp;gid=2790418&amp;uid=1135699[/quote:e6a2aab8f8]lol good thing you can remember, cuz I can\'t lol\r\n\r\nholy fucking shit dude!\r\nthat things gonna be awesome!\r\nthose pics are sweet, I love the light trim, god I gotta do that');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10778,'b4140258a4','The lights are tight as fuck.......they have 8 functions...and I know you can\'t tell but they are on the chasing mode in the pics.......\r\nand I have a little strobe light above the table too....looks sweet....\r\nI told you how I get migraines from the sun and certain bulbs....well, its just natural that I build a track to race on at night 8-)\r\n\r\nthe base is 6\'x30\".....not a lot of space to work with, so I went for the twist on a classic figure 8...... like I said...far from done....I\'m getting a ton of course stickers and shit from bithed in a couple of weeks.....\r\n\r\n\r\nand if you get any series 7 extras....keep me in mind...I can\'t find them around here yet....and its much more fun to trade than but the whole set together...... :grin:\r\n\r\npeace....gotta start workin now... been here for an hour and aint done shit....damn I love my job.......'),(10779,'0d0c8f9015','play it off as an old one hehe'),(10784,'da53e889cd','Good Man!  I put a Perfection 3.0 in the chassis so you get an extra body to work on and a spare 2.2 Tomy motor.  Go ahead and post it up with Pics and write a blurp about what you think of the prize, contest &amp; Da BitPimps.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10785,'53e0af52ea','cool man, sounds like a plan'),(10786,'8ddf14c258','[quote:8ddf14c258=\"ph2t\"][quote:8ddf14c258=\"CaboWabo\"]hey man,\r\nI was wondering if you minded if I put up your Dip Switch mod in our Articles section?\r\n(giving you full credits of course)\r\n\r\nlet me know if that\'s okay.\r\non a side note, please let me know when you get the package I sent just so I know it made it there.[/quote:8ddf14c258]\r\n\r\nThat\'s an affirmative to both action points dude.....\r\n\r\nI\'m starting to get worried though about my alloys package from ez, he sent it two mondays ago and still nada.  Maybee he did the cheaper 3 week option in shipping you were telling me about. hmmmmm......\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:8ddf14c258]cool, thanks homeboy.\r\nI don\'t think I\'d worry about ez - I was some what skeptical at first, but I know now he\'s one of the good guys.\r\nhe probably did ship it regular. thats the way the chick at the PO was gonna ship mine too, I just happened to ask what options I had of shipping and told her I didn\'t want it to take 2 months - that\'s when she told me about the other.\r\nyou could always shoot him a PM too, like I said, he\'s a good guy - he\'ll shoot ya straight.'),(10787,'93dac85416','I got your money...but did you get the Tracks yet?\r\n\r\njust making sure it\'s smooth transation.\r\n\r\n\r\n-nigel');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10788,'83f43099ab','Still have the Eclipse body?'),(11791,'65a300de83','yo just a heads up. ill be back. i just needed to take a vacation from bits for a minute while i reorganize my head and get shit done that needs it. ill try to pop in every coupla days if i can. \r\n\r\nsorry bout the crazy shit.'),(10791,'b4140258a4','The lights are tight as fuck.......they have 8 functions...and I know you can\'t tell but they are on the chasing mode in the pics.......\r\nand I have a little strobe light above the table too....looks sweet....\r\nI told you how I get migraines from the sun and certain bulbs....well, its just natural that I build a track to race on at night 8-)\r\n\r\nthe base is 6\'x30\".....not a lot of space to work with, so I went for the twist on a classic figure 8...... like I said...far from done....I\'m getting a ton of course stickers and shit from bithed in a couple of weeks.....\r\n\r\n\r\nand if you get any series 7 extras....keep me in mind...I can\'t find them around here yet....and its much more fun to trade than but the whole set together...... :grin:\r\n\r\npeace....gotta start workin now... been here for an hour and aint done shit....damn I love my job.......'),(10792,'ebdab66ed9','right on brother, that track is just the shit.\r\nthat sucks certain lights give you migrane\'s, that\'s gotta be pain in the ass... and head.\r\nman I\'ve been so outta the loop on the homies.\r\nall the machines around here were 4 &amp; 5, the 2 series I have almost all of.\r\nI gotta get me some of those palmerios.\r\nI\'ll definitally hook ya up if I run into them.\r\n\r\nI think your track inspired me to build another. I might have to copy a few pieces like the chasing lights. lol\r\n\r\nwell get to work ya bum! lol\r\ntalk to ya later');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10793,'5a0101b494','Sup Pimp,\r\n\r\nI know you deal with ZZ\'s on a regular basis, this is what I\'m doing.\r\n\r\nI\'m taking the rear ZZ hubs off the axle and want to mount them on Tomy knuckles.  When I finally get the Tomy hubs off the knuckles and fit the ZZ hubs, the pin (front axle) is too short.  Now should I cut down the ZZ hubs or find something longer for the pin?\r\nWhat is your method for removing the pins from the knuckles?\r\nIs there an easy way?\r\n\r\nThanx Ahh5hit!'),(10795,'9df61ef435','I got the car.  Looks a little better than the pics on the net.  I\'ll ship it Monday when I get your address.'),(10796,'be0589d04d','great, send the zipzap to:\r\n\r\nBrian Vinh\r\n54 Portsmouth crescent\r\nL9K 1M6\r\nAncaster, Ontario\r\nCanada\r\n\r\ngive me your addy so i can send you my bit char-g\r\n\r\noh and you said a rs near you carries the trueno tune up kit, if you know could you tell me what the all season tires are like or what they are for?'),(10797,'93dac85416','I got your money...but did you get the Tracks yet?\r\n\r\njust making sure it\'s smooth transation.\r\n\r\n\r\n-nigel');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33694,'997eef8ec4','hey DT, I haven\'t been doing much right now. I have been in the process of moving and all the fun stuff that goes with it. \r\n\r\nOnce I get my Internet turned on at the new house I will be back into action, but as of yet I haven\'t finished the truck yet.'),(10799,'415e209cbb','Yeah, I got em yesterday. They look kick ass. Thanks man. I can\'t wait to set them bitches up.. Did I send you enough $$$?\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(10800,'e7be8781e2','[quote:e7be8781e2=\"payaso\"]Yeah, I got em yesterday. They look kick ass. Thanks man. I can\'t wait to set them bitches up.. Did I send you enough $$$?\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:e7be8781e2]\r\n\r\n\r\noh yea.. enuff $..\r\n\r\nI got two sets also..\r\n\r\n\r\nenjoy.'),(10801,'e7be8781e2','[quote:e7be8781e2=\"payaso\"]Yeah, I got em yesterday. They look kick ass. Thanks man. I can\'t wait to set them bitches up.. Did I send you enough $$$?\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:e7be8781e2]\r\n\r\n\r\noh yea.. enuff $..\r\n\r\nI got two sets also..\r\n\r\n\r\nenjoy.'),(10802,'c0d8a18bc3','Let me get this straight...You want to put Zip Zap hubs on the front of a Tomy car? Couldn\'t you just swap the whole wheel and knuckles? The Zip knuckles are the same as the Tomy/MS. I\'ve never actually just swapped the hubs, I have always done full wheel mods with diecast car wheels and used either the MS or Zip knuckles. I\'m a little confused by your post, you said something about the rear and then refered to the knuckles?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (22759,'21c189c477','Did you find a buyer for your bits or change your mind?'),(10804,'be0589d04d','great, send the zipzap to:\r\n\r\nBrian Vinh\r\n54 Portsmouth crescent\r\nL9K 1M6\r\nAncaster, Ontario\r\nCanada\r\n\r\ngive me your addy so i can send you my bit char-g\r\n\r\noh and you said a rs near you carries the trueno tune up kit, if you know could you tell me what the all season tires are like or what they are for?'),(10805,'a8d0d44033','yes it is still available'),(12015,'e76d18ed44','is it still ok for me to use the same couple pics in my ebay auctions when i auction a set of rims? I use same exact listing as you saw i ust change the rim name and pic of the exact style. I beleive it was 2 or 3 pics of your bits wit rims and a link to bitpimps site in the description with a thanks to you for allowing me to use the pics. Thought i would re-ask as some shit has been stirred up.'),(10813,'bd6f7504bf','[quote:bd6f7504bf=\"crazydave\"]Got your package today. Let me go over what I got, make sure it\'s all there and tell you what I can and can not do.\r\n\r\nMicro Speed - How funny you sent this. I\'ve been hitting BigLots every weekend looking for these. I didn\'t really want one, but I wanted to buy one to check out. So you did me a favor, and gave me a chance to check it out.\r\n\r\nNow the bad new about this car, it has a totally unique PCB, I\'ve never seen, and the bastards covered the markings on the transistors with something, so I have no way to figure out how to do this cAR.\r\n\r\nThunder Charger- well you know I was saying I was having issues with this car, I\'ll try it again, and see if I was being stupid that day, but worse comes to worse, I can half mosfet mod it, and then stack those FETs. That might not be as effecient as the full mosfet mod, but would still be way better than stock.\r\n\r\nMini Cooper - This is a cool car, thanks for sending this one, it\'ll be cool to check out.\r\n\r\nbut again bad news. Another oddball PCB, but this one still has the markings on the transistors, so I can do the same as I described for the Thunder Charger.\r\n\r\n...now a little good new before I get to the Nakamichi\r\n\r\nOrange Subaru clone- Definate can do\r\nClone with no body- definate can do\r\nBit Char-G - definate can do\r\nNakamichi - I can do something, but I\'m not sure what. There\'s like 8 transistors on that board that I can potentially swap straight out for FETs, but if any or all of them make a difference I don\'t know. Seems like a lot of mosfets for a maybe, but it\'s your call.\r\n\r\nlet me know if I missed anything.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:bd6f7504bf]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHey man,\r\nsorry I took so long in gettin\' back atcha ........\r\n\r\ngo ahead with any car you know or think you can do, and don\'t worry about the ones you cannot......I am definitely willing to experiment on the Nakamichi......and if it is successful, I have another one...........I\'m real happy the Subaru clone and the clone w/o the body can be done.....those are the \"Micro Tuners\" I got a few months ago at Jegs.com........\r\n\r\nand if you want any of those Micro Speed clones, or bodies, or tracks...let me know....they got a shitload at my biglots....but no TCs.. :lol:\r\n\r\n\r\nkeep me updated :grin:'),(10814,'e8270bf028','Hey, I uploaded all my pictures to the new server. I had 173 pics I posted since January. :shock: I guess I\'m just a picture postin\' fool.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I fixed the pics in that thread, if you see any others you want fixed, you know, just change it to members.cox.net/crazylittlecars.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10815,'4b483bb1f1','hay cabo-\r\n\r\nGot this Skyline ready to mail, but i want to confirm your address. The return label from the homie yo sent me says:\r\n\r\n11822 Borman Drive\r\nSt. Louis, MO 63146\r\n\r\nIs that correct? Lemme know soon and I\'ll get it out today.'),(13826,'5f36340394','Well I didn\'t expect much action during the week, so I was happy with the attention I got, but no bids on Saturday, that\'s not a good sign. I\'m getting a little nervous now. :sad: \r\n\r\nOn the up side I answered four emails yestreday from people checking on shipping. So maybe this is gonna be one of those auctions where you have to keep hitting refresh in the last hour to keep up on the action.\r\n\r\nWe\'ll see...\r\n\r\nYou know, this is the reason I like to sell on ebay. It a fun game. ;)\r\n\r\nDave'),(10817,'e8270bf028','Hey, I uploaded all my pictures to the new server. I had 173 pics I posted since January. :shock: I guess I\'m just a picture postin\' fool.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I fixed the pics in that thread, if you see any others you want fixed, you know, just change it to members.cox.net/crazylittlecars.\r\n\r\ndave'),(10819,'abb6fcbaee','What do you need? I have lots of stuff. I have a bunch of 3.5 motors if interested. I could give ya a couple of those.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12988,'1a3d479912','Are you the one to talk to about this? If not, sorry for bothering ya. I am not getting email updates for new posts. I am not getting emails from one other person that I know of too. My ISP say it is not their network. I find it highly unlikely that two different sources are not getting emails to me due to their network. Could you check and see what error message was returned (if possible), and maybe do a little checkin from your end. Thank you very much.'),(10821,'db6252e132','[quote:db6252e132=\"crazydave\"]Hey, I uploaded all my pictures to the new server. I had 173 pics I posted since January. :shock: I guess I\'m just a picture postin\' fool.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I fixed the pics in that thread, if you see any others you want fixed, you know, just change it to members.cox.net/crazylittlecars.\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:db6252e132]right on bro, thanks! :-)'),(10822,'77c1be491d','Hey, \r\nI wanted to tell you....remember that plastic track at rcmod I was asking you about.....gone from their store.....I\'m glad I waited....looks like it was a bomb..... :cool:\r\nI\'m actually thinking about the Bonzer Mat....free or at a cheaper price of course :grin:'),(13628,'f408b8ee13','whats ur phone nuimberr so i can send b4 other wise it wont ship untill monday!!!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13629,'0a4d0e20cb','Hey man. Just sending my monthly reminder that I\'m waiting on my stuff'),(13630,'f408b8ee13','whats ur phone nuimberr so i can send b4 other wise it wont ship untill monday!!!'),(11735,'b29fe8cde7','I have 1 1.6 (green endbell) and 1 2.2(red end bell) zip zap motors that I could part with depending on the deal.'),(11736,'3935df49ef','[quote:3935df49ef=\"chiga\"]hey man no prob. dont worry but ummm... were do you want me to post them[/quote:3935df49ef]you can post them where sessiz does here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=988\r\n(must be a member of the Raw &amp; Un-censored usergroup)\r\n\r\nor use the thread you already started here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2165'),(16884,'a050d17467','[quote:a050d17467=\"hogjowlz\"]because nobody wants threads on here with 6 posts by the original poster before anyone replies.\r\n\r\nread the faqs.[/quote:a050d17467]\r\nok, I now understand that, and it won\'t happen again, thanks for telling. :cool:'),(11839,'928aad46f7','right now the AE86 body is in high demand through ALOT people and i mean ALOT. so i\'ll get back to you on that, but i can still trade you the ferarri body and some other stuff. but if you don\'t want the ferarri just tell me, and i\'ll put you on the waiting list of the AE86 body trade to see how my other offers fall through.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10825,'3b7e774a0f','My addy is\r\n\r\nChad Ellis\r\n51 Briarwood Ct\r\nEstill Springs, TN  37330\r\nUSA'),(10826,'77c1be491d','Hey, \r\nI wanted to tell you....remember that plastic track at rcmod I was asking you about.....gone from their store.....I\'m glad I waited....looks like it was a bomb..... :cool:\r\nI\'m actually thinking about the Bonzer Mat....free or at a cheaper price of course :grin:'),(10827,'f9dcb87ce0','[quote:f9dcb87ce0=\"Havok\"]Hey, \r\nI wanted to tell you....remember that plastic track at rcmod I was asking you about.....gone from their store.....I\'m glad I waited....looks like it was a bomb..... :cool:\r\nI\'m actually thinking about the Bonzer Mat....free or at a cheaper price of course :grin:[/quote:f9dcb87ce0]yea those tracks were way too expensive at rcmod.\r\nI\'m a little skeptical of the bonzer mat too, seems like the edges would end up getting all curled ya know?'),(10828,'dbad779f4f','hey......\r\nwanna do me a favor? I\'m talking to Pimp_C about the mosfet mod....and he might want a 1/3AAA NiMh battery/batteries put in too (I\'ll supply the batts)....what are you charging people to do the mosfet mod? and how much extra would you charge to throw 1-2 batteries in too? as in maybe just a single cell, maybe a dual....don\'t know yet......\r\n\r\nLemme know :grin:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10829,'b214843f99','[quote:b214843f99=\"Havok\"]hey......\r\nwanna do me a favor? I\'m talking to Pimp_C about the mosfet mod....and he might want a 1/3AAA NiMh battery/batteries put in too (I\'ll supply the batts)....what are you charging people to do the mosfet mod? and how much extra would you charge to throw 1-2 batteries in too? as in maybe just a single cell, maybe a dual....don\'t know yet......\r\n\r\nLemme know :grin:[/quote:b214843f99]hmmm, I\'m not sure. I guess say 15+ shipping for the mosfet mod, I\'ll throw in the dual battery mod for free. I\'ll charge a dollar per battery, since all my batteries are slightly used.\r\n\r\nThat sounds fair, you think?\r\n\r\nDave'),(10830,'6baa68a8c4','[quote:6baa68a8c4=\"SuperFly\"]hay cabo-\r\n\r\nGot this Skyline ready to mail, but i want to confirm your address. The return label from the homie yo sent me says:\r\n\r\n11822 Borman Drive\r\nSt. Louis, MO 63146\r\n\r\nIs that correct? Lemme know soon and I\'ll get it out today.[/quote:6baa68a8c4] :eek: cool dude...\r\nuh well, it\'d be easier if you sent it to:\r\n16 Crystal Lake Drive\r\nSt. Peters, MO 63376\r\n\r\nthanks for the freebie dude...\r\nI\'ll owe ya - maybe a custom painted body?\r\n(not that you can\'t do your own - that green and gold gloria was the shizzle fo rizzle)'),(11759,'54831615ec','[quote:54831615ec=\"midget_man1387\"]got them yesterday! find any you want?\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks a bunch!!! peewee is so sweet![/quote:54831615ec]\r\n\r\n\r\nCool man, glad you like \'em.....I still can\'t get your picture to work....try going there and sending it to me( sometimes picture sites will let you invite someone to see your online photo albums) or if you can take a pic and send it as an attachment in an e-mail...send it to my webtv e-mail address: \r\n\r\nhavok74@webtv.net\r\n\r\nlater on.........');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10832,'f9dcb87ce0','[quote:f9dcb87ce0=\"Havok\"]Hey, \r\nI wanted to tell you....remember that plastic track at rcmod I was asking you about.....gone from their store.....I\'m glad I waited....looks like it was a bomb..... :cool:\r\nI\'m actually thinking about the Bonzer Mat....free or at a cheaper price of course :grin:[/quote:f9dcb87ce0]yea those tracks were way too expensive at rcmod.\r\nI\'m a little skeptical of the bonzer mat too, seems like the edges would end up getting all curled ya know?'),(10833,'b214843f99','[quote:b214843f99=\"Havok\"]hey......\r\nwanna do me a favor? I\'m talking to Pimp_C about the mosfet mod....and he might want a 1/3AAA NiMh battery/batteries put in too (I\'ll supply the batts)....what are you charging people to do the mosfet mod? and how much extra would you charge to throw 1-2 batteries in too? as in maybe just a single cell, maybe a dual....don\'t know yet......\r\n\r\nLemme know :grin:[/quote:b214843f99]hmmm, I\'m not sure. I guess say 15+ shipping for the mosfet mod, I\'ll throw in the dual battery mod for free. I\'ll charge a dollar per battery, since all my batteries are slightly used.\r\n\r\nThat sounds fair, you think?\r\n\r\nDave'),(11121,'30ede935a3','[quote:30ede935a3=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea I sent ya 4 for your 3 that I needed.\r\n\r\n  Its all good I am sure sometime down the road you would do the same.\r\n\r\n  To me they are just extras so if they make a good addition to your collection then thats were they are gonna go.[/quote:30ede935a3]well damn...\r\nthanks homey');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10835,'43aa6e401f','Hey man,\r\nI got the K.I.T. yesterday, I went to work early, so I found out today....My wife always does that to me......\"Oh yeah, you got this package a few days ago\" :lol:\r\n\r\nThanks man :cool:'),(10836,'cb0540b034','$15+shipping sounds very fair.....alot better than Superfly and Hue\'s deal..but I\'m not sure the kid will be able to afford it....we\'ll see..he hasn\'t got back to me yet...I\'ll let you know..8-)'),(10837,'f9bb4413b0','[quote:f9bb4413b0=\"Havok\"]$15+shipping sounds very fair.....alot better than Superfly and Hue\'s deal..but I\'m not sure the kid will be able to afford it....we\'ll see..he hasn\'t got back to me yet...I\'ll let you know..8-)[/quote:f9bb4413b0]Yeah that\'s the problem with dealing with kids, try to offer them a killer deal, and it seems they were thinking more like free. Yeah, like I have the money to be buying toys for every kid in the world. \r\n\r\nI offered to do it for 4 bucks a car for Dark Tari, he said he he\'d go for that, but hasn\'t got back yet. I think he\'s ordering his own mosfets, for me to use.\r\n\r\nI haven\'t been too pushy about doing the FETs for people, because I can see how it would be sketchy for someone you don\'t know, to be all, \'Send me your car\". So I\'m thinking referalls are the way to go.\r\n\r\nCabo\'s going to make a video of his before he post about it. Maybe when he post that will help build my reputation.\r\n\r\nPayaso is still being the smart shopper and asking around about me. Apparently he was asking Cabo if I\'d be able to do his Bit Char-G.\r\n\r\nDid you see the Cali-style Beetle, I did last week? check it out, my best work. Well except for the window, but I fixed that since I took the pics.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2054\r\n\r\ndave'),(10838,'93c9aca70a','im going away and when i get back i intend on sorting this out im going down the bank and getting u some cash!!! \r\ni want the\r\nWT33\r\nWT01\r\n30$us for the wheels and how much for shipping to aus???');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10840,'e5235d35f3','i do not have wt01 i have wm01, and its about $5 to ship rims there.'),(10841,'60202efacd','no thx. you prolly cant get it off of me anyways. It is retired and very rare and actually one of my personal favorites. Not that it is worth bunches, but i have seen \"desperate\" people offer $12-$22  just for this body, which makes me even more hesitant to trade/sell. It was just listed to get offers and if one of the offers was from a \"desperate\" person  then i prolly would trade/sell it.'),(10843,'4df2916e35','Ah, I got ya now. I use 2 pairs of Gerbers to remove them, and it doesn\'t damage them at all. If you search wheel mods at TinyRC, you will find my thread that shows how I hold them, etc.'),(22764,'e5f09282db','Hehe, all right.  If you still have em untouched or un wanted in a month give me a PM, I\'ll buy it for sure (this is no 13 year old kid promise, I am totally serious).  Just starting a new job and you know how that slows down the income flow during transition.'),(10848,'b89e1bc61f','I know....amazingly enough, I actually come up with an idea every now and then........\r\n\r\nI want a phat azz Bitpimps bumper sticker or decal for my real car(s)............can it be done?\r\n\r\nI work at and live near one of the biggest party colleges in the country......talk about advertising....... :cool: \r\n\r\nwhatcha think?....and oh-yeah.....I might have to pay one of you guys to make me a t-shirt too.....  8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10849,'43aa6e401f','Hey man,\r\nI got the K.I.T. yesterday, I went to work early, so I found out today....My wife always does that to me......\"Oh yeah, you got this package a few days ago\" :lol:\r\n\r\nThanks man :cool:'),(10850,'b89e1bc61f','I know....amazingly enough, I actually come up with an idea every now and then........\r\n\r\nI want a phat azz Bitpimps bumper sticker or decal for my real car(s)............can it be done?\r\n\r\nI work at and live near one of the biggest party colleges in the country......talk about advertising....... :cool: \r\n\r\nwhatcha think?....and oh-yeah.....I might have to pay one of you guys to make me a t-shirt too.....  8-)'),(10851,'14126288ed','hopefully soon we can do all of that.\r\nsome plans are in the works, I have no clue if/when something will happen, but I will for sure keep ya posted.\r\nyou see, the problem is we wanna make sure we put out quality shit, and so far what we have is \"ify\" at best.\r\nthere\'s some kinks to work out, etc.'),(10852,'f821f8d4b2','yup i zee beetle hehe\r\ni have a blue beetle but it has a crack down th side...but i was planning on buying another new beetle body set any way so ill give you the blue on and ill keep the clear one to paint\r\n\r\nP.S. what color is the trueno\r\nkent');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (15109,'40a4cf2e19','Got the stuff today thanks :)\r\n\r\nLet me know if you get/have other stuff ofr sale (any scale)\r\n\r\nThanks again\r\n\r\nPete'),(15110,'db0f4586bb','Hey whats going on?\r\n\r\n Alittle late really but been busy as shit.\r\n\r\n  Hope you holiday was good and you got to spend lots of time with the kid :)\r\n\r\n  I hope things get all back to norm for you and me lol.\r\n\r\n  I got my xmod from sessiz and I have to say very impresses with it out of the box although I never read instructions and it took afew hits before I realized ther ewas a lock for the body lol damn thing kept popin off.\r\n\r\n  Now I just need to get some upgrades lol.\r\n\r\nPete'),(10854,'14126288ed','hopefully soon we can do all of that.\r\nsome plans are in the works, I have no clue if/when something will happen, but I will for sure keep ya posted.\r\nyou see, the problem is we wanna make sure we put out quality shit, and so far what we have is \"ify\" at best.\r\nthere\'s some kinks to work out, etc.'),(10855,'b04502f1d8','Cool man....you know I\'m down when the time comes....and I can pay for materials....or whatever....  8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11117,'35f72a7388','Yea I sent ya 4 for your 3 that I needed.\r\n\r\n  Its all good I am sure sometime down the road you would do the same.\r\n\r\n  To me they are just extras so if they make a good addition to your collection then thats were they are gonna go.'),(10858,'b04502f1d8','Cool man....you know I\'m down when the time comes....and I can pay for materials....or whatever....  8-)'),(10860,'1809029bf4','S2K came out pretty good Brendan.  A couple of suggestions:\r\n[b:1809029bf4]Detail[/b:1809029bf4]: door handles, head lights, driving lights, exhaust, mirrors, etc.\r\n[b:1809029bf4]Question:[/b:1809029bf4] what is the space behind the seats used for?  In the future, when making a convertable, always start your rear shelf at the rear of the front door especially when there\'s little trunk and place your seats just in front of that.  That leaves more trunk to show, makes it look more realistic.  I\'m putting the touches on my body mod tuit, will post soon.'),(10862,'eb433e0218','Alright......I suck...at anything mechanical apparently...sure I can program a computer..knock your ass out with my martial arts experience....shoot ya from a mile away with a sniper rifle....\r\n\r\nbut I just cannot seem to get these damn rims mounted...I tried with 1 set...3 times...I suck :lol:\r\n\r\n\r\nand now I will get to the point....I think you still owe me $15.00 for the alloys....\r\n\r\nIf I supply all the necessary parts, wil you put together 3 sets of alloy rims for me?...and we\'ll call us even on the $15?\r\n\r\nI have the rims, 2-5 packs (10) of the Pentel RSVP medium line pens(all they had a few days ago) , and some axles and knuckles...I\'ll \r\nget anything else needed....\r\n\r\n\r\nI am pretty confident in my body modding abilities...and I seem to be doing pretty well on my track....but the electronics and mechanics......thats another story....a funny one :lol:\r\n\r\nlet me know whatcha think... :grin:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10863,'4a3ca103cd','how do i do door handles and lights an all that'),(10865,'72b82cfb07','I\'ll hitcha up tonight!'),(10868,'6f099785b8','[quote:6f099785b8=\"Havok\"]Alright......I suck...at anything mechanical apparently...sure I can program a computer..knock your ass out with my martial arts experience....shoot ya from a mile away with a sniper rifle....\r\n\r\nbut I just cannot seem to get these damn rims mounted...I tried with 1 set...3 times...I suck :lol:\r\n\r\n\r\nand now I will get to the point....I think you still owe me $15.00 for the alloys....\r\n\r\nIf I supply all the necessary parts, wil you put together 3 sets of alloy rims for me?...and we\'ll call us even on the $15?\r\n\r\nI have the rims, 2-5 packs (10) of the Pentel RSVP medium line pens(all they had a few days ago) , and some axles and knuckles...I\'ll \r\nget anything else needed....\r\n\r\n\r\nI am pretty confident in my body modding abilities...and I seem to be doing pretty well on my track....but the electronics and mechanics......thats another story....a funny one :lol:\r\n\r\nlet me know whatcha think... :grin:[/quote:6f099785b8]Sounds like  a heluva good deal to me. \r\n\r\nSounds like you got everything I need. \r\n\r\n..and don\'t feel bad, those rims are bitch and a half to mount, notice how many people have bought them, and how few you actually see on cars?\r\n\r\nOh yeah, and you got a picture of that bug w/ a whale tail you had? I\'ve been looking all over for one.\r\n\r\ndave'),(11116,'b9e3286b29','Hey, the flame mask I sent just got returned. It\'s marked \"Attempted Not Known\"\r\n\r\n\r\nI had my wife send it for me, and she wrote the address down wrong.  She wrote 3508 instead of 2508. Feel stupid using my wife as the scapegoat, but really it wasn\'t fault.\r\n\r\nI feel like an ass, because now there\'s no way to get them to you in time for the contest, but since I spent the time making them, I\'ll go ahead and put them back out on monday.\r\n\r\nSorry man, I dropped the ball on that one.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10870,'3241fb0395','Good, I\'m glad you like the deal :grin: and it more than worth it for me......\r\n\r\nI wish I did have a pic of my Beetle....I never took a picture of her. :sad:\r\n\r\nI\'ll let you know when I send the rims.....I figure...throw them in with the cars when you\'re done with everything (and my hoodrat :mad:) :lol:\r\nI gotta sleep....I work tonite...don\'t wanna be  :-(\r\nlater......'),(10871,'08c04e9ee0','huh'),(10873,'a6fc819e35','I sent those pics to your bitPimps account..'),(10874,'5c2f1791eb','thanks'),(10875,'5c2f1791eb','thanks'),(10876,'a575544282','I have the white panda or the red, what do you want? :)  Hey, im from the philippines so its gonna be more expensive &amp; takes longer to send. like i just got my rims from havok last week and he sent it Aug.7!  Its the stupid mailing system weve got...if thats ok with you? 8)'),(11951,'c79d020545','hey man you recevd the oney et?'),(10879,'3155e91251','is in the mail. I sent it 1st class USPS, so I\'m guessing you\'ll get it Wednesday or Thursday.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get it. I didn\'t insure it or require a sig, but it should be fine. \r\n\r\nGet yourself some grippy tires, cuz that thing has lots o torque! You don\'t owe me anything, btw, not that I wouldn\'t accept a CW custom body. I wanted to pay ya back for the web help, and also for providing the bitpimps site. I did keep the collector\'s points tab.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19159,'64aa581cdb','[quote:64aa581cdb=\"Ahh5hit\"]Hey Cabo,\r\n\r\nI would be interested. Sorry I haven\'t been around, but I have run into some family matters. I am back on my feet now and will be hanging out again. I\'ll look into the link and get something together. Just let me know which project you want to showcase, any is fine by me. ;)\r\n\r\nI appreciate you recongnizing my work!\r\n\r\nMike[/quote:64aa581cdb]Hey there Mike!\r\n\r\nGlad to see ya back man! After you get all situated and get your album going - we\'ll figure out which to showcase, a lot to choose from there :wink:\r\n\r\nanyways man, glad to hear everything is alright with you and all.\r\nlet me know when you register in the Galleries so I can give you the proper permissions to upload.\r\n\r\ntalk to you soon.\r\n\r\nScott (Cabo)'),(10882,'3155e91251','is in the mail. I sent it 1st class USPS, so I\'m guessing you\'ll get it Wednesday or Thursday.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get it. I didn\'t insure it or require a sig, but it should be fine. \r\n\r\nGet yourself some grippy tires, cuz that thing has lots o torque! You don\'t owe me anything, btw, not that I wouldn\'t accept a CW custom body. I wanted to pay ya back for the web help, and also for providing the bitpimps site. I did keep the collector\'s points tab.'),(13823,'1bc899da0f','Thanx Cabo! You da man! They all look great. I just finished another car that i wish I could have entered. (hint: Hotwheels should\'ve thought of it first)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13824,'694b2c07b7','Good Looking Out Cavey!  They don\'t have a clue, lemme get over der!'),(13825,'5f36340394','Well I didn\'t expect much action during the week, so I was happy with the attention I got, but no bids on Saturday, that\'s not a good sign. I\'m getting a little nervous now. :sad: \r\n\r\nOn the up side I answered four emails yestreday from people checking on shipping. So maybe this is gonna be one of those auctions where you have to keep hitting refresh in the last hour to keep up on the action.\r\n\r\nWe\'ll see...\r\n\r\nYou know, this is the reason I like to sell on ebay. It a fun game. ;)\r\n\r\nDave'),(10884,'0d95797da4','i dun think so when you send it?'),(10886,'5a8db0ed0b','deeeeefinantly man im patient im  just tryin to get my hands on the red one that one is cool'),(10887,'667704a42f','[quote:667704a42f=\"SuperFly\"]is in the mail. I sent it 1st class USPS, so I\'m guessing you\'ll get it Wednesday or Thursday.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get it. I didn\'t insure it or require a sig, but it should be fine. \r\n\r\nGet yourself some grippy tires, cuz that thing has lots o torque! You don\'t owe me anything, btw, not that I wouldn\'t accept a CW custom body. I wanted to pay ya back for the web help, and also for providing the bitpimps site. I did keep the collector\'s points tab.[/quote:667704a42f]right on brotha\r\nthanks again for the hook up\r\nI\'ll let ya know when she arrives, she\'ll get some nice shoes and a new top'),(10888,'ad22c728ce','Hi, are you still doing any trading?  I am pretty sure I got a 3.0 or 2.6 to trade and I got all the sen fa styles of bods to, I am from Orlando\r\nucfdan');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10891,'4c52a05c31','Hey man. got my pullback today and was going to do the mod but moticed that its a little wide in the back.\r\n\r\nYour tutorial explains how to do dubs or daytons but what if I wanna do regular fronts on front and backs on back?\r\n\r\ngimmie a call if ya can\r\n\r\n613-247-1540 I\'ll be up till about 2am my time'),(10892,'4c52a05c31','Hey man. got my pullback today and was going to do the mod but moticed that its a little wide in the back.\r\n\r\nYour tutorial explains how to do dubs or daytons but what if I wanna do regular fronts on front and backs on back?\r\n\r\ngimmie a call if ya can\r\n\r\n613-247-1540 I\'ll be up till about 2am my time'),(10896,'c98317aa26','oh , okay. Well for the back I just cut the little outdented tab off one and cut the axl off a bit and it works fine for the rear, waiting for glue to dry fully\r\n\r\nand on front I just took old off and put pullback front on using the old pins and works fine. At least with the fairlady body anyways. prolly other bodies will rub.'),(10921,'c03d9653a2','actually got it today, will send rims out tomorrow or thursday.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10894,'a3eab62449','[quote:a3eab62449=\"Stoli\"]Hey man. got my pullback today and was going to do the mod but moticed that its a little wide in the back.\r\n\r\nYour tutorial explains how to do dubs or daytons but what if I wanna do regular fronts on front and backs on back?\r\n\r\ngimmie a call if ya can\r\n\r\n613-247-1540 I\'ll be up till about 2am my time[/quote:a3eab62449]you\'ll have to put spacers on the front set of pullback rims if you want to put them on the front of your bit, if you don\'t, it\'ll rub against the chassis.\r\nuse about the same size spacer as you would on the back axle.'),(10895,'c98317aa26','oh , okay. Well for the back I just cut the little outdented tab off one and cut the axl off a bit and it works fine for the rear, waiting for glue to dry fully\r\n\r\nand on front I just took old off and put pullback front on using the old pins and works fine. At least with the fairlady body anyways. prolly other bodies will rub.'),(10915,'a6fa4724dd','Thanx Pimp!\r\n\r\nPicked up a RX7 SE &amp; Hop Up Kit yesterday.  That thing is the coolest!  That\'ll be the one to have the most miles in my collection. My son might end up with it though.......?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10916,'ad5b241975','ya that looks sweet.'),(10917,'b6ac8dbe94','LOL dude, mail dont go on sunday so it will take longer than 1 day to get here.'),(10898,'f0c0f7cf38','hey man, when I send you this shell and controller for 2nd place, I wanted to see if you\'d be willing to do a couple of mods for me in trade for a custom painted shell or something, that way I can send it all at once.\r\nlet me know if it\'s worth it to you or what you want, but here\'s what I\'d need:\r\n- I send you a MS Pro chassis, I need the rear axle jbwelded in (it keeps falling out)\r\n- I\'d like you to do an internal dual cell to it\r\n\r\nI\'d be willing to part with one of these bodies:\r\n[img:f0c0f7cf38]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/bits/cabowabo/subaru-wrx/blue_yellow/thumbs/shot2.jpg[/img:f0c0f7cf38][img:f0c0f7cf38]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/bits/cabowabo/s-2000/blue_fade_multi/thumbs/shot01.jpg[/img:f0c0f7cf38][img:f0c0f7cf38]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/bits/cabowabo/accord_wagon/thumbs/shot1.jpg[/img:f0c0f7cf38][img:f0c0f7cf38]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/bits/cabowabo/rx7/red_black/thumbs/shot1.jpg[/img:f0c0f7cf38]\r\n\r\nand I realize these aren\'t my best bodies so I totally understand if it\'s not worth it to you so don\'t feel bad for telling me to get fucked lol'),(10899,'2a0e6a8bb5','ill take the fierro lookin one');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11115,'965c699837','[quote:965c699837=\"Havok\"]no shit? cool I\'m glad VooDoo came to you...thats my boy...he just sent me the whole series 7 set of Homies(palmeros)...just because I\'ve hooked him up with some free homies....he\'s a pimp :cool:...... don\'t tell him, but I\'m gonna send him some more free shit.....poor guy can only get Walmart clones...he can\'t get anything else unless he drives for 2-3 hours....and even then he gets raped on the prices.....I gotta hook him up....:grin:\r\n\r\n\r\nI wanted to ask you,....and I thought I already did....but I must not have sent the PM I wrote yesterday....again I\'m a burnout :lol:............,\r\n\r\nI have a Cyclona BCG thats 57mhz.....is one of my controllers I sent you a 57mhz? if not I have to find it.....and I have a 27mhz MS complete with the controller to send.....lemme know if you have the 57 and I\'ll send \'em.....other than that....I think thats all I\'ll need FET modded until I get a ZZ SE......I\'ll let you know on that too.... 8-)[/quote:965c699837]Wow, I didn\'t even know series 7 is out. Yeah, VDMs cool. I gave him the Pimp\'s deal.\r\n\r\nNope, you didn\'t send me a 57mhz controller. I do not have one either. guess you\'re gonna have to look harder. ;)\r\n\r\nNo need to send the controller with the 27mhz microsizer. I\'ve got plenty of those.\r\n\r\ndave'),(10901,'f771f75b83','[quote:f771f75b83=\"crazydave\"][quote:f771f75b83=\"Havok\"]Alright......I suck...at anything mechanical apparently...sure I can program a computer..knock your ass out with my martial arts experience....shoot ya from a mile away with a sniper rifle....\r\n\r\nbut I just cannot seem to get these damn rims mounted...I tried with 1 set...3 times...I suck :lol:\r\n\r\n\r\nand now I will get to the point....I think you still owe me $15.00 for the alloys....\r\n\r\nIf I supply all the necessary parts, wil you put together 3 sets of alloy rims for me?...and we\'ll call us even on the $15?\r\n\r\nI have the rims, 2-5 packs (10) of the Pentel RSVP medium line pens(all they had a few days ago) , and some axles and knuckles...I\'ll \r\nget anything else needed....\r\n\r\n\r\nI am pretty confident in my body modding abilities...and I seem to be doing pretty well on my track....but the electronics and mechanics......thats another story....a funny one :lol:\r\n\r\nlet me know whatcha think... :grin:[/quote:f771f75b83]Sounds like  a heluva good deal to me. \r\n\r\nSounds like you got everything I need. \r\n\r\n..and don\'t feel bad, those rims are bitch and a half to mount, notice how many people have bought them, and how few you actually see on cars?\r\n\r\nOh yeah, and you got a picture of that bug w/ a whale tail you had? I\'ve been looking all over for one.\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:f771f75b83]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSo how about this......can you mount the rims on axles and knuckles you already have? If so....I will send you back the ZZ you just mosfetted for me, so I\'ll have 1 set of ZZ alloys too. Can we do it? and which of the cars you have do you think we should mount them on....I\'ll go with your opinion.... 8-)\r\n\r\nlemme know....\r\n\r\n:D :D :D :D\r\nI\'m off for 3 days....I don\'t work again till 7pm (cst) on Friday\r\n:D :D :D :D');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10902,'1354f6d468','That\'s a good idea, duh, I have your cars here.\r\n\r\nI\'ll probably do the clones because the pins pull out so much easier, but the knuckles are fully swappable. Some knuckles give you more or less steering. I think most my Microsizers have Thunder Charger knuckles in them now. Then again since those are the cars I know I can fully FET mod, you\'ll probably want to leave the alloys on those.\r\n\r\nWell anyways, I ramble, so ummm...good idea! :lol:'),(10903,'1354f6d468','That\'s a good idea, duh, I have your cars here.\r\n\r\nI\'ll probably do the clones because the pins pull out so much easier, but the knuckles are fully swappable. Some knuckles give you more or less steering. I think most my Microsizers have Thunder Charger knuckles in them now. Then again since those are the cars I know I can fully FET mod, you\'ll probably want to leave the alloys on those.\r\n\r\nWell anyways, I ramble, so ummm...good idea! :lol:'),(10906,'d43bff1d20','get to work!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10908,'79c0e517bc','QUIT bossing me around.'),(10909,'2a0e6a8bb5','ill take the fierro lookin one'),(10913,'a261dbf186','Coolness.....\r\n\r\nI will send try to send out the pens, alloys and the ZZ today...anything else you need?'),(10914,'afbd500a08','[quote:afbd500a08=\"Havok\"]Coolness.....\r\n\r\nI will send try to send out the pens, alloys and the ZZ today...anything else you need?[/quote:afbd500a08]Just more super glue, but I can cover that. :lol: \r\n\r\nI also just wanted to add, I hope the your other alloys aren\'t like those 8.2mm, those were a mega pain in the ass, because the holes did not go all the way through.\r\n\r\nBut if they are...oh well, guess I\'ll deal with it. :grin: \r\n\r\ndave'),(10911,'24610f7bc2','[quote:24610f7bc2=\"hogjowlz\"]ill take the fierro lookin one[/quote:24610f7bc2]this one?\r\n[img:24610f7bc2]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/images/forum_images/bits/cabowabo/accord_wagon/thumbs/shot1.jpg[/img:24610f7bc2]'),(10912,'ad5b241975','ya that looks sweet.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (15108,'40a4cf2e19','Got the stuff today thanks :)\r\n\r\nLet me know if you get/have other stuff ofr sale (any scale)\r\n\r\nThanks again\r\n\r\nPete'),(10925,'ab5a5351b9','Hey C-Dub,\r\n\r\nHave you ever heardof this site:\r\n\r\nhttp://toprcsites.impulsetraitor.com/index.php?hl=16\r\n\r\nWanna register and kick some RC azz ?????'),(10926,'ab5a5351b9','Hey C-Dub,\r\n\r\nHave you ever heardof this site:\r\n\r\nhttp://toprcsites.impulsetraitor.com/index.php?hl=16\r\n\r\nWanna register and kick some RC azz ?????'),(10930,'4b54c4083c','Tru Dat Pimp, Tru Dat!'),(10935,'d5e15ffd75','Didja get the flame mask yet? I figured it would have been there by now.\r\n\r\nI spaced off the placement guide, sorry about that, I\'ll make it after work today.\r\n\r\nHere\'s a quicky paint tip too. I know you have an airbrush, and done some nice fades. Do a fade off the front end in light colors that can be covered, being conscious of where the flames are going to lay. Then apply the flame mask, and paint the rest of the body in darker color that will cover the fade.\r\n\r\nOf coarse you know, rub the mask into the crevices really good, and do your first couple coats extra light.\r\n\r\nI\'ll be back this afternoon with the placement guide.\r\n\r\nDave'),(10932,'afbd500a08','[quote:afbd500a08=\"Havok\"]Coolness.....\r\n\r\nI will send try to send out the pens, alloys and the ZZ today...anything else you need?[/quote:afbd500a08]Just more super glue, but I can cover that. :lol: \r\n\r\nI also just wanted to add, I hope the your other alloys aren\'t like those 8.2mm, those were a mega pain in the ass, because the holes did not go all the way through.\r\n\r\nBut if they are...oh well, guess I\'ll deal with it. :grin: \r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10928,'8a0048c8e2','[quote:8a0048c8e2=\"DarkTari\"]Hey C-Dub,\r\n\r\nHave you ever heardof this site:\r\n\r\nhttp://toprcsites.impulsetraitor.com/index.php?hl=16\r\n\r\nWanna register and kick some RC azz ?????[/quote:8a0048c8e2]yea I have seen that and a few other \"rings\" the Germans, RCMod, and a few other sites use.\r\nI don\'t really want to register the bitPimps site in any of those. I feel like they make us look cheap. Those things don\'t really generate that many hits anyway and I\'d have to put up a banner/link to the website ring, probably on the homepage. That would make us look cheap too.\r\nWe\'ll just get em all by good ole word of mouth :wink:'),(10929,'4b54c4083c','Tru Dat Pimp, Tru Dat!'),(10934,'343f32264a','[quote:343f32264a=\"DarkTari\"]Tru Dat Pimp, Tru Dat![/quote:343f32264a]I\'m hoping once we announce this next contest, we\'ll get another surge.\r\nI think this contest is gonna be the shizz, can\'t wait to get it goin!'),(10936,'f2f4ff43b1','couple things\r\n\r\n  can I ask were you got that van body? I was thinking of making an A-Team van\r\n\r\nand I have a few extra series 7 comies and a few extra full sets of series 7  just thought I would give yea the heads up.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10960,'c2658b64ee','thats cool man. ya were civil with the kid and i get along with her family better than i do with her so im not worried. its just strange getting used to bachelordom again.'),(10938,'d5e15ffd75','Didja get the flame mask yet? I figured it would have been there by now.\r\n\r\nI spaced off the placement guide, sorry about that, I\'ll make it after work today.\r\n\r\nHere\'s a quicky paint tip too. I know you have an airbrush, and done some nice fades. Do a fade off the front end in light colors that can be covered, being conscious of where the flames are going to lay. Then apply the flame mask, and paint the rest of the body in darker color that will cover the fade.\r\n\r\nOf coarse you know, rub the mask into the crevices really good, and do your first couple coats extra light.\r\n\r\nI\'ll be back this afternoon with the placement guide.\r\n\r\nDave'),(11454,'39dd69e5de','Yo man have not seen you around for forums the last little bit.\r\n\r\n  hope all is well with the personal shit :(\r\n\r\n  If theres anything I can do in anyway just let me know homie :)\r\n\r\n  Pete\r\n\r\n  PS. get yer ass back on here and post some more funnny shits'),(10941,'2669760e0a','I\'ll take all your extra series 7 homies look at http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=802 and see if I have what you are looking for.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10943,'98b2554e5e','Did you need me to send you some $$$ for the S/H on the chassis? \r\nJust let me know if you do. \r\nThanks man.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(10944,'2d9a8c2ef0','nah its only 3 bucks. its ready to go. ive been busy. i broke up with the woman. sorry ill try to do it tomorrow.'),(10945,'52c681bd53','Just seeing on how the cars are coming along :)'),(10947,'2d9a8c2ef0','nah its only 3 bucks. its ready to go. ive been busy. i broke up with the woman. sorry ill try to do it tomorrow.'),(10948,'0eaa7ae2fd','theyre pretty much done. sorry its taking so long. the woman moved out and stuff. ill send you extra stuff for the wait tho.'),(10958,'841891e5b0','yea man aslong as you get to see her and your happy, my oldest boy is from a previous \"bitch\" and I had to take her to court so that she would let me see him.  Well that was 5 years ago we went to court and now hes here more then with his mom.'),(10951,'d8de9ac0e3','What?????  Sorry to hear that bro..  Shits always on the rocks here too..\r\n\r\nNo rush on the chassis. Take your time.\r\n\r\n\r\nNow\'s your chance to move down, and party in the \"Sunshine State\"...lol\r\n\r\nNah, j/k... Hope everything works out for you doodman.. (seriously)\r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10952,'18a18f9c21','ah its good. just readjusting and stuff.'),(10953,'add04d658f','its all good :)\r\n\r\n  sorry to hear about the home stuff :('),(11871,'1bb3db58c2','I replied to your request back on 29-Sep-03....\r\n\r\n[b:1bb3db58c2]Well Joe I\'m flattered by your offer but I\'m afraid I\'ll have to decline . \r\n\r\nI don\'t know if you\'ve offered this trade to others but is it the bB\'s that you\'re interrested in or Custom Bits in general?[/b:1bb3db58c2]'),(10955,'07a730b7b4','ah this is probably the first time i broke up with a chick and ended up happy. the kid situation is kinda crappy but i get to see her on the weekend at least.'),(11805,'10db408169','[quote:10db408169=\"hogjowlz\"]yo just a heads up. ill be back. i just needed to take a vacation from bits for a minute while i reorganize my head and get shit done that needs it. ill try to pop in every coupla days if i can. \r\n\r\nsorry bout the crazy shit.[/quote:10db408169]hey man, thanks for poppin in and giving a heads up.\r\ndon\'t push yourself man, we know you\'re going through some serious crap right now - take your time and deal with what ya gotta deal with.\r\n\r\nyou know your spot will be just the same as you left it, poop stains and all.\r\ndont feel obligated to have to stop on the boards - do it for you. we do miss ya, but we also want you to have a good life away from here too, like any friends would.\r\n\r\none thing I did want to mention to you though...\r\nI know the contest prizes aren\'t due for another 2 months, but I just wanted to let ya know, if you gotta back away from modding the chassis - that\'s totally understandable. just give us plenty of notice so we can coordinate the efforts.\r\n\r\nanyways, I hope things start looking up for you (if they haven\'t already) and let us pimps know if there\'s anything we can do to help ya out.'),(10957,'18a18f9c21','ah its good. just readjusting and stuff.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10961,'4aefb6e021','I just checked the mail, and nuttin yet. I hope they didn\'t get lost..\r\n\r\n\r\nHopefully they\'ll be here this week.. Thanks againg Dave.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(10962,'ef42f6ec54','I can use the basketball dude the girl in black and the chick in blue\r\n\r\n\r\n  Just to let you know I have 1 maybe 2 extra sets that I will be postin aswell.'),(10964,'ef42f6ec54','I can use the basketball dude the girl in black and the chick in blue\r\n\r\n\r\n  Just to let you know I have 1 maybe 2 extra sets that I will be postin aswell.'),(10965,'ac637f4a3f','[quote:ac637f4a3f=\"VooDooMafia\"]I can use the basketball dude the girl in black and the chick in blue\r\n\r\n\r\n  Just to let you know I have 1 maybe 2 extra sets that I will be postin aswell.[/quote:ac637f4a3f]cool man.\r\ndo you think there\'s anymore of my extras you want?\r\nif not, then we\'ll just seal the deal with these 3.\r\nI\'ll mark em off the image tonite and get em shipped out tomorrow or friday.\r\nhit me up with an address I can ship to you at.\r\n\r\nYou can ship to me at:\r\nIconMedialab\r\nATTN: Scott Lix\r\n700 Goddard Avenue\r\nChesterfield, MO 63005'),(10966,'b457101b3a','Hey Drive,\r\n\r\nCongrats on the RCMod contest Pimp.  You tied with my son (woho car I did)  Your Celica is hard to beat man, can\'t wait to see what you have instore for the AusMicro Contest !!!  We\'ll see ya there!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10967,'ac637f4a3f','[quote:ac637f4a3f=\"VooDooMafia\"]I can use the basketball dude the girl in black and the chick in blue\r\n\r\n\r\n  Just to let you know I have 1 maybe 2 extra sets that I will be postin aswell.[/quote:ac637f4a3f]cool man.\r\ndo you think there\'s anymore of my extras you want?\r\nif not, then we\'ll just seal the deal with these 3.\r\nI\'ll mark em off the image tonite and get em shipped out tomorrow or friday.\r\nhit me up with an address I can ship to you at.\r\n\r\nYou can ship to me at:\r\nIconMedialab\r\nATTN: Scott Lix\r\n700 Goddard Avenue\r\nChesterfield, MO 63005'),(36288,'3eb317f5f8','Does it come with a controller to use the 1:16 elec\'s with.\r\n\r\nHow did you make the servo work?\r\n\r\nDid you get those parts in today?'),(10969,'67883f4e65','Those are the only ones I need right now\r\n\r\nI will send these off in morning\r\n\r\nmy Addy is\r\n\r\nPeter kostecki\r\n20 Water St.\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nL2V 2K3\r\nCanada'),(10971,'e3995b27a1','[quote:e3995b27a1=\"ph2t\"]ph2t@prahranpianos.com\r\n\r\ncheers dude.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:e3995b27a1]\r\n\r\n\r\ngot the LEDs today...\r\n\r\nshit there small...    gonna have ta sharpen my soldering iron tip.\r\n\r\n3volts?\r\n\r\nthanks...\r\n\r\n-nigel');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10972,'907ebd3e86','[quote:907ebd3e86=\"micromatch\"]deeeeefinantly man im patient im  just tryin to get my hands on the red one that one is cool[/quote:907ebd3e86]\r\n\r\ncool man, send me your details, and ill send you mine.'),(10974,'3a2e15fbcc','Just wanted to give you a heads up, i was busy and unable to mail the package til yesterday so it should be there by next week. Sorry for all the delays. I sent you a little extra for the delay'),(11971,'c3de68f04b','ya thats awesome.  im sure he will update his site for a week and realize that nobody is listening.'),(11801,'bd320a1ab3','Sorry to hear that.\r\nDon\'t worry about locking the thread then.  Send me my prize when you get the chance.'),(11802,'953783d15f','well   guess your not intrested in  the hpi micro rs4  for trade  for the truck ,,,,,or any other of your  customs'),(10980,'42287f26f0','Hallo sinned, Wie geht es dir?  Ich bin müde -_-..Sowieso, Wie findest du meines deutsch?  \r\n\r\nWhat is was wondering though is if you had an MSN/Hotmail email acount, my German teacher wants me to have some german people to talk to so I can understand the language better.   \r\n\r\nDanke!\r\nEvan'),(10981,'42287f26f0','Hallo sinned, Wie geht es dir?  Ich bin müde -_-..Sowieso, Wie findest du meines deutsch?  \r\n\r\nWhat is was wondering though is if you had an MSN/Hotmail email acount, my German teacher wants me to have some german people to talk to so I can understand the language better.   \r\n\r\nDanke!\r\nEvan');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10982,'e2d5419fb3','[quote:e2d5419fb3=\"payaso\"]Are you saying that you\'ll do it for me, and all I have to send you is $5 for return postage? Cause if you are, you\'re a saint..\r\n\r\nIf I gotta pay, I\'ll still do it.\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks man..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:e2d5419fb3]\r\n\r\nHey man, just a holla to see if you\'re still up for this.  I\'m waiting on cabo\'s rider, should be here anyday now. :)\r\n\r\nAS I said before, if you\'re happy to pay for my shipping cost back to you, then I\'m happy to do it for free.  :)\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(10983,'f2f4ff43b1','couple things\r\n\r\n  can I ask were you got that van body? I was thinking of making an A-Team van\r\n\r\nand I have a few extra series 7 comies and a few extra full sets of series 7  just thought I would give yea the heads up.'),(12306,'2c3a6c4f08','[quote:2c3a6c4f08=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:2c3a6c4f08=\"ph2t\"]hey dude, just a holla to say I haven\'t received the cash yet. :)  Bugger off, yeah I know, lol....\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:2c3a6c4f08] :-? definitally keep me posted on if you\'ve gotten it or not.\r\nthe check I mailed steve should be there by tomorrow, I\'m not sure what the hold up is. I even reminded him last night.\r\nI\'ll stay on him man. I\'m sorry this is taking so long.[/quote:2c3a6c4f08]\r\n\r\nIt\'s ok man, really.  I just don\'t wanna be a pain in the arse!  Dang what time is it over there?  Shouldn\'t you be away with the fairys?\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(11870,'5a7f364f10','[quote:5a7f364f10=\"ph2t\"][quote:5a7f364f10=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:5a7f364f10=\"ph2t\"]Coolies, I was quite amazed at how bright the blue lights were.  Typically they aren\'t as bright as the white leds, but these ones enabled me to drive your car around in pitch black no problems.   :)\r\n\r\nOnce you get it if you could do a little review on pimps that would be cool and really stroke my ego, lol.....\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:5a7f364f10]you bet I will man, any particular thread?[/quote:5a7f364f10]\r\n\r\nNah, just anything, I\'m sure I will find it, I guess flossin would be appropriate.   If me ego is getting to big just tell me to bugger off.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:5a7f364f10]sheiit... once I put those bad ass lights and mosfetted chassis with the killer bee antenna and custom painted shell, its for sure going in flossin! lol\r\nI\'ll be sure to describe all its wonderful little details and give ya the creds where applicable. lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11114,'3f8992059f','no shit? cool I\'m glad VooDoo came to you...thats my boy...he just sent me the whole series 7 set of Homies(palmeros)...just because I\'ve hooked him up with some free homies....he\'s a pimp :cool:...... don\'t tell him, but I\'m gonna send him some more free shit.....poor guy can only get Walmart clones...he can\'t get anything else unless he drives for 2-3 hours....and even then he gets raped on the prices.....I gotta hook him up....:grin:\r\n\r\n\r\nI wanted to ask you,....and I thought I already did....but I must not have sent the PM I wrote yesterday....again I\'m a burnout :lol:............,\r\n\r\nI have a Cyclona BCG thats 57mhz.....is one of my controllers I sent you a 57mhz? if not I have to find it.....and I have a 27mhz MS complete with the controller to send.....lemme know if you have the 57 and I\'ll send \'em.....other than that....I think thats all I\'ll need FET modded until I get a ZZ SE......I\'ll let you know on that too.... 8-)'),(10986,'f1cf9810fd','I sent your homies yesterday....just so you know...they\'re in a small brown cardboard box 8-)\r\n\r\nI got the van at a place called The General Store. It was of a big set, but the set only cost $7.99, I wanted the van bad enough, so I got the whole set. That was the only body in the set, and the only van they had. I\'ve been back there a few times, but I haven\'t found another van yet. The van was a great find, but, I had to use a dremel grinder (not a sander) on the inside and it took me almost 2 hours of grinding to get it to fit on the it chassis. I will try to find one if you want....but the people at the store told me the stuff they get is just sent from the distibutor, they don\'t order anything....kinda like Biglots....\r\n\r\nbesides the series 7, I need some from series #2 &amp; #3.\r\nIf you find any..or think you can...I\'ll give you a list   \r\n\r\n\r\ngood idea on the A-Team thing....wish I would have thought of that....and don\'t worry...I don\'t steal ideas :cool:\r\n\r\nlet me know if you want me to look for the van....and when you gets da Homies 8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13085,'9f3bb75729','I did manage to read your email, and send a reply (one way or another). I MUST BE IN EMAIL HELL!!!'),(13086,'6a4bc8234d','[quote:6a4bc8234d=\"DarkTari\"]Hey SF,\r\n\r\nAm I suppose to be getting some FET\'s from you?  I remember contacting you about it but have since fell into a fog of Mods and completely forgot about it until I read in our [i:6a4bc8234d]Pimp Click [/i:6a4bc8234d]forum.  Do I owe you some ducketts?  \r\n\r\nNevermind, I just checked my PM and I owe your $15.00 if they\'re still available.  Lemme know!\r\n\r\nThanx[/quote:6a4bc8234d]\r\n\r\nI got em if ya want em, pimp!\r\n\r\nI have GH Sims at 7815 Quill Point Dr. as the address I sent the last batch to. Should I drop em in the mail?\r\n\r\nSuperFly'),(10988,'8ab6e02977','[quote:8ab6e02977=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:8ab6e02977=\"ph2t\"][quote:8ab6e02977=\"CaboWabo\"]hey man,\r\nI was wondering if you minded if I put up your Dip Switch mod in our Articles section?\r\n(giving you full credits of course)\r\n\r\nlet me know if that\'s okay.\r\non a side note, please let me know when you get the package I sent just so I know it made it there.[/quote:8ab6e02977]\r\n\r\nThat\'s an affirmative to both action points dude.....\r\n\r\nI\'m starting to get worried though about my alloys package from ez, he sent it two mondays ago and still nada.  Maybee he did the cheaper 3 week option in shipping you were telling me about. hmmmmm......\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:8ab6e02977]cool, thanks homeboy.\r\nI don\'t think I\'d worry about ez - I was some what skeptical at first, but I know now he\'s one of the good guys.\r\nhe probably did ship it regular. thats the way the chick at the PO was gonna ship mine too, I just happened to ask what options I had of shipping and told her I didn\'t want it to take 2 months - that\'s when she told me about the other.\r\nyou could always shoot him a PM too, like I said, he\'s a good guy - he\'ll shoot ya straight.[/quote:8ab6e02977]\r\n\r\nJust got a PM from ez apologising for the late send out, so I should be gettin\' those babies soon.\r\n\r\nI also expect your pkg any day now, hopefully it will come before the w/e so I have the time then to mod.\r\n\r\nSo, to confirm.  I\'ll mosfet mod the pcb, drivetrain and steering.  Also add a DIP Switch mod and add led headlights.   What colour you want? blue or white?\r\n\r\nSo you want me to add one of ph2t\'s special guitar string antennas?  I hear his antennas rock  :smile: \r\n\r\nMatt.'),(13271,'a0f884db09','[quote:a0f884db09=\"bdebde\"]Hi again Cabo,\r\n\r\n I was wondering if you could send a test email (from bitpimps) to see if it is working. Seems my ISP\'s new spam filtering set up may be blocking any email that it can\'t confirm the sender of. If it is not too much trouble, I would appreciate it. Here is the address I am trying to check:\r\n\r\nbdebde@gte.net\r\n\r\nIf you send a copy to my hotmail account, I can verify that I got it. Hotmail address is:\r\n\r\nbdebde@hotmail.com\r\n\r\nThank you so very much (crosses fingers).[/quote:a0f884db09]Hey man,\r\nI can tell you now that the email address used when email is sent from bitPimps cannot be varified as it doesn\'t really exist. (that way I don\'t get spam back either)\r\nbecause there is no account setup with that particular email address, I cannot send email from that address, I merely use the smtp service.\r\n\r\nbasically the email you recieve from bitPimps gets sent from my smtp server, but the \"senders\" address (bitPimps) is fake and cannot be replied to, varified, etc.\r\n\r\nbecause of that, it really does no good for me to send you an email to the hotmail account, as the email I would send would use the smpt service as before, but with a varified and working address.\r\n\r\nI believe you can request from your ISP that you would like email from the particular smtp server to be allowed through.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (16941,'b17e045df6','Not yet, sorry. I\'m waitin on my tax return so\'s I can just go to the shack and get everything all at once. That way I wont be goin\' back like the next day for awd, etc...\r\nThat sounds like a good idea, though, your x mod site. When I do get mine, you can count on seeing me there.\r\nI was following your posts yesterday, why you quittin\' bits? You can get Homies outta gumball machines, at Spencers, hell, I found some at Uni Mart the other day. Besides, they are small lookin\' next to x mods... people always put them next to bits, but I\'ve found that they work best with 1/43. They look perfect standing next to my SuperSlick.\r\nGood luck on your site...\r\n\"If you build it, they will come\" - Field of Dreams'),(11913,'84b198fcca','well im not really interested in the ultraman car/s. Like i stated i will take $25 shipped for the zz se if you want it.'),(35922,'0259aaeeef','[quote:0259aaeeef=\"CaboWabo\"]Don\'t forget, you have to pick a random winner for the [url=http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=6788]bitPimps 3rd Annual Years End Custom Blow-Out[/url].\r\n\r\nJust wanted to send a reminder.\r\nI don\'t know if you\'re waiting to see who we\'ve picked for the 3 places before you picks yours so there\'s no overlap or what.\r\nBut just wanted to give you a heads up.[/quote:0259aaeeef]\r\n\r\nI don\'t know how I can\'t pic this one....\r\n\r\n[img:0259aaeeef]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/contest_entries/11/02_steelwoolghandi_1.jpg[/img:0259aaeeef]\r\n\r\nIs SWG going to walk with a sweep? :???: \r\n\r\nSome really awesome rides.'),(34576,'b70eb7d6f7','how do i post pics');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11863,'94924eeebe','[quote:94924eeebe=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:94924eeebe=\"ph2t\"]Dude, here\'s that video of your modded car.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/cabo.avi\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:94924eeebe]right on bro!\r\nthat looks hot!\r\nI can\'t wait to get in my grubby hands! lol\r\nthanks again for hookin me up.\r\npayaso should be paypal\'ing you soon (I\'ve told him again just now on the phone lol)[/quote:94924eeebe]\r\n\r\nCoolies, I was quite amazed at how bright the blue lights were.  Typically they aren\'t as bright as the white leds, but these ones enabled me to drive your car around in pitch black no problems.   :)\r\n\r\nOnce you get it if you could do a little review on pimps that would be cool and really stroke my ego, lol.....\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(11860,'7b53f33079','[quote:7b53f33079=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:7b53f33079=\"ph2t\"]Hey man, your car has gone out today.  Expect approx 7-10 working days for delivery.   Shipping costed 7.50 AUS so if you could get Steve to paysluts me the $4.50USD to ph2t@prahranpianos.com I\'d appreciate it.\r\n\r\nI\'ve got some video of the biatch which I\'ll post for you tonight.\r\n\r\nCheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:7b53f33079]cool man, I\'ll have him paypal ya.\r\nthanks dood![/quote:7b53f33079]\r\n\r\nDude, here\'s that video of your modded car.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/cabo.avi\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(12291,'2da52cec93','[quote:2da52cec93=\"brendan123\"]Hey how ya goen man,\r\n\r\ni just made a video and it goes for a minute 15 sec and it is 257 mb, i was wondering how u make it into div x format??[/quote:2da52cec93]\r\n\r\ngoto www.doom9.org for all your needs :)\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11862,'30b5c2a761','[quote:30b5c2a761=\"ph2t\"]Dude, here\'s that video of your modded car.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/cabo.avi\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:30b5c2a761]right on bro!\r\nthat looks hot!\r\nI can\'t wait to get in my grubby hands! lol\r\nthanks again for hookin me up.\r\npayaso should be paypal\'ing you soon (I\'ve told him again just now on the phone lol)'),(12030,'109e40cdb7','[quote:109e40cdb7=\"Yagbols\"][quote:109e40cdb7=\"ph2t\"][quote:109e40cdb7=\"Yagbols\"][quote:109e40cdb7]Sorry man, I didn\'t mean to get the two countries mixed up.  I\'m looking for the Fairlady 350Z booster set on 57Mhz.  I know they are hard to comebuy but I\'m willing to trade the same stuff as my ZZ SE thread in \"looking to score\"  If you sent me the booster and a chassis of your own I\'m willing to put headlights, mosfet and all other performance mods on it and send you the chassis back.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\ncool, now looking for a 350z is the hard part :eek:  I have one here its opened/used but still in stock form.  But ill look around for a new one. And if i want to get one of our kitt lights what do i add to the package?[/quote:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\nWhat\'s the condition man?  Is it good condition?  If it is I\'m happy to take it :)   As for the Knight Rider lights I\'m happy to make them for you.   What I can do is that you send me one of your chassis and I\'ll add the circuit board to it.   The LED board that has the actual lights will be free-standing and you can mod a shell to suit no sweats.   What else do you have to trade?\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\nI\'ll go over my stuff later tonite and see what i can trade.  The condition is good.  So do i just send you 1 chassis to modify with all the lights and stuff or do I send 2?[/quote:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\nJust send the one chassis to do the Kitt lights.   \r\n\r\n[b:109e40cdb7]OR[/b:109e40cdb7]\r\n\r\nAlso I can do a different deal for you.  How does this sound instead.   You send me 2 chassis and I will mosfet mod them both for you for the used 350z booster.   I will also throw in the headlights mod.   So that is 2 mosfeted chassis and a headlights mod for the used 350z booster set.\r\n\r\nPersonally man I\'d rather do that because it is very tricky to do the Knight Rider light PCB.  I\'ve made many crap pcb\'s with a very low success rate.   Also the turnaround time for the mosfet mod is quicker.\r\n\r\nCheers man,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(10998,'6d677b61c5','Check this out Cavey....\r\n\r\nhttp://www.hotwheelscollectors.com/news/index.asp?sessionID={2B5B81D2-FC59-442D-9B48-4724683597E4}&amp;newurl=265&amp;newsID=265');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (10999,'f732004d9b','I sent the package out today.. [b:f732004d9b] to R.C.I.[/b:f732004d9b]....a few things though...I didn\'t think about it until after I mailed it....how many pens do you need for 3 sets of alloys?....I sent 10..then realized you might need 12....on the plus side...I sent some super glue too...you can keep that :grin: \r\n\r\nAs far as which rims I sent\r\n\r\nhttp://www.scala43.com/scala43/rad.htm\r\n\r\nI think they were....43, 74 &amp; 79....I can\'t remember which ones I sent you....damn weed :smoking:\r\n\r\nI think your\'s were the 38\'s...either way....I know 74 &amp; 79...confused on 38 or 43.. :lol:\r\n\r\nlemme know yo... 8-)'),(11000,'96482f8740','[quote:96482f8740=\"Havok\"]I sent the package out today.. [b:96482f8740] to R.C.I.[/b:96482f8740]....a few things though...I didn\'t think about it until after I mailed it....how many pens do you need for 3 sets of alloys?....I sent 10..then realized you might need 12....on the plus side...I sent some super glue too...you can keep that :grin: \r\n\r\nAs far as which rims I sent\r\n\r\nhttp://www.scala43.com/scala43/rad.htm\r\n\r\nI think they were....43, 74 &amp; 79....I can\'t remember which ones I sent you....damn weed :smoking:\r\n\r\nI think your\'s were the 38\'s...either way....I know 74 &amp; 79...confused on 38 or 43.. :lol:\r\n\r\nlemme know yo... 8-)[/quote:96482f8740]Yep, you\'re right, 4x3=12. I supppose I\'ll have to grab a couple more. That\'s ok, I\'ll need grab some spares to account for those boogers flyin\' across the room, and getting smashed by vise grips. ;)\r\n\r\nYeah the ones I got were the 38s, so yours must be the 43s...\r\n\r\nI\'ll tell ya something about that short term memory loss, it\'s only short term, it\'ll all come back to ya, someday. My friends are mind boggled how I can\'t remember what happened 5min. ago, but I remember last month in picture perfect detail.\r\n\r\nDave'),(11164,'43d2ec7466','What exactly is that?  Explain !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11173,'5854a45b14','C-Dubb,\r\n\r\nHow bout a sticky under the Ride O Da Week for comments?\r\nThat\'ll keep the gallery &amp; comments seperate, if it gets out of hand I can just kill it!  Wanna give it a trail run???'),(11002,'63b6ff2632','Sorry man I\'ve been dealing with alotta bullshit. :( \r\nI\'ll be up and goin as soon as I can bro.'),(11003,'af9186ecba','Thanx for the offer, I will probably take you up on it!\r\nWhat are you charging for the FET\'s &amp; work?\r\n\r\nI was going to contact you about trying to do it myself.  I think I\'ve pretty much mastered the art of body modding, it\'s now time for me to get into the guts of these Micro\'s and I know you\'re one of the techiest Pimps out there.  Do you have a tutorial on FET modding?  I looked at Micro_Amps webpage on this subject.  No tutorial but he explains the pros of the mod and shows his technique of neatness &amp; durability.  Want to get some pointers from you if you don\'t mind.  Got some new magnifying glasses and a fine tip solderer so I guess I\'m ready!....\r\n\r\nThanx!'),(11004,'5efe71d961','[quote:5efe71d961=\"ph2t\"]Just got a PM from ez apologising for the late send out, so I should be gettin\' those babies soon.\r\n\r\nI also expect your pkg any day now, hopefully it will come before the w/e so I have the time then to mod.\r\n\r\nSo, to confirm.  I\'ll mosfet mod the pcb, drivetrain and steering.  Also add a DIP Switch mod and add led headlights.   What colour you want? blue or white?\r\n\r\nSo you want me to add one of ph2t\'s special guitar string antennas?  I hear his antennas rock  :smile: \r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:5efe71d961]I might have to join the band-wagon here, you guys and your sigs are cracking me up! lol\r\n\r\nI was hoping you\'d get it before the weekend too\r\nI\'ll keep my fingers crossed. :grin: \r\n\r\nyea man, you got it right, mosfet pcb, switch and headlights.\r\nif you got blue, that\'d be the schizz, but I could do either or.\r\n\r\nand actually, yea - I\'d love your signature antenna!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11005,'0d5a593c29','I really appreciate the offer!\r\nGive me your address and a price for the work.  Return postage will be included.'),(11006,'29d8de63e8','got \"precious\" today :grin: \r\nthanks bro!\r\nI\'ll get to playin and post up some thoughts'),(11007,'1ac1c19e17','dood, I\'ve been talkin at ya like this was going to be your first experience with a mosfet car, but I saw in some thread that you already have one from crazydave. So you already know what it\'s all about, sorry for talking to ya like a noob. Hope you like the car.'),(11008,'e2d5419fb3','[quote:e2d5419fb3=\"payaso\"]Are you saying that you\'ll do it for me, and all I have to send you is $5 for return postage? Cause if you are, you\'re a saint..\r\n\r\nIf I gotta pay, I\'ll still do it.\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks man..\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:e2d5419fb3]\r\n\r\nHey man, just a holla to see if you\'re still up for this.  I\'m waiting on cabo\'s rider, should be here anyday now. :)\r\n\r\nAS I said before, if you\'re happy to pay for my shipping cost back to you, then I\'m happy to do it for free.  :)\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(11009,'07361b972a','[quote:07361b972a=\"noxorc\"][quote:07361b972a=\"ph2t\"]ph2t@prahranpianos.com\r\n\r\ncheers dude.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:07361b972a]\r\n\r\n\r\ngot the LEDs today...\r\n\r\nshit there small...    gonna have ta sharpen my soldering iron tip.\r\n\r\n3volts?\r\n\r\nthanks...\r\n\r\n-nigel[/quote:07361b972a]\r\n\r\nThey are small hey...   Here\'s the datasheets:\r\n\r\n[url]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/blue_led.pdf[/url]\r\n\r\n[url]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/red_led.pdf[/url]\r\n\r\nSome tips:\r\n\r\nThe blue leds will run off 3V no probs but are brighter at 4V.   Even with 3V use a current limiting resistor (100 -&gt; 200Ohms) to limit the current.\r\n\r\nThe red leds need only 2.4V to run, use a larger resistor (say 680 Ohm -&gt; 1K) to limit the current if you are running them from the same source.\r\n\r\nSoldering:\r\n\r\nDude, with the blues you gotta be extra carefull not to overheat the buggers or they die.   I mount them upside down (terminals up) on a piece of putty and \"tin\" the terminals very quickly with the soldering iron.  I also \"tin\" the wires before attaching them.   To connect the wire then all you need to do is hold the wire against the led\'s terminal and use the soldering iron to re-heat the ends.  This way you get a very quick acting solder joint that won\'t over heat the led.\r\n\r\nThe data sheets show which side is +VE and which is GND.\r\n\r\ngood luck.\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11010,'9606989fee','[quote:9606989fee=\"DarkTari\"]Check this out Cavey....\r\n\r\nhttp://www.hotwheelscollectors.com/news/index.asp?sessionID={2B5B81D2-FC59-442D-9B48-4724683597E4}&amp;newurl=265&amp;newsID=265[/quote:9606989fee]Ahhhhhh! Why are you torturing me. I just narrowed my guitar collection down to 5 from 7. I\'m trying to assure myself I don\'t need so many guitars, but my problem is I need every guitar I see.  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(11012,'2b4d168c28','[quote:2b4d168c28=\"ezenterprises\"]Just wanted to give you a heads up, i was busy and unable to mail the package til yesterday so it should be there by next week. Sorry for all the delays. I sent you a little extra for the delay[/quote:2b4d168c28]\r\n\r\nhey mate, great to hear from you, I was getting a bit worried, but that\'s cool, now I know.  Don\'t worry about the holdup, I know what it\'s like myself.   Can\'t wait for those alloys.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nph2t.'),(11013,'4847ec218e','Hey Pimp, After that Cali Bug, I gotta divert your attention somewhere else so that I\'ll have a chance at dem AusMicro prizes !!!!!!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11014,'1ac1c19e17','dood, I\'ve been talkin at ya like this was going to be your first experience with a mosfet car, but I saw in some thread that you already have one from crazydave. So you already know what it\'s all about, sorry for talking to ya like a noob. Hope you like the car.'),(13820,'b77ed324c4','Hey man, I\'m not an instigator, so don\'t think I\'m trying to start something, but your reputation has been challenged on ausmicro, I thought you should know, so you at least have a chance to defend yourself.\r\n\r\nThird post down in this thread:\r\n\r\nhttp://ausmicro.com/topic.asp?TOPIC_ID=1502&amp;FORUM_ID=8&amp;CAT_ID=2&amp;Topic_Title=Bit+Char%2DG+Drifting+and+Burnout+pics+no+BULL%21%21%21%21&amp;Forum_Title=BCG+%2D+Discussion&amp;whichpage=1\r\n\r\nYou\'re called out when he says,\"Did you take that picture at 11 o\'clock when the sun was just right? Because I reckon you have photoshoped it... wink wink.\"\r\n\r\nObvious poke at your last comment there.\r\n\r\nIf them dumbasses would just try the freakin\' laquer and ditch their enamel, maybe they\'d realize a nice paint job at 11am looks just like that. ;)\r\n\r\ndave'),(13821,'694b2c07b7','Good Looking Out Cavey!  They don\'t have a clue, lemme get over der!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13822,'a9a8853957','Hey C-Dub\r\n\r\nI finished the body mod tutorial from Golden Rod.  How can I post it or should I send it to you?  It\'s in MS Works Word Processor format.\r\n\r\nThanx,\r\n\r\nGotta find time to do the motor comparison.\r\n\r\nAre we straight on the prizes yet?  Can Hog still do the chassis?'),(11763,'f60381f706','[quote:f60381f706=\"chiga\"]sorry to keep botherin you but theres 2 problems... 1 the link you gave me to post the walls on dont work ( at least not 4 me) and how do I join that user group you told me about[/quote:f60381f706]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=342'),(11757,'f81423c7be','Your package is at my wife\'s work right now, so I\'ll be able to get everything finished up this weekend.\r\n\r\nMy Biglots finally got Microspeed cars in. I picked one up, and the transistors have markings on them so I can figure it out now, after I already swapped the PCB in your Microspeed with a Thunder Charger so I could FET yours. \r\n\r\nI just thought that was ironic.\r\n\r\nDave'),(11858,'7b53f33079','[quote:7b53f33079=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:7b53f33079=\"ph2t\"]Hey man, your car has gone out today.  Expect approx 7-10 working days for delivery.   Shipping costed 7.50 AUS so if you could get Steve to paysluts me the $4.50USD to ph2t@prahranpianos.com I\'d appreciate it.\r\n\r\nI\'ve got some video of the biatch which I\'ll post for you tonight.\r\n\r\nCheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:7b53f33079]cool man, I\'ll have him paypal ya.\r\nthanks dood![/quote:7b53f33079]\r\n\r\nDude, here\'s that video of your modded car.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/cabo.avi\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11906,'ff04702bc8','well i havent gotten any money yet, ill get mail today sop maybe it be in todays mail.'),(11908,'839a697920','nah it when into ur paypal account!! it was done via payapl'),(11910,'4831222141','[quote:4831222141=\"ezenterprises\"]not sure, i had my wife mail it. Ill have to ask her how she mailed it and when she mailed it.  i hope it aint lost too, my son would be pissed if i lost his only zz.[/quote:4831222141]\r\n\r\nThanks for the info mate, if you could find out from your wife and let me know that would be great.\r\n\r\nthanks.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(11911,'92818a4eff','At the moment all I have is the Ultraman Mat cars\r\n\r\n  But I am interested in the ZZ SE if there is nothing we can trade (or partial trade for) I can pay with paypal :)'),(11021,'41a700734c','No way man, you didn\'t sound pushy and hells yeah I\'m still interested man. :-) \r\nI bought a new ZZse for voodoo mafia tonight and will most likely be sending it out tomorrow so I\'ll send off the chassis to you also.\r\nThanks man.\r\n\r\nPs. Whats up with the space for your sig? You want me make ya something?'),(13038,'f18beaefb8','[quote:f18beaefb8=\"VooDooMafia\"]Sup dave just wondering if you had a chance to play with that motor?\r\n\r\n  I went through all my cars/motors and that is the only one I have(set sessiz one aweek ago).  I am sure that in one of my next few orders with TE I will get another and when I do I can toss it your way of you like ..[/quote:f18beaefb8]Nah, didn\'t get a chance to test it. Yesterday was hectic, because my wife decided to quit her job spur of the moment, and today I\'ve been at the post office mailing your package.\r\n\r\nYour package got mailed today BTW. Should be about a week.\r\n\r\nI\'ll probably check out that motor in a little bit.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11023,'68fbe2072c','[quote:68fbe2072c=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:68fbe2072c=\"ph2t\"]Just got a PM from ez apologising for the late send out, so I should be gettin\' those babies soon.\r\n\r\nI also expect your pkg any day now, hopefully it will come before the w/e so I have the time then to mod.\r\n\r\nSo, to confirm.  I\'ll mosfet mod the pcb, drivetrain and steering.  Also add a DIP Switch mod and add led headlights.   What colour you want? blue or white?\r\n\r\nSo you want me to add one of ph2t\'s special guitar string antennas?  I hear his antennas rock  :smile: \r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:68fbe2072c]I might have to join the band-wagon here, you guys and your sigs are cracking me up! lol\r\n\r\nI was hoping you\'d get it before the weekend too\r\nI\'ll keep my fingers crossed. :grin: \r\n\r\nyea man, you got it right, mosfet pcb, switch and headlights.\r\nif you got blue, that\'d be the schizz, but I could do either or.\r\n\r\nand actually, yea - I\'d love your signature antenna![/quote:68fbe2072c]\r\n\r\ndone, done and done!    :smile: \r\n\r\nIt should be at home today when I get back from work (9:20am here).   From past experiences with shipping between the US -&gt; AUS if it\'s not here by the middle of next week I\'ll start to worry.\r\n\r\nYeah my sig is a pisstake of all the wankers that use these bloody huge and crappy graphic sigs.  Some are cool, most aren\'t.    :-( \r\n\r\nCheers man.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(11903,'6637afa7e6','hey cabo\r\n\r\nCould u put my link in ur links section?\r\nMy sites official launch 7:00 PM Christmass day');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11904,'8dece96b5a','not sure, i had my wife mail it. Ill have to ask her how she mailed it and when she mailed it.  i hope it aint lost too, my son would be pissed if i lost his only zz.'),(11025,'e062a214af','[quote:e062a214af=\"SuperFly\"]dood, I\'ve been talkin at ya like this was going to be your first experience with a mosfet car, but I saw in some thread that you already have one from crazydave. So you already know what it\'s all about, sorry for talking to ya like a noob. Hope you like the car.[/quote:e062a214af]nah man, I still kinda am a noob to it.\r\njust got the mosfet from crazydave in the last week.\r\ngot to drive for 2 charges and then I broke the fucker!\r\nso it was outta commission for a bit, got it fixed and now shes running again.\r\nstill have yet to give either car a good workout though so I\'m still learning what this thing can and can\'t do.\r\nwhat else is cool is both mosfet\'ed chassis are different.\r\nthe one you gave me, I can tell is going to be my pure muscle, power, built like a brick shithouse, flat out run your kids over, car.\r\nthe one crazydave did for me is going to be my all out, flyin low to the ground, straight shot strip car.\r\nso I can see me using both these cars more than any other chassis I have... so much for the 350 z booster! lol'),(11026,'41f4b34800','You Bet!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11856,'54831615ec','[quote:54831615ec=\"midget_man1387\"]got them yesterday! find any you want?\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks a bunch!!! peewee is so sweet![/quote:54831615ec]\r\n\r\n\r\nCool man, glad you like \'em.....I still can\'t get your picture to work....try going there and sending it to me( sometimes picture sites will let you invite someone to see your online photo albums) or if you can take a pic and send it as an attachment in an e-mail...send it to my webtv e-mail address: \r\n\r\nhavok74@webtv.net\r\n\r\nlater on.........'),(11857,'d65392f5ff','could i take both? and right now i\'m in the middle of another deal, and if that deal is a success then i don\'t need any of them. oh and do you have a Tomy Bit Char-g 1.6 or 2.2?\r\n\r\ni will offer you the ferarri 512BB super bit char-g body, a bunch of homies and some other knick knacks.'),(16890,'29599d0981','ROFL :-D'),(16894,'54e83e0323','Couple of things, literally Rolling on the floor laughing.  2ndly how old are you, you remind me of my 3 year old, so I\'ll give you 10 extra years at 13 w/ your insessive asking of the same question.  Finally, you are getting out of bits great, then maybe \"BIT\" pimps isn\'t the place for you any more.  Honestly try TinyRC.com that\'s a place that\'s perfect for what you are now into.  Bit pimps isn\'t really a place for people that collect Homies, that\'s just a side thing that\'s a long running joke.  \r\n\r\nAll in all man,  your posts were just getting on my nerves and that\'s why I exploded, I\'ll apologize for it tommorrow, but as for now it feels good. :-)'),(11851,'f8de424daf','i am in the hamilton region, and do you have any extra bits as in special editions you could trade me?\r\n\r\ni will get you your picture as soon as i can which will hopefully be tonight when my friend returns my digicam.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11852,'df141d79c6','Only extra bits I have at this moment is teh ultra man cars\r\n\r\n[url]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2193[/url]\r\n\r\n Thats not to say that I wont have anymore soon just not at this moment :)'),(11853,'ad1792928b','hey im sory i didint knw that was your skyline I didnt do it on purposesorry, I just randomly pick pics'),(11875,'8a9eee2c44','wanna sell one then'),(11876,'d528111c63','I just realised I don\'t see you around. Are you on vacation or some shit?\r\nI hope your aight man. :???:'),(11031,'065faedafb','Scott\r\n\r\nWanted to email you to ask you something and see if you would allow it prior to going any further.\r\n\r\nI am wanting to sell Extrememicros.com, the name, likeness, remaining stock, all suppliers, and everything that goes along with it.\r\n\r\nBasically, I was wanting to post a small post about looking to sell in the BST forum.  I know BST isn\'t for self biz promotion, but I really wouldn\'t be promoting the biz in a sense, just giving any members who might want to get into the game a shot.\r\n\r\nBasically, I would say the site, and all the goods, suppliers etc is for sale, then leave an email to contact me for further serious inquiries.\r\n\r\nIf you would rather I not, I totally respect that, and if you don\'t mind, I would appreciate that as well.\r\n\r\nAt any rate, the site is hosted for about 6 months still and the domain was bought for 1 year so it has about 6 months left as well.\r\n\r\nI have no clue what the biz is worth though, and wether or not you opt to let me post or not, I would appreciate your input on what a good starting point would be, as I know you are in the website game.\r\n\r\nWe have about 75-100 motors left, roughly 25 150mah cells and 10 210 cells, about 1500 single count worth or tubing left, labels, baggies, packaging stuff, ummm a bit of other stuff.  It doesn\'t sound like a lot, but the turn around is great on the profit.  \r\n\r\nThe site was a lot of work and the name is worth a decent amount I feel as it is fairly well known.\r\n\r\nJust let me know your thoughts.\r\n\r\nThanks again\r\nTodd'),(11032,'065faedafb','Scott\r\n\r\nWanted to email you to ask you something and see if you would allow it prior to going any further.\r\n\r\nI am wanting to sell Extrememicros.com, the name, likeness, remaining stock, all suppliers, and everything that goes along with it.\r\n\r\nBasically, I was wanting to post a small post about looking to sell in the BST forum.  I know BST isn\'t for self biz promotion, but I really wouldn\'t be promoting the biz in a sense, just giving any members who might want to get into the game a shot.\r\n\r\nBasically, I would say the site, and all the goods, suppliers etc is for sale, then leave an email to contact me for further serious inquiries.\r\n\r\nIf you would rather I not, I totally respect that, and if you don\'t mind, I would appreciate that as well.\r\n\r\nAt any rate, the site is hosted for about 6 months still and the domain was bought for 1 year so it has about 6 months left as well.\r\n\r\nI have no clue what the biz is worth though, and wether or not you opt to let me post or not, I would appreciate your input on what a good starting point would be, as I know you are in the website game.\r\n\r\nWe have about 75-100 motors left, roughly 25 150mah cells and 10 210 cells, about 1500 single count worth or tubing left, labels, baggies, packaging stuff, ummm a bit of other stuff.  It doesn\'t sound like a lot, but the turn around is great on the profit.  \r\n\r\nThe site was a lot of work and the name is worth a decent amount I feel as it is fairly well known.\r\n\r\nJust let me know your thoughts.\r\n\r\nThanks again\r\nTodd');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11033,'89693cb211','[quote:89693cb211=\"extrememicros\"]Scott\r\n\r\nWanted to email you to ask you something and see if you would allow it prior to going any further.\r\n\r\nI am wanting to sell Extrememicros.com, the name, likeness, remaining stock, all suppliers, and everything that goes along with it.\r\n\r\nBasically, I was wanting to post a small post about looking to sell in the BST forum.  I know BST isn\'t for self biz promotion, but I really wouldn\'t be promoting the biz in a sense, just giving any members who might want to get into the game a shot.\r\n\r\nBasically, I would say the site, and all the goods, suppliers etc is for sale, then leave an email to contact me for further serious inquiries.\r\n\r\nIf you would rather I not, I totally respect that, and if you don\'t mind, I would appreciate that as well.\r\n\r\nAt any rate, the site is hosted for about 6 months still and the domain was bought for 1 year so it has about 6 months left as well.\r\n\r\nI have no clue what the biz is worth though, and wether or not you opt to let me post or not, I would appreciate your input on what a good starting point would be, as I know you are in the website game.\r\n\r\nWe have about 75-100 motors left, roughly 25 150mah cells and 10 210 cells, about 1500 single count worth or tubing left, labels, baggies, packaging stuff, ummm a bit of other stuff.  It doesn\'t sound like a lot, but the turn around is great on the profit.  \r\n\r\nThe site was a lot of work and the name is worth a decent amount I feel as it is fairly well known.\r\n\r\nJust let me know your thoughts.\r\n\r\nThanks again\r\nTodd[/quote:89693cb211]Absolutely, you can make your post however, where-ever you wish. I\'m sorry to hear you\'re getting out, I loved your products and dealing with you was great. Hope all goes well with this and your future ventures.\r\n\r\nTo be honest, I don\'t have much input on the business stuff, it seems like being \"aquired\" so to speak might be the best route and sounds like that is your initial plans.\r\nMore than likely, if you went this route and got aquired, the entity aquiring you will be interested in only 2 - maybe 3 things: your customer base, your stock, and maybe your supplier connections.\r\nI\'m guessing, but I think this because the entity aquiring you will probably be better positioned and able to keep everything the same as things change behind the scenes. (much like how TinyRC aquired Bit Char-G Motors)\r\n\r\nI wish I had more information to give you, but I\'d just be guessing and spewing my opinions, doubtful it would help you much.\r\n\r\nGood luck Todd, I hope you get what you deserve - all the good stuff - you\'re a good guy.\r\n\r\nSide Note:\r\nI\'m a little freaked because just tonite I was thinking about contacting you about buying a few batteries and motors... and then you PM me  :shock: \r\nAgent Smith, is this you? Am I in the Matrix?  :lol:'),(11034,'c6703ecbe3','This guy on TRC discovered some stacked transistors on the bottom of the Zip Zap SE PCB. That would explain the increased performance in forwards. So I had to swap them for FETs, and it totally worked.\r\n\r\nSo now if it\'s cool with you I\'d like to use a couple more to see if stacking a third FET makes a difference, and to see if the one next to it improves reverse.\r\n\r\nHere\'s breakdown of what\'s left. After doing three of my cars, and Cabo\'s that leaves 37. (That\'s 4 per car, but I lost one in my carpet, and broke another ). I just used 2 more for the SE.\r\n\r\nI\'m going to be doing the full FET job on 3 of your cars (that\'s 12), and half FETing 2 of your cars. (that\'s 4 more) I\'m leaving the Micro Speed alone, and I\'m not sure about the Nakamichi.\r\n\r\nSo that\'ll leave 19 FETs after I do the batch of cars you sent me.\r\n\r\nJust wanted to keep you updated before I go using up too many of these things.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11037,'c40382e50c','you gonna order more fets in?\r\n\r\n  if so I would send some cars to get fetted up and even order some fets to try myself(prolly mess up but hey gotta try to learn)\r\n\r\n  Let me know and let me know a price if you offer this kind of service.\r\n\r\n  Thanks bro'),(11038,'8f6f82e32d',':lol: are you seriously running low already?\r\ndamn, you been a busy boy! lol\r\n\r\naight, I gots a few things to address here:\r\n- I was already planning on sending you another MS Pro to mosfet and anti-boost sometime in the near future (I\'ve gotta get it to and back from hogjowlz first though), now if you know the SE\'s are kosher I\'d probably like to send you one of those as well. Any of that do-able? even with my timeframe? (could be awhile)\r\n- do you have a thread started somewhere about you offering up fets? I\'ve talked up you doing my fet job in a few places, but not sure if you had a specific place in mind?'),(11039,'e1893153ad','[quote:e1893153ad=\"CaboWabo\"]:lol: are you seriously running low already?\r\ndamn, you been a busy boy! lol\r\n\r\naight, I gots a few things to address here:\r\n- I was already planning on sending you another MS Pro to mosfet and anti-boost sometime in the near future (I\'ve gotta get it to and back from hogjowlz first though), now if you know the SE\'s are kosher I\'d probably like to send you one of those as well. Any of that do-able? even with my timeframe? (could be awhile)\r\n- do you have a thread started somewhere about you offering up fets? I\'ve talked up you doing my fet job in a few places, but not sure if you had a specific place in mind?[/quote:e1893153ad]It\'s not so much that I\'m running low, as much as I\'ve got six cars of Havoks to do, and I\'m not sure how many more he\'s gonna want, so I don\'t wanna go using up all his FETs. I really gotta get some of my own.\r\n\r\nThat\'s why I haven\'t really gone around offering up my services, because I just have Havok\'s FETs right now, and while few people have expressed interest, no ones actually sent me money that I can buy some FETs with.\r\n\r\n...so anyways, you know in your case you get the deal. Just ask for return shipping, and either hook me up with some FETs, or donate to the \'cause so I can buy some.\r\n\r\nIf you want to score some you can get them at digikey.com and the part number is IRLML2502. They are 10 for 4.95, ther is a 5 dollar charge for orders under 25. That\'s why Havok ordered 55. Cost him 28 bucks after shipping.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35206,'a83cf40b57','Okay :-o Thanks'),(36848,'c824bcd809','do you have a prefernce on the willies coup color? do you have a fav color? I hope its not green like SG!  :lol: naw I can even paint it green. I will try the light thing on one of the bodies and send you pictures let me know if you like it and I will do it on all the bodies. (I will experiment on the mini cooper) will see what looks best.'),(11749,'95bfbf4ce3','al ready did, $1 each set, 100 sets min of same style/size. I never said anymore aboit it cause i fig\'ed that was overboard since you couldnt mix n match.'),(11750,'6a25fb8180','do yo have any  \r\n\r\nWT 05\r\nBBS 4-loch\r\nØ 9.0 mm \r\n\r\nleft?'),(11046,'6427f6fc07','Thse are my only doubles I have right now(well the 4 series 7 are gone) but I do pick some up every couple days when i hit TRU.\r\n\r\n  You can always view my need list here\r\n\r\n[url]www3.sympatico.ca/voodoomafia[/url]\r\n\r\n as for the van well if its alot of work then its ok LOL I am not to good with the body mods I might try and make one from an open deck or something.\r\n\r\n  Are you looking for series 7 homies(palermos)?  if so let me know &amp; let me know if you have any as I might have 1 set left.'),(11748,'de0c849c04','I wonder if the guy made it back from vacation... I\'m starting to make my own alloys, but need the hubs to make em pretty. Can you contact them to see if they can be bought seperately? \r\n\r\nThanks a million man..     Let me know.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11049,'c6703ecbe3','This guy on TRC discovered some stacked transistors on the bottom of the Zip Zap SE PCB. That would explain the increased performance in forwards. So I had to swap them for FETs, and it totally worked.\r\n\r\nSo now if it\'s cool with you I\'d like to use a couple more to see if stacking a third FET makes a difference, and to see if the one next to it improves reverse.\r\n\r\nHere\'s breakdown of what\'s left. After doing three of my cars, and Cabo\'s that leaves 37. (That\'s 4 per car, but I lost one in my carpet, and broke another ). I just used 2 more for the SE.\r\n\r\nI\'m going to be doing the full FET job on 3 of your cars (that\'s 12), and half FETing 2 of your cars. (that\'s 4 more) I\'m leaving the Micro Speed alone, and I\'m not sure about the Nakamichi.\r\n\r\nSo that\'ll leave 19 FETs after I do the batch of cars you sent me.\r\n\r\nJust wanted to keep you updated before I go using up too many of these things.'),(11050,'96482f8740','[quote:96482f8740=\"Havok\"]I sent the package out today.. [b:96482f8740] to R.C.I.[/b:96482f8740]....a few things though...I didn\'t think about it until after I mailed it....how many pens do you need for 3 sets of alloys?....I sent 10..then realized you might need 12....on the plus side...I sent some super glue too...you can keep that :grin: \r\n\r\nAs far as which rims I sent\r\n\r\nhttp://www.scala43.com/scala43/rad.htm\r\n\r\nI think they were....43, 74 &amp; 79....I can\'t remember which ones I sent you....damn weed :smoking:\r\n\r\nI think your\'s were the 38\'s...either way....I know 74 &amp; 79...confused on 38 or 43.. :lol:\r\n\r\nlemme know yo... 8-)[/quote:96482f8740]Yep, you\'re right, 4x3=12. I supppose I\'ll have to grab a couple more. That\'s ok, I\'ll need grab some spares to account for those boogers flyin\' across the room, and getting smashed by vise grips. ;)\r\n\r\nYeah the ones I got were the 38s, so yours must be the 43s...\r\n\r\nI\'ll tell ya something about that short term memory loss, it\'s only short term, it\'ll all come back to ya, someday. My friends are mind boggled how I can\'t remember what happened 5min. ago, but I remember last month in picture perfect detail.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11051,'27b2bcb3b4','I don\'t have any of the series 7 (Palmeros)....I can\'t find them around here....but that doesn\'t suprise me...most of the places that do have Homies are just now getting series 6....so anything you want to send  would be awesome...or if you\'re selling them...lemme know.. 8-)\r\n\r\nI\'ll let you know if I come across anything else like the van...I\'m always looking for new stuff....and for as much trouble that my Shaggin Wagon was...I should have converted a BB too...'),(11052,'62477e79fb','Well if you are interested send me your addy I will send you a set of seeries 7.\r\n\r\n  With the homies you have already send and I am sure you will come accross stuff I need in the future its all good.\r\n\r\n  Plus you are one of the few guys out there that just give there doubles away.  So its all good :)\r\n\r\nBTW we have shit for homies around here I have to order all mive from the US.  I order lots of them so I can make sets up and have tradein bate for the sets that I missed or bit stuff.\r\n\r\n  LOL we have 1 machine in my city that has homies and it says series 5 whitch I thought GREAT i need almost all of them well I have yet to get a series 5 from it LOL.'),(11053,'62477e79fb','Well if you are interested send me your addy I will send you a set of seeries 7.\r\n\r\n  With the homies you have already send and I am sure you will come accross stuff I need in the future its all good.\r\n\r\n  Plus you are one of the few guys out there that just give there doubles away.  So its all good :)\r\n\r\nBTW we have shit for homies around here I have to order all mive from the US.  I order lots of them so I can make sets up and have tradein bate for the sets that I missed or bit stuff.\r\n\r\n  LOL we have 1 machine in my city that has homies and it says series 5 whitch I thought GREAT i need almost all of them well I have yet to get a series 5 from it LOL.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11054,'e1893153ad','[quote:e1893153ad=\"CaboWabo\"]:lol: are you seriously running low already?\r\ndamn, you been a busy boy! lol\r\n\r\naight, I gots a few things to address here:\r\n- I was already planning on sending you another MS Pro to mosfet and anti-boost sometime in the near future (I\'ve gotta get it to and back from hogjowlz first though), now if you know the SE\'s are kosher I\'d probably like to send you one of those as well. Any of that do-able? even with my timeframe? (could be awhile)\r\n- do you have a thread started somewhere about you offering up fets? I\'ve talked up you doing my fet job in a few places, but not sure if you had a specific place in mind?[/quote:e1893153ad]It\'s not so much that I\'m running low, as much as I\'ve got six cars of Havoks to do, and I\'m not sure how many more he\'s gonna want, so I don\'t wanna go using up all his FETs. I really gotta get some of my own.\r\n\r\nThat\'s why I haven\'t really gone around offering up my services, because I just have Havok\'s FETs right now, and while few people have expressed interest, no ones actually sent me money that I can buy some FETs with.\r\n\r\n...so anyways, you know in your case you get the deal. Just ask for return shipping, and either hook me up with some FETs, or donate to the \'cause so I can buy some.\r\n\r\nIf you want to score some you can get them at digikey.com and the part number is IRLML2502. They are 10 for 4.95, ther is a 5 dollar charge for orders under 25. That\'s why Havok ordered 55. Cost him 28 bucks after shipping.\r\n\r\nDave'),(12010,'c4c1c1aa9e','im actually in the philippines, and yes we do have BCG stuff here at retail...tell me what you want and ill tell ya if its available here. :eek:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12987,'1f70e076b0','I will mail them on friday. Weird thing with the email. Seems I am not getting any from bitpimps as well. If you have a long letter to send, try my hotmail, curious if that works.'),(12012,'76e6f4dc2d','[quote:76e6f4dc2d=\"Yagbols\"]im actually in the philippines, and yes we do have BCG stuff here at retail...tell me what you want and ill tell ya if its available here. :eek:[/quote:76e6f4dc2d]\r\nSorry man, I didn\'t mean to get the two countries mixed up.  I\'m looking for the Fairlady 350Z booster set on 57Mhz.  I know they are hard to comebuy but I\'m willing to trade the same stuff as my ZZ SE thread in \"looking to score\"  If you sent me the booster and a chassis of your own I\'m willing to put headlights, mosfet and all other performance mods on it and send you the chassis back.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(11113,'89693cb211','[quote:89693cb211=\"extrememicros\"]Scott\r\n\r\nWanted to email you to ask you something and see if you would allow it prior to going any further.\r\n\r\nI am wanting to sell Extrememicros.com, the name, likeness, remaining stock, all suppliers, and everything that goes along with it.\r\n\r\nBasically, I was wanting to post a small post about looking to sell in the BST forum.  I know BST isn\'t for self biz promotion, but I really wouldn\'t be promoting the biz in a sense, just giving any members who might want to get into the game a shot.\r\n\r\nBasically, I would say the site, and all the goods, suppliers etc is for sale, then leave an email to contact me for further serious inquiries.\r\n\r\nIf you would rather I not, I totally respect that, and if you don\'t mind, I would appreciate that as well.\r\n\r\nAt any rate, the site is hosted for about 6 months still and the domain was bought for 1 year so it has about 6 months left as well.\r\n\r\nI have no clue what the biz is worth though, and wether or not you opt to let me post or not, I would appreciate your input on what a good starting point would be, as I know you are in the website game.\r\n\r\nWe have about 75-100 motors left, roughly 25 150mah cells and 10 210 cells, about 1500 single count worth or tubing left, labels, baggies, packaging stuff, ummm a bit of other stuff.  It doesn\'t sound like a lot, but the turn around is great on the profit.  \r\n\r\nThe site was a lot of work and the name is worth a decent amount I feel as it is fairly well known.\r\n\r\nJust let me know your thoughts.\r\n\r\nThanks again\r\nTodd[/quote:89693cb211]Absolutely, you can make your post however, where-ever you wish. I\'m sorry to hear you\'re getting out, I loved your products and dealing with you was great. Hope all goes well with this and your future ventures.\r\n\r\nTo be honest, I don\'t have much input on the business stuff, it seems like being \"aquired\" so to speak might be the best route and sounds like that is your initial plans.\r\nMore than likely, if you went this route and got aquired, the entity aquiring you will be interested in only 2 - maybe 3 things: your customer base, your stock, and maybe your supplier connections.\r\nI\'m guessing, but I think this because the entity aquiring you will probably be better positioned and able to keep everything the same as things change behind the scenes. (much like how TinyRC aquired Bit Char-G Motors)\r\n\r\nI wish I had more information to give you, but I\'d just be guessing and spewing my opinions, doubtful it would help you much.\r\n\r\nGood luck Todd, I hope you get what you deserve - all the good stuff - you\'re a good guy.\r\n\r\nSide Note:\r\nI\'m a little freaked because just tonite I was thinking about contacting you about buying a few batteries and motors... and then you PM me  :shock: \r\nAgent Smith, is this you? Am I in the Matrix?  :lol:'),(11056,'d1ca195666','See...I knew you were a pimp.. :cool:\r\n\r\nThank alot man...I really appreciate the hook-up...\r\n\r\nYou should get a list together and let me know which Homies you still need...I have 6 machines...including a Homie Clown machine with the series 1 clowns in it....\r\n\r\nhere\'s my address:\r\n\r\nWayne Simard\r\n1422 West Monon Drive\r\nBloomington, IN 47403-3020\r\n\r\nit will be on the package I just sent you too...\r\nthanks again man....and watch for future hookups 8-)\r\n\r\np.s.....if you need any bodies...or anything else, like those cars at biglots...or anything you see people talking about...I\'ll hook it up if I can get it.....\r\n\r\npeace.....');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11057,'d1ca195666','See...I knew you were a pimp.. :cool:\r\n\r\nThank alot man...I really appreciate the hook-up...\r\n\r\nYou should get a list together and let me know which Homies you still need...I have 6 machines...including a Homie Clown machine with the series 1 clowns in it....\r\n\r\nhere\'s my address:\r\n\r\nWayne Simard\r\n1422 West Monon Drive\r\nBloomington, IN 47403-3020\r\n\r\nit will be on the package I just sent you too...\r\nthanks again man....and watch for future hookups 8-)\r\n\r\np.s.....if you need any bodies...or anything else, like those cars at biglots...or anything you see people talking about...I\'ll hook it up if I can get it.....\r\n\r\npeace.....'),(11849,'c7f3ac0f89','I am also in Ontario :)\r\n\r\n  and by case I got a full case of 12 bits.\r\n\r\n  I collect bits and rc cars and I like to have 2 of every set (well the hero/special sets).  I also had some friends that wanted this set so we just pitched in and bought a case.\r\n\r\n  I did the same with teh Mach 5 cars, Automodellista cars and the Ultraman cars.\r\n\r\n  I also do alot of ordering from Toy east for motors and different stuff.\r\n\r\n  I am not sure what part of Ontario you are from (I am near the falls) but we have nothing here.  Nothing in our hobby shop and the walmarts just have the clones that are to much $$.'),(11846,'3351e5beb2','http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewforum.php?f=32');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11847,'3351e5beb2','http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewforum.php?f=32'),(16885,'2f5d611171','Hey Man I was just seeing if You got the pictures I sent You, and I also wanted to see If You wanted to dod any trading? Did the Pictures I sent work? write back. thanks :cool:'),(11841,'df5c26da84','Well I wanted the AE body but thats ok I just bought a case of the Initial D cars so I really dont need it anymore I would have just painted it up anyway.\r\n\r\n  As for the other stuff do you have pics?'),(11843,'6b1ee3a949','would it be ok if i wanted the nine milli nstead of the 8.3?'),(11844,'767ff3ab52','when you say you bought a case, how many bits did you get? and i will get you a pic later today, oh and where do you live in canada, cause i live in ontario.'),(11845,'c7f3ac0f89','I am also in Ontario :)\r\n\r\n  and by case I got a full case of 12 bits.\r\n\r\n  I collect bits and rc cars and I like to have 2 of every set (well the hero/special sets).  I also had some friends that wanted this set so we just pitched in and bought a case.\r\n\r\n  I did the same with teh Mach 5 cars, Automodellista cars and the Ultraman cars.\r\n\r\n  I also do alot of ordering from Toy east for motors and different stuff.\r\n\r\n  I am not sure what part of Ontario you are from (I am near the falls) but we have nothing here.  Nothing in our hobby shop and the walmarts just have the clones that are to much $$.'),(12283,'6ec3fa26e7','[quote:6ec3fa26e7=\"VooDooMafia\"]here are some quotes from Ausmicro\r\n\r\n[quote:6ec3fa26e7]Yo what did you have to do to get it fully fetted? you got a tut or pics of what needed to be done?[/quote:6ec3fa26e7]\r\n\r\n\r\nMicro amps\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:6ec3fa26e7]What I am going to do is offer my services to do this mod for people, same as when I was doing FET mods to BCGs and standard ZZs and clones. (and yes I am still doing these mods as well if you want one done, email me or check my website)\r\nI am still charging US$20 for a FET mod, you send the car to me, I mod it, test it, and send it straight back. It really does kick arse once it is modded. Just like a fet modded BCG, only a little heavier. Get into it.\r\nuA\r\nTitaniuMonkey, these cars sell for US$25 in the States (plus postage) and the mods I have been doing have always been US$20. [/quote:6ec3fa26e7][/quote:6ec3fa26e7]That bastard, I feel like he\'s taunting me, makes me even more determined to figure it out.\r\n :lol: \r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12029,'e5e11e8dd2','[quote:e5e11e8dd2=\"ph2t\"][quote:e5e11e8dd2=\"Yagbols\"][quote:e5e11e8dd2]Sorry man, I didn\'t mean to get the two countries mixed up.  I\'m looking for the Fairlady 350Z booster set on 57Mhz.  I know they are hard to comebuy but I\'m willing to trade the same stuff as my ZZ SE thread in \"looking to score\"  If you sent me the booster and a chassis of your own I\'m willing to put headlights, mosfet and all other performance mods on it and send you the chassis back.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:e5e11e8dd2]\r\n\r\ncool, now looking for a 350z is the hard part :eek:  I have one here its opened/used but still in stock form.  But ill look around for a new one. And if i want to get one of our kitt lights what do i add to the package?[/quote:e5e11e8dd2]\r\n\r\nWhat\'s the condition man?  Is it good condition?  If it is I\'m happy to take it :)   As for the Knight Rider lights I\'m happy to make them for you.   What I can do is that you send me one of your chassis and I\'ll add the circuit board to it.   The LED board that has the actual lights will be free-standing and you can mod a shell to suit no sweats.   What else do you have to trade?\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:e5e11e8dd2]\r\n\r\nI\'ll go over my stuff later tonite and see what i can trade.  The condition is good.  So do i just send you 1 chassis to modify with all the lights and stuff or do I send 2?'),(11062,'f239cb5db1','Well I am not sure on my soldering skills as far as fets.\r\n\r\n  I was thinking if I can get sme then cool I will order some LXX as they are cheap and  try it out.  Worst comes to worst I would end up with 4 bodies 2 cells, gears, heatsinks, motors and all teh other stuff I can rip from them for $13.00\r\n\r\n  But there is a few cars I have I would really like to see mosfetted the right way hehe.\r\n\r\n  I dont mind paying upfront for stuff.  Now that $8.00 per car is a nice deal for sure :)\r\n\r\n  What I can do is this.\r\n\r\n  I will send out some cash(unless you take paypal) for you to order some fets in.  I was thinking I have 2 or 3 cars right now I would like to get fetted up and prolly a few more in the future once the SE and stuff arrives.  I would also like to get some fets myself to try it on some cheapo cars.  \r\n\r\n  So if you let me know how much you want me to send for say 3 cars and 2 sets of fets I will send it out ASAP to yea so you can order some fets in.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Thanks\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11744,'767ee69d6a','sorry to keep botherin you but theres 2 problems... 1 the link you gave me to post the walls on dont work ( at least not 4 me) and how do I join that user group you told me about'),(29234,'57b240372f','Well, im workin on a budget right now which i think is probably way below what you would want for that car. I\'m gonna be doing my upgradin a little at a time ( prolly every 2 weeks ) but with my post i wanted to know ahead of time what i wanted/needed...... You tell me a price for it and ill tell you if i can afford it, prolly not tho.'),(11746,'245f93fedd','[quote:245f93fedd=\"payaso\"]How big was the envelope they were in? I\'m hoping I didn\'t throw them away with some of the junk mail...  You know how that goes...lol \r\n\r\nThanks Dave.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:245f93fedd]Don\'t worry you didn\'t throw them away. I just called my wife to see if she ever mailed it, and she found it in her purse.\r\n\r\nSorry about this. My wife refuses to keep stamps and envelopes around, because she can mail stuff from her work. So I rely on her to mail stuff. I\'m irritated she forgot about it, but what can I do, she\'s my wife.\r\n\r\nI\'m going to call her at work tomorrow to remind her. So I\'ll make sure it get\'s out.\r\n\r\nAgain, I am sorry, I feel ridiculous that it\'s gotton to this point, over a little piece of masking tape! Maybe if I had put it in a big box she wouldn\'t have forgot about it. I don\'t know anymore.\r\n\r\nDave'),(11064,'76398dcc26','[quote:76398dcc26=\"crazydave\"]It\'s not so much that I\'m running low, as much as I\'ve got six cars of Havoks to do, and I\'m not sure how many more he\'s gonna want, so I don\'t wanna go using up all his FETs. I really gotta get some of my own.\r\n\r\nThat\'s why I haven\'t really gone around offering up my services, because I just have Havok\'s FETs right now, and while few people have expressed interest, no ones actually sent me money that I can buy some FETs with.\r\n\r\n...so anyways, you know in your case you get the deal. Just ask for return shipping, and either hook me up with some FETs, or donate to the \'cause so I can buy some.\r\n\r\nIf you want to score some you can get them at digikey.com and the part number is IRLML2502. They are 10 for 4.95, ther is a 5 dollar charge for orders under 25. That\'s why Havok ordered 55. Cost him 28 bucks after shipping.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:76398dcc26]cool man, thanks for the heads up.\r\nwell since I\'ve gotta wait a bit, that\'ll give me time to figure out how best to do this.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11065,'a527863f85','[quote:a527863f85=\"CaboWabo\"]cool man, thanks for the heads up.\r\nwell since I\'ve gotta wait a bit, that\'ll give me time to figure out how best to do this.[/quote:a527863f85]Actually I was just over excited last night. VDM just PMed me, and is gonna send me some money to do a few of his cars, and DT is suppose to be ordering FETs for me to do his cars, so really I should be covered on FETs by the time you want your stuff done.\r\n\r\n...but can you blame me for being excited? I have the first FET modded SE anywhere. Wanna race? :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(11066,'c048508947','[quote:c048508947=\"VooDooMafia\"]Well I am not sure on my soldering skills as far as fets.\r\n\r\n  I was thinking if I can get sme then cool I will order some LXX as they are cheap and  try it out.  Worst comes to worst I would end up with 4 bodies 2 cells, gears, heatsinks, motors and all teh other stuff I can rip from them for $13.00\r\n\r\n  But there is a few cars I have I would really like to see mosfetted the right way hehe.\r\n\r\n  I dont mind paying upfront for stuff.  Now that $8.00 per car is a nice deal for sure :)\r\n\r\n  What I can do is this.\r\n\r\n  I will send out some cash(unless you take paypal) for you to order some fets in.  I was thinking I have 2 or 3 cars right now I would like to get fetted up and prolly a few more in the future once the SE and stuff arrives.  I would also like to get some fets myself to try it on some cheapo cars.  \r\n\r\n  So if you let me know how much you want me to send for say 3 cars and 2 sets of fets I will send it out ASAP to yea so you can order some fets in.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Thanks\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:c048508947]Well the FETs aren\'t too expensive, so we\'ll just say an even 25+shipping for 3 cars, and 2 spare sets of FETs. I\'ll tell you what, micro_amps charges 20 bucks per car, but I just can\'t bring myself to charge that much.\r\n\r\nI do have paypal. You can make payments to my davesmoejoe@yahoo.com email.\r\n\r\nyeah, if you pay by paypal, I should get the mosfets by the time I get your cars, and be able to get them right back out.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you need my address again.\r\n\r\nDave'),(11111,'34c8187e3c','I was worried about running low on FETs \'cause I know you said you have a few more cars you want done, but it\'s no prob now.\r\n\r\nVooDoomafia just paid me to do three of his cars, so I\'m gonna take that money to order another batch of FETs.\r\n\r\nSo disregard my last PM, I\'ll have FETs to spare. :-D \r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12013,'76e6f4dc2d','[quote:76e6f4dc2d=\"Yagbols\"]im actually in the philippines, and yes we do have BCG stuff here at retail...tell me what you want and ill tell ya if its available here. :eek:[/quote:76e6f4dc2d]\r\nSorry man, I didn\'t mean to get the two countries mixed up.  I\'m looking for the Fairlady 350Z booster set on 57Mhz.  I know they are hard to comebuy but I\'m willing to trade the same stuff as my ZZ SE thread in \"looking to score\"  If you sent me the booster and a chassis of your own I\'m willing to put headlights, mosfet and all other performance mods on it and send you the chassis back.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(11068,'a527863f85','[quote:a527863f85=\"CaboWabo\"]cool man, thanks for the heads up.\r\nwell since I\'ve gotta wait a bit, that\'ll give me time to figure out how best to do this.[/quote:a527863f85]Actually I was just over excited last night. VDM just PMed me, and is gonna send me some money to do a few of his cars, and DT is suppose to be ordering FETs for me to do his cars, so really I should be covered on FETs by the time you want your stuff done.\r\n\r\n...but can you blame me for being excited? I have the first FET modded SE anywhere. Wanna race? :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(11108,'34c8187e3c','I was worried about running low on FETs \'cause I know you said you have a few more cars you want done, but it\'s no prob now.\r\n\r\nVooDoomafia just paid me to do three of his cars, so I\'m gonna take that money to order another batch of FETs.\r\n\r\nSo disregard my last PM, I\'ll have FETs to spare. :-D \r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11109,'','can you make an american police car and how much would i have to pay'),(11110,'7ef7bc5855','[quote:7ef7bc5855=\"VooDooMafia\"]ok dude I paypaled the chicken (cash) over to ya\r\n\r\n  I will prolly send the cars on monday or tuesday gonna get some good races in with them before you turnem into speed machines lol.[/quote:7ef7bc5855]Yep got the cash. I\'ll order the FETs on monday.\r\n\r\nYeah better get a good idea of what your cars are like now, because they\'re gonna be alot faster when you get them back. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(11070,'4388650abc','those series 7 were gone 2 minutes after posting them.\r\n\r\n [size=18:4388650abc]BUT[/size:4388650abc]\r\n\r\n  I do have 1 complete set that is extra that I was going to be posting for sale or trade. If you are interested let me know.\r\n\r\nPS.the Kit Cars came today'),(11236,'c2bf1068c8','thanks for the info I think it looks like I will just add one to my next toyeast order.\r\n\r\nBTW let me know if you decide to just move the tanks you have and there roms.\r\n\r\n  Have you ordered any of the new ones?  I just ordered a few hope to get them soon :)'),(11072,'ad95029765','What do you want for the complete set?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11073,'96a5174329','Yea I know micro amps charges $20.00 per car thats who did my first one lol.\r\n\r\n  I got the automodellista set from him plus single stack fet and return shipping was $50.00USD:(\r\n\r\n  OK I will paypal some $$ over to yea and its conna come from my Biz account so the e-mail will be diff.  It will come from \"babastoybox@cogeco.ca\"\r\n\r\n  couple things;  What do you need me to mail with the cars?(just chassies, controllers?)\r\n\r\n  How much should I add to that price for return shipping?\r\n\r\n  And is it ok if I just send 2 cars for now then the third later?  I am just waiting for my SE\'s to show up in the next few weeks.\r\n\r\n  I just have you addy in my inbox.  Man I think you live on the longest street in the world LOL'),(11741,'12f1a4c0ed','How big was the envelope they were in? I\'m hoping I didn\'t throw them away with some of the junk mail...  You know how that goes...lol \r\n\r\nThanks Dave.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(11742,'245f93fedd','[quote:245f93fedd=\"payaso\"]How big was the envelope they were in? I\'m hoping I didn\'t throw them away with some of the junk mail...  You know how that goes...lol \r\n\r\nThanks Dave.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:245f93fedd]Don\'t worry you didn\'t throw them away. I just called my wife to see if she ever mailed it, and she found it in her purse.\r\n\r\nSorry about this. My wife refuses to keep stamps and envelopes around, because she can mail stuff from her work. So I rely on her to mail stuff. I\'m irritated she forgot about it, but what can I do, she\'s my wife.\r\n\r\nI\'m going to call her at work tomorrow to remind her. So I\'ll make sure it get\'s out.\r\n\r\nAgain, I am sorry, I feel ridiculous that it\'s gotton to this point, over a little piece of masking tape! Maybe if I had put it in a big box she wouldn\'t have forgot about it. I don\'t know anymore.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11743,'f81423c7be','Your package is at my wife\'s work right now, so I\'ll be able to get everything finished up this weekend.\r\n\r\nMy Biglots finally got Microspeed cars in. I picked one up, and the transistors have markings on them so I can figure it out now, after I already swapped the PCB in your Microspeed with a Thunder Charger so I could FET yours. \r\n\r\nI just thought that was ironic.\r\n\r\nDave'),(11075,'30eb82c054','[quote:30eb82c054=\"crazydave\"][quote:30eb82c054=\"CaboWabo\"]cool man, thanks for the heads up.\r\nwell since I\'ve gotta wait a bit, that\'ll give me time to figure out how best to do this.[/quote:30eb82c054]Actually I was just over excited last night. VDM just PMed me, and is gonna send me some money to do a few of his cars, and DT is suppose to be ordering FETs for me to do his cars, so really I should be covered on FETs by the time you want your stuff done.\r\n\r\n...but can you blame me for being excited? I have the first FET modded SE anywhere. Wanna race? :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:30eb82c054]hell no I can\'t blame ya! lol\r\nI\'d be all over that like white on rice on a paper plate in a snow storm lol\r\nyou\'s definitaly the first with mosfet SE\'s!'),(11076,'74d9bce875','[quote:74d9bce875=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea I know micro amps charges $20.00 per car thats who did my first one lol.\r\n\r\n  I got the automodellista set from him plus single stack fet and return shipping was $50.00USD:(\r\n\r\n  OK I will paypal some $$ over to yea and its conna come from my Biz account so the e-mail will be diff.  It will come from \"babastoybox@cogeco.ca\"\r\n\r\n  couple things;  What do you need me to mail with the cars?(just chassies, controllers?)\r\n\r\n  How much should I add to that price for return shipping?\r\n\r\n  And is it ok if I just send 2 cars for now then the third later?  I am just waiting for my SE\'s to show up in the next few weeks.\r\n\r\n  I just have you addy in my inbox.  Man I think you live on the longest street in the world LOL[/quote:74d9bce875]I\'m not sure what return shipping will be. Probably at least 4-5 bucks, you think?\r\n\r\nJust need the car and the controller. Really if it\'s like a 27 or 49mhz microsizer, or zip zap I don\'t need the controller either. That\'s cool if you want to sent one later.\r\n\r\nYeah that is a long street name. Funny thing is it runs right through the middle of town, and there really is a school for Indians on it.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11079,'a0bbcf9be5','OK dude I sent out your series 7 set :)  you should get it in like 4-5 days(i hope).\r\n\r\n  If you ever have extra stuff to sell just let me know I am always looking for bodies cheap clones and shit like that.\r\n\r\n  Around here we have clones at walmart for $20.00 canadian(about $14-16USD) but we get no Bits, ZZ\'s, MZ\'s ot digi Q\'s.\r\n\r\n  If I want anyof that I have to drive few hours and pay up the nose for that shit.\r\n\r\n  If you ever come accross digi q stuff let me know I will buy that up in a heart beat lol.\r\n\r\n Pete'),(11080,'3e4bd0260b','Just to keep you informed, I sent those 4 homies out today so you should have them in 4-5 days :)'),(11082,'da78175876','E\r\n\r\nI have not received the rims yet.  How did you send them?\r\n\r\nHudken :('),(11083,'53f9ce473d','sent them regular mail about 3-4 days ago you should get them by tomorrow if not monday. Sorry for any delays.'),(11084,'3e4bd0260b','Just to keep you informed, I sent those 4 homies out today so you should have them in 4-5 days :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11739,'cc5c5fb49b','Damn Brotha, I Can\'t Afford That'),(11086,'6753d9dcd5','Package went out today :)  should get it in 4-5 days I hope'),(11087,'4c60e8143b','Thanx Pimp,\r\n\r\nMicro_Amps took down the Tuit cause he\'s charging $20 ea for the mod.  Can\'t have prospective customers learning now can he ???\r\n\r\n$10.00 is cool, is that per car?  I have a few I would like modded.\r\nYou doing this for me, I would like to offer to do some body modding for you! I can mod the body and prime it for you to paint &amp; detail, or paint.  I know you\'d probably want to paint it yourself but we can work out the details for that after we work out the details for the FETs.\r\n\r\nThat is $10.00 US right?'),(11090,'bc3244b9b0','I sent out the chassis a few hours ago man. It occured to me afterwards though that I sent ya a 49mhz and don\'t know if you got a 49mhz controller to test with. :???:'),(13209,'4bb2033bce','[quote:4bb2033bce=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:4bb2033bce=\"VooDooMafia\"]I got the RX7 today thanks\r\n\r\nIt look way better in person now I just need to figure out what chassie I will put it on  :???: \r\n\r\n  Prolly better to just buy a new chassie to put it on.\r\n\r\n  Also thanks for the stickers :) you put those on before you clearcoat?  Keep an eye on some of the new work it will be sportin them fo sho .[/quote:4bb2033bce]cool man, glad it arrived safely.\r\n\r\nyea, that\'s one thing I\'ve come to realize, pictures just don\'t do the cars justice, like with your green flames - I know that thing has got to look hot.\r\n\r\nyea, put the decals on before clear coats.\r\n\r\nI\'m still waiting on the pullback, hopefully any day now, I\'ll let ya know when it comes in.[/quote:4bb2033bce]\r\n\r\n  Yea please let me know when you get it :)  also are they water slides?\r\n\r\n  I will take a pic of the RX7 with my other digi cam (canon powershot pro70) and see what kind of pics I can get of it and post them.\r\n\r\n  Yep now I got one of your paint jobs, CD\'s on the way now I need one from payaso  :???:'),(34193,'9572394f70','HEY DUDE!!!!!\r\nHow\'s it goin\'?\r\n\r\nI left ya a funny suprise message at E-Bay!  :lol:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11840,'df5c26da84','Well I wanted the AE body but thats ok I just bought a case of the Initial D cars so I really dont need it anymore I would have just painted it up anyway.\r\n\r\n  As for the other stuff do you have pics?'),(11093,'af1d62f2d4','OK I will paypal some cash over today for you.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Yea we get alot of calls from customers on that street.'),(11891,'c8cbe97f70','u should have received the money the other guys who i did at the same day all have got theres...'),(29223,'3213298e3c','[quote:3213298e3c=\"ezenterprises\"]checked those bearings on ebay..... what about those \"wide\" ones? they offer any advantages or better to stick with normal ones?[/quote:3213298e3c]\r\n\r\nThe package he sells with the wide bearings would be good.  I\'ve never used them, but they do eliminate some of the slop in the wheels from what I\'ve read about and learned.  Especially the front.  You could also use shims, AKA, washers.'),(11894,'708bcb7964','What would you consider in trades?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11896,'3f79fc43cf','complete working cars, custom bodies etcetc'),(11898,'a4dd2d3e1e','in tinyrc i read a post about the lamborghini murcie, i was wondering if you had any lamborghini murcie pullbacks i could buy off you.'),(11899,'a4dd2d3e1e','in tinyrc i read a post about the lamborghini murcie, i was wondering if you had any lamborghini murcie pullbacks i could buy off you.'),(11900,'53d814d81c','No, just they\'re on sale now, thats it. I want but don\'t have them.'),(11901,'6637afa7e6','hey cabo\r\n\r\nCould u put my link in ur links section?\r\nMy sites official launch 7:00 PM Christmass day'),(11902,'53d814d81c','No, just they\'re on sale now, thats it. I want but don\'t have them.'),(11095,'4d598d1aaa','[quote:4d598d1aaa=\"VooDooMafia\"]Just to keep you informed, I sent those 4 homies out today so you should have them in 4-5 days :)[/quote:4d598d1aaa]whoa 4???\r\nI thought we were only trading 3?\r\nI sent yours off this AM as well.\r\nlemme know if 4 was a typo or if I owe ya another homie.'),(11096,'35f72a7388','Yea I sent ya 4 for your 3 that I needed.\r\n\r\n  Its all good I am sure sometime down the road you would do the same.\r\n\r\n  To me they are just extras so if they make a good addition to your collection then thats were they are gonna go.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11097,'77ab4756b1','Same here bro, I mailed the zip out a few hours ago they told me the same, 4-5 days depending on customs.'),(11098,'5de66fb417','[quote:5de66fb417=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:5de66fb417=\"ph2t\"]Just got a PM from ez apologising for the late send out, so I should be gettin\' those babies soon.\r\n\r\nI also expect your pkg any day now, hopefully it will come before the w/e so I have the time then to mod.\r\n\r\nSo, to confirm.  I\'ll mosfet mod the pcb, drivetrain and steering.  Also add a DIP Switch mod and add led headlights.   What colour you want? blue or white?\r\n\r\nSo you want me to add one of ph2t\'s special guitar string antennas?  I hear his antennas rock  :smile: \r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:5de66fb417]I might have to join the band-wagon here, you guys and your sigs are cracking me up! lol\r\n\r\nI was hoping you\'d get it before the weekend too\r\nI\'ll keep my fingers crossed. :grin: \r\n\r\nyea man, you got it right, mosfet pcb, switch and headlights.\r\nif you got blue, that\'d be the schizz, but I could do either or.\r\n\r\nand actually, yea - I\'d love your signature antenna![/quote:5de66fb417]\r\n\r\nHey dude, got the package, all is cool.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/dscf0015.jpg\r\n\r\nI like those 350z bodies, yum!\r\n\r\ntime to get to work!\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(11100,'a0bbcf9be5','OK dude I sent out your series 7 set :)  you should get it in like 4-5 days(i hope).\r\n\r\n  If you ever have extra stuff to sell just let me know I am always looking for bodies cheap clones and shit like that.\r\n\r\n  Around here we have clones at walmart for $20.00 canadian(about $14-16USD) but we get no Bits, ZZ\'s, MZ\'s ot digi Q\'s.\r\n\r\n  If I want anyof that I have to drive few hours and pay up the nose for that shit.\r\n\r\n  If you ever come accross digi q stuff let me know I will buy that up in a heart beat lol.\r\n\r\n Pete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32820,'16697b0f11','exactly. I pointed out that in one thread, in the coarse of 2 minutes, he posted twice and managed to break all 4 rules godfather outlined in his post \"Forum Rules\".\r\n\r\nOf coarse xmod_supra deleted it. lol. I don\'t care anymore. I\'m not going back to xmodsforum. That place is great for serious newbies to ask silly questions and get other not-quite-as-newbie newbies to answer. Once you know \"where the neos go?\", it\'s nearly worthless with the exception of a few and far between posts and the comic value of watching mods completely disrespect the english language.\r\n\r\n-JNY'),(23761,'7b9ad7ca22','Well, i have no money yet, but i start my new job tommorow, so on my first payday, i might be able to buy them off of ya.'),(11102,'d4d0ead87e','hey cj, sorry i didn\'t ge to do this earlier, but i am going to send my end of the deal to you on saturday, sorry i didn\'t do this earlier, anyways, did you send the se yet? doesn\'t matter if you didn\'t just try to do it as soon as possible.'),(11104,'5aa14aea35','Already sent you might see it this week.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11105,'965dc00257','ok dude I paypaled the chicken (cash) over to ya\r\n\r\n  I will prolly send the cars on monday or tuesday gonna get some good races in with them before you turnem into speed machines lol.'),(11107,'b9e3286b29','Hey, the flame mask I sent just got returned. It\'s marked \"Attempted Not Known\"\r\n\r\n\r\nI had my wife send it for me, and she wrote the address down wrong.  She wrote 3508 instead of 2508. Feel stupid using my wife as the scapegoat, but really it wasn\'t fault.\r\n\r\nI feel like an ass, because now there\'s no way to get them to you in time for the contest, but since I spent the time making them, I\'ll go ahead and put them back out on monday.\r\n\r\nSorry man, I dropped the ball on that one.\r\n\r\nDave'),(11158,'221ee84911','Then I won\'t be a tradin!'),(11170,'43cbc382a3','Well Joe I\'m flattered by your offer but I\'m afraid I\'ll have to decline .\r\n\r\nI don\'t know if you\'ve offered this trade to others but is it the bB\'s that you\'re interrested in or Custom Bits in general?'),(11171,'dbeae2ef74','Silla,\r\n\r\nCan you send me a close up pic of your blended 2 tone G-Sled.  I wanted to post it as the [img]Ride of the Week [/img]but the pics that were available the car was too far back.  Put your avatar in but enlarge the ride.\r\n\r\nThanx!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11172,'5854a45b14','C-Dubb,\r\n\r\nHow bout a sticky under the Ride O Da Week for comments?\r\nThat\'ll keep the gallery &amp; comments seperate, if it gets out of hand I can just kill it!  Wanna give it a trail run???'),(11176,'74f0232c97','just one question how or were do i show them too you so you can approve of them? and im knida new to all this micro rc, bit etc. thing ( but im loving it and want to keep getting into it) so i dont have pics of bit may i borrow some to put on the wallpaper??????'),(11175,'eede3c6ecd','[quote:eede3c6ecd=\"DarkTari\"]C-Dubb,\r\n\r\nHow bout a sticky under the Ride O Da Week for comments?\r\nThat\'ll keep the gallery &amp; comments seperate, if it gets out of hand I can just kill it!  Wanna give it a trail run???[/quote:eede3c6ecd]go for it mang, see how it does'),(11177,'74f0232c97','just one question how or were do i show them too you so you can approve of them? and im knida new to all this micro rc, bit etc. thing ( but im loving it and want to keep getting into it) so i dont have pics of bit may i borrow some to put on the wallpaper??????'),(11180,'b8ac4126ff','I\'m trying to get some videoclips together.\r\n\r\nI was having an issue cause my cameras only letting me take 15 sec. clips, even though I have the space for almost 5 minutes on my card, but I think it did that all along, and I never noticed.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, I\'m gonna have to edit together a bunch of clips, but what I was really wondering is, do you prefer Quicktime movie clips or *.AVI clips, because those are the only 2 formats I can get to work when I export, and I\'m thinking the *.AVI clips look a whole lot cleaner.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11179,'111d243795','[quote:111d243795=\"chiga\"]just one question how or were do i show them too you so you can approve of them? and im knida new to all this micro rc, bit etc. thing ( but im loving it and want to keep getting into it) so i dont have pics of bit may i borrow some to put on the wallpaper??????[/quote:111d243795]I replied to your post, the answer is there.\r\nno, please don\'t use images from bitPimps, only sessiz has permission to borrow the images he has to date - sorry.\r\nwelcome to da hood!'),(12009,'1c7404433a','BdeBde,\r\n\r\nI luv that apint job man but you seem a lil confused about tyres.\r\n\r\nIMO,  I would leave the 5 spokes silver and paint the inside lips of\r\nthe wheels either matching Purple or Yellow and Leave the Tyres Black!\r\nThe lavender tyres detracts from the paint sceme. They\'re fighting \r\ninstead of blending.  You\'ve done enough smuth, fly azz paint jobs to know better pimp!\r\n\r\nJust My 50 Cents!'),(11182,'a5280a3131','whatever format the camera does is fine. the reason you can only do 15-30second clips is cuz the camera writes to it\'s buffer and when its done it dumps to the compactflash. the buffer size is what limits the video length but hey its easier to work with a bunch of short clips anyhow.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11183,'dbeae2ef74','Silla,\r\n\r\nCan you send me a close up pic of your blended 2 tone G-Sled.  I wanted to post it as the [img]Ride of the Week [/img]but the pics that were available the car was too far back.  Put your avatar in but enlarge the ride.\r\n\r\nThanx!'),(11795,'48ef2728a0','havent received any money as of yet. Will let you know if/when i do.'),(11796,'840bf3b7dc','sorry bout the tardiness man. my woman moved out and i got shit to catch up in the real world. its still sitting here. i got probably another week left of bullshit to catch up and ill be back.'),(11797,'d3607d01fb','[quote:d3607d01fb=\"hogjowlz\"]sorry bout the tardiness man. my woman moved out and i got shit to catch up in the real world. its still sitting here. i got probably another week left of bullshit to catch up and ill be back.[/quote:d3607d01fb]\r\n\r\nSorry to hear that. I can wait anouther week or two.'),(11798,'65a300de83','yo just a heads up. ill be back. i just needed to take a vacation from bits for a minute while i reorganize my head and get shit done that needs it. ill try to pop in every coupla days if i can. \r\n\r\nsorry bout the crazy shit.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11187,'a65b93d036','I mostly use different styles of the DUB City. They are pretty easy to install. I have a tutorial over at tinyrc. If you can\'t find it, I\'ll be glad to email you the word document with pics.'),(11188,'504f3ae0af','Yeah ph2t,\r\n\r\nGeisem is from the German Bit forum,  He mods like Sinned though he won\'t admit it!  Here\'s the first mod I saw him do.  I have this posted on my bulletin board at work, that\'s how much I like his work !!!!\r\n\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=1289\r\n\r\nHis pic host\'s server seems to have problems a lot which means his pics\r\nwill not show up some of the time........'),(11189,'c5e2579b3a','Thanks for the heads up on that buffer thing. That makes sense.\r\n\r\nAnyways here ya go. Them .AVI files are pretty big, so I\'ve got over 40 megs here. Try to download them ASAP, because I want to get some footage of a couple more cars, and We\'re gonna be ditching this cox service in a few days.\r\n\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars/01.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars/02.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars/04.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars/05.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars/06.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars/07.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars/08.AVI\r\n\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars2/10.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars2/11.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars2/12.AVI\r\n\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/dharrington5/13.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/dharrington5/14.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/dharrington5/15.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/dharrington5/16.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/dharrington5/18.AVI\r\n\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars3/19.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars3/20.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars3/21.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars3/22.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars3/23.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars3/24.AVI\r\n\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/strollerpusher/26.AVI\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/strollerpusher/27.AVI\r\n\r\nDave'),(11190,'15b783cb15','ya ill do it tonight. word this will be fun.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11191,'53f9ce473d','sent them regular mail about 3-4 days ago you should get them by tomorrow if not monday. Sorry for any delays.'),(11192,'ee0263ec63','cj, i got my se and problems are already happening, my se won\'t turn left and it barely works i\'ve checked everything, i don\'t want to return it to you, and i will still send you your stuff, BUT could you get me another se and i will send you even more stuff, i\'m willing to send you 7 more homies including some of the rare dogs, a transparent blue bit char-g rx-7 body and the ferarri body (bought it off my friend and won about 6 races) a 2.6 engine 5 spoked porsche 911 pullback rims (no tires though, but the bit char-g i\'m gonna send you has pullbacks with tires)and if more is needed i will try to get more, PLEASE reply as soon as possible.'),(11193,'15b783cb15','ya ill do it tonight. word this will be fun.'),(11194,'43cbc382a3','Well Joe I\'m flattered by your offer but I\'m afraid I\'ll have to decline .\r\n\r\nI don\'t know if you\'ve offered this trade to others but is it the bB\'s that you\'re interrested in or Custom Bits in general?'),(11195,'375e2cef56','dude my life is way fucked up. im broke and my old lady left. one of those is a good thing. i apologize and ill send you a car or something along with parts to make up for it.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11197,'791d2d363f','[quote:791d2d363f=\"micromatch\"]hey wel i tryed to fixit agian and the long enamled wire broke off, i go fast forwards and i go so slowback wards that my car doesn even have enuff power to turn..isthere any way i can fix this..or get a new one or sumthing?[/quote:791d2d363f]\r\n\r\nDude, what happened? Sorry to hear it\'s not working. We try to do a really good job putting them together and test them before we ship them, so I\'m surprised it broke so soon. \r\n\r\nI can\'t just send you a new one, but if you mail me back the one you have, I\'ll fix it for you, no charge. Assuming you haven\'t damaged the PCB, anyway. \r\n\r\nMy address to send it back is:\r\n\r\nGreg Maffei\r\n1906 NE Alameda\r\nPortland, Oregon 97212\r\n\r\nIt will probably take a week to fix it and get it back to you. Again, sorry it\'s not working.'),(11200,'3ae2a3b179','o man icant say  enugh abut how good of a jb you did it was an awsoe job bu the onl reason it broke iscause of smthng stupid i did lol i accidentl broke the wir and stupidly tryed fix cause im terrible solderer any way man ill sen off the   chaaassis  and       imma still post a good report in  fo sale tho case is carrocked'),(11201,'882f1e0aee','no prob dude. was just checkin in.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11202,'5c98b35546','Hey Bro,\r\n\r\nDidn\'t want to post this to your thread and step on any toes directly.\r\n\r\nLook around for a post from Darktari, I don\'t recall which one it is...But he gave a link for some DIRT CHEAP Digi-Q (new).\r\n\r\nIf you\'re really interested, it\'s worth the effort mango.\r\n\r\nGood luck.'),(11203,'dbfc69763c','Ok here\'s the breakdown of what\'s up with the rims.\r\n\r\nThe WT4343 should be no problem. Those are cool, because they are so narrow.\r\n\r\nThe WT4379. Those should be easie than normal to mount. They have smaller holes, and I wont need my pen tips, but I don\'t know if the the little center piece will fit over the front pin when mounted. I might have to glue the piece to the pin, so it stays stationary while the wheel spins. These wheels have water slide decals. I hope i don\'t mess those up, i haven\'t touched a water slide decal since I was kid.\r\n\r\nThe WT4314, ok now here\'s where I\'ve got a real issue. You sent me a mismatched set. I have four large tires, 2 smaller wider tires. 2 of the smaller wider rims already assembled, and 3 large rings, and 2 large backs. (see pic)\r\n\r\nI don\'t know if you have the other pieces or not so here\'s the options, either you could send me the missing pieces so I can complete the set of 4314s, or I could put the 2 smaller ones in front, the large ones in back. Do a bit of \'fabricating\' to narrow the front to the same width as the back, and trim the gold 6 spoke pieces to fit in the smaller rims in the front so they match with the back.\r\n\r\nAlso which rims do you want on the Zip Zap?\r\n\r\ndave\r\n[img:dbfc69763c]http://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/havoks.jpg[/img:dbfc69763c]'),(36081,'7b2c13c2d3','only place I know of is www.mini-rc.co.uk, not exactly cheap, but looking at the videos they seem to be upgradeable.\r\n\r\nCheers');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36083,'c8fd72990e','They are super Bit Char - G Lamborghini rims, and if you could have them..'),(11205,'60db68c23a','C-Dub,\r\n\r\nMan I finished up all but the instalation of the exhaust &amp; clear coat.  This mutha is slammin Pimp,  I knew this would happen......\"I don\'t want to give it up now !\"  You\'re gonna like this puppy Pimp!  Will send photos tonight!'),(11206,'35e39bab5c','I ordered a batch of FETs last night. They\'re coming 2nd day priorty mail, so I\'ll have them in plenty of time before your cars get here.\r\n\r\ndave'),(11207,'ee0263ec63','cj, i got my se and problems are already happening, my se won\'t turn left and it barely works i\'ve checked everything, i don\'t want to return it to you, and i will still send you your stuff, BUT could you get me another se and i will send you even more stuff, i\'m willing to send you 7 more homies including some of the rare dogs, a transparent blue bit char-g rx-7 body and the ferarri body (bought it off my friend and won about 6 races) a 2.6 engine 5 spoked porsche 911 pullback rims (no tires though, but the bit char-g i\'m gonna send you has pullbacks with tires)and if more is needed i will try to get more, PLEASE reply as soon as possible.'),(11644,'59e30540aa','i have the ferarri 516BB super bit char-g body, two stock tomy batteries, one 70mAh battery, one pinion gear, two orange plate axles and a LOT FULL of Homies.\r\n\r\nI am looking for the skyline R34 body (the newer thinner body style) the skyline 2000gt, the NSX body a 1.6 engine or 2.2 engine and just list all the body kits yoiu have just in case i forgot something.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11645,'bc61c414b5','Right now I have a Skyline GT-R R32, Skyline GT-R R34, a normal blue skyline a yellow skyline(broken piece ner back tab hole)\r\n\r\n  I also have some 2.6 motors.'),(14241,'e93f6555e8','can i get my bro pimp ike in this deal foo? he like my bro we always chillen and  would happily payy you 10  buckssiif u added him!\r\n\r\nThanks agian \r\nmicro'),(14242,'bf08c3af92','dude, send me your chassis and paypal me $6 and we\'re good to go...\r\n\r\nI\'ll send you my address details/ paypal details when you\'ve confirmed.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14243,'67de31790b','[quote:67de31790b=\"micromatch\"]you are da bobmb man this is the best present that ive ever gotten!![/quote:67de31790b]\r\n\r\ncool , see my other PM for details.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(11209,'f7e9357587','the link to the 2 Fast 2 Furious Shockwave game http://www.shockwave.com/sw/content/zipzaps2 takes you now to Redline Rumble.  Game looks the same just different cars and not sponcered by Radioshack or 2Fast @Furious.'),(11210,'60db68c23a','C-Dub,\r\n\r\nMan I finished up all but the instalation of the exhaust &amp; clear coat.  This mutha is slammin Pimp,  I knew this would happen......\"I don\'t want to give it up now !\"  You\'re gonna like this puppy Pimp!  Will send photos tonight!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14501,'1d5e80bdf4','[quote:1d5e80bdf4=\"micromatch\"]i accidently told you that my car was 49 mhz. i am sorryi ment to say 45 mhz. \r\n\r\nTHanks agian\r\nmicro[/quote:1d5e80bdf4]\r\n\r\nthat\'s fine, I\'ve got all the freq\'s for the controllers dude. \r\n\r\nAlso, I\'ve only seen the one payment from you.  Pimpike is wondering where his payment is.  Are you paying for him as well?   let me know when you send the chassis.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(11212,'f7e9357587','the link to the 2 Fast 2 Furious Shockwave game http://www.shockwave.com/sw/content/zipzaps2 takes you now to Redline Rumble.  Game looks the same just different cars and not sponcered by Radioshack or 2Fast @Furious.'),(11214,'e9f1208a89','[quote:e9f1208a89=\"jeenyus\"]cj, i got my se and problems are already happening, my se won\'t turn left and it barely works i\'ve checked everything, i don\'t want to return it to you, and i will still send you your stuff, BUT could you get me another se and i will send you even more stuff, i\'m willing to send you 7 more homies including some of the rare dogs, a transparent blue bit char-g rx-7 body and the ferarri body (bought it off my friend and won about 6 races) a 2.6 engine 5 spoked porsche 911 pullback rims (no tires though, but the bit char-g i\'m gonna send you has pullbacks with tires)and if more is needed i will try to get more, PLEASE reply as soon as possible.[/quote:e9f1208a89]\r\n\r\nStearing problems are not uncommon. What ever you [b:e9f1208a89]DO NOT [/b:e9f1208a89] adjust he screw on the bottom of the car.  Adjust the wheel on the edge of the controler and make sure that wheel is centered.\r\n\r\nAs for sending you another car for more stuff I\'ll let you know when I get the first things you sent.'),(11215,'b70fe70419','okay, that sounds fair, because i must sound like a total scammer if i didn\'t send you your stuff from another deal, i\'ll send your stuff today, and when you get it pm me so we can talk about something else');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11216,'3ba09f8a01','[quote:3ba09f8a01=\"cj\"]the link to the 2 Fast 2 Furious Shockwave game http://www.shockwave.com/sw/content/zipzaps2 takes you now to Redline Rumble.  Game looks the same just different cars and not sponcered by Radioshack or 2Fast @Furious.[/quote:3ba09f8a01]cool, good lookin out - thanks for the heads-up, I\'ll change it out.'),(11217,'b70fe70419','okay, that sounds fair, because i must sound like a total scammer if i didn\'t send you your stuff from another deal, i\'ll send your stuff today, and when you get it pm me so we can talk about something else'),(22795,'e9985e9ca4','Yeah hey sorry I was grounded im so sorry but im still lookin to buy it :)'),(22796,'e9985e9ca4','Yeah hey sorry I was grounded im so sorry but im still lookin to buy it :)'),(11219,'023c4ac1de','[quote:023c4ac1de=\"DarkTari\"]C-Dub,\r\n\r\nMan I finished up all but the instalation of the exhaust &amp; clear coat.  This mutha is slammin Pimp,  I knew this would happen......\"I don\'t want to give it up now !\"  You\'re gonna like this puppy Pimp!  Will send photos tonight![/quote:023c4ac1de] :lol: man tell me about it. its hard to give these babies up.\r\nI went back and forth. didn\'t wanna do too good of a job because I knew I wouldn\'t wanna give it up, but then again, I did want to because I would give it away and don\'t want the pimps to think I create crap! lol\r\n\r\ncan\'t wait to see the pics homey!'),(11221,'','I heard through the grapeline that there is going to be some big gig in NYC mid-october.\r\n\r\nAny idea when or whre?\r\n\r\nWant to check it out.  :grin:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11222,'7486566959','Dude, quit bossing me around.'),(11223,'d516e1a950','I have two new RS cat# for you to ask for and review.\r\n\r\n60-7531  Initial D Body Kit  $6.99\r\n60-7533  SE Euro Body Kit  $6.99\r\n\r\nI do not know what bodies these are nor when they will be available.'),(23555,'769f5be045','[quote:769f5be045=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea man if you could look that would be cool.\r\n\r\n  As for the other one, I know you didn\'t say anything it was me that said something lol.  So I will see what I have left and give you a pick, you just pick what you want and I will send it.  I have some stuff I was gonna donate for the next comp anyway so this way I can send it all at once.[/quote:769f5be045]cool, let me know whatchya got and I\'ll let ya know what I find out on them subs.'),(11225,'36002a61d7','You are the shit CJ. I owe everything to you! I will defenatly get them and post when I do. I report back on an eta.\r\n\r\nI really appreciate you giving us the 411 on the stuff.'),(11589,'d4065f859e','[quote:d4065f859e=\"VooDooMafia\"]Sup homie\r\n\r\n  just checking if you are still interested in teh car.\r\n\r\n  I will hold one anyway till i hear back from ya :)\r\n\r\n  Hey that race is coming up down there hope that goes well.[/quote:d4065f859e]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat\'s up, \r\n\r\nLooks like the alloys are gonna be at least another week cause I had to order some more metal.\r\n\r\nWould you rather just trade out the hero car for some stuff, and do the alloys later?\r\n\r\n\r\nYou said you want the Trueno, and the Levin in the tuner kit, and the Bb body. I also have a savanna rx-7 SE body that I don\'t need...\r\n\r\nI also have a comptete Nakamichi racer chassis. Great for parts.. W/O controller.  I don\'t have the Tx cause I buy these strictly for the wheels... It comes with body, wheels, gears, dual cell, motor, and tires\r\n\r\n\r\nSorry for the delay, but I was a workin like a dog...lol  \r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11227,'1a2eb9c526','o man icant say enugh abut how good of a jb you did it was an awsoe job bu the onl reason it broke iscause of smthng stupid i did lol i accidentl broke the wir and stupidly tryed fix cause im terrible solderer any way man ill sen off the chaaassis and imma still post a good report in fo sale tho case is carrocked'),(11229,'6eb91cc23c','Just a heads up. I called the 800 line and they are saying sometime in Oct. for 60-7531 and Nov. for 60-7533. I will post once they ARE available.\r\n\r\nThanks again!'),(22840,'f0da0e503f','I\'ll give you 300.00 plz e-mail me at delano_wilson@hotmail.com'),(12007,'35880501db','[quote:35880501db=\"Yagbols\"]ya, i want em.  problem is i dont have paypal.  :(   any ideas on how i could pay for em? have you got those cop blinkers yet?[/quote:35880501db]\r\n\r\nThat\'s not a prob dude, maybee we could trade?  You\'re in Singapore yeah?  Can you get Bit-CharG stuff retail?   Unfortunately I don\'t have the cop lights yet man.  But soon, just developing the circuit at the moment.\r\n\r\nCheers dude,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(11234,'8c97e972f3','Didnt mean to piss you off so much. Didnt mean to piss you off at all!. \r\n\r\nI\'ve only had 32 entries to the comp, so I guess that the odds are better than the lottery, and I kinda hoped that a pimp would win - hence the post. \r\n\r\nYou been good to me, and the board has helped me keep the faith (as in living the dream), that I appreciate - thanks. So Im sorry if you got the wrong slant on my post, didnt mean to offend.\r\n\r\nHey, and I always post here first :D \r\n\r\nTook me a long time to phrase this because I care  :| \r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTeamBonzer');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11238,'9c608ad370','ok Cool thanks for the update :)\r\n\r\n  I will be sending the cars out soon I just keep changing my mind.\r\n\r\n  I have right now a lxx booster car that I am gonna send(will make the car worth way more play time then now lol)\r\n\r\n  The second one I think I am going to send is the tomy single speed ultra man car (mat car is what I think they call it) but I am just waiting for my shippment of these cars to come in.  Should be here soon I hope if its not here in the next few days I will send something else.\r\n\r\n heres a Q for yea.  I have a gen 1 zipzap and I know these cars had probs.  Do you think this would benifit from the mosfet mod or not bother with this car?  right now with red gears, stock cell, and anymotor I try is just putts along :('),(11733,'de0c849c04','I wonder if the guy made it back from vacation... I\'m starting to make my own alloys, but need the hubs to make em pretty. Can you contact them to see if they can be bought seperately? \r\n\r\nThanks a million man..     Let me know.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(11734,'92665a22f2','No Probs pimp\r\n\r\n  I am always like a kid on xmas.\r\n\r\n  I get excited every day when the mail comes, but usually nothing is there lol  I swear my mail lady gets a kick out of that sudden look of disapointment when there is nothing.\r\n\r\n  i also think she keeps it all till the end of the week cause it always seem that everything will show up the same day even with the 5 day difference in mailing date  :???:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (11241,'bc1f285c0f','I will be posting them for $20.00(shipping included) or the same in trade.\r\n\r\n  I am always looking for bodies, cars, parts all that stuff :)'),(11243,'f06fa7e4f0','Here Ya go Pimp......\r\nI tried your technique since it\'s an official Team DarkTari BitPimp VW  Special Edition  LOL...\r\n\r\n[img:f06fa7e4f0]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0QgDOAggSjTBUF5NKovOKw4KXM9er8dy47AMNq*YtHKvkmdW1PBOJpLl3iGt!TAgoY7xn3nR523p4B9uryaIFUL9pTBIWmthDKQARLdNdB1g/DSC01350.JPG?dc=4675441034732624162[/img:f06fa7e4f0]\r\n[img:f06fa7e4f0]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0QgDcAgkSxjBUF5NKovOKwx0GFFm0ThB62JA8CF8GsRmKj49SqSXct46MxN5cKlZ2umdHsYiD12bCtqK*SByrUfOAQNNWI9i2I5nQeGIHdVs/DSC01351.JPG?dc=4675441034782482370[/img:f06fa7e4f0]\r\n[img:f06fa7e4f0]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0QgCz*wsSODFUF5NKovOKw4RxZVR*Z0i1R20ATSkx7g0KAaPw8a7DDBudRNl*w2eY2R!RzLkqm*MjJPzAfmnTycEjt5wJsJxJ!tDJ9Ulj3s4/DSC01353.JPG?dc=4675441034820936643[/img:f06fa7e4f0]\r\n\r\nExhaust not on, got a lil ahead of myself, they don\'t go on til the clearcoat dries.  When all done I\'m gonna floss this in the AusMicro contest stating this is the BitPimps 3rd place prize (body) and watch the contestants roll in.\r\nHonestly what do you think? Now I\'m havin 2nd thoughts about that one.  It\'s late and I\'m tired.\r\n\r\nPeace Out'),(11244,'f06fa7e4f0','Here Ya go Pimp......\r\nI tried your technique since it\'s an official Team DarkTari BitPimp VW  Special Edition  LOL...\r\n\r\n[img:f06fa7e4f0]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0QgDOAggSjTBUF5NKovOKw4KXM9er8dy47AMNq*YtHKvkmdW1PBOJpLl3iGt!TAgoY7xn3nR523p4B9uryaIFUL9pTBIWmthDKQARLdNdB1g/DSC01350.JPG?dc=4675441034732624162[/img:f06fa7e4f0]\r\n[img:f06fa7e4f0]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0QgDcAgkSxjBUF5NKovOKwx0GFFm0ThB62JA8CF8GsRmKj49SqSXct46MxN5cKlZ2umdHsYiD12bCtqK*SByrUfOAQNNWI9i2I5nQeGIHdVs/DSC01351.JPG?dc=4675441034782482370[/img:f06fa7e4f0]\r\n[img:f