n me already I think it can be done.  I just need some more info to confirm things.\r\n\r\nThanks mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:2fa516935f]Hey, what\'s up?\r\n\r\nYep you got the chart correct. I\'ll get those other readings, and the clearest pics I can possibly take this afternoon after work. \r\n\r\nTo answer question 3. The battery is 2 batteries, about half the size of a 1/4 AAA, stacked up and shrink wrapped so it looks like one battery that\'s a little longer than a standard one. With that in mind 2.8v makes sense at 1.4v per battery.\r\n\r\n...and thanks for hooking me up with server space for the pics. My wife gets sick of me wasting all her space for my \'silly\' cars.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:2fa516935f]\r\n\r\nThanks for that mate.  Let me know if you have any issues with the ftp logon.   It\'s almost midnight here so I\'m gonna crash.  You won\'t get a response from me for prolly 8 hours.\r\n\r\nI really believe we can do this.  You\'re a fucken champ for helping me!\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12496,'f4fe9abe84','[quote:f4fe9abe84=\"noxorc\"]Im about to pick yours up today or tomorrow.\r\nse White rx7.\r\n\r\nabout this deal...I really don\'t need anything of your end.\r\nI was just doing the deal to help you out...figuring you could not get\r\nthis car.\r\n\r\nSo, how would  you like to just pay for what it costs me to buy and ship to you?\r\nI\'ll ship anyway you want...since your paying in the end...do you want insurance?\r\n\r\ntalk to me...[/quote:f4fe9abe84]\r\n\r\nOK then that\'s cool.   Find out how much it is for insurance to be added and if it\'s less than $5 more of the shipping cost go with it.\r\n\r\nI have paypal, but it\'s a paypal linked to a CC.  Is your pp account just a personal one (like EZ) or a premier/business one?  If it\'s the former I will have to work a deal with a local mate to get my pp account in the + credit for the cost from your end so the transaction goes through smoothly.\r\n\r\nagain thanks for this man, I appreciate it.\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(14250,'ed9791e722','i can paypal you the money tomaro morning (when mah biotch wakes up) and we can g from there\r\n\r\nThanks agian bro.\r\nmicro\r\n\r\nP.S. what i wanna do for you for christmas...if your ever looking to get any pullback i got my hook up here in cali  who is aways slangin so if you need one tell me aaand i can get it for you free of charge.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14251,'45aa3b0e9c','[quote:45aa3b0e9c=\"micromatch\"]can i get my bro pimp ike in this deal foo? he like my bro we always chillen and  would happily payy you 10  buckssiif u added him!\r\n\r\nThanks agian \r\nmicro[/quote:45aa3b0e9c]\r\n\r\nno sweats, just follow the details on my post.  $6USD via paypal per person, that\'s all I ask!\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14252,'81eccbd991','[quote:81eccbd991=\"micromatch\"]i can paypal you the money tomaro morning (when mah biotch wakes up) and we can g from there\r\n\r\nThanks agian bro.\r\nmicro\r\n\r\nP.S. what i wanna do for you for christmas...if your ever looking to get any pullback i got my hook up here in cali  who is aways slangin so if you need one tell me aaand i can get it for you free of charge.[/quote:81eccbd991]\r\n\r\ncool man, I\'ll let you know!\r\n\r\nmy paypal addy is matt.marcos@bigpond.com\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(12498,'4ec73ae383','Here\'s my # 727-906-3343..\r\n\r\nEvenings are usually better for me, and it\'s not as hot in the courts.. No worries about the lights though, cause there\'s a shit load.. \r\n\r\nI sent my SE off to australia to micro_Amps so I can get that thing FETed out..  Can\'t wait to get it back.\r\n\r\nRing me up, and we\'ll get something squared away..\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(12499,'e4cdd86ce2','The evening sounds better.  I\'ll give you a ring.  My girlfriend reminded me last night that I have to help her move on Saturday.  I had completely forgotten.  At least I can take a break after all that and race my car for a while. :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12500,'d18e7d832d','Sup dude\r\n\r\nIf you can shoot me your addy I will drop these in the mail today :)'),(12501,'9a15ca1bfb','Oh, my name is Matt by the way.  So I don\'t have to say, this is Grunge. :lol:'),(12502,'6ca785ea88','My addy is:\r\n\r\nGreg Maffei\r\n1906 NE Alameda\r\nPortland, Oregon 97212\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks man. I\'ll try to get yours in the mail today, but it may not happen till tomorrow.\r\n\r\nSuperFly'),(12503,'6ca785ea88','My addy is:\r\n\r\nGreg Maffei\r\n1906 NE Alameda\r\nPortland, Oregon 97212\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks man. I\'ll try to get yours in the mail today, but it may not happen till tomorrow.\r\n\r\nSuperFly'),(12504,'849fc13c37','[quote:849fc13c37=\"hogjowlz\"]what thread is that shit in?[/quote:849fc13c37]\r\n\r\n\"I\'ve got fets in my se\" in science.'),(12505,'e4cdd86ce2','The evening sounds better.  I\'ll give you a ring.  My girlfriend reminded me last night that I have to help her move on Saturday.  I had completely forgotten.  At least I can take a break after all that and race my car for a while. :)'),(12506,'9a15ca1bfb','Oh, my name is Matt by the way.  So I don\'t have to say, this is Grunge. :lol:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12553,'bc628f0817','Nice shit :) well looks like my TC is now on the list to be doen\r\n\r\nhey I was thinking, do you think the Super Bits have the same prob as the SE\'s?\r\n\r\n  I know this is my first experiance with them and they are very peppy almost what a fet would put out :)\r\n\r\nPete'),(12554,'27fd1d6902','[quote:27fd1d6902=\"ph2t\"][quote:27fd1d6902=\"noxorc\"][quote:27fd1d6902=\"ph2t\"][quote:27fd1d6902=\"noxorc\"]Im about to pick yours up today or tomorrow.\r\nse White rx7.\r\n\r\nabout this deal...I really don\'t need anything of your end.\r\nI was just doing the deal to help you out...figuring you could not get\r\nthis car.\r\n\r\nSo, how would  you like to just pay for what it costs me to buy and ship to you?\r\nI\'ll ship anyway you want...since your paying in the end...do you want insurance?\r\ntalk to me...[/quote:27fd1d6902]\r\nOK then that\'s cool.   Find out how much it is for insurance to be added and if it\'s less than $5 more of the shipping cost go with it.\r\nI have paypal, but it\'s a paypal linked to a CC.  Is your pp account just a personal one (like EZ) or a premier/business one?  If it\'s the former I will have to work a deal with a local mate to get my pp account in the + credit for the cost from your end so the transaction goes through smoothly.\r\nagain thanks for this man, I appreciate it.\r\nMatt.[/quote:27fd1d6902]\r\n\r\n\r\nOk, I have the car, in my greedy little hands....Hmm, maybe I should just keep it? hmmm\r\njust kidding, it\'s yours...   (since I recently bought the X-mod for $50. I can\'t afford another $25 for the SE zipzips.)\r\n\r\nI will go to the post office and check the prices and let you know.\r\nas to my Paypal account.  it\'s a regular person account with Verification.\r\n\r\n-nigel[/quote:27fd1d6902]\r\n\r\nExcellent, thanks Nigel.   Find out the total price and I\'ll paypal you the amount.  I\'ve sold a few things so my paypal is slowly getting to the amount I approximately need.  Once againn thanks dude.  With this I hope to figure out the fet mod once and for all.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:27fd1d6902]\r\n\r\nWhen I saw that you were looking to get an SE, I knew I needed to help you.\r\nI like the deal you put together, it just didn\'t fit my needs.\r\nBut I\'m glad you found the cash and still want it.\r\nand I am glad I\'m helping you out.\r\nI\'ve got it all bundled up ready for shipping. I don\'t have a price yet.\r\nby noon tomorrow I will.'),(12858,'fb747d6f3d','[quote:fb747d6f3d=\"crazydave\"][quote:fb747d6f3d=\"ph2t\"]If you could I\'d appreciate, just add more data to the s/sheet and upload it to the ftp, :)\r\n\r\nI\'ve gotten a model to work with now.   Basically apart from the 4 fets, I\r\nve added another component that is an inverter/buffer.   It\'s goal is to invert the high signal (2.37V) to a low voltage (0.2V) and vice versa.  This way we might get it to work.  The inverter is of similar size to the fets, another surface mount component,   They are available as free samples from onsemi.com but if I can get it working in a test circuit today I will mail you some I\'ve got,  You only need one per hbridge.\r\n\r\nI\'ll work on this and let you know.  Thanks again for your help dude.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:fb747d6f3d]Cool, I\'ll get those this evening when my wife gets home from work.\r\n\r\nI hope that inverter/buffer works, because a small component is what we need. Space is really tight in the SE.\r\n\r\n..and hey, thanks for your help man, I\'d be useless without you. ;)\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:fb747d6f3d]\r\n\r\nlol dude, I think it\'s that other way around, you\'re the one with the SE!\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12556,'1f6d9a4285','[quote:1f6d9a4285=\"VooDooMafia\"]Nice shit :) well looks like my TC is now on the list to be doen\r\n\r\nhey I was thinking, do you think the Super Bits have the same prob as the SE\'s?\r\n\r\n  I know this is my first experiance with them and they are very peppy almost what a fet would put out :)\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:1f6d9a4285]From what micro-Amps says it does have the same problem as the SE, and that\'s that PCB limits the voltage, but from the testing I\'m doing for ph2t, that doesn\'t seem to be true, so I don\'t know what going on anymore. :roll:\r\n\r\nMy head\'s been spinning with all kinds of questions about the SE. It\'s really been keeping me awake at night. That\'s why I had to figure out the Thunder Charger once and for all. Just to get resolve to something.  :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(37736,'757b2e2e56','just checking in on you, have you started your project yet?\r\nHow far have you gotten?\r\nWhat problems are you getting?\r\n\r\nMaxx'),(34878,'f7e6a21de7','Hang in there with me man. Been real busy at work, and the wife is sick at home, so I\'m playing Mr. Mom too. If I get a few minutes after I get the boys down tonight, I\'ll get the trueno sets out of my closet and get you some more details.\r\n\r\nYour patience will pay.  :grin:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (30163,'e59d50f05a','What truck are you talking about if its the blue one the model A I built it from scratch its a one of a kind..'),(13082,'ff7c4bf9fe','Hey Roland,\r\n\r\n I finally got through to a supervisor with my ISP, after 6 or 8 flunkies telling me that nothing could be done about it. Seems other people with my ISP have not been getting emails either. They have a team investigating it and need to know what addresses are not getting through. I was wondering if you tried sending from your different mail accounts, so I could tell them all of them.Thanks. Oh, stuff went out in the mail today on it\'s way to you. Hotmail is down right now (great) so I don\'t know if you sent me anything. I will check later. I will sent this in an email too. You did say you still recieved my emails, correct?\r\n\r\nBruce'),(13083,'92aeb8113f','Bloody hell Bruce, I sent a whole lot of copied \'previous\' emails to you using the hotmail address, and now you are saying that is down as well !!\r\nWe just cant win here.\r\nI got this as an email as well from the gte.net address, so they are still getting through to me, just not allowing me to respond.\r\nThe addresses I have been using all originate from dodo.com.au such as rolands@dodo.com.au and microamps@dodo.com.au\r\nSo the cars are on the way, good stuff, thanks. I will let you know when I receive them.\r\nLet me know how you go with this email stuff keep in touch and I will be happy to send test emails anytime you need them done so you can see if things are working.\r\nRegards,\r\nRoland\r\nJust so you know, this is a copy of what I receive when I send you an email.\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nThis message was created automatically by mail delivery software (Exim).\r\n\r\nA message that you sent could not be delivered to one or more of its\r\nrecipients. This is a permanent error. The following address(es) failed:\r\n\r\n  bdebde@gte.net\r\n    SMTP error from remote mailer after MAIL FROM:&lt;rolands@dodo.com.au&gt; SIZE=4223:\r\n    host relay.gte.net [206.46.170.12]: 550 You are not allowed to send mail:sc021.verizon.net\r\n\r\n------ This is a copy of the message, including all the headers. ------\r\n\r\nReturn-path: &lt;rolands@dodo.com.au&gt;\r\nReceived: from [203.194.51.29] (helo=c2i5w0)\r\nby relay01.kbs.net.au with smtp (Exim 3.36 #1)\r\nid 1AEQ3B-0000k5-00\r\nfor bdebde@gte.net; Tue, 28 Oct 2003 20:22:06 +1100\r\nMessage-ID: &lt;003601c39d35$a1422500$1d33c2cb@c2i5w0&gt;\r\nFrom: \"Roland\" &lt;rolands@dodo.com.au&gt;\r\nTo: \"Bruce Ellis\" &lt;bdebde@gte.net&gt;\r\nSubject: Fw: email problems?????\r\nDate: Tue, 28 Oct 2003 20:26:54 +1100\r\nMIME-Version: 1.0\r\nContent-Type: multipart/alternative;\r\nboundary=\"----=_NextPart_000_0033_01C39D91.D3D9F040\"\r\nX-Priority: 3\r\nX-MSMail-Priority: Normal\r\nX-Mailer: Microsoft Outlook Express 6.00.2800.1106\r\nX-MIMEOLE: Produced By Microsoft MimeOLE V6.00.2800.1106\r\n\r\nThis is a multi-part message in MIME format.\r\n\r\n------=_NextPart_000_0033_01C39D91.D3D9F040\r\nContent-Type: text/plain;\r\ncharset=\"Windows-1252\"\r\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n.=20\r\n----- Original Message -----=20\r\nFrom: Roland=20\r\nTo: Bruce Ellis=20\r\nSent: Tuesday, October 28, 2003 8:04 PM\r\nSubject: email problems?????\r\n\r\n\r\nBruce,\r\nI am getting notifications from your email provider gte.net about emails =\r\nnot going through.\r\n\r\nIf you get this can you let me know please.\r\nI also am not able to view the vid you posted, but would love to orgnise =\r\nposting something like this on my website, with credit to you.\r\nAlso some news regarding my website too.\r\nPlease let me know if you receive this\r\nRoland\r\nP.S. Do you have MSN or Yahoo accounts? (I do but use them very =\r\ninfrequently) Maybe this might overcome the email problem. Id like to =\r\ndiscuss a few things.\r\nR'),(12559,'0639d6b768','Yea its a piss off that he has the answer(micro that is) and wont give it up.\r\n\r\n  I was almost tempted to send his one of my SE\'s and tell him not to put epoxy on it so I can further mod it in the future.\r\n\r\n  Not sure that would have showed anything though  :-? \r\n\r\n\r\n fuck it pisses me off and I dont even do the mod...  I can understand if everyone was out there charging an arm and a leg for this mod but its seems to be a simple mod(for people with the soldering skills) on normal ZZ\'s and bits and there are tuts all over for it.  I have this feeling its something really simple like a transistor or resistor(again not good with electronics) that is casueing the problem and when removed has no effect on anything else from the car.\r\n\r\n\r\nWell just to let you know You and CW has made me change my way about sprays and paint jobs.  I just did my first fade job and I will have pics up tomorrow(clearcoat dryin).  \r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12833,'1dfc5c6460','ok'),(14190,'365ce257cf','Hey dude I send the cash but from my first acct.\r\n\r\n  The unlocked it the fuckers lol, well now atleast I have a backup account that I can put $$ into incase this happens aagin'),(14191,'121644d5dd','[quote:121644d5dd=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey dude I send the cash but from my first acct.\r\n\r\n  The unlocked it the fuckers lol, well now atleast I have a backup account that I can put $$ into incase this happens aagin[/quote:121644d5dd]\r\n\r\nThanks man, I\'ll check it tongiht when I get home.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(14192,'121644d5dd','[quote:121644d5dd=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey dude I send the cash but from my first acct.\r\n\r\n  The unlocked it the fuckers lol, well now atleast I have a backup account that I can put $$ into incase this happens aagin[/quote:121644d5dd]\r\n\r\nThanks man, I\'ll check it tongiht when I get home.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(12857,'1c2b95a557','[quote:1c2b95a557=\"ph2t\"]If you could I\'d appreciate, just add more data to the s/sheet and upload it to the ftp, :)\r\n\r\nI\'ve gotten a model to work with now.   Basically apart from the 4 fets, I\r\nve added another component that is an inverter/buffer.   It\'s goal is to invert the high signal (2.37V) to a low voltage (0.2V) and vice versa.  This way we might get it to work.  The inverter is of similar size to the fets, another surface mount component,   They are available as free samples from onsemi.com but if I can get it working in a test circuit today I will mail you some I\'ve got,  You only need one per hbridge.\r\n\r\nI\'ll work on this and let you know.  Thanks again for your help dude.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:1c2b95a557]Cool, I\'ll get those this evening when my wife gets home from work.\r\n\r\nI hope that inverter/buffer works, because a small component is what we need. Space is really tight in the SE.\r\n\r\n..and hey, thanks for your help man, I\'d be useless without you. ;)\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12561,'c18998e6e3','[quote:c18998e6e3=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea its a piss off that he has the answer(micro that is) and wont give it up.\r\n\r\n  I was almost tempted to send his one of my SE\'s and tell him not to put epoxy on it so I can further mod it in the future.\r\n\r\n  Not sure that would have showed anything though  :-? \r\n\r\n\r\n fuck it pisses me off and I dont even do the mod...  I can understand if everyone was out there charging an arm and a leg for this mod but its seems to be a simple mod(for people with the soldering skills) on normal ZZ\'s and bits and there are tuts all over for it.  I have this feeling its something really simple like a transistor or resistor(again not good with electronics) that is casueing the problem and when removed has no effect on anything else from the car.\r\n\r\n\r\nWell just to let you know You and CW has made me change my way about sprays and paint jobs.  I just did my first fade job and I will have pics up tomorrow(clearcoat dryin).  \r\n\r\nPete[/quote:c18998e6e3]Yeah you know, I had offered to do a mosfet mod for Payaso for free, just to be cool, and he never got back to me. Then just this evening he mentions in my SS camaro thread that his car is with micro_Amps. I just took offense to that, you know that he\'d rather pay him top dollar than get a freebie off me. That just makes me more determined to figure this stupid SE thing out. ph2t is confident we can do it, I\'m just getting confused. I don\'t know, he\'s got an EE degree, so hopefully he can figure something out.\r\n\r\ndave\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd yeah, your paint jobs have been looking good, can\'t wait to see your fade. :grin: \r\n\r\nDave'),(13226,'929dab8ed3','Hey how\'s going? Getting settled in yet? Been busy over here, stressing out, trying to figure out how to FET the SE, because micro_amps is playing tight with his info, then my wife goes and quits her job, as if I don\'t have enough on my mind.\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna send you back the cars that are done, so I don\'t have so many of your cars here. So give me your address, and I\'ll get those out in the next few days.\r\n\r\nI solved the problem with the Thunder Charger, but I\'m still working on the Micro Speed, and that yellow Mini. I was talking to ph2t, he turned me on to some P-channel FETs, I believe those should solve my problem. I\'m gonna order some of those, so I can do your cars up properly.\r\n\r\nI still have to mount the alloys. I keep procrastinating on that, but as you\'ve found out, ithey\'re a bitch, and because each set is different, each one has it\'s own frustrations that come along with it.\r\n\r\n...but I\'ll get to them, soon, I promise.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHey, been meaning to ask, what\'s the stuff you get around there like? We\'re just coming out of the dry season, and my apartment is wreaking like a skunk right now.  :-D ;)\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13408,'c8ed96a50f','np man its all u if i do.. i may get a new one cuz i liked it it was fats as shiznat!  :eek:   :sad:  but i traded it for 2 shens with oem 3.0s and one with underglow and ms pcb'),(13409,'577a76be50','[quote:577a76be50=\"Maxximum Attack\"]Ok i did that for lowering purposes, I have tonnes of those from clones so its no prob. So my car is on the way then? What was the shipping cost?\r\n\r\nThanx for the complements. your flame jobs are [u:577a76be50]the[/u:577a76be50] best. I learnt my painting stuff from your flame tutorial.  :o[/quote:577a76be50]Welp, it\'s all packed up and ready to go. I know you don\'t want to hear excuses, but here\'s the deal, because it needs to go through customs, I have to make my way to the post office. I don\'t drive a car, so I\'d have to ride a bus. I don\'t have time to take the bus on the days I work. Sunday, and Mondays are my days off, post office is closed on Sunday. So here we are at today, and I have no more excuses. So it will definately go out today. I\'ll let you know when I\'ve got back, and it is definatly in the mail. Hope that is cool.  :grin: \r\n\r\nThat\'s cool my tutorial helps you, but I thought you painting you\'re graphics on with a brush. that\'s part of the reason I was surprized they came out so nice. How are you doing your graphics?\r\n\r\nDave'),(13294,'929dab8ed3','Hey how\'s going? Getting settled in yet? Been busy over here, stressing out, trying to figure out how to FET the SE, because micro_amps is playing tight with his info, then my wife goes and quits her job, as if I don\'t have enough on my mind.\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna send you back the cars that are done, so I don\'t have so many of your cars here. So give me your address, and I\'ll get those out in the next few days.\r\n\r\nI solved the problem with the Thunder Charger, but I\'m still working on the Micro Speed, and that yellow Mini. I was talking to ph2t, he turned me on to some P-channel FETs, I believe those should solve my problem. I\'m gonna order some of those, so I can do your cars up properly.\r\n\r\nI still have to mount the alloys. I keep procrastinating on that, but as you\'ve found out, ithey\'re a bitch, and because each set is different, each one has it\'s own frustrations that come along with it.\r\n\r\n...but I\'ll get to them, soon, I promise.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHey, been meaning to ask, what\'s the stuff you get around there like? We\'re just coming out of the dry season, and my apartment is wreaking like a skunk right now.  :-D ;)\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12831,'1b26d6e697','[quote:1b26d6e697=\"crazydave\"]Ok I\'m almost done. The MAT car went over without a hitch, but as you know, you\'ll have to ditch that 1.0.\r\n\r\nThe LXX Beetle has one small glitch. The FET mod went over fine, and it\'s screaming. (What\'s that a 4.2 Pro in there?) The only prob is for some reason after I put the FETs in the headlights stay on all the time. I disconnected them from the FET, and tried all over the place for somewhere else to put it, but no matter where I put it, the lights came on. I figure if you really want the lights you can wire a micro switch to them to turn them on. I hope that\'s cool, \'cause I\'m not sure what else I can do about it.\r\n\r\nI\'m getting ready to put the dual cell FET modded Zip Zap beast together. This car is gonna be too fast, but everyone should have at least one car that\'s too fast. ;)\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:1b26d6e697]\r\n\r\n  Thats cool with the beetle I am sure I can figure out a dip switch for it ro something.  As for the motor in it  :???:  if its a blue endbell then yes 4.2 pro if its white then the 4.2 king.\r\n\r\n  I know I need to loose teh 1.0 stock Mat motor its almost as bad as when tomy packed a 2,2 in the SBCG.  I will prolly just trade it on the OZ forum as they seem to eat up all the crap I dont want.\r\n\r\n  Well I guess if the ZZ will be that fast I can use it to race the epoch untill I can find another.'),(12563,'9002f95057','[quote:9002f95057=\"noxorc\"][quote:9002f95057=\"ph2t\"][quote:9002f95057=\"noxorc\"][quote:9002f95057=\"ph2t\"][quote:9002f95057=\"noxorc\"]Im about to pick yours up today or tomorrow.\r\nse White rx7.\r\n\r\nabout this deal...I really don\'t need anything of your end.\r\nI was just doing the deal to help you out...figuring you could not get\r\nthis car.\r\n\r\nSo, how would  you like to just pay for what it costs me to buy and ship to you?\r\nI\'ll ship anyway you want...since your paying in the end...do you want insurance?\r\ntalk to me...[/quote:9002f95057]\r\nOK then that\'s cool.   Find out how much it is for insurance to be added and if it\'s less than $5 more of the shipping cost go with it.\r\nI have paypal, but it\'s a paypal linked to a CC.  Is your pp account just a personal one (like EZ) or a premier/business one?  If it\'s the former I will have to work a deal with a local mate to get my pp account in the + credit for the cost from your end so the transaction goes through smoothly.\r\nagain thanks for this man, I appreciate it.\r\nMatt.[/quote:9002f95057]\r\n\r\n\r\nOk, I have the car, in my greedy little hands....Hmm, maybe I should just keep it? hmmm\r\njust kidding, it\'s yours...   (since I recently bought the X-mod for $50. I can\'t afford another $25 for the SE zipzips.)\r\n\r\nI will go to the post office and check the prices and let you know.\r\nas to my Paypal account.  it\'s a regular person account with Verification.\r\n\r\n-nigel[/quote:9002f95057]\r\n\r\nExcellent, thanks Nigel.   Find out the total price and I\'ll paypal you the amount.  I\'ve sold a few things so my paypal is slowly getting to the amount I approximately need.  Once againn thanks dude.  With this I hope to figure out the fet mod once and for all.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:9002f95057]\r\n\r\nWhen I saw that you were looking to get an SE, I knew I needed to help you.\r\nI like the deal you put together, it just didn\'t fit my needs.\r\nBut I\'m glad you found the cash and still want it.\r\nand I am glad I\'m helping you out.\r\nI\'ve got it all bundled up ready for shipping. I don\'t have a price yet.\r\nby noon tomorrow I will.[/quote:9002f95057]\r\n\r\nawww shucks, thanks man.\r\nexcellent!  let me know the final price and I\'ll whip some lemmings to get the $$$.\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14222,'dd9a23ac04','[quote:dd9a23ac04=\"DarkTari\"]Yo Brendan,\'\r\n\r\nWhat are you using to cut &amp; finish the body?  Noticed a mistake to the windshield frame above the mirror.  Look at yours and Dave\'s.  I got my tuitorial ready and will be posting it this week, look for it.[/quote:dd9a23ac04]\r\n\r\nYeah, i use a exato knife and a file. but i heat up the exato knife so it is to cut. I got the dremel out the other day but i just made a big mess with that body. and i will look for the tutorial , what section will it be in.'),(14223,'6cba2c46c4','Hey man,\r\n\r\ni was wondering if you could tell me what the bitPimps font is and were i can find it, if you cant tell me it\'s kool.\r\n\r\nMerry x mas'),(14225,'c312db7c80','hey man im a newb so ill need some advice and nice to meet you :D'),(14226,'f5775ed929','hey whats up im new and i c that un on the site so im jw how to post pics and vids?'),(14232,'c312db7c80','hey man im a newb so ill need some advice and nice to meet you :D');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14228,'0da4c8043b','yo whats the mod? sry im so nosey but i love this kinda stuff'),(14229,'7dbb56ccef','be chill man'),(14230,'7dbb56ccef','be chill man'),(19151,'91e6eb1a7d','Your welcome man I give props where props is due.  Thanks for the 411'),(14236,'9108f91bb9','hurry up and post man\r\n\r\nhttp://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2747'),(14237,'0d808850cf','you are da bobmb man this is the best present that ive ever gotten!!'),(12565,'f07675b0c5','[quote:f07675b0c5=\"ph2t\"][quote:f07675b0c5=\"noxorc\"][quote:f07675b0c5=\"ph2t\"][quote:f07675b0c5=\"noxorc\"][quote:f07675b0c5=\"ph2t\"][quote:f07675b0c5=\"noxorc\"]Im about to pick yours up today or tomorrow.\r\nse White rx7.\r\n\r\nabout this deal...I really don\'t need anything of your end.\r\nI was just doing the deal to help you out...figuring you could not get\r\nthis car.\r\n\r\nSo, how would  you like to just pay for what it costs me to buy and ship to you?\r\nI\'ll ship anyway you want...since your paying in the end...do you want insurance?\r\ntalk to me...[/quote:f07675b0c5]\r\nOK then that\'s cool.   Find out how much it is for insurance to be added and if it\'s less than $5 more of the shipping cost go with it.\r\nI have paypal, but it\'s a paypal linked to a CC.  Is your pp account just a personal one (like EZ) or a premier/business one?  If it\'s the former I will have to work a deal with a local mate to get my pp account in the + credit for the cost from your end so the transaction goes through smoothly.\r\nagain thanks for this man, I appreciate it.\r\nMatt.[/quote:f07675b0c5]\r\n\r\n\r\nOk, I have the car, in my greedy little hands....Hmm, maybe I should just keep it? hmmm\r\njust kidding, it\'s yours...   (since I recently bought the X-mod for $50. I can\'t afford another $25 for the SE zipzips.)\r\n\r\nI will go to the post office and check the prices and let you know.\r\nas to my Paypal account.  it\'s a regular person account with Verification.\r\n\r\n-nigel[/quote:f07675b0c5]\r\n\r\nExcellent, thanks Nigel.   Find out the total price and I\'ll paypal you the amount.  I\'ve sold a few things so my paypal is slowly getting to the amount I approximately need.  Once againn thanks dude.  With this I hope to figure out the fet mod once and for all.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:f07675b0c5]\r\n\r\nWhen I saw that you were looking to get an SE, I knew I needed to help you.\r\nI like the deal you put together, it just didn\'t fit my needs.\r\nBut I\'m glad you found the cash and still want it.\r\nand I am glad I\'m helping you out.\r\nI\'ve got it all bundled up ready for shipping. I don\'t have a price yet.\r\nby noon tomorrow I will.[/quote:f07675b0c5]\r\n\r\nawww shucks, thanks man.\r\nexcellent!  let me know the final price and I\'ll whip some lemmings to get the $$$.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:f07675b0c5]\r\n\r\nI\'ve been searching this AM for your shipping address.\r\ncan\'t find it, Matt.\r\n\r\nsend me it, please....as I was it to go out today.\r\n\r\n-nigel'),(12567,'a8866bcfd5','[quote:a8866bcfd5=\"crazydave\"][quote:a8866bcfd5=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea its a piss off that he has the answer(micro that is) and wont give it up.\r\n\r\n  I was almost tempted to send his one of my SE\'s and tell him not to put epoxy on it so I can further mod it in the future.\r\n\r\n  Not sure that would have showed anything though  :-? \r\n\r\n\r\n fuck it pisses me off and I dont even do the mod...  I can understand if everyone was out there charging an arm and a leg for this mod but its seems to be a simple mod(for people with the soldering skills) on normal ZZ\'s and bits and there are tuts all over for it.  I have this feeling its something really simple like a transistor or resistor(again not good with electronics) that is casueing the problem and when removed has no effect on anything else from the car.\r\n\r\n\r\nWell just to let you know You and CW has made me change my way about sprays and paint jobs.  I just did my first fade job and I will have pics up tomorrow(clearcoat dryin).  \r\n\r\nPete[/quote:a8866bcfd5]Yeah you know, I had offered to do a mosfet mod for Payaso for free, just to be cool, and he never got back to me. Then just this evening he mentions in my SS camaro thread that his car is with micro_Amps. I just took offense to that, you know that he\'d rather pay him top dollar than get a freebie off me. That just makes me more determined to figure this stupid SE thing out. ph2t is confident we can do it, I\'m just getting confused. I don\'t know, he\'s got an EE degree, so hopefully he can figure something out.\r\n\r\ndave\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd yeah, your paint jobs have been looking good, can\'t wait to see your fade. :grin: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:a8866bcfd5]\r\n\r\n I am not sure what micro does for a living or what qualifications he has but really it should be that hard to figure it out an I know you guys will do it.  Main problem is that ph2t doesn;t have one to work with so when he starts to brain storm its all in therey(sp?).\r\n\r\n  I bet that micro took 80 percent of what ph2t (along with others) had to say and figured it out.\r\n\r\n  As for payaso I am not sure why he would not wait as he knows it will be out soon.  Hell I bet the germans have it figured out and will post something soon enough.\r\n\r\n  Well I have al the faith in you guys and even though I have no clue what is up with the mod I make sure to check all for forums I come accross cause you never know.\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12568,'6a31ac5eb0','here\'s my shipping addy mate\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nEAST BENTLEIGH   VIC   3165\r\nAUSTRALIA\r\n\r\nThanks once again.'),(14221,'6cba2c46c4','Hey man,\r\n\r\ni was wondering if you could tell me what the bitPimps font is and were i can find it, if you cant tell me it\'s kool.\r\n\r\nMerry x mas'),(12570,'4ca6593796','I\'m back from the PostOffice.\r\n\r\nno insurance...she didn\'t ask.\r\n$9.70. for shipping to Aussieland.  AirMail..going out today.\r\n\r\n$24.99 for the RadioShack SE \r\n\r\nYou can pay me when you receive your goods or anytime before.\r\nMy paypal account:  noxorc@comcast.net\r\n\r\nLet me know when you receive it...So I can relax.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Nigel\r\n\r\nps...If all goes well with this..and you want to get an X-Mod, let me know.'),(13267,'40d60cc53f','Hey man, any movement on this?  Sorry to be a pain..\r\nCheers,\r\nMatt.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:40d60cc53f=\"payaso\"]No problem man.. I\'m going to the RS tomorrow, so I\'ll see what they got in stock for ya.\r\n\r\nHave you figured out how to FET the ZZ SEs?   Now that I have one of those, it\'s the \"real\" micro r/c of micro r/cs...lol\r\n\r\nAnd with that black Camaro body on it, I mean damn.....\r\n\r\nI\'ll let you know tomorrow dood.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:40d60cc53f]'),(13080,'f1ea58a825','Hey I just saw you over at ausmicro and noticed that you were on the \"Did these ever come to production\" thread.\r\n\r\n  Well I think that was another ploy by microamps to make some doe as he has a set of the tanks he wants to sell.  Not 2 minutes after I posted I would like them I got a PM saying if I want them before he posts them I can have them for $200usd for the pair.\r\n\r\n  Man I swear that guys getting on my nerves.  I had to pm you here cause hes a mod there and I am not sure what they can or can\'t see.\r\n\r\n  Someone should post on the board that they have the SBCG\'s fully fetted now and piss him off.\r\n\r\n  OK rant over hope things are going well there :) got my other se today.\r\n\r\nPS.  You should try and sell a custom at ausmicro forums they pay alot for shit :)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12572,'d0a8d55d19','[quote:d0a8d55d19=\"noxorc\"]I\'m back from the PostOffice.\r\n\r\nno insurance...she didn\'t ask.\r\n$9.70. for shipping to Aussieland.  AirMail..going out today.\r\n\r\n$24.99 for the RadioShack SE \r\n\r\nYou can pay me when you receive your goods or anytime before.\r\nMy paypal account:  noxorc@comcast.net\r\n\r\nLet me know when you receive it...So I can relax.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Nigel\r\n\r\nps...If all goes well with this..and you want to get an X-Mod, let me know.[/quote:d0a8d55d19]\r\n\r\nYou dilligent little bugger! thanks again! :smile: \r\n\r\nSo I\'ll pay you $35USD to your paysluts...\r\nI\'m waiting on payments from voodoo and sessiz that should put me in a positive balance over the $35.  that should be cool, expect payment approx middle of next week.\r\n\r\nThanks again dude.\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(14216,'fd3a772323','priority $4 is cool..  I\'ll send you another $14. Thanks G. :cool: \r\n\r\n-S'),(14217,'36bb19e43b','You got it holmes!\r\n\r\npeace\r\n-B');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14218,'4a4465447c','I sent the money out today. It should reach you in a couple of days.'),(14219,'36bb19e43b','You got it holmes!\r\n\r\npeace\r\n-B'),(14220,'3f328e618d','Awesome man.. I\'m always interested in spare anything..lol\r\n\r\nI went ahead, and changed the gears on my SE to the red ones, and it is easily my favorite car now...\r\n\r\nI\'m off till Sat. so if you feel like racin, come on down..  I was also thinking to go to \"Hobbies 24 Seven\" over on Bruce B Downs blvd. They have a MicroSizer track, and a Mini Z track, that I think the SE will be impressive on.\r\n\r\nMy PC crashed, but I\'m back online now.. \r\n\r\nHit me up.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(12574,'fb3bc640f6','Yo did you send your se to micro amps for fetting?'),(12576,'299344c9ca','go pick up an xmod dude. very nice. very quick. you will rock the tennis court.'),(12577,'992dfd0862','[quote:992dfd0862=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yo did you send your se to micro amps for fetting?[/quote:992dfd0862]\r\n\r\n\r\nYes sir I did..  Thing should be smokin ass fast when he\'s done..  I wish somebody local could do it.. Oh well. In time.lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12578,'8ba7465767','Well I am sure you will post the outcome when you get it back.\r\n\r\n  Maybe you could take some pics when you get it back of the obc and shit.  Who knows maybe we can figure something out after seeing it.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12579,'8ba7465767','Well I am sure you will post the outcome when you get it back.\r\n\r\n  Maybe you could take some pics when you get it back of the obc and shit.  Who knows maybe we can figure something out after seeing it.'),(12581,'d901fc038a','You got it man... sucks that I had to send it so far, but I\'m impatient...lol\r\n\r\nYou get that package yet?   Don\'t tell me \"Cliff Claven\" is getting jiggy wit it somewhere...lol\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12582,'2c92c3634c','No package yet bro but mail has been slow it seems latly.\r\n\r\nWas it an envelope or box?  sometimes that makes a difference'),(12583,'2c92c3634c','No package yet bro but mail has been slow it seems latly.\r\n\r\nWas it an envelope or box?  sometimes that makes a difference'),(12832,'b5b30d6418','[quote:b5b30d6418=\"VooDooMafia\"]  Thanks dude maybe I should try that I am getting shity run times and on the cars with 200mah cells I just keep putting them back on the charger like 10-15 times[/quote:b5b30d6418] That makes sense. I think all these people spending their money on 150mah to 200mah cells are wasting their money, because more mahs don\'t do nothing unless your charging longer. Besides I get 20+ min runtimes from stock 50mah Tomy cells, and it\'s a proven fact that NiCds have a lower internal resistance than NiMHs, and punch better. I prefer the Tomy batteries.\r\n\r\nThose 200mah batteries would probably take 10+ minutes to charge completely from 2 AAs. Takes my 150mah batteries about 7-8 to peak.'),(12585,'c37df023da','It\'s in a box the size of a bit box..    Off to go check my mail... *fingres crossed*....lol\r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12586,'0a0870dfc2','I still can\'t decide if I want one...    I guess I\'m acting like a bitch.lol\r\n\r\n\r\nI like a \"possi\" rearend in my cars.  I get payed today, so that\'s a dangerous thing.\r\n\r\n\r\nHow did you send that package?  The box that I sent it to you in probably wont fit in my box.. I haven\'t called the front office yet...  \r\n\r\nHopefully my mailman won\'t get jiggy wit it.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12587,'0a0870dfc2','I still can\'t decide if I want one...    I guess I\'m acting like a bitch.lol\r\n\r\n\r\nI like a \"possi\" rearend in my cars.  I get payed today, so that\'s a dangerous thing.\r\n\r\n\r\nHow did you send that package?  The box that I sent it to you in probably wont fit in my box.. I haven\'t called the front office yet...  \r\n\r\nHopefully my mailman won\'t get jiggy wit it.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12588,'0afc2fe50a','i still aint shipped it. ill do it monday. i was planning on using the one you sent but i can do it smaller. but your box will keep her safe.'),(12589,'0afc2fe50a','i still aint shipped it. ill do it monday. i was planning on using the one you sent but i can do it smaller. but your box will keep her safe.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12590,'42907054b5','Cool. You can send it in the one I used, and he\'ll just leave it at the front office all nice and safe like...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nOff to get paid like a hooker.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12591,'42907054b5','Cool. You can send it in the one I used, and he\'ll just leave it at the front office all nice and safe like...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nOff to get paid like a hooker.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12827,'c21be320a7','That $7 bucks includes the S/H charges.\r\n\r\n  You send $7 US I send well packaged 4.2 king motor to your address.'),(12593,'2438baf0d0','Just went nad checked the mail and nothing.\r\n\r\n  But to tell you the truth I am kinda glad that the mail is alittle slow on these as I have none of my ZZ\'s or Se\'s here, they are all off getting fetted and worked on.\r\n\r\n  So if they did come today I would wanna toss them shells on and race.'),(12594,'099947b598','[quote:099947b598=\"ph2t\"][quote:099947b598=\"noxorc\"]I\'m back from the PostOffice.\r\n\r\nno insurance...she didn\'t ask.\r\n$9.70. for shipping to Aussieland.  AirMail..going out today.\r\n\r\n$24.99 for the RadioShack SE \r\n\r\nYou can pay me when you receive your goods or anytime before.\r\nMy paypal account:  noxorc@comcast.net\r\n\r\nLet me know when you receive it...So I can relax.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Nigel\r\n\r\nps...If all goes well with this..and you want to get an X-Mod, let me know.[/quote:099947b598]\r\n\r\nYou dilligent little bugger! thanks again! :smile: \r\n\r\nSo I\'ll pay you $35USD to your paysluts...\r\nI\'m waiting on payments from voodoo and sessiz that should put me in a positive balance over the $35.  that should be cool, expect payment approx middle of next week.\r\n\r\nThanks again dude.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:099947b598]\r\n\r\nCool....think about the X-Mod....the beast is great... but different.'),(12595,'4d8ffa8088','Dave you seem to know about charging and battteries.\r\n\r\n  What would happen if I went to RS and got one of them 4,6 or 8 AA battery holders and hooked it upto a bit charge pad.\r\n\r\n  Would this help charging performance at all on normal bits?  I know you need this for duel bits but what would happen if you just charged a normal bit with it?\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12597,'2438baf0d0','Just went nad checked the mail and nothing.\r\n\r\n  But to tell you the truth I am kinda glad that the mail is alittle slow on these as I have none of my ZZ\'s or Se\'s here, they are all off getting fetted and worked on.\r\n\r\n  So if they did come today I would wanna toss them shells on and race.'),(12599,'898f155bdb','Where you gettin the FETs in your SEs done? Can CD do em? Or did you send it to the other side of the world too? lol\r\n\r\n\r\nDo you get mail on Sat.? It should be there by now..  Damn USPS.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12600,'87ee6e9f06','Well I sent a bunch of cars to CD and at that time they didn\'t have the full fet for the se.  So hes gonna hang onto it untill he figures it out.\r\n\r\n I wish micro Amps would just put a tut about it I know (including yours) hes done about 5 or more so hes made some cash on it already :(  what can ya do \r\n\r\nAs for mail, we get nothing on weekends.\r\n\r\nSo you gonna get an xmod?  I am gonna have to get one sent up this way they sound nice although atleast I can use the epoch in my house :)'),(12601,'f9371e21d6','[quote:f9371e21d6=\"VooDooMafia\"]Dave you seem to know about charging and battteries.\r\n\r\n  What would happen if I went to RS and got one of them 4,6 or 8 AA battery holders and hooked it upto a bit charge pad.\r\n\r\n  Would this help charging performance at all on normal bits?  I know you need this for duel bits but what would happen if you just charged a normal bit with it?\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:f9371e21d6]Well the slower you charge the less heat build up, and the more juice you can get in the battery. If you were to increase the charge rate, by adding a another battery, you would charge faster, so you would get longer runtimes from a timed charge, but if you were watching for peak with a volt meter, it would peak before it reached it\'s fullest capacity, and be limiting your potential.\r\n\r\nA lot of clones come with 3 cell chargers, I hate those for single cell cars, because I think they kill the car\'s battery, but I like those chargers for charging dual cell cars. I personally feel that 4-cells is too much to charge dual cells with, but you know, that\'s just  my opinion.\r\n\r\nDid that make any sense?\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14214,'6795835b3f','I picked up a kids collection off of Ebay for cheap.  Quite a few good things in it.  A lot of Zip Zap accessories including the Fast and Furious bodies (all of it is in original packaging).  If you think you might be interested, I\'ll bring the box over next time I come over for the races. :)'),(14215,'3f328e618d','Awesome man.. I\'m always interested in spare anything..lol\r\n\r\nI went ahead, and changed the gears on my SE to the red ones, and it is easily my favorite car now...\r\n\r\nI\'m off till Sat. so if you feel like racin, come on down..  I was also thinking to go to \"Hobbies 24 Seven\" over on Bruce B Downs blvd. They have a MicroSizer track, and a Mini Z track, that I think the SE will be impressive on.\r\n\r\nMy PC crashed, but I\'m back online now.. \r\n\r\nHit me up.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(12604,'b7894fbdcf','Yea it did thanks :)\r\n\r\n  I have beentalking with payaso and hes gonna look at the pbc and see if he can get some pics that might be of use.\r\n\r\n  That ficker micro amps has done atleast 5 se fets now so what the fuck is he waiting for on his tut.... How much does one need to make before its ok to release the info.\r\n\r\n  Well better not get me started.'),(12605,'6357c1d239','[quote:6357c1d239=\"ph2t\"]hey man, I checked postage, it will cost $7.50 AUS, for airmail.  That\'s $5USD.  So to total the order for the following:\r\n\r\n2 gloria\'s and one rx7 and 1 wheel set\r\n\r\nThat\'s then $13 + $5 = $18 total USD.\r\n\r\nSo just paypal me at ph2t@prahranpianos.com and I\'ll post it off on Monday.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:6357c1d239]\r\n\r\nOK dude I am just loggin onto my other computer now and sending the cash.\r\n\r\nCan you send it to my address and not the office?\r\n\r\nI will add it in the paypal msg');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13272,'a0f884db09','[quote:a0f884db09=\"bdebde\"]Hi again Cabo,\r\n\r\n I was wondering if you could send a test email (from bitpimps) to see if it is working. Seems my ISP\'s new spam filtering set up may be blocking any email that it can\'t confirm the sender of. If it is not too much trouble, I would appreciate it. Here is the address I am trying to check:\r\n\r\nbdebde@gte.net\r\n\r\nIf you send a copy to my hotmail account, I can verify that I got it. Hotmail address is:\r\n\r\nbdebde@hotmail.com\r\n\r\nThank you so very much (crosses fingers).[/quote:a0f884db09]Hey man,\r\nI can tell you now that the email address used when email is sent from bitPimps cannot be varified as it doesn\'t really exist. (that way I don\'t get spam back either)\r\nbecause there is no account setup with that particular email address, I cannot send email from that address, I merely use the smtp service.\r\n\r\nbasically the email you recieve from bitPimps gets sent from my smtp server, but the \"senders\" address (bitPimps) is fake and cannot be replied to, varified, etc.\r\n\r\nbecause of that, it really does no good for me to send you an email to the hotmail account, as the email I would send would use the smpt service as before, but with a varified and working address.\r\n\r\nI believe you can request from your ISP that you would like email from the particular smtp server to be allowed through.'),(13049,'fc3740a492','Yea right now I sell old toys and video games and they go well.\r\n\r\n  When ebay first started I went on and made an acount as a 1 year University student (female) that needed extra cash.  I would sell used undies(get a friend to wear them for a day) and get 90usd a pair, man I was selling 7-10 pairs a week but times have changed and you can sell that stuff anymore(well the way I listed it anyway).\r\n\r\n  Right now I have beenlisting the Initial D game cards that come in the tuneup set as they go for $25+.\r\n\r\n  But there are so many ways to make $$ on ebay.  I am also into reptiles and have sold supplis on there for 100 times what they are worth here. Its funnny the things people will buy');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12607,'c099ee4c64','[quote:c099ee4c64=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:c099ee4c64=\"ph2t\"]hey man, I checked postage, it will cost $7.50 AUS, for airmail.  That\'s $5USD.  So to total the order for the following:\r\n\r\n2 gloria\'s and one rx7 and 1 wheel set\r\n\r\nThat\'s then $13 + $5 = $18 total USD.\r\n\r\nSo just paypal me at ph2t@prahranpianos.com and I\'ll post it off on Monday.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:c099ee4c64]\r\n\r\nOK dude I am just loggin onto my other computer now and sending the cash.\r\n\r\nCan you send it to my address and not the office?\r\n\r\nI will add it in the paypal msg[/quote:c099ee4c64]\r\n\r\nDone and done.  :smile: \r\n\r\nIt will go out on Monday. \r\n\r\nCheers Pete,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(12608,'0090de217b','were abouts in canada you from'),(12609,'0090de217b','were abouts in canada you from'),(12611,'e2f33d91be','Burlington Its by toronto in Ontario\r\nyou'),(12612,'ea8c696809','Cool I am by St.Catharines but the falls :)\r\n\r\n\r\n  Us Canadian Bit freaks are few and far between.  \r\n\r\n  You deal with anything bigger then 1/64 scale?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13279,'55bf98d071','[quote:55bf98d071=\"payaso\"]I\'m so pissed off at my RS... I\'ve been there 3 times now, and they still don\'t have any of the tuner kits.  They tell me they\'re coming, but no sign yet. \r\n\r\nSorry for the delay, but I wanted to respond with good news.  I\'m going there after I get paid today also.   They seem to be the hottest item.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:55bf98d071]\r\n\r\nthanks man, I really appreciate your efforts :)\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(12826,'fa14ada0ed','Ok I\'m almost done. The MAT car went over without a hitch, but as you know, you\'ll have to ditch that 1.0.\r\n\r\nThe LXX Beetle has one small glitch. The FET mod went over fine, and it\'s screaming. (What\'s that a 4.2 Pro in there?) The only prob is for some reason after I put the FETs in the headlights stay on all the time. I disconnected them from the FET, and tried all over the place for somewhere else to put it, but no matter where I put it, the lights came on. I figure if you really want the lights you can wire a micro switch to them to turn them on. I hope that\'s cool, \'cause I\'m not sure what else I can do about it.\r\n\r\nI\'m getting ready to put the dual cell FET modded Zip Zap beast together. This car is gonna be too fast, but everyone should have at least one car that\'s too fast. ;)\r\n\r\nDave'),(12614,'7be5919867','Hey I am not sure on your feelings about just downloading softwear and just crackin it.\r\n\r\n  But I have a legit copy of Ulead VideoStudio 5.0 that is unregistered if you want it I can send it to ya.  It came with my firewire card.\r\n\r\n  I use 7.0 right now and love it :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12855,'7817bde026','[quote:7817bde026=\"crazydave\"][quote:7817bde026=\"ph2t\"]hey mate, just a quick question.  When you were taking the readings was that on a stock SE or one that had been modded with fets already?\r\n\r\nthanks dude,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:7817bde026]One that was already FETed, but just the NPNs, I haven\'t figured out how to do the PNPs yet. I have the foward FET stacked, that\'s why the readings are off balance for foward and reverse.\r\n\r\nI meant to get readings off my Mustang before I put any FETs in it, but wife wasn\'t around to help, and since I killed the steering in my first SE, I couldn\'t wait.\r\n\r\nThe Mustang seems much punchier, and had a lot longer runtime, even with the lights going. \r\n\r\nWant me to get readings from that one to see how they differ?\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:7817bde026]\r\n\r\nIf you could I\'d appreciate, just add more data to the s/sheet and upload it to the ftp, :)\r\n\r\nI\'ve gotten a model to work with now.   Basically apart from the 4 fets, I\r\nve added another component that is an inverter/buffer.   It\'s goal is to invert the high signal (2.37V) to a low voltage (0.2V) and vice versa.  This way we might get it to work.  The inverter is of similar size to the fets, another surface mount component,   They are available as free samples from onsemi.com but if I can get it working in a test circuit today I will mail you some I\'ve got,  You only need one per hbridge.\r\n\r\nI\'ll work on this and let you know.  Thanks again for your help dude.\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(12616,'0d3f66b8e5','[quote:0d3f66b8e5=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey I am not sure on your feelings about just downloading softwear and just crackin it.\r\n\r\n  But I have a legit copy of Ulead VideoStudio 5.0 that is unregistered if you want it I can send it to ya.  It came with my firewire card.\r\n\r\n  I use 7.0 right now and love it :)[/quote:0d3f66b8e5]I might take you up on that. Right now I\'m gonna look into these news group things my buddy was telling me about. I can get pretty anything I want there.\r\n\r\n...BUT I have something else to tell you....\r\n\r\n\r\nYour SE is going to be fully FETed when you get it!!!!!! :-D \r\n\r\nI found my problem, I thought it was odd they used all NPN transistors for the H-bridge, turns out I was partially doing my steering too. the 2 PNP that need to be flipped and jumpered are on the top of the board, duh, just like the original Zip Zaps. \r\n\r\nI\'ve confirmed this through my mistakes, I\'m 100% sure of this but I\'ve run out of time to test just how much performance this will give me, but it will definately boost the performance.\r\n\r\nCan I get a \'Hell Yeah\'?\r\n\r\nI said can I get a \"HELL YEAH\"!?!?\r\nAmen brother\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14211,'6795835b3f','I picked up a kids collection off of Ebay for cheap.  Quite a few good things in it.  A lot of Zip Zap accessories including the Fast and Furious bodies (all of it is in original packaging).  If you think you might be interested, I\'ll bring the box over next time I come over for the races. :)'),(14212,'467e530e3b','you want me send it priority $4 or first class $2?\r\n\r\npeace'),(14213,'fd3a772323','priority $4 is cool..  I\'ll send you another $14. Thanks G. :cool: \r\n\r\n-S'),(12824,'70b4f55687','what is the shipping+handling cost?????'),(12619,'c8fdb01529','Hells yea good you figured it out\r\n\r\n  I think if it was something so simple micro amps will look like a dick\r\n\r\n\r\nGOOD he should\r\n\r\n  As for the programs yea you can download anything you need hell I just downloaded my shit from kazza.\r\n\r\n  I can send it out anyway if you liek no biggy\r\n\r\nJust to also let you know we finally got the zipzaps here so if you are looking for those older bodies we got em :)\r\n\r\n  Just check out radioshack.ca  then do a store locator, ontario, St.Catharines \r\n\r\nif you are looking for older stuff that is retired there.'),(12854,'7817bde026','[quote:7817bde026=\"crazydave\"][quote:7817bde026=\"ph2t\"]hey mate, just a quick question.  When you were taking the readings was that on a stock SE or one that had been modded with fets already?\r\n\r\nthanks dude,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:7817bde026]One that was already FETed, but just the NPNs, I haven\'t figured out how to do the PNPs yet. I have the foward FET stacked, that\'s why the readings are off balance for foward and reverse.\r\n\r\nI meant to get readings off my Mustang before I put any FETs in it, but wife wasn\'t around to help, and since I killed the steering in my first SE, I couldn\'t wait.\r\n\r\nThe Mustang seems much punchier, and had a lot longer runtime, even with the lights going. \r\n\r\nWant me to get readings from that one to see how they differ?\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:7817bde026]\r\n\r\nIf you could I\'d appreciate, just add more data to the s/sheet and upload it to the ftp, :)\r\n\r\nI\'ve gotten a model to work with now.   Basically apart from the 4 fets, I\r\nve added another component that is an inverter/buffer.   It\'s goal is to invert the high signal (2.37V) to a low voltage (0.2V) and vice versa.  This way we might get it to work.  The inverter is of similar size to the fets, another surface mount component,   They are available as free samples from onsemi.com but if I can get it working in a test circuit today I will mail you some I\'ve got,  You only need one per hbridge.\r\n\r\nI\'ll work on this and let you know.  Thanks again for your help dude.\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12621,'0388431af6','You know, actually, I feel stupid for not realizing this in the first place. I have a feeling micro_Amps is just torturing ph2t, because he knows he\'ll figure it out as soon as he gets his car, and meanwhile laughing at my ignorance.\r\n\r\nBut that\'s ok, because I figured it out, and no one had to help me, and it\'s not even like I have a degree like those guys, I\'m just a guitar player who always sticks his nose where it don\'t belong, then I got to learn to fix my mistakes.\r\n\r\nYou can learn a lot from your mistakes. ;)\r\n\r\nYeah that\'s cool you guys got Zip Zaps up there now. I pretty much grabbed what I wanted from the first batch of stuff, but later on I might just want you to pick up one of them body sets, if I get an urge to paint one of those cars.\r\n\r\ndave'),(12823,'ad9916036b','[quote:ad9916036b=\"CaboWabo\"]yo man.\r\nany chance you\'d be willing to trade one of those super hero bodies for something?\r\nor trade + $?\r\n\r\nwhat the deal is, I want one of those bodies, but I don\'t want the chassis and shit.\r\n\r\nhowever....\r\n\r\nI completely understand if you wouldn\'t wanna part the shit out, I probably wouldn\'t either unless the situation fit perfectly for me.\r\n\r\njust thought I\'d ask.\r\nlemme know.[/quote:ad9916036b]\r\n\r\n  Sure man its all good to me I have some more on the way anyway (as I said I got a real good deal on these).\r\n\r\n  Let me know what you had in mind and plus I can prolly trade the chassie and and controller off to someone or use it to practice some mods.\r\n\r\nLet me know what you were thinking.'),(12623,'65cc3c1e32','OK bro well let me know on the body kits :)\r\n\r\n  I have another se on the way that will prolly hit the \"goto Daves\" list.\r\n\r\n\r\n  I am suprised that I dont play any instruments as my dad was a base player and my uncle (plays everything) played with black flag why back inthe day.\r\n\r\n  Tried to learn but I was more into percution(SP?) and could not really aford it as a kid.\r\n\r\n  Well maybe my kids will take it up who knows lol.\r\n\r\n  As for the program I am gonna drop it inthe mail on Monday if you use it great if not send it to the next pimp.  If you dont mind burnt/pirate softwear then just let me know as my \"Other work\" (IMB Networking for K1 division) has tons of stuff for me to take and burn.\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12625,'22e54134ce','Will it ever ship?  :lol:'),(12628,'87ee6e9f06','Well I sent a bunch of cars to CD and at that time they didn\'t have the full fet for the se.  So hes gonna hang onto it untill he figures it out.\r\n\r\n I wish micro Amps would just put a tut about it I know (including yours) hes done about 5 or more so hes made some cash on it already :(  what can ya do \r\n\r\nAs for mail, we get nothing on weekends.\r\n\r\nSo you gonna get an xmod?  I am gonna have to get one sent up this way they sound nice although atleast I can use the epoch in my house :)'),(12630,'73604d26cd','ya dude. i still got it. ill give ya a car with the shell too and some springs i guess for the wait. hopefully ill do it monday. i gots money now just no car to drive to the po but ill try to do it on my lunch monday. sorry.'),(12631,'ea8c696809','Cool I am by St.Catharines but the falls :)\r\n\r\n\r\n  Us Canadian Bit freaks are few and far between.  \r\n\r\n  You deal with anything bigger then 1/64 scale?'),(14194,'7070ea45b1','hey dude i was wondering if msn is working for you, u done the s2000 yet. lol i cant wait to see it.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12853,'83edeb6904','[quote:83edeb6904=\"ph2t\"]hey mate, just a quick question.  When you were taking the readings was that on a stock SE or one that had been modded with fets already?\r\n\r\nthanks dude,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:83edeb6904]One that was already FETed, but just the NPNs, I haven\'t figured out how to do the PNPs yet. I have the foward FET stacked, that\'s why the readings are off balance for foward and reverse.\r\n\r\nI meant to get readings off my Mustang before I put any FETs in it, but wife wasn\'t around to help, and since I killed the steering in my first SE, I couldn\'t wait.\r\n\r\nThe Mustang seems much punchier, and had a lot longer runtime, even with the lights going. \r\n\r\nWant me to get readings from that one to see how they differ?\r\n\r\nDave'),(12633,'a40da25a8d','kinda \r\nZips are still 1/64 but....\r\nI have a few audleys 1/32 \r\none is really fast \r\nI also have a bunch of radio shack/tyco 1/10th rc\'s\r\nand I plan on buying a nitro rc truck I am still not sure what to get but I\'m thinking a t-max 2.5 I need to know if you can buy one withought a remote though \r\n\r\nso what do you have ?'),(12634,'6cb6566528','Well I have ots of bits and zip zaps some digi q stuff, the combat Q IR tanks, misc other rc stuff (bikes, tanks,subs,boats) epoch 1.43 indoor racer and a mini Z.\r\n\r\n  Waiting to get a xmod and have some rc planes and helicopters on the way.\r\n\r\n  You should be able to get a t-max without the remote (I take it you have remote already?)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12635,'03d8585d0c','Chris Kostecki but not sure if he used a different last name for stage will ask him.  This was way back when flag first started and were playing alot in NY.  And rollings had hair lol'),(14785,'e3aa0d23aa','check out http://www.questformadness.com I beleive that there is a tri cell mod how to in there somewhere.'),(14196,'d7e5e7b7bb','Cool beans man.. I\'m sending it now.\r\n\r\nSteve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn Lake Circle South Apt C\r\nSt. Petersburg FL. 33712\r\n\r\n\r\nPeace.\r\n\r\n-S'),(12637,'e392f09946','[quote:e392f09946=\"VooDooMafia\"]Chris Kostecki but not sure if he used a different last name for stage will ask him.  This was way back when flag first started and were playing alot in NY.  And rollings had hair lol[/quote:e392f09946]Yeah Chuck Dukowski played in the pre-Rollins days, after left they went through an ever changing array of bass players. So I have no doubt your uncle could have played with them. Dale Nixon played on my favorite Black Flag album, \'My War\'.\r\n\r\nHey, that MAT car showed up today. Right on! That was quick.\r\n\r\nMy wife hates it, thinks it\'s ugly, makes me like it more. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(12639,'ed150bd732','Glad it made it ok and yea that was fast :)\r\n\r\n  I just packed up that program and will mail it monday morn :) If ther eis other programs you are looking for let me know I can get them and burn them from work.\r\n\r\n  My dad is a big base player aswell but is now kickin himself for selling his base(76 rickey), one day for fathers day I wil have to find it for him again :)\r\n\r\n  How is the Se\'s going was that the problem  :???:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12641,'4b52a1c8c0','[quote:4b52a1c8c0=\"VooDooMafia\"]Glad it made it ok and yea that was fast :)\r\n\r\n  I just packed up that program and will mail it monday morn :) If ther eis other programs you are looking for let me know I can get them and burn them from work.\r\n\r\n  My dad is a big base player aswell but is now kickin himself for selling his base(76 rickey), one day for fathers day I wil have to find it for him again :)\r\n\r\n  How is the Se\'s going was that the problem  :???:[/quote:4b52a1c8c0]I just got home from work, and just checking in while the ol\' solding iron heats up. I\'ll know soon, real soon. :-D \r\n\r\nDave'),(12643,'96401f8013','I found my problem, I thought it was odd they used all NPN transistors for the H-bridge, turns out that was half of 2 H-bridges, I was partially doing my steering too. The 2 PNP that need to be flipped and jumpered are on the top of the board, duh, just like the original Zip Zaps. \r\n\r\nI\'ve confirmed this through my mistakes. I\'m 110% sure of this, but I\'ve run out of time to test just how much performance this will give me, but I think this is what we\'re looking for.\r\n\r\nDave'),(12644,'53b2e0dd9c','[quote:53b2e0dd9c=\"crazydave\"]I found my problem, I thought it was odd they used all NPN transistors for the H-bridge, turns out that was half of 2 H-bridges, I was partially doing my steering too. The 2 PNP that need to be flipped and jumpered are on the top of the board, duh, just like the original Zip Zaps. \r\n\r\nI\'ve confirmed this through my mistakes. I\'m 110% sure of this, but I\'ve run out of time to test just how much performance this will give me, but I think this is what we\'re looking for.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:53b2e0dd9c]\r\n\r\nThat\'s great to hear man.  I\'ve just been told by nox that my SE is now on it\'s way down under.  I can\'t wait to get it and see what can be done.\r\n\r\nI still think the drive voltage of 0.9V from the output of the receiver IC will be a problem though.  You need a minimum of 2V to properly turn a mosfet on and really 3v+ is better to get the performance of low resistance that the datasheets specify.\r\n\r\nHow did you go with those extra readings and pics?  any luck?\r\n\r\ncheers man,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12645,'53b2e0dd9c','[quote:53b2e0dd9c=\"crazydave\"]I found my problem, I thought it was odd they used all NPN transistors for the H-bridge, turns out that was half of 2 H-bridges, I was partially doing my steering too. The 2 PNP that need to be flipped and jumpered are on the top of the board, duh, just like the original Zip Zaps. \r\n\r\nI\'ve confirmed this through my mistakes. I\'m 110% sure of this, but I\'ve run out of time to test just how much performance this will give me, but I think this is what we\'re looking for.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:53b2e0dd9c]\r\n\r\nThat\'s great to hear man.  I\'ve just been told by nox that my SE is now on it\'s way down under.  I can\'t wait to get it and see what can be done.\r\n\r\nI still think the drive voltage of 0.9V from the output of the receiver IC will be a problem though.  You need a minimum of 2V to properly turn a mosfet on and really 3v+ is better to get the performance of low resistance that the datasheets specify.\r\n\r\nHow did you go with those extra readings and pics?  any luck?\r\n\r\ncheers man,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(14207,'8be53a9136','[quote:8be53a9136=\"payaso\"]Man do I feel like a dipshit...lol  That\'s what I get for not being a better reader.\r\n\r\nOn top of that, I blew my check (or what I can) on Christmas stuff for the wife..  Can I send the cash when I get paid on Fri.? \r\n\r\nWhat\'s the total?\r\n\r\npeace homie\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:8be53a9136]\r\nlol-\r\n\r\nat least the wife\'s gonna be happy too! \r\nyeah that\'s fine bro fridays cool, i\'ll try to send the stuff out to you tomorrow and you can transfer the cash when the doughs in your acct.\r\n\r\nnow do you want all 6 bodies for $10 + shipping?\r\n\r\nI know I said I didn\'t want to break up the groups, I\'d rather get rid of them all at once if ya know what i mean, but i can make an exception if you don\'t really don\'t want the others. lemme know.\r\n\r\npeace\r\n-B\r\n\r\np.s. - i can send\'em out first class instead of priority to lessen the shipping too.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14208,'dc5339b669','Cool man... I\'ll take all of em for 10+S/H..  Thanks dood.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(14209,'dc5339b669','Cool man... I\'ll take all of em for 10+S/H..  Thanks dood.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(14210,'467e530e3b','you want me send it priority $4 or first class $2?\r\n\r\npeace'),(12647,'44d8dc0966','nice well hope thats it so can shove it up micros ass :)'),(12648,'28d7bf85dc','[quote:28d7bf85dc=\"ph2t\"][quote:28d7bf85dc=\"crazydave\"]I found my problem, I thought it was odd they used all NPN transistors for the H-bridge, turns out that was half of 2 H-bridges, I was partially doing my steering too. The 2 PNP that need to be flipped and jumpered are on the top of the board, duh, just like the original Zip Zaps. \r\n\r\nI\'ve confirmed this through my mistakes. I\'m 110% sure of this, but I\'ve run out of time to test just how much performance this will give me, but I think this is what we\'re looking for.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:28d7bf85dc]\r\n\r\nThat\'s great to hear man.  I\'ve just been told by nox that my SE is now on it\'s way down under.  I can\'t wait to get it and see what can be done.\r\n\r\nI still think the drive voltage of 0.9V from the output of the receiver IC will be a problem though.  You need a minimum of 2V to properly turn a mosfet on and really 3v+ is better to get the performance of low resistance that the datasheets specify.\r\n\r\nHow did you go with those extra readings and pics?  any luck?\r\n\r\ncheers man,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:28d7bf85dc]Yeah I got the readings. I think my first ones are off, because I was trying to hold the probes with one hand, and pull the trigger at the same time. I got my wife to help me the second time and got more accurate readings. I was gonna take the pictures, but the batteries in the camera went dead, and it takes 15 hours to charge them. Meanwhile I discovered this.\r\n\r\nRight now is the first chance I\'m getting to test it, so I\'m gonna go do that with what time I have left tonight.\r\n\r\nYou know that Mustang I picked up is a lot peppier than the RX-7 Savannah I had. I\'m curious to see how that ones does with FETs.\r\n\r\nYou know which car Nox is sending you?\r\n\r\nDave'),(12649,'7c2af6ee50','[quote:7c2af6ee50=\"crazydave\"][quote:7c2af6ee50=\"ph2t\"][quote:7c2af6ee50=\"crazydave\"]I found my problem, I thought it was odd they used all NPN transistors for the H-bridge, turns out that was half of 2 H-bridges, I was partially doing my steering too. The 2 PNP that need to be flipped and jumpered are on the top of the board, duh, just like the original Zip Zaps. \r\n\r\nI\'ve confirmed this through my mistakes. I\'m 110% sure of this, but I\'ve run out of time to test just how much performance this will give me, but I think this is what we\'re looking for.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:7c2af6ee50]\r\n\r\nThat\'s great to hear man.  I\'ve just been told by nox that my SE is now on it\'s way down under.  I can\'t wait to get it and see what can be done.\r\n\r\nI still think the drive voltage of 0.9V from the output of the receiver IC will be a problem though.  You need a minimum of 2V to properly turn a mosfet on and really 3v+ is better to get the performance of low resistance that the datasheets specify.\r\n\r\nHow did you go with those extra readings and pics?  any luck?\r\n\r\ncheers man,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:7c2af6ee50]Yeah I got the readings. I think my first ones are off, because I was trying to hold the probes with one hand, and pull the trigger at the same time. I got my wife to help me the second time and got more accurate readings. I was gonna take the pictures, but the batteries in the camera went dead, and it takes 15 hours to charge them. Meanwhile I discovered this.\r\n\r\nRight now is the first chance I\'m getting to test it, so I\'m gonna go do that with what time I have left tonight.\r\n\r\nYou know that Mustang I picked up is a lot peppier than the RX-7 Savannah I had. I\'m curious to see how that ones does with FETs.\r\n\r\nYou know which car Nox is sending you?\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:7c2af6ee50]\r\n\r\nYeah I\'m getting the Mazda Savanna FC3S RX-7 White from nox.\r\n\r\nCould you update the spreadsheet man and upload it please? I was gonna work on the design today.  I might of figured out how microamps did it.  \r\n\r\nAs I said earlier the fets needs at least 2V+ (idealy &gt;3V) to turn on properly.  You will notice the voltage readings from the motor terminals are around this range.   With a bit of circuit setups and theory, I believe you can use these voltage levels to drive the fet hbridge.\r\n\r\nThis sorta fits in with micro\'s statement on how \"now with the se fet modded you can do a daul/tri cell and get the added performance, before the fet mod a daul/tri would have done nothing to performance\".  This statement sorta implies that the hbridge is tapped straight into the +VE voltage rail now and before the fet mod the motor/hbridge got it\'s power via a regulated source that wouldn\'t change irrepective of the original voltage source.....\r\n\r\nhmmm,  :???: \r\n\r\nAlso, you can just email me at ph2t@prahranpianos.com if it\'s easier for you.   My msn addy is this email as well, if you\'re an msn user of course.\r\n\r\nCheers and thanks again mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12650,'6cb6566528','Well I have ots of bits and zip zaps some digi q stuff, the combat Q IR tanks, misc other rc stuff (bikes, tanks,subs,boats) epoch 1.43 indoor racer and a mini Z.\r\n\r\n  Waiting to get a xmod and have some rc planes and helicopters on the way.\r\n\r\n  You should be able to get a t-max without the remote (I take it you have remote already?)'),(12850,'cf36ee0e55','hey mate, just a quick question.  When you were taking the readings was that on a stock SE or one that had been modded with fets already?\r\n\r\nthanks dude,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(12851,'4ff2159d99','[quote:4ff2159d99=\"sessiz\"]Aight man I paypaled ya the ten bucks. Unfortunatly I still haven\'t gotten my debit card so I had to use the checkin acct. It says it should be cleared by the 30th.\r\nSorry for the delay again and thanks.[/quote:4ff2159d99]\r\n\r\ndude, it\'s cool.  I got the payslust echeck thingy, thanks once again!    It\'s funny you know that both of us were just mega busy over the last month for this trade to happen.   The irony shows you got it here fast as, then I modded it within the week, then just sat on the fucken thing untill I got a chance to go to the fucken post office.  again my apologies for that.   trust me (trust an aussie can ya?) next time you want this mod, or others done the turnaround time will be much quicker.   \r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(12652,'b6783c4f7c','I dont have a remote yet but plan on soon getting a JR XR3 I have heard good things about it and have also heard that the Traxx radio is not too good \r\nI wanted a 3 channel anyways because I want to finish building my robot.\r\n\r\nwow you got alot of stuff (most of the expensive things also) \r\nhow old are you buy the way?\r\n\r\nare you willing to trade/ sell any stuff there are some things I\'m looking for that you probably have');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12653,'a0a7a78cd1','I am one of the old guys of the PIMP hood (27).\r\n\r\n  I am always loking for mini z and epoch stuff.  I like to stay to the smaller scale stuff as my paved track is big enough for z scale stuff.\r\n\r\n What you have for trade?  what kind of things you looking for?'),(15911,'fd336a5d88','Can I order just the electronics for my X mod... I think I may have burnt them out.\r\n\r\nBrett'),(15912,'e7c5a21c31','[quote:e7c5a21c31=\"DarkTari\"]Been real busy lately, I\'ll try and get to it this weekend between changin oil, toppin swivel, retating tires, house shit, etc.[/quote:e7c5a21c31] :lol: I told Cabo you guys have probably been busy.\r\n\r\nIt\'s cool man, whenever you have time. I just wanted to help Cabo get his new gallery going, and you know we all love your stuff. So I thought I\'d bug you.  :-)'),(12655,'a234295b14','I just got an email update for this thread and went to click on the link and now it\'s says it doesn\'t exist :shock:  wtf?\r\n\r\ncheers man.\r\n\r\nMatt \"third draw\" Marcos. :grin:'),(12656,'7c2af6ee50','[quote:7c2af6ee50=\"crazydave\"][quote:7c2af6ee50=\"ph2t\"][quote:7c2af6ee50=\"crazydave\"]I found my problem, I thought it was odd they used all NPN transistors for the H-bridge, turns out that was half of 2 H-bridges, I was partially doing my steering too. The 2 PNP that need to be flipped and jumpered are on the top of the board, duh, just like the original Zip Zaps. \r\n\r\nI\'ve confirmed this through my mistakes. I\'m 110% sure of this, but I\'ve run out of time to test just how much performance this will give me, but I think this is what we\'re looking for.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:7c2af6ee50]\r\n\r\nThat\'s great to hear man.  I\'ve just been told by nox that my SE is now on it\'s way down under.  I can\'t wait to get it and see what can be done.\r\n\r\nI still think the drive voltage of 0.9V from the output of the receiver IC will be a problem though.  You need a minimum of 2V to properly turn a mosfet on and really 3v+ is better to get the performance of low resistance that the datasheets specify.\r\n\r\nHow did you go with those extra readings and pics?  any luck?\r\n\r\ncheers man,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:7c2af6ee50]Yeah I got the readings. I think my first ones are off, because I was trying to hold the probes with one hand, and pull the trigger at the same time. I got my wife to help me the second time and got more accurate readings. I was gonna take the pictures, but the batteries in the camera went dead, and it takes 15 hours to charge them. Meanwhile I discovered this.\r\n\r\nRight now is the first chance I\'m getting to test it, so I\'m gonna go do that with what time I have left tonight.\r\n\r\nYou know that Mustang I picked up is a lot peppier than the RX-7 Savannah I had. I\'m curious to see how that ones does with FETs.\r\n\r\nYou know which car Nox is sending you?\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:7c2af6ee50]\r\n\r\nYeah I\'m getting the Mazda Savanna FC3S RX-7 White from nox.\r\n\r\nCould you update the spreadsheet man and upload it please? I was gonna work on the design today.  I might of figured out how microamps did it.  \r\n\r\nAs I said earlier the fets needs at least 2V+ (idealy &gt;3V) to turn on properly.  You will notice the voltage readings from the motor terminals are around this range.   With a bit of circuit setups and theory, I believe you can use these voltage levels to drive the fet hbridge.\r\n\r\nThis sorta fits in with micro\'s statement on how \"now with the se fet modded you can do a daul/tri cell and get the added performance, before the fet mod a daul/tri would have done nothing to performance\".  This statement sorta implies that the hbridge is tapped straight into the +VE voltage rail now and before the fet mod the motor/hbridge got it\'s power via a regulated source that wouldn\'t change irrepective of the original voltage source.....\r\n\r\nhmmm,  :???: \r\n\r\nAlso, you can just email me at ph2t@prahranpianos.com if it\'s easier for you.   My msn addy is this email as well, if you\'re an msn user of course.\r\n\r\nCheers and thanks again mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14204,'d6ce46eb42','Man do I feel like a dipshit...lol  That\'s what I get for not being a better reader.\r\n\r\nOn top of that, I blew my check (or what I can) on Christmas stuff for the wife..  Can I send the cash when I get paid on Fri.? \r\n\r\nWhat\'s the total?\r\n\r\npeace homie\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(14205,'d6ce46eb42','Man do I feel like a dipshit...lol  That\'s what I get for not being a better reader.\r\n\r\nOn top of that, I blew my check (or what I can) on Christmas stuff for the wife..  Can I send the cash when I get paid on Fri.? \r\n\r\nWhat\'s the total?\r\n\r\npeace homie\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(14206,'8be53a9136','[quote:8be53a9136=\"payaso\"]Man do I feel like a dipshit...lol  That\'s what I get for not being a better reader.\r\n\r\nOn top of that, I blew my check (or what I can) on Christmas stuff for the wife..  Can I send the cash when I get paid on Fri.? \r\n\r\nWhat\'s the total?\r\n\r\npeace homie\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:8be53a9136]\r\nlol-\r\n\r\nat least the wife\'s gonna be happy too! \r\nyeah that\'s fine bro fridays cool, i\'ll try to send the stuff out to you tomorrow and you can transfer the cash when the doughs in your acct.\r\n\r\nnow do you want all 6 bodies for $10 + shipping?\r\n\r\nI know I said I didn\'t want to break up the groups, I\'d rather get rid of them all at once if ya know what i mean, but i can make an exception if you don\'t really don\'t want the others. lemme know.\r\n\r\npeace\r\n-B\r\n\r\np.s. - i can send\'em out first class instead of priority to lessen the shipping too.'),(14201,'361a25067a','Well I got my first one from Micro Amps but if you ask me he over charges.\r\n\r\n  But for the most part I get crazydave to do them, I have got one from Superfly aswell, and ph2t.\r\n\r\n  I have some fets on teh way but have to get some cheap clones to try them on.  Thats the shity thing I order all my RC stuff out of Hong Kong, Japan and the US as we have nothing cheap here.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14202,'9defc1440a','Aight bro, they\'re on their way! Enjoy!\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\n-B'),(14203,'9defc1440a','Aight bro, they\'re on their way! Enjoy!\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\n-B'),(12846,'6caae2915e','Well, I had an accident Saturday when I was moving an entertainment center and cut/smashed a few fingers.  They should recover. :lol:  The group buy thing at ToyEast sounds good.  I\'ll try and contact you later in the week.'),(12848,'a8db4b0e25','[quote:a8db4b0e25=\"Grunge\"]Well, I had an accident Saturday when I was moving an entertainment center and cut/smashed a few fingers.  They should recover. :lol:  The group buy thing at ToyEast sounds good.  I\'ll try and contact you later in the week.[/quote:a8db4b0e25]\r\n\r\n\r\nWhoa dude, that sucks... That\'s gonna hinder driving skills. lol  I hate moving.\r\n\r\n\r\nCall me when you feel up to a race.  I\'m always home.\r\n\r\nThe Toyeast thing would be awesome.  And my new MS Pro from Target rocks.  Great buy.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(12849,'cf36ee0e55','hey mate, just a quick question.  When you were taking the readings was that on a stock SE or one that had been modded with fets already?\r\n\r\nthanks dude,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12660,'2216c95b6f','[quote:2216c95b6f=\"VooDooMafia\"]nice well hope thats it so can shove it up micros ass :)[/quote:2216c95b6f]Well gotta couple setbacks. \r\n\r\nOne, I messed up somewhere. My cars currently not fuctioning. (I don\'t say dead anymore, because death is permanent). I can\'t figure out what went wrong, but I was up late last night, and satuarday is a rough day at work for me. I\'m gonna have a beer, sleep on on it, and hope I have an answer with a clear head in the morning\r\n\r\nSecond, ph2t got back to me, and he thinks ther is more to it, because micro_amps says that you can run dual cells now where as before you couldn\'t. He still believes that .9v is not enough to get them FETs to open up all the way. He believe that micro_amps has tapped straight into the VE+.\r\n\r\nAnyways, not quite there yet, but we\'re making progress. I\'m gonna get your cars done up, and out on Monday morning so you can at least enjoy your others cars for now. \r\n\r\nph2t\'s SE is in the mail now, so it shouldn\'t be more than a week or 2 at the latest before we figure it out.\r\n\r\nI really believe micro_amps left ph2t enough clues so he can figure it out as soon as he gets it, then the 2 of them can have a good laugh at my expense, but the only glitch in the scheme is he pissed off ph2t, and now he\'s working for me. :lol: \r\n\r\nyeah I know that kinda makes me sound like a paranoid freak, but when micro_amps POed ph2t, ph2t came out with a bunch of shit, like he wanted to write a FET tutorial, but micro_amos asked him not to. Which proves that he (micro_Amps) has been deliberately withholding info, and more than likely does not like me for putting it out there.\r\n\r\nOh yeah he\'s a devious plotter, but I\'m on to him, and I\'ve been spending every waking hour trying to expose him.\r\n\r\nSorry, damn beer, I\'m getting carried away now.\r\n\r\n :drinkin: Love you man. (hic) j/k\r\n\r\nReally I am glad I decided to be a pal, and hook you up with those resistors, you\'ve turned out to be a way cool guy. 8-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(13228,'dee8a06ccd','Hey man, im going to be picking up your X5 this weekend. Would you check up on those alloys your machining? I have no more shoes for my Gloria in Flossin. I hope you can hook me up too. Thanks a whole bunch G! -Mike');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13229,'a05b4f121b','[quote:a05b4f121b=\"JAC4412\"]hey  did you get my email???????\r\n\r\nDoes this package come in regular mail???\r\nor Ups???\r\n\r\nalso email me when you get the letter[/quote:a05b4f121b]\r\n\r\n  It will be sent regular mail\r\n\r\n  I will PM you when the letter comes in and motor is sent.'),(13232,'29356449df','ok thanks 8)'),(12818,'195231d493','the motor will come in a little box backing in foam then in a larger padded envolope.\r\n\r\nYes American cash.'),(12819,'2acad2bdcc','yo man.\r\nany chance you\'d be willing to trade one of those super hero bodies for something?\r\nor trade + $?\r\n\r\nwhat the deal is, I want one of those bodies, but I don\'t want the chassis and shit.\r\n\r\nhowever....\r\n\r\nI completely understand if you wouldn\'t wanna part the shit out, I probably wouldn\'t either unless the situation fit perfectly for me.\r\n\r\njust thought I\'d ask.\r\nlemme know.'),(13295,'b9e037e22e','[quote:b9e037e22e=\"crazydave\"]Hey how\'s going? Getting settled in yet? Been busy over here, stressing out, trying to figure out how to FET the SE, because micro_amps is playing tight with his info, then my wife goes and quits her job, as if I don\'t have enough on my mind.\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna send you back the cars that are done, so I don\'t have so many of your cars here. So give me your address, and I\'ll get those out in the next few days.\r\n\r\nI solved the problem with the Thunder Charger, but I\'m still working on the Micro Speed, and that yellow Mini. I was talking to ph2t, he turned me on to some P-channel FETs, I believe those should solve my problem. I\'m gonna order some of those, so I can do your cars up properly.\r\n\r\nI still have to mount the alloys. I keep procrastinating on that, but as you\'ve found out, ithey\'re a bitch, and because each set is different, each one has it\'s own frustrations that come along with it.\r\n\r\n...but I\'ll get to them, soon, I promise.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHey, been meaning to ask, what\'s the stuff you get around there like? We\'re just coming out of the dry season, and my apartment is wreaking like a skunk right now.  :-D ;)\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:b9e037e22e]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m doing pretty well with the daytime thing......I\'m still keeping my fingers crossed that a night -time position will open up soon.\r\n\r\nI\'m cool with the time delays...no worries there.....I\'ve been pretty busy cleaning up and repairing stuff in my house. I rent a house for real cheap, and we (my landlord...but my house) have a city inspection coming up, so I\'ve been doing most of the work myself, mostly paint touch-ups and moldings and shit....I have always felt that speed is less important than doing the job correctly, so whenever\'s clever homie......and hell yeah...those damn rims  :mad: , I definitely understand that one.....\r\n\r\nI only get high quality here (pun intended :grin:).....one 1/8th is $50.00 and I get between 4 and 5 grams.....not too bad.....I haven\'t had any good skunk in awhile...we call what I get out here..Chronic....also known as Endo..Crypt..Fifty/Hun..etc...now I\'m definitely going to have to come out there....me and you will be like this :drinkin:, but with this  &lt;::::# ~~~ \r\ngotta love it :smoking:\r\n\r\nheres my address again.....and you might as well give me yours again....I\'ve tried messing with this Digi-Q and now its your turn :grin:....and I\'ve got a couple of ZZ bodies I\'m sending you too.... :driving: .....\r\nlater...........\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWayne Simard\r\n1422 West Monon Drive\r\nBloomington, IN 47403-3020');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12822,'223277f2e8','[quote:223277f2e8=\"crazydave\"][quote:223277f2e8=\"VooDooMafia\"]Thanks for the info I didn\'t know letting it paint sit would effect the clear coat now I with I just left it cause I prolly wont be driving this one anyway(not enough chassies).\r\n\r\n  Man I am just full of q\'s today.\r\n\r\n  What about peak charging? Is there a simple way to do so?  I think I remember you saying you do it with a normal charger and a volt meter but how you do both at once? Do you have a pic of your charging setup?\r\n\r\n BTW how you licking that lap counter? I was thinking of getting one in my next order with toyet or from ebay.[/quote:223277f2e8]Here\'s my chargeing setup. It\'s a Cannonball charger base, with a Thunder charger base attached to it. That way i can charge just about anything, and whatever pad is not being used, I just lay my meters probes across the terminals. The clips help hold them in place.\r\n\r\n [img:223277f2e8]http://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/charger.jpg[/img:223277f2e8]\r\n\r\nSo far, I\'m not digging the lap counter. It\'s not sensitive enough. Sucks driving your car back \'n\' forth trying to get the counter to register it. Honestly though, I haven\'t had the time to really play with it. It may just need to be set up just right.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:223277f2e8]\r\n\r\n\r\n  Thanks dude maybe I should try that I am getting shity run times and on the cars with 200mah cells I just keep putting them back on the charger like 10-15 times'),(12662,'a27dde5e65','[quote:a27dde5e65=\"crazydave\"][quote:a27dde5e65=\"VooDooMafia\"]nice well hope thats it so can shove it up micros ass :)[/quote:a27dde5e65]Well gotta couple setbacks. \r\n\r\nOne, I messed up somewhere. My cars currently not fuctioning. (I don\'t say dead anymore, because death is permanent). I can\'t figure out what went wrong, but I was up late last night, and satuarday is a rough day at work for me. I\'m gonna have a beer, sleep on on it, and hope I have an answer with a clear head in the morning\r\n\r\nSecond, ph2t got back to me, and he thinks ther is more to it, because micro_amps says that you can run dual cells now where as before you couldn\'t. He still believes that .9v is not enough to get them FETs to open up all the way. He believe that micro_amps has tapped straight into the VE+.\r\n\r\nAnyways, not quite there yet, but we\'re making progress. I\'m gonna get your cars done up, and out on Monday morning so you can at least enjoy your others cars for now. \r\n\r\nph2t\'s SE is in the mail now, so it shouldn\'t be more than a week or 2 at the latest before we figure it out.\r\n\r\nI really believe micro_amps left ph2t enough clues so he can figure it out as soon as he gets it, then the 2 of them can have a good laugh at my expense, but the only glitch in the scheme is he pissed off ph2t, and now he\'s working for me. :lol: \r\n\r\nyeah I know that kinda makes me sound like a paranoid freak, but when micro_amps POed ph2t, ph2t came out with a bunch of shit, like he wanted to write a FET tutorial, but micro_amos asked him not to. Which proves that he (micro_Amps) has been deliberately withholding info, and more than likely does not like me for putting it out there.\r\n\r\nOh yeah he\'s a devious plotter, but I\'m on to him, and I\'ve been spending every waking hour trying to expose him.\r\n\r\nSorry, damn beer, I\'m getting carried away now.\r\n\r\n :drinkin: Love you man. (hic) j/k\r\n\r\nReally I am glad I decided to be a pal, and hook you up with those resistors, you\'ve turned out to be a way cool guy. 8-) \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:a27dde5e65]\r\n\r\n Well for one those resitors are like gold to me cause other wise I would have to give RS my credit card # and I wouldn\'t want to do that.\r\n\r\n  Alittle off topic I have my boss coming up from your city on monday and I am hopin she gives me all the new promo codes as this would help out your cox shit a great deal.\r\n\r\n  As for micro amps I have called him out a few times, I even said on the ausmicro forums \"have you done enough so that you can give a tut on this yet\"  but his answers are always nerver clear to what he is going to do.\r\n\r\n  As for my se if you need to keep it keep it if you kill your or need another pig for testing go ahead it will be worth it inthe eand and I dont mind giving it up for the better good of the se fet\'s.\r\n\r\n  Yea I am not sure why the fet thing is  big deal over there(info wise) as it looks like ofr the basic bits it not hard if you have the soldering skills.  But then again I see things sell in OZ for a great deal more then here or the USA.  Hell I wanted the ae86 tuneup kit from micro but he wanted 50 bucks, all I wanted was the body so I went onthe net found som eebay seller in tokyo and e-mailed him.  Now I have 20 ae86 bullbacks and 5 tuneup kits coming COD with the pullbacks being 3.50 each and the kits 20 us each.\r\n\r\n  I am gonna post them on his site and undercut that fucker.\r\n\r\n  man I forget you are 3 hours behind sometimes you still got alot of beer drinking time left tonight LOL\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12841,'202279e4f6','Cool is it the one from the initial D set?  \r\n\r\nYea the lights dont pop up what it was is it had 2 hoods with lights up and 1 lights down.\r\n\r\n  Well if you wanna part with it cool :) if not let me know what you have to trade or whatever like I said i am easy.  Hells I dont even know what I have coming in some of the trades I have done since some of the guys with a rep on here I just let them choose what to send (superfly, crazydave).  Makes for a nice surprise  8-)'),(12842,'202279e4f6','Cool is it the one from the initial D set?  \r\n\r\nYea the lights dont pop up what it was is it had 2 hoods with lights up and 1 lights down.\r\n\r\n  Well if you wanna part with it cool :) if not let me know what you have to trade or whatever like I said i am easy.  Hells I dont even know what I have coming in some of the trades I have done since some of the guys with a rep on here I just let them choose what to send (superfly, crazydave).  Makes for a nice surprise  8-)'),(13410,'ff2421808a','I draw the graphic I want in paint and then print it on some masking tape like in your tutourial. But I have a basic vision b4 i acctually start.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12844,'b80795c0bb','Aight man I paypaled ya the ten bucks. Unfortunatly I still haven\'t gotten my debit card so I had to use the checkin acct. It says it should be cleared by the 30th.\r\nSorry for the delay again and thanks.'),(12845,'6caae2915e','Well, I had an accident Saturday when I was moving an entertainment center and cut/smashed a few fingers.  They should recover. :lol:  The group buy thing at ToyEast sounds good.  I\'ll try and contact you later in the week.'),(12664,'f60afe26ae','Welp I done messed up somewhere. I\'ve got no forward or reverse, and have no clue what I\'ve done wrong. :mad: \r\n\r\nHonestly Friday, and saturdays are exhausting days at work for me. i stayed up \'til midnight last night figureing these things out, and I\'m just tired and not getting something.\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna have a beer, (well what we americans call beer. ;)  :lol: ), and sleep on it. \r\n\r\nI just uploaded some pics to your server, check \'em out and see if maybe you can see where I went wrong. I don\'t see any shorts from sloppy solder joints, that\'s always the first thing I check. I have a feeling I\'m jumpering it wrong.\r\n\r\nI go do that spread sheet right now.\r\n\r\nI prefer to use the PM, because my Yahoo mail is sometimes slow, unless you\'d rather email, whatevers clever.\r\n\r\nMy email address that I use for MSN is davesmoejoe@hotmail.com. You might catch me on there sometimes trying to get ahold of my wife at work. Not much of a chat room guy, you know?\r\n\r\nDave'),(12665,'5350258f45','Got the Excel spread sheet updated, and uploaded.\r\n\r\nDisregard my last numbers, these ones are garanteed accurate, because I had an extra pair of hands helping this time.\r\n\r\nThe voltage is lower because I ran the car for few before I tested. the battery had a starting voltage of 2.73. Notice forward drops in voltage more than reverse. That\'s because the FETs are stacked in forward.\r\n\r\nMaybe you can explain this system to me. I would have thought one of the wires would be ground, and read 0. It seems to be a system of balance, but I don\'t get it. :? \r\n\r\nAs you upside down people say, cheers,\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12666,'73604d26cd','ya dude. i still got it. ill give ya a car with the shell too and some springs i guess for the wait. hopefully ill do it monday. i gots money now just no car to drive to the po but ill try to do it on my lunch monday. sorry.'),(15129,'aa130e1f50','Hi Payaso!\r\n\r\nThis is my address:\r\n\r\nMarek Statkiewicz\r\nKapitanska 20/13\r\n81-249 Gdynia\r\nPoland\r\n\r\n :rockon:  Miva'),(12668,'a6603dc3f0','[quote:a6603dc3f0=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\n Well for one those resitors are like gold to me cause other wise I would have to give RS my credit card # and I wouldn\'t want to do that.\r\n\r\n  Alittle off topic I have my boss coming up from your city on monday and I am hopin she gives me all the new promo codes as this would help out your cox shit a great deal.\r\n\r\n  As for micro amps I have called him out a few times, I even said on the ausmicro forums \"have you done enough so that you can give a tut on this yet\"  but his answers are always nerver clear to what he is going to do.\r\n\r\n  As for my se if you need to keep it keep it if you kill your or need another pig for testing go ahead it will be worth it inthe eand and I dont mind giving it up for the better good of the se fet\'s.\r\n\r\n  Yea I am not sure why the fet thing is  big deal over there(info wise) as it looks like ofr the basic bits it not hard if you have the soldering skills.  But then again I see things sell in OZ for a great deal more then here or the USA.  Hell I wanted the ae86 tuneup kit from micro but he wanted 50 bucks, all I wanted was the body so I went onthe net found som eebay seller in tokyo and e-mailed him.  Now I have 20 ae86 bullbacks and 5 tuneup kits coming COD with the pullbacks being 3.50 each and the kits 20 us each.\r\n\r\n  I am gonna post them on his site and undercut that fucker.\r\n\r\n  man I forget you are 3 hours behind sometimes you still got alot of beer drinking time left tonight LOL\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:a6603dc3f0]Yeah I don\'t know what the info withholding deal is. Even if you put it out there, people will send their cars to him. Look at me, I don\'t even advertise.\r\n\r\nI won\'t need your SE as test mule, I bought a second one for that purpose. I passed on an XMod to get it, and I was kicking myself in the ass, but since sometime one cvars isn\'t working, I\'m glad I did, helps me sleep at night knowing I still have one SE working.  :lol: \r\nI\'m hoping I can swing enough monet to get a XMod next payday, we\'ll see.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get those pullbacks, I\'ll want to buy a couple, or you  know, maybe trade a FET mod for \'em. I\'d like to have at least one AE86 body, but really I want more pullback wheels, those are my favorite so far.\r\n\r\n...and yep, I gots plenty of drinkin\' ahead of me. Sittin here by myself with a 12 pack, and a sack. Times like this when I wish you guys lived around the corner, and we could hook up and fuck with our cars. \r\n\r\nDave'),(12670,'266d6794e3','yp can you get some pics of the SE fetted PBC for us?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12672,'34188d4076','I have for 4.2 King motors (faster thenthe purple ones) if you are interested?\r\n\r\n  they are $7.00 including shipping :)'),(12674,'fa1213ef75','I was wondering if you still had the celica body and if so how much do you want for it??? Thanx and LMK'),(12675,'376968548f','yes, make offer.'),(12676,'0dfbf0f963','yes!!!!'),(12678,'d21772b449','hey,\r\n\r\nwhere in cali u locATED?  im in a suburb of frisco'),(12679,'77ab4b69f4','you have paypal? and how many would you like?'),(12681,'a7b9588491','No Idont have paypal. :( \r\ncan we do it another way??????'),(12683,'4e2b428710','You mentioned you had spare SE PCB. Still got that?\r\n\r\nI could really use it, since I\'ve popped too many contacts off mine, and I think the steering is now dead beyond repair.\r\n\r\nI can trade you a FETed Thunder Charger PCB for it.\r\n\r\nDave'),(12684,'36461f9551','yep I do take money orders.\r\n\r\nJust let me know how many motors you want as well if there is anything lese you are looking for.  Right now I also have the Tomy BCG Mat hero cars ofr $18.00 shipped plus I have a ton of other parts and shit.'),(12686,'cb86e86011','I just want a motor');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12815,'4c0ddea308','Well no package here yet today but since we dont have mail on weekend yours got more travel time.\r\n\r\n  Yea I kept 3 of these guys, 1 to keep in box, 1 to play with and 1 to paint and mod(getting fets now).\r\n\r\n  So you have the mach 1 anf this one so you need the silver car then hmmm :???:   that one is harder to find I have noticed.\r\n\r\n  there are a few other hero sets and SE/LE sets that I have been looking for.  I want the initial D set (although I have some of the tuneup boxes) and there was this hero set I say that came with a figure in the car(car looked like on old yellow beetle).\r\n\r\n  Well I will let you know when it comes in :) now I need to find a mini Z scale AE body so I have them all\r\n\r\nPete'),(13233,'aa6c8b5734','Hello Geisem can i ask a question, \r\n\r\nWhere can i find Alloy Wheels in Berlin.\r\n\r\nThanks for your helps.'),(13234,'3b49359604','Hello Sinned can i ask a question, \r\n\r\nWhere can i find Alloy Wheels in Berlin.\r\n\r\nThanks for your helps.'),(12689,'589b025147','Hey man. Just sending my monthly reminder that I\'m waiting on my stuff/');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12690,'b861cae952','OK you can send international money or for $7.00 to\r\n\r\nPeter Kostecki\r\n20 Water St.\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nL2V 2K3\r\nCanada\r\n\r\nI am not sure were you live but it takes about 3-4 days for me to get the money orders and 3-4 days for you to get the motor :)\r\n\r\nWill send it out as soon as money order comes in.\r\n\r\nAlso just to let you know these are fast motors and could cause the car to flip when turning so they do take some getting used to when driving :)\r\n\r\n\r\nPete'),(12692,'90c62ed3af','does international mean??????\r\nAmerican?\r\nI live in America'),(12701,'18b42f0c11','Yea I hear yea I think ther eare a few pimps close to me(hour drive) and Stoli is about 4 hours away the rest are in the US or other side of the world.  My friends are really diehard and just race my cars or a few have there own stock cars(no fun to race when you have fets or fast motors in yours).\r\n\r\n\r\n  I to am waiting on the xmods I think when sessiz has his paypal shit hooked up I will send him some cash to send me one.  The do look nice.  I have a mini z now and I have not unpacked it since the move about 4 or so months ago.  I personally fell inlove with the epoch cars they are small and super fast.\r\n\r\n  As for the pullbacks no prob but you you want some wheels now I have a bunch of sets still that I have not used casue of having the same probs with the alloys.\r\n\r\n  that bdebde dude got his se back from micro so I pmed him askng for pics of the pbc and shit maybe there will show something if not maybe just were micro has put the epoxy to see if there are more jump points or something.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete'),(12696,'171aa934a5','No I am in Canada\r\n\r\nI think I gave you the address in the last PM');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12698,'1e2ea24c5a','I dont have any Canadian Money though.'),(12700,'df36722184','ya i got my shit pretty much straight now. ill try hard to do it this week. it hopefully will be worth the wait. i wanted it to be a ghetto contest. sorry it turned out to be really ghetto.'),(12836,'160b919135','well I think for me, custom bodies would be better, but I\'m not certain you\'re in the market for that.\r\nif not, anyway you could give me an idea of what you might like to trade?'),(12837,'8f658f5557','well i am very easy(just ask my wife) but I dont suppose you have any AE86 bodies? \r\n\r\n  If not then I am open for anything really.'),(12838,'8f658f5557','well i am very easy(just ask my wife) but I dont suppose you have any AE86 bodies? \r\n\r\n  If not then I am open for anything really.'),(12840,'2b8bd0efb9','[quote:2b8bd0efb9=\"VooDooMafia\"]well i am very easy(just ask my wife) but I dont suppose you have any AE86 bodies? \r\n\r\n  If not then I am open for anything really.[/quote:2b8bd0efb9]lol, I do have one.\r\nI\'ve never done anything with it because I liked it too much.\r\nbut ya know...\r\nI\'d be willing to part with it for the super hero body.\r\n\r\nit\'s the initial d body that I have (I\'m not super familiar with it, but I know others are so maybe you are too)\r\nit\'s black and white.\r\nthe hood comes off, I don\'t think the headlamps pop up though like I\'ve seen before. at least I\'ve never forced them open, I\'m pretty sure they don\'t come open.\r\n\r\nanyways, that\'s what it is, never even been run on a body'),(12704,'f91fc7d685','[quote:f91fc7d685=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea I hear yea I think ther eare a few pimps close to me(hour drive) and Stoli is about 4 hours away the rest are in the US or other side of the world.  My friends are really diehard and just race my cars or a few have there own stock cars(no fun to race when you have fets or fast motors in yours).\r\n\r\n\r\n  I to am waiting on the xmods I think when sessiz has his paypal shit hooked up I will send him some cash to send me one.  The do look nice.  I have a mini z now and I have not unpacked it since the move about 4 or so months ago.  I personally fell inlove with the epoch cars they are small and super fast.\r\n\r\n  As for the pullbacks no prob but you you want some wheels now I have a bunch of sets still that I have not used casue of having the same probs with the alloys.\r\n\r\n  that bdebde dude got his se back from micro so I pmed him askng for pics of the pbc and shit maybe there will show something if not maybe just were micro has put the epoxy to see if there are more jump points or something.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:f91fc7d685]I just came from Radio Shack. That SOB made me drive a XMod, damn him. Now I absolutely have to have one!!!!! It was the Acura, the one I want too.\r\n\r\nThen I just bought that Mustang, and they got a grey Audi TT SE in. Damn them, it looks soo much better than the Mustang. Then I caught a glimpse of the new Jeep Wrangler. It looks great!!! But it\'s on a first edition chassis, and I have no need for any more of those, and I\'m not gonna spend 20 bucks for a body. Damn Radio Shack. I knew I shouldn\'t have went in there. \r\n\r\nIf they had that Acura there tuesday, I\'d have an XMod right now. Dammit why do they get everything in after I spend my money.\r\n\r\nSorry man, just walked in the door, and had to rant because I\'m kicking myself in the ass hardcore, for blowing my money the second I get it.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12804,'aeb12f027b','Has ne one ever tried to send yoy cash????'),(12805,'3eae96fd16','Has ne one ever tried to send you cash???? Because I dont know when I will be able to pick up a money order.'),(13280,'05ad86cea5','[quote:05ad86cea5=\"VooDooMafia\"]The package came intoday thanks everything looks and works great :)\r\n\r\n  Only a few Q\'s that I have;\r\n\r\n1. Does that wire for the lights just goto the power on the PBC?(not like I am gonna solder it back on but incase I feel the need for lights again lol)\r\n\r\n2. Do you have a use for the ZZ PBC and that chassie?  I just figured you would keep them as I have no use for them.  If so I will toss them in next package.\r\n\r\nWell I will paypal some cash on monday or tuesday for the other mods and shit but still not sure when they will go out(prolly next friday)\r\n\r\n  Again Thanks\r\n\r\nPete\r\n\r\nPS.  I will try and see if I can get nice picks of the flame job and post it up for yea :)[/quote:05ad86cea5]Cool, glad it arrived there all right. \r\n\r\nSo how do them flames compare to the pics? I always feel like my pictures take something away from my paint jobs.\r\n\r\nTo answer your questions:\r\n\r\n1. There is a row of five transistors, the light went to the middle transistor, which is now flipped, the reason i wasn\'t sure what pin to connect it to, but that not an issue now, because no matter where I touched it the light came on. \r\n\r\nI was just thinking, it was basically going to the B (backwards) terminal, that\'s where the transistor was originally leading to, so try hooking it to the motor terminals, in the motor bay. the one on the side first, and if that don\'t work, try the one going down the middle. That just may get the light functioning like normal again.\r\n\r\n2. I don\'t currently have a need for the PCB, or chassis, as I have several of each laying around, but you never know, they might come in handy to build a robot that will go to work for me.   :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWhenever your ready for those mods, I\'ll be up for it. I\'ll probably order more FETs whenever I get the money from you. That\'ll probably be before I get any money for my project ebay car. I\'m still working out the bugs in that. I was twisting the chassis to ensure it\'s bomb proof, and well it wasn\'t. :roll: I\'m known for overtesting stuff, but my other stretched chassis have passed the test, so this one\'s drying right now waiting for a second try. I\'ll have to repaint it, I guess I should have tested it before painting. Oh well, be better to list it on a Sunday night anyways.\r\n\r\nSo until then, have fun with your cars. 8-)'),(12807,'ce94fe219c','Yea I have got cash before this is under 10 bucks so its not like you sending 50 bucks or anything.\r\n\r\nJust wrap newpaper or something around it with cardboard from a cereal box and shit\r\nthen right on the envolope do not bend');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12809,'6606bf0108','Hey dude was just wondering if you got the package?  I know sessiz and crazydave got theres so you should have yours soon I take it :)\r\n\r\nPete'),(12811,'920d7308a9','ok i think ill do that.  I have the money by Saturday. So il put it in the mail by monday.  How are you gonna send the motor??? In an envelope to?????? And do you want American Money?'),(12813,'35b8e76388','I got it today, and am more than happy dood... thanks a million.\r\n\r\n\r\nNow I\'m torn on should I paint it, or leave it as a collectable?\r\n\r\nI\'m still missing the 3rd one. The funky looking one.  Man, CD made his look fantastic..\r\n\r\n\r\nYour package should be there today as well...  Tell me it\'s there...\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D'),(12814,'4c0ddea308','Well no package here yet today but since we dont have mail on weekend yours got more travel time.\r\n\r\n  Yea I kept 3 of these guys, 1 to keep in box, 1 to play with and 1 to paint and mod(getting fets now).\r\n\r\n  So you have the mach 1 anf this one so you need the silver car then hmmm :???:   that one is harder to find I have noticed.\r\n\r\n  there are a few other hero sets and SE/LE sets that I have been looking for.  I want the initial D set (although I have some of the tuneup boxes) and there was this hero set I say that came with a figure in the car(car looked like on old yellow beetle).\r\n\r\n  Well I will let you know when it comes in :) now I need to find a mini Z scale AE body so I have them all\r\n\r\nPete'),(12706,'00d7486195','[quote:00d7486195=\"crazydave\"][quote:00d7486195=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea I hear yea I think ther eare a few pimps close to me(hour drive) and Stoli is about 4 hours away the rest are in the US or other side of the world.  My friends are really diehard and just race my cars or a few have there own stock cars(no fun to race when you have fets or fast motors in yours).\r\n\r\n\r\n  I to am waiting on the xmods I think when sessiz has his paypal shit hooked up I will send him some cash to send me one.  The do look nice.  I have a mini z now and I have not unpacked it since the move about 4 or so months ago.  I personally fell inlove with the epoch cars they are small and super fast.\r\n\r\n  As for the pullbacks no prob but you you want some wheels now I have a bunch of sets still that I have not used casue of having the same probs with the alloys.\r\n\r\n  that bdebde dude got his se back from micro so I pmed him askng for pics of the pbc and shit maybe there will show something if not maybe just were micro has put the epoxy to see if there are more jump points or something.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:00d7486195]I just came from Radio Shack. That SOB made me drive a XMod, damn him. Now I absolutely have to have one!!!!! It was the Acura, the one I want too.\r\n\r\nThen I just bought that Mustang, and they got a grey Audi TT SE in. Damn them, it looks soo much better than the Mustang. Then I caught a glimpse of the new Jeep Wrangler. It looks great!!! But it\'s on a first edition chassis, and I have no need for any more of those, and I\'m not gonna spend 20 bucks for a body. Damn Radio Shack. I knew I shouldn\'t have went in there. \r\n\r\nIf they had that Acura there tuesday, I\'d have an XMod right now. Dammit why do they get everything in after I spend my money.\r\n\r\nSorry man, just walked in the door, and had to rant because I\'m kicking myself in the ass hardcore, for blowing my money the second I get it.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:00d7486195]\r\n\r\nLOL thats funny cause I am the same way.  I get something then I think twice about it later on when they something I really wanted it.\r\n\r\n  If you could see what I have to choose from around here damn.  Our wal-marts have clones 20 bucks our RS just got in the normal ZZ\'s 30 bucks and thats it(canadain of course).\r\n\r\n  Thats whay I spend alot of time looking around the net for dals and one of the main reasons that when I see something cheap I tend to pick alot of them up like the ultraman cars.\r\n\r\n  I want an xmod aswell its killing me to read all the posts on them.  Well thanks to Toy easy and Bithed they have taped out my paypal reserve for a few days.  Guess I will post some 3 day auctions on abay to replenish my stash and get an Xmod/AWD kit/motors shipped up.  Then I will worry about the bearings and body kit for the white supra  :???: \r\n\r\n  Then I will goto the mini z track and spank those guys casue they drive like shit and I think its 80% driving 20% car performance for most of the Z tracks out there.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12707,'d21772b449','hey,\r\n\r\nwhere in cali u locATED?  im in a suburb of frisco'),(12834,'ad9916036b','[quote:ad9916036b=\"CaboWabo\"]yo man.\r\nany chance you\'d be willing to trade one of those super hero bodies for something?\r\nor trade + $?\r\n\r\nwhat the deal is, I want one of those bodies, but I don\'t want the chassis and shit.\r\n\r\nhowever....\r\n\r\nI completely understand if you wouldn\'t wanna part the shit out, I probably wouldn\'t either unless the situation fit perfectly for me.\r\n\r\njust thought I\'d ask.\r\nlemme know.[/quote:ad9916036b]\r\n\r\n  Sure man its all good to me I have some more on the way anyway (as I said I got a real good deal on these).\r\n\r\n  Let me know what you had in mind and plus I can prolly trade the chassie and and controller off to someone or use it to practice some mods.\r\n\r\nLet me know what you were thinking.'),(12710,'4c7ce6d737','Hi, I saw the post that Brendan123 had about getting hooked up with an Xmod. I live right next to Detroit but they don\'t have them yet. Is there anyway you could hook me up? I also realize that you\'re not in the business to go running around and go shopping for every body so If you can\'t get it for me it\'s totally cool.\r\nThanks'),(12712,'4e46460216','You know that\'s what killing me about the XMods. Sure I can swing 50 bucks, but what makes these cool to me is they are upgradable to AWD, and coming from 1/10th scale I feel bearings are a must. So now I\'ve already spent a hundred, and I don\'t even have rechargable batteries for it yet. Then there\'s motors, You gots to gets da motors, I mean come on how can you not?\r\n\r\nYeah sure I could buy that stuff little by little, and I\'m gonna hafta, but I hate that! :mad: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12800,'6606bf0108','Hey dude was just wondering if you got the package?  I know sessiz and crazydave got theres so you should have yours soon I take it :)\r\n\r\nPete'),(12801,'96a41dbb7b','ok well let me know when you are gonna send it and I will put this aside ofr you.\r\n\r\n  If I can get your address I will have it all packed up and ready to go.\r\n\r\n  Again when you get a money order make sure its an international one that can be cashed in Canada.  I dont suggest sending cash but if you do make sure you wrap paper or whatnot around it so it is not as noticable.'),(13208,'c309c3ecd9','Well, let me know if you have tonight off.  I just heard from my woman and she\'s off tonight, so I\'m free. :)'),(12714,'4d0bb7eb15','Hey,\r\n\r\nWhat\'s up. We are located in Los Angeles.\r\n\r\nSan Francisco huh? Pretty cool'),(12715,'f5fc57c12f','i think xmods demand a little more than misc/other rcs since there are so many damn xmods posts now. whatcha think?'),(12716,'f5fc57c12f','i think xmods demand a little more than misc/other rcs since there are so many damn xmods posts now. whatcha think?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12717,'629600d4f6','[quote:629600d4f6=\"hogjowlz\"]i think xmods demand a little more than misc/other rcs since there are so many damn xmods posts now. whatcha think?[/quote:629600d4f6]lol I was just now getting ready to post about that in the moderators forum.\r\nthen I thought of one thing...\r\ntime\r\nwe haven\'t given the xmod enough time yet to see if it commands it own forum, at least that was my last though. lol\r\n\r\nzipzaps 1 &amp; 2 didn\'t get their own forum, but they mix alot better with other micros.\r\n\r\nxmods are more like mini-z\'s, it almost seems like the x-mods would be popular at a mini-z site. we\'re more into the 1/64 stuff so you can see the delima.\r\n\r\nI dunno...\r\nmaybe you should make a post in the moderators forum and see what everyone else thinks.'),(12718,'629600d4f6','[quote:629600d4f6=\"hogjowlz\"]i think xmods demand a little more than misc/other rcs since there are so many damn xmods posts now. whatcha think?[/quote:629600d4f6]lol I was just now getting ready to post about that in the moderators forum.\r\nthen I thought of one thing...\r\ntime\r\nwe haven\'t given the xmod enough time yet to see if it commands it own forum, at least that was my last though. lol\r\n\r\nzipzaps 1 &amp; 2 didn\'t get their own forum, but they mix alot better with other micros.\r\n\r\nxmods are more like mini-z\'s, it almost seems like the x-mods would be popular at a mini-z site. we\'re more into the 1/64 stuff so you can see the delima.\r\n\r\nI dunno...\r\nmaybe you should make a post in the moderators forum and see what everyone else thinks.'),(12719,'5ebc0d6141','ya good points. throw it up. my vote will go for yes tho haha. you get one yet?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12720,'5ebc0d6141','ya good points. throw it up. my vote will go for yes tho haha. you get one yet?'),(16331,'387e2c07ba','[b:387e2c07ba]Siema Miva![/b:387e2c07ba] Fajnie ze jest nas przynajmniej trzech , bo samemu to tak \r\ndziwnie siedzie&amp;#263; na forum :D . \r\n\r\nps. Odwali&amp;#322;a&amp;#347; narazie kawa&amp;#322; wypasionej roboty z t&amp;#261; karoseri&amp;#261;  :eek: \r\nNara@'),(12722,'ffd7345074','[quote:ffd7345074=\"hogjowlz\"]ya good points. throw it up. my vote will go for yes tho haha. you get one yet?[/quote:ffd7345074]nah I haven\'t gotten one.\r\ngot the bug then it went away again.\r\nI pretty skeptical about them.\r\nI don\'t have a whole lot of room to work with easily. and if I have to do something extra for room, I can go even bigger than xmod.\r\nI think I might let this one slip by.'),(12723,'e0984584c4','well thats commendable not lettin the bug bite. i doubt ill buy more than 1 since i dont got a lota room either. but hey its good to take to the park once in a while. the scale hp is pretty stunning as well.'),(12724,'4e2b428710','You mentioned you had spare SE PCB. Still got that?\r\n\r\nI could really use it, since I\'ve popped too many contacts off mine, and I think the steering is now dead beyond repair.\r\n\r\nI can trade you a FETed Thunder Charger PCB for it.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12725,'32f33674a0','well if i ever get around to mailing it out ill just give it to ya.'),(12726,'e0984584c4','well thats commendable not lettin the bug bite. i doubt ill buy more than 1 since i dont got a lota room either. but hey its good to take to the park once in a while. the scale hp is pretty stunning as well.'),(12727,'1b494652c1','whatcha want? as long as you pay upfront i dont mind helpin a fellow pimp out. I take paypal or u could send a M.O.'),(16334,'9516f08962','Do you know you forgot to put the dip switch on my car.'),(16335,'9e49b62170','[quote:9e49b62170=\"hogjowlz\"]well thursday and friday i get off the phones most of the day so im less distracted.[/quote:9e49b62170]lol what are you talking about? I thought during phone calls that\'d be best?\r\n\r\n\"uh huh.... yea.... yup.... umhmmm\" lol'),(12729,'9c2561b115','[quote:9c2561b115=\"hogjowlz\"]well thats commendable not lettin the bug bite. i doubt ill buy more than 1 since i dont got a lota room either. but hey its good to take to the park once in a while. the scale hp is pretty stunning as well.[/quote:9c2561b115]yea they sound alright so far.\r\nI know if I got into them I\'d dump some bigger cash.\r\nI really can\'t be doin that right now lol\r\n\r\nshit I might even have to give up bits and move on to nail clippers or something lol'),(12730,'f725ab881f','haha i hear that. i didnt buy a single rc related product for over a month. and since then ive bought one se and one xmod. im not gona go out and get every kit i dont think. just the motors and bearings probably.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12731,'f725ab881f','haha i hear that. i didnt buy a single rc related product for over a month. and since then ive bought one se and one xmod. im not gona go out and get every kit i dont think. just the motors and bearings probably.'),(15666,'9d9131fdd1','aaaight.'),(15668,'3ef9a002ae','Man I just luv dat WallPaper Gallery.  You are the Piccaso of BitPorn Pimp!'),(15663,'548f72f4ac','You ARE DA MAN Sezz !!!!!!\r\nI owe you BIG Time Pimp !!!!'),(15665,'a60b0bcc60','did you contact dude about how to get the fronts to work? i think i figured out the prob.... hit me up'),(12734,'8f8242d0ec','[quote:8f8242d0ec=\"hogjowlz\"]haha i hear that. i didnt buy a single rc related product for over a month. and since then ive bought one se and one xmod. im not gona go out and get every kit i dont think. just the motors and bearings probably.[/quote:8f8242d0ec]uh huh, we\'ll talk about it again in a few months. lol\r\n\r\nthough you\'re track record is pretty good. sounds like with the bits you ran the ones you had into the ground - got good milage outta them so maybe you\'ll prove me wrong. :lol:'),(12735,'32f33674a0','well if i ever get around to mailing it out ill just give it to ya.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12736,'5aa22ce566','[quote:5aa22ce566=\"crazydave\"]Got the Excel spread sheet updated, and uploaded.\r\n\r\nDisregard my last numbers, these ones are garanteed accurate, because I had an extra pair of hands helping this time.\r\n\r\nThe voltage is lower because I ran the car for few before I tested. the battery had a starting voltage of 2.73. Notice forward drops in voltage more than reverse. That\'s because the FETs are stacked in forward.\r\n\r\nMaybe you can explain this system to me. I would have thought one of the wires would be ground, and read 0. It seems to be a system of balance, but I don\'t get it. :? \r\n\r\nAs you upside down people say, cheers,\r\nDave[/quote:5aa22ce566]\r\n\r\nThanks again mate for the info.  I\'ll have a  look and the sheet and pics today. :)\r\n\r\nHere\'s an email I got from Micro in response to some questions I sent him. Hope this \"enlightens\" you.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nMatt.\r\n\r\n---------- Original Message ----------------------------------\r\nFrom: \"Roland\" &lt;rolands@dodo.com.au&gt;\r\nDate:  Mon, 27 Oct 2003 09:44:30 +1100\r\n\r\n&gt;Hmmm, sounds a bit strange.\r\n&gt;my wire colours were a bit different.\r\n&gt;not sure on the 3rd wire though, the steering motor wires are right next to\r\n&gt;the drive motor terminals and I think he may have taken readings from this\r\n&gt;one as well (??)\r\n&gt;The ZZ SE has a data line terminal as well (a third pin) under the car, that\r\n&gt;is what reprograms the \'channel\' when you charge it up.\r\n&gt;Maybe he has taken readings off this as well, who knows.\r\n&gt;There is also a yellow wire on the steering feedback pot, (this is the only\r\n&gt;yellow on mine)\r\n&gt;(You really need to wait until you get your cars to work through it,\r\n&gt;emailing this kind of stuff back and forth (especially with someone who is\r\n&gt;not 100% techo) can be a pain, let me tell you.)\r\n&gt;Goodluck.\r\n&gt;Roland\r\n&gt;\r\n&gt;.\r\n&gt;----- Original Message -----\r\n&gt;From: \"ph2t\" &lt;ph2t@prahranpianos.com&gt;\r\n&gt;To: &lt;rolands@dodo.com.au&gt;\r\n&gt;Sent: Monday, October 27, 2003 9:23 AM\r\n&gt;Subject: hey\r\n&gt;\r\n&gt;\r\n&gt;&gt; hey man. Just a question with guess what? the SE\'s, lol....\r\n&gt;&gt;\r\n&gt;&gt; There are three wires going to the drive motor.  Do you know what these\r\n&gt;are for.   Here\'s some readings that were taken by crazydave and he asked me\r\n&gt;why there would be three wires.   To me it looks like only two are being\r\n&gt;used as the drive voltages, wires yellow and grey.   Your comments man?\r\n&gt;Where do these wires go?  I will have my zzse in about a week, yeah!   See\r\n&gt;the attached s/sheet.\r\n&gt;&gt;\r\n&gt;&gt; Thanks dude,\r\n&gt;&gt;\r\n&gt;&gt; Matt.\r\n&gt;&gt;\r\n&gt;&gt;\r\n&gt;&gt;\r\n&gt;&gt;\r\n&gt;\r\n&gt;'),(12737,'852d99d38f','[quote:852d99d38f=\"hogjowlz\"]well if i ever get around to mailing it out ill just give it to ya.[/quote:852d99d38f]Cool, thanks. Let me know when you\'re ready, and I\'ll give you my address.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12759,'d1849a04eb','[quote:d1849a04eb=\"bdebde\"]I\'d love to help everyone out on this, but the corner with the drive fets is covered in a thick layer of black epoxy. Pictures would do no good because you can\'t see anything! I guess micro_Amps is trying to keep his work \"top secret\". I would like to figure this one out myself, but I am not ready to chisel the stuff off the pcb yet, it is quite hard.[/quote:d1849a04eb]\r\n\r\n  Thats cool dude we almost got it worked out and when its done expect a tut on it :)\r\n\r\n  I understand that he would like to make $$ on this to cover the time that was invested in figuring it out, But I look at normal fets and there are tuts all ove rthe net on them and people still send there cars off to get done.\r\n\r\n  But I think there is some tuts in german I just need to traslate to see if what they are doing is different.\r\n\r\n  But how does it run? does it run as fast as a normal feted bit or zz?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\npete'),(12761,'4f74415631','It is definetly as fast as a fetted bit or zip zap, the torque may be slightly less, but well more than stock. This may be because they weigh more, but I believe the torque being less may have to do with the batteries though. After some research, I found that the max discharge rate for se batteries is 210 ma, compared to first gen zz batteries max discharge rate of 360 ma.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12762,'bc2ed84cf0','[quote:bc2ed84cf0=\"bdebde\"]It is definetly as fast as a fetted bit or zip zap, the torque may be slightly less, but well more than stock. This may be because they weigh more, but I believe the torque being less may have to do with the batteries though. After some research, I found that the max discharge rate for se batteries is 210 ma, compared to first gen zz batteries max discharge rate of 360 ma.[/quote:bc2ed84cf0]\r\n\r\nplus its pulsed power going to the motor with it being propo not sure if this has anything to do with it but who knows.  They should have just left the cells the same as before :('),(12763,'bc2ed84cf0','[quote:bc2ed84cf0=\"bdebde\"]It is definetly as fast as a fetted bit or zip zap, the torque may be slightly less, but well more than stock. This may be because they weigh more, but I believe the torque being less may have to do with the batteries though. After some research, I found that the max discharge rate for se batteries is 210 ma, compared to first gen zz batteries max discharge rate of 360 ma.[/quote:bc2ed84cf0]\r\n\r\nplus its pulsed power going to the motor with it being propo not sure if this has anything to do with it but who knows.  They should have just left the cells the same as before :('),(13047,'e9e39ad80f','[quote:e9e39ad80f=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea it makes sense I do the same.  I personally like to start all my auctions under 10 bucks.  Glad you are getting an xmod I am still tring to hook myself up for one.\r\n\r\n  It sucks cause I am right at the boarder but really dont wanna take the chance of crossing ever since 911.  I wish I new someone that could get me accross with no probs.\r\n\r\n  But really I did mean dont rush, I have alot of stuff in the mail on its way here now(bought and trades) and heck I have been waiting a month (maybe more) for my stuff from hog.\r\n\r\n  I tell yea you could prolly make more $$ on ebay then you can working.[/quote:e9e39ad80f]I used to sell my guitar stuff with a 1 dolla no reserve auction, and get a couple guys in a bidding war in the first day. End up selling shit for twice what I picked it up in the pawn shop for.\r\n\r\nAhhh, the good ol\' days on ebay.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12765,'b25fa3a7f2','Yeah I think they would be better with the old style cells. At least the thing goes good now!'),(12766,'c5dbae0a39','[quote:c5dbae0a39=\"crazydave\"]The yellow and grey wires led right into the motor bay, and I took my readings there. The black wire ran under the battery, and looked to be going to the motor bay. I got the reading from that wire off the PCB. It did stay at the same voltage the whole time. It probably is the feedback wire he\'s talking about.\r\n\r\nThat last part of his email hints towards something I\'ve already been thinking. I think he\'s left you enough clues that you\'re gonna figure this out as soon as you open up you car, and he is just messing with you until then. \r\n\r\nI\'m hoping this is the case, and I believe you have the knowledge to figure it out with the car in front of you, but I\'m hoping we can work this out together, because it would just be cooler that way.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:c5dbae0a39]\r\n\r\nExactly man, it would be cool to show that the cross-continental pimp\'in development will work out.  It would be a cool thing for bitpimps. :)\r\n\r\nI\'m now going to put my propeller hat on and try work with the values you have given me to get something to work.  I hope you have fets spare, lol.....\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt'),(12767,'682e8853e3','[quote:682e8853e3=\"crazydave\"][quote:682e8853e3=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n  I would really consider if I was you selling a few mods on ebay, I saw a ZZ duel cell with just the chassie(no motors, hubs, wheels body)and the controller and it went for like 40 bucks usd[/quote:682e8853e3]No Shit?\r\nImagine if I threw FETs, and one of my paint jobs in on that. That could buy me an XMod right there.\r\n\r\nEbay here I come. :-D \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:682e8853e3]\r\n\r\n  Do that shit up man I bet you would make some good cash\r\n  If I was you I would do it the cheapo clones though that way you have a bettter profit margine.  \r\n\r\n  I know that alot of the older ZZ bodies and sets are going good on there now so I am extra glad we gots them all over the place here :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13438,'5b997ebb4f','Thanx Pimp!'),(13459,'4c16d05fda','im new to the forum and i was wondering if i can post in the \"swap meet \" for an audley, or is it strictly bit and zz stuff?'),(13440,'bb718735e5','If you get around to it, leave me your address so I can find the pimp shack with no problems.  I tried painting my first car the other night.  It turned out maybe a 3-4 on a scale of 1-10.  Guess I\'ll keep practicing.'),(12769,'af7e527259','[quote:af7e527259=\"Ace_B_Pimpn\"]hey cabo, I dont want to be a snitch, but u might want to know that this guy is using ur pics and probably more than that. He is copying stuff from zipzaps.com and some other site I forgot. Here is his address http://www.ggteks.net/david/zipzaps/modifications/obstacles_and_courses/index.html[/quote:af7e527259]thanks for the heads up Ace.\r\nI did know he is using my imagery.\r\nI\'m in the process of having his website and host shut down as we speak.'),(12770,'31ab898150','Yeah you know, Big Lots has a butt load of the Micro Speed cars for 7 bucks. They are compatible with Microsizer controllers, handle great, and have a pretty good motor in them. Throw some FETs in one those, and just knock a quickie flame job, and I could see that selling for a decent profit. I\'ve been thinking about that recently.\r\n\r\nMan, you guys (you &amp; Havok) are always getting me scheming on ways to make money.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12771,'42afc2d81d','A little harsh, but he got what he dursuved.\r\nI just got a toshiba e750 pocket pc  wit integrated wireless LAN and i was wondering if i could downlad your videos fur my use only, nothin ta do wit any site or $hit'),(12772,'8df948b0cd','A little harsh, but he got what he dursuved.\r\nI just got a toshiba e750 pocket pc  wit integrated wireless LAN (and damn it was expesiv since im only 13, i have to make monthly payments to my dad to keep it)and i was wondering if i could downlad your videos fur my use only, nothin ta do wit any site or $hit'),(12782,'6dc424a94a','haha word to that. and well being monday i was totally frazzled this morning and walked right past it. hey if ya can drop me another reminder tonight to put it by my backdoor so i cant miss it. sorry holmes.'),(13205,'d7f86d7402','Sounds good to me.   I\'m waiting for a call from my work to see if I gotta go in tonight.\r\n\r\n-S'),(13206,'d7f86d7402','Sounds good to me.   I\'m waiting for a call from my work to see if I gotta go in tonight.\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13207,'c309c3ecd9','Well, let me know if you have tonight off.  I just heard from my woman and she\'s off tonight, so I\'m free. :)'),(12797,'6dc424a94a','haha word to that. and well being monday i was totally frazzled this morning and walked right past it. hey if ya can drop me another reminder tonight to put it by my backdoor so i cant miss it. sorry holmes.'),(19189,'a36961bb0c','[quote:a36961bb0c=\"hue35\"]Got the discs! Thanks, man.. I\'m lovin\' this stuff. He\'s a great guitar player.. amazing tones that dude gets. I\'m sending some discs out for you today. I redid the 2 Big Boys compilations and here\'s a few links to some info on the others... \r\n\r\nThe Lazy Cowgirls:\r\n1. How It Looks, Ho It Is\r\n2. Ragged Soul\r\n\r\nThe Gun Club\r\n1. Fire of Love\r\n2. Mother Juno\r\n\r\nYou only get one facet of the Lazy Cowgirls with these two, but they\'re both essential discs.. these are the last 2 with DD weekday on guitar. He\'s a bad motherfucker. If you dig this stuff, I\'ll give you some more later (I have all the Lazy Cowgirs discs!)... they mellow out just a little bit on the later discs, but the tunes are maybe even more solid.\r\n\r\nFire of Love is the first Gun Club record (1981), and it kicks ass. Mother Juno is several records later (1987), but I think it\'s their strongest since the first. I have one more called [i:a36961bb0c]Early Warning[/i:a36961bb0c] that collects demos and whatnot.. if you dig this stuff I\'d be happy to dupe you that set too..\r\n\r\nthanks again... I really appreciate the new tunes.[/quote:a36961bb0c]I got the disc yesterday. Thanks man, you\'re packaging is cool as shit. :lol: \r\n\r\nI listened to the Mother Juno first. I didn\'t care for that one too much. That thing with the jangly chorused guitars, but it did sound like the kind of stuff my ex-girlfriend used to listen to that always grew on me, so I\'ll be giving it another chance. Fire of Love was lot better, and I dug on that one alot more. After coming back and reading what you said about those Gun Club albums, it all makes sense now.\r\n\r\nThe Lazy Cowgirls, now as soon as I saw it was on the Sypathy For the Record Industry label, and was produced by Jeff Dahl, I knew this was right up my alley, and I was not disappointed. I like these guys a lot, but it was missing a stand out track. (I\'ve still got to give it a couple more listens though.)\r\n\r\nThat\'s what I dig about the Big Boys, they got songs like \"Nervous\" that just reach out and grab you by the balls, and don\'t let you forget them.\r\n\r\n\r\nWell thanks again, cool to have something old that\'s new to me, to listen to.\r\n\r\nNow I gotta figure out what I\'m gonna send you next. :???: \r\n\r\ndave\r\n\r\nDave'),(14198,'c7d490c108','Yo Brendan,\'\r\n\r\nWhat are you using to cut &amp; finish the body?  Noticed a mistake to the windshield frame above the mirror.  Look at yours and Dave\'s.  I got my tuitorial ready and will be posting it this week, look for it.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12774,'42afc2d81d','A little harsh, but he got what he dursuved.\r\nI just got a toshiba e750 pocket pc  wit integrated wireless LAN and i was wondering if i could downlad your videos fur my use only, nothin ta do wit any site or $hit'),(12775,'8df948b0cd','A little harsh, but he got what he dursuved.\r\nI just got a toshiba e750 pocket pc  wit integrated wireless LAN (and damn it was expesiv since im only 13, i have to make monthly payments to my dad to keep it)and i was wondering if i could downlad your videos fur my use only, nothin ta do wit any site or $hit'),(12776,'7c3886b72b','[quote:7c3886b72b=\"crazydave\"]Yeah you know, Big Lots has a butt load of the Micro Speed cars for 7 bucks. They are compatible with Microsizer controllers, handle great, and have a pretty good motor in them. Throw some FETs in one those, and just knock a quickie flame job, and I could see that selling for a decent profit. I\'ve been thinking about that recently.\r\n\r\nMan, you guys (you &amp; Havok) are always getting me scheming on ways to make money.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:7c3886b72b]\r\n\r\n  Well I am alwasy thining of ways to make $$ thats what I do best.  The more I think about it the more $$ I end up working.\r\n\r\n  At one point all I did was sell shit on ebay and I made way more then I do now ($700+ a week) and I didn\'t have to go out.\r\n\r\n  Now I still sell be its not like it used to be ever since 911.  Man I remember when you could sell anything on there.\r\n\r\n  Still always looking my big thing is going to the fleamarket or second hand shops and looking for things to buy cheap and resell.\r\n\r\n  Figure the more extra cash I can make the more I can spend on my hobbies.\r\n\r\n  Any progress on your se affair? bdebde said that the PBC was covered in very thick black epoxy so you could tell anything from it :('),(12777,'f8413bd070','I know you\'re toasted like me, and will forget the shizzle again. So this is like one of those celebrity reminders, except I\'m no celeb.  I\'m way cooler.\r\n\r\npeace \r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13244,'6aee0bbfd9','Only 3 days i think. I am from Turkey. Thank you i send a message when i learn. Sorry for spelling. :)'),(13245,'6aee0bbfd9','Only 3 days i think. I am from Turkey. Thank you i send a message when i learn. Sorry for spelling. :)'),(13246,'410fa4f214','Hey..i have some turkish Friends! :-) \r\n\r\nI play Soccer with them in a club!\r\n\r\nDo you have Ramadan too?\r\n\r\nYou can write me an PM!Greetings Sinned'),(12779,'2df0f1a3cc','Hey Dave I had a Q for yea cause I know you are the dupli-color man lol\r\n\r\n  I picked up some cans of dupli-color enamel paint, but what clear coat should be used with it?\r\n\r\n  I used the same clearcoat I was using with the testersenamels I have but it made the paint crack when I sprayed it on my newly detailed bug Grrrrr.\r\n\r\n  Its prolly my clearcoat I was was cheap and just used the \"Motomaster\" canadian Tire car clearcoat for cars/trucks.\r\n\r\n  Man that sucks, oh well gives me a chance to sand out some of the imperfections I found after laying the paint on.'),(12780,'f8413bd070','I know you\'re toasted like me, and will forget the shizzle again. So this is like one of those celebrity reminders, except I\'m no celeb.  I\'m way cooler.\r\n\r\npeace \r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13045,'70a8126a9f','Yea it makes sense I do the same.  I personally like to start all my auctions under 10 bucks.  Glad you are getting an xmod I am still tring to hook myself up for one.\r\n\r\n  It sucks cause I am right at the boarder but really dont wanna take the chance of crossing ever since 911.  I wish I new someone that could get me accross with no probs.\r\n\r\n  But really I did mean dont rush, I have alot of stuff in the mail on its way here now(bought and trades) and heck I have been waiting a month (maybe more) for my stuff from hog.\r\n\r\n  I tell yea you could prolly make more $$ on ebay then you can working.'),(13441,'bb718735e5','If you get around to it, leave me your address so I can find the pimp shack with no problems.  I tried painting my first car the other night.  It turned out maybe a 3-4 on a scale of 1-10.  Guess I\'ll keep practicing.'),(13442,'af170092e2','I live at \r\n\r\n2508 Lynn Lake circle south\r\nSt. Petersburg Fl. 33712\r\n\r\nIf you take HWY 275 south, come across the \"Howard Franklin\" bridge, and follow that all the way south..\r\n\r\nLynn lake apartments are on 54th AVE south..  You will pass all the north ave. so just stay on 275 until you see 54th Ave S/Pinellas Bayway. Take 54th s, and turn left. Lynn Lake is on your right.  Come through the guard gate, and I will come meet you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHope that didn\'t sound confusing... It\'s really easy.\r\n\r\n-S'),(12860,'af8b755d86','hehe my mistake But I know the tuneup box ones are like that with the hoods (have some on the way cant wait).\r\n\r\n  No need for a pic if you wanna trade its all good hell I will even toss in teh 1.0 POWER motor that this set comes with lol.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12861,'fb747d6f3d','[quote:fb747d6f3d=\"crazydave\"][quote:fb747d6f3d=\"ph2t\"]If you could I\'d appreciate, just add more data to the s/sheet and upload it to the ftp, :)\r\n\r\nI\'ve gotten a model to work with now.   Basically apart from the 4 fets, I\r\nve added another component that is an inverter/buffer.   It\'s goal is to invert the high signal (2.37V) to a low voltage (0.2V) and vice versa.  This way we might get it to work.  The inverter is of similar size to the fets, another surface mount component,   They are available as free samples from onsemi.com but if I can get it working in a test circuit today I will mail you some I\'ve got,  You only need one per hbridge.\r\n\r\nI\'ll work on this and let you know.  Thanks again for your help dude.\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:fb747d6f3d]Cool, I\'ll get those this evening when my wife gets home from work.\r\n\r\nI hope that inverter/buffer works, because a small component is what we need. Space is really tight in the SE.\r\n\r\n..and hey, thanks for your help man, I\'d be useless without you. ;)\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:fb747d6f3d]\r\n\r\nlol dude, I think it\'s that other way around, you\'re the one with the SE!\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(12862,'6f190a784a','heyya, where exactly do you live in FL.,  Near tampa by any chance???');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12863,'6f190a784a','heyya, where exactly do you live in FL.,  Near tampa by any chance???'),(13292,'1228bd3cd9','Well if you say 20 is fair for you then its fair for me.  I am very easy to work with :).\r\n\r\n  And I see your point about just running down to rs to pick a zz up.  Only thing is I have had a bad experiance with ZZ\'s.  I got the blue civic when they first came out(thats the one you just removed the PBC from) and I tell yea it ran like shit.  I refused to get another as my bits ran way better.  Now I hear they have improved but then again they have shit range and I dont plan on playing with them that much just to display some of the ZZ chassies I have.\r\n\r\n  So yea let me know if 20 is cool with you its cool with me.  Yea I think I am gonna get a xmod shipped up now there is to much talk about them and them LXX mini z are looking for for under 30 bucks aswell.\r\n\r\nPete\r\n\r\n\r\nPete'),(12866,'0fe5254760','About 8 minutes from Tampa...  Pretty close I guess. What\'s up?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12867,'f38bb42cc3','Ok, I got the Zip Zap done, check it;\r\n\r\n[img:f38bb42cc3]http://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/vdmszz.jpg[/img:f38bb42cc3]\r\n\r\nFor some odd reason the Zip Controller got horrible reception, and a Microsizer controller wouldn\'t work at all. The LXX controller worked fine. It must be on 27mhz, but a different subfrequency, so I just wired it to work with the LXX controller. It\'s kickin\' butt, BTW.\r\n\r\nI\'ll get the Bit, The LXX, and the Zip Zap packed up tonight, so can I ship them in the morning.\r\n\r\nI\'ll go ahead and hang on to the SE a bit longer. ph2t is working on a inverter/buffer thingy, so we\'ll just have to be patient to see if that works out.\r\n\r\nDave'),(12868,'9602ac4eb2','my 3 yo son loves the bucs and the walmarts usually sell local teams shirts and sweats and stuff and i really wanted to get him some bucs sweatshirt/jacket/jersey whatever. I was wonderin if next time you are in wally worl if ya could check out any of that for me. hes a size like boys small 4-5 or toddlers 4t-5t. I found some comparable stuff in the boys section at my walmart but of course no bucs stuff here in ohio :) I will paypal you some money if you can hook a pimp up, maybe even thro in some bit/micro rc stuff too'),(13419,'0aea039d8f','ok man just wait like 2 week cuz im sellin some zz bodies then you can paint away!  :-D  then ill have something to droll over  :-(   :eek:   :lol:   8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12870,'01c31f5024','Sounds good to me.  I will go out tomorrow and pick up a 3 or 4 cell charge thingie from RS and wire it the ZZ charge case in teh controller :)\r\n\r\nCant wait more toys to play with lol'),(12871,'af8b755d86','hehe my mistake But I know the tuneup box ones are like that with the hoods (have some on the way cant wait).\r\n\r\n  No need for a pic if you wanna trade its all good hell I will even toss in teh 1.0 POWER motor that this set comes with lol.'),(12872,'9e38706e16','[quote:9e38706e16=\"VooDooMafia\"]hehe my mistake But I know the tuneup box ones are like that with the hoods (have some on the way cant wait).\r\n\r\n  No need for a pic if you wanna trade its all good hell I will even toss in teh 1.0 POWER motor that this set comes with lol.[/quote:9e38706e16]sweet.\r\ngive me a few days before I can ship it out.\r\ncool?'),(12873,'9602ac4eb2','my 3 yo son loves the bucs and the walmarts usually sell local teams shirts and sweats and stuff and i really wanted to get him some bucs sweatshirt/jacket/jersey whatever. I was wonderin if next time you are in wally worl if ya could check out any of that for me. hes a size like boys small 4-5 or toddlers 4t-5t. I found some comparable stuff in the boys section at my walmart but of course no bucs stuff here in ohio :) I will paypal you some money if you can hook a pimp up, maybe even thro in some bit/micro rc stuff too'),(29286,'3bd312ed6a','[quote:3bd312ed6a=\"ezenterprises\"]hey cj,\r\n\r\nIm lookin to do a full alloy in blue for my xmod...... obviously i\'ll hav eto do it piece by peice but do you have anything in stock now thats blue? If not can you order me the blue stuff. And if its not too much a pain in the ass, can you send me a list of every part that can be had  and its price? Also i saw a different forum and mentioned you also were getting the awd front alloy stuff??? i want that in blue too :) Lemme know........ if it isnt too much i might get like all front then all rear or whatever at a time or maybe all at once....... lmk THANKS[/quote:3bd312ed6a]\r\n\r\nHere is the Xmods parts I can get and prices.  A few items though I do not stock.  At least till June my shipping is just $.50 for every $19.99 spent.\r\n\r\nXM009-ALLOY FRONT UPPER PLATE FOR FRONT GEAR BOX - $7.99\r\nXM010-ALLOY REAR UPPER PLATE FOR REAR GEAR BOX - $11.99\r\nXM012-ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX WITH SCREWS - $12.99\r\nXM013-ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX WITH SCREWS - $14.99\r\nXM018-ALLOY MOTOR HEATSINK MOUNT - $16.50\r\nXM021-ALLOY FRONT KNUCKLE ARM WITH SCREWS - $12.99\r\nXM025-ALLOY CENTER SHAFT - $5.99 \r\nXM025/2WD-ALLOY CENTER SHAFT  1PC (ORIGINAL SIZE) - $5.99 \r\nXM330SUPRA-ALLOY BODY LOCK PLATE W/ SCREWS (FOR SUPRA)- $8.99\r\nXM330RSX-ALLOY BODY LOCK PLATE W/ SCREWS (FOR RSX)- $8.99\r\nXM039F-ALLOY FRONT WHEEL SHAFT-1PR - $3.99\r\nXM039F/4WD-ALLOY FRONT WHEEL SHAFT - 1PR (FOR 4WD) - $3.50\r\nXM039R-ALLOY REAR WHEEL SHAFT - 1PR - $5.49\r\nXM041-ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX JOINT (DIFFERENTIAL USE) - $7.99\r\nXM041F/4WD-ALLOY FRONT GEAR DIFFERENTIAL JOINT (FOR 4WD) $6.50\r\nXM049-ALLOY STEERING PLATE -1PC - $9.99\r\nXM049/I1-ALLOY STEERING PLATE (TOE-IN 1 DEG)-1PC - $9.99\r\nXM049/I2-ALLOY STEERING PLATE (TOE-IN 2 DEG)-1PC - $9.99\r\nXM049/O1-ALLOY STEERING PLATE (TOE-OUT 1 DEG) -1PC - $9.99\r\nXM049/O2-ALLOY STERING PLATE (TOE-OUT 2 DEG) - 1PC - $9.99\r\nXM050-ALLOY CENTER SHAFT HOLDER WITH SCREWS - 2PCS - $12.99\r\nXM052-ALLOY FRONT/REAR DAMPER(FOR GREASE) - 1PR - $7.99\r\nXM054-ALLOY FRONT UPPER ARM SET -1PR - $16.50\r\nXM056-ALLOY REAR LOWER ARM SET - 1PR - $18.50\r\nXM303-ALLOY BATTERY HEAT SINK MOUNT - 1PR - $10.50\r\nTXM025-TITANIUM CENTER  SHAFT - 1PC - $9.99\r\nMZ002-ALLOY 2MM LOCK NUT SET  5PCS - $5.99\r\n\r\n\r\nThe following numbers I don\'t stock XM009, XM010, XM330SUPRA, XM330RSX, XM049, XM049/I1, XM049/I2, XM049/O1, XM049/O2, and XM054.  I will order them if you want them but they have a few problems.  The XM054 were originally made backward and binds.  The XM049\'s will bind if you use the AWD kit unless you modify it.  the XM330\'s plastic works fine and with metal you could do more damage.  The XM009 and XM010 RS makes a kit for $15 that has Carbon Fiber and clear chassis.  Plus these weigh more than stock plastic. \r\n\r\nI have one set of the XM039R in silver(not listed in stock) and the matching XM041 cups in Black, Red, Green, and Golden Black.  All the other parts I have in stock with colors are on my site.  Unfoutanatly I never ordered any Blue.  I\'ll add blue to the next order just like I did for green with SG219.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12876,'93744aef62','hey mate, I wanna ship that chassis back to you, all fet modded.\r\ncould you please confirm your addy:\r\n\r\nErnie Barrett\r\n1658 Cranberry Lane\r\nWarren, OH\r\n44483\r\nUSA \r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(12878,'c7ae712d0d','No problem man... I\'ll see what they have, and let you know.. There\'s bucs stuff all over here.\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D'),(12879,'9e38706e16','[quote:9e38706e16=\"VooDooMafia\"]hehe my mistake But I know the tuneup box ones are like that with the hoods (have some on the way cant wait).\r\n\r\n  No need for a pic if you wanna trade its all good hell I will even toss in teh 1.0 POWER motor that this set comes with lol.[/quote:9e38706e16]sweet.\r\ngive me a few days before I can ship it out.\r\ncool?'),(12880,'f565326e46','Hey got that packed up, and sent off with my wife. If nothing goes wrong she should be putting it in the mail today.\r\n\r\nMan, my wife sucks. I told her I was going to mosfet, and paint a some thunder charger cars to sell on ebay, and she thinks it\'s a stupid idea. She\'s afraid I\'m going to lose money. I\'m like how in the hell could I lose money putting 2 dollars worth of FETs in a 5 dollar car and selling for at least 20+ bucks.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know about her. She doesn\'t seem to get that I\'m not the only one in the world that is fanatical about these cars.\r\n\r\ndave'),(12881,'f565326e46','Hey got that packed up, and sent off with my wife. If nothing goes wrong she should be putting it in the mail today.\r\n\r\nMan, my wife sucks. I told her I was going to mosfet, and paint a some thunder charger cars to sell on ebay, and she thinks it\'s a stupid idea. She\'s afraid I\'m going to lose money. I\'m like how in the hell could I lose money putting 2 dollars worth of FETs in a 5 dollar car and selling for at least 20+ bucks.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know about her. She doesn\'t seem to get that I\'m not the only one in the world that is fanatical about these cars.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13420,'ed58b6714d','oh i see, yeah if i get a new one and want to sell it ur there first to know!'),(13421,'0aea039d8f','ok man just wait like 2 week cuz im sellin some zz bodies then you can paint away!  :-D  then ill have something to droll over  :-(   :eek:   :lol:   8-)'),(32707,'fa5b5521b3','Paypal sent!\r\n\r\nHere\'s my info...\r\n\r\nRich Huang\r\n354 Mayo Lane\r\nBloomingdale, IL 60108\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nRich'),(32708,'5f2bda32a3','[quote:5f2bda32a3=\"richh\"]Paypal sent!\r\n\r\nHere\'s my info...\r\n\r\nRich Huang\r\n354 Mayo Lane\r\nBloomingdale, IL 60108\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nRich[/quote:5f2bda32a3]\r\n\r\n\r\nComin\' your way, buddy!!!!\r\n\r\nIf I don\'t talk to you before then, make sure you PM me or something when you receive the package, so I know you\'re happy!!! :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\nBloomingdale? wow!\r\n\r\nI grew up back of the yards, S. Chicago, Tinley Park, Wheaton/Winfield area! :-)    Born in Blue Island, N. Chicago'),(13423,'25e642a08b','hey man, sry i got the puul back and the nkok truck, sry but if u want a clone how about a dual cell shen? just needs a few wires soldered back together.....');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13424,'b1f425a1c4','[quote:b1f425a1c4=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:b1f425a1c4=\"VooDooMafia\"]Glad they got there ok. \r\n\r\n  Yea those are from the other homie sets(knock off I think)\r\n\r\n  I like to toss something in with the packages to make me feel like the post office didn\'t screw me with there prices(not as cheap as it is for you guys).  But its all a write off anyway.\r\n\r\n  Sometimes I send shit that I get in the mail so you Yanks can see the crap we get.  I sent sessiz a \"Stop Wetting the Bed\" flyer I got in the mail with his package.  Like common if I wetted the bed would I really order that shit with my real name  :???:[/quote:b1f425a1c4]lol thats funny.\r\nwell cool man, thanks for the extras\r\n\r\nI\'ll let ya know when the other body arrives.\r\ndid you get that ae86 body I sent yet?[/quote:b1f425a1c4]\r\n\r\n\r\n  LOL yea I looked after I PMed you and it was in along with some forms from the post office (could be good i guess but proly customs bills lol)'),(12883,'faeaf7cf0a','[quote:faeaf7cf0a=\"payaso\"]I got it today, and am more than happy dood... thanks a million.\r\n\r\n\r\nNow I\'m torn on should I paint it, or leave it as a collectable?\r\n\r\nI\'m still missing the 3rd one. The funky looking one.  Man, CD made his look fantastic..\r\n\r\n\r\nYour package should be there today as well...  Tell me it\'s there...\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:faeaf7cf0a]\r\n\r\n\r\n  DAMN homie thanks for the extra bodies :)  man now you caused some drama in the collection as I only have 3 ZZ chassies. @ of them are off getting fets and the other is in the mail on its way here so if its not here today I am off to RS to pick up another car so I can see these babies on a chassie(seeing that we got the retired zz stuff here now).\r\n\r\n  well I dont forget things :) so if theres anything you need let me know.\r\n\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12884,'a8db4b0e25','[quote:a8db4b0e25=\"Grunge\"]Well, I had an accident Saturday when I was moving an entertainment center and cut/smashed a few fingers.  They should recover. :lol:  The group buy thing at ToyEast sounds good.  I\'ll try and contact you later in the week.[/quote:a8db4b0e25]\r\n\r\n\r\nWhoa dude, that sucks... That\'s gonna hinder driving skills. lol  I hate moving.\r\n\r\n\r\nCall me when you feel up to a race.  I\'m always home.\r\n\r\nThe Toyeast thing would be awesome.  And my new MS Pro from Target rocks.  Great buy.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(12885,'18cb3e3471','[quote:18cb3e3471=\"crazydave\"]Hey got that packed up, and sent off with my wife. If nothing goes wrong she should be putting it in the mail today.\r\n\r\nMan, my wife sucks. I told her I was going to mosfet, and paint a some thunder charger cars to sell on ebay, and she thinks it\'s a stupid idea. She\'s afraid I\'m going to lose money. I\'m like how in the hell could I lose money putting 2 dollars worth of FETs in a 5 dollar car and selling for at least 20+ bucks.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know about her. She doesn\'t seem to get that I\'m not the only one in the world that is fanatical about these cars.\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:18cb3e3471]\r\n\r\n  Cool man I will keep my eyes on the mail :)\r\n\r\n  Yea you know what my wife was like that to when I turned my Toy Collecting hobby into  a Biz on ebay.  But after she saw that I was making more in 5 hours time on the computer then most make in a week she was ok with it.\r\n\r\n  Now I have a basment that is full and 2 extra bedrooms full of shit and I am just to lazy to post it lol.\r\n\r\n  But yea I say go for it, even just pick up one for now you could prolly paint it and fet it in a day.  Put it up for a 3 day auction and see what happens.  Just start it at 9.99 or something and make sure its got zz and bit in the search title.\r\n\r\n  I bet it goes for 20 bucks no prob plus if you have a like to maybe some footage of a mosfetted car so people could see them does wheelies or something.\r\n\r\n  Hell its strange the things that go on on ebay.  Hey have you every though of doing that and posting them on the Ausmicro forums?  They seem to pay really good for things and you could just list it as \"Cleaning out Garage\" or something so that Micro Amps just thinks you are getting rid of some cludder.  I posted some stuff for Stoli and they paid retail for used items with(sorry stoli ) crap paint jobs.  Hell I sold some extra motors to them for a fortune like 4.2\'s for 10 bucks US shit like that.\r\n  Pete'),(12887,'e9a627dc5e','Yeah, it sucks about my hand.  They were the two fingers I grip the controller with.  :lol:  Ill be driving in no time.  I was browsing Ebay last night and I found a few things.  Ive shopped around for different things and after comparing prices, I think I came out okay on the deals.  The first thing was 2 Brand new microsizers in their boxes.  Only thing missing are the bodies, plus he threw in a tire set, 2.2 upgrade motor and a clear 350z body.  They arent the Pro series, but I was getting them for the chassis to mess with anyway.  I have enough extra bodies to make up for these two.  I got both for $20 shipped.  I figure the tire set is $5 if I buy it so I came out about even as if I got them at the store.  One bonehead thing I did, was not realizing they werent the Pros, but Ill learn from the mistake.  Second thing I got was a group of 4  Tomy  Bit Char G pullbacks (GP-01,02,03,06) for $19 shipped.  I can always use these bodies on the chassis I got from the other deal.  Third auction I won was a lot of (20)Bit Char G 3.8 motors for $18 shipped.  If they work well when I get them, Ill hook you up with a few.  The last auction I got was a lot of (40) NiMH Bit Char G batteries rated at 150 MAH.  I got these for $30 shipped.  They come out to around .75 cents each so not too bad.  Ill let you know how it turns out.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12888,'c4036efcbf','OK here is a dude selling the duel cell shit.  Make sure you look at his last to feedbacks(the item) and you can see that people like to pay good money for stuff.\r\n\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3151943539&amp;category=44024[/url]'),(12889,'59222c0676','[quote:59222c0676=\"VooDooMafia\"]OK here is a dude selling the duel cell shit.  Make sure you look at his last to feedbacks(the item) and you can see that people like to pay good money for stuff.\r\n\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3151943539&amp;category=44024[/url][/quote:59222c0676]Yeah I saw that guy\'s auctions.\r\n\r\nI\'m totally gonna do it, I bought too many of those Thunder Chargers, and I could sell off couple of those to start off.\r\ndave'),(12890,'59222c0676','[quote:59222c0676=\"VooDooMafia\"]OK here is a dude selling the duel cell shit.  Make sure you look at his last to feedbacks(the item) and you can see that people like to pay good money for stuff.\r\n\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3151943539&amp;category=44024[/url][/quote:59222c0676]Yeah I saw that guy\'s auctions.\r\n\r\nI\'m totally gonna do it, I bought too many of those Thunder Chargers, and I could sell off couple of those to start off.\r\ndave'),(12892,'9b9f811a01','hey if i can find my clear beetol shell, ill send it with your stuff.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12893,'5fa72ec617','Yea I put that post up cause I found this\r\n\r\n[img:5fa72ec617]http://i12.ebayimg.com/03/i/00/cd/16/51_1.JPG[/img:5fa72ec617]\r\n\r\ndidn\'t know if they are coming or whats the deal.\r\n\r\nthanks for teh beetle body if you find one but you dont have to look to hard lol'),(12894,'5fa72ec617','Yea I put that post up cause I found this\r\n\r\n[img:5fa72ec617]http://i12.ebayimg.com/03/i/00/cd/16/51_1.JPG[/img:5fa72ec617]\r\n\r\ndidn\'t know if they are coming or whats the deal.\r\n\r\nthanks for teh beetle body if you find one but you dont have to look to hard lol'),(13548,'38ea611ca6','Hey Voodoo,\r\n\r\nI just got off the phone with SuperFly and he was telling me about the deal y\'all made. Anyway, I was wondering if you had any more MAT Vehicles? If so, I\'d like to buy one more. I could pay you now and you could ship it with SuperFly\'s MAT Vehicle &amp; AE86 when that deal is done. \r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nhue35'),(13456,'c2bf1068c8','Hello Ph2t,\r\n\r\nI ask a question i hope you can help me ?\r\n\r\nIn mosfet mod which fet using, can you have a datasheet of the mosfets i can\'t find any irlml 2502 fet in Turkey.\r\n\r\nThanks for your helps.\r\n\r\nBest Regards.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12896,'c3f9068fbe','i remember earlier this year zzs were gona come out with a beetle but licensing fell through so they released the porsche body kit instead. but man a beetle zz shell would rock. the ms beetle shell is one of the nicest.'),(12897,'e76a0f3f25','Yea I think my fav shells right now are AE86 bit shell, SBCG RX-7 and 350z\r\n\r\n  All the beetles I have are lxx so the molding on them is poor but like I always say about LXX you get what you pay for(4 shells, 2 chassies, 2 4.2 kings for 13.50)'),(12898,'e76a0f3f25','Yea I think my fav shells right now are AE86 bit shell, SBCG RX-7 and 350z\r\n\r\n  All the beetles I have are lxx so the molding on them is poor but like I always say about LXX you get what you pay for(4 shells, 2 chassies, 2 4.2 kings for 13.50)'),(12899,'33434b4de2','Hey did you happen to buy the initial d tuneup kit?\r\n\r\n  If so I know it came with a Initial D card game card what one did it come with(if you have the set of course lol).'),(12900,'33434b4de2','Hey did you happen to buy the initial d tuneup kit?\r\n\r\n  If so I know it came with a Initial D card game card what one did it come with(if you have the set of course lol).');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12902,'24bf116a96','nah i almost did but i opted out.'),(12903,'faeaf7cf0a','[quote:faeaf7cf0a=\"payaso\"]I got it today, and am more than happy dood... thanks a million.\r\n\r\n\r\nNow I\'m torn on should I paint it, or leave it as a collectable?\r\n\r\nI\'m still missing the 3rd one. The funky looking one.  Man, CD made his look fantastic..\r\n\r\n\r\nYour package should be there today as well...  Tell me it\'s there...\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:faeaf7cf0a]\r\n\r\n\r\n  DAMN homie thanks for the extra bodies :)  man now you caused some drama in the collection as I only have 3 ZZ chassies. @ of them are off getting fets and the other is in the mail on its way here so if its not here today I am off to RS to pick up another car so I can see these babies on a chassie(seeing that we got the retired zz stuff here now).\r\n\r\n  well I dont forget things :) so if theres anything you need let me know.\r\n\r\n\r\nPete'),(12904,'e9a627dc5e','Yeah, it sucks about my hand.  They were the two fingers I grip the controller with.  :lol:  Ill be driving in no time.  I was browsing Ebay last night and I found a few things.  Ive shopped around for different things and after comparing prices, I think I came out okay on the deals.  The first thing was 2 Brand new microsizers in their boxes.  Only thing missing are the bodies, plus he threw in a tire set, 2.2 upgrade motor and a clear 350z body.  They arent the Pro series, but I was getting them for the chassis to mess with anyway.  I have enough extra bodies to make up for these two.  I got both for $20 shipped.  I figure the tire set is $5 if I buy it so I came out about even as if I got them at the store.  One bonehead thing I did, was not realizing they werent the Pros, but Ill learn from the mistake.  Second thing I got was a group of 4  Tomy  Bit Char G pullbacks (GP-01,02,03,06) for $19 shipped.  I can always use these bodies on the chassis I got from the other deal.  Third auction I won was a lot of (20)Bit Char G 3.8 motors for $18 shipped.  If they work well when I get them, Ill hook you up with a few.  The last auction I got was a lot of (40) NiMH Bit Char G batteries rated at 150 MAH.  I got these for $30 shipped.  They come out to around .75 cents each so not too bad.  Ill let you know how it turns out.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12905,'54e337a7b3','Holy schnike....lol That\'s alotof stuff.  You\'ll be gettin stuff in like it\'s christmas. Damn I\'m jealous.   Which pullbacks did you get. I can\'e remember which is which.\r\n\r\nDid you get all that in the USA, or HK?  Did you see bdebde\'s vid of his FETed SE? That thing smokes up the track... \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12906,'54e337a7b3','Holy schnike....lol That\'s alotof stuff.  You\'ll be gettin stuff in like it\'s christmas. Damn I\'m jealous.   Which pullbacks did you get. I can\'e remember which is which.\r\n\r\nDid you get all that in the USA, or HK?  Did you see bdebde\'s vid of his FETed SE? That thing smokes up the track... \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12907,'b6d44a6613','[quote:b6d44a6613=\"payaso\"]Holy schnike....lol That\'s alotof stuff.  You\'ll be gettin stuff in like it\'s christmas. Damn I\'m jealous.   Which pullbacks did you get. I can\'e remember which is which.\r\n\r\nDid you get all that in the USA, or HK?  Did you see bdebde\'s vid of his FETed SE? That thing smokes up the track... \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:b6d44a6613]\r\n\r\nWell, I had some extra cash and I figured I could sell off any batteries or motors that I don\'t use.  Here are the 4 pullbacks that I got.  Skyline GT-R R34, Honda NSX, Skyline R32, Skyline 2000GT-R\r\n\r\nhttp://import.h8rs.com/Grunge/pullback.jpg\r\n\r\nI got the motors, batteries and microsizers from the US and the pullbacks from HK.  No one had placed a bid for the pullbacks, so I got them for the minimum bid.  With shipping they come out to be $5 each and after looking at ToyEast, it\'s a good deal.  It seems like most things on Ebay that are coming from HK are too expensive when you add in the shipping.  One Bit comes out to be 27-30 dollars.  I have a some bids on a few from HK that are 9.99 and with shipping come out to be around $20 bucks.  It looks like a reputable company, so I\'m hoping they don\'t stick me with a clone instead of a Bit Char G.   I was planning on ordering some Mosfets and talk my friend into installing them on a few of my cars.  I looked at a website that had them, but I wasn\'t sure which model number to get.'),(12908,'b6d44a6613','[quote:b6d44a6613=\"payaso\"]Holy schnike....lol That\'s alotof stuff.  You\'ll be gettin stuff in like it\'s christmas. Damn I\'m jealous.   Which pullbacks did you get. I can\'e remember which is which.\r\n\r\nDid you get all that in the USA, or HK?  Did you see bdebde\'s vid of his FETed SE? That thing smokes up the track... \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:b6d44a6613]\r\n\r\nWell, I had some extra cash and I figured I could sell off any batteries or motors that I don\'t use.  Here are the 4 pullbacks that I got.  Skyline GT-R R34, Honda NSX, Skyline R32, Skyline 2000GT-R\r\n\r\nhttp://import.h8rs.com/Grunge/pullback.jpg\r\n\r\nI got the motors, batteries and microsizers from the US and the pullbacks from HK.  No one had placed a bid for the pullbacks, so I got them for the minimum bid.  With shipping they come out to be $5 each and after looking at ToyEast, it\'s a good deal.  It seems like most things on Ebay that are coming from HK are too expensive when you add in the shipping.  One Bit comes out to be 27-30 dollars.  I have a some bids on a few from HK that are 9.99 and with shipping come out to be around $20 bucks.  It looks like a reputable company, so I\'m hoping they don\'t stick me with a clone instead of a Bit Char G.   I was planning on ordering some Mosfets and talk my friend into installing them on a few of my cars.  I looked at a website that had them, but I wasn\'t sure which model number to get.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12909,'37bed4f1ef','You\'re gonna be so pleased with those pullbacks. They rock the house. If you want to get rid of one of them, just let me know.  I wish they sold them locally like at a hobby shop. \r\n\r\n\r\nI was testing motors last night, and the 4.2 motors are JUNK.... Totally not worth the $$$$.  My 3.8 motors from Kyle (bitchar-Gmotors) smoke everything in flat out speed.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get all that cool stuff in.. \r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12910,'1c49f86f95','Hey I was wondering was that the only AE tuneup kits you had?\r\n\r\n  If you did get another one what was the card you got with it (ID card game card)?'),(12911,'37bed4f1ef','You\'re gonna be so pleased with those pullbacks. They rock the house. If you want to get rid of one of them, just let me know.  I wish they sold them locally like at a hobby shop. \r\n\r\n\r\nI was testing motors last night, and the 4.2 motors are JUNK.... Totally not worth the $$$$.  My 3.8 motors from Kyle (bitchar-Gmotors) smoke everything in flat out speed.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get all that cool stuff in.. \r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13452,'9d01585724','OK cool\r\n\r\nHey what kind of car is it going into?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13453,'5f377fe4f9','zip zaps,    Mazda RX-8,  blue'),(13454,'5f377fe4f9','zip zaps,    Mazda RX-8,  blue'),(12913,'1c49f86f95','Hey I was wondering was that the only AE tuneup kits you had?\r\n\r\n  If you did get another one what was the card you got with it (ID card game card)?'),(13450,'65bca292b1','ok'),(12915,'41ce081716','No problem man... You\'re a big help around here, and you hooked me up, so I thought of the \"One hand washes the other, and both hands wash the sink\" saying..\r\n\r\n\r\nAdding you to the Cool traders list...   I\'m glad you like it, but I\'m sorry I forced you to buy more cars to see it on a body...lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12916,'9869c04403','Naw, that was the only one I bought, but I thought I left the cards in there for ya..   They should be in the middle of the pack..  Or did you want some different ones?\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12917,'932ef07c46','Yea they were in there I just wasn\'t sure if you got the same card for the card game in all the tuneups sets. I never got one with the starter(card game card that is).  This tuneup came with teh trueno86 se card.\r\n\r\n  But you have more cards to get rid of I will trade yea for them.\r\n\r\n  Now I only wish that I could find a levin bit body or a trueno epoch body  :???: \r\n\r\n  As for making me buy more cars well there is a package at the post office I am going to get now and I dont mind if I have to buy more cars its the wife that thinks I dont need more lol.\r\n\r\n  BUTT I should really start buying cars with the same mhz so I dont have a mountain of controllers like I do now.\r\n\r\n  Again thanks and let me know if you need/see anything.\r\n\r\nPete'),(12918,'932ef07c46','Yea they were in there I just wasn\'t sure if you got the same card for the card game in all the tuneups sets. I never got one with the starter(card game card that is).  This tuneup came with teh trueno86 se card.\r\n\r\n  But you have more cards to get rid of I will trade yea for them.\r\n\r\n  Now I only wish that I could find a levin bit body or a trueno epoch body  :???: \r\n\r\n  As for making me buy more cars well there is a package at the post office I am going to get now and I dont mind if I have to buy more cars its the wife that thinks I dont need more lol.\r\n\r\n  BUTT I should really start buying cars with the same mhz so I dont have a mountain of controllers like I do now.\r\n\r\n  Again thanks and let me know if you need/see anything.\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13447,'782cf6bc65','new\r\n\r\n  You will have to put a gear on it'),(13448,'65bca292b1','ok'),(13449,'4c16d05fda','im new to the forum and i was wondering if i can post in the \"swap meet \" for an audley, or is it strictly bit and zz stuff?'),(12920,'090a4961b0','http://www.tinyrc.com/shop/product.php?pid=331\r\n\r\nIt\'s an alright deal I guess.  I might be able to get a deal on it for ya..\r\n\r\nI\'ll trade ya my other cards.. I think the SE came with them too. I\'m really trying to find some pullbacks, but I can always use some other stuff too...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat else you got?\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12921,'6f055b6120','[quote:6f055b6120=\"payaso\"]http://www.tinyrc.com/shop/product.php?pid=331\r\n\r\nIt\'s an alright deal I guess.  I might be able to get a deal on it for ya..\r\n\r\nI\'ll trade ya my other cards.. I think the SE came with them too. I\'m really trying to find some pullbacks, but I can always use some other stuff too...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat else you got?\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:6f055b6120]\r\n\r\n  Yea I have the grey epoch lick that but I got mine alot sheaper hehe.  I not really willing to pay more then $50.00 shipped for a nother epoch as I also want xmods.\r\n\r\n  As for what I have well I do have a bunch of ae86 pullbacks on there way here from Hong Kong, I have a order with Bithed coming(not sure whats in it, well I forget is what I should say).\r\n\r\n  I have a munch of motors and shit.  But if I dont have it I will find it :)\r\n\r\n  One of the drawbacks of being on perental leave I work from home so spend most my time on the net looking for deals.'),(12922,'6f055b6120','[quote:6f055b6120=\"payaso\"]http://www.tinyrc.com/shop/product.php?pid=331\r\n\r\nIt\'s an alright deal I guess.  I might be able to get a deal on it for ya..\r\n\r\nI\'ll trade ya my other cards.. I think the SE came with them too. I\'m really trying to find some pullbacks, but I can always use some other stuff too...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat else you got?\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:6f055b6120]\r\n\r\n  Yea I have the grey epoch lick that but I got mine alot sheaper hehe.  I not really willing to pay more then $50.00 shipped for a nother epoch as I also want xmods.\r\n\r\n  As for what I have well I do have a bunch of ae86 pullbacks on there way here from Hong Kong, I have a order with Bithed coming(not sure whats in it, well I forget is what I should say).\r\n\r\n  I have a munch of motors and shit.  But if I dont have it I will find it :)\r\n\r\n  One of the drawbacks of being on perental leave I work from home so spend most my time on the net looking for deals.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13276,'cce3a1b7fd','The package came intoday thanks everything looks and works great :)\r\n\r\n  Only a few Q\'s that I have;\r\n\r\n1. Does that wire for the lights just goto the power on the PBC?(not like I am gonna solder it back on but incase I feel the need for lights again lol)\r\n\r\n2. Do you have a use for the ZZ PBC and that chassie?  I just figured you would keep them as I have no use for them.  If so I will toss them in next package.\r\n\r\nWell I will paypal some cash on monday or tuesday for the other mods and shit but still not sure when they will go out(prolly next friday)\r\n\r\n  Again Thanks\r\n\r\nPete\r\n\r\nPS.  I will try and see if I can get nice picks of the flame job and post it up for yea :)'),(19179,'491223861a','Well thanks for the props man.  :-) \r\n...I thought I did pretty good too. :lol: \r\n\r\nYou know, you have odd timing. I had a miserable day at work. Had a couple customers yell at me, then the manager got mad at me cause I don\'t like having customers yelling at me for shit that aint my fault.\r\n\r\nAnyways, in general I just felt completely unappreciated today, and was kinda depressed. It was cool to check the \'puter one more time before bed, and see someone out there appreciates you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI tell ya, I\'ve been really wanting to get some FETs, partially cause I got a couple new cars that need them, partially cause DT and a couple others are asking about them, but mostly cause I can\'t wait to get your SE FETed for you. I\'ve been loving the SE since I learned that last little bit about the resistors.\r\n\r\nDave'),(12925,'5c83b94474','If you end up with some extra pullbacks, just let me know, and I\'m on em..\r\n\r\nI\'m at home alot too. I work nights driving limos. What do you do for a living..\r\n\r\nYou\'re the closest person to me looks wise on the boards. I was the only hoosier up in bitPimps covered in tats for the longest time, and now I have a partner in crime. lol\r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12926,'41fb1a2c50','Well I do a few things for a living.\r\n\r\nMain Job- Work for COX communications in PHX,NE,CON (crazydaves a customer I service), kinda strang cause I am in canada  :???: \r\n\r\nthen, I do computer networking contracting for IBM Canada (my wifes brother is head of K12 education division there so I got an in)\r\n\r\nSell Vintage toys and video games on ebay.\r\n\r\nRun a local Toy shop here.\r\n\r\n\r\n  As for the tats well my wife has more then me mine are just bigger lol.\r\n\r\n  I should have some extra pullbacks as I get them in every few weeks from hong kong as they are cheap ashell so when I order movies and video games I get them to toss a few in.'),(12927,'41fb1a2c50','Well I do a few things for a living.\r\n\r\nMain Job- Work for COX communications in PHX,NE,CON (crazydaves a customer I service), kinda strang cause I am in canada  :???: \r\n\r\nthen, I do computer networking contracting for IBM Canada (my wifes brother is head of K12 education division there so I got an in)\r\n\r\nSell Vintage toys and video games on ebay.\r\n\r\nRun a local Toy shop here.\r\n\r\n\r\n  As for the tats well my wife has more then me mine are just bigger lol.\r\n\r\n  I should have some extra pullbacks as I get them in every few weeks from hong kong as they are cheap ashell so when I order movies and video games I get them to toss a few in.'),(12928,'30f0477488','yo dude we have no problem with you asking questions and being curious about stuff. but we tend to get peeved when people ask questions that have already been asnwered a zillion times already. so please use the search function when possible. other than that enjoy your stay in pimp city. you will find this site quite fun and crap.\r\n\r\nthank you drive thru');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12929,'5417660afc','you got it bro, thanks a bunch.'),(12932,'7e4261465a','ok what is your address again????\r\nand any other tips how to send the money???? 8-)'),(12934,'40ca0bf308','yea thats cool.\r\n\r\n  Funny thing was I got an e-mail last night after reading your msg saying that I have some 5 ae pullbacks and 2 green murcielago packed with my shippment of games lol.'),(12935,'40ca0bf308','yea thats cool.\r\n\r\n  Funny thing was I got an e-mail last night after reading your msg saying that I have some 5 ae pullbacks and 2 green murcielago packed with my shippment of games lol.'),(13397,'340dd89e83','oh my sig... i got rid of that it was a reg one with the driving school set... also i have a tureno intial d card from the zz se upgrade kit 4 ya!'),(13398,'340dd89e83','oh my sig... i got rid of that it was a reg one with the driving school set... also i have a tureno intial d card from the zz se upgrade kit 4 ya!'),(12937,'fbd48f6cee','[quote:fbd48f6cee=\"VooDooMafia\"]yea thats cool.\r\n\r\n  Funny thing was I got an e-mail last night after reading your msg saying that I have some 5 ae pullbacks and 2 green murcielago packed with my shippment of games lol.[/quote:fbd48f6cee]doh! lol\r\nwell I haven\'t sent anything yet...\r\nwanna try to deal for something else?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12938,'d1a8144bea','its all good just means thats one more to not open and stick in teh closet withthe others hehe\r\n\r\n  Do you have the ZZ tuneup kit (initial D)?'),(12939,'d1a8144bea','its all good just means thats one more to not open and stick in teh closet withthe others hehe\r\n\r\n  Do you have the ZZ tuneup kit (initial D)?'),(13396,'bb083e865a','Yea no prob dude\r\n\r\nHey is your digi Q a R or normal one?'),(12941,'0d72450246','[quote:0d72450246=\"VooDooMafia\"]its all good just means thats one more to not open and stick in teh closet withthe others hehe\r\n\r\n  Do you have the ZZ tuneup kit (initial D)?[/quote:0d72450246]naw, no tune-up kits.\r\ngot extra bodies (custom or not) for both bits and zips.\r\ngot a few extra other pieces of junk like tires and shit.'),(12942,'0eda5bfe36','well I will take th eae body I was just asking cause I have been tring to find out if they pack the same card in teh initial D tuneup set(for the card game)'),(12943,'0eda5bfe36','well I will take th eae body I was just asking cause I have been tring to find out if they pack the same card in teh initial D tuneup set(for the card game)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12944,'60997517e1','I sent that program out today and also went through some stuff in these boxes here and found some gen 1 pullback wheels.  Did you need them?  if so I will put them aside for next package I get together whenever you ready for more moddin hehe.\r\n\r\nPete'),(12946,'3a128ff610','[quote:3a128ff610=\"VooDooMafia\"]I sent that program out today and also went through some stuff in these boxes here and found some gen 1 pullback wheels.  Did you need them?  if so I will put them aside for next package I get together whenever you ready for more moddin hehe.\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:3a128ff610]Well I\'ll tell ya. I don\'t [i:3a128ff610]need[/i:3a128ff610] anything (except maybe weed), but I could use some pullback tires.\r\n\r\nWelp, couldn\'t send the package from my wife\'s work today, because it needs to go through customs. I\'ll take the bus to the post office tomorrow\r\n\r\nDave'),(12948,'abdd801b32','OK cool well whenever you get to it man :)\r\n\r\n  I will put some pullback tires aside then :)\r\n\r\n  As for the weed I would send some but not sure if it would make it through customs  :???: \r\n\r\n  Me I just drink now (mushrooms twice a year maybe).  Had to quick the smoke and cigs after the last heart atach and surgery :(');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13392,'b0507aed51','ok thanx anyway man.'),(13393,'25e642a08b','hey man, sry i got the puul back and the nkok truck, sry but if u want a clone how about a dual cell shen? just needs a few wires soldered back together.....'),(13395,'b1f425a1c4','[quote:b1f425a1c4=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:b1f425a1c4=\"VooDooMafia\"]Glad they got there ok. \r\n\r\n  Yea those are from the other homie sets(knock off I think)\r\n\r\n  I like to toss something in with the packages to make me feel like the post office didn\'t screw me with there prices(not as cheap as it is for you guys).  But its all a write off anyway.\r\n\r\n  Sometimes I send shit that I get in the mail so you Yanks can see the crap we get.  I sent sessiz a \"Stop Wetting the Bed\" flyer I got in the mail with his package.  Like common if I wetted the bed would I really order that shit with my real name  :???:[/quote:b1f425a1c4]lol thats funny.\r\nwell cool man, thanks for the extras\r\n\r\nI\'ll let ya know when the other body arrives.\r\ndid you get that ae86 body I sent yet?[/quote:b1f425a1c4]\r\n\r\n\r\n  LOL yea I looked after I PMed you and it was in along with some forms from the post office (could be good i guess but proly customs bills lol)'),(12950,'a23fb4357d','[quote:a23fb4357d=\"VooDooMafia\"]OK cool well whenever you get to it man :)\r\n\r\n  I will put some pullback tires aside then :)\r\n\r\n  As for the weed I would send some but not sure if it would make it through customs  :???: \r\n\r\n  Me I just drink now (mushrooms twice a year maybe).  Had to quick the smoke and cigs after the last heart atach and surgery :([/quote:a23fb4357d]Ack, that\'s sucks, sorry man.  :sad: \r\n\r\nI guess it takes something like that to make you quit. I can\'t really drink, bad stomach, so I\'m needs me smoke. \r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14514,'bac1990cae','Lemma check out a couple-a-things and I\'ll get back to ya!'),(14515,'3ebd200713','Hey Cavey,\r\n\r\nWe may need your help Pimp.\r\n\r\nIt seems the 1st place prize in our Year End Contest is in delima.  They can\'t decide between a dual cell or FET.  I suggested FET since the dual cell that would be done wouldn\'t be internal.  Now I don\'t know about most but I for 1 wouldn\'t want an external dual cell\'d car.  So here\'s the gig!\r\n\r\nWould it be possible for you to chip (FET) a chassis before Xmas?\r\n\r\nI\'ll send you what chips you need and anything else you require.\r\n\r\nSilla has the chassis, Hog was suppose to do the dual batt but he\'s had some personal shit going on lately so Cabo didn\'t want to chance sending it to him and not having it back in time. I wanted to let them handle it cause I\'ve had a lot, maybe too much input in the other contests so I just followed their leads but as you can see, we\'re getting down to the wire and 1st place is still unfinished and undecided.\r\n\r\nLemme know Pimp!\r\n\r\nThanx Cavey!'),(13275,'cce3a1b7fd','The package came intoday thanks everything looks and works great :)\r\n\r\n  Only a few Q\'s that I have;\r\n\r\n1. Does that wire for the lights just goto the power on the PBC?(not like I am gonna solder it back on but incase I feel the need for lights again lol)\r\n\r\n2. Do you have a use for the ZZ PBC and that chassie?  I just figured you would keep them as I have no use for them.  If so I will toss them in next package.\r\n\r\nWell I will paypal some cash on monday or tuesday for the other mods and shit but still not sure when they will go out(prolly next friday)\r\n\r\n  Again Thanks\r\n\r\nPete\r\n\r\nPS.  I will try and see if I can get nice picks of the flame job and post it up for yea :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12952,'3d97153588','[quote:3d97153588=\"crazydave\"][quote:3d97153588=\"VooDooMafia\"]OK cool well whenever you get to it man :)\r\n\r\n  I will put some pullback tires aside then :)\r\n\r\n  As for the weed I would send some but not sure if it would make it through customs  :???: \r\n\r\n  Me I just drink now (mushrooms twice a year maybe).  Had to quick the smoke and cigs after the last heart atach and surgery :([/quote:3d97153588]Ack, that\'s sucks, sorry man.  :sad: \r\n\r\nI guess it takes something like that to make you quit. I can\'t really drink, bad stomach, so I\'m needs me smoke. \r\ndave[/quote:3d97153588]\r\n\r\n LOL its all good man shit happens and I figured I wouldn\'t get off that lucky anyway my wife was born to torment me well into my 90\'s lol.'),(12953,'30f0477488','yo dude we have no problem with you asking questions and being curious about stuff. but we tend to get peeved when people ask questions that have already been asnwered a zillion times already. so please use the search function when possible. other than that enjoy your stay in pimp city. you will find this site quite fun and crap.\r\n\r\nthank you drive thru'),(12954,'ed8f286a3e','[quote:ed8f286a3e=\"hogjowlz\"]yo dude we have no problem with you asking questions and being curious about stuff. but we tend to get peeved when people ask questions that have already been asnwered a zillion times already. so please use the search function when possible. other than that enjoy your stay in pimp city. you will find this site quite fun and crap.\r\n\r\nthank you drive thru[/quote:ed8f286a3e]\r\n\r\nsry for askin questions....thats all i can say...it wont happen again, sir?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12955,'ed8f286a3e','[quote:ed8f286a3e=\"hogjowlz\"]yo dude we have no problem with you asking questions and being curious about stuff. but we tend to get peeved when people ask questions that have already been asnwered a zillion times already. so please use the search function when possible. other than that enjoy your stay in pimp city. you will find this site quite fun and crap.\r\n\r\nthank you drive thru[/quote:ed8f286a3e]\r\n\r\nsry for askin questions....thats all i can say...it wont happen again, sir?'),(12956,'2f123ba2fb','nah dude ask questions but see if its already been answered first.'),(15101,'bedd7dfdf7','[quote:bedd7dfdf7=\"HoeHunter\"]nice job on bitpimps.\r\n\r\nthere is a friend of mine here, and he is the pocket behind www.gear-boy.com and is painfully subjected to my ability to \"create\" for the site.\r\n\r\ngear-boy, and my AngryRedPimps site, are how i have learned, and i\'m slow, (uptarded) and get paid little (nothing) so i do it when i have time.\r\n\r\nwe are in love w/ bitpimps, and i have been trying to get \'gearboy\" to go the phpBB direction. bitpimps has inspired me, and we are gunna give it a shot.\r\n\r\nthanks for that.[/quote:bedd7dfdf7]thanks for the props pimp...\r\nkeep at it, you\'ll only get better with time and experience.\r\n\r\nI\'m glad you and your pals are enjoying and it\'s inspiring you in whatever ways it might be.\r\n\r\nC-Dub'),(12958,'f3644c219b',':finger:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12959,'e07176af92','hey mate, in this thread http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2317&amp;start=0&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight= you asked micro for a schematic/drawing of the hookup for the fet mod.   Good luck!  He\'s not releasing this mod at the moment, bastard.   This sorta pisses me off \'cause I was helping him via email with some questions he had and now nada, squat!\r\n\r\nO well, crazy and I are working on this together untill my se comes in the mail.  Also on that topic I got an echeck from sessiz for other work and it should clear into paysluts within the next couple.  Once that is done I\'ll move the $30USD into your account.\r\n\r\ncheers dude\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(14186,'7893de275e','How\'s it going dood?  I\'ve been offline for a while since I fried my computer, and it crashed..\r\n\r\n\r\nBack on now though, except for all my apps.  Still gotta get my ICQ hooked up.\r\n\r\nHow are things over there?\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(22481,'593e6ca97f','Sounds like its the cookie issue with your browser.\r\nSounds like they are getting set, but only kept for a certain amount of time.\r\nDo you know if you have any programs running that would be deleting your cookies?\r\n\r\nTo make sure IE allows cookies, in the IE browser you can:\r\n- click on Tools\r\n- select Internet Options\r\n- click on the Security tab\r\n- highlight Trusted Sites and click the Sites button below\r\n- add http://bitpimps.lixlink.com to the list and click OK\r\n- click on the Privacy tab\r\n- select the Edit button below\r\n- add http://bitpimps.lixlink.com to the list and select Allow and click OK\r\n\r\nunless another program or other security settings are restricting cookies on your machine, that should work.\r\n[quote:593e6ca97f=\"DarkTari\"]Using at work today with no problem.\r\n\r\nProblem at home is if I log in and sometimes, not everytime try to reply to a post, I\'m asked to log in again ??  Same if I want to submit a new post but only happens sometimes, not everytime.  Yesterday was the first time I replied to a post, wrote all the shit in, then when submitting response, it asked me to log in and erased all the shit I just wrote which hell, I ain\'t gonna remember dat shit. That\'s the only reason I mentioned it otherwise I just log in again and go on with life.\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp![/quote:593e6ca97f]');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14188,'0c51625a2e','Yo, hows it goin over there. I\'ve been jammed with HW and other shiattt. im going to try to ball the hood with somefin new that im cookin\', but i dunno if i have it in time. So i try mah best, and keep ballin\'. -Mike'),(12961,'feff16d072','[quote:feff16d072=\"ph2t\"]hey mate, in this thread http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2317&amp;start=0&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight= you asked micro for a schematic/drawing of the hookup for the fet mod.   Good luck!  He\'s not releasing this mod at the moment, bastard.   This sorta pisses me off \'cause I was helping him via email with some questions he had and now nada, squat!\r\n\r\nO well, crazy and I are working on this together untill my se comes in the mail.  Also on that topic I got an echeck from sessiz for other work and it should clear into paysluts within the next couple.  Once that is done I\'ll move the $30USD into your account.\r\n\r\ncheers dude\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:feff16d072]\r\n\r\n\r\nIt\'s $35. US.  remember?\r\n\r\nas to microamp, I know all about it.\r\nand that is why I asked for it..knowing he would not answer.\r\nand another reason, why I wanted you to get an SE. Get your ass in gear and go around him.\r\n\r\n-nigel'),(13077,'ff7c4bf9fe','Hey Roland,\r\n\r\n I finally got through to a supervisor with my ISP, after 6 or 8 flunkies telling me that nothing could be done about it. Seems other people with my ISP have not been getting emails either. They have a team investigating it and need to know what addresses are not getting through. I was wondering if you tried sending from your different mail accounts, so I could tell them all of them.Thanks. Oh, stuff went out in the mail today on it\'s way to you. Hotmail is down right now (great) so I don\'t know if you sent me anything. I will check later. I will sent this in an email too. You did say you still recieved my emails, correct?\r\n\r\nBruce');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13078,'801741d47f','in one word, HOTT.\r\n\r\nBut other than that, its cool. Not as fast paced as the states and not as many oppertunities. Thaz cuz we\'re a small island (166 square miles). \r\nI would not change it for the world.'),(12963,'2d31d08337','[quote:2d31d08337=\"noxorc\"][quote:2d31d08337=\"ph2t\"]hey mate, in this thread http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2317&amp;start=0&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight= you asked micro for a schematic/drawing of the hookup for the fet mod.   Good luck!  He\'s not releasing this mod at the moment, bastard.   This sorta pisses me off \'cause I was helping him via email with some questions he had and now nada, squat!\r\n\r\nO well, crazy and I are working on this together untill my se comes in the mail.  Also on that topic I got an echeck from sessiz for other work and it should clear into paysluts within the next couple.  Once that is done I\'ll move the $30USD into your account.\r\n\r\ncheers dude\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:2d31d08337]\r\n\r\n\r\nIt\'s $35. US.  remember?\r\n\r\nas to microamp, I know all about it.\r\nand that is why I asked for it..knowing he would not answer.\r\nand another reason, why I wanted you to get an SE. Get your ass in gear and go around him.\r\n\r\n-nigel[/quote:2d31d08337]\r\n\r\nsorry dude, yes it\'s $35 my mistake...\r\nwe\'ll see how we go, here\'s hoping.\r\nwere you interested in a zz mosfet mod tute? for the originals, not se\'s.  I modded a zz from ez and took photos as I did it.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(12964,'2f123ba2fb','nah dude ask questions but see if its already been answered first.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12965,'0e9403432a','I am going to try to send the car today. But I was @ the post office today and I don\'t have a name to send the money order to so that you can get paid. I am only sending the car tho, its a 35MHz booster. I will see if I can send it off this evening if not tomorrow morning.\r\n\r\nI will check back in the hood a lil later on to see if you replied.\r\n\r\nThanx.'),(28581,'822b7092e7','your first warning.\r\n\r\n\r\nbitPimps relies on mature members not posting stupid shit, like meaningless threads. If you need to do it, do it somewhere else.'),(19035,'22ba61f808','hi there thanks for checkin out my post!  i Can hook u up with the citroen and paint it for you, also i have a few waterslide decals that may work but dont have the coca cola decal,, do u know from what rally that car was featured so that i may get some more info on the sponsors that are on the car... were do u live! and do u have a paypal account...\r\njmays'),(13033,'4f9f9bbe0e','hey mate, you got your car yet?\r\n\r\nmatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13057,'77286276cd','No sir, The one you sent will be my first. :-)'),(13060,'38a5026c89','Well, I didn\'t get any notification on the private message. I think it is on my servers end, too. I have a trouble ticket in with them, I will have to see if they can find anything. They keep trying to tell me that it is on the senders end and they can do nothing, but I will keep bugging them. Very annoying to not get emails. I wonder how many are not getting through that I don\'t know about. Thanks for checking into that for me though.'),(12968,'990d69f0e1','[quote:990d69f0e1=\"Maxximum Attack\"]I am going to try to send the car today. But I was @ the post office today and I don\'t have a name to send the money order to so that you can get paid. I am only sending the car tho, its a 35MHz booster. I will see if I can send it off this evening if not tomorrow morning.\r\n\r\nI will check back in the hood a lil later on to see if you replied.\r\n\r\nThanx.[/quote:990d69f0e1]Hey what\'s up?\r\n\r\nYou can make the money order out to David Harrington.\r\n\r\nBut I am going to need the controller, I do not have a 35mhz booster controller. I\'ve got about 20 of these mods under my belt, and I\'ve gotton it to where they work the first time about 90% of the time, but because it is very difficult to solder on such a small board, there is a chance of shorting something out due to a sloppy solder joint. So I will need the controller so I can trouble shoot, if that is the case..\r\n\r\nBTW, if you want someone to vouch for my mosfet mods you could contact Cabo, or Havok. Voodoomafia will be able to vouch for me soon, as I\'m sending his cars back today.\r\n\r\nDave'),(12969,'bcdfe9cd46','Peter Kostecki\r\n20 Water St\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nL2V 2K3\r\nCanada\r\n\r\n\r\nNo other tips just conceal it as best you can.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12970,'44999fde3f','Sup dude anything new going on your way?\r\n\r\n  Looking for anything new?  Let me know I have some stuff on the way and alwasy extras kicking around here for trade or whatever hehe you know how it is :)\r\n\r\nPete :-)'),(12971,'44999fde3f','Sup dude anything new going on your way?\r\n\r\n  Looking for anything new?  Let me know I have some stuff on the way and alwasy extras kicking around here for trade or whatever hehe you know how it is :)\r\n\r\nPete :-)'),(12972,'f6157d0663','How much are LXX bits worth??  I found a case of 40 LXX brand new skylines on Ebay and with shipping included, they come out to about $4.75 each.  I might be interested in a few of them, but I was just wondering how hard it would be to sell off the extras.  You\'ve been in the bit community longer than I have.  Any ideas?'),(13390,'b0507aed51','ok thanx anyway man.'),(13391,'244f230fbd','Make an offer dude I am mostly looking for chassies as I have a ton of bodies that I need to find chassies &amp; controllers  for.'),(12975,'471acd41af','Can I be assured of your trutworthiness and that you wont take the money and not sen me the engine????? :?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13278,'a0e913ac09','I\'m so pissed off at my RS... I\'ve been there 3 times now, and they still don\'t have any of the tuner kits.  They tell me they\'re coming, but no sign yet. \r\n\r\nSorry for the delay, but I wanted to respond with good news.  I\'m going there after I get paid today also.   They seem to be the hottest item.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(12977,'8fec3892d0','You shouldn\'t need to ask that question :)\r\n\r\n  Look in this thread and you will see nothing bad about me :)\r\n\r\n[url]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=1183[/url]\r\n\r\n  If you want put a post up asking pimps.  If I get someones $$ they get there stuff.  Plus dude its $7.00 why would someone risk anything for 7 bucks.'),(12979,'e0f7aab02f','ok just wondering.  Their are alot of assholes out their.  I lost 50 bucks trying to buy sumthin this way.  Please excuse my caution. I put the letter in the mail on monday. talk to you later'),(12981,'173f5bbba7','I guess you can send me a quick message here.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12982,'173f5bbba7','I guess you can send me a quick message here.'),(12983,'770759e944','Yeah ok, I\'ll use this as a plan B.\r\nSee if the email thing clears up, I sent you a long email (a copy of the last 3 emails that I have sent to you) but it seems you may not have got that either.\r\nHas your ISP/mail provider closed access to the southern half of the world?\r\nLet me know what happens.\r\nFor now, just know that I am still receiveing your emails, even though you cant receive my replies.\r\nI got your note on sending the 3 cars and extra bodies etc, sounds great, go for it. Thanks for sending the stuff for me too, its much appreciated.\r\nKeep in touch, by whatever means, theres a few other things I want to discuss with you, but given the curent problems it might take a while.\r\nThanks Bruce,\r\nRoland'),(12984,'0391684fd8','My Radio Shack finally got Xmods in this week so I\'m just gonna get them there. Thanks anyway dude.'),(12985,'f6157d0663','How much are LXX bits worth??  I found a case of 40 LXX brand new skylines on Ebay and with shipping included, they come out to about $4.75 each.  I might be interested in a few of them, but I was just wondering how hard it would be to sell off the extras.  You\'ve been in the bit community longer than I have.  Any ideas?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (12986,'770759e944','Yeah ok, I\'ll use this as a plan B.\r\nSee if the email thing clears up, I sent you a long email (a copy of the last 3 emails that I have sent to you) but it seems you may not have got that either.\r\nHas your ISP/mail provider closed access to the southern half of the world?\r\nLet me know what happens.\r\nFor now, just know that I am still receiveing your emails, even though you cant receive my replies.\r\nI got your note on sending the 3 cars and extra bodies etc, sounds great, go for it. Thanks for sending the stuff for me too, its much appreciated.\r\nKeep in touch, by whatever means, theres a few other things I want to discuss with you, but given the curent problems it might take a while.\r\nThanks Bruce,\r\nRoland'),(12991,'1a3d479912','Are you the one to talk to about this? If not, sorry for bothering ya. I am not getting email updates for new posts. I am not getting emails from one other person that I know of too. My ISP say it is not their network. I find it highly unlikely that two different sources are not getting emails to me due to their network. Could you check and see what error message was returned (if possible), and maybe do a little checkin from your end. Thank you very much.'),(12992,'67efa6de28','[quote:67efa6de28=\"bdebde\"]Are you the one to talk to about this? If not, sorry for bothering ya. I am not getting email updates for new posts. I am not getting emails from one other person that I know of too. My ISP say it is not their network. I find it highly unlikely that two different sources are not getting emails to me due to their network. Could you check and see what error message was returned (if possible), and maybe do a little checkin from your end. Thank you very much.[/quote:67efa6de28]hey bdebde, yes you contacted the right person.\r\nI don\'t see any error messages on the mail server, looks like all in the queue has been sent off.\r\nemail service on this end is working fine.\r\nIt could have been a temporary glitch in either my mail server or yours.\r\nI\'d think probably yours as you lost another email seperate from this site and as far as I know, no one else is missing email from this site.\r\nLots of email servers are having troubles lately with the last big wave of viruses. hotmail, microsoft just to name a few.\r\n\r\nIf you have email notification turned on for private messages, you should have gotten an email notifying you of this private message.\r\n\r\nlet me know if you get that email.\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nCaboWabo');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14070,'abe0ab38e6','ok im cool, i got the package yesterday,and i am plesed, thank you very much. And im not really interesterested in that stuff.'),(12994,'3f144a44eb','Hello sessiz are you Turk ? Excuse me because your nickname is turkish word.\r\n\r\nBye.'),(12995,'0d7fee3ab9','Merhaba kuzgun. :-) \r\nTurkcem pek iyi degil.\r\nThats why I\'ll ask for you to write in english.\r\nIt\'s Nice to see another turk on bitpimps. Are there many people into bitchar g in turkiye? \r\nSpeak to you later.'),(12996,'0d7fee3ab9','Merhaba kuzgun. :-) \r\nTurkcem pek iyi degil.\r\nThats why I\'ll ask for you to write in english.\r\nIt\'s Nice to see another turk on bitpimps. Are there many people into bitchar g in turkiye? \r\nSpeak to you later.'),(12998,'019ec40d1f','And so my english are not good ?\r\nNo i don\'t think so many people interested bit char+g in Turkey. Only some of my friends and I .\r\n\r\nNice to meet yo my real name is Mutlu = Happy  :)'),(12999,'28932dae8d','Nice to meet you too mutlu. Benim adim Yahya. Senin engilisce cok iyi, better than my turkce :lol: \r\nYou came to the right site mutlu, you\'ll find everything and anything you need to know right here at bitpimps. Enjoy yourself.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13389,'b312dc991f','OK well I will let you know but I think its gone  \r\n\r\njust waiting to finalize the details of the deal but he said he wants it and already send paypal cash for some of his stuff so I think its gone dude\r\n\r\nI will keep my eyes open for more though'),(13001,'dd4d7d7194','[quote:dd4d7d7194=\"VooDooMafia\"]well I will take th eae body I was just asking cause I have been tring to find out if they pack the same card in teh initial D tuneup set(for the card game)[/quote:dd4d7d7194]hey man, I just wanted to let ya know, I still haven\'t shipped out this body.\r\nI was supposed to get it ready this morning for my wife to ship for me, but I forgot.\r\nI\'m totally sorry.\r\nI promise I\'ll have it go out tomorrow morning.\r\nSorry dude.'),(13002,'7c4f44a726','Man it no big deal :)\r\n\r\n  I have enough stuff here to keep my busy till it gets in.\r\n\r\n  Tring to find into on teh paml racers that kyosho(sp?) put out  :???:'),(13003,'28932dae8d','Nice to meet you too mutlu. Benim adim Yahya. Senin engilisce cok iyi, better than my turkce :lol: \r\nYou came to the right site mutlu, you\'ll find everything and anything you need to know right here at bitpimps. Enjoy yourself.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (16882,'0c6771351e','Here are some of the stuff I am willing to trade:\r\n[img:0c6771351e]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0RwAAAMwTjqt4z6Q0liEG0BAZNxwS1stY7MGPRB!vLNzVpIEkuNNjPRRhAq1iL!IxUXydnly8Hgw42hkvWCCIYLcY4aVBHQmYDSFByFHNdo4/MVC-011Fparts3.JPG?dc=4675461612496210399[/img:0c6771351e]\r\n[img:0c6771351e]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0RwCz*8oTF6t4z6Q0liEG0PaP7BzOZOvG3!t2da7kTlLiN27kjYh81vRaS5rGSjjY9urh7*EhqlyZCZtfPRWfI*QpEI8Mys9xJpRit1SRwco/MVC-010Fparts2.JPG?dc=4675461612494194946[/img:0c6771351e]\r\n[img:0c6771351e]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0RwAAAMsTXat4z6Q0liEG0H9zEOvHZvqCGAu4U4kBqEw4eoMTyvpEriNr8uZiaupiQ7SWGqOjO!WwOctujaAr!62wugNsxfxSaSZZ9DQiF6Q/MVC-012Fparts1.JPG?dc=4675461612498146316[/img:0c6771351e]\r\n[img:0c6771351e]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0SwAAAJ0VtCdq9cpmlvXLRLOhcSNKR6Mjv3FgJgSyZPNQYUf5WqI2fE610b6R!Z5MLlTA5UzDJLvr34wkntqFSu5RLWcEoTyHuDBWkkM6IZylhFri2rK5Hg/MVC-007Fmorebodies.JPG?dc=4675461613127029744[/img:0c6771351e]\r\n[img:0c6771351e]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0RwAAAOsTI7Jq9cpmlvXLRDymFUG8CQy0zddcCrTgihn7HgSwMbESS*DBNmPvH0QPJejm1TDK*yae4UgWpWk78XZ6YC4Ie5IbZZNqm6KKryQ/MVC-008Fbodies.JPG?dc=4675461613129166093[/img:0c6771351e]\r\n[img:0c6771351e]http://www.msnusers.com/_Secure/0RwCGGOYTHrF4z6Q0liEG0Dwa!fc2HvLGAX25HDomQatiAQ1CQUek9O3ZlfJWFoPXkEAflT1Dezum*aaxtallHiH0lj2DfiWNeek2poIex!M/MVC-011Fparked.JPG?dc=4675461615080826274[/img:0c6771351e]\r\nTell Me if these Pictures worked or not, and write back if You interested. thanks :cool:'),(13005,'d08c5d5321','I\'m toast, so I forgot to remind you of the reminder...  My brains fried.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13386,'bad49e1f3f','ok cuz i found 11 zz track peices and a lil ramp if u want them too im not sure if u can build a track with 11 peices but hey , its not gonna hurt anything, id take the xtrek car or the bitchar-g'),(13387,'bad49e1f3f','ok cuz i found 11 zz track peices and a lil ramp if u want them too im not sure if u can build a track with 11 peices but hey , its not gonna hurt anything, id take the xtrek car or the bitchar-g'),(13007,'5e5ba27208','Do you happen to know the going price for LXX bits?  I found a deal where I can buy a bunch of them for around $5 each.  I want to be able to get rid of any extras I have.  From what I\'ve seen they go from $10-$15 online.  If I get rid of my extras at $8-$10?, do you think I could unload them??  Thanks for any info you can offer.\r\n -Grunge'),(13008,'d8d2760251','Well it all depends on what cars they are and what they come with.\r\n\r\n LXX are cheap and  you can find them cheap if you look around.\r\n\r\n  you would have to be more detailed on what you will have.'),(13009,'d8d2760251','Well it all depends on what cars they are and what they come with.\r\n\r\n LXX are cheap and  you can find them cheap if you look around.\r\n\r\n  you would have to be more detailed on what you will have.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13011,'b7be32306f','I\'m sorry, here\'s a little more info...  \r\n\r\nASSORTED LXX L-01 R/C MINI CAR\r\nSILVER&amp;BLUE, RED&amp;WHITE, SILVER BLACK AND YELLOW\r\nMicro B 3.0 Motor\r\n\r\nhttp://i3.ebayimg.com/03/i/00/8b/92/10_1.JPG'),(13012,'4cd2bed22b','I would have to say stay away fromthem unless you are only gona get a few.\r\n\r\n  Also when buying from ebay you have to remember the shipping could hurt you.\r\n\r\n  Those cars in that pic are only worth $8.00 shipped'),(13013,'4cd2bed22b','I would have to say stay away fromthem unless you are only gona get a few.\r\n\r\n  Also when buying from ebay you have to remember the shipping could hurt you.\r\n\r\n  Those cars in that pic are only worth $8.00 shipped'),(13443,'45139be78e','is this motor used or new???'),(13444,'45139be78e','is this motor used or new???'),(13446,'af170092e2','I live at \r\n\r\n2508 Lynn Lake circle south\r\nSt. Petersburg Fl. 33712\r\n\r\nIf you take HWY 275 south, come across the \"Howard Franklin\" bridge, and follow that all the way south..\r\n\r\nLynn lake apartments are on 54th AVE south..  You will pass all the north ave. so just stay on 275 until you see 54th Ave S/Pinellas Bayway. Take 54th s, and turn left. Lynn Lake is on your right.  Come through the guard gate, and I will come meet you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHope that didn\'t sound confusing... It\'s really easy.\r\n\r\n-S'),(13015,'e85a7e8330','[quote:e85a7e8330=\"VooDooMafia\"]I would have to say stay away fromthem unless you are only gona get a few.\r\n\r\n  Also when buying from ebay you have to remember the shipping could hurt you.\r\n\r\n  Those cars in that pic are only worth $8.00 shipped[/quote:e85a7e8330]\r\n\r\nThey were cheaper because I was going to buy in bulk.  I guess if they have a history of being crappy, I don\'t want to get stuck with a bunch of bits that don\'t work correctly.  The $5 price per bit included shipping.  Thanks for your help.  It sounded too good to be true.....');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13016,'110ac5347e','well sounds like you are gonna buy them frm hongkong cowboy on ebay.\r\n\r\n  And if $5.00 including the shipping is the cost then thats ok but for that price you can get better cars but you will have to buy 40 of them.  If you have 200 bucks to invest then sure buy them up :)'),(13017,'110ac5347e','well sounds like you are gonna buy them frm hongkong cowboy on ebay.\r\n\r\n  And if $5.00 including the shipping is the cost then thats ok but for that price you can get better cars but you will have to buy 40 of them.  If you have 200 bucks to invest then sure buy them up :)'),(14100,'2a97de2be7','sup pimp\r\npayaso\'s computer is down right now and has been for the past several days.\r\npayaso still loves you though, he said he\'ll just send the love letters through regular mail.\r\n\r\naight he didn\'t say it quite like that. lol\r\n\r\npayaso wants to know if you can just send them out to him and he\'ll just send off the cash in money order, of if you want to wait till he gets back online (a day or 2) he can paypal it to you.\r\n\r\nI guess let me know and I\'ll pass it along to him.\r\n\r\ntalk to ya later\r\nScott'),(13943,'dcb063984a','No tax\r\n\r\n  With shipping it will be about $18.00 for the car set');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13944,'d963570c3e','ill give you 10 for the car, 5 for shipping.  have you ever made a stand alone charger??'),(13945,'d963570c3e','ill give you 10 for the car, 5 for shipping.  have you ever made a stand alone charger??'),(13019,'d08c5d5321','I\'m toast, so I forgot to remind you of the reminder...  My brains fried.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13020,'1b56d3389c','haha i hear ya. im real bad in the morning.'),(13021,'1b56d3389c','haha i hear ya. im real bad in the morning.'),(13022,'f4ea5fc623','Nice to meet you too. If you want when i am online i teach you a Turkish little bit. My msn is mutlu_toker@msn.com see you. Ciao  :-)'),(13024,'68e76bc7ac','Wassup holmes... I was wonderin if you could make a flyer like this one, but with one of my glorias in it..   I wanna start printing em up, and putting them around town..\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m sick of never having anybody to race with.   It\'s time for a club, or some shit...\r\n\r\n[img:68e76bc7ac]http://picserver.student.utwente.nl/getpicture.php?id=327069[/img:68e76bc7ac]\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks man. Let me know.\r\n\r\n-S'),(13025,'44d2945e2d','No problem bro, shoot me some pics and whatever info you want up on it to me at sessiz10@hotmail.com. :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13026,'7c4f44a726','Man it no big deal :)\r\n\r\n  I have enough stuff here to keep my busy till it gets in.\r\n\r\n  Tring to find into on teh paml racers that kyosho(sp?) put out  :???:'),(13028,'44d2945e2d','No problem bro, shoot me some pics and whatever info you want up on it to me at sessiz10@hotmail.com. :-)'),(13029,'6d29099bc1','[quote:6d29099bc1=\"VooDooMafia\"]Man it no big deal :)\r\n\r\n  I have enough stuff here to keep my busy till it gets in.\r\n\r\n  Tring to find into on teh paml racers that kyosho(sp?) put out  :???:[/quote:6d29099bc1]never heard of them, but kyosho is a name I know from way back when.\r\nwonder what they put out?'),(13030,'f28e4a204a','Send me the pics of your steering mod And I\'ll host them and repost them.  RCpics that EZ uses won\'t show up any more.  I wil go and copy the pics he has on there and I\'ll post those.  But prefer the originals without the RCpics.net water mark.'),(13031,'c40ea68f5a','Ok I sent the car off yesterday, I put a $20 money order in it I hope that is enough. It can be resent as a letter, that\'s how I sent it.\r\n\r\nGood luck on the mod (ill need it :-) )');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13062,'72071a65af','[quote:72071a65af=\"bdebde\"]Well, I didn\'t get any notification on the private message. I think it is on my servers end, too. I have a trouble ticket in with them, I will have to see if they can find anything. They keep trying to tell me that it is on the senders end and they can do nothing, but I will keep bugging them. Very annoying to not get emails. I wonder how many are not getting through that I don\'t know about. Thanks for checking into that for me though.[/quote:72071a65af]yea so far everyone I\'ve asked on the boards gets the emails.\r\nI know a lot of mail servers are experiencing troubles due to some Microsoft/XP viruses (Swen/Automat).\r\nI don\'t know if any of this is effecting your situation, but here it is anyway:\r\n[b:72071a65af]ISPs blocking webhosting customers from using SMTP[/b:72071a65af]\r\nA lot of major dialup/dsl/cable ISPs are now blocking EXTERNAL ACCESS to port 25 to prevent SPAM (outgoing email server). If you cannot send emails with outlook, use your dialup/dsl/cable ISP outgoing mail server (contact them for the hostname). \r\n\r\nATT WorldNet, Earthlink,MSN,RCN,Mindspring,Sympatico,Cox...and more are blocking port 25 (or use redirection).'),(13063,'c9e07f28d6','Thanks for the info. If you can think of anything else that I can throw at my ******* ISP, let me know. If you can think of anything else to check on your end, let me know what you find out. I will let you know when (if) this is resolved, so keep me in mind.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13064,'f28e4a204a','Send me the pics of your steering mod And I\'ll host them and repost them.  RCpics that EZ uses won\'t show up any more.  I wil go and copy the pics he has on there and I\'ll post those.  But prefer the originals without the RCpics.net water mark.'),(13066,'c9e07f28d6','Thanks for the info. If you can think of anything else that I can throw at my ******* ISP, let me know. If you can think of anything else to check on your end, let me know what you find out. I will let you know when (if) this is resolved, so keep me in mind.'),(13067,'5785b07146','[quote:5785b07146=\"bdebde\"]Thanks for the info. If you can think of anything else that I can throw at my ******* ISP, let me know. If you can think of anything else to check on your end, let me know what you find out. I will let you know when (if) this is resolved, so keep me in mind.[/quote:5785b07146]you got it'),(13068,'5785b07146','[quote:5785b07146=\"bdebde\"]Thanks for the info. If you can think of anything else that I can throw at my ******* ISP, let me know. If you can think of anything else to check on your end, let me know what you find out. I will let you know when (if) this is resolved, so keep me in mind.[/quote:5785b07146]you got it'),(13074,'bdef6a606f','Nevermind dude I just found a PM that said you sent it to th epaypal address hehe, I will get my lazy ass out to the office and pick it up LOL\r\n\r\n  Thanks alot dude.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13075,'356c2af918','Sup dude just wondering if you could let m eknow when the SE was shipping and to what address so I can track it down at the post office.'),(13076,'dd114adee6','[quote:dd114adee6=\"Maxximum Attack\"]Ok I sent the car off yesterday, I put a $20 money order in it I hope that is enough. It can be resent as a letter, that\'s how I sent it.\r\n\r\nGood luck on the mod (ill need it :-) )[/quote:dd114adee6]Ok, I\'ll keep an eye out for it. I\'m not shure what it will cost to ship it back but 10 bucks should cover it.\r\n\r\n...and don\'t worry about luck, I\'ve gots skillz.  8-) \r\n\r\nSeriuosly though, haven\'t killed a car yet, and don\'t plan to either.\r\n\r\nSo what\'s it like living Barbados?\r\n\r\nDave'),(14171,'62907b92c1','I believe it. I definitely think that mosfets are the best speed mod out there, And then you throw more cells in?  crazy stuff.'),(37383,'f8a984ff6d','Hey cj, I was wondering on the status of the order.  I\'ve seen a few GPM parts on the forums and was wondering if you were starting to ship orders.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(37384,'c59c2a0e4c','[quote:c59c2a0e4c=\"chrome\"]Hey cj, I was wondering on the status of the order.  I\'ve seen a few GPM parts on the forums and was wondering if you were starting to ship orders.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...[/quote:c59c2a0e4c]\r\n\r\nJust got an email from GPM\r\n\r\n[quote:c59c2a0e4c]About the back orders of PO#11233220CJS, there are arms and dampers arrived for the EVO TRUCK and will continue to have more during this week and next week.  Therefore I suggest you to have one shippment at the end of this month for grouping another parcel to you.[/quote:c59c2a0e4c]\r\n\r\nI do have some of your parts.  I was waiting on the car orders for mainly knuckles to arrive before I send everyones out.  \r\n\r\nI have for you.\r\nDXME009T 1 white\r\nXME018A 1 Black\r\nXME028 1 Black\r\nXME030 1 Black\r\nXME039R 1 Black\r\nXME047 1 Black\r\nXME190R 2 Black\r\nXME303 1 Black\r\nXME331R 1 Black\r\n\r\nIf you want those I can send them to you now.  If you want to wait for the end of the month I should have more parts per GPM.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32412,'5ed4164b15','[quote:5ed4164b15=\"CaboWabo\"]I noticed a \"bounce back\" email today.\r\n\r\n[quote:5ed4164b15]Hello BilboBaggins,\r\n\r\nYour account on \"bitPimps.lixlink.com\" has been deactivated, most likely due to changes made to your profile. In order to reactivate your account you must click on the link below:\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/profile.php?mode=activate&amp;u=130&amp;act_key=0c2d31\r\n\r\n--\r\nThanks, bitPimps Custom Modifications Management Team[/quote:5ed4164b15]\r\nLooks like it couldn\'t be delivered due to Verizon.\r\nI re-activated your account. I\'m not sure if you want to be active or not, so let me know if not and I can de-activate you.\r\n\r\nTo ensure you get emails from bitPimps, you have options.\r\nYou can use a form found on this page to request to Verizon that they allow email from this domain to be delivered:\r\nPlease visit http://www.verizon.net/whitelist to request removal.\r\nOr you can use a different email address that accepts emails from this domain.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you need any help.[/quote:5ed4164b15]\r\n\r\nI just filled out the page to allow me email from bitpimps.lixlink.com is there anything else to give them? I\'ve never had a problem with changing my email account before, of course I haven\'t changed it in a few years.\r\n\r\nI get DSL to give me speed and they give me email problems  :grin: .'),(33215,'fce4cdb1dc','Hey Cameron,\r\n\r\nSorry, I\'ve been busy at work and I totally forgot to send the rims, man.  :? \r\n\r\nThey\'ll be in the mail tomorrow for sure.\r\n\r\n-DriveWRX');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33216,'1bcc15ecf2','Hey, no problem.  Thanks for sending them out man!  -Cameron'),(36914,'dbc45cb347','Aight man on the phone thing. Tomorrow night is better for me anyways.\r\n\r\nAs far as tech on my site. I can use mysql,perl,html/xml and php.'),(36915,'dbc45cb347','Aight man on the phone thing. Tomorrow night is better for me anyways.\r\n\r\nAs far as tech on my site. I can use mysql,perl,html/xml and php.'),(15407,'cbe80f3d22','[quote:cbe80f3d22=\"HirotoR34\"]I got the car today. I was kinda sad to see the clear on the rear fenders was messed up. I think the paper towels had something to do with it. (wetsand will take care of it. I can\'t \'t believe how friggin awesome the paint truly is! It looks even better in person. Thanks for the homie too. Sad boy ain\'t lonely anymore. I just pm\'ed SuperFly and let him know that the car isn\'t working at all. I\'m not sure what it is, but it won\'t steer or go fwd/reverse.[/quote:cbe80f3d22]what???\r\nplease tell me you\'re kidding me?\r\nI tested her before I put it in the box. :sad: \r\nThere\'s a battery in there and a motor...\r\nno batteries in the controller - dumb question I know but you put some new ones in right?\r\n\r\nand now the fenders? fuck!!!\r\nthat\'s gotta be from the paper towel - fuck!\r\nthat blows - how the fuck, it\'s been freezing, how the would that have gotten tacky enough to get paper? ahhh whatever\r\n\r\nman dude, this just sucks, I\'m really sorry dude - it sounds like you\'re getting ripped.\r\n\r\ndo me a favor, try some new batteries in the controller and make sure the motor and heat sink are positioned properly.\r\n\r\nkeep me posted man'),(14174,'db2928c50b','Yea I love my fetted cars \r\n\r\nThe duel cells are nice to but atleast with the fets you can use the same charger.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14175,'60a72dd57c','true dat.  Where do you get your fets from?'),(13072,'eba6cc124b','[quote:eba6cc124b=\"ph2t\"]get home, find a zzse in the mailbox, yeah!\r\n\r\nlogon, find the $10 from sess has cleared.  Didn\'t realise you were a paysluts premier member or I would of payed you sooner :)   You\'ve got cash.\r\n\r\nThen I open the packaging, we\'ll wifey and I play \"pass the parcel\" \'cause of all the bloody layers you put! lol, but it\'s good man, I\'d rather you do this than have the zz all busted up in the mail......\r\n\r\nNow I gots to find me 4 AAA batteries, woah, that was a curveball I didn\'t see....\r\n\r\nThanks again for your help!\r\n\r\nShamon,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:eba6cc124b]\r\n\r\n\r\nOh, excellent....  Great news....\r\n\r\nhave fun...enjoy... and keep us up-to-date.\r\n\r\n-nigel'),(34594,'acec11b388','LOL hey dude it\'s all fun and games. Just don\'t take the crap to heart and try to get back into everyones good graces and it will be ok. We just like to weed out the weak links here. The main thing here is about the hobby. It\'s not for beginners here but if you are just read the useful stuff and then try to be creative. Other wise you shouldn\'t post. After you have a little street cred the older members will lighten up and make you apart of the click. Thats all I can say man, just don\'t take it to heart and go around blasting them. sessiz is a moderator and has the ability to change posts. He isn\'t hacking anything. Just don\'t give him a reason to fuck with you.'),(13087,'9f3bb75729','I did manage to read your email, and send a reply (one way or another). I MUST BE IN EMAIL HELL!!!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14185,'27bc0760df','but theres alot more companies base in Canada that will ship to the US. I think its stoopid but especially since its \"technically\" the same company here and there. \r\n\r\nLike that BS I went through with wal-mart and Sams GC for me last year.'),(13203,'a6007083f4','[quote:a6007083f4=\"payaso\"]That sounds cool to me.  I took the SE to the tennis courts last night to see what it had in a big area.. I love it so much, that I\'m sending him 2 or 3 more..lol\r\n\r\nGive me a ring when you get some free time.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:a6007083f4]\r\n\r\nWow, that sounds like quite an improvement if you\'re sending him a few more to modify.  I think that stuff I ordered from Hong Kong will probably take another week or two to arrive.  If my girlfriend doesn\'t have to work tonight, I won\'t be watching her son, so I might have some free time.  I\'ll give you a ring when I get home from work.'),(13090,'4d52161eb8','wassup man,\r\nsorry it took a bit to get back atcha.....\r\n\r\nI\'m working 2 jobs now...usually 16-20 hours a day...so I haven\'t had any time to play. I\'m quitting the 2nd job soon.....and I\'m getting a 2 super BCGs soon....a Jota and a 512 BB...they should be in the mail by now....I\'ll have some bodies and parts to trade soon....I just have to get adjusted with this new work schedule....its driving me crazy :-D \r\n\r\nAre you looking for anything specific right now? I might be able to help....let me know ...and let me know if you\'ve got anything new too.... 8-) \r\n\r\nlater..........');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13091,'238b1f09bf','Well like always I dont need anything but always looking to see whats out there.  I just got some new Super bits in they are nice.\r\n\r\n  I should have some AE86 Pullbacks for trade soon and I have some clone stuff to get rid of to make new room.\r\n\r\n  I am always looking for epoch stuff, looking for xmods(Not in Canada yet), the zipzap wall kits well anything really lol.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Yea it sucks working 2 jobs I did it awhile back and got way to worn out.'),(13092,'814fa24023','Just to let you know that I will send out the mat car body on monday things got crazy around here and I totaly forgot to do it yesterday.\r\n\r\n Is there anything else you are looking for I can toss in the package?\r\n\r\n BTW if you do decide to have space for sale please let me know lol stupid me toook the t1 with no webspace to save some $$ thinking I wouldn;t need more the the 5mb\'s lol\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nPete'),(13093,'814fa24023','Just to let you know that I will send out the mat car body on monday things got crazy around here and I totaly forgot to do it yesterday.\r\n\r\n Is there anything else you are looking for I can toss in the package?\r\n\r\n BTW if you do decide to have space for sale please let me know lol stupid me toook the t1 with no webspace to save some $$ thinking I wouldn;t need more the the 5mb\'s lol\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13202,'4bb2033bce','[quote:4bb2033bce=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:4bb2033bce=\"VooDooMafia\"]I got the RX7 today thanks\r\n\r\nIt look way better in person now I just need to figure out what chassie I will put it on  :???: \r\n\r\n  Prolly better to just buy a new chassie to put it on.\r\n\r\n  Also thanks for the stickers :) you put those on before you clearcoat?  Keep an eye on some of the new work it will be sportin them fo sho .[/quote:4bb2033bce]cool man, glad it arrived safely.\r\n\r\nyea, that\'s one thing I\'ve come to realize, pictures just don\'t do the cars justice, like with your green flames - I know that thing has got to look hot.\r\n\r\nyea, put the decals on before clear coats.\r\n\r\nI\'m still waiting on the pullback, hopefully any day now, I\'ll let ya know when it comes in.[/quote:4bb2033bce]\r\n\r\n  Yea please let me know when you get it :)  also are they water slides?\r\n\r\n  I will take a pic of the RX7 with my other digi cam (canon powershot pro70) and see what kind of pics I can get of it and post them.\r\n\r\n  Yep now I got one of your paint jobs, CD\'s on the way now I need one from payaso  :???:'),(13095,'1a0baeb6a2','[quote:1a0baeb6a2=\"VooDooMafia\"]Just to let you know that I will send out the mat car body on monday things got crazy around here and I totaly forgot to do it yesterday.\r\n\r\n Is there anything else you are looking for I can toss in the package?\r\n\r\n BTW if you do decide to have space for sale please let me know lol stupid me toook the t1 with no webspace to save some $$ thinking I wouldn;t need more the the 5mb\'s lol\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:1a0baeb6a2]thats cool man.\r\nyea I was trying to think if there was anything else we might could trade before I sent it off, but nothing came to mind yet. I\'m sure it will once we\'ve both sent everything off so we\'d have to pay again lol\r\n\r\nyea I\'ve been looking into options on the webspace thing.\r\nI really don\'t want to become a host (another set of probs to deal with) so lately I\'ve been looking for \"packages\" people could get on their own that would allow them do whatever they want.\r\n\r\nI have one in mind that I believe to be a fuckin a great deal, but it might be more than what most are looking for.\r\nhttp://www.cqhost.com/cherokee.html');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13096,'137f4c09a4','Hey dude I just wanted to make a suggestion.\r\n\r\n That tuneup kit you listed is not that great.  I would say to get one of the tuneup kits that come with bodies (the 2f2f or initial D) as they have better motors in them :)'),(13201,'947eb40c35','[quote:947eb40c35=\"VooDooMafia\"]I got the RX7 today thanks\r\n\r\nIt look way better in person now I just need to figure out what chassie I will put it on  :???: \r\n\r\n  Prolly better to just buy a new chassie to put it on.\r\n\r\n  Also thanks for the stickers :) you put those on before you clearcoat?  Keep an eye on some of the new work it will be sportin them fo sho .[/quote:947eb40c35]cool man, glad it arrived safely.\r\n\r\nyea, that\'s one thing I\'ve come to realize, pictures just don\'t do the cars justice, like with your green flames - I know that thing has got to look hot.\r\n\r\nyea, put the decals on before clear coats.\r\n\r\nI\'m still waiting on the pullback, hopefully any day now, I\'ll let ya know when it comes in.'),(13099,'8c956cf589','I got the car in today bro. I haven\'t had a chance to play with it, the kid is still up, but I figured I\'ld let ya know it came in. :-) \r\nThanks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14233,'69234b3453','[quote:69234b3453=\"brendan123\"]Hey man,\r\n\r\ni was wondering if you could tell me what the bitPimps font is and were i can find it, if you cant tell me it\'s kool.\r\n\r\nMerry x mas[/quote:69234b3453]it\'s called Kilroy Was Here.\r\nI\'m not sure where you can find it, but it is out on the net somewhere, just google for it and you should find it.'),(14167,'08ee5e6bd3','Sure dude whatever you feel like sending is cool here.\r\n\r\n  I also have alloys just sittin here as they were a apin to mount.\r\n\r\n  I find the pullback tires alot easier to mount.'),(14168,'084e9fbd3a','haha exactly. pullacks rule.'),(14169,'084e9fbd3a','haha exactly. pullacks rule.'),(14170,'d382151671','[quote:d382151671=\"HirotoR34\"]I have practiced with old pcb\'s I had laying around. I need a new soldering iron , so I\'m not ready to do any of my working cars yet. I think the first will be the hotwheels car I did.[/quote:d382151671]\r\n\r\n  Tri Celled Mosfets I bet it will be fast.  I know my Duel Cell Mosfeted ZZ is to fast to controll on my hardwood floors I have to drive it on thin carpet or rubber mats'),(13103,'edcac9f537','hey man, thanks again for the offer.   I would like to get the  Initial D Street Tuner Upgrade Kit instead of the other upgrade kit I listed.  I\'ve been told that\'s the better upgrade kit anyways.....\r\n\r\nSo just to total the order, lol....\r\n\r\nDodge Challenger body and Chevrolet Yenko S/C Camaro Kitt -  60-7528 \r\nInitial D Street Tuner Upgrade Kit - 60-7532\r\nChevrolet® Camaro Past &amp; Present Body Kit - 60-7534\r\n\r\nSo if you could total that stuff up and add shipping to it I\'ll pay you via paypal is that OK?   I you want as a thanks for doing this, throw a zz/bitG chassis in with the pkg and I\'ll fet mod it for you and ship it back.\r\n\r\nIs your paypal a premier account?  ie, do you take payments from CC linked paypal accounts?  If you do add a couple of $$ to the total to cover the cut paypal takes.  If not, I\'ll work something out this side to get my account balance in the positive so I don\'t have any issues (like I did with EZ).\r\n\r\nThanks again Santa..\r\n\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13104,'748d3aac6d','Yeah man it worked well. I can\'t wait to try this puppy out. Pop her cherry and a wheelie or two. :-) \r\nThanks again man.'),(14164,'80cacaf77d','ya me to. im still trying to locate all the bit shit. but if ya want the alloys theys yours.'),(14165,'80cacaf77d','ya me to. im still trying to locate all the bit shit. but if ya want the alloys theys yours.'),(16877,'6d4b1a12c9','Hey Man, why are You locking all of the thread\'s that I start? I was just doing business ok. write back man.  :cool:'),(14180,'3f338695e4','[quote:3f338695e4=\"Stoli\"]aight cool man. I could do the best buy thing. Theres always movies you guys want but don;t wanna buy and aask for as gifts and shit[/quote:3f338695e4]totally, I garuntee you should won\'t be disappointed with best buy.\r\nshe buys DVDs and CDs from there.\r\nand I know there\'s a few CDs she wants.\r\nJust don\'t get her Default! lol\r\nalready got it! lol'),(14181,'b367806d9b','aight, well I have a bit of a prob. I tried to buy a GC on bestbuy.com but it won;t ship it to me cause I;m CA and it won;t ship it to your door because the visa addy and mailing don;t match.\r\n\r\n :mad:  :mad:  :finger:  :finger: \r\n\r\nGOD DAMN AMERICAN COMPANIES!\r\n\r\nanyways I;ll figure something out\\');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13108,'f833651a5f','[quote:f833651a5f=\"ph2t\"][quote:f833651a5f=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey dude I just wanted to make a suggestion.\r\n\r\n That tuneup kit you listed is not that great.  I would say to get one of the tuneup kits that come with bodies (the 2f2f or initial D) as they have better motors in them :)[/quote:f833651a5f]\r\n\r\nThanks Pete, I guess it\'s the initial D set instead then. :)\r\n\r\nOh and btw, I\'ve been sick this week, off and on work so I\'ve had trouble shipping stuff this week.  Your bodies n stuff will go out on Monday.  My apologies on this again man, kick my arse!\r\n\r\nMatt.\r\n\r\n\r\nCheers man.[/quote:f833651a5f]\r\n\r\n  Thats ok dude I have to go get new paint anyway :)  but since you say it has not been sent is there anything I could maybe trade you for a light set?  I think your super small light setup would work in my AE86 body.\r\n\r\n  Also since you now have your se I am hoping that you guys figure out the fet probs :)'),(14159,'59c2795071','thanks man, it\'s appreciated.....\r\n\r\nmatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14160,'c364e127c0','well i owe ya a buncha shit. i tell ya what. i have an unfinished job wehre i was gona put alloys on a zipzap but its never gona get done so you can have a buncha zz stuff and alloys instead of the thunder chargers if ya want.'),(19152,'274c39eac8','i dono dude. im sorry i was bored last week an i just quit smoking so i was a little umm assholish. ill stop. and ill apologize.'),(14162,'59c2795071','thanks man, it\'s appreciated.....\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(14163,'cd6ccc4969','Well whatever is easyer for you dude, I know you came into some shit and that and I am easy as fuck to work with so I will leave it upto you.\r\n\r\n  Sound cool with you?'),(13111,'fe820279da','Sounds real good man. I know that this microamps bloke is being a lil stingy on sharing the knowledge, but I have faith in you and or dave coming up with a solution to the se. I definatly want one or two of them fetted. :-)'),(13113,'9e0f998fe7','hey man, just a quick followup and how that chassis is.  Is it still OK?  \r\nAny issues I could possibly help with?\r\n\r\nCheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14158,'d45b591577','Yera no probs will send it here.\r\n\r\n  I just got all the shit with the new account set up and I requ $$ from my bank that they said will be in there by today.\r\n\r\n  I also have a package for you thats going out in tomorrows mail pick up for the wait.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Oh and I FUCKING HATE XMAS hehe'),(14155,'13aa72afa3','Yea I think I will take the epoch on the downhill first as I now have an extra chassie and body.\r\n\r\n  As for what else, well I am looking for the hubs, red &amp; green gear sets bodies almost anything now for the ZZ\'s.\r\n  Let me know what you have and what you want for them :)'),(14156,'c364e127c0','well i owe ya a buncha shit. i tell ya what. i have an unfinished job wehre i was gona put alloys on a zipzap but its never gona get done so you can have a buncha zz stuff and alloys instead of the thunder chargers if ya want.'),(14157,'cec9fdaa87','[quote:cec9fdaa87=\"payaso\"]Finally back on line...lol  I smoked the last machine..  How much do I owe you for the pullbacks? \r\n\r\nDo you prefer PayPal, or Money order?  Thanks man.\r\n\r\n\r\n Sorry for the delay.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:cec9fdaa87]\r\nSweet glad your back in action, when Scott told me about your situation I said \"damn he must be buggin\'\" lol\r\n\r\n$14 shipped Priority USPS, Paypal would be cool! id: blormore@mac.com\r\nI\'ll ship it out tomorrow morning, hit me back with your addy... I think I it got it somewhere, but just in case. \r\n\r\nDon\'t even sweat it bro, like I told Scott \"I ain\'t in a hurry and they ain\'t goin nowhere\".\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\nB'),(13117,'56b3d63068','No problem man.. I\'m going to the RS tomorrow, so I\'ll see what they got in stock for ya.\r\n\r\nHave you figured out how to FET the ZZ SEs?   Now that I have one of those, it\'s the \"real\" micro r/c of micro r/cs...lol\r\n\r\nAnd with that black Camaro body on it, I mean damn.....\r\n\r\nI\'ll let you know tomorrow dood.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13118,'7202aeee94','[quote:7202aeee94=\"payaso\"]No problem man.. I\'m going to the RS tomorrow, so I\'ll see what they got in stock for ya.\r\n\r\nHave you figured out how to FET the ZZ SEs?   Now that I have one of those, it\'s the \"real\" micro r/c of micro r/cs...lol\r\n\r\nAnd with that black Camaro body on it, I mean damn.....\r\n\r\nI\'ll let you know tomorrow dood.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:7202aeee94]\r\n\r\nThanks man.   nah I haven\'t figured it out yet.  Just had my SE for like 2 days dude.  yeah I know I\'m a fricken slacka but hey!   I\'ll get there!\r\n\r\nthanks for doing this mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(13119,'238b1f09bf','Well like always I dont need anything but always looking to see whats out there.  I just got some new Super bits in they are nice.\r\n\r\n  I should have some AE86 Pullbacks for trade soon and I have some clone stuff to get rid of to make new room.\r\n\r\n  I am always looking for epoch stuff, looking for xmods(Not in Canada yet), the zipzap wall kits well anything really lol.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Yea it sucks working 2 jobs I did it awhile back and got way to worn out.'),(14152,'6a0d04f689','aight cool man. I could do the best buy thing. Theres always movies you guys want but don;t wanna buy and aask for as gifts and shit');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14153,'d91ba13eff','watch the downhills. i sorta broke mine by driving too fast and taking tight turns. \r\n\r\nya i got a few heatsinks. what else ya want?'),(14338,'2be04f285b','ph2t, i believe that micromatch sent another 6 dollars. so i think now were both in right?'),(14339,'dbfd7400bb','tru dat'),(14151,'dd64a54371','[quote:dd64a54371=\"Stoli\"]Hey mang. Tried calling ya today but I guess you didn;t feel like chattin.\r\n\r\nAnyways whats Sam\'s Fave store/online store she frequents? I wanna get her gift cirtificates for Xmas[/quote:dd64a54371]I\'ve been on conference calls all day man, sorry...\r\n\r\numm... I dunno, gonna have to think about that.\r\nshe\'s got a subscription to best buy, usually for movies and shit, but I know she does shop at clothing stores online as well.\r\nsummertime, she checks out Venus swim-wear.\r\nlet me do a little spy work and I can probably get you a few more places she likes.'),(14128,'b29f48b16f','If you are mailing the $$ then send it to \r\n\r\nPeter Kostecki\r\n20 Water St.\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nCanada\r\nL2V 2K3\r\n\r\nThanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14129,'c4bf6110a4','No prob. $18 it is. I\'ll send it out today. Thanks Peter\r\n\r\n\r\nJustin'),(14130,'31bf8e804d','Finally back on line...lol  I smoked the last machine..  How much do I owe you for the pullbacks? \r\n\r\nDo you prefer PayPal, or Money order?  Thanks man.\r\n\r\n\r\n Sorry for the delay.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(13124,'059757d0e2','What style rims u lookin to get??'),(13125,'059757d0e2','What style rims u lookin to get??'),(35916,'f5c1d71d5b','[quote:f5c1d71d5b=\"CaboWabo\"]Don\'t forget, you have to pick a random winner for the [url=http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=6788]bitPimps 3rd Annual Years End Custom Blow-Out[/url].\r\n\r\nJust wanted to send a reminder.\r\nI don\'t know if you\'re waiting to see who we\'ve picked for the 3 places before you picks yours so there\'s no overlap or what.\r\nBut just wanted to give you a heads up.[/quote:f5c1d71d5b]\r\n\r\nThanks. :-o \r\n\r\nI\'m all over it.'),(13127,'5fffcec5e6','I\'m not really lookin for some right now, sorry');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13128,'cb49bb9b42','[quote:cb49bb9b42=\"ph2t\"]hey man, just a quick followup and how that chassis is.  Is it still OK?  \r\nAny issues I could possibly help with?\r\n\r\nCheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:cb49bb9b42]naw man, so far so good. I still have a slight issue with those wires like I was talking about before, but that\'s just because I just have tried to reposition them (I know that\'s all it needs, easy fix)\r\n\r\ngotta get a body made up for her still though, just been too busy lately.\r\nthanks for checkin though pimp!'),(13130,'3795c08265','ok the money is in US dollars and its coming to you.'),(13224,'4443df71c8','hey  did you get my email???????\r\n\r\nDoes this package come in regular mail???\r\nor Ups???\r\n\r\nalso email me when you get the letter'),(13132,'75bf6c6cd2','OK I will pack the motor up and have it ready to be shipped'),(13133,'3088171a3a','My address is\r\n\r\nJacques LeBlanc\r\n295 Linehouse Rd.\r\nNorth Grosvenordale, CT 06255\r\nUnited States\r\n\r\nthis address shoold be correct but just in case, check my address on the letter.\r\nThanks\r\nHow long does it take tis letter to reach you? How long until the package will reach me????'),(13134,'3088171a3a','My address is\r\n\r\nJacques LeBlanc\r\n295 Linehouse Rd.\r\nNorth Grosvenordale, CT 06255\r\nUnited States\r\n\r\nthis address shoold be correct but just in case, check my address on the letter.\r\nThanks\r\nHow long does it take tis letter to reach you? How long until the package will reach me????');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (15100,'9217f6fc19','[quote:9217f6fc19=\"micromatch\"]o yea an by the way. its both the controller and the car i am sending you :)[/quote:9217f6fc19]\r\n\r\nsweet mate, thanks!  I don\'t need a 150mah batt, I wass seeing if you wanted one :)\r\n\r\nalso, your chassis will be done by the weekend and will be sent out on monday 1/12/04\r\n\r\ncheers!\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(13136,'472bc287ce','hey man, here\'s the addy\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nBENTLEIGH EAST   VIC   3165\r\nAUSTRALIA\r\n\r\nCheers pete and thanks.\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(13138,'5864ec3fe4','Sup dude\r\n\r\n  Hey I know you are into some games workshop stuff and wondered if you ever use there mail order?\r\n\r\n  I only ask casue I was going through some stuff and came accross a bunch of the mail order skulz(used to redeam for goods and exclusive shit).  Anyway let m eknow if these are of any use to you.'),(13200,'bbc5bada43','That sounds cool to me.  I took the SE to the tennis courts last night to see what it had in a big area.. I love it so much, that I\'m sending him 2 or 3 more..lol\r\n\r\nGive me a ring when you get some free time.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(14127,'5fae32a483','I couldn\'t really find the right red, so one of the red\'s you had should be okay. Anything close to fire engine red.  Let me know if you have any problems.  Thanks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13142,'8f544c6fd3','Not sure what they are offering now for them as it always changes but they offer exclusive figures, paint all kinds of shit.  Check out there website :)'),(13143,'0bea174718','Congratulation Sinned, \r\n\r\nYour car has been selected as the BitPimps \"Ride Of Da Week\" \r\nIt is a beautiful job showing excellent craftmanship &amp; detail. \r\n\r\nAgain, Congratulations Sinned !'),(13144,'0bea174718','Congratulation Sinned, \r\n\r\nYour car has been selected as the BitPimps \"Ride Of Da Week\" \r\nIt is a beautiful job showing excellent craftmanship &amp; detail. \r\n\r\nAgain, Congratulations Sinned !'),(13145,'e14aeb07a8','i hear some things about jbweld with the axle, i don\'t understand what is going on with all this, i was wondering if you had a picture of what it looks like, that way i would know what your talking about, anyway, i have been reading this site for a while, but i haven\'t posted yet, and i would like to compliment on how kool you and some of the other people here are for sharing this info, whether or not you can get the picture, thanks'),(13146,'e14aeb07a8','i hear some things about jbweld with the axle, i don\'t understand what is going on with all this, i was wondering if you had a picture of what it looks like, that way i would know what your talking about, anyway, i have been reading this site for a while, but i haven\'t posted yet, and i would like to compliment on how kool you and some of the other people here are for sharing this info, whether or not you can get the picture, thanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13147,'f878a8155f','i dont have a good camera right now. but pretty much fill in the whole axle slot with epoxy so it totally seeps down around the axle. spin it in place while it dries. run it on the charger for a bit so it breaks in cuz you essentially cemented your axle into the chassis. the key is to keep everything where it should be so nothing ratttles when running. it will sound more like a machine.\r\n\r\nglad you like the site man. feel free to post some stuff.'),(13148,'2274e7b1d0','hi'),(13149,'2274e7b1d0','hi'),(13150,'aa8ce8ebd7','done already actually. i have to walk right past it in the morning. so wish me luck.'),(13151,'aa8ce8ebd7','done already actually. i have to walk right past it in the morning. so wish me luck.'),(13152,'404a89d56a','Well I can usually get a letter from the states in about 3-4 days and a small package like this going to the states will be about the same. \r\n\r\n  I will check the address on the latter aswell just to make sure.'),(14147,'d91ba13eff','watch the downhills. i sorta broke mine by driving too fast and taking tight turns. \r\n\r\nya i got a few heatsinks. what else ya want?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14148,'a1b72c78ee','Hey mang. Tried calling ya today but I guess you didn;t feel like chattin.\r\n\r\nAnyways whats Sam\'s Fave store/online store she frequents? I wanna get her gift cirtificates for Xmas'),(14184,'ae173b2474','[quote:ae173b2474=\"Stoli\"]aight, well I have a bit of a prob. I tried to buy a GC on bestbuy.com but it won;t ship it to me cause I;m CA and it won;t ship it to your door because the visa addy and mailing don;t match.\r\n\r\n :mad:  :mad:  :finger:  :finger: \r\n\r\nGOD DAMN AMERICAN COMPANIES!\r\n\r\nanyways I;ll figure something out\\[/quote:ae173b2474]welcome to our world dude.\r\nwe\'ve been going through that since the day she got down here.\r\nnothing from here works up there and vice versa.\r\nfucking bullshit, we\'re only right next door with all the exact same shit.'),(14088,'45228d9aa6','Well, I don\'t think I deserve to be off the watch list yet. As soon as I got off, things got out of hand. Can I be put back on until I\'ve TRULY earned it and not because you felt \"generous\"?'),(14082,'5265479f7b','not sure if I answered this but, \r\n\r\n  I have made a stand alone charger yes bith for single and duel cell cars.\r\n\r\n As for the 10 bucks for the car and 5 shipping well I paid alittle more then that for it.  Here is a list of stuff I am getting rid of. if there is a bunch of stuff then I can go down.  Paypal prefered but cash MO is ok.\r\n\r\nLMK\r\n\r\nUltraman MATT car new in box last one $13.00 + shipping \r\n\r\nTureno AE86 Pullback new in package $7.00 + shipping \r\n\r\nShells \r\n(all shells are $3.00 each or $6.00 with pullback chassie) \r\n\r\nBlue Beetle \r\nClear Celica \r\nRed Skyline R32 \r\nBlue Skyline R34 \r\nBlue Skyline \r\n\r\n60 mAH Cells $1.50 each \r\n\r\n\r\nMOTORS \r\n\r\nTomy 1.0 $1.50 each \r\nTomy 1.6 $2.00 each \r\nTomy 2.2 $2.50 each \r\nKitt Racer 2.6 (nice motors) $3.00 each \r\nPerfection 3.0 $3.00 each \r\n\r\nSuper Bit Speed set (3.0 motor, gold rims, suspention set) $13.00 \r\nTomy Color Tire set $6.00 \r\nTomy Skyline body set (1 black 1 clear) $7.00 \r\n\r\nSpring Suspention $3.00 \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAll those rpices do not include shipping. Let me know as I will be posting this list on the forum after you and a couple other people have a look at it first. \r\n\r\nThanks \r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14083,'f81b9033f4','not sure if I answered this but, \r\n\r\nI have made a stand alone charger yes bith for single and duel cell cars. \r\n\r\nAs for the 10 bucks for the car and 5 shipping well I paid alittle more then that for it. Here is a list of stuff I am getting rid of. if there is a bunch of stuff then I can go down. Paypal prefered but cash MO is ok. \r\n\r\nLMK \r\n\r\nUltraman MATT car new in box last one $13.00 + shipping \r\n\r\nTureno AE86 Pullback new in package $7.00 + shipping \r\n\r\nShells \r\n(all shells are $3.00 each or $6.00 with pullback chassie) \r\n\r\nBlue Beetle \r\nClear Celica \r\nRed Skyline R32 \r\nBlue Skyline R34 \r\nBlue Skyline \r\n\r\n60 mAH Cells $1.50 each \r\n\r\n\r\nMOTORS \r\n\r\nTomy 1.0 $1.50 each \r\nTomy 1.6 $2.00 each \r\nTomy 2.2 $2.50 each \r\nKitt Racer 2.6 (nice motors) $3.00 each \r\nPerfection 3.0 $3.00 each \r\n\r\nSuper Bit Speed set (3.0 motor, gold rims, suspention set) $13.00 \r\nTomy Color Tire set $6.00 \r\nTomy Skyline body set (1 black 1 clear) $7.00 \r\n\r\nSpring Suspention $3.00 \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAll those rpices do not include shipping. Let me know as I will be posting this list on the forum after you and a couple other people have a look at it first. \r\n\r\nThanks \r\n\r\nPete'),(14084,'efc2968fa9','still got that 49 mhz zz controller????');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14085,'efc2968fa9','still got that 49 mhz zz controller????'),(15231,'87cf459604','you still wANT THOSE lloys?'),(14087,'8ae60725ec','yea I do but it has no charge station or battery cover.'),(13158,'417765e66c','[quote:417765e66c=\"ph2t\"]dude, I think i\'ve got it!   you can use irlml6401 fets instead.  these are the p-chan mosfets from IR.   The germans used these fets in the \"dual cell mosfet mod\".   The difference is that you use the p-chan\'s for all 4 fets in the h-bridge.\r\n\r\nThe layout would be similar to this:\r\n\r\n[img:417765e66c]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/fet_h_bridge.jpg[/img:417765e66c]\r\n\r\nThis is for the traditional irlml2502, n-chan fets.   But using the numbers on the schematic: (for the p-chan 6401) from the datasheet:\r\nhttp://www.irf.com/product-info/datasheets/data/irlml6401.pdf\r\n\r\n1=Gate\r\n3=Source\r\n2=Drain\r\n\r\nYou would hook the +VE rail to the + terminal on the battery, the -VE rail to GND. The Fwd wire goes to the one motor terminal, the Rev wire goes to the other motor terminal, there\'s no moddding on board.\r\n\r\nMy testing has sofar shown that the fet turns on rather well.   There are possibilities for different versions, like 2 p-chan fets for switching and 4 n-chan irlml2502 fets for the h-bridge (the n-chan fest are still better than the p-chan when it comes to efficiency).\r\n\r\nIt\'s 12:30am here and I\'m on a roll, no bed just yet, will keep you updated....\r\n\r\nMatt[/quote:417765e66c]That\'s great news, I\'ll have to pick up some of those. I was needing to order more FETs anyways.\r\n\r\nWhen you say, \" 2 p-chan fets for switching and 4 n-chan irlml2502 fets for the h-bridge\", can you identify which ones are switching, and which ones are are the H-bridge for me? That may explain why I couldn\'t get my  flipped N-channel FETs to work in the place of the P-channel ones.\r\n\r\nAlso, thanks again, because you just helped me figure out my problem with these Micro Speed cars. \r\n\r\nWell, get back to work man, and don\'t worry about your job and family, they\'ll just get in the way. ;)\r\n\r\nSeriously, thanks for the the update, and I\'m anxious to hear how it works out for you.\r\n\r\nDave'),(13159,'444c6e0142','[quote:444c6e0142=\"crazydave\"][quote:444c6e0142=\"ph2t\"]dude, I think i\'ve got it!   you can use irlml6401 fets instead.  these are the p-chan mosfets from IR.   The germans used these fets in the \"dual cell mosfet mod\".   The difference is that you use the p-chan\'s for all 4 fets in the h-bridge.\r\n\r\nThe layout would be similar to this:\r\n\r\n[img:444c6e0142]http://www.prahranpianos.com/bit_g/fet_h_bridge.jpg[/img:444c6e0142]\r\n\r\nThis is for the traditional irlml2502, n-chan fets.   But using the numbers on the schematic: (for the p-chan 6401) from the datasheet:\r\nhttp://www.irf.com/product-info/datasheets/data/irlml6401.pdf\r\n\r\n1=Gate\r\n3=Source\r\n2=Drain\r\n\r\nYou would hook the +VE rail to the + terminal on the battery, the -VE rail to GND. The Fwd wire goes to the one motor terminal, the Rev wire goes to the other motor terminal, there\'s no moddding on board.\r\n\r\nMy testing has sofar shown that the fet turns on rather well.   There are possibilities for different versions, like 2 p-chan fets for switching and 4 n-chan irlml2502 fets for the h-bridge (the n-chan fest are still better than the p-chan when it comes to efficiency).\r\n\r\nIt\'s 12:30am here and I\'m on a roll, no bed just yet, will keep you updated....\r\n\r\nMatt[/quote:444c6e0142]That\'s great news, I\'ll have to pick up some of those. I was needing to order more FETs anyways.\r\n\r\nWhen you say, \" 2 p-chan fets for switching and 4 n-chan irlml2502 fets for the h-bridge\", can you identify which ones are switching, and which ones are are the H-bridge for me? That may explain why I couldn\'t get my  flipped N-channel FETs to work in the place of the P-channel ones.\r\n\r\nAlso, thanks again, because you just helped me figure out my problem with these Micro Speed cars. \r\n\r\nWell, get back to work man, and don\'t worry about your job and family, they\'ll just get in the way. ;)\r\n\r\nSeriously, thanks for the the update, and I\'m anxious to hear how it works out for you.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:444c6e0142]\r\n\r\nhey mate, when I\'m talking about 2 p-chan and 4 n-chan fets I\'m talking a whole new circuit.   You don\'t touch the incumbent transisitors on the pcb at all.   The 2 pchans will be used to connect the the original F/R motor points and from there connect into the 4 nchan fet hbridge.   I use the two pchans to get the high voltages needed to turn on the fets.\r\n\r\nWhat I have done tonight is basically use 4 p-chan fets in a quick rig.   The circuit works! and I now read of 2V potential across the motor vs. 1V before, that means the motor can go faster now, hopefully.   The torque is increased but the top speed isn\'t major at the moment.   i suspect I\'m not getting a high enough Gate voltage to turn on the pchan fets.  more work to do....I\'m getting 2.4V across them but they\'d do better with 3V which I belive I can tap from the DCDC convertor.  \r\n\r\nI\'m gonna crash now and continue on in the morning. :-( \r\n\r\ncheers,\r\nmatt\r\n\r\n\r\nI');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13160,'f878a8155f','i dont have a good camera right now. but pretty much fill in the whole axle slot with epoxy so it totally seeps down around the axle. spin it in place while it dries. run it on the charger for a bit so it breaks in cuz you essentially cemented your axle into the chassis. the key is to keep everything where it should be so nothing ratttles when running. it will sound more like a machine.\r\n\r\nglad you like the site man. feel free to post some stuff.'),(13162,'71f673502c','got my sons ZZ today, thanks for the work bro.'),(14074,'ffa797335e','Sorry, Not Interrested !'),(14095,'45228d9aa6','Well, I don\'t think I deserve to be off the watch list yet. As soon as I got off, things got out of hand. Can I be put back on until I\'ve TRULY earned it and not because you felt \"generous\"?'),(14096,'f2ab808db4','would u be intrested in a xmod with 4 wheel drive kit  extra foam tire upgrade ,, black honda civic  in trade for custom bits ,,,,'),(14097,'c3cf0eeac0','[quote:c3cf0eeac0=\"joez2872\"]would u be intrested in a xmod with 4 wheel drive kit  extra foam tire upgrade ,, black honda civic  in trade for custom bits ,,,,[/quote:c3cf0eeac0]no sorry I\'m not.\r\nhaven\'t gotten bitten by the x-mod bug  :grin:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14098,'c3cf0eeac0','[quote:c3cf0eeac0=\"joez2872\"]would u be intrested in a xmod with 4 wheel drive kit  extra foam tire upgrade ,, black honda civic  in trade for custom bits ,,,,[/quote:c3cf0eeac0]no sorry I\'m not.\r\nhaven\'t gotten bitten by the x-mod bug  :grin:'),(14099,'2a97de2be7','sup pimp\r\npayaso\'s computer is down right now and has been for the past several days.\r\npayaso still loves you though, he said he\'ll just send the love letters through regular mail.\r\n\r\naight he didn\'t say it quite like that. lol\r\n\r\npayaso wants to know if you can just send them out to him and he\'ll just send off the cash in money order, of if you want to wait till he gets back online (a day or 2) he can paypal it to you.\r\n\r\nI guess let me know and I\'ll pass it along to him.\r\n\r\ntalk to ya later\r\nScott'),(14077,'6a8766eff0','Got the epoch looks and runs great :)\r\n\r\n  Now to find a site that sells the crystals and takes paypal lol.\r\n\r\nThanks let me know if you get any other epoch or alike stuff.'),(14078,'f3a37b749d','Great, glad to here she got there safe and sound!\r\n\r\nI\'ll keep you in mind if I run into any deals :) \r\n\r\n-Ben');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14079,'f3a37b749d','Great, glad to here she got there safe and sound!\r\n\r\nI\'ll keep you in mind if I run into any deals :) \r\n\r\n-Ben'),(14080,'ffa797335e','Sorry, Not Interrested !'),(15411,'491c638e04','[quote:491c638e04=\"HirotoR34\"]No I\'m not angry at all. I know how things can go wrong at the weirdest times. I\'m just happy that I got it. I love the car, and the controller. I\'ll just play around with it and see if I can get it working.\r\nNo worries chief. It\'s all good. :D[/quote:491c638e04]yea I figured you wouldn\'t be upset, but I am - that thing was rockin - it just sucks, you deserve a real - good - working car.\r\n\r\nplease keep me posted anyways, I\'ll try to help however I can.'),(14090,'f2ab808db4','would u be intrested in a xmod with 4 wheel drive kit  extra foam tire upgrade ,, black honda civic  in trade for custom bits ,,,,'),(14091,'0a8fb0aa20','hey man, thanks man for this, when i get something to trade ill let you no first\r\n\r\nmy detials\r\n\r\nBrendan Tapp\r\n\r\n1 gaffel street\r\n\r\nBundaberg, Australia\r\n\r\n4670\r\n\r\ni think that is right, thanks again man.'),(14093,'5d79edc14d','Don\'t worry about it... I have about 40 or so bodies, so one less won\'t make me lose sleep. Merry Christmas!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13270,'0e20ef36a9','Hi again Cabo,\r\n\r\n I was wondering if you could send a test email (from bitpimps) to see if it is working. Seems my ISP\'s new spam filtering set up may be blocking any email that it can\'t confirm the sender of. If it is not too much trouble, I would appreciate it. Here is the address I am trying to check:\r\n\r\nbdebde@gte.net\r\n\r\nIf you send a copy to my hotmail account, I can verify that I got it. Hotmail address is:\r\n\r\nbdebde@hotmail.com\r\n\r\nThank you so very much (crosses fingers).'),(13166,'695f710a31','Hey, got your car today. That was pretty quick.\r\n\r\nHonestly, I doubt i\'ll get to it today, because I was on the way home with my new Xmod when I checked the mail. So I\'m expecting to busy with my new toy tonight.  :-D \r\n\r\nI\'ll get it done, and shipped out in the next couple days. I\'ll let you know when it\'s in the mail so you can be expecting it.\r\n\r\nHey, you want the anti-boost mod done to your controller? It reverses the function of the button so your boost is always on, and you press the button to slow down. I prefer it that way, you might not, so think about it, and let me know.\r\n\r\ndave'),(13167,'738ec2cda7','No thanx,\r\n\r\nI used your tutourial and did one myself . I plan to keep that controller stock. I did it to the controller i race with. That mod is MAD. I drive so much faster bcuz of it  :grin: . \r\n\r\nI am glad it got there in one piece.\r\nI really want to see how a mosfetted car runs.\r\nIf i win the competition, i\'ll transfer the PCB into the dual celled prize.\r\n\r\nI cant wait to drive my Xmod, but my cuz has it in the states and is waiting for someone to send it by. AWD white supra. gunna paint it like my supra contest entry.\r\n\r\nThanx again \r\n\r\n-----&gt; :shock: this is me till my car comes home');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13265,'631e5afc4c','No problem man... That G-sled looks great. I\'ll see what I can crank out this weekend.\r\n\r\nHit me up on ICQ.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13266,'9acee26bc8','thanx for the motor   :grin: ,\r\n\r\nI got that motor with the prize for the last commpetition, I never used it. So no biggie. I can\'t wait for it to return. \r\n\r\nMy address:\r\n\r\nRasheed Sabir\r\nBannister Land,\r\nMartindales Road,\r\nSt. Michael,\r\nBarbados , W.I.'),(13169,'f275a2ee26','Cabo, \r\n\r\n             \r\n       This is about HogJowlz. I talked to Payaso the other day on the phone, and we talked about many things. We all feel that hes getting mad at MicroMatch, for no apparent reason. Thanks for locking that thread about getting foot stuck up butt. We appreciate all the help you could give. As I have stated above, micro and I are very good friends in the real world. We both are changing, and trying to become good people. I feel, as most does MicroMatch, that Hog is going a bit too far, and scaring people off the forum. This is not only about Micro Match, but also about me, because it concerns my friend, and mostly my friend and I\'s life. Thanks for all the help you can give us. All Appreciation appreciated. Thank You for your time. \r\n\r\n                                                 Sincerely with Care and Concern,\r\n  \r\n                                           Pimpike, Michael C.; MicroMatch, Kent K.'),(14789,'4b192822f9','[quote:4b192822f9=\"ChopShop\"]i I am a noob to the forus adn was wondering how like you make your antenna different colors other than gray and when your painting a c,ear body do u prime and paint on the outside or inside. thnx ffor all your help[/quote:4b192822f9]gotta get new wires for the antenna and replace the old one with your new one.\r\n\r\nI primer all my bodies, clear or not.\r\nand paint from the outside so you can get all the details.\r\nif you paint from the inside, you\'ll have clear pieces like the side-view mirrors because those are just a hunk of plastic and you can\'t paint them from the inside.\r\n\r\nthere\'s a bunch of articles in the forums and in our articles section on painting, go read through them, there are plenty of tips there');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36786,'934a88569e','[quote:934a88569e=\"steelwoolghandi\"]is this a program? it sounds cool can I get  a link to it? \r\n\r\nthanks man! \r\n\r\nAaron[/quote:934a88569e]\r\n\r\nHere\'s the link to their Product page, it\'s software for the PocketPC:\r\nhttp://www.webis.net/products_info.php?p_id=pi&amp;dir=wm\r\n\r\nHere\'s the direct link to get this free:\r\n[url=http://www.handango.com/basket.jsp?siteId=1&amp;pc=list%5B3%5D_cartbutton&amp;jid=C56D894999E1EF1C46A46X5FXDF87C95&amp;prize=**36E662AD528863171AB1E0562A1170F6&amp;addItem=10226]Pocket Informant[/url]'),(31941,'a3125bf1f7','Is that you on Micro RC CENTAR posting those pics of me?\r\n\r\nNakkah?\r\n\r\nIf so stop it now.\r\n\r\nAll the pics link to your photobucket account.'),(31942,'a33fc9d8f6','[quote:a33fc9d8f6=\"blindrider3\"]Is that you on Micro RC CENTAR posting those pics of me?\r\n\r\nNakkah?\r\n\r\nIf so stop it now.\r\n\r\nAll the pics link to your photobucket account.[/quote:a33fc9d8f6]\r\n\r\nwow, man. I got your PM here about an hour ago. \r\nI did some research and went to that Micro RC Centar forum.\r\nWhoa, that\'s some weird shiat!!!!\r\n\r\nBut dude, seriously, I have nothing against you at all, and you have to believe it wasn\'t me. I don\'t have a \"photobucket\" account anymore as of 11/2 weeks ago. If it says motorgong or something, I bet someone is f**king with not only you, but me!!\r\n\r\nI\'m going to go look some more. It ticks me off! \r\nFeel free to PM me if ya find anything else.\r\n\r\nCan there be 2 motorgongs on photobucket? idk, I\'ll check.....'),(19156,'c5d601f82c','i see, i\'ve done quite a number of cars already, check out the galleries some of my cars are there. 8)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19157,'1a0911f983','really like wot u did wit d green beetle n d datsun...how old r u by the way?'),(19158,'cab6f2d8b8','i dono how i got passed the filter. honestly i dont remember maybe a$$? haha my bad dude.\r\n\r\nwell its been like 16 days without a square. im over the hump but i get twitchy when im bored. my bad man you can come over to bitpimps and raise a ruckus anytime.'),(27845,'92767dea07','[quote:92767dea07=\"micro_man\"]i jsut traded hiroto34 a bit shell for some . i wish i new you had some otherwise id have had you throw them in with the motors ... next time im looking for some ( geting another xmod next month  ) i\'ll pm you . \r\n\r\nps: the stage 2 kicks major ass ![/quote:92767dea07]\r\n\r\nAnything you need for an Xmod.  I\'ll hook you up with either real cheap or a trade.\r\n\r\n :-)'),(13269,'0e20ef36a9','Hi again Cabo,\r\n\r\n I was wondering if you could send a test email (from bitpimps) to see if it is working. Seems my ISP\'s new spam filtering set up may be blocking any email that it can\'t confirm the sender of. If it is not too much trouble, I would appreciate it. Here is the address I am trying to check:\r\n\r\nbdebde@gte.net\r\n\r\nIf you send a copy to my hotmail account, I can verify that I got it. Hotmail address is:\r\n\r\nbdebde@hotmail.com\r\n\r\nThank you so very much (crosses fingers).'),(13174,'5683870d61','Hey dude whast going on?\r\n\r\n\r\n  I was going through my stuff and have some more cars I would like to get fetted if you are upto it.  This is what I have\r\n\r\n2 tomy chassies\r\n2 LXX chassies (2 speed)\r\nand 1 TC chassie.\r\n\r\n  I also have a set of alloys that needed to be mounted lol.\r\n\r\n  Well if you are upfro it just give me a price and we can do some biz :)\r\n\r\nHope all is well\r\n\r\nPete\r\n\r\n\r\nPS.  I might have more chassies later on but I figured I would keep some unfetted for those darn tech tracks lol.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13431,'f0a1a74e1c','[quote:f0a1a74e1c=\"VooDooMafia\"]NO NO\r\nIf its a customs bill its for the large packages that come in.\r\n\r\n Customs has my address flagged I think for large packages (anything over 5 lbs) I get dinged on these handleing fees and province taxes.\r\n\r\n  I guess they need to make there cash somewhere[/quote:f0a1a74e1c]whew, glad its not me! lol\r\nI got worried because I know sometimes packages sit in customs for whatever whim they think up.'),(13432,'f0a1a74e1c','[quote:f0a1a74e1c=\"VooDooMafia\"]NO NO\r\nIf its a customs bill its for the large packages that come in.\r\n\r\n Customs has my address flagged I think for large packages (anything over 5 lbs) I get dinged on these handleing fees and province taxes.\r\n\r\n  I guess they need to make there cash somewhere[/quote:f0a1a74e1c]whew, glad its not me! lol\r\nI got worried because I know sometimes packages sit in customs for whatever whim they think up.'),(13433,'63ca115da7','Usually it shit from stores that I get dinged cause they mark them as merchandise.\r\n\r\n  Things from hong kong get here fast and never get dinged no matter how big.\r\n\r\n  I hope I dont get dinged on the enzo bits when they come in lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13434,'63ca115da7','Usually it shit from stores that I get dinged cause they mark them as merchandise.\r\n\r\n  Things from hong kong get here fast and never get dinged no matter how big.\r\n\r\n  I hope I dont get dinged on the enzo bits when they come in lol'),(13435,'b4eac3c860','hey,\r\n\r\n You still selling transisters?'),(13436,'a38b1648d3','Hey I was wondering do you still haave any of the MS fetted cars?  if so what you asking for them cash/trade whatever :)\r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know thanks.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\npete'),(14075,'6a8766eff0','Got the epoch looks and runs great :)\r\n\r\n  Now to find a site that sells the crystals and takes paypal lol.\r\n\r\nThanks let me know if you get any other epoch or alike stuff.'),(14073,'50e4f68324','sorry if iam bothering u  but would u be intrested in a xmod 4 wheel drive honda for one of your customs ,,,   ,, joe.......'),(13177,'506dcd2dd3','[quote:506dcd2dd3=\"PimpIke\"]Cabo, \r\n\r\n             \r\n       This is about HogJowlz. I talked to Payaso the other day on the phone, and we talked about many things. We all feel that hes getting mad at MicroMatch, for no apparent reason. Thanks for locking that thread about getting foot stuck up butt. We appreciate all the help you could give. As I have stated above, micro and I are very good friends in the real world. We both are changing, and trying to become good people. I feel, as most does MicroMatch, that Hog is going a bit too far, and scaring people off the forum. This is not only about Micro Match, but also about me, because it concerns my friend, and mostly my friend and I\'s life. Thanks for all the help you can give us. All Appreciation appreciated. Thank You for your time. \r\n\r\n                                                 Sincerely with Care and Concern,\r\n  \r\n                                           Pimpike, Michael C.; MicroMatch, Kent K.[/quote:506dcd2dd3]thanks for letting me know.\r\nwe know there\'s been some feathers ruffled.\r\nsometimes mistakes happen, we\'re all guilty of making them at one point and time.\r\nI wouldn\'t sweat anything, things tend to naturally calm down on their own, as I\'m sure this will too.\r\ngoing through the ups and downs is all part of evolving, hopefully to something better.\r\nas I mentioned before, I wouldn\'t sweat anything and we\'ll try to take care of business on our end where we need to.\r\n\r\nC-dub'),(13178,'e49b333dac','Thanks a bunch! I just wanted to make sure you saw it. I know that this forum is in the best hands of all the moderators and you, c-dub. Thanks! -Mike, Pimpike; Kent, MicroMatch');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13179,'85c2c6ec77','[quote:85c2c6ec77=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey dude whast going on?\r\n\r\n\r\n  I was going through my stuff and have some more cars I would like to get fetted if you are upto it.  This is what I have\r\n\r\n2 tomy chassies\r\n2 LXX chassies (2 speed)\r\nand 1 TC chassie.\r\n\r\n  I also have a set of alloys that needed to be mounted lol.\r\n\r\n  Well if you are upfro it just give me a price and we can do some biz :)\r\n\r\nHope all is well\r\n\r\nPete\r\n\r\n\r\nPS.  I might have more chassies later on but I figured I would keep some unfetted for those darn tech tracks lol.[/quote:85c2c6ec77]Hey what\'s up?\r\n\r\nAll is well, we\'ll barely get by on minimum wage, so worst cause we\'re get by.\r\n\r\nGot my Xmod today. These things are da bomb yo! They remind me of a little Tamiya car. I could see afatermarket hop ups for these to lighten them up. Gots lots of little goodies in the box. It\'s complete package for 50 buck. Then there\'s all the cool stuff to buy. This is gonna be fun.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ve almost completed my car to sell on ebay. I\'m gonna have trouble parting with it, it\'s came out great. Stretched a Micro Speed chassis, and the PCB cover, painted those charcoal, painted the rims, and  a Dodge Challenger body. Mosfet modded it, and all I have left to do is stick the dual cells in it.\r\n\r\nCheck it out.\r\n[img:85c2c6ec77]http://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/ebay.jpg[/img:85c2c6ec77]\r\n\r\n12 dolla investment, 2 days work...and it screams...handles pretty good too. :grin: \r\n\r\nI\'m curious what it\'s gonna go for. I\'m gonna do a 10 dollar, no reserve, no buy it now, just to see what it gets to.\r\n\r\nAs for your mods you want done, we\'ll stick to the same rate, I was calling it the \"pimp rate\", but since you having so many done now, we\'ll call it \"Bulk rate\". Anyways, that\'s 5 cars at 8 bucks, equals 40 bucks. I\'m not sure what to charge to mount wheels. You could just throw me a pullback or something to cover that. \r\n\r\nSound cool?\r\n\r\nDave'),(14787,'fa804294d2','i I am a noob to the forus adn was wondering how like you make your antenna different colors other than gray and when your painting a c,ear body do u prime and paint on the outside or inside. thnx ffor all your help');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19153,'5f977a2962','[quote:5f977a2962=\"hogjowlz\"]i dono dude. im sorry i was bored last week an i just quit smoking so i was a little umm assholish. ill stop. and ill apologize.[/quote:5f977a2962]\r\n\r\nAhhh, trying to quit aye? Good luck with that man, I\'m sure it ain\'t easy. I went ahead and just deleted the thread entirely.\r\n\r\nLet\'s pretend it never happened...[b:5f977a2962]IF[/b:5f977a2962] you tell me how you were able to get passed the language filters and get \'asshole\' to come up?  :???:'),(13260,'1c29c10525','I\'m interested for sure..  Let me know when you get em in.... \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13261,'5e6788a754','If you do, I\'d like to get a Dodge SRT 4 body made.  I\'m not sure what your prices are, so just let me know.  I can supply pictures if you need them.  The second picture is the Super Street Concept.  Either will do.  Thanks for any help you can offer.\r\n\r\nhttp://import.h8rs.com/Grunge/srt4.jpg\r\nhttp://www.dtmpower.net/ppost2/data/500/857srt4big_poster_flat.jpg'),(13262,'71ccd435a9','LOL.... I\'m clean out of underwear...  Guess I\'ll be going comando.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13263,'73e3cd11dd','Tis all good...\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13264,'00ffaba6d3','Just thought you would like to know that. :-) \r\n\r\nThe motor that was in it when I got it was DOA. I stuck one of my motors in it, and it worked fine. You got another motor to stick in there? If not, I got an extra 2.2, if you want me to throw that your way.\r\n\r\nSo it\'s all done up, and kicking boodie. I just need to cover it with epoxy, to make sure it stays working, and then let that dry for 24 hours. I\'ll get it back out to you in the next couple days.\r\n\r\nWhat was your address again? I lost the envelope the car came in.\r\n\r\ndave'),(13181,'d9e459afef','Yea I hear yea on the minimum wage job thing. Before I worked for COX I had a job with price club(costco) and they paid me $15.00 per hour but they would only give me 10-12 hours a week the fuckers so I got a job that paid alittle more then minium wage and thats shits hard with kids.\r\n\r\n  I to am curious as to what the car on ebay will go for but I bet it will go good.  Man you might have to give me the link so I can bid on it lol.  I still say you shoul dtry some of your stuff on bitpimps and ausmicro as they will pay for top quality work.\r\n\r\n  I also have another se hre but will wait till ph2t has cracked that hole up.\r\n\r\n  Yea I wanna get an xmod so bad just gotta get some chickin in paypal as I have spend way to much ebay moron money with toyeast, bithed and some other dude in japan.\r\n\r\n  Yea I can toss you some pullbacks for the alloys mount and some cash its all good.  They have been sitting here for ever and never get anything done with them as I could not get the holes strait after filling them. So now they look the way they came lol.\r\n\r\n  OK give me a few days and I will paypal some cash to you, just send me paypal info to confirm the e-mail address.  Not sure whn I will get them in the mail but atleast this way you have the cash already.\r\n\r\n  Man I can\'t wait to get an xmod lol have you run a mini z? if so how do they compair? Man I also want more epochs lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete'),(13182,'182260c9cb','[quote:182260c9cb=\"Maxximum Attack\"]-----&gt; :shock: this is me till my car comes home[/quote:182260c9cb]-----&gt;  :cool: You in a week or two.  :lol: \r\n\r\nTo try to give you an idea of what mosfets do. They allow more current to get to the motor, which means a slight increase in speed, but mostly just tons of torque. Enough torque that it will pull wheelies on high traction surfaces. What that mean to you is you can run your fastest gear ratio, with your fastest motor and still get instant excelleration.\r\n\r\nYou wont be disappointed.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13183,'fcbe935cc2','Cool,\r\n\r\nI just can\'t wait  :eek:'),(14788,'4b192822f9','[quote:4b192822f9=\"ChopShop\"]i I am a noob to the forus adn was wondering how like you make your antenna different colors other than gray and when your painting a c,ear body do u prime and paint on the outside or inside. thnx ffor all your help[/quote:4b192822f9]gotta get new wires for the antenna and replace the old one with your new one.\r\n\r\nI primer all my bodies, clear or not.\r\nand paint from the outside so you can get all the details.\r\nif you paint from the inside, you\'ll have clear pieces like the side-view mirrors because those are just a hunk of plastic and you can\'t paint them from the inside.\r\n\r\nthere\'s a bunch of articles in the forums and in our articles section on painting, go read through them, there are plenty of tips there'),(13186,'619504f547','Hey dude whats up\r\n\r\nJust getting a update on the mat, have they been produced yet?\r\n\r\n  Your contest over for these mats?\r\n\r\n  What do you think the shipping will be to Canada on one of these.\r\n\r\n  Thanks dude'),(13427,'5b997ebb4f','Thanx Pimp!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13428,'9d497af567','[quote:9d497af567=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:9d497af567=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:9d497af567=\"VooDooMafia\"]Glad they got there ok. \r\n\r\n  Yea those are from the other homie sets(knock off I think)\r\n\r\n  I like to toss something in with the packages to make me feel like the post office didn\'t screw me with there prices(not as cheap as it is for you guys).  But its all a write off anyway.\r\n\r\n  Sometimes I send shit that I get in the mail so you Yanks can see the crap we get.  I sent sessiz a \"Stop Wetting the Bed\" flyer I got in the mail with his package.  Like common if I wetted the bed would I really order that shit with my real name  :???:[/quote:9d497af567]lol thats funny.\r\nwell cool man, thanks for the extras\r\n\r\nI\'ll let ya know when the other body arrives.\r\ndid you get that ae86 body I sent yet?[/quote:9d497af567]\r\n\r\n\r\n  LOL yea I looked after I PMed you and it was in along with some forms from the post office (could be good i guess but proly customs bills lol)[/quote:9d497af567]not on the shit I\'m sending you is it?'),(13429,'c333e91c1d','NO NO\r\nIf its a customs bill its for the large packages that come in.\r\n\r\n Customs has my address flagged I think for large packages (anything over 5 lbs) I get dinged on these handleing fees and province taxes.\r\n\r\n  I guess they need to make there cash somewhere');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13430,'c333e91c1d','NO NO\r\nIf its a customs bill its for the large packages that come in.\r\n\r\n Customs has my address flagged I think for large packages (anything over 5 lbs) I get dinged on these handleing fees and province taxes.\r\n\r\n  I guess they need to make there cash somewhere'),(13188,'bd6cd402eb','I received the shipment yesterday.  The 3.8 motors seems pretty quick.  When I get home tonight, I\'m going to hook up some dual cells and see how that goes.  I\'ve been working on the track a little bit.  Maybe we can set something up for the end of the week.  I want to check out that fetted SE that you have.'),(13189,'f7ea51f57e','Here\'s where we\'re standing on the SE FET mods:\r\n\r\nPh2t has a partial solution, but he\'s looking to further improve upon that. Only problem is his plan involves etching a second PCB, and building a whole separate circuit to piggy back on the SE circuit, and switch on the the FETs.\r\n\r\nThat building a whole second circuit thing seems like the wrong way to go about it to me, esprcially when micro_amps has figured a way to do it with the current circuit. So I\'m going to order some P-channel FETs, try his partial solution, because that\'s hitting the motor with 2.6v, and increasing torque. We\'ll try that out, and you can decide if you want any more cars done like that. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ve never tried the Epoch, or Mini-Z, but I have had 1/10th scale Kyosho cars. The build quality of these seems to be as good as a Kyosho car, with the exception of a hard plastic body, instead of poly-carbonate. Heck the plastic is probably some brittle stuff, as opposed to ABS, but the design is there, which is why I could see aftermarket companies producing graphite pieces for these. They are a bit heavy for their size. \r\n\r\nThe controller feels a bit flimsy, and I understand it\'s only 15 steps proportional, as opposed to 150 steps, but honestly with my all or nothing driving style, I don\'t think I\'ll notice the difference in how proportional it is, and considering it was only 50 bucks for a complete package, I\'m willing to overlook the controller\'s sloppy feel.\r\n\r\nI would rather an Epoch, but I just don\'t have the money for that stuff right now.\r\n\r\nDave'),(13190,'619504f547','Hey dude whats up\r\n\r\nJust getting a update on the mat, have they been produced yet?\r\n\r\n  Your contest over for these mats?\r\n\r\n  What do you think the shipping will be to Canada on one of these.\r\n\r\n  Thanks dude');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13249,'c0bd8c38e5','Sorry things didn\'t work out for you Todd, I know you mentioned you had\r\nother endevors so good luck with them.  Your whole sale biz is suppose to start 11-Nov-03, Is there anyway I can purchase some motors from you before this takes place?\r\n\r\nLemme know!\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!'),(13250,'c9aa6ba526','Yes we have a ramadan in here but i am a diabetic.\r\n\r\nThanks for your helps.'),(13251,'c9aa6ba526','Yes we have a ramadan in here but i am a diabetic.\r\n\r\nThanks for your helps.'),(13252,'ba6d6d43ed','They are all Bit Char G\'s, no clones.  I think I got a really good price on them, but I might have 1 or 2 extras if you\'re interested.  I already have a yellow skyline and a red RX-7.  I only paid $14 shipped for each.  I\'ll fill you in more when they finally arrive.'),(13253,'1c29c10525','I\'m interested for sure..  Let me know when you get em in.... \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13254,'bf75215c13','ok dude go get some clean underwear cuz i actually remembered to bring it today. had some issues so i iddnt make it into work yesterday but yes i am here and it is sitting on my desk. i should be able to ship it out at lunch.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13255,'71ccd435a9','LOL.... I\'m clean out of underwear...  Guess I\'ll be going comando.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13256,'f1f10140a4','ok the lady at the post office took it away so she said 4days delivery??\r\n\r\nhaha sorry i took so long dude.'),(13257,'73e3cd11dd','Tis all good...\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13193,'1278331cfc','Trouble in china with production. Still aiming to get some landed before christmas.\r\n\r\nComp still open until first batch produced (probably another 3-4 weeks now).\r\n\r\nStill dont know final price or weight, so cant give price to canada yet.\r\n\r\nSoon as I know i\'ll let the dudes know.\r\n\r\nCheers'),(13194,'def41e0663','Well I have to agree on the whole \"second pbc\" thing, if micro has a way of doing it without one then there has to be another solution.  \r\n\r\n  Not sure if you have tried looking at the german sites but I will search around today see if I can find anything.  As for the other fets you are going to order, are tehy different then the normal ones that are being used?  If so maybe the solution is just that and thats why micro has not said anything but who knows.\r\n\r\n  With the first fets that you tried on teh SE was it just the torque it was lacking but still had the top speed of a normal fetted car?\r\n\r\n  well I will also continue to ask micro amps questions and try and get something out of him, has not worked yet but lets see.\r\n\r\n  As for the xmod/mini z/epoch deal I know the xmod has 16 steps but that would be fine with me.   The epoch has 512 steps and I use about 4 of them lol.  I am working on a deal with a guy in hong kong to have some epochs sent over and if it works out they will be cheap and I am sure we can trade for something.  I was lucky and got mine from ebay for $50 shipped.  I never use my mini z though it is packed away but one I get an xmod I will use it for sure.\r\n\r\n  I never got into 1/10 cars only cause the price and every time I saw a good deal it was without the TX and servos and shit.  Maybe one day I will just get a used one but untill then I am more then happy with the micros and epoch.  I will say my fav car right now is my AE86 Digi Q R, I am very happy with how these handle (better then normal digi q) and there speed is nice for such a small thing.\r\n\r\nPete'),(13195,'bd6cd402eb','I received the shipment yesterday.  The 3.8 motors seems pretty quick.  When I get home tonight, I\'m going to hook up some dual cells and see how that goes.  I\'ve been working on the track a little bit.  Maybe we can set something up for the end of the week.  I want to check out that fetted SE that you have.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13196,'c9ee7c6196','I got the RX7 today thanks\r\n\r\nIt look way better in person now I just need to figure out what chassie I will put it on  :???: \r\n\r\n  Prolly better to just buy a new chassie to put it on.\r\n\r\n  Also thanks for the stickers :) you put those on before you clearcoat?  Keep an eye on some of the new work it will be sportin them fo sho .'),(13197,'c9ee7c6196','I got the RX7 today thanks\r\n\r\nIt look way better in person now I just need to figure out what chassie I will put it on  :???: \r\n\r\n  Prolly better to just buy a new chassie to put it on.\r\n\r\n  Also thanks for the stickers :) you put those on before you clearcoat?  Keep an eye on some of the new work it will be sportin them fo sho .'),(13198,'bbc5bada43','That sounds cool to me.  I took the SE to the tennis courts last night to see what it had in a big area.. I love it so much, that I\'m sending him 2 or 3 more..lol\r\n\r\nGive me a ring when you get some free time.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13426,'b6a2c8230c','[quote:b6a2c8230c=\"DarkTari\"]What\'s the website for ordering?\r\n\r\nI have the RS solderer but my tip doesn\'t look fine enough, I think ??\r\n\r\nI\'ll be pickin up some copper braid for cleaning up the old solder (hint from SuperFly) today and I\'ll probably give it a shot tonight since there\'s no work tomorrow.\r\n\r\nQuestion:\r\nI\'ve seen the FET mods done from numerous sources and most appear to\r\neither piggy-back the old ones and/or jumper to others.  Wouldn\'t it be much easier to just remove the old transisters/resisters and replace with the FET\'s and eliminate all the wire jumping ?[/quote:b6a2c8230c]The website is www.digikey.com.\r\n\r\nMy RS iron has a cone shaped tip, and it\'s plenty fine enough.\r\n\r\nAs for your question, you\'re gonna be replacing the transistors with the FETs. The FETs we use are N-channel FETs. The H-bridge is composed of 2 N-channel transitors, and 2 P-channel resistors. Since the polarity of P-channel transistors is different than N-channel, we have to flip 2 of the FETs, to align 2 of the pins with the proper contacts. The third contact will have to be jumpered.\r\n\r\nIt would be helpful to read up on how the mod works, because if you have a loose connection, or a short, it may be hard to see. Understanding how the circuit works will make it easier to trouble shoot your problem. Search BitPimps for \'mosfet\', all the info is there, just make sure to follow all the links.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13211,'37391a7dd7','[quote:37391a7dd7=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:37391a7dd7=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:37391a7dd7=\"VooDooMafia\"]I got the RX7 today thanks\r\n\r\nIt look way better in person now I just need to figure out what chassie I will put it on  :???: \r\n\r\n  Prolly better to just buy a new chassie to put it on.\r\n\r\n  Also thanks for the stickers :) you put those on before you clearcoat?  Keep an eye on some of the new work it will be sportin them fo sho .[/quote:37391a7dd7]cool man, glad it arrived safely.\r\n\r\nyea, that\'s one thing I\'ve come to realize, pictures just don\'t do the cars justice, like with your green flames - I know that thing has got to look hot.\r\n\r\nyea, put the decals on before clear coats.\r\n\r\nI\'m still waiting on the pullback, hopefully any day now, I\'ll let ya know when it comes in.[/quote:37391a7dd7]\r\n\r\n  Yea please let me know when you get it :)  also are they water slides?\r\n\r\n  I will take a pic of the RX7 with my other digi cam (canon powershot pro70) and see what kind of pics I can get of it and post them.\r\n\r\n  Yep now I got one of your paint jobs, CD\'s on the way now I need one from payaso  :???:[/quote:37391a7dd7]I will fo sho.\r\nyea, they\'re water slides.\r\n\r\nhope ya like the body, it\'s not my best but still aight.'),(13213,'4ef3049363','email me when the letter reaches you and when you ship the package also.\r\nIs this going through the regular mail?? or is it comming UPS?????');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13214,'ba6d6d43ed','They are all Bit Char G\'s, no clones.  I think I got a really good price on them, but I might have 1 or 2 extras if you\'re interested.  I already have a yellow skyline and a red RX-7.  I only paid $14 shipped for each.  I\'ll fill you in more when they finally arrive.'),(13215,'bf75215c13','ok dude go get some clean underwear cuz i actually remembered to bring it today. had some issues so i iddnt make it into work yesterday but yes i am here and it is sitting on my desk. i should be able to ship it out at lunch.'),(13216,'f1f10140a4','ok the lady at the post office took it away so she said 4days delivery??\r\n\r\nhaha sorry i took so long dude.'),(13218,'a771e12c00','bad: i havnt shipped your stuff yet\r\n\r\ngood: i just shipped payasos so that makes you next in line. ill try to get everything togetther tonight but i wont be able to ship til next week which will give me time to quadruple check everything. ill let ya know whats up.'),(13219,'4fe1f1810d','Thanks for teh heads up dude.\r\n\r\n  To be honest I have not thought about  it much I have been thinking of how to get me ass a xmod LOL.\r\n\r\n  Not sure if I answered this before but the epoch has 512 steps of propo.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13220,'4fe1f1810d','Thanks for teh heads up dude.\r\n\r\n  To be honest I have not thought about  it much I have been thinking of how to get me ass a xmod LOL.\r\n\r\n  Not sure if I answered this before but the epoch has 512 steps of propo.'),(13425,'9d497af567','[quote:9d497af567=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:9d497af567=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:9d497af567=\"VooDooMafia\"]Glad they got there ok. \r\n\r\n  Yea those are from the other homie sets(knock off I think)\r\n\r\n  I like to toss something in with the packages to make me feel like the post office didn\'t screw me with there prices(not as cheap as it is for you guys).  But its all a write off anyway.\r\n\r\n  Sometimes I send shit that I get in the mail so you Yanks can see the crap we get.  I sent sessiz a \"Stop Wetting the Bed\" flyer I got in the mail with his package.  Like common if I wetted the bed would I really order that shit with my real name  :???:[/quote:9d497af567]lol thats funny.\r\nwell cool man, thanks for the extras\r\n\r\nI\'ll let ya know when the other body arrives.\r\ndid you get that ae86 body I sent yet?[/quote:9d497af567]\r\n\r\n\r\n  LOL yea I looked after I PMed you and it was in along with some forms from the post office (could be good i guess but proly customs bills lol)[/quote:9d497af567]not on the shit I\'m sending you is it?'),(13222,'92f91a0ba6','512 steps?? damn that aint even needed. that vid of yours was pretty cool. id get one of those but i think one bigger car is enough. ya dude drive across the border and get one of those things.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13281,'27b87a7a9c','Hey man-\r\n\r\nI\'m really sorry it took me sooo friggin long to find the time to properly package up those bodies and get my ass to the post office, but I did it today. I sent you a MS Sport S2000 body in the milky white color, a yellow Lancer and a clear Celica. Anyway, just letting you know they really are in the mail. I figured 3 of my unwanted bodies was fair trade for 2 that I did want.\r\n\r\nSuperFly'),(13282,'27b87a7a9c','Hey man-\r\n\r\nI\'m really sorry it took me sooo friggin long to find the time to properly package up those bodies and get my ass to the post office, but I did it today. I sent you a MS Sport S2000 body in the milky white color, a yellow Lancer and a clear Celica. Anyway, just letting you know they really are in the mail. I figured 3 of my unwanted bodies was fair trade for 2 that I did want.\r\n\r\nSuperFly'),(16115,'3242e5e5b4','sup pimp,\r\n\r\nin case you didn\'t know, we have a new \"Galleries\" section to our site:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php\r\n\r\nI want to offer you up some space there for your bit images - if you\'re interested that is.\r\n\r\nif interested, hit the link above and register - let me know when you do so I can give you the proper permissions to create your own album and upload your own images. The images you upload will be in your own album under the \"bitPimps Crew Galleries\" like the rest:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php?cat=1\r\n\r\nthere are a few other shots of yours I\'d also like to put in our \"Custom Modifications\" album, which eventually will house images of killer rides from pimps from all around the world - my images will be moved out:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/thumbnails.php?album=3\r\n\r\nif interested, let me know.\r\nif not - that\'s totally cool - I understand and there\'s no hard feelings from this side.\r\n\r\nlet me know what you think\r\n\r\nScott (CaboWabo)'),(13284,'6bdd738714','The flames look awsome your pics do it no justice whats makes me think your other cars are stellar aswell(like I didn\'t already know this).\r\n\r\n  Thanks for letting me know about the lights but in all reality the only time I think I would hook them up is if I was donnt do a drunk driver movie so I could flip it and have the lights rolling as it fliped.\r\n\r\n  Yea I will paypal some cash after the weekend just waiting for a couple more people to pay for there shit.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13285,'2efddff7fc','Cool dude thanks :)\r\n\r\n In all honesty I am glad you waited this way it will offset the mail abit.\r\n\r\n  I would rather get mail everyday then all at once.\r\n\r\n  If I get any more race bodies you will be the first to know &amp; if there is anything else you are looking for let me know.'),(13286,'6bdd738714','The flames look awsome your pics do it no justice whats makes me think your other cars are stellar aswell(like I didn\'t already know this).\r\n\r\n  Thanks for letting me know about the lights but in all reality the only time I think I would hook them up is if I was donnt do a drunk driver movie so I could flip it and have the lights rolling as it fliped.\r\n\r\n  Yea I will paypal some cash after the weekend just waiting for a couple more people to pay for there shit.'),(13287,'42d5727de9','Dave not sure if is possible but would you sell and how much would you charge for:\r\n\r\n  Thundercharger with stretched chassie to fit a ZZ body and maybe lowered tabs?\r\n\r\n  I have way more ZZ bodies then I do chassies (1 ZZ and 2 Se\'s). \r\n\r\n  if this is possible let me know.\r\n\r\n  I was just about to buy a zz off ebay when I realized that that was alot of cash just for a chassie lol.\r\n\r\nLet me know cause I would prolly be up for one or 2 of them with my next fet mods.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete'),(13288,'42d5727de9','Dave not sure if is possible but would you sell and how much would you charge for:\r\n\r\n  Thundercharger with stretched chassie to fit a ZZ body and maybe lowered tabs?\r\n\r\n  I have way more ZZ bodies then I do chassies (1 ZZ and 2 Se\'s). \r\n\r\n  if this is possible let me know.\r\n\r\n  I was just about to buy a zz off ebay when I realized that that was alot of cash just for a chassie lol.\r\n\r\nLet me know cause I would prolly be up for one or 2 of them with my next fet mods.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13418,'189b7d5b36','[quote:189b7d5b36=\"grnmachnracr\"]dude i have to have some work by you!! i love your cars!!! No matteer what i WILL have a car from you, man i love your flamesa and everything you have so much skill! how do you do it???[/quote:189b7d5b36]Well, I\'ll tell ya, I make no secret as to how I do my paint jobs. BitPimps has been hosting my article on how to paint, check it out;\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/articles/article_postings.php?id=21&amp;catId=6\r\n\r\nI also have to tell ya, everyone begged me for that tutorial, and when I finally got it up, I expected to see everyone doing graphics, but instead everyone PMed me telling me how hard it is, and \'how\'d I do it?\'\r\n\r\nI\'d be happy to cut you a deal on a paint job, but honestly, I\'ve been trying to turn down your offer to trade the Shen. I already have to many cars. Somewhere around 20, I lost count. I\'m already back up on other mods I\'m doing for doing for people that I\'m trying to get out of the way, and money\'s tight over here right now. So I hate to say it, but really I need a little bit of cash for my time, but honestly, I think 15 bucks is fair for an afternoons worth of work, materials, and travel time to get to the post office, not to mention a piece of my work. If it makes you feel in better, I can throw in that WRX body, \'cause I\'ve got 2 of those.\r\n\r\nSo whenever you\'re ready to put up a little cash, let me know, and I\'ll get you my address so you can send me a money order, and I\'ll get something painted up for you.\r\n\r\nDave'),(13290,'4e36e9815d','[quote:4e36e9815d=\"VooDooMafia\"]Dave not sure if is possible but would you sell and how much would you charge for:\r\n\r\n  Thundercharger with stretched chassie to fit a ZZ body and maybe lowered tabs?\r\n\r\n  I have way more ZZ bodies then I do chassies (1 ZZ and 2 Se\'s). \r\n\r\n  if this is possible let me know.\r\n\r\n  I was just about to buy a zz off ebay when I realized that that was alot of cash just for a chassie lol.\r\n\r\nLet me know cause I would prolly be up for one or 2 of them with my next fet mods.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:4e36e9815d]Well I\'m having trouble coming up with a fair price for stretching a TC chassis. See, it takes a lot more time and handi work than a FET mod (several hours of cutting glueing, sanding, and painting),  so I was thinking chargeing twice what I charge you for FETs, but then with the 5 for the car that\'s 20, and I might as well run down to RS and pick you up one of dem Wranglers, or the Firebirds for that price. So I figure a good compromise would be 15. That\'s 5 for the car, and 10 for the mod, and that\'s still cheaper than a Zip Zap, to make it worth your while.\r\n\r\nI could also dual cell them to make them worth the 20 over a Zip Zap. \r\n\r\nI don\'t know, I\'m not a money man, I just know I need some money to get my Xmod where I want it. :sad: \r\n\r\nWhach you think is a fair price?\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13291,'1228bd3cd9','Well if you say 20 is fair for you then its fair for me.  I am very easy to work with :).\r\n\r\n  And I see your point about just running down to rs to pick a zz up.  Only thing is I have had a bad experiance with ZZ\'s.  I got the blue civic when they first came out(thats the one you just removed the PBC from) and I tell yea it ran like shit.  I refused to get another as my bits ran way better.  Now I hear they have improved but then again they have shit range and I dont plan on playing with them that much just to display some of the ZZ chassies I have.\r\n\r\n  So yea let me know if 20 is cool with you its cool with me.  Yea I think I am gonna get a xmod shipped up now there is to much talk about them and them LXX mini z are looking for for under 30 bucks aswell.\r\n\r\nPete\r\n\r\n\r\nPete'),(13297,'7a53052a75','[quote:7a53052a75=\"VooDooMafia\"]Well if you say 20 is fair for you then its fair for me.  I am very easy to work with :).\r\n\r\n  And I see your point about just running down to rs to pick a zz up.  Only thing is I have had a bad experiance with ZZ\'s.  I got the blue civic when they first came out(thats the one you just removed the PBC from) and I tell yea it ran like shit.  I refused to get another as my bits ran way better.  Now I hear they have improved but then again they have shit range and I dont plan on playing with them that much just to display some of the ZZ chassies I have.\r\n\r\n  So yea let me know if 20 is cool with you its cool with me.  Yea I think I am gonna get a xmod shipped up now there is to much talk about them and them LXX mini z are looking for for under 30 bucks aswell.\r\n\r\nPete\r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:7a53052a75]Yeah, if you really don\'t care for Zip Zaps then I can see your point in paying me 20. That would obviously be better for me, because I would profit for my time, but in all fairness, I have to tell you the recent Zip Zaps are very well made. I have 2 I keep bone stock ecept for the motor, because I think they\'re fine as they are. \r\n\r\nYeah I\'ll tell you, I think I already prefer the Xmod to the Mini-Z, because, it design give it so much potential. Too bad the electronics kinda suck, because that\'s where it could get expensive, swapping those out, but they just kinda suck, they\'re not too bad, just not \'hobby\' grade.\r\n\r\nTher\'s all this stuff I want to do to my Xmod, but I think I\'m gonna have to pick up one of those LXX clones as well. Be cool to compare to the Xmod, see what can be had for about the same price, and just to have something to race with my Xmod, in case a buddy came over or something. Plus, i really dig that Audi TT body.\r\n\r\nDave'),(13298,'b9e037e22e','[quote:b9e037e22e=\"crazydave\"]Hey how\'s going? Getting settled in yet? Been busy over here, stressing out, trying to figure out how to FET the SE, because micro_amps is playing tight with his info, then my wife goes and quits her job, as if I don\'t have enough on my mind.\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna send you back the cars that are done, so I don\'t have so many of your cars here. So give me your address, and I\'ll get those out in the next few days.\r\n\r\nI solved the problem with the Thunder Charger, but I\'m still working on the Micro Speed, and that yellow Mini. I was talking to ph2t, he turned me on to some P-channel FETs, I believe those should solve my problem. I\'m gonna order some of those, so I can do your cars up properly.\r\n\r\nI still have to mount the alloys. I keep procrastinating on that, but as you\'ve found out, ithey\'re a bitch, and because each set is different, each one has it\'s own frustrations that come along with it.\r\n\r\n...but I\'ll get to them, soon, I promise.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHey, been meaning to ask, what\'s the stuff you get around there like? We\'re just coming out of the dry season, and my apartment is wreaking like a skunk right now.  :-D ;)\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:b9e037e22e]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m doing pretty well with the daytime thing......I\'m still keeping my fingers crossed that a night -time position will open up soon.\r\n\r\nI\'m cool with the time delays...no worries there.....I\'ve been pretty busy cleaning up and repairing stuff in my house. I rent a house for real cheap, and we (my landlord...but my house) have a city inspection coming up, so I\'ve been doing most of the work myself, mostly paint touch-ups and moldings and shit....I have always felt that speed is less important than doing the job correctly, so whenever\'s clever homie......and hell yeah...those damn rims  :mad: , I definitely understand that one.....\r\n\r\nI only get high quality here (pun intended :grin:).....one 1/8th is $50.00 and I get between 4 and 5 grams.....not too bad.....I haven\'t had any good skunk in awhile...we call what I get out here..Chronic....also known as Endo..Crypt..Fifty/Hun..etc...now I\'m definitely going to have to come out there....me and you will be like this :drinkin:, but with this  &lt;::::# ~~~ \r\ngotta love it :smoking:\r\n\r\nheres my address again.....and you might as well give me yours again....I\'ve tried messing with this Digi-Q and now its your turn :grin:....and I\'ve got a couple of ZZ bodies I\'m sending you too.... :driving: .....\r\nlater...........\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWayne Simard\r\n1422 West Monon Drive\r\nBloomington, IN 47403-3020');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13299,'e8c388227e','[quote:e8c388227e=\"Havok\"]I\'m doing pretty well with the daytime thing......I\'m still keeping my fingers crossed that a night -time position will open up soon.\r\n\r\nI\'m cool with the time delays...no worries there.....I\'ve been pretty busy cleaning up and repairing stuff in my house. I rent a house for real cheap, and we (my landlord...but my house) have a city inspection coming up, so I\'ve been doing most of the work myself, mostly paint touch-ups and moldings and shit....I have always felt that speed is less important than doing the job correctly, so whenever\'s clever homie......and hell yeah...those damn rims  :mad: , I definitely understand that one.....\r\n\r\nI only get high quality here (pun intended :grin:).....one 1/8th is $50.00 and I get between 4 and 5 grams.....not too bad.....I haven\'t had any good skunk in awhile...we call what I get out here..Chronic....also known as Endo..Crypt..Fifty/Hun..etc...now I\'m definitely going to have to come out there....me and you will be like this :drinkin:, but with this  &lt;::::# ~~~ \r\ngotta love it :smoking:\r\n\r\nheres my address again.....and you might as well give me yours again....I\'ve tried messing with this Digi-Q and now its your turn :grin:....and I\'ve got a couple of ZZ bodies I\'m sending you too.... :driving: .....\r\nlater...........\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWayne Simard\r\n1422 West Monon Drive\r\nBloomington, IN 47403-3020[/quote:e8c388227e]One month ago, I would have told I don\'t think I can do the Digi-Q, but in the last month I\'ve learned so much trying to figure out the SE, I think I could do a Digi-Q now. \r\n\r\nDo NOT send any more packages to RCI, because as I had said, my wife quit. My home address again was :\r\n\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd. apt. 1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nI still got to go through and figure out what needs to go back, and the Hood Rat too, but I\'ll let you know what to expect when it goes out.\r\n\r\n.. and you know, you keep saying don\'t worry how low it takes, so i wasn\'t worried at first, but then i took longer than I meant to, so even though I know you\'re not too worried about it, i still feel bad i took so long, I\'m just like that, you know.\r\n\r\nYeah, from reading High Times, I had a feeling you were getting that expensive hydro type stuff. That stuff\'s around here, but it\'s 125 a quarter :shock: , too rich for my blood. During the slow season, we get brown nasty crap that makes you wonder why you even bother smoking it, but when it gets good, it\'s good. This stuff is just as good as the hydro, but it has some seeds and stems, but hey for 60 bucks an oz, I aint bitching. We get good prices because we\'re right next to the border, you know.\r\n\r\nThat would be cool if we could hook up, that\'s why I brought it up, whenever the good stuff comes around, I always want to share it with my buddies. Since I couldn\'t exactly break out with you, I had to at least mention it. Maybe someday, who knows?\r\n\r\n\r\ndave'),(13300,'4a8735970b','To be honest even though I hear they are better I would rather see my cash goto a person not a company :) &amp; if it can help you get more items for you hobby then bonus.  Its nice if you have a hobby that can help fund your hobby.\r\n\r\n  I wonder if the LXX bodies will fit the xmods  :???:   I have heard that the xm\'s have a different mounting system then z\'s.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13301,'4a8735970b','To be honest even though I hear they are better I would rather see my cash goto a person not a company :) &amp; if it can help you get more items for you hobby then bonus.  Its nice if you have a hobby that can help fund your hobby.\r\n\r\n  I wonder if the LXX bodies will fit the xmods  :???:   I have heard that the xm\'s have a different mounting system then z\'s.'),(13405,'9dfd647779','[quote:9dfd647779=\"grnmachnracr\"]yeah ..but im getting a iracer for 10$ sson prolly.[/quote:9dfd647779]\r\n\r\n  well if you come across anymore digi q stuff let me know.'),(13406,'c8ed96a50f','np man its all u if i do.. i may get a new one cuz i liked it it was fats as shiznat!  :eek:   :sad:  but i traded it for 2 shens with oem 3.0s and one with underglow and ms pcb'),(13407,'23422f0826','dude i have to have some work by you!! i love your cars!!! No matteer what i WILL have a car from you, man i love your flamesa and everything you have so much skill! how do you do it???'),(13303,'e8c388227e','[quote:e8c388227e=\"Havok\"]I\'m doing pretty well with the daytime thing......I\'m still keeping my fingers crossed that a night -time position will open up soon.\r\n\r\nI\'m cool with the time delays...no worries there.....I\'ve been pretty busy cleaning up and repairing stuff in my house. I rent a house for real cheap, and we (my landlord...but my house) have a city inspection coming up, so I\'ve been doing most of the work myself, mostly paint touch-ups and moldings and shit....I have always felt that speed is less important than doing the job correctly, so whenever\'s clever homie......and hell yeah...those damn rims  :mad: , I definitely understand that one.....\r\n\r\nI only get high quality here (pun intended :grin:).....one 1/8th is $50.00 and I get between 4 and 5 grams.....not too bad.....I haven\'t had any good skunk in awhile...we call what I get out here..Chronic....also known as Endo..Crypt..Fifty/Hun..etc...now I\'m definitely going to have to come out there....me and you will be like this :drinkin:, but with this  &lt;::::# ~~~ \r\ngotta love it :smoking:\r\n\r\nheres my address again.....and you might as well give me yours again....I\'ve tried messing with this Digi-Q and now its your turn :grin:....and I\'ve got a couple of ZZ bodies I\'m sending you too.... :driving: .....\r\nlater...........\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nWayne Simard\r\n1422 West Monon Drive\r\nBloomington, IN 47403-3020[/quote:e8c388227e]One month ago, I would have told I don\'t think I can do the Digi-Q, but in the last month I\'ve learned so much trying to figure out the SE, I think I could do a Digi-Q now. \r\n\r\nDo NOT send any more packages to RCI, because as I had said, my wife quit. My home address again was :\r\n\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd. apt. 1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nI still got to go through and figure out what needs to go back, and the Hood Rat too, but I\'ll let you know what to expect when it goes out.\r\n\r\n.. and you know, you keep saying don\'t worry how low it takes, so i wasn\'t worried at first, but then i took longer than I meant to, so even though I know you\'re not too worried about it, i still feel bad i took so long, I\'m just like that, you know.\r\n\r\nYeah, from reading High Times, I had a feeling you were getting that expensive hydro type stuff. That stuff\'s around here, but it\'s 125 a quarter :shock: , too rich for my blood. During the slow season, we get brown nasty crap that makes you wonder why you even bother smoking it, but when it gets good, it\'s good. This stuff is just as good as the hydro, but it has some seeds and stems, but hey for 60 bucks an oz, I aint bitching. We get good prices because we\'re right next to the border, you know.\r\n\r\nThat would be cool if we could hook up, that\'s why I brought it up, whenever the good stuff comes around, I always want to share it with my buddies. Since I couldn\'t exactly break out with you, I had to at least mention it. Maybe someday, who knows?\r\n\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13304,'f14ca25d0b','[quote:f14ca25d0b=\"VooDooMafia\"]To be honest even though I hear they are better I would rather see my cash goto a person not a company :) &amp; if it can help you get more items for you hobby then bonus.  Its nice if you have a hobby that can help fund your hobby.\r\n\r\n  I wonder if the LXX bodies will fit the xmods  :???:   I have heard that the xm\'s have a different mounting system then z\'s.[/quote:f14ca25d0b]I don\'t know what the Z\'s mounting system is like, but the xmod has a large slot in front, like an oversized bit, and a hook that snaps in the back.\r\n\r\nI was afraid the Z bodies would be too big, as I\'ve heard Mini-Zs are 1/24, where as Xmods are 1/28th, just slightly smaller. \r\n\r\nI\'d like to find a cool old model, but I think those are 1/24th too.\r\n\r\ndave'),(13305,'da635bcd22','how much would it be for you to do a custom paint job on my 350z?\r\ni have stuff to trade also if u like.'),(13307,'6b40eed9f9','This is gunna be my next entry for the blow-out contest.\r\n\r\nWhen the chassis comes I will take official pics.\r\n[img:6b40eed9f9]http://groups.msn.com/_Secure/0SgDOAtIWJGXiKJcp97pGoQERCXT*kPQAPpS51fkYlHjctZFahZPvdp1EfIv4JASPAC3XUobOzm2Nvc0rRxfpLmviQIstB1o!00k*hjXvd6vplbenQceTug/driftdog.JPG?dc=4675446501763985520[/img:6b40eed9f9]\r\n\r\nThis is my \'drift dog\'  :grin: . I made an Aluminium wing to improve drifting. And with the mosfet... she should be a blast. 8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13308,'d23d63d316','did you get the letter????? :???:'),(13487,'9cf174f8a9','just abut anything..its just that i dont know how mutch its worth because ive never bought one\r\n\r\nmicro'),(13310,'da635bcd22','how much would it be for you to do a custom paint job on my 350z?\r\ni have stuff to trade also if u like.'),(19182,'8143d8ad25','[quote:8143d8ad25=\"CaboWabo\"]well whattya need to get fets?\r\nI\'m assuming you already know where to get them for what you need at the right amount and price.[/quote:8143d8ad25]See here\'s the deal. Digikey has a $5 sur-charge on orders under $25, so I might as well order them 50 at a time. It\'s not like we don\'t have the $28 it comes to after shipping, we just blew $50 at BigLots tonight, but my wife is saving to take the kid to Disneyland next month, and I\'m not allowed to get anything until she\'s saved enough. :roll:\r\n\r\n...but DTs got some cars on the way, that I\'m gonna be FETing to be auctioned off, so it\'s been made clear between me and her that I [i:8143d8ad25][b:8143d8ad25]am[/b:8143d8ad25][/i:8143d8ad25] getting a batch of FETs before the end of the month.\r\n\r\nIt\'s funny, like tonight when we\'re out, and she\'ll say, \"should we get it?\" I\'m like, \"I don\'t care, but don\'t forget you\'re saving money, and I am getting mosfets this month\" :lol: \r\n\r\n :lol: Dave'),(28857,'bccf4bf5b8','Are you serious? Would you really do this to me?\r\n\r\nI don\'t want you to buy them on your own money,I would only like you to send them.\r\n\r\nI\'d like two monster trucks of those zipzaps ones(could you make one of them provide that bigfoot body?),a tire kit and a motor kit.\r\nThose together cost 64$.\r\n\r\nAt the post theres a special service,I think its called \"collect package\". You know when you send the package on your own money and the postman only gives it to the one you had sent it,if he pays for it. \r\n\r\n(This way neither I,nor you have to be afraid of being fooled)\r\n\r\nSo I thought we could make it this way. You can write any amount on the package till 95$. So you can earn a little money too(I hope shipping doesn\'t cost that much),and I would be totally pleased if you did this.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think about this? Would it be appropriate?\r\n\r\nIf you say yes I can give you my address.\r\n\r\nCould you write your answer into the forum,in my topic?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13314,'4cb48f9131','That\'s cool. I really like your paint jobs you\'ve been doing. They\'re unique, but they look nice, you\'ve a good eye. Nice touch with the aluminum wing.\r\n\r\nHey, you know with that sway bar missing up front, the front wheels don\'t center up as well, and the car just doesn\'t seem to turn consistantly. I saw you shaved the sway bar\'s mount off the bulkhead, and I meant to throw you a another bulkhead thing, so you could put your sway bar back, but I forgot to put it in the box. Do you have any spare bulkhead thingies?\r\n\r\n\r\nDave'),(13315,'3fd4ed9278','Ok i did that for lowering purposes, I have tonnes of those from clones so its no prob. So my car is on the way then? What was the shipping cost?\r\n\r\nThanx for the complements. your flame jobs are [u:3fd4ed9278]the[/u:3fd4ed9278] best. I learnt my painting stuff from your flame tutorial.  :o'),(13316,'5a90afb7ef','Cavey,\r\n\r\nWhere are you getting your FET\'s?\r\n\r\nI\'m getting some from SuperFly this week.  I got some previously but\r\nhaven\'t used them yet.  Can\'t get my head outta the body modding enough to get started.  I think I\'ll need to get a finer soldering tip though.\r\nWhat would you recommend?\r\n\r\nThanx!'),(37271,'fb155845ba','Funny thing is I was thinking of sending you this PM, I had changed my mind, but then I saw this...\r\n[img:fb155845ba]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10097/untitled.JPG[/img:fb155845ba]\r\n_________________________________________________\r\nAnyhow, onto the real PM:\r\n\r\nI need some stuff from Radioshack. If you\'re up to it of course. I\'ve already asked DT, he only found the lights. I mainly need the body tops so that I can refurbish some Xmods for resale.\r\n\r\nAll from Radioshack, all in-store only:\r\n\r\n[b:fb155845ba]XMODS® Custom RC Command Logic Lights[/b:fb155845ba]\r\n[img:fb155845ba]http://rsk.imageg.net/graphics/product_images/pRS1C-2266576t98.jpg[/img:fb155845ba] I want 4 of these.  $5.99 each  [b:fb155845ba]60-8509[/b:fb155845ba]\r\n\r\n[b:fb155845ba]XMODS® Custom RC Body Kit for Silver Toyota® SUPRA® [/b:fb155845ba]\r\n[img:fb155845ba]http://rsk.imageg.net/graphics/product_images/pRS1C-2160618t98.jpg[/img:fb155845ba] one of these. $9.97 each  [b:fb155845ba]60-8546[/b:fb155845ba]\r\n\r\n[b:fb155845ba]XMODS® Custom RC Body Kit for 2004 Ford® Mustang® [/b:fb155845ba]\r\n[img:fb155845ba]http://rsk.imageg.net/graphics/product_images/pRS1C-2265436t98.jpg[/img:fb155845ba] one of these $9.97 each  [b:fb155845ba]60-8535[/b:fb155845ba]\r\n\r\n[b:fb155845ba]That stuff, and all the returned Xmod EVO cars you can get for free or $10  bucks(or less). Once the PCB works snag it, all other problems are trivial[/b:fb155845ba]\r\n\r\nJust tell me how much it all came to and what you got and I\'ll paypal you the cash  :-o. You\'ll be sending them to my Brother Alister in Jersey also.\r\n\r\nI\'m also trying to get [url=http://www.xmodworld.com/modules.php?name=Forums&amp;file=viewtopic&amp;t=15902&amp;start=15]this lot[/url] for $75 but he\'s taking really long to reply.\r\n\r\nI have a very small window, my brother is coming back home from the states on the 13th so I want him to bring my stuff down for me. For that reason I\'m also borrowing a paypal account from the guy he\'s staying at to speed things up.\r\n\r\nI don\'t need the packages, just bag everything up. The returned EVOs I\'ll need in their boxes tho.\r\n\r\nMaxx');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35939,'60b0d57e45','Thanks man, I sorta like the White motor. My brother runs the red motor with AWD and his picks up pretty nicely. \r\n\r\nOnce question you might be able to help me out with...\r\n\r\nWhen my brother first got his Xmod he put it together and started driving around the basement. His car took a nasty wide turn and while he was turning right, his left tire stuck the side of a object and his car became motionless.\r\n\r\nI then saw this and picked the car up to notice the wheels had locked towards the right. Like something was jammed. So I told him not to worry and opened up the front section of his mod. \r\n\r\nOnce i popped the hood I just pushed the wheels back into the center and sorta loosned up the servo, suddenly the wheels turned back and forth and it was almost all good to go.\r\n\r\nNow just one more problem...\r\n\r\nBack on the track his car went, and..OH NO! His car pulls majorly to one side, and turns sharper left than right!? \r\n\r\nNow is there a way to fix this, because I am noticing my Xmod starting to pull to the right too...\r\n\r\nHow can I straighten out these cars?'),(31798,'f29185edda','[quote:f29185edda=\"mikirgra\"]Yo DT, you out there???\r\n\r\nFrom: mikirgra \r\nTo: DarkTari \r\nPosted: Mon Jul 18, 2005 1:23 pm \r\nSubject: Lupin the III BCG  \r\nDarkTari &amp; payaso, \r\n\r\nI\'m an idot and an ass, and you can call me out publicly if you want. I was too tired to think clearly when I posted that about the Fiat bit (aka, Lupin the III BCG) the other night. My post was WAY to short on details, and it opened me up to just such a bind. I got PM\'s from both of you, and since my post didn\'t state that I would sell to the first to PM me, well, here we are. Don\'t misunderstand, I will NOT allow you to bid against each other. I would like your help on figuring this out. I know either of you will give the home it deserves. I think I paid like $32 plus shipping from Japan for it. I\'ll sell it to either of you for $30 shipped. Maybe whoever doesn\'t get mine can get one from HLJ?  \r\n\r\nSorry guys. I fubar\'d this one. I\'ll post to the forum that it\'s spoken for. Let me know what you guys think. Don\'t know if it matters to you, but here are the times on your PM\'s to me: \r\n\r\nDT: 7/16 @ 5am \r\nPY: 7/16 @ 2:45PM \r\n\r\nYou\'re the only two, thank goodness, and I wish I had two. Hoping we can work it out.[/quote:f29185edda]\r\n\r\nI\'m here and still want.  Did you hear from Silla?  If he wants it, I\'ll step aside, if not as I said before..........[b:f29185edda][color=green:f29185edda]SOLD[/color:f29185edda] ![/b:f29185edda]');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13411,'04a90f4d49','are you interested in the iracer?'),(13412,'23422f0826','dude i have to have some work by you!! i love your cars!!! No matteer what i WILL have a car from you, man i love your flamesa and everything you have so much skill! how do you do it???'),(13413,'04a90f4d49','are you interested in the iracer?'),(13415,'ebf65c7ab7','Not really I have some on the way.\r\n\r\n  I just like to have the digi Q\'s for the wife(she likes them the most)'),(13416,'ed58b6714d','oh i see, yeah if i get a new one and want to sell it ur there first to know!'),(19178,'491223861a','Well thanks for the props man.  :-) \r\n...I thought I did pretty good too. :lol: \r\n\r\nYou know, you have odd timing. I had a miserable day at work. Had a couple customers yell at me, then the manager got mad at me cause I don\'t like having customers yelling at me for shit that aint my fault.\r\n\r\nAnyways, in general I just felt completely unappreciated today, and was kinda depressed. It was cool to check the \'puter one more time before bed, and see someone out there appreciates you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI tell ya, I\'ve been really wanting to get some FETs, partially cause I got a couple new cars that need them, partially cause DT and a couple others are asking about them, but mostly cause I can\'t wait to get your SE FETed for you. I\'ve been loving the SE since I learned that last little bit about the resistors.\r\n\r\nDave'),(13319,'5a90afb7ef','Cavey,\r\n\r\nWhere are you getting your FET\'s?\r\n\r\nI\'m getting some from SuperFly this week.  I got some previously but\r\nhaven\'t used them yet.  Can\'t get my head outta the body modding enough to get started.  I think I\'ll need to get a finer soldering tip though.\r\nWhat would you recommend?\r\n\r\nThanx!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14497,'03be114910','i accidently told you that my car was 49 mhz. i am sorryi ment to say 45 mhz. \r\n\r\nTHanks agian\r\nmicro'),(14498,'8f8a1fce75','[quote:8f8a1fce75=\"PimpIke\"]thanks man, i contacted micro match, he said it should have been there. i have no clue what happened.[/quote:8f8a1fce75]\r\n\r\ndo you know when he did it?  I\'ll check when I get home dude.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14499,'c2525044ab','damn, man.. \r\n\r\nI dont think he has one, but i understood it like he had an SE with fets - hmm.. i dont know why? :???:  Afterall my english isnt complete :cool: \r\n\r\nThanks\r\nEvo'),(13321,'e520626e27','[quote:e520626e27=\"DarkTari\"]Cavey,\r\n\r\nWhere are you getting your FET\'s?\r\n\r\nI\'m getting some from SuperFly this week.  I got some previously but\r\nhaven\'t used them yet.  Can\'t get my head outta the body modding enough to get started.  I think I\'ll need to get a finer soldering tip though.\r\nWhat would you recommend?\r\n\r\nThanx![/quote:e520626e27]I order my FETs from Digikey. I order 51 to put it over 25 bucks, and avoid the sur charge. It comes to under 30 bucks after shipping.\r\n\r\nI just use a regular ol\' 15watt iron from Radio Shack. They\'re less than 5 bucks.\r\n\r\ndave'),(13322,'5f90ff912d','What\'s the website for ordering?\r\n\r\nI have the RS solderer but my tip doesn\'t look fine enough, I think ??\r\n\r\nI\'ll be pickin up some copper braid for cleaning up the old solder (hint from SuperFly) today and I\'ll probably give it a shot tonight since there\'s no work tomorrow.\r\n\r\nQuestion:\r\nI\'ve seen the FET mods done from numerous sources and most appear to\r\neither piggy-back the old ones and/or jumper to others.  Wouldn\'t it be much easier to just remove the old transisters/resisters and replace with the FET\'s and eliminate all the wire jumping ?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13323,'5f90ff912d','What\'s the website for ordering?\r\n\r\nI have the RS solderer but my tip doesn\'t look fine enough, I think ??\r\n\r\nI\'ll be pickin up some copper braid for cleaning up the old solder (hint from SuperFly) today and I\'ll probably give it a shot tonight since there\'s no work tomorrow.\r\n\r\nQuestion:\r\nI\'ve seen the FET mods done from numerous sources and most appear to\r\neither piggy-back the old ones and/or jumper to others.  Wouldn\'t it be much easier to just remove the old transisters/resisters and replace with the FET\'s and eliminate all the wire jumping ?'),(13324,'f106758979','not yet dude, when did you send it?  will PM you as soon as it arrives.'),(13403,'154f09c480','yeah ..but im getting a iracer for 10$ sson prolly.'),(19594,'dcab313c55','Why?  What did I do?  I don\'t know where the IC is, so therefore you\'re pissed?'),(13327,'631b165c4b','Hey Cheese,\r\nwe\'re getting some complaints about the size of your avatar.\r\nI\'m going to have to delete your current avatar.\r\nplease use these dimensions: 80 pixels x 80 pixels\r\n\r\nsorry about the avatar\r\nthanks pimp!'),(13328,'8d2222527a','I have an extra Bit Char G yellow Evo and red Mazda RX-7 along with a black WRX body with clear body set.  Let me know if you\'re not busy one evening during the week and I\'ll bring my stuff over.  If you\'re interested, the cars are $15 and the body is $5.  I might be making another order in a few weeks, if you want anything.  Oh, my number is 813-805-7925, if you call after 6pm, I should be around.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13329,'946ac7fbe2','[quote:946ac7fbe2=\"grnmachnracr\"]how much would it be for you to do a custom paint job on my 350z?\r\ni have stuff to trade also if u like.[/quote:946ac7fbe2]Honestly, it\'s hard to come up with a price for my paint jobs, because they take me most of the day, and if I charged an hourly rate, no one would want to pay that.\r\n\r\nThen there\'s the cost of paint, but as long as I\'m able to work with colors I have on hand, then that\'s a non-issue.\r\n\r\nI\'d probably say 10-15 bucks+shipping for time spent. \r\n\r\nYou could send me a body, or if you want one I have on hand, I\'d charge you 2.50 for the body. I have a Supra, Beetle, RX-7, and a Subaru laying around.\r\n\r\nGive me an idea of what your looking for, and maybe we can swing a deal.\r\n\r\nDave'),(13330,'6eb4f65635','ok i have a 350z that i have clear, i want it painted white with black flamish grapix in black. also i would like the wrx cuztom painted, any color combo u thinkis cool, or any colors u have laying around, i would be willing to trade a dual cell shen qi wei, with a accord body , if u like the shen just needs a few of the thin wires soldered back and i will include controller, it has a custom paintjob and and it has deatils under the body painted as well, and the controlle matches. if u are interseted plese tell me.'),(13331,'8d2222527a','I have an extra Bit Char G yellow Evo and red Mazda RX-7 along with a black WRX body with clear body set.  Let me know if you\'re not busy one evening during the week and I\'ll bring my stuff over.  If you\'re interested, the cars are $15 and the body is $5.  I might be making another order in a few weeks, if you want anything.  Oh, my number is 813-805-7925, if you call after 6pm, I should be around.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13333,'99054200f9','Hell yeah I\'m interested...lol\r\n\r\nI left a message on your machine.. Gimme a call.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(13334,'6eb4f65635','ok i have a 350z that i have clear, i want it painted white with black flamish grapix in black. also i would like the wrx cuztom painted, any color combo u thinkis cool, or any colors u have laying around, i would be willing to trade a dual cell shen qi wei, with a accord body , if u like the shen just needs a few of the thin wires soldered back and i will include controller, it has a custom paintjob and and it has deatils under the body painted as well, and the controlle matches. if u are interseted plese tell me.'),(13335,'99054200f9','Hell yeah I\'m interested...lol\r\n\r\nI left a message on your machine.. Gimme a call.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(13336,'6c369079fa','sent it last monday to\r\n\r\nPeter Kostecti\r\n20 water street\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nl2v 2k3\r\nCanada'),(13486,'47e9bb8faf','[quote:47e9bb8faf=\"Grunge\"]How much do you want for the pullback and the Mat car??  Let me know, I\'m interested. :)[/quote:47e9bb8faf]\r\n\r\n If it was cash not trade I would want $20usd plus shipping (about 4-5 bucks if you in the states)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13402,'154f09c480','yeah ..but im getting a iracer for 10$ sson prolly.'),(13339,'2d90f7dc55','got the pullback in the mail today man.\r\nthanks dude!'),(13341,'69284dd02a','lol\r\njust looked more at that bag, saw another lump...\r\nextra homies!\r\nand I don\'t have any of em!\r\n\r\nthat was really cool of ya man.\r\nthanks alot!'),(13342,'df04ac8c3d','[quote:df04ac8c3d=\"JAC4412\"]sent it last monday to\r\n\r\nPeter Kostecti\r\n20 water street\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nl2v 2k3\r\nCanada[/quote:df04ac8c3d]\r\n\r\n  Yea I got it today thanks.\r\n\r\n  your motor was sent today aswell but it was just sent and thre is no pick up after 5pm so it will start moving in the morning.'),(13344,'26b2e897bd','Glad they got there ok. \r\n\r\n  Yea those are from the other homie sets(knock off I think)\r\n\r\n  I like to toss something in with the packages to make me feel like the post office didn\'t screw me with there prices(not as cheap as it is for you guys).  But its all a write off anyway.\r\n\r\n  Sometimes I send shit that I get in the mail so you Yanks can see the crap we get.  I sent sessiz a \"Stop Wetting the Bed\" flyer I got in the mail with his package.  Like common if I wetted the bed would I really order that shit with my real name  :???:'),(13345,'87e5f7b3c9','thanks\r\nnice dealing with you, ill email you when it arrives');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13485,'836ccfc4bb','How much do you want for the pullback and the Mat car??  Let me know, I\'m interested. :)'),(13347,'aa2c3a5773','OK cool dude I am also going to update my good traders list in the forums.'),(13348,'244f230fbd','Make an offer dude I am mostly looking for chassies as I have a ton of bodies that I need to find chassies &amp; controllers  for.'),(13401,'ee5b287470','[quote:ee5b287470=\"grnmachnracr\"]oh my sig... i got rid of that it was a reg one with the driving school set... also i have a tureno intial d card from the zz se upgrade kit 4 ya![/quote:ee5b287470]\r\n\r\n  Cool Cool yea if you ask the pimps that have delt with me I always toss shit in I have kickin around.\r\n\r\n  So you got rid of the digi Q then damn lol'),(13351,'812364ebff','ok you have been very helpful.\r\n\r\nhey im working on a project and im wondering if i could ask sum questions\r\n(for colledge)\r\n\r\nDoes the schoolsystem provide transportation (buses) is it good and do alot of kids use it??\r\nalso how bing is your schoolsystem if your still in school or how it was when you were in it.  \r\n\r\nagain,  Many Thanks'),(13352,'e3b1fb74c3','Do you just have the bodies and controller? no chassies?\r\n\r\n  Well anyway make an offer dude');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13353,'59ed98c756','well if u want a 27 with a loose rear axel.....\r\ni will trade a pink S2000 a God supra a blue rx-8 and anycontrollers u want and the tuerono with body lines and lowered with file, i will also include the 27 mgz  chaissis if u want for the esclade and tureno.'),(16065,'995f6d7a37','That sounds awesome... I think the Torino SE by itself is more than enough, man. ph2t is going to donate a prize (probably a ligh kit) as well as bettyK (a suspension mod), SuperFly (a custom-painted ride), Sessiz (a bitPimps poster) and myself (a custom-painted car). \r\n\r\nSuperFly and I talked today and figured that, with yours (the Starsky and Hutch SE) added to the mix, there would be a prize for each entry. We thought that would be sweet since they\'ve done a lot for all of us.\r\n\r\nWhat we figured as far as judging goes is this... we, who donated the prizes, plus micromatch for having the initial idea, will judge the contest. We figured it would be real simple if each of us ranked the cars from 1st to last and assigned a simple point system based on the number of entries (if 5 mods enter, then 1st place vote is worth 5 points, 2nd is worth 4 points, etc.) The first place winner would get to choose their prize first, second would choose second and so on... last place will get whats left. I think a brand new SE (totally stock) would be one of the best prizes... especially the Starsky and Hutch Torino. If nox and kwikbb enter as well, we\'ll come up short... if that\'s the case, I\'ll donate a new-in-the-package Thunder Charger clone or 2 (last place prizes for shure :) )\r\n\r\nHope that all makes sense, and by no means is this set in stone... it\'s just what we discussed this morning.'),(13355,'59ed98c756','well if u want a 27 with a loose rear axel.....\r\ni will trade a pink S2000 a God supra a blue rx-8 and anycontrollers u want and the tuerono with body lines and lowered with file, i will also include the 27 mgz  chaissis if u want for the esclade and tureno.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19181,'207b90dd91','[quote:207b90dd91=\"crazydave\"]Well thanks for the props man.  :-) \r\n...I thought I did pretty good too. :lol: \r\n\r\nYou know, you have odd timing. I had a miserable day at work. Had a couple customers yell at me, then the manager got mad at me cause I don\'t like having customers yelling at me for shit that aint my fault.\r\n\r\nAnyways, in general I just felt completely unappreciated today, and was kinda depressed. It was cool to check the \'puter one more time before bed, and see someone out there appreciates you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI tell ya, I\'ve been really wanting to get some FETs, partially cause I got a couple new cars that need them, partially cause DT and a couple others are asking about them, but mostly cause I can\'t wait to get your SE FETed for you. I\'ve been loving the SE since I learned that last little bit about the resistors.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:207b90dd91]well whattya need to get fets?\r\nI\'m assuming you already know where to get them for what you need at the right amount and price.'),(13357,'78a2614d39','[quote:78a2614d39=\"grnmachnracr\"]well if u want a 27 with a loose rear axel.....\r\ni will trade a pink S2000 a God supra a blue rx-8 and anycontrollers u want and the tuerono with body lines and lowered with file, i will also include the 27 mgz  chaissis if u want for the esclade and tureno.[/quote:78a2614d39]\\\r\n\r\n\r\n  Sure sounds good.  I would have to say the 27mzh controller if you are putting a 27mzh chassie(loose axle) in there.\r\n\r\n  Do you want the box for the Caddy?  Ther AE\'s are all still new.\r\n\r\n  Whats address to sent to?\r\n\r\nMines\r\n\r\nPeter Kostecki\r\n20 Water St.\r\nThorold Ontaro\r\nCanada\r\nL2V 2K3\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13358,'66fbbcd839','Dude I am alittle old to remember what school was like lol\r\n\r\n  Do you mean highschool or Univerity?\r\n\r\n  I know my high school gave out bus tickets if you lived far enough away and you just toook the city bus with them tickets.\r\n\r\n  univeristy gave you shit but you got a discound on a bus pass with your ID.\r\n\r\n  But I had a few cars at that time anyway so last time I took the bus was really long time ago.'),(13359,'0db1612332','cool, do u have aim, we can talk faster than this, and also the addy is and i will include the front knuckles also and sure ill take the pox if its ok.\r\nmy e-mail is rpm1234567@hotmail.com\r\nwhen u wanna send?\r\n\r\nRyan Manuel\r\n11 Windy Ct.\r\nNewark, DE. 19713'),(13360,'1c80f149d1','ok thank you   that really helps :lol:'),(13361,'b8eee3dedf','so if you want il put in a biglots clone with oem 3.0 and orange pigtail antenna'),(13362,'b8eee3dedf','so if you want il put in a biglots clone with oem 3.0 and orange pigtail antenna');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13363,'1c80f149d1','ok thank you   that really helps :lol:'),(13364,'0db1612332','cool, do u have aim, we can talk faster than this, and also the addy is and i will include the front knuckles also and sure ill take the pox if its ok.\r\nmy e-mail is rpm1234567@hotmail.com\r\nwhen u wanna send?\r\n\r\nRyan Manuel\r\n11 Windy Ct.\r\nNewark, DE. 19713'),(13366,'fb19285292','[quote:fb19285292=\"grnmachnracr\"]so if you want il put in a biglots clone with oem 3.0 and orange pigtail antenna[/quote:fb19285292]\r\n\r\nI dont have aim but I do have yahoo and msn\r\n\r\n  I dont really need any biglots clones as I have about 6 still not opened yet lol.  So I am not sure what you wanna do'),(13367,'ddca534b3d','well ill sned the zz and a extra 45 mgz chassis if u want , you cn fiddle with them both'),(13368,'ddca534b3d','well ill sned the zz and a extra 45 mgz chassis if u want , you cn fiddle with them both'),(13370,'26b2e897bd','Glad they got there ok. \r\n\r\n  Yea those are from the other homie sets(knock off I think)\r\n\r\n  I like to toss something in with the packages to make me feel like the post office didn\'t screw me with there prices(not as cheap as it is for you guys).  But its all a write off anyway.\r\n\r\n  Sometimes I send shit that I get in the mail so you Yanks can see the crap we get.  I sent sessiz a \"Stop Wetting the Bed\" flyer I got in the mail with his package.  Like common if I wetted the bed would I really order that shit with my real name  :???:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13371,'0800e889e7','[quote:0800e889e7=\"VooDooMafia\"]Glad they got there ok. \r\n\r\n  Yea those are from the other homie sets(knock off I think)\r\n\r\n  I like to toss something in with the packages to make me feel like the post office didn\'t screw me with there prices(not as cheap as it is for you guys).  But its all a write off anyway.\r\n\r\n  Sometimes I send shit that I get in the mail so you Yanks can see the crap we get.  I sent sessiz a \"Stop Wetting the Bed\" flyer I got in the mail with his package.  Like common if I wetted the bed would I really order that shit with my real name  :???:[/quote:0800e889e7]lol thats funny.\r\nwell cool man, thanks for the extras\r\n\r\nI\'ll let ya know when the other body arrives.\r\ndid you get that ae86 body I sent yet?'),(13372,'6d04f41477','[quote:6d04f41477=\"grnmachnracr\"]well ill sned the zz and a extra 45 mgz chassis if u want , you cn fiddle with them both[/quote:6d04f41477]\r\n\r\nOk, just send a list of what you are sending \r\n\r\nI\'ll put this stuff in the mail tomorrow\r\n\r\nThanks'),(13373,'937553c5d7','ok i ma sending\r\nthe gold supra body,rx-8 body(took out the windoes)S2000 body, and tureno body(body lines in black e-mail me 4 pik of it) a 27 mgz chassis(no motor or heatsink or geras)a 49mgz zz chassis(needs 1 front knuckle gears motor and heat sink) and a 49mgz controller and 27 mgz controler, i will include some extra rims in the deal also');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13374,'0800e889e7','[quote:0800e889e7=\"VooDooMafia\"]Glad they got there ok. \r\n\r\n  Yea those are from the other homie sets(knock off I think)\r\n\r\n  I like to toss something in with the packages to make me feel like the post office didn\'t screw me with there prices(not as cheap as it is for you guys).  But its all a write off anyway.\r\n\r\n  Sometimes I send shit that I get in the mail so you Yanks can see the crap we get.  I sent sessiz a \"Stop Wetting the Bed\" flyer I got in the mail with his package.  Like common if I wetted the bed would I really order that shit with my real name  :???:[/quote:0800e889e7]lol thats funny.\r\nwell cool man, thanks for the extras\r\n\r\nI\'ll let ya know when the other body arrives.\r\ndid you get that ae86 body I sent yet?'),(13375,'c337ae295e','2maros a holiday, if u live in the us u cant send either lol i 4got .'),(13376,'937553c5d7','ok i ma sending\r\nthe gold supra body,rx-8 body(took out the windoes)S2000 body, and tureno body(body lines in black e-mail me 4 pik of it) a 27 mgz chassis(no motor or heatsink or geras)a 49mgz zz chassis(needs 1 front knuckle gears motor and heat sink) and a 49mgz controller and 27 mgz controler, i will include some extra rims in the deal also'),(19180,'207b90dd91','[quote:207b90dd91=\"crazydave\"]Well thanks for the props man.  :-) \r\n...I thought I did pretty good too. :lol: \r\n\r\nYou know, you have odd timing. I had a miserable day at work. Had a couple customers yell at me, then the manager got mad at me cause I don\'t like having customers yelling at me for shit that aint my fault.\r\n\r\nAnyways, in general I just felt completely unappreciated today, and was kinda depressed. It was cool to check the \'puter one more time before bed, and see someone out there appreciates you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI tell ya, I\'ve been really wanting to get some FETs, partially cause I got a couple new cars that need them, partially cause DT and a couple others are asking about them, but mostly cause I can\'t wait to get your SE FETed for you. I\'ve been loving the SE since I learned that last little bit about the resistors.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:207b90dd91]well whattya need to get fets?\r\nI\'m assuming you already know where to get them for what you need at the right amount and price.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13378,'c337ae295e','2maros a holiday, if u live in the us u cant send either lol i 4got .'),(13380,'551c6a6a9a','sounds cool dude\r\n\r\nLike I said I will pack this up and post it out tomorrow morning :)'),(13381,'fc3aae19b2','LOl its all good no I am in Canada and we dont have mail on Saterdays so they will still arrive aournd same time if you dont send tomorrow'),(13382,'3f91fe546c','hey anychance u can throw that digi clone in for some xtra stuff like a chrome controller,and a set of se headlights? or anything else u want'),(13383,'3f91fe546c','hey anychance u can throw that digi clone in for some xtra stuff like a chrome controller,and a set of se headlights? or anything else u want'),(13385,'f82eae1e8c','I will see if I can find another one as I am just waiting to hear back on a trade for that.  But if it falls through I can trade it'),(13457,'ecf84d1128','Sure,  it\'s here:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.irf.com/product-info/datasheets/data/irlml2502.pdf\r\n\r\ngood luck!\r\n\r\n:)\r\n\r\nph2t.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:ecf84d1128=\"KuZGuN\"]Hello Ph2t,\r\n\r\nI ask a question i hope you can help me ?\r\n\r\nIn mosfet mod which fet using, can you have a datasheet of the mosfets i can\'t find any irlml 2502 fet in Turkey.\r\n\r\nThanks for your helps.\r\n\r\nBest Regards.[/quote:ecf84d1128]'),(13458,'0399c474f2','[quote:0399c474f2=\"DarkTari\"]Thanx Pimp![/quote:0399c474f2]No prob.  :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19177,'962ade8a62','well even though I can\'t say it like this publicly without driving away many others - I had to let you know this...\r\n\r\nsince I got my most favorite ever car stolen, I was forced to use another car as my \"main\" chassis and another for my \"2nd to main\" chassis.\r\n\r\nI\'ve gotten mods from ph2t, superfly, and you.\r\nhands down - you kick all their asses combined on the chassis mod, fet modding specifically but I\'m willing to be the rest of it as well.\r\n\r\nI ended up giving superfly\'s fet to Hiroto as part of his contest prize, ph2t\'s shit I\'ve been pissed with since day 1 except for the micro switch.\r\nbut yours, the 1st fet mod you did (which is used on my V-Dub) is my new favorite (used to me 2nd to main). that chassis with my V-Dub shell has seen more miles than some taxi\'s and has the battle wounds to prove it. the last chassis you did for me is my new 2nd favorite (2nd to main). I love it - and probably the only reason why it\'s not #1 is because it\'s the only fet\'ed dual cell I have - and have ever had.\r\n\r\nanyways - I wanted to give you my own props.\r\nyour work is fucking stellar, exactly what I expect and exactly what I have come to expect from you.\r\n\r\nget high and lift your chin up for me - you deserve that and more.'),(13461,'35ae9bb1ff','ok cool you will notice a big different then in top speed.\r\n\r\n  These motors suck in teh first set of ZZ\'s that came out cause the PBC\'s were shit.  But they even make the se\'s kick ass (compared to the stock motors or any of the zz motors)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13462,'4617eb1300','ok thanks\r\n\r\ni also have a 350z and looking to buy a blue porsche (se) from radio shack.'),(13463,'4617eb1300','ok thanks\r\n\r\ni also have a 350z and looking to buy a blue porsche (se) from radio shack.'),(13547,'eea025570d','ok ill ask you for stuff first\r\n\r\nthanks'),(13465,'49dcaee5eb','[quote:49dcaee5eb=\"grnmachnracr\"]im new to the forum and i was wondering if i can post in the \"swap meet \" for an audley, or is it strictly bit and zz stuff?[/quote:49dcaee5eb]I\'m not sure actually. It would be better to ask Cabo that question.\r\n\r\n\r\nDave'),(13466,'2287a839b6','I got about half way home and realized I forgot the box of bits.  I think it was the caffeine.  Well, I\'ll just pick them up Friday or Saturday if I\'m over that way.  Well, keep em safe for me. :)  I\'ll talk to you later.  Had a fun time.'),(13467,'eea908723a','hey man\r\n\r\nim so eager to get my first pullback and im lookin to get a tureno body too... so when i came across your deal i said to my self \"YES!\" and what i am trying to do is make an trade with you for that pullback ae86\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nmicro'),(13468,'eea908723a','hey man\r\n\r\nim so eager to get my first pullback and im lookin to get a tureno body too... so when i came across your deal i said to my self \"YES!\" and what i am trying to do is make an trade with you for that pullback ae86\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nmicro');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13470,'2287a839b6','I got about half way home and realized I forgot the box of bits.  I think it was the caffeine.  Well, I\'ll just pick them up Friday or Saturday if I\'m over that way.  Well, keep em safe for me. :)  I\'ll talk to you later.  Had a fun time.'),(13471,'87514467a8','Yeah man, when I came up stairs, I saw the box.  No worries man, I\'ll keep em safe for ya.\r\n\r\nThanks for stoppin out, and racin.\r\n\r\n-S'),(13473,'87514467a8','Yeah man, when I came up stairs, I saw the box.  No worries man, I\'ll keep em safe for ya.\r\n\r\nThanks for stoppin out, and racin.\r\n\r\n-S'),(13474,'836ccfc4bb','How much do you want for the pullback and the Mat car??  Let me know, I\'m interested. :)'),(13475,'1bbe1b5c81','well what you gots for trade?'),(13476,'9cf174f8a9','just abut anything..its just that i dont know how mutch its worth because ive never bought one\r\n\r\nmicro'),(13477,'4dffdaa6f4','Yea the 350Z\'s are good but I have not seen the Porche se yet just the normal ones'),(13483,'2961e9150d','I heard from the lady in Hong Kong and she gave me a list of what she has left.  It\'s going to be a few weeks before I buy anything else, but if you let me know some stuff you\'re looking for, I\'ll see what I can do.  I did notice that she has the 27 and 35 mhz booster sets in stock.  She even has the original bit racers.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13481,'50b80f67d4','Hello micro i am in Turkey and i can\'t find IRLML2502 fet do you know which part is the cross reference thanks for your helps.'),(13482,'2961e9150d','I heard from the lady in Hong Kong and she gave me a list of what she has left.  It\'s going to be a few weeks before I buy anything else, but if you let me know some stuff you\'re looking for, I\'ll see what I can do.  I did notice that she has the 27 and 35 mhz booster sets in stock.  She even has the original bit racers.'),(13484,'1ba033d552','i saw them at radio shack yesterday, they looked cool.\r\n\r\nwhat do you think is better?????  the regular zzs or the se\'s????'),(13489,'1ba033d552','i saw them at radio shack yesterday, they looked cool.\r\n\r\nwhat do you think is better?????  the regular zzs or the se\'s????'),(31374,'96213f7367','I\'m sorry the heat must have gotten to my brain...and thanks for the area info  :-o \r\n\r\nmarc arcoria\r\np.o.box 158\r\ndrake, north dakota,58736'),(13876,'51b623f96e','DT\r\n\r\nI guess me just getting this now, tells how long since I have been on here... :???: \r\n\r\nActually, if I got what you need in stock, sure Ill hook you up.....gotta take care of those who have helped me get where I got... :smile: \r\n\r\nJust let me know what you are needing and Ill check my stock...\r\n\r\nSorry for the delay getting back to you, but I havent been on here in a serious minute...\r\n\r\nTalk to you soon\r\nTodd');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13544,'b6ac9a5814','It should be there sometime next week.   :) \r\n\r\ndave'),(13545,'9ea0abcb76','you get your ride?'),(13546,'9ea0abcb76','you get your ride?'),(13491,'16a615da03','Well hte SE\'s dont have the torque of a normal zz but they are still cool.  \r\n\r\n  I like the SE\'s but then again the on;y ZZ\'s I have have been modified(changed PBC\'s, duel cells and mosfets)\r\n\r\n  I had the ZZ\'s when they first came out and they sucked.  I have heard that the newer ones are nice might have to get one and see.'),(13492,'cf10549860','ok thanks again.\r\n\r\nthe package is in the mail by now right???????'),(13493,'cf10549860','ok thanks again.\r\n\r\nthe package is in the mail by now right???????'),(13494,'68f9e5638f','I don\'t find irlml2502 in Turkey do you know which parts is the cross reference for irlml2502.\r\n\r\nThanks.'),(14146,'ee04638562','Hey whats up ?\r\n\r\n  Hope all is good....\r\n\r\n  Was wondering if you have an extra ZZ heatsink for sale or trade.  I am one short (even after all teh trade I did for ZZ stuff lol).\r\n\r\n  How you like the Xmod still?   Sessiz has mine on the way so I can\'t wait to play with that &amp; since they just paved my street and I am on a nice hill it should proove to be fun :)'),(13496,'47e9bb8faf','[quote:47e9bb8faf=\"Grunge\"]How much do you want for the pullback and the Mat car??  Let me know, I\'m interested. :)[/quote:47e9bb8faf]\r\n\r\n If it was cash not trade I would want $20usd plus shipping (about 4-5 bucks if you in the states)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13497,'51a572e44b','[quote:51a572e44b=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:51a572e44b=\"Grunge\"]How much do you want for the pullback and the Mat car??  Let me know, I\'m interested. :)[/quote:51a572e44b]\r\n\r\n If it was cash not trade I would want $20usd plus shipping (about 4-5 bucks if you in the states)[/quote:51a572e44b]\r\n\r\nWhat are you interested in for a trade??  I have some nice 3.8 motors and quite a few extra clear bit bodies sitting around.  Ask payaso about the 3.8\'s, he saw them in action last night and was impressed.'),(13498,'51a572e44b','[quote:51a572e44b=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:51a572e44b=\"Grunge\"]How much do you want for the pullback and the Mat car??  Let me know, I\'m interested. :)[/quote:51a572e44b]\r\n\r\n If it was cash not trade I would want $20usd plus shipping (about 4-5 bucks if you in the states)[/quote:51a572e44b]\r\n\r\nWhat are you interested in for a trade??  I have some nice 3.8 motors and quite a few extra clear bit bodies sitting around.  Ask payaso about the 3.8\'s, he saw them in action last night and was impressed.'),(13499,'7a033ec2b8','I have lots of motors (way more then I will ever use).\r\n\r\n  I am looking for ZZ chassies, bit bodies(depends on the body of course), ZZ track, Xmod stuff, other tomy special sets that I dont have. wild char G\'s. ZZ bodies that I dont have, Initial D stuff the list can go on lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13500,'98eb24e170','did u send? i am goinfg to send tomaro sry on the delay man,'),(13501,'98eb24e170','did u send? i am goinfg to send tomaro sry on the delay man,'),(13503,'e0a5dd31bc','Yep the package was sent :)'),(13504,'e729ff374d','thanx man, how did u send...? im shipping prority, i think.. and tell me if any other deals fall thro'),(13505,'3e8266120a','hey i got the car and it onl goes fowrwards\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nmicro'),(13506,'e729ff374d','thanx man, how did u send...? im shipping prority, i think.. and tell me if any other deals fall thro'),(13507,'7a033ec2b8','I have lots of motors (way more then I will ever use).\r\n\r\n  I am looking for ZZ chassies, bit bodies(depends on the body of course), ZZ track, Xmod stuff, other tomy special sets that I dont have. wild char G\'s. ZZ bodies that I dont have, Initial D stuff the list can go on lol'),(13509,'8a43959a16','I sent it air so you should get it in like 5 days or so\r\n\r\nWill let you know for sure dude'),(13510,'5002bc9ae6','tahst cool! its all wraped up and ready to go! just waiting for my mom to bring it to werk to send!! let me know if u want to trade anything else if those trades fall through!! i wanna b the first 2 kno! i really want another bit and want to try an x-trek how is it?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13511,'5002bc9ae6','tahst cool! its all wraped up and ready to go! just waiting for my mom to bring it to werk to send!! let me know if u want to trade anything else if those trades fall through!! i wanna b the first 2 kno! i really want another bit and want to try an x-trek how is it?'),(13513,'7263842bfc','They are fun\r\n\r\n  I like to program all 45 options in it and see what it will do\r\nI try to make it all around the different tracks and shit, the sound is funny as hell.\r\n\r\n  I will let you know when anything comes up'),(13514,'b6d92f5f7a','lol sounds like fun lol yeah man keep me updated!'),(13515,'b6d92f5f7a','lol sounds like fun lol yeah man keep me updated!'),(13516,'a9ffb07494','[quote:a9ffb07494=\"micromatch\"]just abut anything..its just that i dont know how mutch its worth because ive never bought one\r\n\r\nmicro[/quote:a9ffb07494]\r\n\r\n  Pullbacks are worth about $6.00 plus shipping to order them in but the AE86 is a rare one so sometimes they go for alittle bit more.\r\n\r\n  But I am very easy to deal with so if you have a list just sent what you have for trade so I can see.'),(13517,'887b60d2ed','i will trade you some 8.3 mm wt-06 alloys already with the putty filled in the hole and there in perfect condition for them is that good?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nmicro');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13518,'887b60d2ed','i will trade you some 8.3 mm wt-06 alloys already with the putty filled in the hole and there in perfect condition for them is that good?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nmicro'),(13520,'3d4fd68c59','Dude for real I gots all the alloys I need :)\r\n\r\n  I have about 9 sets here that I have not even mounted lol\r\n\r\n  Looking for xmod stuff, ZZ stuff bodies chassies shit like that.\r\n\r\n  I will also sell them but would rather trade.'),(13521,'1f4a28d82d','you fo serious!?!?! i love xmods...i got every xmod up grade..you name it...il trade you man'),(13522,'804524528d','[quote:804524528d=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey I was wondering do you still haave any of the MS fetted cars?  if so what you asking for them cash/trade whatever :)\r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know thanks.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\npete[/quote:804524528d]\r\n\r\n\r\nWell, technically we\'re sold out, as Micromatch proved to be the \"worst case scenario,\" and hue35 and I realized it wasn\'t worth the hassle since we were mostly doing it as a favor for pimps who couldn\'t do it themselves for whatever reason. We were selling them for $30 shipped in the US.\r\n\r\nHere\'s an idea, though: I have one 49mhz yellow Lancer that I haven\'t opened yet, and I have a few fets left. I\'ll do you up a mosfetted car (the yellow Lancer) in trade for your MAT vehicle and the AE86 pullback if you haven\'t already dealt them. Or I\'ll do up a car for you for $30, assuming postage to Canada isn\'t too much more than $4.00.'),(13523,'1f4a28d82d','you fo serious!?!?! i love xmods...i got every xmod up grade..you name it...il trade you man');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (15098,'cd7849dd63','o yea an by the way. its both the controller and the car i am sending you :)'),(13525,'804524528d','[quote:804524528d=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey I was wondering do you still haave any of the MS fetted cars?  if so what you asking for them cash/trade whatever :)\r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know thanks.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\npete[/quote:804524528d]\r\n\r\n\r\nWell, technically we\'re sold out, as Micromatch proved to be the \"worst case scenario,\" and hue35 and I realized it wasn\'t worth the hassle since we were mostly doing it as a favor for pimps who couldn\'t do it themselves for whatever reason. We were selling them for $30 shipped in the US.\r\n\r\nHere\'s an idea, though: I have one 49mhz yellow Lancer that I haven\'t opened yet, and I have a few fets left. I\'ll do you up a mosfetted car (the yellow Lancer) in trade for your MAT vehicle and the AE86 pullback if you haven\'t already dealt them. Or I\'ll do up a car for you for $30, assuming postage to Canada isn\'t too much more than $4.00.'),(16113,'a726fe7bc5','sup dude,\r\n\r\nI wanted to offer up some gallery space to you in our new Galleries section:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php\r\n\r\nif you\'re interested, hit the link above and register - let me know when you do and I\'ll give you permissions to create your own album and upload your own pictures. they would end up in the \"bitPimps Crew Galleries\" like the others:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php?cat=1\r\n\r\nif this isn\'t something you\'re totally into, no sweat - I understand totally and no hard feelings from this side - but I wanted to offer it to you and a few other pimps that I feel deserve it and actually could use it as you guys help out alot pimps even just with the photos you take.\r\n\r\nso let me know what you think either way.\r\n\r\nScott (CaboWabo)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (16114,'a726fe7bc5','sup dude,\r\n\r\nI wanted to offer up some gallery space to you in our new Galleries section:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php\r\n\r\nif you\'re interested, hit the link above and register - let me know when you do and I\'ll give you permissions to create your own album and upload your own pictures. they would end up in the \"bitPimps Crew Galleries\" like the others:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php?cat=1\r\n\r\nif this isn\'t something you\'re totally into, no sweat - I understand totally and no hard feelings from this side - but I wanted to offer it to you and a few other pimps that I feel deserve it and actually could use it as you guys help out alot pimps even just with the photos you take.\r\n\r\nso let me know what you think either way.\r\n\r\nScott (CaboWabo)'),(13527,'75c70eb1de','[quote:75c70eb1de=\"SuperFly\"][quote:75c70eb1de=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey I was wondering do you still haave any of the MS fetted cars?  if so what you asking for them cash/trade whatever :)\r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know thanks.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\npete[/quote:75c70eb1de]\r\n\r\n\r\nWell, technically we\'re sold out, as Micromatch proved to be the \"worst case scenario,\" and hue35 and I realized it wasn\'t worth the hassle since we were mostly doing it as a favor for pimps who couldn\'t do it themselves for whatever reason. We were selling them for $30 shipped in the US.\r\n\r\nHere\'s an idea, though: I have one 49mhz yellow Lancer that I haven\'t opened yet, and I have a few fets left. I\'ll do you up a mosfetted car (the yellow Lancer) in trade for your MAT vehicle and the AE86 pullback if you haven\'t already dealt them. Or I\'ll do up a car for you for $30, assuming postage to Canada isn\'t too much more than $4.00.[/quote:75c70eb1de]\r\n\r\n Sounds cool man I do have a few of the mat cars left(I was almost out but got more in) and I Have more AE\'s aswell(made sure I ordered alot of them for traders and shit).\r\n\r\n  I understand about the whole deal with him but I can asure you if I mess it up in anyway You wont be hearing from me lol.\r\n\r\n  Really I dont understand that kid I have fets from craztdave and micro amps and my cars have been thourhg the ringer lol they still work just fine, the only thing that is going on them is the chassies(stress marks on tabs and shit), so I am not sure what this kid is doing  :???: \r\n\r\nBTX those bodies came in today thanks :)'),(13528,'33ac8368fa','[quote:33ac8368fa=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:33ac8368fa=\"SuperFly\"][quote:33ac8368fa=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey I was wondering do you still haave any of the MS fetted cars?  if so what you asking for them cash/trade whatever :)\r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know thanks.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\npete[/quote:33ac8368fa]\r\n\r\n\r\nWell, technically we\'re sold out, as Micromatch proved to be the \"worst case scenario,\" and hue35 and I realized it wasn\'t worth the hassle since we were mostly doing it as a favor for pimps who couldn\'t do it themselves for whatever reason. We were selling them for $30 shipped in the US.\r\n\r\nHere\'s an idea, though: I have one 49mhz yellow Lancer that I haven\'t opened yet, and I have a few fets left. I\'ll do you up a mosfetted car (the yellow Lancer) in trade for your MAT vehicle and the AE86 pullback if you haven\'t already dealt them. Or I\'ll do up a car for you for $30, assuming postage to Canada isn\'t too much more than $4.00.[/quote:33ac8368fa]\r\n\r\n Sounds cool man I do have a few of the mat cars left(I was almost out but got more in) and I Have more AE\'s aswell(made sure I ordered alot of them for traders and shit).\r\n\r\n  I understand about the whole deal with him but I can asure you if I mess it up in anyway You wont be hearing from me lol.\r\n\r\n  Really I dont understand that kid I have fets from craztdave and micro amps and my cars have been thourhg the ringer lol they still work just fine, the only thing that is going on them is the chassies(stress marks on tabs and shit), so I am not sure what this kid is doing  :???: \r\n\r\nBTX those bodies came in today thanks :)[/quote:33ac8368fa]\r\n\r\n\r\nHey! The Skyline bodies just showed up here, too! Cool. Thanks for the bonus homies.\r\n\r\nThe only other thing about the mosfet car deal is that hopefully I\'ll be able to do the mod this weekend and send it next week, but it\'s entirely possible I might not be able to get it done till late next week. I\'ve got a lot on my plate right now and it takes an hour or two to do the mod, plus post office, etc. Just want to be upfront that I have a really busy week coming up, but I\'ll do my best.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13529,'33ac8368fa','[quote:33ac8368fa=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:33ac8368fa=\"SuperFly\"][quote:33ac8368fa=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey I was wondering do you still haave any of the MS fetted cars?  if so what you asking for them cash/trade whatever :)\r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know thanks.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\npete[/quote:33ac8368fa]\r\n\r\n\r\nWell, technically we\'re sold out, as Micromatch proved to be the \"worst case scenario,\" and hue35 and I realized it wasn\'t worth the hassle since we were mostly doing it as a favor for pimps who couldn\'t do it themselves for whatever reason. We were selling them for $30 shipped in the US.\r\n\r\nHere\'s an idea, though: I have one 49mhz yellow Lancer that I haven\'t opened yet, and I have a few fets left. I\'ll do you up a mosfetted car (the yellow Lancer) in trade for your MAT vehicle and the AE86 pullback if you haven\'t already dealt them. Or I\'ll do up a car for you for $30, assuming postage to Canada isn\'t too much more than $4.00.[/quote:33ac8368fa]\r\n\r\n Sounds cool man I do have a few of the mat cars left(I was almost out but got more in) and I Have more AE\'s aswell(made sure I ordered alot of them for traders and shit).\r\n\r\n  I understand about the whole deal with him but I can asure you if I mess it up in anyway You wont be hearing from me lol.\r\n\r\n  Really I dont understand that kid I have fets from craztdave and micro amps and my cars have been thourhg the ringer lol they still work just fine, the only thing that is going on them is the chassies(stress marks on tabs and shit), so I am not sure what this kid is doing  :???: \r\n\r\nBTX those bodies came in today thanks :)[/quote:33ac8368fa]\r\n\r\n\r\nHey! The Skyline bodies just showed up here, too! Cool. Thanks for the bonus homies.\r\n\r\nThe only other thing about the mosfet car deal is that hopefully I\'ll be able to do the mod this weekend and send it next week, but it\'s entirely possible I might not be able to get it done till late next week. I\'ve got a lot on my plate right now and it takes an hour or two to do the mod, plus post office, etc. Just want to be upfront that I have a really busy week coming up, but I\'ll do my best.'),(16110,'d25be0d13a','just to let you know we would like you to be a judge for the moderator contest');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (16111,'8809d65570','gerday! i\'ve been asked to be a judge on the comp! woo hoo! official duties! and i\'m donating a prize and thought between the 2 of us we could come up with something sweet. i\'m providing: \r\n\r\nlxx suspension chassis,\r\ncustom lego wheelset,\r\nred hummer shell.\r\n\r\ni can\'t really afford any more generosity, broke dole bludger! get in touch and we\'ll sort it out.\r\n\r\nseeya, trent.'),(23824,'c6f4bceced','You still got teh xmod stuff for sale?'),(36856,'4ce5faef33','Thanx for the quick reply.\r\n\r\nI\'ll try to mustor $140 to be safe. Any word yet from GPM on the price of the front/rear gearbox pairs? Even an estimated price?\r\n\r\nAnyhow, we\'ll be in touch. I\'ve figured a way to pay you, I\'ll use my frind\'s paypal in the states. When My brother ges up there, I\'ll send the cash with him.\r\n\r\nMaxx'),(36868,'5f2d0721d8','dragonplate will cut stuff for you, but the first time it is very expensive. i got a quote for over $100, just for chassis plates.\r\n\r\ni would look around in the yellow pages.'),(36869,'e13c5b8f4e','Thanks dude. Works good. Basically what I want to do is have all Taylors movies on the left and the media player on the right. When you click one of the movies it plays in the side media player.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (27332,'20a2e2857b','That totally helps out a ton.  Thanks, bro.  I\'ll keep you on my upsoming \"Respeck Nuckles\" List (something for all forums I go to).  I\'ve been to Toysn\'Joys, and I expect I\'ll be there again sooner than later.\r\n\r\nFreaking sucks that TOMY seems to be pulling out of the Bit biz, huh?\r\nThere is still so much they can do with bits that hasn\'t even been done yet,\r\ntoo!\r\n\r\nLate,\r\nAbe'),(13531,'809ccd0b74','[quote:809ccd0b74=\"SuperFly\"][quote:809ccd0b74=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:809ccd0b74=\"SuperFly\"][quote:809ccd0b74=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey I was wondering do you still haave any of the MS fetted cars?  if so what you asking for them cash/trade whatever :)\r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know thanks.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\npete[/quote:809ccd0b74]\r\n\r\n\r\nWell, technically we\'re sold out, as Micromatch proved to be the \"worst case scenario,\" and hue35 and I realized it wasn\'t worth the hassle since we were mostly doing it as a favor for pimps who couldn\'t do it themselves for whatever reason. We were selling them for $30 shipped in the US.\r\n\r\nHere\'s an idea, though: I have one 49mhz yellow Lancer that I haven\'t opened yet, and I have a few fets left. I\'ll do you up a mosfetted car (the yellow Lancer) in trade for your MAT vehicle and the AE86 pullback if you haven\'t already dealt them. Or I\'ll do up a car for you for $30, assuming postage to Canada isn\'t too much more than $4.00.[/quote:809ccd0b74]\r\n\r\n Sounds cool man I do have a few of the mat cars left(I was almost out but got more in) and I Have more AE\'s aswell(made sure I ordered alot of them for traders and shit).\r\n\r\n  I understand about the whole deal with him but I can asure you if I mess it up in anyway You wont be hearing from me lol.\r\n\r\n  Really I dont understand that kid I have fets from craztdave and micro amps and my cars have been thourhg the ringer lol they still work just fine, the only thing that is going on them is the chassies(stress marks on tabs and shit), so I am not sure what this kid is doing  :???: \r\n\r\nBTX those bodies came in today thanks :)[/quote:809ccd0b74]\r\n\r\n\r\nHey! The Skyline bodies just showed up here, too! Cool. Thanks for the bonus homies.\r\n\r\nThe only other thing about the mosfet car deal is that hopefully I\'ll be able to do the mod this weekend and send it next week, but it\'s entirely possible I might not be able to get it done till late next week. I\'ve got a lot on my plate right now and it takes an hour or two to do the mod, plus post office, etc. Just want to be upfront that I have a really busy week coming up, but I\'ll do my best.[/quote:809ccd0b74]\r\n\r\n\r\n  Dude you should know that its all good :)\r\n\r\n I know it will got out sometime lol, I know what its like being bogged down sometimes.  I am free most the time now but whne the perental leave is up and I have to \"work\" again I will be busy as shit seeing as some dumb ass has been running my department for the last 8 months lol.\r\n\r\n  When ever you get the time dude, get the important stuff done first then sent it.  I am in no hurry :)'),(13532,'166d0fa82c','[quote:166d0fa82c=\"micromatch\"]you fo serious!?!?! i love xmods...i got every xmod up grade..you name it...il trade you man[/quote:166d0fa82c]\r\n\r\n Let me know what you have in mind');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13533,'c4f74b4cc2','red 30k rpm drag racing motor?'),(13534,'c4f74b4cc2','red 30k rpm drag racing motor?'),(13536,'9c2082db22','Hello hog do you know company that sells this shits and make international shipping. Beacuse i can\'t find it in Turkey.\r\n\r\nThanks.'),(13537,'0b595b50b4','whats that mosfets?? digikey.com i dont know about international shipping tho. superfly would probably sell you some.'),(13538,'0b595b50b4','whats that mosfets?? digikey.com i dont know about international shipping tho. superfly would probably sell you some.'),(13539,'1eae113089','Yep you should get it by this time next week.\r\n\r\n  If you are looking for other stuff let me know I always have stuff in.'),(13540,'12c5892f06','what\'s the new word on my bit?'),(13541,'eea025570d','ok ill ask you for stuff first\r\n\r\nthanks'),(13551,'23f8461456','Yea man not a prob :)\r\n\r\n  I will pack it up and send it off with Superflys on monday :)'),(13552,'cbf3ed329f','ddue im gona try to send tomaro cuz the stupid pririty mail peeps would take it top canada! urrr..... i willk run to my local staples and send it ther  2maro i hope');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13553,'cbf3ed329f','ddue im gona try to send tomaro cuz the stupid pririty mail peeps would take it top canada! urrr..... i willk run to my local staples and send it ther  2maro i hope'),(13554,'6f944082c6','Excellent, can you give me the payment info again? (how much $ and the email address I plug into PayPal)\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nhue35'),(16064,'3da09903a8','I have sent a messaage to Ph2t to see if he can make a mod for me that I\'d like to donate as a prize. A new ZipZap SE Starsky &amp; Hutch 1976 Ford Gran Torino. I asked if he could fet mod it and add the light kit. Not sure what place should get it though.'),(13557,'ecc762d1ec','Do you need paypal info? or we can wait till later upto you, but it will be send on monday regardless :)'),(19618,'794dde379c','Did you get the moola bro?'),(19626,'83d79bcfb2','Sexy dude.  I\'ll pm ya when I get it this time  :-)'),(13559,'7bcb02abee','LOL I just PMed you about that.\r\n\r\n  Well was 13+shipping but since it going with another package just add 2 bucks :)  so 15 total cool with you?\r\n\r\nvoodoomafia@sympatico.ca'),(13560,'52cf50ac5c','Sounds good, so should I use the voodoomafia@sympatico.ca address for PayPal?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13563,'a1e8448e0a','Yea thats cool :)'),(13564,'65ec2c423f','Just sent you the money. Thanks again, VDM.'),(13568,'a9d3814b8b','Thanks dude, I am gonna try and get these out to you and superfly tomorrow but if not monday for sure.\r\n\r\n  Hey not sure if you are into them but the lambo and ferrari sets are at toyeast for 30 bones each not a bad deal :)'),(13569,'c091fb831e','No rush man, I think SuperFly is gonna be at least a week out gettin\' the mosfet car to you. (not to speak for him, but I know he\'s workin\' around the clock these days)... so whenever it\'s easy for you.\r\n\r\nYeah, ToyEast is a dangerous place. I try to order only once in a while so I can order big and save on shipping. Toys... they\'re more addictive than drugs. 8-) \r\n\r\nlater...'),(16061,'453b6242b6','i sent it to your email address.'),(16062,'92e1c6fa62','[quote:92e1c6fa62=\"MadScott\"]I\'m trying to sell out my 1/64 stuff and wanted to see if I could list it here in the selling section.  My post count isn\'t over 50, I didn\'t want to break a rule, so I figured I\'d ask you first.  No big either way.  \r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nMS[/quote:92e1c6fa62]go for it man - good luck\r\nsorry to hear you\'re selling all your stuff though'),(13572,'15be0e22d0','Yea i told superfly not to rush to get everything else he has going on done first as I hate to rush people lol.\r\n\r\n  Yea TE is very addictive thats for sure I got my habbbit with them down to 1 order a month so that s not that bad.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13573,'afe2321fea','You get your 512BB yet???!'),(13576,'37c335f843','Not yet. Hoping it comes tomorrow.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13577,'64ff9e6894','It better! :('),(14786,'fa804294d2','i I am a noob to the forus adn was wondering how like you make your antenna different colors other than gray and when your painting a c,ear body do u prime and paint on the outside or inside. thnx ffor all your help'),(13579,'50b80f67d4','Hello micro i am in Turkey and i can\'t find IRLML2502 fet do you know which part is the cross reference thanks for your helps.'),(13580,'03e0ae0b0b','Sorry Kuzgun, I dont know if they have a equivilent part.\r\nI buy mine online from www.conrad.de  I dont know if tht is any help.\r\nGoodluck modding\r\nuA  :)'),(13581,'03e0ae0b0b','Sorry Kuzgun, I dont know if they have a equivilent part.\r\nI buy mine online from www.conrad.de  I dont know if tht is any help.\r\nGoodluck modding\r\nuA  :)'),(13582,'71e27dc7f7','Well let me know when you send it so I can keep my eye on the mail');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13583,'631b165c4b','Hey Cheese,\r\nwe\'re getting some complaints about the size of your avatar.\r\nI\'m going to have to delete your current avatar.\r\nplease use these dimensions: 80 pixels x 80 pixels\r\n\r\nsorry about the avatar\r\nthanks pimp!'),(13584,'5164a37cc1','Sorry \'bout that myimgs.com had a hiccup with my image I think. Next time I\'ll just upload it.\r\n\r\nSorry \'bout my disturbing avatar man.'),(13585,'84e24fe842','i rode my sk8board in 50 mph winds to go to my local staples, btu then i had to leave because i needed your phone #??!!!! thats what they said, so im just gonna give em mine or if ur safe giving me urs, thats would be good, thank you'),(13586,'84e24fe842','i rode my sk8board in 50 mph winds to go to my local staples, btu then i had to leave because i needed your phone #??!!!! thats what they said, so im just gonna give em mine or if ur safe giving me urs, thats would be good, thank you'),(15097,'bd7105ac15','i might be able to get you a 150 mah batt but i dont need any bods orany thing man :lol:  thanks tho but if youever need any zz stuff just tell me cause i can get free shipping and some times even free stuff :lol:  :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTHanks\r\nmicro');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13589,'a1cf173501','[quote:a1cf173501=\"micromatch\"]red 30k rpm drag racing motor?[/quote:a1cf173501]\r\n\r\n  Thats from the stage@ motor set right?\r\n\r\n  Yea I already have that.\r\n\r\n  Hey you have any ZZ track? I will trade for that or the Xmods light set'),(13590,'6e6d9a56f3','i aint got zz track or lightset'),(13591,'6e6d9a56f3','i aint got zz track or lightset'),(13592,'5164a37cc1','Sorry \'bout that myimgs.com had a hiccup with my image I think. Next time I\'ll just upload it.\r\n\r\nSorry \'bout my disturbing avatar man.'),(13593,'d51f48f2da','[quote:d51f48f2da=\"CheeseWarfare\"]Sorry \'bout that myimgs.com had a hiccup with my image I think. Next time I\'ll just upload it.\r\n\r\nSorry \'bout my disturbing avatar man.[/quote:d51f48f2da]no sweat man, just wanted to let ya know so you didn\'t think it just disappeared on it\'s own.\r\n\r\nthanks man!'),(15096,'2be9bd9867','[quote:2be9bd9867=\"fook yu\"]I recieved the wheels yesterday. Thanks again ph2t.[/quote:2be9bd9867]\r\n\r\ncoolies, glad to hear they got there OK dude.\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(13595,'ab6478bb30','what else you gots to trade?  I take cash but I would rather trade cause the shipping on 1 pullback is like 4 bucks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13596,'df067d14cb','were do you live?\r\n\r\n  I have delt with over 50 pimps on that site and lots elsewhere and never heard of anyone having so many probs with shipping stuff out to me  :???:'),(13597,'a4d5732cbe','in delaware. ya man i wil definety ship tomaro! :shock:  i will put down my phone # instead and it should werk out.'),(13598,'a4d5732cbe','in delaware. ya man i wil definety ship tomaro! :shock:  i will put down my phone # instead and it should werk out.'),(13599,'d51f48f2da','[quote:d51f48f2da=\"CheeseWarfare\"]Sorry \'bout that myimgs.com had a hiccup with my image I think. Next time I\'ll just upload it.\r\n\r\nSorry \'bout my disturbing avatar man.[/quote:d51f48f2da]no sweat man, just wanted to let ya know so you didn\'t think it just disappeared on it\'s own.\r\n\r\nthanks man!'),(13601,'24430e1c43','I was being sarcastic with asking \"were you lived\" I mailed stuff off so I have the address LOL\r\n\r\nBut yea I have never heard of a prob like that how are you sending it?'),(13602,'2e7251c389','ups\r\nand i bought a tube 4 my bike so i can ride up and it will b shipped tomaro\r\nwhen can i expect to see this package from u?\r\ndont wry bout me jipping u , if u are worried, i have shipped to many pleseed customers.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13603,'2e7251c389','ups\r\nand i bought a tube 4 my bike so i can ride up and it will b shipped tomaro\r\nwhen can i expect to see this package from u?\r\ndont wry bout me jipping u , if u are worried, i have shipped to many pleseed customers.'),(13605,'571d51fcee','You should see it middle of next week\r\nall I ask is that you mark the package as value less then $20.00 and as a gift'),(13606,'2935398d4e','huh?????'),(13607,'2935398d4e','huh?????'),(19176,'962ade8a62','well even though I can\'t say it like this publicly without driving away many others - I had to let you know this...\r\n\r\nsince I got my most favorite ever car stolen, I was forced to use another car as my \"main\" chassis and another for my \"2nd to main\" chassis.\r\n\r\nI\'ve gotten mods from ph2t, superfly, and you.\r\nhands down - you kick all their asses combined on the chassis mod, fet modding specifically but I\'m willing to be the rest of it as well.\r\n\r\nI ended up giving superfly\'s fet to Hiroto as part of his contest prize, ph2t\'s shit I\'ve been pissed with since day 1 except for the micro switch.\r\nbut yours, the 1st fet mod you did (which is used on my V-Dub) is my new favorite (used to me 2nd to main). that chassis with my V-Dub shell has seen more miles than some taxi\'s and has the battle wounds to prove it. the last chassis you did for me is my new 2nd favorite (2nd to main). I love it - and probably the only reason why it\'s not #1 is because it\'s the only fet\'ed dual cell I have - and have ever had.\r\n\r\nanyways - I wanted to give you my own props.\r\nyour work is fucking stellar, exactly what I expect and exactly what I have come to expect from you.\r\n\r\nget high and lift your chin up for me - you deserve that and more.'),(13609,'6b8d59e57c','You asked when you should be seeing the one I send I said next week should be in.\r\n\r\n  Now when you send a package to me here in Canada you will have to fill out some info like what is in the package, how much its worth and if its a gift or murchandise (same as I have to do with stuff going to the states) this is for customs.\r\n\r\n  i ask that you mark it a value of less then $20(put 10 or 15) and mark it as  a gift or customs will charge me.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13610,'f4a75208a4','oh np man i didnt understand wwhat u were sayin lol, i have a bike tire now so i can be fatser lol'),(13611,'f4a75208a4','oh np man i didnt understand wwhat u were sayin lol, i have a bike tire now so i can be fatser lol'),(13613,'5c3c51ba35','Thats what the cars are for, bits are for driving drunk real cars are for racing and cruisin'),(13614,'5f39d042e0','yah i got a 96; lexus es 300  the pimp mobile lol'),(13615,'5f39d042e0','yah i got a 96; lexus es 300  the pimp mobile lol'),(13617,'64e3531dd1','Then why you skated in the wind and bike\'n it?'),(13618,'b49494f9f7','cuz im 14 and would get arrested lol, but it is my car when i can drive'),(13619,'b49494f9f7','cuz im 14 and would get arrested lol, but it is my car when i can drive'),(13621,'07bfd40293','Is that what your parents have?\r\n\r\n  I am not a big lexus fan myself'),(13622,'cc9c3ee792','well its my mom\'s daily driver right now, but neither am i but hey ill live with it\r\ni myself perfer either a supra a rx-7 or any old muscle car!'),(13623,'cc9c3ee792','well its my mom\'s daily driver right now, but neither am i but hey ill live with it\r\ni myself perfer either a supra a rx-7 or any old muscle car!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19609,'ac10005506','[quote:ac10005506=\"hue35\"]\r\nAndre Williams is oooold school Detroit. He was makin\' records in the 50s through the 60s and burned out, drugged and boozed out. He made a comeback in the 90s, and had the Detroit garage scene backin\' him in various combinations. He\'s an old black dude that dresses like a pimp and is funny as hell. If you don\'t know this stuff, then I\'m definitely sendin\' some your way... two of his best records are on the same label as the Dirtbombs disc you sent me (and this is where I\'d heard their name before). [/quote:ac10005506]That\'s where I knew that name. \r\n\r\nI had a subscription to emusic.com. Unlimited access to a bunch of indie labels. I used to just browse by label. I more than likely have Andre Williams archived in my MP3 CDs somewhere.\r\n\r\n\r\n...AND there is a slight slight chance he is singing on that Dirtbombs CD. I could have sworn he was credited in the description, that\'s why I got confused about your question, and the other Dirtbombs CD sound not even remotley the same, so now I\'m wondering if this was a one off collaboration with Andre Williams.\r\n\r\ndave'),(13625,'4ca6c4df12','[quote:4ca6c4df12=\"grnmachnracr\"]well its my mom\'s daily driver right now, but neither am i but hey ill live with it\r\ni myself perfer either a supra a rx-7 or any old muscle car![/quote:4ca6c4df12]\r\n\r\n  Yep I love the supras and RX-7\'s \r\n\r\nAswell as muscle cars my first car was a 69 nova SS(still have it just doesn\'t move that much)\r\n\r\n  Right now I have a z22, Aztek and a eagle vista');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13626,'d61741f5ab','yeah we have the car that was based on the aztec but without the relally ugly body, the buick rendezvous and my dad has a 1972 buick skylark 455  :eek:  :-(  :-D'),(13627,'d61741f5ab','yeah we have the car that was based on the aztec but without the relally ugly body, the buick rendezvous and my dad has a 1972 buick skylark 455  :eek:  :-(  :-D'),(13632,'7354a1310b','[quote:7354a1310b=\"grnmachnracr\"]whats ur phone nuimberr so i can send b4 other wise it wont ship untill monday!!![/quote:7354a1310b]\r\n\r\n905-227-2498'),(13633,'38cb68ef8b','Yo got it yet boi?\r\n\r\n\r\n-B'),(13635,'249fdb58f5','i shipped and the tracking # is 1Z5AR5066800031252 THE  BAD NEW IS IT WONT SGHIP UNTILL  monday... but 9i got it shipped! and i said it was worth 15$ and it was named toy cars and it was a gift  :grin:  just how u wanted it. Thank you for doing buisness'),(13636,'249fdb58f5','i shipped and the tracking # is 1Z5AR5066800031252 THE  BAD NEW IS IT WONT SGHIP UNTILL  monday... but 9i got it shipped! and i said it was worth 15$ and it was named toy cars and it was a gift  :grin:  just how u wanted it. Thank you for doing buisness'),(13637,'c35167d6e9','Hell yeah man. Got it on Fri.  Runs like a champ.\r\n\r\nThanks dood.\r\n\r\n_s');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13638,'9e1d411bb0','Hey, what\'s up?\r\n\r\nHadn\'t seen you around much in the last week. Then I seen you\'ve had computer problems, so I figured that must explain it.\r\n\r\nAnyways, finally got an auction up for one of my cars. It\'s just a FET modded Thunder Charger, but I\'m about to put up another for a dual cell FET modded Zip zap right now.\r\n\r\nCheck it out, let me know what you think.\r\nhttp://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3157114442\r\n\r\nDave'),(13639,'9e1d411bb0','Hey, what\'s up?\r\n\r\nHadn\'t seen you around much in the last week. Then I seen you\'ve had computer problems, so I figured that must explain it.\r\n\r\nAnyways, finally got an auction up for one of my cars. It\'s just a FET modded Thunder Charger, but I\'m about to put up another for a dual cell FET modded Zip zap right now.\r\n\r\nCheck it out, let me know what you think.\r\nhttp://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3157114442\r\n\r\nDave'),(13640,'d14e1f791e','Yea man I got a boot virus and was lucky that I had 2 harddrives so I could switch the master and slave to boot up my win2k cd and install it.\r\n\r\n  But that meant I lost all my files on teh socond HD aswell as the install would not continue till I formated(all my pics movies everything :( )\r\n\r\nBut that was just the start.  Got it formated and installed to then have to kill the boot sector on the drive that had the virus.\r\n\r\n  The the mother board blew(had intergraded chip) and since I am using SD ram I couldn\'t take the cheap way out and get another intergraded board without getting DDR ram.\r\n\r\n  So I had to get a motherboard and I picked up a Athlon XP 2100+ chip (good thing it only cost $170 cnd for both).\r\n\r\n  So I install everything and it takes a few days to get rid of spyware and 3rd party shit(I hate to pay for programes lol).\r\n\r\n  Now even though I updated my pioneer A05 firmware it still wont read any kind of blank media.  Thats whats killing me cause that what I use for all my extra cash(selling ps2,xbox games, and dvd screener movies).  So the requests keep coming in but I cant fill them.  I know its not the drive cause it would not read anything if it was.\r\n\r\n  I think its maybe the bios setting on the new motherboard or something not really sure.\r\n\r\n\r\n  but anyway\r\n\r\n  Hells yea that car looks sweat.  I can tell yea this that I will be bidding on it for sure and if I dont win you will proly be happy with what you get for it for sure.\r\n\r\n\r\nMan I went to the asian market mall this weekend and the prices just killed me.  Everything else there is cheap but not there rc stuff.  The new superbit speed sets were 26.50 cnd, when I get them for $9.00 US (about $13.00 cnd) and the bit (ultraman, and other LE sets) were like 65 cnd.  man I sell the Mat cars for $13.00US.  Thats ok I have some extras I am conna take them in and say I bought them but they are wrng ones and trade for sets I dont have.\r\n\r\n  you should make some good money on ebay with those and I was thinking even just painted bodies(no chassie) you should try.  Not sure what you get them for but should be cheap.\r\n\r\n  I should have some more paypal this week(damn slow payers) and I will toss some cash your way for the other fets but not ure whn they wil lget sent lol.\r\n\r\n  Man not sure if any of the above made sence my mind is all over the place cause this burner.  I have $30 games &amp; movies to do at $10.00 each and I could use the cash for more of my hobby stuff.\r\n\r\n\r\nGrr well that was proly a rant in a half lol\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13641,'d14e1f791e','Yea man I got a boot virus and was lucky that I had 2 harddrives so I could switch the master and slave to boot up my win2k cd and install it.\r\n\r\n  But that meant I lost all my files on teh socond HD aswell as the install would not continue till I formated(all my pics movies everything :( )\r\n\r\nBut that was just the start.  Got it formated and installed to then have to kill the boot sector on the drive that had the virus.\r\n\r\n  The the mother board blew(had intergraded chip) and since I am using SD ram I couldn\'t take the cheap way out and get another intergraded board without getting DDR ram.\r\n\r\n  So I had to get a motherboard and I picked up a Athlon XP 2100+ chip (good thing it only cost $170 cnd for both).\r\n\r\n  So I install everything and it takes a few days to get rid of spyware and 3rd party shit(I hate to pay for programes lol).\r\n\r\n  Now even though I updated my pioneer A05 firmware it still wont read any kind of blank media.  Thats whats killing me cause that what I use for all my extra cash(selling ps2,xbox games, and dvd screener movies).  So the requests keep coming in but I cant fill them.  I know its not the drive cause it would not read anything if it was.\r\n\r\n  I think its maybe the bios setting on the new motherboard or something not really sure.\r\n\r\n\r\n  but anyway\r\n\r\n  Hells yea that car looks sweat.  I can tell yea this that I will be bidding on it for sure and if I dont win you will proly be happy with what you get for it for sure.\r\n\r\n\r\nMan I went to the asian market mall this weekend and the prices just killed me.  Everything else there is cheap but not there rc stuff.  The new superbit speed sets were 26.50 cnd, when I get them for $9.00 US (about $13.00 cnd) and the bit (ultraman, and other LE sets) were like 65 cnd.  man I sell the Mat cars for $13.00US.  Thats ok I have some extras I am conna take them in and say I bought them but they are wrng ones and trade for sets I dont have.\r\n\r\n  you should make some good money on ebay with those and I was thinking even just painted bodies(no chassie) you should try.  Not sure what you get them for but should be cheap.\r\n\r\n  I should have some more paypal this week(damn slow payers) and I will toss some cash your way for the other fets but not ure whn they wil lget sent lol.\r\n\r\n  Man not sure if any of the above made sence my mind is all over the place cause this burner.  I have $30 games &amp; movies to do at $10.00 each and I could use the cash for more of my hobby stuff.\r\n\r\n\r\nGrr well that was proly a rant in a half lol\r\nPete'),(13642,'ce24a27db9','You lost me man.  :shock: \r\n\r\nJust kidding, seriously, that\'s  really bumming what happened to your system. If anything like that happened to me, I would never be able to afford to fix it.  :lol: \r\n\r\nWell anyways, I decided to keep that stretched Micro Speed, and sell my own car in the same frequency instead. I was too lazy to custom paint it, and then realized I would probably make more selling mods like paint jobs separate, instead of piling them on top of so many other mods.\r\n\r\nSo here\'s the Zip Zap I\'m selling. It\'s a beast.\r\nhttp://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3157149832\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13643,'ce24a27db9','You lost me man.  :shock: \r\n\r\nJust kidding, seriously, that\'s  really bumming what happened to your system. If anything like that happened to me, I would never be able to afford to fix it.  :lol: \r\n\r\nWell anyways, I decided to keep that stretched Micro Speed, and sell my own car in the same frequency instead. I was too lazy to custom paint it, and then realized I would probably make more selling mods like paint jobs separate, instead of piling them on top of so many other mods.\r\n\r\nSo here\'s the Zip Zap I\'m selling. It\'s a beast.\r\nhttp://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3157149832\r\n\r\nDave'),(13644,'c35167d6e9','Hell yeah man. Got it on Fri.  Runs like a champ.\r\n\r\nThanks dood.\r\n\r\n_s'),(13645,'a2b37e2871','word. hopefully in time to spank some peoples on the track.'),(13933,'6c3b4b274f','yea I have 1 mat car left\r\n\r\nSTill $13.00 plus shipping   also\r\n\r\nI have 1 200MAH battery $3.00\r\n\r\n1 Tureno (ae86) pullback (body fits on bits and the wheels are great to use)  $8.00\r\n\r\n  And some various motors (low torque &amp; high torque) \r\n\r\nPlus lots of various things around'),(13934,'3a5ffdb7d5','does the car come with a controller??? what kind of car is it??? has it been used???');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13649,'a2b37e2871','word. hopefully in time to spank some peoples on the track.'),(13650,'06344f4abf','I\'m gonna smash the track record to bits with this thing.  I\'ll let you guys know how I do.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13651,'06344f4abf','I\'m gonna smash the track record to bits with this thing.  I\'ll let you guys know how I do.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13652,'b9c3e530fb','What up big pimpin . I was wonder\'n if you could help me wit some quests i got ? I need to extend 1 o my Shen chassis to fit a ZZ body ! Could u kick some o yo wisdom 2 me bout dat yo ? How do i keep the chass. straight ,and what to use to rebuild the sides o tha chass. ? I been BORED wit no job ! I need to start moddin sumptin ! You got much wisdom yo ! I gots plenty o time ,and u seem to be busy on dem bad ass rides u be bangin out !! So when ever u can hit me up pimp ! Thanx 4 yo time  DarkTari !   : Stalker :-)'),(13654,'9e50d148f0','Yo Dog,\r\n\r\nSorry to hear about da job situation, bummer.  I never stretched a chassis before, haven\'t gotten to do one yet.  Hit up on Ripper77777, he\'s a pro at dat shit !  He\'s make dragsters, funny cars, etc.  Holla at \'em !  Sorry I couldn\'t help ya !'),(14101,'22a4aac01b','Merry Christmas to you to :-), i keep on forgetting it is only 3 weeks or so.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13658,'bcb6eb3adf','Dats enough help fo me Pimpin , like i said i got PLENTY o time on my hands ! I lost my JOB 4 hittin some fags who messed my ride up !  :smile:  I\'m outa here like last year on a mission !  Stalker'),(13659,'45d62ed00e','haha. well i had to get payaso\'s out first cuz he was first in line. yours will be  soon. i have a whole toolbox full o stuff. itl be a big bag i promise. haha'),(13660,'05096d3321','n/p dude. Just giving a reminder thats all\r\n\r\nHaven;t been playing with my Bits much. Kinda busy with my divorce and all that shit plus I get no time to my self anymore since I have my kid 4 days a week now'),(13661,'2109763045','Sup , dog . DarkTari said you could prob help ! Could you give me some pointers on strechin a Shen Chassis to fit ZZ bodys ? I need to know what 2 use to put tha chassis together after its cut ! And how do you keep tha chassis straight so it wil still function normaly ? Thanx 4 yo time ! : Stalker'),(13662,'c699634e19','Here\'s a link to a tutorial, if that doesn\'t help let me know, I can\'t remember how much detail I went into but there are some good pics.\r\n\r\nThe basics:\r\n\r\nI use thin lexan, and I make sure I cut it square, then glue it down inside the chassis bumping up against the front and the battery holders.  After thats done I glue the sides on.  I\'ve stretched wuite few chassis\'s so if you need more specific questions answered feel free to ask.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.microrccenter.com/forum/index.php?showtopic=7792');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13663,'dd55deb738','Yo Fly,\r\n\r\nHow\'s da family Pimp?  Hope all is well.\r\nDid you ever get da cash for da FET\'s?\r\n\r\nThanx!'),(13667,'04b7e7246b','ya dude same boat here. ive started to emerge from the tunnel and now i see all these chicks that need to be sitting down next to me. haha.'),(13668,'10b8ec1770','[quote:10b8ec1770=\"DarkTari\"]Yo Fly,\r\n\r\nHow\'s da family Pimp?  Hope all is well.\r\nDid you ever get da cash for da FET\'s?\r\n\r\nThanx![/quote:10b8ec1770]\r\n\r\nHey DT-\r\n\r\nFamily is better this week, even the cat. Thanks for asking. I did get the funds. Had to go ask my wife \"Is there a stack of unopened mail somewhere?\" You know, things like mail just get tossed on the dining room table, unexpected guests show up, table gets quickly cleaned, and 6 months later you find a stack of unopened mail. Anyway, I got it and I\'ll drop those in the mail tomorrow.\r\n\r\nTake care,\r\nSuperFly'),(33227,'9dd391a294','[quote:9dd391a294=\"pimpsmurf\"]Balsa products just got them back in stock, but they don\'t seem to offer faster shipping. I guess we should go with the place in florida because they have faster shipping options, which is only $3US more all together.\r\n\r\n-JNY[/quote:9dd391a294]\r\n\r\n\r\ncool banannas, you want me to pay you now?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24451,'001644acf3','Yo I spoke with Daveand told him that my wife was in the hospital and that it was coming out the pockey for the bills and to plz hold the car he then told me that he may wanted to keep the car but I told him if that\'s what he wanted to do then that was fine and he in returned told me nah and that he understood my position and to let him know when i would be getting the car and I told hom that it would be this week here. So yes I am getting the car I am not some mark to be palying like that sorry if it seen that way Pimp\'s up hoes down.'),(13670,'81f995c82f','That\'s good to hear SF, now all\'s rights with the world again!\r\n\r\nThanx for the FETs, When I ready to start moddin, I may contact you for some pointers!\r\n\r\nThanx Again Pimp!'),(13671,'c699634e19','Here\'s a link to a tutorial, if that doesn\'t help let me know, I can\'t remember how much detail I went into but there are some good pics.\r\n\r\nThe basics:\r\n\r\nI use thin lexan, and I make sure I cut it square, then glue it down inside the chassis bumping up against the front and the battery holders.  After thats done I glue the sides on.  I\'ve stretched wuite few chassis\'s so if you need more specific questions answered feel free to ask.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.microrccenter.com/forum/index.php?showtopic=7792'),(13673,'894ccab5f5','[quote:894ccab5f5=\"crazydave\"]You lost me man.  :shock: \r\n\r\nJust kidding, seriously, that\'s  really bumming what happened to your system. If anything like that happened to me, I would never be able to afford to fix it.  :lol: \r\n\r\nWell anyways, I decided to keep that stretched Micro Speed, and sell my own car in the same frequency instead. I was too lazy to custom paint it, and then realized I would probably make more selling mods like paint jobs separate, instead of piling them on top of so many other mods.\r\n\r\nSo here\'s the Zip Zap I\'m selling. It\'s a beast.\r\nhttp://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3157149832\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:894ccab5f5]\r\n\r\n  I see your zip zaps car has some bids on it so thats good &amp; considering there is lots of time left on them.\r\n\r\n  I ment to ask last time how the se fets were going (or not going).');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13674,'894ccab5f5','[quote:894ccab5f5=\"crazydave\"]You lost me man.  :shock: \r\n\r\nJust kidding, seriously, that\'s  really bumming what happened to your system. If anything like that happened to me, I would never be able to afford to fix it.  :lol: \r\n\r\nWell anyways, I decided to keep that stretched Micro Speed, and sell my own car in the same frequency instead. I was too lazy to custom paint it, and then realized I would probably make more selling mods like paint jobs separate, instead of piling them on top of so many other mods.\r\n\r\nSo here\'s the Zip Zap I\'m selling. It\'s a beast.\r\nhttp://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3157149832\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:894ccab5f5]\r\n\r\n  I see your zip zaps car has some bids on it so thats good &amp; considering there is lots of time left on them.\r\n\r\n  I ment to ask last time how the se fets were going (or not going).'),(13675,'2364bd1c1a','[quote:2364bd1c1a=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:2364bd1c1a=\"crazydave\"]You lost me man.  :shock: \r\n\r\nJust kidding, seriously, that\'s  really bumming what happened to your system. If anything like that happened to me, I would never be able to afford to fix it.  :lol: \r\n\r\nWell anyways, I decided to keep that stretched Micro Speed, and sell my own car in the same frequency instead. I was too lazy to custom paint it, and then realized I would probably make more selling mods like paint jobs separate, instead of piling them on top of so many other mods.\r\n\r\nSo here\'s the Zip Zap I\'m selling. It\'s a beast.\r\nhttp://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3157149832\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:2364bd1c1a]\r\n  I see your zip zaps car has some bids on it so thats good &amp; considering there is lots of time left on them.\r\n\r\n  I ment to ask last time how the se fets were going (or not going).[/quote:2364bd1c1a]Yeah, I got a bid on the Zip Zap on the first day. That\'s always a good sign. Last I looked our own Bilbo Baggins was high bidder. I hope he sticks it out, be nice to see it go to a fellow pimp. I\'ll throw in a painted body, if a BitPimp buys it.  8-) \r\n\r\nThe SE mods are not happening at this point, due to lack of funds. That is 90% of the reason I put the cars on ebay, to buy more FETs, so I can try what ph2ts has done. He says he\'s getting the full 2.6 volts to the motor. He thinks the FETs are still not turning all the way on, but that sounds like it\'s more than fast enough for me. As soon as I get the cash flowing again, I\'m ordering some P-channel FETs, so I can try that. At which point I\'ll finally be able to get your SE done.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13676,'fc01039b40','That should do just fine ! Thanx for tha help man ! You make some awesome rides ! Thanx Stalker :-)'),(13677,'53b4a84895','No problem, I should have a site up soon with all my How-to\'s and customs.'),(13678,'2364bd1c1a','[quote:2364bd1c1a=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:2364bd1c1a=\"crazydave\"]You lost me man.  :shock: \r\n\r\nJust kidding, seriously, that\'s  really bumming what happened to your system. If anything like that happened to me, I would never be able to afford to fix it.  :lol: \r\n\r\nWell anyways, I decided to keep that stretched Micro Speed, and sell my own car in the same frequency instead. I was too lazy to custom paint it, and then realized I would probably make more selling mods like paint jobs separate, instead of piling them on top of so many other mods.\r\n\r\nSo here\'s the Zip Zap I\'m selling. It\'s a beast.\r\nhttp://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3157149832\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:2364bd1c1a]\r\n  I see your zip zaps car has some bids on it so thats good &amp; considering there is lots of time left on them.\r\n\r\n  I ment to ask last time how the se fets were going (or not going).[/quote:2364bd1c1a]Yeah, I got a bid on the Zip Zap on the first day. That\'s always a good sign. Last I looked our own Bilbo Baggins was high bidder. I hope he sticks it out, be nice to see it go to a fellow pimp. I\'ll throw in a painted body, if a BitPimp buys it.  8-) \r\n\r\nThe SE mods are not happening at this point, due to lack of funds. That is 90% of the reason I put the cars on ebay, to buy more FETs, so I can try what ph2ts has done. He says he\'s getting the full 2.6 volts to the motor. He thinks the FETs are still not turning all the way on, but that sounds like it\'s more than fast enough for me. As soon as I get the cash flowing again, I\'m ordering some P-channel FETs, so I can try that. At which point I\'ll finally be able to get your SE done.\r\n\r\nDave'),(13679,'5c3ce04b95','Thats cool but no rush dude I have a se here with green gears and a 4.2 pro(blue endbell) that is rippin it up for now hehe.\r\n\r\n  Yea as soon as I get these damn payments I will paypal some cash for yea.\r\n\r\n  As for being fast enough well I think the se\'s would be better with alittle less speed then normal fets only cause then you can make use of the improved stearing with the se\'s.  But that MO.\r\n\r\n  I can tell you there are alot of people on ebay like me that are last day bidders.  I dont bid on anything till the last day and even the last 5 mins if possible.  So there is no doubt in my mind that they will get up there.\r\n\r\n  Hows the xmod?  I think I finally worked something out with sessiz to have one shipped up so I better finish my mini z/xmods track before it gets here lol  but like thats gonna happen my bit track is still not close to being finished.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete\r\n\r\n\r\nPS.  How much are those new fets you are gonna try?  I might have a little bit in paypal right now.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13680,'53b4a84895','No problem, I should have a site up soon with all my How-to\'s and customs.'),(13681,'5c3ce04b95','Thats cool but no rush dude I have a se here with green gears and a 4.2 pro(blue endbell) that is rippin it up for now hehe.\r\n\r\n  Yea as soon as I get these damn payments I will paypal some cash for yea.\r\n\r\n  As for being fast enough well I think the se\'s would be better with alittle less speed then normal fets only cause then you can make use of the improved stearing with the se\'s.  But that MO.\r\n\r\n  I can tell you there are alot of people on ebay like me that are last day bidders.  I dont bid on anything till the last day and even the last 5 mins if possible.  So there is no doubt in my mind that they will get up there.\r\n\r\n  Hows the xmod?  I think I finally worked something out with sessiz to have one shipped up so I better finish my mini z/xmods track before it gets here lol  but like thats gonna happen my bit track is still not close to being finished.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete\r\n\r\n\r\nPS.  How much are those new fets you are gonna try?  I might have a little bit in paypal right now.'),(13682,'39f3e60e78','[quote:39f3e60e78=\"VooDooMafia\"]Thats cool but no rush dude I have a se here with green gears and a 4.2 pro(blue endbell) that is rippin it up for now hehe.\r\n\r\n  Yea as soon as I get these damn payments I will paypal some cash for yea.\r\n\r\n  As for being fast enough well I think the se\'s would be better with alittle less speed then normal fets only cause then you can make use of the improved stearing with the se\'s.  But that MO.\r\n\r\n  I can tell you there are alot of people on ebay like me that are last day bidders.  I dont bid on anything till the last day and even the last 5 mins if possible.  So there is no doubt in my mind that they will get up there.\r\n\r\n  Hows the xmod?  I think I finally worked something out with sessiz to have one shipped up so I better finish my mini z/xmods track before it gets here lol  but like thats gonna happen my bit track is still not close to being finished.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete\r\n\r\n\r\nPS.  How much are those new fets you are gonna try?  I might have a little bit in paypal right now.[/quote:39f3e60e78]Yeah man, I\'m a last second bidder. I have 2 windows open, one with my back up bid that\'s set at the most I can possibly spend. I\'ll send my first bid through, with less than a minute, then be ready to submit the second at a moments notice.\r\n\r\nThe Xmod is really cool. It\'s way too fast to play with in my little kitchen. I took it out to the parking lot, and in an open area it seems about as fast as a bit with a 2.2. Kinda like a 1/10th scale with a stock motor. Which is cool, because with bearings, and a stage 2 motor, it should be pretty fun. Once I get it to that level, a Xspeed motor, and 5 or 6 cells should make it more than fast enough.\r\n\r\nAs far as the price of FETs, those things are cents, but there is a sur charge for orders under 25 bucks, so it just makes sense to wait until I have the cash to order a bunch.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13683,'39f3e60e78','[quote:39f3e60e78=\"VooDooMafia\"]Thats cool but no rush dude I have a se here with green gears and a 4.2 pro(blue endbell) that is rippin it up for now hehe.\r\n\r\n  Yea as soon as I get these damn payments I will paypal some cash for yea.\r\n\r\n  As for being fast enough well I think the se\'s would be better with alittle less speed then normal fets only cause then you can make use of the improved stearing with the se\'s.  But that MO.\r\n\r\n  I can tell you there are alot of people on ebay like me that are last day bidders.  I dont bid on anything till the last day and even the last 5 mins if possible.  So there is no doubt in my mind that they will get up there.\r\n\r\n  Hows the xmod?  I think I finally worked something out with sessiz to have one shipped up so I better finish my mini z/xmods track before it gets here lol  but like thats gonna happen my bit track is still not close to being finished.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPete\r\n\r\n\r\nPS.  How much are those new fets you are gonna try?  I might have a little bit in paypal right now.[/quote:39f3e60e78]Yeah man, I\'m a last second bidder. I have 2 windows open, one with my back up bid that\'s set at the most I can possibly spend. I\'ll send my first bid through, with less than a minute, then be ready to submit the second at a moments notice.\r\n\r\nThe Xmod is really cool. It\'s way too fast to play with in my little kitchen. I took it out to the parking lot, and in an open area it seems about as fast as a bit with a 2.2. Kinda like a 1/10th scale with a stock motor. Which is cool, because with bearings, and a stage 2 motor, it should be pretty fun. Once I get it to that level, a Xspeed motor, and 5 or 6 cells should make it more than fast enough.\r\n\r\nAs far as the price of FETs, those things are cents, but there is a sur charge for orders under 25 bucks, so it just makes sense to wait until I have the cash to order a bunch.\r\n\r\nDave'),(13684,'8d337bd282','Yea I hear that order a ton of them to save on shipping/sur charges.\r\n\r\n  well I hope these fucks pay in the next few days but if not I plan to list about 50 3 days auctions tomorrow and 40% of them should pay day auction ends. So I will paypal some cash as soon as there is something worthwhile to send lol.\r\n\r\n  I can\'t wait for my xmod to come I am like a kid on xmas eve lol.  I have also been thinking about picking up(well having one shiped up) one of them Super Slicks from TRU.  They lok cool and 1.43 scale to boot.\r\n\r\n  Oh I am starting to put some packages together I know you wanted some pullback wheels was there anything else?  Did you ever get that disc? Not sure you will use it but I had a bunch of them kicking around.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Well you will prolly see my nick on the bidding table for them cars that are up (the ZZ mostly cause I could use more zz chassies).\r\n\r\n  Also have you tried to change teh crystal on the SBCG\'s to fix teh range problem Thingie?\r\n\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13685,'8d337bd282','Yea I hear that order a ton of them to save on shipping/sur charges.\r\n\r\n  well I hope these fucks pay in the next few days but if not I plan to list about 50 3 days auctions tomorrow and 40% of them should pay day auction ends. So I will paypal some cash as soon as there is something worthwhile to send lol.\r\n\r\n  I can\'t wait for my xmod to come I am like a kid on xmas eve lol.  I have also been thinking about picking up(well having one shiped up) one of them Super Slicks from TRU.  They lok cool and 1.43 scale to boot.\r\n\r\n  Oh I am starting to put some packages together I know you wanted some pullback wheels was there anything else?  Did you ever get that disc? Not sure you will use it but I had a bunch of them kicking around.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Well you will prolly see my nick on the bidding table for them cars that are up (the ZZ mostly cause I could use more zz chassies).\r\n\r\n  Also have you tried to change teh crystal on the SBCG\'s to fix teh range problem Thingie?\r\n\r\n\r\nPete'),(13686,'2e2e26962b','[quote:2e2e26962b=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea I hear that order a ton of them to save on shipping/sur charges.\r\n\r\n  well I hope these fucks pay in the next few days but if not I plan to list about 50 3 days auctions tomorrow and 40% of them should pay day auction ends. So I will paypal some cash as soon as there is something worthwhile to send lol.\r\n\r\n  I can\'t wait for my xmod to come I am like a kid on xmas eve lol.  I have also been thinking about picking up(well having one shiped up) one of them Super Slicks from TRU.  They lok cool and 1.43 scale to boot.\r\n\r\n  Oh I am starting to put some packages together I know you wanted some pullback wheels was there anything else?  Did you ever get that disc? Not sure you will use it but I had a bunch of them kicking around.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Well you will prolly see my nick on the bidding table for them cars that are up (the ZZ mostly cause I could use more zz chassies).\r\n\r\n  Also have you tried to change teh crystal on the SBCG\'s to fix teh range problem Thingie?\r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:2e2e26962b]I hear ya on the Xmod. I feel the same way waiting to get my hop ups for it. I\'m still need to get rechargable batteries. I\'ve only run one set of alkalines through, \'cause I don\'t want to waste my money on batteries.\r\n\r\nI thought those Super Slicks looked pretty cool, and you know they\'re not totally generic like a lot of clones, because they\'re advertising them on TV, but searching around the net people don\'t seem to care much about them. I think maybe because they\'re larger, not proportional, and so similar to Zip Zaps which are smaller, and can be bought proportional. I don\'t know, just a theory, but at any rate even though I think they\'re cool, they\'re still down at the bottom of my \'things to get\' list.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know about the crystals in the super bit. This is the theory I\'m working with; the later bits are the ones with the cripple caps in the controller, so they obviously think that\'s an improvement for some odd reason. So by this point I\'m guessing the crip cap is integrated into the circuit, instead of just being added on like before, since it is a brand new circuit. I took my controller apert to see if I could find a crip cap, but the PCB is attached to the back of the controller, by practically welding the PCB to the battery tabs. I was afraid I\'d damage the PCB if I tried to remove all that solder, so put it off until later, and just ended up never playing with those cars.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13687,'f07c3ebdab','What\'s up?  Can you let me know if you\'ll be around Wed, Thur or Fri evening.  I\'d like to stop by and pick up my cars.  Maybe even take a few laps around the tennis court.  Hey, would you be able to do a custom paint job on a beetle body for me?  I could hook ya up with cash or some motors for payment.  My gf\'s dad has a red turbo beetle and he\'s into anything to do with beetles.  For part of his Christmas present, I was going to give him a red beetle bit and an extra body with a cool design.  Thanks.'),(13688,'f07c3ebdab','What\'s up?  Can you let me know if you\'ll be around Wed, Thur or Fri evening.  I\'d like to stop by and pick up my cars.  Maybe even take a few laps around the tennis court.  Hey, would you be able to do a custom paint job on a beetle body for me?  I could hook ya up with cash or some motors for payment.  My gf\'s dad has a red turbo beetle and he\'s into anything to do with beetles.  For part of his Christmas present, I was going to give him a red beetle bit and an extra body with a cool design.  Thanks.'),(13689,'cdebab6771','I should be here Thur., and Fri. You can stop by anytime. As for the paint job, no problem man. You can trade out parts if you want.\r\n\r\nJust solid red, or did you want some pizazze&lt;sp? lol.\r\n\r\nWe\'ll get it squared away when you come over.    \r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13690,'2e2e26962b','[quote:2e2e26962b=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea I hear that order a ton of them to save on shipping/sur charges.\r\n\r\n  well I hope these fucks pay in the next few days but if not I plan to list about 50 3 days auctions tomorrow and 40% of them should pay day auction ends. So I will paypal some cash as soon as there is something worthwhile to send lol.\r\n\r\n  I can\'t wait for my xmod to come I am like a kid on xmas eve lol.  I have also been thinking about picking up(well having one shiped up) one of them Super Slicks from TRU.  They lok cool and 1.43 scale to boot.\r\n\r\n  Oh I am starting to put some packages together I know you wanted some pullback wheels was there anything else?  Did you ever get that disc? Not sure you will use it but I had a bunch of them kicking around.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Well you will prolly see my nick on the bidding table for them cars that are up (the ZZ mostly cause I could use more zz chassies).\r\n\r\n  Also have you tried to change teh crystal on the SBCG\'s to fix teh range problem Thingie?\r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:2e2e26962b]I hear ya on the Xmod. I feel the same way waiting to get my hop ups for it. I\'m still need to get rechargable batteries. I\'ve only run one set of alkalines through, \'cause I don\'t want to waste my money on batteries.\r\n\r\nI thought those Super Slicks looked pretty cool, and you know they\'re not totally generic like a lot of clones, because they\'re advertising them on TV, but searching around the net people don\'t seem to care much about them. I think maybe because they\'re larger, not proportional, and so similar to Zip Zaps which are smaller, and can be bought proportional. I don\'t know, just a theory, but at any rate even though I think they\'re cool, they\'re still down at the bottom of my \'things to get\' list.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know about the crystals in the super bit. This is the theory I\'m working with; the later bits are the ones with the cripple caps in the controller, so they obviously think that\'s an improvement for some odd reason. So by this point I\'m guessing the crip cap is integrated into the circuit, instead of just being added on like before, since it is a brand new circuit. I took my controller apert to see if I could find a crip cap, but the PCB is attached to the back of the controller, by practically welding the PCB to the battery tabs. I was afraid I\'d damage the PCB if I tried to remove all that solder, so put it off until later, and just ended up never playing with those cars.'),(13691,'cdebab6771','I should be here Thur., and Fri. You can stop by anytime. As for the paint job, no problem man. You can trade out parts if you want.\r\n\r\nJust solid red, or did you want some pizazze&lt;sp? lol.\r\n\r\nWe\'ll get it squared away when you come over.    \r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13692,'c2d7387541','havent got it yet, ill let you no\r\nitll prolly come in tommorrow'),(13693,'2dce43b0df','hey man con gradualations on your 999th post!!! your 1 away from 1000!!!!\r\n\r\ngreat job man!\r\n\r\nMicroMatch'),(13694,'285c891662','hey,\r\n\r\niwas wondering if you have any stuff to do a dual cell mod.  I have the 2 cells i just need the other crap.  Got anything??????'),(13695,'d612a68b92','Hello Micro,\r\n\r\nI buy a ZZ not SE do you add the mosfet\'s to this. Andd i am in Turkey do you ship to Turkey. Please answer.\r\n\r\nThanks.'),(13696,'977f8654c0','hey i talkedwith payaso on ICQ and i asked hi what the fastest motor was and he immediatly told e it was your 3.8 and so i am looking to buy one or two from you\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nMicro'),(13697,'c2d7387541','havent got it yet, ill let you no\r\nitll prolly come in tommorrow'),(13698,'285c891662','hey,\r\n\r\niwas wondering if you have any stuff to do a dual cell mod.  I have the 2 cells i just need the other crap.  Got anything??????'),(13700,'2dce43b0df','hey man con gradualations on your 999th post!!! your 1 away from 1000!!!!\r\n\r\ngreat job man!\r\n\r\nMicroMatch');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13701,'4dd66937d6','hey,\r\n\r\niwas wondering if you have any stuff to do a dual cell mod.  I have the 2 cells i just need the other crap.  Got anything??????'),(13702,'05eee4d8bd','If you have the 2 cells then all you need is some solder and wire to join the cells\r\n\r\n\r\n  Yea let me know what the motor comes in'),(13703,'4dd66937d6','hey,\r\n\r\niwas wondering if you have any stuff to do a dual cell mod.  I have the 2 cells i just need the other crap.  Got anything??????'),(13705,'9d9b2a7989','im gona try to piece all that shit together tonight and try to ship tomorrow. unfortunatly my powersupply is busted at home so i dont have a way to correspond while im putting shit together. but what i know you will get\r\n\r\n2 thunder chargers dual celled. ill throw in a multicell charging box(probably motorworks) some springs. i got at least one or two extra zz heatsinks and random zz parts. if you want the tc controllers i can send but they should work with most 27 and 49mhz rides but if you dont need em there will be more room for more crap like some shells or more cars.'),(13706,'9d9b2a7989','im gona try to piece all that shit together tonight and try to ship tomorrow. unfortunatly my powersupply is busted at home so i dont have a way to correspond while im putting shit together. but what i know you will get\r\n\r\n2 thunder chargers dual celled. ill throw in a multicell charging box(probably motorworks) some springs. i got at least one or two extra zz heatsinks and random zz parts. if you want the tc controllers i can send but they should work with most 27 and 49mhz rides but if you dont need em there will be more room for more crap like some shells or more cars.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13707,'d92ab8af41','[quote:d92ab8af41=\"JAC4412\"]hey,\r\n\r\niwas wondering if you have any stuff to do a dual cell mod.  I have the 2 cells i just need the other crap.  Got anything??????[/quote:d92ab8af41]\r\n\r\n  What other stuff you need?\r\n\r\n  the only thing that you will need after the 2 cells is a 3 ro 4 cell holder from radio shack(about 2 bucks)\r\n\r\n  If you have a list of things you have and need let me know I will see what I can do to help out.'),(13708,'d8fe788b6e','the soldering crap and sum instructions how to do it.  Do you need a dremel to do it??????'),(13709,'3068bb1346','Thats cool man what ever I am easy lol\r\n\r\n  Yea I her yea on the putter probs I just fried my motherboard and chip, and now my dvd burner is on the fritz.\r\n\r\n  I am Waiting for an xmod so hopfully the deals I have going will pan out so I dont have to wait to much longer.\r\n\r\n   But yea whatever is good I have some TC controllers not sure what frqu but its all good'),(13710,'d8fe788b6e','the soldering crap and sum instructions how to do it.  Do you need a dremel to do it??????');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24990,'4a5461b0fa','I got it my gay ass mail man brought mail left and came back 2 hours later i never said you were a as you put it a dogy dude. if you go anymore car like this one i want them i am starting a lil racing team here and i have sold most of my bitsd I am now down to 75 cars oH IF ANY OF YOUR MATES ARE LOOKING FOR A MINI-Z OR LITHUIM ION POWER XMODS I HAVE 2 FOR TRADE I AM TRING TO GET A DIGI-Q BULLET TRAIN FOR MY CITY i AM BUILDING \r\nYOU ARE A PERSON TO BUSINESS WITH . I Need MOre Cars!!!!!!!!!'),(13712,'3068bb1346','Thats cool man what ever I am easy lol\r\n\r\n  Yea I her yea on the putter probs I just fried my motherboard and chip, and now my dvd burner is on the fritz.\r\n\r\n  I am Waiting for an xmod so hopfully the deals I have going will pan out so I dont have to wait to much longer.\r\n\r\n   But yea whatever is good I have some TC controllers not sure what frqu but its all good'),(13713,'6956ea31dd','[quote:6956ea31dd=\"JAC4412\"]the soldering crap and sum instructions how to do it.  Do you need a dremel to do it??????[/quote:6956ea31dd]\r\n\r\n  Nope but here is a link http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/articles/article_postings.php?id=17&amp;catId=7');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13714,'3878acbb9a','ok thanks'),(13715,'3878acbb9a','ok thanks'),(14105,'87efc0e25c','I\'ll pass along the message.\r\nI almost hopped on those biatches before payaso but I just traded with VDM for pullbacks.\r\nbut it was damn tempting! lol\r\n\r\nanyways, I\'ll pass along the message.'),(13718,'3a42bb56ea','hi sm2osley i justnoticed you live in san jose...i livein san ramon and im lookin to get a bay area bit char-g race together some time. does it sound like some thing you would go to?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nMicro'),(13719,'d6218d47d6','Hey VDM-\r\nI\'d like to get $40 plus shipping, the body is the only thing used on it and they retail for $65 so I think that\'s fair. The rear spoiler is missing from the body, other that that the body\'s in good shape and it\'ll be in it\'s original packaging too.\r\n\r\nSo let me know if you\'re interested.\r\n\r\nBen'),(13720,'d6218d47d6','Hey VDM-\r\nI\'d like to get $40 plus shipping, the body is the only thing used on it and they retail for $65 so I think that\'s fair. The rear spoiler is missing from the body, other that that the body\'s in good shape and it\'ll be in it\'s original packaging too.\r\n\r\nSo let me know if you\'re interested.\r\n\r\nBen'),(13721,'952e89478b','well sounds good\r\n\r\nDo you know were to get the crystal sets?\r\n\r\n  I think I lucked out on my epochs now as I have managed to pick up the ready sets for $50 US shipped but they seem to be dryin up.\r\n\r\n  How much you think it will be with shipping to Canada?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13722,'952e89478b','well sounds good\r\n\r\nDo you know were to get the crystal sets?\r\n\r\n  I think I lucked out on my epochs now as I have managed to pick up the ready sets for $50 US shipped but they seem to be dryin up.\r\n\r\n  How much you think it will be with shipping to Canada?'),(13723,'6c68f093a3','[quote:6c68f093a3=\"VooDooMafia\"]well sounds good\r\n\r\nDo you know were to get the crystal sets?\r\n\r\n  I think I lucked out on my epochs now as I have managed to pick up the ready sets for $50 US shipped but they seem to be dryin up.\r\n\r\n  How much you think it will be with shipping to Canada?[/quote:6c68f093a3]\r\n\r\nok cool, i\'d prefer paypal do you have an account?\r\nBTW that\'s a great price for ready sets! \r\nas far as the xstals go you can get them here; http://www.shopatron.com/product/product_id=APX-RM-CP**/151.0.497.834.0.0.0\r\n\r\nas far as shipping goes, give me your addy tomorrow at work i\'ll pack up the epoch and see what the shipping is gonna run.'),(13724,'6c68f093a3','[quote:6c68f093a3=\"VooDooMafia\"]well sounds good\r\n\r\nDo you know were to get the crystal sets?\r\n\r\n  I think I lucked out on my epochs now as I have managed to pick up the ready sets for $50 US shipped but they seem to be dryin up.\r\n\r\n  How much you think it will be with shipping to Canada?[/quote:6c68f093a3]\r\n\r\nok cool, i\'d prefer paypal do you have an account?\r\nBTW that\'s a great price for ready sets! \r\nas far as the xstals go you can get them here; http://www.shopatron.com/product/product_id=APX-RM-CP**/151.0.497.834.0.0.0\r\n\r\nas far as shipping goes, give me your addy tomorrow at work i\'ll pack up the epoch and see what the shipping is gonna run.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13725,'a70278e5c2','Yea that was a good price I get them for thats why I kept getting them lol got most my xmas shopping for my friends done that way :)\r\n\r\n  Yea all I really need is what you have then the xstles(or whatever lol) as I use my mini Z controller for them.\r\n\r\nMy addy is\r\n\r\nPeter Kostecki\r\n20 Water St\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nCanada\r\nL2V 2K3\r\n\r\n\r\nYea I do have paypal but I need to Xfer some cash from my bank into it.  So do you mind holding that stuff for a couple 3 days till it goes in?  I love paypal makes things so easy :) sometimes to easy to spend $$.'),(13726,'a70278e5c2','Yea that was a good price I get them for thats why I kept getting them lol got most my xmas shopping for my friends done that way :)\r\n\r\n  Yea all I really need is what you have then the xstles(or whatever lol) as I use my mini Z controller for them.\r\n\r\nMy addy is\r\n\r\nPeter Kostecki\r\n20 Water St\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nCanada\r\nL2V 2K3\r\n\r\n\r\nYea I do have paypal but I need to Xfer some cash from my bank into it.  So do you mind holding that stuff for a couple 3 days till it goes in?  I love paypal makes things so easy :) sometimes to easy to spend $$.'),(13727,'cc60f8cc96','Yeah that\'s no problem bro, i\'ll hold onto it for ya! Yeah paypal\'s the best thing since sliced bread lol. I\'m glad I took a peak at the want ads before I listed it on ebay, i\'d rather see it go to a fellow pimp!\r\n\r\nBTW have you found a ZZ track yet? I\'ve got one brand new one in the box, for say $10?\r\n\r\noh damn, while rumaging through all my stuff i found the rear spoiler for the epoch body. Plus I found an extra ZZ heat sink and some front knuckles and hubs, those i\'ll just throw in.\r\n\r\n\r\nMeanwhile i\'ll get back to you tomorrow with the shipping costs.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13728,'3a42bb56ea','hi sm2osley i justnoticed you live in san jose...i livein san ramon and im lookin to get a bay area bit char-g race together some time. does it sound like some thing you would go to?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nMicro'),(13729,'cc60f8cc96','Yeah that\'s no problem bro, i\'ll hold onto it for ya! Yeah paypal\'s the best thing since sliced bread lol. I\'m glad I took a peak at the want ads before I listed it on ebay, i\'d rather see it go to a fellow pimp!\r\n\r\nBTW have you found a ZZ track yet? I\'ve got one brand new one in the box, for say $10?\r\n\r\noh damn, while rumaging through all my stuff i found the rear spoiler for the epoch body. Plus I found an extra ZZ heat sink and some front knuckles and hubs, those i\'ll just throw in.\r\n\r\n\r\nMeanwhile i\'ll get back to you tomorrow with the shipping costs.'),(13730,'d439e03c3c','Hey, that program showedup today.\r\n\r\nIt\'s cool. At first I had problem with the excessively user friendly format. I have issues with user friendly formats, I prefer programs that look like Windows. But anyways after a little bit I figured out it was all drag and drop, and it has taken me about an hour to figure out how to put my clips together, add a title screen, music, transistion effects, and most importantly exporting as .wmv file. \r\n\r\nSo that\'s everything I needed it to do. Thanks man, I appreciate it.\r\n\r\nBTW, have you noticed the popularity of Xmods has just about killed the bit scene? Been real boring about the forums lately, but the Xmod forums are exploding like the bit ones were last year.  :???: \r\n\r\nSucks, the Xmod is really cool, but I still love my bits more.\r\n\r\ndave'),(13731,'d439e03c3c','Hey, that program showedup today.\r\n\r\nIt\'s cool. At first I had problem with the excessively user friendly format. I have issues with user friendly formats, I prefer programs that look like Windows. But anyways after a little bit I figured out it was all drag and drop, and it has taken me about an hour to figure out how to put my clips together, add a title screen, music, transistion effects, and most importantly exporting as .wmv file. \r\n\r\nSo that\'s everything I needed it to do. Thanks man, I appreciate it.\r\n\r\nBTW, have you noticed the popularity of Xmods has just about killed the bit scene? Been real boring about the forums lately, but the Xmod forums are exploding like the bit ones were last year.  :???: \r\n\r\nSucks, the Xmod is really cool, but I still love my bits more.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13732,'81895146be','[quote:81895146be=\"crazydave\"]Hey, that program showedup today.\r\n\r\nIt\'s cool. At first I had problem with the excessively user friendly format. I have issues with user friendly formats, I prefer programs that look like Windows. But anyways after a little bit I figured out it was all drag and drop, and it has taken me about an hour to figure out how to put my clips together, add a title screen, music, transistion effects, and most importantly exporting as .wmv file. \r\n\r\nSo that\'s everything I needed it to do. Thanks man, I appreciate it.\r\n\r\nBTW, have you noticed the popularity of Xmods has just about killed the bit scene? Been real boring about the forums lately, but the Xmod forums are exploding like the bit ones were last year.  :???: \r\n\r\nSucks, the Xmod is really cool, but I still love my bits more.\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:81895146be]\r\n\r\n  Glad you can make use if it :)\r\n\r\n  Yea I noticed that the xmods killed for market but this could be a good thing as might be able to pick up some cheaap stuff :)\r\n\r\n  I have no coments on the xmod till I get mine but they do look cool.  Only thing is the size/space thing.  Seeing that is snows here I am limited to my mini z track in the basement that is about half what it should be to get the full experiance from the cars.  Bits I can just toss on a floor and away I go haveing fun with it.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Speaking of bits I got some ZZ stuff in a trade(thats why I posted that post for parts that there were missing).  Well one of the chassies only turns one way when I click right it does nothing is this something simple to fix? \r\n\r\n\r\nPete'),(13733,'81895146be','[quote:81895146be=\"crazydave\"]Hey, that program showedup today.\r\n\r\nIt\'s cool. At first I had problem with the excessively user friendly format. I have issues with user friendly formats, I prefer programs that look like Windows. But anyways after a little bit I figured out it was all drag and drop, and it has taken me about an hour to figure out how to put my clips together, add a title screen, music, transistion effects, and most importantly exporting as .wmv file. \r\n\r\nSo that\'s everything I needed it to do. Thanks man, I appreciate it.\r\n\r\nBTW, have you noticed the popularity of Xmods has just about killed the bit scene? Been real boring about the forums lately, but the Xmod forums are exploding like the bit ones were last year.  :???: \r\n\r\nSucks, the Xmod is really cool, but I still love my bits more.\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:81895146be]\r\n\r\n  Glad you can make use if it :)\r\n\r\n  Yea I noticed that the xmods killed for market but this could be a good thing as might be able to pick up some cheaap stuff :)\r\n\r\n  I have no coments on the xmod till I get mine but they do look cool.  Only thing is the size/space thing.  Seeing that is snows here I am limited to my mini z track in the basement that is about half what it should be to get the full experiance from the cars.  Bits I can just toss on a floor and away I go haveing fun with it.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Speaking of bits I got some ZZ stuff in a trade(thats why I posted that post for parts that there were missing).  Well one of the chassies only turns one way when I click right it does nothing is this something simple to fix? \r\n\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13734,'55b89d4b15','[quote:55b89d4b15=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\n  Speaking of bits I got some ZZ stuff in a trade(thats why I posted that post for parts that there were missing).  Well one of the chassies only turns one way when I click right it does nothing is this something simple to fix? \r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:55b89d4b15]First thing I\'d check is them thin ass steering wires, if that don\'t work there\'s my ultimate quick fix. Gut it out and fill it full of 5 dolla clone parts.  :lol:'),(13735,'55b89d4b15','[quote:55b89d4b15=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\n  Speaking of bits I got some ZZ stuff in a trade(thats why I posted that post for parts that there were missing).  Well one of the chassies only turns one way when I click right it does nothing is this something simple to fix? \r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:55b89d4b15]First thing I\'d check is them thin ass steering wires, if that don\'t work there\'s my ultimate quick fix. Gut it out and fill it full of 5 dolla clone parts.  :lol:'),(13736,'f165405db5','[quote:f165405db5=\"crazydave\"][quote:f165405db5=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\n  Speaking of bits I got some ZZ stuff in a trade(thats why I posted that post for parts that there were missing).  Well one of the chassies only turns one way when I click right it does nothing is this something simple to fix? \r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:f165405db5]First thing I\'d check is them thin ass steering wires, if that don\'t work there\'s my ultimate quick fix. Gut it out and fill it full of 5 dolla clone parts.  :lol:[/quote:f165405db5]\r\n\r\n Yea its the thin copper looking wire theat is broke, I can see 4 of them and on eit broke off inthe middle.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13737,'d612a68b92','Hello Micro,\r\n\r\nI buy a ZZ not SE do you add the mosfet\'s to this. Andd i am in Turkey do you ship to Turkey. Please answer.\r\n\r\nThanks.'),(13738,'5e3be30916','Hi KuzGun,\r\nyes no problem with you being in Turkey.\r\nJust so long as you can send me the US$20 with the car I will do the mod for you.\r\nYes I can do the standard ZipZap fet mod for you, no problem.\r\nThe address to send it to is,\r\n\r\nmicro fet mod\r\nC/o AMD Drive Systems\r\n8 Freelands Drive,\r\nMont Eliza, 3930\r\nVictoria, Australia.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you are sending it, so I will know when to expect it.\r\nThanks\r\nuA'),(13739,'f165405db5','[quote:f165405db5=\"crazydave\"][quote:f165405db5=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\n  Speaking of bits I got some ZZ stuff in a trade(thats why I posted that post for parts that there were missing).  Well one of the chassies only turns one way when I click right it does nothing is this something simple to fix? \r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:f165405db5]First thing I\'d check is them thin ass steering wires, if that don\'t work there\'s my ultimate quick fix. Gut it out and fill it full of 5 dolla clone parts.  :lol:[/quote:f165405db5]\r\n\r\n Yea its the thin copper looking wire theat is broke, I can see 4 of them and on eit broke off inthe middle.'),(13740,'051f064c9c','[quote:051f064c9c=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:051f064c9c=\"crazydave\"][quote:051f064c9c=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\n  Speaking of bits I got some ZZ stuff in a trade(thats why I posted that post for parts that there were missing).  Well one of the chassies only turns one way when I click right it does nothing is this something simple to fix? \r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:051f064c9c]First thing I\'d check is them thin ass steering wires, if that don\'t work there\'s my ultimate quick fix. Gut it out and fill it full of 5 dolla clone parts.  :lol:[/quote:051f064c9c]\r\n\r\n Yea its the thin copper looking wire theat is broke, I can see 4 of them and on eit broke off inthe middle.[/quote:051f064c9c]Scrape the 2 ends of wire with an exacto knif, so there is some shiny copper shwowing. That\'ll give the solder something to stick to. Then tin the tip of both wire ends, and then get a good amount of solder on the tip of your iron, and you should be able to stick them wire backs together. If not, you could always translant the steering coil.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13741,'051f064c9c','[quote:051f064c9c=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:051f064c9c=\"crazydave\"][quote:051f064c9c=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\n  Speaking of bits I got some ZZ stuff in a trade(thats why I posted that post for parts that there were missing).  Well one of the chassies only turns one way when I click right it does nothing is this something simple to fix? \r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:051f064c9c]First thing I\'d check is them thin ass steering wires, if that don\'t work there\'s my ultimate quick fix. Gut it out and fill it full of 5 dolla clone parts.  :lol:[/quote:051f064c9c]\r\n\r\n Yea its the thin copper looking wire theat is broke, I can see 4 of them and on eit broke off inthe middle.[/quote:051f064c9c]Scrape the 2 ends of wire with an exacto knif, so there is some shiny copper shwowing. That\'ll give the solder something to stick to. Then tin the tip of both wire ends, and then get a good amount of solder on the tip of your iron, and you should be able to stick them wire backs together. If not, you could always translant the steering coil.\r\n\r\nDave'),(13742,'d2a384be93','[quote:d2a384be93=\"crazydave\"][quote:d2a384be93=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:d2a384be93=\"crazydave\"][quote:d2a384be93=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\n  Speaking of bits I got some ZZ stuff in a trade(thats why I posted that post for parts that there were missing).  Well one of the chassies only turns one way when I click right it does nothing is this something simple to fix? \r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:d2a384be93]First thing I\'d check is them thin ass steering wires, if that don\'t work there\'s my ultimate quick fix. Gut it out and fill it full of 5 dolla clone parts.  :lol:[/quote:d2a384be93]\r\n\r\n Yea its the thin copper looking wire theat is broke, I can see 4 of them and on eit broke off inthe middle.[/quote:d2a384be93]Scrape the 2 ends of wire with an exacto knif, so there is some shiny copper shwowing. That\'ll give the solder something to stick to. Then tin the tip of both wire ends, and then get a good amount of solder on the tip of your iron, and you should be able to stick them wire backs together. If not, you could always translant the steering coil.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:d2a384be93]\r\n\r\nWell them are some small wires lol maybe I will wait till I can see strait lol.\r\n\r\n  Man I thought this PM was from microamps when I got the e-mail as I sent him a PM about the se mod and asking other then $$ what are the reasons for not posting a tut.  See what happens I get a few beers in me and I start to get heated when thinking how nice it was when the net first started and all the info was shared and nothing was about the cash just about learning more.\r\n  Well I know he is good with electronics but I tell yea if he gives me some lame as reply he better be good with internet security or he will have some VDM in his ass !!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13743,'5e3be30916','Hi KuzGun,\r\nyes no problem with you being in Turkey.\r\nJust so long as you can send me the US$20 with the car I will do the mod for you.\r\nYes I can do the standard ZipZap fet mod for you, no problem.\r\nThe address to send it to is,\r\n\r\nmicro fet mod\r\nC/o AMD Drive Systems\r\n8 Freelands Drive,\r\nMont Eliza, 3930\r\nVictoria, Australia.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you are sending it, so I will know when to expect it.\r\nThanks\r\nuA'),(13744,'d2a384be93','[quote:d2a384be93=\"crazydave\"][quote:d2a384be93=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:d2a384be93=\"crazydave\"][quote:d2a384be93=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\n  Speaking of bits I got some ZZ stuff in a trade(thats why I posted that post for parts that there were missing).  Well one of the chassies only turns one way when I click right it does nothing is this something simple to fix? \r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:d2a384be93]First thing I\'d check is them thin ass steering wires, if that don\'t work there\'s my ultimate quick fix. Gut it out and fill it full of 5 dolla clone parts.  :lol:[/quote:d2a384be93]\r\n\r\n Yea its the thin copper looking wire theat is broke, I can see 4 of them and on eit broke off inthe middle.[/quote:d2a384be93]Scrape the 2 ends of wire with an exacto knif, so there is some shiny copper shwowing. That\'ll give the solder something to stick to. Then tin the tip of both wire ends, and then get a good amount of solder on the tip of your iron, and you should be able to stick them wire backs together. If not, you could always translant the steering coil.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:d2a384be93]\r\n\r\nWell them are some small wires lol maybe I will wait till I can see strait lol.\r\n\r\n  Man I thought this PM was from microamps when I got the e-mail as I sent him a PM about the se mod and asking other then $$ what are the reasons for not posting a tut.  See what happens I get a few beers in me and I start to get heated when thinking how nice it was when the net first started and all the info was shared and nothing was about the cash just about learning more.\r\n  Well I know he is good with electronics but I tell yea if he gives me some lame as reply he better be good with internet security or he will have some VDM in his ass !!'),(13745,'6c2e3ed69f','[quote:6c2e3ed69f=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\nWell them are some small wires lol maybe I will wait till I can see strait lol.\r\n\r\n  Man I thought this PM was from microamps when I got the e-mail as I sent him a PM about the se mod and asking other then $$ what are the reasons for not posting a tut.  See what happens I get a few beers in me and I start to get heated when thinking how nice it was when the net first started and all the info was shared and nothing was about the cash just about learning more.\r\n  Well I know he is good with electronics but I tell yea if he gives me some lame as reply he better be good with internet security or he will have some VDM in his ass !![/quote:6c2e3ed69f]Yeah I know what you mean about the old days of the net. It was like people wanted to put out info just to show how cool they are, but for some reason this all reminds me of the 2 fueding motor builders in the mini-Z realm. I don\'t want the bit scene to get like that. \'Cause I hate that kind of attititude. Soon I\'ll burst micro_amps bubble, and then I\'m going to work on those mini-Z motor builders. (NML and Soloman).  I know how to wind and balance an armature, and I\'ve found a source for cheap cannisters with bearings. I\'m thinking when  have enough money, I might just introduce my own Xmod modified on ebay, except instead of calling mine a \'Stage 20\' or \'Stage 2,560\', or whatever the hell other hype they try to give, my plan is to tell people how many winds I\'ve used, explain what balancing, timing, and bearings do for a motor, etc. I really believe honesty is the best way to do business. besides I think 50 bucks is too much for one of these motors, so of coarse I\'m figuring how I can do it at half the price.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13746,'6c2e3ed69f','[quote:6c2e3ed69f=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\nWell them are some small wires lol maybe I will wait till I can see strait lol.\r\n\r\n  Man I thought this PM was from microamps when I got the e-mail as I sent him a PM about the se mod and asking other then $$ what are the reasons for not posting a tut.  See what happens I get a few beers in me and I start to get heated when thinking how nice it was when the net first started and all the info was shared and nothing was about the cash just about learning more.\r\n  Well I know he is good with electronics but I tell yea if he gives me some lame as reply he better be good with internet security or he will have some VDM in his ass !![/quote:6c2e3ed69f]Yeah I know what you mean about the old days of the net. It was like people wanted to put out info just to show how cool they are, but for some reason this all reminds me of the 2 fueding motor builders in the mini-Z realm. I don\'t want the bit scene to get like that. \'Cause I hate that kind of attititude. Soon I\'ll burst micro_amps bubble, and then I\'m going to work on those mini-Z motor builders. (NML and Soloman).  I know how to wind and balance an armature, and I\'ve found a source for cheap cannisters with bearings. I\'m thinking when  have enough money, I might just introduce my own Xmod modified on ebay, except instead of calling mine a \'Stage 20\' or \'Stage 2,560\', or whatever the hell other hype they try to give, my plan is to tell people how many winds I\'ve used, explain what balancing, timing, and bearings do for a motor, etc. I really believe honesty is the best way to do business. besides I think 50 bucks is too much for one of these motors, so of coarse I\'m figuring how I can do it at half the price.\r\n\r\nDave'),(13747,'85c96a1403','Ok so here\'s what I\'ve gotten for USPS priority postage;\r\n\r\nepoch only = $8\r\nepoch and track (if you want it) = approx. $14-$17\r\n\r\n\r\nB');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13748,'85c96a1403','Ok so here\'s what I\'ve gotten for USPS priority postage;\r\n\r\nepoch only = $8\r\nepoch and track (if you want it) = approx. $14-$17\r\n\r\n\r\nB'),(13749,'977f8654c0','hey i talkedwith payaso on ICQ and i asked hi what the fastest motor was and he immediatly told e it was your 3.8 and so i am looking to buy one or two from you\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nMicro'),(13750,'f7e9acdc86','Thank for the interest.  Let me get a price and I\'ll let you know.'),(13751,'a445724d71','Here\'s my pricing and I included a few other things you might be interested in...\r\n\r\n3.8 motor - $5 for (1) and if you buy more than 1, they are $4 each\r\n\r\n150mAH NiMH battery - $2.50 each (same size as stock battery, fits in \r\n                                   Bit with no bending of contacts)\r\n\r\nPullbacks (GP01, GP02) - $7.00 each (brand new in box)\r\n\r\nBit Char G Yellow Evo - $18.00 (original Bit Char G, brand new in box)\r\n\r\nAll this is before shipping......If you tell me what you want, I\'ll let you know what the shipping will be.  I\'m in Florida if you want to try and figure out shipping on your own.  Thanks.'),(13752,'caadcb2e56','Thanks for hookin a brutha up!!  I got a referral from someone wanting to buy some motors.  Looks like I won\'t be able to get over that way until Friday if that\'s okay.  I\'ll give you a call before I head over.  Thanks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13753,'f7e9acdc86','Thank for the interest.  Let me get a price and I\'ll let you know.'),(13754,'a445724d71','Here\'s my pricing and I included a few other things you might be interested in...\r\n\r\n3.8 motor - $5 for (1) and if you buy more than 1, they are $4 each\r\n\r\n150mAH NiMH battery - $2.50 each (same size as stock battery, fits in \r\n                                   Bit with no bending of contacts)\r\n\r\nPullbacks (GP01, GP02) - $7.00 each (brand new in box)\r\n\r\nBit Char G Yellow Evo - $18.00 (original Bit Char G, brand new in box)\r\n\r\nAll this is before shipping......If you tell me what you want, I\'ll let you know what the shipping will be.  I\'m in Florida if you want to try and figure out shipping on your own.  Thanks.'),(13755,'a2e3ea87c8','thanks man ill take 2 3.8`s\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nMicromatch'),(13756,'caadcb2e56','Thanks for hookin a brutha up!!  I got a referral from someone wanting to buy some motors.  Looks like I won\'t be able to get over that way until Friday if that\'s okay.  I\'ll give you a call before I head over.  Thanks.'),(13757,'040bdeacb7','Yea I think I will just take the epoch as they have the ZZ tracks in at our RS\'s for 20 cnd.\r\n\r\n  man we get everything so late.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13758,'a2e3ea87c8','thanks man ill take 2 3.8`s\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nMicromatch'),(13759,'a795581630','How do you want to pay? Do you use paypal?  I just need your shipping info and I\'ll get it packed up.  Thanks.'),(13760,'040bdeacb7','Yea I think I will just take the epoch as they have the ZZ tracks in at our RS\'s for 20 cnd.\r\n\r\n  man we get everything so late.'),(13761,'dbbce6de75','Ok sounds good, let me know when you\'re ready to transfer the funds.'),(13762,'dbbce6de75','Ok sounds good, let me know when you\'re ready to transfer the funds.'),(13763,'a795581630','How do you want to pay? Do you use paypal?  I just need your shipping info and I\'ll get it packed up.  Thanks.'),(13764,'4dcc534f28','send them to \r\n\r\nKent\r\n2953 marlboro way \r\nsan ramon ca, 94583\r\n\r\nand i will keep you posted on how i pay...stil waitin for my mom to come home\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nKent'),(13765,'23fa232da3','Was visiting [url=http://www.bannedrc.com/forum/profile.php?mode=register&amp;ruid=535]BannedRC - This aint no family forum [/url]and they use the same phpBB you do but version 2.0.6 and it has a built in spell checker.  Any chance of doing the same thing here?'),(13780,'d5db4746c4','[quote:d5db4746c4=\"CaboWabo\"]\r\nbeen so busy lately, haven\'t had time to keep up with the programming end of things here.[/quote:d5db4746c4]\r\nI know that feeling in a week I\'ll probably disappear from the net for about a month and a half.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13781,'d5db4746c4','[quote:d5db4746c4=\"CaboWabo\"]\r\nbeen so busy lately, haven\'t had time to keep up with the programming end of things here.[/quote:d5db4746c4]\r\nI know that feeling in a week I\'ll probably disappear from the net for about a month and a half.'),(19418,'4d8e8442da','hey Shack pimp what is your new store number?\r\n\r\nAnd why have you not come over to [url]http://www.cjshobbies.net[/url] and sighned up for my forum?'),(19419,'27e419f692','01-1524 Bath Baby.\r\n\r\nJust registered for your forums, very cool to see man.  Will stomp there for sure.'),(19420,'bb7e892896','Do you have a tutorial showing where to connect all the pins and wires for the FETs on Woah nelly...like, where to connect them, and what FETs to use....thanks!'),(13783,'c1dd148f5e','[quote:c1dd148f5e=\"cj\"][quote:c1dd148f5e=\"CaboWabo\"]\r\nbeen so busy lately, haven\'t had time to keep up with the programming end of things here.[/quote:c1dd148f5e]\r\nI know that feeling in a week I\'ll probably disappear from the net for about a month and a half.[/quote:c1dd148f5e]oh shit...\r\nthere goes our RS updates! lol\r\ntry and stop in when you can, even if it\'s just to say \"screw all of you\"  :-)'),(13784,'9a3c0838b8','Hey man. I just read this today and was wondering if the lordhelmetr34 account can be deleted. I just got me a yahoo account so I can receive mail now. Verizon sucks ass, so I won\'t be using it anymore.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13785,'be0cd377ee','Yeah man. today is ok with me...  I\'m off tonight.\r\n\r\n-S'),(13786,'5293cbc691','I don\'t mean to waste your time or piss you off, but what the hell is a \"BitThug\"?? Did I do something wrong? I mean, heck, I\'m on the watch list for screaming out loud, but what the heck is a BitThug? Is it a status you achieve after your 50th post? Just curious man....  \r\n\r\nBTW congrats on reaching over 5000 posts....been eager to say that for a while... :-)'),(13787,'be0cd377ee','Yeah man. today is ok with me...  I\'m off tonight.\r\n\r\n-S'),(13788,'9a3c0838b8','Hey man. I just read this today and was wondering if the lordhelmetr34 account can be deleted. I just got me a yahoo account so I can receive mail now. Verizon sucks ass, so I won\'t be using it anymore.'),(14123,'410e4ac16b','I guess you really like the car since I haven\'t received it yet.'),(14125,'a476a24ce0','haha sorry dude. actually i feel like an ass. i was gona hook it up with a car and the turd but i havnt had time to do any of that. ill try to get it in the mail weds. cash has been way tight lately but ill try to get it in the mail weds. its safe and sound on a shelf tho.'),(13790,'5293cbc691','I don\'t mean to waste your time or piss you off, but what the hell is a \"BitThug\"?? Did I do something wrong? I mean, heck, I\'m on the watch list for screaming out loud, but what the heck is a BitThug? Is it a status you achieve after your 50th post? Just curious man....  \r\n\r\nBTW congrats on reaching over 5000 posts....been eager to say that for a while... :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14111,'d4bd9ea7e1','Here is a list of stuff I am going to be posting \r\n\r\nLMK\r\n\r\nUltraman MATT car new in box last one $13.00 + shipping \r\n\r\nTureno AE86 Pullback new in package $7.00 + shipping \r\n\r\nShells \r\n(all shells are $3.00 each or $6.00 with pullback chassie) \r\n\r\nBlue Beetle \r\nClear Celica \r\nRed Skyline R32 \r\nBlue Skyline R34 \r\nBlue Skyline \r\n\r\n60 mAH Cells $1.50 each \r\n\r\n\r\nMOTORS \r\n\r\nTomy 1.0 $1.50 each \r\nTomy 1.6 $2.00 each \r\nTomy 2.2 $2.50 each \r\nKitt Racer 2.6 (nice motors) $3.00 each \r\nPerfection 3.0 $3.00 each \r\n\r\nSuper Bit Speed set (3.0 motor, gold rims, suspention set) $13.00 \r\nTomy Color Tire set $6.00 \r\nTomy Skyline body set (1 black 1 clear) $7.00 \r\n\r\nSpring Suspention $3.00 \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPeter'),(13792,'bfb311a0c7','got the super hero body today in the mail - with a \"united we stand\" patch is it?\r\n\r\nthanks bro!'),(13793,'bfb311a0c7','got the super hero body today in the mail - with a \"united we stand\" patch is it?\r\n\r\nthanks bro!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13794,'e892d4802c','[quote:e892d4802c=\"CaboWabo\"]got the super hero body today in the mail - with a \"united we stand\" patch is it?\r\n\r\nthanks bro![/quote:e892d4802c]\r\n\r\n  Naw thats just a car/bumber sticker\r\n\r\nWe made thousands of them when 911 happened and sold them at al the truck stops and shit and donated all the proceeds to the United Way.\r\n\r\n  That was back when I did alot of graphix work and shit like transformers car window stickers and boat dash boards.\r\n\r\n Glad you got it :)'),(13795,'c933872bd6','Glad to see your auction starting to go up :)  I have still not bid so you can count on them going up more still.\r\n\r\n  I hope you are PMin or tellin those people on the forum about your auctions as they will prolly bid aswell.\r\n\r\n  I hope you make some good coin off your mods cause they are worth it and this way the more cash you got for investing the better the mods you can work on :)\r\n\r\n\r\nPete'),(13796,'e892d4802c','[quote:e892d4802c=\"CaboWabo\"]got the super hero body today in the mail - with a \"united we stand\" patch is it?\r\n\r\nthanks bro![/quote:e892d4802c]\r\n\r\n  Naw thats just a car/bumber sticker\r\n\r\nWe made thousands of them when 911 happened and sold them at al the truck stops and shit and donated all the proceeds to the United Way.\r\n\r\n  That was back when I did alot of graphix work and shit like transformers car window stickers and boat dash boards.\r\n\r\n Glad you got it :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13797,'aac270deb8','[quote:aac270deb8=\"Son_Gokou\"]I don\'t mean to waste your time or piss you off, but what the hell is a \"BitThug\"?? Did I do something wrong? I mean, heck, I\'m on the watch list for screaming out loud, but what the heck is a BitThug? Is it a status you achieve after your 50th post? Just curious man....  \r\n\r\nBTW congrats on reaching over 5000 posts....been eager to say that for a while... :-)[/quote:aac270deb8]yea man, its just a rank automagically given as your post count goes up.\r\nit means nothing really.\r\nand you can come off the watch list now too.'),(13798,'3a758896f1','[quote:3a758896f1=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:3a758896f1=\"Son_Gokou\"]I don\'t mean to waste your time or piss you off, but what the hell is a \"BitThug\"?? Did I do something wrong? I mean, heck, I\'m on the watch list for screaming out loud, but what the heck is a BitThug? Is it a status you achieve after your 50th post? Just curious man....  \r\n\r\nBTW congrats on reaching over 5000 posts....been eager to say that for a while... :-)[/quote:3a758896f1]yea man, its just a rank automagically given as your post count goes up.\r\nit means nothing really.\r\nand you can come off the watch list now too.[/quote:3a758896f1]\r\n\r\noh ok, I thought it meant I was banned or something  :-? \r\n\r\nAre you serious? I can come off the watch list now? Have I really earned it?'),(23050,'a8295a5f46','How much are you asking for that box of Xmod Stuff and the 350Z shipped?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13800,'17fccb0749','[quote:17fccb0749=\"HirotoR34\"]Hey man. I just read this today and was wondering if the lordhelmetr34 account can be deleted. I just got me a yahoo account so I can receive mail now. Verizon sucks ass, so I won\'t be using it anymore.[/quote:17fccb0749]yea I can delete it.\r\ndo you need to me to change anything with Hiroto account after deleting lordhelmet account?'),(13801,'9dbb276a59','naw, I\'m lord helmet on another site. I kinda like being Hiroto and every thing is cool. Right now I may be a Bit playa, but I\'ll get my Bpimp status. Just takes time.\r\n\r\nThanx for the response.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW: I know you guys are busy, but when will the contest gallery be updated? Being the first contest I\'ve entered, I can\'t wait to see my rides in there.'),(13802,'c933872bd6','Glad to see your auction starting to go up :)  I have still not bid so you can count on them going up more still.\r\n\r\n  I hope you are PMin or tellin those people on the forum about your auctions as they will prolly bid aswell.\r\n\r\n  I hope you make some good coin off your mods cause they are worth it and this way the more cash you got for investing the better the mods you can work on :)\r\n\r\n\r\nPete'),(13803,'0a70155fb4','[quote:0a70155fb4=\"VooDooMafia\"]Glad to see your auction starting to go up :)  I have still not bid so you can count on them going up more still.\r\n\r\n  I hope you are PMin or tellin those people on the forum about your auctions as they will prolly bid aswell.\r\n\r\n  I hope you make some good coin off your mods cause they are worth it and this way the more cash you got for investing the better the mods you can work on :)\r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:0a70155fb4]Yeah, my auction is starting to get some action. It should just get better. That\'s why i run them on Sunday night. they sit there all week, and then they blow up over the weekend.\r\n\r\nI haven\'t told any BitPimps about the auctions, because I\'m just testing the ebay market right now, before I sell a full on custom. That\'s why I put a single cell bit, and a dual cell zip zap. So far it looks like a dual cell zip zap will create the most interest.\r\n\r\nThe dollar store across the street has cannonball clones for 4 bucks. I want to buy them all for charger bases, extra batteries, and PCBs to swap in. That way I can do more of these Zip Zaps for about 25 bucks a piece.\r\n\r\nCool to hear you\'re still planning to bid. Always nice to know you got at least one more bid garanteed. :-) \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13804,'0a70155fb4','[quote:0a70155fb4=\"VooDooMafia\"]Glad to see your auction starting to go up :)  I have still not bid so you can count on them going up more still.\r\n\r\n  I hope you are PMin or tellin those people on the forum about your auctions as they will prolly bid aswell.\r\n\r\n  I hope you make some good coin off your mods cause they are worth it and this way the more cash you got for investing the better the mods you can work on :)\r\n\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:0a70155fb4]Yeah, my auction is starting to get some action. It should just get better. That\'s why i run them on Sunday night. they sit there all week, and then they blow up over the weekend.\r\n\r\nI haven\'t told any BitPimps about the auctions, because I\'m just testing the ebay market right now, before I sell a full on custom. That\'s why I put a single cell bit, and a dual cell zip zap. So far it looks like a dual cell zip zap will create the most interest.\r\n\r\nThe dollar store across the street has cannonball clones for 4 bucks. I want to buy them all for charger bases, extra batteries, and PCBs to swap in. That way I can do more of these Zip Zaps for about 25 bucks a piece.\r\n\r\nCool to hear you\'re still planning to bid. Always nice to know you got at least one more bid garanteed. :-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(13805,'e16c13451d','Yea I like to have my auctions end on weekends aswell.\r\n\r\n  I htink the zip zap is doing better only cause of the name.  Alot of people on ebay aren\'t into the hobby like some of us so they see the name Zip Zap and they know it.\r\n\r\n  I am not sure how good the cannonball clones are but for 4 bucks you cant go wrong even if just for the parts.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19610,'ea3a5d949e','You interested in some Andre Williams cds?'),(13807,'3a758896f1','[quote:3a758896f1=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:3a758896f1=\"Son_Gokou\"]I don\'t mean to waste your time or piss you off, but what the hell is a \"BitThug\"?? Did I do something wrong? I mean, heck, I\'m on the watch list for screaming out loud, but what the heck is a BitThug? Is it a status you achieve after your 50th post? Just curious man....  \r\n\r\nBTW congrats on reaching over 5000 posts....been eager to say that for a while... :-)[/quote:3a758896f1]yea man, its just a rank automagically given as your post count goes up.\r\nit means nothing really.\r\nand you can come off the watch list now too.[/quote:3a758896f1]\r\n\r\noh ok, I thought it meant I was banned or something  :-? \r\n\r\nAre you serious? I can come off the watch list now? Have I really earned it?'),(14108,'7e04b3e26f','are you looking to sell it?'),(31076,'6c899341da','you in chat?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36981,'ec45c488fb','Cool, that\'s kinda what I was thinkin, but what do you mean by &quot;tubby&quot;?\r\n\r\nDid you mean the body, or chassis, cause he wanted it cause of the MM chassis over the RM one.\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks for the insight.  He also ordered the 911 Carrera body to go with it, that fucker..'),(36970,'9644bc5312','Hey cj would you be willing to part the IW Tx out?\r\n\r\nAlso does it have a reversable trigger feature?'),(30669,'ec665ceef3','I guess you got them by now? :???:'),(14110,'393e6ef4c6','modding\'s been at a low lately so they\'re just sitting there... they need love! lol\r\nyeah vdm\'s cool to do business with, I just sent him a epoch.\r\n\r\nthanx for passing the message along\r\n\r\npeace,\r\nB'),(13809,'9dbb276a59','naw, I\'m lord helmet on another site. I kinda like being Hiroto and every thing is cool. Right now I may be a Bit playa, but I\'ll get my Bpimp status. Just takes time.\r\n\r\nThanx for the response.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW: I know you guys are busy, but when will the contest gallery be updated? Being the first contest I\'ve entered, I can\'t wait to see my rides in there.'),(14120,'5c22934652','You got a deal! Where do I ship the money?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13811,'77fd64335f','[quote:77fd64335f=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:77fd64335f=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:77fd64335f=\"Son_Gokou\"]I don\'t mean to waste your time or piss you off, but what the hell is a \"BitThug\"?? Did I do something wrong? I mean, heck, I\'m on the watch list for screaming out loud, but what the heck is a BitThug? Is it a status you achieve after your 50th post? Just curious man....  \r\n\r\nBTW congrats on reaching over 5000 posts....been eager to say that for a while... :-)[/quote:77fd64335f]yea man, its just a rank automagically given as your post count goes up.\r\nit means nothing really.\r\nand you can come off the watch list now too.[/quote:77fd64335f]\r\n\r\noh ok, I thought it meant I was banned or something  :-? \r\n\r\nAre you serious? I can come off the watch list now? Have I really earned it?[/quote:77fd64335f]probably not, but I\'m feeling generous lol :wink:'),(13812,'3720f4576c','[quote:3720f4576c=\"HirotoR34\"]naw, I\'m lord helmet on another site. I kinda like being Hiroto and every thing is cool. Right now I may be a Bit playa, but I\'ll get my Bpimp status. Just takes time.\r\n\r\nThanx for the response.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW: I know you guys are busy, but when will the contest gallery be updated? Being the first contest I\'ve entered, I can\'t wait to see my rides in there.[/quote:3720f4576c]I\'ll try to get them updated this weekend'),(13813,'e16c13451d','Yea I like to have my auctions end on weekends aswell.\r\n\r\n  I htink the zip zap is doing better only cause of the name.  Alot of people on ebay aren\'t into the hobby like some of us so they see the name Zip Zap and they know it.\r\n\r\n  I am not sure how good the cannonball clones are but for 4 bucks you cant go wrong even if just for the parts.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13814,'0e51446f7e','Well I have some good news and some bad news.\r\n\r\nI will start withthe bad news.\r\n\r\n  I got home last night to find a package on my door step saying \"Unclaimed/Undeliverable\"  So I am not sure if you get slips form the post to pick stuff up and it was not picked up and returned or if I had the address incorect please confirm if this is correct.\r\n\r\nRyan Manuel \r\n11 Windy Ct. \r\nNewark, DE. 19713\r\n\r\n\r\n  BUT for the good news I have repackaged it in a bigger box as I have added a Xtrek that I came across.\r\n\r\n  So please confirm that is the correct address so I can sent this out again.  This time it will go express so you will have it in a couple days.'),(13815,'ea05452ef8','oh crap that sux but is kinda good....ok thats address is correct. so thanx'),(13935,'1c435499a5','Ok bro she on her way to you! :)'),(13936,'3a5ffdb7d5','does the car come with a controller??? what kind of car is it??? has it been used???'),(13938,'1c435499a5','Ok bro she on her way to you! :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13939,'2ca40b55da','The Mat car yes it comes with everything.  Its made by Tomy and is from there \"Hero Collection\"  This one is Ultramans car.\r\n\r\n  It is new in a sealed box.'),(13940,'fb1c1d286d','how much for tax???'),(13941,'fb1c1d286d','how much for tax???'),(13817,'ea05452ef8','oh crap that sux but is kinda good....ok thats address is correct. so thanx'),(13819,'31ee97ff1c','i was looking for some mosfets, and figured that a buck a piece aint that bad, would that include shipping, im still debating if i should get a buunch and fet all my bit\'s, or just fet my booster, once i make a descision, ill order accordingly.'),(25172,'1c7f91917e','Sure thing man.  Consider it a congrats on the Ausmicro comp.'),(14119,'1d09acb780','Well Unpackaged (but shipped in a box) Total=$16.00usd\r\n\r\nor\r\n\r\n Packaged (and shipped in bidder box) total=$$18.00usd\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nPete'),(13831,'e57e9336f6','Pimp,\r\n\r\nDid you hear about these??\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?p=32433#32433');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13834,'c33a09e8f9','[quote:c33a09e8f9=\"DarkTari\"]Hey C-Dub\r\n\r\nI finished the body mod tutorial from Golden Rod.  How can I post it or should I send it to you?  It\'s in MS Works Word Processor format.\r\n\r\nThanx,\r\n\r\nGotta find time to do the motor comparison.\r\n\r\nAre we straight on the prizes yet?  Can Hog still do the chassis?[/quote:c33a09e8f9]I\'d post up the body mod tutorial in the forums. Then you can send it to me, or I can nab it from the post you make. I\'ll then put it into our Articles section of the site (giving you da props of course). Sound good?\r\n\r\nas for the contest prizes....\r\nhere\'s the deal, and keep this under your hat please...\r\npayaso and I are a little worried about hog.\r\nhe\'s obviously had a rough couple of months in his real life.\r\npayaso had sent him a chassis to be jbwelded, it took almost 4 months.\r\nso payaso and I are hesitant on sending the prizes to him for modding because when it comes time to deliver the prizes, we can\'t be 4 months late delivering the prizes like he was in delivering payaso ride.\r\nso that got us worried and starting to think of other options.\r\nneither of us would mind trying to get crazydave to mosfet them, but we run into other issues here, namely:\r\n- who\'s going to provide the 2nd place chassis to be mosfetted?\r\n- does crazydave even have mosfets left?\r\n- if crazydave does have mosfets left, would he want to do this for us, and if so, what would he want in return?\r\n\r\nso that\'s pretty much where things are at.\r\nwe for sure have to figure this out ASAP or we\'ll be stuck holding our sacks with awesome painted bodies and non-modded chassis.\r\nI\'m just not sure how to approach it without pissing people off, etc., etc.'),(22794,'a89ba77648','Are you still getting the stuff?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13835,'04678b434a','Well Cabo, we\'ll get it done!  Hog\'s outta da picture right now. I know he\'s been dealing with a lot of personal shit lately so the rest will hafta pulled this thing together.\r\n\r\nWhere is the original chassis that was suppose to be modded?\r\n\r\nI know for 1st place, Silla was to do the body &amp; alloys, then hog was to do the dual batt.\r\nWhere\'s that chassis?\r\n\r\nWhere you able to do a dual for your chassis?  What\'s the status on that chassis?\r\n\r\nLemme Know Pimp!\r\n\r\nI\'ll rap to Cavey as soon as I get a status on the chassis\'s.  I\'ve got some FETs and more on the way.  I\'ve never done a FET mod before but I\'ll soon be getting it down. So as you can tell I don\'t want to test on the prizes if you get my drift.'),(13836,'04678b434a','Well Cabo, we\'ll get it done!  Hog\'s outta da picture right now. I know he\'s been dealing with a lot of personal shit lately so the rest will hafta pulled this thing together.\r\n\r\nWhere is the original chassis that was suppose to be modded?\r\n\r\nI know for 1st place, Silla was to do the body &amp; alloys, then hog was to do the dual batt.\r\nWhere\'s that chassis?\r\n\r\nWhere you able to do a dual for your chassis?  What\'s the status on that chassis?\r\n\r\nLemme Know Pimp!\r\n\r\nI\'ll rap to Cavey as soon as I get a status on the chassis\'s.  I\'ve got some FETs and more on the way.  I\'ve never done a FET mod before but I\'ll soon be getting it down. So as you can tell I don\'t want to test on the prizes if you get my drift.'),(14486,'de5bc1bdc7','[quote:de5bc1bdc7=\"ph2t\"][quote:de5bc1bdc7=\"JdmHatchback\"][quote:de5bc1bdc7=\"ph2t\"]cool dude ,let me know when you send it off so I can know when to expect it.\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:de5bc1bdc7]\r\n\r\n\r\nHey there, I just sent you $12 to your paypal account. I\'ll be sending the chassis to you tomorrow. O btw, you live in austrailia right? Just wanted to make sure I add the country or else theyll ship the chassis back to me lol. I\'m from the US in California. If you need anything here in the states let me know. \r\n\r\nThanks again![/quote:de5bc1bdc7]\r\n\r\nGot the paypal, thanks.  You get my address?\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nBENTLEIGH EAST   VIC   3165\r\nAUSTRALIA\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:de5bc1bdc7]\r\n\r\n\r\nCool, I got your address. Thanks. I\'ll be sending it out tomorrow. Thanks!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14487,'1c81d2ec2a','I don\'t think xp comes with the ability to unzip .rar files standard. If you do have a problem just download the winrar utility. It should be free to download.\r\nOh and I just got back from the PO, your disc is on it\'s way  :-)'),(14489,'03be114910','i accidently told you that my car was 49 mhz. i am sorryi ment to say 45 mhz. \r\n\r\nTHanks agian\r\nmicro'),(14491,'61f80f04dc','You said it ! It would\'ve taken 1.5 hours ?????  I\'ll plop em on a cd tonight and send, hopefully tomorrow according to my schedule.\r\n\r\nWhat\'s the deal with 1st place prize ?'),(13838,'a9180653da','[quote:a9180653da=\"HirotoR34\"]Thanx Cabo! You da man! They all look great. I just finished another car that i wish I could have entered. (hint: Hotwheels should\'ve thought of it first)[/quote:a9180653da]no prob man.\r\ncool man, can\'t wait to see it...\r\nhope it\'s in Flossin\'\r\nI haven\'t had time to check the boards yet, but I\'ma go look now! lol'),(13839,'513b55c99b','hey dave by any chance do you have the link to babble fish? like where i can translate stuff');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13840,'513b55c99b','hey dave by any chance do you have the link to babble fish? like where i can translate stuff'),(13841,'08f0efcfe3','Here ya go: :-) \r\nhttp://babelfish.altavista.com/\r\n\r\nDave'),(13842,'08f0efcfe3','Here ya go: :-) \r\nhttp://babelfish.altavista.com/\r\n\r\nDave'),(13843,'9c69372b9c','thanks dude'),(13844,'9c69372b9c','thanks dude'),(13845,'61c63181d8','[quote:61c63181d8=\"DarkTari\"]Well Cabo, we\'ll get it done!  Hog\'s outta da picture right now. I know he\'s been dealing with a lot of personal shit lately so the rest will hafta pulled this thing together.\r\n\r\nWhere is the original chassis that was suppose to be modded?\r\n\r\nI know for 1st place, Silla was to do the body &amp; alloys, then hog was to do the dual batt.\r\nWhere\'s that chassis?\r\n\r\nWhere you able to do a dual for your chassis?  What\'s the status on that chassis?\r\n\r\nLemme Know Pimp!\r\n\r\nI\'ll rap to Cavey as soon as I get a status on the chassis\'s.  I\'ve got some FETs and more on the way.  I\'ve never done a FET mod before but I\'ll soon be getting it down. So as you can tell I don\'t want to test on the prizes if you get my drift.[/quote:61c63181d8]I need to double check with payaso, it\'s been awhile so I might have forgotten, but this is what I believe is up.\r\npayaso has 1st place body and chassis, last I heard - he still had to make the alloys :???: he was then supposed to ship that to hog for dual celling and hog would provide the controller (hog was going to mod the controller as well as paint it)\r\nso we need to get with payaso and see if he can\'t provide the controller, paint it to match, then ship it off for fet or dual cell or whatever.\r\nI\'ve got 2nd place body and controller 49 mhz\r\nhog or nox (last I heard, hog) was going to provide the chassis and dual cell and mod the controller.\r\nso I need to see if I rummage up a 49 mhz chassis to ship off to get fet or dual cell.\r\nand then you had 3rd wrapped up.\r\n\r\nbefore we go talking to crazydave, let\'s get with payaso and see what we have to play with first so we\'re not wasting crazydave\'s time.\r\npayaso went to Disneyworld... seriously - lol\r\nHe\'ll probably call sometime tonite so I\'ll ask him what he\'s got and where he\'s at so we\'ll know what we gotta do.\r\nsound cool?'),(13846,'d20d19d669','Cool Beans !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13847,'af542a5a40','Well that was a nail biter. The Microsizer clone didn\'t go for much, and the Zip Zap was just kinda sitting there, then sure enough, last half an hour, WAR!. Right down to the last second.\r\n\r\nSold for 60 bucks, not bad, about what I hoped.\r\n\r\nI\'m thinkin\' I\'ll do a couple more in the next week. :grin: \r\n\r\nDave'),(13848,'d20d19d669','Cool Beans !'),(13849,'af542a5a40','Well that was a nail biter. The Microsizer clone didn\'t go for much, and the Zip Zap was just kinda sitting there, then sure enough, last half an hour, WAR!. Right down to the last second.\r\n\r\nSold for 60 bucks, not bad, about what I hoped.\r\n\r\nI\'m thinkin\' I\'ll do a couple more in the next week. :grin: \r\n\r\nDave'),(13850,'78a09fc1e7','Yea I wanted to bid onthe clone but was out getting funiture(fucking wife).\r\n\r\n  Well I am not sure what you had into each but atleast teh TC clones are cheap to buy.  BUT 60 bones for teh ZZ thats good.\r\n\r\n  Also have you thought of getting some cheap bodies and just selling some painted bodies on the forums?\r\n\r\n  I bet you could move them no prob.\r\n\r\n  Man 60 bucks is great, now I guess will have to get some cheap ZZ\'s from the.\r\n\r\n  I know you could trade 2 ZZ for one of your painted bodies.  Thats a good deal for you and the person gettin the body.\r\n\r\n   Man I almost got a micro RS4 this weekend but it was 2 bills without the tx so screw that.'),(13851,'78a09fc1e7','Yea I wanted to bid onthe clone but was out getting funiture(fucking wife).\r\n\r\n  Well I am not sure what you had into each but atleast teh TC clones are cheap to buy.  BUT 60 bones for teh ZZ thats good.\r\n\r\n  Also have you thought of getting some cheap bodies and just selling some painted bodies on the forums?\r\n\r\n  I bet you could move them no prob.\r\n\r\n  Man 60 bucks is great, now I guess will have to get some cheap ZZ\'s from the.\r\n\r\n  I know you could trade 2 ZZ for one of your painted bodies.  Thats a good deal for you and the person gettin the body.\r\n\r\n   Man I almost got a micro RS4 this weekend but it was 2 bills without the tx so screw that.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13852,'4a370c987b','Hey whats your paypal info :)\r\n\r\n  I got something you might want :)'),(13853,'15938f3470','Well Dave not sure what teh cost and time this mod would take but I found this while loking around ebay.\r\n\r\n  Considering the Stock Xmod is 50 bones not sure it would be worth it but looks ok if the mod is cheap and easy.\r\n\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3157975108&amp;category=2565[/url]'),(13854,'15938f3470','Well Dave not sure what teh cost and time this mod would take but I found this while loking around ebay.\r\n\r\n  Considering the Stock Xmod is 50 bones not sure it would be worth it but looks ok if the mod is cheap and easy.\r\n\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3157975108&amp;category=2565[/url]'),(13855,'fb5ef8cf23','[quote:fb5ef8cf23=\"VooDooMafia\"]Well Dave not sure what teh cost and time this mod would take but I found this while loking around ebay.\r\n\r\n  Considering the Stock Xmod is 50 bones not sure it would be worth it but looks ok if the mod is cheap and easy.\r\n\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3157975108&amp;category=2565[/url][/quote:fb5ef8cf23]Shit man, I\'ve already got the lowdown on putting FETs in the XMod. Extra cells just add weight. Here\'s my plan of attack. FET modded, Mini-Z modified motor, and just a 5th cell, if needed. I honestly don\'t know if the Xmod\'s drive train could handle more than that. It\'s less weight than 6-cells, and with the extra punch from the upgraded FETs, you\'ll take the 6-cell every time, in a drag race, or coming out of corners. Hold more speed through the corners too.\r\n\r\nBut that\'s all down the road. First I have to buy all the RS hop ups, and enjoy this thing one step at a time. That\'s the way I am with new toys.\r\n\r\nI just got my rechargeable batteries, and because that auction did a little better than expected, I was able to get my stage 2 motors today too. :-D \r\n\r\nI already got a tire set, so I just need bearing kit, AWD set, and I\'m set. Oh well then there\'s the wheels, and body kit, I suppose I\'ll have to get some of those too.\r\n\r\nThere\'s an electronics store across town clearing out 1.3v Panasonic NiCds for 1.69 a piece. That a pretty good price on a high volt NiCd. I\'m thinkin\' I need to go pick some of those up too.\r\n\r\n :-D Whheee, this is fun.\r\n\r\n...I haven\'t had a chance to play with the car very much though.  :???:\r\n\r\nDave'),(13856,'fb5ef8cf23','[quote:fb5ef8cf23=\"VooDooMafia\"]Well Dave not sure what teh cost and time this mod would take but I found this while loking around ebay.\r\n\r\n  Considering the Stock Xmod is 50 bones not sure it would be worth it but looks ok if the mod is cheap and easy.\r\n\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=3157975108&amp;category=2565[/url][/quote:fb5ef8cf23]Shit man, I\'ve already got the lowdown on putting FETs in the XMod. Extra cells just add weight. Here\'s my plan of attack. FET modded, Mini-Z modified motor, and just a 5th cell, if needed. I honestly don\'t know if the Xmod\'s drive train could handle more than that. It\'s less weight than 6-cells, and with the extra punch from the upgraded FETs, you\'ll take the 6-cell every time, in a drag race, or coming out of corners. Hold more speed through the corners too.\r\n\r\nBut that\'s all down the road. First I have to buy all the RS hop ups, and enjoy this thing one step at a time. That\'s the way I am with new toys.\r\n\r\nI just got my rechargeable batteries, and because that auction did a little better than expected, I was able to get my stage 2 motors today too. :-D \r\n\r\nI already got a tire set, so I just need bearing kit, AWD set, and I\'m set. Oh well then there\'s the wheels, and body kit, I suppose I\'ll have to get some of those too.\r\n\r\nThere\'s an electronics store across town clearing out 1.3v Panasonic NiCds for 1.69 a piece. That a pretty good price on a high volt NiCd. I\'m thinkin\' I need to go pick some of those up too.\r\n\r\n :-D Whheee, this is fun.\r\n\r\n...I haven\'t had a chance to play with the car very much though.  :???:\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13857,'1257064de6','Yo what you looking for for your xmod?\r\n\r\n  I have lots to trade.'),(13858,'4a370c987b','Hey whats your paypal info :)\r\n\r\n  I got something you might want :)'),(13859,'d1fbe0f278','Sweet, here ya go man; blormore@mac.com\r\n\r\nI\'ll try and get that package out today!\r\n\r\nBen'),(13860,'d1fbe0f278','Sweet, here ya go man; blormore@mac.com\r\n\r\nI\'ll try and get that package out today!\r\n\r\nBen'),(13862,'5a5da71b56','got the motor, Thanks.  Is their any way I could get more torque out of it??????? :???:'),(13863,'5a5da71b56','got the motor, Thanks.  Is their any way I could get more torque out of it??????? :???:'),(13866,'1257064de6','Yo what you looking for for your xmod?\r\n\r\n  I have lots to trade.'),(13867,'24776c2618','Just to let you know I was busy as fuck last week but I did mail you car aswell as hue\'s out today.  Well I should say your car and pullback.\r\n\r\n  Sorry for the delay :)'),(13868,'8efd925464','Thanks man! I\'m going to do your mosfet either sat or sun after thanksgiving, so I\'ll get that in the mail earlyt next week. Sorry for the delay on my end also. My good soldering iron is over at hue35\'s place, so I kinda have to do it when I have free time and he\'s home. 3 yr old has had a 104 degree temp for 4 days now, so no daycare = me taking care of her all day, working at night.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13869,'8efd925464','Thanks man! I\'m going to do your mosfet either sat or sun after thanksgiving, so I\'ll get that in the mail earlyt next week. Sorry for the delay on my end also. My good soldering iron is over at hue35\'s place, so I kinda have to do it when I have free time and he\'s home. 3 yr old has had a 104 degree temp for 4 days now, so no daycare = me taking care of her all day, working at night.'),(13871,'c0bd8c38e5','Sorry things didn\'t work out for you Todd, I know you mentioned you had\r\nother endevors so good luck with them.  Your whole sale biz is suppose to start 11-Nov-03, Is there anyway I can purchase some motors from you before this takes place?\r\n\r\nLemme know!\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!'),(13873,'3faf6bdb26','[quote:3faf6bdb26=\"SuperFly\"]Thanks man! I\'m going to do your mosfet either sat or sun after thanksgiving, so I\'ll get that in the mail earlyt next week. Sorry for the delay on my end also. My good soldering iron is over at hue35\'s place, so I kinda have to do it when I have free time and he\'s home. 3 yr old has had a 104 degree temp for 4 days now, so no daycare = me taking care of her all day, working at night.[/quote:3faf6bdb26]\r\n\r\n  Its all good dude I am in no hurry, I just felt bad cause hue paid and I said it would go out last week.\r\n\r\n  Being a dad myself I can understand you there.  Only thing is when one gets sick they all do hehe.\r\n\r\n  Hope shes better soon :) and again no rush on the car dude get it done when you haave time.'),(13874,'3c7e675c77','when did you send off the car? Its been a week and I haven\'t seen it yet. What address did you send it to?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13875,'1396abec6e','cabo,\r\nentries #17 &amp; 18 have mosfets in them now. I changed it in the posting section. Just thought u shud know.\r\n :grin: \r\nthanx'),(13877,'c485a9abf4','Thanx Santa Todd,\r\n\r\nI\'ll make my list, and check it twice ..........'),(13881,'4fa4dc52c4','[quote:4fa4dc52c4=\"Maxximum Attack\"]when did you send off the car? Its been a week and I haven\'t seen it yet. What address did you send it to?[/quote:4fa4dc52c4]I sent it off about week and a half ago. You really should have seen it by now. I was just wondering last night why you hadn\'t thanked me yet. I really thought you\'d be lovin\' your car by now.\r\n\r\nDammit! I tried to get insurance, and shipping confirmation, but you can only get that with priorty mail, and priorty mail to foreign countries was way too expensive.\r\n\r\nHere\'s is the address I sent it to:\r\nRasheed Sabir \r\nBannister Land, \r\nMartindales Road, \r\nSt. Michael, \r\nBarbados , W.I.\r\n\r\nIf that is all correct, the best we can do is wait. They told me it would take 10-14 days, but they always say that, VDM, in Canada, usually gets my stuff in a week. If it get to be a month, I\'ll have to file claim with the post office. Hopefully it doesn\'t get to that point.\r\n\r\nPossible reasons for the delay could be: Because alot of people are mail ordering for Christmas now days, they could be backed up. Because I sent it in a box, it may take longer than the envelope you sent, and you know  sometime things just get hung up in the mail.\r\n\r\nAt any rate you really should see it any day now, just keep your fingers crossed, and I\'ll pray for you over here.\r\n\r\nSorry about that man, I order alot of stuff, so I understand how frustrating it is waiting.\r\n\r\nDave'),(13882,'f1c3dc2e14','Glad you got it :)\r\n\r\n  For torque this is what I am going to suggest.\r\n\r\n  I duel cell or even better the Mosfet mod.\r\n\r\n  The mosfet mod is well worth the buck and there are people that will do it less the the 20 bucks micro amps charges and they are in the US.\r\n\r\n   You cant go wrong with this mod at all almost all my cars are mosfeted and I love it.  I just keep a few stock cars for when friends come over and can\'t control the fets.\r\n\r\n\r\n  Also what gears you running?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13883,'97783b56e2','the blue gears,  is their a forum on this??? just so i can see how they do it????'),(13884,'c01a9012a2','hey how much do you charge for the mod????? (the mosfet)'),(13885,'97783b56e2','the blue gears,  is their a forum on this??? just so i can see how they do it????'),(14104,'676e29c496','[quote:676e29c496=\"CaboWabo\"]sup pimp\r\npayaso\'s computer is down right now and has been for the past several days.\r\npayaso still loves you though, he said he\'ll just send the love letters through regular mail.\r\n\r\naight he didn\'t say it quite like that. lol\r\n\r\npayaso wants to know if you can just send them out to him and he\'ll just send off the cash in money order, of if you want to wait till he gets back online (a day or 2) he can paypal it to you.\r\n\r\nI guess let me know and I\'ll pass it along to him.\r\n\r\ntalk to ya later\r\nScott[/quote:676e29c496]\r\nlol\r\nwhat\'s up bro, oh damn he\'s been down all this time, hope he\'s coping with it well! lol\r\n\r\nwhatever he wants to do is fine with me. i\'m in no rush and they\'re not going anywhere, so if he want\'s to do it now it\'s aight or if he wants to wait that\'s cool too!\r\n\r\nthanks man, catch ya later\r\n\r\npeace\r\nB'),(13887,'e84c2f59da','Look in our wierd science section there is lot of info and so \"how to\'s\" for the mosfet mod.\r\n\r\n  You need good soldering skills but like I said it work it');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13888,'9d09b11ab2','thanks'),(13889,'c12818f1e0','looking for custom bits  trucks cars  etc ,,  custom wheels on them ,, just a plain  killer custom machine send pics of what u got to joez2872@yahoo.com  the xmod has been used 3 times has 4 wheel drive kit  and is black honda civic ,,, foam tire kit 2'),(13890,'c12818f1e0','looking for custom bits  trucks cars  etc ,,  custom wheels on them ,, just a plain  killer custom machine send pics of what u got to joez2872@yahoo.com  the xmod has been used 3 times has 4 wheel drive kit  and is black honda civic ,,, foam tire kit 2'),(13891,'9d09b11ab2','thanks'),(13892,'42afc2d81d','have you done this yourself????'),(13894,'a96b09808b','hey, can you tell me how to do a mosfet mod on a zz?????'),(13896,'42afc2d81d','have you done this yourself????'),(13898,'bda5fdd610','hey man, so did shypo give you any idea as to why the sh1tfest happened?'),(13901,'24fe41800a','nope, he just kept saying that he doesn\'t know what they\'re talking about, he sent mscharged\'s shit, and he payed bithed everything that dgs payed him.  He said he hadn\'t been on ausmicro for ages and hadn\'t even seen the thread.  And said he had resigned from the moderators position.  Pretty boring conversation really.  Anyway, I\'ll catch ya.\r\nNick'),(14069,'a3350f8ac3','[quote:a3350f8ac3=\"grnmachnracr\"]ok cool  :grin:  giv me a list of the other stuff for sale or trade if ya can plese. I just got a crap load of $$[/quote:a3350f8ac3]\r\n\r\n\r\n  Its been really busy around here so here is a small list\r\n\r\n\r\n  Ultraman MATT car new in box last one $13.00 + shipping\r\n\r\n  Tureno AE86 Pullback new in package $7.00 + shipping\r\n\r\n  [b:a3350f8ac3]Shells[/b:a3350f8ac3]\r\n(all shells are $3.00 each or $6.00 with pullback chassie)\r\n\r\nBlue Beetle\r\nClear Celica\r\nRed Skyline R32\r\nBlue Skyline R34\r\nBlue Skyline\r\n\r\n60 mAH Cells $1.50 each\r\n\r\n\r\n[b:a3350f8ac3] MOTORS[/b:a3350f8ac3]\r\n\r\nTomy 1.0   $1.50 each\r\nTomy 1.6   $2.00 each\r\nTomy 2.2   $2.50 each\r\nKitt Racer 2.6 (nice motors) $3.00 each\r\nPerfection 3.0 $3.00 each\r\n\r\nSuper Bit Speed set (3.0 motor, gold rims, suspention set) $13.00\r\nTomy Color Tire set $6.00\r\nTomy Skyline body set (1 black 1 clear) $7.00\r\n\r\nSpring Suspention $3.00 \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n All those rpices do not include shipping.  Let me know as I will be posting this list on the forum after you and a couple other people have a look at it first.\r\n\r\n  Thanks\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13903,'bbda9263c2','No I send mine off to get done\r\nThe parts are cheap but if you spend less then 25 bucks you get kiled in surcharges, so its easyer for me to send it off to get done.'),(13904,'15805f1913','Hey Peter-\r\njust wanted to check with you and make sure you recieved my pm yesterday.\r\nJust in case you didn\'t for some reason, my paypal acct. id is blormore@mac.com\r\n\r\nBen'),(13905,'15805f1913','Hey Peter-\r\njust wanted to check with you and make sure you recieved my pm yesterday.\r\nJust in case you didn\'t for some reason, my paypal acct. id is blormore@mac.com\r\n\r\nBen'),(13906,'f30070f133','[quote:f30070f133=\"kwikbb\"]Hey Peter-\r\njust wanted to check with you and make sure you recieved my pm yesterday.\r\nJust in case you didn\'t for some reason, my paypal acct. id is blormore@mac.com\r\n\r\nBen[/quote:f30070f133]\r\n\r\n  Shit dude I left a msg with my wife to pay that shit LOL.\r\n\r\n  I will log on tonight when I am at my home computer and pay it so that it can get out :)'),(13907,'f30070f133','[quote:f30070f133=\"kwikbb\"]Hey Peter-\r\njust wanted to check with you and make sure you recieved my pm yesterday.\r\nJust in case you didn\'t for some reason, my paypal acct. id is blormore@mac.com\r\n\r\nBen[/quote:f30070f133]\r\n\r\n  Shit dude I left a msg with my wife to pay that shit LOL.\r\n\r\n  I will log on tonight when I am at my home computer and pay it so that it can get out :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13908,'f441970f81','LOL- No biggie, just wanted to make sure you didn\'t think i was blowin\' you off. The sites been acting weird for me lately, don\'t know if it\'s me or what... gotta touch base with Cabo to make sure i\'m not goin nuts. :)\r\nShe\'s all boxed up and snug for her trip, so with tomorrow being a holiday and all i\'ll get the epoch out to you on friday.\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\nBen'),(13909,'f441970f81','LOL- No biggie, just wanted to make sure you didn\'t think i was blowin\' you off. The sites been acting weird for me lately, don\'t know if it\'s me or what... gotta touch base with Cabo to make sure i\'m not goin nuts. :)\r\nShe\'s all boxed up and snug for her trip, so with tomorrow being a holiday and all i\'ll get the epoch out to you on friday.\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\nBen'),(13910,'c01a9012a2','hey how much do you charge for the mod????? (the mosfet)'),(13911,'efe383123d','have you done the mod (mosfet) yourself or did you send it off?  How did you create your own website??? can you give me a link????'),(13912,'efe383123d','have you done the mod (mosfet) yourself or did you send it off?  How did you create your own website??? can you give me a link????');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13914,'fce0715fdc','I sent mine off to get done\r\n\r\n  Link to what ?  The info on the fet mod?'),(13915,'2081396046','no, how to create your own webpage'),(13916,'2081396046','no, how to create your own webpage'),(13918,'80a0e67886','Oh just downloada webpage program (frontpage or something)\r\n\r\nthen upload it to your server.\r\n\r\n  Or sign up at Geocities and they have a step by step proccess aswell as give you space.'),(13919,'d0270aca5a','Yo duded $15 bucks is way to much\r\n\r\n  If you want it I will sell it for $10 including shipping\r\n\r\n  Let me know I have 1 left'),(13920,'7cf357f0a6','what style is it? I would really like to have an R32'),(13921,'7cf357f0a6','what style is it? I would really like to have an R32'),(13925,'89394531c2','hey do you have that guys email, the one you gave me awhile ago?? (he had cars on ebay) ????'),(13926,'89394531c2','hey do you have that guys email, the one you gave me awhile ago?? (he had cars on ebay) ????'),(14102,'7e04b3e26f','are you looking to sell it?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14103,'676e29c496','[quote:676e29c496=\"CaboWabo\"]sup pimp\r\npayaso\'s computer is down right now and has been for the past several days.\r\npayaso still loves you though, he said he\'ll just send the love letters through regular mail.\r\n\r\naight he didn\'t say it quite like that. lol\r\n\r\npayaso wants to know if you can just send them out to him and he\'ll just send off the cash in money order, of if you want to wait till he gets back online (a day or 2) he can paypal it to you.\r\n\r\nI guess let me know and I\'ll pass it along to him.\r\n\r\ntalk to ya later\r\nScott[/quote:676e29c496]\r\nlol\r\nwhat\'s up bro, oh damn he\'s been down all this time, hope he\'s coping with it well! lol\r\n\r\nwhatever he wants to do is fine with me. i\'m in no rush and they\'re not going anywhere, so if he want\'s to do it now it\'s aight or if he wants to wait that\'s cool too!\r\n\r\nthanks man, catch ya later\r\n\r\npeace\r\nB'),(13947,'b1355d6845','sorry dude $13.00 plus shipping is the lowest I can go.  These cars sell for alot more.\r\n\r\n  goto www.hlj.com and search bit char\r\n\r\n  then look under ultraman and MAT car you will see they gofor $26.00 US or more plus shipping.\r\n\r\n  This is also my last one out of 4 cases(12 per case) so I know the price is good.\r\n\r\n  Hey ask around bitpimps if its a good deal :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14021,'e01a1d7047','Hey man i was wondering if you could get me that x mod, i finally got all the money. And u have changed my order a bit.\r\nthis is what i want now\r\n-honda civic-black\r\n-civic body kit\r\n-the 3 sets of wheels\r\n-stage 2 motor \r\n\r\nit is still all the same price. \r\n\r\n\r\nThanks brendan.'),(13949,'a69ce18bb7','I have a red r32 :)'),(13950,'7fe78742b4','It was the Tureno\r\n\r\nR32 I will see if I have any R32 shells'),(13951,'50f0187729','i still havnt gotten ur package. Whats up?'),(13952,'50f0187729','i still havnt gotten ur package. Whats up?'),(19613,'2bd64ef85e','[quote:2bd64ef85e=\"hue35\"]You interested in some Andre Williams cds?[/quote:2bd64ef85e]Sure why not. I\'m always open to anything. \r\n\r\nDave'),(13954,'5ea6f6a8d3','[quote:5ea6f6a8d3=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:5ea6f6a8d3=\"SuperFly\"]Thanks man! I\'m going to do your mosfet either sat or sun after thanksgiving, so I\'ll get that in the mail earlyt next week. Sorry for the delay on my end also. My good soldering iron is over at hue35\'s place, so I kinda have to do it when I have free time and he\'s home. 3 yr old has had a 104 degree temp for 4 days now, so no daycare = me taking care of her all day, working at night.[/quote:5ea6f6a8d3]\r\n\r\n  Its all good dude I am in no hurry, I just felt bad cause hue paid and I said it would go out last week.\r\n\r\n  Being a dad myself I can understand you there.  Only thing is when one gets sick they all do hehe.\r\n\r\n  Hope shes better soon :) and again no rush on the car dude get it done when you haave time.[/quote:5ea6f6a8d3]\r\n\r\nHey man-\r\n\r\nTurned out my daughter had pneumonia, pretty nasty. However, I did manage to get some soldering time in last night and got your mosfet Lancer put together. I also put in a custom matching antenna for you, and tested it well. Usually we just make sure the motor runs forward and reverse and that the RPMs sound like they should with a mosfet mod, but I went ahead and put all the wheels and tires on and drove it around for a charge. It was surprisingly fast for a stock motor. Anyway, just letting you know why there\'s a little dust on the tires. I\'ll mail it tomorrow.\r\n\r\nSuperFly'),(13955,'5ea6f6a8d3','[quote:5ea6f6a8d3=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:5ea6f6a8d3=\"SuperFly\"]Thanks man! I\'m going to do your mosfet either sat or sun after thanksgiving, so I\'ll get that in the mail earlyt next week. Sorry for the delay on my end also. My good soldering iron is over at hue35\'s place, so I kinda have to do it when I have free time and he\'s home. 3 yr old has had a 104 degree temp for 4 days now, so no daycare = me taking care of her all day, working at night.[/quote:5ea6f6a8d3]\r\n\r\n  Its all good dude I am in no hurry, I just felt bad cause hue paid and I said it would go out last week.\r\n\r\n  Being a dad myself I can understand you there.  Only thing is when one gets sick they all do hehe.\r\n\r\n  Hope shes better soon :) and again no rush on the car dude get it done when you haave time.[/quote:5ea6f6a8d3]\r\n\r\nHey man-\r\n\r\nTurned out my daughter had pneumonia, pretty nasty. However, I did manage to get some soldering time in last night and got your mosfet Lancer put together. I also put in a custom matching antenna for you, and tested it well. Usually we just make sure the motor runs forward and reverse and that the RPMs sound like they should with a mosfet mod, but I went ahead and put all the wheels and tires on and drove it around for a charge. It was surprisingly fast for a stock motor. Anyway, just letting you know why there\'s a little dust on the tires. I\'ll mail it tomorrow.\r\n\r\nSuperFly');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (26534,'c6bc7cf7eb','okay... where du you buy it...?'),(26535,'748023ef10','Hobby stores.  The last places I saw some was in North Carolina and Japan.  You could search for it online.  I\'m sure it\'s on a site somewhere.  It\'s \"Tamiya epoxy putty\".'),(26538,'230a191489','the linkis dead... doo he send it to denmark'),(26539,'eb92ebc73a','okay i am from denmark i use plastik padding or pp100 it is good'),(26540,'0df9024927','http://www.microracers24.com \r\n\r\n\r\nI think he send to Denmark...write him!\r\n\r\n\r\n :eek: \r\n\r\nSinned!'),(26541,'f13475d04c','Cool.  Thanx for the tip.\r\n\r\nHere\'s a site that has the Tamiya putty.\r\n[url]http://store.yahoo.com/matrixcollectibles/tamepput.html[/url]\r\n\r\nHope this helps.'),(13957,'6f2fda2ea4','hehe dust is always good :)\r\n\r\n Yea I wish I had more time to play with the little basterds but with Xmas coming and with the Family deciding to come here theres been alot of work.\r\n\r\n  Only bonus is we still have not moved the stove from our other house to this one so we are using teh one it came with and its tiny (22 inches or so), so I wont have alot of cooking to do just lots of preparing.\r\n\r\n\r\n  I will let you know when it arrives, let me know on the MAts and pullback :)'),(13958,'1b791ac76d','hey man, did you get that package with the bodies and lights?   You should of got it by now.  Also I haven\'t got my efini rx7 shell yet, hope it gets here soon :)\r\n\r\nAlso, when were you going to paypal me the $25 bigones for the other order?  It\'s packaged up all ready to go but I got a few other shipments to make and I\'d rather get them all done in one hit.  If you don\'t want that stuff anymore that\'s cool as well.  Just let me know.\r\n\r\nThanks mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14068,'1e5942f0e0','yea...liife\'s been keepiin me real busy.\r\n\r\nbeen playing with my Xmod a bit...but haven\'t touched a bit-char-g for a month or more.\r\n\r\nhope all is well.\r\n\r\nthinking about getting a second xmod for xmas.\r\n\r\n\r\nglad to see you won a place in the Aussie contest.\r\n\r\n-nigel'),(13960,'47d1d4f91d','Yo Pimp,\r\n\r\nI\'m tryin to post pics from the Pimp gallery for Ride O Da Week, only the pics are posting small.\r\n\r\nHow can I enlarge?\r\n\r\nThanx'),(13961,'47d1d4f91d','Yo Pimp,\r\n\r\nI\'m tryin to post pics from the Pimp gallery for Ride O Da Week, only the pics are posting small.\r\n\r\nHow can I enlarge?\r\n\r\nThanx'),(13966,'66f188e4f0','you should have got it by now, the only thing I can think is cause of the holiday\r\nbut here i dug out the tracking #\r\n\r\n23067004843'),(13967,'51dceb5658','yah how did u ship it? like what company?'),(13968,'51dceb5658','yah how did u ship it? like what company?'),(14513,'35a3c6a1da','[quote:35a3c6a1da=\"DarkTari\"]You said it ! It would\'ve taken 1.5 hours ?????  I\'ll plop em on a cd tonight and send, hopefully tomorrow according to my schedule.\r\n\r\nWhat\'s the deal with 1st place prize ?[/quote:35a3c6a1da]I have no clue.\r\nI keep making posts in the moderators forum, but nobody really pipes up.\r\n\r\nbasically, from the way I understand, payaso says he\'s got everything covered as far as the car/chassis/controller.\r\n\r\nso now we need to decide if these things are getting dual celled or fetted.\r\n\r\ndepending upon what we choose, we got a few more decisions to make.\r\nbut as of now, we need to decide dual cell or fet.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13964,'7c70608f6a','[quote:7c70608f6a=\"DarkTari\"]Yo Pimp,\r\n\r\nI\'m tryin to post pics from the Pimp gallery for Ride O Da Week, only the pics are posting small.\r\n\r\nHow can I enlarge?\r\n\r\nThanx[/quote:7c70608f6a]check the link you\'re using for the image.\r\nif there is a \"/thumbs\" in the address, get rid of it and that should be the large version of the image.'),(13965,'2a4a097c8f','Thanx Pimp!\r\n\r\nBeen trying for a couple weeks, but doing it late on Sunday so I\'ve just been goin to my second, third choices.\r\n\r\nHow was Turkey Day ?'),(19614,'9913ebc888','no need for the sig. if they dont read the faqs its their own damn fault'),(13970,'92b234ebfe','Canada Xpress post\r\n\r\n  [url]http://www.canadapost.ca/segment-e.asp[/url]'),(13971,'76fc0128b3','ok so its in the country? And how will it arrive to my house? ups?'),(13972,'76fc0128b3','ok so its in the country? And how will it arrive to my house? ups?'),(13974,'5de6e38a53','Not sure what company picks it up when it in the US but it should have been there by now.\r\n\r\n  Make sure you didn\'t get a slip for pickup (incase they tried to deliver when you were not home)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13975,'65c20f256a','ok man thanx, i have a lil bit of patience  :? \r\nbut i hope it comes soon, im buggin for it  :eek: \r\nalso, i saw you posting stuff to sell a tureno pull back, Is that a different one than the one included in mine?'),(13976,'65c20f256a','ok man thanx, i have a lil bit of patience  :? \r\nbut i hope it comes soon, im buggin for it  :eek: \r\nalso, i saw you posting stuff to sell a tureno pull back, Is that a different one than the one included in mine?'),(13978,'a9f4c5ccdb','Well its teh same type of pullback but not yours if thats what you mean.\r\n\r\n  I had a bunch of these and other stuff aswell.\r\n\r\n  Prolly going to post more for sale soon.'),(13979,'94fb841a26','ok cool  :grin:  giv me a list of the other stuff for sale or trade if ya can plese. I just got a crap load of $$'),(13980,'94fb841a26','ok cool  :grin:  giv me a list of the other stuff for sale or trade if ya can plese. I just got a crap load of $$'),(13982,'5909eb317b','ok I will gather a list up and send it later tonight');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13983,'4624b1dd72','what\'s up holmes?!\r\n\r\nI figure that USPS Priority should run about $4.00, is that all you want dawg just the pullbacks? no bodies?\r\n\r\nhit me back\r\n\r\n-word'),(13984,'4624b1dd72','what\'s up holmes?!\r\n\r\nI figure that USPS Priority should run about $4.00, is that all you want dawg just the pullbacks? no bodies?\r\n\r\nhit me back\r\n\r\n-word'),(13985,'0e64694acb','[quote:0e64694acb=\"kwikbb\"]what\'s up holmes?!\r\n\r\nI figure that USPS Priority should run about $4.00, is that all you want dawg just the pullbacks? no bodies?\r\n\r\nhit me back\r\n\r\n-word[/quote:0e64694acb]\r\n\r\n\r\nActually, I do want more, but can\'t figure it out yet...lol\r\n\r\nLet me check it out again....\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(13986,'2a4a097c8f','Thanx Pimp!\r\n\r\nBeen trying for a couple weeks, but doing it late on Sunday so I\'ve just been goin to my second, third choices.\r\n\r\nHow was Turkey Day ?'),(20108,'a7aa86e2a2','[quote:a7aa86e2a2]and a double post before he left... \r\nI\'m not sure who got in the last word there lol[/quote:a7aa86e2a2]\r\n\r\nHaha...he Posted a picture of a BUDDHA.....this is a PIMP site, we don\'t give a fuckin shit about some fat ass curry smellin....woah, got carried away, almost forgot I myself was of that background.  :eek: :gives:\r\n\r\nOh, and get a load of this- he says this shit in chat- \"I\'m a professional photographer, you\'re just jealous. I didn\'t spend 1800 dollars on a 8.5 megapixel camera to take some shitty pics on a cluttered desk, I\'d rather take it in nature and be a true photographer\". Imagining him saying that in some accent....LMFAO\r\n\r\nDidn\'t want to post this in the public, just thought I should tell ya in private. \r\n\r\nPE@CE');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14485,'24a75886e4','[quote:24a75886e4=\"JdmHatchback\"][quote:24a75886e4=\"ph2t\"]cool dude ,let me know when you send it off so I can know when to expect it.\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:24a75886e4]\r\n\r\n\r\nHey there, I just sent you $12 to your paypal account. I\'ll be sending the chassis to you tomorrow. O btw, you live in austrailia right? Just wanted to make sure I add the country or else theyll ship the chassis back to me lol. I\'m from the US in California. If you need anything here in the states let me know. \r\n\r\nThanks again![/quote:24a75886e4]\r\n\r\nGot the paypal, thanks.  You get my address?\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nBENTLEIGH EAST   VIC   3165\r\nAUSTRALIA\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(13988,'65ce4ede56','Sup dude\r\n\r\n  Yea I just got the package, I would assume you will recieve yours anytime now not sure why it taking that long.\r\n\r\n  I left msg for wife to pay that 25 bones I guess with all the busyness(if thats a word) she forgot.  I will get on tonight and send some cash.'),(13989,'054bbc4711','[quote:054bbc4711=\"VooDooMafia\"]Sup dude\r\n\r\n  Yea I just got the package, I would assume you will recieve yours anytime now not sure why it taking that long.\r\n\r\n  I left msg for wife to pay that 25 bones I guess with all the busyness(if thats a word) she forgot.  I will get on tonight and send some cash.[/quote:054bbc4711]\r\n\r\nThanks man, just wanted to confirm.  I\'ll send the package out tomorrow.\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13990,'0e64694acb','[quote:0e64694acb=\"kwikbb\"]what\'s up holmes?!\r\n\r\nI figure that USPS Priority should run about $4.00, is that all you want dawg just the pullbacks? no bodies?\r\n\r\nhit me back\r\n\r\n-word[/quote:0e64694acb]\r\n\r\n\r\nActually, I do want more, but can\'t figure it out yet...lol\r\n\r\nLet me check it out again....\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(13991,'8b8df9392f','[quote:8b8df9392f=\"payaso\"]\r\nActually, I do want more, but can\'t figure it out yet...lol\r\n\r\nLet me check it out again....\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:8b8df9392f]\r\nalright bro n/p, you got first dibs!\r\n\r\n\r\nBen'),(13992,'8b8df9392f','[quote:8b8df9392f=\"payaso\"]\r\nActually, I do want more, but can\'t figure it out yet...lol\r\n\r\nLet me check it out again....\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:8b8df9392f]\r\nalright bro n/p, you got first dibs!\r\n\r\n\r\nBen'),(13993,'97b8cffd78','Thanks man....  This birthday is starting to look better..  I already don\'t like my 30s...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nKeeping the Epochs? lol\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(13994,'97b8cffd78','Thanks man....  This birthday is starting to look better..  I already don\'t like my 30s...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nKeeping the Epochs? lol\r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13995,'b1dff2ebe5','[quote:b1dff2ebe5=\"payaso\"]Thanks man....  This birthday is starting to look better..  I already don\'t like my 30s...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nKeeping the Epochs? lol\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:b1dff2ebe5]\r\nYeah that 30 is creepin\' up on me too! lol i got less than 4 months left.\r\n\r\nYeah I got my one left that I want to hold onto, and the other spare chassis I just shipped to Canada to VDM. \r\n\r\nDon\'t get me wrong, I\'m not out of the hobby... things have just been kinda slow and i gotta get some cash for car repairs! So i figured i\'d loose some of the stuff that\'s been just sittin\' around, ya feel me?!\r\n\r\nAnyway let me know whats on your wish list when you\'re ready!\r\n\r\n-b'),(13996,'a6ea373f90','[quote:a6ea373f90=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:a6ea373f90=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:a6ea373f90=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:a6ea373f90=\"Son_Gokou\"]I don\'t mean to waste your time or piss you off, but what the hell is a \"BitThug\"?? Did I do something wrong? I mean, heck, I\'m on the watch list for screaming out loud, but what the heck is a BitThug? Is it a status you achieve after your 50th post? Just curious man....  \r\n\r\nBTW congrats on reaching over 5000 posts....been eager to say that for a while... :-)[/quote:a6ea373f90]yea man, its just a rank automagically given as your post count goes up.\r\nit means nothing really.\r\nand you can come off the watch list now too.[/quote:a6ea373f90]\r\n\r\noh ok, I thought it meant I was banned or something  :-? \r\n\r\nAre you serious? I can come off the watch list now? Have I really earned it?[/quote:a6ea373f90]probably not, but I\'m feeling generous lol :wink:[/quote:a6ea373f90]\r\n\r\nI dunno...I don\'t like getting good things unless I earn them....it just feels unjust...Oh, who the fuck am I kidding. Bye Bye watch list! lol  :-D'),(13997,'a6ea373f90','[quote:a6ea373f90=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:a6ea373f90=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:a6ea373f90=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:a6ea373f90=\"Son_Gokou\"]I don\'t mean to waste your time or piss you off, but what the hell is a \"BitThug\"?? Did I do something wrong? I mean, heck, I\'m on the watch list for screaming out loud, but what the heck is a BitThug? Is it a status you achieve after your 50th post? Just curious man....  \r\n\r\nBTW congrats on reaching over 5000 posts....been eager to say that for a while... :-)[/quote:a6ea373f90]yea man, its just a rank automagically given as your post count goes up.\r\nit means nothing really.\r\nand you can come off the watch list now too.[/quote:a6ea373f90]\r\n\r\noh ok, I thought it meant I was banned or something  :-? \r\n\r\nAre you serious? I can come off the watch list now? Have I really earned it?[/quote:a6ea373f90]probably not, but I\'m feeling generous lol :wink:[/quote:a6ea373f90]\r\n\r\nI dunno...I don\'t like getting good things unless I earn them....it just feels unjust...Oh, who the fuck am I kidding. Bye Bye watch list! lol  :-D');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (13999,'371b832896','Anything yet?\r\n\r\nDave'),(14000,'7383ef1e05','no, not eve a peep :('),(14001,'b1dff2ebe5','[quote:b1dff2ebe5=\"payaso\"]Thanks man....  This birthday is starting to look better..  I already don\'t like my 30s...lol\r\n\r\n\r\nKeeping the Epochs? lol\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:b1dff2ebe5]\r\nYeah that 30 is creepin\' up on me too! lol i got less than 4 months left.\r\n\r\nYeah I got my one left that I want to hold onto, and the other spare chassis I just shipped to Canada to VDM. \r\n\r\nDon\'t get me wrong, I\'m not out of the hobby... things have just been kinda slow and i gotta get some cash for car repairs! So i figured i\'d loose some of the stuff that\'s been just sittin\' around, ya feel me?!\r\n\r\nAnyway let me know whats on your wish list when you\'re ready!\r\n\r\n-b'),(14066,'f6fb23bc80','hey mate, good to see you on, how you been?  well?   looks like we\'ve all been busy with life \'n shit, oh well.  such goes it.\r\n\r\ncheers\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(33532,'faca1901f3','[quote:faca1901f3][quote:faca1901f3=\"crazydave\"]I\'m listening to Super Furry Thing\'s recent one right now. Don\'t know much about them. Its alright. Really mellow, but they\'re appropriately named, because its all warm and fuzzy.[/quote:faca1901f3]Do you mean Super Furry Animals? If you\'re talking about those guys, I\'ve got all of it, except the new one. I love that band.[/quote:faca1901f3]Yeah, Super Furry Animals. Fuckin\' stoner Dave. They got some really cool sounds, but the songs are a bit slow for me. Reminds of something I\'d get into when I\'m so baked I can\'t hold my eyes open. :lol: \r\n\r\nThis is my first time checking them out, as of yesterday. So you\'ll have to check the new album out, and let me know if you think the older stuff is any better.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:faca1901f3][quote:faca1901f3=\"crazydave\"]So that\'s about it. Still loving System of a Down. They fucking rock. You listening to anything new? [/quote:faca1901f3]\r\nSystem of a down... hmmm. I don\'t know what it is with those guys that just doesn\'t sit so well with me. There\'s a lot about it that I really appreciate, but the guy\'s voice is just... I don\'t know, maybe it isn\'t even that. I wanna like \'em, and I certainly don\'t dislike them... they just leave me all meh &amp; whatnot. What album would you start with? Maybe that\'s the problem... I just started in the wrong spot. I\'ve done that before.[/quote:faca1901f3]If you don\'t really dig SOD, then I\'m not sure where to tell you where to start. For me it all starts with Black Sabbath, then progresses through the speed metal of the late \'80s, then somehow we end up with this mutant by product. \r\n\r\nI really love SOD, but it didn\'t come all at once, so I\'ll go ahead and tell you a little story of how I came to like them. See back in \'98 I met this really cool guy, who turned me on to their first album. It was interesting, really hardcore metal, with a lot of hooks and time shifts, and a wild looking/sounding singer. They dressed like terrorist, and wore like gas mask and stuff. They had an upside down flag hanging behind their stage. I\'m not totally anti-American, by my anti political setiments often run along the same line as anti-American I suppose. Anyways, liked that first one. Didn\'t fall in love, but didn\'t hate it at all. Then few years later they show up on MTV with that Chop Suey. I blown away be the dramatics of the soft/heavy thing. That was exactly one week before 9/11. Suddenly the line, \"I cry when angels deserve to die in my self righteous suicide\", when paired with upside down flags, and terrorist images, seemed just a little too prophetic to be coincidence. I went to their website, and checked the forum, it seemed every day someone else made the same connection also referencing other songs from the album, and the fans would defend them and refer back to 9/11 when the band defended themselves on the forum. It would seem that the band are transplanted Armanians, and the singer Serg is a political activist. He is lobbying Bush to teach about the Armanian Genocide in American schools, because no one in the band knows who their grandfathers are, and they would hate to see for something like that to happen again. They think its important to teach anout the Armanian Genocide, so it doesn\'t happen to us. So anyways, there is a map of the world on their website, if you click on any country it will tell you the political issues in that country, and Serg\'s stance on it. Turns out he\'s extremely intelligent, and is just writing about events that have taken place around the world. The fact that one of these type of events hit home a week after the album\'s release was just an amazing coincidence, and the upside flag is actually flown when a country is in distress.\r\n\r\nThen we get into the guitar player, Damon. Seems he is the musical mastermind behind the band. He came into the studio with 40 songs prepared for that album. He writes super simple riffs, but strings so many of them together in one song, it makes his playing seem way more complicated than it is. So all those extra songs he had prepared get stolen, and are released via Napster. This kinda upsets the band, so as opposed to finishing them up, they just release them on \"Steal This Album\". That included the track \"Boom\", which the video was immediately banned from MTV after the first time it was shown. It showed the band at a protest in New York, against the war in Iraq the week before we went in, and tens of thousands of protesters around the world, interlaced with emotional commentary from some of the protesters, and ended with a home vid of a little Iraq-ey boy rideing his bike in circles, and a quote from John Lennon. Very moving video, still hard for me to watch.\r\n\r\nSo now we catch up to the present. The genious little guitar player has master minded not one, but two complete albums, this new one, Mezmorize, is just the prelude to the story that will be completed on Hyptnotize, which was actually due out in September, but I think they\'re stalling now due to its continued success. Anyways, right off the bat they\'re fucking with peoples heads with the first single \"Cigarro\". The opening line, \"My god is much bigger than yours, so big and so pure, my god can walk right through the door.\" Sounds just exactly like, \"My c0ck is much bigger..\", and the phones go nuts at the local radio station, but the DJ is swearing he\'s saying \"God\". I don\'t know, I think he\'s saying cock sometimes. Then there\'s BYOB, \"Bring Your Own Bomb\", that I\'m sure you\'ve heard by now, where they\'re just fucking railing against the war. I saw them perform that on SNL, and that\'s when I became convinced these guys are possibly the most important metal band since Sabbath. They were just so tight, and the little guitar guy is actually singing most of it, and not just the manic screaming. He switches from soft to heavy distortion in a heartbeat, and his tone was really good, you can hear every note in the fast sections. He even managed to slip a \"Fuck you\" past the censors. The best part was the split second of awed silence when they stopped playing. I don\'t think the SNL audience has ever heard anything so hardcore.\r\n\r\nMy buddy became hooked after seeing them live, said the same thing, they\'re just so damn tight, and the little guitar guy stole the show. I was reading about him in Guitar World, and he does some crazy stuff, like how he got  all the guitar sounds on the new album, by covering a wall with acoustics, and bouncing his amp\'s sound off them, then mic\'ing the soundholes. Sometime the strings are unmuted, and all the guiatrs tuned to a specific open tuning, for drone tones. He became my hero, when I found out he writes songs by hanging out in his apartment, that is littered with band equiptment, and a 4ft bong sitting next to his black leather couch. He admits to just baking out all day. See I knew that was the best way to write music. :lol: \r\n\r\nWell, that turned out longer than expected, and took a lot longer to type than I thought too, but, I had to tell the story like that, that\'s the only way you\'d understand my point of view.  :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:faca1901f3]What I\'ve really been listening to, though, is D.O.A., War on 45/Bloodied But Unbowed. Can\'t get enough of it. That drummer, Chuck Biscuits, is just fuckin\' sick... like the John Bonham of punk. They just rock so hard, nothing else matters... nothing except The Wipers, that is, which is a conversation I\'ve been wanting to have with you for a while now. Greg Sage... he\'s from my town, but relocated to your town quite awhile ago. I\'ve read a lot of interviews with that guy and always think you and he may be of the same mindset. He\'s a super-cool dude, for sure. I\'ve got most of the catalog now, and I dig it all. I\'m sure you know all about The Wipers... they are something I put off forever, but finally got into about a year and a half ago... whew, I wish I would have been a little older when those dudes were playin\' in Portland.[/quote:faca1901f3]I just got into the Wipers a few years ago. I knew they were from up north, and recorded in Tuscon, for some reason a lot of the Seatlle bands came and recorded in Tuscon, so I never knew they actually relocated here, never played any club shows in Phoenix. I got an album from about \'83 I think. I\'ll have to look up the title. You probably know it though. I love that one to death. I heard a later one, but had to ditch it. So loved the early stuff, hated the later stuff.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:faca1901f3]So, when you\'re asking, \"do you think that was part of the appeal, or had that even occurred to you as being part of it?\", are you talking about the \"more jacked up\", old school thing? If it\'s that, then yeah, maybe a little... again, I just like your take on that stuff. Honestly, I think I\'d be super happy with anything that came off of your bench. So, unless you aren\'t feelin\' the direction you\'re headin\', just keep on keepin\' on... but, if it feels like you\'re tryin\' to chase what you think I want, and you\'re not feelin\' like it\'s a car you\'d build for yourself, then maybe finish it off like [i:faca1901f3]you\'d[/i:faca1901f3] want it. The whole point for me is that I want a crazydave car, not a commissioned car that you built to my specs... does that help?\r\n\r\nHopefully I didn\'t miss your point, or make it more confusing.[/quote:faca1901f3] [/quote]Umm yeah, I get it, I think. No I\'m not confused, too much.  :lol: \r\n\r\nSeriously, I dig where you\'re coming from, I did before. The problem I think, is I\'m actually becoming increasingly influenced by how you and Superfly just keep \'em clean, and I\'m afraid that its gonna unintentionally look like I made it just for you, in your style or something, but I guess I need to shut up and go for it, cause really, I guess everything I do wreaks of me. :lol: \r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14029,'8d78a861b2','[quote:8d78a861b2=\"ph2t\"]hey man, congrats!\r\n\r\nI beat ya!  suffa! haha!\r\n\r\nsorry, couldn\'t help myself.\r\n\r\nBeing a member of the organising team I was getting pretty pissed off with the lack of turn-around in getting the results posted.  Aaron (site admin) doesn\'t realise the need to keep things moving.   Like a typical bloody programmer (his real life job) he thinks in a very anal fashion and this 100 point list for every fucken car just isn\'t feaslible.   Oh well , hopefully he\'ll learn.\r\n\r\nAnyways, congrats on third place dude.  And if you have some time, check out my latest (non electronic) project:\r\nhttp://www.ausmicro.com/link.asp?TOPIC_ID=1548&amp;view=lasttopic\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:8d78a861b2]Oh yeah, so ya beat me huh? Looks like I\'m gonna have to come down there and race ya. We\'ll let our drivin\' skillz be the final test.  :lol: \r\n\r\nSeriously, congrats to you too. I didn\'t think I\'d place with so many hot cars out there. \r\n\r\nTo tell you the truth my only real concern was to come out ahead of Yagbols \'cause he posted a Beetle so similar to mine right after mine.\r\n\r\n\r\n...and about the judging taking so long. Yeah, I totally lost interest. I\'m already bored with the car I entered, etc. etc. I could go on all day, but it doesn\'t look good bitching when you just placed, so I\'ll shut the hell up now. ;)\r\n\r\nI\'ll go check out your project now. That\'s what cool about you, you\'re not just a tech head, you\'re a creative bugger too. (lol, I said bugger, tee hee)\r\n\r\nDave'),(14005,'93895a594b','He has started to edit my posts and he did plenty of that with SkyLiNEz 4-eva!. He started a thread making fun of micromatch, and locked it down when micromatch stood up for himself. I don\'t want to be a backseat driver, but I think he\'s starting to get off hand. If he is going to edit my posts and make me look like a fool, then he\'d better fuck off. I\'m sick of him.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14006,'93895a594b','He has started to edit my posts and he did plenty of that with SkyLiNEz 4-eva!. He started a thread making fun of micromatch, and locked it down when micromatch stood up for himself. I don\'t want to be a backseat driver, but I think he\'s starting to get off hand. If he is going to edit my posts and make me look like a fool, then he\'d better fuck off. I\'m sick of him.'),(14106,'87efc0e25c','I\'ll pass along the message.\r\nI almost hopped on those biatches before payaso but I just traded with VDM for pullbacks.\r\nbut it was damn tempting! lol\r\n\r\nanyways, I\'ll pass along the message.'),(14107,'393e6ef4c6','modding\'s been at a low lately so they\'re just sitting there... they need love! lol\r\nyeah vdm\'s cool to do business with, I just sent him a epoch.\r\n\r\nthanx for passing the message along\r\n\r\npeace,\r\nB'),(14009,'2ab3e27620','hey superfly, do you think i could get some mosfets from you for my bit'),(14010,'6cbb96f42b','[quote:6cbb96f42b=\"CeliRA29\"]hey superfly, do you think i could get some mosfets from you for my bit[/quote:6cbb96f42b]\r\n\r\nHow many do you want? I\'m on the tail end of my last order, so I don\'t have a ton left. In fact, I have to make sure hue35 didn\'t already use the last of our stash. Let me know how many you want. 4 for $4 or 5 of them for $5 is pretty standard. You need 4 to do the mod and you can break the legs off if you\'re not careful so it\'s good to have an extra.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14011,'d6e941024b','[quote:d6e941024b=\"Maxximum Attack\"]no, not eve a peep :([/quote:d6e941024b]Damn, that makes me mad. Well keep me posted, if it\'s not there in another week, I\'ll check with the post office to see what I have to do.\r\n\r\nDave'),(14012,'6856595799','[quote:6856595799=\"Son_Gokou\"]He has started to edit my posts and he did plenty of that with SkyLiNEz 4-eva!. He started a thread making fun of micromatch, and locked it down when micromatch stood up for himself. I don\'t want to be a backseat driver, but I think he\'s starting to get off hand. If he is going to edit my posts and make me look like a fool, then he\'d better fuck off. I\'m sick of him.[/quote:6856595799]don\'t bother me with this shit'),(14013,'9387a19fc0','[quote:9387a19fc0=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:9387a19fc0=\"Son_Gokou\"]He has started to edit my posts and he did plenty of that with SkyLiNEz 4-eva!. He started a thread making fun of micromatch, and locked it down when micromatch stood up for himself. I don\'t want to be a backseat driver, but I think he\'s starting to get off hand. If he is going to edit my posts and make me look like a fool, then he\'d better fuck off. I\'m sick of him.[/quote:9387a19fc0]don\'t bother me with this shit[/quote:9387a19fc0]\r\n\r\n :???:'),(14014,'2e9fedf463','[quote:2e9fedf463=\"DarkTari\"]Thanx Pimp!\r\n\r\nBeen trying for a couple weeks, but doing it late on Sunday so I\'ve just been goin to my second, third choices.\r\n\r\nHow was Turkey Day ?[/quote:2e9fedf463]I hear ya, put em on the back burner and hit em up whenever you can.\r\n\r\nit was good, busy as all hell but still very cool.\r\nleft overs for 3 days straight! lol\r\n\r\nnow I gotta get back into the groove of actually working 5 days in a row again... yuck!\r\n\r\nfinally used my airbrush for the first time ever over the break.\r\njust some practice spraying, hopefully be hitting a car with it soon.\r\npaint lays down smooth as a babies bottom, but damn, what a pain in the ass to clean! lol\r\n\r\nhad some computer troubles over the break too, finally got those taken care of Sun. night.\r\nthat was my break.\r\n\r\nhow about yours?\r\nhow\'d it go?\r\nlots of family and even more food?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14015,'6cbb96f42b','[quote:6cbb96f42b=\"CeliRA29\"]hey superfly, do you think i could get some mosfets from you for my bit[/quote:6cbb96f42b]\r\n\r\nHow many do you want? I\'m on the tail end of my last order, so I don\'t have a ton left. In fact, I have to make sure hue35 didn\'t already use the last of our stash. Let me know how many you want. 4 for $4 or 5 of them for $5 is pretty standard. You need 4 to do the mod and you can break the legs off if you\'re not careful so it\'s good to have an extra.'),(17700,'f2f02571b9','Well I\'m registered at your gallery, so let me know whats next.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nripper7777777'),(14017,'aa4cc5a8a0','ill prolly want six just in case, but i may have a couple of other cars to fet so im not to sure at the moment i may just order 20 or so from digikey'),(14018,'9387a19fc0','[quote:9387a19fc0=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:9387a19fc0=\"Son_Gokou\"]He has started to edit my posts and he did plenty of that with SkyLiNEz 4-eva!. He started a thread making fun of micromatch, and locked it down when micromatch stood up for himself. I don\'t want to be a backseat driver, but I think he\'s starting to get off hand. If he is going to edit my posts and make me look like a fool, then he\'d better fuck off. I\'m sick of him.[/quote:9387a19fc0]don\'t bother me with this shit[/quote:9387a19fc0]\r\n\r\n :???:'),(14019,'e8c161838a','[quote:e8c161838a=\"VooDooMafia\"]Sup dude\r\n\r\n  Yea I just got the package, I would assume you will recieve yours anytime now not sure why it taking that long.\r\n\r\n  I left msg for wife to pay that 25 bones I guess with all the busyness(if thats a word) she forgot.  I will get on tonight and send some cash.[/quote:e8c161838a]\r\n\r\nSorry to be a biatchass punk but I ain\'t got the $$ yet.  I wanna put an order into TE and I could use the extra credit in my paysluts account :)\r\n\r\nthanks mate.\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14020,'d20a18f38c','sorry man i dont want this item any more, but thanks for your help'),(17514,'71baea98d3','Ya, I will need one once I move.  I\'m looking for one that is first and foremost [color=green:71baea98d3]CHEAP[/color:71baea98d3]!!  I don\'t care if its new or used.  Other than that all I want in it is....\r\n\r\n--CD burner...DVD burner would be bonus\r\n--60 or 80 harddrive\r\n--decent size monitor\r\n--ability to pimp the web quickly and easily, will have cable ISP\r\n--1 or 2 USB ports\r\n\r\nI don\'t really play to any games on the computer, so I don\'t need much graphic stuff on it, just enough to play some clips and stuff on the net.  Like BitPimp clips.  I just want something I can download and surf on.  I\'m not worried about software, I can get that.'),(14023,'a4a681fa85','hey can you help me wit my comp prob?? im stuck on 16 color and 680X4??  and it doesnt let me up the resolution or the color. My comp rashed and i re did it and now im stuccccccck wit this setting. i used to be 32 bit color and like 1000X??? resolution but now i aint got it. any help?? THANKS'),(14064,'49566b06bc','[quote:49566b06bc=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey \r\n\r\n\r\n  FUCK for some reason I can\'t log into my main paypal acct.\r\n\r\n  If you can send me your paypal info I will log into my other one and pay from there.\r\n\r\n  My wife said she had trub with it to.  I bet with all the cash going in from ebay and xmas they fucking locked it.\r\n\r\n  Grr this happened once before and it took almost a month to sort out.\r\n\r\n  Hint dont have lots of incoming transations with paypal at an givin moment.\r\n\r\n  Fucking paysluts.[/quote:49566b06bc]\r\n\r\nWhat a bitch man.  Those bastards.\r\n\r\nhere ya go:\r\n\r\nph2t@prahranpianos.com\r\n\r\ncheers and hope it all works out.\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14025,'e0b3a3a725','hey man, congrats!\r\n\r\nI beat ya!  suffa! haha!\r\n\r\nsorry, couldn\'t help myself.\r\n\r\nBeing a member of the organising team I was getting pretty pissed off with the lack of turn-around in getting the results posted.  Aaron (site admin) doesn\'t realise the need to keep things moving.   Like a typical bloody programmer (his real life job) he thinks in a very anal fashion and this 100 point list for every fucken car just isn\'t feaslible.   Oh well , hopefully he\'ll learn.\r\n\r\nAnyways, congrats on third place dude.  And if you have some time, check out my latest (non electronic) project:\r\nhttp://www.ausmicro.com/link.asp?TOPIC_ID=1548&amp;view=lasttopic\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(14026,'e0b3a3a725','hey man, congrats!\r\n\r\nI beat ya!  suffa! haha!\r\n\r\nsorry, couldn\'t help myself.\r\n\r\nBeing a member of the organising team I was getting pretty pissed off with the lack of turn-around in getting the results posted.  Aaron (site admin) doesn\'t realise the need to keep things moving.   Like a typical bloody programmer (his real life job) he thinks in a very anal fashion and this 100 point list for every fucken car just isn\'t feaslible.   Oh well , hopefully he\'ll learn.\r\n\r\nAnyways, congrats on third place dude.  And if you have some time, check out my latest (non electronic) project:\r\nhttp://www.ausmicro.com/link.asp?TOPIC_ID=1548&amp;view=lasttopic\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(14476,'c163d9496b','[quote:c163d9496b=\"DarkTari\"]I gotta get some High Speed access soon, right now I\'m working with 52.0 dial up and this will take awhile.  I\'ll send it from work this week, promise!\r\n\r\nThanx![/quote:c163d9496b]holy whoa!\r\npics of the hot rides musta been taking forever.\r\n\r\nwhenever you can do it man, I\'ll be here.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14477,'61f80f04dc','You said it ! It would\'ve taken 1.5 hours ?????  I\'ll plop em on a cd tonight and send, hopefully tomorrow according to my schedule.\r\n\r\nWhat\'s the deal with 1st place prize ?'),(14511,'029f16bd1d','[quote:029f16bd1d=\"DarkTari\"]Yo Pimp,\r\n\r\nI accidently deleted all my inbox messages instead of the selected ones (trying to do 2 things ay once) Can your restore them???? Thanx[/quote:029f16bd1d]sorry pimp, but I can\'t roll it back.\r\nI\'d have to restore from a backup, my last backup was last night.\r\nso if I restored that backup, we\'d roll back in time and miss all the posts, private messages, and registrations we\'ve had today until now.\r\n\r\nsorry homey'),(14512,'4e737ea007','Oh Well, that\'s the price I have to pay for trying to multitask (to put it lightly)\r\n\r\nThanx'),(14028,'8614c0975e','It is here!!!!!!! :-D \r\n\r\ni popped a wire tho :(  but i can fix that. I have to put in a faster motor to see how this thing goes. Is it supposed to wheelie with the 2.2 you gave me? and what surfaces are good for poppin wheelies?\r\n\r\nTHANK YOU DAVE'),(19165,'294390be60','Hey Cavey!\r\n\r\nThe package is on the way. Gotcha 3 Precious Micro\'s.  I put the 3 chassis in a separate box within the box.  Use the smaller box to return chassis (less postage).\r\n\r\nThanx Cavey !\r\n\r\nGH Sims\r\n7815 Quill Point Dr.\r\nBowie, Md. 20720');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19174,'75b5c50f19','C-Dub,\r\n\r\nI can cop you a couple of Precious to mod if you want.  I sent Cavey Dave\'s yesterday.\r\n\r\nHe\'s doin 3, I\'m doin 3-4, I can get you 2 and that makes 8-9.  That\'s 2 months of auction material with just us 3.  Now if you throw in Hog &amp; Silla we may be able to stretch this out thru da summer.\r\n\r\nI want to get my alter ego \"Da Big Kahuna\" to post this auction. Can I just register again with the same email or do I have to use a different one?\r\n\r\nI\'m feelin pump\'d about this, I\'ll take the lead on it which give you and the others time to moderate.\r\n\r\nAlso I still wanna do a [b:75b5c50f19]Pimp My Ride[/b:75b5c50f19] thang this summer!  I wanna make this summer even better than the last  :eek:   I\'ll bring it to the IC once we get the auction off the ground.'),(15134,'f07df7bbd5','Any others, like over there in Poland, Denmark, Germany, etc. ?'),(15152,'99e1157047','Just looking for other forums to spread the word!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (15153,'8753364dc5','Good I\'m glad it made it! And i\'ll let you know if anything is movin\'!\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nBen'),(15137,'aa130e1f50','Hi Payaso!\r\n\r\nThis is my address:\r\n\r\nMarek Statkiewicz\r\nKapitanska 20/13\r\n81-249 Gdynia\r\nPoland\r\n\r\n :rockon:  Miva'),(15138,'5046721fd1','Congrats on your win Marek...  Great car you had. Your prize will be shipped tomorrow.  Let us know when you get it...\r\n\r\nEnjoy.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(15139,'5046721fd1','Congrats on your win Marek...  Great car you had. Your prize will be shipped tomorrow.  Let us know when you get it...\r\n\r\nEnjoy.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(15140,'fdee8afa4a','Thank You very much :)\r\n\r\nI will inform you immediately.\r\n\r\nMiva'),(15141,'fdee8afa4a','Thank You very much :)\r\n\r\nI will inform you immediately.\r\n\r\nMiva'),(15142,'d640b066d4','Race on....... :-) \r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(14033,'2fce7c1bc8','This thing is fast as rasshole  :-D [size=24:2fce7c1bc8][/size:2fce7c1bc8]'),(14034,'61d9f376bd','[quote:61d9f376bd=\"Maxximum Attack\"]It is here!!!!!!! :-D \r\n\r\ni popped a wire tho :(  but i can fix that. I have to put in a faster motor to see how this thing goes. Is it supposed to wheelie with the 2.2 you gave me? and what surfaces are good for poppin wheelies?\r\n\r\nTHANK YOU DAVE[/quote:61d9f376bd]\r\nI glad it finally showed up. :-D \r\n\r\nI was wondering what was taking so long.\r\n\r\nAs for poppin\' wheelies, you have to go in reverse, then slam it into fowards to pop the front end up. If you hit forward from a dead stop it might not look like it\'s pulling wheelies, but you\'ll notice it doesn\'t steer very well, because the front wheels do lift slightly for a second. Something like a Perfection 4.2 Pro will make it much easier to pop wheelies.\r\n\r\nAs for surfaces, you want all the traction you can get to pull wheelies. My best combo has been Microsizer tires (Tomy pullbacks are [i:61d9f376bd]the[/i:61d9f376bd] best) on a shiny smooth surface. I clean the surface, and tires with degreaser so there is no oils, or dust to get in the way.\r\n\r\n...and don\'t worry about the Homie, had a bunch of doubles so I figured I\'d throw you a girl to pose with your cars.\r\n\r\nWell, enjoy, and if anyone ask, you tell them I\'m the best. ;)\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37400,'43a09acf03','yeah, the selecta is a frend of mine, but I ripped the CD to my PC, then burned the mp3\'s\r\n\r\nThe thing i hate about burning these DJ done cds is that, in the copy, there is a gap between the tracks, while in the original all the soongs flow into one another. I can\'t figure out how to burn and keep the fluency. I may buy a fresh CD with fresh misic for ya when i go into town to mail it. With some Dr. Evil  :smile: . His misic CAN\'T be played on the radio lol. I\'m not a big fan of him, but the first time you listen the lyrics make you laugh.\r\n\r\n[quote:43a09acf03=\"Dr. Evil\"]&quot;Each and every night I must get some puna nah na nah ni (punani),\r\nTake her to the water and make a Tsuna na nah nah na mi (tsunami),....\r\n\r\n...One night I took my girl to Tamboo boo boo boo \r\nThat\'s when I propped her up and introduced her to my Bam boo boo boo (bamboo),\r\nShe said, \'Dr. Evil can you be my boo boo boo?\'\r\nI said,\' No no nooo, I\'m not Usher FUCK YOU!\' &quot;[/quote:43a09acf03]:lol: :lol:\r\n\r\nI\'m buying that CD, I want it too  :eek: \r\n\r\nMaxx'),(34191,'c100dbefd0','Sup pimp?\r\n\r\nTime is of the essence, I cannot make ebay purchases :( so I\'m asking you for help. I really want this MRS4 roller, it\'s a real deal.\r\n\r\nCurrent bid= $50\r\nShipping= $12 US only\r\n[url=http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=6004969682&amp;category=44015&amp;sspagename=rvi:1:1v_home]link[/url]\r\n\r\nI\'m trying to build my micro from the ground up, so I really need the diffs and suspension off that roller. The motor too. Are you into MRS4\'s? If you are, and you need an aftermarket chassis we can work something out. That roller carries a Motek EXO1 chassis. I have no need for it. More on that later.\r\n\r\nIf you don\'t want anything off the MRS4, can you have it sent to:\r\n\r\nRasheed Sabir\r\n4405 NW 73rd Ave\r\nSTE 716993\r\nMiami, Florida 33166-6488\r\n\r\nThat is a forwarding service (skybox) that my dad has. You will only pay shipping there, I pay shipping from there to Barbados.\r\n\r\nIf you [u:c100dbefd0]do[/u:c100dbefd0] want stuff off it, here\'s what I\'m willing to offer:\r\n\r\n-Micro steering servo\r\n-Battery\r\n-Ferrari body\r\n-Motek EXO chassis\r\n\r\nI\'ll send a stock bottom plate so that yoou mount the shock and the differentials on. Along with a MO. Also if you\'re taking stuff you can have it, but can you pay the shipping of my part to barbados. That stuff for $10-$15 shipping cost seems like a good deal. Tell me what you think.\r\n\r\nPlease don\'t go over $55, that would put me over budget.\r\nPlease let me know before you start bidding, as I\'ve asked another pimp.\r\n\r\nThanx\r\nMaxx');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (15131,'eea616c86f','Thank You! :)\r\n\r\nI\'m not sure if i understood you. My english...  :? \r\n\r\nDo you mean: what webpages i visit most often?\r\nIf you do, my answer is: bitPimps, since i started micro r/c adventure :) (about 3 moths).\r\n\r\nMiva'),(15132,'f07df7bbd5','Any others, like over there in Poland, Denmark, Germany, etc. ?'),(28303,'b5c3d4abca','Hey Biohazard, I\'m not really needing resin parts right now, but when I do need those I\'ll come to You, but the ZZ MT board is 49 Mhz and it has no wires attached to it, I have other MT scrap parts that you may could use as well such as stock tires, and the stock dual cells, I\'ll be posting pics later tonight of what all I have up for graps. I am though in the market for a running chassis 1/64th scale, doesn\'t matter what freq 27 or 49, I just needs something that runs, (steers and drives) maybe we can work out a trade. Or if You want to pay cash just make an offer, cuz I really have no idea what that would be worth. :cool: \r\nThanks'),(14037,'f5b165a080','I finally got around to ordering a new batch of FETs, and I\'m getting ready to start my work on the SE back up. I could use your extra PCB, because I like to keep one car working, so I have a reference point should something go wrong.\r\n\r\nThe offers still on if you want a FET modded Thunder charger PCB, that\'s no prob for me. I could even paint you a body if that appeals to you. Just let me know.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the address, for whenever you\'re ready to send it, is:\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd. Apt 1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14038,'49f90fb703','[quote:49f90fb703=\"Maxximum Attack\"]This thing is fast as rasshole  :-D [size=24:49f90fb703][/size:49f90fb703][/quote:49f90fb703] :???: Not sure what a rasshole is, but them thing must be fast, \'cause I\'ve never seen one. :lol: \r\n\r\nYep, FETs do make them cars go quick, but you notice that it doesn\'t seem to add speed as much as power. It seems like fast motors like the TinyRC R-spec, and Perfection 4.2s are drawing too much power, and FETs are just give these motors the power they need to hit their rated speed.\r\n\r\nDave'),(14039,'f5b165a080','I finally got around to ordering a new batch of FETs, and I\'m getting ready to start my work on the SE back up. I could use your extra PCB, because I like to keep one car working, so I have a reference point should something go wrong.\r\n\r\nThe offers still on if you want a FET modded Thunder charger PCB, that\'s no prob for me. I could even paint you a body if that appeals to you. Just let me know.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the address, for whenever you\'re ready to send it, is:\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd. Apt 1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\ndave'),(14040,'5df364975a','You get anymore up on ebay yet?  Its the xmas season and people wanna spend there cash lol.\r\n\r\n  But anyway just checking to see how things are going, I know here they are busy as shit and dont have time to drop in asmuch as I should.\r\n\r\n  With Xmas and having to prepare to go back to work in just avoer a month its killin me.\r\n\r\n  Congrats on your 3rd place but IMO that car should have takin it but I hear they had some crazy system for judging so who knows.\r\n\r\n  Hows the se mods going and the xmods?\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14041,'b3b957a25f','you just need the pcb or the whole car? one of the little transistors or something came off the board but for the most part its intact. ya a trade for a fetted tcharger or one of your paint jobs would work well. i just payed rent today so i cant afford shit til probably next week.'),(14042,'5df364975a','You get anymore up on ebay yet?  Its the xmas season and people wanna spend there cash lol.\r\n\r\n  But anyway just checking to see how things are going, I know here they are busy as shit and dont have time to drop in asmuch as I should.\r\n\r\n  With Xmas and having to prepare to go back to work in just avoer a month its killin me.\r\n\r\n  Congrats on your 3rd place but IMO that car should have takin it but I hear they had some crazy system for judging so who knows.\r\n\r\n  Hows the se mods going and the xmods?\r\n\r\nPete'),(14043,'c97a003472','[quote:c97a003472=\"VooDooMafia\"]You get anymore up on ebay yet?  Its the xmas season and people wanna spend there cash lol.\r\n\r\n  But anyway just checking to see how things are going, I know here they are busy as shit and dont have time to drop in asmuch as I should.\r\n\r\n  With Xmas and having to prepare to go back to work in just avoer a month its killin me.\r\n\r\n  Congrats on your 3rd place but IMO that car should have takin it but I hear they had some crazy system for judging so who knows.\r\n\r\n  Hows the se mods going and the xmods?\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:c97a003472]To basically answer all your questions, I just ordered my FETs, as soon as they get here, everything will resume. I also came across some 10 dolla Bit Char-Gs, so I got a batch of those to modify.\r\n\r\nA Lancer, that I will FET mod, paint, put a 4.2 in it, then put right back in the box, and definately sell on ebay.\r\n\r\nA Calsonic Skyline. It comes with a 2.6, and a race themed body, so I\'m just gonna FET mod it, but it\'s not going right back in the box. I gonna play with it for a week, and think about keeping it, but it will probably end up back in the box, as I already have a 35mhz Skyline, but I\'d kinda like to keep that 2.6, because it\'s the only Tomy motor I don\'t have.\r\n\r\nA silver S2000 that I will be keeping for the 57mhz frequency\r\n\r\nA Wild Char-G (I can\'t believe I got that for 10 bucks too! last one at that! :eek: ) That I don\'t know what I\'m gonna do with. I\'m gonna FEt mod it, and it better be cool, or I\'m gonna put that sucker on ebay too.\r\n\r\nThen there\'s that stretched Micro Speed. I paint the camaro body, and give that one a second chance.\r\n\r\n\r\nOn the Ausmicro contest, I didn\'t mind taking 3rd place, but I honestly didn\'t agree with 1st and second. There was several cars that could have, should have placed above mine, but they didn\'t like just say, \'I put in FETs, and a 3.8 in it\', because the reality is, even though you and me know I have FETs in my cars, the judges didn\'t really know that as a fact. Considering all they can do is look at a picture, I feel looks should have played the largest contributing factor.\r\n\r\nI\'d like to bitch, but I took 3rd, so I gotta just smile and wave.  :-) Thanks guys, thank you so much, wow, just thanks, you know whatever. :roll: \r\n\r\nSo yeah, just waiting for stuff to come in, then I placed in that ausmicro thing. That\'s about it. :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(14044,'b3b957a25f','you just need the pcb or the whole car? one of the little transistors or something came off the board but for the most part its intact. ya a trade for a fetted tcharger or one of your paint jobs would work well. i just payed rent today so i cant afford shit til probably next week.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14045,'83af92636f','[quote:83af92636f=\"hogjowlz\"]you just need the pcb or the whole car? one of the little transistors or something came off the board but for the most part its intact. ya a trade for a fetted tcharger or one of your paint jobs would work well. i just payed rent today so i cant afford shit til probably next week.[/quote:83af92636f]Yeah just the PCB. I ripped the tab that a capacitor solders to off mine, so as long as the tabs are still there, I can always pull the part off my dead PCB to replace it.\r\n\r\nCool, I\'ll hook ya up.\r\n\r\nI understand about the rent thing. In the same boat myself. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(14046,'c97a003472','[quote:c97a003472=\"VooDooMafia\"]You get anymore up on ebay yet?  Its the xmas season and people wanna spend there cash lol.\r\n\r\n  But anyway just checking to see how things are going, I know here they are busy as shit and dont have time to drop in asmuch as I should.\r\n\r\n  With Xmas and having to prepare to go back to work in just avoer a month its killin me.\r\n\r\n  Congrats on your 3rd place but IMO that car should have takin it but I hear they had some crazy system for judging so who knows.\r\n\r\n  Hows the se mods going and the xmods?\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:c97a003472]To basically answer all your questions, I just ordered my FETs, as soon as they get here, everything will resume. I also came across some 10 dolla Bit Char-Gs, so I got a batch of those to modify.\r\n\r\nA Lancer, that I will FET mod, paint, put a 4.2 in it, then put right back in the box, and definately sell on ebay.\r\n\r\nA Calsonic Skyline. It comes with a 2.6, and a race themed body, so I\'m just gonna FET mod it, but it\'s not going right back in the box. I gonna play with it for a week, and think about keeping it, but it will probably end up back in the box, as I already have a 35mhz Skyline, but I\'d kinda like to keep that 2.6, because it\'s the only Tomy motor I don\'t have.\r\n\r\nA silver S2000 that I will be keeping for the 57mhz frequency\r\n\r\nA Wild Char-G (I can\'t believe I got that for 10 bucks too! last one at that! :eek: ) That I don\'t know what I\'m gonna do with. I\'m gonna FEt mod it, and it better be cool, or I\'m gonna put that sucker on ebay too.\r\n\r\nThen there\'s that stretched Micro Speed. I paint the camaro body, and give that one a second chance.\r\n\r\n\r\nOn the Ausmicro contest, I didn\'t mind taking 3rd place, but I honestly didn\'t agree with 1st and second. There was several cars that could have, should have placed above mine, but they didn\'t like just say, \'I put in FETs, and a 3.8 in it\', because the reality is, even though you and me know I have FETs in my cars, the judges didn\'t really know that as a fact. Considering all they can do is look at a picture, I feel looks should have played the largest contributing factor.\r\n\r\nI\'d like to bitch, but I took 3rd, so I gotta just smile and wave.  :-) Thanks guys, thank you so much, wow, just thanks, you know whatever. :roll: \r\n\r\nSo yeah, just waiting for stuff to come in, then I placed in that ausmicro thing. That\'s about it. :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(14047,'83af92636f','[quote:83af92636f=\"hogjowlz\"]you just need the pcb or the whole car? one of the little transistors or something came off the board but for the most part its intact. ya a trade for a fetted tcharger or one of your paint jobs would work well. i just payed rent today so i cant afford shit til probably next week.[/quote:83af92636f]Yeah just the PCB. I ripped the tab that a capacitor solders to off mine, so as long as the tabs are still there, I can always pull the part off my dead PCB to replace it.\r\n\r\nCool, I\'ll hook ya up.\r\n\r\nI understand about the rent thing. In the same boat myself. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14048,'e6f9fec06c','but ya its yours ill try to bring it into work at least this week. i cant imagine it costs more than a buck to ship so ill try asap.'),(14049,'e6f9fec06c','but ya its yours ill try to bring it into work at least this week. i cant imagine it costs more than a buck to ship so ill try asap.'),(14050,'37bde7aac8','Cool glad you got some cheap cars :)\r\n\r\n  I just picked up a wild char G, Initial D set and 10 bodies from that trackmaster dude on ausmicro.  Not bad for 50 bucks with like 4 day shipping.\r\n\r\n  I have not opened up the Wild Char G yet but the chassie is huge compared to a normal bit and it runs a different stearing.\r\n\r\n  One thing about them that I have to get is HLJ had this missle launching grappling hook for them.  Nothing better then a bit firing some shit out.\r\n\r\n  Hope I have more time and $$ after xmas to pick up more stuff.\r\n\r\n  I hear ya on the contest.  I know they also looked at how much you contribute to the site but still you can say all you want but you dont know what mods it has unless you can see them.\r\n\r\n  Oh well I think they took so long cause all 3 would have been pimps and they had to figure a way to stop that. LOL I gonna get bithed to send me some shit anyway.'),(14051,'37bde7aac8','Cool glad you got some cheap cars :)\r\n\r\n  I just picked up a wild char G, Initial D set and 10 bodies from that trackmaster dude on ausmicro.  Not bad for 50 bucks with like 4 day shipping.\r\n\r\n  I have not opened up the Wild Char G yet but the chassie is huge compared to a normal bit and it runs a different stearing.\r\n\r\n  One thing about them that I have to get is HLJ had this missle launching grappling hook for them.  Nothing better then a bit firing some shit out.\r\n\r\n  Hope I have more time and $$ after xmas to pick up more stuff.\r\n\r\n  I hear ya on the contest.  I know they also looked at how much you contribute to the site but still you can say all you want but you dont know what mods it has unless you can see them.\r\n\r\n  Oh well I think they took so long cause all 3 would have been pimps and they had to figure a way to stop that. LOL I gonna get bithed to send me some shit anyway.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14052,'dfc0121cf6','[quote:dfc0121cf6=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\n  Oh well I think they took so long cause all 3 would have been pimps and they had to figure a way to stop that. [/quote:dfc0121cf6]I was thinking the same thing, but know ones ever gonna say it out loud, ya know. ;)\r\n\r\n\r\nThat\'s cool you getting a Wild Char-G too. I\'ve always kinda wanted one, but not that bad. I want to fix mine up like a total monster truck, and i can\'t figure out what I could do with the extra motor in that context. I saw that shooter thing, and that\'s kinda cool. Now that I\'m actually getting Wild Char-G I\'m not so sure I want one. I just want to make it fast, so I romp it off road. If it\'s still too slow with FETs and a 4.2 then on to the auction block it goes. :lol: \r\n\r\nBetcha no one ever seen a custom painted, FET modded Wild Char-G on ebay before.  8-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(14053,'dfc0121cf6','[quote:dfc0121cf6=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n\r\n  Oh well I think they took so long cause all 3 would have been pimps and they had to figure a way to stop that. [/quote:dfc0121cf6]I was thinking the same thing, but know ones ever gonna say it out loud, ya know. ;)\r\n\r\n\r\nThat\'s cool you getting a Wild Char-G too. I\'ve always kinda wanted one, but not that bad. I want to fix mine up like a total monster truck, and i can\'t figure out what I could do with the extra motor in that context. I saw that shooter thing, and that\'s kinda cool. Now that I\'m actually getting Wild Char-G I\'m not so sure I want one. I just want to make it fast, so I romp it off road. If it\'s still too slow with FETs and a 4.2 then on to the auction block it goes. :lol: \r\n\r\nBetcha no one ever seen a custom painted, FET modded Wild Char-G on ebay before.  8-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(14054,'d9a1305262','Yea I would like to see how it goes with fets in it.  You are gonna want alot of torque thats for sure.\r\n\r\n  If you like it you are gonna want another.  I know my wife wants me to get another so we can battle it out.  She also wants the coin battle set lol.  Shes not into the racing to much but like to hit shit.  I know I tossed in a 3.0 I think and it move alot better then stock.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14055,'d9a1305262','Yea I would like to see how it goes with fets in it.  You are gonna want alot of torque thats for sure.\r\n\r\n  If you like it you are gonna want another.  I know my wife wants me to get another so we can battle it out.  She also wants the coin battle set lol.  Shes not into the racing to much but like to hit shit.  I know I tossed in a 3.0 I think and it move alot better then stock.'),(14056,'3e6d8ff1f7','[quote:3e6d8ff1f7=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n  If you like it you are gonna want another. [/quote:3e6d8ff1f7]\r\nWell that goes without saying, doesn\'t it ;)  :lol: \r\n\r\n[quote:3e6d8ff1f7] I know my wife wants me to get another so we can battle it out.  She also wants the coin battle set lol.  Shes not into the racing to much but like to hit shit.  I know I tossed in a 3.0 I think and it move alot better then stock.[/quote:3e6d8ff1f7] :???: Hmm, maybe this will be the one that finally gets my wife hooked. \r\n\r\nWe\'ll see.  :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(14057,'3e6d8ff1f7','[quote:3e6d8ff1f7=\"VooDooMafia\"]\r\n  If you like it you are gonna want another. [/quote:3e6d8ff1f7]\r\nWell that goes without saying, doesn\'t it ;)  :lol: \r\n\r\n[quote:3e6d8ff1f7] I know my wife wants me to get another so we can battle it out.  She also wants the coin battle set lol.  Shes not into the racing to much but like to hit shit.  I know I tossed in a 3.0 I think and it move alot better then stock.[/quote:3e6d8ff1f7] :???: Hmm, maybe this will be the one that finally gets my wife hooked. \r\n\r\nWe\'ll see.  :lol: \r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14058,'5fae32a483','I couldn\'t really find the right red, so one of the red\'s you had should be okay. Anything close to fire engine red.  Let me know if you have any problems.  Thanks.'),(14059,'d46ac16b2f','hey man, I got your package, thanks!\r\n\r\nI sent out your other pkg today.  post office say 1-2 weeks\r\n\r\nCheers man,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(14060,'d46ac16b2f','hey man, I got your package, thanks!\r\n\r\nI sent out your other pkg today.  post office say 1-2 weeks\r\n\r\nCheers man,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(14472,'20a6090471','Are you able to extract a .rar file?'),(14473,'b0616cc7a1','Aight I\'ll send ya one too. :-)'),(14062,'f19a4d30bc','Hey \r\n\r\n\r\n  FUCK for some reason I can\'t log into my main paypal acct.\r\n\r\n  If you can send me your paypal info I will log into my other one and pay from there.\r\n\r\n  My wife said she had trub with it to.  I bet with all the cash going in from ebay and xmas they fucking locked it.\r\n\r\n  Grr this happened once before and it took almost a month to sort out.\r\n\r\n  Hint dont have lots of incoming transations with paypal at an givin moment.\r\n\r\n  Fucking paysluts.'),(14063,'49566b06bc','[quote:49566b06bc=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey \r\n\r\n\r\n  FUCK for some reason I can\'t log into my main paypal acct.\r\n\r\n  If you can send me your paypal info I will log into my other one and pay from there.\r\n\r\n  My wife said she had trub with it to.  I bet with all the cash going in from ebay and xmas they fucking locked it.\r\n\r\n  Grr this happened once before and it took almost a month to sort out.\r\n\r\n  Hint dont have lots of incoming transations with paypal at an givin moment.\r\n\r\n  Fucking paysluts.[/quote:49566b06bc]\r\n\r\nWhat a bitch man.  Those bastards.\r\n\r\nhere ya go:\r\n\r\nph2t@prahranpianos.com\r\n\r\ncheers and hope it all works out.\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19149,'2659fe11f5','Thanks for the props man, i got the body from one of my kids toys and had to chop it in two and put it back together...the chassis is from a bit char-A clone.  If you notice the bars at the back are from a Toyota Bb body.'),(15431,'bd739b445f','Mann don\'t worry about the time, I\'m not in a rush (as most KIDS are), it get\'s here when it gets here  :eek: \r\n\r\nThanx a lot Cavey, no I don\'t own a chip\'d Micro so it\'s gonna be Da Bomb!\r\nI\'m probably gonna do a spring suspension, alloys, (got plenty of \'em) and some more untimate stuff.  Now I just gotta do a new body becoming of it\'s awsome power!\r\n\r\nThanx again Mann.........'),(14280,'0a549c61d9','hey brother!\r\n\r\njust mail me a chassis, paypal me $6USD to matt.marcos@prahranpianos.com and tell me what you want from the list and I\'ll do it.  Hell man for you I\'m happy to do all of the 2nd group for ya, not just the 2 of 3.   \r\n\r\ncheers pete,\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(14282,'b7797c917c','hey man, I\'m happy to do this for you BUT I\'m only accepting paypal for this.  The main reason I\'m doing this is to increase my paypal balance for other purchases.  If you could pay barto the cash and get him to pay me then that\'s fine.\r\n\r\ncheers man,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14283,'2504495f9d','hey man, yeah i do have paypal now, i have had it for a while.but the only prob is the wires come loss on my car and i dont have the skills do solder them back up, mabye you could do that for me. and i just get a fet and spring mod.\r\ncheers'),(14284,'8fb8729cf6','go whoop his ass!!'),(14286,'0c7ed9ca80','Who?  What?  WHERE????'),(14288,'20c77039d1','http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2742'),(14334,'87f9ad569b','my guess is he ripped from trc or rcmod'),(14335,'dbfd7400bb','tru dat'),(14290,'508d859b17','Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nsend me your email and I\'ll send you the body mod file to post in the appropriate forum.\r\n\r\nThanx!'),(35350,'892c97c043','[quote:892c97c043=\"cj\"][color=red:892c97c043][size=18:892c97c043][b:892c97c043]For Your Eys Only[/b:892c97c043][/size:892c97c043][/color:892c97c043]\r\n[size=9:892c97c043]My cell number is 931-607-0548[/size:892c97c043]\r\n[color=red:892c97c043][size=18:892c97c043][b:892c97c043]For Your Eys Only[/b:892c97c043][/size:892c97c043][/color:892c97c043][/quote:892c97c043]\r\n\r\nI\'ll try an give you a call monday afternoon.   :-o \r\n\r\n\r\nMike'),(14293,'0a549c61d9','hey brother!\r\n\r\njust mail me a chassis, paypal me $6USD to matt.marcos@prahranpianos.com and tell me what you want from the list and I\'ll do it.  Hell man for you I\'m happy to do all of the 2nd group for ya, not just the 2 of 3.   \r\n\r\ncheers pete,\r\n\r\nmatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14294,'cc53f59106','Damn!  That\'s the 3rd paint job I did!  Where da hell did he pull dat from!\r\n\r\nI had that one posted everywhere, before I was a Pimp.  I\'ll have a convo wit \'em....'),(14336,'bef6c5da38','[quote:bef6c5da38=\"DarkTari\"]Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nsend me your email and I\'ll send you the body mod file to post in the appropriate forum.\r\n\r\nThanx![/quote:bef6c5da38]cool mang...\r\ncabowabo@lixlink.com\r\n\r\nspeaking of which, man I\'ve gotta get modding something! lol'),(14296,'834064452f','[quote:834064452f=\"PimpIke\"]ph2t,\r\n\r\n       what\'d mr. micromatch talk to you about. i was sleeping like a cow, so i don\'t know. thanks for the info. -mike[/quote:834064452f]\r\n\r\nhe was saying that you\'d be interested in this:\r\nhttp://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2747&amp;start=0&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight=\r\n\r\nbut it\'s your call.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14297,'575e215638','reply @ ph2t. \r\n\r\n\r\n           I believe that I want the mosfet mod and the DIP switch mod and the springs. \r\n\r\n         Both me and micro match want mods. He will send you 12 dollars via paypal soon enough, and we will get this going. I think that we will be using our LHS to handle this order so we don\'t have stuff going two different places. Also cheaper on your side to send your stuff back to one place in the same package. \r\n\r\n         Thanks ph2t, your the bomb. -Mike');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14298,'6a5818a1ca','hey man, got your payment, thanks :)\r\n\r\nmail your chassis to:\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nBENTLEIGH EAST   VIC   3165\r\nAUSTRALIA\r\n\r\nOnce I get it I\'ll mod it, test it, then send it right back.   What freq chassis will you be sending?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14299,'acf521616e','i will have 49mhz. i will be sending you a brannd new bcg chassis right out  of the box\r\n\r\nThanks Agian\r\nmicro mmatch'),(14300,'9e71189672','hey,\r\n\r\ni asked originally for\r\n\r\nmosfet mod\r\nfront springs and\r\nguitar string anteanna\r\n\r\nbut i want to chaange it to\r\n\r\n\r\nmosfet mod\r\nfront springs and\r\ndip switch mod\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nmicro'),(14301,'93164040ff','o an di for got im sending pimp ikes 6 too i will pm  u his adress later ... gotta get it\r\n\r\nand he wants\r\n\r\nmosfet\r\ndip switch\r\nfront suspension'),(14302,'2504495f9d','hey man, yeah i do have paypal now, i have had it for a while.but the only prob is the wires come loss on my car and i dont have the skills do solder them back up, mabye you could do that for me. and i just get a fet and spring mod.\r\ncheers'),(14783,'8b34cac21e','Hi Hiroto34,\r\n\r\nCan i ask a question. I can\'t link to the my digitalpose albums. What can i do. Can you tell me step by step.\r\n\r\nThanks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14784,'cbb45f0f07','What I do after I download my pics, I go to my album, click on the pic I want. Then after it\'s displayed, I click on it again to bring up a bigger version. Finally, I  right click the imgage to bring up the properties window,highlight the image link,  then right click again to copy the text. Then i paste the image link into my post\r\n\r\nex. [img]http:www.digitalpose/yada yada yada[/img]\r\n\r\nLet me know if this helps'),(14304,'acf521616e','i will have 49mhz. i will be sending you a brannd new bcg chassis right out  of the box\r\n\r\nThanks Agian\r\nmicro mmatch'),(14305,'9e71189672','hey,\r\n\r\ni asked originally for\r\n\r\nmosfet mod\r\nfront springs and\r\nguitar string anteanna\r\n\r\nbut i want to chaange it to\r\n\r\n\r\nmosfet mod\r\nfront springs and\r\ndip switch mod\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nmicro'),(14306,'93164040ff','o an di for got im sending pimp ikes 6 too i will pm  u his adress later ... gotta get it\r\n\r\nand he wants\r\n\r\nmosfet\r\ndip switch\r\nfront suspension'),(14307,'bd29a16786','[quote:bd29a16786=\"micromatch\"]o an di for got im sending pimp ikes 6 too i will pm  u his adress later ... gotta get it\r\n\r\nand he wants\r\n\r\nmosfet\r\ndip switch\r\nfront suspension[/quote:bd29a16786]\r\n\r\ncool');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14308,'3fc5d410ee','[quote:3fc5d410ee=\"micromatch\"]hey,\r\n\r\ni asked originally for\r\n\r\nmosfet mod\r\nfront springs and\r\nguitar string anteanna\r\n\r\nbut i want to chaange it to\r\n\r\n\r\nmosfet mod\r\nfront springs and\r\ndip switch mod\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nmicro[/quote:3fc5d410ee]\r\n\r\ncool, it won\'t be locked in until I get your chassis, you can change you mind no sweats man :)'),(19145,'048c068955','[quote:048c068955=\"PimpIke\"]i know im not totally innocent. that is because i said things to charlie.\r\ni am sorry for being a shithead about this matter. \r\n\r\ncan i stay here for a bit longer if i don\'t be a shithead?\r\n-mike[/quote:048c068955]I never told you to leave.\r\nyou\'re still welcome here.'),(19146,'bd9dd6e833','Thanks cabo.'),(19148,'531dd0f4b5','Dude I just love that Swat Van.  You said it was a Bit Char-A clone body or car you used.  I search the web for 2 days looking for that car.  Where did you get it from or do you know where I can find it? \r\n\r\nThanks Man you Rock\r\n\r\nMike'),(25482,'faafa0868b',':sad: my zz got drowned on my cool tub mod\r\n\r\n :grin: but i dried it with a hair dryer and wala :eek:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14311,'b585f6d3aa','[quote:b585f6d3aa=\"brendan123\"]hey man, yeah i do have paypal now, i have had it for a while.but the only prob is the wires come loss on my car and i dont have the skills do solder them back up, mabye you could do that for me. and i just get a fet and spring mod.\r\ncheers[/quote:b585f6d3aa]\r\n\r\nas longs you can confirm that the pcb is ok, I\'ll happily resolder the wires dude, that aint an issue.  you can still have 2 mods from the second group no sweats.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(14312,'806a05871f','yeah, man it\'s kool with my parents, so when should i send it, and pay for it. and by the way this car already has a guiter string antanna on it so it is now, a mosfet, springs and a dip switch. i think you will have to send my ur details again i forgot them.\r\n\r\ncheers'),(14313,'806a05871f','yeah, man it\'s kool with my parents, so when should i send it, and pay for it. and by the way this car already has a guiter string antanna on it so it is now, a mosfet, springs and a dip switch. i think you will have to send my ur details again i forgot them.\r\n\r\ncheers'),(14314,'f539606e5a','g\'day!\r\n\r\nwhat I need is for you to paypal me the $6USD and mail me a chassis and tell me what mods you want done from the list.  To be locked in  I need to see the payment.  Once that\'s done and I receive your chassis, I\'ll mod it, test it then ship it back to you.\r\n\r\nCheers dude,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14315,'fc185c8226','alright what is your paypal name??????  Count me in definitly'),(14316,'fc185c8226','alright what is your paypal name??????  Count me in definitly'),(15229,'0be8402321','Auight SuperFly, your package is in the mail today, you should bet it in a few days.  Please let me know when it arrives!\r\n\r\nEnjoy !'),(14318,'647bac15d9','[quote:647bac15d9=\"JAC4412\"]alright what is your paypal name??????  Count me in definitly[/quote:647bac15d9]\r\n\r\ncool, paypal is matt.marcos@bigpond.com\r\n\r\nShip your chassis to\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nBENTLEIGH EAST   VIC   3165\r\nAUSTRALIA\r\n\r\nWhat freq chassis are you sending?  And what mods do you want man?\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14319,'725cd19a73','i sending a 49mhz zz chassis.  I gonna say mosfet, guitar string anntena, and spring suspension.  Do you think you can wait till christmas?????  im gonna be getting some more cars.  If not ill send it now.  But rather sent it later.'),(14320,'725cd19a73','i sending a 49mhz zz chassis.  I gonna say mosfet, guitar string anntena, and spring suspension.  Do you think you can wait till christmas?????  im gonna be getting some more cars.  If not ill send it now.  But rather sent it later.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14322,'d7496fee27','[quote:d7496fee27=\"JAC4412\"]i sending a 49mhz zz chassis.  I gonna say mosfet, guitar string anntena, and spring suspension.  Do you think you can wait till christmas?????  im gonna be getting some more cars.  If not ill send it now.  But rather sent it later.[/quote:d7496fee27]\r\n\r\nthat\'s fine mate, I can do zz chassis as well.   Send it when you want to(just tell me when you have sent it so I know when to expect).   No rush at all.  What chassis would you want to send me?   Got your paysluts too, thanks...:)\r\n\r\n\r\ncheers man,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14323,'0ca21c25c9','well, ill be getting some zzses for christmas and i just got an lxx beetle off of ebay.  so im still considering what i will send.  ill tell you when im ready.\r\nItll prolly be a zz though.'),(14324,'508d859b17','Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nsend me your email and I\'ll send you the body mod file to post in the appropriate forum.\r\n\r\nThanx!'),(19598,'c8d867cfaf','[quote:c8d867cfaf=\"hue35\"]Holy shit! The Dirtbombs!! Man, that is some fuuuunnn shit. They remind me of Wilson Pickett in the gutter on speed. When the Stevie Wonder song played, I was beltin\' it out while doin\' some dishes... that\'s one of my favorite tunes of his (Livin\' for the City).\r\n\r\nThanks, man.. I should be mailin\' some stuff tomorrow or Saturday.[/quote:c8d867cfaf]Cool man, I glad you dug that one. One of my favs. \"Underdog\" is like my theme song.  :lol: \r\n\r\nI\'ve got Big Black ripped for you. It\'s all of Songs About Fucking, and a few of the better tracks off of Atomizer. I\'m gonna get around to getting the Jesus Lizard album Goat ripped. \r\n\r\nYou ever heard No Means No? I was kinda thinking you\'d dig them too.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14326,'bd29a16786','[quote:bd29a16786=\"micromatch\"]o an di for got im sending pimp ikes 6 too i will pm  u his adress later ... gotta get it\r\n\r\nand he wants\r\n\r\nmosfet\r\ndip switch\r\nfront suspension[/quote:bd29a16786]\r\n\r\ncool'),(14327,'3fc5d410ee','[quote:3fc5d410ee=\"micromatch\"]hey,\r\n\r\ni asked originally for\r\n\r\nmosfet mod\r\nfront springs and\r\nguitar string anteanna\r\n\r\nbut i want to chaange it to\r\n\r\n\r\nmosfet mod\r\nfront springs and\r\ndip switch mod\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nmicro[/quote:3fc5d410ee]\r\n\r\ncool, it won\'t be locked in until I get your chassis, you can change you mind no sweats man :)'),(14328,'4e68480658','[quote:4e68480658=\"PimpIke\"]reply @ ph2t. \r\n\r\n\r\n           I believe that I want the mosfet mod and the DIP switch mod and the springs. \r\n\r\n         Both me and micro match want mods. He will send you 12 dollars via paypal soon enough, and we will get this going. I think that we will be using our LHS to handle this order so we don\'t have stuff going two different places. Also cheaper on your side to send your stuff back to one place in the same package. \r\n\r\n         Thanks ph2t, your the bomb. -Mike[/quote:4e68480658]\r\n\r\nI\'d prefer to deliver to the address listed in the paypal account.  This way we are covered under there policies.  What freq chassis will you be sending dude?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14329,'00d1e7a86b','Fine with me if you want to send them both to micro match, since he paypal\'d, and we meet up every once week, so we are in touch. I will probably be sending a 35mhz Chassi  brand new in the box. Where we send it out will be different, because were going to use our hobby shop to send them to AUS, so, don\'t post them back to that same addy on the box. \r\n\r\n      Cheers,\r\n\r\n\r\n            Mike');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14330,'0ca21c25c9','well, ill be getting some zzses for christmas and i just got an lxx beetle off of ebay.  so im still considering what i will send.  ill tell you when im ready.\r\nItll prolly be a zz though.'),(14332,'50d8b99d4d','OK cool will go out same day as it gets here.'),(14333,'25df67b643','hey dude.\r\n\r\nJust paypal me at matt.marcos@bigpond.com\r\n\r\nSend your chassis to me and I\'ll mod it and send it back.\r\n\r\nOnce the $$ has gone through I\'ll advise you of my delivery details.\r\n\r\nWhat freq chassis will you be sending?\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14342,'24420422ce','yo biatch lol\r\nlemme know the ftp stuff whenever we\'re ready for the photoshop swap thang will ya?\r\n\r\nthanks bro!'),(14343,'24420422ce','yo biatch lol\r\nlemme know the ftp stuff whenever we\'re ready for the photoshop swap thang will ya?\r\n\r\nthanks bro!'),(14344,'6fd67a0e15','[quote:6fd67a0e15=\"CaboWabo\"]yo biatch lol\r\nlemme know the ftp stuff whenever we\'re ready for the photoshop swap thang will ya?\r\n\r\nthanks bro![/quote:6fd67a0e15]\r\n\r\nyo ya \'lil bugger.....\r\n\r\njust making the ftp account now man.\r\nI\'ll let hog know so he can up it\r\nthen I\'ll pass it on.\r\n\r\nshamon!\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14345,'6fd67a0e15','[quote:6fd67a0e15=\"CaboWabo\"]yo biatch lol\r\nlemme know the ftp stuff whenever we\'re ready for the photoshop swap thang will ya?\r\n\r\nthanks bro![/quote:6fd67a0e15]\r\n\r\nyo ya \'lil bugger.....\r\n\r\njust making the ftp account now man.\r\nI\'ll let hog know so he can up it\r\nthen I\'ll pass it on.\r\n\r\nshamon!\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14346,'722a6bc0aa','poifect!'),(14347,'d76fe28ea9','yo man\r\n\r\nip: 66.199.174.32\r\nuser: pimps@prahranpianos\r\npwd: b1tp1mps\r\n\r\nupload away!  how big is it?\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14348,'722a6bc0aa','poifect!'),(14349,'608bfc46db','[quote:608bfc46db=\"PimpIke\"]ph2t, i believe that micromatch sent another 6 dollars. so i think now were both in right?[/quote:608bfc46db]\r\n\r\nI\'m at work right now so I can\'t check paypal.  I\'ll check it out tonight and let you know.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14350,'83501cc9bb','coolio'),(14351,'d76fe28ea9','yo man\r\n\r\nip: 66.199.174.32\r\nuser: pimps@prahranpianos\r\npwd: b1tp1mps\r\n\r\nupload away!  how big is it?\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14352,'f0873dfba8','word up. its 150megs. i need the bandwidth to play videogames so ill start it before i goto bed.'),(14353,'f0873dfba8','word up. its 150megs. i need the bandwidth to play videogames so ill start it before i goto bed.'),(14354,'bbf0e2999e','[quote:bbf0e2999e=\"hogjowlz\"]word up. its 150megs. i need the bandwidth to play videogames so ill start it before i goto bed.[/quote:bbf0e2999e]\r\n\r\ncoolies, pm me when you\'ve started it running.\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14356,'','heyy can u tell me how to mosfet so i can do it myself bc im short on moeny'),(14358,'bbf0e2999e','[quote:bbf0e2999e=\"hogjowlz\"]word up. its 150megs. i need the bandwidth to play videogames so ill start it before i goto bed.[/quote:bbf0e2999e]\r\n\r\ncoolies, pm me when you\'ve started it running.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14359,'9572394f70','Hey man, stupid paypal doesnt let me log in cause of my stupid web browser and i tried it with all the other browsers to and they dont work either, this is the message i get when i try to log in. \r\n\r\n[color=red:9572394f70]You cannot access PayPal because your browser does not currently support cookies. You must enable cookies with your browser before you may use the PayPal site. Please go to your browser\'s help files to learn how to enable cookies. After you have enabled cookies, you may have to refresh the page twice. \r\n\r\nIf you have already enabled cookies and are still unable to log in to the PayPal website, please email service@paypal.com. \r\n\r\nError 3014 [/color:9572394f70]\r\n\r\nso i might try and get barto to try and pay it for me'),(14360,'ac8f19c8a0','ill start it now');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14361,'25df67b643','hey dude.\r\n\r\nJust paypal me at matt.marcos@bigpond.com\r\n\r\nSend your chassis to me and I\'ll mod it and send it back.\r\n\r\nOnce the $$ has gone through I\'ll advise you of my delivery details.\r\n\r\nWhat freq chassis will you be sending?\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14362,'c602a13b14','i dont know which kind of car/mhz ill be sending yet, do you have a preference as far as mhz goes? i have about 10 clones that are brand new, and i was just thinking of sending one of those to you. I\'ll paypal the cash to you when i get back, im going downtown for a few hours.'),(14363,'8ebf100eb2','I think i might wait till xmas, cause ill be getting some zzse\'s and i heard you cant duel cell mod them.  Can you do the mods on a zzse????'),(14364,'74e1c390f8','hey dude,\r\n unfortunately I now have four dudes.  But if you wish to still do it I\'m happy to do it for $12USD.   \'cause I need to buy the fets.  If you want that I\'ll happily do all three of the other mods in section two.\r\n\r\ncheers and let me know.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14365,'8f838d9678','Hi,\r\n\r\nYeah I\'m still interested. Let me know your email address to use for paypal. I\'ll send over the $12 later today. Thanks!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14366,'4ba2852c48','Hey Bro,\r\n\r\nCan ya hook me up with that FTP access for CS?\r\n\r\nThanks much.\r\n\r\nNamuna.'),(14369,'8f05289581','Cool dude\r\n\r\nI\'ll take the cd from you\r\n\r\nSend it to \r\nChad Ellis\r\n51 Briarwood Ct\r\nEstill Springs, TN 37330'),(14370,'a40cc337dd','Okay will do. I\'ll try to get it out tomorrow but most likely tuesday (we\'re getting hit pretty hard with the snow and ice over here.)'),(14371,'a40cc337dd','Okay will do. I\'ll try to get it out tomorrow but most likely tuesday (we\'re getting hit pretty hard with the snow and ice over here.)'),(14373,'2579fd5c9e','[quote:2579fd5c9e=\"sessiz\"]Okay will do. I\'ll try to get it out tomorrow but most likely tuesday (we\'re getting hit pretty hard with the snow and ice over here.)[/quote:2579fd5c9e]\r\n\r\nTuesday is cool even if you sent it out tomorow I still would not get a chance to look at it till next sunday.'),(14374,'ac8f19c8a0','ill start it now');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14375,'4ba2852c48','Hey Bro,\r\n\r\nCan ya hook me up with that FTP access for CS?\r\n\r\nThanks much.\r\n\r\nNamuna.'),(14377,'8ebf100eb2','I think i might wait till xmas, cause ill be getting some zzse\'s and i heard you cant duel cell mod them.  Can you do the mods on a zzse????'),(14378,'c602a13b14','i dont know which kind of car/mhz ill be sending yet, do you have a preference as far as mhz goes? i have about 10 clones that are brand new, and i was just thinking of sending one of those to you. I\'ll paypal the cash to you when i get back, im going downtown for a few hours.'),(14379,'9572394f70','Hey man, stupid paypal doesnt let me log in cause of my stupid web browser and i tried it with all the other browsers to and they dont work either, this is the message i get when i try to log in. \r\n\r\n[color=red:9572394f70]You cannot access PayPal because your browser does not currently support cookies. You must enable cookies with your browser before you may use the PayPal site. Please go to your browser\'s help files to learn how to enable cookies. After you have enabled cookies, you may have to refresh the page twice. \r\n\r\nIf you have already enabled cookies and are still unable to log in to the PayPal website, please email service@paypal.com. \r\n\r\nError 3014 [/color:9572394f70]\r\n\r\nso i might try and get barto to try and pay it for me'),(14411,'fbca75d47d','FTP\'ed from Ph2t.\r\n\r\nThanks bro!!!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14409,'d613c56fc8','Hey, I\'m new to the forum here but have been browsing this site for some time now. I got some extra batteries that I can sell to you. I bought a bunch but havent had the time to install them in my cars. How does $3each sound to you and theres no shipping charge for these. Let me know. Thanks!'),(14441,'5bb5839753','[quote:5bb5839753=\"ph2t\"][quote:5bb5839753=\"JdmHatchback\"][quote:5bb5839753=\"ph2t\"]hey dude,\r\n unfortunately I now have four dudes.  But if you wish to still do it I\'m happy to do it for $12USD.   \'cause I need to buy the fets.  If you want that I\'ll happily do all three of the other mods in section two.\r\n\r\ncheers and let me know.\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:5bb5839753]\r\n\r\n\r\nHey ph2t,\r\n\r\nNot sure if you got my other PM, but Im still interested in getting the mosfet for $12. Email me at tinn446158@aol.com to work out the paypal payment. I need your email address so I can send the money to your paypal account.  THanks!\r\n\r\nJdmhatchback[/quote:5bb5839753]\r\n\r\nhey man, sorry I didn\'t respond to your other PM.  paypal me the $12USD at matt.marcos@bigpond.com.\r\n\r\nSend your chassis to this address:\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nBENTLEIGH EAST   VIC   3165\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nph2t.[/quote:5bb5839753]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHey no problem, sounds good. Thanks!'),(14442,'41590bac7b','Just wondering if you got the package yet :)\r\n\r\nLMK');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14443,'0fd4dd0a86','[quote:0fd4dd0a86=\"JAC4412\"]I think i might wait till xmas, cause ill be getting some zzse\'s and i heard you cant duel cell mod them.  Can you do the mods on a zzse????[/quote:0fd4dd0a86]\r\n\r\nI can mosfet mod the zzse, but not to the great performance grades just yet.  still working on that.  I suggest either a bit-g or a regular ZZ for the mods.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14444,'4393ece1af','ok, ill prolly send a regular car, but if i get more than 1 zzse for xmas, ill prolly send that because i heard that their really slow and anything that can improve speed is an improvment.  What kind of guitar string mod do you do??? ive seen on the posts that people do it different ways.  epescially on microrccenter.com'),(14445,'392f93af88','Hey dude can I get access for the photoshop?\r\n\r\n  BTW if you ever want movies let me know I can upload them for yea :)\r\n\r\n  I just got hackers 2 (great movie), the new matrix, Gothica, Cat in the Hat and a few others :)'),(19599,'539604e159','Yeah, that Underdog tune kicks ass... I feel like I know you better after hearing that record. \r\n\r\nDo you have any Andre Williams?\r\n\r\nI\'ve not heard any No Means No.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14447,'4393ece1af','ok, ill prolly send a regular car, but if i get more than 1 zzse for xmas, ill prolly send that because i heard that their really slow and anything that can improve speed is an improvment.  What kind of guitar string mod do you do??? ive seen on the posts that people do it different ways.  epescially on microrccenter.com'),(14448,'fa0a184784','[quote:fa0a184784=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey dude can I get access for the photoshop?\r\n\r\n  BTW if you ever want movies let me know I can upload them for yea :)\r\n\r\n  I just got hackers 2 (great movie), the new matrix, Gothica, Cat in the Hat and a few others :)[/quote:fa0a184784]\r\n\r\nhere ya go: \r\n\r\nip: 66.199.174.32 \r\nuser: pimps@prahranpianos \r\npwd: b1tp1mps \r\n\r\n\r\ndon\'t worry about the movies man, but thanks for the offer\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(19548,'60c8d38fd5','Ok, done deal. I just want to get rid of the things.'),(14450,'ea4003095d','Hi pimp. :-) \r\n\r\nAs you might have seen in da hook up, im looking for a ZipZaps SL500 SE. :cool:  That is the not a problem - the problem is i\'ve heard they are so damn slow!? And as far as i know, you sent payaso a fet modded se, right?\r\n\r\nIm lokking for something similar and i\'ll pay 60$ for an SL500 SE, with fets and s/h - can that be done?\r\n\r\n/Evo');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14451,'2050f7db6c','no no no, i sent payaso a 512BB super bcg. micro_amps does the mods. I dont\' believe that Payaso has a sl500, or does he? sorry evo. \r\n\r\n\r\n                                    with regards,\r\n                                          mike'),(14452,'b76855ad9e','[quote:b76855ad9e=\"PimpIke\"]ph2t, i believe that micromatch sent another 6 dollars. so i think now were both in right?[/quote:b76855ad9e]\r\n\r\nchecked it last night, no cash, suggest you chase it up with him.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14453,'0a9f4f99a3','awww man, err. still none ph2t?'),(14454,'f05c17fe6f','cool dude ,let me know when you send it off so I can know when to expect it.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(19140,'4093f037c6','i know im not totally innocent. that is because i said things to charlie.\r\ni am sorry for being a shithead about this matter. \r\n\r\ncan i stay here for a bit longer if i don\'t be a shithead?\r\n-mike'),(17477,'b3bae23803','damn money!\r\nthat\'s hot - I think that\'s exactly the kind of thing the judges are looking for man.\r\nyou one slick cat :lol: \r\n\r\nso wow - dude, I wonder how you\'d get busted for MP3s? I mean the people running the domain would have to investigate on their own to find out if nobody told them. I\'d hope none of the gangsta trick click folks would harbor a \"rat\".\r\nI\'m wondering if it\'s not a bandwidth issue? is it possible we used up your bandwidth for the month?\r\nI hope so.\r\nSorry for causing the shit man - really.\r\n\r\nyea I just got back from payaso\'s about 20 minutes ago.\r\ngotta go through the unpacking saga and all that shit.\r\ngot a fuckload of stories from my visit - some good - some bad - all interesting though lol\r\nI\'ll fill you and the pimps in when I get a chance.\r\n\r\nI\'ll try to connect via FTP to the bitpimps account you have on your server, if I can connect - I\'ll go ahead and get rid of the MP3s up there for now just in case, or at least until we can find out what happened.\r\n\r\ntalk to you soon');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14458,'263fbd458a','[quote:263fbd458a=\"JAC4412\"]ok, ill prolly send a regular car, but if i get more than 1 zzse for xmas, ill prolly send that because i heard that their really slow and anything that can improve speed is an improvment.  What kind of guitar string mod do you do??? ive seen on the posts that people do it different ways.  epescially on microrccenter.com[/quote:263fbd458a]\r\n\r\nthe mosfet mod I do to the zzse will improve it, definately.  The guitar string posts on MRCC are all mine anyways so you can me assured it\'s a good mod.\r\n\r\nlet me know when you send th chassis dude.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14459,'d5a309e998','all right no prob. thanks man'),(14460,'fa0a184784','[quote:fa0a184784=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey dude can I get access for the photoshop?\r\n\r\n  BTW if you ever want movies let me know I can upload them for yea :)\r\n\r\n  I just got hackers 2 (great movie), the new matrix, Gothica, Cat in the Hat and a few others :)[/quote:fa0a184784]\r\n\r\nhere ya go: \r\n\r\nip: 66.199.174.32 \r\nuser: pimps@prahranpianos \r\npwd: b1tp1mps \r\n\r\n\r\ndon\'t worry about the movies man, but thanks for the offer\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(14461,'f6fa536130','[quote:f6fa536130=\"PimpIke\"]awww man, err. still none ph2t?[/quote:f6fa536130]\r\n\r\nAs of 5 hours ago, no.  I\'m at work now so I can\'t check dude.  I will check tonight.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14462,'22c19c16db','thanks man, i contacted micro match, he said it should have been there. i have no clue what happened.'),(14463,'ac0e35bbbd','just wanted to get the dilly on the dl b4 it was gone :)'),(14464,'ac0e35bbbd','just wanted to get the dilly on the dl b4 it was gone :)'),(14467,'315f25d22b','[quote:315f25d22b=\"ezenterprises\"]just wanted to get the dilly on the dl b4 it was gone :)[/quote:315f25d22b]\r\n\r\nhere ya go: \r\n\r\nip: 66.199.174.32 \r\nuser: pimps@prahranpianos \r\npwd: b1tp1mps \r\n\r\nlet me know when you\'re done man.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(19139,'5312f727f1','Alright, let me in on the reason for this thread please...Especially with the cursing, you know TRC is a rated G zone Bro. What\'s up?\r\n\r\nhttp://tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;threadid=19336'),(14516,'be592896e0','[quote:be592896e0=\"crazydave\"]Yeah you know that\'s cool with me. I gots da FETs! :cool: \r\n\r\nI never know what to ask for FET mods, so if you could just cover the shipping, and if you want to throw me anthing extra that\'s cool too. ;)\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:be592896e0]you\'re the shit dude.\r\nthanks man, you\'re helping out in a huge way...\r\n\r\nlemme let the other pimps know its a go and I\'ll get payaso to send you the chassis and either him or I will get you the shipping money and some extra.\r\n\r\nthanks again man, get back with you soon'),(14517,'3ebd200713','Hey Cavey,\r\n\r\nWe may need your help Pimp.\r\n\r\nIt seems the 1st place prize in our Year End Contest is in delima.  They can\'t decide between a dual cell or FET.  I suggested FET since the dual cell that would be done wouldn\'t be internal.  Now I don\'t know about most but I for 1 wouldn\'t want an external dual cell\'d car.  So here\'s the gig!\r\n\r\nWould it be possible for you to chip (FET) a chassis before Xmas?\r\n\r\nI\'ll send you what chips you need and anything else you require.\r\n\r\nSilla has the chassis, Hog was suppose to do the dual batt but he\'s had some personal shit going on lately so Cabo didn\'t want to chance sending it to him and not having it back in time. I wanted to let them handle it cause I\'ve had a lot, maybe too much input in the other contests so I just followed their leads but as you can see, we\'re getting down to the wire and 1st place is still unfinished and undecided.\r\n\r\nLemme know Pimp!\r\n\r\nThanx Cavey!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18486,'1f6840e9b4','[quote:1f6840e9b4=\"hogjowlz\"]i doubt my car will come together in time for me to do this so heres the idea if you want it.\r\n\r\nyou know those model railroad sets that have actual smoke comin out of the train? well they use an oil that turns to smoke at a relativly low temperature(on a heat plate). its like 3bucks a bottle. make a damn bleach box with that shit in it and i bet on the right surface you will be smokin!![/quote:1f6840e9b4]You know what? I\'m gonna be doing my video out on the blacktop. If I wait until the evening, it should get pretty hot. That just might work.\r\n\r\nThanks for the tip. :-) \r\nDave'),(14519,'4e737ea007','Oh Well, that\'s the price I have to pay for trying to multitask (to put it lightly)\r\n\r\nThanx'),(14520,'bac1990cae','Lemma check out a couple-a-things and I\'ll get back to ya!'),(14780,'dc7e74e004','hey dude,\r\n\r\npaypal me @ matt.marcos@bigpond.com  and I\'ll ship the rims out asap.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14782,'580dacfada','Hey man,\r\nI\'m pretty sure I talked to you about this before, but I honestly can\'t remember what, when, etc. anyways....\r\n\r\nWe want to offer you up a spot as one of the bitPimps moderators.\r\nYou\'re a tremendous help on the boards.\r\nThis offer has been tossed around for awhile, we\'ve just been so busy we haven\'t had a chance to put it out there.\r\nSo this offer isn\'t just because you\'re helping out with the contest this time around, it\'s for all you do - helping out other pimps on the boards, all of it.\r\nIf you\'re interested, here\'s some details:\r\n- you\'ll get moderator privilages\r\n- you\'ll be responsible for helping keep the forums clean and running smoothly\r\n- you won\'t be eligible to enter and win contests\r\n- you will be able to help decide what upcoming contest will be, prizes, etc.\r\n\r\nso, if you\'re interested, awesome, let me know.\r\nif not, that\'s fine too - its good enough to just have you as a member.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14522,'a36adbf02d','Just hit me wit your paypal id ,.. I\'ll send the stash .\r\nAre these ez to put together ?? \r\n\r\n\r\ndenden'),(14523,'c59acebbfc','[quote:c59acebbfc=\"DarkTari\"]Hey Cavey,\r\n\r\nWe may need your help Pimp.\r\n\r\nIt seems the 1st place prize in our Year End Contest is in delima.  They can\'t decide between a dual cell or FET.  I suggested FET since the dual cell that would be done wouldn\'t be internal.  Now I don\'t know about most but I for 1 wouldn\'t want an external dual cell\'d car.  So here\'s the gig!\r\n\r\nWould it be possible for you to chip (FET) a chassis before Xmas?\r\n\r\nI\'ll send you what chips you need and anything else you require.\r\n\r\nSilla has the chassis, Hog was suppose to do the dual batt but he\'s had some personal shit going on lately so Cabo didn\'t want to chance sending it to him and not having it back in time. I wanted to let them handle it cause I\'ve had a lot, maybe too much input in the other contests so I just followed their leads but as you can see, we\'re getting down to the wire and 1st place is still unfinished and undecided.\r\n\r\nLemme know Pimp!\r\n\r\nThanx Cavey![/quote:c59acebbfc]Hey, DT, Cabo already contacted me. Don\'t you worry none, I gots ya\'ll covered.  :cool: \r\n\r\ndave'),(14524,'1e6adb3c94','Cool!  I was gonna send one of mine and have you do while I was at it, U game?  Lemme know what you need!\r\n\r\nThanx');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14525,'8107027461','Hey Pimp!\r\n\r\nAre you still willing to chip (FET) one for me ?\r\n\r\nLemma Know!'),(14526,'42cf0d127f','hi crazydave\r\n\r\nare you interested trading one of this modded cars (identical to this one) for a super bitcharg ferrari enzo? i have it for almost a month but rarely use it since i have another super bitcharg (mazda rx7) and also some bitchargs. i dont know if you\'re interested but i think asking doesn\'t hurt... thanks.\r\n\r\njose (mekinhux@iol.pt)  :)'),(14527,'a36adbf02d','Just hit me wit your paypal id ,.. I\'ll send the stash .\r\nAre these ez to put together ?? \r\n\r\n\r\ndenden'),(14528,'6a14b0aa75','hey whats up?\r\n\r\nYou still have this for sale?\r\n\r\n4- 2F2F Street Tuner  less the NX motor and green gear set (mint cond.) http://www.radioshack.com/product.asp?catalog%5Fname=CTLG&amp;category%5Fname=CTLG%5F006%5F008%5F002%5F000&amp;product%5Fid=60%2D7526 \r\n2F2F Muscle car body set (mint cond.) \r\nhttp://www.radioshack.com/product.asp?catalog%5Fname=CTLG&amp;category%5Fname=CTLG%5F006%5F008%5F002%5F000&amp;product%5Fid=60%2D7528 \r\n$13 +shipping \r\n\r\n\r\n  Also I see that you only ship to the US if you are willing to ship to Canada again how much will that stuff be with shipping?  (no NX motor but has the other ones right ?)\r\n\r\n  Anymore epoch stuff in?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nDude\r\n\r\nPete'),(14530,'6a14b0aa75','hey whats up?\r\n\r\nYou still have this for sale?\r\n\r\n4- 2F2F Street Tuner  less the NX motor and green gear set (mint cond.) http://www.radioshack.com/product.asp?catalog%5Fname=CTLG&amp;category%5Fname=CTLG%5F006%5F008%5F002%5F000&amp;product%5Fid=60%2D7526 \r\n2F2F Muscle car body set (mint cond.) \r\nhttp://www.radioshack.com/product.asp?catalog%5Fname=CTLG&amp;category%5Fname=CTLG%5F006%5F008%5F002%5F000&amp;product%5Fid=60%2D7528 \r\n$13 +shipping \r\n\r\n\r\n  Also I see that you only ship to the US if you are willing to ship to Canada again how much will that stuff be with shipping?  (no NX motor but has the other ones right ?)\r\n\r\n  Anymore epoch stuff in?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nDude\r\n\r\nPete');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14531,'943e7a5fe7','[quote:943e7a5fe7=\"VooDooMafia\"]hey whats up?\r\n\r\nYou still have this for sale?\r\n\r\n  Also I see that you only ship to the US if you are willing to ship to Canada again how much will that stuff be with shipping?  (no NX motor but has the other ones right ?)\r\n\r\n  Anymore epoch stuff in?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nDude\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:943e7a5fe7]\r\nHey what\'s up bro, yeah still got it and that US only stuff doesn\'t count for you... you\'re good people, I don\'t know that other cat and don\'t feel like risking it. lol \r\nLooks like Global Priority will be approx. $7\r\n\r\nYep the set\'s just missing the NX motor and green gear set, sorry no more epoch stuff. BTW how\'d you make out with getting a chipset?\r\n\r\nLet me know if you want it.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nBen'),(14533,'8107027461','Hey Pimp!\r\n\r\nAre you still willing to chip (FET) one for me ?\r\n\r\nLemma Know!'),(18485,'9d45258423','[quote:9d45258423=\"crazydave\"][quote:9d45258423=\"CaboWabo\"]you can keep uploading images in the image gallery\r\ndunno if my post about the server space confused anyone, but just thought I\'d metion it just in case.[/quote:9d45258423]That\'s funny, I was about to upload the pictures last night, but then I thought, \"Oh I shouldn\'t waste all his server space, he\'s running low...\" :lol: \r\n\r\nAt any rate. I\'m on dial up right now, it was 11:00 at night. I\'d been working non stop on the car since 6 AM, so I probably would have just used the FTP regardless, but it is a good thing you said something, cause that was a concern of mine.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:9d45258423]cool yea - keep using it, might as well use it up - that\'s what it\'s for.\r\nI just wanted to get as much space as possible cleared (got rid of a lot of duplicated hosted images and stuff) trying to keep the space open for bit related stuff.\r\nI don\'t know if you noticed, but I moved a few movies over to your server. might end up moving more over, that helps clear the space as well.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14535,'1e6adb3c94','Cool!  I was gonna send one of mine and have you do while I was at it, U game?  Lemme know what you need!\r\n\r\nThanx'),(14536,'afa384f58c','i ust found my rcmd springs and i wanted to in stead  of springs a anteanna?\r\n\r\n\r\nSorry for all the changes, lol\r\nMicro'),(18484,'1f6840e9b4','[quote:1f6840e9b4=\"hogjowlz\"]i doubt my car will come together in time for me to do this so heres the idea if you want it.\r\n\r\nyou know those model railroad sets that have actual smoke comin out of the train? well they use an oil that turns to smoke at a relativly low temperature(on a heat plate). its like 3bucks a bottle. make a damn bleach box with that shit in it and i bet on the right surface you will be smokin!![/quote:1f6840e9b4]You know what? I\'m gonna be doing my video out on the blacktop. If I wait until the evening, it should get pretty hot. That just might work.\r\n\r\nThanks for the tip. :-) \r\nDave'),(14841,'6433b9aacb','Thanks man, didn\'t mean to make ya think I was a phony. Yes, I am bdebde, I had some trouble with my ISP and could no longer get email notifications from bitpimps, so I created the new account until regular mail is resolved (if ever).');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (15481,'3aa0de4232','[quote:3aa0de4232=\"ph2t\"]hey dude, love the pics of the 1/10 stuff.  cool as mate!\r\n\r\nI had a favour to ask ( yeah another one I know!).  Do yu have any ZZ chassis lying around? I just need the chassis. This would include the steering assembly and rear motor mount as well. I don\'t need the pcb, rear axle or motor(but id you can spare the axle and intermediate gear cog that would be sweet). I wanna do a tri cell monster and I hear you can fit 3 1/3AAA batteries in a zip chassis quite easily. \r\n\r\nIf you have it I\'ll happily pay you via paysluts or if that ain\'t an option I\'m sure we can figure something out!\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:3aa0de4232]Well I don\'t have any extra chassis, but I have a couple extra complete Zip Zaps. I might be willing to sell one, as I want to get a Jeep, but don\'t want another Zip Zap, you know what I mean?\r\n\r\ndave'),(14839,'59a42eb57a','[quote:59a42eb57a=\"fook yu\"]Sorry for the delay, been a busy holidays. I will send now.[/quote:59a42eb57a]\r\n\r\nGot the payment man, thanks!  Sorry to sound harsh but a few people said they would pay and never bothered getting back to me.   Are you bdebde?\r\n\r\nI will send them out tomorrow (monday 29/12) Aus time.\r\n\r\nCheers mate,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14836,'892e07a6c8','[quote:892e07a6c8=\"mekinhux\"]Hi. Do you still have those rims for sale? They come complete (rear axle with gear, front knuckles, etc...)? I just have to install them or have to mod something in the way? How about postage to Portugal? Tell me the total value and also if you accept paypal! Thanks[/quote:892e07a6c8]\r\n\r\nSorry mate, they\'ve been sold :).\r\n\r\nregards,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14540,'afa384f58c','i ust found my rcmd springs and i wanted to in stead  of springs a anteanna?\r\n\r\n\r\nSorry for all the changes, lol\r\nMicro'),(26616,'3270116565','lol, do you have a pic of your stash? Im going to make a 4X4 now, if you want, send me 2/3 chassis with controllers and ill make you one too  :grin: \r\n\r\nWhat are you doing today?\r\nKarl'),(26617,'f298a1ec1f','I\'ve added you to msn, fancy a chat? :smile:'),(14542,'dd05a3bde5','[quote:dd05a3bde5=\"denden1\"]Just hit me wit your paypal id ,.. I\'ll send the stash .\r\nAre these ez to put together ?? \r\n\r\n\r\ndenden[/quote:dd05a3bde5]\r\nPaypal id: blormore@mac.com\r\n\r\nThey\'re not too bad, you do have to improvise a bit though. For one thing the hole diameter is a tad bit larger, for the rears it\'s not that bad (the epoxy will fill in the gaps), for the fronts you need to make or find a thin liner to fill the gap.\r\nI would suggest doin a search too, theres a few threads here that will be really helpful to you when assembling and mounting the rims.\r\n\r\nHit me back with your addy and i\'ll get\'em out in the morning.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nB'),(14543,'c1e4dd2bf4','You\'ve got money ! \r\n\r\nDennis Hargro\r\n25 Baylor Street\r\nSouth Toms River , NJ 08757\r\n\r\nThanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14544,'c1a66f8699','Hi,\r\n\r\nJust wanted to let you know that I shipped the chassis out to you today via airmail. Let me know when you get it. Thanks again!\r\n\r\nJdmhatchback'),(14547,'c1e4dd2bf4','You\'ve got money ! \r\n\r\nDennis Hargro\r\n25 Baylor Street\r\nSouth Toms River , NJ 08757\r\n\r\nThanks'),(15809,'5e1360fe67','[b:5e1360fe67]Glenn Sims \r\n7815 Quill Point Dr \r\nBowie, Md. 20720 \r\nUSA [/b:5e1360fe67]\r\n\r\n[b:5e1360fe67]Please[/b:5e1360fe67] don\'t put [b:5e1360fe67]MA[/b:5e1360fe67] as the state on it.  It\'ll end up in Maine somewhere.  I\'m in Maryland.\r\n\r\nHey man, I can\'t thank you enough for going the extra mile me a Pimp!'),(14549,'1af09aedce','[quote:1af09aedce=\"JdmHatchback\"]Hi,\r\n\r\nJust wanted to let you know that I shipped the chassis out to you today via airmail. Let me know when you get it. Thanks again!\r\n\r\nJdmhatchback[/quote:1af09aedce]\r\n\r\ngood stuff man, hopefully the xmas rush won\'t slow the delivery.  Also, to confirm, whatmods did you want done apart from the mosfet mod?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14550,'d2c26c9e8c','[quote:d2c26c9e8c=\"ph2t\"][quote:d2c26c9e8c=\"JdmHatchback\"]Hi,\r\n\r\nJust wanted to let you know that I shipped the chassis out to you today via airmail. Let me know when you get it. Thanks again!\r\n\r\nJdmhatchback[/quote:d2c26c9e8c]\r\n\r\ngood stuff man, hopefully the xmas rush won\'t slow the delivery.  Also, to confirm, whatmods did you want done apart from the mosfet mod?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:d2c26c9e8c]\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you can do the guitar string antenna mod and spring suspension that would be cool. BTw, What does the DIP switch mod do? Sorry, Im not too sure on what it does to the chassis lol. \r\n\r\nThanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21598,'c6255d5f86','Thanks, nice doing business with you! ;) I will try to send it off on my lunch break tomorrow, but if not, it will be at post office tomorrow evening after work to go out the next day. They estimated 3 days to you.\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get it. If there is any problem, tell me and we will work it out.\r\n\r\nMike'),(19592,'60cd21c374','its going to be fucking halarious.'),(19593,'c2f8244471','[quote:c2f8244471=\"crazydave\"][quote:c2f8244471=\"CaboWabo\"]I dunno, I sway back and forth so much on what types of music I listen to. I hear ya on the TKK, it\'s not bad at all - maybe I just needed to get baked lol[/quote:c2f8244471]Oh I gotta be baked to listen to music, but then I just gotta be baked. :lol: \r\n\r\n[quote:c2f8244471]I\'m like that with the Frogs set 1, I love the horns and all the shit that seems to be fitting together when it totally shouldn\'t lol[/quote:c2f8244471]I got that DL\'d. Still gotta listen to it. Got side tracked by that Beastie Boys. :lol: \r\n\r\nHey, can\'t find Ministry right now. You into Steve Albini at all? I just ripped Big Black - Songs About Fucking, for hue, I could upload that.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:c2f8244471]lmao yea upload it, I\'d like to check it out'),(14553,'948d0a0f01','[quote:948d0a0f01=\"denden1\"]You\'ve got money ! \r\n\r\nDennis Hargro\r\n25 Baylor Street\r\nSouth Toms River , NJ 08757\r\n\r\nThanks[/quote:948d0a0f01]\r\nSweet! \r\nThe alloys will be on their way to you tomorrow bro!\r\n\r\nB');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14554,'943e7a5fe7','[quote:943e7a5fe7=\"VooDooMafia\"]hey whats up?\r\n\r\nYou still have this for sale?\r\n\r\n  Also I see that you only ship to the US if you are willing to ship to Canada again how much will that stuff be with shipping?  (no NX motor but has the other ones right ?)\r\n\r\n  Anymore epoch stuff in?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nDude\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:943e7a5fe7]\r\nHey what\'s up bro, yeah still got it and that US only stuff doesn\'t count for you... you\'re good people, I don\'t know that other cat and don\'t feel like risking it. lol \r\nLooks like Global Priority will be approx. $7\r\n\r\nYep the set\'s just missing the NX motor and green gear set, sorry no more epoch stuff. BTW how\'d you make out with getting a chipset?\r\n\r\nLet me know if you want it.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nBen'),(14555,'6dfa4a7019','[quote:6dfa4a7019=\"kwikbb\"][quote:6dfa4a7019=\"VooDooMafia\"]hey whats up?\r\n\r\nYou still have this for sale?\r\n\r\n  Also I see that you only ship to the US if you are willing to ship to Canada again how much will that stuff be with shipping?  (no NX motor but has the other ones right ?)\r\n\r\n  Anymore epoch stuff in?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nDude\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:6dfa4a7019]\r\nHey what\'s up bro, yeah still got it and that US only stuff doesn\'t count for you... you\'re good people, I don\'t know that other cat and don\'t feel like risking it. lol \r\nLooks like Global Priority will be approx. $7\r\n\r\nYep the set\'s just missing the NX motor and green gear set, sorry no more epoch stuff. BTW how\'d you make out with getting a chipset?\r\n\r\nLet me know if you want it.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nBen[/quote:6dfa4a7019]\r\n\r\n  OK cool so $20.00 shipped then for the lot?  thats cool here I can use the bodies to chop up lol.\r\n\r\n  OK I only have $15.00 in paypal right now so I just requested some more cash in there.  Give me your paypal info again and I will send it when its in.\r\n\r\n\r\n  As for the epoch chips I have not got them yet as they dont take paypal and I hate to use the cretid card with online shops(not saying anything about them just any in general).  If you are planning on making a order with them let me know I will pay you for the item + shipping + your time :)'),(14557,'6dfa4a7019','[quote:6dfa4a7019=\"kwikbb\"][quote:6dfa4a7019=\"VooDooMafia\"]hey whats up?\r\n\r\nYou still have this for sale?\r\n\r\n  Also I see that you only ship to the US if you are willing to ship to Canada again how much will that stuff be with shipping?  (no NX motor but has the other ones right ?)\r\n\r\n  Anymore epoch stuff in?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nDude\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:6dfa4a7019]\r\nHey what\'s up bro, yeah still got it and that US only stuff doesn\'t count for you... you\'re good people, I don\'t know that other cat and don\'t feel like risking it. lol \r\nLooks like Global Priority will be approx. $7\r\n\r\nYep the set\'s just missing the NX motor and green gear set, sorry no more epoch stuff. BTW how\'d you make out with getting a chipset?\r\n\r\nLet me know if you want it.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nBen[/quote:6dfa4a7019]\r\n\r\n  OK cool so $20.00 shipped then for the lot?  thats cool here I can use the bodies to chop up lol.\r\n\r\n  OK I only have $15.00 in paypal right now so I just requested some more cash in there.  Give me your paypal info again and I will send it when its in.\r\n\r\n\r\n  As for the epoch chips I have not got them yet as they dont take paypal and I hate to use the cretid card with online shops(not saying anything about them just any in general).  If you are planning on making a order with them let me know I will pay you for the item + shipping + your time :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14558,'6ed20f86e9','Sounds good holmes! Oh and usually when you want to send money it\'ll debit your checking acct. directly so you don\'t have to wait for it to clear, at least that\'s what it does when I send money. Unless your account\'s set up differently you should be able to do the same since you\'re verified.\r\n\r\nWell anyway here\'s my paypal id: blormore@mac.com\r\n\r\nthanks bro\r\n\r\nB'),(14559,'6ed20f86e9','Sounds good holmes! Oh and usually when you want to send money it\'ll debit your checking acct. directly so you don\'t have to wait for it to clear, at least that\'s what it does when I send money. Unless your account\'s set up differently you should be able to do the same since you\'re verified.\r\n\r\nWell anyway here\'s my paypal id: blormore@mac.com\r\n\r\nthanks bro\r\n\r\nB'),(14560,'78c5eae786','[quote:78c5eae786=\"HirotoR34\"]I sent the money out today. It should reach you in a couple of days.[/quote:78c5eae786]\r\n\r\n I am guessing the cash should be here any time now, can you confirm your addy so I have have this all ready to go out when the mail guy comes :).'),(14561,'c321518731','sure thing. \r\n\r\n\r\nJustin Long\r\n132R Danforth St.\r\nPortland, Maine 04101\r\n\r\n\r\nI sent it last week. Man the postal service is slow.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14563,'46ddb6f6ab','[quote:46ddb6f6ab=\"JdmHatchback\"][quote:46ddb6f6ab=\"ph2t\"][quote:46ddb6f6ab=\"JdmHatchback\"]Hi,\r\n\r\nJust wanted to let you know that I shipped the chassis out to you today via airmail. Let me know when you get it. Thanks again!\r\n\r\nJdmhatchback[/quote:46ddb6f6ab]\r\n\r\ngood stuff man, hopefully the xmas rush won\'t slow the delivery.  Also, to confirm, whatmods did you want done apart from the mosfet mod?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:46ddb6f6ab]\r\n\r\nIt\'s in the articles section :)\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/articles/article_postings.php?id=30&amp;catId=\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you can do the guitar string antenna mod and spring suspension that would be cool. BTw, What does the DIP switch mod do? Sorry, Im not too sure on what it does to the chassis lol. \r\n\r\nThanks[/quote:46ddb6f6ab]'),(14564,'4878964a56','Thanks for the link! I\'ll just get the antenna and spring mod. Thanks again!'),(14565,'82fdca53a2','OK dude payment is off, I keep forgeting that I have more then one account with paypal and didn\'t need to requ anything :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14567,'3e973d5293','[quote:3e973d5293=\"micromatch\"]i ust found my rcmd springs and i wanted to in stead  of springs a anteanna?\r\n\r\n\r\nSorry for all the changes, lol\r\nMicro[/quote:3e973d5293]\r\n\r\nno worries dude.  have you sent your chassis yet?  I\'ve had no payment from you on behalf of pimkike, suggest you speak to him and work it out.\r\n\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14568,'73d1d9d5bc','[quote:73d1d9d5bc=\"DarkTari\"]Cool!  I was gonna send one of mine and have you do while I was at it, U game?  Lemme know what you need!\r\n\r\nThanx[/quote:73d1d9d5bc]Yeah, it\'s no prob if you want one of yours done. I\'ve been charging people 10 buck to install FETs, but since you\'re a pimp, it\'s like, whatever\'s clever, but you could at least cover my return shipping. ;)\r\n\r\nLet me know what\'s up, and I\'ll get you my address whenever you\'re ready.\r\n\r\ndave'),(14569,'758d6b47e1','Cool Cavey,\r\n\r\nHow many chips (FET\'s) will you need? \r\n\r\nWhat are your favorite bodies?'),(14570,'5017213483','Hey C-Dub,\r\n\r\nSend me your email address again, it got deleted with the rest of my PM\'s\r\n\r\nThanx!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14571,'c8a5b0244a','[quote:c8a5b0244a=\"DarkTari\"]Hey Pimp!\r\n\r\nAre you still willing to chip (FET) one for me ?\r\n\r\nLemma Know![/quote:c8a5b0244a]\r\n\r\nhey man, yeah I\'d be happy to fet mod a chassis for you. All I ask is that you pay return postage of $6USD via paysluts....\r\n\r\nalternatively we were discussing the fact of me writing a fet mod tute for the bit-g chassis for you.  I\'ve finally taken the pics but I just haven\'t had the time to sit down and do the writeup.  I will hopefully finish it soon since work finishes for me next tuesday and I\'ll have more time then\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(14572,'aafe07f56b','Not a problem Pimp!\r\n\r\nDo you want me to supply the chips (FET\'s) ?\r\nI have some that I got from SuperFly if you want me to send them.\r\n\r\nReturn postage will be included, no problem.\r\n\r\nI finished my body mod tutorial and will be sending it to Cabo today, pop me your email and I\'ll send you a copy.\r\n\r\nAlso send me your address and I\'ll get the chassis to you.  Let me know what body you would like to have modded and I\'ll send that too.\r\n\r\nThanx Again.'),(14573,'82fdca53a2','OK dude payment is off, I keep forgeting that I have more then one account with paypal and didn\'t need to requ anything :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14574,'6ec87f46e1','Alright bro sweet, ima get out the goods ASAP!\r\n\r\n-B'),(14575,'758d6b47e1','Cool Cavey,\r\n\r\nHow many chips (FET\'s) will you need? \r\n\r\nWhat are your favorite bodies?'),(18483,'85231eae29','[quote:85231eae29=\"CaboWabo\"]you can keep uploading images in the image gallery\r\ndunno if my post about the server space confused anyone, but just thought I\'d metion it just in case.[/quote:85231eae29]That\'s funny, I was about to upload the pictures last night, but then I thought, \"Oh I shouldn\'t waste all his server space, he\'s running low...\" :lol: \r\n\r\nAt any rate. I\'m on dial up right now, it was 11:00 at night. I\'d been working non stop on the car since 6 AM, so I probably would have just used the FTP regardless, but it is a good thing you said something, cause that was a concern of mine.\r\n\r\nDave'),(14577,'74c95aa2be','[quote:74c95aa2be=\"DarkTari\"]Cool Cavey,\r\n\r\nHow many chips (FET\'s) will you need? \r\n\r\nWhat are your favorite bodies?[/quote:74c95aa2be]I\'ve got enough FETs on hand to do 7 cars, so I should have you covered. If you already have some FETs that you want me to use, I would need 4 per car.\r\n\r\nMy favorite body? Hmmmm, whach you up to DT?\r\n\r\nAnyways, you know I\'m partial to muscle cars, and exotics. As for standard bits bodies, I think the Beetle is my fav, and the bB is the only one I never had.\r\n\r\nDave'),(14578,'6ec87f46e1','Alright bro sweet, ima get out the goods ASAP!\r\n\r\n-B');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14579,'1930373b5a','Auight Cavey, pop me Yo address Pimp! and we in bidness!\r\n\r\nThanx!'),(14580,'1930373b5a','Auight Cavey, pop me Yo address Pimp! and we in bidness!\r\n\r\nThanx!'),(14582,'45e7c73eff','[quote:45e7c73eff=\"DarkTari\"]Auight Cavey, pop me Yo address Pimp! and we in bidness!\r\n\r\nThanx![/quote:45e7c73eff]Oh yeah, the address, guess you\'d need that. :lol: \r\n\r\nhere ya go,\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd.\r\nApt. 1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\n\r\nDave'),(14583,'5017213483','Hey C-Dub,\r\n\r\nSend me your email address again, it got deleted with the rest of my PM\'s\r\n\r\nThanx!'),(14585,'cf77601f79','[quote:cf77601f79=\"DarkTari\"]Hey C-Dub,\r\n\r\nSend me your email address again, it got deleted with the rest of my PM\'s\r\n\r\nThanx![/quote:cf77601f79]here ya go mang...\r\ncabowabo@lixlink.com'),(14586,'aafe07f56b','Not a problem Pimp!\r\n\r\nDo you want me to supply the chips (FET\'s) ?\r\nI have some that I got from SuperFly if you want me to send them.\r\n\r\nReturn postage will be included, no problem.\r\n\r\nI finished my body mod tutorial and will be sending it to Cabo today, pop me your email and I\'ll send you a copy.\r\n\r\nAlso send me your address and I\'ll get the chassis to you.  Let me know what body you would like to have modded and I\'ll send that too.\r\n\r\nThanx Again.'),(14587,'','hey im the one that email u about makin a car for me bc my old one is trashed and i would like it fetted too! pm bac');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14588,'315f25d22b','[quote:315f25d22b=\"ezenterprises\"]just wanted to get the dilly on the dl b4 it was gone :)[/quote:315f25d22b]\r\n\r\nhere ya go: \r\n\r\nip: 66.199.174.32 \r\nuser: pimps@prahranpianos \r\npwd: b1tp1mps \r\n\r\nlet me know when you\'re done man.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(23318,'3884bcb239','teh money is on my desk ive been so busy with skool i forgot about it ill prolly be busy for a while....if sum one else wants to buy sell it to them'),(14590,'c1a011a2c6','[quote:c1a011a2c6=\"mekinhux\"]hi crazydave\r\n\r\nare you interested trading one of this modded cars (identical to this one) for a super bitcharg ferrari enzo? i have it for almost a month but rarely use it since i have another super bitcharg (mazda rx7) and also some bitchargs. i dont know if you\'re interested but i think asking doesn\'t hurt... thanks.\r\n\r\njose (mekinhux@iol.pt)  :)[/quote:c1a011a2c6]Well I\'ll tell ya, I really wasn\'t happy with my Super Bit Char-Gs, so I\'m not thinking so...\r\n\r\n\r\n...but that Enzo is sweet, so I\'ll keep it in mind, and get back to you if I change my mind anytime soon.\r\n\r\nDave'),(14591,'07f3e8f929','hi\r\n\r\ni have a super bcg ferrari enzo (complete set) i dont use for a while. are you interested in trading for the s2000 or rx7? can you tell some details of this two cars (brand, any mods, motor...)\r\n\r\njose');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14593,'8deae61937','nevermind im clueless as how to do this, i thought i could just put in a web address and then click on a thing to dl it but im lost LOL im not very good with comps. lol. :???:  thanks anyways dude.'),(14595,'','hey im the one that email u about makin a car for me bc my old one is trashed and i would like it fetted too! pm bac'),(14596,'887212a681','Hey just keepin in touch still busy as fuck around ehre with the holidays and work wants to send me to Texas for 7 weeks when I return so I am not looking forward to that.\r\n\r\n  How the se\'s going? any improvment on the fets?  \r\n\r\n  Hope all is going well\r\n\r\nPete'),(14597,'887212a681','Hey just keepin in touch still busy as fuck around ehre with the holidays and work wants to send me to Texas for 7 weeks when I return so I am not looking forward to that.\r\n\r\n  How the se\'s going? any improvment on the fets?  \r\n\r\n  Hope all is going well\r\n\r\nPete'),(14598,'0d13b56241','[quote:0d13b56241=\"ph2t\"][quote:0d13b56241=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey dude can I get access for the photoshop?\r\n\r\n  BTW if you ever want movies let me know I can upload them for yea :)\r\n\r\n  I just got hackers 2 (great movie), the new matrix, Gothica, Cat in the Hat and a few others :)[/quote:0d13b56241]\r\n\r\nhere ya go: \r\n\r\nip: 66.199.174.32 \r\nuser: pimps@prahranpianos \r\npwd: b1tp1mps \r\n\r\n\r\ndon\'t worry about the movies man, but thanks for the offer\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:0d13b56241]\r\n\r\n  Is this still teh info I finially got around to loggin in today and wouldn\'t log in lol\r\n\r\nmaybe I had the port wrong but I asumed it was 21');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14599,'e47ad0b852','[quote:e47ad0b852=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey just keepin in touch still busy as fuck around ehre with the holidays and work wants to send me to Texas for 7 weeks when I return so I am not looking forward to that.\r\n\r\n  How the se\'s going? any improvment on the fets?  \r\n\r\n  Hope all is going well\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:e47ad0b852]Nope, no time to improve on the SE FETs. With my wife working nights, I spend most my time with my kid. I meant to get that car on ebay a lot sooner, but kept putting that off, I had to force myself to do it when I did, because it was my last chance before Christmas.\r\n\r\nI\'ve been planning to PM you all week, and say what\'s up, but I wanted to get the PNP FETs in your SE first, so I could say that was on the way, before I contacted you, but here it is thursday, and still not done. I\'m going to definately do that this weekend, so I can get it out on monday. I\'ve got to try to finish up Havoks stuff this weekend too.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, they\'ve asked me to FET the 1st prize for the current BitPimps contest, \'cause Hog\'s having personal issues, and wont be able to dual cell the cars. Funny thing is I offered to do it in the first place, and cabo\'s like, \'maybe next time\'. Now they\'re all, \'hey...umm, dave....\'\r\n\r\n...and since I put that last auction up, the ebay kiddies are tracking me down here, and PMing me trying to trade stuff, and I really don\'t like trades, but i got one guy that wants to trade a Enzo SBCG for a FETed car, and I\'m really considering that one.\r\n\r\nSo that\'s my story, what\'s up with you? :-) \r\nDave'),(14600,'e47ad0b852','[quote:e47ad0b852=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey just keepin in touch still busy as fuck around ehre with the holidays and work wants to send me to Texas for 7 weeks when I return so I am not looking forward to that.\r\n\r\n  How the se\'s going? any improvment on the fets?  \r\n\r\n  Hope all is going well\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:e47ad0b852]Nope, no time to improve on the SE FETs. With my wife working nights, I spend most my time with my kid. I meant to get that car on ebay a lot sooner, but kept putting that off, I had to force myself to do it when I did, because it was my last chance before Christmas.\r\n\r\nI\'ve been planning to PM you all week, and say what\'s up, but I wanted to get the PNP FETs in your SE first, so I could say that was on the way, before I contacted you, but here it is thursday, and still not done. I\'m going to definately do that this weekend, so I can get it out on monday. I\'ve got to try to finish up Havoks stuff this weekend too.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, they\'ve asked me to FET the 1st prize for the current BitPimps contest, \'cause Hog\'s having personal issues, and wont be able to dual cell the cars. Funny thing is I offered to do it in the first place, and cabo\'s like, \'maybe next time\'. Now they\'re all, \'hey...umm, dave....\'\r\n\r\n...and since I put that last auction up, the ebay kiddies are tracking me down here, and PMing me trying to trade stuff, and I really don\'t like trades, but i got one guy that wants to trade a Enzo SBCG for a FETed car, and I\'m really considering that one.\r\n\r\nSo that\'s my story, what\'s up with you? :-) \r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14601,'6de6fed262','[quote:6de6fed262=\"crazydave\"][quote:6de6fed262=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey just keepin in touch still busy as fuck around ehre with the holidays and work wants to send me to Texas for 7 weeks when I return so I am not looking forward to that.\r\n\r\n  How the se\'s going? any improvment on the fets?  \r\n\r\n  Hope all is going well\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:6de6fed262]Nope, no time to improve on the SE FETs. With my wife working nights, I spend most my time with my kid. I meant to get that car on ebay a lot sooner, but kept putting that off, I had to force myself to do it when I did, because it was my last chance before Christmas.\r\n\r\nI\'ve been planning to PM you all week, and say what\'s up, but I wanted to get the PNP FETs in your SE first, so I could say that was on the way, before I contacted you, but here it is thursday, and still not done. I\'m going to definately do that this weekend, so I can get it out on monday. I\'ve got to try to finish up Havoks stuff this weekend too.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, they\'ve asked me to FET the 1st prize for the current BitPimps contest, \'cause Hog\'s having personal issues, and wont be able to dual cell the cars. Funny thing is I offered to do it in the first place, and cabo\'s like, \'maybe next time\'. Now they\'re all, \'hey...umm, dave....\'\r\n\r\n...and since I put that last auction up, the ebay kiddies are tracking me down here, and PMing me trying to trade stuff, and I really don\'t like trades, but i got one guy that wants to trade a Enzo SBCG for a FETed car, and I\'m really considering that one.\r\n\r\nSo that\'s my story, what\'s up with you? :-) \r\nDave[/quote:6de6fed262]\r\n\r\n  I I figured hog was still having issues as I sent out  a $40 money order ofr some stuff back in the 1st of October and still has not got a chance to sent it out.\r\n\r\n   As for teh people wanting to trade for shit yea I can see your point, unless its something that you want its not worth a trade as cash goes towards whatever you need.  I would do the enzo deal though aslong as he is sending everything first.\r\n\r\n    I have been lazy at getting some of the mods done and paint jobs finished to much shit with Xmas and to be honest thinking that I have to goback to work soon and leave my little girl with someone is killing me lol.  I hope those fuckers dont send me to texas for those 7 weeks cause then I can just work nights and spends the days with her to save on child care.\r\n\r\n  I can even tell you the last time I played with a ZZ or bit but I do get a chance to run the epochs everynight :)\r\n\r\n  I just can\'t wait till xmas is over so things go back to normal around here.'),(14602,'6de6fed262','[quote:6de6fed262=\"crazydave\"][quote:6de6fed262=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey just keepin in touch still busy as fuck around ehre with the holidays and work wants to send me to Texas for 7 weeks when I return so I am not looking forward to that.\r\n\r\n  How the se\'s going? any improvment on the fets?  \r\n\r\n  Hope all is going well\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:6de6fed262]Nope, no time to improve on the SE FETs. With my wife working nights, I spend most my time with my kid. I meant to get that car on ebay a lot sooner, but kept putting that off, I had to force myself to do it when I did, because it was my last chance before Christmas.\r\n\r\nI\'ve been planning to PM you all week, and say what\'s up, but I wanted to get the PNP FETs in your SE first, so I could say that was on the way, before I contacted you, but here it is thursday, and still not done. I\'m going to definately do that this weekend, so I can get it out on monday. I\'ve got to try to finish up Havoks stuff this weekend too.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, they\'ve asked me to FET the 1st prize for the current BitPimps contest, \'cause Hog\'s having personal issues, and wont be able to dual cell the cars. Funny thing is I offered to do it in the first place, and cabo\'s like, \'maybe next time\'. Now they\'re all, \'hey...umm, dave....\'\r\n\r\n...and since I put that last auction up, the ebay kiddies are tracking me down here, and PMing me trying to trade stuff, and I really don\'t like trades, but i got one guy that wants to trade a Enzo SBCG for a FETed car, and I\'m really considering that one.\r\n\r\nSo that\'s my story, what\'s up with you? :-) \r\nDave[/quote:6de6fed262]\r\n\r\n  I I figured hog was still having issues as I sent out  a $40 money order ofr some stuff back in the 1st of October and still has not got a chance to sent it out.\r\n\r\n   As for teh people wanting to trade for shit yea I can see your point, unless its something that you want its not worth a trade as cash goes towards whatever you need.  I would do the enzo deal though aslong as he is sending everything first.\r\n\r\n    I have been lazy at getting some of the mods done and paint jobs finished to much shit with Xmas and to be honest thinking that I have to goback to work soon and leave my little girl with someone is killing me lol.  I hope those fuckers dont send me to texas for those 7 weeks cause then I can just work nights and spends the days with her to save on child care.\r\n\r\n  I can even tell you the last time I played with a ZZ or bit but I do get a chance to run the epochs everynight :)\r\n\r\n  I just can\'t wait till xmas is over so things go back to normal around here.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14834,'59a42eb57a','[quote:59a42eb57a=\"fook yu\"]Sorry for the delay, been a busy holidays. I will send now.[/quote:59a42eb57a]\r\n\r\nGot the payment man, thanks!  Sorry to sound harsh but a few people said they would pay and never bothered getting back to me.   Are you bdebde?\r\n\r\nI will send them out tomorrow (monday 29/12) Aus time.\r\n\r\nCheers mate,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14605,'0d13b56241','[quote:0d13b56241=\"ph2t\"][quote:0d13b56241=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey dude can I get access for the photoshop?\r\n\r\n  BTW if you ever want movies let me know I can upload them for yea :)\r\n\r\n  I just got hackers 2 (great movie), the new matrix, Gothica, Cat in the Hat and a few others :)[/quote:0d13b56241]\r\n\r\nhere ya go: \r\n\r\nip: 66.199.174.32 \r\nuser: pimps@prahranpianos \r\npwd: b1tp1mps \r\n\r\n\r\ndon\'t worry about the movies man, but thanks for the offer\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:0d13b56241]\r\n\r\n  Is this still teh info I finially got around to loggin in today and wouldn\'t log in lol\r\n\r\nmaybe I had the port wrong but I asumed it was 21'),(14606,'ce92482f28','[quote:ce92482f28=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:ce92482f28=\"ph2t\"][quote:ce92482f28=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey dude can I get access for the photoshop?\r\n\r\n  BTW if you ever want movies let me know I can upload them for yea :)\r\n\r\n  I just got hackers 2 (great movie), the new matrix, Gothica, Cat in the Hat and a few others :)[/quote:ce92482f28]\r\n\r\nhere ya go: \r\n\r\nip: 66.199.174.32 \r\nuser: pimps@prahranpianos \r\npwd: b1tp1mps \r\n\r\n\r\ndon\'t worry about the movies man, but thanks for the offer\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:ce92482f28]\r\n\r\n  Is this still teh info I finially got around to loggin in today and wouldn\'t log in lol\r\n\r\nmaybe I had the port wrong but I asumed it was 21[/quote:ce92482f28]\r\n\r\njust tried it again man and it works OK.   What client are you using?  I use ws_ftp and it\'s fine.  Make sure the username is as it is written above.   Also, you sent your chassis to be modded yet?  Also you were gonna send some chassis for me to fix as well.   When you can paypal me at matt.marcos@bigpond.com the $6USD.\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14607,'49fc8307a1','Hey, what\'s up?\r\n\r\nI\'ve been charging people 10+ shipping to put FETs in their cars. \r\n\r\nSo what\'s up with the SBCG bodies you mentioned?'),(14608,'ce92482f28','[quote:ce92482f28=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:ce92482f28=\"ph2t\"][quote:ce92482f28=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey dude can I get access for the photoshop?\r\n\r\n  BTW if you ever want movies let me know I can upload them for yea :)\r\n\r\n  I just got hackers 2 (great movie), the new matrix, Gothica, Cat in the Hat and a few others :)[/quote:ce92482f28]\r\n\r\nhere ya go: \r\n\r\nip: 66.199.174.32 \r\nuser: pimps@prahranpianos \r\npwd: b1tp1mps \r\n\r\n\r\ndon\'t worry about the movies man, but thanks for the offer\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:ce92482f28]\r\n\r\n  Is this still teh info I finially got around to loggin in today and wouldn\'t log in lol\r\n\r\nmaybe I had the port wrong but I asumed it was 21[/quote:ce92482f28]\r\n\r\njust tried it again man and it works OK.   What client are you using?  I use ws_ftp and it\'s fine.  Make sure the username is as it is written above.   Also, you sent your chassis to be modded yet?  Also you were gonna send some chassis for me to fix as well.   When you can paypal me at matt.marcos@bigpond.com the $6USD.\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(14609,'25f1b7ef88','I think I might have had a space in there somewhere or something.\r\n\r\n  Also I send some cash from my other paypal acct..\r\n\r\n  Will try and get this box out tomorrow to you');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14611,'8815012105','Hey you and superfly get your cars yet?\r\n\r\nThanks'),(14612,'237d5230c0','Yep, I assumed SuperFly would have let you know when he received the package... sorry about that. Did you get the Mosfetted car from SuperFly?'),(16059,'92e1c6fa62','[quote:92e1c6fa62=\"MadScott\"]I\'m trying to sell out my 1/64 stuff and wanted to see if I could list it here in the selling section.  My post count isn\'t over 50, I didn\'t want to break a rule, so I figured I\'d ask you first.  No big either way.  \r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nMS[/quote:92e1c6fa62]go for it man - good luck\r\nsorry to hear you\'re selling all your stuff though'),(14615,'769f3325c0','He didn\'t let me know but this time of year I just figured hes busy as I know I am lol.\r\n\r\n  No I have not recieved the mosfet car but it will come. This is a bad time of year for packages not to boot passing through customs lol.'),(14616,'6e08102086','[quote:6e08102086=\"mekinhux\"]hi\r\n\r\ni have a super bcg ferrari enzo (complete set) i dont use for a while. are you interested in trading for the s2000 or rx7? can you tell some details of this two cars (brand, any mods, motor...)\r\n\r\njose[/quote:6e08102086]hi jose\r\n\r\nI\'m not looking trade right now.\r\nI might sometime in the future though, you\'ll see a post about it if I do.\r\nThanks for the offer though pimp!\r\n\r\nC-Dub'),(16058,'d85daa82f5','I\'m trying to sell out my 1/64 stuff and wanted to see if I could list it here in the selling section.  My post count isn\'t over 50, I didn\'t want to break a rule, so I figured I\'d ask you first.  No big either way.  \r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nMS');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14619,'f668f5016e','Hi\r\n\r\nhow about something like this two cars for sale? do u have anything?\r\n\r\njose'),(14620,'25f1b7ef88','I think I might have had a space in there somewhere or something.\r\n\r\n  Also I send some cash from my other paypal acct..\r\n\r\n  Will try and get this box out tomorrow to you'),(14622,'3d24f7fae6','[quote:3d24f7fae6=\"VooDooMafia\"]I think I might have had a space in there somewhere or something.\r\n\r\n  Also I send some cash from my other paypal acct..\r\n\r\n  Will try and get this box out tomorrow to you[/quote:3d24f7fae6]\r\n\r\ncool dude, I\'m at work at the moment so I can\'t check paypal to confirm the transaction.   When I\'m home tonight I\'ll check it out.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(31350,'4cf0544904','Hi there , I purchased a bonzermat from you at christmas , and i really liked it . I recently moved house , and dispite the sign on the package\r\n \" DO NOT FOLD\"\r\nthe removal people still managed to fold it in half , now i have big creases that are like creater shapes in my mat .I would really appreciate if you could give me any help possible on getting rid of them.\r\n\r\nmany thanks , \r\nJoe :cool:'),(14624,'a1db74a54a','[quote:a1db74a54a=\"DarkTari\"]Not a problem Pimp!\r\n\r\nDo you want me to supply the chips (FET\'s) ?\r\nI have some that I got from SuperFly if you want me to send them.\r\n\r\nReturn postage will be included, no problem.\r\n\r\nI finished my body mod tutorial and will be sending it to Cabo today, pop me your email and I\'ll send you a copy.\r\n\r\nAlso send me your address and I\'ll get the chassis to you.  Let me know what body you would like to have modded and I\'ll send that too.\r\n\r\nThanx Again.[/quote:a1db74a54a]\r\n\r\nHey man, you\'re very generous, I respect that!   How about you keep the fets, I got tons.   I\'ll do the fet mod to your chassis and also finalise the fetmod tutorial so that way you can try it out yourself on a chassis of your own sometime with the fets you already have.  how does that sound?\r\n\r\nSend your chassis to:\r\n\r\nMatt Marcos\r\n17 Adrian Street\r\nBENTLEIGH EAST   VIC   3165\r\nAUSTRALIA\r\n\r\nCan\'t wait to see the masters\' tutorial, email it to matt.marcos@bigpond.com.   This is also my address for paypal for the $6USD to cover the return post.\r\n\r\nYou don\'t have to do a body mod for me man, but hey if ya wants to then that\'s cool!  thanks a ton!  I\'ll gleefully accept any shell that aint a supra or nsx so I hope that leaves you with some options.\r\n\r\nThanks again man!\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14646,'45ed1bfddc','hey man.....\r\nI\'ve had some bullshit happen lately.....I\'ll get into that some other time.....I\'m still sending you the digi-Q to check out, and the ZZ bodies....just been having a bad month....or was that year....lol\r\n\r\nI\'m still checking the posts.....mostly in the Gangsta Trick Click....don\'t have alot of time lately.....stupid me decided to go out and get a part-time job....some shit happpened and now I\'m done. The wife was stressing out over me working so much anyway......I\'ll probably be mailing the stuff out right after christmas.....speaking of which, I hope you and you\'re family have a great one. Tell \'em all Happy Holidays from Havok....lol.......later on..............'),(14626,'cec6f7f49e','Ju Got It Maan!  \r\nI\'ll try to get it in the mail next week, real busy right now, Xmas season-n-all !!!'),(14627,'0ff53702c4','is that  car  you made  that was named \"cloudy \" a zcar cuz i have the benz zcar black top/silverbody and the red celica\r\ncheck em out at the 1st ann. contest enteries post  \r\n\r\npeace love and  mini rc\r\nzcar07'),(32884,'f840c97bcb','Got it today and i love everything :-D');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32885,'cabc127957','package received!  haven\'t opened it yet, and may not for awhile, but everything look great!\r\n\r\nthanks again...\r\n\r\nrich'),(32886,'e465484346','Hi, I haven\'t had time to keep up with the micro RC forums in the past few months. I remember half a year ago or longer, you were selling the woah nelly 1.2 and 1.3 turbos. But I noticed that you closed up shop and saw your link for eBay auctions but I could see none for sale. Do you still produce them from time to time or by request? \r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nVince'),(32887,'2e87b68f6d','hey vince, I\'m just waiting on some more mosfets to come in from my suppliers and I\'ll be releasing them again soon.  I\'ll let you know when they\'ll be available.  just shoot me an email to ph2t@netspace.net.au and I\'ll add you to the list!\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14629,'5f3ffbb5c5','Hey DT , can you shed some light on your convertible interiors .\r\nI think you\'re right , just doesn\'t look right without one . \r\nI have a convert , I\'m working on .'),(14631,'55ec5b5780','I use the interiors of 1/64 Muscle Machine Imports, Modifiers, &amp; Dub City cars.  I also use the wheels and the MMI have exhausts that can be used.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14643,'e1eef42d1c','[quote:e1eef42d1c=\"DarkTari\"]Ju Got It Maan!  \r\nI\'ll try to get it in the mail next week, real busy right now, Xmas season-n-all !!![/quote:e1eef42d1c]\r\n\r\nI so understand dude, coolies.\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(14832,'e61b403c30','Sorry for the delay, been a busy holidays. I will send now.'),(14635,'cec6f7f49e','Ju Got It Maan!  \r\nI\'ll try to get it in the mail next week, real busy right now, Xmas season-n-all !!!'),(14637,'6eb411aa10','hey, if you still have that gear, i\'d love to have it, my adress is \r\n\r\nColin McCarthy\r\n661 Rte. 31\r\nGlen Spey, NY 12737'),(14638,'648cfd4646','in the post tomaro  :lol:  \r\n\r\nhave fun with it!\r\n\r\nmerry christmas\r\nmicro'),(14640,'26592b7732','[quote:26592b7732=\"mekinhux\"]Hi\r\n\r\nhow about something like this two cars for sale? do u have anything?\r\n\r\njose[/quote:26592b7732]no I don\'t, sorry.\r\nif ever do have something for sale or trade, I\'ll post it in the bitPimps Flea Market forums'),(14642,'a0036b7656','Thanks .,  I have some dub city cars , I\'ll try it .');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14644,'22aee39b65','Any particular body you\'d like to have modded?'),(14645,'1cc3a601fb','Hey C-Dub,\r\n\r\nCrazyDave said you already talked to him about chip\'n the 1st place prize.\r\nAny decision yet on what\'s gonna happen?\r\n\r\nI suggest if you don\'t hear anything by Saturday, have Silla send it to Dave\r\nso we can get this outta da way and update the contest prize post and give Dave his props.\r\n\r\nLemme know if you need assistance!'),(14647,'45ed1bfddc','hey man.....\r\nI\'ve had some bullshit happen lately.....I\'ll get into that some other time.....I\'m still sending you the digi-Q to check out, and the ZZ bodies....just been having a bad month....or was that year....lol\r\n\r\nI\'m still checking the posts.....mostly in the Gangsta Trick Click....don\'t have alot of time lately.....stupid me decided to go out and get a part-time job....some shit happpened and now I\'m done. The wife was stressing out over me working so much anyway......I\'ll probably be mailing the stuff out right after christmas.....speaking of which, I hope you and you\'re family have a great one. Tell \'em all Happy Holidays from Havok....lol.......later on..............'),(14648,'8f49bff357','[quote:8f49bff357=\"Havok\"]....just been having a bad month....or was that year....lol[/quote:8f49bff357]I heard that. Been crazy around here the last couple months, but I\'m hoping it gets back to normal soon.\r\n\r\nI\'m going to the PO on monday to mail some other stuff, so I\'m hopin\' to get your package in there too. All I got left are 2 of the wheel mods. Should be able to do that this weekend, if all goes well.\r\n\r\nSo apparently you\'ve been busy.  :lol: \r\n\r\nWell hopefully everything works out for you so can enjoy your holidays.\r\n\r\nSo go have a happy Christmas, and hopefully we\'ll see you around the boards again soon. ;)\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21248,'52d70da5ef','I agree for the most part, and the other part is, well, I\'m high, so I forgot...lmao..\r\n\r\n\r\nebay would be great, and like you said, bring in new people..\r\n\r\nThat sucks that your ride went for 27 bones... I\'ve had people PM me wanting to buy the cars I\'m not willing to part with for $60 to $80, so I would put your cars in the $80 +  range all day long..\r\n\r\n\r\nDon\'t sell yourself short bro. \r\n\r\n\r\nMaybe I\'ll just throw up a thread with the ebay link in it.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(15370,'e4d2bc118d','Yo Pimp,  Did you get the 3rd place prize yet ? :-?'),(14651,'25d2802b89','Hey Dennis, I wasn\'t able to get the wheels out until this morning... remodeling our showroom, before I knew it it was time to leave! Anyway I got\'em out to you this morning, shouldn\'t take to long since you\'re only in Jersey and I\'m sending from CT.\r\n\r\nThanks again bro\r\n-Ben'),(14652,'71786971b7','Not a problem !!  \r\n\r\nden');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14653,'71786971b7','Not a problem !!  \r\n\r\nden'),(14654,'c745db4124','Hey Pete, got the goods out this morning and they\'re on their way to you!\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nBen'),(14655,'ffe2934eaf','Thanks dude\r\n\r\n I am eyein up your skyline set aswell I will get back to you on that.  Have to see if I have that one unopened yet.'),(14656,'1cc3a601fb','Hey C-Dub,\r\n\r\nCrazyDave said you already talked to him about chip\'n the 1st place prize.\r\nAny decision yet on what\'s gonna happen?\r\n\r\nI suggest if you don\'t hear anything by Saturday, have Silla send it to Dave\r\nso we can get this outta da way and update the contest prize post and give Dave his props.\r\n\r\nLemme know if you need assistance!'),(14658,'8f49bff357','[quote:8f49bff357=\"Havok\"]....just been having a bad month....or was that year....lol[/quote:8f49bff357]I heard that. Been crazy around here the last couple months, but I\'m hoping it gets back to normal soon.\r\n\r\nI\'m going to the PO on monday to mail some other stuff, so I\'m hopin\' to get your package in there too. All I got left are 2 of the wheel mods. Should be able to do that this weekend, if all goes well.\r\n\r\nSo apparently you\'ve been busy.  :lol: \r\n\r\nWell hopefully everything works out for you so can enjoy your holidays.\r\n\r\nSo go have a happy Christmas, and hopefully we\'ll see you around the boards again soon. ;)\r\n\r\nDave'),(14659,'43d5192b41','Why yes it is !  It\'s my first Micro RC, 1 year old nect week!!!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14660,'ffe2934eaf','Thanks dude\r\n\r\n I am eyein up your skyline set aswell I will get back to you on that.  Have to see if I have that one unopened yet.'),(14662,'be1c7ec11c','[quote:be1c7ec11c=\"VooDooMafia\"]Thanks dude\r\n\r\n I am eyein up your skyline set aswell I will get back to you on that.  Have to see if I have that one unopened yet.[/quote:be1c7ec11c]\r\nN/P dude!\r\n\r\nShit I probably could\'ve saved you some on shipping if you end up picking it up, damn my super fast shipping department! :lol:\r\n\r\n-B'),(14663,'22aee39b65','Any particular body you\'d like to have modded?'),(18482,'85231eae29','[quote:85231eae29=\"CaboWabo\"]you can keep uploading images in the image gallery\r\ndunno if my post about the server space confused anyone, but just thought I\'d metion it just in case.[/quote:85231eae29]That\'s funny, I was about to upload the pictures last night, but then I thought, \"Oh I shouldn\'t waste all his server space, he\'s running low...\" :lol: \r\n\r\nAt any rate. I\'m on dial up right now, it was 11:00 at night. I\'d been working non stop on the car since 6 AM, so I probably would have just used the FTP regardless, but it is a good thing you said something, cause that was a concern of mine.\r\n\r\nDave'),(14665,'1a016b0850','[quote:1a016b0850=\"DarkTari\"]Hey C-Dub,\r\n\r\nCrazyDave said you already talked to him about chip\'n the 1st place prize.\r\nAny decision yet on what\'s gonna happen?\r\n\r\nI suggest if you don\'t hear anything by Saturday, have Silla send it to Dave\r\nso we can get this outta da way and update the contest prize post and give Dave his props.\r\n\r\nLemme know if you need assistance![/quote:1a016b0850]yea payaso was supposed to send it yesterday... he called me and told me he lost the chassis with the alloys.\r\nso now he\'s frantically trying to find it or replace it - figures.\r\n\r\nI\'d like to find out for sure what frequency of chassis 1st place needs to be. if payaso can\'t ship off by tomorrow (I\'ll ask him tonite), then I\'d like someone to anti up the chassis and send it off to dave.\r\n\r\nI told dave we would pay for shipping and give him a little extra for his time and efforts and such. so however we wanna work that, whoever wants to donate, etc.\r\n\r\nBasically, seems like the balls been dropped and picking up back up is going to fall on 1 or 2 of our shoulders.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14666,'525830e70d','[quote:525830e70d=\"DarkTari\"]Any particular body you\'d like to have modded?[/quote:525830e70d] \r\n\r\nGloria, lancer or a wrx would be cool man.  but hey, what ever is easiest for you dude.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14667,'a6bd3c1d52','hey cabo hows life?\r\n\r\nso i hear thee was that picture theft on ebay... what ever made of him?'),(14668,'2a65c3db20','micromatch is sending another 6 dollars today or tomorrow. i believe. and then the first 6 dollars is what he wants me to have. he wants to get it sent to me, if thats alright with you. contact him for more info. my car is already sent to you ph2t. \r\n\r\n   Cheers,\r\n      Mike'),(14669,'073da92f47','hey thanks for sending the rx7 body hopefully i will get it before the end of the bp contest,\r\n\r\ncheers and merry christmas'),(14670,'4258bca224','yo wantie wantie? send addy addy\r\n\r\nlol\r\nkent'),(14673,'4cb4dd645d','Man, some loser with no feedback was bidding on my car.\r\n\r\nYeah, his user name was... oh hey what\'s up? :-) \r\n\r\nThat\'s cool, thanks man. I really think that helped bumped it up, \'cause now it going into the weekend over 20 bucks already.\r\n\r\nCool, I\'m getting excited to see how this car does.  :-D \r\n\r\nDave'),(14674,'2a649cef52','Well I was kinda pissed to get outbid so soon, that fucker want to start a war then its on lol.\r\n\r\n  yea i just set up yet another ebay account.  I have a few on there now but this one will be for all my personal stuff nothing to do withthe biz.\r\n\r\n  Man that guy better hope he has a fast connection come the last day lol.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14675,'2a649cef52','Well I was kinda pissed to get outbid so soon, that fucker want to start a war then its on lol.\r\n\r\n  yea i just set up yet another ebay account.  I have a few on there now but this one will be for all my personal stuff nothing to do withthe biz.\r\n\r\n  Man that guy better hope he has a fast connection come the last day lol.'),(21245,'5ea78f7d3a','No prob at all J, I am lax like you too.  No hurry and thanks for the extras, they will go to good use. :-)'),(14677,'f924a8d312','[quote:f924a8d312=\"VooDooMafia\"]Well I was kinda pissed to get outbid so soon, that fucker want to start a war then its on lol.\r\n\r\n  yea i just set up yet another ebay account.  I have a few on there now but this one will be for all my personal stuff nothing to do withthe biz.\r\n\r\n  Man that guy better hope he has a fast connection come the last day lol.[/quote:f924a8d312]Oh sheeit, it\'s Friday night at the fights. :lol: \r\n\r\nI was surprised you got out bid so soon too, but you know, being the seller and all, I don\'t mind. ;)  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(14678,'7f0503c08f','Yea I figured that 20 buck bid would keep me going for a bit, thats ok if he wants the car hewill have to pay for it.  I figured I still have not sent you more shit to mod or paypal $$ so I can spend some on a premodded car.  Hell my first bid was really just on the body if I won (I knew I wouldn\'t at 20 bones) I would have said keep the car send the body.\r\n\r\n  So this guys gonna pay for that shit thats for sure :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14680,'7f0503c08f','Yea I figured that 20 buck bid would keep me going for a bit, thats ok if he wants the car hewill have to pay for it.  I figured I still have not sent you more shit to mod or paypal $$ so I can spend some on a premodded car.  Hell my first bid was really just on the body if I won (I knew I wouldn\'t at 20 bones) I would have said keep the car send the body.\r\n\r\n  So this guys gonna pay for that shit thats for sure :)'),(14682,'a6bd3c1d52','hey cabo hows life?\r\n\r\nso i hear thee was that picture theft on ebay... what ever made of him?'),(26614,'349a417ec1','oh ok well ,\r\nif you want any or all of my stash  , you can have e\'m \r\nso let us know either way ,\r\n( blowing up , hehe , nice one )'),(14684,'1d4f038553','[quote:1d4f038553=\"micromatch\"]hey cabo hows life?\r\n\r\nso i hear thee was that picture theft on ebay... what ever made of him?[/quote:1d4f038553]life\'s super busy, the holidays close by, several projects at work with tight deadlines, etc.\r\n\r\nyea some fool stole some pics of a few pimps cars and tried to sell his crap using their images.\r\nas far as I know, he keeps getting booted from ebay.\r\nI\'m sure it\'s getting harder for him to sell anything.\r\n\r\noh well, off to browse the boards - hope alls going well for you.\r\ntalk to you later pimp.'),(14686,'131eae39df','[quote:131eae39df=\"PimpIke\"]micromatch is sending another 6 dollars today or tomorrow. i believe. and then the first 6 dollars is what he wants me to have. he wants to get it sent to me, if thats alright with you. contact him for more info. my car is already sent to you ph2t. \r\n\r\n   Cheers,\r\n      Mike[/quote:131eae39df]\r\n\r\nSorry dude, but I need confirmation from him personally about this.  Please ask him to send me a PM stating what you have said above.\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14687,'e21dad61f0','no prob ph2t, i\'ll talk to him first.'),(14691,'9edb02f0bd','[quote:9edb02f0bd=\"PimpIke\"]no prob ph2t, i\'ll talk to him first.[/quote:9edb02f0bd]\r\n\r\nthanks man, sorry to be a pain in the arse but I\'m sure you can understand where I\'m comming from.\r\n\r\nthanks.'),(14692,'1ec31d3ef1','hey pete, I got your $$, thanks for that dude.\r\n\r\nlet me know when you\'ve sent your pkg\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(14695,'9e623ef065','Well shit man, it just sat there all day Saturday. This is where I start to get apprehensive, but this is right where my Zip Zap sat at, and all the action took place in the last hour, so this could get exciting.\r\n\r\nDamn, it\'s fun running auctions.\r\n\r\n\r\nEither way, this has worked out very well, as I\'ve had 4 people contact me about modding their cars. So if I don\'t make my dollar per hour put into ratio, that\'s totally cool, because this is turning out to be good advertising.\r\n\r\nI should put a home page together. :???: \r\n\r\nDave'),(14696,'b7facc67d0','[quote:b7facc67d0=\"crazydave\"]Well shit man, it just sat there all day Saturday. This is where I start to get apprehensive, but this is right where my Zip Zap sat at, and all the action took place in the last hour, so this could get exciting.\r\n\r\nDamn, it\'s fun running auctions.\r\n\r\n\r\nEither way, this has worked out very well, as I\'ve had 4 people contact me about modding their cars. So if I don\'t make my dollar per hour put into ratio, that\'s totally cool, because this is turning out to be good advertising.\r\n\r\nI should put a home page together. :???: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:b7facc67d0]\r\n\r\n\r\n  Yea I have fun posting stuff but sometimes its stressfull LOL, I know the last day is a killer for both seller and buyer.\r\n\r\n  Man I got my nephew a ZZ (350z) and some of the other kids including mine got some zz\'s (kinda funny that all the other adults thought these were new things little do they know they have been out for a while now).\r\n\r\n  So the only working ZZ I have right now is the duel cell fet one you did and I tell yea when we were racing these kids were not happy lol.   So after the xmas mail calms down I might be sending you  some stuff LOL.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14698,'b7facc67d0','[quote:b7facc67d0=\"crazydave\"]Well shit man, it just sat there all day Saturday. This is where I start to get apprehensive, but this is right where my Zip Zap sat at, and all the action took place in the last hour, so this could get exciting.\r\n\r\nDamn, it\'s fun running auctions.\r\n\r\n\r\nEither way, this has worked out very well, as I\'ve had 4 people contact me about modding their cars. So if I don\'t make my dollar per hour put into ratio, that\'s totally cool, because this is turning out to be good advertising.\r\n\r\nI should put a home page together. :???: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:b7facc67d0]\r\n\r\n\r\n  Yea I have fun posting stuff but sometimes its stressfull LOL, I know the last day is a killer for both seller and buyer.\r\n\r\n  Man I got my nephew a ZZ (350z) and some of the other kids including mine got some zz\'s (kinda funny that all the other adults thought these were new things little do they know they have been out for a while now).\r\n\r\n  So the only working ZZ I have right now is the duel cell fet one you did and I tell yea when we were racing these kids were not happy lol.   So after the xmas mail calms down I might be sending you  some stuff LOL.'),(14700,'c650cead61','hey hiroto, i checked out your site and took a look at your focus. well i saw it in your sig and your avatar too lol, but man its tripple cell? im thinking of doing a dual cell mod so i was interested, how fast does that car go?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14702,'23606496c3','Yeah, it\'s a triple. The car is so quick, I don\'t have enough room to drive it in my kitchen. I can drive it around in my garage, but have to be careful not to hit anything. I hope to have the pcb fet modded soon and will probably have to use my driveway. I also have to slow way down before turning, cause it\'ll flip easily.\r\nI\'d line up with an Xmod anyday.'),(14703,'62b578615a','[quote:62b578615a=\"VooDooMafia\"]  Yea I have fun posting stuff but sometimes its stressfull LOL, I know the last day is a killer for both seller and buyer.\r\n\r\n  Man I got my nephew a ZZ (350z) and some of the other kids including mine got some zz\'s (kinda funny that all the other adults thought these were new things little do they know they have been out for a while now).\r\n\r\n  So the only working ZZ I have right now is the duel cell fet one you did and I tell yea when we were racing these kids were not happy lol.   So after the xmas mail calms down I might be sending you  some stuff LOL.[/quote:62b578615a]Those poor kids, they never had a chance.  :lol:'),(14704,'b4a9caf31f','Dude, bad news. Well, not that bad. The package I sent you came back! I need to confirm your address. Thought I used the same one I sent the bodies to, but something must have been wrong. Can you tell me what it is? I don\'t have the original e-mail, and the file I used is obviously wrong.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14705,'46707fbd1c','[quote:46707fbd1c=\"SuperFly\"]Dude, bad news. Well, not that bad. The package I sent you came back! I need to confirm your address. Thought I used the same one I sent the bodies to, but something must have been wrong. Can you tell me what it is? I don\'t have the original e-mail, and the file I used is obviously wrong.[/quote:46707fbd1c]\r\n\r\n  Address is\r\n\r\nPeter Kostecki\r\n20 Water St.\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nL2V 2K3\r\nCanada\r\n\r\n\r\n  Hey since you have to resend do you have any zz stuff you are getting rid of?  I need some heatsinks and shit.  If so I can paypal some cash for them or send yea some shit if there is something you are looking for.\r\n\r\n  Anyway LMK\r\n\r\nCoolies\r\n\r\nPete'),(14706,'16b083f71e','$16USD to denmark I can do.  This is economy airmail, 2-4 weeks delivery.  For $18USD I can do priority airmail, 3-10 days delivery.\r\n\r\nyour choice mate,\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14707,'a72c9db53d','got it in the mail.  Thanks Sessiz.  Had to DL Win Rar and istalling it now.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14708,'46707fbd1c','[quote:46707fbd1c=\"SuperFly\"]Dude, bad news. Well, not that bad. The package I sent you came back! I need to confirm your address. Thought I used the same one I sent the bodies to, but something must have been wrong. Can you tell me what it is? I don\'t have the original e-mail, and the file I used is obviously wrong.[/quote:46707fbd1c]\r\n\r\n  Address is\r\n\r\nPeter Kostecki\r\n20 Water St.\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nL2V 2K3\r\nCanada\r\n\r\n\r\n  Hey since you have to resend do you have any zz stuff you are getting rid of?  I need some heatsinks and shit.  If so I can paypal some cash for them or send yea some shit if there is something you are looking for.\r\n\r\n  Anyway LMK\r\n\r\nCoolies\r\n\r\nPete'),(14709,'8eccb76f3d','[quote:8eccb76f3d=\"crazydave\"][quote:8eccb76f3d=\"VooDooMafia\"]  Yea I have fun posting stuff but sometimes its stressfull LOL, I know the last day is a killer for both seller and buyer.\r\n\r\n  Man I got my nephew a ZZ (350z) and some of the other kids including mine got some zz\'s (kinda funny that all the other adults thought these were new things little do they know they have been out for a while now).\r\n\r\n  So the only working ZZ I have right now is the duel cell fet one you did and I tell yea when we were racing these kids were not happy lol.   So after the xmas mail calms down I might be sending you  some stuff LOL.[/quote:8eccb76f3d]Those poor kids, they never had a chance.  :lol:[/quote:8eccb76f3d]\r\n\r\n  Yea they ended up makeing a track that was very hard to drive around so the slower speed helped them out alot :)\r\n\r\n  Yea I really need to get some stuff done I have 2 sets of alloys here and shit I am so lazy around this time of year lol'),(14710,'8eccb76f3d','[quote:8eccb76f3d=\"crazydave\"][quote:8eccb76f3d=\"VooDooMafia\"]  Yea I have fun posting stuff but sometimes its stressfull LOL, I know the last day is a killer for both seller and buyer.\r\n\r\n  Man I got my nephew a ZZ (350z) and some of the other kids including mine got some zz\'s (kinda funny that all the other adults thought these were new things little do they know they have been out for a while now).\r\n\r\n  So the only working ZZ I have right now is the duel cell fet one you did and I tell yea when we were racing these kids were not happy lol.   So after the xmas mail calms down I might be sending you  some stuff LOL.[/quote:8eccb76f3d]Those poor kids, they never had a chance.  :lol:[/quote:8eccb76f3d]\r\n\r\n  Yea they ended up makeing a track that was very hard to drive around so the slower speed helped them out alot :)\r\n\r\n  Yea I really need to get some stuff done I have 2 sets of alloys here and shit I am so lazy around this time of year lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14712,'7e34d2cc46','I didn\'t think anything was gonna happen. I was all ready to PM you to tell you congrats, when in the last minute, BAM, you got sniped. He got 2 bids in there in the last 30 secs. Quick little mofo, wasn\'t he?\r\n\r\nWell damn, I was hoping you would win it. Now I got to hope this guy is cool.\r\n\r\nNot bad though, less than 15 invested, 31 dollars return, that\'s more than double my money back. \r\n\r\nDave'),(14713,'b97bd04797','[quote:b97bd04797=\"crazydave\"]I didn\'t think anything was gonna happen. I was all ready to PM you to tell you congrats, when in the last minute, BAM, you got sniped. He got 2 bids in there in the last 30 secs. Quick little mofo, wasn\'t he?\r\n\r\nWell damn, I was hoping you would win it. Now I got to hope this guy is cool.\r\n\r\nNot bad though, less than 15 invested, 31 dollars return, that\'s more than double my money back. \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:b97bd04797]\r\n\r\n  Glad you made some $$ but I am pissed cause its all Pride fightings fault Grrrr.\r\n\r\n  I came to check between rounds and was over lol.\r\n\r\n  Those little basterds like me that wait and watch.'),(14714,'b97bd04797','[quote:b97bd04797=\"crazydave\"]I didn\'t think anything was gonna happen. I was all ready to PM you to tell you congrats, when in the last minute, BAM, you got sniped. He got 2 bids in there in the last 30 secs. Quick little mofo, wasn\'t he?\r\n\r\nWell damn, I was hoping you would win it. Now I got to hope this guy is cool.\r\n\r\nNot bad though, less than 15 invested, 31 dollars return, that\'s more than double my money back. \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:b97bd04797]\r\n\r\n  Glad you made some $$ but I am pissed cause its all Pride fightings fault Grrrr.\r\n\r\n  I came to check between rounds and was over lol.\r\n\r\n  Those little basterds like me that wait and watch.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21243,'2f9a789d49','Sounds good to me.  :-)'),(21244,'5b1fc867d3','[quote:5b1fc867d3=\"payaso\"]I feel ya on the Auctions...  When I first mentioned it to CW, it wasn\'t supposed to go down like this at all.  DT kinda took the reigns which is cool for him, but not for me..\r\n\r\nIf you noticed (I\'m sure you did) I haven\'t put up any cars yet. I don\'t feel like I need an \"Auctioneer\" to sell my cars. I\'d like to think they sell themselves.. Ya know?\r\n\r\nThe way DT has it set up is like for kids, or a younger crowd... Which are also the people with the least amount of money.\r\n\r\nI didn\'t want to put this up in the mod forum, cause I didn\'t want DT to think I\'m raggin on him..  I\'m not really..\r\n\r\n\r\nYou\'re takin a sever loss on your cars, and I believe it\'s due to the auction as it stands now.  He can auction his cars however he feels like it, but I\'m going to travel a different path.\r\n\r\nI\'ll be doing my own auctions in seperate threads, or maybe even on Ebay..\r\n\r\n\r\nI think the easiest way would be to start a thread, and let it go for 7 days, and whoever had the highest bid when locked, gets it. PERIOD.\r\n\r\n\r\njust a few of my thoughts....\r\n\r\nWhatcha think?\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:5b1fc867d3]Well I\'m dissapointed in our own members, it\'s like they\'ve forgotten part of the idea is to support bitPimps. So far the highest bidder has been Hachi-Rokou, who I never see around here, what the hell does he care to support bitPimps for. I really think if we took them to ebay, and put them on the open market, we\'ll attract more people willing to actually spend money, and not just trying to get a bargain.  Also I really believe an ebay auction can bring new members, which is good and bad, but we could use a few more people in the mix around here.\r\n\r\nI think what pissed me off, is Finks PMed last Tuesday all excited because he\'s getting a one of a kind car for $27. If this was ebay, I would be able to laugh my ass off at him, cause the real bidders will wait until the last day, but as it turned out, the smart ass got it.\r\n\r\nI hear ya about DT, I don\'t think it bothered me as much as you, but I noticed it, and I guess I almost thought it was funny. I think he just couldn\'t wait to sell his cars, but I have sold my cars, and I can tell ya, people will pay $50 for a stock Zip Zap chassis that been dual celled and comes with a charger, but they don\'t pay shit for a custom painted bit. Bits just don\'t have the market, or name recognition that Zip Zaps do, and when it comes to custom paint jobs and such, taste is subjective, so you just killed half your market right there by giving it personality.\r\n\r\nOk, I\'m starting to rant, so I\'ll cut it off here, but that\'s what I think about everything.\r\n\r\nDave'),(14716,'33737a51c4','[quote:33737a51c4=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:33737a51c4=\"crazydave\"]I didn\'t think anything was gonna happen. I was all ready to PM you to tell you congrats, when in the last minute, BAM, you got sniped. He got 2 bids in there in the last 30 secs. Quick little mofo, wasn\'t he?\r\n\r\nWell damn, I was hoping you would win it. Now I got to hope this guy is cool.\r\n\r\nNot bad though, less than 15 invested, 31 dollars return, that\'s more than double my money back. \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:33737a51c4]\r\n\r\n  Glad you made some $$ but I am pissed cause its all Pride fightings fault Grrrr.\r\n\r\n  I came to check between rounds and was over lol.\r\n\r\n  Those little basterds like me that wait and watch.[/quote:33737a51c4]Well that sucks, because if you were there, it would have been \'on\'.  :lol: \r\n\r\nOh well, that\'s cool though, \'cause you know I\'ll always give you deal on another car. ;)\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14717,'cdc8771ba3','Yea I know I can always count on some cool ass mods, but I can also always count on you postin another car hehe.'),(14718,'648cfd4646','in the post tomaro  :lol:  \r\n\r\nhave fun with it!\r\n\r\nmerry christmas\r\nmicro'),(14721,'cdc8771ba3','Yea I know I can always count on some cool ass mods, but I can also always count on you postin another car hehe.'),(14723,'a83489185e','[quote:a83489185e=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea I know I can always count on some cool ass mods, but I can also always count on you postin another car hehe.[/quote:a83489185e]Yeah, you never know what I might post next. ;)\r\n\r\nDude paid already, that\'s all good.\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna build a new track. I need an 8 ft straight on my track. :-D \r\n\r\nDave'),(14724,'d2bca50703','Yea I have a track that I am making all from styro for the walls and 2 pieces of 4\'X4\' play.\r\n\r\n  I use the wonder cutter to cut all my styro to look like rocks and cliffs some I am painting like rock some I aded moss to but its gonna be awhile before I finish.\r\n  \r\n\r\nMost the time I move the area rug and race no track or build what I can from the ZZ track I have traded for.\r\n\r\n  Good to hear that the dude paid already, 1 less thing for you to worry about :)\r\n\r\n  Man I need to fix that ZZ I had done by you.  The rear axle is really loose(like the nubs are gone or something) what do you think is best to keep them in?  I figure is gonna be a perm mod so I might not do it untill I decide on teh green or red gears.'),(14725,'d2bca50703','Yea I have a track that I am making all from styro for the walls and 2 pieces of 4\'X4\' play.\r\n\r\n  I use the wonder cutter to cut all my styro to look like rocks and cliffs some I am painting like rock some I aded moss to but its gonna be awhile before I finish.\r\n  \r\n\r\nMost the time I move the area rug and race no track or build what I can from the ZZ track I have traded for.\r\n\r\n  Good to hear that the dude paid already, 1 less thing for you to worry about :)\r\n\r\n  Man I need to fix that ZZ I had done by you.  The rear axle is really loose(like the nubs are gone or something) what do you think is best to keep them in?  I figure is gonna be a perm mod so I might not do it untill I decide on teh green or red gears.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35454,'79f3f2c2ee','I may just invest in these after all  :???: . I may jump in on the new years group buy. My nephew has an Xmod evo and he breaks everything. So I\'ll probably buy it off him cheap.\r\n\r\nThanx for the info man,\r\nMaxx'),(36799,'680be9419e','Here you go!  Congrats.  Now I gotta change my sig.\r\n\r\n[img:680be9419e]http://www.operationgoldstar.org/images/star.gif[/img:680be9419e]'),(36831,'692324074e','Anytime,\r\n             I can get them in and out as fast as you need.  Just give me a heads up first.  I\'ve already got the fets on hand and I\'ve had plenty of practice doing them in bits.  I\'m not to savy on fet swapping with ZipZaps, but I could always replace the pcb with a bit/clone pcb and give it a controller that I know would have longer range.  I\'ve got literally boxes of controllers that I\'ll never use.\r\n\r\nMy address;\r\nRobert Wilson\r\n1230 North Tomcat Court\r\nVirginia Beach, Va\r\n23454'),(35457,'2309f3889f','Thanks man, well half of my  1/10th shit is my Uncles (the starter of my RC passion) he done that one up. Shitty part is he banged it up a touch at the front, lost value and interest in it and sold it for 30 Canadian. Now he has got some badddd ass cars. He puts together Tamiya kits and hops em up like crazy adding extra cells and all, then sells em to people who want em. Like those deep dish rims eh lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21240,'d158d46d7f','How much and could you wait till the 13th of Aug.?  \r\n\r\nI gotta get my real 1:1 car inspected this week and I think its gonna take me for everything I\'m worth.   Its a mess!!  :-(  \r\n\r\nHowever if it doesn\'t, I\'ll gladly take it much sooner!!!\r\n\r\nThanks, \r\n\r\nMike'),(28936,'828ced098b','here is my address for the keychain that i won in the contest:\r\n\r\nJustin Coats\r\n2748 Stanton dr.\r\nSaginaw,MI 48601\r\n\r\nthanks for having the contest for me to win! :grin:'),(35533,'313b87c5f2','[quote:313b87c5f2=\"crazydave\"]Finally, I got a start. I really didn\'t want to do the wheels if I wasn\'t feeling it, \'cause you know, they gotta be round and stuff, and that\'s really hard. That was my hang up. So I finally just did it, I finally got the hard parts out of the way, and I\'m extremely happy with the results. Better than mine.\r\n\r\nHere your wheels, Tomy pullback rears, and ZZ fronts:\r\n[img:313b87c5f2]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/psII1.jpg[/img:313b87c5f2]\r\n\r\nI gotta go back and clean up that bevel on the fronts, didn\'t have any fine grit sand paper around, but I went ahead and painted in the silver ring to give you an idea.\r\n\r\n\r\n...and here\'s the beginnings of your chassis. You this part is tricky cause its gotta be square. It\'s Zip Zap based. I Figured they\'re only a couple bucks more than clones when on clearance, and that gives a solid platform.\r\n[img:313b87c5f2]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/psII3.jpg[/img:313b87c5f2]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m not flossin\' this until I\'m done, so you\'re gonna get the progress shots, cause you know I gotta show someone. :lol:\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:313b87c5f2]\r\n\r\nSorry for the delayed response, work has been kicking my ass... actually life in general has been kicking my ass. \r\n\r\nAnyway, shit dude... this thing is lookin\' sweet already. I really dig the way the chassis looks so far. It\'s cool you\'re startin\' with a ZZ... the quality of ZZ chassis, especially the steering components, is pretty much the best of the old-school stuff. The bulk is the only thing that keeps me away... it\'s a lot of work to carve away all that bulk. I really dig the way you just stripped away the whole bulky mid section.\r\n\r\nThe wheels look badass. I know how it is to have one little thing hold a whole thing up... I\'m the master at that shit, which is why I don\'t finish very many cars.\r\n\r\nSweet!\r\n\r\nIt\'s cool to get a sneak peek, man... thanks.\r\n\r\n\r\nNow I\'mm gonna go home and :cool:  &lt;--- except smokeless.  :lol:   Man, I\'m lovin\' this vaporizer... I haven\'t \"smoked\" anything since I got it, and my lungs can tell the difference.'),(33507,'4cdb612a45','Eh Cabo wats goin on...\r\n\r\nSorry to bother you but I wanted to know, for a bit with great handling what type of wheels would be best for the turning radius?\r\n\r\n1. Pullbacks\r\n2. Aloy type (like your tutorial)\r\n3. Or even HO scale slot cars (lovin the rubber on those damnnnnn!)\r\n\r\nLet me know pimp, thanks for your time.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34146,'1374b04ba7','Still doing it even tho now I am trying to revert back to the old avatar.  The odd thing is that my sig still works, I don\'t know, I am going to give you the info for my Avatar and just never touch this shit again  :grin: \r\nhttp://img.photobucket.com/albums/v77/marjoke/BitPimp1.jpg'),(32486,'8482f6aafb','[quote:8482f6aafb=\"Finks\"]Think I hit my limit in the gallery bro.  Can anything be done?  If not no worries, my photobucket account is alive and kickin. :-o[/quote:8482f6aafb]\r\n :???: You\'ve still got like 34 MB of space...\r\nAre you experiencing problems?\r\nTrying to upload a file over 5 MB?'),(37225,'7ddecc7cbc','http://www.microrccenter.com/forum/index.php?showtopic=35943&amp;pid=353400&amp;st=15&amp;#entry353400'),(37226,'46880de3ec','I guess I missed it. :sad:'),(35189,'030ce871ae','Wow, great news...thanks man just let me know. If you could really get a good price that would be crazily appreciated.\r\n\r\nAre you familiar with the 1/28th scale RC? I wanted to either get a miniZ or Xmod. Some say the EVO is kick ass, but the MR02 is the superior car. I dont know if i could believe that until i see them side by side. I\'m building a huge track for them in my basement, almost done. We painted the floor white and its sticky for grip, now we just gotta do the side borders and we have the lap timer.\r\n\r\nAlmost ready to go.'),(21242,'832bbf2026','[quote:832bbf2026=\"sessiz\"]I could, if it\'s cool, start off with $10 for one month tonight if that\'s cool with your guy. Then I\'ld go into the 6month payment schedual. Problem is that I nixed my paypal and will have to setup another, or do you/he have any other payment options?\r\nThanks again man. :-)[/quote:832bbf2026]no need to pay just yet.\r\nyou\'ll end up receiving an invoice in August (for the month of August).\r\npay when you receive that invoice.\r\nright now he only has pay by check available, but is going to setup paypal too. so more than likely, by the time you have your paypal setup, he\'ll have his setup.\r\n\r\nmore than likely, he\'ll wait until these last few upgrades are installed and configured before he sets up your account (probably before August, if not - we\'ll figure out billing, he\'s cool and flexible).\r\nthis way you don\'t have to deal with the site going down for a few hours temporarily or things mysteriously not working all of the sudden.\r\n\r\nsound good?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14727,'7026098da1','[quote:7026098da1=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea I have a track that I am making all from styro for the walls and 2 pieces of 4\'X4\' play.\r\n\r\n  I use the wonder cutter to cut all my styro to look like rocks and cliffs some I am painting like rock some I aded moss to but its gonna be awhile before I finish.\r\n  \r\n\r\nMost the time I move the area rug and race no track or build what I can from the ZZ track I have traded for.\r\n\r\n  Good to hear that the dude paid already, 1 less thing for you to worry about :)\r\n\r\n  Man I need to fix that ZZ I had done by you.  The rear axle is really loose(like the nubs are gone or something) what do you think is best to keep them in?  I figure is gonna be a perm mod so I might not do it untill I decide on teh green or red gears.[/quote:7026098da1]That\'s what Hogjowl\'s little JB Weld fix that he\'s famous for will fix, but that\'s permanent, and I don\'t like permanent, because I think the ability to change gear ratios is one of the coolest features of these cars.\r\n\r\nHere\'s what I\'ve done. I pulled off one wheel, slipped a WD40 red sprayer tube thingy over the axle. Since it came from a can of WD40 it had been lubricated already. ;)\r\n\r\nI put the wheel back on. Then carved out the area where the axle snaps into the chassis, enough to allow the WD40 tube to slip in without compressing it, and squeazing the axle. Finish by super glueing the tube into the chassis.\r\n\r\nThe axle should spin freely, if not loosen it up by spinning it with a dremel.\r\n\r\nAt that point my car was fixed, and it seemed permanent, but when I really wanted to change gears, I ended up making 2 cuts in the WD40 tube, to pull out a strip. That allowed my axle to snap in and out and still be snugger than it ever was stock.\r\n\r\nSo far it\'s held up to my dual cell punishment, but if it wears out, it\'ll be easy fix.\r\n\r\ndave'),(14728,'983344e1d8','[quote:983344e1d8=\"crazydave\"][quote:983344e1d8=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea I have a track that I am making all from styro for the walls and 2 pieces of 4\'X4\' play.\r\n\r\n  I use the wonder cutter to cut all my styro to look like rocks and cliffs some I am painting like rock some I aded moss to but its gonna be awhile before I finish.\r\n  \r\n\r\nMost the time I move the area rug and race no track or build what I can from the ZZ track I have traded for.\r\n\r\n  Good to hear that the dude paid already, 1 less thing for you to worry about :)\r\n\r\n  Man I need to fix that ZZ I had done by you.  The rear axle is really loose(like the nubs are gone or something) what do you think is best to keep them in?  I figure is gonna be a perm mod so I might not do it untill I decide on teh green or red gears.[/quote:983344e1d8]That\'s what Hogjowl\'s little JB Weld fix that he\'s famous for will fix, but that\'s permanent, and I don\'t like permanent, because I think the ability to change gear ratios is one of the coolest features of these cars.\r\n\r\nHere\'s what I\'ve done. I pulled off one wheel, slipped a WD40 red sprayer tube thingy over the axle. Since it came from a can of WD40 it had been lubricated already. ;)\r\n\r\nI put the wheel back on. Then carved out the area where the axle snaps into the chassis, enough to allow the WD40 tube to slip in without compressing it, and squeazing the axle. Finish by super glueing the tube into the chassis.\r\n\r\nThe axle should spin freely, if not loosen it up by spinning it with a dremel.\r\n\r\nAt that point my car was fixed, and it seemed permanent, but when I really wanted to change gears, I ended up making 2 cuts in the WD40 tube, to pull out a strip. That allowed my axle to snap in and out and still be snugger than it ever was stock.\r\n\r\nSo far it\'s held up to my dual cell punishment, but if it wears out, it\'ll be easy fix.\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:983344e1d8]\r\n\r\n  yea I dont like permanent to much my self but I think, duel cell and fets, what diff is the gears gonna make really lol.\r\n\r\n  I love that car, that and teh beatle you did they are fun as shit now.\r\n\r\n  Have you had a chance to try out that black motor in the se? I have been meaning to ask what you think of those motors.\r\n\r\n  Man I have some of the newer lxx and stock they are pulling wheelies with yelow zz motors.  next time I send some cars I will send one of them for you to play with lol fun as fuck.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14729,'983344e1d8','[quote:983344e1d8=\"crazydave\"][quote:983344e1d8=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea I have a track that I am making all from styro for the walls and 2 pieces of 4\'X4\' play.\r\n\r\n  I use the wonder cutter to cut all my styro to look like rocks and cliffs some I am painting like rock some I aded moss to but its gonna be awhile before I finish.\r\n  \r\n\r\nMost the time I move the area rug and race no track or build what I can from the ZZ track I have traded for.\r\n\r\n  Good to hear that the dude paid already, 1 less thing for you to worry about :)\r\n\r\n  Man I need to fix that ZZ I had done by you.  The rear axle is really loose(like the nubs are gone or something) what do you think is best to keep them in?  I figure is gonna be a perm mod so I might not do it untill I decide on teh green or red gears.[/quote:983344e1d8]That\'s what Hogjowl\'s little JB Weld fix that he\'s famous for will fix, but that\'s permanent, and I don\'t like permanent, because I think the ability to change gear ratios is one of the coolest features of these cars.\r\n\r\nHere\'s what I\'ve done. I pulled off one wheel, slipped a WD40 red sprayer tube thingy over the axle. Since it came from a can of WD40 it had been lubricated already. ;)\r\n\r\nI put the wheel back on. Then carved out the area where the axle snaps into the chassis, enough to allow the WD40 tube to slip in without compressing it, and squeazing the axle. Finish by super glueing the tube into the chassis.\r\n\r\nThe axle should spin freely, if not loosen it up by spinning it with a dremel.\r\n\r\nAt that point my car was fixed, and it seemed permanent, but when I really wanted to change gears, I ended up making 2 cuts in the WD40 tube, to pull out a strip. That allowed my axle to snap in and out and still be snugger than it ever was stock.\r\n\r\nSo far it\'s held up to my dual cell punishment, but if it wears out, it\'ll be easy fix.\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:983344e1d8]\r\n\r\n  yea I dont like permanent to much my self but I think, duel cell and fets, what diff is the gears gonna make really lol.\r\n\r\n  I love that car, that and teh beatle you did they are fun as shit now.\r\n\r\n  Have you had a chance to try out that black motor in the se? I have been meaning to ask what you think of those motors.\r\n\r\n  Man I have some of the newer lxx and stock they are pulling wheelies with yelow zz motors.  next time I send some cars I will send one of them for you to play with lol fun as fuck.'),(14730,'16b083f71e','$16USD to denmark I can do.  This is economy airmail, 2-4 weeks delivery.  For $18USD I can do priority airmail, 3-10 days delivery.\r\n\r\nyour choice mate,\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14731,'c785589b4a','via Paypal?\r\n\r\nMy dad has a paypal account, i\'ll have to talk with him about it, im with him today. \r\n\r\n/Max'),(14732,'c785589b4a','via Paypal?\r\n\r\nMy dad has a paypal account, i\'ll have to talk with him about it, im with him today. \r\n\r\n/Max'),(14733,'1b7b1de3dd','[quote:1b7b1de3dd=\"TheEvo\"]via Paypal?\r\n\r\nMy dad has a paypal account, i\'ll have to talk with him about it, im with him today. \r\n\r\n/Max[/quote:1b7b1de3dd]\r\n\r\nyes, paypal please :)\r\n\r\npaypal me at matt.marcos@bigpond.com and once I\'ve got it I\'ll send out the alloy rims.  what shipping do you want? the $16USD or $18USD?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14734,'1b7b1de3dd','[quote:1b7b1de3dd=\"TheEvo\"]via Paypal?\r\n\r\nMy dad has a paypal account, i\'ll have to talk with him about it, im with him today. \r\n\r\n/Max[/quote:1b7b1de3dd]\r\n\r\nyes, paypal please :)\r\n\r\npaypal me at matt.marcos@bigpond.com and once I\'ve got it I\'ll send out the alloy rims.  what shipping do you want? the $16USD or $18USD?\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14735,'ed51783b77','I\'ll go with the 18$\r\n\r\nI will talk to him in a couple of hours right now he\'s busy.\r\nHope you dont mind.\r\n\r\n/Max');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14736,'ed51783b77','I\'ll go with the 18$\r\n\r\nI will talk to him in a couple of hours right now he\'s busy.\r\nHope you dont mind.\r\n\r\n/Max'),(14737,'6b2d252ee2','[quote:6b2d252ee2=\"TheEvo\"]I\'ll go with the 18$\r\n\r\nI will talk to him in a couple of hours right now he\'s busy.\r\nHope you dont mind.\r\n\r\n/Max[/quote:6b2d252ee2]\r\n\r\nthat\'s fine, I will probably be asleep by then (currently it\'s 11pm here),  I\'ll check in the morning and we\'ll take it from there.\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14738,'6b2d252ee2','[quote:6b2d252ee2=\"TheEvo\"]I\'ll go with the 18$\r\n\r\nI will talk to him in a couple of hours right now he\'s busy.\r\nHope you dont mind.\r\n\r\n/Max[/quote:6b2d252ee2]\r\n\r\nthat\'s fine, I will probably be asleep by then (currently it\'s 11pm here),  I\'ll check in the morning and we\'ll take it from there.\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14739,'733884cdf1','id like to mount 3 cells, but i dont really want to extend my chassis, is 3 cells harder than just dualing it? id imagine its just more wiring right? so keeping the chassis normal, where do you suggest i mount the cells? thanks alot for the help.  :-)'),(23293,'ce1297789e','Are you going to part out any of the xmod stuff?\r\n\r\n  If so what would you be asking for it?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14741,'f19b004f7f','Hey Man,\r\n\r\nIt seems no one is reading the forum!\r\n\r\nAs I posted, S/H is going to be approx $3.00 from Dave so can you take care of that?\r\n\r\nDon\'t worry about givin Dave anything extra, I\'ve got him completely covered.\r\n\r\nHave you PM\'d Silla about the chassis?  Alloys?'),(21234,'5d0df5966d','I\'ll double on it this week!  System at home is down.'),(21554,'3960089d18','Yeah, I got a t maxx. I\'m a member on banned, but not on the other...\r\n\r\nHow\'s your sport maxx run? You got the 2.5?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(21555,'4a24a4ad4b','do you know why i cant get on chat'),(21236,'f2510e337a','Thanks for the info. I tried to upload and delete some pics today and it worked just fine. Keep up the good work. Nice to see the improvements you\'ve done to the finest pimps place on the web  :-)'),(14743,'1466e3ef9c','[quote:1466e3ef9c=\"VooDooMafia\"]  Have you had a chance to try out that black motor in the se? I have been meaning to ask what you think of those motors.[/quote:1466e3ef9c]Yeah, I\'ve been meaning to tell you about that motor.\r\n\r\nIt is very fast. It\'s in that, \'I don\'t know if it\'s a 3.5, 3.8, or a 4.2, but it\'s quick\'. In the SE I think it\'s a little faster than the ZZ 3.4, but doesn\'t quite have the torque. Still it has very good torque, especially in a bit.\r\n\r\nSo I was swapping motors back and forth, trying to get a good comparison of that motor, when I went to pull the pinion off that motor, and the shaft pulled right out of it. I was like, \"Oh shit I just killed VDM\'s motor\", but I stuck it back in, and it works fine. I\'m just scared to touch that motor now, for fear of breaking it. \r\n\r\ndave'),(14744,'349443817d','Man if it breaks it breaks I have more lol\r\n\r\n  I have had that happen with motors aswell and is strange that they still work when you just push it back in but they do so I tried not to question it to much lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14745,'349443817d','Man if it breaks it breaks I have more lol\r\n\r\n  I have had that happen with motors aswell and is strange that they still work when you just push it back in but they do so I tried not to question it to much lol'),(14746,'08d8688712','Just reading th eforums and came accross the \"fets in se thread\"\r\n\r\n  I am betting if CW checked the ip of cyborgzero it would match that of microamps (or atleast in the same range as he might use a router).'),(14748,'6df40a46bb','I don\'t have any extra ZZ stuff, but I\'ll make a trip to RS for you. Let me know what you need. I\'m not sure if you can get heatsinks separate from a new chassis, but I\'ll check on it for you. \r\n\r\n[quote:6df40a46bb=\"VooDooMafia\"][quote:6df40a46bb=\"SuperFly\"]Dude, bad news. Well, not that bad. The package I sent you came back! I need to confirm your address. Thought I used the same one I sent the bodies to, but something must have been wrong. Can you tell me what it is? I don\'t have the original e-mail, and the file I used is obviously wrong.[/quote:6df40a46bb]\r\n\r\n  Address is\r\n\r\nPeter Kostecki\r\n20 Water St.\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nL2V 2K3\r\nCanada\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  Hey since you have to resend do you have any zz stuff you are getting rid of?  I need some heatsinks and shit.  If so I can paypal some cash for them or send yea some shit if there is something you are looking for.\r\n\r\n  Anyway LMK\r\n\r\nCoolies\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:6df40a46bb]'),(14750,'08d8688712','Just reading th eforums and came accross the \"fets in se thread\"\r\n\r\n  I am betting if CW checked the ip of cyborgzero it would match that of microamps (or atleast in the same range as he might use a router).');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14752,'994b52d71f','[quote:994b52d71f=\"VooDooMafia\"]Just reading th eforums and came accross the \"fets in se thread\"\r\n\r\n  I am betting if CW checked the ip of cyborgzero it would match that of microamps (or atleast in the same range as he might use a router).[/quote:994b52d71f]I\'m  not so sure about that. This guy was selling his mods on MRRC. Micro-amps has established a reputation under his name. I would think he\'d keep his name over there too.\r\n\r\ndave'),(14753,'a97ede351c','its all good bro, the heatsinks is all I really need I just didn\'t want to go buy teh tuneup kit just for it as it comes with crap motors lol.\r\n\r\n  I think CD has some he said.  man one of the sity things about ZZ\'s when you get a bare chassie in a trade those damn heatsinks should be like the bit ones.'),(14755,'112190bd95','Well let me check on that, then. I\'ve bought a couple of those tune-up kits for the gears, so maybe I do have a spare heatsink. If I do, I\'ll throw it in and mail that package tomorrow.'),(14756,'ad22292207','Hey, I was just wondering, how do I send pics for an entry for the End of the year contest?  Could you please email me back at viperdout@yahoo.com .   Thanks.\r\n\r\n-Max');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14757,'f745a2eef4','Hey Pimp!,  what\'s been shakin!\r\n\r\nCan you give my a link where I can get shots of your white ZZ Skyline, the first body mod you did ?\r\n\r\nI want to host it cause it doesn\'t show in the Ride Of Da Week anymore.\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp'),(14759,'f19b004f7f','Hey Man,\r\n\r\nIt seems no one is reading the forum!\r\n\r\nAs I posted, S/H is going to be approx $3.00 from Dave so can you take care of that?\r\n\r\nDon\'t worry about givin Dave anything extra, I\'ve got him completely covered.\r\n\r\nHave you PM\'d Silla about the chassis?  Alloys?'),(18478,'20eaec2142','I\'m gettin\' ready to get out now. Just makin a quick swing through the hood. See if you can give Finks any advice in the Photoshop fun thread.'),(18480,'cedfd2976c','you can keep uploading images in the image gallery\r\ndunno if my post about the server space confused anyone, but just thought I\'d metion it just in case.'),(18481,'cedfd2976c','you can keep uploading images in the image gallery\r\ndunno if my post about the server space confused anyone, but just thought I\'d metion it just in case.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31379,'470a2bf7af','I do, and I can send it out on Monday.  I\'ll be home tomorrow, so I\'ll give you the paypal to send it to when I\'m home.'),(25711,'732eee17ef','[quote:732eee17ef=\"viperdout\"]Dave:\r\n\r\nDid the parts get in yet?\r\n\r\n-Max[/quote:732eee17ef]Nah, just ordered them yesterday. Don\'t worry man, I\'ll get this done as fast as possible. Promise.\r\n\r\nAnd I am sorry it\'s taken as long as it has, but you knew I wasn\'t quite prepared when you sent your truck. ;)\r\n\r\ndave'),(14763,'942db08273','hey man,\r\n\r\nI\'ve got the black lambo shell and chassis, also a 4.2PRO and a LXX ferrari shell still available.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested these are all available, I\'m willing to sell you these for $16USD inc shipping.  How does that sound?\r\n\r\nCheers mate,\r\n\r\nMAtt.'),(14764,'676accb0f4','hey do you still have that file up there?\r\nif so how do i get to it?'),(14765,'676accb0f4','hey do you still have that file up there?\r\nif so how do i get to it?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14766,'f44f5b7e96','[quote:f44f5b7e96=\"hogjowlz\"]hey do you still have that file up there?\r\nif so how do i get to it?[/quote:f44f5b7e96]\r\n\r\nhere ya go: \r\n\r\nip: 66.199.174.32 \r\nuser: pimps@prahranpianos \r\npwd: b1tp1mps \r\n\r\n\r\nit\'s gonna go in a few days.\r\ncheers man,\r\n\r\nph2t,.'),(22854,'0ddfc399c7','Can you pay with paypal? If you need references, just ask anyone on here.'),(14768,'9cc7ac6c46','[quote:9cc7ac6c46=\"DarkTari\"]Hey Man,\r\n\r\nIt seems no one is reading the forum!\r\n\r\nAs I posted, S/H is going to be approx $3.00 from Dave so can you take care of that?\r\n\r\nDon\'t worry about givin Dave anything extra, I\'ve got him completely covered.\r\n\r\nHave you PM\'d Silla about the chassis?  Alloys?[/quote:9cc7ac6c46]yea man I can take care of the shipping.\r\nsilla\'s making another chassis now.\r\njust got off the phone with him - he said he started last night, got alot done and should be able to finish the chassis tonite.\r\nhe\'s got some alloys on it, but needs to dial them in.\r\nhe also needs to paint the controller - but says that\'s a quick one.\r\n\r\nwhat I\'m thinking is this...\r\n- silla finishes up the chassis tonite (hopefully), get him to ship by tomorrow to crazydave.\r\n- while crazydave fets, silla can be painting up the controller.\r\n- while all this is going on, we don\'t say anything publicly. like you mentioned, we\'ll just \"take our time\" judging if need be and that should give us enough time to get everything done and ready to ship out to winners.'),(14769,'91ae8236f9','Sounds like a plan to me!\r\n\r\nU Da Man!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14770,'6b627f1b71','Damn.. Im sorry but my dad didnt have a paypal account afterall.\r\n\r\nany other way i can pay? I will buy them for sure..\r\n\r\n/Evo'),(14771,'e36ab2ebd3','[quote:e36ab2ebd3=\"crazydave\"][quote:e36ab2ebd3=\"VooDooMafia\"]Just reading th eforums and came accross the \"fets in se thread\"\r\n\r\n  I am betting if CW checked the ip of cyborgzero it would match that of microamps (or atleast in the same range as he might use a router).[/quote:e36ab2ebd3]I\'m  not so sure about that. This guy was selling his mods on MRRC. Micro-amps has established a reputation under his name. I would think he\'d keep his name over there too.\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:e36ab2ebd3]\r\n\r\n  Yea man that guy just pisses me off and rubs me the way micr does lol.'),(14772,'6b627f1b71','Damn.. Im sorry but my dad didnt have a paypal account afterall.\r\n\r\nany other way i can pay? I will buy them for sure..\r\n\r\n/Evo'),(14773,'dd9bdc61fb','[quote:dd9bdc61fb=\"TheEvo\"]Damn.. Im sorry but my dad didnt have a paypal account afterall.\r\n\r\nany other way i can pay? I will buy them for sure..\r\n\r\n/Evo[/quote:dd9bdc61fb]\r\n\r\nsorry dude, paypal only.\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14774,'dd9bdc61fb','[quote:dd9bdc61fb=\"TheEvo\"]Damn.. Im sorry but my dad didnt have a paypal account afterall.\r\n\r\nany other way i can pay? I will buy them for sure..\r\n\r\n/Evo[/quote:dd9bdc61fb]\r\n\r\nsorry dude, paypal only.\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(14775,'c3a653b4e9','I\'ll talk to him about it.\r\n\r\nBut now that its christmas and so on, i wont see him in a couple of days.\r\n\r\n/Evo'),(14776,'c3a653b4e9','I\'ll talk to him about it.\r\n\r\nBut now that its christmas and so on, i wont see him in a couple of days.\r\n\r\n/Evo'),(14777,'91ae8236f9','Sounds like a plan to me!\r\n\r\nU Da Man!'),(14778,'e36ab2ebd3','[quote:e36ab2ebd3=\"crazydave\"][quote:e36ab2ebd3=\"VooDooMafia\"]Just reading th eforums and came accross the \"fets in se thread\"\r\n\r\n  I am betting if CW checked the ip of cyborgzero it would match that of microamps (or atleast in the same range as he might use a router).[/quote:e36ab2ebd3]I\'m  not so sure about that. This guy was selling his mods on MRRC. Micro-amps has established a reputation under his name. I would think he\'d keep his name over there too.\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:e36ab2ebd3]\r\n\r\n  Yea man that guy just pisses me off and rubs me the way micr does lol.'),(14779,'ebaac79d84','You think your hot shit homie? Well i was juss playin G! I got some good news!!!!!! And its fo shizzle this time.\r\n\r\n           I dialed up my bros at LHS (again) and they are closing out (which sucks, cos now i gotta find another place to race), but see, they\'ve still got Overlands, and 1 X5 left! I just happen to call them... I hope you\'ll forgive me for being a little beeeyatch late(lol) but this time its for real. I still got  yo addy, so don\'t worry about nothin yo. I know you want the Monster Mad Force mini-z, but I just happen to catch this, and it reminded of me what I still owed you.... A BAD ASS CHRISTMAS PRESENT YO!!!!!! \r\n\r\n           Hope you enjoy it when you get it. Too bad it won\'t  be there in time for x-mas, but still, think of me when you drive that beast! It\'ll be sent the monday after X-mas. Have some bad ass fun dood.... \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n                           Yo friend pimpin\' in Ka-LEE-FOR-NEEE-YAHHHHH \r\n\r\n              [color=violet:ebaac79d84]Mi[/color:ebaac79d84][color=darkred:ebaac79d84]ke[/color:ebaac79d84][color=orange:ebaac79d84]Chen[/color:ebaac79d84]');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14790,'f72f38270e','umm last question and then i will stop bothering u but do you know where i can get those wires at??? thanx for all your help'),(14791,'f72f38270e','umm last question and then i will stop bothering u but do you know where i can get those wires at??? thanx for all your help'),(14792,'7d7cebc46e','[quote:7d7cebc46e=\"ChopShop\"]umm last question and then i will stop bothering u but do you know where i can get those wires at??? thanx for all your help[/quote:7d7cebc46e]almost any electronics store, radio shack, some online sites that sell the micro\'s, etc.\r\nextrememicros might still have some single stock left as well\r\nhttp://www.extrememicros.com/'),(14793,'7d7cebc46e','[quote:7d7cebc46e=\"ChopShop\"]umm last question and then i will stop bothering u but do you know where i can get those wires at??? thanx for all your help[/quote:7d7cebc46e]almost any electronics store, radio shack, some online sites that sell the micro\'s, etc.\r\nextrememicros might still have some single stock left as well\r\nhttp://www.extrememicros.com/'),(36365,'fbcea831fa','[quote:fbcea831fa=\"pimpsmurf\"]You should have got a PM from me. That is weird.\r\n\r\nYes, I got your payment, but was unable to get to the hobby shop today and get those items I ordered. I will be able to get them tomorrow, and will ship your stuff out tomorrow. Everything is boxed up and ready to go, but I\'m still looking through some of my boxes to make sure there isn\'t some parts laying around here. I think I\'ve got it all.\r\n\r\nAnyway, Thanks a lot man. I will send you a tracking number as soon as I get it shipped. This week we are preparing for a boat show, and I just got done driving boats to the convention center all afternoon. Fun fun.\r\n\r\n-JNY[/quote:fbcea831fa]\r\n\r\nThat is wierd i never got one ehh.\r\n\r\n\r\nThats cool man, you can take your time i can use anything you got for it.\r\nThat must be fun driving boats and all, personally they give me the shits when going high speeds, im more comfortable on a jet ski lol. weird.\r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37413,'31c2239150','in your burning prog there should be a way to set the gap between audio tracks, check preferences or something.'),(14798,'580dacfada','Hey man,\r\nI\'m pretty sure I talked to you about this before, but I honestly can\'t remember what, when, etc. anyways....\r\n\r\nWe want to offer you up a spot as one of the bitPimps moderators.\r\nYou\'re a tremendous help on the boards.\r\nThis offer has been tossed around for awhile, we\'ve just been so busy we haven\'t had a chance to put it out there.\r\nSo this offer isn\'t just because you\'re helping out with the contest this time around, it\'s for all you do - helping out other pimps on the boards, all of it.\r\nIf you\'re interested, here\'s some details:\r\n- you\'ll get moderator privilages\r\n- you\'ll be responsible for helping keep the forums clean and running smoothly\r\n- you won\'t be eligible to enter and win contests\r\n- you will be able to help decide what upcoming contest will be, prizes, etc.\r\n\r\nso, if you\'re interested, awesome, let me know.\r\nif not, that\'s fine too - its good enough to just have you as a member.'),(14799,'66acee018e','[quote:66acee018e=\"CaboWabo\"]Hey man,\r\nI\'m pretty sure I talked to you about this before, but I honestly can\'t remember what, when, etc. anyways....\r\n\r\nWe want to offer you up a spot as one of the bitPimps moderators.\r\nYou\'re a tremendous help on the boards.\r\nThis offer has been tossed around for awhile, we\'ve just been so busy we haven\'t had a chance to put it out there.\r\nSo this offer isn\'t just because you\'re helping out with the contest this time around, it\'s for all you do - helping out other pimps on the boards, all of it.\r\nIf you\'re interested, here\'s some details:\r\n- you\'ll get moderator privilages\r\n- you\'ll be responsible for helping keep the forums clean and running smoothly\r\n- you won\'t be eligible to enter and win contests\r\n- you will be able to help decide what upcoming contest will be, prizes, etc.\r\n\r\nso, if you\'re interested, awesome, let me know.\r\nif not, that\'s fine too - its good enough to just have you as a member.[/quote:66acee018e]Yeah sure, that would be cool.\r\n\r\nI was planning something a little extra speial for the contest, but oh well, I\'m running out of time, and haven\'t even started it it. So this will just give me an excuse to put it off longer. ;)\r\n\r\n...and Happy Christmas, and all that stuff too.  :-) \r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (14800,'c14d4d2779','You are too cool dood...  What are you, and your family doing for the holidays?\r\n\r\nI\'m still waiting to get back up running full speed, but my computer skills suck ass.lol\r\n\r\n\r\nYou can always call me.    Have a great christmas Mike.\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(14801,'3ffbad58be','We are doing completely nothing man... but its aight, cos i never was too big on the holidaish thing.  Its all good man...  You\'ll love it when you get it.... i\'ll call you soon man, i still got the number (I believe, lol) and so yeah. merry x-mas and happy holidays (new year too), lol. \r\n\r\n \r\n                                                             yo friend in ka-lee-for-nee-yah,\r\n\r\n                                                                                      -Mike'),(14962,'b724aebaf5','hey man, happy new year!  hope you\'re well and that everything is working out well for you.   even if you do have idiots in your hood shooting rounds into the air!\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(14963,'b724aebaf5','hey man, happy new year!  hope you\'re well and that everything is working out well for you.   even if you do have idiots in your hood shooting rounds into the air!\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nmatt.');
