\n\r\nYou got a Camaro body set for me?!  :eek: \r\n\r\nI don\'t remember that, but that\'s freakin\' great, I needed to get another body set, to stretch my body, and was praying that my local RS wasn\'t sold out. \r\n\r\nHmm, now if I\'m gonna have a stretched body, that\'s gonna leave plenty of room to run 7.2v, this could get interesting. Very interesting...\r\n\r\nI\'ll you keep you updated. You\'re the only one that knows what I\'m up to, so, shhhh. ;)\r\n\r\nThanks man, you da mutha fuckin\' man, dude.  :cool: \r\n\r\nHere\'s that addy you asked for:\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd.\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:aad85de564]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\ndid you forget your apartment # or have you moved up to the \"Big Time\" :lol:\r\n\r\nI did tell you I had a ZZ body set for you, but I didn\'t tell you it was the camaro one....its the 67 and the 2002 anniversary...and they will be in the mail on monday :grin:');
