INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (16968,'07c03197f0','Do You have Xmods? I was just wondering because I am starting a page for Xmods where You can post pics and Mods and everybody can talk about X mods and stuff, it would be cool if I could get more people to join, If You would like to join i need Your Email address I can send You a invitation. Need more members, and I am trying to figure out how to make the site public to the web, right now it is a private site and I need managers and other people. thanks'),(16972,'f848cf9385','alright I understand, but see You can still join the website because You can post Pics of mini Z\'s and we can still have Mods and stuff about Mini\'Z\'s and X mods, On my website You don\'t have to just have a X mod You can have any type of Micro RC, see You could have a Page of Your own just about Mini Z\'s, idk, just asking :cool:'),(37879,'bc28697c93','Hey man, I\'m not blowin\' you off, I\'ve just been slammed like a muthafucka. Saw ya just now, so I thought I\'d at least say hey.\r\n\r\nTalk to ya more thoroughly later.'),(33047,'a7218b5834','Its all good dude.  I spoke to the other Aussie guys, and they reckon it can take an assload of time sometimes, so i\'ll wait it out another fortnight or so.  We can sort somethin im sure.  I\'m not riding you man, I know sending mail to the asshole of the world is a pain, and you\'ve been checking in and stuff, so please don\'t think im trying to be pushy or nothin.  Just getting peeved with australia post.  Apparently any shipment of international mail can land in any australian capital city, so it could be sitting in fucking perth for all i know.  Thats like me sending a parcel to my sister in NY and having it arive in LA. Then they kick it around customs for a while, then send it ground shipping from whichever place they decide to land the shipment.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36921,'6862538440','[quote:6862538440=\"Stoli\"]Aight man on the phone thing. Tomorrow night is better for me anyways.\r\n\r\nAs far as tech on my site. I can use mysql,perl,html/xml and php.[/quote:6862538440]\r\nCool, well if my last PM (with code) isn\'t what you want, go get a PHP/MySQL gallery and install it.'),(34786,'688638a29f','[quote:688638a29f=\"arfin\"]HAHA man! I seen when you posted that story of us playing, that was a sick scene! If you wanna play/talk hit me up.[/quote:688638a29f]\r\n\r\nHell yeah, man, it was totally true!! LOL\r\n\r\nI just sent ya a message about it via MSN.\r\n\r\nLater!!!'),(34788,'b5ca478e8a','Hey are your tuitons coming along? I was just wondering wether you send me my chassis yet. You said it would be thursday/friday. There is no hurry but hey.. I thought I let you know.  :-)'),(33888,'52b8bc0083','OK, then what else is in your stock-pile\'o\'junk?'),(33890,'b207f0cdfb','I\'m almost ready!!!!!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37286,'606e874244','that seems like an ok deal, there\'s probably better but you never know when they will come around.\r\n\r\ni personally wouldn\'t buy anymore iwavers, i\'m all about the mr02 now. but iwavers still work good and teach you a lot about the hobby :-o'),(33988,'6556a6dd20','Was it bad that  I removed the steering spring thingy from the front of my zzmt.'),(17161,'5ecd7a1705','ya, its two gay lovers singing over a web cam to each other!!!'),(17172,'f8ac846e02','Hi CW\r\n\r\njust got first batch of mats into USA for local postage. Are you da man to review the bonzer mat for the pimps?\r\n\r\nIf you are email me with your postal address and I will get one sent to you foc.\r\n\r\nIf you are not da man, suggest someone else.\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTB'),(17163,'021c523eec','you gotta do a google search and watch the gummo trailer...'),(17164,'a12fa1c881','Cool  :cool:'),(17165,'aeb6d2838d','man, my wife tricked me, and snagged the computer from me before I could upload anything yesterday, but I got it done last night.\r\n\r\nI got your songs downloaded too. I dig punk covers, but Lita Ford is so lame, even a punk band can\'t save one of her songs.  :lol: \r\n\r\nI like to make fun of her, \'cause I always see her on VH1 bitching how grunge killed her career, then she starts ranting how she can\'t wait until \"real rock \'n roll\" comes back in style, and that just offends the hell out of me, and I\'m just like, \"So you think [i:aeb6d2838d]you\'re[/i:aeb6d2838d] \'real rock n roll\', whatever, Shut the fuck up, you stupid ass no talent bitch.\" \r\n\r\nJoan Jett was the only thing going in the Runaways. Now there\'s a bad ass bitch that understands \"real rock \'n roll\".\r\n\r\nSorry for the rant, but you\'ll find that I go off on quite a few rants when discussing music.  :lol:\r\n\r\ndave'),(16977,'e0c3d6f9e3','Do You have a Xmods? I was just wondering because I am starting a page for Xmods where You can post pics and Mods and everybody can talk about X mods and stuff, it would be cool if I could get more people to join, If You would like to join i need Your Email address so that I can send You a invitation to get into the site. Need more members, and I am trying to figure out how to make the site public to the web, right now it is a private site and I need managers and other people. thanks\r\n\r\n_________________');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (16978,'a3eb11c453','i want 1 set of\r\nWT 06 \r\nBBS 5-loch \r\nØ 8.3 mm \r\n\r\nbut i want to send you cash cuz i dont know how the paypal thing works and plus im only 14 and have a b day comin up on march 3rd so i can send the money to you before my bday but dont make any orders un til i am sure i can buy some cuz i dont want you stuck with a set of rims and no money to pay for them or the word to get out and for meto have a bad rep torwards trading and buying things because i couldnt live to my part of the deal\r\n\r\nTHANKS'),(16979,'2732fc92c4','Do You have a Xmods? I was just wondering because I am starting a page for Xmods where You can post pics and Mods and everybody can talk about X mods and stuff, it would be cool if I could get more people to join, If You would like to join i need Your Email address so that I can send You a invitation to get into the site. Need more members, and I am trying to figure out how to make the site public to the web, right now it is a private site and I need managers and other people. thanks\r\n\r\n_________________'),(16980,'527fc2ab6d','[quote:527fc2ab6d=\"Bird\"]I\'ll be in touch.[/quote:527fc2ab6d]\r\nok thanks :cool:');
