If I stall long enough, my wife might head that way. ;)  :lol: \r\n\r\nYou just gave me \'The Greatest Idea\' ever. We enter all our entries as usual, in the mod contest, meantime put this car together (but we\'ll have to put a rush on it) and enter the joint venture in the last seconds.\r\n\r\nThat\'d be cool, ya think?\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:674aedea69]fuck yes it would be! lol\r\nI think the other pimps would get a kick out of it too.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17244,'96cb0f1bf0','[quote:96cb0f1bf0=\"Havok\"]I got the e-mail from Bonzer Mats yesterday.... you won!!!!  :-D  :D  :D  :-D \r\n\r\nand I wanted to let you know I\'m still around....and will be up to my old tricks soon....gotta get through moving first :grin:[/quote:96cb0f1bf0]\r\n\r\n  Yea man thanks I cant wait to get it and see what its all about.  \r\n\r\n  I to am still around just been working like a mad man since I started back at work (12+ hours a day)\r\n\r\n  I will return to the forums with a vengance though and keep teh pimp hand movin .'),(17245,'e7c67122a1','cool man, i\'m ready when you are!\r\n\r\ncheers!'),(17246,'674aedea69','[quote:674aedea69=\"crazydave\"][quote:674aedea69=\"CaboWabo\"]sitting there all high tonite I started thinking of the joint project thing we all were talking about. I\'d really like to do that, get several pimps hands in on one ride - you know it\'d probably be the best bit out there lol\r\n\r\nwe should start planning something on that for whoever teams up.\r\n\r\n[/quote:674aedea69]Honestly then, If your not gonna be around for a couple weeks I should go ahead, and stall a little longer. If I stall long enough, my wife might head that way. ;)  :lol: \r\n\r\nYou just gave me \'The Greatest Idea\' ever. We enter all our entries as usual, in the mod contest, meantime put this car together (but we\'ll have to put a rush on it) and enter the joint venture in the last seconds.\r\n\r\nThat\'d be cool, ya think?\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:674aedea69]fuck yes it would be! lol\r\nI think the other pimps would get a kick out of it too.'),(17247,'8ef2b08c6d','you gonna paint it right it looks sick fo real dawg wit dem windows and front lip :eek:  :eek:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17250,'8ef2b08c6d','you gonna paint it right it looks sick fo real dawg wit dem windows and front lip :eek:  :eek:'),(17251,'e879b7a0af','I just uploaded some tunes for you.\r\nArtist: Oysterhead\r\nAlbum: The Grand Pecking Order\r\nList: http://www.crazybydesign.net/bitpimps/tunes/\r\n\r\nSo I\'m thinking... maybe we should let the \"Gangsta Trick Click\" pimps in on it a bit?\r\nI don\'t mean give them access to upload and shit, but just give the link I just posted above - if they want, they can go on their own to download.\r\nEach time you or I put up new tunes, we make a post in the Gangsta Trick Click and let the other pimps know it\'s there for download for awhile until the next update.\r\n\r\nwhat you think?'),(17253,'865b15e8ed','its a done deal, i was hooked when i put dual cells in my mini cooper and it left the ground. lol'),(17365,'07138c5433','Do you think i should tell the world about a voice controlled bit that i have under construction?\r\nthx for any answer!'),(17255,'978a68438a','the rc was like 5.99, let me know and i will getcha one, now take it that that it does not drive all that good but parts could be worth it, were from maine are u i used to live at kittery me.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17257,'865b15e8ed','its a done deal, i was hooked when i put dual cells in my mini cooper and it left the ground. lol'),(17259,'2270322b5d','No, I haven\'t picked one up yet.  I\'ve started buyin\' the accessories for it a little bit at a time so i could have them when i get the car.  I might pick one up next friday or the following one.  I\'m not sure which one yet, the black Bonda or the yellow Skyline.  Have to wait for payday.'),(17260,'2270322b5d','No, I haven\'t picked one up yet.  I\'ve started buyin\' the accessories for it a little bit at a time so i could have them when i get the car.  I might pick one up next friday or the following one.  I\'m not sure which one yet, the black Bonda or the yellow Skyline.  Have to wait for payday.'),(17315,'1464398b68','check out he modded avatar'),(17311,'7659e126e6','word up on dat. i just got reconnected to tha net, adelphia had issues all day, call my cell, and I\'ll tell ya about web\'s weekend.'),(17263,'a8cf2a3192','Hey, I hope you can find the bearings.  I picked up the all wheel drive set the other day (it was the last one) and the guy said I should get the bearings also, because he can\'t keep them in stock.  He got 12 packs of the all wheel drive and 12 of the bearings and in 2 days he was down to one of each.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGood Luck');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17264,'a8cf2a3192','Hey, I hope you can find the bearings.  I picked up the all wheel drive set the other day (it was the last one) and the guy said I should get the bearings also, because he can\'t keep them in stock.  He got 12 packs of the all wheel drive and 12 of the bearings and in 2 days he was down to one of each.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGood Luck'),(17312,'c355712906','That is very very cool man.  I am only interested in the body anyhow.  I am a Huge Honda freak and was always bummed that there are no micro RC Hatchbacks.  After I saw your post I picked pu the phone book, and wouldn\'t you know, no Pepboys in Maine!!! gahh  \r\n\r\nAnyhow, yeah I spent my earlier years in Cape Elizabeth/Portland and now live in Bath.  Maine is such a love hate relationship for me  :grin: \r\n\r\nIf you are willing to grab one of those Civics (compared to my previous trades w/ pimps) including shipping it should be around $10 - $12 and I am very down w/ getting that car one way or another.  Either way thanks for your offer.'),(17267,'e45b954273','I wanna conquer a tennis court or two with an Xmod.  Then maybe a basketball gym, where you can do some serious driftin\'.  Have you seen any solo bodies for them?  I haven\'t seen them at any of the Shacks I\'ve been too.  I need to chop one up.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17269,'064ad31c28','dude, you\'s nuts man.'),(17270,'e879b7a0af','I just uploaded some tunes for you.\r\nArtist: Oysterhead\r\nAlbum: The Grand Pecking Order\r\nList: http://www.crazybydesign.net/bitpimps/tunes/\r\n\r\nSo I\'m thinking... maybe we should let the \"Gangsta Trick Click\" pimps in on it a bit?\r\nI don\'t mean give them access to upload and shit, but just give the link I just posted above - if they want, they can go on their own to download.\r\nEach time you or I put up new tunes, we make a post in the Gangsta Trick Click and let the other pimps know it\'s there for download for awhile until the next update.\r\n\r\nwhat you think?'),(17271,'e28382f999','[quote:e28382f999=\"CaboWabo\"]I just uploaded some tunes for you.\r\nArtist: Oysterhead\r\nAlbum: The Grand Pecking Order\r\nList: http://www.crazybydesign.net/bitpimps/tunes/\r\n\r\nSo I\'m thinking... maybe we should let the \"Gangsta Trick Click\" pimps in on it a bit?\r\nI don\'t mean give them access to upload and shit, but just give the link I just posted above - if they want, they can go on their own to download.\r\nEach time you or I put up new tunes, we make a post in the Gangsta Trick Click and let the other pimps know it\'s there for download for awhile until the next update.\r\n\r\nwhat you think?[/quote:e28382f999]Yeah, I suppose that\'d be pretty cool.\r\n\r\nHey, did ya get that Anthrax tunes I\'m requesting for BPRX? It\'s a funny one.\r\n\r\nI just walked in from work, but I\'ll get some more stuff up later today. \r\n\r\ndave'),(17272,'e45b954273','I wanna conquer a tennis court or two with an Xmod.  Then maybe a basketball gym, where you can do some serious driftin\'.  Have you seen any solo bodies for them?  I haven\'t seen them at any of the Shacks I\'ve been too.  I need to chop one up.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17702,'87c184b1e7','[quote:87c184b1e7=\"ripper7777777\"]Well I\'m registered at your gallery, so let me know whats next.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nripper7777777[/quote:87c184b1e7]cool, got your permissions set - next time you login to the gallery you should see 3 new buttons that will allow you to create and manage your albums.\r\n\r\nif you need help, let me know.\r\n\r\n- Cabo'),(17275,'51b965b1e7','I really don\'t like any of the bodies that they have now.  I want a WRX or a Classic car, 1950\'s-70\'s.  At least an American car would be nice.  I\'ll keep an eye out for some bearings over this way, I have about 3 or 4 RS\'s within minutes of me and someone my friend knows is a RS manager.  Thay are hard to get, along with other parts for the Xmods.  You would think that they would have a decent supply of stuff to sell.'),(17276,'e28382f999','[quote:e28382f999=\"CaboWabo\"]I just uploaded some tunes for you.\r\nArtist: Oysterhead\r\nAlbum: The Grand Pecking Order\r\nList: http://www.crazybydesign.net/bitpimps/tunes/\r\n\r\nSo I\'m thinking... maybe we should let the \"Gangsta Trick Click\" pimps in on it a bit?\r\nI don\'t mean give them access to upload and shit, but just give the link I just posted above - if they want, they can go on their own to download.\r\nEach time you or I put up new tunes, we make a post in the Gangsta Trick Click and let the other pimps know it\'s there for download for awhile until the next update.\r\n\r\nwhat you think?[/quote:e28382f999]Yeah, I suppose that\'d be pretty cool.\r\n\r\nHey, did ya get that Anthrax tunes I\'m requesting for BPRX? It\'s a funny one.\r\n\r\nI just walked in from work, but I\'ll get some more stuff up later today. \r\n\r\ndave'),(17277,'c99db5f0a2','[quote:c99db5f0a2=\"crazydave\"]Yeah, I suppose that\'d be pretty cool.\r\n\r\nHey, did ya get that Anthrax tunes I\'m requesting for BPRX? It\'s a funny one.\r\n\r\nI just walked in from work, but I\'ll get some more stuff up later today. \r\n\r\ndave[/quote:c99db5f0a2]yea I just nabbed it today, I put up a new list last night so I\'ll get it in the next update.\r\nbeen running around all damn day so I haven\'t had a chance to check out the song yet, but will tonite.');
