INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17281,'51b965b1e7','I really don\'t like any of the bodies that they have now.  I want a WRX or a Classic car, 1950\'s-70\'s.  At least an American car would be nice.  I\'ll keep an eye out for some bearings over this way, I have about 3 or 4 RS\'s within minutes of me and someone my friend knows is a RS manager.  Thay are hard to get, along with other parts for the Xmods.  You would think that they would have a decent supply of stuff to sell.'),(17282,'13d50f9b08','but you seem to know what youre talkin bout. keep it up.'),(17283,'1e2421684c','[quote:1e2421684c=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:1e2421684c=\"crazydave\"]Yeah, I suppose that\'d be pretty cool.\r\n\r\nHey, did ya get that Anthrax tunes I\'m requesting for BPRX? It\'s a funny one.\r\n\r\nI just walked in from work, but I\'ll get some more stuff up later today. \r\n\r\ndave[/quote:1e2421684c]yea I just nabbed it today, I put up a new list last night so I\'ll get it in the next update.\r\nbeen running around all damn day so I haven\'t had a chance to check out the song yet, but will tonite.[/quote:1e2421684c]Aww man, you never heard that one before? That\'s a funny ass one. \r\n\r\ndave'),(17284,'d31e42ecb6','[quote:d31e42ecb6=\"crazydave\"]Aww man, you never heard that one before? That\'s a funny ass one. \r\n\r\ndave[/quote:d31e42ecb6]I might have, actually it\'s probable that I have - it\'s just been so long since I\'ve listened to them that I can only think of the semi-mainstream song names.\r\nman we got so much to talk about - it\'s gonna take years to catch up with each other lol\r\n\r\nforgive the sappy bullshit but I\'m pretty much drunk right now...\r\n\r\ndude, one day I\'m coming down there - I\'ve got several old pals that live where you do, you seem like one of my old pals - probably should / could have been in another time. but I swear, someday all us like minds need to meet - it\'s rare thing.\r\nit\'s like mensa for weed smokers lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17285,'da111975c2','Is something wrong with my browser or did the B crew go away?'),(17287,'d31e42ecb6','[quote:d31e42ecb6=\"crazydave\"]Aww man, you never heard that one before? That\'s a funny ass one. \r\n\r\ndave[/quote:d31e42ecb6]I might have, actually it\'s probable that I have - it\'s just been so long since I\'ve listened to them that I can only think of the semi-mainstream song names.\r\nman we got so much to talk about - it\'s gonna take years to catch up with each other lol\r\n\r\nforgive the sappy bullshit but I\'m pretty much drunk right now...\r\n\r\ndude, one day I\'m coming down there - I\'ve got several old pals that live where you do, you seem like one of my old pals - probably should / could have been in another time. but I swear, someday all us like minds need to meet - it\'s rare thing.\r\nit\'s like mensa for weed smokers lol'),(17288,'c9e6a1f3ac','I know this is late and all, but just got around to check out link and it\'s all Oysterhead tunes.  If you don\'t have it any more no worries bro, but if ya do 8-)'),(17289,'c9e6a1f3ac','I know this is late and all, but just got around to check out link and it\'s all Oysterhead tunes.  If you don\'t have it any more no worries bro, but if ya do 8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17291,'799c91ac26','[quote:799c91ac26=\"SuperFly\"]Is something wrong with my browser or did the B crew go away?[/quote:799c91ac26]grrr.... nope, nothing is wrong.\r\nthis all completely my fault - I\'m sorry.\r\n\r\nI\'ll fix it right now.\r\nI swapped out groups earlier and forgot to fix a few other things it effected.\r\n\r\nlet me know right away if you still have troubles please.\r\nthanks for the heads up - stoner lol'),(17292,'7b773411ce','[quote:7b773411ce=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:7b773411ce=\"SuperFly\"]Is something wrong with my browser or did the B crew go away?[/quote:7b773411ce]grrr.... nope, nothing is wrong.\r\nthis all completely my fault - I\'m sorry.\r\n\r\nI\'ll fix it right now.\r\nI swapped out groups earlier and forgot to fix a few other things it effected.\r\n\r\nlet me know right away if you still have troubles please.\r\nthanks for the heads up - stoner lol[/quote:7b773411ce]\r\n\r\nWhew! Hue35 had to lay off cuz he thinks he\'s got chronic bronchitis (is that where the term \"chronic\" comes from?), thought maybe we got thrown out! Either that or you got a visit from the FBI or somthin.\r\n\r\nThe thing that tipped me off was my name used to show up in bold at the bottom of the page where it says what pimps are online. I assume it was because I had moderator privileges in the B crew. Not that it matters, but while I see the B crew now, I no longer have moderator privvys there, hence no more bold.'),(17293,'01a4476d72','[quote:01a4476d72=\"Finks\"]I know this is late and all, but just got around to check out link and it\'s all Oysterhead tunes.  If you don\'t have it any more no worries bro, but if ya do 8-)[/quote:01a4476d72]it\'s back in there holmes');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17294,'4c39f215de','LoL gotta remember to scroll, arit ethanks Cabo.'),(17295,'7b773411ce','[quote:7b773411ce=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:7b773411ce=\"SuperFly\"]Is something wrong with my browser or did the B crew go away?[/quote:7b773411ce]grrr.... nope, nothing is wrong.\r\nthis all completely my fault - I\'m sorry.\r\n\r\nI\'ll fix it right now.\r\nI swapped out groups earlier and forgot to fix a few other things it effected.\r\n\r\nlet me know right away if you still have troubles please.\r\nthanks for the heads up - stoner lol[/quote:7b773411ce]\r\n\r\nWhew! Hue35 had to lay off cuz he thinks he\'s got chronic bronchitis (is that where the term \"chronic\" comes from?), thought maybe we got thrown out! Either that or you got a visit from the FBI or somthin.\r\n\r\nThe thing that tipped me off was my name used to show up in bold at the bottom of the page where it says what pimps are online. I assume it was because I had moderator privileges in the B crew. Not that it matters, but while I see the B crew now, I no longer have moderator privvys there, hence no more bold.'),(36174,'56d24b53f4','Hey, sorry to bother ya,\r\n\r\nI needed some motor tips for a gen1 xmod and Maxxa told me that you might be more helpful than he could.\r\n\r\nMy main concern is torque, I don\'t want alot of top speed considering the track I am running on has two medium straights and some nice curves to scoot around. \r\n\r\nHe had mentions neo magnets and stuff like that, but i wanted to know if it was better to go for the stage two motors with magnets, or hit up an after market motor. Just a reminder I want to try and stay away from fets right now, unless you advise that it is better to have fets no matter the motor.\r\n\r\nHe also said something about hybrid motors...what are they?\r\n\r\nI guess I am asking you for some tips on how to start off the motor selection, and if i should be swappin pinion gears from motor to motor to get what i want.\r\n\r\nThanks for your time B.K.\r\n\r\nSam');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33006,'a1158af2f7','Cool man.  Sorry it took so long to get to you.  I\'m not familiar with shipping overseas.  Maybe there is a faster way?  Glad you like them.  Do up a review on the Mini, not many have heard of them.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(28180,'ec76c0520d','Dude, this is interesting, but I really only need half of the shit there.  Want to split it up?  Maybe even offer him $50, $25 a peice?  Just an idea.\r\n\r\nFYI the things I would be interested in would be the NSX, Beatle and H2'),(28186,'c0d459f3be','http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;category=34063&amp;item=5956485525&amp;rd=1&amp;ssPageName=WDVW\r\n\r\nhe wrote xr3 pro in the title, but xs3 pro in the description. :-)'),(28187,'073ac063fc','Hi\r\nI hope you saw my apology in the forum. You have to understand why i did it, that\'s what seller feedback is for. Anyhow i\'m back in. and i\'ll need your address again since i didn\'t write it down.\r\n\r\nNo need to ship first since a known pimp has vouched for you.\r\njust give me your address + name and i\'ll send out the money tomorrow, cuz i may get this reply too late.\r\n\r\nI\'ll put the shipping address in the envelope with the MO.\r\n\r\nAgain, sorry\r\nMaxx'),(37919,'237972e7cc','Hey, what\'s up? You know I\'d be more than happy to paint something up for you.\r\n\r\nSo how would you want to work something like that? I\'m assuming it\'d be a little cheaper for me to pick a body up and send it to you, or did you already have a body you wanted painted?\r\n\r\nI would only ask that you cover my cost, and if after you get it you wanted to throw me something extra for my efforts, that\'s cool too. :-o \r\n\r\nOh and I guess you could bounce some ideas off me of what you\'re looking for, as far as style and color and what not.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (26113,'588d59859c','Awww man... I had the chat down in my toolbar when you came in there... I brought it back up just as you were leaving... I\'m that RThirty40oz character lol... BTW, AWESOME Pantera, man...\r\n\r\nBird'),(23605,'71105a7c43','can i add a 5th cell to my madforce without modding the esc?\r\ni cant buy any turbos or motors because im broke and i had an extra single cell holder laying around and i was wondering because right now im running an x speed and i think its slow as shit.if i had money id be ordering a nelly from you lol and an NML motor(my neighbor has a vert ramp for skateboards :rockon: )\r\n\r\n\r\na reply would be greatly appreciated'),(17297,'4c39f215de','LoL gotta remember to scroll, arit ethanks Cabo.'),(17298,'eabe38270f','Is there any policy on changing avatars?\r\nI would like to trade my clown in for the violin case carrying palermo.'),(17309,'fcf4d0ec0a','I sent out another email.  I don\'t think I\'m going to get a response from him.  I got his phone # from Ebay and I\'m going to try to call in the morning.'),(17301,'63cd660b79','[quote:63cd660b79=\"filelicker\"]Is there any policy on changing avatars?\r\nI would like to trade my clown in for the violin case carrying palermo.[/quote:63cd660b79]naw not really - just try to use one nobody elses... which you wouldn\'t be - those are brand new - nobody has one as an avatar yet.\r\nI say go for it, you can be the first palermo! 8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17302,'1778b710f3','Thanks ---its just my sicilian -cleveland heritage showing!'),(17304,'fa4df32916','[quote:fa4df32916=\"SuperFly\"]Whew! Hue35 had to lay off cuz he thinks he\'s got chronic bronchitis (is that where the term \"chronic\" comes from?), thought maybe we got thrown out! Either that or you got a visit from the FBI or somthin.\r\n\r\nThe thing that tipped me off was my name used to show up in bold at the bottom of the page where it says what pimps are online. I assume it was because I had moderator privileges in the B crew. Not that it matters, but while I see the B crew now, I no longer have moderator privvys there, hence no more bold.[/quote:fa4df32916]good stoner eye! lol\r\nyou got it right. its only us in the B crew so I gave all us moderator privilages, but then your names coming up in bold threw off other forum members that have no clue about the B crew. So that\'s why you see the change from bold to un-bold. You don\'t have privilages to moderate the entire B crew forum, but like always - you do have the powers to edit your own posts in there.\r\n\r\nyou guys both still have access right? (lemme know)\r\n\r\nbronchitus sucks man - I feel for him. My wife just got rid of it, had it for about 3 weeks.'),(17305,'bfe3b8eade','Hey Miva,\r\n\r\nI just got the Porcupine Tree discs yesterday, and I\'ve listened to all of it twice... WOW! They are amazing! I\'m so glad to hear someone my age (Steven Wilson) carrying the 70s prog torch with so much respect, while gracefully losing the 70s sheen... it sounds so fresh. I can\'t believe I\'ve never heard these guys, and they\'ve been around so long! \r\n\r\nHave you received the package from me yet? It might take a little longer because it\'s a parcel. Hopefully it will get there soon, I can\'t wait to see what you turn that silver Mustang into.\r\n\r\nThanks again for the music... what a treat!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (26291,'6e9b6b1116','Dudes paypal addy is mike@frequency-rc.com\r\n\r\nthe link to that site is http://www.frequency-rc.com/portal/home/type.asp?iCat=312&amp;iChannel=4&amp;nChannel=Files'),(17363,'1556e8748b','Here ya go.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.wantedfonts.com/browse.phtml?field=single&amp;val=165'),(37733,'95279be264','Talking about the IW02M?  The one with the plug connection ports?'),(37734,'757b2e2e56','just checking in on you, have you started your project yet?\r\nHow far have you gotten?\r\nWhat problems are you getting?\r\n\r\nMaxx'),(37735,'15dc064fb0','Hey man, what are you looking for as far as bits and zips for that NSX?  I have a lot of maybe 15-20 bit and zip bodies, a few ready to run stock and several random motors and other stuff (new in box lap counter off the top of my head)  \r\n\r\nLet me know if there is anything you are looking for.  Ill send ya some pics if you are interested.  Ill be home tomorrow (at my girlfriends place for the weekend)\r\n\r\nSTG'),(28398,'87039f23a8','[quote:87039f23a8=\"DarkTari\"]Will Do !  What is the name of the store , I can start there.\r\n\r\nThanx ![/quote:87039f23a8]\r\n\r\nKinneys.  It\'s a small chain of drug stores in the Northeast.  The one I went to is right by Lake Placid, NY (where the US beat the Russians if you don\'t know where it is).');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28399,'8729d14964','[quote:8729d14964=\"viperdout\"][quote:8729d14964=\"DarkTari\"]Will Do !  What is the name of the store , I can start there.\r\n\r\nThanx ![/quote:8729d14964]\r\n\r\nKinneys.  It\'s a small chain of drug stores in the Northeast.  The one I went to is right by Lake Placid, NY (where the US beat the Russians if you don\'t know where it is).[/quote:8729d14964]\r\n\r\nThanx  VD !'),(28403,'d4592d2430','Alright I can do that, I\'ll charge my camera up and show the chevy truck body tonight, and that sounds good, but dang those rims are hot, where did You get them? That bodies pretty hott with the red and blue, so yeah I can do that deal as long as it\'s cool with you.\r\nThanks'),(29390,'55555d84e1','Alright thats cool.....Gloria for Blue shell, \r\nMy address is:\r\nKorey Kiger\r\n6110 Germanton Rd.\r\nRural Hall, NC 27045\r\nThanks man, yeah it is Christmas,\r\nbut whats your address?\r\nTalk to Ya later'),(28406,'8220c1fcc5','ok then, \r\nso my aunt should get them sometime next week then? I\'ll let her know.\r\n\r\nI will purchase the MO for the GPM\'s when she gets the stuff. Do you have another pair of knuckles? my cuz may want a pair too. If you do, forget the center shaft, btw what is its length? \r\n\r\nI\'ll be using a hollow center shaft(lolly-pop stick). If its too flexable i\'ll return to stock. \r\n\r\nMaxx\r\n\r\nLove the colors of the GPM\'s');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (25076,'13a9e2e845','I took mine apart too....Its a big pain in the ass. Unfortunately, that little sprin for the steering popped out. I figured out how it goes back in, but I can\'t seem to get the steering arm to go back in quite right......AAAAARGH!\r\n\r\nThats the last time I take the front end apart on these things.'),(29327,'408d815258','No problem.  \r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nRyan'),(27760,'a896e8db28','Cool, looks good.\r\n\r\nGo ahead and do the MOSFET one too if you like.  When I wrote it I intentionally did not give a \'recipe\' style description, in an effort to get people to really read and understand the material before attempting the mod themselves.  Its a little harder to understand, but serves to discourage people without the necessary skills screwing up their cars.'),(32579,'9943eb6eb4','Hi Mate!\r\n\r\nSorry for the holdup, I can\'t put through the payment by Paypal until tommorow. The internet payment i made on my c/card hasn\'t cleared yet, and they wont allow any more transactions on my account until it has.\r\n\r\nStupid banks *grumbles*\r\n\r\nBut it will be there tommorrow, even if i have to go into the bank to pay them farquars again.'),(33749,'8464a40e60','Shouldnt be a problem.  [url=http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=6510&amp;highlight=fets]Thread that might help some.[/url]');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24621,'367a7a68b6','Really I just want a Sick ass Vw bus or a van for my City if not then something fast like the one I bidded on.'),(24638,'b649598599','Hey.....trust me, I understand. I\'m 34 myself and understand that you have other obligations. No pressure here. I\'m only asking because a few of us have been waiting to get our hands on some alloy knuckles since the plastic ones break so much.\r\n\r\nSo you are obsessed with Xmods huh? That is pretty interesting coming from a guy who has been messing around with RC\'s as long as you have. I am pretty new to the RC scene and I\'m more of a collector right now than a modder. But, that may change oin the future. I only have one Xmod...but I have a pretty nice collection of ZZ\'s. I\'ve been gravitating more to the xmod because I can tinker with it more. I beat on it pretty good where I run it. I plan to get a second one that I can make...and keep...pretty with some upgrades and maybe some mods.\r\n\r\nI have to say that your work is an inspiration. You have some pretty cool stuff going on there with you cars. How is it you got so hooked on Xmods?'),(17318,'9c6b3ec76e','aaaight, gimme a minute. I got all baked on res scrapings and went all deep thought carefully worded or whatever on the teletubbies thread.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17319,'ec8a4f05b1','I say cool. Maria says it\'s gay. says you need to do a bunch of stuff, too much for me to type.'),(17327,'6d83ca3716','I was disconnected all day, I probably need to fix dat.'),(17609,'6f79d160c4','Ya, I asked mom and she can\'t do it, reasons I\'m not sure about.  And dad can\'t help because he has 2 big loans right now, plus he doesn\'t have a job.  I\'m pretty much fucked!!!!!!!!!  Looks like I might need to tell Melissa to make some room for me.\r\n\r\nI still got a week or so to find a loan and stuff..........'),(17333,'7b4ee47cdc','just one of those pretty \"X\'s\".........finks is missin\' his too......'),(17330,'aacc3bc1ff','I\'ll print it out for her next time I stop over the parents house.  No problem.'),(17331,'84a20a7df6','I think it\'s alright, now. must\'ve been cuz I was disconnected all day. check and see if its there for me'),(17334,'3332ce4768','this will be ok with me finks, would u like the 27 or i believe a 49 mhz car.\r\ni will get one maybe tuesday whitch is my day off from work and can get to that part of town were pep boys is. give me your address and i will get the package ready, it was 70 degrees today here in louisiana, man i feel for you up in yankee land...lol'),(19191,'05f1599ed4','[quote:05f1599ed4=\"DarkTari\"]C-Dub,\r\n\r\nI can cop you a couple of Precious to mod if you want.  I sent Cavey Dave\'s yesterday.\r\n\r\nHe\'s doin 3, I\'m doin 3-4, I can get you 2 and that makes 8-9.  That\'s 2 months of auction material with just us 3.  Now if you throw in Hog &amp; Silla we may be able to stretch this out thru da summer.\r\n\r\nI want to get my alter ego \"Da Big Kahuna\" to post this auction. Can I just register again with the same email or do I have to use a different one?\r\n\r\nI\'m feelin pump\'d about this, I\'ll take the lead on it which give you and the others time to moderate.\r\n\r\nAlso I still wanna do a [b:05f1599ed4]Pimp My Ride[/b:05f1599ed4] thang this summer!  I wanna make this summer even better than the last  :eek:   I\'ll bring it to the IC once we get the auction off the ground.[/quote:05f1599ed4]damn dude - I can\'t tell you how glad I am you\'re part of \"us\".\r\nI\'m in awe of your attitudes and how willing you are to share, etc., etc.\r\nyou\'re a real fucking man - man lol\r\n*end gay props*\r\n\r\nI\'ve got some ideas for this summer too, I\'m pretty psyched. we need to keep giving the community a shot in the veins to keep em hooked.\r\n\r\nI have to admit, I feel bad accepting those cars from you man. you already do so much in that area. I\'ve got a few cars here I\'m probably going to part with (just been takin my time talking myself into it lol) so in all honesty - I probably don\'t [i:05f1599ed4]need[/i:05f1599ed4] the cars - it might help us more if they went to payaso or hog or nox or something, or even if you kept em and did \"joint\" ventures with them.\r\nbut I don\'t want to be offensive either so if you have your heart set on it, fine by me - send em my way, I\'ll get em cherry and get on the auction block.\r\n\r\nas far as your alter ego, you need to use a new email address (you could use a freebie at yahoo to make it easy on you).\r\nby the way - in case you haven\'t already - you should change your profile (DarkTari) email address to your own (not darktari@lixlink.com - as it doesn\'t exist anymore, along with the pimps email addys)\r\n\r\nlet\'s make this communities collective jaws drop again. :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17374,'7a46da75ae','[quote:7a46da75ae=\"Havok\"]wow man...that is sooooo tight....I never knew what they were called, but that is where I got my inspiration for the drag car I posted in my first contest here. It was a white skyline with ridiculously large tires...lifted off of some crazy beetle 3 times the size of a bit.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?pos=-251[/quote:7a46da75ae]Oh yeah, I forgot about that Skyline. Where did you get he little Hot Rod decals. I still need to find decals like that.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:7a46da75ae]That is awesome man...I am very impressed....don\'t worry...I\'m also tight lipped about such things....[/quote:7a46da75ae]Thanks man, that\'s what i wanted to hear. I aim to impress.\r\n\r\n[quote:7a46da75ae]your camaros are in the mail as of monday afternoon...I sent it from my house, so hopefully you\'ll get it by friday :grin:[/quote:7a46da75ae]Cool, I\'m still debating if I\'m going with the \'68 SS, or the \'69 Yenko.\r\n\r\n[quote:7a46da75ae]The track is on hold....I think I told you that me &amp; the wife are callin it quits..well, I will be moving the 1st or 2nd week of April....and I have alot of detail to still put into the track....so I\'m waiting till after I move..I have friends that are getting interested in the bits too...its gonna be great having 4-6 cars to race against.....[/quote:7a46da75ae]No, I don\'t think you told me, I would have remembered something like that. I\'m sorry to hear that.\r\n\r\nYou know, honestly, me and the wife don\'t get along the way we used to. We don\'t fight, and we get along fine, but sometimes it just seems like we\'re just friends, and I get frustrated, and feel like she doen\'t get care for me anymore, or get paranoid, and think she\'s cheating, but I just keep telling myself that it\'s just because we\'ve been together 10 years, and thing are different now that we have a kid around, but still I can\'t help to feel something\'s wrong. Really I think she\'s sick of me making very little money, and spending it on weed, but I can\'t help who I am, and I always hoped I could be appreciated for my strengths, instead of my weaknesses.\r\n\r\nAnyways, whenever I hear of people, like you or Hog, splitting, it bothers me, and makes me concerned for my future.\r\n\r\n[quote:7a46da75ae]I will keep you posted on my works in progress....let me know when you get the camaros....\r\n\r\npeace from the east.... :cool:[/quote:7a46da75ae]For shure man. We\'ll be touch.  :-) \r\n\r\ndave'),(17337,'a2afca5939','Hey sg want me to throw some flava at your Avatar?  Would only take me 10 min max.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17338,'19c23083bd','Gahh it\'s friggin snowing today..... WTF!?!  Well you made a good move w/ Lousiana for sure.  As far as frequency... I guess it doesn\'t matter.  I will more than likly part out the chassis.  So any how here is my RL info and I need yours to send ya the cash/check (sorry I am not a paypal guy).  Any how, you can mail me the ride when you get the cash.\r\n\r\nJesse King\r\n25 Springview Ln.\r\nWest Bath, ME 04530'),(17339,'8e206bd09f','here it is finks\r\n\r\njeffrey mays\r\n532 wilkinson\r\nshreveport, la. 71104\r\n\r\njust drop a ten in there and we be cool.\r\n\r\nthanks\r\njeff'),(19013,'1cc7f70af7','[quote:1cc7f70af7=\"crazydave\"]Ok, check this out:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=2140&amp;start=135\r\n\r\nSomeone put together a FET mod tut for the SE, it\'s got some new info about some resistors, I try it, and it works. \r\n\r\nSo I\'m happy, been playing with my cars all morning. It\'s really cool, even though it was Gokou that turned me on to it.\r\n\r\nThen I realize, wait a minute, the guy gives credit to ph2t, cyborgzero, and some other guy, but I\'m the one who got the FETs in there first place, and told everyone that there was something else going on, all ph2t added was using pchannels, for a very slight theoretical increase in performance, and also 90% of the info needed for the mod is in that thread.\r\n\r\n\r\nSo that pissed me off, and I decided it\'s time I write my own tutorial. I\'m giving credit to ph2t and cyborgzero, since they worked with me, but credit for anything else will be given to \"...and others\"\r\n\r\nThe tutorial gokou linked to has a mistake in it, and is confusing, so just to have my own take on it, I\'m calling mine, \"FET modding the SE in layman\'s terms.\"\r\n\r\n\r\nDude, now that you\'re gonna have 2 SEs I really need to get some FETs so I can do up your car too. You\'ve seen Payaso\'s car in action, so you could probably tell if we\'ve gotton it, but I think we have, this resistor mod was just the thing to put the SE over the edge.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:1cc7f70af7]dude yea that\'s awesome.\r\nI\'ll put your tutorial up in our Articles section as well - we\'ll make you the man for FET\'ed SEs no doubt. screw the others.\r\n\r\nkeep me posted, let me know when I should send ya something. I\'ll toss in some extras for the favor - I was gonna be sending you some bodies anyways.\r\n\r\noh, and let me know when you got the tutorial done so I can put it in our Articles section.\r\n\r\n\r\nlet me know if that stuffs cool or not or if you have other ideas or whatever.'),(17341,'8608d9956c','Hi!\r\n\r\n[quote:8608d9956c=\"hue35\"]I just got the Porcupine Tree discs yesterday, and I\'ve listened to all of it twice... WOW! They are amazing! I\'m so glad to hear someone my age (Steven Wilson) carrying the 70s prog torch with so much respect, while gracefully losing the 70s sheen... it sounds so fresh. I can\'t believe I\'ve never heard these guys, and they\'ve been around so long! [/quote:8608d9956c]\r\nI\'m glad that you like it :) Nowadays it is hard time for bands making music not money. In the past they were known only by people who are looking for such a kind of music. Fortunately one of radio presenters has popularized PT in Poland and i had opportunity to be on theirs few gigs :). Theirs latest album was published by big label - Warner, so maybe they will become more popular in the world.\r\n\r\nI can send you more music by internet. Do you have ftp or something like that?\r\n\r\n[quote:8608d9956c=\"hue35\"]\r\nHave you received the package from me yet? It might take a little longer because it\'s a parcel.[/quote:8608d9956c]\r\n\r\nThe package hasn\'t arrived yet.  :???:  I\'m starting to worry a bit, but i\'ll wait till end of week before i go to post office and kill everybody :)\r\n\r\nCheers\r\nMiva');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17342,'2a951e37ba','They said it would take 10-14 days, and it\'s been 13... we\'ll kill \'em after tomorrow.  8-)'),(18472,'664aaeb53f','No problem bro. :-) \r\nSend me whatever ya want and I\'ll put them together. I\'ll start workin on them tomorrow night. Let me know what screen resolution you use.(600x800, 1024x768, etc.)'),(17345,'8e206bd09f','here it is finks\r\n\r\njeffrey mays\r\n532 wilkinson\r\nshreveport, la. 71104\r\n\r\njust drop a ten in there and we be cool.\r\n\r\nthanks\r\njeff'),(17346,'e51faa2ab3','Hey man whats up, well I got a url for you but keep it secret it does not go public until this weekend, I still have to get the rules posted...lol.\r\n\r\nTell cabowabo to stop by if he gets a chance, I know he stays pretty busy.\r\n\r\nRight now all thats up is the forum we consentrated on that, next we will build the site around it.\r\n\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com\r\n\r\nLater\r\nrippper77777777'),(17348,'3f01b2e929','Hi Hue35!\r\n\r\nPackage has arrived and...\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\nmy jaw has dropped on the floor when i saw these cds  :bowdown: \r\n[b:3f01b2e929]B E A T I F U L[/b:3f01b2e929]\r\nI feel like a lame with cds i sent you. :?  Next delivery from Miva will be better. It has to be!\r\n\r\nZipZap is nice too, especially bodies. It will be difficult to do what i want with this fully packed chassis, but i\'ll try :)\r\n\r\nThank you again!\r\n\r\nCheers \r\nMiva');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17349,'3f01b2e929','Hi Hue35!\r\n\r\nPackage has arrived and...\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\n.\r\nmy jaw has dropped on the floor when i saw these cds  :bowdown: \r\n[b:3f01b2e929]B E A T I F U L[/b:3f01b2e929]\r\nI feel like a lame with cds i sent you. :?  Next delivery from Miva will be better. It has to be!\r\n\r\nZipZap is nice too, especially bodies. It will be difficult to do what i want with this fully packed chassis, but i\'ll try :)\r\n\r\nThank you again!\r\n\r\nCheers \r\nMiva'),(17350,'edacac1a4b','Cool, I was getting a little nervous about the delay. \r\n\r\nI don\'t always spend time on cd packaging, but I figured, \"these are going to travel far, they should look nice\".\r\n\r\nI\'m still listening to the hell out of the Porcupine Tree stuff, thanks again. Maybe we can trade more cds in the future... maybe over the internet, or if we talked back and forth a bit, we could come up with enough cds we want from each other, to make it worth shipping. I have over 2500 cds, ranging from punk to jazz to prog to pop... old stuff, new stuff... lots of stuff. We\'ll have to work something out, it sounds like we were both happy with the music exchange.  :) \r\n\r\nhappy modding and listening,\r\n\r\n-hue35'),(19005,'b644c4a42e','I am interested in trading rather than receiving cash for it. I don\'t know what you have for trade, but I am looking for custom wheel sets to apply to other bits or a nice body. Try to make me an offer and we\'ll see about that.\r\n\r\nCheers');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19006,'01b3104c00','I am also interested in some pullback models if you can get an hand to them  :)'),(17352,'5eef50978d','So Far So Good !  I\'ll be cruisin thru Pimp !'),(17465,'79ff919ab5','If you want motors, axles, gears and such, please visit my estore- http://ripper7racing.com/forums/index.php?showforum=48\r\non the forum-  www.ripper7racing.com'),(17466,'e2430456e0','Yo EZ!\r\n\r\nIt\'s been a lot goin on in Da Hood!\r\n\r\nDa Pimps are holdin a moderators Contest, they are puttin up da prizes and they are off da hook!\r\n\r\nLemme know what you have left!  I\'m just using the 1st set of alloys I got from you on my [b:e2430456e0]sure fire win![/b:e2430456e0].\r\n\r\nThe MiniLites I\'m lookin for:\r\n[img:e2430456e0]http://www.scala43.com/scala43/rad/rad-fotosk/rad-wt67.jpg[/img:e2430456e0][img:e2430456e0]http://www.scala43.com/scala43/rad/rad-fotosk/rad-wt47a.jpg[/img:e2430456e0][img:e2430456e0]http://217.160.105.72/microsizers/upload/rims_bbs_rwII.gif[/img:e2430456e0]\r\n\r\nPlanning to do one of these:\r\n[img:e2430456e0]http://www.zeemax.com/Images/MINI/7Mini18.jpg[/img:e2430456e0]\r\n\r\nMakes sure you check out my Gallery:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php?cat=10005 \r\n[img:e2430456e0]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/wallpapers/normal_darktari01.jpg[/img:e2430456e0]\r\n\r\nAnd the rest:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php'),(17354,'b28791d461','Got a start on my project for the mod contest this weekend. It\'s coming out killer, so I couldn\'t wait to show it off, but it\'s still under wraps so, shhhh. \r\n\r\n\r\nI was originally thinking funny car, but Ripper777 has already done one of those, so I wanted to do something a little more original. When I was a kid, my favorite class was always Pro Stock, because they were door slammers so they looked more like street cars, bad ass street cars that were the fastest class besides the funny cars.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, started with a pan car style chassis. lighter and stiffer than stock, and plenty of room for my Zip Zap SE batteries.\r\n[img:b28791d461]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/prstkcam1.jpg[/img:b28791d461]\r\n\r\nI\'m proud of it, because it it\'s nice and straight, and fits the ZZ chassis perfect.\r\n[img:b28791d461]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/prstkcam2.jpg[/img:b28791d461]\r\n\r\nI made the front wheels from some Hot Wheels wheels. Had to dremel off the black \"tire\" part of the plastic, and I sanded back the fronts, by almost half, until they were narrow enough for bit tires. Then I carved in a bevel on the front with my exacto knife. Painted the edge silver, and I think it nails the magnesium \'Mag\' wheel look. Used Motorworks tires to get that old scool tall profile.\r\n\r\nThe rears are of coarse yours, thanks man.  :-)  \r\nI added a some dots to simulate bolts, and I think they\'re perfect. Used some tires left over from my alloys, because they have a taller profile.\r\n[img:b28791d461]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/prstkca3.jpg[/img:b28791d461]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n...and since I\'m so excited about this, I\'m probably gonna clue cabo in too, but, since he\'s competition right now, here\'s the pic he wont see...\r\n[img:b28791d461]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/prstktps.jpg[/img:b28791d461]\r\n...here it is with 5-6v sitting in it all ready to go.\r\n\r\nI just need to wire it up, FET it, paint and detail the body, and I think it\'s gonna be pretty kick ass. I\'m excited.\r\n\r\nHow\'s your track coming.  :-) \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17356,'6cb383094c','Hey, I\'m trying to keep my project for the mod contest under wraps, but I\'m getting excited, and have to share with someone. Havok donated the wheels so I\'ve been sharing with him, but he might not be around for a few days, so I\'m gonna clue you in, but since you are competition right now, I am gonna save the big surprise. ;)\r\n\r\nI was originally thinking funny car, but Ripper777 has already done one of those, so I wanted to do something a little more original. When I was a kid, my favorite class was always Pro Stock, because they were door slammers so they looked more like street cars, bad ass street cars that were the fastest class besides the funny cars.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, started with a pan car style chassis. Lighter and stiffer than stock. Made it from a Thunder Charger chassis, and Zip Zap packageing, so see, it is part Zip Zap, umm... by-product.\r\n[img:6cb383094c]http://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/prstkca1.jpg[/img:6cb383094c]\r\n\r\nI\'m proud of it, because it is nice and straight, and fits the ZZ chassis perfect.\r\n[img:6cb383094c]http://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/prstkca2.jpg[/img:6cb383094c]\r\n\r\nI made the front wheels from some Hot Wheels wheels. Had to dremel off the black \"tire\" part of the plastic, and I sanded back the front of the wheel, by almost half, until they were narrow enough for bit tires. Then I carved in a bevel on the front with my exacto knife. Painted the edge silver, and I think it nails the magnesium \'Mag\' wheel look. Used Motorworks tires to get that old school tall profile.\r\n\r\nThe rears are are made of some spare parts of alloys that Havok sent me when he asked me to mount his. I added a some dots to simulate bolts, and I think they\'re perfect. Used some tires left over from my alloys, because they have a taller profile.\r\n[img:6cb383094c]http://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/prstkca3.jpg[/img:6cb383094c]\r\n\r\nJust gotta wire it up, and do some detailing to make it look like an authentic early 70s pro stock car, but it won\'t be until next month until I can get paint and detail stuff. I don\'t want to leave people hanging, so until it\'s done, shhh.;)\r\n\r\nI seriously can not wait until this one is done. I rarely stretch these things out beyond a weekend ya know.\r\n\r\nDave\r\n\r\n\r\n***EDIT:Hey dude, I think I got busted for using my domain to swap MP3s. I have no access to my account. I had to move these pictures so you could see them. No big deal though, it was freebie account.\r\n\r\n********Double EDIT: I forgot you\'re hanging with Payaso this week...so much for instant gratification.  :lol: \r\n\r\nThat\'s cool, havok got back to me, and he\'s diggin\' it. So I\'ll just leave this here for when you get back. :grin:'),(17357,'9f9875afbc','Could you please send me the font that you use in your backrounds?\r\nThe font where you signed your name?\r\nOr, could you please tell me the name of it?\r\nSo that I could find it myself?\r\nthx!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17358,'1556e8748b','Here ya go.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.wantedfonts.com/browse.phtml?field=single&amp;val=165'),(17359,'b28791d461','Got a start on my project for the mod contest this weekend. It\'s coming out killer, so I couldn\'t wait to show it off, but it\'s still under wraps so, shhhh. \r\n\r\n\r\nI was originally thinking funny car, but Ripper777 has already done one of those, so I wanted to do something a little more original. When I was a kid, my favorite class was always Pro Stock, because they were door slammers so they looked more like street cars, bad ass street cars that were the fastest class besides the funny cars.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, started with a pan car style chassis. lighter and stiffer than stock, and plenty of room for my Zip Zap SE batteries.\r\n[img:b28791d461]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/prstkcam1.jpg[/img:b28791d461]\r\n\r\nI\'m proud of it, because it it\'s nice and straight, and fits the ZZ chassis perfect.\r\n[img:b28791d461]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/prstkcam2.jpg[/img:b28791d461]\r\n\r\nI made the front wheels from some Hot Wheels wheels. Had to dremel off the black \"tire\" part of the plastic, and I sanded back the fronts, by almost half, until they were narrow enough for bit tires. Then I carved in a bevel on the front with my exacto knife. Painted the edge silver, and I think it nails the magnesium \'Mag\' wheel look. Used Motorworks tires to get that old scool tall profile.\r\n\r\nThe rears are of coarse yours, thanks man.  :-)  \r\nI added a some dots to simulate bolts, and I think they\'re perfect. Used some tires left over from my alloys, because they have a taller profile.\r\n[img:b28791d461]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/prstkca3.jpg[/img:b28791d461]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n...and since I\'m so excited about this, I\'m probably gonna clue cabo in too, but, since he\'s competition right now, here\'s the pic he wont see...\r\n[img:b28791d461]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/prstktps.jpg[/img:b28791d461]\r\n...here it is with 5-6v sitting in it all ready to go.\r\n\r\nI just need to wire it up, FET it, paint and detail the body, and I think it\'s gonna be pretty kick ass. I\'m excited.\r\n\r\nHow\'s your track coming.  :-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(17360,'91dd998892','wow man...that is sooooo tight....I never knew what they were called, but that is where I got my inspiration for the drag car I posted in my first contest here. It was a white skyline with ridiculously large tires...lifted off of some crazy beetle 3 times the size of a bit.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?pos=-251\r\n\r\n\r\nThat is awesome man...I am very impressed....don\'t worry...I\'m also tight lipped about such things....\r\n\r\nyour camaros are in the mail as of monday afternoon...I sent it from my house, so hopefully you\'ll get it by friday :grin:\r\n\r\nThe track is on hold....I think I told you that me &amp; the wife are callin it quits..well, I will be moving the 1st or 2nd week of April....and I have alot of detail to still put into the track....so I\'m waiting till after I move..I have friends that are getting interested in the bits too...its gonna be great having 4-6 cars to race against.....\r\n\r\nI will keep you posted on my works in progress....let me know when you get the camaros....\r\n\r\npeace from the east.... :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17361,'91dd998892','wow man...that is sooooo tight....I never knew what they were called, but that is where I got my inspiration for the drag car I posted in my first contest here. It was a white skyline with ridiculously large tires...lifted off of some crazy beetle 3 times the size of a bit.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?pos=-251\r\n\r\n\r\nThat is awesome man...I am very impressed....don\'t worry...I\'m also tight lipped about such things....\r\n\r\nyour camaros are in the mail as of monday afternoon...I sent it from my house, so hopefully you\'ll get it by friday :grin:\r\n\r\nThe track is on hold....I think I told you that me &amp; the wife are callin it quits..well, I will be moving the 1st or 2nd week of April....and I have alot of detail to still put into the track....so I\'m waiting till after I move..I have friends that are getting interested in the bits too...its gonna be great having 4-6 cars to race against.....\r\n\r\nI will keep you posted on my works in progress....let me know when you get the camaros....\r\n\r\npeace from the east.... :cool:'),(17362,'7a46da75ae','[quote:7a46da75ae=\"Havok\"]wow man...that is sooooo tight....I never knew what they were called, but that is where I got my inspiration for the drag car I posted in my first contest here. It was a white skyline with ridiculously large tires...lifted off of some crazy beetle 3 times the size of a bit.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?pos=-251[/quote:7a46da75ae]Oh yeah, I forgot about that Skyline. Where did you get he little Hot Rod decals. I still need to find decals like that.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:7a46da75ae]That is awesome man...I am very impressed....don\'t worry...I\'m also tight lipped about such things....[/quote:7a46da75ae]Thanks man, that\'s what i wanted to hear. I aim to impress.\r\n\r\n[quote:7a46da75ae]your camaros are in the mail as of monday afternoon...I sent it from my house, so hopefully you\'ll get it by friday :grin:[/quote:7a46da75ae]Cool, I\'m still debating if I\'m going with the \'68 SS, or the \'69 Yenko.\r\n\r\n[quote:7a46da75ae]The track is on hold....I think I told you that me &amp; the wife are callin it quits..well, I will be moving the 1st or 2nd week of April....and I have alot of detail to still put into the track....so I\'m waiting till after I move..I have friends that are getting interested in the bits too...its gonna be great having 4-6 cars to race against.....[/quote:7a46da75ae]No, I don\'t think you told me, I would have remembered something like that. I\'m sorry to hear that.\r\n\r\nYou know, honestly, me and the wife don\'t get along the way we used to. We don\'t fight, and we get along fine, but sometimes it just seems like we\'re just friends, and I get frustrated, and feel like she doen\'t get care for me anymore, or get paranoid, and think she\'s cheating, but I just keep telling myself that it\'s just because we\'ve been together 10 years, and thing are different now that we have a kid around, but still I can\'t help to feel something\'s wrong. Really I think she\'s sick of me making very little money, and spending it on weed, but I can\'t help who I am, and I always hoped I could be appreciated for my strengths, instead of my weaknesses.\r\n\r\nAnyways, whenever I hear of people, like you or Hog, splitting, it bothers me, and makes me concerned for my future.\r\n\r\n[quote:7a46da75ae]I will keep you posted on my works in progress....let me know when you get the camaros....\r\n\r\npeace from the east.... :cool:[/quote:7a46da75ae]For shure man. We\'ll be touch.  :-) \r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17415,'d78a9eb540','Hey Darktari says your the man, well I\'m letting you know there is a new forum, it\'s an affiliate to wegotu.  The New Forum will focus on the average to Moderate users and wegotu will remain focused on the advanced users.  I want to extend an invitation to all Bit Pimps they are more then welcome to post at R7R and link back to Bit Pimps, even though we have a bits section, are focus is not on 1/64th scale.  We plan on competing with MRCC, I would also like to get your permission to include a bitpimps link in our soon to be built Link Page.\r\n\r\nWell Come on over and give it a look, we are still a long way from complete.\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nLance- ripper7777777\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com'),(17371,'f6694cc004','tha hybrid is lookin\' good in primer, dude. I\'m gettin really excited to see how that turns out in the end.'),(17375,'dcc7a55b82','Thanks, I just wish I could put up better pics 4 the Pimps....'),(17376,'3b9c2cb15d','The white is actually a Flat White, the primer was gray.  Thats the white I\'m going to use and gloss coat the hell out of it.\r\n\r\nOn it now---\r\n\r\n4 coats of gray primer\r\n2 coats of flat white');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17377,'941a5abe81','k, i went there, and it took me to a font package place, i think? Is it supposed to do that? Or could you jus gimme the download cuz im a noob to putting + finding fonts into stuff\r\nand, um...\r\ncould you, if you have it, tell me how to put different fonts into psp 8?\r\nif you know how?\r\ncuz im having trouble w/ it right now'),(17378,'b3e2e8c33f','The font\'s name is brooklyn kid and it should be in the graphiti section on that site. There should be a download button next to the sample pic of the font, click that and it should start downloading the .zip file. Extract that .zip right into your fonts folder which should be in the windows folder. The font will automatically be installed. Another way to install the font which may be easier for you is to download it, extract the zip to the desktop or where have you, double click on the font  (XXX.ttf) and in the font view window click on file and then install.\r\nHope this helped. :-)'),(17379,'6f5ab1bdc7','I got those water decals from Nox...at one point I told you I had some extras...but you said you didn\'t like messing with them cuz of your shaky hands.....you said you thought you\'d mess them up.... ask him...I\'m sure he\'d hook you up......tell him I sent you...lol.......he prints them out on his pc.......\r\n\r\nas far as me &amp; the wife......I\'ve been with her for a year and a half....we met on may 13th 2002....got married july 1st 2002....we both realize that we\'re both so completely different from each other...and its a totally mutual, amicable thing.....we don\'t want to end up hating each other...so thats why we\'re callin it quits now......its cool man....shes also a clinical psychologist. so its a little easier when you\'ve dealt with life\'s problems for 15 years......\r\n\r\n\r\nsorry I made you reflect on your life...thats a bummer...   :-( \r\n\r\nI can\'t wait to see what you do with the camaros.... :grin:');
