INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17382,'b3e2e8c33f','The font\'s name is brooklyn kid and it should be in the graphiti section on that site. There should be a download button next to the sample pic of the font, click that and it should start downloading the .zip file. Extract that .zip right into your fonts folder which should be in the windows folder. The font will automatically be installed. Another way to install the font which may be easier for you is to download it, extract the zip to the desktop or where have you, double click on the font  (XXX.ttf) and in the font view window click on file and then install.\r\nHope this helped. :-)'),(17384,'7127a47146','Thx, \r\nabout earlier, \r\nthat was when i was at school, and the comps there only have IE\r\nand at my house i have netscape 7.1\r\ntotal difference!\r\nwhenever i get done w/ my pic w/ the font, i\'ll show it to ya\r\nif you want?'),(17385,'082f20adfd','Do you think that i should tell the world about my voice operated bit\'s\r\nthat i have under construction?\r\nThx for any answer!'),(17386,'d65933a41e','$2.19 for shipping. you\'s a strange fucker. oh and $1.29 for each additional item. You shoulda made the min. bid $1.92. I started typing this at 9:12pm. thats just creepy.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17607,'f6c55571b5','didja talk to yer raise about cisigning for a loan yet?'),(17388,'e891a50e6d','See, The 219 monster lives!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!'),(17390,'16d63e0f4e','any takers yet?'),(17605,'a39104cc59','Not sure what I\'ll need yet, but thanks.  Right noew I have to find a place to live.'),(17626,'1060f8befc','i think we need to start plannin\' a caper.'),(17396,'2be1cbea57','[quote:2be1cbea57=\"Bird\"]Anyways, Maria says that da nex time you come up here you need to bring up yo dvd playa. hey i can type fast if i try. [/quote:2be1cbea57]\r\n\r\nDVD player and no movies? Thats dumb......\r\n\r\nType fast?....I know your not Frankie, but where did that come from?'),(17601,'171a298335','Sweet, A little racing action.  I gotta get an Xmod.......Fet modded bits and ZZ\'s are going to kill.\r\n\r\nI talked to him today and yesterday and he offered to build a computer or help me get one, he said, maybe for around $300.'),(17394,'9b20f89c02','[color=green:9b20f89c02][/color:9b20f89c02]Ya nobody likes a quitter :cool: \r\n[color=#444444:9b20f89c02][/color:9b20f89c02]hey redneck mountain hillbillybob ass, take dat sheeit back to Butchers Hollow.\r\nAnyways, Maria says that da nex time you come up here you need to bring up yo dvd playa. hey i can type fast if i try. im baked. \r\nI hope my dough gets here soon so\'s i can get mad clones offs dat techno guy. and toyeast shit.\r\nthe reciept for my Shen fell out of a coloring book today. Jan. 30, 6:58pm, best $10.69 i ever spunt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17603,'2607f63a88','that\'d be sweet to get the cheap computer hookup. any software i can pirate for you i will.'),(17399,'7b4a151589','Im all baked. gbongs to da dome. them \'Merican Pie movies. all dem.'),(17400,'f2f34db3ce','There hasn\'t been shit for postin\' today........I think everyone took the day off to SMACK there Hoes and drink their Gin and Juice!!!!!!!!!'),(17406,'338f295f95','aaah. we gonna hafta bust out with some hollywood video.'),(17403,'80618850b7','I only have one of them, \"The Wedding\", I didn\'t start getting the BL\'s til\', late spring, early last summer...........  I started getting them around Matrix 2 and American Wedding was some of the first ones........'),(17408,'91732cbf5c','Why go to Hollywood Video? I have a ton of movies, plus you can copy them and keep\'em so i don\'t have to let you borrow my originals!  Unless the only ones you want are the American Pie Trilogy.........And if theres one you want, just give me a little time and I can get it.........its about a 60/40 + chance its avalible........'),(17405,'2eac6696f3','ya pimps be busy and shit. Goku\'s grounded and shit. asked his mammy what a twat was. sike. wednesdays is slow.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17600,'1dc352953c','[quote:1dc352953c=\"hue35\"]Back when you were haveing trouble posting a pic of yourself, I grabbed the image you posted on tiny. I was gonna post it for you, but you figured it out before I got around to it. Also, it was really dark, so I brightened it up a bit... not evil plans this time.  :grin:[/quote:1dc352953c]\r\n\r\nOh....thanks pimp!  :grin:'),(17409,'b76471ff62','Ya, thats me.  I\'ll look into S&amp;H for you and if I can ship to Portugal, It says I can ship anywhere, but it is never that simple for me.  No problem.  I\'ll get back to you as soon as possible.  I\'m not worried about the actual price of the bodies, its the S&amp;H thats cost more than the bodies.  \r\n\r\nThanks, SG219'),(17410,'eab3823f20','I need to know the city and postal code that I would be shipping to.  In order to get an accurate S&amp;H cost.\r\n\r\nThanks.......SG219'),(17411,'922b23520e','[quote:922b23520e=\"Havok\"]sorry I made you reflect on your life...thats a bummer...   :-( [/quote:922b23520e]Don\'t worry, not your fault. I\'ve just been like that lately.\r\n\r\nLife is a bummer, but that\'s why we play with toys as a distraction, isn\'t it?  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(17412,'4f86b00437','Hi CW\r\n\r\nExpect a parcel from UPS today\r\n\r\ntracking No. mm99c8hvybve5      www.mbe.com\r\n\r\nTB');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17413,'922b23520e','[quote:922b23520e=\"Havok\"]sorry I made you reflect on your life...thats a bummer...   :-( [/quote:922b23520e]Don\'t worry, not your fault. I\'ve just been like that lately.\r\n\r\nLife is a bummer, but that\'s why we play with toys as a distraction, isn\'t it?  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(18869,'ed4043045e','lol...dude you\'re always welcome wherever I am....and I\'ll always have a place to smoke for you :smoking:\r\n\r\nI never thought I could quit the cigs either man....I smoked 2 packs a day for 16 years...Newports box...I finally said fuck it and tossed \'em....and 1 xbox controller got broken in the process. all I did for 4 days was play video games and watch tv....it was hard, but i really wanted to quit....and thats the most important thing...don\'t quit for someone else, or because its the \"right\" thing to do....do it cuz you want to.....\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m not going to be able to play with my cars at all until after this coming August...so theres your deadline..like I\'ve said before....I\'m cool wit it and I know a true artist cannot be rushed :lol:'),(17418,'784176b3e3','It takes quite a bit of filing. \r\n\r\n1st - File down the axle nub flat.\r\n2nd - Using a wide file, lay the file on a flat surface, take the wheel \r\n        (outside end up) and move it back &amp; forth across the file to file the\r\n        wheel to the same thickness as a ZZ hub.\r\n3rd -  Drill out the middle to accommodate the ZZ hub center.\r\n4th -  Now use a Micro file, at an angle, and file down the wheel diameter\r\n         evenly to fit inside the ZZ hub.\r\n\r\n                                       D O N E !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17432,'e874f2b23c','I say post away. At the very least some of our electronics gurus may help. I think the idea was out there though, I don\'t remember seeing any finished work. Good luck to ya, hope to see something soon. :-)'),(17420,'780260dbe2','eat 2 bowls once a week and you will be surprised. my family has not had the cold or flu or infections for the year I\'ve been doing this soup.we used to get sick all the time , our doctor called to see waht was up even!\r\n\r\nThis is my grandmothers recipe { from sicily}\r\ningredients:\r\nsicilian chicken soup\r\n 1 package of chicken{like a whole chicken cut up , but all thighs work too}\r\n3 cubes chicken bouillon\r\n1 large onion[diced}\r\n2-1/2 tablespoons salt\r\n3 bay leaves\r\n1 tablespoon sugar\r\n3 tablespoons parsley\r\n4 carrots sliced and skinned\r\n1/2 box of acini de pepi noodles{ look like tiny balls} --{cook per package instructions before adding to the soup}\r\n------dumplings-----------\r\n2 eggs beaten\r\n2/3 cup romano cheese{ spaghetti cheese}\r\n1/2 cup flour\r\n\r\ninstructions:\r\n\r\nget a big pot fill half way with water , put in the chicken and all ingredients. EXCEPT THE NOODLES AND DUMPLING MIX\r\nCOOK ON MEDIUM HEAT FOR 1 1/2 HOURS .\r\nThen remove the chicken de-bone it and put the meat back in the pot.\r\nCook on medium another 30 minutes\r\nAdd the cooked noodles and its cooking water{ when done you want the water level to be about 3 inches from the top of the pot so add water if necessary}\r\nmix the dumpling ingredients and drop teaspoon fulls into the soup{ it will cook and solidify right away}\r\nleave on medium heat 10 more minutes  and then serve.'),(35732,'07ca227e2b','Hmm, the only 1/10th scale stuff I have is Tamiya touring. I got a TB-02, other than that I don\'t have much. \r\n\r\nHow much would you be willing for the stuff...doesn\'t matter to me man.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35733,'3794fc9c72','[quote:3794fc9c72]I would like these if possible. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[color=red:3794fc9c72]The RED evo on white rims . (Check)\r\nWhatever chassis that is on + a controller to match please. (Check)\r\n\r\n1x suspension upgrade (Check)\r\n1 (3.0 Tomy motor) (Might be sold, stil pending)\r\n1 (1.0 Microsizer motor) (Check)\r\nMicrosizer Lap Counter (Check[/color:3794fc9c72]\r\n\r\nI will get some pictures in a few mins for you of what xmod stuff i have and some better details. \r\n\r\nI basically have a parts car that has a badly locked diff , a missing knuckle , has elec but cant test , servo , Some extra tires of diff compounds. \r\nCarbon driveshaft , a badly painted (well , hand painted) skyline body \r\nOnly painted in acrylic so can be removed. \r\nSome rough painted upgrade wheels. \r\n\r\nBetter details in and pics 10mins  \r\n\r\nThanks , \r\nJoe \r\n\r\n[quote:3794fc9c72][/quote:3794fc9c72]\r\n\r\nRead the red part, and let me know what you will trade for it, I really want a CF drive shaft, let\'s see this part car buddy.[/quote:3794fc9c72]'),(31707,'0c11a167ec','That\'s really big of ya man. I feel like shit about it, but that\'s me. :? \r\nIf you really wanted it, tell DT he\'s already got WAY too much, and he should just let you have this one.  :lol: Don\'t know about you, but his pockets run deeper than mine, so he can probably afford that one on eBay, or one from HLJ. If you don\'t want to hassle him over it, I will let him have a go like you said.\r\n\r\nMaybe I can make it up to you. I\'m going to be selling off some duplicate bits that I know I\'ll never get around to working over. I\'ll give you first shot.\r\n\r\nThanks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18901,'4f58edff9d','Hey Dennis,\r\n\r\nHe didn\'t mean anything by it.  He\'s a good guy that gives everybody shit sometimes, so does Hogjowles &amp; BettyK.  It\'s just joking around so don\'t take it seriously.  Very Nice job by the way, let\'s take out SL\'s and cruise the babes on the Ave.  :cool:'),(35363,'1680a44616','Hey CJ I\'m just getting in from my week long vacation.\r\n\r\nI\'m a little lost on the GPM deal, I think I follow you, but I\'m not 100% sure.  Dropping the clip to make up the cost of the increase sounds fine.  I want a complete car kit with dog bones and axles for AWD minus the front clip.  If you need anymore dough, that\'s fine.  Just drop me another PM and I\'ll have it to you as soon as I can get to the computer.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(35089,'5d8da2b6fd','Would be my pleasure bro. :-) \r\n\r\nSend it to sessiz10@hotmail.com  or sessiz@gmail.com\r\nGimme an idea of what ya want in the email. :-o'),(36202,'36910ce06a','Hey man where did you get that picture in you Avatar that chick is sweet! is there a full video? I hope I hope I hope!!  :-o');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19408,'97f3cb5688','[quote:97f3cb5688=\"DarkTari\"]Good !  2 days just as I paid for.\r\n\r\nDo what you want, you been der, done dat !   8) \r\n\r\nI\'ve got 3 done and one in Da Cut.  Maybe doing a couple joint ventures too   :cool:[/quote:97f3cb5688]yea man - the joint venture thing is really cool - I dig on that idea all the way around, it\'s fun for us and the people watching as well as the future owner gets stoked.'),(18530,'b54a5cca75','[img:b54a5cca75]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10003/hand1.jpg[/img:b54a5cca75]'),(18532,'5e23537458','haha ya. i guess i should do that soon huh?\r\n\r\ni know i said a bag of random clone parts, but what you lookin for? ill try to accomodate with whatever you want. sorry dude. right after that contest my life kinda went on this fucked up rollercoaster ride. but after the court shit and moving life is settled and i got a few extra duckets shit is a little more stable.\r\n\r\nhow you been?'),(18533,'4b95f09bdf','Pretty goo dnow that my divorce/separtaion is compltely over with too.\r\n\r\nSeeing alot of my son and loving it. \r\n\r\nAs far as what I am looking for? umm dunno. I haven;t played with my bits in months. Other than the odd time with my son now that he\'s old enough to drive the tanks.\r\n\r\numm maybe you could hook me up with a weird bodied clone or something. Just so I can have somfin new.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17423,'81313bcd34','[quote:81313bcd34=\"filelicker\"]eat 2 bowls once a week and you will be surprised. my family has not had the cold or flu or infections for the year I\'ve been doing this soup.we used to get sick all the time , our doctor called to see waht was up even!\r\n\r\nThis is my grandmothers recipe { from sicily}\r\ningredients:\r\nsicilian chicken soup\r\n 1 package of chicken{like a whole chicken cut up , but all thighs work too}\r\n3 cubes chicken bouillon\r\n1 large onion[diced}\r\n2-1/2 tablespoons salt\r\n3 bay leaves\r\n1 tablespoon sugar\r\n3 tablespoons parsley\r\n4 carrots sliced and skinned\r\n1/2 box of acini de pepi noodles{ look like tiny balls} --{cook per package instructions before adding to the soup}\r\n------dumplings-----------\r\n2 eggs beaten\r\n2/3 cup romano cheese{ spaghetti cheese}\r\n1/2 cup flour\r\n\r\ninstructions:\r\n\r\nget a big pot fill half way with water , put in the chicken and all ingredients. EXCEPT THE NOODLES AND DUMPLING MIX\r\nCOOK ON MEDIUM HEAT FOR 1 1/2 HOURS .\r\nThen remove the chicken de-bone it and put the meat back in the pot.\r\nCook on medium another 30 minutes\r\nAdd the cooked noodles and its cooking water{ when done you want the water level to be about 3 inches from the top of the pot so add water if necessary}\r\nmix the dumpling ingredients and drop teaspoon fulls into the soup{ it will cook and solidify right away}\r\nleave on medium heat 10 more minutes  and then serve.[/quote:81313bcd34]Cool man, thanks.  :-) \r\n\r\nI\'ll definately try that out. Be out of antibiotics tomorrrow, and some cold wet weather this morning kinda got it started back up, so I\'m bummin\'. :-( \r\n\r\n...and besides, me and the wife love chicken and dumplings, but we never had a clue how to make it.  :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(17425,'c8bbe8fc2e','first off, thx for the font- i love it and it looks really kool!\r\nsecondly, i believe i have come up w/ an idea for a voice automated bit!\r\ngreat, isnt it?\r\nthe q is-\r\ndo you think i should tell everyone, or keep it under wraps for a while?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17426,'e874f2b23c','I say post away. At the very least some of our electronics gurus may help. I think the idea was out there though, I don\'t remember seeing any finished work. Good luck to ya, hope to see something soon. :-)'),(17427,'8be334aad1','Hey Dude,\r\n\r\naccording to the tracking service, you should have found a BonzerMat in your porch. Let me know if you received it ok\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTB'),(33259,'d596c4db64','Just found the mustang front clip and the 2 white gear diff. In my parts box, I can pm you a pic tomorrow if needed.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt'),(29456,'7c10a2d427','Just making sure I got it right:\r\n\r\nJay Bailey\r\n105 Mayfield Lane\r\nWest Mifflin, PA 15122\r\n\r\n\r\nThat right?'),(28575,'f5d36d7bae','Yeah man... I wanna see those man... c\'mon over and burn one and lemme see them... what I owe for the diorama? I might got it, or might gotta pay you later lol...'),(17599,'48def46fa1','I called radioshack hot line and tried to order a part and they said that they wouldtn make the parts till March 23rd is it true?\r\n\r\n\r\npeace \r\n\r\nJakobe');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17430,'78eda7c3fd','When you get this give me a call.  I proably won\'t be online, but I gotta get out of here and do something, it\'s killing me!!!'),(18870,'ed4043045e','lol...dude you\'re always welcome wherever I am....and I\'ll always have a place to smoke for you :smoking:\r\n\r\nI never thought I could quit the cigs either man....I smoked 2 packs a day for 16 years...Newports box...I finally said fuck it and tossed \'em....and 1 xbox controller got broken in the process. all I did for 4 days was play video games and watch tv....it was hard, but i really wanted to quit....and thats the most important thing...don\'t quit for someone else, or because its the \"right\" thing to do....do it cuz you want to.....\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m not going to be able to play with my cars at all until after this coming August...so theres your deadline..like I\'ve said before....I\'m cool wit it and I know a true artist cannot be rushed :lol:'),(17433,'648bfdd662','I saw on tiny that it\'s your birthday. Happy birthday, dude. :drinkin:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17435,'072bd2c467','Thanks man  :-)'),(17436,'4960be94ff','Hi im new here so i got a question\r\n  \r\n\r\n if you have an article tip thing how do you get it to be on the site like everyone elses in the articl section help appreciated   \r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n      JaKoBe'),(23345,'3884bcb239','teh money is on my desk ive been so busy with skool i forgot about it ill prolly be busy for a while....if sum one else wants to buy sell it to them'),(23346,'4a4465447c','No problem. I decided to keep em, winter is coming up and I will need something to drive around the house besides my Zips.\r\n\r\nSorry for the confusion. Good luck in school!'),(17440,'e709fe054c','ok kool thanx alot    :D'),(24352,'21246710a9','Hey if you are willing to sell some bits tell me which ones im in need of some and i got money now so yeah....'),(17459,'acbedb334b','hey man,\r\nwassup? did you get those \'Maros yet? lemme know.. :grin:'),(17460,'9d60f43487','when they gona be available in merika?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17462,'6d175a23fe','They are available now. I shipped a small number (150) to florida for local posting - they probably seem a little expensive because of the current crappy exchange rate. Bilbobaggins got one already and one is on its way to Voodoomafia.\r\n\r\nDrop me a line and let me know what you think.\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTB\r\n\r\nderek@bonzergear.com'),(17443,'b7853461f5','My bad about yesterday, dude. I was at tha in laws all day. did\'nt get yer message til like 11pm. I had been on earlier yesterday and saw on tiny that it was finks\' 25th b-day and pm\'ed him a happy bifrday. He pm\'ed me back this mornin\' \"thanks man.\"\r\nI am having real choice issues on the whole xmod/miniz1/miniz2 thing. I want a z in the worst way but want an xmod so\'s I can run with you and maybe hog... If I just get a z you guys would\'nt be able to hang... I am racking my brains trying to figger out how to swing for both AND bit stuff....'),(17597,'c7f689039d','been talkin\' to hogjowlz back and forth all day... he\'s in bellevue, movin\' like 5 blocks to his new place. he\'s down to get some racin\' and drinkin\' and smokin\' on with us.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18371,'79602f9606','payasodesnudo'),(18372,'76e3a67d2e','[quote:76e3a67d2e=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:76e3a67d2e=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:76e3a67d2e=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:76e3a67d2e=\"Son_Gokou\"]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=313&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=615\r\n\r\nUmm....they\'re joking, right? Or did I look gay/retarded in each of those pictures?[/quote:76e3a67d2e]yea - they\'re just giving you a hard time.\r\nyou can either laugh with them, against them, or blow off their comments - whichever works best for you[/quote:76e3a67d2e]\r\n\r\nMmm hmmm...\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3597\r\n\r\nAll I said was \"I don\'t get how it will do this\". Just that, and hog goes nuts on me and so does Finks. I don\'t get it, why are they so angry? I even made a post stating my point of view, he edited it, as you could see.....[/quote:76e3a67d2e]well I\'m going to be brutally honest with you. as you can see - not everyone is going to like you. for whatever reasons.\r\n\r\nyou\'ll just have to deal with it however you must. I can\'t monitor everyone\'s each and every posts. this takes up too much of my time as it is.[/quote:76e3a67d2e]\r\n\r\nYeah, I guess so....\r\n\r\nBut, I think it\'s starting to get out of hand....I mean, what\'s up with his avatar? HE USED MY REAL RACE AS A PUSSY!! :shock:\r\n\r\nI guess I\'ll just PM him and ask him WTF he thinks he\'s doing....'),(17885,'4f4c2de1da','Ok, i think i got it. you\'re building some type of funny car, aren\'t ya?\r\n\r\ngot my toyeast shit today... the porsche body that came on the mini-z clone is missing the drivers side mirror. it looks well made though, and i\'ll probly be runnin it later. they hooked me up with an extra 200mah bit battery, too, so i\'ll let the miror slide.\r\n\r\nmike got his xmod shit a few days ago, and the motor he bought off of ebay is retarded fast. made the 10 tooth stage 2 in mine seem slow... but i was having technical difficulties that i didn\'t iron out til after he was gone. seems when i put the awd in i mixed up the diffs and had the front one in the back and that was causing my car to be slow. now that it\'s fixed i\'m really impressed with it. i\'m just afraid that this mini-z is gonna smoke it. we\'ll see');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17445,'e93db1da90','i say get the xmod..other than that i\'ve been packing all day....i\'m off and since i only got a 2 weeks notice from the fuckin\' roommates to move.  it fuckin\' blows balls.  i have too much shit to move and no place to move it to.....i\'ll have to find a really big refridgeator box.........\r\n\r\nits a nice day out and i gotta do this shit....i\'m gonna get really drunk tonight at bowling and then whoop someones ass forr the hell of it i think...........\r\n\r\nsorry, but\r\ni\'m just really pissed off right now!!!!!!!!!!1'),(17455,'f92b26575e','Gotta go.  If you see me on the news, tape it.   :-)  :ak:  :drinkin:'),(17464,'6d175a23fe','They are available now. I shipped a small number (150) to florida for local posting - they probably seem a little expensive because of the current crappy exchange rate. Bilbobaggins got one already and one is on its way to Voodoomafia.\r\n\r\nDrop me a line and let me know what you think.\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTB\r\n\r\nderek@bonzergear.com'),(17516,'bce5ed3d17','Hwy are you the administrator of tiny rc....if so why is my account disabled..I juss got back from a big trip and havnt posted for a while and when i tried to post i couldnt this is what it said\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n vBulletin Message \r\nYou do not have permission to access this page. This could be due to one of several reasons: \r\nYou do not have permission to access the page that you were trying to. Are you trying to edit someone else\'s post or trying to access administrative features? Check that you are allowed to perform this action in the Forum Rules. \r\nIf you are trying to post, the administrator may have disabled your account, or it may be awaiting activation. \r\nLogged in user: WhiteSupra43 [logout] \r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n \r\nall i did was try to post......if i did something wrog tell me please');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17458,'acbedb334b','hey man,\r\nwassup? did you get those \'Maros yet? lemme know.. :grin:'),(17447,'b6137fffc3','man that sucks... that\'s a LOT of liquor bottles to be packin.... I don\'t know about other shit, but just your alcohol paraphernalia is a lot. Kickin ass at tha bowlin\' alley or on tha roomates? :???: \r\nBoth? :???: \r\nI WILL FIND A WAY TO HAVE ALL THE CARS!!!!\r\nhogjowlz said he\'s movin into a new apt. in like 2 weeks with only 1 room carpeted. The rest is hardwood/tile. You should think about that in yer search.... :???: \r\nWhole lotta  :???:  today!'),(17449,'ac3a2b3584','I think I\'m going to recreate the movie \" Falling Down\"!!!!!!!!!!  I\'m going to kick everyones ass!!!  \r\n\r\nI\'m haven\'t even had a chance to really look for a place, I don\'t know if I\'m going home for a little bit or what.....\r\n\r\n\r\nFuck the Mini-BS, just get an Xmod and a Nitro........'),(17453,'bc3a3f4a7f','Maybe the parents, or maybe \"In a van, down by the river.\"  I\'ll be close to work that way and rent will be almost nothin\'.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17451,'424f4d372d','1. Falling Down - awesome movie!\r\n2. You gonna stay at the parents cribby for a minute? what you gonna do?\r\n3. nitro..... :mad:  damn they\'re expensive... tempting, but expensive.'),(17463,'11f6bd389d','no sweat homie... :-)'),(17478,'4f86b00437','Hi CW\r\n\r\nExpect a parcel from UPS today\r\n\r\ntracking No. mm99c8hvybve5      www.mbe.com\r\n\r\nTB'),(17479,'8be334aad1','Hey Dude,\r\n\r\naccording to the tracking service, you should have found a BonzerMat in your porch. Let me know if you received it ok\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTB'),(17480,'ac8f07fcf0','[quote:ac8f07fcf0=\"TeamBonzer\"]Hey Dude,\r\n\r\naccording to the tracking service, you should have found a BonzerMat in your porch. Let me know if you received it ok\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTB[/quote:ac8f07fcf0]hey man - got that Bonzer Mat!\r\nsorry I didn\'t get back to you sooner, I\'ve been out of town visiting payaso.\r\n\r\nI just got in about 20 minutes ago, so I\'ve got the un-packing ritual and all that to do still, but as soon as I get a chance, I\'ll rip in to that box and get to playing :lol: \r\n\r\nI\'ll let you know how it goes.\r\n\r\ntalk to you soon.\r\n\r\n- Cabo'),(17481,'d78a9eb540','Hey Darktari says your the man, well I\'m letting you know there is a new forum, it\'s an affiliate to wegotu.  The New Forum will focus on the average to Moderate users and wegotu will remain focused on the advanced users.  I want to extend an invitation to all Bit Pimps they are more then welcome to post at R7R and link back to Bit Pimps, even though we have a bits section, are focus is not on 1/64th scale.  We plan on competing with MRCC, I would also like to get your permission to include a bitpimps link in our soon to be built Link Page.\r\n\r\nWell Come on over and give it a look, we are still a long way from complete.\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nLance- ripper7777777\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35417,'2b88e46b36','Hey, got those gears. Thanks a ton, you probably saved $20.\r\n\r\nHopefully you\'ve got or will get that red gear soon.\r\n\r\nDave'),(35422,'169b5e2cc3','[quote:169b5e2cc3=\"microzen\"]Hello DarkTari,\r\n\r\nYou replied to a post of mine on microrccenter regarding VW Bus. \r\n\r\nDo you know where I can get a body for a Bit?[/quote:169b5e2cc3]\r\n\r\nTry PM\'ing JDMHatchback, might have some left  :cool:'),(35423,'4a101ec4c3','Visit our galleries, we have the world\'s largest Micro RC Gallery, plenty to see, check it out!:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php\r\n\r\nAnd my personal Gallery:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php?cat=10005\r\n\r\nAlso check out our year end Car Contest which ends Dec 31st.\r\nGot some great prizes:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=6788\r\n\r\nWe have the most informative Tech forum on the web:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewforum.php?f=50\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewforum.php?f=49\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewforum.php?f=48\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewforum.php?f=21\r\n\r\nSo cruise around a while and join in, but read the rules 1st or they\'ll\r\nreem you a new one  :lol: \r\n\r\nThanx for stoppin by   :cool:'),(31666,'3818232312','My address is 23537 cherry hill, 48124 Dearborn, MI.\r\n\r\nLol, i got lucky, i saw the thread and was like whaa? lol.  Thanks again.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31667,'5a5876d182','you want me to address it to stagg? lol\r\n\r\n-JNY'),(35510,'134c33dbd3','Totally forgot that it came.  Been a little busy with some stuff.\r\n\r\nI like the cover you made. :-o \r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nI\'ll check it out soon.  Gotta find some buds. :search:'),(36502,'e57a77d4dc','Nope never recieved mine yet. Just wanted to hear from you incase you did receive it.\r\n\r\nIt\'s ok about the tracking, just let me know if you receive anything!\r\n\r\nTake care'),(36608,'f9c8910fe6','Hey man do you happen to have any more of those mini-Z wheel nuts? I need 4 if you have them I bought a Mini-Z from Gfunk but he is keeping the tires, body and wheels I am just getting the chasse I have wheels but no wheel nuts.\r\n\r\nthanks man!  :-)'),(35960,'1c1bf9a9fb','Cool man, thanks though!'),(36469,'5ad5abfda6','I used a dremel for most of my cutting.  I dont have too many shots but these should help a little.  I used the epoch suspension as inspiration.  \r\n\r\nNot sure if this pic helps much, this is the underside,, i used some aluminum to dress up the arm (its plastic under it)\r\n\r\n[img:5ad5abfda6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10078/underside.jpg[/img:5ad5abfda6]\r\n\r\n[img:5ad5abfda6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10078/lancer-suspension-4.jpg[/img:5ad5abfda6]\r\n\r\nThis one should show you pretty much how i went about setting it up.  You may have less room with an SE so some artistic liberties will need to be taken for sure.\r\n\r\nI think your best option will be to make some sort of a suspension plate/pivot plate like the mini z\'s have or like betty K did on some of his full suspension bits.  ITs simple and it works great.  At this scale you dont need much more than the springyness of the plastic quite honestly\r\n\r\nhope that helps\r\nSTG'),(35966,'60971a6733','You mean it does not give as much of a boost as I am thinking?\r\n\r\nWould\'nt the weight hold it down nice on the track though?\r\n\r\n...lol why is it risky ?  :???:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28513,'72c7728046','The RS I was in yesterday had at least 5. They were $9.99.\r\n\r\nIf you want one just let me know I\'ll try to grab you one.\r\n\r\nDave'),(17483,'b3bae23803','damn money!\r\nthat\'s hot - I think that\'s exactly the kind of thing the judges are looking for man.\r\nyou one slick cat :lol: \r\n\r\nso wow - dude, I wonder how you\'d get busted for MP3s? I mean the people running the domain would have to investigate on their own to find out if nobody told them. I\'d hope none of the gangsta trick click folks would harbor a \"rat\".\r\nI\'m wondering if it\'s not a bandwidth issue? is it possible we used up your bandwidth for the month?\r\nI hope so.\r\nSorry for causing the shit man - really.\r\n\r\nyea I just got back from payaso\'s about 20 minutes ago.\r\ngotta go through the unpacking saga and all that shit.\r\ngot a fuckload of stories from my visit - some good - some bad - all interesting though lol\r\nI\'ll fill you and the pimps in when I get a chance.\r\n\r\nI\'ll try to connect via FTP to the bitpimps account you have on your server, if I can connect - I\'ll go ahead and get rid of the MP3s up there for now just in case, or at least until we can find out what happened.\r\n\r\ntalk to you soon'),(17484,'ac8f07fcf0','[quote:ac8f07fcf0=\"TeamBonzer\"]Hey Dude,\r\n\r\naccording to the tracking service, you should have found a BonzerMat in your porch. Let me know if you received it ok\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTB[/quote:ac8f07fcf0]hey man - got that Bonzer Mat!\r\nsorry I didn\'t get back to you sooner, I\'ve been out of town visiting payaso.\r\n\r\nI just got in about 20 minutes ago, so I\'ve got the un-packing ritual and all that to do still, but as soon as I get a chance, I\'ll rip in to that box and get to playing :lol: \r\n\r\nI\'ll let you know how it goes.\r\n\r\ntalk to you soon.\r\n\r\n- Cabo');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17485,'bf4abc6839','[quote:bf4abc6839=\"ripper7777777\"]Hey Darktari says your the man, well I\'m letting you know there is a new forum, it\'s an affiliate to wegotu.  The New Forum will focus on the average to Moderate users and wegotu will remain focused on the advanced users.  I want to extend an invitation to all Bit Pimps they are more then welcome to post at R7R and link back to Bit Pimps, even though we have a bits section, are focus is not on 1/64th scale.  We plan on competing with MRCC, I would also like to get your permission to include a bitpimps link in our soon to be built Link Page.\r\n\r\nWell Come on over and give it a look, we are still a long way from complete.\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nLance- ripper7777777\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com[/quote:bf4abc6839]sure man go for it.\r\nthanks for asking, it\'s very much appreciated.\r\n\r\nyou\'re welcome to make a post here about it as well if you want.\r\nwe just ask that you only make your one post about it and not \"spam\" it with multiple posts.\r\n\r\nI\'ve just gotten back from out of town so sorry for the delay in getting back to you. I\'ll check out your site as soon as I can.\r\n\r\nfeel free to link to us, we might do the same (gotta check it out first, ya know)\r\n\r\nat any rate - good luck with the site and all! :-)'),(17486,'342b40ad2f','[quote:342b40ad2f=\"synj\"]Do you think that i should tell the world about my voice operated bit\'s\r\nthat i have under construction?\r\nThx for any answer![/quote:342b40ad2f]absolutely you should tell the world about it - I\'m sure some where along the way you would get some really useful feedback.\r\nI kind of remember hearing about the idea and a few opions before.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17487,'0e3d12d01f','Hey, good to see you\'re back.  :-) \r\nBeen kinda slow last couple days, I was starting to think I was boring these guys. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, about that MP3 thing, it might have been the bandwidth, I just assumed I got cut off because it said my password is invalid. So I guess I\'ll try again next month and see if it comes back.\r\n\r\nDave'),(17488,'aae3b5ad43','[quote:aae3b5ad43=\"Havok\"]hey man,\r\nwassup? did you get those \'Maros yet? lemme know.. :grin:[/quote:aae3b5ad43]Hey man, I got them. \r\n\r\nI found soemthing else too. ;) :-D \r\n\r\nThat sheeit was killer. Different than what we get around here.  :???: \r\n\r\nCool man, thanks. 8-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(17489,'0e3d12d01f','Hey, good to see you\'re back.  :-) \r\nBeen kinda slow last couple days, I was starting to think I was boring these guys. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, about that MP3 thing, it might have been the bandwidth, I just assumed I got cut off because it said my password is invalid. So I guess I\'ll try again next month and see if it comes back.\r\n\r\nDave'),(17490,'0edb13adab','[quote:0edb13adab=\"crazydave\"]Hey, good to see you\'re back.  :-) \r\nBeen kinda slow last couple days, I was starting to think I was boring these guys. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, about that MP3 thing, it might have been the bandwidth, I just assumed I got cut off because it said my password is invalid. So I guess I\'ll try again next month and see if it comes back.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:0edb13adab]well I read your post and Namuna\'s reply after I sent off the PM to you.\r\nI hit the page tonite, it displayed and mp3s seem to still be there.\r\n\r\nmight as well play it on the safe side and just change the file extension like namuna suggested');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17491,'aae3b5ad43','[quote:aae3b5ad43=\"Havok\"]hey man,\r\nwassup? did you get those \'Maros yet? lemme know.. :grin:[/quote:aae3b5ad43]Hey man, I got them. \r\n\r\nI found soemthing else too. ;) :-D \r\n\r\nThat sheeit was killer. Different than what we get around here.  :???: \r\n\r\nCool man, thanks. 8-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(17492,'db16f8edff','maaaaannnnn\r\nI told you its good here....I was sweatin that for a minute...it always seeeeeeems like a good idea when you\'re :smoking: and not so great later....I was hopin\' you wouldn\'t be :mad: I put the return addy on there for the heat though...so that was good....I\'ll be coming to see you eventually...and you can believe you\'ll be seein that again...I\'m moving to So-Cal by next year and I\'ll be making the rounds...to Cabo\'s...you...anyone else out that way....I love road trips.... :driving:'),(17493,'d1a9025f88','CJ, how did you get that cool url banner? how or where did you make it. (i want one for my rc site) Please help me thanks.'),(17494,'0edb13adab','[quote:0edb13adab=\"crazydave\"]Hey, good to see you\'re back.  :-) \r\nBeen kinda slow last couple days, I was starting to think I was boring these guys. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, about that MP3 thing, it might have been the bandwidth, I just assumed I got cut off because it said my password is invalid. So I guess I\'ll try again next month and see if it comes back.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:0edb13adab]well I read your post and Namuna\'s reply after I sent off the PM to you.\r\nI hit the page tonite, it displayed and mp3s seem to still be there.\r\n\r\nmight as well play it on the safe side and just change the file extension like namuna suggested');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17495,'5798a7e91a','[quote:5798a7e91a=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:5798a7e91a=\"crazydave\"]Hey, good to see you\'re back.  :-) \r\nBeen kinda slow last couple days, I was starting to think I was boring these guys. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, about that MP3 thing, it might have been the bandwidth, I just assumed I got cut off because it said my password is invalid. So I guess I\'ll try again next month and see if it comes back.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:5798a7e91a]well I read your post and Namuna\'s reply after I sent off the PM to you.\r\nI hit the page tonite, it displayed and mp3s seem to still be there.\r\n\r\nmight as well play it on the safe side and just change the file extension like namuna suggested[/quote:5798a7e91a]Hey looky there, it\'s back. :-D \r\n\r\nWell I guess it was just technical difficulties.\r\n\r\nNamuna does have a good point about the extension. Maybe what we should do is just pack up whole albums into .zip files, and change the extension. I\'d think that would be pretty damn safe. Doncha?\r\n\r\nDave'),(17496,'db16f8edff','maaaaannnnn\r\nI told you its good here....I was sweatin that for a minute...it always seeeeeeems like a good idea when you\'re :smoking: and not so great later....I was hopin\' you wouldn\'t be :mad: I put the return addy on there for the heat though...so that was good....I\'ll be coming to see you eventually...and you can believe you\'ll be seein that again...I\'m moving to So-Cal by next year and I\'ll be making the rounds...to Cabo\'s...you...anyone else out that way....I love road trips.... :driving:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17497,'807176a321','[quote:807176a321=\"Havok\"]maaaaannnnn\r\nI told you its good here....I was sweatin that for a minute...it always seeeeeeems like a good idea when you\'re :smoking: and not so great later....I was hopin\' you wouldn\'t be :mad: I put the return addy on there for the heat though...so that was good....I\'ll be coming to see you eventually...and you can believe you\'ll be seein that again...I\'m moving to So-Cal by next year and I\'ll be making the rounds...to Cabo\'s...you...anyone else out that way....I love road trips.... :driving:[/quote:807176a321] :lol: Yeah, I questioned the sanity of that manuever. Betcha you were sweating it when it ran late.  :?  \r\n\r\nI wasn\'t too worried, \'cause it\'s here, right? Just don\'t go and try to send an Ozzy, \'cause that [i:807176a321]would[/i:807176a321] be crazy. :lol: \r\n\r\nI can get stuff almost like that, but it\'s 120 bucks for a quarter ounce. I like to smoke an ounce every week or 2, so I can\'t hang with those prices, but the stuff I regularly get is skunky or piney, and just as stoney once you get all the stems and seeds out. \r\n\r\nI recently took a pic for Cabo and the guys (behind the scenes of coarse. ;) ) Check it out, this is what I\'m smokin\' off of now.\r\nhttp://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/sizechart2.jpg\r\n\r\nIf you make your way down here, that will be super cool. VooDooMafia was supposed to get sent down here by his job, and was all excited, but they sent him to Texas instead, and now i don\'t get to see him on the forums. That sucks. Filelicker is moving down here soon, but he\'s an older guy, but me and you, we could have some serious fun baking out, and racing cars.  :-D \r\n\r\n(hey, check out my new Zip Zap SE over in the Flossin\' forum)\r\n\r\nDave'),(17498,'5798a7e91a','[quote:5798a7e91a=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:5798a7e91a=\"crazydave\"]Hey, good to see you\'re back.  :-) \r\nBeen kinda slow last couple days, I was starting to think I was boring these guys. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, about that MP3 thing, it might have been the bandwidth, I just assumed I got cut off because it said my password is invalid. So I guess I\'ll try again next month and see if it comes back.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:5798a7e91a]well I read your post and Namuna\'s reply after I sent off the PM to you.\r\nI hit the page tonite, it displayed and mp3s seem to still be there.\r\n\r\nmight as well play it on the safe side and just change the file extension like namuna suggested[/quote:5798a7e91a]Hey looky there, it\'s back. :-D \r\n\r\nWell I guess it was just technical difficulties.\r\n\r\nNamuna does have a good point about the extension. Maybe what we should do is just pack up whole albums into .zip files, and change the extension. I\'d think that would be pretty damn safe. Doncha?\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17499,'f601a73656','[quote:f601a73656=\"crazydave\"][quote:f601a73656=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:f601a73656=\"crazydave\"]Hey, good to see you\'re back.  :-) \r\nBeen kinda slow last couple days, I was starting to think I was boring these guys. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, about that MP3 thing, it might have been the bandwidth, I just assumed I got cut off because it said my password is invalid. So I guess I\'ll try again next month and see if it comes back.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:f601a73656]well I read your post and Namuna\'s reply after I sent off the PM to you.\r\nI hit the page tonite, it displayed and mp3s seem to still be there.\r\n\r\nmight as well play it on the safe side and just change the file extension like namuna suggested[/quote:f601a73656]Hey looky there, it\'s back. :-D \r\n\r\nWell I guess it was just technical difficulties.\r\n\r\nNamuna does have a good point about the extension. Maybe what we should do is just pack up whole albums into .zip files, and change the extension. I\'d think that would be pretty damn safe. Doncha?\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:f601a73656]yea that\'d be safe - if they were in .zip, shouldn\'t even have to change the file extensions.\r\n\r\nmight be a huge download / upload to have an entire album as a .zip'),(17500,'f601a73656','[quote:f601a73656=\"crazydave\"][quote:f601a73656=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:f601a73656=\"crazydave\"]Hey, good to see you\'re back.  :-) \r\nBeen kinda slow last couple days, I was starting to think I was boring these guys. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, about that MP3 thing, it might have been the bandwidth, I just assumed I got cut off because it said my password is invalid. So I guess I\'ll try again next month and see if it comes back.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:f601a73656]well I read your post and Namuna\'s reply after I sent off the PM to you.\r\nI hit the page tonite, it displayed and mp3s seem to still be there.\r\n\r\nmight as well play it on the safe side and just change the file extension like namuna suggested[/quote:f601a73656]Hey looky there, it\'s back. :-D \r\n\r\nWell I guess it was just technical difficulties.\r\n\r\nNamuna does have a good point about the extension. Maybe what we should do is just pack up whole albums into .zip files, and change the extension. I\'d think that would be pretty damn safe. Doncha?\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:f601a73656]yea that\'d be safe - if they were in .zip, shouldn\'t even have to change the file extensions.\r\n\r\nmight be a huge download / upload to have an entire album as a .zip');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17501,'6600f80231','[quote:6600f80231=\"CaboWabo\"]yea that\'d be safe - if they were in .zip, shouldn\'t even have to change the file extensions.\r\n\r\nmight be a huge download / upload to have an entire album as a .zip[/quote:6600f80231]Yeah, I always forgot about the people with slow connections.  :lol: \r\n\r\nI don\'t know, that\'s the way they do it on the news groups, and buddy prefers it that way, but I guess since these files are in a fixed position it a little different, cause it\'s not like you\'re gonna have to search all over for the rest the album.\r\n\r\nOn the plus side it would make downloading whole albums a tad bit faster in the long run.\r\n\r\nI guess I\'ll have to think this one through.\r\n\r\ndave'),(17502,'6600f80231','[quote:6600f80231=\"CaboWabo\"]yea that\'d be safe - if they were in .zip, shouldn\'t even have to change the file extensions.\r\n\r\nmight be a huge download / upload to have an entire album as a .zip[/quote:6600f80231]Yeah, I always forgot about the people with slow connections.  :lol: \r\n\r\nI don\'t know, that\'s the way they do it on the news groups, and buddy prefers it that way, but I guess since these files are in a fixed position it a little different, cause it\'s not like you\'re gonna have to search all over for the rest the album.\r\n\r\nOn the plus side it would make downloading whole albums a tad bit faster in the long run.\r\n\r\nI guess I\'ll have to think this one through.\r\n\r\ndave'),(17504,'807176a321','[quote:807176a321=\"Havok\"]maaaaannnnn\r\nI told you its good here....I was sweatin that for a minute...it always seeeeeeems like a good idea when you\'re :smoking: and not so great later....I was hopin\' you wouldn\'t be :mad: I put the return addy on there for the heat though...so that was good....I\'ll be coming to see you eventually...and you can believe you\'ll be seein that again...I\'m moving to So-Cal by next year and I\'ll be making the rounds...to Cabo\'s...you...anyone else out that way....I love road trips.... :driving:[/quote:807176a321] :lol: Yeah, I questioned the sanity of that manuever. Betcha you were sweating it when it ran late.  :?  \r\n\r\nI wasn\'t too worried, \'cause it\'s here, right? Just don\'t go and try to send an Ozzy, \'cause that [i:807176a321]would[/i:807176a321] be crazy. :lol: \r\n\r\nI can get stuff almost like that, but it\'s 120 bucks for a quarter ounce. I like to smoke an ounce every week or 2, so I can\'t hang with those prices, but the stuff I regularly get is skunky or piney, and just as stoney once you get all the stems and seeds out. \r\n\r\nI recently took a pic for Cabo and the guys (behind the scenes of coarse. ;) ) Check it out, this is what I\'m smokin\' off of now.\r\nhttp://www.s2k-kidz.com/crazycars/sizechart2.jpg\r\n\r\nIf you make your way down here, that will be super cool. VooDooMafia was supposed to get sent down here by his job, and was all excited, but they sent him to Texas instead, and now i don\'t get to see him on the forums. That sucks. Filelicker is moving down here soon, but he\'s an older guy, but me and you, we could have some serious fun baking out, and racing cars.  :-D \r\n\r\n(hey, check out my new Zip Zap SE over in the Flossin\' forum)\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17505,'bf300ead22','look here little man. 1: shut the hell up 2: he was asked to stop posting repeditivly 3: he kept doing that 4: he bugged me like you are doing now 5: he posted repetitivly after he pmd me saying hed stop\r\n\r\nkeep in mind this was all about 20minutes\r\n\r\ni could have been worse but i was in a good mood that day. just enjoy the cars homey and dont fuel the shit'),(24485,'f6742a7733','how much fro the xmod need one more for my science fair project'),(17517,'1c370b3b85','hello betty...i am back :) i was gone for a while with mono and i was not able to send out my chassis but i wanted to know if its ok if i send it now?\r\n\r\nthanks\r\nkent'),(17519,'627720ae48','Hi i juss joined umm I have a tip to go in teh articles so do I send it to you or what ??'),(17520,'7649102559','How can i order the mat from ya well teh track really whast the price with shipping to TEXAS'),(35643,'831ed214c3','well i was just looking at your siggy and I like fps and I was wondering what game that was');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17523,'44420689cd','Hey, man, whats up? I see you\'re moving in a few days. You stayin\' in the area? I was kinda lookin\' forward to gettin\' some racing on. Soon as the weather improves I\'m gonna get this X-mod I just got sorted out, and 219 is getting one when he resolves his housing issues.\r\nI was at this hobby shop in White Oak lookin\' to score some alloy wheel nuts and they had them charge n go\'s for like 10 bucks. I might grab one anyway just to have, I\'m kinda on a get one of everything mission.\r\nGet the new purple Superslick motor... It\'s a beast!\r\nMy trailer park is about 5 minutes from Kennywood. There are a bunch of trailer parks scattered around Pgh\'s suburbs. Mines actually pretty nice, as far as trailer parks go, the police can only come here if called, they aren\'t allowed to patrol, and I could walk the streets drinkin\' a beer and not worry about being hassled if I wanted(I got the super-private hidden invisible back yard thing goin\' on, though). I just get annoyed by the crackheads that knock on my door in the middle of the night lookin\' for the crackwhores next door. Management says they are gonna be gone soon though.\r\nOh, by the way, what thrift store had those lap counters for a buck?'),(17525,'71baea98d3','Ya, I will need one once I move.  I\'m looking for one that is first and foremost [color=green:71baea98d3]CHEAP[/color:71baea98d3]!!  I don\'t care if its new or used.  Other than that all I want in it is....\r\n\r\n--CD burner...DVD burner would be bonus\r\n--60 or 80 harddrive\r\n--decent size monitor\r\n--ability to pimp the web quickly and easily, will have cable ISP\r\n--1 or 2 USB ports\r\n\r\nI don\'t really play to any games on the computer, so I don\'t need much graphic stuff on it, just enough to play some clips and stuff on the net.  Like BitPimp clips.  I just want something I can download and surf on.  I\'m not worried about software, I can get that.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17527,'576814b1dc','http://home.earthlink.net/~hue35/images/son.jpg\r\n\r\nUhh......WHAT ARE YOU PLANNING TO DO TO ME??? lol jk :lol:\r\n\r\nYou\'ve got Photoshop skills, eh?'),(17528,'5a755d8d79','Back when you were haveing trouble posting a pic of yourself, I grabbed the image you posted on tiny. I was gonna post it for you, but you figured it out before I got around to it. Also, it was really dark, so I brightened it up a bit... not evil plans this time.  :grin:'),(17699,'f2f02571b9','Well I\'m registered at your gallery, so let me know whats next.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nripper7777777'),(17530,'273dc29f77','aaight, cool. we gotta set up like maybe a weekly racing hook-up or something like that... maybe a tennis court convenient from your direction and me and 219\'s direction, like McKinley park(off of 51, near the tunnels) or something. I\'m really looking forward to getting into this X-mod this summer. 219 is a member of the Elks club in Braddock, and bartends there Sat. nights, and he says that the upstairs is huge, smooth, and pretty much empty... he\'s going to look into getting something going down there, too.\r\neither way, we should all get together for some racing....'),(17531,'273dc29f77','aaight, cool. we gotta set up like maybe a weekly racing hook-up or something like that... maybe a tennis court convenient from your direction and me and 219\'s direction, like McKinley park(off of 51, near the tunnels) or something. I\'m really looking forward to getting into this X-mod this summer. 219 is a member of the Elks club in Braddock, and bartends there Sat. nights, and he says that the upstairs is huge, smooth, and pretty much empty... he\'s going to look into getting something going down there, too.\r\neither way, we should all get together for some racing....');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17533,'dcfae87e18','[quote:dcfae87e18=\"hogjowlz\"]ya hollidays blew nuts this year. i tell ya what i owe ya 40bucks still so i can send you all the zz parts i got and a broken xmod with some motors.[/quote:dcfae87e18]\r\n\r\n  Hey dude whast up?  Hope all is going well.\r\n\r\n  I have been away for a bit with work and shit so that kinda sucks just sending some pms off to stay in touch and shit :)\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nPete'),(17534,'869edf6b17','Hey dude how things going?\r\n\r\n  Man I have been away alittle to long for my likin.....\r\n\r\n Damn work has me over worked I think its fucking killing me.\r\n\r\n  Well just checking in :)\r\n\r\nhey ever figure out Micro Amps se thing.\r\n\r\nPete'),(17535,'dcfae87e18','[quote:dcfae87e18=\"hogjowlz\"]ya hollidays blew nuts this year. i tell ya what i owe ya 40bucks still so i can send you all the zz parts i got and a broken xmod with some motors.[/quote:dcfae87e18]\r\n\r\n  Hey dude whast up?  Hope all is going well.\r\n\r\n  I have been away for a bit with work and shit so that kinda sucks just sending some pms off to stay in touch and shit :)\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nPete'),(21922,'05dc8025a8','I was going to sell it for 10 bucks plus shipping\r\n\r\n  Its beeen used once but since I am a lazy fucker and have not opened my pool (for the last 4 years lol) I dont think I will get much use of it');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17538,'6a51f6939a','were you moving to?  You staying in same area?\r\n\r\n  I fucking hate movie lol I did it this summer and still living out of boxes for alot of teh shit.  I hate to pack and hate to unpack lol'),(17540,'175c6d3e54','what, sealed bearings? I got the shaq bearings when I bought the car, but if the price was right, I\'d be all over some sealed. the shaq ones seem to be pretty low-grade...'),(17541,'6a51f6939a','were you moving to?  You staying in same area?\r\n\r\n  I fucking hate movie lol I did it this summer and still living out of boxes for alot of teh shit.  I hate to pack and hate to unpack lol'),(17543,'175c6d3e54','what, sealed bearings? I got the shaq bearings when I bought the car, but if the price was right, I\'d be all over some sealed. the shaq ones seem to be pretty low-grade...'),(17596,'5a3d8618c2','Hey there you are! :-) I was starting to wonder.\r\n\r\nAnyways. That CyborgZero guy came up with this voltage bypass mod. It picks the SE up quite a bit, but it\'s not quite what I hoped. I\'m starting to wonder if microamp\'s claims are exagerated.\r\n\r\nSo everyone was supposed to get video together of an uphill test to compare cyborgzero\'s mod to micro-amp\'s. I was testing it off and on over the period of about 30-40 min. The FETs got really hot, but it was still working when I shut it off. The next time I picked it up it was dead. So I think I burnt something out. I had no more SEs left to test with, so I had to wait a month and a half to get another. I just got the Chevelle 4 days ago, and just put my last set of FETs in yesterday. So it\'s kinda ironic you showed back up now. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo far this car is still working. It will pull a 3.4 with red gears, but it\'s still sluggish for my taste, but with 12:1 gearing, it works pretty good.\r\n\r\ndave'),(17546,'f2fc2d9db8','i bought almost everything when i got the car. put in the awd and the bearings 2 nights ago. still on the alkalines i put in it when i got it 3 nights ago. i also got the IC3\'s and charger and stage 2, but havent opened the IC3\'s yet, and i\'m polishing the heatsink before i mess with the stage 2\'s... bought a cordless dremel mini-mite at wal-mart yesterday for stuff like that(and of course bit choppin\').\r\nmy tax return finally came and i\'m on a major buying binge...\r\nwhen i do my toy east order i\'m gonna grab a few of those escalation motors that sessiz is always talkin\' about... they\'re only like 5 or 6 bucks and he says the only thing faster he has is the custom wound mini-z motor he paid like 50 bucks for.. so that seems more than worth looking into.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19004,'b1b80e4d88','Well im not very sure i can buy it but i am intersted in buying ur clone that u have posted for sale or trade, how much would u want for it/ what would u want to trade for it\r\n\r\nSky'),(17549,'04e9b0e151','Yo white boy :grin: \r\n\r\nThe mat has special price for board members of $39.99 plus shipping = $49.99.. Costs everyone else about $62\r\n\r\nYou can pay me by paypal if you are interested\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTB'),(17550,'52e9c2bf18','Hmm ill think about it haha im hispanic hahaa \r\n\r\npeace'),(17551,'f2fc2d9db8','i bought almost everything when i got the car. put in the awd and the bearings 2 nights ago. still on the alkalines i put in it when i got it 3 nights ago. i also got the IC3\'s and charger and stage 2, but havent opened the IC3\'s yet, and i\'m polishing the heatsink before i mess with the stage 2\'s... bought a cordless dremel mini-mite at wal-mart yesterday for stuff like that(and of course bit choppin\').\r\nmy tax return finally came and i\'m on a major buying binge...\r\nwhen i do my toy east order i\'m gonna grab a few of those escalation motors that sessiz is always talkin\' about... they\'re only like 5 or 6 bucks and he says the only thing faster he has is the custom wound mini-z motor he paid like 50 bucks for.. so that seems more than worth looking into.'),(17698,'55c4fa9a34','[quote:55c4fa9a34=\"Son_Gokou\"]Hey dude, sorry to hear about the fuckers that stole your stuff. Just remember, don\'t let them get away with the thought and fact that they did this. Hell, kill them if it gets the point across.\r\n\r\nOh, and BTW, congrats on 6000th post. ;)[/quote:55c4fa9a34]s\'all good - the world\'s round, it\'ll come back to them :wink:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17554,'4d68a7cbd6','HAHA thats what we did to.....it was summer so we had a garage sale when the house was empty and just called charity for everything that was left lol\r\n\r\n  You still find time to play with the bits or xmod?'),(17555,'4d68a7cbd6','HAHA thats what we did to.....it was summer so we had a garage sale when the house was empty and just called charity for everything that was left lol\r\n\r\n  You still find time to play with the bits or xmod?'),(17558,'cae7c55e09','[quote:cae7c55e09=\"hogjowlz\"]i was rockin the xmod last weekend a little bit. the new pad has all wood floors so forsure once i unpack.[/quote:cae7c55e09]\r\n\r\n  Nice yea I have hardwood in my new place its cool.\r\n\r\n  I haven\'t done much with the xmod just added suspention/2nd stage motors/body kit &amp; tires\r\n\r\n\r\n  I just ordered bearings and the light set in'),(17559,'51df643139','Well I got the links page up, so if you get a moment stop on by and let me know what you think.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nripper77777777\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com'),(17560,'cae7c55e09','[quote:cae7c55e09=\"hogjowlz\"]i was rockin the xmod last weekend a little bit. the new pad has all wood floors so forsure once i unpack.[/quote:cae7c55e09]\r\n\r\n  Nice yea I have hardwood in my new place its cool.\r\n\r\n  I haven\'t done much with the xmod just added suspention/2nd stage motors/body kit &amp; tires\r\n\r\n\r\n  I just ordered bearings and the light set in');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21924,'98f90209a3','Allright, I\'ll take the second way....\r\n\r\nmy dad\'s paypal email is gurmitbatra@hotmail.com'),(17563,'89ec5632c5','yea I am thinking the AWD kit next\r\n\r\n  Or doign a 5/6 cell upgrade if I can find a good tut on it.'),(17564,'89ec5632c5','yea I am thinking the AWD kit next\r\n\r\n  Or doign a 5/6 cell upgrade if I can find a good tut on it.'),(17568,'30138fb781','the light kit is the one thing i forgot to get... i regretted not getting it as soon as i got home... i\'m going back to the waterfront soon to go to lowes for some home improvin\' stuff, i\'ll just grab it then. i think the shack down there just recently restocked because they had everything... and lots of it. i also picked up the hemi \'cuda/boss mustang pack for my SE the night i got all of my X-mod stuff. \r\nwhen i put everything on the counter and the guy started ringing me up and he got to the IC3\'s he was like \"the x-mod batteries are only like $25\", and i was like \"the only reason i want to have to come back here is if you sell me a dud car\" and he just goes \"you ain\'t playin around then, are you?\"... i just smile...\"no, not at all\"\r\nby the way, which car do you got? i got the blue civic 8-)'),(17569,'30138fb781','the light kit is the one thing i forgot to get... i regretted not getting it as soon as i got home... i\'m going back to the waterfront soon to go to lowes for some home improvin\' stuff, i\'ll just grab it then. i think the shack down there just recently restocked because they had everything... and lots of it. i also picked up the hemi \'cuda/boss mustang pack for my SE the night i got all of my X-mod stuff. \r\nwhen i put everything on the counter and the guy started ringing me up and he got to the IC3\'s he was like \"the x-mod batteries are only like $25\", and i was like \"the only reason i want to have to come back here is if you sell me a dud car\" and he just goes \"you ain\'t playin around then, are you?\"... i just smile...\"no, not at all\"\r\nby the way, which car do you got? i got the blue civic 8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17572,'edd80346e9','i\'ll hafta let 219 know... it was between the skyline and the black civic for him, i just got the blue civic because it seems like the least popular of the bunch.....'),(17573,'edd80346e9','i\'ll hafta let 219 know... it was between the skyline and the black civic for him, i just got the blue civic because it seems like the least popular of the bunch.....'),(33020,'3e0959f38b','Since your the alloy man..I was wondering if I can still get some alloys from anywhere...hit me up soon.\r\n\r\n\r\nLater for now \r\n\r\n\r\nwsupra'),(17577,'51df643139','Well I got the links page up, so if you get a moment stop on by and let me know what you think.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nripper77777777\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com'),(24400,'41d3b54d0a','Greetings, \r\nI got a link to your site from payaso, a regular member here.\r\nHe and I are members of bannedr/c.com\r\nAnyway, I am from Belleville, IL. (I noticed you were from StLouis)\r\nI got this x-mod for my step-son who isn\'t the least bit interested. I want to sell it to buy more parts for my Savage. However, the rukes of your site state something about having 50 posts. I do not. Since I am not really into the micros, I do not frequent this forum. I just figured someone into the micros might realize a good deal rather than e-bay for such a small priced item. More trouble that it\'s worth if y\'ask me.\r\nThis x-mod has the stage two motors, and the steering /suspension upgrades. Several tires and wheels and various body parts. I have made it run a couple of times but that\'s it. I traded an old Notro Rustler for this x-mod. \r\nYour help and advice in this matter would be appreciated. I am 39 years old with no intentions of mistreating anyone in any way about this x-mod.\r\nIf you\'d rather, my e-mail is: jonrcoats@hotmail.com\r\n\r\nThanks'),(17579,'6091956407','[quote:6091956407=\"Whitesupra35\"]Hi i juss joined umm I have a tip to go in teh articles so do I send it to you or what ??[/quote:6091956407]uhh... post it in the forum in the proper forum catagory. the moderators will review / read it - if it\'s decided to be used, we\'ll ask for your permission.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17580,'3515505ef2','koo....ok thanx alot'),(17581,'3515505ef2','koo....ok thanx alot'),(35656,'eefc1c235c','I just got into putting body kits onto my bits and I was wondering Do you use credit card? Does it go on the outside of the bumper or under it, like where the bumper ends (incase you didnt get what i said) What do I use to keep it on? What do you use?\r\n\r\nWell if you could help me out :D\r\n\r\nThanks In Advance'),(17584,'869edf6b17','Hey dude how things going?\r\n\r\n  Man I have been away alittle to long for my likin.....\r\n\r\n Damn work has me over worked I think its fucking killing me.\r\n\r\n  Well just checking in :)\r\n\r\nhey ever figure out Micro Amps se thing.\r\n\r\nPete'),(21214,'51c43ab3f2','Hey CW just thought I would drop you  a line as I feel bad I have not been around in awhile.\r\n\r\n  Things have been really crazy with work (now that I am not on perental leave anymore :( ) and we are opening a new store and dumping a ton of cash into it.\r\n\r\n  Also got a new car thats taking alot of my cash I guess I shouldnt have got the TT maybe should have went with the 350Z as they are alot cheaper.\r\n\r\n  Anyway I plan to be around more now that I have net access at work now.\r\n\r\nPete \r\n\r\nVooDoo'),(25367,'cc2680e879','I justed wanted to say thanks Sessiz for not being an ass to me. No one knows this but I am physically hadicapped. I can\'t type and I can barely ply with my rcs. I just wanted to say thanks for not being an ass to me when I was a douche bag in the Nov. 2 post. I use a voice program to type for me and that is why I ramble and the program isn\'t accurate and that is why there are speeling mistakes. I have a wasting disease but the docotrs are close to having it under control. You don\'t know how much it meant to me when your weren\'t a jerk to me like everyone else always is. Thank you! And sorry to be a problem.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17707,'ede6b05a89','[quote:ede6b05a89=\"ripper7777777\"]Cool, I will try to keep it simple and yet pimpin....lol\r\n\r\nI was wondering if you would mind if I asked some of your members if I could add there car pics to My gallery, I have a gallery of the Best of the Best.  They could of course leave in any bit pimp signs.  This gallery would be very selective and I would be the only judge, basically it would be a gallery of cars that made me take a second look.  I would like to have cars from all the forums and anywhere.\r\n\r\n\r\nLater\r\n\r\nripper7777777[/quote:ede6b05a89]go ahead ask them - their pictures are their property - we only protect the ones we actually host here on our site.'),(17588,'777ae67a54','[quote:777ae67a54=\"hogjowlz\"]well i busted both mirrors off the skyline within 48hours.[/quote:777ae67a54]\r\nDang. I really need to mess with the stage 2\'s. I\'m still babying mine... that\'ll surely pass. I\'ll probably throw a fit the first time I damage the body, and then it\'ll pretty much be anything goes. I\'m always like that with new stuff.'),(17592,'d6e7c72144','[quote:d6e7c72144=\"Whitesupra35\"]koo....ok thanx alot[/quote:d6e7c72144]no problem pimp :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17695,'9c781fdc9d','Hey dude, sorry to hear about the fuckers that stole your stuff. Just remember, don\'t let them get away with the thought and fact that they did this. Hell, kill them if it gets the point across.\r\n\r\nOh, and BTW, congrats on 6000th post. ;)'),(17696,'55c4fa9a34','[quote:55c4fa9a34=\"Son_Gokou\"]Hey dude, sorry to hear about the fuckers that stole your stuff. Just remember, don\'t let them get away with the thought and fact that they did this. Hell, kill them if it gets the point across.\r\n\r\nOh, and BTW, congrats on 6000th post. ;)[/quote:55c4fa9a34]s\'all good - the world\'s round, it\'ll come back to them :wink:'),(17697,'ada0f45243','Yea I have contacted him and Monouk added a script to our front page to break out of the url trap.  I told him if he is going to have links then he needs to warn people that the url is being trapped and that the pop-ups are his.  I also told him if he wants to remain friendly I suggest he ask before he does anything.  As far as the tutorials I told him that they will have to be removed and that I will notify him when I have decided what he can post, but for the moment he can either leave my work as it is or he can remove it.  What I\'m thinking is I will allow him to link to the front page and thats it, no links to the forum or the How to pages, until he moves his site to a host that does not trap urls.  This kid really pissed me off but I\'m trying to hold my temper, it just burned me the way he listed the other sites by name but refered to R7R as Our Forums, if he complies and is a good boy I will allow him to remain part of R7R.\r\n\r\n\r\nLater\r\nRipper7777777'),(17611,'d1c553b00c','Damn... that sux. I wish I could help... I\'m really in no position but I will try to think of possible shit you could do...');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17613,'2b7282a404','Thanks, I\'ve tried appling to a couple of places online for a loan without any luck, I\'d try more of them, but most of those kind of sites scare me.'),(17615,'165632dec0','[quote:165632dec0=\"hogjowlz\"]how old are you guys? i thought ya was little kids at first.[/quote:165632dec0]\r\nha. i love it. that\'s the shit. i\'m 29 about to be 30 in like 2 months, my name\'s Jay, hence the Bird... sg219 is like 27 or so, and the sg is for the name of our old crew back in the day... and he has a wierd fixation on the number 219.. his name\'s Mike. I don\'t drink but I surely smoke... the drinkin\' was gettin\' in the way of my enjoying of the smoking, and i\'m a lightweight as far as drinking goes(puker). 219 is down for whatever and is hilarious when he\'s all hammered. at least I think he\'s hilarious, I might just be baked, no, my lady says he\'s hilarious. anyway, thats us, what\'s up with you?'),(17616,'db96811f3f','That would be about my target area.  $300, is just about right.  I have to wait to see where I move before I buy a computer.  I\'m stuck on where I\'m going yet, I have to be out by the end of the month.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17617,'bf4ebef10c','I hear that... plus your credits more fucked up than mine, aint it?'),(17619,'62c7acaacf','Way more, I\'m sure.'),(17623,'83e34966b8','Mine should be comin\' back around to being better in a couple of years.  Still need some major things to drop off.'),(17621,'7d52a29486','i remember back in the day you sayin your credit was all fucked....\r\ni fucked mine up pretty good over the last few years.'),(17631,'a90640e09d','puffins, lol. no, pretty far from monroeville... from parkway east take either homestead or swissvale exit... or from southside out carson st. to homestead, a little past. The \"mon valley\" they call this area... bunch of old ghosty run down steel mill towns along the mon.... the only thing this area has going for it is Kennywood Park.'),(25468,'147ef86a39','Are you still alive pimp? I sent you a message not too long ago. I wanted to know if you got the Audi SE yet?'),(25470,'1bf83589f7','Thanks man, I\'ve been lookin\' all over for my pint-sized Homie.\r\n\r\nHere\'s my address...\r\n\r\nMat Mathey\r\n3104 SE 39th Avenue\r\nPortland, Oregon 97202\r\n\r\nThanks again, DT!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17635,'b82627a7c2','Well glad the testing still going on.\r\n\r\n  I never really liked micro amps and his antics but what can you do.  Info shoul dbe free unless you plan on takin over the world or something.\r\n\r\n Oh well My SE doesn\'t get much play really just the normal ZZ\'s and the epochs and xmods other then that its strait bits'),(17636,'72dd5c0457','ya, i\'ve been jaded on kennywood since like the 8th grade... it\'s kinda lame growing up that close to an amusement park. 219\'s parents live like right across the highway from kennywood, and he worked there for years. my dad\'s house is close enough to hear the screaming, but not too close.\r\ncedar point\'s the one near sandusky, huh? i got alot of family around cleveland, i think geauga lake is near them...'),(17637,'adc7da7ef1','I still have some of them left.  Are you still interested?  I just need a zip/postal code and city for accurate S&amp;H.  Just get back to me if interested.'),(17639,'b82627a7c2','Well glad the testing still going on.\r\n\r\n  I never really liked micro amps and his antics but what can you do.  Info shoul dbe free unless you plan on takin over the world or something.\r\n\r\n Oh well My SE doesn\'t get much play really just the normal ZZ\'s and the epochs and xmods other then that its strait bits');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21205,'5ea78f7d3a','No prob at all J, I am lax like you too.  No hurry and thanks for the extras, they will go to good use. :-)'),(23214,'d667980941','oh i\'m supposed to tell any1 who got banned if u wanna com eback just email admin at info@rcmod.com and he said he would be cool about it.\r\n\r\nhe gets letters from the corporate lawyers and he starts stressing so he just bans every1 lol'),(21207,'0bd729bbf3','Yea I have had more time with the z\'s and xmods then bits as we just paved the parking lot at the new store so we race almost every night from 2am till about 4 am lol.\r\n\r\n  You still use you xmod?'),(21209,'1453930496','my xmod is in da garage for now. i got an iwaver to.'),(23247,'3d274c0fd4','you can access it here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/admin/\r\n\r\nyou\'ll be prompted to login.\r\nusername: bitpimps\r\npassword: n00dl3s\r\n\r\nyou\'ll then need to choose your name: hogjowlz\r\nand enter your password: p005layer\r\n\r\nlet me know if you have any troubles.'),(21212,'279004b14b','I was thinking of getting one of those but not sure on the performance.\r\n\r\n  Hey I have a Q.  I have a fetted, duel cell ZZ.  When its on teh charger everything works fine when its off it does nothing.\r\n\r\n  All teh wires look ok, could it just be the cells?\r\n\r\n  You have any parts or anything you are getting rid of.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (27930,'07c5e38ad7','Yo, if you haven\'t already bought an AM set for me, put it on hold. I bought on on the bay. If however, you have already picked one up, I will live up to my end and it from you. I bet you haven\'t even been online in lately. You been busy with the little one I\'m sure. Last time I\'ll bug you about this.\r\n\r\nHope all is well, and your getting some sleep.  :)'),(17641,'ab4b565721','[quote:ab4b565721=\"VooDooMafia\"]Well glad the testing still going on.\r\n\r\n  I never really liked micro amps and his antics but what can you do.  Info shoul dbe free unless you plan on takin over the world or something.\r\n\r\n Oh well My SE doesn\'t get much play really just the normal ZZ\'s and the epochs and xmods other then that its strait bits[/quote:ab4b565721]Yeah, I think we got it. Because micro_amps did say it was like a FET modded bit, with twice the weight. Which leads me to believe, even his mod is not quite up to par. Also he states the top speed he\'s gotton out of his cars, but does not say how long it takes to reach that speed. \r\n\r\nI race in a tight track, so I\'m disappointed with the punch, even after all the improvement. But still I really believe this is as good as what mAs has done, so I\'m gonna go ahead and write the tutorial, with a special warning that extreme circumstances, like the wheels being held at a dead stop for extended periods, may cause damage to the car.\r\n\r\nWhen I was doing the uphill test the FET modded bit flew up a 45 degree incline, the FET modded SE struggled to make any forward motion at all, but at least kept the wheels spinning a little.\r\n\r\nI\'d really love to see what one of mA\'s cars do in such extreme conditions. I really believe he\'s hyped up his mod to make a sale.\r\n\r\nCheck out this thread where he sent one of his lackies over to promote him.:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3421\r\n\r\nI shot him down though. I\'m not gonna be havin\' mA trying to charge people for the stupid easy ass steering fix, especially when I believe it doesn\'t work properly.\r\n\r\nI\'m tellin\' ya though, you just might want to get one of the new SEs. No jitter in the steering, 7 steps in both direction, and it returns to center everytime, and punch is better than the first run of SEs, even with FETs in them. I belive they are using improved transistors, as the PCB has only been reworked in the steering area. The drive train is the same, but the transistors have different markings.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSo you almost done training? I\'ve been kinda bored lately, don\'t care for this new crowd as much.\r\n\r\nDave'),(17642,'0edb9112e6','Yea I might pick up one fo the new SE\'s on cause they are muscle cars :)\r\n\r\n  It will just get sent off to your though for fetting lol.\r\n\r\n  Hey have you fetted you xmod or anything? I want to do a 5/6 cell mod but have not found a good tut yet on it.\r\n\r\n  As for training well thats done but I just got moved to another new position so I have been learing about that.\r\n\r\n  Do you still have cox? every time someone called to say that we sucked I was wondering hmmmmmm :???:   was that dave lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17643,'0edb9112e6','Yea I might pick up one fo the new SE\'s on cause they are muscle cars :)\r\n\r\n  It will just get sent off to your though for fetting lol.\r\n\r\n  Hey have you fetted you xmod or anything? I want to do a 5/6 cell mod but have not found a good tut yet on it.\r\n\r\n  As for training well thats done but I just got moved to another new position so I have been learing about that.\r\n\r\n  Do you still have cox? every time someone called to say that we sucked I was wondering hmmmmmm :???:   was that dave lol'),(21204,'6dc811fbb3','good deal finks i need someone to keep me in-line :-D  good news though!\r\n\r\n I just got back from the post office and u should be getting them thursday.\r\ni also sent u a mini cooper body that i was not going to do anything with, and about 3 feet of cat 5 ethernet cable, for the antenna swaps.\r\n\r\ni did some cleaning up of the flashings of the casted bodies, there was an air bubble here and there that i filled, but they are real nice, especially the single cab. \r\n\r\ndude i feel like an ass hole since i talked shiat about you being  slow on sending me the funds for the last deal and now i totally did the same ass thing. :x  so again jesse i am truly sorry and i hope that we can be cool and deal with again.\r\n\r\njmays'),(17645,'5de7a0527e','[quote:5de7a0527e=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yea I might pick up one fo the new SE\'s on cause they are muscle cars :)\r\n\r\n  It will just get sent off to your though for fetting lol.\r\n\r\n  Hey have you fetted you xmod or anything? I want to do a 5/6 cell mod but have not found a good tut yet on it.\r\n\r\n  As for training well thats done but I just got moved to another new position so I have been learing about that.\r\n\r\n  Do you still have cox? every time someone called to say that we sucked I was wondering hmmmmmm :???:   was that dave lol[/quote:5de7a0527e]I never got around to doing anything with my xmod. It\'s too big, it just sits there. I did re-paint it so it would look better sitting there.  :lol: \r\n\r\nYep we still gots da Cox. I don\'t know why everyone disses them. It\'s reliable service, almost never goes out. I\'m a satisfied Cox customer. :-) \r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17646,'34dd539472','well the ppl that really diss them are the ones that download alot of pay for teh ultra service.\r\n\r\n  Its like 79.95 a month and we put a cap on the amout of dl\'s and ul\'s.\r\n\r\n  One thing for sure I feel sorry for American high speed customers no matter what company as I feel they charge you guys way to much for the service.\r\n\r\n  Hey I still have the controller for that se do you have any use for it?'),(17647,'572aa8b94d','Hey thought I\'d notify you of a little thing\r\n\r\nhttp://www.rctuners.tk\r\n\r\nCheck the links page, it seems everything in this site stays under his url, kind of makes it look like he has one big super rc network.\r\n\r\nThought you\'d like to know.\r\n\r\n\r\nripper7777777'),(17649,'572aa8b94d','Hey thought I\'d notify you of a little thing\r\n\r\nhttp://www.rctuners.tk\r\n\r\nCheck the links page, it seems everything in this site stays under his url, kind of makes it look like he has one big super rc network.\r\n\r\nThought you\'d like to know.\r\n\r\n\r\nripper7777777'),(17651,'3a84fbdb27','[quote:3a84fbdb27=\"ripper7777777\"]Hey thought I\'d notify you of a little thing\r\n\r\nhttp://www.rctuners.tk\r\n\r\nCheck the links page, it seems everything in this site stays under his url, kind of makes it look like he has one big super rc network.\r\n\r\nThought you\'d like to know.\r\n\r\n\r\nripper7777777[/quote:3a84fbdb27]thanks for the heads up...\r\nthis kid is worthless - I\'ve been watching his posts here and they\'re absolutely worthless.\r\n\r\nanyways, I\'ll check in to it - thanks again for the heads up.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17652,'a451fe2092','I just noticed he\'s ripping us off with his tutorials, he gives credit but I never gave permission to post or link to that stuff.\r\n\r\nripper7777777'),(17653,'34dd539472','well the ppl that really diss them are the ones that download alot of pay for teh ultra service.\r\n\r\n  Its like 79.95 a month and we put a cap on the amout of dl\'s and ul\'s.\r\n\r\n  One thing for sure I feel sorry for American high speed customers no matter what company as I feel they charge you guys way to much for the service.\r\n\r\n  Hey I still have the controller for that se do you have any use for it?'),(21200,'86b7ecf876','hmm cj is about to order a buncha alloy parts for the xmod(gpm). ive been more into zipzaps lately. \r\n\r\nstill mostly the same crew up in hurr so dont feel bad brother. we all gota take a vacation from pimpin once in a while. radioshaq is off the hook lately with what theyve been comin out with.\r\n\r\nand ya i still owe ya some cars.'),(21201,'a3ecd17da7','hey man should be through in next few days.. waiting for money to get into account for paypal... just wondering if u still got them mini-t bearings  if u dont want them ill pay you want u payed for them (need a set for my T) and i also need a new frount upper deck for the xmod got a spare one.. hows  3 bux USD for one');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21203,'ac66105dd0','[quote:ac66105dd0=\"Finks\"]Actually just got a PM from CW saying to Paypal you OR Send cash to him.  So I\'ll send the cash to him if that makes sence to you.[/quote:ac66105dd0]Yeah, that\'d be better. I wasn\'t thinkin\' when I gave you my address. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(17655,'a451fe2092','I just noticed he\'s ripping us off with his tutorials, he gives credit but I never gave permission to post or link to that stuff.\r\n\r\nripper7777777'),(17656,'2a45b669b8','[quote:2a45b669b8=\"VooDooMafia\"]well the ppl that really diss them are the ones that download alot of pay for teh ultra service.\r\n\r\n  Its like 79.95 a month and we put a cap on the amout of dl\'s and ul\'s.\r\n\r\n  One thing for sure I feel sorry for American high speed customers no matter what company as I feel they charge you guys way to much for the service.\r\n\r\n  Hey I still have the controller for that se do you have any use for it?[/quote:2a45b669b8]Yeah see that\'s the thing, we pay 39.95 a month+ modem rental (forget what that is), and we\'re getting 200-250kbs, up or down. Other DSL services that we tried and actually cost more, were only giving us 75-100kbs up or down, then they down graded it, and we were getting 25-35 down, and only 13kbs up. That\'s when we switched to Cox, and we realize there\'s faster, and also cheaper, but for what\'s available in our area, I think it\'s the fastest for the price. \r\n\r\nNah, I don\'t need that SE controller, I have several by this point. Keep it, I\'m gonna make a tutorial on a stand alone charger for the SE, you can use it for that.\r\n\r\ndave'),(17657,'66d56b9e0b','Cool cool yea I willbe busy reading up on all the shit I missed the last little bit.\r\n\r\n  As for the speed and shit yea we are fast but here in Canada I pay $50.00 a month and get unlimited Up/downloads.  I dl at 400kbs and upload at 200kbs so thats the only reason I say its expensive there.\r\n\r\n\r\n   Hey I was wondering when you have more fets in can I send you a se to get fetted and some alloys to be mounted?  if so let me know how much and shit');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17658,'66d56b9e0b','Cool cool yea I willbe busy reading up on all the shit I missed the last little bit.\r\n\r\n  As for the speed and shit yea we are fast but here in Canada I pay $50.00 a month and get unlimited Up/downloads.  I dl at 400kbs and upload at 200kbs so thats the only reason I say its expensive there.\r\n\r\n\r\n   Hey I was wondering when you have more fets in can I send you a se to get fetted and some alloys to be mounted?  if so let me know how much and shit'),(23213,'976e09617c','i was lmao and so was admin, but he has to kiss the corporate sponsors butts now so that\'s why he was upset. every thing is cool between all of us and you guys and admin and cabo and every body else so that\'s it.'),(21198,'28e63463ab','Yea I plan to.\r\n\r\n  I just got new net access at work so I can log on from there and my store is right beside work so I can now connect there using works access lol.\r\n\r\n  You got any xmod parts or anything for sale?\r\n\r\n  Man feels weird being gone for so long never know what the mood is like.'),(17660,'d6893018d5','[quote:d6893018d5=\"VooDooMafia\"]Cool cool yea I willbe busy reading up on all the shit I missed the last little bit.\r\n\r\n  As for the speed and shit yea we are fast but here in Canada I pay $50.00 a month and get unlimited Up/downloads.  I dl at 400kbs and upload at 200kbs so thats the only reason I say its expensive there.\r\n\r\n\r\n   Hey I was wondering when you have more fets in can I send you a se to get fetted and some alloys to be mounted?  if so let me know how much and shit[/quote:d6893018d5]Sure I\'d be glad to do the mods for ya. I couldn\'t charge you though, I owe you for the SE killed.  :lol: \r\n\r\nRight now, I got something special planned for the moderators contest. I don\'t know if you know about that, but the pimps put together some really kickass prizes for a contest for us mods. Being the newest mod on the block, I feel obligated to give them something really special. So I\'ve got some stuff I\'ve got to order before I get more FETs. I was planning to get more FET around or before May.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17661,'c887f9a046','I sent this to Cabowabo but I know hes busy so here you go.\r\n\r\nHey thought I\'d notify you of a little thing\r\n\r\nhttp://www.rctuners.tk\r\n\r\nCheck the links page, it seems everything in this site stays under his url, kind of makes it look like he has one big super rc network.\r\n\r\nThought you\'d like to know.\r\n\r\n\r\nripper7777777'),(17663,'cffaaf0fe5','Thanx Pimp!  I\'ll cruise thru his hood..... :cool:'),(37334,'ce84b0408c','[quote:ce84b0408c=\"SHAUN\"]Would you be a moderater on my forum. I\'m thinkin your gonna say no cause i dont think ya like me.[/quote:ce84b0408c]\r\n\r\nShow me the site first. :-o \r\n\r\nSend me the link.'),(34971,'09646e0e46','thats cool is ther any threads that ever went on a bout them? wish it were a civic though. :-?'),(37904,'70262bd5ca','It\'s about 20 :shock:  Could I use Flash to edit it? I could cut it down a bit, and add a screen shot with title. It\'s been a while since I\'ve used flash, but I have it. I think I may have Adobe Premier....I\'ll have to look for the disc.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?'),(37618,'fc0e5351b3','Hey Betty.k\r\n\r\nDamn, i shouldve Pmed you before saying what i did about the Nelly info. As we both know SporTrac is a pretty experienced modder, i don\'t think his install was wrong, but maybe a problem in the woah nelly itself? So maybe Ph2t won\'t ask you to pay for it? Anyways, sorry about that.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33865,'82c01c9220','[quote:82c01c9220=\"arfin\"]Gonna take a shower first tho, be on in 20 please. :D  :cool:[/quote:82c01c9220]\r\n\r\n\r\nBe on in 20min? here? Okay, or Gamespy?\r\n\r\nRemember to put me on your buddy list via gamespy.\r\nThat way, we\'ll know if eachother is online and even what sever we\'re in.\r\n\r\nDave'),(34648,'250ea68294','for sure! on this one though:\r\n\r\nassyrian_king104@hotmail.com'),(33877,'a34d4d2274','[quote:a34d4d2274=\"arfin\"]Hey feel like playin or no? I\'ll leave it up to you this time. :D[/quote:a34d4d2274]\r\n\r\nwoah, hey dude!!! up alrready? how much did ya drink?\r\nhow do you feel? lolol\r\n\r\ni left messages for ya on gamespy...my connection was bad, i kept losing it cuz of the neighbors cars parked in front of their house, they had some friends over or something.\r\n\r\nHell yeah, give me a little bit here.....around 9:15 perhaps?'),(31812,'88cabae1c3','Hey i was just wanting to say thanks for that Import racer wheel mod for zipzaps. I did it yesterday and it looks pimp now. Heres a pic of it http://i2.photobucket.com/albums/y19/nitrorc2332/ZipZaps/37b06d44.jpg'),(31813,'345fad2fc5','Hehe, glad I could help, that rides looks like it\'s turning out well, and everyone knows, the shoes make the outfit  :grin:   Don\'t forget to floss that sucker once you feel it\'s ready.  Oh and thanks for the PM, it\'s always nice to know what you do helps other people out.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17668,'7487bf1918','just checking out your stuff...\r\nyou build this track?\r\nhttp://home.houston.rr.com/extremedesigns/micro2.html\r\n\r\nthat\'s god damn cool as all get out - looks great.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know if you would be interested or not, but in our main Galleries section - we allow some registered users to create their own \"albums\".\r\nI\'d like to help you showcase some of your work by offering you up some space in our bitPimps Crew Galleries.\r\n\r\nif you\'re interested, just let me know - you just have to register in the Galleries and then let me know when you do so I can give you the special permissions.\r\n\r\nif you\'re not interested, that\'s totally understandable - no hard feelings from this end.\r\n\r\n\r\nanyways, like what I see so far - hope to see if flourish in to something bigger. I\'ll toss you up in our links section.'),(17669,'b8e4cd65e2','A chance to show off my work in your gallery, of course I\'m interested, hell I\'d be honored, as soon as I get more tehn a passing moment at the computer I\'ll register, git the inlaws over for the day   :-(  :-D \r\n\r\nWell I\'ll let you know when I register.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nripper7777777'),(17670,'097e0d88d1','I almost forgot I got jac to clean up his links, he said it was his host doing that which I believe but it was him that told people he was an R7R affiliate or really that we had affiliated with him and it was him acting like R7R was an rctuners forum.....kids.\r\n\r\nI also told him he will have to remove the tutorials, I\'m going to let him link to my How to page but thats it, he has swiped alot of bit pimp stuff so you might want to talk to him about it.\r\n\r\nlater\r\nripper7777777');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17671,'b8e4cd65e2','A chance to show off my work in your gallery, of course I\'m interested, hell I\'d be honored, as soon as I get more tehn a passing moment at the computer I\'ll register, git the inlaws over for the day   :-(  :-D \r\n\r\nWell I\'ll let you know when I register.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nripper7777777'),(17672,'097e0d88d1','I almost forgot I got jac to clean up his links, he said it was his host doing that which I believe but it was him that told people he was an R7R affiliate or really that we had affiliated with him and it was him acting like R7R was an rctuners forum.....kids.\r\n\r\nI also told him he will have to remove the tutorials, I\'m going to let him link to my How to page but thats it, he has swiped alot of bit pimp stuff so you might want to talk to him about it.\r\n\r\nlater\r\nripper7777777'),(17673,'a874af46f3','Once again you\'ve impressed the fuck out of me with your music taste my friend....I am a big MLWTTKK fan......I would never buy drugs...... me and the misses filed for divorce last week...its all good...don\'t feel bad.....I\'m moving as soon as I can find a place, after that...I\'m off on Sundays, Mondays, and Tuesdays....so I\'m coming for a weird weekend.....I\'m either crashing in your garage or you need to hook me up with the # for the cheapest, nastiest motel near you...lmao\r\n\r\n\r\np.s. I am a true pimp....one of my prospective future thangs is 19 ....and shes down with it .....damn.....I feel like the most lecherous 30 year old I know.....  :lol:'),(17674,'a874af46f3','Once again you\'ve impressed the fuck out of me with your music taste my friend....I am a big MLWTTKK fan......I would never buy drugs...... me and the misses filed for divorce last week...its all good...don\'t feel bad.....I\'m moving as soon as I can find a place, after that...I\'m off on Sundays, Mondays, and Tuesdays....so I\'m coming for a weird weekend.....I\'m either crashing in your garage or you need to hook me up with the # for the cheapest, nastiest motel near you...lmao\r\n\r\n\r\np.s. I am a true pimp....one of my prospective future thangs is 19 ....and shes down with it .....damn.....I feel like the most lecherous 30 year old I know.....  :lol:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17675,'d9c21aada5','[quote:d9c21aada5=\"Havok\"]Once again you\'ve impressed the fuck out of me with your music taste my friend....I am a big MLWTTKK fan......I would never buy drugs...... me and the misses filed for divorce last week...its all good...don\'t feel bad.....I\'m moving as soon as I can find a place, after that...I\'m off on Sundays, Mondays, and Tuesdays....so I\'m coming for a weird weekend.....I\'m either crashing in your garage or you need to hook me up with the # for the cheapest, nastiest motel near you...lmao\r\n\r\n\r\np.s. I am a true pimp....one of my prospective future thangs is 19 ....and shes down with it .....damn.....I feel like the most lecherous 30 year old I know.....  :lol:[/quote:d9c21aada5]lmfao - dude you crack me up.\r\naight, I know it\'s probably for the better for you, but I can\'t help but to say \"I\'m sorry and I feel for you\" - I know no matter what, it\'s gotta be tough - me and the wife have been on the verge since day 1 and dance on the line all the time - that\'s no way to live either and we both know it - somethings gotta change.\r\nanyways, you\'re not the only pimp - there\'s more of us than you think - there\'s more pimps getting a divorce this year than you could count on 1 hand. you\'re not alone - your bro\'s are with ya and will be here for ya whenever.\r\n\r\naight, enough with the gay shit and on to the cool shit....\r\n\r\nyou\'re a fucking hero and pervert all in one - how can you not love that? lol\r\na 19 y/o? I\'ve come to realize that age means nothing when it comes to chicks except potential for a better body and a tad less nagging. lol\r\nother than that - they all stay 9 years old for life :wink:\r\n\r\nwell this isn\'t the best time for me, I\'m about to lose my job in about 3 weeks - which will probably result in me losing my house and car (major down-grading) and a sorted life for awhile, but I know I can hook you up some how.\r\ngive me a time frame.\r\nif you come soon - you could stay at my house for a few days and a hotel for a few days. there\'s all kinds of hotels around here. in bad spots you can pay by the hour - it\'s kinda far from me. on average at a hotel near me, you\'re going to pay around 30 - 40 a night.\r\nfor around here it\'s a pretty good price. a lot of times they run deals and such so I\'m thinking between the time you stay here for free and the time you might have to stay at a hotel, you\'d pay around 100 (that\'s about 3 days on average at hotel around here).\r\n\r\nweed for me is fucking stupid expensive right now.\r\nI\'ve got over an ounce of shit that neither of us would prefer to smoke if you\'re desperate.\r\nother than that, my only source for the past 3 months is 185/oz. for just a hair about regular - tastes pretty good - nice stone, but pretty dry and tore up for the price - that\'s just the way it is around here right now :sad: \r\n\r\nI just got back from a slight vacation, and I\'m about ready to lose my job so I don\'t think I could take many days off, but you\'re a night owl anyways so you\'d be asleep and just waking by the time I got home from work. I stay up late - the grind has broke me a tad but not much.\r\n\r\n\r\njust make sure you give me details and we can work whatever out.\r\nI\'m sure I could make at least a few days of fun.'),(17676,'25acece827','Yo Pimp,\r\n\r\nMy work load has decreased, things have come together nicely so I\'m ready to administer the Ride-O-Da Week again, if that\'s cool wit U ??\r\n\r\nAlso I\'m gonna post in the moderators forum about ideas for the next Contest.  My shit here is bulging (prizes) and I gotta get rid of some shit.\r\nThe prizes that were suggested (offered) before still stands.\r\n\r\nPeace Out !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17678,'25acece827','Yo Pimp,\r\n\r\nMy work load has decreased, things have come together nicely so I\'m ready to administer the Ride-O-Da Week again, if that\'s cool wit U ??\r\n\r\nAlso I\'m gonna post in the moderators forum about ideas for the next Contest.  My shit here is bulging (prizes) and I gotta get rid of some shit.\r\nThe prizes that were suggested (offered) before still stands.\r\n\r\nPeace Out !'),(18471,'76a29c23c6','[quote:76a29c23c6=\"Son_Gokou\"]Ok, which FET is better than the other....IRF7389, or SI4562DY? You said that the 4562 isn\'t as better than the 7389 as thought...but it\'s still better, right? I mean, someone said that while it may have less amperage capability, it has lower resistance.....And that the IRF7389 has lower amperage capability, but it can handle that current continuously....\r\n\r\nSo, which is better and why?  :-( \r\n\r\nBTW I\'m back at MRCC, you may see me there as 100mph_Xmod.[/quote:76a29c23c6]\r\n\r\nMy testing has shown that the IRF7389 is better than the SI4562DY, period.   You get more torque from the IRF\'s than the SI\'s.   Even though people will say that the data shows the SI\'s to be better.  Real world tests show that the IRF\'s have a lesser resistance (Rds(on)) than the SI\'s.   This means that they can deliver more current to the motor.\r\n\r\nThe SI\'s can handle more current but that means squat in terms of performance.  IT\'s HOW much current the fets let though that determine performance.  Also, if you\'re stacking fets (which people do anyways) the less current handling by the IRF\'s isn\'t a problem anymore.......'),(17680,'2f369c69c7','No problem.  Just wanted to throw that back at you, for a reminder..  Its all good.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17681,'79ff919ab5','If you want motors, axles, gears and such, please visit my estore- http://ripper7racing.com/forums/index.php?showforum=48\r\non the forum-  www.ripper7racing.com'),(17703,'535cf146a3','Cool, I will try to keep it simple and yet pimpin....lol\r\n\r\nI was wondering if you would mind if I asked some of your members if I could add there car pics to My gallery, I have a gallery of the Best of the Best.  They could of course leave in any bit pimp signs.  This gallery would be very selective and I would be the only judge, basically it would be a gallery of cars that made me take a second look.  I would like to have cars from all the forums and anywhere.\r\n\r\n\r\nLater\r\n\r\nripper7777777'),(17684,'79a2924e62','Seems he\'s building his page off of the work, dedication, and skilz of others that have posted on various forums.  Basically rippin off shit to make his page.  Cabo has email\'d him about it, it\'s cool to reference the original posts on their respected forum but not to copy the article, post it on his page, then point to their respected origins.  I\'m gonna contact him also. \r\n\r\nHave you contacted him yet ?\r\n\r\nThanx again for the heads up !'),(18470,'d256d7196f','Ok, which FET is better than the other....IRF7389, or SI4562DY? You said that the 4562 isn\'t as better than the 7389 as thought...but it\'s still better, right? I mean, someone said that while it may have less amperage capability, it has lower resistance.....And that the IRF7389 has lower amperage capability, but it can handle that current continuously....\r\n\r\nSo, which is better and why?  :-( \r\n\r\nBTW I\'m back at MRCC, you may see me there as 100mph_Xmod.');
