w I can hook you up some how.\r\ngive me a time frame.\r\nif you come soon - you could stay at my house for a few days and a hotel for a few days. there\'s all kinds of hotels around here. in bad spots you can pay by the hour - it\'s kinda far from me. on average at a hotel near me, you\'re going to pay around 30 - 40 a night.\r\nfor around here it\'s a pretty good price. a lot of times they run deals and such so I\'m thinking between the time you stay here for free and the time you might have to stay at a hotel, you\'d pay around 100 (that\'s about 3 days on average at hotel around here).\r\n\r\nweed for me is fucking stupid expensive right now.\r\nI\'ve got over an ounce of shit that neither of us would prefer to smoke if you\'re desperate.\r\nother than that, my only source for the past 3 months is 185/oz. for just a hair about regular - tastes pretty good - nice stone, but pretty dry and tore up for the price - that\'s just the way it is around here right now :sad: \r\n\r\nI just got back from a slight vacation, and I\'m about ready to lose my job so I don\'t think I could take many days off, but you\'re a night owl anyways so you\'d be asleep and just waking by the time I got home from work. I stay up late - the grind has broke me a tad but not much.\r\n\r\n\r\njust make sure you give me details and we can work whatever out.\r\nI\'m sure I could make at least a few days of fun.'),(17704,'535cf146a3','Cool, I will try to keep it simple and yet pimpin....lol\r\n\r\nI was wondering if you would mind if I asked some of your members if I could add there car pics to My gallery, I have a gallery of the Best of the Best.  They could of course leave in any bit pimp signs.  This gallery would be very selective and I would be the only judge, basically it would be a gallery of cars that made me take a second look.  I would like to have cars from all the forums and anywhere.\r\n\r\n\r\nLater\r\n\r\nripper7777777');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17689,'4f0f63275a','Hey thanks for the heads up.  I\'ll check out the paper.  But I am tryin\'  to stay close to the job.  I work in the Waterfront in Homestead.  It doesnt\'t hurt to look. I don\'t have reliable transportation.  My car is ready to die, I give it 4-6 months.  Right now is such a bad time for me to have to move, its rediculous.'),(18330,'9b45174aa8','and why the hell aint you in the aim room yet?'),(18331,'57af6d0c54','Sup Pimp!\r\n\r\nYou have been gone a while.  The body modding material is called Styrene.\r\nI use 0.60 for the ground effects, and 0.30 &amp; 0.20 for various other mods.\r\nYou can usually find it at your LHS or you can order it from here....\r\n\r\nhttp://www.micromark.com/\r\n\r\n[i:57af6d0c54]These plastic sheets can be used for fabricating model structures, car bodies, airplane cowls, dollhouse and miniature furniture \'glass,\' windshields and other window glazing. Easily glued, they can also be vacuum formed to create specialized [/i:57af6d0c54]shapes.\r\n \r\n[b:57af6d0c54]Butyrate:[/b:57af6d0c54] Optically clear, easily cut, dimensionally stable. Great for model window glazing. \r\n \r\n[b:57af6d0c54]Styrene:[/b:57af6d0c54] Multipurpose high-strength opaque plastic. Excellent for structure walls and roofs.\r\n\r\n[b:57af6d0c54]Vivak:[/b:57af6d0c54] Multipurpose high-strength clear plastic. Use for forming airplane canopies.\r\n\r\n[b:57af6d0c54]Polycarbonate:[/b:57af6d0c54] An unbreakable, high-temperature plastic. Ideal for forming engine cowls'),(17694,'9c781fdc9d','Hey dude, sorry to hear about the fuckers that stole your stuff. Just remember, don\'t let them get away with the thought and fact that they did this. Hell, kill them if it gets the point across.\r\n\r\nOh, and BTW, congrats on 6000th post. ;)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17708,'1c5280170f','Thanks, I always like to ask first, its a respect thing, and like i said any Bit pimps signs in the photos are cool and I will make sure in the description to give full credit to the Bit pimps and the url.\r\n\r\nThanks again.\r\n\r\nLater\r\n\r\nRipper7777777'),(17709,'1c5280170f','Thanks, I always like to ask first, its a respect thing, and like i said any Bit pimps signs in the photos are cool and I will make sure in the description to give full credit to the Bit pimps and the url.\r\n\r\nThanks again.\r\n\r\nLater\r\n\r\nRipper7777777'),(17710,'65b3c8a7ee','Whats up?  I went apartment hunting/veiwing today and saw some real pieces of shit.  The money these people want for rent and what they give you now-a-days is fuckin\' retarded!!!!!!!!!'),(17714,'da114c658e','Ya, I know.....But theres not much I can do about it right now.  It sucks....I think I\'m gonna start taking some stuff over the parents house in the morning.  I have to get some stuff moved........I can\'t get a storage space till after payday.\r\n\r\n\r\nWish I was high... :bowdown:'),(17712,'132d428d00','thats why i bought a trailer... you cant even fix up piece of shit apts and houses... and if you can, you get no return on your money and labor in the end... i\'ll be here til i buy a house.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17905,'4ed1cc49a1','HOly shit this is very sweet!  So are there any guidlines to it?  I mean of course I will keep it all pimp/bit related, but .. hehe sorry this is very cool and I am stoked that you\'re hookin me up.  Allright, well I posted what I needed to.  Cabo always wondered who pays for this site, and doesn\'t the bandwith cost a friggin bag of pretty pennies?'),(17883,'ef00383456','I\'m really disappointed that I was the only pimp to enter, but, hey, you can never have enough homies, right?\r\nI really don\'t think that my cheesy little story deserves a spot on the home page. Maybe tell Cabo just to use the PNN pic or somethin\'? That\'s the only decent pic of the lot. I was using a borrowed camera and experimenting because I have no photography skills. Oh, also, if you guys want it, I\'d like to donate this pic to the site:\r\n[img:ef00383456]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/bitpimps.jpg[/img:ef00383456]\r\n\r\nI dunno, ask Cabo or whatever.\r\nAnyway, not to take up too much of your time, I\'d just like to say that I got some stuff in the works that should be pretty nice if it comes out o.k., and I just got my email from ez saying that my 2 sets of alloys are on the way... so I\'ll be flossin\' some truly pimped bits real soon. \r\nAnyhoo, here\'s my info:\r\nJay Bailey\r\n105 Mayfield Lane\r\nWest Mifflin, PA 15122'),(17716,'8d9c513132','that does suck. my kids are still fussin and shit over here.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17718,'8c2e468e7c','hey,  i got an empty kitchen since theres no table here!!!!!!  maybe a little BIT of drivin\'..... 8-)'),(17722,'f4a658314e','[quote:f4a658314e=\"Bird\"]meh. i wish. they tryin to work in the kitchen, and i got a lot of shit to do and then take her girl home on top of that.[/quote:f4a658314e]\r\n\r\nwhos they?  and when?  in the morning, what?  i\'m confused....\r\n\r\ni\'m going to guess kathy is there and her and your girl are in the kitchen fuckin\' around with paint and you gotta ride her home later......???'),(17720,'f973faf829','meh. i wish. they tryin to work in the kitchen, and i got a lot of shit to do and then take her girl home on top of that.'),(17879,'b54fdcfb2f','tomorrow'),(17881,'d526ce2ae0','[quote:d526ce2ae0=\"hogjowlz\"]tomorrow[/quote:d526ce2ae0]lol i was just fuckin with you.\r\n\r\nyou still look like wesley snipes?'),(17726,'0a4bab622b','i guess ill crash in a couple of hours since i ain\'t got shit to do.......i have to copy all my shit off this computer yet.  favorites, music, pics, and stuff so i can keep it.......'),(17724,'2efe79d09e','yeah.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17877,'9654ff5716','[quote:9654ff5716=\"hogjowlz\"]ok they aint on this box\r\n\r\nhopefully they are at work[/quote:9654ff5716]so you gonna go check right now?'),(17878,'b54fdcfb2f','tomorrow'),(17727,'4a295d1d1d','Hey whats up, I\'m creating a Best of the Best on The web Gallery for R7R and I would like to include this vehicle [url]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?album=7&amp;pos=29[/url]  I have already got an okay from Cabowabo to ask the members of Bit Pimps.  The Bit Pimps signs can stay in the pic or it can be added to the description.\r\n\r\n\r\nWell Let me know if your interested'),(17728,'624f3a527b','Hey man whats up, I\'m creating a Best of the Best on The Web gallery for Ripper7Racing and I would like to include this vehicle [url]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?album=11&amp;pos=25[/url]  I have already talked to Cabowabo and he said it was cool as long as I get the authors permissions.  I would leave the Bit Pimps signs in the pic or add it to the description in the gallery\r\n\r\nWell let me know if your interested\r\n\r\nRipper7777777'),(17729,'624f3a527b','Hey man whats up, I\'m creating a Best of the Best on The Web gallery for Ripper7Racing and I would like to include this vehicle [url]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?album=11&amp;pos=25[/url]  I have already talked to Cabowabo and he said it was cool as long as I get the authors permissions.  I would leave the Bit Pimps signs in the pic or add it to the description in the gallery\r\n\r\nWell let me know if your interested\r\n\r\nRipper7777777');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17730,'dc9b3b0c4d','Hey man whats up, I\'m creating a Best of the Best on The Web gallery for Ripper7Racing and I would like to include this vehicle [url]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?album=11&amp;pos=65[/url]  I have already talked to Cabowabo and he said it was cool as long as I get the authors permissions.  I would leave the Bit Pimps signs in the pic or add it to the description in the gallery\r\n\r\nWell let me know if your interested\r\n\r\nRipper7777777'),(17732,'fdc5c90562','Hey man whats up, I\'m creating a Best of the Best on The Web gallery for Ripper7Racing.com and I would like to include this vehicle [url]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?album=topn&amp;cat=10015&amp;pos=0[/url]  I have already talked to Cabowabo and he said it was cool as long as I get the authors permissions.  I would leave the Bit Pimps signs in the pic or add it to the description in the gallery\r\n\r\nWell let me know if your interested\r\n\r\nRipper7777777'),(17733,'b03a6fbc6c','[quote:b03a6fbc6c=\"ripper7777777\"]Hey man whats up, I\'m creating a Best of the Best on The Web gallery for Ripper7Racing and I would like to include this vehicle [url]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?album=11&amp;pos=25[/url]  I have already talked to Cabowabo and he said it was cool as long as I get the authors permissions.  I would leave the Bit Pimps signs in the pic or add it to the description in the gallery\r\n\r\nWell let me know if your interested\r\n\r\nRipper7777777[/quote:b03a6fbc6c]Sure man. I\'d be honored to be part of your \'best of the best\', especially since I consider your work to be some of the best out there.  :-) \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17734,'9344d83b19','Hey can I include this vehicle in My Best of the Best on The Web Gallery.\r\n\r\n[url]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?album=38&amp;pos=40[/url]\r\n\r\nLater\r\nripper'),(17736,'bf013f09a1','Cool I\'ll shoot you a pm when it\'s up, the site is www.ripper7racing.com'),(17737,'12b2f017c1','Cool I\'ll shoot you a pm when it\'s up, the site is www.ripper7racing.com\r\n\r\nlater\r\nripper7777777'),(17738,'fdc5c90562','Hey man whats up, I\'m creating a Best of the Best on The Web gallery for Ripper7Racing.com and I would like to include this vehicle [url]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?album=topn&amp;cat=10015&amp;pos=0[/url]  I have already talked to Cabowabo and he said it was cool as long as I get the authors permissions.  I would leave the Bit Pimps signs in the pic or add it to the description in the gallery\r\n\r\nWell let me know if your interested\r\n\r\nRipper7777777'),(17740,'7128631c36','Hi!\r\n\r\nNice that you want this Picture...you can put it on your Site! :-) \r\n\r\nI Hope that your Site becomes many Visitors...\r\n\r\nGreetings and have a nice day!!\r\n\r\nSinned');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17741,'52cd151416','Well Thanks for the nice reply, I dont get to see your work anymore since I can no longer visit MRCC, but stop by my site if you get a chance we hope to have more of an emphasis on larger scale RC, we still have the 1/64th section but the Bit Pimps do it so well here that it is just for show.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nRipper7777777\r\n\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com'),(22947,'030055f8e0','Alright I\'m sending out the first round of emails, time to get the ball rolling and find some staff members.\r\n \r\nI plan to ask everyone what articles they would like to write or what they would like to contribute to the magazine.  After that we will work on a time schedule and a layout for upcoming magazines.\r\n \r\nPh2t I guess you can contact me with this pm or on the R7R pm\r\n\r\n\r\nLater\r\nRipper'),(22930,'382f26cce3','Alright I\'m sending out the first round of emails, time to get the ball rolling and find some staff members.\r\n \r\nI plan to ask everyone what articles they would like to write or what they would like to contribute to the magazine.  After that we will work on a time schedule and a layout for upcoming magazines.\r\n \r\nThanks for any help or support, oh and no shit eaters....LOL\r\n\r\n\r\nLater\r\nRipper'),(22945,'186fc14636','Alright I\'m sending out the first round of emails, time to get the ball rolling and find some staff members.\r\n \r\nI plan to ask everyone what articles they would like to write or what they would like to contribute to the magazine.  After that we will work on a time schedule and a layout for upcoming magazines.\r\n \r\nThanks for any help or support and a Micro Boat would be awesome.\r\n\r\n\r\nLater\r\nRipper');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17748,'e2644ac148','hey man, wanna get a snap shot of that kick ass video you just made so we can put it up in our movies page with the other one?'),(17749,'cc6ee3c733','[quote:cc6ee3c733=\"ripper7777777\"]Hey can I include this vehicle in My Best of the Best on The Web Gallery.\r\n\r\n[url]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?album=38&amp;pos=40[/url]\r\n\r\nLater\r\nripper[/quote:cc6ee3c733]sure, all I ask is you don\'t download it and host it - instead use this URL:\r\nhttp://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10008/rx7_redblack_fade_02.jpg\r\n\r\nand the typical routine, just give credits and a link.\r\n\r\nthanks for asking and thanks for thinking it belongs in there :-)'),(17750,'fa9454f489','Is it possible to use the url in the gallery and add links, I have the same software as you, I have not had much time to become familiar with it.\r\n\r\nAs far as credit, dont worry everyone will know its a Bit Pimp Creation and I hope everyone understands these are My Picks from all over the Net, not R7R stuff.  I always wanted to have a best of the best, I got tired of seeing outdated or crappy galleries and I always thought it would be cool if there was a gallery covering all models with links to where ever, your galleries are one of the few that I see that actually show cases some really nice stuff.\r\n\r\nWe have a 1/64th section but I\'m thinking we will handle the basic stuff but recommend any one that wants to see or learn some really sweet mods head this way.  Once we get the Mods and How to\'s going I\'m thinking about adding your link in there as a resource and a place for the true 1/64th fans.\r\n\r\nWell anyways I\'ll shoot you a pm when everything is up at the gallery.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nRipper\r\n\r\nThanks for all the support and help.'),(17752,'0ea86414bb','Care if I come past in a little BIT?   No, I don\'t mean a tiny car either!!   Call me.  I\'m leaving the parents now.  I gotta get outta here......');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17753,'e2644ac148','hey man, wanna get a snap shot of that kick ass video you just made so we can put it up in our movies page with the other one?'),(17754,'73fbb3ed65','[quote:73fbb3ed65=\"CaboWabo\"]hey man, wanna get a snap shot of that kick ass video you just made so we can put it up in our movies page with the other one?[/quote:73fbb3ed65]Ok, here\'s one...\r\n[img:73fbb3ed65]http://www.crazybydesign.net/crazycars/bjtrdrat.jpg[/img:73fbb3ed65]\r\n\r\nI really did throw that one together. Consider that a teaser for the one I really want to do. 8-) \r\n\r\ndave'),(23071,'a5823a58de','Sept 17th is the working deadline for the October Issue.  Don\'t worry about Image size just make it as high quality as possible I will handle the reduction for the web.'),(25861,'8bb71b01dc','Peace out.  Thanx.'),(17757,'73fbb3ed65','[quote:73fbb3ed65=\"CaboWabo\"]hey man, wanna get a snap shot of that kick ass video you just made so we can put it up in our movies page with the other one?[/quote:73fbb3ed65]Ok, here\'s one...\r\n[img:73fbb3ed65]http://www.crazybydesign.net/crazycars/bjtrdrat.jpg[/img:73fbb3ed65]\r\n\r\nI really did throw that one together. Consider that a teaser for the one I really want to do. 8-) \r\n\r\ndave'),(17758,'e984733cd5','[quote:e984733cd5=\"crazydave\"]I really did throw that one together. Consider that a teaser for the one I really want to do. 8-) \r\n\r\ndave[/quote:e984733cd5]I believe it - for me, those seem to be where my better footage comes from - when I\'m not trying lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17759,'e984733cd5','[quote:e984733cd5=\"crazydave\"]I really did throw that one together. Consider that a teaser for the one I really want to do. 8-) \r\n\r\ndave[/quote:e984733cd5]I believe it - for me, those seem to be where my better footage comes from - when I\'m not trying lol'),(17760,'6f8991a303','[quote:6f8991a303=\"ripper7777777\"]Is it possible to use the url in the gallery and add links, I have the same software as you, I have not had much time to become familiar with it.\r\n\r\nAs far as credit, dont worry everyone will know its a Bit Pimp Creation and I hope everyone understands these are My Picks from all over the Net, not R7R stuff.  I always wanted to have a best of the best, I got tired of seeing outdated or crappy galleries and I always thought it would be cool if there was a gallery covering all models with links to where ever, your galleries are one of the few that I see that actually show cases some really nice stuff.\r\n\r\nWe have a 1/64th section but I\'m thinking we will handle the basic stuff but recommend any one that wants to see or learn some really sweet mods head this way.  Once we get the Mods and How to\'s going I\'m thinking about adding your link in there as a resource and a place for the true 1/64th fans.\r\n\r\nWell anyways I\'ll shoot you a pm when everything is up at the gallery.\r\n\r\nLater\r\nRipper\r\n\r\nThanks for all the support and help.[/quote:6f8991a303]ahh I see - no there\'s no way to add links in the gallery to other images unless you program it into the template or the software.\r\nin that case, go ahead an nab that one if you want.'),(17761,'9abe4a1fc8','If you edited my posts in this thread.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?p=40558#40558');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17762,'dc9b3b0c4d','Hey man whats up, I\'m creating a Best of the Best on The Web gallery for Ripper7Racing and I would like to include this vehicle [url]http://www.bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?album=11&amp;pos=65[/url]  I have already talked to Cabowabo and he said it was cool as long as I get the authors permissions.  I would leave the Bit Pimps signs in the pic or add it to the description in the gallery\r\n\r\nWell let me know if your interested\r\n\r\nRipper7777777'),(17763,'80b9d38eab','Goku, man, dude... there\'s no hint to get... I gots no problem with you... I actually enjoy your rants. I went to a ghetto-ass high school and got jumped by 4-5 guys frequently, and this was in the late \'80s early \'90s when there was no internet for me to go on to rant about it. I just used to wait and catch them later, one at a time, and kick their asses. Anyway, I really do look forward to your rants and I just like havin\' fun and breaking your balls about stuff... IT\'S ALL IN FUN!!! Hell, if you didn\'t rant on here I\'d still go read the PG13 version on Tiny. I think it\'s like that with everyone else, too. It\'s just too fun to break your balls, I don\'t think anyone means any harm.'),(22928,'d8586e3323','Hey I\'m offering a free half page ad to friendly forums or basically forums that allow there members to contribute to the Mag, but since the Bit Pimps have been there for R7R since day one, I think a full page ad would be better.  Just if anyone asks you paid for an upgrade, don\'t want to step on any toes..... 8-) \r\n\r\nSo I was thinking you would get sessiz or someone to do the layout, no nudity, but half naked car show hoes are fine.\r\n\r\nWell let me know your thoughts, and thanks again for all the support.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17766,'2accde301d','It\'s cool with me Pimp !     :cool:   Anytime!'),(17767,'80b9d38eab','Goku, man, dude... there\'s no hint to get... I gots no problem with you... I actually enjoy your rants. I went to a ghetto-ass high school and got jumped by 4-5 guys frequently, and this was in the late \'80s early \'90s when there was no internet for me to go on to rant about it. I just used to wait and catch them later, one at a time, and kick their asses. Anyway, I really do look forward to your rants and I just like havin\' fun and breaking your balls about stuff... IT\'S ALL IN FUN!!! Hell, if you didn\'t rant on here I\'d still go read the PG13 version on Tiny. I think it\'s like that with everyone else, too. It\'s just too fun to break your balls, I don\'t think anyone means any harm.'),(17876,'ef00383456','I\'m really disappointed that I was the only pimp to enter, but, hey, you can never have enough homies, right?\r\nI really don\'t think that my cheesy little story deserves a spot on the home page. Maybe tell Cabo just to use the PNN pic or somethin\'? That\'s the only decent pic of the lot. I was using a borrowed camera and experimenting because I have no photography skills. Oh, also, if you guys want it, I\'d like to donate this pic to the site:\r\n[img:ef00383456]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/bitpimps.jpg[/img:ef00383456]\r\n\r\nI dunno, ask Cabo or whatever.\r\nAnyway, not to take up too much of your time, I\'d just like to say that I got some stuff in the works that should be pretty nice if it comes out o.k., and I just got my email from ez saying that my 2 sets of alloys are on the way... so I\'ll be flossin\' some truly pimped bits real soon. \r\nAnyhoo, here\'s my info:\r\nJay Bailey\r\n105 Mayfield Lane\r\nWest Mifflin, PA 15122'),(17769,'fcf3a4fe74','[quote:fcf3a4fe74=\"Bird\"]Goku, man, dude... there\'s no hint to get... I gots no problem with you... I actually enjoy your rants. I went to a ghetto-ass high school and got jumped by 4-5 guys frequently, and this was in the late \'80s early \'90s when there was no internet for me to go on to rant about it. I just used to wait and catch them later, one at a time, and kick their asses. Anyway, I really do look forward to your rants and I just like havin\' fun and breaking your balls about stuff... IT\'S ALL IN FUN!!! Hell, if you didn\'t rant on here I\'d still go read the PG13 version on Tiny. I think it\'s like that with everyone else, too. It\'s just too fun to break your balls, I don\'t think anyone means any harm.[/quote:fcf3a4fe74]\r\n\r\nOh, ok. I get a little overreactive sometimes. From what betty.k said, I thought I was getting on everyone\'s nerves, that\'s kinda what pushed me out of the train. \r\n\r\nBut, I never knew someone ENJOYED my rants.... :eek:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17770,'3a791e715e','[quote:3a791e715e=\"Son_Gokou\"] \r\n\r\nBut, I never knew someone ENJOYED my rants.... :eek:[/quote:3a791e715e]\r\n\r\nYeah... that\'s some pretty entertaining teen angst you got there....'),(17771,'42a92b6788','anytime you\'re ready to send it is cool with me! just let me know when it\'s definately coming so i\'ll know to expect it.\r\n\r\ncheers, trent.'),(18385,'abac56199f','[quote:abac56199f=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:abac56199f=\"payaso\"]I may not reply to all post/threads, but I do see EVERYTHING, and I just thought I\'d give you a little insider info.....\r\n\r\nMake yourself an avatar with HJ and show em you can joke around too... It\'s all about fun..\r\n\r\nDon\'t sweat it man.[/quote:abac56199f]\r\n\r\nCool...\r\n\r\nAnd, how\'s my avatar....is it ok?[/quote:abac56199f]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYou\'re on the right track, but maybe something a little less graphic...lol  Your avatar shows up in all forums..'),(18386,'bc4a1db8e0','You\'re also insulting me in your avatar? Man.....');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18387,'2bf511f723','Yeah....\r\n\r\nOh, and I think I should have made it something....non sexual....I think maybe I\'ve gone too far? In the \"general bit-discussion\"?  :?'),(17773,'3a791e715e','[quote:3a791e715e=\"Son_Gokou\"] \r\n\r\nBut, I never knew someone ENJOYED my rants.... :eek:[/quote:3a791e715e]\r\n\r\nYeah... that\'s some pretty entertaining teen angst you got there....'),(17872,'c8245f28bf','http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3505'),(17873,'223b177c53','ok they aint on this box\r\n\r\nhopefully they are at work'),(17874,'223b177c53','ok they aint on this box\r\n\r\nhopefully they are at work'),(17775,'83677cc7ca','[quote:83677cc7ca=\"Bird\"][quote:83677cc7ca=\"Son_Gokou\"] \r\n\r\nBut, I never knew someone ENJOYED my rants.... :eek:[/quote:83677cc7ca]\r\n\r\nYeah... that\'s some pretty entertaining teen angst you got there....[/quote:83677cc7ca]\r\n\r\n:lol:\r\n\r\nBut anyways, I have to commend you on having so much tolerance and understanding of kids, considering you had a bad history as a teenager.'),(17776,'d8de3a8875','If it doesn\'t kill me, it makes me stronger. words to live by....');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17777,'d8de3a8875','If it doesn\'t kill me, it makes me stronger. words to live by....'),(17778,'abf6725738','Hey, man, whats up? I guess your move went smooth. I got a question, since you\'ve had a few SE\'s.. are the newer ones that much better? Mine is a few months old(white initial d mazda) and i guess it\'s pretty good, but kinda glitchy sometimes... just wonderin\'.\r\nOh, yeah, I ordered a bunch of stuff from toyeast yesterday, and they had those iWAVER mini z clones\r\n[img:abf6725738]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/a02006057a.jpg[/img:abf6725738]\r\nfor 25 bucks so i grabbed one to see what they\'re all about. all the mini z fanatics on all of the forums say to avoid them, but I get the impression that they\'re a bunch of elitist snobs from the way they talk down on x-mods.... I\'ll judge for myself.\r\nHow\'d ya like my ghetto ass pic contest entry? low budget to say the least... I had to borrow Mikes cam to do it.\r\nI like your \"distort peoples pics\" idea. i have to get the password to my ladys photobucket account.... she\'s like the sessiz of the \"Days of our Lives\" forums, and does some jive flash stuff to soap opera people... I\'ll have to post a few of them.'),(17868,'aa87345ab2','toss up the ones you want somewhere when you get a chance and let me know where, I\'ll snag em and put em in the gallery');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17869,'e098448f75','word. ill try to do that tonigh.'),(17870,'e098448f75','word. ill try to do that tonigh.'),(17871,'c8245f28bf','http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3505'),(17780,'4f4dd4804a','ya im almost done moving. well i have unpacking and organizing still. been a damn busy week and i wont be able to rest until sunday.\r\n\r\nya the new batch of ses are less buggy. probably a little faster to.\r\n\r\nya those cars seem pretty sweet for 30bucks.\r\n\r\ni got the awd kit in my xmod. i think im gona put the normal front end back and just run it rwd with the possi tho. that differential kicks serious ass.'),(18383,'f87fef68ed','[quote:f87fef68ed=\"payaso\"]I may not reply to all post/threads, but I do see EVERYTHING, and I just thought I\'d give you a little insider info.....\r\n\r\nMake yourself an avatar with HJ and show em you can joke around too... It\'s all about fun..\r\n\r\nDon\'t sweat it man.[/quote:f87fef68ed]\r\n\r\nCool...\r\n\r\nAnd, how\'s my avatar....is it ok?'),(18384,'abac56199f','[quote:abac56199f=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:abac56199f=\"payaso\"]I may not reply to all post/threads, but I do see EVERYTHING, and I just thought I\'d give you a little insider info.....\r\n\r\nMake yourself an avatar with HJ and show em you can joke around too... It\'s all about fun..\r\n\r\nDon\'t sweat it man.[/quote:abac56199f]\r\n\r\nCool...\r\n\r\nAnd, how\'s my avatar....is it ok?[/quote:abac56199f]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYou\'re on the right track, but maybe something a little less graphic...lol  Your avatar shows up in all forums..');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17783,'9dd60f79ed','I still haven\'t gotten a chance to really drive my xmod yet(maybe today if it stays dry long enough) but I finally put in the stage 2 drift motor... after spending 2 nights polishing the heatsink. it\'s purdy. I haven\'t driven it with the bearings and awd yet though. I didn\'t even take my IC3\'s out of the package, yet.\r\nI also have a package coming from ezenterprizes...  :cool: \r\n\r\nDid you see this techno guy on tiny thats sellin all kinds of bit stuff? he has Shens for 6 bucks, and a ton of other good deals... I may be doing business with him soon.'),(17784,'88b62a0ff0','hows it goin homez?'),(17787,'657af2e91b','i was at big lots a few days ago. i picked up a few thunder chargers and some bodies. thats all ive bought bitwise for several months. well except for the ses.'),(17788,'3b39088834','it\'s going....and you...?  sounds like you\'ve been busy recently.\r\n\r\notherwise, trying to stay good... survive life...'),(27244,'a5943d3161','[quote:a5943d3161=\"HirotoR34\"]I like the Gallery idea. Is this something I can do? would I just set up another gallery in the same manner as my own? Or does it require da Cheif to step in? :-)[/quote:a5943d3161]You talking about puttin some rides up in this Album?\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/thumbnails.php?album=3\r\n\r\nYea that one I have to put them in, I haven\'t had a lot of time and kinda forgot about it to be honest.\r\nBut if you want somefin in there, let me know bro.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18381,'18aac648a8','I may not reply to all post/threads, but I do see EVERYTHING, and I just thought I\'d give you a little insider info.....\r\n\r\nMake yourself an avatar with HJ and show em you can joke around too... It\'s all about fun..\r\n\r\nDon\'t sweat it man.'),(18382,'f87fef68ed','[quote:f87fef68ed=\"payaso\"]I may not reply to all post/threads, but I do see EVERYTHING, and I just thought I\'d give you a little insider info.....\r\n\r\nMake yourself an avatar with HJ and show em you can joke around too... It\'s all about fun..\r\n\r\nDon\'t sweat it man.[/quote:f87fef68ed]\r\n\r\nCool...\r\n\r\nAnd, how\'s my avatar....is it ok?'),(17791,'b72fb97cd2','ya my life is all screwey. i think most of the bs is taken care of. now i just need a day of sleep. the new crib is nice tho. yous best roll through hur more often.'),(17792,'1986e1c3af','I gotta get one of them thunder chargers(or 2). theres a biglots right up the road from my in-laws, I always mean to stop in, but never do. I got one of them lighted bottom lxx\'s coming in my toyeast order, plus 2 pullbacks, a 360 modena bit body, 2 200mah perfection batts, a black heatsink, and a ferrari mini z body so I can maybe use the porsche mini z clone body on the xmod. I\'m SERIOUSLY addicted to buying bit stuff, if you hadn\'t noticed. I gotta stop... for real.\r\nI just can\'t wait to get my package from ez....\r\nI was wondering about the SE\'s because I want to send one to micro-amps, and wanted to know if I should send the onr I already have, or get one of the newer ones to send.'),(17866,'a3d62396af','ya i dont think any on the web at the moment. well ya\r\n\r\nhttp://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/thud.wmv\r\n\r\ni have \"dukeboyz in da hood\" and another movie on my hard disk at home');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17794,'1f3c5ea8f8','hmm you wana see what kinda deal he will cut if we send two? i wouldnt mind a fetted se.'),(18380,'18aac648a8','I may not reply to all post/threads, but I do see EVERYTHING, and I just thought I\'d give you a little insider info.....\r\n\r\nMake yourself an avatar with HJ and show em you can joke around too... It\'s all about fun..\r\n\r\nDon\'t sweat it man.'),(17796,'2864cbd926','sounds good to me. definately. \r\n\r\nI have another proposition for you... I have all the stuff for a dual cell, but no skills at soldering... maybe a trade? or I could make yer xmod heatsink shiny and purdy? or both... something. I dunno. I got enough of them tomy batteries out of K.I.T. racers to last a while....'),(17798,'0864850af2','ya ill wire up a dualie for ya sometime. gime a week or so to unpack and shit then ill be ready to operate.'),(17800,'50a9ff1562','cool. no hurry. my kitchen is wrecked right now anyways, I can barely drive a quick single cell bit in there now as it is... we\'re in the middle of redoing the cabinets and then we are re-tiling. it is fun with the SE in the dark with the headlights and all the obstacles, though. i am really enjoying my current unemployed status.'),(17864,'96f595a85d','hey man, you still got some of them old clips you had posted of your bits - I know I remember one driving in a bowl and shit with lights, another rug runner / ramp one....\r\n\r\nI wanna put them biatches in our movie gallery');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17865,'a3d62396af','ya i dont think any on the web at the moment. well ya\r\n\r\nhttp://hogjowlz.lixlink.com/thud.wmv\r\n\r\ni have \"dukeboyz in da hood\" and another movie on my hard disk at home'),(17802,'cb7412a283','haha i wish i was unemployed. then i could sleep. well i work til 8 mon-fri. i got my kid some nights and on the weekend at some point. if ya wana come over after i get off work sometime next week that should be cool. it only takes maybe 20mins to set up a dual cell. my soldering iron is crap but it works for something like that.'),(18379,'acd47022f9','[quote:acd47022f9=\"payaso\"]I know alot of the pimps rag on you, but if I was you, I wouldn\'t let it get to me..\r\n\r\n\r\nYou\'re young, and have your whole life ahead of you, and that can make older people resent you....\r\n\r\nI admire your resilience to take it all in stride.(pretty tough kid)   Stick with what\'s been working for you, and remember that if you show them that their pranks are getting to you, they\'ll keep at it. I\'d just ignore em for the most part, and for the second part, this is bitPimps, so take your shots back at them..  It\'s really all just in good fun..\r\n\r\n\r\nPeace out dood.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:acd47022f9]\r\n\r\nI don\'t exactly know why, but that just made me feel a lot better. Thanks. :)'),(17804,'fe32d43938','yeah, that sounds cool... maybe a night that 219 is off so he could come, too. man, I just popped the xmods cherry in fine fashion. charged(i thought at least.. only 2 charged) the IC3\'s up, it ran shitty for like 5 minutes. went back in the house, put them back on the charger(right this time), took out the awd, tightened up the diff(left the red one in), and went back out. i\'m pretty impressed with the quickness, but the range isn\'t all that... o.k., i guess. i\'m gonna have to sweep the little rocks and shit off of my neighbors driveway cuz it was bouncin\' all over them things. and my pretty civic now has scratches on the roof and one mirror. oh well. i think with some tweaking this ride will be a bad-ass.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17805,'babaed34cd','Just get her in the mail 20 min ago, lovin this ride, thanks a ton man. :-)'),(17809,'496351f266','Umm....dood.....I don\'t even have a dog..... :???:'),(17810,'9cd4a0e378','i wana buy a coffee mug. is there a promotion code?'),(17811,'9cd4a0e378','i wana buy a coffee mug. is there a promotion code?'),(18378,'acd47022f9','[quote:acd47022f9=\"payaso\"]I know alot of the pimps rag on you, but if I was you, I wouldn\'t let it get to me..\r\n\r\n\r\nYou\'re young, and have your whole life ahead of you, and that can make older people resent you....\r\n\r\nI admire your resilience to take it all in stride.(pretty tough kid)   Stick with what\'s been working for you, and remember that if you show them that their pranks are getting to you, they\'ll keep at it. I\'d just ignore em for the most part, and for the second part, this is bitPimps, so take your shots back at them..  It\'s really all just in good fun..\r\n\r\n\r\nPeace out dood.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D[/quote:acd47022f9]\r\n\r\nI don\'t exactly know why, but that just made me feel a lot better. Thanks. :)'),(17813,'2fda589341','[quote:2fda589341=\"hogjowlz\"]i wana buy a coffee mug. is there a promotion code?[/quote:2fda589341]unfortunately theres not. each mug is marked up $2.00 so let me know which mug ya want I can just make it base price (- $2.00).\r\nnobody buys stuff from there anyways lol\r\nbeen thinking of changing up some graphics on some of the items.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17814,'acb79bb891','ah  ill just order it. i dont care about 2bucks. ya new graphics may help move the shizzle.\r\n\r\nyou should start moving bits. kids would pay a lot just cuz its a \"cabowabo car\"'),(17815,'acb79bb891','ah  ill just order it. i dont care about 2bucks. ya new graphics may help move the shizzle.\r\n\r\nyou should start moving bits. kids would pay a lot just cuz its a \"cabowabo car\"'),(17817,'3c19f53547','[quote:3c19f53547=\"hogjowlz\"]ah  ill just order it. i dont care about 2bucks. ya new graphics may help move the shizzle.\r\n\r\nyou should start moving bits. kids would pay a lot just cuz its a \"cabowabo car\"[/quote:3c19f53547]bah, at this point I think they\'d prefer a \"bitpimps car\" made by several of us.\r\n\r\ngot any ideas on new graphics?\r\ngotta be original, we can\'t use copyright images.'),(17818,'c0f0ed9734','well pics of our cars. id say one of dave\'s flame jobs.'),(17819,'c0f0ed9734','well pics of our cars. id say one of dave\'s flame jobs.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17821,'edea0eeebe','hey man, i\'ve sorted out a paypal account so if that\'s ok with your transactions then lemme know.\r\nwhile i\'m at it, i\'m also after some zz wheels, doesn\'t matter if they have hubcaps or axles. and also if you have any spare zz se knuckles floating around i\'d be interested in those too. thanks plenty, get back to me with availability and price.\r\n\r\ncheers man, trent.'),(37698,'1bb99ee956','sounds good to me\r\n\r\nthe stuff is yours i am just hookin up with my uncle right now to get the go ahead for you pimps to send the money to his paypal because i dont have my own.\r\n\r\nWhen he gets back to me i will post up the pm right away...\r\n\r\ncool?'),(35383,'fe6cca97bd','heh, long time no see from you, man.\r\n\r\nso tell me you did something useful with that supra i sent you a year ago.  :-o'),(35397,'c9e102dc2c','[quote:c9e102dc2c=\"Clint\"][quote:c9e102dc2c=\"cj\"][quote:c9e102dc2c=\"Clint\"]Hey,  sorry was away a few days.\r\n\r\nI paypalled you 71$ for a silver kit, mustang clip, and an extra set of rear axles.\r\n\r\n-Cancel the extra set of rear axles\r\n-Add in the set of the front dogbones.\r\n-I still want the mustang clip. \r\n-I would like to add a silver diff for the car.\r\n\r\njust lemme know how much to paypal.\r\n\r\n-Clint[/quote:c9e102dc2c]\r\n\r\nAdding the Diff and the clip you are looking at $21.00 more.[/quote:c9e102dc2c]\r\n\r\nThanks..\r\n21$ sent via paypal.[/quote:c9e102dc2c]\r\n\r\nGot it.\r\n\r\nThank You!'),(37043,'436a96b48f','[quote:436a96b48f=\"crazydave\"]Got the inspiration, spent my whole weekend fiddleing with this:\r\n\r\n[img:436a96b48f]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/ps2_1.jpg[/img:436a96b48f]\r\n\r\n[img:436a96b48f]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/ps2_2.jpg[/img:436a96b48f]\r\n\r\nYep, that one\'s yours, biotch. :-o \r\n\r\nI still need to FET mod it, a few details like wrapping some strips around the wheels, to hold the tires on, spin the right front wheel with the dremel to loosen it up a bit,  it pitches the axle out of the car in reverse... but its freaking together, and just about ready to kick butt. The hard shit is done, its all downhill from here. :-o \r\n\r\nI also plan to get another SS motor set, mine has red KIT gears, and orange SS motor now, I plan to run the red SS motor, with my red gears, and yours with the purple motor, and these blue gears. If that works out like it does in SSs, then we should be fairly evenly matched, with a slightly different acceleration curve. Should make for more interesting racing than two indentical setup cars.\r\n\r\nOh yeah, and does this look familiar?\r\n[img:436a96b48f]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/ps2_3.jpg[/img:436a96b48f]\r\n\r\nIts like its the same, but different. :???: \r\n\r\nPretty sure this is your body, but I haven\'t decided on the colors. Pep Boys ditched the Plasti Coat, and blew my plans to play with some candy blue on top of black and silver graphics. Walmart ditched the Testors stuff for some House of Kolor paintes, which I\'m excited to check out, but they just threw them in the locked cabinet in a big ol\' pile. Hopefully they\'ll have that\'ll straightened out this weekend, and I can pick some cool custom colors.\r\n\r\n... and I know you like to see how the wheels sit in the wheel wells...\r\n[img:436a96b48f]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/ps2_4.jpg[/img:436a96b48f]\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:436a96b48f]\r\n\r\nGod damn!... I\'m still stunned by how fuckin\' cool this thing is. Shit, man... people are gonna shit when they see this car flossed up.\r\n\r\nedit: AND, it hasn\'t EVEN sunk in yet that this car will be in my hands, when all is said and done. God damn.\r\n\r\n\r\nedit 2: have you heard The Ribeye Brothers? If not, I\'ve got a couple of discs to send ya... right up your alley, I\'d bet... fun stuff. They\'re another spinoff of Monster Magnet, just the polar opposite of the other spinoff (Atomic Bitchwax).');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32731,'227ffcc902','Please tell me you got the package!'),(37129,'261a14ab4c','check out sessiz\'s thread in da click... I got 2 versions, but one needs a little more work'),(37131,'7cff683a88','Just curious, hows the Epoch doing?  Any problems?  What would you change? That sort of thing.\r\n\r\nCheers\r\nPhilip.'),(37132,'7cff683a88','Just curious, hows the Epoch doing?  Any problems?  What would you change? That sort of thing.\r\n\r\nCheers\r\nPhilip.'),(37168,'4cde86a8ab','the mr01 and mr02 are two different animals, rear ends (including diffs) are different and not cross compatible.\r\n\r\nonly parts that are:\r\nbb\'s\r\nscrews\r\nservo gears\r\nwheelnuts\r\nwheels, motor, pcb (02 pcb has brake, 01 does not)\r\n\r\num, i think that\'s it.\r\n\r\ncheck my 02 thread for good chassis pics:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=6514\r\ni started with an iw02 but quickly upgraded the whole thing.\r\n\r\ni\'ve never used anything from tincars, but i get all the grip i need with my gandini foams :-o'),(37315,'38998db44d','sounds good to me! you can send paypal cash to: bettykay@gmail.com\r\n\r\nall goods will be packed well and shipped via airmail. shipping to the u.s. usually takes 1 - 2 weeks.\r\n(next time a merikan tries to charge you too much shipping you can say &quot;i got an xmod shipped from aus for $10! :-o )');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37833,'c3102883bb','Hiya sg!\r\n\r\nJust wanted to know...any news for my ZZSE?\r\n\r\nThanks ,\r\n\r\nM_M'),(32385,'3aa361b921','I dunno.  $1+shipping sound fair?  Not sure on how to ship it though.  Think if I put it in bubble wrap then inside a padded envelope it would be okay?  I\'ve never shipped just a small bit body before.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...\r\n\r\nPS. Yeah, paypal is my preferred method of payment.'),(37380,'56e882a931','Eh Zenith how much you think I could get for this, i am selling it all as a bundle and want to get rid of it. I am tryin to come up with some extra cash for an iwaver or save up for my FM remote...\r\nlol \r\n\r\nHere\'s the stuff\r\n\r\n\r\n- 6 Cell Nissan 350z Xmods Chassis \r\n- Aluminum rear diff joints \r\n- aluminum front diff joints \r\n- Never used stock motor \r\n- Stock motor \r\n- Stage 2 white motor \r\n- ATOMIC PERFECT SHAFT (long) \r\n- Bearings set x 2 \r\n- Foam tires and Xmod rim package \r\n- Tons of extra slicks and tredded (soft) \r\n- Extra stock diff \r\n- Five star rims, (corvette) and 350 rims \r\n- Short (1), and Long (2) drive shafts \r\n- Aluminum Heat sinc \r\n- two extra plastic heat sincs \r\n- Stock steering rods (2) \r\n- Two extra sets of front and rear plastic arms \r\n\r\nadding to the list \r\n\r\n- AWD rear and front arms \r\n- AWD Differentials (X2) \r\n- Steering rod for better handling on turns (red one) \r\n\r\nBodies that come with the bundle.. \r\n\r\n- 350z (used on my custom track) \r\n\r\n- Black RSX body and body kit, put together and never ran (my model) \r\n\r\n- Used Skyline plus body kit \r\n\r\n- Subaro Impreza Cop car (Custom painted black with fake lights) \r\nplus comes with body extra\'s (blue and silver) \r\n\r\n- Mustang body custom painted, plus body kit \r\n\r\nAlso included in the bundle is... \r\n\r\nExtra PCB board, SERVO, and Chassis, I have included some of the parts to get it running. It needs the frequencies, and battery cases...'),(34784,'139d43c63b','HAHA man! I seen when you posted that story of us playing, that was a sick scene! If you wanna play/talk hit me up.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34785,'688638a29f','[quote:688638a29f=\"arfin\"]HAHA man! I seen when you posted that story of us playing, that was a sick scene! If you wanna play/talk hit me up.[/quote:688638a29f]\r\n\r\nHell yeah, man, it was totally true!! LOL\r\n\r\nI just sent ya a message about it via MSN.\r\n\r\nLater!!!'),(31634,'9c94fa9cd4','Do you still have that car?  I need it bad like a mofo....   Let me know if you still wanna get rid of it, and where to send the $$$\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks bro \r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(31624,'b0a17055b7','[color=green:b0a17055b7][b:b0a17055b7][size=24:b0a17055b7]SOLD ![/size:b0a17055b7][/b:b0a17055b7][/color:b0a17055b7]\r\nThanx!\r\n\r\nContact me.......... 8-)'),(32571,'cb31535638','[quote:cb31535638=\"itzlinky\"]Just wondering how much would it be total including shipping to 39540?  Packing could be whatever\'s the most cheapest and efficient method using priority mail.[/quote:cb31535638]\r\n\r\nHey man!! \r\n\r\nWell, I\'m at 98038. I went to USPS, and looks like the cheapest is 3-day first class, with approx. weight at 10 ounces. That\'s approx. $2.50.\r\n\r\n14 ounces says $3.13. So, in and around there. I could mail it and PM you with the total before you make your payment.\r\n\r\nI was figuring 1/2 off for the XMod stuff. We\'ll give Red_Line a day to get back to me, since he showed interest first. If not, it\'s all yours dude!!!!\r\n\r\n\r\nMotorGong'),(35133,'92b53aa28e','[quote:92b53aa28e=\"arfin\"]HAHA, that e-mail was HARSHHHHHHHH, how you doin\' bro?[/quote:92b53aa28e]\r\n\r\nSorry dude, I forgot already, what e-mail?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17823,'7837bdfac1','[quote:7837bdfac1=\"betty.k\"]hey man, i\'ve sorted out a paypal account so if that\'s ok with your transactions then lemme know.\r\nwhile i\'m at it, i\'m also after some zz wheels, doesn\'t matter if they have hubcaps or axles. and also if you have any spare zz se knuckles floating around i\'d be interested in those too. thanks plenty, get back to me with availability and price.\r\n\r\ncheers man, trent.[/quote:7837bdfac1]\r\n\r\nDo you want me to just pick up some stuff from Radio Shack for you? Seriously, I don\'t mind at all. for $12.99 USD you can get the new Hemi Cuda and Boss Mustang SE bodies (all wired up with lights), 2 sets of nice hubcaps, 3 rear axles (blue, green and red gears) 1 purple Nitrous motor and one orange Turbo moto. It\'s a pretty good deal. They also still have the Initial D version of that set, everything\'s the same except you get a AE85 Corolla and a AE86 Levin and different hubcaps.\r\n\r\nDude, I\'m totally lame with the purple motor thing. I was sure I had some laying around because I\'ve bought at least 3 of the kits I metioned above, but when I dug through my stash I couldn\'t find them. I think I may have put one or two in cars I traded and forgotten about it. I\'m really sorry I went and got your hopes up, I truly thought I had some laying around. \r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested, hue35 and I got a killer deal on a bunch of white endcap 3.8 motors. We bought like 30 of them for $1.50 each. If you want some I\'ll break some out of my stash. \r\n\r\nLet me know what I can do for ya.'),(17826,'ce5636ab05','i know the feeling about giving away cars with parts i wish i kept! oh well, all parta the job! :grin:  i was a little hesitant about that tune up kit cos i\'m not much into bodies but i know someone who would be interested in them so i reckon i\'ll get you to buy me one. i\'m also interested in a couple of those 3.8\'s you mentioned, but 1 is cool if stocks are low. lemme know your final price and pp details when you\'re ready. thanks for doing this man, i\'m always excited by big letters from overseas!\r\n\r\nseesya \'round, trent.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17827,'f78ddc9fba','Hey! as long as its ok with CW, its ok with me... :grin:'),(18375,'d51f168f72','I know alot of the pimps rag on you, but if I was you, I wouldn\'t let it get to me..\r\n\r\n\r\nYou\'re young, and have your whole life ahead of you, and that can make older people resent you....\r\n\r\nI admire your resilience to take it all in stride.(pretty tough kid)   Stick with what\'s been working for you, and remember that if you show them that their pranks are getting to you, they\'ll keep at it. I\'d just ignore em for the most part, and for the second part, this is bitPimps, so take your shots back at them..  It\'s really all just in good fun..\r\n\r\n\r\nPeace out dood.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D'),(18377,'d51f168f72','I know alot of the pimps rag on you, but if I was you, I wouldn\'t let it get to me..\r\n\r\n\r\nYou\'re young, and have your whole life ahead of you, and that can make older people resent you....\r\n\r\nI admire your resilience to take it all in stride.(pretty tough kid)   Stick with what\'s been working for you, and remember that if you show them that their pranks are getting to you, they\'ll keep at it. I\'d just ignore em for the most part, and for the second part, this is bitPimps, so take your shots back at them..  It\'s really all just in good fun..\r\n\r\n\r\nPeace out dood.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla :D'),(17829,'fd19aecf1f','whats up man. got me a se Chevelle the other night. might just send it to uA new in box. my kitchen is fully tore up now, can\'t really drive in there. got a \"broken\" Shen for $5. nothin\' wrong with it. sweet deal.\r\n\r\non to my research. been doing a lot of reading up on mini-z\'s and clone mini-z\'s. all of the \"hardcore\" mini-z people are totally anti clone, but from what I can tell, the lxx is the best of the clones. I\'m assuming that this iWAVER one that I got coming is the new version of the lxx, so I\'m keeping my fingers crossed. I wound up reading some threads at ausmicro, and a few guys over there have the lxx\'s and say they\'re good and all of the parts are compatible with the Kyosho shit. so I\'m gonna upgrade a few things with aftermarket mini-z shit, and hopefully end up with a nice ride, cheap-style.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20929,'f143c5820d','Dude Hook me up with one when you get it.  How much was the shipment?\r\n\r\nThanks Man\r\n\r\nEmail me at vze22z2h@verizon.net'),(20930,'f143c5820d','Dude Hook me up with one when you get it.  How much was the shipment?\r\n\r\nThanks Man\r\n\r\nEmail me at vze22z2h@verizon.net'),(24358,'bedd729a3f','SG.. ive talked 2 trent(betty.k).. and i was thinking about the possability of u having what i want in spares that u may wanna get rid off.. i really dont want a xmod that much... i got a project car on the go pretty much one of these\r\nhttp://212.186.204.12/bits/xwpro_us01.jpg\r\nas u can see all a really need is the rear module and the AWD kit in terms of chassis and the drive shaft hold down (the yellow bit)\r\nontop of that i need 2 sets of wheels  stage 2 motors and suspention kit (just for tuneability) and a tyre pack..i dunno tell me what u can do out of 2nd hand stuff if anything. becasue that woudl be helpful and probly easyer on my pocket'),(17832,'a3fa80bd40','if the webmaster ignores you, go above him:\r\nhttp://www.samspade.org/t/lookat?a=www.xmodsrc.com\r\n\r\ntypically, if you contact them and inform them of the copyright infringement and give them the URLs to the stolen and original images along with an explination - they will usually help you out.\r\n\r\nIf not, you can get the government in on it rather easily.\r\n\r\nIf the webmaster is un-willing to help, let them know that you plan on exercising your rights to copyright and if doesn\'t remove it in a timely matter, you will fight until the entire site and host is taken down.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17833,'a3fa80bd40','if the webmaster ignores you, go above him:\r\nhttp://www.samspade.org/t/lookat?a=www.xmodsrc.com\r\n\r\ntypically, if you contact them and inform them of the copyright infringement and give them the URLs to the stolen and original images along with an explination - they will usually help you out.\r\n\r\nIf not, you can get the government in on it rather easily.\r\n\r\nIf the webmaster is un-willing to help, let them know that you plan on exercising your rights to copyright and if doesn\'t remove it in a timely matter, you will fight until the entire site and host is taken down.'),(17834,'cfca3f69b5','[quote:cfca3f69b5=\"CaboWabo\"]if the webmaster ignores you, go above him:\r\nhttp://www.samspade.org/t/lookat?a=www.xmodsrc.com\r\n\r\ntypically, if you contact them and inform them of the copyright infringement and give them the URLs to the stolen and original images along with an explination - they will usually help you out.\r\n\r\nIf not, you can get the government in on it rather easily.\r\n\r\nIf the webmaster is un-willing to help, let them know that you plan on exercising your rights to copyright and if doesn\'t remove it in a timely matter, you will fight until the entire site and host is taken down.[/quote:cfca3f69b5]Cool thanks for the advice.\r\n\r\nThat\'s probably a better plan.\r\n\r\nMy plan if he ignored me was to go on every Xmod forum on the net and tell people that if he allows my image to be stolen, anything they do could be stolen too, and to let them know what they think about that.\r\n\r\nI figured they might not check all their emails, and there\'s strength in numbers, but there\'s probably even more strength in the law.\r\n\r\nReally I already have a thing against the Xmods website, if I have to get them shut down, that would be a bonus. :-D \r\n\r\nDave'),(20476,'821d98dab8','[quote:821d98dab8=\"SuperFly\"]I\'m interested in a Whoa Nelly for my MR02. I think I want the 1.1, and I think hue35 wants one as well that can be shipped in the same package. How much were they? Do you have any available for delivery?\r\n\r\nThanks man,\r\n\r\nSuperFly[/quote:821d98dab8]\r\n\r\nhey mate, nelly 1.1 costs $25USD a pop, i can throw two into the same bag, shipping would be $5, 7-10 day airmail...\r\n\r\nI have two left out of my current batch that are halfway through production.  made the pcb\'s, put the mosfets on, yet to solder up the cables n shit.  I should have them done by the end of the w/e, ship \'em out early next week, no sweats...\r\n\r\nI\'m building the install doc currently, it\'s a fucken bitch, reminds me too much of my work doco, as you\'ll see when it\'s finished...\r\nbasically you solder the two fatass power wires to the batt +/- terminals, solder four wires onto the rx pcb.  the shit\'s color coded so you can\'t go wrong, lol..... \r\n\r\ndunno if you\'ve seen the latest developments man but check out the nelly thread at brucemicro, there\'s some pics of how she looks.....\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nfellow coffee freak..');
