749ba4746]Cool thanks for the advice.\r\n\r\nThat\'s probably a better plan.\r\n\r\nMy plan if he ignored me was to go on every Xmod forum on the net and tell people that if he allows my image to be stolen, anything they do could be stolen too, and to let them know what they think about that.\r\n\r\nI figured they might not check all their emails, and there\'s strength in numbers, but there\'s probably even more strength in the law.\r\n\r\nReally I already have a thing against the Xmods website, if I have to get them shut down, that would be a bonus. :-D \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:9749ba4746]good idea, do both - get the community behind you, it\'ll only help.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17838,'cb834d6fc2','definately the cuda and mustang set! looks hot. so just to confirm,\r\n1 x tune up set\r\n2 x 3.8\'s\r\nzz front wheels (if ya gottem)\r\nzzse knuckles (if ya gottem)\r\n\r\ncheers'),(24361,'3129368482','What\'s up man.    I own this site with a friend of mine, so I\'ll make sure you can post up a thread...   Just so you know, most of our members are older, like 30s, and those will probably be your target audience as they are the ones with cash to spend, and they\'ll let you know what it\'s worth.. \r\n\r\nYou can probably work a trade also if you need something, it don\'t hurt to throw it out there.. Lots of shit on this site to be traded....lol\r\nThere\'s also a thread for member feedback in the \"contests polls, and surveys\" forum.\r\n\r\nStart the thread, and I\'ll reply, and let the members know I\'m vouching for you...\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(17840,'9749ba4746','[quote:9749ba4746=\"crazydave\"][quote:9749ba4746=\"CaboWabo\"]if the webmaster ignores you, go above him:\r\nhttp://www.samspade.org/t/lookat?a=www.xmodsrc.com\r\n\r\ntypically, if you contact them and inform them of the copyright infringement and give them the URLs to the stolen and original images along with an explination - they will usually help you out.\r\n\r\nIf not, you can get the government in on it rather easily.\r\n\r\nIf the webmaster is un-willing to help, let them know that you plan on exercising your rights to copyright and if doesn\'t remove it in a timely matter, you will fight until the entire site and host is taken down.[/quote:9749ba4746]Cool thanks for the advice.\r\n\r\nThat\'s probably a better plan.\r\n\r\nMy plan if he ignored me was to go on every Xmod forum on the net and tell people that if he allows my image to be stolen, anything they do could be stolen too, and to let them know what they think about that.\r\n\r\nI figured they might not check all their emails, and there\'s strength in numbers, but there\'s probably even more strength in the law.\r\n\r\nReally I already have a thing against the Xmods website, if I have to get them shut down, that would be a bonus. :-D \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:9749ba4746]good idea, do both - get the community behind you, it\'ll only help.'),(17841,'babaed34cd','Just get her in the mail 20 min ago, lovin this ride, thanks a ton man. :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17913,'bfe5237f4f','Well from all the pimps, thanks man.  Think maybe that Pimp of the year award should head your way.... :???:'),(17843,'09e6039349','sorry it took so long, it came back cuz the postage was stale! fuckin mailman, glad its werkin, my mini is hands down one of the faves.'),(17845,'f21569ead6','i also wanna get an initial d set (shells motors etc) and the 2 fast 2 furious body set for someone else, but i\'ll pay for the lot.\r\n\r\nthanks'),(37702,'42e38a7914','Sounds good, remind me later on 2morrow...'),(17847,'2555a04ff9','No problem, I\'ll get yer stuff and mail it this weekend. Give me your address you want me to mail it to. My papal e-mail is greg@grymttr.com, but I\'ll give you a total when I pick the stuff up. Just to confirm:\r\n\r\n1 x tune up set Hemi Cuda and Boss Mustang\r\n1 x tune up set Initial D\r\nFnF body set (silver and blue Skyline and pink S2000)\r\n2 x 3.8\'s \r\nzz front wheels (if I can find some) \r\nzzse knuckles (if I can find some) \r\n\r\nLike I said, I\'ll go this weekend, so if you want to add or subract anything, just let me know before then.\r\n\r\nSuperFly'),(37088,'f94ffa6296','XME039R/4WD\r\n\r\nIf this is all I need for the 4WD, weed out the unnecessary parts that it replaces. \r\n\r\nIf I get the 2nd set in blue would it change the price? If not, gimmie the 2nd set in blue. [b:f94ffa6296]Don\'t commit me to the 2nd set yet I still haven\'t contacted my guy yet.[/b:f94ffa6296] I will do so this evening when I think he got home from work');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17849,'a9ab06ab36','[quote:a9ab06ab36=\"merc-blue\"]hey whats the deal with this is there any way 2 get one or the schems. or sumthing.... looks very cool i have a hobby elect. background and have a solid understainding of electronics... email me at boy_with_pants@hotmail.com[/quote:a9ab06ab36]\r\n\r\n\r\nhere is all you need.  Attach the base of an NPN to a serial pin on your RS232 pinout (your choice which pin, recommend not 1).\r\nThe collector, pulled down with a 1k, connected to the driving connecter on the controller\'s switch. (which ever pin drives the car when asserted, ie the pin wiggling on the RS232)\r\n\r\nThen all you need is the software to control that pin on the RS232.\r\nnow do that for each direction you want to control. (ie Forward, backward, right, left.)\r\n\r\nGot it?\r\n\r\n-nox'),(18373,'03f7b6b541','Dude, why am I so annoying? In that dual cell ZZ thread (mellow yellow....whatever) you insulted me....all I did was complinent the guy and ask what CD meant when he said the rear end will wear out. That\'s all. Why did you find it so annoying? And your avatar....are you fucking crazy man? That\'s my real picture, you really think I\'m THAT much of a dickhead? C\'mon, just tell me, WTF is going on????'),(17851,'418f9c6463','heres how many you have..............\r\n\r\n\r\nBird\r\nbitPlaya\'\r\n\r\n\r\nJoined: 17 Jan 2004\r\nPosts: 129\r\nLocation: waste mifflin, pa');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17854,'fb1b336946','[quote:fb1b336946=\"SuperFly\"]No problem, I\'ll get yer stuff and mail it this weekend. Give me your address you want me to mail it to. My papal e-mail is greg@grymttr.com, but I\'ll give you a total when I pick the stuff up. Just to confirm:\r\n\r\n1 x tune up set Hemi Cuda and Boss Mustang\r\n1 x tune up set Initial D\r\nFnF body set (silver and blue Skyline and pink S2000)\r\n2 x 3.8\'s \r\nzz front wheels (if I can find some) \r\nzzse knuckles (if I can find some) \r\n\r\nLike I said, I\'ll go this weekend, so if you want to add or subract anything, just let me know before then.\r\n\r\nSuperFly[/quote:fb1b336946]\r\n\r\nyep that\'s perfect! thanks so much for this, can\'t wait to get a real shell, not them pussy jap mobiles! :lol:  i won\'t be able to send any cash til next week, probably wednesday so wait til then before posting anything, i could be a clever shyster!! :-(  hehe, anyway that should be it, don\'t go nuts looking for wheels and knuckles, it\'s just on the off chance you might have spares you don\'t want.\r\n\r\nthanks again, trent.'),(17853,'779957d598','you have a problem.\r\nthe first step is admitting it.\r\nseek help.\r\ni got lighted superslick bodies.\r\ni admit that i have a problem. \r\ni gotta stop buying shit.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18374,'03f7b6b541','Dude, why am I so annoying? In that dual cell ZZ thread (mellow yellow....whatever) you insulted me....all I did was complinent the guy and ask what CD meant when he said the rear end will wear out. That\'s all. Why did you find it so annoying? And your avatar....are you fucking crazy man? That\'s my real picture, you really think I\'m THAT much of a dickhead? C\'mon, just tell me, WTF is going on????'),(17856,'4d06974148','picked up a pair of the lighted bodies last night. they suck. the whole thing lights up... the paint is so thin, you\'d have to back it with a darker color to keep the light contained. i covered the contacts with electrical tape. problem solved.\r\n\r\nmy lady finished the kitchen floor last night(she loves doin\' stuff like that). i\'m lovin\' it. got the retro black and white checkerboard racing surface goin\' on now, and no chipped tile hazards.'),(17862,'7ee0eb545b','Hey dude you aint on no more what up?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17858,'9b3bdbefbd','i got a superslick and well i gutted her and the rear end is going to be used for my moderator contest entry. its either gona fall apart before its done or its gona be the baddest bit ive made yet.'),(17860,'ddfff98898','I\'m not even gonna ask what you\'re trying to build. whatever it is it sounds sick.'),(17887,'dd56d5c771','im just gona keep the possi in the rear and remove the front wheel drive shit. then ill put more batteries in there. but i wana get the electronics installed in the project car tonight. but i need to borrow my friends desoldering pump.'),(18367,'7c30703eed','you can tell her that it is still possible for me to get her back without a pic of her. now she can be nice and hand one over or she can make me get harsh.  :cool: \r\n\r\nI know what youd wana see.   :lol:'),(18368,'4d338d6678','what\'s you aol screen name?'),(18369,'4d338d6678','what\'s you aol screen name?'),(18370,'79602f9606','payasodesnudo');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17889,'c679281ad8','I hear that. I\'m already thinkin\' about more batteries in there, too.\r\nthe only drawback is I\'m gonna have to get more IC3\'s.\r\nIf my lady gives me a break from all the home improvin\', I\'m puttin\' pullback wheels on one of my Shens tonight.\r\n\r\nCheck this shit out. I told you we got the new tile laid in the kitchen the other night, right? Well I woke up yesterday morning and my 4 year old had gotten up earlier than us and painted like half of the floor and one of the new (less than 24 hours old) kitchen chairs. I spent a good 9 hours cleaning that shit up yesterday. I was ready to twist her head off.\r\n\r\nLet me know how that goes with the project car.'),(18183,'e6faa03222','[quote:e6faa03222=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:e6faa03222=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:e6faa03222=\"Son_Gokou\"]Hey, I posted some requests in that radio request thread....I can send you the music files if you want.... Just making an offer.[/quote:e6faa03222]unfortunately, for the time being, I\'ve had to cancel the requests due to downloads and viruses, etc.\r\nthanks for the offer, I\'ll try and review your list again and see if I have something.[/quote:e6faa03222]\r\n\r\nWell, if you\'re gonna do that, try searching on Kazaa...[/quote:e6faa03222]you\'re joking right? between the copyright crap (5 seconds of song, the rest bleeps and buzzes) and virus / spyware - it\'s a fruitless search most of the times.'),(17891,'6a1193b73c','haha my kid wanted her nail polish last week so she could paint her door. i said no and explained why. so 10 minutes later shes drawing on the door with a marker.\r\n\r\ncompromise: i bought her some posters');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17893,'0ef44c544a','my girl has painted, make-upped, nail polished, crayoned, markered, anything she can get her hands on, damn near every surface in my house. coloring books don\'t help, nothing helps. we got her a desk at toys be us 3 nights ago and she colored on that thing already. she painted her and her baby sisters faces pink with make-up a few weekends ago(i can\'t wait to get the pics developed). she is out of hand.'),(17895,'95531200e2','haha mine just turned 3. i see what i have to look fwd to in the next year.'),(17897,'f27c0e33df','http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3501\r\n\r\nyou should make your own album in our galleries section and pimp that bad bitch\r\n\r\nor not, just thought I\'d mention it :lol:'),(17898,'014711cf6b','Hey thanks a lot Cabo, I thought it was invetation only.  This is cool. Laters.'),(17899,'014711cf6b','Hey thanks a lot Cabo, I thought it was invetation only.  This is cool. Laters.'),(17915,'c8a4847c65','Hey sorry I have taken so long to get back to ya.  Been busy with other stuff.  Do they still have any hatchies?  if so I do want one.  If it\'s ok w/ you can ya buy one then I\'ll shoot ya the cash in a card or whatever?  Thanks J');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17901,'10e0fd549a','[quote:10e0fd549a=\"Finks\"]Hey thanks a lot Cabo, I thought it was invetation only.  This is cool. Laters.[/quote:10e0fd549a]it is... you\'re invited :grin:'),(17902,'d2b04a6b5c','for your sake, i hope she isn\'t half as bad as mine.\r\nfor my sake, i hope that my 18 month old stays good.\r\ni dunno, though, she\'s learning the ropes from her sister.'),(17904,'4ed1cc49a1','HOly shit this is very sweet!  So are there any guidlines to it?  I mean of course I will keep it all pimp/bit related, but .. hehe sorry this is very cool and I am stoked that you\'re hookin me up.  Allright, well I posted what I needed to.  Cabo always wondered who pays for this site, and doesn\'t the bandwith cost a friggin bag of pretty pennies?'),(17906,'a4686b8c20','you live with three women? damn dude that sucks ass.'),(19399,'3921a0a5c4','i can cast a couple for you! do you live in the states. if you want them painted i will have to charge ya though. and the shipping will be 5 bucks within the usa. and 5 ea. for the painting of the bodies, it will be a total of 15 dollars. do you have a paypal account, that would be an easy way to transfer the money. i have been burnt once already so i cant send of without the funds first... sorry\r\n\r\njmays'),(35003,'b3576749fb','Well I am moving and getting internet cut off in an hour or so. I wont have it back for a few days but if you want to come over to my place on Sunday to make the exchange that would be fine by me. I\'m moving to \r\n111-405 N.Briggs Ave, Sarasota FL 34237\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or concerns the best way to reach me is my cell at  941-735-0591\r\n\r\nLet me know :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35005,'dcd25d8333','This is the final list of what I want according to what you say you have.\r\n\r\nSkyline kit\r\nDogbones x 2 \r\nDual Link Tie Rod Set \r\nBall Diff Set\r\nGPM Front Spring Damper (Purple) \r\nGPM 1pc Rear Oil Damper (Purple) \r\nAll the foams, rims and rubber tires you have.\r\n\r\n$70 shipped (US) to take all that old stuff off your hands. \r\n\r\nMaxx'),(26981,'e342c7b311','The cash is sent.\r\n\r\nThanks, \r\n\r\nMike'),(23188,'066ab51229','Thank you for the kind words as well CW.  You and your site are truly a credit and class act in the hobby.  I definitely got to cool my jets for awhile but all that\'ll mean is that I\'ll probably be hanging here more to decompress some.  \r\n\r\nThanks again man,\r\nMS'),(18363,'24ab0916e1','I\'m up on there right now bro. :-)'),(18364,'24ab0916e1','I\'m up on there right now bro. :-)'),(18365,'e4825b35fe','[quote:e4825b35fe=\"micromatch\"]i wanted to know if you would tradesome of a pair of your really good springs for a white endbell 3.8 i got from grunge. its only got about 3 charges on it in a unmosfetted car and itis great for off roading and street racing. if it sounds good to you pm me back :)\r\n\r\nhave a nice day\r\n-micro[/quote:e4825b35fe]\r\n\r\nsure dude, no sweats.  you send me the 3.8 and once I\'ve received it I\'ll sent you TWO pairs of springs, ready to fit.   I\'m sure you can trust me on this as I\'ve done stuff for you in the past.\r\n\r\nsound good?\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(17909,'4636099308','[quote:4636099308=\"Finks\"]HOly shit this is very sweet!  So are there any guidlines to it?  I mean of course I will keep it all pimp/bit related, but .. hehe sorry this is very cool and I am stoked that you\'re hookin me up.  Allright, well I posted what I needed to.  Cabo always wondered who pays for this site, and doesn\'t the bandwith cost a friggin bag of pretty pennies?[/quote:4636099308]cool man, glad ya dig it.\r\nno real guidelines, just like you say - try to keep it pimp/bit related.\r\n\r\n...and I pay for the site, and yea it costs enough :lol:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17910,'39909f43b3','yeah, i\'m telling you, it does suck. the abundance of feminine things and estrogen in my home is just out of hand. i imagine it will become worse the older my kids get. i\'m just glad my bathroom isn\'t pink anymore. that sucked the worst.'),(17911,'bfe5237f4f','Well from all the pimps, thanks man.  Think maybe that Pimp of the year award should head your way.... :???:'),(19402,'3a7376a93c','i dont know if my first post replie got to you , so here it is again, i do have two of them and i can paint them for you at the price of $5 ea. and the $5 for the shipping within the usa. i will need money first cause i have gotten burnt on the shipping already, i have a paypal account or how ever you want to handle it. but i can paint and send you two bodies.\r\n\r\nthanks\r\njmays'),(19397,'f69bea0db8','Do you have any of those Citroen shells left that you showed in the Gallery.  I would like 2 of them.  Preferaby already painted.'),(19398,'444be758a2','nothing yet finks i\'m keeping my eye open. how are things up in the north, here it has been very stormy with 70 mph wind and thunder and such, i just got my internet connection back up after the wind knocked it out two days ago...lol   anyways its all good now.\r\n\r\nttyl\r\njmays');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37780,'9ff9ef8e12','Hey man just got your pm now...\r\n\r\nok as for price big guy I feel your judgement is good enough, i\'m not sure how much shipping costs are but what ever you feel is right is cool.\r\n\r\nsend you cashity cash to \r\n\r\nsstirpe@sympatico.ca\r\n\r\nDon\'t forget your address! lol...I should be able to ship in the next few days!!!\r\n\r\nTake it easy'),(35558,'7c64c3e067','Hey,\r\n\r\nI am new to this forum, and I dont know much electronics,mechanics etc. I recently took apart my zipzap monster truck, and now I cannot put it back together.I took it apart, because it was stuttering a bit. Well I could but it would only steer right now left. So if you think you can help me on how to put a zzmt back together that would be great, Thank you.'),(37827,'131e88a43f','I\'m gonna pay pal you the $20 for the chassis tonight. Is that ok?'),(37828,'ad81360c09','That\'s fine just make sure you send it to \r\n\r\nsstirpe@sympatico.ca\r\n\r\nSoon as I get noticed the stuff will be shipped \r\n\r\nYou just wanted the two 27mhz chassis right? the 27, and the 27a chassis?\r\n\r\nsend me your addy and I could try for it to be sent wednesday or thursday....\r\n\r\ntake it easy pimp'),(17918,'098741209b','hey betty.k, hows it goin? I saw that you are looking for alloys. I\'m pm\'ing you this instead of putting it in the forum because I think ez only has like 2 sets left and I\'d rather see you get them than some kid who just joined a week ago, so check the list on this post:\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3440\r\n\r\nand then check the available sets out here:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.scala43.com/scala43/rad.htm\r\n\r\nsee if you like \'em and then email ez. I just bought 2 sets and he was very easy to do business with. He charged me $15 a set shipped(same as what pimps paid last summer), I don\'t know if it would change for Australia, and I don\'t think it would be that much more.\r\n\r\nlet me know how it goes.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17919,'7db8b8307c','[quote:7db8b8307c=\"Finks\"]Well from all the pimps, thanks man.  Think maybe that Pimp of the year award should head your way.... :???:[/quote:7db8b8307c]aww schucks :-) \r\nno problem man - I get my thanks back when good members like yourself find us and participate and help keep the hobby going in the right direction.'),(17920,'06718a61e7','no problem finks i will get over there in the next few days and pick one up for ya, just give me your address again so i can mail it out monday.\r\n\r\njeff\r\n\r\nhere is my email i use all the time so it would be easier to catch up with me here\r\n\r\nsuperpieboy@yahoo.com\r\n\r\nthanks'),(18182,'5d638d787a','[quote:5d638d787a=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:5d638d787a=\"Son_Gokou\"]Hey, I posted some requests in that radio request thread....I can send you the music files if you want.... Just making an offer.[/quote:5d638d787a]unfortunately, for the time being, I\'ve had to cancel the requests due to downloads and viruses, etc.\r\nthanks for the offer, I\'ll try and review your list again and see if I have something.[/quote:5d638d787a]\r\n\r\nWell, if you\'re gonna do that, try searching on Kazaa...'),(17924,'59969c8b82','hey man! :-) thanks for thinking about me! i checked out what he had but they\'re not quite where i\'m after. but thanks for the scala link, i\'ll be checking their stuff out for sure! hope them rims workout well for ya!\r\n\r\ncheers');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17925,'94c966ae62','Not much happening here, just back [color=red:94c966ae62][size=24:94c966ae62]PAIN[/size:94c966ae62][/color:94c966ae62]!!!!!!!\r\n\r\nMy xmod is making a funny noise, i can\'t figure it out.  I think i hit the cat too hard with it.  It might have a furball!!!!!!'),(17926,'40c193458b','RL info is\r\nJesse King\r\n25 Springview Ln Unit #3\r\nWest Bath, ME 04530\r\n\r\nThanks bro'),(17927,'c2248a3f8c','I got a message at my hotmail account from cabo.myspace.com telling me that I\'ve got a message at [b:c2248a3f8c]MY[/b:c2248a3f8c] myspace acct. I\'ve got no clue when and how I got a myspace mail account (could be the alcohol). Anyway man, Do you have any insight on this? :???:'),(17928,'c2248a3f8c','I got a message at my hotmail account from cabo.myspace.com telling me that I\'ve got a message at [b:c2248a3f8c]MY[/b:c2248a3f8c] myspace acct. I\'ve got no clue when and how I got a myspace mail account (could be the alcohol). Anyway man, Do you have any insight on this? :???:'),(31874,'52dc53766b','Booted his worthless ass:\r\nhttp://tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;postid=192020#post192020\r\n\r\nIn case you\'d like to \"love\" him for a little longer, his IP is:\r\n65.35.117.181 (or at least that\'s the IP on record).\r\n\r\nIf anybody asks, it wasn\'t me that gave you that IP!  :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37433,'b5aa6c9c9b','[quote:b5aa6c9c9b=\"steelwoolghandi\"][quote:b5aa6c9c9b=\"sg219\"]Went out today. :-o[/quote:b5aa6c9c9b]\r\n\r\nI will get out some stuff to you (I will try) tomorrow I have been knee deep in work and traveling but will get it out As soon as I can. Thanks man and thank bird for me!!  :-)[/quote:b5aa6c9c9b]\r\n\r\nWhenever.  It\'s cool. :cool:'),(29237,'048d7d58c6','$60 shipped..........'),(17930,'b4affe6854','[quote:b4affe6854=\"sessiz\"]I got a message at my hotmail account from cabo.myspace.com telling me that I\'ve got a message at [b:b4affe6854]MY[/b:b4affe6854] myspace acct. I\'ve got no clue when and how I got a myspace mail account (could be the alcohol). Anyway man, Do you have any insight on this? :???:[/quote:b4affe6854]no I don\'t know. I\'d not touch it - just delete it.\r\n\r\nyou know how spammers work.\r\n\r\nthey\'re spoofing the header information in the email. makes it look like it comes from \"cabowabo\" or \"lixlink\".\r\n(I think we have a few enemies of bitPimps, we always have - I\'ve had to fight off hackers since day 1 on this site.)\r\n\r\nif it aint from bitpimpsfeedback@lixlink.com or cabowabo@lixlink.com then it has nothing to do with me and is probably a virus.\r\neven if you do see it\'s from one of those email addresses - it should be normal text message, it should never contain an attachment.\r\n\r\nfuckin spammers'),(17931,'ea1b9e71c4','dude thats some shit. i think its time to go to plan b 8-) \r\n\r\nyes you have forced me to goto plan b. you didnt wana do that.\r\n\r\ngood work man. thats badass.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17933,'ea1b9e71c4','dude thats some shit. i think its time to go to plan b 8-) \r\n\r\nyes you have forced me to goto plan b. you didnt wana do that.\r\n\r\ngood work man. thats badass.'),(17935,'7b04f66862','[quote:7b04f66862=\"hogjowlz\"]dude thats some shit. i think its time to go to plan b 8-) \r\n\r\nyes you have forced me to goto plan b. you didnt wana do that.\r\n\r\ngood work man. thats badass.[/quote:7b04f66862] :lol: Oh shit, I don\'t think I wanna know what plan B is. :shock: \r\n\r\nThanks man, the bitch fatser than I thought it would be. 8-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(17936,'786a462e48','you gota harness that energy a little more. lay in the jbweld. if you get it right you will get a 20-30% boost. less slop in the rear. that is a true piece of muscle tho.'),(17937,'8666726bd4','ya dude ill roll up to that shit. float me the details yo.'),(17939,'786a462e48','you gota harness that energy a little more. lay in the jbweld. if you get it right you will get a 20-30% boost. less slop in the rear. that is a true piece of muscle tho.'),(18359,'ba66710cf7','[quote:ba66710cf7=\"sessiz\"]Looks like I asked the right person, thanks. :-) \r\nMy only condition is $$$ right now man. I\'ld love to go all out and flash it up and what not but not at the point where I\'m spending hundreds, ya feel me?\r\nThanks again cabo.[/quote:ba66710cf7]totally feel ya - you\'ll have options.\r\nyou just have to decide if they\'re worth it to you.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18361,'d508de24d4','hey fuck this pm shit, get me on that aol thingy.\r\nI tried to add you to the buddy list yesterday but it just wasn\'t working.\r\nscreen name bitPimps'),(17941,'37f2b11d55','Hey thanks Dave.  I thought it was a great idea for a contest, but that whole moving thing screwed me up.  \r\n\r\nBut if you wanna send me some homies, THANKS.\r\n\r\nMichael Smalley Jr.\r\n3918 Inland Ave.\r\nWest Mifflin, Pa 15122'),(17942,'37f2b11d55','Hey thanks Dave.  I thought it was a great idea for a contest, but that whole moving thing screwed me up.  \r\n\r\nBut if you wanna send me some homies, THANKS.\r\n\r\nMichael Smalley Jr.\r\n3918 Inland Ave.\r\nWest Mifflin, Pa 15122'),(17943,'824d10c579','[quote:824d10c579=\"hogjowlz\"]you gota harness that energy a little more. lay in the jbweld. if you get it right you will get a 20-30% boost. less slop in the rear. that is a true piece of muscle tho.[/quote:824d10c579]I\'ll tell ya, I wholeheartedly agree with your use of JB Weld to eliminate slop, the only reason I haven\'t tried it, is because with my long hair, and my hair line receding in my old age, plus 2 cats. I\'m lucky if I make it through a whole run without getting a hair tangled in the gears. So I kinda need to remove the rear axle, a lot.\r\n\r\nBut, I totally agree this car needs some major taming. I\'m gonna order some slot car bushings, and try to make them slip into my chassis the way they would on a slot car, but if I don\'t work that out in time for the end of the contest, I [i:824d10c579]will[/i:824d10c579] be using some JB Weld.\r\n\r\nDave'),(17944,'2dd63ec10b','you can use a minimal amount around the sides if you need to remove every so often. just never ever use any wetlube if you do that shit.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17945,'05d795479a','Well I got the pictures posted, thanks for allowing me to use it, let me know if I made any mistake.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ripper7racing.com/galleries/\r\n\r\nLater\r\n\r\nRipper7777777\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com'),(17947,'f497773f0d','Well I got the pictures posted, thanks for allowing me to use it, let me know if I made any mistake.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ripper7racing.com/galleries/\r\n\r\nLater\r\n\r\nRipper7777777\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com'),(17948,'7b113d2674','Well I got the pictures posted, thanks for allowing me to use it, let me know if I made any mistake.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ripper7racing.com/galleries/\r\n\r\nLater\r\n\r\nRipper7777777\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com'),(17949,'748010b7f1','Well I got the pictures posted, thanks for allowing me to use it, let me know if I made any mistake.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ripper7racing.com/galleries/\r\n\r\nThanks again CaboWabo, I tried to make sure to credit the bit pimps as much as possible.\r\n\r\nLater\r\n\r\nRipper7777777\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com'),(17950,'2c777c1074','I\'ll keep checking the xmod site. it still says \"to be announced\".');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17951,'7b113d2674','Well I got the pictures posted, thanks for allowing me to use it, let me know if I made any mistake.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ripper7racing.com/galleries/\r\n\r\nLater\r\n\r\nRipper7777777\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com'),(33241,'2228df190d','[quote:2228df190d=\"cj\"][quote:2228df190d=\"sg219\"]I\'m lookin\' for tires, wheels, and diffs, or anything else that my come my way.  Not really lookin\' to buy, just trade at the moment. \r\n\r\nI think I\'m getting the Hardcore green stuff.  There\'s a package deal on Ebay I\'ve been eyeing up.  $85 for all the goodies from HC.\r\n\r\nDid you have something in mind?[/quote:2228df190d]\r\n\r\nI am planning on reducing some of my Xmods stock and go into other cars.  I still will stock Original Xmods parts like Axles and Knuckles just not a lot of the other parts. [b:2228df190d]SECRET[/b:2228df190d] [size=9:2228df190d][i:2228df190d]I am working with GPM now on the EVO and EVO-T.[/i:2228df190d][/size:2228df190d][/quote:2228df190d]\r\n\r\nCool. \r\n\r\n[b:2228df190d]1/18th scale[/b:2228df190d] \r\n\r\nMRS4, Mini-T, M18, RC18T, are all good canidates for good parts and the sales of them.  There are tons of cars out there, but as far as 1/18th scale, those are the cream of the crop for now.\r\n\r\n[b:2228df190d]1/10th scale[/b:2228df190d]\r\n\r\nAnything.  There\'s just so many cars and trucks that you could sell parts for its rediculous to even begin to name all of them. \r\n\r\nI have a TC3 that I would like to get parts for, but all I ever see is fuckin\' blue.   :? \r\n\r\nLet me know if I can be of any help. :-)'),(17953,'748010b7f1','Well I got the pictures posted, thanks for allowing me to use it, let me know if I made any mistake.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ripper7racing.com/galleries/\r\n\r\nThanks again CaboWabo, I tried to make sure to credit the bit pimps as much as possible.\r\n\r\nLater\r\n\r\nRipper7777777\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (27857,'658a1033e1','Yo mang.\r\nI need your shipping info so I can send you some of these sticker decals.\r\n\r\nThey\'re on the white background so you\'ll have to cut them out.\r\nJust peel them off and stick.\r\nThese aren\'t the best by far, but maybe you use them - if not, no biggie.'),(37877,'dfc0196a20','Sorry about that, i wont put anything like that in it again :-)  Thanks for the heads up :-o'),(35448,'6899029723','[quote:6899029723=\"Bithigh707\"]Shit If anybody owes anything it\'s me for all of the ideas i get from you Pimps wish I could buy one one Bits that the dem Greman catz do sorry if I came off the wrong way.[/quote:6899029723]\r\nNo worries man, easy to mis-interpret the typed word. If we were speaking in person, there wouldn\'t be as much confusion.\r\nI just didn\'t want you to feel \"ripped off\" or something, because we are not like that here at all.\r\n\r\nAnyways, we\'ll chalk it up to a mis-understanding and move on.\r\nAlls good in da hood ya know.'),(17955,'2dd63ec10b','you can use a minimal amount around the sides if you need to remove every so often. just never ever use any wetlube if you do that shit.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (25397,'3514c39371','It\'s cool with me....\r\n\r\nHere\'s a link to the contest section\r\n\r\nhttp://ripper7racing.com/forums/index.php?s=301789e9ae5e6e976927a0622d452b75&amp;showforum=62'),(24921,'77dd7ad423','Hey man whats up, I\'ve been kinda under the radar with the new kid, the server move and more work than I know what to do, also the mag should go up monday your ad looks great.\r\n\r\nI was curious if you had any idea how much bandwidth on average gtchat uses, I\'m testing x7 and I like that it integrates with my forum but it is a whore for BW.\r\n\r\nWell just wondering and I\'ll shoot you a link when the mag goes up, after all this I should be able to keep the mag on a schedule....LOL'),(18357,'5ef39fa0b2','Looks like I asked the right person, thanks. :-) \r\nMy only condition is $$$ right now man. I\'ld love to go all out and flash it up and what not but not at the point where I\'m spending hundreds, ya feel me?\r\nThanks again cabo.'),(24079,'db5f5c132b','hey bro I picked up one of them subs at wally world today, they are tiny lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37013,'165bf7c0e0','[quote:165bf7c0e0=\"cj\"][quote:165bf7c0e0=\"Tuner1989\"]Hey cj would you be willing to part the IW Tx out?\r\n\r\nAlso does it have a reversable trigger feature?[/quote:165bf7c0e0]\r\n\r\nNo I really want to get rid of the whole car.  It wouldn\'t be as good a deal when you add up the cost of the controller and the receiver would be more that the package price. \r\n\r\nWhat you do you mean by reversible?  You want to change it around like a Xmods controller?  If that what you mean then NO it can\'t.[/quote:165bf7c0e0]\r\n\r\nNah i mean reversible like on the older IW controllers where you could reverse the channel of the throttle.\r\n\r\nSwitch around the up motion and down motions of the trigger. etc.'),(17959,'42e794caf0','Well I see it\'s been a month since I intended to send it, but I finally got off my ass.\r\n\r\nHere\'s what\'s on the way to you...\r\n[img:42e794caf0]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/cbscar.jpg[/img:42e794caf0]\r\n\r\nThe S2K is not the best fit for this chassis, but I knew you liked them, so I threw that on there.\r\n\r\nIt\'s fully drivable, so I\'ll let you work out the details, probably needs a faster motor.\r\nA little tip: turn the wheels back when you take the picture, and they\'ll look centered in the chassis.;)\r\n\r\n\r\nHave to tell you, I heard something rattling around in there. I\'m hoping it\'s not a seed, like I accidently sent Havok. I really gotta start checking my boxes better. :roll:\r\n\r\nAnyways, the FET mod is epoxied down, so if it\'s anything from the car rattling around, you should be able to fix it.\r\n\r\nEnjoy it. Sorry it took so long to actually send it.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18181,'5d638d787a','[quote:5d638d787a=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:5d638d787a=\"Son_Gokou\"]Hey, I posted some requests in that radio request thread....I can send you the music files if you want.... Just making an offer.[/quote:5d638d787a]unfortunately, for the time being, I\'ve had to cancel the requests due to downloads and viruses, etc.\r\nthanks for the offer, I\'ll try and review your list again and see if I have something.[/quote:5d638d787a]\r\n\r\nWell, if you\'re gonna do that, try searching on Kazaa...');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17961,'a625fccff4','man am i pissed. took a drive put to that \"hobbytown usa\" out robinson town center today, hoping to get some alloy locknuts for the xmod and miniz clone. do these hobby shop people have something against micros? they had micro rs4 shit, but no wheel nuts for them. they had mini-z shit, but , you guessed it, no wheel nuts! WTF!!!! I guess its gonna have to be dinball or mini-z racer.com or something. whatever. it pisses me off.'),(17962,'6d24bdbf1e','[quote:6d24bdbf1e=\"ripper7777777\"]Well I got the pictures posted, thanks for allowing me to use it, let me know if I made any mistake.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ripper7racing.com/galleries/\r\n\r\nThanks again CaboWabo, I tried to make sure to credit the bit pimps as much as possible.\r\n\r\nLater\r\n\r\nRipper7777777\r\nwww.ripper7racing.com[/quote:6d24bdbf1e]perfect homey.\r\nthanks for making it easy and thanks for putting us in your best of the best gallery.\r\n\r\nC-dub'),(17964,'b442891358','Nice....very nice your site!\r\n\r\nHere is my newest ride!\r\n\r\n\r\n[img:b442891358]http://land.heim.at/toskana/211863/IMG_2429.JPG[/img:b442891358]\r\n\r\n[img:b442891358]http://land.heim.at/toskana/211863/IMG_2432.jpg[/img:b442891358]\r\n\r\n[img:b442891358]http://land.heim.at/toskana/211863/IMG_2434.JPG[/img:b442891358]\r\n\r\n[img:b442891358]http://land.heim.at/toskana/211863/IMG_2435.jpg[/img:b442891358]\r\n\r\nHave a nice day');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18210,'8a7f9972df','Hi!\r\n\r\n[quote:8a7f9972df=\"crazychimp\"]I am wondering if you know a common place I can find that wire mesh you used on your skyline [/quote:8a7f9972df]\r\nYou can buy them here: [url=http://jadarhobby.waw.pl/e_portal/c_default.php?PHPSESSID=c6e76a94eebfcea613860e8ca2e5bbe4&amp;cPath=18_60_63&amp;sort=5a&amp;page=3&amp;language=en&amp;currency=USD&amp;PHPSESSID=c6e76a94eebfcea613860e8ca2e5bbe4]LINK[/url]\r\n\r\n[quote:8a7f9972df=\"crazychimp\"]I\'m working on several new customs (although they won\'t compare to yours) a semi, an s2000, and not sure what do do with it yet, but a strange no-name rally-ish body.  Your ideas have inspired me and I want to go above and beyond what I would have done (first paint job), and I have studied up on technique.[/quote:8a7f9972df]  \r\nNice to hear that :)\r\n[quote:8a7f9972df=\"crazychimp\"]\r\nI\'m sorry to have wasted your time, you must have dozens of pms a day.[/quote:8a7f9972df]\r\nYou don\'t waste my time.\r\n\r\nCheers\r\nMiva'),(17966,'b138e7ea87','Thanks, we are trying to build a site for all RC fans to come and give and get information.\r\n\r\nThat Car is just awe inspiring, I love that shade of green.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17967,'42e794caf0','Well I see it\'s been a month since I intended to send it, but I finally got off my ass.\r\n\r\nHere\'s what\'s on the way to you...\r\n[img:42e794caf0]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/cbscar.jpg[/img:42e794caf0]\r\n\r\nThe S2K is not the best fit for this chassis, but I knew you liked them, so I threw that on there.\r\n\r\nIt\'s fully drivable, so I\'ll let you work out the details, probably needs a faster motor.\r\nA little tip: turn the wheels back when you take the picture, and they\'ll look centered in the chassis.;)\r\n\r\n\r\nHave to tell you, I heard something rattling around in there. I\'m hoping it\'s not a seed, like I accidently sent Havok. I really gotta start checking my boxes better. :roll:\r\n\r\nAnyways, the FET mod is epoxied down, so if it\'s anything from the car rattling around, you should be able to fix it.\r\n\r\nEnjoy it. Sorry it took so long to actually send it.\r\n\r\nDave'),(17968,'de811e3836','hahaa a seed, that\'s funny.\r\nno problem on the time man, all\'s good there - I\'ve been squeezed for time lately anyways.\r\nI\'ve been working on a body - haven\'t told anyone about it yet (not even payaso) it\'s going okay, but time is hard to find to get it done.\r\nI just replaced my ganked camera so I\'ve got some catching up to do - I got a bonzer mat to take pics of and give some initial thoughts on (between you and me - not worth the cash)\r\nI\'ve got some plans for that baby too, but I have to check on some things first.\r\nanyways - totally kick-ass that you\'re sending me this bad bitch, can\'t wait to hook it up.\r\nI\'m all fuckered up right now so I\'ll chat at ya more later :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18166,'ffae8ac4dd','cool, i will remove them from my gallery, no point doubling up. oh and thanks for the rotm honours! pretty funny really, it\'s won 3 things now and it\'s the one i use the least!! :lol: \r\n\r\ncheers brudda, trent.'),(17974,'8a39d01e8c','Hey what\'s up?\r\n\r\nGot them Homies out today. They\'re all unique, mostly series 6, but there\'s a skater Hoodrat, and I think a couple series 4, I don\'t know, it was a mixed up machine, I saw clowns in there too.\r\n\r\nYeah, you know I thought it was pretty lame for no one to even try. It wasn\'t like some big official contest, but hey, we\'re off\'ing up Homies, and a spotlight, just to have a little fun.  Whatever, their loss.  :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(17970,'de811e3836','hahaa a seed, that\'s funny.\r\nno problem on the time man, all\'s good there - I\'ve been squeezed for time lately anyways.\r\nI\'ve been working on a body - haven\'t told anyone about it yet (not even payaso) it\'s going okay, but time is hard to find to get it done.\r\nI just replaced my ganked camera so I\'ve got some catching up to do - I got a bonzer mat to take pics of and give some initial thoughts on (between you and me - not worth the cash)\r\nI\'ve got some plans for that baby too, but I have to check on some things first.\r\nanyways - totally kick-ass that you\'re sending me this bad bitch, can\'t wait to hook it up.\r\nI\'m all fuckered up right now so I\'ll chat at ya more later :-)'),(17971,'a474573d41','[quote:a474573d41=\"CaboWabo\"]\r\nI just replaced my ganked camera so I\'ve got some catching up to do - I got a bonzer mat to take pics of and give some initial thoughts on (between you and me - not worth the cash)[/quote:a474573d41]If you ask me, none of these track kits are. Some guy on TRC trying to sell his crap for 80 bucks for a 6\'x6\', and 140 for 12\'x6\'. You have to cut all the railings out, and it takes you a day to put it together.\r\n\r\n...and it\'s totally portable, it ships in an 8 foot long tube you can store it in. :roll:\r\n\r\nFor 140 I\'d build a permanent track, and detail it with all that cool railroal stuff.\r\n\r\n\r\n\"Fuckered\"  :lol: \r\nYou guys with your words today...ok go be fuckered man.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17972,'a474573d41','[quote:a474573d41=\"CaboWabo\"]\r\nI just replaced my ganked camera so I\'ve got some catching up to do - I got a bonzer mat to take pics of and give some initial thoughts on (between you and me - not worth the cash)[/quote:a474573d41]If you ask me, none of these track kits are. Some guy on TRC trying to sell his crap for 80 bucks for a 6\'x6\', and 140 for 12\'x6\'. You have to cut all the railings out, and it takes you a day to put it together.\r\n\r\n...and it\'s totally portable, it ships in an 8 foot long tube you can store it in. :roll:\r\n\r\nFor 140 I\'d build a permanent track, and detail it with all that cool railroal stuff.\r\n\r\n\r\n\"Fuckered\"  :lol: \r\nYou guys with your words today...ok go be fuckered man.\r\n\r\nDave'),(17973,'0f2abe514c','[quote:0f2abe514c=\"crazydave\"][quote:0f2abe514c=\"CaboWabo\"]\r\nI just replaced my ganked camera so I\'ve got some catching up to do - I got a bonzer mat to take pics of and give some initial thoughts on (between you and me - not worth the cash)[/quote:0f2abe514c]If you ask me, none of these track kits are. Some guy on TRC trying to sell his crap for 80 bucks for a 6\'x6\', and 140 for 12\'x6\'. You have to cut all the railings out, and it takes you a day to put it together.\r\n\r\n...and it\'s totally portable, it ships in an 8 foot long tube you can store it in. :roll:\r\n\r\nFor 140 I\'d build a permanent track, and detail it with all that cool railroal stuff.\r\n\r\n\r\n\"Fuckered\"  :lol: \r\nYou guys with your words today...ok go be fuckered man.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:0f2abe514c]yea tell me about it - this one was a freebie of sorts so...\r\nI was thinkin - I wanted to find out what shipping would be on the thang.\r\nI could either\r\n- ship it off to one of you pimps, let em play with it for awhile, then ship it off to the next pimp in line and just let it circle the globe.\r\n- keep it and offer it up as a prize for some big ass contest yet to be thought about\r\n\r\nboth sound cool to me\r\n\r\nI like \"fuckered\", it\'s easier to say than \"higher than bird pussy\" :lol:'),(17975,'7012e0e004','that ride of the month thing...\r\nI\'d like to keep that running but I understand if you don\'t have time or whatever - I\'ll be glad to take over on that one\r\nsound cool?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17976,'8d94cc43ef','TellYa What, Let\'s let the Pimps choose from the 4 weeks in the month for the Car-O-Da-Month, then let \'em pick the Car Of The Year in December.\r\n\r\nLet\'s set up the announcement, then the pole.\r\n\r\nSound Cool ?'),(17977,'31b6810740','Thanks, man.\r\n\r\nMy Homies collection has a lot of holes in it, so I\'m sure that some of those will be filled. I don\'t have any rats, so it will be cool to finally have one. I know what you mean about the machines. The main one that I hit up spits out Palermos half the time. There is a quarter machine in a little mom and pop store near me that has a bunch of Homies, but you gotta go through a bunch of ricky martin keychains and crap to get to them. I\'m keeping a close eye on that one, because when all the other crap is almost gone, I\'m hitting that with a pocket full of quarters.\r\n\r\nHave you seen on the Homies site: Coming this summer, Trailer Park! That should be interesting.\r\n\r\nOnce again, thanks.\r\n\r\nJay(bird)'),(17978,'7578b77430','try home depot dude. ya hobbyscam usa blows nuts.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17980,'f3e381a8f2','already tried lowes and busy beaver, can\'t find anything smaller than 4mm. I\'ll probly just order the cheapest I can find online.'),(18180,'40cf376913','[quote:40cf376913=\"Son_Gokou\"]Hey, I posted some requests in that radio request thread....I can send you the music files if you want.... Just making an offer.[/quote:40cf376913]unfortunately, for the time being, I\'ve had to cancel the requests due to downloads and viruses, etc.\r\nthanks for the offer, I\'ll try and review your list again and see if I have something.'),(18353,'783b8c71a2','I\'m looking into making up a gallery site for myself and was wondering if you had a recomendation for a host. I\'ve been looking around but being the fuckin dumbass I\'m really not sure what to look for. Any help/advice would be apreciated bro. :-)'),(26214,'e6c9fe7093','[quote:e6c9fe7093=\"hogjowlz\"]ill put the cuda on it then. its boogered up a bit but not too beat lol.[/quote:e6c9fe7093]\r\n\r\nHog, did you ever ship it, I never received it here.'),(26215,'8829824ab4','lol sorry dude actually i have a cuda body untouched you can have ill even throw in the challenger. i need your address again.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17984,'0f2abe514c','[quote:0f2abe514c=\"crazydave\"][quote:0f2abe514c=\"CaboWabo\"]\r\nI just replaced my ganked camera so I\'ve got some catching up to do - I got a bonzer mat to take pics of and give some initial thoughts on (between you and me - not worth the cash)[/quote:0f2abe514c]If you ask me, none of these track kits are. Some guy on TRC trying to sell his crap for 80 bucks for a 6\'x6\', and 140 for 12\'x6\'. You have to cut all the railings out, and it takes you a day to put it together.\r\n\r\n...and it\'s totally portable, it ships in an 8 foot long tube you can store it in. :roll:\r\n\r\nFor 140 I\'d build a permanent track, and detail it with all that cool railroal stuff.\r\n\r\n\r\n\"Fuckered\"  :lol: \r\nYou guys with your words today...ok go be fuckered man.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:0f2abe514c]yea tell me about it - this one was a freebie of sorts so...\r\nI was thinkin - I wanted to find out what shipping would be on the thang.\r\nI could either\r\n- ship it off to one of you pimps, let em play with it for awhile, then ship it off to the next pimp in line and just let it circle the globe.\r\n- keep it and offer it up as a prize for some big ass contest yet to be thought about\r\n\r\nboth sound cool to me\r\n\r\nI like \"fuckered\", it\'s easier to say than \"higher than bird pussy\" :lol:'),(17985,'12c3e62a9d','Well that was cool of Bonzer dude to send you a freebie. \r\n\r\nIf he ever comes \'round these parts we\'ll have to get him fuckered. :lol: \r\n\r\nI\'m just past baked, working on toasted, hoping to be flame broiled before I\'m done.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17986,'31b6810740','Thanks, man.\r\n\r\nMy Homies collection has a lot of holes in it, so I\'m sure that some of those will be filled. I don\'t have any rats, so it will be cool to finally have one. I know what you mean about the machines. The main one that I hit up spits out Palermos half the time. There is a quarter machine in a little mom and pop store near me that has a bunch of Homies, but you gotta go through a bunch of ricky martin keychains and crap to get to them. I\'m keeping a close eye on that one, because when all the other crap is almost gone, I\'m hitting that with a pocket full of quarters.\r\n\r\nHave you seen on the Homies site: Coming this summer, Trailer Park! That should be interesting.\r\n\r\nOnce again, thanks.\r\n\r\nJay(bird)'),(17988,'a4715043ce','[quote:a4715043ce=\"Bird\"]The main one that I hit up spits out Palermos half the time.[/quote:a4715043ce]Well that\'s just funny. I used to really want that guy, I was gonna trade a pile of Homies and paint a body for him. Then I ended up getting him, and again later.\r\n\r\nBut then I got three more when I went to get yours. I had said I wouldn\'t make any garantees about doubles, but I couldn\'t send you 4 of the same guy, so went back with more quarters.\r\n\r\nYou have a Palermo curse and you jinxed me. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(17989,'114f0d1d15','[quote:114f0d1d15=\"crazydave\"]You have a Palermo curse and you jinxed me. :lol:[/quote:114f0d1d15]\r\nhaha Sorry, man. I\'ve been after the elusive \"godfather\" Palermo for ages now, but my lady has been making me hit the Spongebob machine because we just redid our bathroom in a Spongebob theme(toilet seat, shower curtain, blue and white sponged paint to simulate water, and a bunch of stickers and Homie-sized Spongebob figures), and my collecting has been suffering. I also have a paralell collection of female Homies doubles going on for my 4 year old daughter, because she digs them.\r\n\r\nI remember what I was meaning to say to you... Remember a while back, when you were doing the baja Beetle, and you showed the Motorworks dumptruck, and I suggested making a flatbed on a zz chassis to haul your bits? That Camaro you are doing for the moderator contest would look too sweet sitting on a matched flatbed. Just somethin\' to get ya thinkin\'. Maybe a side project to keep the Camaro work from driving you nuts....\r\n\r\nJay(bird)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17990,'c22e943708','ya the dude at hobbytown tried to show me some steel ones that were over with the airplane shit, and I was like \"nah, I want nylock.\" \r\n\r\nI dont want to risk strippin\' the axles. the stock xmod ones really aren\'t that bad, but the ones on the iWaver blow. the xmod ones won\'t directly fit, so i think I\'m gonna try to drill a few out(not really out, just through... maybe with the teeeeny etching bit on the dremel) because I\'m sure they would work better than the crappy iWaver ones.\r\n\r\nI will eventually gets my alloy, though.'),(17991,'8d94cc43ef','TellYa What, Let\'s let the Pimps choose from the 4 weeks in the month for the Car-O-Da-Month, then let \'em pick the Car Of The Year in December.\r\n\r\nLet\'s set up the announcement, then the pole.\r\n\r\nSound Cool ?'),(18165,'ffae8ac4dd','cool, i will remove them from my gallery, no point doubling up. oh and thanks for the rotm honours! pretty funny really, it\'s won 3 things now and it\'s the one i use the least!! :lol: \r\n\r\ncheers brudda, trent.'),(17993,'12c3e62a9d','Well that was cool of Bonzer dude to send you a freebie. \r\n\r\nIf he ever comes \'round these parts we\'ll have to get him fuckered. :lol: \r\n\r\nI\'m just past baked, working on toasted, hoping to be flame broiled before I\'m done.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (17994,'b138e7ea87','Thanks, we are trying to build a site for all RC fans to come and give and get information.\r\n\r\nThat Car is just awe inspiring, I love that shade of green.'),(17995,'5cb3268f4f','[quote:5cb3268f4f=\"sg219\"]Hey thanks Dave.  I thought it was a great idea for a contest, but that whole moving thing screwed me up.  \r\n\r\nBut if you wanna send me some homies, THANKS.\r\n\r\nMichael Smalley Jr.\r\n3918 Inland Ave.\r\nWest Mifflin, Pa 15122[/quote:5cb3268f4f]Well I din\'t have as many spare quarters as I thought, I but I put a couple homies in the mail or you today.\r\n\r\nI should have shoved them in with Bird\'s now that I think about it, you two hang out anyways, and they cost as much to ship as the homies do.  :lol: \r\n\r\nOh well, the thought that counts.\r\n\r\nDave'),(17996,'07087583af','Ya, I didn\'t even think of puttin\' them in with Birds.  Well, thanks again!!\r\n\r\nHopefully I don\'t miss the next deadline for a contest.  \r\n\r\nI can\'t say it enough, you do some sweet work. Take it easy and stay on to of Mount Bottle Cap......'),(17997,'114f0d1d15','[quote:114f0d1d15=\"crazydave\"]You have a Palermo curse and you jinxed me. :lol:[/quote:114f0d1d15]\r\nhaha Sorry, man. I\'ve been after the elusive \"godfather\" Palermo for ages now, but my lady has been making me hit the Spongebob machine because we just redid our bathroom in a Spongebob theme(toilet seat, shower curtain, blue and white sponged paint to simulate water, and a bunch of stickers and Homie-sized Spongebob figures), and my collecting has been suffering. I also have a paralell collection of female Homies doubles going on for my 4 year old daughter, because she digs them.\r\n\r\nI remember what I was meaning to say to you... Remember a while back, when you were doing the baja Beetle, and you showed the Motorworks dumptruck, and I suggested making a flatbed on a zz chassis to haul your bits? That Camaro you are doing for the moderator contest would look too sweet sitting on a matched flatbed. Just somethin\' to get ya thinkin\'. Maybe a side project to keep the Camaro work from driving you nuts....\r\n\r\nJay(bird)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18179,'52cd5c939d','[quote:52cd5c939d=\"SuperEMAXX\"]I have the money now, Do you remember what i wanted?\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nTyler[/quote:52cd5c939d]\r\n\r\nMy apologies, I\'ve been very busy with a new job lately.   Sorry for not reponding.   I\'m happy to to the headlight mod for you with the DIP switch and a 3V litium battery.   If you still want to go ahead with that then cool.  Otherwise I\'m ready to ship the other outstanding DIP switch for you with wires already soldered to it.\r\n\r\nLet me know man and if you don\'t want the headlights anymore then that\'s cool, I\'ll just ship the other DIP switch then.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(17999,'07087583af','Ya, I didn\'t even think of puttin\' them in with Birds.  Well, thanks again!!\r\n\r\nHopefully I don\'t miss the next deadline for a contest.  \r\n\r\nI can\'t say it enough, you do some sweet work. Take it easy and stay on to of Mount Bottle Cap......'),(18001,'b9f9f71744','[quote:b9f9f71744=\"Bird\"]I remember what I was meaning to say to you... Remember a while back, when you were doing the baja Beetle, and you showed the Motorworks dumptruck, and I suggested making a flatbed on a zz chassis to haul your bits? That Camaro you are doing for the moderator contest would look too sweet sitting on a matched flatbed. Just somethin\' to get ya thinkin\'. Maybe a side project to keep the Camaro work from driving you nuts....\r\n\r\nJay(bird)[/quote:b9f9f71744]Aww man, that idea is just too good to pass up, now I got 2 things I need to finish this month.\r\n\r\nSeriously though, that is an excellent idea, this car is certainly not street legal, we got to get it to the track some how...and rolling up to the strip, and then rolling the car off the back up the truck, would be just too cool for my final vid. Thanks for the great idea. :-) \r\n\r\nI hope I can pull it off in time.  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18002,'c0c9fe41d3','Hey Superfly, ya know what, I don\'t have any Bit Racer gears.\r\n\r\nSince I\'m PMimg you I\'m gonna give you my Kit Racer rant. When I heard that people were grabbing those up at TRU for a couple bucks, I checked mine out, they had one left, but the price tag was missing, so they tried to charge me 8.99, for a Kit Racer hop up set. I said never mind.\r\n\r\nSo yeah if you want to send me a gear set I\'ll definately throw them in this car and see what they do.\r\n\r\nBTW, help me out here, you know what a scale quarter mile is? I\'m thinking I heard somewhere 16ft., but I\'m not sure. Still that\'s a pretty good amount of room to wind those gears out. :???: \r\n\r\nAnyways, I ramble, here\'s my info,\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School rd. Apt.1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nDave'),(18003,'5912d712a5','[quote:5912d712a5=\"DarkTari\"]TellYa What, Let\'s let the Pimps choose from the 4 weeks in the month for the Car-O-Da-Month, then let \'em pick the Car Of The Year in December.\r\n\r\nLet\'s set up the announcement, then the pole.\r\n\r\nSound Cool ?[/quote:5912d712a5]sounds good, let\'s bring up to April though - so we\'ll need to post up 2 quick - I was thinkin Yagbols\' Datsun for Feb and crazydaves black muscle car for Mar'),(18004,'6a109481ab','[quote:6a109481ab=\"crazydave\"]Aww man, that idea is just too good to pass up, now I got 2 things I need to finish this month.\r\n\r\nSeriously though, that is an excellent idea, this car is certainly not street legal, we got to get it to the track some how...and rolling up to the strip, and then rolling the car off the back up the truck, would be just too cool for my final vid. Thanks for the great idea. :-) \r\n\r\nI hope I can pull it off in time.  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:6a109481ab]\r\n\r\nSorry for adding a headache to your already hectic month. But the more you showed that Camaro, the more I thought about it, and then when you put the video up, it just clicked and seemed like the natural accessory for that car. Hell, you could even do it up like a beat garage truck, all primer and rust and \"crazydave racing\" or \"crazydave towing\" or something like that on the doors and have that grass roots old school feel. I dunno. I think too much. I need to get busy on the stuff I have in mind for some of my rides instead of thinking about how to accessorize other peoples stuff..... but I\'m glad you like it. \r\n\r\nJay(bird)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18005,'ab7b20b60c','Let\'s let the Pimps vote on that. Give \'em a time limit, and take it from there....... 8-)'),(18178,'d9f0d26290','[quote:d9f0d26290=\"crazydave\"]Cool man, that\'s slick looking.  :cool: \r\nThat body looks like it fits the TC chassis pretty good too. I\'m guessing you had to cut the holes for the capacitor and inducter to get it to fit? Maybe you could make some little drivers helmets out of Fimo to cover those, or something like that.\r\n\r\nHave you tried a different motor in that car yet? Honestly I thought that car should\'ve been going faster, and meant to experiment with it more before i sent it, but never got around to it.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:d9f0d26290]yea I was gonna try and make some sort of cage or something to cover them - we\'ll see how it goes.\r\nthat bodies 2 different bodies chopped in half and then obviously the roof.\r\nit\'s the ass-end of a gloria and the front-end of an accord.\r\n\r\nhaven\'t had a chance to put a new motor in yet - will tonite though :)'),(18008,'72c82c0fad','hey man! i is all cashed up and ready to roll on the paypal deal, just need to confirm price and your pay details. and for god\'s sake do it soon.... i keep looking at toyeast and thinking \"hmmm, maybe superfly can wait!\" :-D \r\n\r\nthanks bloke, trent.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37786,'9cb59ddb59','Perfect!\r\n\r\nI should either be able to send it today or 2morrow, I am gonna try to squeeze it into today\'s works so I can get it outta the way.\r\n\r\nOne last thing, your real name? unless it does not matter for me to send it to you...\r\n\r\nlater'),(26329,'8f9bd01b1c','Hey, saw you browsing, thought I\'d say merry Xmas and all that shit. :-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(26951,'2ee272cff6','Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nDid you get your prize?  It was delivered on the 13th.\r\n\r\nLemme know!'),(18024,'8884a8bb05','[quote:8884a8bb05=\"CaboWabo\"]quote]sounds good to me.\r\nshould we let the other \"gangsta trick click\"ers decide or do we just make the executive decision?\r\n[/quote:8884a8bb05]\r\n\r\nya ya dude thats a good idea. ill start a thread.'),(18026,'6a109481ab','[quote:6a109481ab=\"crazydave\"]Aww man, that idea is just too good to pass up, now I got 2 things I need to finish this month.\r\n\r\nSeriously though, that is an excellent idea, this car is certainly not street legal, we got to get it to the track some how...and rolling up to the strip, and then rolling the car off the back up the truck, would be just too cool for my final vid. Thanks for the great idea. :-) \r\n\r\nI hope I can pull it off in time.  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:6a109481ab]\r\n\r\nSorry for adding a headache to your already hectic month. But the more you showed that Camaro, the more I thought about it, and then when you put the video up, it just clicked and seemed like the natural accessory for that car. Hell, you could even do it up like a beat garage truck, all primer and rust and \"crazydave racing\" or \"crazydave towing\" or something like that on the doors and have that grass roots old school feel. I dunno. I think too much. I need to get busy on the stuff I have in mind for some of my rides instead of thinking about how to accessorize other peoples stuff..... but I\'m glad you like it. \r\n\r\nJay(bird)'),(18028,'9eddae02c3','I picked up the 2 body sets with motors, axles and hubcaps ($13.00 each) and there\'s this new wheel set that I think you\'re gonna want. It\'s $5.00, and it has 6 \"wheel extenders\" that double the width of a ZZ wheel, as well as 3 nice hubcap styles and good tires, including double-wides for those extenders. I did find a bunch of ZZ blue rear axles, I\'ll send you some of those. Not the knuckles you\'re looking for, but you\'re handy and can pull those ZZ wheels off and convert them to fronts on LXX knuckles.\r\n\r\nGive me your address (did you already?) and I\'ll give you the total once I get it all in the mail. It should be:\r\n\r\n$13.00 Initial D body set\r\n$13.00 Cuda &amp; Stang body set\r\n$5.00 wheel set\r\n$3.00 two white endcap 3.8 motors\r\n\r\n$34.00 plus postage.\r\n\r\nI\'ll swing by RS on my way home and pick up those wheels and mail it tomorrow.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18030,'2fb0ca80b8','cool, i\'m into that wheelset you mentioned! thanks! :-) \r\nalthough you skipped that 2f2f bodyset, but i checked the price and it\'s listed at $7. so grand total of $41. thanks for looking out for me, and now here\'s my address:\r\n\r\ntrent heffer\r\n39 currajong avenue\r\ncamberwell\r\nvictoria 3124\r\ncrikeyland (australia)\r\n\r\nthanks again, trent.'),(18031,'a9ed8c4bba','hey cabo, I got a question for ya... about the galleries or w/e... what do I gotta do to get my own gallery?\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks in advance man\r\n~midget_man~'),(31887,'cace7f5235','He\'s Baaack !\r\n\r\nhttp://tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;postid=192037#post192037'),(23149,'236ae9dff1','yeah, thats all correct!\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'d say leave everything unpainted... I wouldnt want to mess them up even if i did decided to paint them lol\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks fo e\'rything pimp daddy!'),(18035,'34011f7df1','[quote:34011f7df1=\"midget_man1387\"]hey cabo, I got a question for ya... about the galleries or w/e... what do I gotta do to get my own gallery?\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks in advance man\r\n~midget_man~[/quote:34011f7df1]gotchya all set up.\r\nyou got 1 MB of space for now so try to keep your images optimized'),(18041,'8abb48097f','I think you might be able to help me with this.  Where can I host a video?  Perferably for free!!\r\n\r\nThanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31627,'9e3c6c3a65','Hey, got your cars a coule days ago. Sorry I didn\'t back to you about that, but i\'ve been busy trying to get this video together for the review of the DC Mod I\'m doing. Wanna check it out?\r\nhttp://members.cox.net/crazydcars2/seshootout1.wmv\r\n(Shhh, it\'s a preview. ;))\r\n\r\nWell FETs not here yet, so hopefully I\'ll get those by next week, and I can wrap this up. Meantime, whach you think of my video? Can you tell how much faster the DC Modded car is? I afraid it doesn\'t show how drastically faster it is.\r\n\r\ndave'),(36936,'d2b08e4001','Can you suggest somewhere to find the G10? The stock MRS4 chassis is made of G10 and it has a fair amount of flex compared to the same thickness in CF. I\'ll concider it tho but with the many holes in the chasis design it maynot be a good choice.\r\n\r\nThanx\r\nMaxx'),(37538,'345ac7709b','I got some help over msn from betty.k, so thanks, no need to dig up or tear down for lil ol me :)\r\n\r\nMaxx'),(35284,'31303daa0b','[quote:31303daa0b=\"Sporttracguy\"]Its in the mail\r\n\r\nSTG[/quote:31303daa0b]You\'re pretty quick. Good thing I was heading to the store this morning anyways. So I got yours in the mail this morning also. :-o \r\n\r\nWell... that worked out pretty good, everyone breaking stuff at the same time and stuff. Except the breaking part... that sucked. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34937,'dd20bee0b7','Hey Max, man i would but i don\'t have that kind of money in my PayPal account. I\'m still working on getting a Bank Account set up. \r\n\r\nHope you find someone.'),(37437,'1d14cbc539','sorry dude, i forgot to get back to you!\r\nyeah, it made it here safe and sound, 2 weeks to the day after you sent it. quickest shipping yet from the states!\r\nBy that point, the blowout thread had gone a bit cold so i didn\'t bother postin there, but i shoulda messaged you back.  \r\nSorry man, slackage on my behalf.'),(37438,'5f26e74e7e','[quote:5f26e74e7e=\"45tr0\"]sorry dude, i forgot to get back to you!\r\nyeah, it made it here safe and sound, 2 weeks to the day after you sent it. quickest shipping yet from the states!\r\nBy that point, the blowout thread had gone a bit cold so i didn\'t bother postin there, but i shoulda messaged you back.  \r\nSorry man, slackage on my behalf.[/quote:5f26e74e7e]\r\nOh dude, no problem. It happens to us all.\r\nI honestly was thinking it didn\'t make it there yet, the tracking page didn\'t have any information on it since it left here.\r\nCool, glad it got there. :-o'),(18208,'160502c0ad','hog says all ya gotta do is click the link on the first page');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18209,'ad6c0084a1','I know you\'re busy with that testarossa (best bit body I have ever seen) and I am wondering if you know a common place I can find that wire mesh you used on your skyline...I\'m working on several new customs (although they won\'t compare to yours) a semi, an s2000, and not sure what do do with it yet, but a strange no-name rally-ish body.  Your ideas have inspired me and I want to go above and beyond what I would have done (first paint job), and I have studied up on technique.  I\'m sorry to have wasted your time, you must have dozens of pms a day.'),(32462,'bcbb4db32b','[quote:bcbb4db32b=\"sessiz\"]Yeah man I feel like a scumbag but being broke and all it\'s definatly what I\'m gonna do. I just hope that they got some left and that my wife gets cool with it. So far she\'s against me doing it. :lol:[/quote:bcbb4db32b]\r\n\r\nYou outta yo mind?\r\n\r\nYou NEVER tell your woman you\'re going to do something like this. Ya just do it and if she asks how it\'s working again you lie and tell her you fixed it yourself.\r\n\r\nTsk tsk tsk, what the hell kind of criminal are you?'),(18342,'6fafe1f1d7','I take paypal and i will wait till sunday for your payment. Thanks for the deal. Paypal to funstuff4me@zipido.com   Please email me your mailing address to ang_N_ern@peoplepc.com\r\n\r\n\r\nTHANKS');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18051,'d9ccba581b','the range on my xmod blows. i never ran it anywhere big enough to realize it until today. it\'s so beat up that i dont think the shaq will take it back. any suggestions? hey thanks for putting me and mike down with the gangsta trick click. i suspected that there was a seedy underbelly to this motherfucker. thats pretty cool.'),(18350,'3e9a0eacd5','i wanted to know if you would tradesome of a pair of your really good springs for a white endbell 3.8 i got from grunge. its only got about 3 charges on it in a unmosfetted car and itis great for off roading and street racing. if it sounds good to you pm me back :)\r\n\r\nhave a nice day\r\n-micro'),(18056,'db9ef0b077','What\'s up, man. Hey, I have a bunch of decent clone bBs. Give me your addy and I\'ll send you one.'),(18057,'607c1ecaa8','i dont know offhand what my shit is, but i cant even get like 3 parking spaces away. mikes shit was gettin\' like way far, and so was the iWAVER, until the sucky nut on the back wheel fell off and spilt all the rear-end parts all over the lot and i had to look for all that little shit. maybe i\'ll try mikes crystals in it and if that works i\'ll go buy me some.'),(18058,'44d8ff7273','[quote:44d8ff7273=\"PiMp_C\"]OK I need to sell them all, as a hole: \r\n\r\nOrange Challenger\r\nBlue Yenko\r\nGreen Eclipse\r\nPurple PT Cruiser\r\nGold Civic\r\nGreen Lancer\r\nPurple Syper\r\n\r\nI need at least 25 bucks...or I will trade for 7 Bit bodies, or like a bit chassis (no clones plz, MS or Bit), and a couple bodies. Because, the Eclipse is rare, and the PT, and Civic.[/quote:44d8ff7273] Are these still for sell???');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18059,'de5c8fae76','I\'ll do it for 5 bucks no problem. You pay for shipping to and from my location. No need for solder I have plenty. PM me or send me an email at ImOnFireGetHelp@aol.com'),(18060,'34011f7df1','[quote:34011f7df1=\"midget_man1387\"]hey cabo, I got a question for ya... about the galleries or w/e... what do I gotta do to get my own gallery?\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks in advance man\r\n~midget_man~[/quote:34011f7df1]gotchya all set up.\r\nyou got 1 MB of space for now so try to keep your images optimized'),(18064,'c9598b70ef','Hey, just wanted to let you know that the Homies arrived today, damn that was fast! Filled a few gaps in my collection, plus filled a few gaps in my daughters collection as well, so thanks. I have been watching my mailbox intently for like a week waiting for my alloys from EZ, and thought for sure that they would get here before the package from you. I\'m not sweatin\' though, I just can\'t wait to get those wheels! \r\n\r\nThanks again,\r\n\r\nJay(bird)'),(18065,'c9598b70ef','Hey, just wanted to let you know that the Homies arrived today, damn that was fast! Filled a few gaps in my collection, plus filled a few gaps in my daughters collection as well, so thanks. I have been watching my mailbox intently for like a week waiting for my alloys from EZ, and thought for sure that they would get here before the package from you. I\'m not sweatin\' though, I just can\'t wait to get those wheels! \r\n\r\nThanks again,\r\n\r\nJay(bird)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18067,'520c15ca4c','Damn, that was fast. :shock: \r\n\r\nCool, glad they worked out for ya.\r\n\r\ndave'),(18069,'bb394952ed','update. i tried mikes crystals today and it got more range than mine... not as good as in his car, but better. my crystals worked well in his car, though. :???:  i may have bought a dud 9 volt for the tx, so i\'m gonna try that next.\r\n\r\nhey you are welcome to go through my superslick hubcap collection to see if you find anything you like better for your drag car. i\'m up to like 8 bodies for that thing, so i have a LOT of hubcaps.'),(18073,'7fee0e5aca','Maybe you don\'t realise but TYPING LIKE THIS IS FUCKING ANNOYING!!!!!\r\nPlease stop.'),(18074,'db9ef0b077','What\'s up, man. Hey, I have a bunch of decent clone bBs. Give me your addy and I\'ll send you one.'),(18076,'6ae886b08c','Hey man, thats really awesome of you!  :-)  Ill definatly repay you with somethin cool soon.\r\n\r\n\r\nTom Pyle\r\n951 east 3rd st\r\nRoebling, NJ 08554'),(18077,'b6b3c5937e','219 was goin\' through his drawers(haha) and found this. check it out.\r\n\r\n[img:b6b3c5937e]http://img23.photobucket.com/albums/v70/jaybirdy/blotter2.jpg[/img:b6b3c5937e]\r\n\r\nthat shit happened right in front of my dads house. they said they pulled us over because 2 white guys cruising back alleys in the ghetto was suspicious....');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18080,'1e4260b2c7','hey finks i picked up your car this morning and will be getting it shipped out this week sometime, i cant do it tomorrow but maybe thursday. \r\ntalk to you soon\r\n\r\njeff'),(18082,'e6b50e5fd7','I\'ve been chuckling ever since about ten minutes after the court hearing...... went through most of a 50 box of blunts that day.... had a lot of fun...\r\n\r\nhey man, you got a crush on Condi Rice?'),(18348,'7c0a28f3da','[quote:7c0a28f3da=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:7c0a28f3da=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:7c0a28f3da=\"Son_Gokou\"]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=313&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=615\r\n\r\nUmm....they\'re joking, right? Or did I look gay/retarded in each of those pictures?[/quote:7c0a28f3da]yea - they\'re just giving you a hard time.\r\nyou can either laugh with them, against them, or blow off their comments - whichever works best for you[/quote:7c0a28f3da]\r\n\r\nMmm hmmm...\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3597\r\n\r\nAll I said was \"I don\'t get how it will do this\". Just that, and hog goes nuts on me and so does Finks. I don\'t get it, why are they so angry? I even made a post stating my point of view, he edited it, as you could see.....[/quote:7c0a28f3da]well I\'m going to be brutally honest with you. as you can see - not everyone is going to like you. for whatever reasons.\r\n\r\nyou\'ll just have to deal with it however you must. I can\'t monitor everyone\'s each and every posts. this takes up too much of my time as it is.'),(18086,'8a3ab2a53b','only 5 bucks! I was figurin\' it would be like 12-15 bucks. Gotta get that, for sure. \r\n\r\nI assume because the rears are wider, the car is less flippy?\r\n\r\nwhen I was lookin\' at hues pics last night, I started thinkin\' it might be cool to have those wides all the way around  :???:\r\n\r\nsee my iWaver vid? whattya think? check it out again.... I updated and added like 17 seconds of footie that I didn\'t know I had.\r\n\r\nThat editing shit is FUN.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18088,'52c554873b','Not only is the link not working for me man but it\'s displaying some info you may not want displayed.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?p=41693#41693\r\n\r\nLike this shit. :-) \r\n\r\n\"Macintosh HD1Users/mariabruno/Desktop/iWaver/Media/Drifting 01\"'),(18090,'a661b844a2','Thanks, man. I gotta get the glitches worked out I guess. I took my link down until I can get it to work right. I\'m new at the video thing.... \r\n\r\nThanks for letting me know though, It was working from my end, I guess I messed up somewhere. It should be up soon....'),(18355,'93ed3468f9','[quote:93ed3468f9=\"sessiz\"]I\'m looking into making up a gallery site for myself and was wondering if you had a recomendation for a host. I\'ve been looking around but being the fuckin dumbass I\'m really not sure what to look for. Any help/advice would be apreciated bro. :-)[/quote:93ed3468f9]welp... lemme go get a few links for ya (another pm).\r\nfirst off, think of what you really need / want.\r\nas in, how much space? probably quite a bit I\'d imagine, you\'re an image whore lol\r\nnow bandwidth, it costs - the more times your image is accessed, that\'s bandwidth going up / getting used up.\r\nnow features on the server - if you\'re going to have some sort automated gallery or something, you\'ll probably need access to some sort of scripting technologies (e.g. ASP, PHP, JSP, etc., etc.) as well as a database (MySQL, SQL, etc.). most servers have the basics installed automatically. servers that allow you to install your own applications are fuckin-a expensive.\r\nyou\'ll probably want some sort of server statistic software or management screens as well so you can see things like # of hits and shit.\r\n\r\nand of course the basic need of FTP access.\r\n\r\nlemme get some shit together and I\'ll pm ya back'),(18092,'0448da6639','hey man, sessiz pm\'ed me and told me my movie link was taking him to some listing on my desktop. I have made adjustments and think I got it right... I hope. Click this and hit me back and let me know what it does. Thanks. I don\'t wanna be posting links that lead to my desktop.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.angelfire.com/clone2/birdhaus/iWaver.mov.html\r\n\r\nIt works for me in preview, but it did before, too, so I don\'t know what I\'m doing wrong....');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18096,'297a99d49a','ok, not sure what that means... is that like when I try to watch some peoples wmv\'s and all I get is the text file instead? I am really new to this shit and am slowly learning, sorry I\'m being a pain....'),(18099,'f960627352','Got the Homies today.  Thanks'),(21196,'1313d7a53b','yo dogg. been a long ass time. drop by a little more often dude. lots has been goin on lately.'),(18102,'5f6946877d','ok I think I might have it. I dont think there was supposed to be .html after it, I\'m not sure, though.\r\n\r\nhttp://angelfire.com/clone2/birdhaus/iWaver.mov\r\n\r\nsee if that one does it.'),(18697,'d695aeca5e','Ok, my brain is frazzled, I\'ve figured out enough over the last couple days, so now I\'m ready to ask for some help.\r\n\r\nSee now my new soundcard is doing the same as the old.\r\n\r\nXP reconizes it, and says it\'s working, but when I try to install the driver, it says there is no soundblaster device on thjis computer.\r\n\r\nThen I install the new one, I can\'t uninstall the old one because apprently it\'s integrated into my mother board, never realized that before\r\n\r\nAnyway start it up, it reconizes the new plug and play device, before I could respond it says your device is installed and ready to use, and is listing both sound cards in my list of available devices So I disabled it before I ran the driver, because there wasn\'t supposed to be any other drivers installed. Then when I run the new driver, it does the same as the update for the old card. says there is no sound blaster device.  and now the new sound card is not listed or being reconized, even when I turn the computer off and on.\r\n\r\nSo what\'s up? why can\'t I get a sound card driver to install with XP?\r\n\r\nAny help would be greatly apprecited, thanks.  :-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(18107,'0d0fa7cb18','http://www.angelfire.com/clone2/birdhaus/iWaver.mov');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18110,'5ad514446b','cool.(not about the firewall)... 219s on, I just sent it to him, so if it works on his end I\'m puttin\' it up.\r\n\r\nthanks for the tech support, man. I think pimps will dig my first editing effort.'),(37806,'a2596c018e','I sent the stuff today...sorry for the delay...I woulda\' sent it right away...but school and homework was in the way...\r\n\r\nlol 7-10 days bro enjoy'),(37821,'d7600fdaf7','cool, thanks.\r\n\r\nJust in case:\r\n\r\nGreg Maffei\r\nGrey Matter\r\n431 NW Flanders, #203\r\nPortland, Oregon 97209'),(31549,'adfda06350','[quote:adfda06350=\"jmays\"]dont sweat the extra cash! \r\ni am just proud that someone would want one of my cars.\r\n\r\nsee ya on bitpimps\r\njmays[/quote:adfda06350]\r\n\r\nHey I dont think I let you know I got the bodies they are truely sweeeeeet! I put you down on the bitpimps as a great buy/sell/trade the day they came in but forgot to PM you that I got them!\r\n\r\nGreat stuff thaks so much I will post pics of the work when done!\r\n\r\nSWG\r\nAaron'),(18113,'5288620001','[quote:5288620001=\"betty.k\"]cool, i\'m into that wheelset you mentioned! thanks! :-) \r\nalthough you skipped that 2f2f bodyset, but i checked the price and it\'s listed at $7. so grand total of $41. thanks for looking out for me, and now here\'s my address:\r\n\r\ntrent heffer\r\n39 currajong avenue\r\ncamberwell\r\nvictoria 3124\r\ncrikeyland (australia)\r\n\r\nthanks again, trent.[/quote:5288620001]\r\n\r\nThought I\'d let you know I mailed that package yesterday. Shipping was $11.00 for air, you should get it in a week. Surface was $4.50 and took 4-6 weeks, and I figured you didn\'t want to wait that long. I threw in 2 ZZ blue gear axles/wheels and a few bodies I didn\'t need. Let me know when you get it!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18347,'fe9c7e8698','[quote:fe9c7e8698=\"hogjowlz\"]ah dude just break down and get aim. its pretty sweet with all the pimps up live and shit. buncha cool cats.\r\n\r\ni think the new fruity is 28megs. probably a little much for dial-up but if you wana give it a go i dont care. either way youll get it haha.[/quote:fe9c7e8698]My wife uses AIM, and I\'ll propbably break down and get on there, have to admit I\'m kinda jealous that I\'m missing out, but the reason that i\'m on dial up right now is because my wife couldn\'t go without the internet one day, and installed an AOL free trial, now it\'s taken over our system, keeps reinstalling itself everytime we try to access our cable, which is back up and working. Cox guy suggested we get a new computer, since ours is so old, but it looks like we\'re gonna have to re-format, which means, I\'m hating AOL right now.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18117,'5ba63f09d3','you is tha king! :bowdown:  thanks a bunch, i\'ll put the cash in now. so it\'s $52 usd, correct? that\'s what i\'ll put in now and if i need to put more lemme know, it\'s no trouble. good thinking with the airmail, i\'ll be bored with bits in 6 weeks! i\'ll let you know when the goods arrive.\r\n\r\ncatcha soon, trent.'),(18118,'3b93c47217','you got a nice desk?\r\n\r\nneed a nice desk? we just finished putting together the new one. looking for someone who needs the old one.\r\n\r\nwe switched to a corner desk. the old one is nice... black tops, natural sides and keyboard tray. you can have it if you want it.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18346,'fe9c7e8698','[quote:fe9c7e8698=\"hogjowlz\"]ah dude just break down and get aim. its pretty sweet with all the pimps up live and shit. buncha cool cats.\r\n\r\ni think the new fruity is 28megs. probably a little much for dial-up but if you wana give it a go i dont care. either way youll get it haha.[/quote:fe9c7e8698]My wife uses AIM, and I\'ll propbably break down and get on there, have to admit I\'m kinda jealous that I\'m missing out, but the reason that i\'m on dial up right now is because my wife couldn\'t go without the internet one day, and installed an AOL free trial, now it\'s taken over our system, keeps reinstalling itself everytime we try to access our cable, which is back up and working. Cox guy suggested we get a new computer, since ours is so old, but it looks like we\'re gonna have to re-format, which means, I\'m hating AOL right now.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18122,'7fee0e5aca','Maybe you don\'t realise but TYPING LIKE THIS IS FUCKING ANNOYING!!!!!\r\nPlease stop.'),(18124,'6e62d3832a','huge. the thing is a behemoth. that\'s why we got a corner one now. that thing overpowered everything else in the room, visually... 29\" tall, 40\" wide, and a 48\" wide shelf like 7\" above that. I\'m estimating about 2 and a half feet deep because my kid jetted with the tape measurer after I got those measurements... you get the idea, though. massive.\r\n\r\nyou at home? got a minute to see if this one works? mikes parents shit could\'nt play the last set-up, I tweaked it some more. thanks.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.angelfire.com/clone2/birdhaus/video/iWaver.mov');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19579,'e41e20c005','[quote:e41e20c005=\"CaboWabo\"]I dunno, I sway back and forth so much on what types of music I listen to. I hear ya on the TKK, it\'s not bad at all - maybe I just needed to get baked lol[/quote:e41e20c005]Oh I gotta be baked to listen to music, but then I just gotta be baked. :lol: \r\n\r\n[quote:e41e20c005]I\'m like that with the Frogs set 1, I love the horns and all the shit that seems to be fitting together when it totally shouldn\'t lol[/quote:e41e20c005]I got that DL\'d. Still gotta listen to it. Got side tracked by that Beastie Boys. :lol: \r\n\r\nHey, can\'t find Ministry right now. You into Steve Albini at all? I just ripped Big Black - Songs About Fucking, for hue, I could upload that.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18204,'c18ead1bf5','dude, seriously. get in the chat... you gonna miss out cuz ya don\'t like aohell? send the man yo shit!'),(18191,'c6c18fe253','[quote:c6c18fe253=\"crazydave\"][quote:c6c18fe253=\"CaboWabo\"]yea I was gonna try and make some sort of cage or something to cover them - we\'ll see how it goes.\r\nthat bodies 2 different bodies chopped in half and then obviously the roof.\r\nit\'s the ass-end of a gloria and the front-end of an accord.\r\n\r\nhaven\'t had a chance to put a new motor in yet - will tonite though :)[/quote:c6c18fe253]I thought something was up with the rear end, but I had no idea it was a Gloria. So what\'s that make it? An Accordia? :lol: \r\n\r\nYou know, whenever I see someones bodywork in progress, I can never quite picture it without the paint, so I can\'t wait to see some paint on that thing.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:c6c18fe253]lol that\'s exactly what I was gonna name it.\r\nHond-issan Accordia\r\n\r\nsoon as I get some time, she\'s getting painted.\r\nI\'m dying to use my air-brush but talk myself out of it everytime I think of having to clean it.'),(18131,'11033d0819','Yea dude that was me :)\r\n\r\n  Yea the problem I had was that he never responded to any e-mails about a total for combined shipping.  Just one e-mail from him that said pay us then another one abit later saying \"our ebay guy was fired\"\r\n\r\n  I said forget it, plus I rec e-mails from others that had not rec there items.  now I just deal with this dude for my xmod stuff (well the retail stuff anyway)   spcolley.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21193,'35a0f9418b','just wondering whats up.\r\n\r\n  Havnt been around for awhile as I have been super busy with working and opening the new store.\r\n\r\nVooDoo\r\n\r\nPete'),(21194,'51c43ab3f2','Hey CW just thought I would drop you  a line as I feel bad I have not been around in awhile.\r\n\r\n  Things have been really crazy with work (now that I am not on perental leave anymore :( ) and we are opening a new store and dumping a ton of cash into it.\r\n\r\n  Also got a new car thats taking alot of my cash I guess I shouldnt have got the TT maybe should have went with the 350Z as they are alot cheaper.\r\n\r\n  Anyway I plan to be around more now that I have net access at work now.\r\n\r\nPete \r\n\r\nVooDoo'),(18133,'cb22202a45','sorry . . . .\r\n\r\nthat\'s all i can say for my unacceptable behaviour, in the future i will not do it again.'),(18134,'40001cf330','got that car in the mail today dude - thank you!\r\nlove how that rear end is so smooth and pushed out, awesome job man.\r\n\r\nunfortunately, the body I\'ve been working on - I don\'t think is gonna work.\r\nit might if I modify a few things on the body, but I\'m affraid it might look like shit - we\'ll see.\r\n\r\nmight have to use the s2k or something else as a body.\r\n\r\n :???: now what can I send ya back'),(18135,'40001cf330','got that car in the mail today dude - thank you!\r\nlove how that rear end is so smooth and pushed out, awesome job man.\r\n\r\nunfortunately, the body I\'ve been working on - I don\'t think is gonna work.\r\nit might if I modify a few things on the body, but I\'m affraid it might look like shit - we\'ll see.\r\n\r\nmight have to use the s2k or something else as a body.\r\n\r\n :???: now what can I send ya back');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18136,'03856c951a','[quote:03856c951a=\"CaboWabo\"]got that car in the mail today dude - thank you!\r\nlove how that rear end is so smooth and pushed out, awesome job man.\r\n\r\nunfortunately, the body I\'ve been working on - I don\'t think is gonna work.\r\nit might if I modify a few things on the body, but I\'m affraid it might look like shit - we\'ll see.\r\n\r\nmight have to use the s2k or something else as a body.\r\n\r\n :???: now what can I send ya back[/quote:03856c951a]Cool that was quick. 8-) \r\n\r\nYou should chop down a ZZ body, like you did with that challenger. As soon as I\'m done with with my Prostocker, I\'m gonna be doing me a SS Camaro like that.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18137,'03856c951a','[quote:03856c951a=\"CaboWabo\"]got that car in the mail today dude - thank you!\r\nlove how that rear end is so smooth and pushed out, awesome job man.\r\n\r\nunfortunately, the body I\'ve been working on - I don\'t think is gonna work.\r\nit might if I modify a few things on the body, but I\'m affraid it might look like shit - we\'ll see.\r\n\r\nmight have to use the s2k or something else as a body.\r\n\r\n :???: now what can I send ya back[/quote:03856c951a]Cool that was quick. 8-) \r\n\r\nYou should chop down a ZZ body, like you did with that challenger. As soon as I\'m done with with my Prostocker, I\'m gonna be doing me a SS Camaro like that.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18139,'ddd46be632','Hey I say that video with your car that pulled those wheelies... that was tight man, and i gotta give u props for that, and i was wondering if you could send me a tutorial or u could tell me on what you did to get your car to do it.  thanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18140,'13f5d7118a','Here\'s my name BirdHaus74. I got into iChat and hopefully it will work.'),(18141,'ddd46be632','Hey I say that video with your car that pulled those wheelies... that was tight man, and i gotta give u props for that, and i was wondering if you could send me a tutorial or u could tell me on what you did to get your car to do it.  thanks'),(18142,'4a07ac5244','[quote:4a07ac5244=\"2fast4u\"]Hey I say that video with your car that pulled those wheelies... that was tight man, and i gotta give u props for that, and i was wondering if you could send me a tutorial or u could tell me on what you did to get your car to do it.  thanks[/quote:4a07ac5244]You can follow the build up here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3448&amp;start=0&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight=\r\n\r\nIt\'s so strong off the line, because I use FETs in in the PCB, and because of the lightweight chassis.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18143,'4a07ac5244','[quote:4a07ac5244=\"2fast4u\"]Hey I say that video with your car that pulled those wheelies... that was tight man, and i gotta give u props for that, and i was wondering if you could send me a tutorial or u could tell me on what you did to get your car to do it.  thanks[/quote:4a07ac5244]You can follow the build up here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3448&amp;start=0&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight=\r\n\r\nIt\'s so strong off the line, because I use FETs in in the PCB, and because of the lightweight chassis.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18202,'94acad007a','cool. cool cool. fer sheezy.\r\n\r\nsend hog yer aim name. the chat is cool\r\n\r\nit\'s just me, hog, and superfly right now... cabo and cj were in there earlier..'),(18146,'84f8da1db1','Yea hes on ebay\r\n\r\n\r\n  Yea that dude left neg feedback for me after I left it for him \r\n\r\nOh well hes a dead beat'),(18340,'892cadc34c','Are any avaliable?\r\nThanks'),(18341,'ee93c75440','Nah, I didn\'t delete his post.\r\n\r\nAs for the chatroom, I don\'tknow, just never got into chatrooms, so I never thought about it.\r\n\r\n\r\nHey I still want that Fruity Loops 4, I didn\'t want you to think I forgot about that, I\'m just having problems getting on my C-panel, because our cable went out and we\'re temporarily on dial up, I guess it\'s not reconizing the IP.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18148,'4471ee0324','Yo, man. I made a vid of you trying to kill yer x-mod. Too bad I can\'t post it. Can your host put up .mov\'s?\r\n\r\nIt\'s pretty tight. I\'m in love with editing....'),(18152,'a556fd35b3','ah, well. I\'ll put it on a disk for ya. just somethin\' cool.... for like, posterity or whatever.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18175,'ea8744c24b','Hey, filelicker, I saw in a thread over on TinyRC that you wanted some info on the SuperSlicks, so here ya go... They are $20 at Toys R Us for a starter kit, 1/43 scale, available with a LOT of really nice bodies... They sell a \"tuner kit\" for $10 that comes with 2 hotter motors and gear sets, a neat little pinion remover tool, and some more tires and hubcaps(zipzap style, only bigger)... They just recently came out with a \"quarter mile race kit\" that comes with your choice of the 2fast 2furious Skyline or Mitsu EVO body, more tires and caps, and a SERIOUSLY fast motor and another set of gears to mess with for $10. They have a neat pistol-style transmitter which the grip removes from to double as the charger... The chassis is basically like a larger zipzap, only the steering has a gear system to smooth out the magnet set-up... and it has dual cells. The motors are longer and of a larger diameter than bit motors. Oh, and they sell body sets in packs of 2 for like $6. I have had mine since January and have accumulated both the tuner kit, the quarter mile kit, and a collection of like 8 bodies, all without putting out much money. The only thing I don\'t like about these is the TOTAL lack of suspension, and it is kinda loud. Oh, and only 2 freq\'s...27 and 49. \r\nI run the high RPM motor that came in the 1/4 mile kit with the stock low ratio gears, and it truly is a beast. Wicked acceleration.\r\n\r\nOh, the SuperSlick is the chassis that hogjowlz is using for the wide back end of his moderator contest project.\r\n\r\nThey are a fast, fun, reliable, and inexpensive car... I love to clear out my kitchen and scream around with mine.\r\n\r\nThey are a Toys R Us exclusive brand, so that\'s the only place that has \'em. Here\'s the site:\r\n\r\nhttp://www4.toysrus.com/superslicks/index.cfm\r\n\r\nI am seriously confused as to why these awesome little cars are not popular.'),(18155,'ad6c0084a1','I know you\'re busy with that testarossa (best bit body I have ever seen) and I am wondering if you know a common place I can find that wire mesh you used on your skyline...I\'m working on several new customs (although they won\'t compare to yours) a semi, an s2000, and not sure what do do with it yet, but a strange no-name rally-ish body.  Your ideas have inspired me and I want to go above and beyond what I would have done (first paint job), and I have studied up on technique.  I\'m sorry to have wasted your time, you must have dozens of pms a day.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37886,'a67b56d8b5','Sweet, stuff came in not bad time...hope you like it, thought you could do more with it any how! \r\n\r\nBesides i believe you should get what you pay for man! lol\r\n\r\nTake er\' easy..'),(36110,'76de6113b7','i know everything'),(30080,'5fa11e6eec','well i somehow just killed my 3rd an prolly last xmod i\'ll ever get . im sick of them breakin all the time . im just gona fix up my mini t i guess . thanks for all your help with the car , and the stage 2 motor and shocks .\r\ni guess i wont be needing that supra body i hope you didnt get it yet man , if ya did i\'ll still pay for it since i said i would . later . matt .'),(18168,'1ece237d23','go check your yahoo mail'),(18169,'bee20d8740','Cool man, that\'s slick looking.  :cool: \r\nThat body looks like it fits the TC chassis pretty good too. I\'m guessing you had to cut the holes for the capacitor and inducter to get it to fit? Maybe you could make some little drivers helmets out of Fimo to cover those, or something like that.\r\n\r\nHave you tried a different motor in that car yet? Honestly I thought that car should\'ve been going faster, and meant to experiment with it more before i sent it, but never got around to it.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18170,'35fab2a99c','Sure thats fine by me.\r\n\r\nDragster\r\n\r\nThis is a 4-Cell Monster, It has a stretched bit chassis, Muscle Machine rear wheels and a custom made body and wing. And yes it is fast.\r\nripper7777777 - www.ripper7racing.com\r\n\r\nMustang Funny Car\r\n\r\nAfter building the dragster it looked kinda funny sitting next to ordinary bits so I decided it needed a counterpart for it, so what better than a Funny Car.  It sports a stretched bit chassis, a stretched ZZ mustang body, and uses the same 4-cell battery pack.\r\nripper7777777 - www.ripper7racing.com');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18171,'bee20d8740','Cool man, that\'s slick looking.  :cool: \r\nThat body looks like it fits the TC chassis pretty good too. I\'m guessing you had to cut the holes for the capacitor and inducter to get it to fit? Maybe you could make some little drivers helmets out of Fimo to cover those, or something like that.\r\n\r\nHave you tried a different motor in that car yet? Honestly I thought that car should\'ve been going faster, and meant to experiment with it more before i sent it, but never got around to it.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18172,'d9f0d26290','[quote:d9f0d26290=\"crazydave\"]Cool man, that\'s slick looking.  :cool: \r\nThat body looks like it fits the TC chassis pretty good too. I\'m guessing you had to cut the holes for the capacitor and inducter to get it to fit? Maybe you could make some little drivers helmets out of Fimo to cover those, or something like that.\r\n\r\nHave you tried a different motor in that car yet? Honestly I thought that car should\'ve been going faster, and meant to experiment with it more before i sent it, but never got around to it.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:d9f0d26290]yea I was gonna try and make some sort of cage or something to cover them - we\'ll see how it goes.\r\nthat bodies 2 different bodies chopped in half and then obviously the roof.\r\nit\'s the ass-end of a gloria and the front-end of an accord.\r\n\r\nhaven\'t had a chance to put a new motor in yet - will tonite though :)'),(18173,'35fab2a99c','Sure thats fine by me.\r\n\r\nDragster\r\n\r\nThis is a 4-Cell Monster, It has a stretched bit chassis, Muscle Machine rear wheels and a custom made body and wing. And yes it is fast.\r\nripper7777777 - www.ripper7racing.com\r\n\r\nMustang Funny Car\r\n\r\nAfter building the dragster it looked kinda funny sitting next to ordinary bits so I decided it needed a counterpart for it, so what better than a Funny Car.  It sports a stretched bit chassis, a stretched ZZ mustang body, and uses the same 4-cell battery pack.\r\nripper7777777 - www.ripper7racing.com');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24398,'af2f69c71f','Hey CJ! I am going to have Bird fix my xmod and I need to know how much some L2 inductors would set me back. I could try and convince my dad to buy them via paypal. You got paypal, right? \r\n\r\n\r\nthanks in advance,\r\n~midget~'),(19170,'b692a6b416','i can trade you bit/zz bodies or parts for the bit jota body, and also, do you have pictures of the black rims?'),(19171,'bdb59beb00','Hey man, I will custom make you a monster bit or something along those lines for your Xmod you have listed in the swap meet forum.  I\'m just wanting to add a TRUE xmod (I made the XmoDRR) to my collection, and since you are putting it up for trade, I figured I would give you a shout.\r\n\r\n-=GfµnK=-'),(18521,'2a2bf1356f','why did u edit my post?\r\ni know it was you because you were the only moderator on when i was posting wit miget'),(28535,'960ed3bfcc','yep I got it today already cutting it apart, I am not sure if I can save the body'),(28536,'960ed3bfcc','yep I got it today already cutting it apart, I am not sure if I can save the body');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18523,'2a2bf1356f','why did u edit my post?\r\ni know it was you because you were the only moderator on when i was posting wit miget'),(18544,'d317b675e6','im pretty sure you have a madforce and was wondering if you knew of a good site where i could buy an alloy steering servo case and front bar(i forgot the name of it.It holds the front suspension in nad i snapped it clear in half)superglue is hold ing for now but it will break again and im sure of that.'),(18525,'e3dd5f10c6','No Trouble at all Pimp!  I just went to the post and checked it out.  That\'s damn good work! Damn good! I never read your post, and that was a BigLots TC ???  No doubt you can mod Pimp!  Me Like !  Never seen a Citroen Micro before, gotta be a 1st.  You gotta enter that in the next contest we have here.'),(18526,'db0e488d11','Hey man just curious if I\'m ever gonna get it?'),(18184,'e6faa03222','[quote:e6faa03222=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:e6faa03222=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:e6faa03222=\"Son_Gokou\"]Hey, I posted some requests in that radio request thread....I can send you the music files if you want.... Just making an offer.[/quote:e6faa03222]unfortunately, for the time being, I\'ve had to cancel the requests due to downloads and viruses, etc.\r\nthanks for the offer, I\'ll try and review your list again and see if I have something.[/quote:e6faa03222]\r\n\r\nWell, if you\'re gonna do that, try searching on Kazaa...[/quote:e6faa03222]you\'re joking right? between the copyright crap (5 seconds of song, the rest bleeps and buzzes) and virus / spyware - it\'s a fruitless search most of the times.'),(18185,'60c1ffddf1','[quote:60c1ffddf1=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:60c1ffddf1=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:60c1ffddf1=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:60c1ffddf1=\"Son_Gokou\"]Hey, I posted some requests in that radio request thread....I can send you the music files if you want.... Just making an offer.[/quote:60c1ffddf1]unfortunately, for the time being, I\'ve had to cancel the requests due to downloads and viruses, etc.\r\nthanks for the offer, I\'ll try and review your list again and see if I have something.[/quote:60c1ffddf1]\r\n\r\nWell, if you\'re gonna do that, try searching on Kazaa...[/quote:60c1ffddf1]you\'re joking right? between the copyright crap (5 seconds of song, the rest bleeps and buzzes) and virus / spyware - it\'s a fruitless search most of the times.[/quote:60c1ffddf1]\r\n\r\nThat\'s why I offered to send them to ya...I found the right ones. :-)\r\n\r\nBut, anyways...\r\n\r\nOh, and look in that easter bunny thead....;)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18186,'78b81929e9','[quote:78b81929e9=\"betty.k\"]cool, i will remove them from my gallery, no point doubling up. oh and thanks for the rotm honours! pretty funny really, it\'s won 3 things now and it\'s the one i use the least!! :lol: \r\n\r\ncheers brudda, trent.[/quote:78b81929e9]lol I guess the action shots carry that bad boy even further - still a sweet ride no matter how much she gets used.'),(18187,'60c1ffddf1','[quote:60c1ffddf1=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:60c1ffddf1=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:60c1ffddf1=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:60c1ffddf1=\"Son_Gokou\"]Hey, I posted some requests in that radio request thread....I can send you the music files if you want.... Just making an offer.[/quote:60c1ffddf1]unfortunately, for the time being, I\'ve had to cancel the requests due to downloads and viruses, etc.\r\nthanks for the offer, I\'ll try and review your list again and see if I have something.[/quote:60c1ffddf1]\r\n\r\nWell, if you\'re gonna do that, try searching on Kazaa...[/quote:60c1ffddf1]you\'re joking right? between the copyright crap (5 seconds of song, the rest bleeps and buzzes) and virus / spyware - it\'s a fruitless search most of the times.[/quote:60c1ffddf1]\r\n\r\nThat\'s why I offered to send them to ya...I found the right ones. :-)\r\n\r\nBut, anyways...\r\n\r\nOh, and look in that easter bunny thead....;)'),(18188,'490e2c18f2','[quote:490e2c18f2=\"CaboWabo\"]yea I was gonna try and make some sort of cage or something to cover them - we\'ll see how it goes.\r\nthat bodies 2 different bodies chopped in half and then obviously the roof.\r\nit\'s the ass-end of a gloria and the front-end of an accord.\r\n\r\nhaven\'t had a chance to put a new motor in yet - will tonite though :)[/quote:490e2c18f2]I thought something was up with the rear end, but I had no idea it was a Gloria. So what\'s that make it? An Accordia? :lol: \r\n\r\nYou know, whenever I see someones bodywork in progress, I can never quite picture it without the paint, so I can\'t wait to see some paint on that thing.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18189,'490e2c18f2','[quote:490e2c18f2=\"CaboWabo\"]yea I was gonna try and make some sort of cage or something to cover them - we\'ll see how it goes.\r\nthat bodies 2 different bodies chopped in half and then obviously the roof.\r\nit\'s the ass-end of a gloria and the front-end of an accord.\r\n\r\nhaven\'t had a chance to put a new motor in yet - will tonite though :)[/quote:490e2c18f2]I thought something was up with the rear end, but I had no idea it was a Gloria. So what\'s that make it? An Accordia? :lol: \r\n\r\nYou know, whenever I see someones bodywork in progress, I can never quite picture it without the paint, so I can\'t wait to see some paint on that thing.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18190,'c6c18fe253','[quote:c6c18fe253=\"crazydave\"][quote:c6c18fe253=\"CaboWabo\"]yea I was gonna try and make some sort of cage or something to cover them - we\'ll see how it goes.\r\nthat bodies 2 different bodies chopped in half and then obviously the roof.\r\nit\'s the ass-end of a gloria and the front-end of an accord.\r\n\r\nhaven\'t had a chance to put a new motor in yet - will tonite though :)[/quote:c6c18fe253]I thought something was up with the rear end, but I had no idea it was a Gloria. So what\'s that make it? An Accordia? :lol: \r\n\r\nYou know, whenever I see someones bodywork in progress, I can never quite picture it without the paint, so I can\'t wait to see some paint on that thing.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:c6c18fe253]lol that\'s exactly what I was gonna name it.\r\nHond-issan Accordia\r\n\r\nsoon as I get some time, she\'s getting painted.\r\nI\'m dying to use my air-brush but talk myself out of it everytime I think of having to clean it.'),(18193,'f979d5af5d','Hey thanks man! great job!  Love the dragsters!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19740,'9aeeb6f21a','[quote:9aeeb6f21a=\"crazydave\"]I guess when CJ posted the Gene Simmons I was just dying to tell someone my Kiss rant.[/quote:9aeeb6f21a]yea I\'m trying to avoid putting that in the playlist lol\r\n\r\n[quote:9aeeb6f21a=\"crazydave\"]So now I know you know ...[/quote:9aeeb6f21a]I know you know that I know you know, ya know lol (had to be done)\r\n\r\n[quote:9aeeb6f21a=\"crazydave\"]I\'m having trouble coming up with stuff to upload that I think you\'ll all like. [/quote:9aeeb6f21a]me too man, I mean at times what I\'m digging, everyone else probably has on cd or mp3 somewhere too lol and the other stuff I\'m affraid is so obscure, people are gonna be like \"huh?\" lol\r\nI usually upload it anyways, even if it\'s just 1 or 2 actually downloading and listening, that\'s cool - whatever.\r\n\r\n[quote:9aeeb6f21a=\"crazydave\"]I\'m uploading the Dirtbombs for you guys now. No one really seemed to care for that Ultra-Violence, but I got another one from them where the theme is about Jessica, crack hoe, turned talk show guest that goes on a murderous rampage. I want to upload that, but don\'t want to bother if no one\'s gonna listen.[/quote:9aeeb6f21a]you know what I say - put it up!'),(18195,'b6b37e1c55','Hey man, dub question, but what is your process for taking pics?  Are you using a web cam or a real dig cam, cuz every time you post, the pics are so blurry and I really want to seem em clearer.  Hate to make these suggestions (hence the PM) but do you use zoom when snappin pics?  If so don\'t, just get closer.  Now to contradict that, if you are doping that, try getting farther away from th car to get it crisp, then crop after the fact.  Anyhow, sorry to ask such basic shit.  eithr way, love seeing your work.  Laters.\r\nFinks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18212,'8a7f9972df','Hi!\r\n\r\n[quote:8a7f9972df=\"crazychimp\"]I am wondering if you know a common place I can find that wire mesh you used on your skyline [/quote:8a7f9972df]\r\nYou can buy them here: [url=http://jadarhobby.waw.pl/e_portal/c_default.php?PHPSESSID=c6e76a94eebfcea613860e8ca2e5bbe4&amp;cPath=18_60_63&amp;sort=5a&amp;page=3&amp;language=en&amp;currency=USD&amp;PHPSESSID=c6e76a94eebfcea613860e8ca2e5bbe4]LINK[/url]\r\n\r\n[quote:8a7f9972df=\"crazychimp\"]I\'m working on several new customs (although they won\'t compare to yours) a semi, an s2000, and not sure what do do with it yet, but a strange no-name rally-ish body.  Your ideas have inspired me and I want to go above and beyond what I would have done (first paint job), and I have studied up on technique.[/quote:8a7f9972df]  \r\nNice to hear that :)\r\n[quote:8a7f9972df=\"crazychimp\"]\r\nI\'m sorry to have wasted your time, you must have dozens of pms a day.[/quote:8a7f9972df]\r\nYou don\'t waste my time.\r\n\r\nCheers\r\nMiva'),(18213,'e8e71ad397','http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;category=64648&amp;item=3671858397&amp;rd=1\r\n\r\ni want this but dude is a dick and wont ship it?? wtf is the point of selling on ebay?? if a: you are near there and b: willing to ship it to me that would be cool. if not ill try to buy from less of a moron hehe. but that price is cheap.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18345,'4d02948568','ah dude just break down and get aim. its pretty sweet with all the pimps up live and shit. buncha cool cats.\r\n\r\ni think the new fruity is 28megs. probably a little much for dial-up but if you wana give it a go i dont care. either way youll get it haha.'),(18198,'c052447d66','get yer ass in the pimp chat beeyatch!!!'),(18693,'b4a40ee329','well deserved.'),(18694,'b4a40ee329','well deserved.'),(18695,'0a14aa304d','[quote:0a14aa304d=\"hogjowlz\"]well deserved.[/quote:0a14aa304d]Thanks man. :-) \r\n\r\nHey, I think I got my computer working, I still need to go install the new sound card, but that shouldn\'t be a problem.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I\'m ready to get a hold of that Fruity Loops 4.\r\n\r\nHere\'s the info for the account I set up for cabo:\r\nSite Label: CBD - CaboWabo\r\nHostName: crazybydesign.net\r\nUser Name: u35707516cabowabo\r\nPassword: cabowabo\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n...and I\'ll probably be jumping on AIM real soon. Help me out here, I never play with chat software, how do I hook up with the rest you guys. My AOL username is \"supergloopunk\" BTW.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18696,'0a14aa304d','[quote:0a14aa304d=\"hogjowlz\"]well deserved.[/quote:0a14aa304d]Thanks man. :-) \r\n\r\nHey, I think I got my computer working, I still need to go install the new sound card, but that shouldn\'t be a problem.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I\'m ready to get a hold of that Fruity Loops 4.\r\n\r\nHere\'s the info for the account I set up for cabo:\r\nSite Label: CBD - CaboWabo\r\nHostName: crazybydesign.net\r\nUser Name: u35707516cabowabo\r\nPassword: cabowabo\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n...and I\'ll probably be jumping on AIM real soon. Help me out here, I never play with chat software, how do I hook up with the rest you guys. My AOL username is \"supergloopunk\" BTW.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18215,'67ba8f6eba','are You interested in joining my site to be a manager or assitant manager? can You try and get other people to join, all You have to do is tell me Your email address then You can join because I send You this invitation thing. thanks :cool:'),(18219,'368030d386','I guess I could get stoned. Never too busy for that....'),(19395,'f3b72c3017','Hey, feel like a tool for even asking, but like you have said before, just making sure the mail is getting through.  Either way, wassssssssssssssup :-)'),(18224,'f5cf8c816b','finks i have not forgotten about you , i meant to send it out last friday but ran into some shortage on the cash, but dont fear i will have this thing in the mail tomorrow fo sure\r\n\r\nsorry again , its comeing\r\njeff'),(18226,'f20df16809','That sucks that he\'s being like that... Why would you put shit on egay if you basically wanna jus tsell it to th efuckin neighbor...lol\r\n\r\n\r\ni\'m about 2 hours from Orlando   I can meet the guy half way...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(18227,'78f57a2cf8','ah dont sweat it. i got my friend who sits on ebay all day lookin for one.\r\n\r\ngood luck with yo speech.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18344,'4d02948568','ah dude just break down and get aim. its pretty sweet with all the pimps up live and shit. buncha cool cats.\r\n\r\ni think the new fruity is 28megs. probably a little much for dial-up but if you wana give it a go i dont care. either way youll get it haha.'),(18230,'1f20fc0111','Cool beans man... Thanks. In 6 hours, it\'ll be done with, and they\'ll be having their first fight as a couple...lol\r\n\r\nWe was so late yesterday to the rehersal that it almost blew up, and was a no go...lol'),(18231,'b662794dcf','that tune is interesting. i think we come from different schools o thought but thats all good. i think that plucked thing sucks ass. youd be better off with a sample of a single note from a real guitar. my favorite synth plugin is \"deamstatioin\" its dxi and is very versitale.  i got a korg polysix as well(no midi) and none of the soft synths can come close even at 96khz.\r\n\r\nbut anyhow ill throw up a few zip files tonight but you will probably need version 4+ which i could put on your ftp if ya want. along with assloads of samples and plugins and crap. another cool plugin thats freeware even is called \"superwave\" google it.'),(18335,'9b45174aa8','and why the hell aint you in the aim room yet?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18336,'ee93c75440','Nah, I didn\'t delete his post.\r\n\r\nAs for the chatroom, I don\'tknow, just never got into chatrooms, so I never thought about it.\r\n\r\n\r\nHey I still want that Fruity Loops 4, I didn\'t want you to think I forgot about that, I\'m just having problems getting on my C-panel, because our cable went out and we\'re temporarily on dial up, I guess it\'s not reconizing the IP.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18234,'2a2fd9292c','[quote:2a2fd9292c=\"hogjowlz\"]that tune is interesting. i think we come from different schools o thought but thats all good. i think that plucked thing sucks ass. youd be better off with a sample of a single note from a real guitar. my favorite synth plugin is \"deamstatioin\" its dxi and is very versitale.  i got a korg polysix as well(no midi) and none of the soft synths can come close even at 96khz.\r\n\r\nbut anyhow ill throw up a few zip files tonight but you will probably need version 4+ which i could put on your ftp if ya want. along with assloads of samples and plugins and crap. another cool plugin thats freeware even is called \"superwave\" google it.[/quote:2a2fd9292c]Heh heh, I\'m sure we do come from entirely different directions. I\'m come from a background of extreme hatred of Techno, and dance music in particular. When I first started playing with it, my intention was to make techno that sounded more organic, and less techno, but when I got into I started getting into all the sounds, and started listening to some techno. Atari Teenage Riot are the ones that got me into it, and a dude from work loaned me a stack of the Thunderdome CDs...\r\n\r\n...anyways I like to listen to techno now, because now that i have an understanding of what they\'re doing, I\'m like, \"Damn, how they doing that\", almost like if i was listening to Hendrix or someone.\r\n\r\nSince I was never into Techno, I\'m probably going about it all wrong, but that\'s ok, cause i like to be myself anyways, ya know?\r\n\r\n\r\nSo, yeah, I ramble, sorry, but l\'ll try to get some stuff zipped up this weekend. I\'m curious to see what you could do with my stuff, most of it is noisier than what I posted.\r\n\r\n\r\n...and I definately want that Fruity Loops 4, :-D \r\nI\'m too lazy to set up a FTP account right now, so I\'ll just give the one I set up for cabo.\r\n\r\nhost address: crazybydesign.net\r\nusername: u35707516cabowabo\r\npassword : bitpimps (I think, if it don\'t work, let me know, and I\'ll look it up)'),(18235,'57ff3dc831','password no worky.\r\n\r\nive been into electronic shit most of my life. i never really liked four on the floor dance beats tho like you until i started making it. ya noise rules. search for \"plug\" \"squarepusher\" and of course aphex twin. that thunderdrome shit is funny as hell.\r\n\r\nbefore i really started making electronic shit id always play with my friends\' guitar fx and just made noise. so synth shit was a natural progression i suppose. plus my uncle was always listening to devo and shit in the 80s and then he got me into skinny puppy.\r\n\r\nwhen you gime a password that works ill upload the new orb album as well. its \"ambient dub\" which means slow techno with raggae influence.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18236,'8e463102a2','hey cabo u looking for a xmod?'),(18334,'7c0a28f3da','[quote:7c0a28f3da=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:7c0a28f3da=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:7c0a28f3da=\"Son_Gokou\"]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=313&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=615\r\n\r\nUmm....they\'re joking, right? Or did I look gay/retarded in each of those pictures?[/quote:7c0a28f3da]yea - they\'re just giving you a hard time.\r\nyou can either laugh with them, against them, or blow off their comments - whichever works best for you[/quote:7c0a28f3da]\r\n\r\nMmm hmmm...\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3597\r\n\r\nAll I said was \"I don\'t get how it will do this\". Just that, and hog goes nuts on me and so does Finks. I don\'t get it, why are they so angry? I even made a post stating my point of view, he edited it, as you could see.....[/quote:7c0a28f3da]well I\'m going to be brutally honest with you. as you can see - not everyone is going to like you. for whatever reasons.\r\n\r\nyou\'ll just have to deal with it however you must. I can\'t monitor everyone\'s each and every posts. this takes up too much of my time as it is.'),(18238,'adc638bea5','Not a prob at all bro, I actually wasn\'t prepared to buy it last week either.  Sad but true, didn\'t have $10 to spare.  But now I am cool.  Thanks man.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19400,'a13df42ebc','i can cast a couple for you! do you live in the states. if you want them painted i will have to charge ya though. and the shipping will be 5 bucks within the usa. and 5 ea. for the painting of the bodies, it will be a total of 15 dollars. do you have a paypal account, that would be an easy way to transfer the money. i have been burnt once already so i cant send of without the funds first... sorry\r\n\r\njmays'),(18240,'8e463102a2','hey cabo u looking for a xmod?'),(18241,'a76564bbd4','[quote:a76564bbd4=\"joez2872\"]hey cabo u looking for a xmod?[/quote:a76564bbd4]naw not really man, thanks for askin though :-)'),(18242,'a76564bbd4','[quote:a76564bbd4=\"joez2872\"]hey cabo u looking for a xmod?[/quote:a76564bbd4]naw not really man, thanks for askin though :-)'),(18243,'569970c25a','cool finks, i sent it out today, i used a box at work that i had in the bakery that hard hard candies in it, i did not want to eat them nor throw them out i sent them to you, maybe about 20 pieces of left over christmas candies.  lol toss em if u want! no biggie, anyways i also was looking for some packing material at the casino i work at and all i could find was this crown royal bag, u know the purple bag that the crown comes in, so i stuffed the rc in the bag in the baox with the candies. i know to much info, none the less, its cool if u cant send the money for the rc no biggie maybe i will need something that u could help me with in this hobbie, or even a little trade. ttyl\r\njmays'),(18315,'95388b68dd','[quote:95388b68dd]i dont want to hear about buttsex and this car on the same day.\r\n[/quote:95388b68dd]\r\n\r\nIt was just a sense of humor.....Allright, fine. My bad. I\'m the twat.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18246,'9baab7ebe1','Sorry Da Bomb,\r\n\r\nWe\'d have to decline on your offer to host any \"Ride O Da Week\" pic from this forum.  These pics are for the express enjoyment of the Pimps that cruise thru Da Hood, so please do not used pics posted here.\r\n\r\nWhat would be a good idea is to post here and on various other forums for pic of rides to be hosted on your site.  There would be dozens of replies, who wouldn\'t want their ride hosted on a website  :???: You\'ll have more than you\'ll need.\r\n\r\nThanx For Asking 1st  :cool:'),(18468,'a371b30038','Sess,  What Up Pimp ?\r\n\r\nListen, I\'d like for you to do a few more Wall Papers 4 me if that\'s cool ?\r\n\r\nI\'d like dis babe:\r\n[img:a371b30038]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/wallpapers/normal_sessiz13.jpg[/img:a371b30038]\r\n\r\nWith this Pimp\'n Azz Ride:\r\n[img:a371b30038]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10005/normal_GoldenRod2.jpg[/img:a371b30038]\r\n\r\nGimme a caption [b:a371b30038]\"All That Glitters Is Not Gold\"   DarkTari Collection[/b:a371b30038]\r\n\r\nDis Babe:\r\n[img:a371b30038]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10001/normal_sessiz_real.jpg[/img:a371b30038]\r\n\r\nWit my latest Ride:\r\n[img:a371b30038]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10005/AMG%20Hammer1.jpg[/img:a371b30038]\r\n\r\nCaption: [b:a371b30038]\"Chicago Breez\'n\"  Team DarkTari[/b:a371b30038]\r\n\r\nCan U Pop me a copy thru email:  DarkTari@msn.com\r\n\r\nCan I email you some personal pics thru email to blend wit my rides?\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!  \r\n\r\n[b:a371b30038]U DA Man  [/b:a371b30038]:cool:'),(18248,'d17542865d','Would you mind if i hosted some of your pics. My rc site totally lacks content because i do not have enough cars.  I would like to host pics of some of your most pimp rides In the forums. it is an rc site. www.cswens.rchomepage.com\r\nthanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18249,'69ce7881b6','Do you mind if i host some pics of your pimpest bits on my rc site. I would really appreciate it. I would credit you and all of that. You have some of the sweetest rides and i would like others to see them.  I even created a link and banner to bitpimps. Just tell me what you think. Thanks\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com'),(18250,'c8b90e5ad2','Do you mind if i host some pics of your pimpest bits on my rc site. I would really appreciate it. I would credit you and all of that. You have some of the sweetest rides and i would like others to see them.  I even created a link and banner to bitpimps. Just tell me what you think. Thanks\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com'),(18251,'c8b90e5ad2','Do you mind if i host some pics of your pimpest bits on my rc site. I would really appreciate it. I would credit you and all of that. You have some of the sweetest rides and i would like others to see them.  I even created a link and banner to bitpimps. Just tell me what you think. Thanks\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com'),(27010,'609d37ec6a','Shipped your stuff this morning. USPS priority...let me know when you get it. Evrything is packed back up in the original packaging so it will feel like new when you get it   :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24373,'7b88e7d076','Did you get a new inductor? I\'d be glad to do it... no problem. If you still need to get an inductor/inductors, hit cj up... he has some. But, hell yeah, I love messing with soldering shit on xmods.\r\n\r\nLet me know.\r\n\r\nOh, yeah... I\'ve been meaning to ask you... You live in Lorain OH... is the steel mill there still open? Me and my dad were talking about that the other day, and he said he wasn\'t sure if it was, and I said \"Well, I know a guy from there, so when I get a chance I\'ll ask him...\"'),(18255,'7676fbe1ec','Do you mind if i host some pics of your pimpest bits on my rc site. I would really appreciate it. I would credit you and all of that. You have some of the sweetest rides and i would like others to see them.  I even created a link and banner to bitpimps. Just tell me what you think. Thanks\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com'),(18256,'3c4f52248e','Do you mind if i host some pics of your pimpest bits on my rc site. I would really appreciate it. I would credit you and all of that. You have some of the sweetest rides and i would like others to see them.  I even created a link and banner to bitpimps. Just tell me what you think. Thanks\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com'),(26498,'8a1f0f69fe','this is backdrift ( obviously ) the one who is trying to get to the get to gethers.. i was wondering, do u have an offroad 1:28 or 1:18 scale i can buy? i saw that u have a mini-t and a couple monsters, and overlands.. i just want to get into that and would like mine to have alloy and stuff that i would end up breaking..');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36596,'e39171e5a7','Whats your paypal? I need to give you a few bucks, or better yet, I have some spare evo parts I can hook you up with, anything off of an evo car except the electronics and the bushings because it doesnt have them. If you need any parts off of a truck I have some stock suspension parts and the stock wheels and such and I also have some Gen1 Stuff(Corvette body, bearings, chassis, etc) Just let me know.  \r\n\r\nAdress is:\r\n\r\nBrandon Bridges\r\n1815 Metcalf Rd.\r\nShelby, NC 28150\r\n\r\nThanks!'),(18258,'269a343637','Do you mind if i host some pics of your pimpest bits on my rc site. I would really appreciate it. I would credit you and all of that. You have some of the sweetest rides and i would like others to see them.  I even created a link and banner to bitpimps. Just tell me what you think. Thanks\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com'),(18259,'69ce7881b6','Do you mind if i host some pics of your pimpest bits on my rc site. I would really appreciate it. I would credit you and all of that. You have some of the sweetest rides and i would like others to see them.  I even created a link and banner to bitpimps. Just tell me what you think. Thanks\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com'),(18698,'d695aeca5e','Ok, my brain is frazzled, I\'ve figured out enough over the last couple days, so now I\'m ready to ask for some help.\r\n\r\nSee now my new soundcard is doing the same as the old.\r\n\r\nXP reconizes it, and says it\'s working, but when I try to install the driver, it says there is no soundblaster device on thjis computer.\r\n\r\nThen I install the new one, I can\'t uninstall the old one because apprently it\'s integrated into my mother board, never realized that before\r\n\r\nAnyway start it up, it reconizes the new plug and play device, before I could respond it says your device is installed and ready to use, and is listing both sound cards in my list of available devices So I disabled it before I ran the driver, because there wasn\'t supposed to be any other drivers installed. Then when I run the new driver, it does the same as the update for the old card. says there is no sound blaster device.  and now the new sound card is not listed or being reconized, even when I turn the computer off and on.\r\n\r\nSo what\'s up? why can\'t I get a sound card driver to install with XP?\r\n\r\nAny help would be greatly apprecited, thanks.  :-) \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18312,'2f236d824a','http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=313&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=615\r\n\r\nUmm....they\'re joking, right? Or did I look gay/retarded in each of those pictures?'),(18314,'21ae31453b','I respect that. Thanks for your time man. Did you check out my site. I could use the hits. :) anyway thanks again for your time'),(18261,'2ce464d7e9','Was thinking about the whole Pimp My Ride thread and thought WTF what a great idea for a mod contest.  So here is the idea.  Basically contestants have to take a car that they own or owned and either make a replica in bit form or a replica pimped out in bit form.  To add some substance to it, requiring a Pic of the contestant w/ the 1:1 car and then the bit bic would be hot as well.  This also prevents Gokou and other posers from claiming yeah this is my MR2, really it is!!  Would be fun all around, especially for those pimps thats rides havn\'t been made into a bit and see them crazy skills.  Just an idea.  PM me what ya think.'),(18262,'43777c12a7','[quote:43777c12a7=\"dabomb_04\"]Do you mind if i host some pics of your pimpest bits on my rc site. I would really appreciate it. I would credit you and all of that. You have some of the sweetest rides and i would like others to see them.  I even created a link and banner to bitpimps. Just tell me what you think. Thanks\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com[/quote:43777c12a7]Hi dabomb_04 -\r\n\r\nSorry, but we can not allow you to host any of our content and/or images\r\non your site. All our imagery and content is copyright.\r\n\r\nThanks for checking.\r\n\r\n- CaboWabo');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18263,'2ce464d7e9','Was thinking about the whole Pimp My Ride thread and thought WTF what a great idea for a mod contest.  So here is the idea.  Basically contestants have to take a car that they own or owned and either make a replica in bit form or a replica pimped out in bit form.  To add some substance to it, requiring a Pic of the contestant w/ the 1:1 car and then the bit bic would be hot as well.  This also prevents Gokou and other posers from claiming yeah this is my MR2, really it is!!  Would be fun all around, especially for those pimps thats rides havn\'t been made into a bit and see them crazy skills.  Just an idea.  PM me what ya think.'),(18264,'cf019ff95d','I can however ask for peeps pics permission individually right. And have them send me via email and then i will host them on my own. you don\'t actually own the picture just the hosting of them. And as long as they are hosted on my account and i have the permission of the pimp then i\'m allright. Correct?'),(19403,'6354a8830b','Mothernature is going skitzo here.  It will be bright sun shiny day one min then BAM Rain like a mofo for an hour then sun then rain rinse repeat.  It\'s June and it\'s acting like it\'s April up here.  \r\n\r\nWell anyhow due to the Holiday think it went out Tuesday so hopefully you will get it tomorrow.  Laters J');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19404,'3a7376a93c','i dont know if my first post replie got to you , so here it is again, i do have two of them and i can paint them for you at the price of $5 ea. and the $5 for the shipping within the usa. i will need money first cause i have gotten burnt on the shipping already, i have a paypal account or how ever you want to handle it. but i can paint and send you two bodies.\r\n\r\nthanks\r\njmays'),(19405,'a13df42ebc','i can cast a couple for you! do you live in the states. if you want them painted i will have to charge ya though. and the shipping will be 5 bucks within the usa. and 5 ea. for the painting of the bodies, it will be a total of 15 dollars. do you have a paypal account, that would be an easy way to transfer the money. i have been burnt once already so i cant send of without the funds first... sorry\r\n\r\njmays'),(18266,'cf019ff95d','I can however ask for peeps pics permission individually right. And have them send me via email and then i will host them on my own. you don\'t actually own the picture just the hosting of them. And as long as they are hosted on my account and i have the permission of the pimp then i\'m allright. Correct?'),(18302,'8776bed7ee','I am going to have to respectfully deny your request.  If they can\'t find them here they won\'t find my pics.  I like to know that if I choose to I can take my pictures off of where I put them when I want.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18304,'e496c392d4','absolutely i will give props. I\'m making a gallery dedicated to pimps. Could you give me a url of or several urls of where you host your pics. CaboWabo doesn\'t want me getting them off of forums because it\'s copywritten. If not that is fine and thanks for your trouble'),(18305,'d45bf989bc','LOL tht\'s a riot dude.  No I have the cash no worries there, but I do appreciate your generosity.  Arite I\'ll throw the mula in the mail tomorrow.  Thanks again.'),(18306,'3fdf671b9c','Will do bro, thanks for the input.'),(19733,'dfa45e8737','I tried it under DarkTari, didn\'t work.  Could lock Kahuna\'s post either ???'),(19829,'0c029c6c09','wanna catch a buzz in about an hour?'),(18268,'172a267aa8','[quote:172a267aa8=\"dabomb_04\"]I can however ask for peeps pics permission individually right. And have them send me via email and then i will host them on my own. you don\'t actually own the picture just the hosting of them. And as long as they are hosted on my account and i have the permission of the pimp then i\'m allright. Correct?[/quote:172a267aa8]for the most part - yes you are right.\r\nhere\'s specifically how it works.\r\n\r\nAny image you see here that is hosted by bitPimps, belongs to bitPimps and is therefore copyright. Even if the picture was originally taken by some other member (let\'s use crazydave as an example).\r\n\r\nif crazydave takes a picture of his car and posts it for the world to see from his own domain. then he owns that picture - bitPimps has nothing to do with it. at that point - you can feel free to contact that person and ask them whatever you want to ask them.\r\n\r\nhere\'s where it\'s different.\r\n\r\nlet\'s say crazydave takes a picture of his car and posts it for the world to see from the [b:172a267aa8]bitPimps[/b:172a267aa8] domain (http://bitpimps.lixlink.com in the image address). then both crazydave and bitPimps own that picture - it is copyright material along with the text if any exists. at that point - the copyright is self-explanitory. any infraction on the copyrights would result in legal action taken against the party or parties who are infringing on our copyright.\r\n\r\nmake sense?'),(18269,'ee4317fa60','Yeah that is cool. I\'m not trying to rip off your site man. Just trying to improve mine. you should check my site when you get a minute. from pimp to pimp. My gallery isn\'t quite finished. But the xmod is definetly worth checking. It is also in your xmod crip titled \"C Swens Is Back\"\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com/smod.html');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18270,'ee4317fa60','Yeah that is cool. I\'m not trying to rip off your site man. Just trying to improve mine. you should check my site when you get a minute. from pimp to pimp. My gallery isn\'t quite finished. But the xmod is definetly worth checking. It is also in your xmod crip titled \"C Swens Is Back\"\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com/smod.html'),(18271,'e6419f1063','[quote:e6419f1063=\"Finks\"]Was thinking about the whole Pimp My Ride thread and thought WTF what a great idea for a mod contest.  So here is the idea.  Basically contestants have to take a car that they own or owned and either make a replica in bit form or a replica pimped out in bit form.  To add some substance to it, requiring a Pic of the contestant w/ the 1:1 car and then the bit bic would be hot as well.  This also prevents Gokou and other posers from claiming yeah this is my MR2, really it is!!  Would be fun all around, especially for those pimps thats rides havn\'t been made into a bit and see them crazy skills.  Just an idea.  PM me what ya think.[/quote:e6419f1063]it is a cool idea - we\'ve toyed with \"themed\" contests before, problem is we have to make it a pretty generic theme because the idea is - we want as many pimps to try their hand at it as possible.\r\nin the past, it seemed that if we got too specific - we cut off the majority of the potential contestants, either they discouraged themselves or we did.\r\n\r\nI love the concept, I think it can be done and done in a way that it won\'t exclude many pimps - but we\'ve gotta work out all the little details.\r\n\r\nmaybe go ahead and post this up in the suggestion box so everyone can get their input in on it?\r\nif we see enough interests, we can get more details worked out and hopefully set it up.\r\n\r\nwhat do you think?'),(18272,'3fdf671b9c','Will do bro, thanks for the input.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18273,'d9d1d041c1','Do you mind if i host some pics of your pimpest bits on my rc site. I would really appreciate it. I would credit you and all of that. You have some of the sweetest rides and i would like others to see them.  I even created a link and banner to bitpimps. Just tell me what you think. Thanks\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com'),(23347,'24e4374197','y0 Cabo. I got a question about that truck. Is the chassis stock? or does it got fets and stuff?? could u give me the particulars?\r\n\r\n\r\nbtw i do in fact love it lol'),(28101,'5995a6c192','Just thought I\'d tell ya - that fuckin avatar kicks all kinds of asses.\r\nGood one holmes.'),(28039,'16d2f5f86b','how long you had it?'),(18277,'b8f832a84a','Nice man. Of course i i will give you your props. If you like you can even tell me exactly what you want by your pics in your gallery pages. what i need from you is your pics. I can\'t get them off of the forum because that is a copyright violation. So in an email send me a folder with like 2 megs of pics. I will try to post them asap. Thanks man i really appreciate it.\r\np.s. what you think of the site'),(18301,'8776bed7ee','I am going to have to respectfully deny your request.  If they can\'t find them here they won\'t find my pics.  I like to know that if I choose to I can take my pictures off of where I put them when I want.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24370,'22807d7ecd','yo Bird, I was/am talkin to sg on AIM, and he told me that you might want to /be able to fix my xmod. it\'s got a fried L2 inductor. Seeing as how you live pretty close, shipping wouldn\'t be too much, and I could pitch in somethin extra, like xmods parts or stuff.. \r\n\r\nHe told me to tell you he sent me!  :) \r\n\r\n\r\nget back at me mang!\r\n\r\n\r\n~midget~'),(27321,'49be842c8e','[quote=\"sg219]..just a mess to clean up. :cool:[/quote]\r\n\r\nHah i thought thats for the ladys to do, lol'),(18281,'9cfb56af5d','My email is dabomb_04@msn.com do you have msn messenger? that would be way better than this. And i can\'t take them off of the forums because cabowabo says it is copyrighted. So i have to get it straight from the pimps.  Don\'t ask me why he is just acting a fool.'),(18282,'066e2ba485','aiight, I have msn messenger... midget_man1387@msn.com'),(24376,'071dfc3449','aiight I\'ll talk to CJ. \r\n\r\n\r\nAre there any xmods parts or homies you need man? I could give you another bird lol\r\n\r\n\r\nYeah, the steel mill is still open. owned by like US Steel. Did your dad used to work there or somethin?'),(18285,'18ad0c4ad4','sign onto messenger');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18286,'7cf8fd3ec4','I\'m on, but I\'m leaving now, so I\'ll give you a link to all the sites I\'ve used so far:\r\n\r\n[url]http://groups.msn.com/midgetman1387andhisminircs/_homepage.msnw[/url]\r\n[url]http://groups.msn.com/midgetman1387sminircpics/_homepage.msnw[/url]\r\n[url]http://www.pbase.com/midget_man1387/[/url]\r\n[url]http://www.rcpics.net/member/Midget_man1387[/url]'),(24390,'135a95e671','hey man. How long till ya get the stuff done? lol I\'m getting antsy and wanna put them on my new project! lol pm me back when ya get this!\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks\r\n\r\n~midget~'),(24391,'91f3118dcc','Sorry for the delay bro... If you only knew the BS I had to deal with...lol I\'ll send out this week.  Mon, or Tues morn.'),(27322,'9ce5ab94bc','[quote:9ce5ab94bc=\"stagg\"][quote:9ce5ab94bc=\"sg219\"]..just a mess to clean up. :cool:[/quote:9ce5ab94bc]\r\n\r\nHah i thought thats for the ladys to do, lol[/quote:9ce5ab94bc]\r\n\r\nYa, it is....but when your single, it doesn\'t work like that. :-('),(18289,'0836f8cc49','thanks man\r\nthat will do check site tommorow and they will be there\r\nunder Pimp Gallery');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18290,'69c80b113f','Do you mind if i host some pics of your pimpest bits on my rc site. I would really appreciate it. I would credit you and all of that. You have some of the sweetest rides and i would like others to see them.  I even created a link and banner to bitpimps. Just tell me what you think. Thanks\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com'),(18291,'f8617290ee','It all depends on what pics you wanna use. None of the wallpapers can be put up on your site. Any of the cars I\'ve posted here can be posted up on your site with credits.\r\nGood luck on your site.'),(18292,'f8617290ee','It all depends on what pics you wanna use. None of the wallpapers can be put up on your site. Any of the cars I\'ve posted here can be posted up on your site with credits.\r\nGood luck on your site.'),(18294,'9647db83bc','the thing is i can\'t use the url from the forums if because cabo wabo is being all \"copyright\" so if you have a different url that you could give me that originally hosted the pics in the forum. that would rock. I am syked to have my new \"Pimp Gallery\"  thanks man'),(18295,'d17542865d','Would you mind if i hosted some of your pics. My rc site totally lacks content because i do not have enough cars.  I would like to host pics of some of your most pimp rides In the forums. it is an rc site. www.cswens.rchomepage.com\r\nthanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18296,'70de451e81','[quote:70de451e81=\"dabomb_04\"]Would you mind if i hosted some of your pics. My rc site totally lacks content because i do not have enough cars.  I would like to host pics of some of your most pimp rides In the forums. it is an rc site. www.cswens.rchomepage.com\r\nthanks[/quote:70de451e81]I suppose that would be ok. Just make sure proper credit is given.\r\n\r\ndave'),(18297,'1ded89a4bd','That sounds cool. So i should ask the pimps individually for the car.  Allright, no problem on asking first i saw a guy on here that asked befrore to so i thought i should as well.\r\nThanks\r\nBitHood'),(18298,'70de451e81','[quote:70de451e81=\"dabomb_04\"]Would you mind if i hosted some of your pics. My rc site totally lacks content because i do not have enough cars.  I would like to host pics of some of your most pimp rides In the forums. it is an rc site. www.cswens.rchomepage.com\r\nthanks[/quote:70de451e81]I suppose that would be ok. Just make sure proper credit is given.\r\n\r\ndave'),(18299,'e496c392d4','absolutely i will give props. I\'m making a gallery dedicated to pimps. Could you give me a url of or several urls of where you host your pics. CaboWabo doesn\'t want me getting them off of forums because it\'s copywritten. If not that is fine and thanks for your trouble');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18300,'7676fbe1ec','Do you mind if i host some pics of your pimpest bits on my rc site. I would really appreciate it. I would credit you and all of that. You have some of the sweetest rides and i would like others to see them.  I even created a link and banner to bitpimps. Just tell me what you think. Thanks\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com'),(37580,'8b37f3a82c','Hey man, Im sure you are super busy but ive run into a problem with my new woah nelly evo.  I just got it in the mail last night and after installing it im only getting one gear( forward or reverse)...I switched the motor wires and it still stays the same direction (figure that out)  but if i flip the switch on the remote i can get a different direction.  So im either stuck with reverse or forward but i dont get both.  Also, the signal doesnt seem to be that strong.  \r\n\r\nIm running 4 cells (AAA) with the z2 motor (so that shouldnt have overloaded anything)\r\n\r\nANy ideas?  Have you happened upon this problem before?  maybe bad FETs?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nSporttracguy'),(18319,'2f236d824a','http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=313&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=615\r\n\r\nUmm....they\'re joking, right? Or did I look gay/retarded in each of those pictures?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18320,'08c77069a9','[quote:08c77069a9=\"Son_Gokou\"]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=313&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=615\r\n\r\nUmm....they\'re joking, right? Or did I look gay/retarded in each of those pictures?[/quote:08c77069a9]yea - they\'re just giving you a hard time.\r\nyou can either laugh with them, against them, or blow off their comments - whichever works best for you'),(18321,'08c77069a9','[quote:08c77069a9=\"Son_Gokou\"]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=313&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=615\r\n\r\nUmm....they\'re joking, right? Or did I look gay/retarded in each of those pictures?[/quote:08c77069a9]yea - they\'re just giving you a hard time.\r\nyou can either laugh with them, against them, or blow off their comments - whichever works best for you'),(18323,'1ea40fc652','hey man. everything arrived safe and sound today! i\'m lovin all the stuff, the fat tyres are excellent! and thanks so much for all those shells, they going to a good home. those motors are great, just what i\'m after.\r\nso all in all a great experience, thanks for hooking us sheep fuckers up, there\'s a couple of happy campers down here! :-)  gonna have to do it again soon if that\'s cool. a few people are jealous of my goodies so we might go for a bigger one next time. any probs lemme know, don\'t wanna use you up........ too much! :eek: \r\n\r\ncheers brudda, trent'),(36121,'581efd46ad','Then why didnt you know about ultimaterc :? \r\n\r\nhah :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33028,'0b2044d50f','Oh shit, I just remembered... there was $15 in MT hop ups too..... ERGHHYQ#A%TY*#WUYITHJRS #W)  Fuckin gay.'),(18325,'5f15a395b9','[quote:5f15a395b9=\"betty.k\"]hey man. everything arrived safe and sound today! i\'m lovin all the stuff, the fat tyres are excellent! and thanks so much for all those shells, they going to a good home. those motors are great, just what i\'m after.\r\nso all in all a great experience, thanks for hooking us sheep fuckers up, there\'s a couple of happy campers down here! :-)  gonna have to do it again soon if that\'s cool. a few people are jealous of my goodies so we might go for a bigger one next time. any probs lemme know, don\'t wanna use you up........ too much! :eek: \r\n\r\ncheers brudda, trent[/quote:5f15a395b9]\r\n\r\nGlad you got it in one piece. Yeah, I go to Radio Shack all the time, so no big deal if you want more. Maybe next time we\'ll have to do it for trade, for a suspended chassis or the parts to make one. Hue35 and I are going to order more of those motors. For $1.50 you can\'t beat em. There\'s a few motors out there that have a slight edge, but usually cost 4 times as much. Anyway, let me know when you need more stuff, I\'ll be your personal shopper.'),(18326,'3c4f52248e','Do you mind if i host some pics of your pimpest bits on my rc site. I would really appreciate it. I would credit you and all of that. You have some of the sweetest rides and i would like others to see them.  I even created a link and banner to bitpimps. Just tell me what you think. Thanks\r\nwww.cswens.rchomepage.com');
