INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21674,'a833248637','I just got back from the post office.  It was only $1.35 to send the body to you.  Not bad. \r\n\r\nSo its in the mail. :-) \r\n\r\n\r\nGlad I could help,\r\n\r\nMike'),(36867,'34e1400f3e','[quote:34e1400f3e=\"Maxximum Attack\"]Thanx for the quick reply.\r\n\r\nI\'ll try to mustor $140 to be safe. Any word yet from GPM on the price of the front/rear gearbox pairs? Even an estimated price?\r\n\r\nAnyhow, we\'ll be in touch. I\'ve figured a way to pay you, I\'ll use my frind\'s paypal in the states. When My brother ges up there, I\'ll send the cash with him.\r\n\r\nMaxx[/quote:34e1400f3e]\r\n\r\nThat will work.  Just make sure that when he paypals me he adds a note that it is for you so I know.'),(35294,'945dcfd0cb','Any word on the OL, and hows your cold treating ya????'),(23942,'55b77468e4','RX7 (LXX automodellista)\r\nGloria (green)\r\n\r\nI would love to have these too......'),(28680,'d454274543','Hey Sez,\r\n\r\nI was hopin you might be able to help me out with this one...I set this badboy up beautiful on the bigscreen, but then the bigscreen bulb blew, so I put the player in my bedroom and set it up on a regular screen TV (no composite input, no progressive scan).\r\n\r\nProblem is, I think the player is still spitting out the video in that format and out the composite connections...So I can\'t get the damned picture on my regular TV. \r\n\r\nI tried leaving the thing unplugged for hours (that\'s supposed to set the thing back to factory default...But I think not).\r\n\r\nSo, being a DVP642 owner yurself I was hoping you might have a trick or something I can try?\r\n\r\nThanks man.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36820,'22e0ed4101','[quote:22e0ed4101=\"SuperFly\"]Hey man-\r\n\r\nJust saying hi, haven\'t seen ya round as much as usual. Kids can do that to ya. How is your little one? My little guy is having his first birthday in 3 weeks, can\'t believe it\'s gone by so fast. Santa brought him his first Hot Wheels set for xmas, so he\'s got the bug now. \r\n:-D \r\n\r\nBTW, I successfully modded my Nelly the other night. I was scared shitless I was going to fuck it up, but all went well. All I needed to do was change the direction the power wires entered the Nelly from the battery terminals. I\'m running a McLaren body on the Nelly chassis, and there\'s not a lot of room under there and it felt like I was going to bust out the windshield every time I mounted the body. I was having some binding issues that were affecting the rear suspension, so I made the wires come out the other side. Now I have about a nice short 4cm length leading to the Nelly instead of the full length as supplied being doubled over and wadded into the shell. Is there any danger in just wrapping a little electrical tape around the nelly vs. the shrink-tubing? I just wanted to protect the Nelly pcb and don\'t have a heat gun.\r\n\r\nBeen in full MR02 mode lately, almost more obsessively than I ever was with bits.[/quote:22e0ed4101]\r\n\r\nlol, good stuff!  Yeah, marrisa is %110 my attention and fucken loving it.  she\'s going wel, just started solids.  So it\'s poo left right and centre!\r\n\r\nI\'ve been busy whoreing on the xmod forums.  Sorta to an obssesive level, lol...  Pushing nelly\'s trhough my site shop and doing al sorts of crazy things in the 1:28 world.\r\n\r\nI hear ya on the mr02.  I\'mjust about to goto betty\'s for an extended lunch/race/bake meet. lol.  Gotta love the holidays when no-ones in at work!\r\n\r\nThe tape will be fine.  SHouldn\'t have any issues there.  I now use 28AWG silicon wire on my nellys for the very reason you pointed out.  It works well and takes the current no probs.  It\'s funny with all the xmod kiddies go &quot;but man, you\'re not using 18awg superflex, mega huge wire&quot;.  Yeah, just shows how a little bit of info can be screwed so royally on forums with kids on it.\r\n\r\nI also have the ma-010, you may want to look into it for your RCP track.  EMU knows a shitload about z\'s and he says that the ma-010 even in stock form totally owns the RCP tracks.\r\n\r\nbetty and I are concrete whores so my ma-010 needs a lot of suping up to make it even remotely effective.  One good thing is that they\'re improved the electronics so you can run hot motors no probs.  The hottest I\'ve run ins the pn Anima and it works a treat.\r\n\r\ncheers and avagoodone mate.\r\n\r\nMAtt.'),(26552,'87783d3b7e','[quote:87783d3b7e=\"Sdog\"]Want me to throw in a barely used Bigfoot Monster Truck and Monster Truck Motor Upgrade kit for another $20?\r\n\r\nThis stuff is in the orifinal packaging as well.[/quote:87783d3b7e]\r\n\r\nSure, why not. :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34173,'8f9ecf0faa','Yeah it works now, Odd, well whatever you did, thanks man. :-o'),(32535,'f86cc19df5','[quote:f86cc19df5=\"Finks\"][quote:f86cc19df5]Greg Maffei \r\nGrey Matter \r\n431 NW Flanders, #203 \r\nPortland, Oregon 97209[/quote:f86cc19df5]\r\n\r\nJust sending a confirmation to make sure this is a valid addy for you.  Also I will be sending both yours and Hue\'s stuff in the same box as you asked earlier if that\'s still fine.[/quote:f86cc19df5]\r\n\r\nYep, that\'s me. Thanks again!'),(26563,'076d6f7dbd','how much are you asking for that car?\r\n\r\n\r\n-ludamak'),(26564,'cf5031ac7d','can u make an offer please..'),(26568,'b448480df4','I must say that you are hardcore to build micro rc\'s  how long have you being doing that?  :eek:  :eek:'),(26569,'b82ac0c021','hey wantede to here what the tamiya padding you have is it a smooth surface 87052 or a quik type 87051'),(26570,'db695cb328','Thanx man!  I\'ve been working with mini cars for about two years now.\r\n\r\nI use smooth surface putty.  It takes 24 hours to fully dry, but it\'s worth the wait.  I usually wait about a week to drive it.  It\'s much stronger after a week.\r\n\r\nI\'ve only done body work on 4 or 5 cars.  The Pantera was my 4th try at body work.  You get better the more you do it.  After a while it gets easy and you start to understand it.\r\n\r\nI learned a lot from Dark Tari.  But I have my own style.  I do things a little different from him.  But he\'s the one that taught me the most about body work.\r\n\r\nP.S.  Happy new year!'),(26574,'bc72930e4f','yo pimp.  were do you have the street paper from?? your trackrox!!!!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (23531,'ecf99484ac','Aight thats cool, let me know if you decide to sell them by tonight so I can get the package together.\r\n\r\nPeace.'),(23532,'318e14ea39','[quote:318e14ea39=\"KaNye\"]Aight thats cool, let me know if you decide to sell them by tonight so I can get the package together.\r\n\r\nPeace.[/quote:318e14ea39]Oh well then if you want an answer by tonight, I\'d have to say no. I still need to put them on a car and see if I can get it dial the way I like. That\'s a major deciding factor.;)\r\n\r\ndave'),(28505,'12db5b5d4b','I will deff let Ya know, that paint job was clean and sharp, very good job, and I\'ll let Ya know if I need any resin parts made aswell, about those crazy rims, I\'m trying to pick out something still, not sure what would really set this skyline off, but it\'s going to be cool, any ideas?\r\nThanks Man'),(24446,'b2f44e9368','Thanks, man. I guess it automatically goes inactive if you change the email address... it said it needed to be reactivated via email because of the change.'),(18816,'38b3937a6d','[quote:38b3937a6d=\"jmays\"]hi cw i am sorry for the trouble i am only wanting to be a part of the happenings, i joined in the middle of some stuff and did not have to whole picture if u know what i mean, i have been correted and again i am very sorry. i cant wait till i get a chance to enter into a contest. it will be fun i am sure, i am old enough that i want let pride get into the way, i have made a foul of my self and i slump down in my chair, i will chill and watch, when its my turn to get into the action i will be there, thanks for the great sight. i will email this to the others aswell.\r\nreguards\r\njeff[/quote:38b3937a6d]Hey dude, I\'m CD (crazydave) not CW(cabowabo).\r\n\r\nAt any rate sorry I spoke up. I just couldn\'t help myself. The moderators contest was an extremly cool thing, I never heard of any forum\'s members doing that for it\'s moderators. So I just thought it was extremly uncool to dump on our parade.\r\n\r\nWith that said,there is a contest in the works. So be cool man, hang out a little, because I can tell you complaining is gonna make you more enemies than friends.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18817,'0fdddfdb40','sorry dave i sent that to cw and did not correct the email. i would like to send all modderatores a body of the citroen and of my bus if you guys want one , its on me please except my gift . my email is superpieboy@yahoo.com i would like to give the moderatores bodies as a thanks.'),(19194,'043aaa7494','By the way the box is 10\"x7\"x6\" and buldging so if your box is that large, it should fit!\r\n\r\nAlso you can do what you want with the bodies, paint the stock one or use something else, your call Pimp!  If you need bodies, let me know. If you want me to do a body for you to paint, holla  :eek:'),(19186,'468f49ae6a',':???: lemme think - I\'m sure I can help.'),(24015,'357b397d7d','OK so the extra pb chassie is cool with you then?\r\n\r\n  I also ment to ask what mhz the zz was?'),(24016,'994279b3c4','It\'s an SE, so I\'m not sure.'),(23793,'22b478384a','I don\'t remember what we talked about last regarding xmod stuff...\r\n\r\nBut...\r\n\r\nI have an xmod (red supra), with every available RS upgrade, that I\'m not using much anymore. Hue35 and I both had them, and raced them against eachother. He traded his to Crazy Dave, so I don\'t drive mine anymore. I\'d be willing to sell or trade it if you\'re interested.\r\n\r\nThe body is beat to hell, but I still have unused body kit parts that could make it look pretty new if you just used a different combination. The chassis is in really good shape. Raced only indoors, probably only 50 or so sets of batteries run through it. It\'s got all the upgrades, bearings, AWD, stage 2 motors, suspension, wheel sets, tire sets, lights, body kit,???\r\n\r\nAnyway, make me an offer if you\'re interested.'),(23954,'feba1ef769','OK sounds good, when I get home I will just be sure that they are still around ( I am 99.9% sure they are) and I will see if I have a chassie kickin around that I missed\r\n\r\n\r\n  Peter Kostecki\r\n20 Water St.\r\nThorold Ontario\r\nL2V 2K3\r\nCanada');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (23955,'33001864e5','cool. It\'s on it\'s way as of tomorrow. :-D'),(34400,'196614a462','[quote:196614a462=\"DarkTari\"][quote:196614a462=\"JdmHatchback\"]Hey Wussup!\r\n\r\nSorry I didnt reply sooner, I still got a bunch of Microsizer bodies and Perfection bodies. Let me know if youre looking for something in particular. Thanks!\r\n\r\nJDM[/quote:196614a462]\r\n\r\nLooking for :\r\n\r\n[b:196614a462]3 - Lambo Bodies\r\n3 - Ferrari Bodies[/b:196614a462]\r\n\r\n\r\nand if you still got \'em:\r\nTomy [b:196614a462]Gloria, WRX[/b:196614a462]\r\nPerfection [b:196614a462]VW[/b:196614a462]\r\n\r\nAlso looking for a New Tomy Fairlady (lost mine)\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp![/quote:196614a462]\r\n\r\nHey,\r\n\r\nI still have quite a few of the perfection lambo and ferrari bodies. I have them in 5-6 different colors. I also have these available in the sets too if interested. \r\n\r\nI have the Perfection VW Beetle bodies or sets in quite a few colors as well. For the Tomy Fairlady, the only thing that I most likely have is the Pullback. As for the Tomy WRX and Gloria, I still need to check on those as I packed alot of my stuff in storage. \r\n\r\nThanks!\r\nJDM'),(19184,'468f49ae6a',':???: lemme think - I\'m sure I can help.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (22900,'76aac33297','Yeah he up\'d his own bid to $24.00, but I told him that\'s not neccessary I would accept his $21.00 bid so $21.00 it is.\r\n\r\nI think Dave\'s calmed down some.  I didn\'t think it was that big of a deal but hey, I\'m not Dave either.  He\'ll come back around.  How does he\r\n[u:76aac33297]honestly[/u:76aac33297] feel about all the mods we have here now?\r\n\r\nContact Dave and see if we can still use his paypal til this thing is over.\r\n\r\nMy badd about not contacting you, something always get\'s lost in da sauce.'),(20126,'d8097bf20e','Hey Cabo,\r\n\r\nI haven\'t heard from JAC4412 to get his address.  Do you have it ?'),(19133,'0a5d0cfca9','[quote:0a5d0cfca9=\"hogjowlz\"]i almost locked this so you couldnt edit anymore but i want you to sweat.\r\n\r\nmy middle finger is ready to go. just you wait and see   :-)[/quote:0a5d0cfca9]\r\n\r\nAllright, got the message. I\'ll stop posting to that thread.'),(37277,'782f7e8796','[quote:782f7e8796=\"betty.k\"]yup, still for sale.\r\nprices are in aussie dollars.\r\n(currency converter:\r\nhttp://finance.yahoo.com/currency?u )\r\n\r\nshipping will be around $10 - 15usd (probably 10).\r\n\r\njust remember, i\'ve driven these hard and they\'re suffering handling problems (pulls left under throttle, pulls right off throttle).\r\nbut i\'ve looked after them well and all electronics are rock solid\r\n :-o \r\n\r\ni got plenty of spares too :-o[/quote:782f7e8796]\r\n\r\nNo worries, ive seen the way you and ph2t drive lol :-o \r\n\r\nGlad to know the electronics are solid i\'ve been wanting to do a conversion for sometime but never got around to it. Hmm the handling problems should take some time but i\'m sure i\'ll get it all up and runnning. Should be fun to work on.\r\n\r\n\r\nOne question though how hard has the motor been run do you think it could use a set of new brushes?\r\n\r\nAlso what\'s the specs on the nelly v1.2 11 amps if i can remember correctly?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI used the converter link and $50AUS came out to $37.4275USD\r\n\r\nHow\'s $48USD shipped sound?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19183,'8143d8ad25','[quote:8143d8ad25=\"CaboWabo\"]well whattya need to get fets?\r\nI\'m assuming you already know where to get them for what you need at the right amount and price.[/quote:8143d8ad25]See here\'s the deal. Digikey has a $5 sur-charge on orders under $25, so I might as well order them 50 at a time. It\'s not like we don\'t have the $28 it comes to after shipping, we just blew $50 at BigLots tonight, but my wife is saving to take the kid to Disneyland next month, and I\'m not allowed to get anything until she\'s saved enough. :roll:\r\n\r\n...but DTs got some cars on the way, that I\'m gonna be FETing to be auctioned off, so it\'s been made clear between me and her that I [i:8143d8ad25][b:8143d8ad25]am[/b:8143d8ad25][/i:8143d8ad25] getting a batch of FETs before the end of the month.\r\n\r\nIt\'s funny, like tonight when we\'re out, and she\'ll say, \"should we get it?\" I\'m like, \"I don\'t care, but don\'t forget you\'re saving money, and I am getting mosfets this month\" :lol: \r\n\r\n :lol: Dave'),(18827,'f968a01ac3','[quote:f968a01ac3=\"cj\"][quote:f968a01ac3=\"crazydave\"][quote:f968a01ac3=\"cj\"]Are you still Interested in a ZZ Jeep body?[/quote:f968a01ac3]You know I am.  :-D \r\n\r\nSooo....umm, whach ya lookin\' for? :-) \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:f968a01ac3]\r\n\r\nI\'ve got a new gold jeep body I\'ll send you in trade fro a few homies.  Unfortunately I am at work now and can\'t tell you what ones I need.  I\'ll let you know Sunday.   Cool?[/quote:f968a01ac3]That sounds like a deal to me.\r\n\r\nI\'ve got mostly series 6, and a few of 4, 5, clowns, and rats. Only got a few  doubles, but I think I\'d be willing to part with almost any of them for a Jeep body. :lol: \r\n\r\nI\'ll have to post you a pic of what I got.\r\n\r\nThnaks for thinking of me. 8-) \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18828,'a0d40c084e','[quote:a0d40c084e=\"jmays\"]sorry dave i sent that to cw and did not correct the email. i would like to send all modderatores a body of the citroen and of my bus if you guys want one , its on me please except my gift . my email is superpieboy@yahoo.com i would like to give the moderatores bodies as a thanks.[/quote:a0d40c084e]Dude, I\'d love to have one of your bodies, but really you don\'t have to do that. \r\n\r\nI\'d settle with just being your friend. That\'s all I was asking, is for you just chill, so we all can hang out.\r\n\r\nAnd don\'t take that the wrong way, I\'m a fan of VW buses, and think your body is very cool.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18829,'2baf50cd18','[quote:2baf50cd18=\"jmays\"]hi cw i am sorry for the trouble i am only wanting to be a part of the happenings, i joined in the middle of some stuff and did not have to whole picture if u know what i mean, i have been correted and again i am very sorry. i cant wait till i get a chance to enter into a contest. it will be fun i am sure, i am old enough that i want let pride get into the way, i have made a foul of my self and i slump down in my chair, i will chill and watch, when its my turn to get into the action i will be there, thanks for the great sight. i will email this to the others aswell.\r\nreguards\r\njeff[/quote:2baf50cd18]I haven\'t gone through and read any of the posts yet, but I was told about them.\r\nthanks for the appology.\r\ndon\'t sweat the small stuff - be here to have fun and learn.\r\nyou don\'t ever really have to question if you are welcomed here or not - everyone is welcomed here, and there\'s no mistaking it when someone is not welcomed here.\r\n\r\nso anyways, thanks again for the appology and don\'t worry - go have fun pimp.'),(18830,'ffc1bcbe10','ya dude just chill. everyone likes your work so just mellow out a bit aite?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18831,'0d6e12a395','No problem at all Jeff. I understand your frustration. There is alot of content on the site, and it\'s hard to take it all in in a short period of time.\r\n\r\nyou do outstanding jobs on your cars, and they are easily contest material, and or ROTW material.\r\n\r\nYour work doesn\'t need to be sold by you to us. It\'s great work and it sells itself.  Now that the site is cooling off, and we\'ll be hosting another contest for the members, you\'ll be able to strut your stuff like the rest.\r\n\r\nHave fun, and good luck.    And yes, you\'re totally welcome on our board. :-) \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(18832,'61b8f73b59','Cavey,  Don\'t worry about the cars, I\'ll send you a few.  I\'ll head up there next weekend and grab some more.  These are the models they have:\r\n[b:61b8f73b59]RX7\r\nSkyline\r\nWRX\r\nAccord Wagon[/b:61b8f73b59]\r\nI also have a few bodies that were removed from Shen chassis that I\'ve been using on my SBG Pullback Bodies:\r\n[b:61b8f73b59]Supra\r\nPeugeuot 206\r\nbB\r\nAccord Wagon[/b:61b8f73b59]\r\n\r\nPop me your address again Pimp!  Also do you think you can find the time to FET a few more chassis for me?\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!'),(18834,'61b8f73b59','Cavey,  Don\'t worry about the cars, I\'ll send you a few.  I\'ll head up there next weekend and grab some more.  These are the models they have:\r\n[b:61b8f73b59]RX7\r\nSkyline\r\nWRX\r\nAccord Wagon[/b:61b8f73b59]\r\nI also have a few bodies that were removed from Shen chassis that I\'ve been using on my SBG Pullback Bodies:\r\n[b:61b8f73b59]Supra\r\nPeugeuot 206\r\nbB\r\nAccord Wagon[/b:61b8f73b59]\r\n\r\nPop me your address again Pimp!  Also do you think you can find the time to FET a few more chassis for me?\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18835,'bff8f2eb42','Yo Pimp, Don\'t forget about me   :-)'),(19631,'c2d51153b3','ok, I\'ve given this TKK you gave me more chances.\r\nit\'s growing on me.\r\nkind of crystal methodish (before crystal method though)\r\n\r\nfor sure weed makes a difference. lol'),(36429,'3f1a2506fa','Betty K...sorry to ask you another question...\r\n\r\n I am not sure you know the answer to this question but I figured you knew alot and could maybe help my friend and I... \r\n\r\nMy buddy that i am getting the Iwaver with, he would like to know one thing, perhaps you would know the answer? \r\n\r\nWe are both new to this scale and i didnt want to give him the wrong answer... \r\n\r\nHe asked to ask you guys \r\n\r\n&quot;if i can install a novak esc and a novak receiver for micro cars in place of the one it has, and if i can replace the standard iwaver servo with a Hitec HS-81&quot;'),(19632,'8e89c3951c','[quote:8e89c3951c=\"CaboWabo\"]ok, I\'ve given this TKK you gave me more chances.\r\nit\'s growing on me.\r\nkind of crystal methodish (before crystal method though)\r\n\r\nfor sure weed makes a difference. lol[/quote:8e89c3951c]You know, now that I think about it, it kinda had to grow on me, and I\'m just now lovin\' it when I dug it out for you.\r\n\r\nReally, the albums that always stuck with me, and ended being ones I keep coming back to, are usually ones that had to grow me. Usually stuff with the intial impact wears off off pretty quick. You can relate to that, can\'t you?\r\n\r\nDave'),(19167,'2395d2ceba','Im 32 bro, too old to be playing with toys:) lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19168,'70a504b525','nah....im 23...hmm...32/23...interesting.... :-D'),(18988,'50611e2663','01-4584'),(18841,'e8dc6541a9','I didn\'t forget ya bro, I\'ll get them wallpapers done real soon man. I built myself a new computer man, and I\'m having some troubles making it stable. I think I did pretty damn good for my first time though. :-)'),(18843,'4655bd8770','[quote:4655bd8770=\"DarkTari\"]Cavey,  Don\'t worry about the cars, I\'ll send you a few.  I\'ll head up there next weekend and grab some more.  These are the models they have:\r\n[b:4655bd8770]RX7\r\nSkyline\r\nWRX\r\nAccord Wagon[/b:4655bd8770]\r\nI also have a few bodies that were removed from Shen chassis that I\'ve been using on my SBG Pullback Bodies:\r\n[b:4655bd8770]Supra\r\nPeugeuot 206\r\nbB\r\nAccord Wagon[/b:4655bd8770]\r\n\r\nPop me your address again Pimp!  Also do you think you can find the time to FET a few more chassis for me?\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp![/quote:4655bd8770]Man, dude, I really gotta order me some more FETs, I gotta few people wanting FETs...but I had to order that VW bus from Toyeast, I wasn\'t missing out on that. Hopefully I can get some FETs next payday.\r\n\r\nAt any rate, if you wanted to trade some precious for some FET mods that would be cool.\r\n\r\nI don\'t know why you guys have cool clones everywhere for cheap, but all I ever see around here are Cannonballs, Charg n Gos, and Rally Racers, for $13.99. If there was cheap clones everywhere around here, I think my wife would end up killing me. :lol: \r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\ndave'),(18844,'6d359ae00f','Tru Dat Pimp!  Let me know which one\'s you want to work with or does it matter?  \r\n\r\nI think you gave me the place you get your FET\'s from but shoot it to me again.................\r\n\r\nThanx!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18845,'968adcc9fb','Hot Shit Sess!\r\n\r\nI know you got dat baby soup\'d up !  No rush at all Pimp!\r\n\r\nThanx !'),(18846,'6d359ae00f','Tru Dat Pimp!  Let me know which one\'s you want to work with or does it matter?  \r\n\r\nI think you gave me the place you get your FET\'s from but shoot it to me again.................\r\n\r\nThanx!'),(31129,'e0c49c9c14','[quote:e0c49c9c14=\"hue35\"]OK, here\'s my final list...\r\n\r\n\r\nsilver supra 45mhz $15 \r\nred enzo ferrari 40a mhz $15 \r\nskyline history set 35mhz $15\r\nferrari special set f40, testarrossa and 512bb 40b mhz $25\r\nspecial edition pennzoil skyline 27mhz $15\r\n\r\nyellow lambo/red ferrari 27c $8\r\nblack lambo/silver ferrari 27a $8\r\n\r\nDome Zero $3\r\n\r\nMini Heart Mini Cooper sets:\r\nwhite  $10\r\ndark green  $10\r\nwhite w/blue police light on roof  $10 \r\n\r\nQTY 1 200mah battery $1.50 \r\nQTY 1 160mah battery $.75 \r\nQTY 4 perfection 3.8 motor $2ea \r\nperfection heatsinks - QTY 2 black, QTY 2 gold, QTY 1 silver $.50ea \r\nQTY 3 perfection 4.2 motor $2ea\r\n\r\n\r\nI came up with a total of 152.75... \r\n\r\nThere\'s a few things in the list that are more than I\'d want to spend, but I\'m still interested in... I can weed those things out, which is no problem, but I\'ll offer you $125 (via PayPal) for this list as is, shipped to Portland, OR 97201.\r\n\r\nThanks again, \r\n\r\nhue35[/quote:e0c49c9c14]\r\n\r\n\r\nHi,\r\n\r\nCool, what were the other things that you were interested in? I\'d prefer to sell everything at once. So let me know what other stuff and we\'ll work something out.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nJDM'),(19627,'c2d51153b3','ok, I\'ve given this TKK you gave me more chances.\r\nit\'s growing on me.\r\nkind of crystal methodish (before crystal method though)\r\n\r\nfor sure weed makes a difference. lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18875,'987cf0e7a4','your aol name is supergloopunk right? i added that to my list but i aint seen you on.\r\n\r\nad these names\r\n\r\nkeeph42\r\nbitpimps\r\nsessiz26\r\nuberweenie\r\nph2ty\r\nand uh theres a few more but i forget how they spell their shit but get on and ill hook you up. \r\n\r\nill upload fruity right now'),(18849,'b82cda45af','do you want me to send your new Starsky&amp; Hutch ZipZap SE to:\r\n\r\nIconMedialab \r\nATTN: Scott Lix \r\n700 Goddard Avenue \r\nChesterfield, MO 63005'),(19130,'0a5d0cfca9','[quote:0a5d0cfca9=\"hogjowlz\"]i almost locked this so you couldnt edit anymore but i want you to sweat.\r\n\r\nmy middle finger is ready to go. just you wait and see   :-)[/quote:0a5d0cfca9]\r\n\r\nAllright, got the message. I\'ll stop posting to that thread.'),(19131,'ca43d5cc07','Hi Jose, Your are not boreing me, i expected your emails. i really like this color on the last picture you submitted. this will be the one i will do, i have only one problem though , i only have black numbers for the side, i could however add a white number plate like on my cit, check that out and let me know if that will work for you, my cit is a two door body and the ones you have shown me are the four door type, so since we are not staying completely original maybe the white number plate would not take away from it\'s authinti[color=orange:ca43d5cc07][/color:ca43d5cc07]CIT[color=#444444:ca43d5cc07][/color:ca43d5cc07]y. :grin: I am really into this project and cant wait to get on it! i have to work today so i will check my email when i get off later tonight.\r\n\r\njeff'),(18851,'830c0a5776','I\'d let you in on the post before anyone else take a look at post [url]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3763&amp;start=0&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight=[/url]');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35304,'da8c7e9c12','Just keep kicken that colds ass and i would only sell to a pimp in need, i dont exactly need to get rid of it any time soon :-)'),(31951,'f8e73cc1fc','[quote:f8e73cc1fc=\"MotorGong\"][quote:f8e73cc1fc=\"blindrider3\"]Is that you on Micro RC CENTAR posting those pics of me?\r\n\r\nNakkah?\r\n\r\nIf so stop it now.\r\n\r\nAll the pics link to your photobucket account.[/quote:f8e73cc1fc]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nwait, my account is still active. I just checked. It was another one I guessed I cancelled. \r\nBut I\'m tellin ya I\'m new, and it wouldn\'t be wise for me to do something like this. I\'m just gettin to know people and stuff.\r\nI\'m new to computers, too. But you know that from my posts at BP, I mention it often.\r\nIf I can figure it out, I\'ll even send ya the link to my photobucket account and you can check it out. :-o[/quote:f8e73cc1fc]\r\n\r\n\r\nIt\'s okay, I wiped the hole forum out, I couldnt delete it tho.  See, all they did was make fun of me and my friends from the forums, that was the last straw, I got into the admin cp and deleted all the posts, and all the forums except one, and i made that forum read only so no one can post, now the owner just signed into msn so ill probably have to fight with him, whatever, you dont treat people like they did.'),(18986,'a1758e6135','Ahh shit, sorry Chad, no sooner did you say your store number than I forgot it.  Lay it down again so we can chat when life gets slow here 8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (23965,'204cf6e10d','Dude whast your yahoo name?'),(24977,'35fa1123f2','yea I got it'),(18856,'3e2f40d508','That\'s perfect man... I\'ve had a couple of mishaps from the ghetto kids swiping shit off my doorstep.\r\n\r\nI\'ll keep my eyes peeled for it, and I\'ll let you know as soon as I get it.\r\n\r\nThanks bro....woooo hoooo'),(18857,'cd1e2d6037','Hey bro, what heppend with your amazing Testorossa?  You have got to keep us updated 8-)'),(18858,'b82cda45af','do you want me to send your new Starsky&amp; Hutch ZipZap SE to:\r\n\r\nIconMedialab \r\nATTN: Scott Lix \r\n700 Goddard Avenue \r\nChesterfield, MO 63005'),(18859,'cfdfaf40e8','[quote:cfdfaf40e8=\"cj\"]do you want me to send your new Starsky&amp; Hutch ZipZap SE to:\r\n\r\nIconMedialab \r\nATTN: Scott Lix \r\n700 Goddard Avenue \r\nChesterfield, MO 63005[/quote:cfdfaf40e8]sure man, that\'d be cool - thanks dude!\r\n\r\n(I know I forgot to send ya my shipping addy - good records homey lol)\r\n\r\nthanks again chad'),(18861,'cfdfaf40e8','[quote:cfdfaf40e8=\"cj\"]do you want me to send your new Starsky&amp; Hutch ZipZap SE to:\r\n\r\nIconMedialab \r\nATTN: Scott Lix \r\n700 Goddard Avenue \r\nChesterfield, MO 63005[/quote:cfdfaf40e8]sure man, that\'d be cool - thanks dude!\r\n\r\n(I know I forgot to send ya my shipping addy - good records homey lol)\r\n\r\nthanks again chad');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18862,'2eb2ea62a2','Well I posted the question in 4 different forums due to the reason not many people look at the X mod category and still know quite a bit about steering servos and soldering and wiring.  Excuse me you cocksuckers for wanting to get a fairly immediate response from the RC community.  You two should go blow each other as you do in every other forum, and if after the other one gives you a nice clean facial, answer my question if you have any useful information or if you are just gonna post whore with dumb spam remarks.  Keep in mind I have a 12 year old brother looking for some help here dick wads.'),(35691,'1793206e5a','I\'m too fucked up to be talkin on the phone right now, but I gotta tell you something. You just gotta remind me and call me tomorrow.\r\nI ran into Jocelyn Jones tonight. Actually, I\'ve run into her many nights - just never knew it was her.\r\nThere\'s a few chicks at Tony\'s that I always see and have always said that \"they look familiar\" to Samantha.\r\nWell tonight I confirmed 2 of them. Jocelyn and some chick that I used to work with way back when at Rich and Charlies.\r\nJocelyn looks completely different, that\'s why I could never place the name with the some-what familiar face.\r\nIt was a total trip.\r\nWeird, I\'ve ran into a handful of old faces in just the past few weeks - it makes ya feel old - that\'s for sure.'),(34896,'53b481fdcb','[quote:53b481fdcb=\"Maxximum Attack\"]I need a purchase please reply[/quote:53b481fdcb]\r\n\r\nWhat do you need?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37039,'0ca642ed80','yes'),(37395,'27fea9c48a','I forgot to get your address the other day. Let me know so I can send off the CD.'),(37396,'b48bbe8532','here\'s me:\r\n\r\ntrent heffer\r\n39 currajong ave\r\ncamberwell 3124\r\nvictoria\r\naustralia\r\n\r\nthanks heaps for doing this for me, i can\'t wait to rattle da bass bins!\r\ngive my thanks to de selektah :-o'),(34900,'2cd88fe2c1','[quote:2cd88fe2c1=\"Maxximum Attack\"]Can you ship it to another US address? 3 Hours left.\r\nI\'ll send you a MO when you win.\r\nI just need you to bid as late as possible on [url=http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=6010340347&amp;rd=1&amp;sspagename=STRK%3AMEWA%3AIT&amp;rd=1][b:2cd88fe2c1]THIS[/b:2cd88fe2c1][/url] so that I can get it as cheap as possible and less than $60.\r\n\r\nThat cool? All you need to do is pay for it, unless, by \"not home\" you mean that you will not have any internet access  :???: \r\n\r\nLet me know\r\nMaxx[/quote:2cd88fe2c1]\r\nI\'m currently at work. The firewall filters out Ebay. Sorry, i wont be able to do it.'),(30919,'4917f583c0','[quote:4917f583c0=\"SuperFly\"]Hey man-\r\n\r\nI shipped your stuff out last wednesday on the 4-7 day parcel post. \r\n\r\nSo ya got $15 worth of tires that cost $5 to ship to me, and then another $3.50 for me to ship to you. The minimum shipping from that joint is $5, and I piggybacked your same order for me so it didn\'t increase the shipping price, but just make it an even $23 and we\'ll call it good.\r\n\r\nBy the way, I realize you\'re a busy guy, and when your little creature busts out you\'ll have even less time, but I have to ask about something...\r\n\r\nI pre-paid ya $30 for 2 biffs (isn\'t that what they were called? the outboard FET turbo for bits) back when I bought the Nellies. Curious if I might ever see those.\r\n\r\nTake care,\r\nGreg[/quote:4917f583c0]\r\n\r\nfuck, you\'re right! really sorry about that shit man :? .  I\'ll build them this week and shoot them out asap. \r\n\r\nthanks again for the hookup and I\'ll paypal shortly.\r\n\r\nmatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (23943,'18864d67f7','Yea dude I think I still have that pullback there.'),(23944,'1b2d0c7ade','I would take all three for that. I need new shells and the pullback parts come in handy'),(23064,'42f02fa873','Sorry about that.\r\n\r\nMike Chronister\r\n4602 Gaardahl Dr.\r\nSandston, Va. 23150'),(18864,'2eb2ea62a2','Well I posted the question in 4 different forums due to the reason not many people look at the X mod category and still know quite a bit about steering servos and soldering and wiring.  Excuse me you cocksuckers for wanting to get a fairly immediate response from the RC community.  You two should go blow each other as you do in every other forum, and if after the other one gives you a nice clean facial, answer my question if you have any useful information or if you are just gonna post whore with dumb spam remarks.  Keep in mind I have a 12 year old brother looking for some help here dick wads.'),(18865,'5bb696ea13','Well I posted the question in 4 different forums due to the reason not many people look at the X mod category and still know quite a bit about steering servos and soldering and wiring.  Excuse me you cocksuckers for wanting to get a fairly immediate response from the RC community.  You two should go blow each other as you do in every other forum, and if after the other one gives you a nice clean facial, answer my question if you have any useful information or if you are just gonna post whore with dumb spam remarks.  Keep in mind I have a 12 year old brother looking for some help here dick wads.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18877,'5fe072acfa','uh its 108megs. get on aim and i can direct transfer it to you.  maybe ill try when i goto bed.'),(18878,'5fe072acfa','uh its 108megs. get on aim and i can direct transfer it to you.  maybe ill try when i goto bed.'),(33022,'ce892a3c6b','lol. yeah, I understand how that works. Does it have lithium protection?\r\n\r\nYes, your stuff is gone dude. I wish you could see a picture of how dirty I am. I had to replace several transformers and other stuff at one of my businesses today because we had some crazy stuff going on. Maybe a surge or something, but I have *never* *ever* had a EEPROM in one of my machines get corrupted, but still alloy me to connect and reprogram it. Usually if the rom is damaged in a surge, I have to replace it and manually reprogram it at the house. It has been a long hard day to say the least.\r\n\r\nAnyway, I\'m looking forward to that deluxe, I\'ll check your site for stats on it\'s resistance and such. Also, I just found a racetrack at badlandsrc that is a new ROAR track close to my house. The guys mostly race 1:10 gp and ep stadium trucks, but I\'m going to see about starting up a 1:18 division here so I have an excuse to get a rc18t or mini-t. I\'m currently building a adam drake 2 XXX-NT, with ROAR specs (sweet freaking truck, btw. can\'t wait to get it running and score a phatty 2.4ghz TX.)\r\n\r\nIf you are going to wait to recieve the xmods stuff before you ship, that is ok. I have a spider with a 5v reg installed and working great now. (good enough to eat my uberdash! =) )\r\n\r\n*sigh* now I have to find another ultra dash motor somewhere.\r\n\r\nAnyway, thanks again. You can expect your packages in the next week or so, as I used to better shipping option (jesus that was expensive.)\r\n\r\n-JNY'),(18880,'987cf0e7a4','your aol name is supergloopunk right? i added that to my list but i aint seen you on.\r\n\r\nad these names\r\n\r\nkeeph42\r\nbitpimps\r\nsessiz26\r\nuberweenie\r\nph2ty\r\nand uh theres a few more but i forget how they spell their shit but get on and ill hook you up. \r\n\r\nill upload fruity right now');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20178,'2ff6531291','keith kowalski\r\n\r\n194 sheridan ave apt. 2\r\npittsburgh pa 15202\r\n\r\nword. ive got your technique down pretty well but i suck at cuttin curved shit.'),(20179,'747f8a723e','How mcuh you want for one of the sets of bodies?'),(20180,'72bbf5ac9c','i know dude, its just i dont do it often...\r\nso i thought it was proper\r\nBITCH'),(20181,'0c3e334240','[quote:0c3e334240=\"synj\"]i know dude, its just i dont do it often...\r\nso i thought it was proper\r\nBITCH[/quote:0c3e334240]\r\n\r\nlol'),(18882,'d91825c502','[quote:d91825c502=\"crazydave\"]I took some pics of my Homies, so you know what I got to work with.\r\n\r\n\r\nYour basic Homies...\r\n\r\nThese guys are \"Who are the people in your neighborhood\"\r\n\r\nSome pimp looking guys, and a few clowns\r\n\r\nThe females\r\n\r\nThese guys are all doubles, consider them freebies.\r\n\r\n\r\nJust let me know what you want and they\'re yours, for dat there Jeep body of coarse.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:d91825c502]\r\n\r\nI\'ll trade you the circled ones for that body.\r\n[img:d91825c502]http://pic8.picturetrail.com/VOL248/1115503/2256947/53479362.jpg[/img:d91825c502]'),(18883,'e89da2a10c','[quote:e89da2a10c=\"cj\"]I\'ll trade you the circled ones for that body.[/quote:e89da2a10c]Sounds fair enough, if you wanted any others just let me know.\r\n\r\nHere\'s my address:\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd. #1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\n\r\nGet me your address, and I\'ll get those Homies out.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18884,'159d881553','Ok, I\'m soopersnot now. I got those names on my buddy list. \r\n\r\ndave'),(18885,'159d881553','Ok, I\'m soopersnot now. I got those names on my buddy list. \r\n\r\ndave'),(18886,'1e34fe573c','You been doggin\' Sinned lately,  is there an inside joke I missed? :???: \r\n\r\nJust curious, I like to be in the know, ya know. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(18887,'e89da2a10c','[quote:e89da2a10c=\"cj\"]I\'ll trade you the circled ones for that body.[/quote:e89da2a10c]Sounds fair enough, if you wanted any others just let me know.\r\n\r\nHere\'s my address:\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd. #1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\n\r\nGet me your address, and I\'ll get those Homies out.\r\n\r\nDave'),(18888,'06862171cc','[quote:06862171cc=\"crazydave\"]You been doggin\' Sinned lately,  is there an inside joke I missed? :???: \r\n\r\nJust curious, I like to be in the know, ya know. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:06862171cc]\r\n\r\nlol, hey man.  I\'m just being my usual bastard self.   Call it aussie humour....lol....\r\n\r\nIt\'s just that whenever sinned posts everyone is like \"man, that\'s mad\" or \"dude, you cars rock..\" etc, etc,......  I\'m not disputing that he\'s a great modder, I\'m just getting sick and tired of it, in a youthfull, playfull way, lol.....\r\n\r\nSo I though I\'d say his rides are shit and see what happens.  Also, I wanna see if I can get a response out of him.  The fucker never engages in any threads at pimps, even his own at times... He just posts and then sit\'s back......\r\n\r\nSo I though I\'d rock the boat!\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(18889,'a52cc060e7','[quote:a52cc060e7=\"crazydave\"][quote:a52cc060e7=\"cj\"]I\'ll trade you the circled ones for that body.[/quote:a52cc060e7]Sounds fair enough, if you wanted any others just let me know.\r\n\r\nHere\'s my address:\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd. #1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\n\r\nGet me your address, and I\'ll get those Homies out.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:a52cc060e7]\r\n\r\nSure Dave\r\n\r\nChad Ellis\r\n51 Briarwood Ct\r\nEstill Springs, TN 37330\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW:if you haven read it yet I posted some KitRacers I had on ebay I put the links in the For Sale group.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18890,'06862171cc','[quote:06862171cc=\"crazydave\"]You been doggin\' Sinned lately,  is there an inside joke I missed? :???: \r\n\r\nJust curious, I like to be in the know, ya know. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:06862171cc]\r\n\r\nlol, hey man.  I\'m just being my usual bastard self.   Call it aussie humour....lol....\r\n\r\nIt\'s just that whenever sinned posts everyone is like \"man, that\'s mad\" or \"dude, you cars rock..\" etc, etc,......  I\'m not disputing that he\'s a great modder, I\'m just getting sick and tired of it, in a youthfull, playfull way, lol.....\r\n\r\nSo I though I\'d say his rides are shit and see what happens.  Also, I wanna see if I can get a response out of him.  The fucker never engages in any threads at pimps, even his own at times... He just posts and then sit\'s back......\r\n\r\nSo I though I\'d rock the boat!\r\n\r\ncheers mate,\r\n\r\nmatt.'),(33026,'c453c47609','Do you think I\'m a redneck? :lol:\r\nIt must be the nitro!\r\n\r\n-JNY'),(18892,'a52cc060e7','[quote:a52cc060e7=\"crazydave\"][quote:a52cc060e7=\"cj\"]I\'ll trade you the circled ones for that body.[/quote:a52cc060e7]Sounds fair enough, if you wanted any others just let me know.\r\n\r\nHere\'s my address:\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd. #1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\n\r\nGet me your address, and I\'ll get those Homies out.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:a52cc060e7]\r\n\r\nSure Dave\r\n\r\nChad Ellis\r\n51 Briarwood Ct\r\nEstill Springs, TN 37330\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW:if you haven read it yet I posted some KitRacers I had on ebay I put the links in the For Sale group.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18895,'577380d165','[quote:577380d165=\"DarkTari\"]Tru Dat Pimp!  Let me know which one\'s you want to work with or does it matter?  \r\n\r\nI think you gave me the place you get your FET\'s from but shoot it to me again.................\r\n\r\nThanx![/quote:577380d165]Oh I don\'t care, I\'ve got bodies I got plans for, I just need some chassis that work decent.\r\n\r\nI get my FETs from digikey.com, but really I need to get stocked up on FETs on my own, I feel naked without them now a days.  :lol: \r\n\r\nOh yeah and I forgot my addy;\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd. #1150\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\n\r\n...and also I forgot to mention, CJ is hooking me up with a Jeep body, so I\'m gonna be building my Betty.K killer real soon. It\'s kind of a secret project, but I had to let someone know what I\'m up to.  :-D  \r\n\r\nDave'),(18896,'2da5754c9c','Oh, ok, that pretty much what I figured, but I was kinda curious if it was personal.\r\n\r\nSinned complimented one of my cars once, and a few people cracked, \"Whoah Dave, even Sinned said something\" :lol: \r\n\r\nFunny he\'s not saying anytrhing\r\n\r\nDave'),(18897,'0c50f241c3','[quote:0c50f241c3=\"crazydave\"]Oh, ok, that pretty much what I figured, but I was kinda curious if it was personal.\r\n\r\nSinned complimented one of my cars once, and a few people cracked, \"Whoah Dave, even Sinned said something\" :lol: \r\n\r\nFunny he\'s not saying anytrhing\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:0c50f241c3]\r\n\r\nlol, we\'ll see!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18898,'0c50f241c3','[quote:0c50f241c3=\"crazydave\"]Oh, ok, that pretty much what I figured, but I was kinda curious if it was personal.\r\n\r\nSinned complimented one of my cars once, and a few people cracked, \"Whoah Dave, even Sinned said something\" :lol: \r\n\r\nFunny he\'s not saying anytrhing\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:0c50f241c3]\r\n\r\nlol, we\'ll see!'),(18902,'c19773e49a','hi cw, i had posted about the pep boys mini rc and finks wanted one so i went out and bought it and mailed it to him with my money and i have yet to get him to return any emails on if he intends to send the reinbursment for the car. he was all over the email thing before i sent the car but now nothing, before i thru him under the bus i wanted to mail you first. i dont want to start any more shit, just to warn others , what do you think.\r\n\r\njmays'),(18903,'4f58edff9d','Hey Dennis,\r\n\r\nHe didn\'t mean anything by it.  He\'s a good guy that gives everybody shit sometimes, so does Hogjowles &amp; BettyK.  It\'s just joking around so don\'t take it seriously.  Very Nice job by the way, let\'s take out SL\'s and cruise the babes on the Ave.  :cool:'),(18904,'8356814930','hi hog before i thru a pimp under the bus i sent finks a new pep boys rc two weeks ago and he has not replied to me nor payed me as he said.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18907,'eec31144d2','hmm that sucks. but you have to take it with him. if you feel ripped thats what that thread is for.'),(29271,'40ae54244e','No problem.  I wasn\'t using them.  Like I said earlier, I will have more soon.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nRyan'),(37741,'32b172b6d9','sure...send me a pic or two :-o'),(37742,'879afa5dec','will do,,, ill get them to you tomorrow  :-) \r\n\r\nSTG'),(37744,'5b13e5b083','hey man, ive seen your clone monster (http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v413/frizzen/RC/First_Monster.jpg) a few times and i was wondering if you could get me some more pics of the under side and the front suspension?  Id like to try my hand at a mod like it (with my own twist of course)  Any chance you can give me some tips and problems you ran into,, maybe the materials you used.\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nSTG'),(26644,'f4ab75eb6c','Sorry Cabo I\'m I being incredibly thick but when I try &amp; put the movie into my created folder I get this Critical error\r\n\r\n\"Destination directory albums/userpics/10071/ is not writable by the script ! \"\r\n\r\nDo I have to put anything in the description or in the height , width etc to make it accept this movie ??\r\n\r\nYakboy'),(18911,'ff32ffa267','[quote:ff32ffa267=\"jmays\"]hi cw, i had posted about the pep boys mini rc and finks wanted one so i went out and bought it and mailed it to him with my money and i have yet to get him to return any emails on if he intends to send the reinbursment for the car. he was all over the email thing before i sent the car but now nothing, before i thru him under the bus i wanted to mail you first. i dont want to start any more shit, just to warn others , what do you think.\r\n\r\njmays[/quote:ff32ffa267]well from past experiences with him (as well as hearing of others\' past experiences with him) he\'s a good guy.\r\nsounds like he\'s a busy guy too.\r\n\r\nI\'d give it at least a few more days.\r\ntry emailing again (so many viruses and spam blockers - it\'s quit possible he didn\'t get your email), try sending a PM as well.\r\n\r\nI honestly don\'t think he\'s going to rip you off.\r\n\r\nif after whatever amount of time is acceptable to you has passed and you still haven\'t heard from him - do what you have to do - make the post if you want.\r\n\r\n\r\ngood luck - keep us posted.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18912,'1452ab6190','yeah cw i was going to wait about another week, i have pm him along as emailed him like three times, idunno i am cool just wanted your oppinion before, i probably want post anything anyways,  i will let u know about what happens.\r\n\r\nthanks\r\njeff'),(19410,'4952d9ef4c','Hey Cabo, I know you don\'t like to get stupid, pointless PMs all the time, but you kno that I\'ve been around long enough to not be a stupid newb lol\r\n\r\nAnyway, I\'ve just got one quick question. I\'d like to try and find the font you use in the bitPimps logo, so I could use it for contests and stuff.... What is the name of that font? I\'m looking through right now, but there\'s a thousand fonts to look at lol, and it\'d be a big help if you could tell meh what the name is....\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\n\r\n~midget_man~'),(19166,'294390be60','Hey Cavey!\r\n\r\nThe package is on the way. Gotcha 3 Precious Micro\'s.  I put the 3 chassis in a separate box within the box.  Use the smaller box to return chassis (less postage).\r\n\r\nThanx Cavey !\r\n\r\nGH Sims\r\n7815 Quill Point Dr.\r\nBowie, Md. 20720'),(18915,'4fe971a939','I got those papers up for ya man.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?p=44542#44542\r\n\r\nFeel free to let me know what you don\'t like and want changed or if ya want anything added bro. :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18917,'7278d378f4','Man dem Mu-Suckers are GREAT !!!!!!! :eek: \r\n\r\nThanx Again Pimp!  Anything you need, lemme know!    :cool:'),(19193,'16c6b5a67a','We\'ve discuss\'d my 3 chassis, just FET \'em for me and ship \'em back.\r\n\r\nThe other 3 are for you to do what you do best.  Whatever plans you have with Hog is between you 2. Do what you want!  I\'m just giv\'n you a clean slate to start.  Hog did mention he can still get Thunder Chargers so it\'s all what you guys wanna do!   \r\n\r\nI was thinking about doing a joint venture with you to build the[b:16c6b5a67a] Ultimate Micro,[/b:16c6b5a67a] and joint venture from [b:16c6b5a67a]Cavey Dave\'s Speed Shop &amp; Team DarkTari ![/b:16c6b5a67a]   :cool: \r\n\r\nTell Ya What, FET one of the Precious and send it back to me, don\'t worry about the controller, I got a plenty!.  I\'ll then create a body for it.  I\'ll ship you out another one to replace it.   Sounds good   8-)'),(18921,'031373d7f2','wow dude, thanks a million. That\'ll be awesome.. I know I\'m gonna love that stuff. Another band I\'ve been meaning to ask you if you dig, is Gun Club.. you ever get into those dudes? And the one I think you\'d really dig, is The Lazy Cowgirls...  you know them? D D Weekday is one of my favorite guitar players.\r\n\r\nThanks again, dude\r\n\r\nMat');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (27530,'cbe84ea21c','Ok, to make a long story short when i was attaching the wires to two of the chargers they were faulty, and i placed an order with the place i get them from for more. so it will be a little while, im sorry for the inconvience and because of this im going do give u 8 chargers. \r\nonce again sorry. \r\n\r\nBackdrift'),(18923,'c34dd4f7e1','got the prize today man - fuckin awesome!\r\nthanks man - you\'re a real pimp.'),(21618,'33ab29c6ef','NP bro.\r\n\r\nJesse King\r\n25 Springview Ln Unit#3\r\nWest Bath, ME 04530\r\n\r\nLookin forward to seeing this puppy.'),(28163,'cd45c5fcdd','[quote:cd45c5fcdd=\"backdrift\"][quote:cd45c5fcdd=\"payaso\"][quote:cd45c5fcdd=\"HirotoR34\"]I\'m not saying that Back is shady..[/quote:cd45c5fcdd]\r\n\r\n\r\nI wasn\'t calling anybody out with my comment, but just noticed it was his first post, and it wasn\'t about shit...lol[/quote:cd45c5fcdd]\r\n\r\nwhat is that supposta mean?[/quote:cd45c5fcdd]\r\n\r\nIt was supposed to mean that I was proud of skylines72 for actually registering, and his first post was good info, and not spam like someone with skyline in their username would most likely do...lol'),(31823,'90841afcbe','sweet dude.  I\'ll try and get with it on paypal today.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested in weird shells, I\'ll trade you a bit clone i found yesterday at a local $2 store for a working SE - its a fire truck with a flashing LED on the roof and a siren built in to the controller.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31824,'c472b3b6d1','Perfect!  It\'s a deal.  Tell me when you paypal the dough and I will get it all together.'),(34211,'7fe5e5720e','Good glad you understand where I am coming from.  This place is my home on the internet, and I like how it is.  My responses to your earlier posts were there to 1st off make sure you have what it takes, and then 2ndly to encourage you in my own fucked up way, to get a moddin.  Can\'t wait to see what you come up w/.  Hell, if that dumb ass Shaun can pimp a ride like he did, it shouldn\'t be that tuff for you man.  Read, and learn, then mod like a bastard.'),(33627,'5b28411213','Sounds good man.  Those are good ideas.  And I agree about how much people will spend on R/C...\r\n\r\nBetween those 2 trucks, radio, and my tools/gear, I have almost $4,000 invested. :eek:   It\'s a sickness I tell ya.\r\n\r\nThe problem with 1/10 is the resale is shit..  Just consider half of what you got in it.\r\n\r\nThat\'s why I\'m keeping the Maxx even though it\'s the older out dated truck. I\'ve got about $1,500 in that thing alone, and it\'d kill me to have to let it go for $400 - $500...\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThat\'s the main reason I have so many...  Can\'t just dump em ya know.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(31840,'fc0a28d91f','Cool DT. That\'s the right call since you spoke first as far as I\'m concerned, but I didn\'t want to screw Steve over since I didn\'t state that as ruling in my half-assed post. I\'ll offer some other bit to Steve to ease his pain.\r\n\r\nI\'m having surgery tomorrow (out-patient), so it\'ll be Monday at the earliest before I can ship this out to you. Send me the address you want it shipped to, and I\'ll get it boxed up. You don\'t need to paypal me right away. I\'m ok with it if you want to wait until I confirm for you that I\'m shipping. My paypal id is graham@gte.net.\r\n\r\nYou got any Toy-R-Us\'s in your area? I\'ll knock $10 off the price for this Lupin the III bit if you can find me the Super Slick black WRX. I\'ve ordered it twice from Amazon, and they kept sending me blue one\'s. Bastards. Anyway, let me know. If not, I\'ll let you have this bit for $30, and I\'ll cover the shipping.\r\n\r\nLater DT. You may not hear back from me until Monday.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18943,'4446fb3ef6','[quote:4446fb3ef6]What size are you thinkin\' for a permanent track? We seem to have mixed thoughts on that.[/quote:4446fb3ef6]I got my 8\'x4\' chunk of particle board that I\'m using now. I\'m just leaning it against the wall, when I\'m not using it, then move some furniture, and it just plops right down when I\'m ready. It\'s a pretty good sized track, so sometimes I can\'t get at it, and I still pull my 4\'x4\' out alot. Ultimately when I move into a home, I\'d like to go 8\'x8\', so I can have room to make hills, little lighted buildings, trees and stuff. I\'m thinking I could start with what I have, and leave it open to integrate the other 8\'x4\' chunk later.\r\n\r\nIt\'s probably just a dream, but it\'s fun to daydream when you\'re baked.  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(18944,'a94c3e1ed2','Hell yeah... tonight, I\'m gonna get my bake on. I can\'t wait to get home from work.\r\n\r\nThat\'s the size range I\'m thinkin\' about... If I can swing it, space wise, I think 6x10 would be a nice size.'),(21617,'d035399825','I was packing up a pile of shit to take to the post office yesterday, and I realized, I never got your address.\r\n\r\nDoh! I guess that would have came in handy.\r\n\r\nSo shoot me your addy, and I\'ll get that car out by friday.\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18946,'c7d3f775f5','here\'s the dealio.\r\nyou seem to fit in well - I\'ve added you to a new usergroup that should open up a new forum only viewable to you and other \"Click\" usergroup members.\r\nenjoy.\r\n\r\nanother usergroup I don\'t think you know about, but might enjoy is the \"Raw &amp; Un-Censored Crew\"\r\nmore info here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=342\r\n\r\n\r\njust a note in case you didn\'t already know.'),(18947,'c7d3f775f5','here\'s the dealio.\r\nyou seem to fit in well - I\'ve added you to a new usergroup that should open up a new forum only viewable to you and other \"Click\" usergroup members.\r\nenjoy.\r\n\r\nanother usergroup I don\'t think you know about, but might enjoy is the \"Raw &amp; Un-Censored Crew\"\r\nmore info here:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=342\r\n\r\n\r\njust a note in case you didn\'t already know.'),(18948,'e4f23752fc','Thanks dog....I am flattered actually. I really haven\'t done any modding, but I do like to collect and some modding may be in the near future when the home improvements slow down. I\'ll check it all out.\r\n\r\nBTW.....what led you to beleive I fit in?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18949,'e4f23752fc','Thanks dog....I am flattered actually. I really haven\'t done any modding, but I do like to collect and some modding may be in the near future when the home improvements slow down. I\'ll check it all out.\r\n\r\nBTW.....what led you to beleive I fit in?'),(18950,'d5a5f8475e','[quote:d5a5f8475e=\"Sdog\"]Thanks dog....I am flattered actually. I really haven\'t done any modding, but I do like to collect and some modding may be in the near future when the home improvements slow down. I\'ll check it all out.\r\n\r\nBTW.....what led you to beleive I fit in?[/quote:d5a5f8475e]well you consider yourself smart and a good judge of character I\'m sure - so do I.\r\n\r\nI\'m pretty sure I\'m right. I don\'t know where you found us from but I can usually tell the good ones.\r\nIt\'s not really important how much or how good you mod as much as your enjoyment - that\'s what you\'re here for.\r\n\r\nyou\'ll mod soon - it\'s just a matter of time when you hang around people that do.\r\n\r\nnow go have fun.'),(18951,'d5a5f8475e','[quote:d5a5f8475e=\"Sdog\"]Thanks dog....I am flattered actually. I really haven\'t done any modding, but I do like to collect and some modding may be in the near future when the home improvements slow down. I\'ll check it all out.\r\n\r\nBTW.....what led you to beleive I fit in?[/quote:d5a5f8475e]well you consider yourself smart and a good judge of character I\'m sure - so do I.\r\n\r\nI\'m pretty sure I\'m right. I don\'t know where you found us from but I can usually tell the good ones.\r\nIt\'s not really important how much or how good you mod as much as your enjoyment - that\'s what you\'re here for.\r\n\r\nyou\'ll mod soon - it\'s just a matter of time when you hang around people that do.\r\n\r\nnow go have fun.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20303,'f6f11411e8','I\'m getting your package in tha mail today.\r\n\r\nI\'ve done a WRX, all primered and ready for paint.  I\'m keeping with the summertime theme of things so I\'ve added an open sunroof and all windows rolled down.  I\'m including the bad chassis from the Celica, maybe you can toy around with it.  It is already double tab lowered in the front and sits real nice under this body, only it\'s not steady cause it was done for the Celica. you\'ll see what I mean when you get it.  I suggest double tab lowering the chassis that you\'re going to use. I\'ve taped the exhaust tip to the package tapering one end so you\'ll know which end to use.\r\n\r\nI\'ve also included a couple goodies for ya Pimp!\r\n\r\nI\'ve got this slamming azz body waitin for that Precious chassis you\'re sending.  Just gotta decide on a color.   :???: \r\n\r\nGotta go get my Swole on, lata!'),(18953,'e0502a0926','[quote:e0502a0926=\"hogjowlz\"]its fucking easy moron. just dont start or ad to any flame shit. i guess you like to be a flamer.[/quote:e0502a0926]\r\n\r\nLet me rephrase this...What I meant by \"still learning how\" was that I\'m still learning how to joke around, take a joke, yada yada....I already know what flaming is, and no I\'m not a flamer.....\r\n\r\nDude, you need to chill, I was joking around anyway. Jesus.....'),(18954,'ab760971ff','fruityloops should be on your site by the time you get this.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18955,'c8256bfd08','Hey I\'d like a citroen and a bus.  How much for S&amp;H?  You can mail them together when the bus is done!!  Do you have PayPal?  Drop me your info.   Here is my addy.\r\n\r\n\r\nOnce again,\r\n\r\nTHANKS\r\n\r\nsg219\r\n\r\n\r\nMike Smalley Jr.\r\n3918 Inland Ave.\r\nWest Mifflin, PA  15122'),(36904,'938d17f4a7','hey mang, could ya gimmie a call tonight and give me a hand with iframes stuff. \r\n\r\nBasically I want to have images on the left and when you click the images on the left an embedded media player on the right plays the video without opening a new page etc.\r\n\r\nAlso do you have any good scripts for a photo gallery. I wanna have a page come up with 8 thumbnails on the top and when you click a thumb it comes up 640x480 underneath the thumbs. each thumb you click will then appear in the window below and replace the current 640x480 image.?\r\n\r\nMake sense? I tried the iframes thingy and between Daniel and I we cann get it to work right. Same wiuth some of the photo viewers we have tried. I got one to work but not very well. I have tried programs like magic gallery but cannot find a crack for the program and all images are watermarked. I found a work around for the watermark but it will take forever to resize and copy and paste 200+ images.\r\n\r\nThanks mang! YOU RULE!'),(28212,'0420b37077','Thanx for the offer.\r\n\r\nBut i\'m not sending my only xmod overseas. I live in Barbados and xmod stuff is really hard to get. I have one other xmod that needs a servo. I\'m trying not to buy the WRX when it comes out cuz its too expensive for me. Cuz everything costs double in my currency. (xmod= $100). I have a mini-z body wrx that i bought costs US$30 but i had to fork out BDS$100 for MO, shipping etc.\r\n\r\nBut I have to jump at the chance of getting a nelly from the states.\r\nDon\'t worry you are shipping to yonkers NY not barbados.\r\n\r\nI want to mod my car so that I can be competitive with STOCK electric 1:10. so I\'ll be getting a PN04 motor soon. You have any spare GPM parts?\r\n\r\nI\'ll keep in touch incase we work something else out. :-) \r\n\r\nMaxx');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18957,'ab760971ff','fruityloops should be on your site by the time you get this.'),(18958,'a8b920bdff','[quote:a8b920bdff=\"hogjowlz\"]fruityloops should be on your site by the time you get this.[/quote:a8b920bdff]Yeah, just saw that. That\'s a bigun. :lol: \r\n\r\nThanks man, that\'s gonna be fun stuff. :-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(35739,'a7fdfd5d37','Honestly man I just wanna get rid of all my shit, the truth is and I didn\'t wanna tell you this....is...that murcielago is my favorite bit of all time. I too fell in love with it when my eyes were set on the lil beauty.\r\n\r\nReally, I am glad you have that same sorta passion lol, I don\'t mind giving it to you at all, and why not that price seems i guess. Just how can we do this, I don\'t have paypal or anything?'),(31754,'01e9ddf68c','Your Jedi mind tricks must be working. Haven\'t heard back from DT yet. You? I\'ll give him another day or two. Later.'),(31755,'0c55a2211a','I haven\'t heard from him either.... My powers must be stronger than I thought.....lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know if he bails...lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31756,'63c381a755','I have all of the MTs available.  All of them are used but they also all work 100%.  Tell me what you want and we can deal.'),(31759,'8bf2177c74','I was wondering if you still had some of 1/3AAA batteries for sale. I am interested and can use Paypal to send payment. Just let me know the price for item and for shipping. Thanks in advance.'),(20195,'e610ff7de4','Heard all da transactions are a done deal!  Enjoy your Ride Pimp !\r\n\r\nThanx 4 Participating !'),(36998,'e7ac05aa19','Just wanna make sure I have something when everyone gets together.  I may just keep the MR-01 and parts I\'ve got now and maybe go with either the Micro RS4 or the Mini-T or look into a MR-02 when I get over there.  One of the local hobby shops where I used to live has a sale on the RTR sets Mini-T and Micro RS4 sets (car/truck &amp; controller) for less than $150AUS shipped to my door.  Best price I\'ve seen on them in a while and thought I\'d take advantage if I\'d get some use out of them over there.\r\n\r\nMy immigration application/payment has been received at the Aussie high commission in Ottawa so i can only assume it\'s in the process.  With luck we\'ll have it approved by the end of March and we\'ll be there by August.'),(18962,'d550d929f5','Hang on while I check out some IP shizzle...lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35754,'5119b17918','Perfect man...I won\'t bother you at work, get back to me later big guy...\r\n\r\nHave a good one!'),(20194,'15d15472ee','I seem to be doin shit backwards tonight.\r\nI just PM\'d JackD about contact info for Cabo from my PM then read that it\'s a done deal.  Then I reply to your post in Moderators, then read your pm to me.  Just ain\'t my night so I\'m goin to bed.\r\n\r\nI started the body for the Precious FET chassis you\'re sending.\r\nGot a WRX body to send you that I\'ll start on tomorow night.  Shouldn\'t take too long.\r\n\r\nI\'m Out !'),(18966,'d554366944','It appears that they are indeed 2 different people, or at least their IPs don\'t match, and they have way different hosts.  Wouldn\'t surprise me though if Drac was still pulling the strings so to speak.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ll keep an eye peeled for his BS.'),(35764,'432e7724a5','aww fuck yaa do it...i was gona buy a savage the other day from my buddy at the LHS...but I don\'t have the funds just yet..be kick ass in the snow here o my!'),(31828,'43d0209cc1','DT &amp; P,\r\n\r\nSending this to both of you...\r\n\r\nMan, you\'re both telling me the same thing: \"If he still wants it, let him have it, and I\'ll try to find another one. If he doesn\'t want it, then I still want it...\" Something like that anyway. Can you two \"talk\" to each other and figure it out? Otherwise, I\'m going to have to do something really dumb like \"pick a number...\"\r\n\r\nMan, I messed this up.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31829,'d35fb22d1e','[quote:d35fb22d1e=\"mikirgra\"]DT &amp; P,\r\n\r\nSending this to both of you...\r\n\r\nMan, you\'re both telling me the same thing: \"If he still wants it, let him have it, and I\'ll try to find another one. If he doesn\'t want it, then I still want it...\" Something like that anyway. Can you two \"talk\" to each other and figure it out? Otherwise, I\'m going to have to do something really dumb like \"pick a number...\"\r\n\r\nMan, I messed this up.[/quote:d35fb22d1e]\r\n\r\nWe Did, It\'s Mine, Let\'s Deal !  8-) \r\nHow do you want payment?   PayPal?  Check? Cash?  Lemme Know!  :cool:'),(20191,'48d0d79367','Jack,\r\n\r\nCabo Will contact with payment information.  Sorry for Da delay..   :cool:'),(20192,'77d6b3fce2','I contacted him to let him know that he will be contacted by you with payment information.\r\n\r\n???????? :???:'),(20193,'63b8a2d197','Hey what\'s up? \r\n\r\nJust got done moving, and we\'re pretty much settled in.\r\n\r\nI have to tell you, I feel guilty still having your cars to FET up. Usually I do FET mods right away, and get them right back out, but you know, shit came up that I had to deal with.\r\n\r\nAnyways, your FET mods are next on my \"to do\" list, so I\'ll be tryimg to get those out to you by this weekend.\r\n\r\nJust wanted to keep you updated so you know I haven\'t forgotten.'),(18970,'fd22bacffc','I\'m sure Spooky is a friend of dracs. That\'s how those dipshits operate. \r\n\r\nAll we can do is wait for them to fuck up. Maybe he\'ll see the light here, and chill.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35772,'07c74aed41','Chilly? ...see it is not chilly here, its...um...Chilling! nothing like standing outside in the snow and wind chill watching something bash through the white \"sand\" and coming back to you dripping with sweat ahha or snow! \r\n\r\nGood point, the LHS is building a 1/8th in door dirt track, so maybe i should consider that.'),(35787,'94c479b437','Well man, I would rather trade for it...and both the skyline painted body and the perfection chassis with controller is still available. Like I said, if you have any Xmod stuff it would be so much better. Just let me know if you got some extra modding stuff laying around. \r\n\r\nThe deal for me is to make a nice transition from bits to Xmods...check ya lata.'),(26162,'4bd196cd6e','Rasheed Sabir\r\n\r\nBannister Land \r\nMartindales Road\r\nSt. Michael\r\nBridgetown\r\nBarbados ,W.I.'),(21079,'f7feb8b3d1','Hey Mike,\r\n\r\nThanx 4 try\'n Pimp !\r\n\r\nI was looking thru a couple boxes of Micro 5hit I got and ran across 3 of then so that\'ll hold me.  \r\nDo you have any 5Below stores in your area?\r\nThey have Precious Micro\'s for $5.00  :eek: \r\n\r\nThanx Again and let me know.............'),(20189,'e34bac7c2a','did you send a PM to JackD letting him know he won the bid for crazydave\'s bus? and tell him where to send the loot?\r\nif not or if you want me to, let me know and I\'ll shoot him a PM.\r\n\r\nif I don\'t hear back from you, I\'ll assume you\'ve contacted him, etc., etc.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20190,'4db4c6171d','No I didn\'t, I\'ll pop him one right now.  Been bust as shit lately.\r\n\r\nI did heard from JAC4412, I\'m getting his out tomorrow.'),(18973,'c1a5aae912','hey man! i was just about to send the car and did a final test to discover a wheel arsing up! so i\'ll fix that and i should also be able to add a couple of extras as well, apply recent knowledge so to speak. so i\'ll be mailing it out next week for sure. i\'m sure you\'d rather wait for a good one than get a dud fast! i\'ll keep you posted\r\n\r\ncheers, b.k.'),(35368,'f7fd877111','Hey, that is good news.  I saw where you were going to add some diff\'s on the gearbox group buy.  If that\'s the case, I\'ll just get in on them then.  Thanks CJ.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(18975,'a8b920bdff','[quote:a8b920bdff=\"hogjowlz\"]fruityloops should be on your site by the time you get this.[/quote:a8b920bdff]Yeah, just saw that. That\'s a bigun. :lol: \r\n\r\nThanks man, that\'s gonna be fun stuff. :-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(18976,'6ca49a7abf','Hey pimp what is your stores number?  01-????');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18977,'86801b16b2','01-1132  Why you wanna toll free call  :cool:'),(18980,'1c3fa83816','Hehe shit dude sorry.  At work is where I check forums, and they have a popup blocker for new messages, didn\'t see you PM.  Anyhow, yeah, I got the Civic, very cool.  Like you said, the chassis sucks ass, but the body has potential.  In all honesty I havn\'t looked at my biuts for a couple of weeks and forgot about the cash.  I\'ll mail it tomorrow, sorry for flaking on ya.  I\'ll throw a very positive review for yeah on forums, sorry again.'),(19192,'47ea680144','I\'ll keep an eye out. Hopefully it fits in the box, and I don\'t have to go pick it up.  :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\nSo am I just FETing these for now? What are our plans for modding these without sending them back and forth too much? Are you gonna maybe do some body mods and send them to me to be painted? Or should I just go ahead and paint 1 or 2 of the stock bodies? Were gonna get hog involved? I think we pretty much got it covered between us. Were we gonna dual cell one? I got extra batteries. Why\'s the sky blue? How\'s it goin\'?\r\n\r\nOk, I\'m out of questions, see ya. :-) \r\n\r\ndave'),(18983,'86801b16b2','01-1132  Why you wanna toll free call  :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (18984,'f735524c62','You got that right, give it the once, twice over, improve it any way you want, I\'m in no hurry Pimp!\r\n\r\nThanx Again !'),(33015,'49a8cd90ea','Hey Finks,\r\n\r\nJust letting you know I still havent got the parcel.  \r\nIt sucks, I got all excited cos there was a slip in the box to pick up a parcel, but it was the mini and sub Chrome sent me less than 2 weeks ago.  :? \r\nThanks again for helping out man, but after 6 weeks im beginning to wonder if some customs officer isn\'t enjoying some office-bashing with my MT.  Australia post said the only way to check it\'s progress is from the America end, but if they have told you they can\'t help, then I guess i may never know where it ended up.\r\nI\'ll keep you posted if I get anything, but right now i\'m not holding my breath.  :('),(19059,'9b38a2b365','Hey man, I got da car today.\r\n\r\nIt kicks ass man. Excellent work. You did a great job lowering it, and that body looks so mean with the wheels tucked up into the wheel wells.\r\n\r\nIt\'s speed is precisely on track with my FET modded cars running Perfection 3.8s.\r\n\r\nThe handling took a little getting used to, as my little track I use most the time is all 90 degree turns with a couple hairpins. This cars steering radius was more than tight enough, but I think it\'s the springs that made the steering response sluggish. It threw my timing all off, but once I got used to turning a little sooner, I was making clean laps. That\'s when I realized I never made clean laps with my other cars sthat went that fast.\r\n\r\nSo now I\'ve decided I really need to redo my big track wide open for my faster cars.\r\n\r\n\r\n...and i could not find the idler gear for the Kit racer, I tore that package apart looking for it. You for shure if that was in there?\r\n\r\nWell any ways, thanks a bunch man. This is the best contest prize I\'ve won, and this will be part of the permanent collection for sure. \r\n\r\ndave'),(19060,'6e58e2ca95','[quote:6e58e2ca95=\"crazydave\"]Hey man, I got da car today.\r\n\r\nIt kicks ass man. Excellent work. You did a great job lowering it, and that body looks so mean with the wheels tucked up into the wheel wells.\r\n\r\nIt\'s speed is precisely on track with my FET modded cars running Perfection 3.8s.\r\n\r\nThe handling took a little getting used to, as my little track I use most the time is all 90 degree turns with a couple hairpins. This cars steering radius was more than tight enough, but I think it\'s the springs that made the steering response sluggish. It threw my timing all off, but once I got used to turning a little sooner, I was making clean laps. That\'s when I realized I never made clean laps with my other cars sthat went that fast.\r\n\r\nSo now I\'ve decided I really need to redo my big track wide open for my faster cars.\r\n\r\n\r\n...and i could not find the idler gear for the Kit racer, I tore that package apart looking for it. You for shure if that was in there?\r\n\r\nWell any ways, thanks a bunch man. This is the best contest prize I\'ve won, and this will be part of the permanent collection for sure. \r\n\r\ndave[/quote:6e58e2ca95]\r\n\r\nI\'m glad it made it safe, and more importantly, that you like it. That car is a complete mutt, built entirely from parts stripped off of junked cars. What\'s that saying \"the whole is greater than the sum of it\'s parts\"? As I began building it, it just kept getting better and better. My original thought on the body was to do something that wouldn\'t take too long and would be simple to do. I thought, \"paint the hood, the wing, and put some decals, details and clearcoat, boom done.\" Anyway, I liked it so much I\'m making another pair in the same basic scheme but different colors. I don\'t like having too many cars that are just for show, and hue35 and I beat the crap out of our cars when we race them. So it\'s a good solution for a car that looks pretty nice but not too precious to drive.\r\n\r\nThe tracks hue and I run on are pretty large, and I tend to forget that when I\'m talking about handling issues. We generally run in an area about 6\' x 10\' - 12\', so I naturally set up cars for that kind of driving.\r\n\r\nI had a sneaky suspicion after I mailed that that I might have robbed the idler gear as well. No worries, I\'ll drop one in the mail to you tomorrow. I ran my Supra with blue KIT racer gears last friday night. KIT racer gears on large tracks are incredible. Somehow the acceleration seems way more realistic and \"scale\". I think you\'ll did them. I sent you that kit because it had front wheels that matched in case you wanted to use the KIT racer wheels all around. Most of the KIT racer sets have funny thin plastic front wheels that don\'t take tires. Talk about pizza cutters!\r\n\r\nAnyway, glad you like it, I\'m honored you picked it when you could have had any of those sweet prizes.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19062,'84109dc8dd','Hoy! lol, i live in Kapitolyo Pasig!  Its good to finally have a flip over at the pimps:)  Happy modding! :eek:'),(19063,'1e863565d1','hoy karin!\r\nr we d only pinoys here?!\r\ni mean in the phil?\r\nnew manila me'),(34023,'579ee4d613','Hi SWG-\r\n\r\nI just sent paypal money, but I forgot to indicate quantity as you requested. sorry about that. I sent you $15 to cover 3 bodies plus shipping.\r\n\r\nSuperFly'),(34024,'06aa714aeb','[quote:06aa714aeb=\"SuperFly\"]Hi SWG-\r\n\r\nI just sent paypal money, but I forgot to indicate quantity as you requested. sorry about that. I sent you $15 to cover 3 bodies plus shipping.\r\n\r\nSuperFly[/quote:06aa714aeb]\r\n\r\nCool man I got Hue\'s payment and he said the same thing as you I will send them together when they arrive. \r\nI will also post when I have sent payment for the bodies!\r\nthanks man\r\nhope you have a great week!\r\n\r\nOh I was telling Hue we are all long lost brothers I was born in Portland OR and lived in Hubbard for a while and also on the coast at Lincoln City! \r\nloved it there and miss it still have family in OR and close friends. \r\nthanks again\r\n :-) Aaron'),(23797,'c7b08c8486','Thats cool we all hove those days. No problem.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24018,'32c754bab9','The MAT body is gone but I think I can just pull one off my MAT car.'),(24020,'d6fff5363f','[quote:d6fff5363f=\"VooDooMafia\"]The MAT body is gone but I think I can just pull one off my MAT car.[/quote:d6fff5363f]you ain\'t gotta do that man.\r\nyou still got the trueno body?'),(20870,'5c10d4c8a8','Congratulations on your winning bid!\r\n\r\n(look biatch, I\'m trying not to give you the non-typical \"pre-canned\" homo response here so bare with me lol)\r\n\r\nAlright...\r\n#1.) sorry nobody contacted you yet. our own dumb fault. call us names - we deserve it. I can only offer you a \"sorry\" and I guess a random \"homey\" to make up for it.\r\n#2.) you can pay cash or money order to me, or you can pay paypal to crazydave, if you would like to pay crazydave, please send him a PM (private message) asking for his paypal address and he will give it to you.\r\nif you would like to pay cash or money order, send it to me at:\r\nScott Lix\r\n16 Crystal Lake Drive\r\nSt. Peters, MO 63376\r\n#3.) if you want a homey to compensate for our retardness, you\'ll have to send me an address I can ship to you at.\r\n#4.) I appoligize again, I know this doesn\'t make us look \"trust-worthy\" (but you know we are) or like we are \"on top of things\" (we are, just maybe not on these type things).\r\nwe\'re not a shop. we\'ve never \"sold\" anything. and we don\'t want to be a \"shop\" or \"sell\" anything. this is kind of a once a year (if that) type thing and we\'re not looking to \"sell\", \"rip-off\", \"get rich\", or any of that type shit.\r\n\r\nanyways, you have your options, please let me know which you have chosen so I can make \"it\" happen.\r\n\r\nthanks for helping support bitPimps homey, you\'re doing your community a great deed as well as getting something kick ass in return for it. you should feel great and I hope you do.\r\n\r\nthanks again.\r\n- CaboWabo'),(20129,'36813b3e92','your location says Down South where is down south?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35405,'b93d4f54fa','Here is the list of EVO parts. \r\n\r\nPART ID	DESCRIPTION	PRICE	Cost	Silver	Green\r\nDXME009T	DELRIN MOTOR GEAR (9T) - 1PC	$1.90	$2.47	1	1\r\nDXME100R	DELRIN REAR BALL DIFFERENTIAL - 1 COMPLETED SET	15.50   	$0.00		0\r\nDXME1224T	DELRIN MAIN GEAR (12T/24T) - 2PCS SET	3.50   	$0.00		\r\nXME018A	ALLOY MOTOR HEAT SINK - 1PC	3.50   	$4.55	1	1\r\nXME021	ALLOY FRONT KNUCKLE ARM - 1PR	9.90   	$6.44		1\r\nXME022	ALLOY REAR KNUCKLE ARM -1 PR	9.90   	$6.44		1\r\nXME028	ALLOY FRONT SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	7.50   	$4.88		1\r\nXME030	ALLOY REAR SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	7.50   	$4.88		1\r\nXME032	ALLOY MAIN GEAR PROTECTOR - 1PC	3.90   	$2.54		1\r\nXME039F	ALLOY FRONT WHEEL SHAFT - 1PR	3.90   	$5.07	1	1\r\nXME039R	ALLOY REAR Wheel SHAFT - 1PR 	3.90   	$5.07	1	1\r\nXME047	ALLOY PROTECTOR FOR FRONT STEERING PLATE - 1PC 	3.90   	$2.54		1\r\nXME049/0	ALLOY STEERING PLATE - 1PC	6.50   	$4.23		1\r\nXME055	ALLOY FRONT LOWER ARM - 1PR	6.90   	$4.49		1\r\nXME056	ALLOY REAR LOWER ARM - 1PR	6.90   	$4.49		1\r\nXME190R	ALLOY REAR DOG BONE (9.0MM) - 1PR	2.50   	$3.25		2\r\nXME303	ALLOY BATTERY HEAT SINK MOUNT - 1PC	7.90   	$10.27	1	1\r\nXME316F	ALLOY FRONT DAMPER (16MM) -1PR	5.90   	$3.84		1\r\nXME316R	ALLOY REAR DAMPER (16MM) - 1PR	5.90   	$3.84		1\r\nXME330LAN	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR LANCER) - 1PC	5.90   	$0.00		0\r\nXME330MUS	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR MUSTANG) - 1PC	5.90   	$0.00		0\r\nXME331R	ALLOY REAR SKID PLATE - 1PC	3.50   	$2.28		1\r\nDXET009T	DELRIN MOTOR GEAR (9T) - 1PC	$1.90	$0.00	0	\r\nDXET100R	DELRIN REAR BALL DIFFERENTIAL - 1 COMPLETED SET	14.50   	$0.00	 	\r\nDXET1224T	DELRIN MAIN GEAR (12T/24T) - 2PCS SET	3.50   	$0.00		\r\nXET018A	ALLOY MOTOR HEAT SINK - 1PC	$3.50	$0.00	0	\r\nXET021	ALLOY FRONT KNUCKLE ARM - 1PR	$9.90	$6.44	1	\r\nXET022	ALLOY REAR KNUCKLE ARM -1 PR	$9.90	$6.44	1	\r\nXET028	ALLOY FRONT SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	$7.50	$7.50	1	\r\nXET030	ALLOY REAR SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	$7.50	$7.50	1	\r\nXET032	ALLOY MAIN GEAR PROTECTOR - 1PC	$4.50	$2.93	1	\r\nXET039F	ALLOY FRONT WHEEL SHAFT - 1PR	$3.90	$0.00	 	\r\nXET039R	ALLOY REAR Wheel SHAFT - 1PR 	$3.90	$0.00	 	\r\nXET047	ALLOY PROTECTOR FOR FRONT STEERING PLATE - 1PC	$3.90	$2.54	1	\r\nXET049	ALLOY STEERING PLATE - 1PC	$6.50	$0.00	0	\r\nXET055	ALLOY FRONT LOWER ARM - 1PR	$6.90	$4.49	1	\r\nXET056	ALLOY REAR LOWER ARM - 1PR	$6.90	$4.49	1	\r\nXET114R	ALLOY REAR DOG BONE (14MM) - 1PR	2.90   	$3.77	2	\r\nXET303	ALLOY BATTERY HEAT SINK MOUNT - 1PC	$7.50	$0.00	0	\r\nXET322F	ALLOY FRONT DAMPER (22MM) -1PR	$5.90	$3.84	1	\r\nXET322R	ALLOY REAR DAMPER (22MM) - 1PR	$5.90	$3.84	1	\r\nXET330FORD	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR TRUCKIN) - 1PC	$6.90	$0.00	0	\r\nXET330HUM	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR HUMMER) - 1PC	$5.90	$0.00	0	\r\nXET331F	ALLOY FRONT SKID PLATE - 1PC	$3.90	$2.54	1	\r\n		Sub	$137.79		\r\n		Rouund	$138.00		\r\n\r\nYou will notice that you have 2 pairs of each Dog bone and just one each axles.  Also the front clips have been removed. They will be added to the Gear box GB.  Also so I will not have to ask you for any more money the Steering arm for the truck has been removed.  With some changes to prices Some truck people pulled out so Steering plate and shock towers are not at 35% any more.  :sad: \r\n\r\nThe ORG parts are on the way to you with a surprise.  Let me know if the Gold front arms work and are made right.\r\n\r\nSince I am taking some peoples DIFF orders on this if you want to add diffs let me know.  They run $15 each.'),(20131,'6a29188281','Alabama');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20132,'c79bf6ad1b','[quote:c79bf6ad1b=\"Finks\"][quote:c79bf6ad1b]you know... stirring his pot lol \r\n\r\nmessing with him - goto trick click[/quote:c79bf6ad1b]\r\n\r\nYeah I went to check it out and nadda.  I mean I know we love fuckin w/ the boy but who is doing this?  Do you know?  Just seems odd the timing that he would be getting screwed with durring this time of War. :shock:   Can you hook me up with a link.[/quote:c79bf6ad1b]I think it might be birds wife.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?p=48284&amp;highlight=#48284\r\n\r\ngave ya the wrong forum before, sorry bout that'),(19067,'356fac16a9','[quote:356fac16a9=\"DarkTari\"]Yo Dave,\r\n\r\nI got you three Precious Micro\'s for Da Auction.\r\n\r\nI\'ll get\'em in the mail this week along with 3 chassis for FET\'s.  Lemme know if you need anything else (motor, wheels, body, decals, etc.)\r\nPop me your email, I think you sent me your address again, the brain is fried from doin 6th grade math homework with Lil Matrix so I\'ll have to check for your address.  Ahh send it anyways, I\'m hittin da sack   :neutral:[/quote:356fac16a9]6th grade homework :???: That must be that 3 and four digit long divison. That stuff always hurt my head. :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\nAlrighty then cool. I\'ll keep an eye out.\r\n\r\nHere\'s the address:\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n6751 W Indian School Rd. #1150\r\nPhoenix AZ 85033\r\n\r\n\r\ndave'),(19087,'761f9d44a1','i believe that we are the only pinoys...so, what have you done with your bits? :eek:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24235,'aa6ae2a6eb','Ya, I can still get them.  They are $10 + tax = $11 + Shipping.\r\n\r\nI just need to take one to the post office to see about shipping to your zip code.  Whats your addy?\r\n\r\n\r\n :cool:'),(31842,'d5da18b430','Hey dude - paypal should be sorted. :D\r\n\r\nwhats your postal address, so i can send this stuff out?\r\n\r\n :-D'),(31843,'4ea005db8e','Hey dude,\r\n\r\nThe paypal stuff all went through today - i shoulda checked with you though, the $15, is that for just the motor set, or the motor set and wheel set?  \r\nI was assuming both, \'cos the shack\'s website has them listed as $6.99 each = $14 for both = logical $15 transaction.  :-o\r\n\r\nI just thought i\'d check, cos i wasn\'t 100% sure.\r\n\r\ncheers mate!'),(31844,'ae8dc3721d','Yeah it\'s for both.  Need your address as well.  Here is mine.\r\n\r\nJesse King\r\n163 Main St\r\nFt Fairfield, ME 04742\r\nUSA'),(31846,'36bfcff878','cheers mate.  \r\n\r\nyours is in the mail today.\r\n\r\nMy address is:\r\n\r\nMichael Frawley\r\nPO BOX 2010\r\nTOOWONG QLD 4066\r\nAUSTRALIA');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31847,'43ba726e8a','Hey man, do you still have enough stuff to fill this order?\r\n\r\nTomy BCG sets: \r\n\r\nSpeed racer mach V 45mhz \r\nLupin the third 35mhz\r\n\r\n\r\nMini Heart sets: \r\n\r\nred fire chief\r\nwhite/green police car \r\nwhite \r\npale yellow\r\nyellow\r\nmint green\r\nblack\r\n\r\nAlso, do you have any of the swap-out roofs or any other accessories for the mini heart cars?\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nhue35'),(24137,'e757f553a5','[quote:e757f553a5=\"KaNye\"]Got it today! I apreciate the fast shippin, and the nice packaging.  :-)  Im afraid I didnt have access to anything but a box and some paper as protection.\r\n\r\nThanks again, let me know when you get yours,\r\nKanye.[/quote:e757f553a5]\r\n\r\nHmm... well, I\'m guessing it musta got lost in the mail. If it comes back to ya, double check the address...\r\n\r\nMat Mathey\r\n3104 SE 39th Avenue\r\nPortland, OR 97202'),(19074,'391ba51aab','[quote:391ba51aab=\"SuperFly\"]I\'m glad it made it safe, and more importantly, that you like it. That car is a complete mutt, built entirely from parts stripped off of junked cars. What\'s that saying \"the whole is greater than the sum of it\'s parts\"? As I began building it, it just kept getting better and better. My original thought on the body was to do something that wouldn\'t take too long and would be simple to do. I thought, \"paint the hood, the wing, and put some decals, details and clearcoat, boom done.\" Anyway, I liked it so much I\'m making another pair in the same basic scheme but different colors. I don\'t like having too many cars that are just for show, and hue35 and I beat the crap out of our cars when we race them. So it\'s a good solution for a car that looks pretty nice but not too precious to drive.\r\n\r\nThe tracks hue and I run on are pretty large, and I tend to forget that when I\'m talking about handling issues. We generally run in an area about 6\' x 10\' - 12\', so I naturally set up cars for that kind of driving.\r\n\r\nI had a sneaky suspicion after I mailed that that I might have robbed the idler gear as well. No worries, I\'ll drop one in the mail to you tomorrow. I ran my Supra with blue KIT racer gears last friday night. KIT racer gears on large tracks are incredible. Somehow the acceleration seems way more realistic and \"scale\". I think you\'ll did them. I sent you that kit because it had front wheels that matched in case you wanted to use the KIT racer wheels all around. Most of the KIT racer sets have funny thin plastic front wheels that don\'t take tires. Talk about pizza cutters!\r\n\r\nAnyway, glad you like it, I\'m honored you picked it when you could have had any of those sweet prizes.[/quote:391ba51aab]Hey don\'t get me wrong on the handling issue. I think the slower steering response makes the car less twitchy and easier to control at speeds. The problems I was having are the same as the ones I have with my cars that go that fast. I was just saying it was different and took a little getting used to\r\n\r\n10x6 is a pretty big track (for me). My kitchen where I get to run flat out is only 9x5.\r\n\r\nI redid my 8x4 track with wide lanes and an easy layout. \r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3819\r\nThis should be fun, but i didn\'t get to test it last night. Now I\'m gonna be busting ass trying to get out of work early, cause I can\'t wait to try it out.  :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\n...and thanks for sending a KIT racer with the front wheels. I really dig those wheels, So I\'m already planning to do something with them.\r\n\r\nI was bored before bed last night and put that KIT racer together with some purple tires on it. It looks kinda cool, and now I want to try to build a KIT Racer bit, like Hue did. I\'m looking for a small plastic jet to cut the canopy off of, other than that, I\'ve got a lot of details to work out on that project.\r\n\r\nAnyways, thanks, and I\'ll keep an eye out for that idler gear. :-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(19075,'26b8be366b','What have you been up to?\r\n\r\nAre you in the middle tennessee area?  \r\n\r\nHow Old are you?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36409,'2b37adcbb0','Betty K..Sorry for askin some dumb ass questions, but i consider you a master around the site, especially about 1/28th scale RC.\r\n\r\nFor my Gen1 Xmod after I slap in a fet i wanted to check out the choices in batteries. I heard Lithium Ion batteries are good? \r\n\r\nBut should i put AA, instead of AAA. This way i could earn practically double the run time at the same voltage right?'),(31927,'7eb9eb5321','hiya. i just got a bunch from swg today, i can spare about 15. i didn\'t pay for them so just send me $5 to cover shipping if you want. my paypal addy is: bettykay@gmail.com\r\n\r\njust confirm this is your address:\r\n\r\nmichael frawley\r\npo box 2010\r\ntoowong 4066\r\nqld'),(19078,'7285b1d338','I just saw \"jowlz\'s\" posts over at your place.\r\nmoderate how you wish - you\'re not going to break any bonds here.\r\nhog\'s our local nut case - he means no harm but I don\'t want you to feel you have to cater to him to keep in good relations with bitPimps.\r\n\r\njust thought I\'d return the courtesy of respect'),(19079,'4d2b29f5f5','Well I appreciate it, I think he got the message, he\'s a good guy and he means well, he\'s just trying to bring that pimpin flavor....lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19080,'4d2b29f5f5','Well I appreciate it, I think he got the message, he\'s a good guy and he means well, he\'s just trying to bring that pimpin flavor....lol'),(19081,'20366b6f97','I think I might have asked you this before, but have forgotten...\r\n\r\nI wanted to start adding your tutorials on the dirty bits to our articles section. of course you\'d get the credit, etc. like you see in some of the other articles.\r\n\r\nif that\'s not okay, that\'s completely fine and I understand.\r\n\r\nlet me know man - I\'d like to get your information out there as much as possible.'),(19082,'6a1fbc4884','g\'day bruceo! feel free to grab anything you want from my site and do with it what you will! hopefully peeps will give it a go, i\'m sick of chopping chassis\' now!! :lol:  the only grey area is some of the gallery pics are of other peoples cars. they are clearly labelled as such and i made a point of getting permission from the owners before putting them up as you do. other than that go nuts! :-)'),(19085,'6a1fbc4884','g\'day bruceo! feel free to grab anything you want from my site and do with it what you will! hopefully peeps will give it a go, i\'m sick of chopping chassis\' now!! :lol:  the only grey area is some of the gallery pics are of other peoples cars. they are clearly labelled as such and i made a point of getting permission from the owners before putting them up as you do. other than that go nuts! :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20186,'e001d38fa9','As of now, CXPsponseredspeed is the newest user...\r\ni suggest making it so he cant post  :-D  :smile:'),(19088,'9b9ee17a29','none...hahahaha!\r\ni\'m not gud at moddin\'\r\ni only did d \"boost-button\" mod (d 1 which makes it always run on turbo)\r\nn i glued d hood of d trueno to d body so dat it wont flip went i hit d wall...\r\nyou!?'),(19089,'18bcd12a1e','Got the discs! Thanks, man.. I\'m lovin\' this stuff. He\'s a great guitar player.. amazing tones that dude gets. I\'m sending some discs out for you today. I redid the 2 Big Boys compilations and here\'s a few links to some info on the others... \r\n\r\nThe Lazy Cowgirls:\r\n1. How It Looks, Ho It Is\r\n2. Ragged Soul\r\n\r\nThe Gun Club\r\n1. Fire of Love\r\n2. Mother Juno\r\n\r\nYou only get one facet of the Lazy Cowgirls with these two, but they\'re both essential discs.. these are the last 2 with DD weekday on guitar. He\'s a bad motherfucker. If you dig this stuff, I\'ll give you some more later (I have all the Lazy Cowgirs discs!)... they mellow out just a little bit on the later discs, but the tunes are maybe even more solid.\r\n\r\nFire of Love is the first Gun Club record (1981), and it kicks ass. Mother Juno is several records later (1987), but I think it\'s their strongest since the first. I have one more called [i:18bcd12a1e]Early Warning[/i:18bcd12a1e] that collects demos and whatnot.. if you dig this stuff I\'d be happy to dupe you that set too..\r\n\r\nthanks again... I really appreciate the new tunes.'),(37905,'70262bd5ca','It\'s about 20 :shock:  Could I use Flash to edit it? I could cut it down a bit, and add a screen shot with title. It\'s been a while since I\'ve used flash, but I have it. I think I may have Adobe Premier....I\'ll have to look for the disc.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37906,'b1c73d58d2','[quote:b1c73d58d2=\"HirotoR34\"]It\'s about 20 :shock:  Could I use Flash to edit it? I could cut it down a bit, and add a screen shot with title. It\'s been a while since I\'ve used flash, but I have it. I think I may have Adobe Premier....I\'ll have to look for the disc.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?[/quote:b1c73d58d2]\r\nI think you shouldn\'t spend time on it unless you personally want to.\r\nDon\'t do it just because I asked.\r\n\r\nI also think Premiere would be the better choice over Flash.\r\nI don\'t know what version of Flash you have either.\r\n\r\nIdeally, you\'d create and export your video from Premiere as a .wmv\r\nMost likely, after compression, it\'d be small enough to upload to your Gallery. (I realize, right now, you can\'t upload it to the bitPimps Galleries. I am uprading everything, so you\'d just have to wait)\r\nOr at least email to bitPimps.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested further, I can help - just ask.'),(27819,'bf11cf4d38','If you\'re talking about the Castrol/Hiroto body, TE still has some!\r\n Sometimes Bablefish ain\'t all it\'s cracked up to be!\r\n\r\nTry this:\r\nhttp://www.freetranslation.com/web.htm\r\nSee how that does for you !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (27774,'18ae90f660','How have you been?  Haven\'t heard from ya.\r\n\r\n :-)  :cool: \r\n\r\nDid you finish the Ferrari? :???:'),(27433,'748b7285dc','hey i tryed clicking on your link for the wheel mod and i think your site is down :-(  so can you give me another link to it or fix your website? 8-) \r\n\r\nthanks'),(27434,'c4514951dd','I\'ll try my best.'),(32971,'ed63d26838','So do you do any mods?   \r\n\r\nThe faster motors do help, but there are some mods that will REALLY wake up the cars.  Super Bits seem to be limited more than the Pro and Sport models.\r\n\r\nWhen I first got started, the \"Bit Racers\" were available here under the name \"Kitt Racers\" sold through hotwheels.  They were a wonderful source of Bit / MS parts.'),(28442,'892ba13950','Alright, just let me know, and maybe I can send everything out to You tomorrow, Hey just curious but when I put Your name and adress on the package do I put Attn: Charlie, or just Charlie, what does Attn mean, sorry if it\'s something I should know, but I\'m pretty slow sometimes, lol\r\nIs the car going to be a Panther with the Skyline body or the rally racer with the body?\r\nThanks man.'),(28443,'24bd56290a','Oh nevermind, I thought for some reason it said something else, but Attn means attention, sorry about that man, lol\r\nI\'m filling out your address on the package, and packing everything up, by the way what freq is the chassis Your sending me?\r\nThanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28444,'aee5817e33','Hey man,\r\nThis is getting better for Ya everyday, lol, anyway Ya know how I said I only had one MT spring, I found the other now!!!! YAY\r\nso thats better at least You can now have a working suspension.\r\nAlright talk to Ya later\r\nThanks'),(19092,'e68ef404e2','[quote:e68ef404e2=\"PimpIke\"]looks like amitoj has been to massachussets and san fransisico...[/quote:e68ef404e2]\r\n\r\nIn English please? And how\'d you know my name was Amitoj....???'),(35950,'43f25508b1','Payaso man I told you, the lambo is yours as well as the other\'s bodys\r\n\r\n-Murcielago\r\n-Chevy 57 clear\r\n- 512bb\r\n\r\nI am just waitin for your response and exact answer as to how we get the deal done.\r\n\r\nThat\'s what I mean when i say \"Pending\"\r\n\r\nSorry! PS. Are you gonna take these things off my hands or what? lol to other pimps i never heard of asked for em and i\'m like forgeh bawt it...on reserve lol'),(19094,'d2caf7b0f7','You see that Hockey game?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19095,'d2caf7b0f7','You see that Hockey game?'),(24392,'0f819540a7','I hate to be the bearer of bad news but the Diamond Caberet is now LArry Flint\'s Hustler Club. \r\nI honestly have never been to any of the local titty bars. But they\'re sure popular day and night......\r\nThe offer stands, if y\'ever get up this way we\'ll hook up. Maybe y\'all could bring along some of that Florida Herbal Tea...... :cool:  ;-)  :smoking: \r\n\r\nThanks again for your help!\r\n\r\nJon'),(32981,'a6a879be54','http://one18th.com/GetGallery5902.htm                                                \n\n\nhttp://one18th.com/GetGallery5904.htm'),(19097,'57bd7f8bad','fuck yea - god damn they work hard.\r\nbut I gotta believe, even though for all their valiant (sp?) efforts, they\'re gonna loose game 7.\r\nit\'s gonna be calgary and tampa bay.\r\n\r\nI\'m torn - I kind think calgary and philly would be a better game just because of how the 2 teams play vs. how calgary and TB play.\r\n\r\nif my heart was in it (which really it\'s not), I\'d have to root for calgary to win it.\r\nmy brain say TB is gonna win it - probably stompin ass.\r\nnot that TB has a niche tough guy, but they do have the biggest one in the league. and they\'re talented as fuck when it comes to skating, stick work / puck handling, their goaly is on fire - and so are a few of their \"elite\".\r\ncalgary is tough, they work hard and jerome iginlia is a fuckin masterpiece.\r\nI was just talking to my wife tonight and mentioning how when paul korea first came in to the nhl, he was my hero, then iginlua came in and he was my hero.\r\n\r\noverall thought TB has more than a super work ethic - the work ethic may not be quite as much as calgary - but they\'re skills and goal work will compensate for that.\r\n\r\nunbelievably, I\'ve been nothing but surprised in this whole series. for the most part anyways.'),(19098,'1769ed8124','I can\'t disagree with anything you said.....except that the Flyers will lose game 7. I think it will be Flyers/Calgary. Then again, my heart is in it. They played that overtime period extremely well. If it wasn\'t for that awesome left glovehand of that twitchy, ticky, eyeball poppin\' Tampa goalie, the game would have ended much sooner with a Flyers win.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19099,'1769ed8124','I can\'t disagree with anything you said.....except that the Flyers will lose game 7. I think it will be Flyers/Calgary. Then again, my heart is in it. They played that overtime period extremely well. If it wasn\'t for that awesome left glovehand of that twitchy, ticky, eyeball poppin\' Tampa goalie, the game would have ended much sooner with a Flyers win.'),(32245,'52a0846cda','[quote:52a0846cda=\"sg219\"]burn one in a little bit?\n\n\n\nreply or give me a call....\n\n\n\n\n\nHow about those Epoch prices?  :lol:[/quote:52a0846cda]\n\n :-o  :-o  :-o\n\n  :-)'),(36773,'40c3b9a6ba','is the RS4 ready to go except electronics?  Or will i need the belts and what not?  Does it have a servo in it?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nSTG'),(34885,'ef6fb7739d','I need you to bid on this for me at the very last minute\r\n\r\n[url]http://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;item=6010340347&amp;rd=1&amp;sspagename=STRK%3AMEWA%3AIT&amp;rd=1[/url]\r\n\r\nI really don\'t want to goto $60  but If you have to :(\r\nSee if you can get it as cheap as possible.\r\n\r\nI\'ll repay you through an MO ,I have a US addy that you can use\r\n\r\nThanx\r\nMaxx'),(19101,'8a1649f958','[quote:8a1649f958=\"Sdog\"]I can\'t disagree with anything you said.....except that the Flyers will lose game 7. I think it will be Flyers/Calgary. Then again, my heart is in it. They played that overtime period extremely well. If it wasn\'t for that awesome left glovehand of that twitchy, ticky, eyeball poppin\' Tampa goalie, the game would have ended much sooner with a Flyers win.[/quote:8a1649f958]lmao word man - I know where you\'re coming from - and I have nothing but respect for it.\r\nwere I in your shoes - I\'d say exactly the same.\r\nroot for your team dude.\r\n\r\nI wondered if anyone else was thinking shit about that goaly with his twitchin - you know crank/coke and shit isn\'t detectable 24\'s later... he\'s just way too twitchy and eyeball poppin...\r\n\r\nyou need to get up on that AIM thang.\r\nI didn\'t download shit. I\'m using a \"web\" version of it.\r\nbut at least you\'ll run into a few of the pimps.\r\n\r\n\r\np.s. had my agavero / tequilla time out all night long.\r\ndamn that was a good game');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19102,'cbf70055be','I use yahoo IM....works great....I\'ll look in to the AIM.\r\n\r\nI am down with the good tequila man. It was beer for me tonight.\r\n\r\nI\'m put for the night....peace.'),(19104,'cbf70055be','I use yahoo IM....works great....I\'ll look in to the AIM.\r\n\r\nI am down with the good tequila man. It was beer for me tonight.\r\n\r\nI\'m put for the night....peace.'),(26074,'43af2ad0c0','Well I got bit/bodies galore and a few zip/se bodies. A few Thunderchargers and microspeeds, and chargers up the ass.  Anything in particular you need/want?  \r\nAlso Ph2t said Nelly can be installed in the 04 so I\'ll let you know when I get everything.  Thanks\r\n\r\nVik'),(19604,'631d13f78f','Thanks!!! :-)   I can\'t wait....'),(31121,'6defb794fa','[quote:6defb794fa=\"hue35\"]OK, I\'m close.... \r\n\r\nOne more thing, then I\'ll give you my final list of what I want...\r\n\r\nhow many of each of these do you have...\r\n\r\n200mah battery $1.50 \r\n160mah battery $.75 \r\nperfection 3.8 motor $2ea \r\nperfection heatsinks - black, gold, silver $.50ea \r\nperfection 4.2 motor $2ea \r\n\r\nThanks for putting the list together, that was nice and tidy... makes things easy.\r\n\r\nhue35[/quote:6defb794fa]\r\n\r\nHi, Heres the info you needed. I put the quantity in front of product and will do the same with the color heatsinks which will be in front of each color. \r\n\r\nQTY 1 200mah battery $1.50 \r\nQTY 1 160mah battery $.75 \r\nQTY 4 perfection 3.8 motor $2ea \r\nperfection heatsinks - QTY 2 black, QTY 2 gold, QTY 1 silver $.50ea \r\nQTY 3 perfection 4.2 motor $2ea \r\n\r\nThanks and let me know if you have any other questions!\r\n\r\n\r\n- JDM'),(20868,'4202e011d0','Lemme know what he decides to do and when you or Dave get his ducketts !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (25043,'1eef5eb796','Yeah Man,  DarkTari has some things goin on right now but he said he will\r\ncontact. Next month sometime.  This will also give you time to get the ends together.\r\n\r\nThanx! Pimp   :cool:'),(19109,'be4166cd01','[quote:be4166cd01=\"Sdog\"]I use yahoo IM....works great....I\'ll look in to the AIM.\r\n\r\nI am down with the good tequila man. It was beer for me tonight.\r\n\r\nI\'m put for the night....peace.[/quote:be4166cd01]aight (but you\'re a whip even though I\'m close behind lol)\r\n\r\nI use a \"web\" version of AIM so I don\'t have to install shit or have any spyware, blah - blah - blah\r\n\r\nso if you\'re interested, cool - if not, that\'s cool too.\r\n\r\n\r\nkeep in touch biatch cuz I\'m watchin the play-offs all the way to the end.'),(19110,'531dd0f4b5','Dude I just love that Swat Van.  You said it was a Bit Char-A clone body or car you used.  I search the web for 2 days looking for that car.  Where did you get it from or do you know where I can find it? \r\n\r\nThanks Man you Rock\r\n\r\nMike'),(20136,'daacf8a420','Hey what\'s up? Thanks for bidding on my car. 8-) \r\n\r\nWe\'ll I\'ll tell ya, just got done with a last minute emergency move, and this is my first time back on the net in 2 days.\r\n\r\nMy paypal email is davesmoejoe@yahoo.com, you can do that, or if you want to send me a money order let me know, and I\'ll get you the address.\r\n\r\nAlso you should know I\'m a bit busy unpacking and organizing, it may not be until this weekend until I can ship it out.\r\n\r\nWell thanks again for bidding and supporting the bitPimps.  :-) \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19114,'0eaa8ef92a','umm i didnit send no emails bitch\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=169&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight=beer&amp;start=15\r\n\r\ni dono i remember your samoan lawyer buddy had that problem one day  or something.'),(19115,'0eaa8ef92a','umm i didnit send no emails bitch\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=169&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight=beer&amp;start=15\r\n\r\ni dono i remember your samoan lawyer buddy had that problem one day  or something.'),(19116,'c9375a9399','[quote:c9375a9399=\"hogjowlz\"]umm i didnit send no emails bitch\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=169&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight=beer&amp;start=15\r\n\r\ni dono i remember your samoan lawyer buddy had that problem one day  or something.[/quote:c9375a9399]its because some dippity shits subscribe or watch the thread so everytime there\'s a new post it tries to send the email.\r\nsince they provide a wrong email address, it can\'t send the email.\r\n\r\nshould be fixed now though.'),(19117,'f11a4ee538','no problem mekinhux i can do the car for you, are you sure that u dont need the monte carlo rally decal for the hood, i will throw them in for you and you can add them if you want! give me a couple of days to give you a photo of what i come up with on the cit. dont worry about the funds right now i only need the shipping cost and maybe a few extra bucks for the materials. this shouldn\'t cost you any more than ten bucks or so.\r\n\r\ntalk to you soon\r\njeff');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19118,'139fba478e','hey mekinhux u showed me two differant cit\'s a blue one and the monte carlo one that is the color orangish brown, which one do u need?\r\n\r\njmays'),(19120,'26b8be366b','What have you been up to?\r\n\r\nAre you in the middle tennessee area?  \r\n\r\nHow Old are you?'),(20137,'284bfdf815','No problem.  Movin\' is always a hassle.  I went ahead and paypal\'d the cash....just send it when you get settled in and whatnot.'),(28528,'f563d1976a','Hey Bio,\r\n\r\nWhat kinda truck body are you think\'n about for your new Bit Monster?\r\n\r\nI got a few suggestions if interrested, email me at\r\n\r\nDarkTari@msn.com   :cool:'),(21086,'f74a0dca8b','Never heard from Hog so I\'m gonna take a week break from the Auction and pick it up on Aug 1st.  I\'ll address the issue later.\r\nI didn\'t have confidence that he would come thru, you\'ve mentioned certain issues in the past about his end of the bargain on other projects, that\'s why I pretty much didn\'t want to do a joint with him unless he sent me a finished chassis. He gave all the specs but no pics.....\r\n\r\n[quote:f74a0dca8b]So will this be ready to put on Da Block Saturday midnight EST ?? \r\nSee if you can get some pics in yo gallery so Da Big Kahuna can get that baby on Da Block! \r\n\r\nWere you serious about starting the bid at $30.00 ??[/quote:f74a0dca8b]\r\n\r\nI\'ll post his at $30.00 if he wants ......... :???:'),(20555,'dc65d9a0cf','I got the VW rig last week.  The paint job is slammin\' !!  Thanks  It runs very strong too................thanks....jd');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19448,'1c45149e37','that JDM-R34 dude is killin me he mailed me about building him a zz body. maybe i will quit my job and be a bit body builder 24/7 lo0l\r\nits all good i am waiting to see what kind of body he needs.\r\n\r\njmays'),(19449,'1c45149e37','that JDM-R34 dude is killin me he mailed me about building him a zz body. maybe i will quit my job and be a bit body builder 24/7 lo0l\r\nits all good i am waiting to see what kind of body he needs.\r\n\r\njmays'),(19123,'c9375a9399','[quote:c9375a9399=\"hogjowlz\"]umm i didnit send no emails bitch\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=169&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight=beer&amp;start=15\r\n\r\ni dono i remember your samoan lawyer buddy had that problem one day  or something.[/quote:c9375a9399]its because some dippity shits subscribe or watch the thread so everytime there\'s a new post it tries to send the email.\r\nsince they provide a wrong email address, it can\'t send the email.\r\n\r\nshould be fixed now though.'),(19124,'bb0c766420','u got it mekinhux, i am glad to send it to you and have my body or should i say a peice of my wirk in another country, u know i am in the usa and this war thing is about to really piss ppl off over here, just like the ones in iraq that are good ppl there are also good ppl here in the states, what we see on the news is only what the news wants to portray, the poll here in america is that about 50 percent of americans support bush and the war and the other 50 dont, i agree on the initial reasons why we were there but its now time to get out of iraq so that the country can get on with there lives, its like this, here there are gangs and such that cause trouble and there, there are militant groups, idunno sorry for the ramblings. \r\n\r\n    I wish u the best and i will get on the body asap, did u like the color of my cit, i still have some of that color left, the only thing is that i will be painting the roof on yours white like the picture, do you have a chassis for the car?\r\n\r\nttyl\r\njeff');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20865,'08fdc35a88','Don\'t worry about sendin him Da Homie, I send one out with every car \r\n\r\nIt\'s Da Pimp thing to do  :cool:'),(20864,'3a49ece7ac','1st off this PM isn\'t intended to kiss yer ass :grin: \r\n\r\nHoly shit, if I win that ride you and DT put together for only $27 I will shit myself.  Checked out the other pics of the Subaru in your gallery and Wow!  I have been holding out for a ride that really speaks to me and that car is just amzing.  Not to mention that it is a product of you and DT.  Well anyhow, we\'ll see how it all turns out.  Just thought you would like to know that your work is being greatly admired from this pimp.'),(21644,'91718c1034','I got a Blue Honda Civic body.  Want it?  Have any doubles of ZZ or ZZ SE shells you willin\' to trade.  If not, how\'s $10 shipped for the body?'),(21774,'7735033886','Hey I think the link I sent you got changed.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ripper7racing.com/Magazine/aug04/index.htm\r\n\r\nI\'m going to post a thread asking for writers, I would like the mag to cover from 1/18th to 1/64th scales so I\'d like to have some Pimpin Writers and maybe a section for the Pimps, also I\'d like you to have a Bit Pimp Full page ad in the next issue.\r\n\r\nWell I wanted to give you a heads up.\r\n\r\nTTYL\r\n\r\nRipper'),(21646,'2e29b5f86d','no extra zz stuff right now I still need to dig out the rest and go through.\r\n\r\n10 shipped is cool but I am in Canada but if you talk to any of the other pimps (hog, Cabo, Superfly or anyothers I have delt with) the shipping is often cheaper to send it here.\r\n\r\n  Funny thing is I can also send cheaper to the US then to canada weird shit  :???:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19200,'e3c7663e8f','[quote:e3c7663e8f=\"hue35\"]Cool man, the feedback on that batch of discs will help me figure out what\'s next... I have a shitload of stuff and it\'s all over the map. Some things that come to mind are; the Nuggets box sets (vols 1 and 2), firehose, Mission of Burma, Wayne Kramer, Claw Hammer (this might be a big priority, if you\'re not familiar with these dudes), Link Wray, Captain Beefheart... you into Zappa? There\'s so much shit to listen to..lol.[/quote:e3c7663e8f]I\'ve got 2 CDs full of Nuggets that I got off of Napster. That is one of my all time favorite CDs, I love that stuff. I\'ve got the A-Z of Link Wray, another of my favorites. firehose, Mission of Burma, Wayne Kramer, Claw Hammer is all stuff that my buddies had, and I\'ve heard, but I haven\'t sat and listened to, like you do with your own music. I like Captain Beefheart, but I\'ve only heard a couple songs by him.\r\n\r\nFrank Zappa...I\'ll tell ya about Frank Zappa. I really want to like him. I\'ve tried to like him. I\'ve tried really hard to like him. I\'ve listened to Joe\'s Garage over and over, and every time I\'m left with the same feeling, like I\'m the only one who don\'t get the joke. It\'s a shame too, because everyone else seems to be so profoundly affected.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re digging on the White Stripes, then I think I\'ll send you more garage rock, as I\'ve got piles of that stuff. Ever heard the Deviants, Urinals, Swingin\' Neckbreakers, or Detroit Cobras?\r\n\r\nI\'ve got this one chick band, Bratmobile. They really kinda suck, but I love \'em just for the line, \"Don\'t write a song about it, just give me back my Cheap Trick record\" :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(19201,'1ee57209a4','[quote:1ee57209a4=\"crazydave\"]Frank Zappa...I\'ll tell ya about Frank Zappa. I really want to like him. I\'ve tried to like him. I\'ve tried really hard to like him. I\'ve listened to Joe\'s Garage over and over, and every time I\'m left with the same feeling, like I\'m the only one who don\'t get the joke. It\'s a shame too, because everyone else seems to be so profoundly affected.[/quote:1ee57209a4]\r\nHave you heard any late 60\'s, early 70\'s Zappa? Hot Rats (\'69) and Over-Nite Sensation (\'73)? Those records are less \"funny\" and are the ones I was thinking you\'d dig. They have way more grit within the complexity and are a different thing altogether than the 80\'s stuff... the Joe\'s Garage era is so slick, that I would assume right off the bat, it ain\'t your bag.\r\n\r\n[quote:1ee57209a4=\"crazydave\"]If you\'re digging on the White Stripes, then I think I\'ll send you more garage rock, as I\'ve got piles of that stuff. Ever heard the Deviants, Urinals, Swingin\' Neckbreakers, or Detroit Cobras?[/quote:1ee57209a4]\r\nThe only stuff I\'ve heard from that scene (if I\'m even close) is the Gories and the Compulsive Gamblers (via Andre Williams). I\'d love to hear that stuff... Detroit Cobras is a great name, I dig them already.\r\n\r\n[quote:1ee57209a4=\"crazydave\"]I\'ve got this one chick band, Bratmobile. They really kinda suck, but I love \'em just for the line, \"Don\'t write a song about it, just give me back my Cheap Trick record\" :lol:[/quote:1ee57209a4]\r\n:lol: beautiful');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19202,'6920748433','[quote:6920748433=\"DarkTari\"]By the way the box is 10\"x7\"x6\" and buldging so if your box is that large, it should fit!\r\n\r\nAlso you can do what you want with the bodies, paint the stock one or use something else, your call Pimp!  If you need bodies, let me know. If you want me to do a body for you to paint, holla  :eek:[/quote:6920748433]Well I\'ll tell ya, what I\'m thinking just based off my experience selling a few cars on ebay.\r\n\r\nIf we just FET mod, and paint a car, we aint gonna get what it\'s worth. I made the most money off a dual cell FET modded Zip Zap, that I didn\'t even paint.\r\n\r\nSo what I\'m thinking is, we really need to offer something really special to grab peoples attention. I\'m figuring I\'ve got a lot of attention from from my paint jobs, and everyone loves your body work...so if I lay a paint job on one of your bodies, that\'s gotta be a hit.\r\n\r\n...and since dual cell Zip Zaps sell for more on ebay, we got to stretch a chassis to fit a Zip Zap body. If I fetched $60 for a unpainted one, I figure one with one of your bodies on it should go through the roof. Maybe we can get Hog to build a charger for that one, and JB weld the rear end. \r\n\r\nI don\'t know, I don\'t have a clear plan of what I want to do. I\'m just trying to get on the same page as everyone else.\r\n\r\nDave'),(19203,'8867f913db','We got one factor in our favor. Da Pimps know of our skliz and so do our US, German, Denmark &amp; Aussie counterparts. We are auctioning on BitPimps so I don\'t think we have to be too extreme.  I tellya, 80%-90% of our Pimps never go to eBay, I know I don\'t !  So I think we\'ll get a great response in Da Hood.  I would say do a couple of Extreme Micros, let me know what you need from me and it will be granted!   :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19205,'c9b7f6bca4','You can\'t get this stuff from a hardware store.  Do you have a hobby shop near you ?  If not, go here\r\nhttp://www.micromark.com'),(19207,'943cc70a6e','[quote:943cc70a6e=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:943cc70a6e=\"dodgeracerguy\"]trucks are gay[/quote:943cc70a6e]you\'re a fucking moron.\r\n\r\nhey dipshit - I run this place and guess what I can tell who you are!\r\n\r\nYou\'re either that same Lorne faggot or one of his butt buddies.\r\nYou both come from the same piece of shit place.\r\n\r\nYour provider is in Burlington, Ontario - Canda\r\nI\'ve got your IP, I\'ve got your ISP, I\'ve got it all.\r\nYou\'re using Cogeco Cable and Lorne\'s using Rogers High-Speed Internet\r\n\r\nit\'s time for you to be scared.\r\nif I see anymore shit coming from anywhere even close to Canada, I\'m coming after your ass and I will burn you down to the ground bitch.\r\nmatter of fact, if I see or hear of anything coming from any place north of here, I\'m coming after you - you dumb mother fucker.\r\n\r\nwait until I shut down all your shit, I\'ve done it before (legally I might add)[/quote:943cc70a6e]\r\n\r\n\r\nRock on pimp!\r\n\r\nBTW, thanks for standing up for me in that \"stupid PM\'s thread\". If I can do anything to repay you, lemme know. \r\n\r\nPE@CE out'),(19208,'943cc70a6e','[quote:943cc70a6e=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:943cc70a6e=\"dodgeracerguy\"]trucks are gay[/quote:943cc70a6e]you\'re a fucking moron.\r\n\r\nhey dipshit - I run this place and guess what I can tell who you are!\r\n\r\nYou\'re either that same Lorne faggot or one of his butt buddies.\r\nYou both come from the same piece of shit place.\r\n\r\nYour provider is in Burlington, Ontario - Canda\r\nI\'ve got your IP, I\'ve got your ISP, I\'ve got it all.\r\nYou\'re using Cogeco Cable and Lorne\'s using Rogers High-Speed Internet\r\n\r\nit\'s time for you to be scared.\r\nif I see anymore shit coming from anywhere even close to Canada, I\'m coming after your ass and I will burn you down to the ground bitch.\r\nmatter of fact, if I see or hear of anything coming from any place north of here, I\'m coming after you - you dumb mother fucker.\r\n\r\nwait until I shut down all your shit, I\'ve done it before (legally I might add)[/quote:943cc70a6e]\r\n\r\n\r\nRock on pimp!\r\n\r\nBTW, thanks for standing up for me in that \"stupid PM\'s thread\". If I can do anything to repay you, lemme know. \r\n\r\nPE@CE out');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19209,'f0ecb4ef06','Not trying to be a pest or anything on this website, but how come under my avatar it doesn\'t say anything like Bit Pimp or anything like other people? For example after so many posts it changes to Bit THugs, or Bit Ninja or eventually Bit Pimp like under Your avatar, Sorry for the trouble, just wondering, thanks Pimp :cool:'),(28526,'b816d188be','WHAT? dude it should have been there by now,  what was this the 3rd day?\r\nAlright I\'ll see if I can track it and let ya know.\r\nEDIT: alright it is insured, and I have the receipt so if You don\'t get it tomorrow I\'ll contact the post office and see if they are sending it to the right address and all that, etc, but Yea it should come tomorrw.'),(28537,'c9efacc147','Alright, Glad to do biz-naz with Ya man, Thanks again for everything, I\'ll deff Hit Ya up for a paint job within a month after I get a GT-500 and modify to a certain extent, but I\'ll let Ya know when the time comes. Let me know if you need any other parts, and Thanks again.\r\nKorey'),(20394,'59065c6637','Thanks dude... Anything you decide on is cool with me.  take a black magic marker, and sign it. I\'m framing this bitch up...\r\n\r\nSteve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn Lake circle south Apt C\r\nSt. Petersburg FL 33712\r\n\r\nIf you need some $$ for S/H, just let me know.\r\n\r\nPeace.\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36106,'b297b2984f','Ok then let\'s do it!'),(27522,'aa3026875f','Nah, I\'m good.  I found the Trueno pullback at a British site, and got the last one.  It should be here in a week.\r\n\r\nI never was  much of a ZZ fan, except for their muscle car bodies, bits always looked more realistic to me, and my Purple NX motor probably goes faster on my bits than on the ZZ chassis like it was intended to.  Bits are lighter in weight than ZZ, right?\r\n\r\nI just got tore back with a smoke and a drink with my bro so I gotta bounce.  Drop a line when you feel the urge.\r\nLate,\r\nAbe'),(28064,'bbb6a3abbc','[quote:bbb6a3abbc=\"Mazda787b\"]Ok, well let me know what happens.  Actually, I will be strapping this into either a RC18, Xray M18T, or a Kyosho Mini777.  I am selling my Mini-T.  But I need the Rx for the XXX-T I am trading a custom Xmod Chassis for.  Infact, I originalyl created it to be used with a 280 motor (what a coincidence),  Thanks, I was going to order from BPP anyways, I just mainly do not want to order fro mRcmart, because they kill you with shipping.\r\n\r\nLet me know what hapens,\r\n\r\nMazda[/quote:bbb6a3abbc]\r\n\r\nMazda:\r\n\r\nI\'ve been ordering little things from them and their shipping no longer wants you to crawl under your bed and whimper.\r\n\r\n-Max'),(25668,'d79634c6b4','[quote:d79634c6b4=\"viperdout\"]Dave:\r\n\r\nCould you just wait and do the all Ns, unless cool\'s goes faster.  How much better is it fetted?\r\n\r\n-Max[/quote:d79634c6b4]In theory, ph2t\'s method should be more efficient, in real life there shouldn\'t be a noticable difference, except under the most extreme conditions.\r\n\r\nI\'m sorry if I misunderstood you, but I don\'t have Code\'s mod done yet. I was busy studying it last night.\r\n\r\nI\'m getting ready to do code\'s mod right now. ph2t asked me to do both, so we can compare how much voltage the gate is being hit with. So since I have the P-channel FETs right here, I\'m gonna go ahead and do that one now.\r\n\r\nI just had a guy pay me for 3 FET mods, so I\'m ordering a big batch of FETs right now. So if you want me to hold off, and do it ph2t\'s way, or whichevers best, I should have the extra N-channels by this weekend.\r\n\r\nWhen you ask how much better it is FETed, I have to ask if you ever had any FET modded bits? Because the difference we\'re are looking for here is the same, and that is to say, it is not necessarily faster, as much as it\'s more powerful. That\'s because there is more current flowing. What that means is we\'ll be able to run the Orange motor and gears, and have it accellerate instantly, and since in this case it\'s a monster, it should have more than enough power left over to climb hills.\r\n\r\nBecause the motors in these cars take so long to wind up, stock, we may never actually see the motors top speed, especially on a surface like carpet. That\'s why FET modded cars seem faster to people, because you\'re actually able to wind up the motor close to it\'s rated number. The RPM rating of a motor is with no load.\r\n\r\nSo let me know what you want to do, personally I prefer we wait until I know which way I\'m more comfortable with.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19212,'2d27193aea','[quote:2d27193aea=\"JDM-R34\"]Not trying to be a pest or anything on this website, but how come under my avatar it doesn\'t say anything like Bit Pimp or anything like other people? For example after so many posts it changes to Bit THugs, or Bit Ninja or eventually Bit Pimp like under Your avatar, Sorry for the trouble, just wondering, thanks Pimp :cool:[/quote:2d27193aea]It will say something like other people. you answered your own question pretty much. the title changes after so many posts.\r\nonly the moderators have the title \"bitPimp\".\r\nnew users start off with no title.'),(19213,'3828f9d900','Ok Man I was just wondering about that, thanks though,  :???:'),(19215,'bdb59beb00','Hey man, I will custom make you a monster bit or something along those lines for your Xmod you have listed in the swap meet forum.  I\'m just wanting to add a TRUE xmod (I made the XmoDRR) to my collection, and since you are putting it up for trade, I figured I would give you a shout.\r\n\r\n-=GfµnK=-'),(19216,'8687dab927','send sum pics of your custom monster bits');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37279,'4c6be1e2fa','I see you have a 11 tooth pinion in that spare parts box. \r\n\r\nI also see you may have some spare rear alloy purple axles. Do you have any extra alloy cups to go along with them?\r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt'),(21641,'cf4618825b','[quote:cf4618825b=\"hue35\"]... chicks have a way of playin\' dumbass AND getting away with it. [/quote:cf4618825b] They sure do, they sure do, but what are ya gonna do, you don\'t want to make a stink and blow your chance at sex. Women control the planet, don\'t ever forget that.\r\n\r\n[quote:cf4618825b]Shoot me yer new address and I\'ll get those discs off.\r\n\r\nlater[/quote:cf4618825b]Oh duh. See when I start talking about music, I forget everything else. :lol: \r\n\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n7002 W Indian School Rd.\r\nApt#1131\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033'),(21607,'c98b0df73f','I am CJ the keeper of the Xmods FAQ at CJ\'s Hobbies.net I also am now a dealer for Xmods Upgrade Parts.  I saw that you make upgrades.  Pleace contact me on CJ\'s Hobbies.net or CJ@cjshobbies.net .'),(19218,'8867f913db','We got one factor in our favor. Da Pimps know of our skliz and so do our US, German, Denmark &amp; Aussie counterparts. We are auctioning on BitPimps so I don\'t think we have to be too extreme.  I tellya, 80%-90% of our Pimps never go to eBay, I know I don\'t !  So I think we\'ll get a great response in Da Hood.  I would say do a couple of Extreme Micros, let me know what you need from me and it will be granted!   :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19222,'307b80bdf7','Well if you\'re lookin for an alternative to exhausts, use the ends of Ball Point pens.  I\'ve seen some do it and it looks damn good.'),(19228,'8b3b2aa000','Hey you know what? While I was busy typing about it, the package was actually sitting on my porch yesterday. I didn\'t notice until this morning.  :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\nGotta tell ya, I never had easy access to Precious clones. These are pretty nice, I dig the grey chassis. I don\'t have any 45mhz cars, and I don\'t have a Lancer either. So I\'m pretty sure that one\'s going in the permanent collection.\r\n\r\n\r\n...and you know, I\'m curious as to why your having me do all 49mhz chassis for you. I would have figured that you\'d want several frequencies FETed, to keep racing action fair, but that just my way of thinking I guess.\r\n\r\nOh and BTW, where did you get your suspension springs, I think I like those ones better than the ones that Superfly used.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I haven\'t got FETs yet. I accidently washed my last paycheck, and just now got my replacement. :roll:\r\n...but I will be ordering in the next couple days, so hopeully I\'ll have \'em by next week. I\'ll let you know when everything is all ready to go.\r\n\r\nDave'),(19224,'8687dab927','send sum pics of your custom monster bits');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19225,'294302ec5d','I will get some pics ASAP (tomorrow) to show you if possible.  The one monster bit I made was sent to a friend in a trade, so I will have to see if he can get pics online, but if you want, I could show you how I put large wheels on an SE, and I can also show you a pic of a 1:43/1:32 scale Off-roader I made.  Although it probably wouldn\'t be quite as big as the off-roader, but I could make one with similar working suspension for ya to trade for your Xmod.  Just please man, I\'m really interested, and I thank you alot for your time.\r\n\r\n-=GfµnK=-'),(19226,'09a44fc465','I\'m sorry if you recieve two PM\'s from me, but I\'m not sure if my first one sent, so I\'ll send another just incase.\r\n\r\nI will try to get the pics up ASAP sometime today or some of my creations.  I can show you something as simple as me putting larger lego wheels on my SE, to my completely custom ~1:32 scale off-roader dune buggy type thing.  I can probably make you something very similar to the off-roader thing, but a bit smaller than, using Bit electronics, but it should still work very nicely.  Thank you very much again for your time,\r\n\r\n-=GfµnK=-'),(24439,'4445ec8e22','aiight but I can\'t go with paypal, my dad is being dumb as usual. would you take an MO? And there prolly wouldn\'t be shipping, would there?\r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know! Thanks,\r\n\r\n~midget~');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19229,'19fe30f8f2','[quote:19fe30f8f2]Hey you know what? While I was busy typing about it, the package was actually sitting on my porch yesterday. I didn\'t notice until this morning.  [/quote:19fe30f8f2]\r\n[b:19fe30f8f2]Good!  I sent it 2 day delivery and was wondering if I needed to get a partial refund from the PO.[/b:19fe30f8f2]\r\n\r\n[quote:19fe30f8f2]Gotta tell ya, I never had easy access to Precious clones. These are pretty nice, I dig the grey chassis. I don\'t have any 45mhz cars, and I don\'t have a Lancer either. So I\'m pretty sure that one\'s going in the permanent collection[/quote:19fe30f8f2]. \r\n[b:19fe30f8f2]Not to worry, right now they\'re readily available right now.  Let me know what bodies you don\'t have and want.  I probably have \'em in [i:19fe30f8f2]Da Body Bag. [/i:19fe30f8f2] Also any frequencies, I think they come in 27, 35, 45, 49 and body styles are Celica, Accord Wagon, SkyLine GTR, RX7, EVO, and I think they have a WRX.  So if you\'re gonna keep the EVO and you\'re gonna send me one back that I said I would replace, that just leaves you with one for the auction. I\'ll send you some more (personal &amp; auction) just let me know what freq &amp; model you want.  I\'m probably going out there tomorrow so hit me back today/night if possible. [/b:19fe30f8f2]\r\n\r\n[quote:19fe30f8f2]...and you know, I\'m curious as to why your having me do all 49mhz chassis for you. I would have figured that you\'d want several frequencies FETed, to keep racing action fair, but that just my way of thinking I guess[/quote:19fe30f8f2]. \r\n[b:19fe30f8f2]I bought all my MicroSizers &amp; ZipZaps in 49mhz, and Lil Matrix in 27mhz. Now I do have clones &amp; Tomy\'s in various freq.[/b:19fe30f8f2]\r\n\r\n[quote:19fe30f8f2]Oh and BTW, where did you get your suspension springs, I think I like those ones better than the ones that Superfly used. [/quote:19fe30f8f2]\r\n[b:19fe30f8f2]They\'re stock MicroSizers, nothing special.[/b:19fe30f8f2]\r\n\r\n[quote:19fe30f8f2]Anyways, I haven\'t got FETs yet. I accidently washed my last paycheck, and just now got my replacement.  \r\n...but I will be ordering in the next couple days, so hopeully I\'ll have \'em by next week. I\'ll let you know when everything is all ready to go. [/quote:19fe30f8f2]\r\n[b:19fe30f8f2]Thanx Pimp[/b:19fe30f8f2]   :cool:'),(19230,'2e1581bf9f','Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nI\'ll be goin out to[b:2e1581bf9f] 5Below [/b:2e1581bf9f]probably tomorrow so here\'s the deal.\r\n\r\nThey come in the following frequecies:\r\n[b:2e1581bf9f]27mhz, 35mhz, 45mhz, 49mhz[/b:2e1581bf9f]\r\nAnd body styles are:\r\n[b:2e1581bf9f]Celica, Accord Wagon, SkyLine GTR, RX7, EVO, and I think they have a WRX[/b:2e1581bf9f].\r\n\r\nLet me know what you want by COB (LOL) or tonight.  I\'ll be working on that 2nd one for the auction. Just waitin for Big Spooky\'s (Nox) decals to come.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19231,'19fe30f8f2','[quote:19fe30f8f2]Hey you know what? While I was busy typing about it, the package was actually sitting on my porch yesterday. I didn\'t notice until this morning.  [/quote:19fe30f8f2]\r\n[b:19fe30f8f2]Good!  I sent it 2 day delivery and was wondering if I needed to get a partial refund from the PO.[/b:19fe30f8f2]\r\n\r\n[quote:19fe30f8f2]Gotta tell ya, I never had easy access to Precious clones. These are pretty nice, I dig the grey chassis. I don\'t have any 45mhz cars, and I don\'t have a Lancer either. So I\'m pretty sure that one\'s going in the permanent collection[/quote:19fe30f8f2]. \r\n[b:19fe30f8f2]Not to worry, right now they\'re readily available right now.  Let me know what bodies you don\'t have and want.  I probably have \'em in [i:19fe30f8f2]Da Body Bag. [/i:19fe30f8f2] Also any frequencies, I think they come in 27, 35, 45, 49 and body styles are Celica, Accord Wagon, SkyLine GTR, RX7, EVO, and I think they have a WRX.  So if you\'re gonna keep the EVO and you\'re gonna send me one back that I said I would replace, that just leaves you with one for the auction. I\'ll send you some more (personal &amp; auction) just let me know what freq &amp; model you want.  I\'m probably going out there tomorrow so hit me back today/night if possible. [/b:19fe30f8f2]\r\n\r\n[quote:19fe30f8f2]...and you know, I\'m curious as to why your having me do all 49mhz chassis for you. I would have figured that you\'d want several frequencies FETed, to keep racing action fair, but that just my way of thinking I guess[/quote:19fe30f8f2]. \r\n[b:19fe30f8f2]I bought all my MicroSizers &amp; ZipZaps in 49mhz, and Lil Matrix in 27mhz. Now I do have clones &amp; Tomy\'s in various freq.[/b:19fe30f8f2]\r\n\r\n[quote:19fe30f8f2]Oh and BTW, where did you get your suspension springs, I think I like those ones better than the ones that Superfly used. [/quote:19fe30f8f2]\r\n[b:19fe30f8f2]They\'re stock MicroSizers, nothing special.[/b:19fe30f8f2]\r\n\r\n[quote:19fe30f8f2]Anyways, I haven\'t got FETs yet. I accidently washed my last paycheck, and just now got my replacement.  \r\n...but I will be ordering in the next couple days, so hopeully I\'ll have \'em by next week. I\'ll let you know when everything is all ready to go. [/quote:19fe30f8f2]\r\n[b:19fe30f8f2]Thanx Pimp[/b:19fe30f8f2]   :cool:'),(20114,'94283d3e73','I\'m savin up some $$$');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20116,'58fe747ac7','wuts ur problem man'),(20113,'2658e36772','[quote:2658e36772]SpongeBob rules![/quote:2658e36772]\r\n\r\nhaha.....NOOOO\r\n\r\nDragonBall GT= ultimate cartoon\r\n\r\n=P'),(19584,'4959b7fcb3','Holy shit! The Dirtbombs!! Man, that is some fuuuunnn shit. They remind me of Wilson Pickett in the gutter on speed. When the Stevie Wonder song played, I was beltin\' it out while doin\' some dishes... that\'s one of my favorite tunes of his (Livin\' for the City).\r\n\r\nThanks, man.. I should be mailin\' some stuff tomorrow or Saturday.'),(19585,'38c6804dd1','Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nI\'m interested in 3 of your VW Bus bodies.  Black/Milk, and any color you pick (They\'re getting painted anyways!!!)\r\n\r\nPop me your address.........\r\n\r\n\r\nThanx Man!'),(19233,'c12f60788b','[quote:c12f60788b]\r\n[b:c12f60788b]Not to worry, right now they\'re readily available right now.  Let me know what bodies you don\'t have and want.  I probably have \'em in [i:c12f60788b]Da Body Bag. [/i:c12f60788b] Also any frequencies, I think they come in 27, 35, 45, 49 and body styles are Celica, Accord Wagon, SkyLine GTR, RX7, EVO, and I think they have a WRX.  So if you\'re gonna keep the EVO and you\'re gonna send me one back that I said I would replace, that just leaves you with one for the auction. I\'ll send you some more (personal &amp; auction) just let me know what freq &amp; model you want.  I\'m probably going out there tomorrow so hit me back today/night if possible. [/b:c12f60788b][/quote:c12f60788b] Well actually the EVO, is probably the only original bit body I don\'t have, and 45mhz was the only frequency I don\'t have, so that\'s why this car called to me. So now it don\'t really matter\r\n\r\n[quote:c12f60788b] \r\n[b:c12f60788b]I bought all my MicroSizers &amp; ZipZaps in 49mhz, and Lil Matrix in 27mhz. Now I do have clones &amp; Tomy\'s in various freq.[/b:c12f60788b][/quote:c12f60788b]Oh well, now that makes sense, you already have a designated racing buddy, but now poor lil\' Matrix is gonna wonder why your cars keep dusting him off.  :lol: \r\n\r\n[quote:c12f60788b]\r\n[b:c12f60788b]They\'re stock MicroSizers, nothing special.[/b:c12f60788b][/quote:c12f60788b]No but they are special. :lol: \r\nSeriously, one of the booster chassis has gold springs on it.\r\n\r\n[quote:c12f60788b][b:c12f60788b]Thanx Pimp[/b:c12f60788b]   :cool:[/quote:c12f60788b]No probs, man.  :-)  \r\n\r\nDave'),(19234,'f023ef3a6b','[quote:f023ef3a6b]No but they are special.  \r\nSeriously, one of the booster chassis has gold springs on it. [/quote:f023ef3a6b]\r\nThat\'s right, I got those from RCMod a long time ago, I forgot I had put them on   :roll: \r\n\r\nYou can go ahead and use that body, I\'ll send you a Real (MS) EVO !  I think I have one in Da Body Bag.  I\'ll kit &amp; prime it for U to paint. Do you have a Supra!  These chassis will not for MS or other bodies without modifications.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19235,'f023ef3a6b','[quote:f023ef3a6b]No but they are special.  \r\nSeriously, one of the booster chassis has gold springs on it. [/quote:f023ef3a6b]\r\nThat\'s right, I got those from RCMod a long time ago, I forgot I had put them on   :roll: \r\n\r\nYou can go ahead and use that body, I\'ll send you a Real (MS) EVO !  I think I have one in Da Body Bag.  I\'ll kit &amp; prime it for U to paint. Do you have a Supra!  These chassis will not for MS or other bodies without modifications.'),(19237,'2e1581bf9f','Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nI\'ll be goin out to[b:2e1581bf9f] 5Below [/b:2e1581bf9f]probably tomorrow so here\'s the deal.\r\n\r\nThey come in the following frequecies:\r\n[b:2e1581bf9f]27mhz, 35mhz, 45mhz, 49mhz[/b:2e1581bf9f]\r\nAnd body styles are:\r\n[b:2e1581bf9f]Celica, Accord Wagon, SkyLine GTR, RX7, EVO, and I think they have a WRX[/b:2e1581bf9f].\r\n\r\nLet me know what you want by COB (LOL) or tonight.  I\'ll be working on that 2nd one for the auction. Just waitin for Big Spooky\'s (Nox) decals to come.'),(19239,'a37073dd08','[quote:a37073dd08=\"DarkTari\"]Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nI\'ll be goin out to[b:a37073dd08] 5Below [/b:a37073dd08]probably tomorrow so here\'s the deal.\r\n\r\nThey come in the following frequecies:\r\n[b:a37073dd08]27mhz, 35mhz, 45mhz, 49mhz[/b:a37073dd08]\r\nAnd body styles are:\r\n[b:a37073dd08]Celica, Accord Wagon, SkyLine GTR, RX7, EVO, and I think they have a WRX[/b:a37073dd08].\r\n\r\nLet me know what you want by COB (LOL) or tonight.  I\'ll be working on that 2nd one for the auction. Just waitin for Big Spooky\'s (Nox) decals to come.[/quote:a37073dd08]a somewhat off-freq. would probably be cool (I\'m guessing most people who might buy have the typical 27 and 49)\r\n\r\nI like the Skyline bodies, but whatever you come up with is completely fine.\r\n\r\nthanks DT :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19240,'bd526fff37','[quote:bd526fff37=\"DarkTari\"]Do you have a Supra! [/quote:bd526fff37] Yeah, I gots my stealth flamed one, the spare orange body, and now Superfly\'s. 8-) \r\n\r\nI was actually thinking of doing up my spare orange one for the auction.\r\n\r\n[quote:bd526fff37] These chassis will not for MS or other bodies without modifications.[/quote:bd526fff37]Ahh man, I hadn\'t noticed. \r\n\r\nWell as long as the wheel base lines up (which it does) we\'re in business.'),(19241,'c0f2b12c20','Hey man. Sorry I haven\'t gotten that bB shell out to you yet... I have been super busy trying to get my shit together with home and family issues and haven\'t had the chance to send it... it is set aside and I WILL be sending it sometime soon... I have your address saved in my inbox, and when I get the chance, it will be on its way.'),(19242,'09a44fc465','I\'m sorry if you recieve two PM\'s from me, but I\'m not sure if my first one sent, so I\'ll send another just incase.\r\n\r\nI will try to get the pics up ASAP sometime today or some of my creations.  I can show you something as simple as me putting larger lego wheels on my SE, to my completely custom ~1:32 scale off-roader dune buggy type thing.  I can probably make you something very similar to the off-roader thing, but a bit smaller than, using Bit electronics, but it should still work very nicely.  Thank you very much again for your time,\r\n\r\n-=GfµnK=-'),(19243,'07b6f9b0bc','Sorry to PM you again, but I brought a pic.  Unfortunatly today was busier than I thought it was going to be, and I\'ve got a party to go to, so I could only grab a pic of a previous monster bit, but for yours it will have larger tires, as well as  some custom chassis upgrades, like awesome off-road suspension, and a few super-strong Brass parts.  Here ya go man: [img:07b6f9b0bc]http://users.adams.net/~dbuss/pics/monsterbit1.jpg[/img:07b6f9b0bc]\r\n\r\nTalk to ya later, and thanks again for your time and patience.\r\n\r\n-=GfµnK=-');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19244,'01d572d83f','That was a good idea gathering the FET info in the Faq.  8-) \r\n\r\nThanks for the reccomendation over in that one thread too.\r\n\r\nI\'m still planning to do that SE tutorial, I\'m just trying to get my head clear. Lots of BS going on in my life right now, got me all confused about things, but I think I\'m getting back on track now.\r\n\r\nGot a pile of cars here that DT sent me, for me to do up for him and the auction cars. Made me realize I gotta get back on track. I\'m gonna be orderin\' more FETs tonight, end of the month is here, so my wife can stall me no more. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, I\'ll let you know when I\'m set to go on the FET situation, and thanks for the props lately. I know I\'ve been moody, but don\'t worry, it\'s nothing to do with any of you guys.\r\n\r\nDave'),(19245,'07b6f9b0bc','Sorry to PM you again, but I brought a pic.  Unfortunatly today was busier than I thought it was going to be, and I\'ve got a party to go to, so I could only grab a pic of a previous monster bit, but for yours it will have larger tires, as well as  some custom chassis upgrades, like awesome off-road suspension, and a few super-strong Brass parts.  Here ya go man: [img:07b6f9b0bc]http://users.adams.net/~dbuss/pics/monsterbit1.jpg[/img:07b6f9b0bc]\r\n\r\nTalk to ya later, and thanks again for your time and patience.\r\n\r\n-=GfµnK=-'),(20134,'e3199299d3','[quote:e3199299d3=\"Da Big Kahuna\"]Hey Cabo,\r\n\r\nI haven\'t heard from JAC4412 to get his address.  Do you have it ?[/quote:e3199299d3]he never gave it to me, but I do have an address from the envelope he sent with his $.\r\nwe should maybe just confirm the address with him still though just to be safe.\r\nlet me know if you want the address from the envelope.\r\nI can\'t get it tonight, it\'s locked up in the same room my wife is sleeping in lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34563,'8daf24fcc1','[quote:8daf24fcc1=\"crazydave\"]Figures, there\'s always some smart ass. :-) \r\n\r\nThat\'s alright, never saw that movie anyways.  \r\n\r\nThat was a good one, Bilbo just sucks. You\'ll stump them next time... yeah right, huh. :lol: \r\n\r\nSidenote: Notice how Bilbo always lurks around, and then suddenly posts when there booty to be won, he just likes to win stuff. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:8daf24fcc1]\r\nTotally noticed that. lol\r\nIt\'s gonna get hard to stump everyone.\r\nPost about Star Trek, somebodies a Trekkie. Post about the price of fruit in Peurto Rico, somebodies a human trafficer. You know the same old story. :lol:'),(31307,'506d133448','Hi:\r\n\r\nI just noticed that you were from Westchester, and was curious where, since my dad lives in White Plains.\r\n\r\n-Max'),(31309,'98ce100465','Hye, i seen your post about Under Glow, well i have 4 Diff types of LED\'s i use for headlights. White/Amber/Red/Blue, i can make you headlights, and underglow BUT i don\'t have a bit and don\'t know if these headlights would fit as underglow. Unless you drill the bottom of the bit and put them there.  :-o'),(28544,'f300032405','Not sure yet, the Celica fit the best because of the high back. If I use a truck body almost all of the rear end will be missing.  Ok so I am all ears on your suggestions.  let me know if you have any of those ZZford 150 bodies.  I just need it for a mod on my ZZMT');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37419,'cad56e0a78','Hey CD,\r\nThat was a great write up on the DC mod for the SE.  I have been out of micros for the past 2 years cuz life got a little busy for me, otherwise I would have been all over that.  It seems that the 1/64 enthusiasm has dwindled, and RS is downsizing ZZs all together.  I don\'t ever see Codesuide on any of the sites.  I\'m getting off subject, I just wanted to ask if you still had that vid of the DC showdown and if you could send it to me.  If you can\'t send through the site or y listed email, rctapia@gmail.com should be able to receive a pretty big file.  thanks in advance man, I love your work.'),(37425,'6aad905e64','Went out today. :-o'),(37449,'8e218c6ca7','Heres a description of my experiences with the servo,\r\n\r\nTurn full left, lot of noise no movement\r\n\r\nTurn full right lots of noise some movement to the right, not much.'),(37929,'34d9d5ff3e','[quote:34d9d5ff3e=\"steelwoolghandi\"][quote:34d9d5ff3e=\"SuperFly\"]I realize I said I would paypal you $30, but I forgot about shipping. If ya feel like you can trust me, you can package it up and mail it, and just tell me how much postage was and I\'ll paypal ya that amount. However you want to do it is cool with me.[/quote:34d9d5ff3e]\r\n\r\nI trust ya but I can send it for $4.00 if that sounds fair I will try and drum up some Crystals if I can find them and send them along. \r\n\r\nplease send your address and I will get it out monday. \r\n\r\noh and my paypal is my email airo@ev1.net \r\n\r\nthanks man hope ya like the Epoch I know I like them a ton! :grin:[/quote:34d9d5ff3e]\r\n\r\nSounds good. Are the crystals the same size as mini-z/xmod crystals? If so, don\'t worry about it, I have extras.\r\n\r\nWhat body is on it btw? Any other details?\r\n\r\nGreg Maffei\r\nGrey Matter\r\n431 NW Flanders, #203\r\nPortland, Oregon 97209'),(31138,'b0da405def','Nah man, I can\'t get even close to that right now. Thanks, though... that sounds like a great deal for all you\'re talkin\' about, but it\'s just too rich for my blood... I think you have even more than I thought you had... the more I think about it, I should just stick with my last offer.\r\n\r\nLet me know if that\'s all good (my final list for $125, shipped... I\'ll paste it below), then give me your PayPal info, and I\'ll pay you right away.\r\n\r\nThanks again man, and sorry I couldn\'t take it all, but damn dude, you\'ve got a ton of stuff!  :lol: \r\n\r\nhue35\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhere\'s that list again...\r\n\r\n\r\nsilver supra 45mhz $15 \r\nred enzo ferrari 40a mhz $15 \r\nskyline history set 35mhz $15 \r\nferrari special set f40, testarrossa and 512bb 40b mhz $25 \r\nspecial edition pennzoil skyline 27mhz $15 \r\n\r\nyellow lambo/red ferrari 27c $8 \r\nblack lambo/silver ferrari 27a $8 \r\n\r\nDome Zero $3 \r\n\r\nMini Heart Mini Cooper sets: \r\nwhite $10 \r\ndark green $10 \r\nwhite w/blue police light on roof $10 \r\n\r\nQTY 1 200mah battery $1.50 \r\nQTY 1 160mah battery $.75 \r\nQTY 4 perfection 3.8 motor $2ea \r\nperfection heatsinks - QTY 2 black, QTY 2 gold, QTY 1 silver $.50ea \r\nQTY 3 perfection 4.2 motor $2ea');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37428,'64b2b12c8c','Just fuckin with ya. :-) \r\n\r\nI\'ve got no idea who she is but am searching the friggen net for her like every day. :('),(35080,'2411cc020a','Hey man whats up?? \r\nI have a favor to ask I have a picture and I would love to have a wallpaper made of it, If I email you a picture of it could you make me one? \r\n\r\nthanks\r\nAaron\r\nSWG'),(37409,'5d41b32c4f','[quote:5d41b32c4f=\"sg219\"]Bird has two sets he\'s willing to trade.  I\'m going over there tonight to pick them up.\r\n\r\nHe was wondering about some of the decals like you sent me.  He\'s not picky.  He said to be creative when trading.  (catch my drift?) :wink: \r\n\r\nI\'ll send them out sometime in the next couple of days. :-o[/quote:5d41b32c4f]\r\n\r\n\r\nwill do man do you want me to send my creativity to you or to bird? just let me know. I am on the road right now (selling) but when I get back will send some creativity out!\r\n\r\nthanks man!\r\n\r\nAaron'),(35083,'3cf435aecc','Sessiz I just wanted to ask you a quick question if it\'s ok...\r\n\r\nI read a few of your previous posts mostly on the Xmod vs MiniZ discussion. Now I understand you have Xmods so your view on this might be biased, but my question to you is, is an Xmod worth buying to race against other 1/28th scale RC.\r\n\r\nI realize the price difference, the hop up parts and all other issues. But by experience with your post detialing how Miniz were beating you at first but then with some hop ups and a little fix you went back and kit the HSboys ass lol...\r\n\r\nI ask you this because I am deciding to take the plunge into 1/28th scale. Now I am already in 1/10th and Micro. 1/10th is just a money pit for me, but none the less I love it. I love the racing feel, the hop ups and most of all the Tamiya Chassis. This is what I am wishing for in the 1/28th scale as well. \r\n\r\nShould I hunt around for a Evo Xmod, or even an older Xmod (by the way you know of any lying around for a good price?) or do you think I should hop on the Mini Z wagon and send my grocery store checks right to Kyosho lmao...\r\n\r\nTry and get back to me I\'d greatly appreciate it. \r\n\r\nPeace; Sam...');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37555,'7d3965772c','Your body will ship out first thing in the morning.\r\nthanks\r\nAaron\r\nSWG  :-)'),(37556,'0ea3915829','I might have just two different pcb boards for you...I belive one is a 45, I will check 2morrow, what are you willing to trade for it?'),(37872,'ab2aa352b2','...alright \r\n\r\nWhat\'s your email I will snap a few of the bodies and send em 2morrow...cool?'),(37790,'b950da30e3','I\'m shipping yours out tomorrow(payday)I was a little short on cash, so It should get to you around Friday or Saturday. Thanks again!'),(27215,'95aeef71f8','hey i was wondering if you could send me the iwaver servo to this address if you can\r\n\r\nC. Ladd-Viti\r\nUniversity of California\r\n109 Cesar Chavez Center\r\nBerkeley, California  94720\r\n\r\nThanks 8-)'),(37370,'9a3e0d4d66','Yo Pimp!  You\'re our Admin, that\'s why I put &quot;Us Mods&quot; in quotes.  You have enough on your plate so we\'ll take care of it, those that step up that is .  I sure hope we don\'t have a lotta fuckin conflict with this.  I think it ran rather smuth last year and I don\'t want to fuck with the process......\r\nIf It Ain\'t Broke.... :???:'),(37372,'f3a2d07719','[quote:f3a2d07719=\"DarkTari\"]Yo Pimp!  You\'re our Admin, that\'s why I put &quot;Us Mods&quot; in quotes.  You have enough on your plate so we\'ll take care of it, those that step up that is .  I sure hope we don\'t have a lotta fuckin conflict with this.  I think it ran rather smuth last year and I don\'t want to fuck with the process......\r\nIf It Ain\'t Broke.... :???:[/quote:f3a2d07719]\r\nYea I hear ya.\r\nI\'ve got a controller I\'ve been wanting to paint in bitPimps colors, basically just to finish off the rattle cans. lol\r\nSo I might be able to help out a little here and there.\r\n\r\nKinda funny, I get the feeling the guys almost disappear when we post stuff like that.\r\nI don\'t know why. It\'s not like we force them to do anything one way or the other.\r\nIt\'s okay if someone doesn\'t want to participate - just say so instead of hiding until it\'s all over ya know? :lol: \r\n\r\nAh well. I\'m not worried. We\'ll get through it one way or another.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37373,'','hey did u no that u could take the rear end of another mt and glue it to the rear end of another and make it 6 wheel drive.    what did u use for the rear end of the hummer 6 wheel?'),(34127,'238323350e','im not a fucking retard. Do you like my crawler project.'),(34128,'c4d883936c','[quote:c4d883936c=\"Chrome\"]you\'re the real deal; a fucking retard who has no idea he\'s retarded.[/quote:c4d883936c]\r\n\r\n[quote:c4d883936c=\"SHAUN\"]im not a fucking retard. Do you like my crawler project.[/quote:c4d883936c]\r\n\r\nI rest my case.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(34938,'42ca51a769','[quote:42ca51a769=\"Maxximum Attack\"]jump in the chat urgent![/quote:42ca51a769]\r\n\r\nSorry, looks like I missed you again, lol. I had the chat window closed.lol\r\n\r\nWhat was the auction? Sounds exciting, but bummin\' if ya didn\'t win it.\r\nI know what ya mean by too expensive.  :grin: \r\n\r\nLater'),(33064,'3d61fa3244','[quote:3d61fa3244=\"MotorGong\"][quote:3d61fa3244=\"Tuner1989\"]Great pics\r\n\r\nhttp://s6.invisionfree.com/Infernal_XMOD/index.php?showtopic=6779\r\n\r\n\r\nPrintout of the skus for all the new stuff i made\r\n\r\n http://s6.invisionfree.com/Infernal_XMOD/index.php?showtopic=6730\r\n\r\nAtomic mods review of the new chassis\r\n\r\nhttp://www.atomicmods.com/projects/Evo%20Xmod/Evo_Xmod.htm\r\n\r\n\r\nUnder this general discussion there is alot of informative topics and pics of the new xmods \r\n\r\nhttp://s6.invisionfree.com/Infernal_XMOD/index.php?showforum=4\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHope this helped :-) \r\n\r\n---Matt[/quote:3d61fa3244]\r\n\r\n\r\nWow, man!!!!\r\nThanks a helluva Lot!!!!!\r\nI was going to get an x-mod like 2 months ago. \r\nPeople like you saved me from buying one now, so I can get one of these new ones. :-o \r\n\r\nHelped? you put the answers and pics right on my plate!!\r\n\r\nI love you, and no I\'m not gay! :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\nThanks again.....Dave[/quote:3d61fa3244]\r\n\r\n\r\nRofl lol no problem nam anythime!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35951,'ba687856ca','Well, its not the hardest project ive ever done but i wouldnt say its the easiest either..Harder than changing out motors, wheels, and gears but if you dont rush it and take some time to do it right it isnt that difficult.. its really hard to say when i dont have much of an idea as to what your skill level is...Ill try to get some more info for you so you can figure out if its right for you\r\n\r\nSTG'),(32830,'0ac83d570a','Nice to hear from a local.  I never really went looking for anybody around here that\'s into these.  \r\n\r\nI\'ve got 3 ZZ-M, a 1st &amp; 3rd gen SE, several base ZZ, 3-4 MS, 2 MotorWorks cars, Motorworks boat, bunch of bullet clones...  I need to do a group photo of my shit, not sure what all I\'ve got anymore. \r\n\r\nWhat do you think of the SuperBit?  I\'ve heard mixed reviews.'),(33019,'2279869f6c','Hey cj, are you gonna get back to me on the status of my order or what??? :-) I just wanted to know if it was shipped and the address it was shipped to.... lordhelmetr342003@yahoo.com is my e-mail. Get back to me when you get a chance. thanks....later\r\n\r\n :-o'),(29311,'556c08ba00','money sent. I rounded up. Thanks!\r\n\r\noh, just in case, my shipping address:\r\n\r\nGreg Maffei\r\nGrey Matter\r\n431 NW Flanders, #203\r\nPortland, Oregon 97209');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28712,'e74ab17dd7','CD,\r\n\r\nHaven\'t forgotten about this, just too much going on right now. It will be probably end of April before I can get anything ordered. Having to get a \"new\" car, and not having much luck in my price range. Anyway, I\'m not on here much any more. No disrespect to BP, but I check R7R almost every day now, and not BP. You might look for me over there if you\'re ever at R7R.\r\n\r\nI know she has all the Perfection bodies available, JGTC, VW\'s, Lambo\'s, 512BB\'s, Modenas, pretty much all of them. When I eventually am able to, I\'ll let you know and have her send whatever you want. I\'ll send you a detailed list later.\r\n\r\nYo,\r\n\r\nmg'),(26241,'49f989bdf9','[quote:49f989bdf9=\"hogjowlz\"]lol sorry dude actually i have a cuda body untouched you can have ill even throw in the challenger. i need your address again.[/quote:49f989bdf9]\r\n\r\nSend it to my work address.\r\n\r\nAttn: Bill J. Wilson\r\nMJI Photo\r\n1209 Walnut Street\r\nPhiladelphia, Pa 19107\r\n267-671-9250'),(26633,'aab0ed2da2','i dont noo...... hey happe birthday  :D  we dont have a fuck of micro rc\'s or eny of that  :sad:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (23522,'4c9573159b','[quote:4c9573159b=\"KaNye\"]Since Im sending you stuff I might as well ask if you have any alloy wheels (pics?) or even possibly a Humvee body for Bits that I could buy off you?\r\n\r\nIm not usually one to buy off the net so when I do I want to get every thing I can. Doesnt hurt to ask.\r\n\r\nThanks pimp.[/quote:4c9573159b]No Humvee body. I do have a set of alloys I might possibly sell, but I don\'t don\'t I was just thinking about digging them out and using them again.\r\n\r\nDave'),(23830,'d4526582f2','Have they arrived yet?'),(23831,'41539efa74','[quote:41539efa74=\"KaNye\"]Have they arrived yet?[/quote:41539efa74]Yep. Just walked in the door with them.\r\n\r\nI forgot to ask the frequencies. 27mhz boosters are the one frequency I don\'t have, but luckily for you I got another guy\'s booster car here with his 27mhz controller. I\'ll have to stall him for a couple days, so I can borrow his controller. :lol: \r\n\r\nI\'ll try my best to get them out by next monday.\r\n\r\ndave'),(28337,'cbc386e7a9','[quote:cbc386e7a9=\"micro_man\"]sounds good to me , i\'ll take the whole deal the body and the car and tx . i can pay some time next week , this week my dad is to busy to go to the bank and mess with paypal . but $30  plus shipping is good , thanks i\'ll let you know when i can transfer the funds , later . \r\n\r\nmatt[/quote:cbc386e7a9]\r\n\r\nJust let me know when. :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19252,'b2d0eb5d55','[quote:b2d0eb5d55]Have you heard any late 60\'s, early 70\'s Zappa? Hot Rats (\'69) and Over-Nite Sensation (\'73)? Those records are less \"funny\" and are the ones I was thinking you\'d dig. They have way more grit within the complexity and are a different thing altogether than the 80\'s stuff... the Joe\'s Garage era is so slick, that I would assume right off the bat, it ain\'t your bag.[/quote:b2d0eb5d55]You ever boggled over something half your life, then all at once, someone says something that just makes you say, \"D\'oh\"?\r\n\r\nI should have figured that. Now in retrospect I\'m not sure why everyone kept pushing Joe\'s Garage on me. It didn\'t take you very long to figure out that\'s not my style.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:b2d0eb5d55]The only stuff I\'ve heard from that scene (if I\'m even close) is the Gories...[/quote:b2d0eb5d55]One of my all time favorite bands features the former singer of the Gories, and the Horrors. (If I\'m not mistaken). Anyways The Dirtbombs is something I\'m definately sending you now. They\'re like a fuzzed out, buzz bomb variation of Motown. Way Cool.\r\n\r\n\r\nOh yeah, and now that I\'m getting to listen to the Big Boys in my own enviroment, iI\'m digging the hell out of these guys. They are rapidly becoming one of my all time favorites.\r\n\r\n\"No\" and \"Let\'s play God\" are couple more standouts, but I\'m really getting off on \"I Do Care\". The whole, \"I don\'t care, I do care\" back and forth thing precisely sums up how I\'ve been feeling about work, life and everything lately. Then just to put over the top, I love the harmonic thing the guitar player is doing.\r\n\r\nI like stuff where the guitar is just kinda flowing in between a bass line with a strong groove. I should turn you on to some Jesus Lizard, and Shellac, so you know what I\'m talking about, with that.\r\nDave'),(19253,'880751231b','Cool, I\'ll be sendin\' some early Zappa records in the near future.. I might just cherry pick a discs-worth of songs from that era. I\'ll think about that.\r\n\r\nI\'ve heard of The Dirtbombs (only from reading about the Gories).. that\'s definitely some shit I\'d love to hear.  \"buzz bomb variation of Motown\" is all I need to hear... I\'m way curious now.\r\n\r\nJesus Lizard is another band I\'ve always been curious about. I\'ve known a few people over the years that were fanatical over those dudes... they always talked big about the live shows... anyway, I\'ve never heard any.\r\n\r\nShellac is a thing I dig quite a bit, I\'ve heard most of it and like it a lot. I\'ve only heard a little bit of Big Black, but I like Shellac much better... either way, I have a lot of respect for Steve Albini.\r\n\r\nI\'m glad you dig the Big Boys as much as I do... they are one of the few bands I can just listen to over and over. There\'s always a song in the mix that speaks to my current mood or phase of life.\r\n\r\nlater,\r\nMat');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (30158,'9a6a7dc2d7','Cool man, I will ship it out in the next day or two. Glad I can help a pimp out. Let me know when you get it.'),(21602,'e0a9e7438b','I\'m not sure about the colors, but I know that www.rcmart.com has a lot of stuff. I deal with them all the time for Mini-Z\'s. They are good to deal with. Shipping is a little high though.\r\n\r\nAlso try www.rcxmini.com , www.stellamodels.net , and www.horizonhobby.com . Of course, there\'s ebay too. ;)\r\n\r\nMike'),(28446,'3692aa2929','that\'s great you found the spring. Here is a picture of what I will send you.  It will be a panther car 45mhz. I will ship it with the drip car body on it and place it back in it\'s container. I will try to ship it tomorrow, but I am not sure I will make it in time, I will let you know. I am goin to use usmail regular mail with confermation.  This will arrive in three days like priority mail.  let me know if you have any questions \r\n\r\n\r\n[img:3692aa2929]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10037/zzmt%20trade.jpg[/img:3692aa2929]'),(28447,'2b3362f0e2','Hey,\r\nThats cool, Your giving me a controller too? Thats cool i wasn\'t expecting that, I don\'t have the controller for the MT though... :???: umm let\'s see, well here\'s a pic though of everything, one last shot, oh yeah my address is on that padded envelope it\'s just cut off, out of the picture, and I\'ll try to get over to the post office tomorrow, and I\'ll probably do the same type of shipping as You, I\'ll keep You up to date on everything, such as when I ship out the MT stuff.\r\n[img:2b3362f0e2]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10039/DSC00793.JPG[/img:2b3362f0e2]\r\nThe small stuff such as springs and washers, steering spring etc. is in the small bag, can\'t really see them though from that pic.\r\nThanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35629,'f7b18cd91c','I\'m about a half hour north of White Plains'),(35630,'f7b18cd91c','I\'m about a half hour north of White Plains'),(35631,'48170b9cd9','Ah, ok.'),(37784,'b950da30e3','I\'m shipping yours out tomorrow(payday)I was a little short on cash, so It should get to you around Friday or Saturday. Thanks again!'),(28369,'a04b1dd81b','I can afford the $40 but I cant afford to send the MO express.\r\n\r\nDid you get the first one? If i send another one It will take forever.\r\nNOTE: I can afford it but i cant get it there quickly cuz express here is US$22. That\'s Expensive. I\'me very interested tho. Can\'t I wait till i recieve the first set?\r\n\r\nMaxx'),(30066,'3366bebcb9','hi swg my address is \r\n\r\nmatthew evink\r\n25085 cr388\r\ngobels Mi 49055\r\n\r\nthanks , i realy needed a bit or clone , i have a few custom bodys in the works and needed somethin to drive it around on .'),(35060,'6cd8b7695d','No prob pimp! I am more into micros, but the 1/24th scale cars are a lot of fun! Post pixs of your track! I wanna see it! :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (27851,'55390f8962','cool thanks for helping me out , later  :-)'),(27852,'55390f8962','cool thanks for helping me out , later  :-)'),(23521,'766b303b58','Since Im sending you stuff I might as well ask if you have any alloy wheels (pics?) or even possibly a Humvee body for Bits that I could buy off you?\r\n\r\nIm not usually one to buy off the net so when I do I want to get every thing I can. Doesnt hurt to ask.\r\n\r\nThanks pimp.'),(19256,'e0fd368f31','[quote:e0fd368f31=\"hue35\"]Cool, I\'ll be sendin\' some early Zappa records in the near future.. I might just cherry pick a discs-worth of songs from that era. I\'ll think about that.[/quote:e0fd368f31]That\'ll be cool either way. I\'m looking forward to finally understanding Zappa.\r\n\r\n[quote:e0fd368f31]I\'ve heard of The Dirtbombs (only from reading about the Gories).. that\'s definitely some shit I\'d love to hear.  \"buzz bomb variation of Motown\" is all I need to hear... I\'m way curious now.[/quote:e0fd368f31]If that\'s all you needed, then you\'re gonna love this, because that about sums it up, kind of a Hendrix meets Stevie Wonder. One of my all time favorites. I got teased on the Fender Forum, because I refered to one of their songs as my theme song. :lol: \r\n\r\n[quote:e0fd368f31]Jesus Lizard is another band I\'ve always been curious about. I\'ve known a few people over the years that were fanatical over those dudes... they always talked big about the live shows... anyway, I\'ve never heard any.[/quote:e0fd368f31]Then I\'ve got to tell you my Jesus Lizard story. I\'ll try to keep it short. :roll:\r\n\r\nI was in Tower records. I asked my budy what was hot. He said, \"I don\'t know.\" So I grabbed a Flipside mag, and let it fall open. It opened to Jesus Lizard. Flipside loved it, so I bought it. My buddy insisted on hearing it there. So we threw it in. Everyone in the store stopped what they where doing, and just looked at each other, like WTF? :? It was confusing disturbing abstract music. I really didn\'t know what to think, but I liked everyone\'s reaction. So I took it home and let it grow on me.\r\n\r\nI still wasn\'t sure what to think, so I took it to my buddy Joey, who is a monster bass player, and my mentor. He became so fanatical about them that he became a collector of aluminum neck Kramer guitars and basses, because they\'re like Duane dennison\'s Travis Bean. \r\n\r\nI wanted to know why he loved them so much, so I listened again from what I imagined his point of view to be, and it was just totally amazing.\r\n\r\nThe live show...fuck dude, completely off the wall. David Yow in a drunken stupor, howling yelling and stammering out lyrics whjilst falling all over breaking everything, the band literally beating him off of them and screaming at him between songs, while stile managing to pound out precise tight rythyms.\r\n\r\nIt was just like nothing else, and to top it off Mudhoney played the State Fair that night, and we sat with Steve Arm. (Was that his name?  :lol: ) at the bar cracking Pabst Blue Ribbon jokes, cause he was drinking Heineken. It was great.\r\n\r\n(End of story)\r\n\r\n[quote:e0fd368f31]Shellac is a thing I dig quite a bit, I\'ve heard most of it and like it a lot. I\'ve only heard a little bit of Big Black, but I like Shellac much better... either way, I have a lot of respect for Steve Albini.[/quote:e0fd368f31]Cool, I like Shellac better too.\r\n\r\nHave you heard the Big Black album, \"Songs About Fucking\"? That was my first exposure to them, and I love that album, all the other Big Black stuff is different, and I really don\'t like it compared to this.\r\n\r\nThis one is relentless, guitar oriented, industrial pounding, with some real sick fucked up lyrics going over the top.\r\n\r\nDave'),(19257,'dc242a79ab','\"Hendrix meets Stevie Wonder\" makes me even more curious... can\'t wait.\r\n\r\nThe Jesus Lizard story is great, I\'m anxious to hear that stuff, too. I just played one of those kramer basses a few weeks ago. I really [i:dc242a79ab]want[/i:dc242a79ab] to like the way those play, \'cuz they look all custom hot rod like... but the feel ain\'t my thing. \r\n\r\nYeah, Songs about Fucking is the one that will be in my collection... I almost got that a few months back, but opted for a Link Wray upgrade intead... finally got \'Mr Guitar\'. What a great collection, exactly what I wanted.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34493,'e00913e3cd','got it thx!\r\n\r\nnow i need to wind a new motor, i gave away all my 130\'s when i went brushless.   :-( \r\n\r\n[quote:e00913e3cd=\"ph2t\"]it\'s quite different since thee\'s two different mosfets now.\r\n\r\nsee the doco here:\r\n\r\n\r\nhttp://www.woahnelly.com/stuff/xmods/EVOMOSFETInstallationGuide.pdf\r\n\r\ngood luck!\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:e00913e3cd=\"Clint\"][quote:e00913e3cd=\"ph2t\"]hey man, just wanted to let you know that the installation doco for the evo mosfet upgrade is almost done.  it will be posted shortly.\r\n\r\nif you wanted something sooner to help let me know.\r\n\r\ncheers man,\r\n\r\nph2t.,[/quote:e00913e3cd]\r\n\r\nsweet thx. I received the package of fets from aus micro this afternoon.\r\nUnfortunatly, i wont be able to work on it until i get home this weekend, so no rush. if the install is anything like the original xmod fet upgrade, i wont have any problems.\r\n\r\nthx,\r\n-clint[/quote:e00913e3cd][/quote:e00913e3cd]'),(28582,'de6284f928','Whatup?\r\nCheck it out:  I\'m gonna order two clusters of eight of those KANs type NiMH batteries you suggested on one of my threads, but I need to know if I should go for the 1/4AAA or 1/3AAA size.  Which one would you prefer?\r\n\r\nHit me back when ya gots the time,\r\nAbe');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21707,'59517784ae','lol goodo sorry about the delay and stuff it was pretty shit hey.. again i apologise'),(21676,'0355aed00e','[quote:0355aed00e=\"merc-blue\"]hey just wondering does the eletrics include the servo and the top part (blakc bit that holds it down).. casue i need them...[/quote:0355aed00e]\r\n\r\nIts the whole thing.  Plus, your too late.  Its already mailed. :-)'),(19260,'f76f628163','[quote:f76f628163=\"hue35\"]I just played one of those kramer basses a few weeks ago. I really [i:f76f628163]want[/i:f76f628163] to like the way those play, \'cuz they look all custom hot rod like... but the feel ain\'t my thing. [/quote:f76f628163]I know what you mean. I like the basses. Short neck scale, really nice action, great for a guitar player like me, but my buddies guitars needed some work. After he got it set up, and the stock pickups rewound, it\'s like a shredder guitar with the wide flat neck, low action, and now hotter than hell pickups, but it has a clarity and sharpness that comes through even in the most distorted situations, that I really dig. In the end though, since I only weigh 120 pounds, I think that neck out weighs me. I stand crooked when I play one of those.\r\n\r\n[quote:f76f628163]... finally got \'Mr Guitar\'. What a great collection, exactly what I wanted.[/quote:f76f628163]Have you heard him doing the live version of \"Black Widow\"? It\'s recent and he\'s in his 70s and just tearing it the fuck up. I love that guy. Crazy speaker pokin\' mofo.\r\n\r\nI\'ll hook you up with the Big Black too. 8-) \r\n\r\n\r\nDave'),(20124,'6d9f6ab511','[quote:6d9f6ab511]you know... stirring his pot lol \r\n\r\nmessing with him - goto trick click[/quote:6d9f6ab511]\r\n\r\nYeah I went to check it out and nadda.  I mean I know we love fuckin w/ the boy but who is doing this?  Do you know?  Just seems odd the timing that he would be getting screwed with durring this time of War. :shock:   Can you hook me up with a link.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20135,'21fbadf35b','hey, how ya goen?\r\n\r\nI just downloaded a php forum and i was wondering if you could help me out in installing it.\r\n\r\ncheers.'),(20120,'d181843a3a','Whazzup Crazy Dave,\r\n\r\nI\'m JackD, the cat that just won the auction for the VW bus over the weekend.  I am not sure how to submit payment.  I can do paypal, check or money order or even cold cash since we\'re among fellow pimps.  Holla at me sometime,  you can also use email upree.john@epa.gov.............thanks jd'),(20119,'200cff6655','thanks dude. i have a temporary workaround at least. i ripped an inductor from a clone controller. i have no clue what the rating is but it works better than a fried one. i have to test the range and see if its acceptable. ill get back at ya in a few days.'),(19263,'8ee9e49840','hi mekinhux i have not forgotten about you here, i have been on your project the last couple of days, i had it all painted up without the details but i did not like the outcome so i stripped the paint back off and repainted the body color tonight.\r\n   Tomorrow i will paint the top white, and might be able to do the chrome bumpers and such, i dont want to rush the paint to fast , since there are three differant colors on it i need each color to completely dry before i do more, so bare with me and i will get it finished.\r\n   I will keep you informed on my progress.\r\n\r\njmays'),(19265,'01d572d83f','That was a good idea gathering the FET info in the Faq.  8-) \r\n\r\nThanks for the reccomendation over in that one thread too.\r\n\r\nI\'m still planning to do that SE tutorial, I\'m just trying to get my head clear. Lots of BS going on in my life right now, got me all confused about things, but I think I\'m getting back on track now.\r\n\r\nGot a pile of cars here that DT sent me, for me to do up for him and the auction cars. Made me realize I gotta get back on track. I\'m gonna be orderin\' more FETs tonight, end of the month is here, so my wife can stall me no more. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, I\'ll let you know when I\'m set to go on the FET situation, and thanks for the props lately. I know I\'ve been moody, but don\'t worry, it\'s nothing to do with any of you guys.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19266,'5cfa1e3848','[quote:5cfa1e3848=\"crazydave\"]That was a good idea gathering the FET info in the Faq.  8-) \r\n\r\nThanks for the reccomendation over in that one thread too.\r\n\r\nI\'m still planning to do that SE tutorial, I\'m just trying to get my head clear. Lots of BS going on in my life right now, got me all confused about things, but I think I\'m getting back on track now.\r\n\r\nGot a pile of cars here that DT sent me, for me to do up for him and the auction cars. Made me realize I gotta get back on track. I\'m gonna be orderin\' more FETs tonight, end of the month is here, so my wife can stall me no more. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, I\'ll let you know when I\'m set to go on the FET situation, and thanks for the props lately. I know I\'ve been moody, but don\'t worry, it\'s nothing to do with any of you guys.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:5cfa1e3848]sounds good man - don\'t worry bout that stuff - I\'ve been having some shitty real life stuff happening too lately.\r\nsucks - but we\'ll get through it.\r\nI just got back from out of town so I gotta get my shit together - back on track as you say.'),(19267,'69596b418c','C-Dubb,\r\n\r\nGot your Precious all packed up!  \r\nIs your address still:\r\n\r\n[b:69596b418c]16 Crystal Lake Dr.\r\nSt Peters, Mo. 63376[/b:69596b418c]\r\n\r\nPop me your email address....\r\n\r\nI have the linxlink address only.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19268,'69596b418c','C-Dubb,\r\n\r\nGot your Precious all packed up!  \r\nIs your address still:\r\n\r\n[b:69596b418c]16 Crystal Lake Dr.\r\nSt Peters, Mo. 63376[/b:69596b418c]\r\n\r\nPop me your email address....\r\n\r\nI have the linxlink address only.'),(19295,'0495b4dac8','As Rick James would say....Giv\'em to me baby  :smile: \r\n\r\nThanx....'),(26493,'cd2b401bae','I saw that s7mk posted that he\'s got a iRiver ifp-190tc  he\'s gonna offer you for less than what he\'d get on eBay.\r\n\r\nI just checked on eBay and it looks like those things are selling for anywhere between $70 and $82 (price of shipping included).\r\n\r\nUnless he gives you a solid deal, I think that Sandisk is the way to go...It\'s free shipping, 4x more memory and USB 2.0 (the iRiver is USB 1.1 and if girly\'s got a bunch of music to move around, it\'s gonna be SLOW...Unless you\'ve got an old ass system that only handles USB1.1 then it\'s moot anyway).\r\n\r\nblah blah blah and so forth.'),(19270,'751ff5f2b9','[quote:751ff5f2b9=\"DarkTari\"]C-Dubb,\r\n\r\nGot your Precious all packed up!  \r\nIs your address still:\r\n\r\n[b:751ff5f2b9]16 Crystal Lake Dr.\r\nSt Peters, Mo. 63376[/b:751ff5f2b9]\r\n\r\nPop me your email address....\r\n\r\nI have the linxlink address only.[/quote:751ff5f2b9]you got it the right one homey.\r\n\r\ncabowabo@lixlink.com\r\n\r\nI\'ve been out of town this weekend, gotta get my shit together and get back on track lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19271,'3273630f5f','Lats couple of times I tried to send you something, it came back  :???: \r\n\r\nI\'ll try it again....'),(19272,'3273630f5f','Lats couple of times I tried to send you something, it came back  :???: \r\n\r\nI\'ll try it again....'),(37296,'3ca89cc133','These were not in the first order.\r\n\r\nPART ID	DESCRIPTION	Price 	Silver	Black	Green\r\nXME012A	ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET	$7.74	0	0	1\r\nXME012B	ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX BACK COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET	$0.00	0	0	1\r\nXME013A	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET 	$15.54	0	0	1\r\nXME013B	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX REAR COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET 	$7.74	0	0	1\r\nXME330LAN	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR LANCER) - 1PC	$5.90	0	0	1\r\nXME330MUS	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR MUSTANG) - 1PC	$3.84	0	0	1\r\nXET330FORD	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR TRUCKIN) - 1PC	$6.90	1	0	0\r\nXET330HUM	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR HUMMER) - 1PC	$5.90	1	0	0\r\n\r\nActual	$53.54	 	 	 \r\n10.00%	$5.35	 	 	 \r\nSub	$58.89			\r\nS&amp;H	$3.00			\r\nTotal	$61.89			\r\n\r\nThat is a Savings of $13.41 Off of GPM\'s regular price.\r\n\r\nIf you have any additions or corrections let me know as soon as possible.  My PayPal is cjellis@yahoo.com.  Please include your user name in the notes on PayPal.\r\n\r\nIf you do reply by February 11th  your request will not be ordered.'),(37503,'c76e04302b','Will send the body out next week!\r\n\r\nlook forward to the trade.\r\n\r\nAddress:\r\nAaron Olmsted\r\n1941 Sayers Road\r\nBastrop, Texas 78602 \r\n\r\nthanks man!  :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37504,'ed98be5e82','I\'ll take the rolling chassis and I can give you the any of the following:\r\n\r\nThe list goes \r\nZZ bodys \r\n1x f&amp;f evos \r\n1x 2f2f Purple Conv Eclipse \r\n1x red porsche \r\n1x black porsche \r\n1x Orange 350z \r\n1x Purple PT Cruiser \r\n1x 2f2f Orange Challengers \r\n1x blue rx8 \r\n1x Xmen Chrome RX8 \r\n1x beat up mustang body 2000 or something actually ok shape just layers of paint. \r\n1x Yellow Civic \r\n1x Blue Civic \r\n\r\nZZSE bodies \r\n1x Trueno \r\n1x Levin \r\n1x Silver Escalade \r\n1x 2003 Mustang concept gray \r\n1x blue Audi TT\r\n\r\nWhen you decide let me know and send me your address.\r\nSend the Chassis to\r\n\r\nRodney Tapia\r\n128 Via Bellagio\r\nAmerican Canyon, CA 94503'),(35502,'c9b28ba961','[quote:c9b28ba961=\"frizzen\"]Oh that\'s so wicked.  Bit size?   [b:c9b28ba961]How much do you need to have for it?[/b:c9b28ba961]\r\nI\'m:   \r\nJeremy Boyle\r\n1325 N Dukane Way\r\nIndianapolis, IN  46214[/quote:c9b28ba961]\r\n\r\nI got your back  :cool:'),(36851,'4451e2bb12','got the wheels and chassis in today thanks a ton man and thanks for the extra wheels I can use them on my other cars!\r\n\r\nThanks again!  :-o  :-) \r\n\r\nAaron');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37552,'7d3965772c','Your body will ship out first thing in the morning.\r\nthanks\r\nAaron\r\nSWG  :-)'),(37553,'267431eebc','Whereabouts are you?\r\n\r\nLove doc'),(31722,'0d109523c4','There was a pic of a superslick - gold benz (with another benz) that was lowered, can you please explain how you lowered it? If pics are possible it\'d be awesome but it\'d be cool if you could just explain too. Thanks.'),(32451,'cabdb9ee2b','[quote:cabdb9ee2b=\"dbxl\"]could you delete my post in lookin to score\r\n\r\nnew here and posted w/o 50 posts\r\n\r\nsorry[/quote:cabdb9ee2b]\r\nNo sweat, thanks for letting me know.\r\nI\'ll go delete the post.\r\nJust an FYI and in case you missed it:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=1957\r\n\r\nThat explains the rules for those special sections as well as the reason we have them.'),(28899,'2380ddb6ee','[quote:2380ddb6ee=\"Sdog\"]Spaten Optimator bitch....[/quote:2380ddb6ee]\r\n\r\nThanks :-)'),(30021,'f6d2bf9b72','[quote:f6d2bf9b72=\"cj\"][quote:f6d2bf9b72=\"ezenterprises\"]i went over the list and wanted to send you an actual order..... Wife complainin so keepin order small for now........hopefully in future will finish. Would like everything Blue. THANKS\r\n\r\nXM021\r\nXM039F\r\nXM039F/4WD\r\nXM039R\r\nXM041\r\nXM041F/4WD\r\nMZ002\r\nSend me a paypal bill to X_FUNSTUFF_X@yahoo.com when i need to pay.[/quote:f6d2bf9b72]\r\nPlaced the order and am waiting for the confirmation from them.\r\n[/quote:f6d2bf9b72]\r\nGot my confirmation.  I won\'t need the full amount now but if you send $25 as a down payment to cjellis@yahoo.com I\'ll collect the rest $23.45 when I ship them to you.  Sound OK?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19275,'5cfa1e3848','[quote:5cfa1e3848=\"crazydave\"]That was a good idea gathering the FET info in the Faq.  8-) \r\n\r\nThanks for the reccomendation over in that one thread too.\r\n\r\nI\'m still planning to do that SE tutorial, I\'m just trying to get my head clear. Lots of BS going on in my life right now, got me all confused about things, but I think I\'m getting back on track now.\r\n\r\nGot a pile of cars here that DT sent me, for me to do up for him and the auction cars. Made me realize I gotta get back on track. I\'m gonna be orderin\' more FETs tonight, end of the month is here, so my wife can stall me no more. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, I\'ll let you know when I\'m set to go on the FET situation, and thanks for the props lately. I know I\'ve been moody, but don\'t worry, it\'s nothing to do with any of you guys.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:5cfa1e3848]sounds good man - don\'t worry bout that stuff - I\'ve been having some shitty real life stuff happening too lately.\r\nsucks - but we\'ll get through it.\r\nI just got back from out of town so I gotta get my shit together - back on track as you say.'),(28336,'6eddf9ddb0','[quote:6eddf9ddb0=\"Sugarfoot\"]Oh ya, sorry for not saying it arrived. It\'s a great piece of craftsmanship. Probably the only Bit Camaro in existence. Its clean as hell and sits on my computer desk.  :-D[/quote:6eddf9ddb0]Cool, thanks for the update. :-) \r\n\r\n\r\n(BTW, it\'s a driver too.:good: ) \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19278,'c4005e5cc6','Hey Dave,\r\nAny word on any FETs yet?'),(19279,'c4005e5cc6','Hey Dave,\r\nAny word on any FETs yet?'),(23670,'e28d557ac9','The only one of those that I know I have is a 1970 Dodge Hemi Challenger ZZ body. I would like to see pics, and I can get some if you would be interested in that body.'),(31077,'53afe99e0c','[quote:53afe99e0c=\"hue35\"]\r\n\r\nAlright, here\'s my first pass of stuff I\'m interested in... I have no idea how you\'re pricing this stuff, so it\'s hard for me to commit at this point... let me know how much you want for this stuff, with a general breakdown, so I can prioritize, if need be.\r\n\r\nMini Heart Mini Cooper sets:\r\n\r\nwhite\r\ndark green\r\nwhite w/blue police light on roof\r\nred fire chief\r\nwhite/green police car\r\n\r\n\r\n2Speed Super Perfection sets - this is the ferrari 512bb/lambo countach sets:\r\n\r\nyellow lambo/red ferrari 27c\r\nblack lambo/silver ferrari 27a\r\n\r\n\r\nTomy BCG and SBCG sets:\r\n\r\nGunmetal Nissan Gloria 45mhz\r\nsilver supra 45mhz\r\nred enzo ferrari 40a mhz\r\nferrari special set f40, testarrossa and 512bb 40b mhz\r\nskyline history set 35mhz\r\nspecial edition pennzoil skyline 27mhz\r\n\r\n\r\nTomy Pullbacks: \r\n what do you have?\r\n\r\n\r\nFerrari Modena:  yellow, red, silver\r\n\r\n\r\nParts/accessories:\r\n\r\nTomy 3.0 motor\r\nPerfection 3.0 motor\r\n200mah battery\r\n160mah battery\r\nperfection 3.8 motor\r\nperfection heatsinks - black, gold, silver\r\nperfection 4.2 motor\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nhue35[/quote:53afe99e0c]\r\n\r\n\r\nHere are the prices and for the pullbacks I have the lamborghini Countach LP500s, Dome Zero, Nissan Fairlady Z and Nissan skyline GTR R32. Selling for $3 each. All new in package.\r\n\r\n\r\nMini Heart Mini Cooper sets: [b:53afe99e0c]$10each[/b:53afe99e0c]\r\n\r\nwhite\r\ndark green\r\nwhite w/blue police light on roof\r\nred fire chief\r\nwhite/green police car\r\n\r\n\r\n2Speed Super Perfection sets - this is the ferrari 512bb/lambo countach sets: [b:53afe99e0c]$8each[/b:53afe99e0c]\r\n\r\nyellow lambo/red ferrari 27c\r\nblack lambo/silver ferrari 27a\r\n\r\n\r\nTomy BCG and SBCG sets:\r\n\r\nGunmetal Nissan Gloria 45mhz  $15\r\nsilver supra 45mhz $15\r\nred enzo ferrari 40a mhz $15\r\nferrari special set f40, testarrossa and 512bb 40b mhz $25\r\nskyline history set 35mhz $15\r\nspecial edition pennzoil skyline 27mhz $15\r\n\r\n\r\nFerrari Modena:  yellow, red, silver   .75 each\r\n\r\n\r\nParts/accessories:\r\n\r\nTomy 3.0 motor $2ea\r\nPerfection 3.0 motor $1ea\r\n200mah battery $1.50\r\n160mah battery $.75\r\nperfection 3.8 motor $2ea\r\nperfection heatsinks - black, gold, silver $.50ea\r\nperfection 4.2 motor $2ea\r\n\r\nLet me know what you want and we can work something out. Thanks!'),(20123,'6d9f6ab511','[quote:6d9f6ab511]you know... stirring his pot lol \r\n\r\nmessing with him - goto trick click[/quote:6d9f6ab511]\r\n\r\nYeah I went to check it out and nadda.  I mean I know we love fuckin w/ the boy but who is doing this?  Do you know?  Just seems odd the timing that he would be getting screwed with durring this time of War. :shock:   Can you hook me up with a link.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19282,'47d6cc847a','[quote:47d6cc847a=\"DarkTari\"]Lats couple of times I tried to send you something, it came back  :???: \r\n\r\nI\'ll try it again....[/quote:47d6cc847a]make sure you got it spelled right. I noticed you had linxlink in the last PM, but coulda just been a typo there.\r\n\r\nyou can also use scott.lix@lixlink.com'),(19527,'cafa881cd1','I\'m interested in the Bus Bodies.  What colors do you have?  WHat else are you selling, send me a list.\r\n\r\nThanx'),(19284,'9f0ac4b312','Yeah, thank goodness for spellcheck (rereading)  I have it right in my box, just I had .net instead of .com.  Did you get one from me today?'),(19286,'07dd2ad9d0','[quote:07dd2ad9d0=\"Sugarfoot\"]Hey Dave,\r\nAny word on any FETs yet?[/quote:07dd2ad9d0]How ironic, I just ordered them today. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(19287,'9f0ac4b312','Yeah, thank goodness for spellcheck (rereading)  I have it right in my box, just I had .net instead of .com.  Did you get one from me today?'),(19293,'83cd36083e','Namuna,\r\n\r\nDa Bit Pimps will be conducting an auction in the coming weeks. We want to open it to all that would be interested in bidding so we are asking your permission to plug it in the TRC forum.  \r\nIf this presents itself to be a problem, please let me know.\r\n\r\nThanx Man');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19289,'ce2a606654','[quote:ce2a606654=\"DarkTari\"]Yeah, thank goodness for spellcheck (rereading)  I have it right in my box, just I had .net instead of .com.  Did you get one from me today?[/quote:ce2a606654]yea got the bootlicious babe  :-)'),(19290,'7302933855','Cool, Gotta get Sess to do another WallPaper for me  :eek: \r\n\r\nI\'m gonna post an announcement for the auction start date (13-Jun-04).\r\nJust contacted other sites for permission before posting in their forum.\r\nI was home, in the basement, all day yesterday and just about completed 2 more for the auction.  These muthas are off do hook!  You may want to bid on one of them yourself  :-)   \r\nWe\'ll discuss da rules to dis auction soon.\r\n\r\nPeace Out !'),(19292,'7302933855','Cool, Gotta get Sess to do another WallPaper for me  :eek: \r\n\r\nI\'m gonna post an announcement for the auction start date (13-Jun-04).\r\nJust contacted other sites for permission before posting in their forum.\r\nI was home, in the basement, all day yesterday and just about completed 2 more for the auction.  These muthas are off do hook!  You may want to bid on one of them yourself  :-)   \r\nWe\'ll discuss da rules to dis auction soon.\r\n\r\nPeace Out !'),(19298,'b73412b6fe','[quote:b73412b6fe]Hey DarkTari, \r\n\r\nI shall check with the Big dog (Tiny) and get back to you.[/quote:b73412b6fe]\r\n\r\nCool !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19299,'0495b4dac8','As Rick James would say....Giv\'em to me baby  :smile: \r\n\r\nThanx....'),(19326,'5fd8b5f46d','Whatcha hear Namuna, any word yet?  Wanna get it out there this week.\r\n\r\nThanx Again    :cool:'),(19327,'64fc0a0b68','Could not decide weather to put this in the suggestion or not.\r\n\r\nI was looking at some of the MODs you can do to phpBB and saw this one http://www.phpbbhacks.com/viewhack.php?id=789 to ignore users\r\n\r\n[quote:64fc0a0b68]This hack allows members to compile a list of users to ignore. Posts of the ignored users will be replaced by a message that the user is being ignored. There is a link that will show the post if the member chooses to read it. \r\n\r\nThis also removes the ignored user\'s post in the topic review when replying to the thread. \r\n[/quote:64fc0a0b68]\r\n\r\nWith that mod I think it would be fun for us to just personaly have a list of users we wouldn\'t want to talk to.  Like charlie/goku!'),(35159,'627654335d','O, that E-mail that Superfly posted up here and at craiglist or somthing. Anyways, i got the metl tech! It\'s pretty sweet.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19302,'15d7b9b8c3','[quote:15d7b9b8c3=\"crazydave\"]That was a good idea gathering the FET info in the Faq.  8-) \r\n\r\nThanks for the reccomendation over in that one thread too.\r\n\r\nI\'m still planning to do that SE tutorial, I\'m just trying to get my head clear. Lots of BS going on in my life right now, got me all confused about things, but I think I\'m getting back on track now.\r\n\r\nGot a pile of cars here that DT sent me, for me to do up for him and the auction cars. Made me realize I gotta get back on track. I\'m gonna be orderin\' more FETs tonight, end of the month is here, so my wife can stall me no more. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, I\'ll let you know when I\'m set to go on the FET situation, and thanks for the props lately. I know I\'ve been moody, but don\'t worry, it\'s nothing to do with any of you guys.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:15d7b9b8c3]by the way, thanks for the props on the reguritation post about mosfets.\r\nyou know you can feel free to add to that whenever right?\r\nI just took what was  being asked frequently and matched them to your guys\' responses. I\'m sure I\'ve missed a few tid bits of info so if you find something or have something else to add - it\'s not a locked thread so you and anyone else has an opportunity to add to the comprehensive thread.\r\n\r\np.s.\r\nfuckin love that clone thread - should we move that baby into FAQs too?'),(19303,'97e31560f3','just read your breaking news post.\r\nlove the names of the shops you came up with.\r\nand perfect post.\r\n\r\nyou sly mo\'fo');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19304,'d3c603a87a','WORD !  :cool: \r\n\r\nI don\'t need mod rights for Kahuna, I\'ll just edit post under DarkTari!\r\n\r\nGlad U Like Pimp !'),(19305,'4c0eac9e2e','[quote:4c0eac9e2e=\"DarkTari\"]As Rick James would say....Giv\'em to me baby  :smile: \r\n\r\nThanx....[/quote:4c0eac9e2e]well... okay, but if there\'s a way around it, I\'d like to find it.\r\nhere\'s what I mean:\r\nwhen you\'re a moderator, your name comes up listed as a moderator, and your name is in bold.\r\npimps notice it - I\'ve witnessed it here (on accident) and got called out on it and had to back track a little to explain.\r\n\r\nso, by avoiding it, here\'s what I mean:\r\nwhat exact priviliages does Da Big Kahuna need?\r\nI can give Da Big Hakuna whatever priviliages, but I\'m wondering if it really needs moderator priviliages (identification as a moderator)?\r\n\r\nwhat are your exact plans with this alter ego?\r\nI think I can help and I know we can make this work - I just want to make sure I understand what the concept is before we sign-off on it and before I start to offer any real suggestions.\r\n\r\nlet me know what your pimp mind is schemin\' bro'),(19306,'c0cfb33224','I won\'t be needin it.  I couldn\'t make the auction an annaouncement so I just went in as DarkTari and edit\'d it so it won\'t be neccessary now.  Thanx anyways  :cool: \r\n\r\nI always ask before I try a workaround, silly me !\r\n\r\nIt\'s late and I\'m about modded out   :neutral:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19307,'d3c603a87a','WORD !  :cool: \r\n\r\nI don\'t need mod rights for Kahuna, I\'ll just edit post under DarkTari!\r\n\r\nGlad U Like Pimp !'),(19308,'c0cfb33224','I won\'t be needin it.  I couldn\'t make the auction an annaouncement so I just went in as DarkTari and edit\'d it so it won\'t be neccessary now.  Thanx anyways  :cool: \r\n\r\nI always ask before I try a workaround, silly me !\r\n\r\nIt\'s late and I\'m about modded out   :neutral:'),(19309,'15d7b9b8c3','[quote:15d7b9b8c3=\"crazydave\"]That was a good idea gathering the FET info in the Faq.  8-) \r\n\r\nThanks for the reccomendation over in that one thread too.\r\n\r\nI\'m still planning to do that SE tutorial, I\'m just trying to get my head clear. Lots of BS going on in my life right now, got me all confused about things, but I think I\'m getting back on track now.\r\n\r\nGot a pile of cars here that DT sent me, for me to do up for him and the auction cars. Made me realize I gotta get back on track. I\'m gonna be orderin\' more FETs tonight, end of the month is here, so my wife can stall me no more. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, I\'ll let you know when I\'m set to go on the FET situation, and thanks for the props lately. I know I\'ve been moody, but don\'t worry, it\'s nothing to do with any of you guys.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:15d7b9b8c3]by the way, thanks for the props on the reguritation post about mosfets.\r\nyou know you can feel free to add to that whenever right?\r\nI just took what was  being asked frequently and matched them to your guys\' responses. I\'m sure I\'ve missed a few tid bits of info so if you find something or have something else to add - it\'s not a locked thread so you and anyone else has an opportunity to add to the comprehensive thread.\r\n\r\np.s.\r\nfuckin love that clone thread - should we move that baby into FAQs too?'),(19310,'903d06bc00','[quote:903d06bc00=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:903d06bc00=\"crazydave\"]That was a good idea gathering the FET info in the Faq.  8-) \r\n\r\nThanks for the reccomendation over in that one thread too.\r\n\r\nI\'m still planning to do that SE tutorial, I\'m just trying to get my head clear. Lots of BS going on in my life right now, got me all confused about things, but I think I\'m getting back on track now.\r\n\r\nGot a pile of cars here that DT sent me, for me to do up for him and the auction cars. Made me realize I gotta get back on track. I\'m gonna be orderin\' more FETs tonight, end of the month is here, so my wife can stall me no more. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, I\'ll let you know when I\'m set to go on the FET situation, and thanks for the props lately. I know I\'ve been moody, but don\'t worry, it\'s nothing to do with any of you guys.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:903d06bc00]by the way, thanks for the props on the reguritation post about mosfets.\r\nyou know you can feel free to add to that whenever right?\r\nI just took what was  being asked frequently and matched them to your guys\' responses. I\'m sure I\'ve missed a few tid bits of info so if you find something or have something else to add - it\'s not a locked thread so you and anyone else has an opportunity to add to the comprehensive thread.[/quote:903d06bc00]Yeah you know, I think I\'ll add Superfly\'s thread, that\'s got good info on getting started.\r\n\r\n[quote:903d06bc00]p.s.\r\nfuckin love that clone thread - should we move that baby into FAQs too?[/quote:903d06bc00] :lol: That\'s cool, glad you liked it. That was just my Sunday morning, \"I just woke up and I\'m not baked yet so I\'m bored\" rant. \r\n\r\nYeah I suppose that probably does belong over in Faqs. That\'s what I was kinda thinking, everyone\'s always asking about different clones, let\'s put it in one spot.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19311,'903d06bc00','[quote:903d06bc00=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:903d06bc00=\"crazydave\"]That was a good idea gathering the FET info in the Faq.  8-) \r\n\r\nThanks for the reccomendation over in that one thread too.\r\n\r\nI\'m still planning to do that SE tutorial, I\'m just trying to get my head clear. Lots of BS going on in my life right now, got me all confused about things, but I think I\'m getting back on track now.\r\n\r\nGot a pile of cars here that DT sent me, for me to do up for him and the auction cars. Made me realize I gotta get back on track. I\'m gonna be orderin\' more FETs tonight, end of the month is here, so my wife can stall me no more. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo anyways, I\'ll let you know when I\'m set to go on the FET situation, and thanks for the props lately. I know I\'ve been moody, but don\'t worry, it\'s nothing to do with any of you guys.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:903d06bc00]by the way, thanks for the props on the reguritation post about mosfets.\r\nyou know you can feel free to add to that whenever right?\r\nI just took what was  being asked frequently and matched them to your guys\' responses. I\'m sure I\'ve missed a few tid bits of info so if you find something or have something else to add - it\'s not a locked thread so you and anyone else has an opportunity to add to the comprehensive thread.[/quote:903d06bc00]Yeah you know, I think I\'ll add Superfly\'s thread, that\'s got good info on getting started.\r\n\r\n[quote:903d06bc00]p.s.\r\nfuckin love that clone thread - should we move that baby into FAQs too?[/quote:903d06bc00] :lol: That\'s cool, glad you liked it. That was just my Sunday morning, \"I just woke up and I\'m not baked yet so I\'m bored\" rant. \r\n\r\nYeah I suppose that probably does belong over in Faqs. That\'s what I was kinda thinking, everyone\'s always asking about different clones, let\'s put it in one spot.\r\n\r\nDave'),(37350,'a155510395','[quote:a155510395=\"SHAUN\"]http://www.1-2-free-forums.com/mf/?mforum=rcworld  the site as soon As we get people were going to go to a real site , its not done yet still gotta get banner and color.[/quote:a155510395]\r\n\r\n\r\nI guess you don\'t want me there anymore?\r\n\r\nYou can\'t reply?\r\n\r\nWhy can\'t I log in?  I registered.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36390,'3c73ae25bc','Check out my post in the sale section...or give me a list of stuff you need i can hook you up...'),(37111,'2ee2d2f272','Don\'t forget to vouch for a pimp, or toss me under the bus. Whatever I deserve. lol\r\n\r\n-JNY'),(37112,'0c8985fc01','[quote:0c8985fc01=\"pimpsmurf\"]Don\'t forget to vouch for a pimp, or toss me under the bus. Whatever I deserve. lol\r\n\r\n-JNY[/quote:0c8985fc01]\r\n\r\nYeah dont worry i didnt forget ya. :-o'),(37115,'21c277f918','Damn you hue!!! I think I busted my spleen!!!!11! :lol: \r\n\r\n[img:21c277f918]http://home.comcast.net/~hue35/penismonsterdlx.gif[/img:21c277f918]'),(36285,'99c5bcb583','I got both, turns out the cashier guy who was helping was into R/C\'s too, so he gave me a 15% discount, so I was able to afford both.  The Evo VIII is beautiful and the ZZMT is wonderful.  Only problem is, is it\'s a little low on power, and likes to flip and roll.  I\'m so happy.\r\n\r\nI was thinking of doing a board swap with my SE, but I\'m not sure how to get it to work.  Mainly getting it to work with the motor, servo and what to do to charge batteries.  I was thinking Iwaver board for the SE.  I want to get started by stripping everything out of the car, so what can I take out that won\'t be needed for a new board, and what wires should I be careful wth?\r\n\r\nFor the ZZMT I\'m thinking I just need a better motor, a higher RPM motor, have you noticed it\'s a little low on power?  I\'m in Canada so I don\'t think we have any MT upgrades just yet, don\'t know if they are going to continue selling or getting new stuff or stopping.  For me it\'s just a touch too little, sometimes it gets stuck on some obstacles, like going over my bed or over rough carpet because of not enough power.  What could I do, it\'s already 2-celled (right?) unless i can change to better cells.'),(37706,'a789801d02','no problems, glade you like it!!!!!!!!!!! :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32618,'69a72c9b93','my addy is\r\n2329 Cherry St\r\nDenver, CO\r\n80207\r\njust adress it to Weazel.  PayPalworks for me'),(32619,'0c97e3e36c','You got it buddy!!\r\n\r\nI\'ll send it off today/tomorrow, and I\'ll PM you with my PP addy with the total. \r\n\r\nDo you need an extra pinion for the motor, or do you have one?'),(19314,'49e30f5485','iam kind of neww to modding micros and it seems like hogjwls follows me around.i am not being sissy or anything,but i find out what i post isnt sufficient and i ask to delete it and he changes the title and message to something vulgar or rude.i might be new but he is acting like a bitch to me in everything i post and he wont get off my case.could you maybe tell him to lay off?hes making me look like a fool.please do not take this wrong,i just would like him to lay off.please disreguard this if you think it is not appropriate.\r\n                                                     Thanks,\r\n                                                        Brandon'),(35999,'9bb8b86558','What kind of xmods parts do you need?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36017,'fa80da788c','Alright so you want\r\n\r\n- 57 chevy body painted\r\n- red car on the riight, (if it is the nissan I painted it blue with black and silver\r\n- if it is the ferrari F50 I gave it away\r\n\r\n- controller and chassis is no problem\r\n\r\nSo you say you could give me a returned xmod right? And you work in a radioshack?\r\n\r\nWell I wanted to try something\r\n\r\nI could give you\r\n\r\n3 Super Tomy Bit Char - G BRAND NEW\r\n\r\n- They could all be different frequencies and are valued for 29.99 at tower hobbies\r\n\r\nThat righ there is a 90 dollar american value + all the things you wanted on my bit list\r\n\r\nIf you can get a hold of an EVO Xmod?\r\n\r\nIF you could do this for me I would definately try and score this for you, If not let me know.....and the sale stuff could still be yours.'),(26321,'f257be4ffe','Ok, its \r\n\r\nRyan Patrick\r\n16640 Sherwood Ln. Apt. 103\r\nWoodhaven, Michigan\r\n48183\r\n\r\nThanks, $25 should cover everything.'),(19317,'ebac073b06','[quote:ebac073b06=\"stampede_dude\"]iam kind of neww to modding micros and it seems like hogjwls follows me around.i am not being sissy or anything,but i find out what i post isnt sufficient and i ask to delete it and he changes the title and message to something vulgar or rude.i might be new but he is acting like a bitch to me in everything i post and he wont get off my case.could you maybe tell him to lay off?hes making me look like a fool.please do not take this wrong,i just would like him to lay off.please disreguard this if you think it is not appropriate.\r\n                                                     Thanks,\r\n                                                        Brandon[/quote:ebac073b06]that\'s hogjowlz\'s way of warning pimps when they start making a mess of the boards. the moderators have spent a lot of time getting the boards as organized as possible to help pimps find the info. they\'re looking for.\r\nif you look around, you\'ll see quite a few other posts that have been hogjowlz edited. again, it\'s his way of warning pimps who start to post before they think, making a mess, or whatever - so don\'t take his edits quite so personal as much as a warning.\r\nhe\'ll lay off when he doesn\'t see \"cluttering posts\", so if you follow the rules - you don\'t have to worry about him.\r\nhope that helps.\r\n\r\n- CaboWabo');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19318,'f753d4c51e','thanks lots cabo-no i understand.if you dont mind me asking,could you please delete the post in the trade forum t that says i have sex violently with animals and stuff?its kinda embarrasing'),(36000,'0d51ad3c31','http://i20.photobucket.com/albums/b238/MafiaSam99/FirstBitPics014.jpg\r\n\r\nI am super-interested in the 57 chevy body and the red car in the right of this pic. I would also like a controller and a chassis. I am going to go sometime this week and see if i can score you a returned xmod and/or some parts.'),(19320,'48d6f275e7','i was dumb enough not to read the b/s/t rules-sorry.i have no use for the thread i made anyways.sorry i am annoying you,if i am.'),(36012,'6c9475fb6c','Maybe, but probably not. I havent seen them.'),(19322,'64fc0a0b68','Could not decide weather to put this in the suggestion or not.\r\n\r\nI was looking at some of the MODs you can do to phpBB and saw this one http://www.phpbbhacks.com/viewhack.php?id=789 to ignore users\r\n\r\n[quote:64fc0a0b68]This hack allows members to compile a list of users to ignore. Posts of the ignored users will be replaced by a message that the user is being ignored. There is a link that will show the post if the member chooses to read it. \r\n\r\nThis also removes the ignored user\'s post in the topic review when replying to the thread. \r\n[/quote:64fc0a0b68]\r\n\r\nWith that mod I think it would be fun for us to just personaly have a list of users we wouldn\'t want to talk to.  Like charlie/goku!'),(21085,'339f2fdc74','Congratulation [b:339f2fdc74]J[/b:339f2fdc74]!\r\n\r\nGreat job on your entries, I\'ll get your prize out tomorrow so you should get it this week.  \r\nAgain your work is top notch Pimp :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21078,'e3a70ed5b8','Bad news pimp...\r\n\r\nI guess it has been a while since I\'ve been there.  Sorry to say that all 3 Big Lots were out of the Thunder Chargers. I will keep an eye out for them and let ya know if I run across any.\r\n\r\nMike'),(19324,'10a207eca7','i been real slack getting your car out due to my iwaver (honest it wasn\'t me! the iwaver made me do it!!), but she\'s in the mail as we speak, hopefully you\'ll see it within 2 weeks. i tested it out, replaced the dodgy wheel and gave it a little pimpin\' to boot! so congrats again on another fine piece o\' pimp from the dt stables!!\r\n\r\ncheers man, trent.\r\n\r\np.s. i hope the kids love it too, but only if they\'re good! :-)'),(26806,'4e87b0d88c','Sorry hoss, that\'s a negative on having a ZZ/ZZ SE body checklist.\r\n\r\nThough you might have some luck on this guy\'s page (or contacting him directly):\r\nhttp://www.cmoo.com/~snor/weeds/zapstuff.htm\r\n\r\nGood luck and glad to hear the Sis is happy with her stuff!'),(19332,'2d51d63dfd','[quote:2d51d63dfd=\"cj\"]Could not decide weather to put this in the suggestion or not.\r\n\r\nI was looking at some of the MODs you can do to phpBB and saw this one http://www.phpbbhacks.com/viewhack.php?id=789 to ignore users\r\n\r\n[quote:2d51d63dfd]This hack allows members to compile a list of users to ignore. Posts of the ignored users will be replaced by a message that the user is being ignored. There is a link that will show the post if the member chooses to read it. \r\n\r\nThis also removes the ignored user\'s post in the topic review when replying to the thread. \r\n[/quote:2d51d63dfd]\r\n\r\nWith that mod I think it would be fun for us to just personaly have a list of users we wouldn\'t want to talk to.  Like charlie/goku![/quote:2d51d63dfd]that is kinda cool - thanks cj, I\'m gonna look at it.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19333,'49d4e9e3a9','When I saw it I thought of charlie/goku and what he would complain about if I had posted that in the suggestion Box.'),(19334,'49d4e9e3a9','When I saw it I thought of charlie/goku and what he would complain about if I had posted that in the suggestion Box.'),(19336,'6883a38dce','yea you probably avoided a lot of hassle lol'),(19337,'c04e024b2c','Wouldn\'t think of steppin on anyones toes!\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp!'),(37096,'cb0ab6991c','Yo, is that guy your friend? If so could you give me his email i\'m interested in his bits. I\'ll offer him $25 shipped, since he\'s in Canada. I\'m just pming you in case he left the site, and doesn\'t get my pm.'),(37097,'141d72677c','No problem man\r\n\r\nHis email is \r\n\r\nfgareri@rogers.com\r\n\r\nHis name is Fred, and just incase, tell him you are from bitpimps, and you have dealth with mafiaS before. \r\n\r\nLet me know if he responds, I talk to him at school so I could easily get a hold of him.\r\n\r\nPeace'),(37099,'96d9e3739d','lol...I used the battery clip you sent me, made my xmod a 6cell mod\r\n\r\nSlapped in the drift motor, Carbon Fibre shaft, Aluminum axels, heat sinc,\r\ni still ran it 2wd. It was all torque when I put in the extra 2 cells. The thing jumped for the first two feet. All I needed to do was fix up the steering.\r\n\r\nSad news though, my uncle advised me to sell the whole xmod bundle, create a nice chassis (it is brand new I exchanged it today) and throw in all the hop up and extra\'s and maybe sell it so I can finally get my AWD miniZ I have been dying for. \r\n\r\nI am not sure if I am going to do it !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33867,'c6791726d4','[quote:c6791726d4=\"arfin\"]Sweet your on! Very fun im drunk lets play![/quote:c6791726d4]\r\n\r\nHAHAHAHAHA cool, i was gonna ask if you were gonna sneak some drinks lol\r\n\r\nDave'),(35557,'fee706bfdf','[quote:fee706bfdf=\"crazydave\"][quote:fee706bfdf=\"hue35\"]Now I\'mm gonna go home and :cool:  &lt;--- except smokeless.  :lol:   Man, I\'m lovin\' this vaporizer... I haven\'t \"smoked\" anything since I got it, and my lungs can tell the difference.[/quote:fee706bfdf]Shit man, I think my lungs need one of them. I\'ve been afraid to look at them, because I\'m pretty shure they\'re more than the wife would allow for paraphernalia. :lol: [/quote:fee706bfdf]\r\nThey can be had for about $150 on ebay... the vaporbrothers one, which is the one SF and I have.\r\n\r\n[quote:fee706bfdf=\"crazydave\"]Well gald you like the start on the car. I was actually just sitting down to take a break on it. I\'m finishing up the chassis getting ready for paint. Just carved it out for the Super Slick motor.[/quote:fee706bfdf]\r\nOh man, a Super Slick motor... it\'s gonna haul ass. I still haven\'t put one of those in a Bit yet... I have a couple, though. I\'ve got some parts set aside for a tiny little demon for the RCP... now I just need some time.\r\n\r\n[quote:fee706bfdf=\"crazydave\"]My wife just brought a big bag of peanuts in the shells from one of those dudes on the side of the road, and they rock. :rockon:[/quote:fee706bfdf]\r\nSounds good... we don\'t have peanut vendors on the side of the road here, though I wish we did. We\'ve got \"fresh crab\" guys, but I have a hard time buying seafood from a dude on the side of the road.'),(19340,'4198001003','croikey bruce!!!! never realized you were on here. you get about 50 get out of jail free cards. go ahead and post any damn thing and ill back ya up.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36413,'4414444c73','So looking at your last sentence, it looks like I am going to stick to nimh batteries. But I might try and get tricky and use perhapds AA batteries to double the length time. 2500 mah, 1.2 volts...\r\n\r\nEnduro races on the track would last forever ahah! \r\n\r\nI considered staying away from the lithium shit...'),(19342,'563878c50e','Hey, I finally ordered some FETs the other day, and they are confirmed on the way. So if you want to send me a SE, I\'ll do it up for ya.\r\n\r\n\r\nDid you get that Torino from CJ? If so I\'m not sure which car I\'d reccomend you have FETed. My Chevelle was faster out of the package than my other SEs, and has a slightly reworked PCB, but it just seems a tad bit slower after the FET mod. Then again my other SE is a car that I salvaged from the parts of 3 different SEs, and in order to get the PCB working again I had to jump the base on one of the forward FETs straight to ground, so who knows, maybe that bypass is what is making the differerence. Either way my Chevelle has tighter steering and almost no twitch. So that\'s still the prefered car.\r\n\r\nI could just FET up both your cars, but since I\'m doing up cars for the auction, I have no clue what my FET budget is like, and I want to stack the FETs on your car. (Hopefully that\'ll give you a slight advantage over Payaso ;) ) But I can get your other car on the next batch of FETs.\r\n\r\nDave'),(19343,'8f9c373cae','it worked a few hours ago.  dude owned it pretty darn good. sorry man.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19344,'3d904a6ab0','Yeah, got a few \'haha\' emails in the TRC box that it was hacked too.\r\n\r\nno skin off my ass, but I\'d imagine it was a bitch for Tiny himself.  :-?'),(26902,'cf39e68b15','iPod aye? Hmmmmm.\r\n\r\nWhat\'s your price range?'),(19346,'563878c50e','Hey, I finally ordered some FETs the other day, and they are confirmed on the way. So if you want to send me a SE, I\'ll do it up for ya.\r\n\r\n\r\nDid you get that Torino from CJ? If so I\'m not sure which car I\'d reccomend you have FETed. My Chevelle was faster out of the package than my other SEs, and has a slightly reworked PCB, but it just seems a tad bit slower after the FET mod. Then again my other SE is a car that I salvaged from the parts of 3 different SEs, and in order to get the PCB working again I had to jump the base on one of the forward FETs straight to ground, so who knows, maybe that bypass is what is making the differerence. Either way my Chevelle has tighter steering and almost no twitch. So that\'s still the prefered car.\r\n\r\nI could just FET up both your cars, but since I\'m doing up cars for the auction, I have no clue what my FET budget is like, and I want to stack the FETs on your car. (Hopefully that\'ll give you a slight advantage over Payaso ;) ) But I can get your other car on the next batch of FETs.\r\n\r\nDave'),(19348,'f9ec1aa917','whats strange is we were bsing in this thread all afternoon.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3905&amp;highlight=');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19349,'ddccf7645f','[quote:ddccf7645f=\"crazydave\"]Hey, I finally ordered some FETs the other day, and they are confirmed on the way. So if you want to send me a SE, I\'ll do it up for ya.\r\n\r\n\r\nDid you get that Torino from CJ? If so I\'m not sure which car I\'d reccomend you have FETed. My Chevelle was faster out of the package than my other SEs, and has a slightly reworked PCB, but it just seems a tad bit slower after the FET mod. Then again my other SE is a car that I salvaged from the parts of 3 different SEs, and in order to get the PCB working again I had to jump the base on one of the forward FETs straight to ground, so who knows, maybe that bypass is what is making the differerence. Either way my Chevelle has tighter steering and almost no twitch. So that\'s still the prefered car.\r\n\r\nI could just FET up both your cars, but since I\'m doing up cars for the auction, I have no clue what my FET budget is like, and I want to stack the FETs on your car. (Hopefully that\'ll give you a slight advantage over Payaso ;) ) But I can get your other car on the next batch of FETs.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:ddccf7645f]awww shiat yea lol\r\nyea I got the Torino from cj.\r\nI think I\'m gonna send the savannah (has twitches) because I think I won\'t mind the twitch as much when it\'s flyin\'\r\ngive me a bit to get some shit together, I\'ve been all over the place lately and I wanna send somefin else down (not sure what yet - it\'ll have to be a surprise lol)\r\n\r\nthanks bro'),(19350,'6018557872','[quote:6018557872=\"hogjowlz\"]whats strange is we were bsing in this thread all afternoon.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3905&amp;highlight=[/quote:6018557872]\r\n\r\nBadlink, comes up as saying no such thread?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19351,'ddccf7645f','[quote:ddccf7645f=\"crazydave\"]Hey, I finally ordered some FETs the other day, and they are confirmed on the way. So if you want to send me a SE, I\'ll do it up for ya.\r\n\r\n\r\nDid you get that Torino from CJ? If so I\'m not sure which car I\'d reccomend you have FETed. My Chevelle was faster out of the package than my other SEs, and has a slightly reworked PCB, but it just seems a tad bit slower after the FET mod. Then again my other SE is a car that I salvaged from the parts of 3 different SEs, and in order to get the PCB working again I had to jump the base on one of the forward FETs straight to ground, so who knows, maybe that bypass is what is making the differerence. Either way my Chevelle has tighter steering and almost no twitch. So that\'s still the prefered car.\r\n\r\nI could just FET up both your cars, but since I\'m doing up cars for the auction, I have no clue what my FET budget is like, and I want to stack the FETs on your car. (Hopefully that\'ll give you a slight advantage over Payaso ;) ) But I can get your other car on the next batch of FETs.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:ddccf7645f]awww shiat yea lol\r\nyea I got the Torino from cj.\r\nI think I\'m gonna send the savannah (has twitches) because I think I won\'t mind the twitch as much when it\'s flyin\'\r\ngive me a bit to get some shit together, I\'ve been all over the place lately and I wanna send somefin else down (not sure what yet - it\'ll have to be a surprise lol)\r\n\r\nthanks bro'),(19352,'daebb97e9b','[quote:daebb97e9b=\"CaboWabo\"]awww shiat yea lol\r\nyea I got the Torino from cj.\r\nI think I\'m gonna send the savannah (has twitches) because I think I won\'t mind the twitch as much when it\'s flyin\'\r\ngive me a bit to get some shit together, I\'ve been all over the place lately and I wanna send somefin else down (not sure what yet - it\'ll have to be a surprise lol)\r\n\r\nthanks bro[/quote:daebb97e9b]I think that\'s probably the best choice. To tell ya the truth, I can\'t tell when I\'m driving that the twitch is killing a couple steps in the steering. In retrospect, I\'m thinking the twitch really wasn\'t that big of a deal, we\'re just a bunch of anal fucks that like to give the RS engineers a bad day. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (26906,'87a5604473','[quote:87a5604473=\"DarkTari\"]$150.00 - $220.00\r\n\r\nDon\'t wanna pay $399.00 +\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp ![/quote:87a5604473]\r\n\r\n150-220 puts you into iPod Mini range, even the low end iPods (which is the 20gb version) is almost $300. The iPod Minis are $249 everywhere you go, but I found a current deal at Crutchfield that brings it down to $227.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re interested in that, let me know and I\'ll give you the details.\r\n\r\nOther than that, you could try eBay and look for 3rd generation iPods, you might be able to get a sweet deal on a 15gb.\r\n\r\nGood luck!'),(19355,'daebb97e9b','[quote:daebb97e9b=\"CaboWabo\"]awww shiat yea lol\r\nyea I got the Torino from cj.\r\nI think I\'m gonna send the savannah (has twitches) because I think I won\'t mind the twitch as much when it\'s flyin\'\r\ngive me a bit to get some shit together, I\'ve been all over the place lately and I wanna send somefin else down (not sure what yet - it\'ll have to be a surprise lol)\r\n\r\nthanks bro[/quote:daebb97e9b]I think that\'s probably the best choice. To tell ya the truth, I can\'t tell when I\'m driving that the twitch is killing a couple steps in the steering. In retrospect, I\'m thinking the twitch really wasn\'t that big of a deal, we\'re just a bunch of anal fucks that like to give the RS engineers a bad day. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(19356,'c6df0ea966','[quote:c6df0ea966=\"crazydave\"]I think that\'s probably the best choice. To tell ya the truth, I can\'t tell when I\'m driving that the twitch is killing a couple steps in the steering. In retrospect, I\'m thinking the twitch really wasn\'t that big of a deal, we\'re just a bunch of anal fucks that like to give the RS engineers a bad day. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:c6df0ea966]I can admit to that lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19357,'c6df0ea966','[quote:c6df0ea966=\"crazydave\"]I think that\'s probably the best choice. To tell ya the truth, I can\'t tell when I\'m driving that the twitch is killing a couple steps in the steering. In retrospect, I\'m thinking the twitch really wasn\'t that big of a deal, we\'re just a bunch of anal fucks that like to give the RS engineers a bad day. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:c6df0ea966]I can admit to that lol'),(19358,'cdbed20fa1','got your articles up holmes, in a 10 part series\r\ncheck it out.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/articles/\r\n\r\nlet me know if you want me to change something or whatever :-)'),(19359,'ce4a3fc779','that\'s all looking good to me, great job!! i\'m sure you put a bitta work into that so kick back and have a well earned one! :cool: \r\n\r\nthanks man, trent.'),(33030,'8258cc3ad2','If I use the chassis power switch to turn it off and leave the cells plugged in, will there be any drain on the batteries?\r\n\r\nI swear to you I found a site with a lithium poly protector that simply lit a LED when it was low. It did not turn off the cells. That would be ideal for my setup, but I lost my bookmarks and can\'t find that sucker anywhere. If you have a clue, please pass one along to a recovering redneck yank.\r\n\r\n-JNY'),(31392,'e891f1ce3b','Matt:\r\n\r\nAre you sure SS controllers don\'t work on the MT?  If they do, I believe TRU\'s still selling them for 10.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31393,'11337590fb','i thought about it but i wasnt sure is there anyone you know that can verify they work :???:'),(19362,'45465a256a','ah you gota join the raw and uncensored crew. ur missin out on some shit dude.'),(37304,'8f793909bc','These were not ordered on the first group Buy.\r\n\r\nPART ID	DESCRIPTION	Price 	Red \r\nDXME009TA	DELRIN MOTOR GEAR (9T) WITH ALLOY TRAY &amp; SCREWS - 1PC SET	$1.24	1\r\nDXME1224T	DELRIN MAIN GEAR (12T/24T) - 2PCS SET	$2.28	1\r\nXME012A	ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET	$7.74	1\r\nXME013A	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET 	$15.54	1\r\nXME013B	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX REAR COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET 	$7.74	1\r\nXME330MUS	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR MUSTANG) - 1PC	$3.84	1\r\n\r\nActual	$38.35	 \r\n10.00%	$3.84	 \r\nSub	$42.19	\r\nS&amp;H	$3.00	\r\nTotal	$45.19	\r\n\r\nThat is a Savings of $16.82 Off of GPM\'s regular price.\r\n\r\nIf you have any additions or corrections let me know as soon as possible.  My PayPal is cjellis@yahoo.com.  Please include your user name in the notes on PayPal.\r\n\r\nIf you do reply by February 11th  your request will not be ordered.'),(36536,'436237ba07','\'fraid i cant do just the body,sorry.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36903,'6cd0d900a8','Man I knew Namuna would like this post but God Damn!  Chicken Nuggets !!!!  :lol: \r\nHe\'s gonna blow this mutha UP !!!!  Watch....'),(33928,'ecff80898d','y arent you on msn dude'),(33433,'07cc0e3071','Hey Cameron,\r\n\r\nGot the package you sent.\r\nDamn man!  :shock: I only sent you a couple sets of rims. And you send me what looks like the whole Mini RC section at BigLots! I really didn\'t expect anything in return other than pics of your Shelby with the rims!\r\n\r\nI feel you got the short end of the stick...  :sad:\r\nYou need anything else?\r\nI got:\r\n- Different DUB\'s\r\n- Cyclona bodies (bB, WRX, Celica, S2000; fits Bits and MicroSizers)\r\n- Mini Cooper (complete mini RC)\r\n- Motors\r\n- Cat5 wire\r\n- misc parts\r\n\r\nLet me know. I can take pics.\r\n\r\n-DriveWRX  :cool:'),(31019,'3b2893552b','[quote:3b2893552b=\"MotorGong\"]dude, look at the picture that chaoscauser posted.\r\nthe one of his car. look at the quality of the photo, the style of\r\ncouch everything is on.....all looks like it is from the seventies.\r\nIt\'s before my time, too, but I\'ve seen old photos, seen the Seventies Show, etc.\r\n\r\nGet it?\r\n\r\n\r\n-Motor :)[/quote:3b2893552b]\r\n\r\nOhhhh I didn\'t even notice the homies lol'),(19380,'ce5591604b','look here buddy. you are annoying as hell and you are on your final thread. \r\n\r\n :ban:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19365,'94c9acb006','What\'s been done to the chassis?  Is it just waiting for a body &amp; paint!  How about wheels?'),(19366,'94c9acb006','What\'s been done to the chassis?  Is it just waiting for a body &amp; paint!  How about wheels?'),(19391,'561c068ae3','tell me what shell you want and I\'ll see if I have it (probably do)'),(19392,'d898542e50','Good !  2 days just as I paid for.\r\n\r\nDo what you want, you been der, done dat !   8) \r\n\r\nI\'ve got 3 done and one in Da Cut.  Maybe doing a couple joint ventures too   :cool:'),(20185,'0c3e334240','[quote:0c3e334240=\"synj\"]i know dude, its just i dont do it often...\r\nso i thought it was proper\r\nBITCH[/quote:0c3e334240]\r\n\r\nlol'),(19370,'286ff2ce2c','hey no problem man! dont worry about it, your doin me the favor... take your time.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTMP  :-)'),(19371,'9f1ab42e94','hmm i dont really have much in the special wheels department. i could do one like crazy dave\'s prostocker with alloy rears. but i got a few thunder chargers layin round. some half worked on already.  what color schemes you got workin out??'),(19373,'b90269f10c','[quote:b90269f10c]hmm i dont really have much in the special wheels department. i could do one like crazy dave\'s prostocker with alloy rears. but i got a few thunder chargers layin round. some half worked on already. what color schemes you got workin out??[/quote:b90269f10c]\r\n\r\nWell I didn\'t mean to ask so many questions.  Not worried about wheels, just wanna know what you got ready to go in a chassis ?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19374,'b90269f10c','[quote:b90269f10c]hmm i dont really have much in the special wheels department. i could do one like crazy dave\'s prostocker with alloy rears. but i got a few thunder chargers layin round. some half worked on already. what color schemes you got workin out??[/quote:b90269f10c]\r\n\r\nWell I didn\'t mean to ask so many questions.  Not worried about wheels, just wanna know what you got ready to go in a chassis ?'),(19390,'f647a54866','ok im lookin at a thunder charger chassis with red wheels already jbwelded. now she just needs a pcb and shit. you want me just make the whole car do you wana ship me a few shells to go with these? i paint pretty well now but not like your ass does.'),(26262,'8d9ab759ce','[quote:8d9ab759ce=\"stampede_dude\"]can i please have my title reset back to defaults?I am trying to work my way back up here and its a little bit hard to do with the title gimp :-)  thanks :cool:[/quote:8d9ab759ce]lol yea I guess you been doin good for awhile now...\r\nyou got it.\r\nMerry Christmas :-)'),(19378,'c88d72feeb','[quote:c88d72feeb=\"betty.k\"]that\'s all looking good to me, great job!! i\'m sure you put a bitta work into that so kick back and have a well earned one! :cool: \r\n\r\nthanks man, trent.[/quote:c88d72feeb]copying was tedious, but nowhere near the amount of work you put in to creating the articles.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19381,'43062d3143','i know i was stupid in the contest thread but why did you make that post i made about carbon fiber hoods look bad?i was trying to help there!'),(36041,'fcce6dc3ad','I dont know what I can get, but I can try.I would just need a used or new chassis along with the pink bel air body or something If i can score something. I dont work there im just tight with them.'),(36090,'da2bfba736','Whats you\'re username on UltimateRc?'),(19384,'0c08c5fb7a','because your comments aint needed. nobody likes you around here. go to one of the little kid rc sites and have fun.'),(19385,'bb446857f7','got the precious clones today in the mail.\r\nyou know, I\'ve never had one of these, they look good.\r\n\r\nnow I gotta think of what I\'m gonna do for modding these babies and get up on the block.\r\n\r\nthanks pimp :-)'),(19386,'d898542e50','Good !  2 days just as I paid for.\r\n\r\nDo what you want, you been der, done dat !   8) \r\n\r\nI\'ve got 3 done and one in Da Cut.  Maybe doing a couple joint ventures too   :cool:'),(19387,'0aeb4f8dc9','you got aol or aim?? we should try to schedule all the mods to get on at the same time one day. that way in real time we can all be on the same level.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19388,'517c301042','well i could jbweld it and fix up the slop in the rear. i should be able to scrounge up a set of springs or two. ill goto the hobby store this weekend to see if they have any more.'),(19411,'ad553f86e6','yo mang, I tried to open up that tutorial you sent on CD.\r\nI can\'t open it, it\'s a Microsoft Works file and I don\'t have Works, I\'ve got MS Office XP suite (Word, etc.)'),(19412,'a2152ab0f7','Damn   :x \r\nI know, I have XP Home edition.  Tried to do it from work and couldn\'t.\r\n\r\nI\'ll speak with some guru\'s here and find a way to get it to you.'),(24456,'55a8c1ad21','alright, I talked to CJ, and since my dad won\'t let me use his paypal, he told me to just include $2 with the stuff and you can just use your paypal, then he\'ll send the stuff right to you and you can fix it. Does that sound good? My dad approved of that, too... Also, do you want me to send you the whole chassis?\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\n~midget~'),(24457,'6dd426a6c0','It all sounds great, but I don\'t have paypal... We could probably use 219s, though... I have been having him do all of my paypal related shit lol... I\'ll ask him if it\'s aaaight(should be) and get back at you... lol I reread that... Yeah... he\'ll definately do that.\r\n\r\nYeah, you might as well send the whole chassis... it\'s easier to send it driving up the street to check the range than to walk lol.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19416,'86d6da17e7','[quote:86d6da17e7=\"midget_man1387\"]Hey Cabo, I know you don\'t like to get stupid, pointless PMs all the time, but you kno that I\'ve been around long enough to not be a stupid newb lol\r\n\r\nAnyway, I\'ve just got one quick question. I\'d like to try and find the font you use in the bitPimps logo, so I could use it for contests and stuff.... What is the name of that font? I\'m looking through right now, but there\'s a thousand fonts to look at lol, and it\'d be a big help if you could tell meh what the name is....\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\n\r\n~midget_man~[/quote:86d6da17e7]I honestly can\'t remember the name right now.\r\nI\'ll have to do some searchin and see if I can find it again.\r\n\r\nby the way, I still haven\'t forgotten about the homey I was gonna send ya - it\'s gonna come one of these days - I\'ve just had so much other stuff going I just haven\'t had the time to go through my doubles. I will though and when I do - I won\'t forget ya.'),(19417,'a2152ab0f7','Damn   :x \r\nI know, I have XP Home edition.  Tried to do it from work and couldn\'t.\r\n\r\nI\'ll speak with some guru\'s here and find a way to get it to you.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33039,'5447274629','great! I\'ll keep that to myself.\r\n\r\n-JNY'),(33042,'dce7bb3cc0','[quote:dce7bb3cc0=\"HirotoR34\"]Hey cj, are you gonna get back to me on the status of my order or what??? :-) I just wanted to know if it was shipped and the address it was shipped to.... lordhelmetr342003@yahoo.com is my e-mail. Get back to me when you get a chance. thanks....later\r\n\r\n :-o[/quote:dce7bb3cc0]\r\n\r\nIt was shipped out last Friday to your PayPal address.'),(24052,'f1fb9c5b39','[quote:f1fb9c5b39=\"HirotoR34\"]do you need the controller as well? It\'s a 27Mhz[/quote:f1fb9c5b39]\r\nDude, have you sent that car yet? If you haven\'t, then try a 49Mhz controller. Now that I think about, I\'m almost positive that\'s a 49Mhz chassis, not 27Mhz. That would explain why you\'re not getting anything outta the car. Either Cabo sent you the wrong controller, or you are using the wrong one, is my guess.'),(35287,'fb0d833a85','My ZZSE\'s are first Gen I think And I\'ll pay pal you next friday after I cash my check i package the ZZMT good I am adding a lipoly to it too but I can do that one  of my Bits need 2 more cells added.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36899,'21ccade813','cnc can do anything, lol. i would find a lot of machinists and ask for their quotes before deciding on who to go with; i trust that most people will ask maybe $60 the first time, and $35 or so subsequently. heck, aluminum rims only cost atomicmods $40 a set (supposedly), so a cf chassis (only 2-dimensional) should be much cheaper.'),(20121,'daacf8a420','Hey what\'s up? Thanks for bidding on my car. 8-) \r\n\r\nWe\'ll I\'ll tell ya, just got done with a last minute emergency move, and this is my first time back on the net in 2 days.\r\n\r\nMy paypal email is davesmoejoe@yahoo.com, you can do that, or if you want to send me a money order let me know, and I\'ll get you the address.\r\n\r\nAlso you should know I\'m a bit busy unpacking and organizing, it may not be until this weekend until I can ship it out.\r\n\r\nWell thanks again for bidding and supporting the bitPimps.  :-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(19424,'4bb72abcb1','i need help i dont know what kind of turbo i should buy\r\n\r\ni asked u because ur the man of fets and crap like that.\r\ni found a $15 gpm turbo forward+reverse \r\n\r\ni just wanna get it so i can upgrade to a faster motor like the NML.\r\n\r\n\r\ndo u think the turbo can handle a motor like that.\r\n\r\no and i saw u needed a front damper mount in alloy and there getting one up right here pretty soon in the shop\r\n\r\nwww.minizworld.com\r\n\r\nu should check it out its in the shop section. \r\n\r\nso far i borke the front damper mount twice,wheelie bar,chipped a rim and cracked one,broke a screw mount on the servo case twice nad snapped a suspension arm.\r\n\r\nwow thats alot :lol:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19425,'b93a5b94ef','look at his AIM Sn, \"songokouisgay\". What a fag....\r\n\r\nI\'m debating whether I should start a thread in the Raw and uncensored sect that says something smart like \"Hey ike, sorry to disappoint you, but I\'m not gay. You WISH I was. But don\'t worry, I think nouseforaname would like some cock licking though,\" or some shit of the sort. meh....'),(19426,'27152addf9','Thats great man.  Just let me know your paypal account and I will forward the funds to you.....no problem..   Just double checkin\' it\'s $15 total bucks for two painted shells shipped ?????  That\'s a bargain........thanks........jd'),(19427,'3eca52bddd','ok  sounds great just let me know what colors u would like, i have some awsome dark tan like on my cit and have a new clear coat system set up here and the finished product is soooo sweet, i just finished one for a gent in europe with this color and clear coat and am blown away by the shine.\r\n\r\ngive me your addy and i will start on them for you . dont worry about payment yet, i will let you know how the cars are comeing along, i will need about a week to get them painted up.\r\n\r\nthanks jeff'),(19428,'86d6da17e7','[quote:86d6da17e7=\"midget_man1387\"]Hey Cabo, I know you don\'t like to get stupid, pointless PMs all the time, but you kno that I\'ve been around long enough to not be a stupid newb lol\r\n\r\nAnyway, I\'ve just got one quick question. I\'d like to try and find the font you use in the bitPimps logo, so I could use it for contests and stuff.... What is the name of that font? I\'m looking through right now, but there\'s a thousand fonts to look at lol, and it\'d be a big help if you could tell meh what the name is....\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\n\r\n~midget_man~[/quote:86d6da17e7]I honestly can\'t remember the name right now.\r\nI\'ll have to do some searchin and see if I can find it again.\r\n\r\nby the way, I still haven\'t forgotten about the homey I was gonna send ya - it\'s gonna come one of these days - I\'ve just had so much other stuff going I just haven\'t had the time to go through my doubles. I will though and when I do - I won\'t forget ya.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19429,'cc622553a2','aiight, thanks man.... hey, its a good thing you remembered a/b that homie lol... i kinda forgot... hey, you can send that when you send my prize for the contest :grin:  j/j... i think I still need a hell of a lot more work than that, to beat these guys.... that\'s aiight, I juss need to keep tryin lol\r\n\r\n~midget~'),(19432,'b93a5b94ef','look at his AIM Sn, \"songokouisgay\". What a fag....\r\n\r\nI\'m debating whether I should start a thread in the Raw and uncensored sect that says something smart like \"Hey ike, sorry to disappoint you, but I\'m not gay. You WISH I was. But don\'t worry, I think nouseforaname would like some cock licking though,\" or some shit of the sort. meh....'),(24459,'c1bab31773','it\'s all good mang! Don\'t you need my address? or did Voodoo include it with my stuff?'),(24460,'a581a9e1a3','Nah, I was just thinkin that I need your addy...lol'),(19435,'355b4f3ed4','if i was you id retake the blurry ones. that thing is nice and id hate to see you lose out(depending on the rest of the pack of course) because of a few crappy pics. try and try until you get some good ones dude.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19436,'8f9ed6b337','Alright thanks man, I will do that. :cool:'),(19437,'d14c8acc0b','I edited my posts (different pics) for the swing and bling contest, I tried to take clearer pics but they don\'t look that much better.  :cool:'),(19440,'8ca3e75222','[img:8ca3e75222]http://img27.photobucket.com/albums/v82/superpieboy/citroen.jpg[/img:8ca3e75222]\r\n\r\n\r\nhere it is finally finished, let me know what u think. also i need your address.\r\n\r\nthanks jmays'),(20863,'f64724586a','his post in the \"Bids\" thread and/or if he\'s contacted you via a \"PM\", don\'t respond, I\'ve taken care of it.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?p=49997#49997\r\n\r\n[quote:f64724586a=\"CaboWabo\"]Congratulations on your winning bid!\r\n\r\n(look biatch, I\'m trying not to give you the typical \"pre-canned\" homo response here so bare with me lol)\r\n\r\nAlright...\r\n#1.) sorry nobody contacted you yet. our own dumb fault. call us names - we deserve it. I can only offer you a \"sorry\" and I guess a random \"homey\" to make up for it.\r\n#2.) you can pay cash or money order to me, or you can pay paypal to crazydave, if you would like to pay crazydave, please send him a PM (private message) asking for his paypal address and he will give it to you.\r\nif you would like to pay cash or money order, send it to me at:\r\nScott Lix\r\n16 Crystal Lake Drive\r\nSt. Peters, MO 63376\r\n#3.) if you want a homey to compensate for our retardness, you\'ll have to send me an address I can ship to you at.\r\n#4.) I appoligize again, I know this doesn\'t make us look \"trust-worthy\" (but you know we are) or like we are \"on top of things\" (we are, just maybe not on these type things).\r\nwe\'re not a shop. we\'ve never \"sold\" anything. and we don\'t want to be a \"shop\" or \"sell\" anything. this is kind of a once a year (if that) type thing and we\'re not looking to \"sell\", \"rip-off\", \"get rich\", or any of that type shit.\r\n\r\nanyways, you have your options, please let me know which you have chosen so I can make \"it\" happen.\r\n\r\nthanks for helping support bitPimps homey, you\'re doing your community a great deed as well as getting something kick ass in return for it. you should feel great and I hope you do.\r\n\r\nthanks again.\r\n- CaboWabo[/quote:f64724586a]'),(19451,'039a5899a1','hahaha just make like 30 castings of your cit and bus and sell em on ebay dude. or send them to me  :-) \r\n\r\ni prefer the zz scale nowadays tho. maybe look into that shit dude.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19452,'8eb29ef332','www.photobucket.com free easy and you can remote link.  Use it, love it.'),(19453,'f5bd3a77a4','Well the FETs are here, almost. Damn mailman just left a note to pick up the package. We had made arangements with him to have our stuff dropped on our porch, because we hate having to take the bus to the post office several times a week. Then everytime it\'s something really important to me, we get a different mailman that just leaves the note.\r\n\r\n\r\nSorry for the vent, but that just irritates me, because I would have been able to get everything done this weekend, and out on monday, but as it is now the post office will be closed by the time I get off work today, and I\'ll have to wait until Monday before I can even pick them up. That\'s so frustrating.\r\n\r\nAnyways, they\'re here, and I\'ll be getting stuff done over the next week.\r\n\r\nDave'),(19454,'ec63fc27f1','I know how it is when you got a plan but that\'s cool.  I just finished the 2nd &amp; 3rd ones so I have enough to carry the Auction for the rest of the month.  :cool:'),(19455,'cddf91db23','[quote:cddf91db23=\"Son_Gokou\"]Do you have a tutorial showing where to connect all the pins and wires for the FETs on Woah nelly...like, where to connect them, and what FETs to use....thanks![/quote:cddf91db23]\r\n\r\nyou don\'t seem to be paying attention, that\'s not like you.....\r\n\r\nhere\'s eveything you need to know:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ausmicro.com/topic.asp?TOPIC_ID=2044&amp;FORUM_ID=13&amp;CAT_ID=4&amp;Topic_Title=my+%22Woah+Nelly%21%22+Turbo%2E%2E%2E%2E&amp;Forum_Title=Mini%2DZ%2C+Mini%2DX%2C+X%2DMods+%2D+Technical\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (23601,'57a31dff23','Sent them out today, should be there by the weekend or early next week.'),(23602,'13830fad10','[quote:13830fad10=\"KaNye\"]Sent them out today, should be there by the weekend or early next week.[/quote:13830fad10]Cool, I\'ll let you know when they arrive.\r\n\r\ndave'),(19457,'8eb29ef332','www.photobucket.com free easy and you can remote link.  Use it, love it.'),(19458,'ec63fc27f1','I know how it is when you got a plan but that\'s cool.  I just finished the 2nd &amp; 3rd ones so I have enough to carry the Auction for the rest of the month.  :cool:'),(19459,'5bddbc5dca','r u talking about the 280 z or older datsun z cars or the zipzaps cars from radio shack. or a body that would fit a zz chassis.\r\n\r\njmays'),(19462,'3eca52bddd','ok  sounds great just let me know what colors u would like, i have some awsome dark tan like on my cit and have a new clear coat system set up here and the finished product is soooo sweet, i just finished one for a gent in europe with this color and clear coat and am blown away by the shine.\r\n\r\ngive me your addy and i will start on them for you . dont worry about payment yet, i will let you know how the cars are comeing along, i will need about a week to get them painted up.\r\n\r\nthanks jeff'),(19463,'cddf91db23','[quote:cddf91db23=\"Son_Gokou\"]Do you have a tutorial showing where to connect all the pins and wires for the FETs on Woah nelly...like, where to connect them, and what FETs to use....thanks![/quote:cddf91db23]\r\n\r\nyou don\'t seem to be paying attention, that\'s not like you.....\r\n\r\nhere\'s eveything you need to know:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ausmicro.com/topic.asp?TOPIC_ID=2044&amp;FORUM_ID=13&amp;CAT_ID=4&amp;Topic_Title=my+%22Woah+Nelly%21%22+Turbo%2E%2E%2E%2E&amp;Forum_Title=Mini%2DZ%2C+Mini%2DX%2C+X%2DMods+%2D+Technical\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19464,'1d77118c9f','hi there. bruce kulhanek is getting an xmod today and wants the awd kit. so pm him on brucemicro or get back to me and i\'ll sort it out. i\'m sure he\'ll take all the spare crap you got too.\r\n\r\ncheers man, trent.'),(19465,'4c47ff9fa3','[quote:4c47ff9fa3=\"crusty\"]i need help i dont know what kind of turbo i should buy\r\n\r\ni asked u because ur the man of fets and crap like that.\r\ni found a $15 gpm turbo forward+reverse \r\n\r\ni just wanna get it so i can upgrade to a faster motor like the NML.\r\n\r\n\r\ndo u think the turbo can handle a motor like that.\r\n\r\no and i saw u needed a front damper mount in alloy and there getting one up right here pretty soon in the shop\r\n\r\nwww.minizworld.com\r\n\r\nu should check it out its in the shop section. \r\n\r\nso far i borke the front damper mount twice,wheelie bar,chipped a rim and cracked one,broke a screw mount on the servo case twice nad snapped a suspension arm.\r\n\r\nwow thats alot :lol:[/quote:4c47ff9fa3]\r\n\r\nthe gpm v2 is better than the tlp twin and the topcad turbo\'s.  If you have patience though, my nelly turbo will cream them all.  thanks for the link but I just picked up the front damper mount on ebay!\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(33112,'cfd779a63a','I just ordered my oil dampers, alloy servo gears, alloy rear gearbox arm mount (because the full alloy rear gearbox I got is too bloody heavy), and alloy 1 degree castor knuckles. These should be the last things I get provided I don\'t bash anything to death. That is unless GPM makes a 1 degree camper and caster knuckle. What I was wondering was if you were using 1 or 2 degree castor knuckles on your old one. I tend to thing 2 degrees would be overkill and might give some understeer. *shrug*\r\n\r\n1 degree castor and 1 degree camper would own because in a turn, you would be getting close to 2 degrees camber on the ouside and next to 0 degrees on the inside I think. That would be fucking killer.\r\n\r\nThanks dude,\r\n-JNY\r\n\r\nbtw, T-Maxx is hella fun to bash. Even though I don\'t have the gearbox quite right yet. I can\'t figure it out. I think maybe the slipper clutch isn\'t slipping, not to mention it shifts way too late and I can\'t get it to tune. Plus it won\'t go into reverse. But with some camber on all 4 wheels, 1 degree of toe out on the rear, and the shocks set low and fairly stiff, it corners like a demon at 30mph (that pretty rad for this top heavy electric start shit.)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19467,'3febf6ef3f','thx for the help.\r\ni know u nelly would cream them all but i live in US and u live in AUS and i just have no patience at all :lol:'),(19469,'56d2d2eb1a','if your xmod is bone stock i would get stage 2 motors(unless you got a pinion puller) i could hook you up with one or two of thems if you dont wana bother with the whole set but youd have to make your own heat sink. bearings forsure tho i think z bearings work. and the ball diff is a must. i dont like the awd shit but it does have some advantages. and if you want ill throw in a broken headlight kit.\r\n\r\nill sign up for paypal this week. keep on me its summer and im busy but i need to recoup some $$.'),(20385,'987e615482','muthang?  What\'s that mean.  I for got a \"to\" in my first sentence.  I have painted before, and it came out good, except my putty job underneath sucked 9first time I had ever bondoed).  Buh-bye, wannabe.'),(19472,'a2278d7948','i never did one for a zz but it should not be a problem, what kind of body are you looking for? \r\n\r\nIf i think that the body would be saught after by other pimps and i can sale it i will put the time into it and cast it, as of now i am only making bodies that i can cast and sale, off beat cars, one of a kind ect. ect.\r\n\r\n   It takes me about three weeks to make one from scratch, it took me a month on the vw bus, and three weeks on the cit. so u see were i am going with this. how much are u willin to pay for a body of your choice?\r\n\r\njmays');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20861,'b46c3b9c99','[quote:b46c3b9c99=\"crazydave\"]I\'m gonna go in and vote without looking what you guys have voted, but I will say this, boats do nothing for me, they just don\'t. I will be keeping the theme of the contest in strong consideration, but Hue\'s car is easily his swan song. He easily has the best eyes on the bPs, and just deserves recognition as \"the best\". It\'s convertable, so it\'s fits the theme close enough for me. So his \'maro\' will be getting my #1 vote without further consideration.[/quote:b46c3b9c99]straight up... damn man - judging is so hard.\r\nI go back and forth, especially after I hear pro\'s and con\'s from others.\r\n\r\nshit man, I\'m second guessing...\r\nahh, gonna stick to my guns, but yea - I can totally see where you\'re coming from'),(19474,'a7c3587f0e','Cavey,\r\n\r\nI edited your response to Chrome a lil.\r\n\r\nDon\'t want any details of the cars getting out before they hit Da Block.\r\n\r\nHope that\'s cool  :cool: \r\n\r\nWhich replacements would you like, I\'ve got a Celica. Skyline, EVO &amp; WRX\r\n\r\nLemme know!'),(19477,'a7c3587f0e','Cavey,\r\n\r\nI edited your response to Chrome a lil.\r\n\r\nDon\'t want any details of the cars getting out before they hit Da Block.\r\n\r\nHope that\'s cool  :cool: \r\n\r\nWhich replacements would you like, I\'ve got a Celica. Skyline, EVO &amp; WRX\r\n\r\nLemme know!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19771,'6c0eac0477','can you chage the text under my name to say Ex Shack ZipPimp.  As of Thusday the 17 I am no longer with the shack.  :-D'),(33048,'5ba52fa42a','you gonna be around much longer? ive got a charger i made inspired by yours that ide like to show you'),(20111,'6190d60e8b','[quote:6190d60e8b=\"hogjowlz\"]no i probably should get it tho huh? ill do that payday.\r\n\r\nill more than likely grab 4 off ya for future wrecking.[/quote:6190d60e8b]\r\n\r\nThe ones I have ave slightly larger than the stock ones but they will fit.  Do you want 4 pairs or just 4 total?  \r\n\r\n1 Pair = 1 each = $1.00 Shipped\r\n2 Pairs = 2 each = $2.00 Shipped\r\n3 Pairs = 3 each = $3.00 Shipped\r\n4 Pairs = 4 each = $4.00 Shipped\r\n\r\nHow is this for pricing and hows the Papal coming?'),(34682,'8409447d29','[quote:8409447d29=\"DarkTari\"][quote:8409447d29=\"JdmHatchback\"][quote:8409447d29=\"DarkTari\"]How much do you want for the Tomy Sets?  Shipping?\r\n\r\nIs that everything or do you have any Lxx sets left?\r\n\r\nI know someone looking for the WRX set\r\n\r\nLemme Know!\r\n\r\nThanx Again Pimp![/quote:8409447d29]\r\n\r\n$15 each for the Tomy Sets.... Shipping for one set around $5 bucks priority mail with delivery confirmation. \r\n\r\nFor more sets etc... I gotta figure shipping depending on you what you would want etc... \r\n\r\nI may have a few Lxx sets left. I have the vw beetle sets with working lights. Also have the super perfection lambo/ferrari combo sets and maybe a few of the regular/auto modellista sets.\r\n\r\nThanks and let me know![/quote:8409447d29]\r\n\r\nI want the following:\r\n2- Lxx VW Sets\r\n2- Lxx Super Sets: Ferrari/Lambo\r\n1- Tomy Gloria\r\n\r\nLet me know which Lxx AM sets you have, and bodies.\r\nThanx![/quote:8409447d29]\r\n\r\nOk, heres a tentative list of whats left. I\'ll double check when you let me know which ones you are interested. \r\n\r\nLXX Auto Modellista booster sets -\r\nRed supra/clear skyline 35mhz\r\ncalsonic skyline/clear skyline 27mhz\r\ngrey rx7/clear supra 40mhz\r\nblue rx7/clear supra 27mhz\r\n\r\nLXX reg 1-speed -\r\ncalsonic skyline/white rx7 35mhz\r\n\r\nLXX VW Beetle sets -2 speed w/working headlights -\r\npea green/white 40mhz\r\nroyal blue/silver 49mhz\r\nyellow/orange rust 49mhz\r\nred/orange rust 35mhz\r\nyellow/black 57mhz \r\n\r\nThanks again and let me know if you have any other questions!\r\n\r\nThanks again!'),(34681,'8409447d29','[quote:8409447d29=\"DarkTari\"][quote:8409447d29=\"JdmHatchback\"][quote:8409447d29=\"DarkTari\"]How much do you want for the Tomy Sets?  Shipping?\r\n\r\nIs that everything or do you have any Lxx sets left?\r\n\r\nI know someone looking for the WRX set\r\n\r\nLemme Know!\r\n\r\nThanx Again Pimp![/quote:8409447d29]\r\n\r\n$15 each for the Tomy Sets.... Shipping for one set around $5 bucks priority mail with delivery confirmation. \r\n\r\nFor more sets etc... I gotta figure shipping depending on you what you would want etc... \r\n\r\nI may have a few Lxx sets left. I have the vw beetle sets with working lights. Also have the super perfection lambo/ferrari combo sets and maybe a few of the regular/auto modellista sets.\r\n\r\nThanks and let me know![/quote:8409447d29]\r\n\r\nI want the following:\r\n2- Lxx VW Sets\r\n2- Lxx Super Sets: Ferrari/Lambo\r\n1- Tomy Gloria\r\n\r\nLet me know which Lxx AM sets you have, and bodies.\r\nThanx![/quote:8409447d29]\r\n\r\nOk, heres a tentative list of whats left. I\'ll double check when you let me know which ones you are interested. \r\n\r\nLXX Auto Modellista booster sets -\r\nRed supra/clear skyline 35mhz\r\ncalsonic skyline/clear skyline 27mhz\r\ngrey rx7/clear supra 40mhz\r\nblue rx7/clear supra 27mhz\r\n\r\nLXX reg 1-speed -\r\ncalsonic skyline/white rx7 35mhz\r\n\r\nLXX VW Beetle sets -2 speed w/working headlights -\r\npea green/white 40mhz\r\nroyal blue/silver 49mhz\r\nyellow/orange rust 49mhz\r\nred/orange rust 35mhz\r\nyellow/black 57mhz \r\n\r\nThanks again and let me know if you have any other questions!\r\n\r\nThanks again!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36072,'3c6b6934c3','Yeah...It might be the weekend before i get it here :*('),(19479,'cf2ddd3af8','[quote:cf2ddd3af8=\"DarkTari\"]Cavey,\r\n\r\nI edited your response to Chrome a lil.\r\n\r\nDon\'t want any details of the cars getting out before they hit Da Block.\r\n\r\nHope that\'s cool  :cool: \r\n\r\nWhich replacements would you like, I\'ve got a Celica. Skyline, EVO &amp; WRX\r\n\r\nLemme know![/quote:cf2ddd3af8]To tell you the truth, I\'m not sure what I said. What\'d ya change?  :lol: \r\n\r\nIt don\'t matter on the replacement. I tried to pick up a Charg-N-Go, because they are similar quality to Precious, but have good grippy tires, but they just had some generic looking cars. I lack in the spare grippy tire department, and these tires on the Precious are not gonna cut it after I get FETs in them.\r\n\r\nBTW, tested out one of your MS Pros, and it had the same problem I have with all my pros and sports, and that is that it turns excessively tight to the left, and not quite tight enough to the right. I\'ve discovered the problem is in the steering knuckles, and a pair of Thunder Charger knuckles will fill that right up.\r\n\r\nDave'),(19480,'9994581d50','[quote:9994581d50]BTW, tested out one of your MS Pros, and it had the same problem I have with all my pros and sports, and that is that it turns excessively tight to the left, and not quite tight enough to the right. I\'ve discovered the problem is in the steering knuckles, and a pair of Thunder Charger knuckles will fill that right up. [/quote:9994581d50]\r\n\r\nI have some Spare TC knuckles so send dem babies home !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19481,'9994581d50','[quote:9994581d50]BTW, tested out one of your MS Pros, and it had the same problem I have with all my pros and sports, and that is that it turns excessively tight to the left, and not quite tight enough to the right. I\'ve discovered the problem is in the steering knuckles, and a pair of Thunder Charger knuckles will fill that right up. [/quote:9994581d50]\r\n\r\nI have some Spare TC knuckles so send dem babies home !'),(19484,'78ce25c1ef','you are very welcome mekinhux! i learned some on this cit as a matter of fact it is better than my original as far as paint goes, i am pleased to be able to help you out, its what make this lil hobbie fun,  to be able to share with others.. so sit back i will get this out to you on monday, i dont know how much it will be for the shipping, just make donation to my paypal account and is ( superpieboy@yahoo.com ) and i will get it out.\r\n\r\ni have gotten bits from toyeast shipped here in the u.s. for 8 bucks so it shouldnt be anymore than that.\r\n\r\n\r\ni will let you know when it is on the way.\r\n\r\njmays'),(19486,'f7c28037c5','Hey I\'m heading to the post office, so I threw together Dirtbombs- Ultraglide in Black for ya, and I\'ll be sending that off today. :-) \r\n\r\nI\'ll probably be heading back to the PO in the next week or so, so I\'ll get some Big Black and Jesus Lizard ready for you by then too.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19487,'d99c3106a2','Sweet.. I\'ll get some early Zappa off to you soon, then we\'ll quit beatin\' that dead horse.  :grin: \r\n\r\nCan\'t wait!'),(21599,'18ba292ac5','No problem, I\'ll let you know when I get it.  \r\n\r\nI do have a question....\r\n\r\nWhere do YOU recommend buying parts for the Mini-T?  I want alloy!! Perferably in green, but chrome or silver will be acceptable or mixture of the two.  Green and Chrome.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nMike'),(19489,'4459b4c2a1','[quote:4459b4c2a1=\"DarkTari\"]\r\n\r\nI have some Spare TC knuckles so send dem babies home ![/quote:4459b4c2a1]I will. Slow down, I need to get the FETs in first. ;) :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(22785,'5f045e8aed','thats too bad that we could not play together without fighting...\r\n\r\nthis would of been one killer example of what this sight could pull off when we all worked together. oh well\r\n\r\nyou will know when its done, and when its casted .\r\n\r\nman who was pissy about who should paint it! i want start no shit promise.\r\n\r\njmays'),(19493,'12350e2634','G\'day. Uh..Can ya help me out? I need parts but dont know many yanks. I\'ll have da awd kit, but also want new suspension kit, bearings, tyre set, rsx bodkit, light set. Got any idea where i can find a pair of short cf driveshafts? I\'ll pay extra fo trouble');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19494,'6d1eca4dec','Hey i need help, i will take the awd, but need more! Can ya get me bearings, tyre set, susp. Set, light set? (52 usd+post+trouble) and where can i get 2x short carbon driveshafts? Thanks man!'),(19495,'12350e2634','G\'day. Uh..Can ya help me out? I need parts but dont know many yanks. I\'ll have da awd kit, but also want new suspension kit, bearings, tyre set, rsx bodkit, light set. Got any idea where i can find a pair of short cf driveshafts? I\'ll pay extra fo trouble'),(19496,'6d1eca4dec','Hey i need help, i will take the awd, but need more! Can ya get me bearings, tyre set, susp. Set, light set? (52 usd+post+trouble) and where can i get 2x short carbon driveshafts? Thanks man!'),(19497,'97bf37557b','tinyrc.com has the carbon driveshafts. he owns minizracer.com and is a legit guy.\r\n\r\nif you want all those kits new ya ill do it. umm gime a week or two to set up paypal and all that crap.  another possible way to do this would be for you to pay ph2t that $$ and he ships me an equal amount of fet boarded crap for us yanks. that way no money has to transfer. this could be messy but i think i trust him enough. ill ask him if he is cool with that. if not paypal forsure.\r\n\r\nhow you likin that xmod?'),(19498,'56d2d2eb1a','if your xmod is bone stock i would get stage 2 motors(unless you got a pinion puller) i could hook you up with one or two of thems if you dont wana bother with the whole set but youd have to make your own heat sink. bearings forsure tho i think z bearings work. and the ball diff is a must. i dont like the awd shit but it does have some advantages. and if you want ill throw in a broken headlight kit.\r\n\r\nill sign up for paypal this week. keep on me its summer and im busy but i need to recoup some $$.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19499,'db0e6d68f0','[quote:db0e6d68f0=\"hogjowlz\"]if your xmod is bone stock i would get stage 2 motors(unless you got a pinion puller) i could hook you up with one or two of thems if you dont wana bother with the whole set but youd have to make your own heat sink. bearings forsure tho i think z bearings work. and the ball diff is a must. i dont like the awd shit but it does have some advantages. and if you want ill throw in a broken headlight kit.\r\n\r\nill sign up for paypal this week. keep on me its summer and im busy but i need to recoup some $$.[/quote:db0e6d68f0]\r\n\r\nWhen it comes to motors i steer clear of the Xmod motors, the tamiya or kyosho/mabuchi are much better and thats what i use. Using a bit of heat removes pinions easily too. I am also Putting a turbo on it as there is *bugger all (*bruce\'s saying for \"not much\") room for FETs.\r\n\r\nI tried the Z bearings....they are much wider than the nylon bushings.\r\n\r\n\r\nI don\'t know what to do man, im tight on cash at the mo, so getting all this shit separately is guna be killer on postage. Dont feel like im trying to force ya man!! Look, ya can keep advertising the awd kit, and if it ain\'t claimed i\'ll take it. Sorry to be a complete whore about it and waste yo\' time.'),(19500,'97bf37557b','tinyrc.com has the carbon driveshafts. he owns minizracer.com and is a legit guy.\r\n\r\nif you want all those kits new ya ill do it. umm gime a week or two to set up paypal and all that crap.  another possible way to do this would be for you to pay ph2t that $$ and he ships me an equal amount of fet boarded crap for us yanks. that way no money has to transfer. this could be messy but i think i trust him enough. ill ask him if he is cool with that. if not paypal forsure.\r\n\r\nhow you likin that xmod?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19501,'f5863c42ea','[quote:f5863c42ea=\"hogjowlz\"]tinyrc.com has the carbon driveshafts. he owns minizracer.com and is a legit guy.\r\n\r\nif you want all those kits new ya ill do it. umm gime a week or two to set up paypal and all that crap.  another possible way to do this would be for you to pay ph2t that $$ and he ships me an equal amount of fet boarded crap for us yanks. that way no money has to transfer. this could be messy but i think i trust him enough. ill ask him if he is cool with that. if not paypal forsure.\r\n\r\nhow you likin that xmod?[/quote:f5863c42ea]\r\n\r\nDisregard my last PM, If ya can get the stuff for me i\'m happy, and i am gunna make my own hollow driveshaft for the time being. They are piss easy to make.\r\n\r\nThe list is Ball bearings $19.99, AWD kit $10, Shock/tie bar set $7.99, tyre set $7.99, light set (for a mate( mate means friend)) $5.99.\r\n\r\nYou said sumthin\' about a wheelset, how much ya want for that??\r\n\r\n$52 USD + Postage + Yo\' effort and help.\r\n\r\n\r\nAs i might have said i didn\'t like the xmod until i juiced it up a bit, now its reasonable but has approx 1/8 the power of my mini Z.\r\n\r\nCheers, bruce'),(28335,'0ab975f565','Oh ya, sorry for not saying it arrived. It\'s a great piece of craftsmanship. Probably the only Bit Camaro in existence. Its clean as hell and sits on my computer desk.  :-D');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19504,'72a796aeca','where in west varginia are you? im in pittsburgh. we got a few others around here.'),(19505,'9f64f3cbd4','Wow, finally some people at least in the same region.  I live in Scott Depot right now.  It\'s about 30min West of Charleston.  I\'m moving to Morgantown in August.  That\'s even closer to Pittsburgh.  Where are some of the other guys from?\r\n\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(35225,'565da6d02f','Okay, that\'s fine.\r\n\r\nI will be at the below address from around December 12th to Janurary 9.  Other than those dates, I will be at the address I gave you with my paypal payment.  Thanks again man.\r\n\r\nSean Dill\r\n301 Dominic Drive\r\nScott Depot WV 25560 \r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(19508,'75fa8f1e62','well bird and sg219 live across town from me. and ezenterprizes lives just across the border in ohio by lourdestown but ive never chilled with him.\r\n\r\ncharlestown is pretty far right? i know morgantown isnt that bad of a drive tho. im not from here anyhow haha.'),(19509,'cffd364a5c','Charelston is about 3 hours away from Morgantown.  Just add that to however long it is to get there.  So are you in the city or a suburb?  I\'ve only been in Pittsburg a few times.  \r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34130,'e534d374d0','fine be a hata'),(21551,'e6bb657b8b','[quote:e6bb657b8b=\"crazydave\"][quote:e6bb657b8b=\"CaboWabo\"]want me to send the extras back? I don\'t mind, hell I might have more stuff to unload on ya anyways lol[/quote:e6bb657b8b]Nah, I just was letting you know, so you wouldn\'t wonder why the center of your wheel is black, and so you wouldn\'t think that was just the stock Zip Zap motor in there when you first run it.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:e6bb657b8b] :lol: cool man, thanks for them then'),(19512,'256e158b9a','im about a 6 minute drive from the stadiums. just out of the city but i can see the city from my house.'),(19513,'f5863c42ea','[quote:f5863c42ea=\"hogjowlz\"]tinyrc.com has the carbon driveshafts. he owns minizracer.com and is a legit guy.\r\n\r\nif you want all those kits new ya ill do it. umm gime a week or two to set up paypal and all that crap.  another possible way to do this would be for you to pay ph2t that $$ and he ships me an equal amount of fet boarded crap for us yanks. that way no money has to transfer. this could be messy but i think i trust him enough. ill ask him if he is cool with that. if not paypal forsure.\r\n\r\nhow you likin that xmod?[/quote:f5863c42ea]\r\n\r\nDisregard my last PM, If ya can get the stuff for me i\'m happy, and i am gunna make my own hollow driveshaft for the time being. They are piss easy to make.\r\n\r\nThe list is Ball bearings $19.99, AWD kit $10, Shock/tie bar set $7.99, tyre set $7.99, light set (for a mate( mate means friend)) $5.99.\r\n\r\nYou said sumthin\' about a wheelset, how much ya want for that??\r\n\r\n$52 USD + Postage + Yo\' effort and help.\r\n\r\n\r\nAs i might have said i didn\'t like the xmod until i juiced it up a bit, now its reasonable but has approx 1/8 the power of my mini Z.\r\n\r\nCheers, bruce'),(19514,'839dcf2960','I wasn\'t sure if you missed my post, but I uploaded that tkk.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3359&amp;start=60\r\n\r\nI was never a big fan of these guys, but I love this album. A shame it didn\'t get more attention.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19515,'839dcf2960','I wasn\'t sure if you missed my post, but I uploaded that tkk.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3359&amp;start=60\r\n\r\nI was never a big fan of these guys, but I love this album. A shame it didn\'t get more attention.\r\n\r\nDave'),(19516,'1ce9e03c05','[quote:1ce9e03c05=\"crazydave\"]I wasn\'t sure if you missed my post, but I uploaded that tkk.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3359&amp;start=60\r\n\r\nI was never a big fan of these guys, but I love this album. A shame it didn\'t get more attention.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:1ce9e03c05]well shit, I did - thanks man!\r\ngonna get Live Frogs Set 1 up soon too, I find it better than Set 2.'),(19519,'1ce9e03c05','[quote:1ce9e03c05=\"crazydave\"]I wasn\'t sure if you missed my post, but I uploaded that tkk.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3359&amp;start=60\r\n\r\nI was never a big fan of these guys, but I love this album. A shame it didn\'t get more attention.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:1ce9e03c05]well shit, I did - thanks man!\r\ngonna get Live Frogs Set 1 up soon too, I find it better than Set 2.'),(36363,'e2d7dd524b','You should have got a PM from me. That is weird.\r\n\r\nYes, I got your payment, but was unable to get to the hobby shop today and get those items I ordered. I will be able to get them tomorrow, and will ship your stuff out tomorrow. Everything is boxed up and ready to go, but I\'m still looking through some of my boxes to make sure there isn\'t some parts laying around here. I think I\'ve got it all.\r\n\r\nAnyway, Thanks a lot man. I will send you a tracking number as soon as I get it shipped. This week we are preparing for a boat show, and I just got done driving boats to the convention center all afternoon. Fun fun.\r\n\r\n-JNY');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37791,'9cb59ddb59','Perfect!\r\n\r\nI should either be able to send it today or 2morrow, I am gonna try to squeeze it into today\'s works so I can get it outta the way.\r\n\r\nOne last thing, your real name? unless it does not matter for me to send it to you...\r\n\r\nlater'),(19634,'80dbe52f6b','[quote:80dbe52f6b=\"crazydave\"][quote:80dbe52f6b=\"CaboWabo\"]ok, I\'ve given this TKK you gave me more chances.\r\nit\'s growing on me.\r\nkind of crystal methodish (before crystal method though)\r\n\r\nfor sure weed makes a difference. lol[/quote:80dbe52f6b]You know, now that I think about it, it kinda had to grow on me, and I\'m just now lovin\' it when I dug it out for you.\r\n\r\nReally, the albums that always stuck with me, and ended being ones I keep coming back to, are usually ones that had to grow me. Usually stuff with the intial impact wears off off pretty quick. You can relate to that, can\'t you?\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:80dbe52f6b]relate? shit me and are way too alike there.\r\nwell to be honest, I thought you had no interest in anything but punk, garage, classic rock, rock, metal (heave &amp; speed included) and that was it.\r\n\r\nlong hair, what can I say - I stereo typed a little.\r\nnow that I know it spans way further... I\'m willing to bet I could give a few gigs worth of music that you\'d check out and either get stuck on or at least pull out every now and then.\r\n\r\nok, so what\'s next - I\'m still kinda shootin in the dark here, but I\'m gonna find somethin I know not a lot of people get in to, but I\'m sure you\'d either appreciate or like :???:'),(19635,'80dbe52f6b','[quote:80dbe52f6b=\"crazydave\"][quote:80dbe52f6b=\"CaboWabo\"]ok, I\'ve given this TKK you gave me more chances.\r\nit\'s growing on me.\r\nkind of crystal methodish (before crystal method though)\r\n\r\nfor sure weed makes a difference. lol[/quote:80dbe52f6b]You know, now that I think about it, it kinda had to grow on me, and I\'m just now lovin\' it when I dug it out for you.\r\n\r\nReally, the albums that always stuck with me, and ended being ones I keep coming back to, are usually ones that had to grow me. Usually stuff with the intial impact wears off off pretty quick. You can relate to that, can\'t you?\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:80dbe52f6b]relate? shit me and are way too alike there.\r\nwell to be honest, I thought you had no interest in anything but punk, garage, classic rock, rock, metal (heave &amp; speed included) and that was it.\r\n\r\nlong hair, what can I say - I stereo typed a little.\r\nnow that I know it spans way further... I\'m willing to bet I could give a few gigs worth of music that you\'d check out and either get stuck on or at least pull out every now and then.\r\n\r\nok, so what\'s next - I\'m still kinda shootin in the dark here, but I\'m gonna find somethin I know not a lot of people get in to, but I\'m sure you\'d either appreciate or like :???:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19636,'102e2f65c9','Let me explain my perspective on music to you. \r\n\r\nBig major turning point came in \'79 when I was 9yo. That band was Kiss. Did I love them? Oh fuck no, and that was the problem, these guys were like super hereos. Something supernatural, completely unreal, I was expecting the most awesome, heavy ass music I ever heard, and it was lame gay shit. The only song that came close to sounding like what I expected was God Of Thunder.\r\n\r\nFrom that point on I\'ve been on a constant search, almost a mission, for real music. Raw real shit, that aint fake like Kiss. It\'s amazing the social impact music has on us, and that\'s my reason for being. I like music that shocks people.\r\n\r\nDoes that explain where I\'m coming from and why I favor the stuff I do, particularly the punk/garage stuff? :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(19638,'8ed0df2024','Did you watch that stupid night vid yet?'),(31932,'adde8bf402','Yo DT, everything is cool. I had a cyst removed from back. No big deal, just a pain in the ass.\r\n\r\nDon\'t worry about looking for the WRX body. Of course, I will honor the offer I made you of taking $10 off the price for the Bit to swap for the body. If you want me to hold off on shipping the bit so you can look for the SS body, I will. Otherwise, if you just want to pull the trigger, paypal me the $30 and I\'ll ship your bit ASAP. I\'m cool with it either way. Later.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31933,'490fcc1d46','[quote:490fcc1d46=\"mikirgra\"]Yo DT, everything is cool. I had a cyst removed from back. No big deal, just a pain in the ass.\r\n\r\nDon\'t worry about looking for the WRX body. Of course, I will honor the offer I made you of taking $10 off the price for the Bit to swap for the body. If you want me to hold off on shipping the bit so you can look for the SS body, I will. Otherwise, if you just want to pull the trigger, paypal me the $30 and I\'ll ship your bit ASAP. I\'m cool with it either way. Later.[/quote:490fcc1d46]\r\n\r\nIf I don\'t see it, I\'ll PayPal you the $30.00, no problem.  You can send when you like........\r\n\r\n[b:490fcc1d46]GH Sims\r\n7815 Quill Point Drive\r\nBowie, Md. 20720[/b:490fcc1d46]'),(19640,'102e2f65c9','Let me explain my perspective on music to you. \r\n\r\nBig major turning point came in \'79 when I was 9yo. That band was Kiss. Did I love them? Oh fuck no, and that was the problem, these guys were like super hereos. Something supernatural, completely unreal, I was expecting the most awesome, heavy ass music I ever heard, and it was lame gay shit. The only song that came close to sounding like what I expected was God Of Thunder.\r\n\r\nFrom that point on I\'ve been on a constant search, almost a mission, for real music. Raw real shit, that aint fake like Kiss. It\'s amazing the social impact music has on us, and that\'s my reason for being. I like music that shocks people.\r\n\r\nDoes that explain where I\'m coming from and why I favor the stuff I do, particularly the punk/garage stuff? :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(19712,'ad4c93d17d','hey bitch, wanna get stoned?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37779,'4e56e3576a','ok, i\'m all cashed up.\r\n\r\ngimme a paypal address and the final price (in usd) and i\'ll send the cash and give you a shipping address :-)'),(28437,'25cbd8b421','The deal is good, but I just want to check the car to make sure that it is in working condition before I send it out.  I will let you know tonight about the car.  Here is my info\r\n\r\nAttn: Charlie\r\n366 Robinhill Drive\r\nWilliamsville NY, 14221'),(28438,'25cbd8b421','The deal is good, but I just want to check the car to make sure that it is in working condition before I send it out.  I will let you know tonight about the car.  Here is my info\r\n\r\nAttn: Charlie\r\n366 Robinhill Drive\r\nWilliamsville NY, 14221'),(28439,'892ba13950','Alright, just let me know, and maybe I can send everything out to You tomorrow, Hey just curious but when I put Your name and adress on the package do I put Attn: Charlie, or just Charlie, what does Attn mean, sorry if it\'s something I should know, but I\'m pretty slow sometimes, lol\r\nIs the car going to be a Panther with the Skyline body or the rally racer with the body?\r\nThanks man.'),(28440,'24bd56290a','Oh nevermind, I thought for some reason it said something else, but Attn means attention, sorry about that man, lol\r\nI\'m filling out your address on the package, and packing everything up, by the way what freq is the chassis Your sending me?\r\nThanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28441,'aee5817e33','Hey man,\r\nThis is getting better for Ya everyday, lol, anyway Ya know how I said I only had one MT spring, I found the other now!!!! YAY\r\nso thats better at least You can now have a working suspension.\r\nAlright talk to Ya later\r\nThanks'),(19644,'eda999629b','Thanks.'),(19645,'dd94ff97ef','[quote:dd94ff97ef=\"crazydave\"]Let me explain my perspective on music to you. \r\n\r\nBig major turning point came in \'79 when I was 9yo. That band was Kiss. Did I love them? Oh fuck no, and that was the problem, these guys were like super hereos. Something supernatural, completely unreal, I was expecting the most awesome, heavy ass music I ever heard, and it was lame gay shit. The only song that came close to sounding like what I expected was God Of Thunder.\r\n\r\nFrom that point on I\'ve been on a constant search, almost a mission, for real music. Raw real shit, that aint fake like Kiss. It\'s amazing the social impact music has on us, and that\'s my reason for being. I like music that shocks people.\r\n\r\nDoes that explain where I\'m coming from and why I favor the stuff I do, particularly the punk/garage stuff? :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:dd94ff97ef]yea kind of, cuz again - I\'m very similar lol\r\nbut I have to say - I go through stages now and then.\r\nback then the stages lasted longer, and now-a-days those stages last about long enough to play 3-4 songs and I\'m on to something completely different.\r\n\r\nin the past and still today, I run the gammut from classic rock, rock, metal, grunge, hip hop, rap, obscure, electronica, house, rave, blah, blah, blah, basically everthing you wanna call it except country and opera.\r\nof course there\'s varying degress of \"like\" in there, but for the most part - I really do go from one end of the spectrum to another.\r\nI\'ve got over 50 gigs of tunes and that\'s not including anything I have on CD that I\'ve bought in the past.\r\nI usually put about 5 gigs worth queued up in a playlist and push random and it gets me through my entire work day easily.'),(19646,'a10f8bb117','to continue my post...\r\nI was gonna post it right up cuz I don\'t care who knows what - but then I thought - I don\'t wanna put ya on the spot or come off in the wrong way\r\nbut here\'t goes.\r\n[quote:a10f8bb117=\"CaboWabo\"]word Namuney\r\nI know I hear ya, I\'m the mods here hear ya too.[/quote:a10f8bb117]\r\nwhat you need is support *nudge - nudge* the kind you get here.\r\nc\'mon - you\'ve already got your chair moved into our crib - now you just need to sit in it more often.\r\n\r\nnow don\'t get me wrong here.\r\nI\'m not askin ya to give your pal - you need to keep that going, just like payaso and kwik did/does (one disappeared, the other - has his own schedule)\r\nI\'d just like to see you here more often.\r\nyou\'re someone people like to hear from and talk to and you already have the respect and authority associated with a moderator/administrator.\r\nof course I\'m asking because I know you\'d be beneficial to our crew, but I\'m asking because I think you\'d have more fun - and I (and I\'m sure others) would like to see/talk to ya more often (as much as possible anyways, being married like most of us lol)\r\n\r\nso puff on that for awhile.\r\nno rush - just wanted to put it out there.\r\nI can take rejection you mother fucker lol\r\nno really and seriously, it\'s an offer to you - you do with it what you like and no hard feelings can result whatever your decision\r\n\r\nanyways, enough pussy - sugar coat talk. lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19647,'b002d3ccf2','Dude, what in the hell did you just say!?\r\n\r\nI THINK you offered me Mod, Did you? Did you just offer me Modship over here in Pimpsville?\r\n\r\nIf so, well shit I gladly accept!...IF you would allow me 2 things\r\n1. Keep my change in status on the DL, as a matter of fact if you could keep my title from not saying Mod that would be even better. It ain\'t because I\'m trying to be sneaky, I\'m just the type that likes to walk quiet and carry a BIG FUCKING STICK! \r\n2. And as long as we\'re cool with the notion that I don\'t give up Mod at TRC, it\'s all good.\r\n\r\n- Lincoln (aka Namuna)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:b002d3ccf2=\"CaboWabo\"]to continue my post...\r\nI was gonna post it right up cuz I don\'t care who knows what - but then I thought - I don\'t wanna put ya on the spot or come off in the wrong way\r\nbut here\'t goes.\r\n[quote:b002d3ccf2=\"CaboWabo\"]word Namuney\r\nI know I hear ya, I\'m the mods here hear ya too.[/quote:b002d3ccf2]\r\nwhat you need is support *nudge - nudge* the kind you get here.\r\nc\'mon - you\'ve already got your chair moved into our crib - now you just need to sit in it more often.\r\n\r\nnow don\'t get me wrong here.\r\nI\'m not askin ya to give your pal - you need to keep that going, just like payaso and kwik did/does (one disappeared, the other - has his own schedule)\r\nI\'d just like to see you here more often.\r\nyou\'re someone people like to hear from and talk to and you already have the respect and authority associated with a moderator/administrator.\r\nof course I\'m asking because I know you\'d be beneficial to our crew, but I\'m asking because I think you\'d have more fun - and I (and I\'m sure others) would like to see/talk to ya more often (as much as possible anyways, being married like most of us lol)\r\n\r\nso puff on that for awhile.\r\nno rush - just wanted to put it out there.\r\nI can take rejection you mother fucker lol\r\nno really and seriously, it\'s an offer to you - you do with it what you like and no hard feelings can result whatever your decision\r\n\r\nanyways, enough pussy - sugar coat talk. lol[/quote:b002d3ccf2]'),(27077,'c1de7ec62d','Hey Hog,\r\n\r\nCan ya hook me up with some Doom III action? I\'d DL it over BitTorrent, but with all the shit goin down over BT I\'m tryin to stay away from any \'questionable\' behavior.\r\n\r\nReceived my 6800GT last night and now I wanna put that badboy to USE.\r\n\r\nThanks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (27714,'8b2957aca1','I sent that out this afternoon. :-) \r\n\r\nHave fun.'),(37720,'f8831e87bc','Can\'t afford the remotes right now. If you still have them next week, then no problem. I\'ll send the $22 for the chassis tomorrow.....thanks :)'),(28048,'9d791cdc2d','a month or so..'),(27717,'dc2ff432d8','[quote:dc2ff432d8=\"LoRDDeVO2\"]Hows it going man.  Yea I been browsing more than repling lately ... I will post up a Pic today to show you the Progress.... \r\n\r\nHows your T coming ?[/quote:dc2ff432d8]\r\n\r\nCool.  I was just messing around with mine the other day and was wondering how your was turnin\' out to be. :cool: \r\n\r\nI\'m still at the chassis stage.  I might put some electronics I already have in it till I can buy the good stuff that I want so bad.  (Mamba, JR XS3 Pro, and a good servo.)\r\n\r\nRight now I have a Tekin Speed Star ESC, a JR2 RX and TX, and the Trinity motor.  \r\n\r\nI just picked up my first Nitro rides a couple of weeks ago and they\'ve been keeping me busy.  Plus, I grabbed Payaso\'s Bandit and that my first 1:10th ride.\r\n\r\nI have alot of learning to do. :-? \r\n\r\nAny new rides in your collection?'),(27233,'dab78c6593','talk to you later then.\r\n\r\nCharge up a pack.\r\n\r\nAbout 9:30 or 10 cool?\r\n\r\nif not ring my phone.\r\n\r\nlater....  :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36310,'676739df21','Long day one more question before i hit the sack.\r\n\r\nCan the 1:16 electronics handle a plasmatomic and that 850 mah lipo pack?\r\n\r\nWhenever you get back to me about that shipping ? i\'ll send the dough your way. Probably tomorrow i guess!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Matt'),(32828,'8223c1c2b7','Thanks again man, I really like the wallpaper.'),(34992,'74b69e6e35','[quote:74b69e6e35=\"hue35\"][quote:74b69e6e35=\"CaboWabo\"]Hey dude,\r\nI seem to remember you saying somefin about making a DVD with the bitPimps movie you did on there.\r\nI\'d like to get the source file to make a DVD myself - think you could that mutha to me somehow?\r\nAlso, just out of curiousity, what size is the source file? Like is it sized for the web at 640 x 480 or for TV at 720 x 480?\r\n\r\nOh... and while I\'m PM\'ing ya.\r\nI\'ve noticed your emails from bitPimps are bouncing back, from loosing your ISP, if you don\'t have a useable email address yet, I can send you a gmail invite if you want, you could use that for your online activities or whatever. Just let me know.[/quote:74b69e6e35]\r\n\r\nYeah, that was the plan, but there wasn\'t a shitload of interest, so I didn\'t make it a priority. I\'m still plannin\' on it, but it\'s just a matter of getting it done. Everything is done except the artwork and the DVD interface. It\'s sized for TV... what are you plannin\' on doing with it, outta curiosity?\r\n\r\nOh shit, yeah... I\'ll change my email settings in my profile. I\'ve got a gmail account, so that\'ll work great.[/quote:74b69e6e35]\r\nNuttin that cool really.\r\nSince I just upgraded to a new computer, I\'ve finally got the ability to create DVDs.\r\nI started out with a quick, little, shitball project and it was kinda cool - even just to see it on TV if nothing else.\r\nMy initial thoughts are to create an \"archive\" of sorts but have it viewable/browse-able via the TV.\r\nMy little project basically had an animated menu screen with hotspots to the video you made (copied offline so it was a little pixelated on TV, that\'s why I want the source), that \"lions vs hyenas\" video, bitPimps wallpapers slide show, NERD video un-censored, and a few other little stupid items.\r\nI\'ve got a shit-ton of ideas for DVDs, but no content really.\r\nI wish we all had badass video capabilities and fuckloads of time, the options would be near endless.'),(34120,'2d697e2c91','y do you hate me');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34121,'5e7f10aea1','Cause of stupid shit like this.   You are so fuckin thick headed it quit being funny after your first dozen posts.  I thought for real you were some smartass pretending to be a n00b.  No, you\'re the real deal; a fucking retard who has no idea he\'s retarded.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(19650,'1531893b4a','lol yea - guess I should just been straight to the point.\r\nsee that\'s where me and crazydave relate - shitload of words for little point.\r\nanyways.\r\nI could, if it\'s that important to you - I\'d be glad to do it. just say the word.\r\n\r\nnow I\'ll give you the \"but\".\r\nbut, it\'d make it easier if I just put you in the \"moderators\" group.\r\nthe only thing to signify you as a moderator is the title \"bitPimp\" under your username (I think only kids pay attention to that) and your name will be bold on the \"who\'s online\" list (unless you make yourself \"hidden\").\r\nso the only the other thing you\'d need to do is maybe make a post in the moderators forum and tell the other moderators you\'d like it to stay \"hush-hush\". I\'m sure they\'d understand.\r\n\r\nand as far as I\'m concerned. you\'re in - I can deal with your terms :lol: \r\nlet me know what you want to do and I\'ll make it happen.\r\n[quote=\"Namuna\"]Dude, what in the hell did you just say!?\r\n\r\nI THINK you offered me Mod, Did you? Did you just offer me Modship over here in Pimpsville?\r\n\r\nIf so, well shit I gladly accept!...IF you would allow me 2 things\r\n1. Keep my change in status on the DL, as a matter of fact if you could keep my title from not saying Mod that would be even better. It ain\'t because I\'m trying to be sneaky, I\'m just the type that likes to walk quiet and carry a BIG FUCKING STICK! \r\n2. And as long as we\'re cool with the notion that I don\'t give up Mod at TRC, it\'s all good.\r\n\r\n- Lincoln (aka Namuna)'),(19651,'24cba9abc2','Bring it on man! \r\n\r\nI can live with \'bitPimp\', hell I didn\'t even know it meant Mod until you just told me, so it\'s cool.\r\n\r\nGravy!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19652,'bd8e9915cd','lol yea - guess I should just been straight to the point.\r\nsee that\'s where me and crazydave relate - shitload of words for little point.\r\nanyways.\r\nI could, if it\'s that important to you - I\'d be glad to do it. just say the word.\r\n\r\nnow I\'ll give you the \"but\".\r\nbut, it\'d make it easier if I just put you in the \"moderators\" group like the others.\r\nthe only thing to signify you as a moderator is the title \"bitPimp\" under your username (I think only kids pay attention to that) and your name will be bold on the \"who\'s online\" list (unless you make yourself \"hidden\").\r\nso the only the other thing you\'d need to do is maybe make a post in the moderators forum and tell the other moderators you\'d like it to stay \"hush-hush\". I\'m sure they\'d understand.\r\n\r\nand as far as I\'m concerned. you\'re in - I can deal with your terms :lol: \r\nlet me know what you want to do and I\'ll make it happen.\r\n\r\np.s. if you\'re worried about PMs from being a moderator, the most come to hogjowlz or myself - either asking him \"why are you on my ass\" or asking me \"why is hogjowlz on my ass\" lol\r\nso I don\'t think you\'d be inundated.\r\n[quote:bd8e9915cd=\"Namuna\"]Dude, what in the hell did you just say!?\r\n\r\nI THINK you offered me Mod, Did you? Did you just offer me Modship over here in Pimpsville?\r\n\r\nIf so, well shit I gladly accept!...IF you would allow me 2 things\r\n1. Keep my change in status on the DL, as a matter of fact if you could keep my title from not saying Mod that would be even better. It ain\'t because I\'m trying to be sneaky, I\'m just the type that likes to walk quiet and carry a BIG FUCKING STICK! \r\n2. And as long as we\'re cool with the notion that I don\'t give up Mod at TRC, it\'s all good.\r\n\r\n- Lincoln (aka Namuna)[/quote:bd8e9915cd]'),(27371,'f2bc02d2df','Yessir!\r\n\r\nEnjoy!...it\'s 20mb, so be ready for it to take a few to DL.\r\n\r\nhttp://tinyrc.com/lincoln/movies/Misc/BreakinTransformers.zip');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19654,'dd94ff97ef','[quote:dd94ff97ef=\"crazydave\"]Let me explain my perspective on music to you. \r\n\r\nBig major turning point came in \'79 when I was 9yo. That band was Kiss. Did I love them? Oh fuck no, and that was the problem, these guys were like super hereos. Something supernatural, completely unreal, I was expecting the most awesome, heavy ass music I ever heard, and it was lame gay shit. The only song that came close to sounding like what I expected was God Of Thunder.\r\n\r\nFrom that point on I\'ve been on a constant search, almost a mission, for real music. Raw real shit, that aint fake like Kiss. It\'s amazing the social impact music has on us, and that\'s my reason for being. I like music that shocks people.\r\n\r\nDoes that explain where I\'m coming from and why I favor the stuff I do, particularly the punk/garage stuff? :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:dd94ff97ef]yea kind of, cuz again - I\'m very similar lol\r\nbut I have to say - I go through stages now and then.\r\nback then the stages lasted longer, and now-a-days those stages last about long enough to play 3-4 songs and I\'m on to something completely different.\r\n\r\nin the past and still today, I run the gammut from classic rock, rock, metal, grunge, hip hop, rap, obscure, electronica, house, rave, blah, blah, blah, basically everthing you wanna call it except country and opera.\r\nof course there\'s varying degress of \"like\" in there, but for the most part - I really do go from one end of the spectrum to another.\r\nI\'ve got over 50 gigs of tunes and that\'s not including anything I have on CD that I\'ve bought in the past.\r\nI usually put about 5 gigs worth queued up in a playlist and push random and it gets me through my entire work day easily.'),(31418,'35b494ab97','[quote:35b494ab97=\"Tuner1989\"][quote:35b494ab97=\"viperdout\"][quote:35b494ab97=\"Tuner1989\"]beause my local tru is at least a a hour away its easier just to get a controller that i know works.[/quote:35b494ab97]\r\n\r\nAh, ok.  So 10+shipping is what you offered?  Where am I shipping this to?[/quote:35b494ab97]\r\n\r\n\r\nCan we do 10 shipped? I need your paypal address and it would be shipped to florida.\r\n\r\nMatt Gera\r\n4303 Radcliffe Dr.\r\nPalm Harbor Fl.\r\n34685[/quote:35b494ab97]\r\n\r\nI\'ll send it to you when I\'m home, which will be in roughly 7 hours, so I can make sure I still have it and all.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31498,'7a043d66cf','Thanks man i appreciate it. Do you think it will reach here by saturday?'),(31499,'057579848d','Well I\'d like to say thank you for the props.\r\n\r\nI am a much more active member at ripper7racing. In fact I am a moderator over there. We have an online magazine, which, I\'m happy to say that in our past issue, I wrote a tutorial/article on lowering a bit. The link to the magazine is [url=http://www.ripper7racing.com/Magazine/]here[/url]. When you get there, click on \"Micros and Minis\", which will take you to our current issue. I believe my article is the last one.\r\n\r\nThe pics in the mag are a little small, so if you want, here is a link to my r7r gallery, where I have the larger pics: [url=http://www.ripper7racing.com/galleries/profile.php?uid=22]link![/url] Click on lowering mod tutorial.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'d like to also invite you to r7r. It is a bit more friendly of a community than bitPimps(not that BP is bad).\r\n\r\nAnyway, whether or not you join us at r7r is not important. Make sure you take pics and don\'t forget who told you how to lower  :-o \r\n\r\nFeel free to PM me back anytime.\r\n\r\nGood luck,\r\n~midget_man1387~'),(19678,'bdc5a1e65a','[quote:bdc5a1e65a=\"viperdout\"]Cabo:\r\n\r\nI do not know why Hog is mad at me, and he will not reply to me telling why.  Instead, he sent a copy of my pm (I\'m guessing) to betty.k and betty.k then replied with hatemail about something that did not involve him.  Hog has also been abusing his mod privilages, by editing a post of mine and turning it into insulting gibberish.  Maybe you can pm him and get something out of him, because I honestly don\'t know what I did to piss him off.  I have tried to deal with it by PMing him, he just won\'t say.  Thanks.\r\n\r\n-Max[/quote:bdc5a1e65a]yea I\'ve been somewhat informed on this whole situation.\r\nhogjowlz is riding your ass because of your posts on the forums.\r\nour moderators work hard on keeping the forums clean and organized.\r\n\r\nthere aren\'t many rules here to follow, but we do have a few - and we expect each and every one of our members to follow them. members in the past who haven\'t followed those rules got the same treatment - so don\'t think you\'re being singled out here.\r\n\r\nnow whether you know it or not - you are in the wrong. one example is your post about those batteries that were on sale.\r\ntypical forum etiquette on any forum is to NOT double post (spam), which you did. when hogjowlz called you out on it and told you not to double post the same post in 2 different forum categories - you fought him on it and said something to the effect of \"yes it does belong in both places\".\r\n\r\nthere\'s more, but that alone makes you completely in the wrong.\r\nthose are our rules (and rules at just about every other forum online) and a moderator asked you to follow them. your response was to argue - that\'s not smart.\r\n\r\nthe more you make extra work for our moderators and the more you clutter up the boards for other members - the more you\'re going to piss those people off and their going to let you know about it one way or another.\r\n\r\npimps that follow the rules have no problems here - so if you want it to stop, you need to do the same, and it will.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19657,'e1de18ada6','[quote:e1de18ada6=\"CaboWabo\"]in the past and still today, I run the gammut from classic rock, rock, metal, grunge, hip hop, rap, obscure, electronica, house, rave, blah, blah, blah, basically everthing you wanna call it except country and opera.\r\nof course there\'s varying degress of \"like\" in there, but for the most part - I really do go from one end of the spectrum to another.\r\nI\'ve got over 50 gigs of tunes and that\'s not including anything I have on CD that I\'ve bought in the past.\r\nI usually put about 5 gigs worth queued up in a playlist and push random and it gets me through my entire work day easily.[/quote:e1de18ada6]I was raised in a household that listened to all types of music. I never like how you had to listen to a certain music to hang with a certain crowd. I was the \"punk\" that hung with a crowd of stoners, they were always teasing me about \"Dave\'s music\". Then I just didn\'t fit in with the punks at all. They were wanna be skater/jock type punks, that wanted to call me a poser, cause I was stoned, but I think they were the posers. I\'ve only known a couple people that \"got it\" when it comes to me and music.\r\n\r\ndave\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI don\'t know what the hell I\'m rambling about anymore. Time for bed. :lol:'),(19658,'003d6d6281','When did Namuna become a moderator ?  Just curious  :???:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36447,'59f9d4ab9c','Betty thanks your always a great help man! \r\n\r\nI think i might just leave my chassis as is. Just upgrade the FETS and mayve increase the steering power or something. \r\n\r\nI am going to purchase those Iwaver Pro boards, get one for my Iwaver 02, and a couple for my other Xmods. \r\n\r\nI like the Iwaver controllers better than the xmods so it would be nice to get em all running. \r\n\r\nI got my MR-02 nice and stock for the track, maybe just add a few hop up parts here and there. As for the Iwaver and Xmods, it is all about projects, and testing.\r\n\r\nThanks for your time...'),(31452,'5a04ca82f2','Sorry, this might sound odd, but a lightning bolt struck about 20 feet from my house and fucked up my router, so I didn\'t have internet for the past 2 days.  Send it to ltauber@lehman.cuny.edu (I use my mom\'s paypal).   Just put your address in, and I\'ll send it out today priority.'),(31558,'2440221ba4','I got your package today thanks  :-) i really appreciate the batterys and electronics too.\r\n\r\n--Matt :-o');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36528,'f67ba0f488','I know you talk to ph2t a lot and since I haven\'t seen him online, I was hoping you could pass along some questions to him?\r\nHe is a network administrator right?\r\n\r\nI wanted to know if he is familiar with MS Exchange 2003?\r\nI\'m getting an &quot;Unable to bind to the destination server in DNS&quot; message in the queue.\r\n\r\nI\'ve got more info but don\'t wanna go into it all if I\'m barking up the wrong tree.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks dude.'),(31456,'4487cefafc','Yep, got payment, and everything\'s included.  I\'ll Get it out ASAP.'),(33016,'d205f782a5','Hmmm....  This is fuckin gay.  Well, don\'t worry, I am being fucked by intercontenental shipping a lot latly.....  If it\'s ok with you give it another week, if you don\'t get it by next tues PM me and I\'ll see what I can do.  I have assloads of SEs, and I should be able to throw together another stock MT.  As for the extras... well I don\'t know.  \r\n\r\nThis sucks'),(31900,'357c4d2f0d','[quote:357c4d2f0d=\"DarkTari\"]He\'s Baaack !\r\n\r\nhttp://tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;postid=192037#post192037[/quote:357c4d2f0d]\r\n\r\nBlah, this explains it:\r\nhttp://www.freewebs.com/mototuner05/aboutme.htm\r\n\r\nOur little mosquito is only 12yrs old.  :roll: \r\n\r\nI\'ll leave it up to you how far to mess with him, he register (and re-registered) with these 2 email accounts:\r\n\r\nanthony7893@hotmail.com \r\ncrazysk8r777@yahoo.com');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34480,'e368d2796e','Sure,\r\n        I gotta wait until I can get at my computer at home though.  This computer at work doesn\'t write Kanji.  My computer at home does.  Do you want it writen in Chinese Kanji or Japanese (slight difference).  Also, how do you pronounce your name?  That\'s important.\r\n\r\nI\'ll be at my computer tomorrow.  I\'m working on a 36 hour shift.  I can sleep and eat, but I just can\'t go home.  Every 6 days I pull one of these shifts for an emergency medical response team.'),(37589,'6c2a8af979','Which body do you have? I noticed my friends Saleen body to be rather long for an MM fit, it was longer than my F50 Ferrari RM fit.'),(19667,'5957369b07','Cabo:\r\n\r\nI do not know why Hog is mad at me, and he will not reply to me telling why.  Instead, he sent a copy of my pm (I\'m guessing) to betty.k and betty.k then replied with hatemail about something that did not involve him.  Hog has also been abusing his mod privilages, by editing a post of mine and turning it into insulting gibberish.  Maybe you can pm him and get something out of him, because I honestly don\'t know what I did to piss him off.  I have tried to deal with it by PMing him, he just won\'t say.  Thanks.\r\n\r\n-Max'),(36980,'6a67a1a9da','Trying to get myself set-up for some hobbies when in Oz and wondering if and how often you guys run the HPI Micros or the Losi Mini-T/LST\'s? And perhaps more importantly how difficult is it to get parts? I\'ve got a good good source for both and wondering if it\'d be worth the effort or if the $$ would be better spent on my trusty old MR-01 \'Z. \r\n\r\nI\'ve got the Mr-01 and a couple XMods so far... and WAY to many bits!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19687,'c6c686ca9d','[quote:c6c686ca9d=\"viperdout\"]I did not realize.  I felt it should\'ve been in both, but obivously that sohuldn\'t be done.  I apoligize (sp).  Feel free to send a copy to hog.  If he simply pmed me and said no, then fine.  Hell, he could\'ve deleted the whole thread, but instead, he decided to screw around with my posts.  He in fact sent me a PM, saying the next time I post, he\'d edit it, for spite.  If he felt that way, there is a delete button.[/quote:c6c686ca9d]again - don\'t feel singled out. that\'s how hogjowlz moderates everyone, not just you.'),(19673,'e1de18ada6','[quote:e1de18ada6=\"CaboWabo\"]in the past and still today, I run the gammut from classic rock, rock, metal, grunge, hip hop, rap, obscure, electronica, house, rave, blah, blah, blah, basically everthing you wanna call it except country and opera.\r\nof course there\'s varying degress of \"like\" in there, but for the most part - I really do go from one end of the spectrum to another.\r\nI\'ve got over 50 gigs of tunes and that\'s not including anything I have on CD that I\'ve bought in the past.\r\nI usually put about 5 gigs worth queued up in a playlist and push random and it gets me through my entire work day easily.[/quote:e1de18ada6]I was raised in a household that listened to all types of music. I never like how you had to listen to a certain music to hang with a certain crowd. I was the \"punk\" that hung with a crowd of stoners, they were always teasing me about \"Dave\'s music\". Then I just didn\'t fit in with the punks at all. They were wanna be skater/jock type punks, that wanted to call me a poser, cause I was stoned, but I think they were the posers. I\'ve only known a couple people that \"got it\" when it comes to me and music.\r\n\r\ndave\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI don\'t know what the hell I\'m rambling about anymore. Time for bed. :lol:'),(19674,'003d6d6281','When did Namuna become a moderator ?  Just curious  :???:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19768,'8e035d9277','Yo Trent,\r\n\r\nI got the Hummer last week.  Man you put some ingenuity into that thing.\r\nHaving a problem charging it on the tx so I used my custom multi-batt charger and it runs great.  Now I think Ima throw some brush guards, maybe some roof lights and a rack, gotta do a snorkle, would be a real off-roader without one.\r\n\r\nThanx Again Pimp!  I\'ll keep ya posted  :cool:'),(31495,'ad47cc01df','It\'ll be in the Post office in roughly 10 minutes.'),(31681,'7d44545c98','Hi\r\n\r\nNY toy fair is the biggest. Held in February each year at the Javits centre.\r\nNext year on 12-15th feb.\r\n\r\nHere is a link\r\nhttp://www.toy-tia.org/Content/NavigationMenu/TIA_Trade_Shows_and_Events/American_International_TOY_FAIR/American_International_TOY_FAIR1.htm\r\n\r\nIf you want to go you will have to get a free ticket. Need to prove that you are a toy company or shop or agent - just lie! (but you will need a business card - photoshop!)\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTB'),(31682,'9a244bc373','count me in one 2 of those shells when you get them in let me know');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31683,'25dd552819','OK Will do. Need to organise a group buy for the USA pimps.\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTB'),(31684,'25dd552819','OK Will do. Need to organise a group buy for the USA pimps.\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTB'),(33096,'4015b58ec5','[quote:4015b58ec5=\"Tuner1989\"][quote:4015b58ec5=\"viperdout\"]I am T-Bolt on MZR.  Just letting you know.  I tried to get the same username there, but I never got the validation email.[/quote:4015b58ec5]\r\n\r\n\r\nLol i thought so but i didnt know so i thought what the heck ill post it.\r\n\r\nMy instincts were right lol :-) \r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt[/quote:4015b58ec5]\r\n\r\nYep, and thanks for pointing that out (if it wasn\'t me).'),(27679,'b651013891','[quote:b651013891=\"viperdout\"]Dave:\r\n\r\nWell, looks like I will then, and I\'ll just not stall it.\r\n\r\n-Max[/quote:b651013891]I\'m sorry, you lost me. :? \r\n\r\nYou will what?  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(31680,'1b26422822','Hi:\r\n\r\nI just noticed that you mentioned there was a toy fair in NYC, and I was curious as to where it\'s located and usually what time of the year it occurs.  Does it have bigger R/Cs also?  Thanks for any help.\r\n\r\n-Max\r\n\r\nP.S.- Love the mat, and it might be a neat idea to make an offroad/rally course for the zip zap monsters and lifted bits.'),(31588,'a6c7f5feb4','[quote:a6c7f5feb4=\"Tuner1989\"]I got your package today thanks  :-) i really appreciate the batterys and electronics too.\r\n\r\n--Matt :-o[/quote:a6c7f5feb4]\r\n\r\nMatt:\r\n\r\nNo prob.  Glad to know everything got there in one piece.\r\n\r\n-Max');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33079,'cf023e6acb','[quote:cf023e6acb=\"viperdout\"]I am T-Bolt on MZR.  Just letting you know.  I tried to get the same username there, but I never got the validation email.[/quote:cf023e6acb]\r\n\r\n\r\nLol i thought so but i didnt know so i thought what the heck ill post it.\r\n\r\nMy instincts were right lol :-) \r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt'),(20106,'bcbeba3f89','Sinned I love that new clone you been using.  How much did one of those run ya?  Where did you get them?  If I paypal you the money do you think you hook a pimp up...\r\n 8-) \r\nThanks Man,\r\n\r\nMike'),(20107,'d181843a3a','Whazzup Crazy Dave,\r\n\r\nI\'m JackD, the cat that just won the auction for the VW bus over the weekend.  I am not sure how to submit payment.  I can do paypal, check or money order or even cold cash since we\'re among fellow pimps.  Holla at me sometime,  you can also use email upree.john@epa.gov.............thanks jd'),(29176,'3affe32c48','Is it ok if i just send you money in an envolop? Your in Ontairo or something? (got it from the ebay :P)\r\n\r\nAnyways..go msn? Add me: ez_icz_is@gmail.com');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (29204,'bd6f9e2217','[quote:bd6f9e2217=\"Mazda787b\"]Don\'t forget, even though it looks like I never do anything, I still do sell stuff through the store.  :-D[/quote:bd6f9e2217]\r\n\r\nWhat kinds of things do you sell?  \r\n\r\nCan I get you to add CJ\'s Hobbies.net to your links on your page?'),(31648,'a755a85305','Hi , there \r\nThe digi q is packaged up and ready to go with a printed adress.\r\nI didnt manage to get it out before the weekend wich i am very sorry about but i have been real busy . I will make sure i DEFINATLY post it out on monday (its sunday here ) .As there is no point posting today as the post office isnt open and even if it was it wouldnt be shipped out untill moday . Hope you understand \r\nJOE!\r\n :-)'),(19679,'02c4c2ec4b','Hey jowlz,\r\n\r\nHeres the lst if i never gave it to ya, ive revised it a bit.\r\n\r\n-Xmods AWD Kit ($10)\r\n\r\n-Xmods Shock/ Tie rod kit ($7.99)\r\n\r\n-Xmods Tyre set ($7.99)\r\n\r\n-Xmods Bearing Set ($19.99)\r\n\r\n-Xmods Light set ($5.99)\r\n\r\n-And I am really looking for the  3.82:1 (blue) and 4.40:1 (yellow) gearsets and pinions anyway ya can hook me up??\r\n\r\nAlso that wheelset you were talking about, what do ya want for it??\r\n\r\ncheers man\r\n\r\nJamie'),(19680,'2531103a8a','I did not realize.  I felt it should\'ve been in both, but obivously that sohuldn\'t be done.  I apoligize (sp).  Feel free to send a copy to hog.  If he simply pmed me and said no, then fine.  Hell, he could\'ve deleted the whole thread, but instead, he decided to screw around with my posts.  He in fact sent me a PM, saying the next time I post, he\'d edit it, for spite.  If he felt that way, there is a delete button.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19691,'e9e24389f1','Well, I saw your site, \"ripper7racing\" and all. I though it was pretty cool, until I saw ph2t, sessiz, and sg219 were mods. \r\n\r\nLet me ask in advance, if I register, and follow the rules and behave, will I be banned in 3 posts? Will I be judged by the mistakes I made at other sites, or be given a fair chance? I don\'t want to register and be given the \"Congratulations, chuck, you are now the first banned member!\" bullshit.'),(19692,'fbbebe523f','Is this charlie brown? The Chuckster? msn or email me at:\r\n\r\nripper7777777@hotmail.com\r\n\r\n\r\nand all people are treated fairly at R7R, I created R7R because I was tired of the Forum Nazi\'s.'),(19693,'fbbebe523f','Is this charlie brown? The Chuckster? msn or email me at:\r\n\r\nripper7777777@hotmail.com\r\n\r\n\r\nand all people are treated fairly at R7R, I created R7R because I was tired of the Forum Nazi\'s.'),(19695,'cb1892f0c4','[quote:cb1892f0c4=\"DarkTari\"]When did Namuna become a moderator ?  Just curious  :???:[/quote:cb1892f0c4]last night.\r\nI was talkin with him and decided it was time.\r\n\r\nkeep this between me and you, but here\'s what I was thinking...\r\n\r\nNamuna already has the reputation from TinyRC and we all know he\'s a good moderator and a good contributor with his info and pics.\r\n\r\nbut what really gives us an edge is we got him here. remember when this thing first started and people came to check us out after they found out that moderators from TinyRC were moderators here at bitPimps. essentially the moderators are moving to where the action is, or better to say - the moderators help bring the action where ever they go.\r\n\r\nsee where I\'m coming from?\r\nI\'m kinda hoping this is gonna help drive the nail in the coffin and help get bitPimps known as \"The biggest, the best, and the only\".\r\n\r\nnow, the other huge benefit I see from this is help.\r\nSome of us do shitloads to help bitPimps and it keeps them busy, overwhelmed even. I think he\'ll be able to pick up some of the things we just don\'t have time for anymore and probably even come up with some of his own cool ideas.\r\n\r\nI didn\'t discuss my decision with anyone, I know I probably should have. I thought about it for quite sometime now and finally decided last night - screw it - let\'s see what happens.\r\n\r\n\r\ny\'all cool wit dat? got any thoughts on it?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19696,'9b4ede95d4','I\'m Cool Wit Dat Pimp  :cool: \r\n\r\nNow for the Auction, I thought we\'d call it [b:9b4ede95d4]Da BitPimps Back Alley Auction[/b:9b4ede95d4], gotta nice ring to it.  Man I just took my pics today after the sun finally decided to come out.  Hadda do a lotta shit to 2 of the cars last night. Hadda change the whole chassis on one of them, wouldn\'t charge sometimes and acted fuckt up with the body on.  Hadda redo the wheelwells on the other. Didn\'t allow a tollarence for paint &amp; clearcoat.\r\nBut everything is on schedule, all cars are runnin &amp; lookin BLING  :shock: \r\nReady for Da Block  :eek: \r\nI\'ll be postin tonight, Guess I\'ll post in Contest unless you throw another forum in today sometime  :???:   didn\'t see it when I logged on, remember\r\n[b:9b4ede95d4]Da BitPimps Back Alley Auction[/b:9b4ede95d4] if so......'),(19697,'ad12d5de30','[quote:ad12d5de30=\"ripper7777777\"]Is this charlie brown? The Chuckster? msn or email me at:\r\n\r\nripper7777777@hotmail.com\r\n\r\n\r\nand all people are treated fairly at R7R, I created R7R because I was tired of the Forum Nazi\'s.[/quote:ad12d5de30]\r\n\r\nYup, this is Charlie Brown. And do the forum nazi\'s include WGU?'),(19698,'ff139e82db','delete post http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3763 I don\'t need it anymore');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19699,'5513a11da5','Yes they do, I argued with stride and Capt Black to no end about what he did, even cheesecake who is not your biggest fan did not think it was fair.  Then when they continued to harrass members and treat them badly I got tired of arguing and quit as Admin and R7R was born, so feel free to join as Charlie Brown or whatever and you will get a fair shake from me, look at all the trouble talon has caused at other forums and he is a member of R7R.'),(19700,'2d4429744d','[img:2d4429744d]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/images/avatars/45a6a1b340ca6e4c77797.jpg[/img:2d4429744d]\r\n\r\nLOL, too true!!  :-D'),(19701,'9b4ede95d4','I\'m Cool Wit Dat Pimp  :cool: \r\n\r\nNow for the Auction, I thought we\'d call it [b:9b4ede95d4]Da BitPimps Back Alley Auction[/b:9b4ede95d4], gotta nice ring to it.  Man I just took my pics today after the sun finally decided to come out.  Hadda do a lotta shit to 2 of the cars last night. Hadda change the whole chassis on one of them, wouldn\'t charge sometimes and acted fuckt up with the body on.  Hadda redo the wheelwells on the other. Didn\'t allow a tollarence for paint &amp; clearcoat.\r\nBut everything is on schedule, all cars are runnin &amp; lookin BLING  :shock: \r\nReady for Da Block  :eek: \r\nI\'ll be postin tonight, Guess I\'ll post in Contest unless you throw another forum in today sometime  :???:   didn\'t see it when I logged on, remember\r\n[b:9b4ede95d4]Da BitPimps Back Alley Auction[/b:9b4ede95d4] if so......'),(19766,'e0ad97f552','[quote:e0ad97f552=\"betty.k\"]fuck! lots to list!\r\n\r\niwaver: rx pcb, servo\r\n\r\nkyosho: clear chassis set, tierod, motor housing, screwset, xspeed motor, cf h plate, front springset(yellow), cf/alloy stabilizer bar, 20 degree tyres\r\n\r\nwfc: bearings, knuckles, wheelnuts\r\n\r\nxtra speed: 9t pinion, diff gear\r\n\r\nmegatech: triple alloy rear shockset\r\n\r\ntopcad: alloy bulkhead, motor clip\r\n\r\nyeah racing: crystals, wide alloy wheelset\r\n\r\nsecond hand ball diff, whoah nelly 1.0\r\n\r\n i think that\'s it. probably cost about $200us to get to this point.[/quote:e0ad97f552]\r\n\r\n :eek: Wow, cool.\r\n\r\nJust wanted to know....wait a minute, don\'t you have ph2t\'s woah nelly?\r\n\r\nJust thought I could add a few suggestions...but hell, it\'s YOUR z, I\'m just mentioning a few things you could do to it:\r\n\r\nSince you have ph2t\'s woah nelly, try the Tamiya Plasma Dash motor armautre in a Ball Bearing motor can, or the 35T motor from www.minizworkshop.com\r\n\r\nAlso, for even more speed, you could get the....uhh, whatchamacallit.... Micro RS4 12T pinion...it\'s brass, so it may be a bit hard to get on.\r\n\r\nJust a few tips, hell even I\'m still learning about all the parts for a mini-z and what they\'re called!  :shock: \r\n\r\nOh, and thanks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37080,'686d3fc65c','Yeah, I\'ve not had much issue with speed of \'regular\' motors, I\'ve just never been a fan of the brush arm design (it\'s a big headache on one of my favorite HO slot cars as well).\r\n\r\nhave a quick look at http://www.slotcars.org/ohora/130motors.htm'),(36890,'c52540f96a','hey I havent  forgot to get back to ya, lemme just figure out my situation and what I need. i\'ll get back to ya tomorrow and thanks brutha!'),(36891,'e03c5ddaf7','Sounds A ok...alright man be lookin forward to it'),(35511,'c5a4369ba3','Finally, I got a start. I really didn\'t want to do the wheels if I wasn\'t feeling it, \'cause you know, they gotta be round and stuff, and that\'s really hard. That was my hang up. So I finally just did it, I finally got the hard parts out of the way, and I\'m extremely happy with the results. Better than mine.\r\n\r\nHere your wheels, Tomy pullback rears, and ZZ fronts:\r\n[img:c5a4369ba3]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/psII1.jpg[/img:c5a4369ba3]\r\n\r\nI gotta go back and clean up that bevel on the fronts, didn\'t have any fine grit sand paper around, but I went ahead and painted in the silver ring to give you an idea.\r\n\r\n\r\n...and here\'s the beginnings of your chassis. You this part is tricky cause its gotta be square. It\'s Zip Zap based. I Figured they\'re only a couple bucks more than clones when on clearance, and that gives a solid platform.\r\n[img:c5a4369ba3]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/psII3.jpg[/img:c5a4369ba3]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m not flossin\' this until I\'m done, so you\'re gonna get the progress shots, cause you know I gotta show someone. :lol:\r\n\r\ndave'),(33078,'b1adfaec2c','I am T-Bolt on MZR.  Just letting you know.  I tried to get the same username there, but I never got the validation email.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37103,'5f6d792f29','[quote:5f6d792f29=\"Maxximum Attack\"]XME039R/4WD\r\n\r\nIf this is all I need for the 4WD, weed out the unnecessary parts that it replaces. \r\n\r\nIf I get the 2nd set in blue would it change the price? If not, gimmie the 2nd set in blue. [b:5f6d792f29]Don\'t commit me to the 2nd set yet I still haven\'t contacted my guy yet.[/b:5f6d792f29] I will do so this evening when I think he got home from work[/quote:5f6d792f29]\r\n\r\nColor really doesn\'t matter.  You could get your car parts every color they offer and pricing would be the same.  They only problem with color is that certain colors tend to take longer to get here.\r\n\r\nI plan to submit this order in 1 week.  Let me know soon how many you need.'),(26486,'caf7c5d5f1','Sure thing, go ahead and duplicate it.\r\n\r\nThe only issue is that at the moment I haven\'t posted the source code that goes with the chip, so its not quite complete.  I\'ve got a little more cleanup to do to the code before its ready for publication.\r\n\r\nSorry for the delay in reply, I\'ve been on vacation :)'),(26487,'9b1f3baf05','[quote:9b1f3baf05=\"codesuidae\"]Sure thing, go ahead and duplicate it.\r\n\r\nThe only issue is that at the moment I haven\'t posted the source code that goes with the chip, so its not quite complete.  I\'ve got a little more cleanup to do to the code before its ready for publication.\r\n\r\nSorry for the delay in reply, I\'ve been on vacation :)[/quote:9b1f3baf05]Oh no sweat man, vacation says it all.\r\n\r\nIf you would rather I wait until you finish, that\'s fine - just give me a heads up whenever you\'re ready.\r\n\r\nThanks for sharing brutha :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33596,'0414e87747','[quote:0414e87747=\"TeamBonzer\"]Hi\r\n\r\nNY toy fair is the biggest. Held in February each year at the Javits centre.\r\nNext year on 12-15th feb.\r\n\r\nHere is a link\r\nhttp://www.toy-tia.org/Content/NavigationMenu/TIA_Trade_Shows_and_Events/American_International_TOY_FAIR/American_International_TOY_FAIR1.htm\r\n\r\nIf you want to go you will have to get a free ticket. Need to prove that you are a toy company or shop or agent - just lie! (but you will need a business card - photoshop!)\r\n\r\nCheers\r\n\r\nTB[/quote:0414e87747]\r\n\r\nSo they have all the big brands?  I\'ll ask around if the hobby shops mind if I go in their name, then I\'ll resort to photoshop.'),(19722,'0ebd880edd','aight, what if under \"bitPimps Headlines\" I create \"Da bitPimps Back Alley Auction\" and inside that, we make our post and it\'s open if pimps have questions, etc. for them to post a new top, but we make ours a sticky.\r\nwaddya think? I think that\'s a good solution.\r\n\r\nI still have yet to get on one of them cars you sent, been busy with real life shit - sucks - but I\'m gonna get on something soon.\r\n\r\nthanks again for pushin this baby out the door.\r\n\r\np.s. can\'t wait to see what you got in store - I\'m even in the dark on what\'chu gots! lol\r\n[quote:0ebd880edd=\"DarkTari\"]I\'m Cool Wit Dat Pimp  :cool: \r\n\r\nNow for the Auction, I thought we\'d call it [b:0ebd880edd]Da BitPimps Back Alley Auction[/b:0ebd880edd], gotta nice ring to it.  Man I just took my pics today after the sun finally decided to come out.  Hadda do a lotta shit to 2 of the cars last night. Hadda change the whole chassis on one of them, wouldn\'t charge sometimes and acted fuckt up with the body on.  Hadda redo the wheelwells on the other. Didn\'t allow a tollarence for paint &amp; clearcoat.\r\nBut everything is on schedule, all cars are runnin &amp; lookin BLING  :shock: \r\nReady for Da Block  :eek: \r\nI\'ll be postin tonight, Guess I\'ll post in Contest unless you throw another forum in today sometime  :???:   didn\'t see it when I logged on, remember\r\n[b:0ebd880edd]Da BitPimps Back Alley Auction[/b:0ebd880edd] if so......[/quote:0ebd880edd]'),(19708,'5513a11da5','Yes they do, I argued with stride and Capt Black to no end about what he did, even cheesecake who is not your biggest fan did not think it was fair.  Then when they continued to harrass members and treat them badly I got tired of arguing and quit as Admin and R7R was born, so feel free to join as Charlie Brown or whatever and you will get a fair shake from me, look at all the trouble talon has caused at other forums and he is a member of R7R.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (25429,'7490bf6958','Did you get the cars yet.'),(31711,'aed0b1cd90','DarkTari &amp; payaso, \r\n\r\nI\'m an idot and an ass, and you can call me out publicly if you want. I was too tired to think clearly when I posted that about the Fiat bit (aka, Lupin the III BCG) the other night. My post was WAY to short on details, and it opened me up to just such a bind. I got PM\'s from both of you, and since my post didn\'t state that I would sell to the first to PM me, well, here we are. Don\'t misunderstand, I will NOT allow you to bid against each other. I would like your help on figuring this out. I know either of you will give the home it deserves. I think I paid like $32 plus shipping from Japan for it. I\'ll sell it to either of you for $30 shipped. Maybe whoever doesn\'t get mine can get one from HLJ?   :oops: \r\n\r\nSorry guys. I fubar\'d this one. I\'ll post to the forum that it\'s spoken for. Let me know what you guys think. Don\'t know if it matters to you, but here are the times on your PM\'s to me: \r\n\r\nDT: 7/16 @ 5am \r\nPY: 7/16 @ 2:45PM \r\n\r\nYou\'re the only two, thank goodness, and I wish I had two. Hoping we can work it out. \r\n\r\n :?'),(19710,'46c4082e8a','[quote:46c4082e8a=\"ripper7777777\"]Yes they do, I argued with stride and Capt Black to no end about what he did, even cheesecake who is not your biggest fan did not think it was fair.  Then when they continued to harrass members and treat them badly I got tired of arguing and quit as Admin and R7R was born, so feel free to join as Charlie Brown or whatever and you will get a fair shake from me, look at all the trouble talon has caused at other forums and he is a member of R7R.[/quote:46c4082e8a]\r\n\r\n*E.T. voice* Friiieeeennnnddd  :smile:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19741,'9aeeb6f21a','[quote:9aeeb6f21a=\"crazydave\"]I guess when CJ posted the Gene Simmons I was just dying to tell someone my Kiss rant.[/quote:9aeeb6f21a]yea I\'m trying to avoid putting that in the playlist lol\r\n\r\n[quote:9aeeb6f21a=\"crazydave\"]So now I know you know ...[/quote:9aeeb6f21a]I know you know that I know you know, ya know lol (had to be done)\r\n\r\n[quote:9aeeb6f21a=\"crazydave\"]I\'m having trouble coming up with stuff to upload that I think you\'ll all like. [/quote:9aeeb6f21a]me too man, I mean at times what I\'m digging, everyone else probably has on cd or mp3 somewhere too lol and the other stuff I\'m affraid is so obscure, people are gonna be like \"huh?\" lol\r\nI usually upload it anyways, even if it\'s just 1 or 2 actually downloading and listening, that\'s cool - whatever.\r\n\r\n[quote:9aeeb6f21a=\"crazydave\"]I\'m uploading the Dirtbombs for you guys now. No one really seemed to care for that Ultra-Violence, but I got another one from them where the theme is about Jessica, crack hoe, turned talk show guest that goes on a murderous rampage. I want to upload that, but don\'t want to bother if no one\'s gonna listen.[/quote:9aeeb6f21a]you know what I say - put it up!'),(19744,'bbe91e4a06','[quote:bbe91e4a06=\"DarkTari\"]I tried it under DarkTari, didn\'t work.  Could lock Kahuna\'s post either ???[/quote:bbe91e4a06] :???: \r\nI wonder if this is what happened?\r\nYou logged in as DT like normal.\r\nThen opened a new window and logged in as DaBigKahuna and tried to make your post.\r\nif you went back to the other window where DT was logged in, he\'s been automatically logged off now once DaBigKahuna was logged in.\r\n\r\nThe system is able to see 2 users from 1 IP at the same time and kills one of the connections for security sakes.\r\n\r\nI think that might be what happened because hog is able to make posts and new topic in our locked contest gallery threads.\r\n\r\nby the way, hope I got the auction block threads setup right.\r\nif not, feel free to change it or tell me to or whatever.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (29773,'f98b0c4e54','you can email me at this email, your addy,\r\nsuperpieboy@yahoo.com\r\ni will have to cast one for you, i have the mold ready, so just give me a couple of days to get it out.\r\n\r\njeff mays'),(19746,'11a01a62f8','I got bodies out da ying yang Pimp, just tell me what you want!\r\n\r\nI still got a couple precious still here to send you so I can do one of those bodies and send.\r\n\r\nAbout the tyres, have you tried sanding them down?  They get more grip when done .  If you wanna put on some PullBack tyres &amp; wheels, I can send a set of those also.'),(19747,'11a01a62f8','I got bodies out da ying yang Pimp, just tell me what you want!\r\n\r\nI still got a couple precious still here to send you so I can do one of those bodies and send.\r\n\r\nAbout the tyres, have you tried sanding them down?  They get more grip when done .  If you wanna put on some PullBack tyres &amp; wheels, I can send a set of those also.'),(19758,'6895d04eff','What is your full setup on your Iwaver? Like, what motor/pinion, what type of alloy parts you have on, have you upgraded to aluminum servo gears, what tires, blah blah.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19759,'2201defb7a','fuck! lots to list!\r\n\r\niwaver: rx pcb, servo\r\n\r\nkyosho: clear chassis set, tierod, motor housing, screwset, xspeed motor, cf h plate, front springset(yellow), cf/alloy stabilizer bar, 20 degree tyres\r\n\r\nwfc: bearings, knuckles, wheelnuts\r\n\r\nxtra speed: 9t pinion, diff gear\r\n\r\nmegatech: triple alloy rear shockset\r\n\r\ntopcad: alloy bulkhead, motor clip\r\n\r\nyeah racing: crystals, wide alloy wheelset\r\n\r\nsecond hand ball diff, whoah nelly 1.0\r\n\r\n i think that\'s it. probably cost about $200us to get to this point.'),(36817,'15fe1a37c5','Can I get a total for the following items? I have added these up and totaled down below. What I want to know is, with this group buy, will this price be less than calculated here?\r\n\r\nI know you accept paypal only, I\'ll try to get it sorted soon, once I find the money. I have money that I don\'t want to touch but I would if it comes to that cuz I\'d like to get 2 sets or even 3. Let me know if the price is lower and what the new price is. \r\n\r\n\r\nList:\r\nDXME100R-DELRIN REAR BALL DIFFERENTIAL - 1 COMPLETED SET $15.50 \r\nDXME1224T-DELRIN MAIN GEAR (12T/24T) - 2PCS SET	  $3.50 \r\nXME012-ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX - 1PR 			\r\n[b:15fe1a37c5]XME012A-ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET  $12.90 [/b:15fe1a37c5]\r\nXME013-ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX - 1PR 			\r\nXME021-ALLOY FRONT KNUCKLE ARM WITH DELRIN COLLARS &amp; SCREWS - 1PR SET  $9.90 \r\nXME022-ALLOY REAR KNUCKLE ARM WITH DELRIN COLLARS &amp; SCREWS - 1PR SET  $9.90 \r\n[b:15fe1a37c5]XME028-ALLOY FRONT SHOCK MOUNT WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET $7.90 \r\nXME030-ALLOY REAR SHOCK MOUNT WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET $7.90 [/b:15fe1a37c5]\r\nXME039F-ALLOY FRONT WHEEL SHAFT - 1PR  $3.90 \r\nXME039R-ALLOY REAR WHEEL SHAFT - 1PR  $3.90 \r\n[b:15fe1a37c5]XME039R/C-ALLOY REAR UNIVERSAL SWING SHAFT (CVD DESIGN) - 1PR  $7.90 [/b:15fe1a37c5]\r\nXME049/0-ALLOY FRONT STEERING PLATE (0 DEG) - 1PC $6.50 \r\n[b:15fe1a37c5]XME055-ALLOY FRONT LOWER ARM WITH SCREWS - 1PR SET $7.90 \r\nXME056-ALLOY REAR LOWER ARM WITH SCREWS - 1PR SET $7.90 [/b:15fe1a37c5]\r\nXME190R-ALLOY REAR DOG BONE (9.0MM) - 1PR  $2.50 \r\nXME316F-ALLOY FRONT SHOCK (16MM) WITH SPRINGS - 1PR SET $5.90 \r\nXME316R-ALLOY REAR SHOCK (16MM) WITH SPRINGS - 1PR SET	$5.90 \r\nXME331R-ALLOY REAR SKID PLATE - 1PC  $3.50\r\n\r\noriginal Xmods:\r\n\r\nXM039F/4WD-ALLOY FRONT UNIVERSAL SWING SHAFT - 1PR $8.80\r\nYou said this part would work for the AWD Xmod EVO (I think) \r\n\r\nThis total is $132.10 without :\r\nXME012 , and\r\nXME013\r\n\r\nThis is also $147.60 if the GPM diff can be used in the front for the car and a second ball diff is added to the list ($15.50)\r\n\r\nI\'ll keep this list incase I find the money to make the purchase(s).\r\n\r\nThanx\r\nMaxx\r\n\r\nPS: Can you also tell me the shipping to this zip code in Florida, 33166-6488. This is so I know roughly how much money I\'ll need for at least one set of the above items. I\'ll wing it if I order multiple sets.'),(29099,'1fe4173e68','sup chad, its me freak. im registered and ill get as many people here as i can. talk to u in the forums aight man. later');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (29100,'ac2660f999','[quote:ac2660f999=\"FrEaK_aCcIdEnT\"]sup chad, its me freak. im registered and ill get as many people here as i can. talk to u in the forums aight man. later[/quote:ac2660f999]\r\n\r\nHere is a hangout CJ\'s Hobbies.net is my home'),(37076,'1d5f255337','Quick question, do you think having multiple motor brush options and multiple brush spring options (in a way similar to larger scale electric motors) would be of any benefit on the 130 sized motors?\r\n\r\nI\'ve got a slot car friend who\'s made up a jig to cut 1/24 slot car endbells to fit into 130 sized cans.  My MiniZ has a stock motor mount and the new endbell wouldn\'t fit, but an open design (like the PN racing ones) should work.\r\n\r\nLots of quality cheap brushes with a huge surface area (80% copper, gold impregnated copper, etc) and ALOT of different sping tensions.  Add some shunt wires and they\'d be quite alot like the larger motors.'),(36568,'baf47ae657','Hey man, ive been doing some searching on the site and i cant seem to find the answer im looking for.  Im installing an iwaver pcb in my zzse buggy but im a little confused about what to do with the steering POT.  Do i use the existing zzse pot or do i use the iwaver pot???  ALso, ive been reading that i need to install 10k ohm resistors on the pot (whatever pot i end up using)  Do   What wires do i need to solder these to?  The iwaver pot only has two wires but the se has three so im a little confused on the issue.\r\n\r\nAny help would be great\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nSTG');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28105,'e508b5f045','OK just to be sure....\r\nI need a total for:\r\nNelly 1.3\r\nLI- Pro kit w/ deans\r\ncharger\r\n\r\nI proposed $65., with $40 upfront.\r\nIs that good with you?\r\n\r\nHit me back. And i\'ll try to send off the money on monday.'),(28110,'326e86f300','Wazzzup cracka ass cracka...crackin\' cracka?'),(28876,'23dfcf573d','I will get all the info together for you let me find out what is availible at the locale Radio Shack as far as ZZMT and I will get you an actual price for them. \r\n\r\nI\'ll be in touch \r\ntake care\r\nAaron W. Olmsted\r\nsteelwoolghandi'),(19749,'02c4c2ec4b','Hey jowlz,\r\n\r\nHeres the lst if i never gave it to ya, ive revised it a bit.\r\n\r\n-Xmods AWD Kit ($10)\r\n\r\n-Xmods Shock/ Tie rod kit ($7.99)\r\n\r\n-Xmods Tyre set ($7.99)\r\n\r\n-Xmods Bearing Set ($19.99)\r\n\r\n-Xmods Light set ($5.99)\r\n\r\n-And I am really looking for the  3.82:1 (blue) and 4.40:1 (yellow) gearsets and pinions anyway ya can hook me up??\r\n\r\nAlso that wheelset you were talking about, what do ya want for it??\r\n\r\ncheers man\r\n\r\nJamie'),(19751,'75d9867248','AIM..............\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[size=24:75d9867248][color=green:75d9867248]NOW!!!![/color:75d9867248][/size:75d9867248]');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19752,'afdba46d58','[quote:afdba46d58=\"DarkTari\"]I got bodies out da ying yang Pimp, just tell me what you want![/quote:afdba46d58]Well here\'s the deal, I\'ve got an experiment I haven\'t had time to test. if it works the idea will be revolutionary. If it flops, then forget I said anything, and any ol\' body will do. I\'ll keep you updated as to whether I pull it off or not.\r\n\r\n[quote:afdba46d58] I still got a couple precious still here to send you so I can do one of those bodies and send.\r\n\r\nAbout the tyres, have you tried sanding them down?  They get more grip when done .  If you wanna put on some PullBack tyres &amp; wheels, I can send a set of those also.[/quote:afdba46d58]I\'ll have to try sanding them, I thought they seemd somewhat soft, but they are slick. I have discovered that the wheels raise the center and narrow the contact patch. I flattened out the wheels and that helped.\r\n\r\n...and I got to tell you this...That Lancer that I got attached to, it was the dud of the batch. The other 2 handle great. They all have some slop in the rear end, but it was so bad in the Lancer, I ended up grafting a new rear end on it. Then the Lancer had kind of a dud yellow battery in it, that I replaced because it wasn\'t performing, and the one I\'m working on today has one them blue 70mah Ni-Cd batteries in it. Don\'t listen to what any one else tells you, these are the punchiest batteries you\'ll find, period. [i:afdba46d58]And also[/i:afdba46d58] That Lancer had a red endbell motor that looked just like a Tomy 3.0 in it. The one I worked on today had the notorious pink endbell motor, and combined with that killer blue battery this thing is screaming.\r\n\r\nWait \'til you see it with the body I did today for it. I\'m gonna post pics in the mod\'s forum in couple hours. I\'m just putting the finishing details. I think you might shit. :eek: \r\n\r\nSo that\'s cool, because I wanted to put out a quality product, but I had to tell you the whole story, because I think it was funny I was drawn to the dud. Seems like I always get the dud. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(19753,'b4a2aea407','I did a Celica and the chassis was a dud also.  I ended up switchin chassis with a Honda Accord Wagon with green gears and this thing performs like a MoFo!\r\nI\'ll get started on a body, I\'ll MAXX out a WRX !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19754,'b4a2aea407','I did a Celica and the chassis was a dud also.  I ended up switchin chassis with a Honda Accord Wagon with green gears and this thing performs like a MoFo!\r\nI\'ll get started on a body, I\'ll MAXX out a WRX !'),(29715,'a730eee8ea','I was wondering how much do you sell the VW bus for?'),(19756,'c8366271c0','[quote:c8366271c0=\"DarkTari\"]I did a Celica and the chassis was a dud also.  I ended up switchin chassis with a Honda Accord Wagon with green gears and this thing performs like a MoFo![/quote:c8366271c0]Yeah, the one I did last night green gears. \r\n\r\nMust be something to that. :???:'),(20105,'bcbeba3f89','Sinned I love that new clone you been using.  How much did one of those run ya?  Where did you get them?  If I paypal you the money do you think you hook a pimp up...\r\n 8-) \r\nThanks Man,\r\n\r\nMike'),(33185,'3e46c05e18','*twitch* want lipo protector *twitch*\r\n\r\nhurry. they might sell out again...\r\n\r\n-JNY'),(33187,'dd08a7be8d','thanks for the money. \r\n\r\nI honestly thought it would be hard to get the money back..but no worries now. Thanks very much and I hope the bodies eventually get back to you.\r\n\r\nthanks again');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33188,'7cc6c1222d','yeah man, ive just been crazy busy with school, i had two prototypes due this week,, sorry i didnt reply to your last message.  If i do get those bodies back ill let you know,, (if you havent already purchased a set lol)\r\n\r\nThanks again for being understanding\r\n\r\nSporttracguy'),(33355,'f7e7abd500','PayPal sent :-)'),(33356,'49d5a5acae','Hey where you from? Just wonderin because the way you talk, is how we talk up where im at. Im in Hamilton Ontario.'),(19784,'c34dea0419','lol, just thought I\'d ask a few q\'s about the latest pimp language:\r\n\r\nQ.E.D.???\r\n\r\nAnd I noticed a few members like PimpIke (fuckin bastard!!) and...what\'s his name....stampede dude, and viperdout have their titles set to \"BitGimp\"....What\'s a bitgimp and why do they have that as their titles?\r\n\r\n lol  :-)'),(19785,'d055541b49','Q.E.D.???\r\n\r\nOh, and I tried to make another diagram of Woah nelly that could be easier to understand, lol, is this correctly made?\r\n\r\n[img:d055541b49]http://img19.photobucket.com/albums/v57/amitojbatra/woahnellydiagram.jpg[/img:d055541b49]'),(20562,'8d6954e849','I sent you a PM last night, now it\'s neither in my outbox, or sentbox. That\'s odd, but I\'m assuming you didn\'t get it now, so I\'m gonna try again.\r\n\r\nI couldn\'t fix the windows. \r\n\r\nI sanded with 1000grit, got it nice and smooth, then I laid another clear coat, and it went crystal clear, I breathed a sigh of relief, the it textured up about 10 minutes later. \r\n\r\nSo I sanded with 1000 grit again, then went over it with rubbing compoud, and car polish. That got the surface glossy, but the windows still are not clear, so it apparently goes beyond the surface.\r\n\r\n\r\nIt is much better now, and my wife thinks I\'m over reacting, but you know, when you go to sell something, you just want it to be perfect.\r\n\r\nI figure if I go over with the sandpaper, rubbbing compound and wax again, it could only improve. I figure if I keep repeating that process, I\'ll eventuall get past the layer of paint and down to bare plastic again, but I don\'t want to risk ruining the paint around it.\r\n\r\nSo here it is now.\r\n[img:8d6954e849]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/collab2.jpg[/img:8d6954e849]\r\n[img:8d6954e849]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/collab3.jpg[/img:8d6954e849]\r\n\r\nThis is really pissing me off, because it\'s the story of my life. When I\'m just playing around by myself, I do great things, but as soon as I go to duplicate it for money, I have issues. Every single fuckin\' time. It\'s particularly annoying, because I feel like you sent me your quality work, and I just went and jacked it up. :-( \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19788,'6b78992ce4','[quote:6b78992ce4=\"cj\"]can you chage the text under my name to say Ex Shack ZipPimp.  As of Thusday the 17 I am no longer with the shack.  :-D[/quote:6b78992ce4]will do man - getting your business going or looking somewhere else?\r\neither way - good luck pimp!'),(19789,'d0ab0817d2','LoL grats dude, well hate to burst your bubble, but as of 7-5-04 the Pimps will be shack pimp-less all together.  Got my ass a sweet job w/ Time Warner that pays 2x better than my best week here and I am the top seller hands down.  Either way tho, hope it all works out for ya CJ.  We will always have the memories. :-)'),(19790,'0086322885','hey man i could use at least two of those so that costs me a buck right? or should i send you 5bucks for a bunch? how you wana work that?'),(19791,'32885ac50a','[quote:32885ac50a=\"hogjowlz\"]hey man i could use at least two of those so that costs me a buck right? or should i send you 5bucks for a bunch? how you wana work that?[/quote:32885ac50a]\r\n\r\nI don\'t have them yet hope to see them before this week is out. I\'ll let you know when I send them so I can get your address.  With your luck I\'ll let 3 each go for $1.99 shipped!\r\n\r\nBTW: I am nolonger a Shack Pimp'),(30646,'292a08111d','I did finish the vespa , and also started a new job, i have been working about atleast 10 hours a day 6 days a week now for about 5 months now and this week was the first time i have been off two days in a row. \r\n\r\ni never casted the impala but did get some more rtv rubber for that issue.\r\n\r\ni bought the herbie beetle from rr and its realy sweet.\r\ni need to interact more with the pimps huh. \r\nshit things have been grazy here , but looks to be calming down some.\r\n\r\nthx for the email\r\njmays');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (30818,'27ef35925b','I can hook you up with the vw bus no problem. It will be 5 bucks.\r\n\r\nsend me you address and i will get it out to you.\r\n\r\njeff'),(30819,'05fee71e57','That would be awesome Jeff! Can I send you the Money Paypal? If not get me your address and I will send you money. \r\n\r\nMy address:\r\nAaron W. Olmsted\r\n1941 Sayers Road\r\nBastrop, Texas 78602\r\n\r\nPlease let me know freight and I will send you that too.\r\n\r\nThanks again I really appreciate it I have wanted one of those ever since I saw them.  :-o \r\nAaron'),(19794,'c34dea0419','lol, just thought I\'d ask a few q\'s about the latest pimp language:\r\n\r\nQ.E.D.???\r\n\r\nAnd I noticed a few members like PimpIke (fuckin bastard!!) and...what\'s his name....stampede dude, and viperdout have their titles set to \"BitGimp\"....What\'s a bitgimp and why do they have that as their titles?\r\n\r\n lol  :-)'),(19795,'42f51c1ef1','[quote:42f51c1ef1=\"Son_Gokou\"]lol, just thought I\'d ask a few q\'s about the latest pimp language:\r\n\r\nQ.E.D.???\r\n\r\nAnd I noticed a few members like PimpIke (fuckin bastard!!) and...what\'s his name....stampede dude, and viperdout have their titles set to \"BitGimp\"....What\'s a bitgimp and why do they have that as their titles?\r\n\r\n lol  :-)[/quote:42f51c1ef1]I think you can figure out \"bitGimp\".\r\n\r\nI haven\'t been on the forums much lately - too busy, so I don\'t know what you\'re talking about w/ QED.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19796,'42f51c1ef1','[quote:42f51c1ef1=\"Son_Gokou\"]lol, just thought I\'d ask a few q\'s about the latest pimp language:\r\n\r\nQ.E.D.???\r\n\r\nAnd I noticed a few members like PimpIke (fuckin bastard!!) and...what\'s his name....stampede dude, and viperdout have their titles set to \"BitGimp\"....What\'s a bitgimp and why do they have that as their titles?\r\n\r\n lol  :-)[/quote:42f51c1ef1]I think you can figure out \"bitGimp\".\r\n\r\nI haven\'t been on the forums much lately - too busy, so I don\'t know what you\'re talking about w/ QED.'),(19798,'588d9a3843','You wanted what I had for your comp or Hugh?  I am figuring hugh but thought I would ask.'),(19802,'bfe75e0b3f','NP that\'s what I figured'),(19803,'95e5945141','Auight Cavey,\r\n\r\nYour VW Bus is next on Da Block!\r\n\r\nSend me the particulars and a starting bid.  I\'ll use the pics you posted in the Mods Forumor something else if you want.  I\'ll let Da Big Kahuna know to post you up   :cool:'),(19804,'95e5945141','Auight Cavey,\r\n\r\nYour VW Bus is next on Da Block!\r\n\r\nSend me the particulars and a starting bid.  I\'ll use the pics you posted in the Mods Forumor something else if you want.  I\'ll let Da Big Kahuna know to post you up   :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20301,'f6f11411e8','I\'m getting your package in tha mail today.\r\n\r\nI\'ve done a WRX, all primered and ready for paint.  I\'m keeping with the summertime theme of things so I\'ve added an open sunroof and all windows rolled down.  I\'m including the bad chassis from the Celica, maybe you can toy around with it.  It is already double tab lowered in the front and sits real nice under this body, only it\'s not steady cause it was done for the Celica. you\'ll see what I mean when you get it.  I suggest double tab lowering the chassis that you\'re going to use. I\'ve taped the exhaust tip to the package tapering one end so you\'ll know which end to use.\r\n\r\nI\'ve also included a couple goodies for ya Pimp!\r\n\r\nI\'ve got this slamming azz body waitin for that Precious chassis you\'re sending.  Just gotta decide on a color.   :???: \r\n\r\nGotta go get my Swole on, lata!'),(19813,'e5ebd65c65','[quote:e5ebd65c65=\"DarkTari\"]Auight Cavey,\r\n\r\nYour VW Bus is next on Da Block!\r\n\r\nSend me the particulars and a starting bid.  I\'ll use the pics you posted in the Mods Forumor something else if you want.  I\'ll let Da Big Kahuna know to post you up   :cool:[/quote:e5ebd65c65]Hey dude, bummer news, we\'re getting evicted from our apartment for BS reasons. I got 10 days to move now. So don\'t ship anything to my current address. I\'ll know the apartment # to my new place in a couple days.\r\n\r\nSo anyways, I was gonna PM you to tell you that anyways, but about the car... I got it waxed out, and the damn shine just wont stop. So I wanted to get new pics in the sun, but my wife just left for Disneyland today, and took the camera, so I wont be able to take new pics until saturday or sunday, so I guess you\'ll have to use the pics from the mods forum, but I\'ll get better pics asap. Go ahead and use the same description too, I think that basicly covered it.\r\n\r\nDave'),(19814,'5d304c4695','Bummer Dave!  Fuck\'d Up is more like it !\r\n\r\nI\'ll just hold off til I hear from you.  I\'ll start on that WRX tonight.\r\n\r\nThat\'s cool, just send the particulars, we can update the pics when you get the new one\'s.\r\n\r\nLil Matrix is going to Disney in a couple weeks, so it\'ll be just me and the Ol\' B&amp;C (ball &amp; chain) for a week!   :???: \r\n\r\nI guess the first auction car has peak\'d.  If we can get at least $30 per car, we\'ll have the debt covered.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19815,'5d304c4695','Bummer Dave!  Fuck\'d Up is more like it !\r\n\r\nI\'ll just hold off til I hear from you.  I\'ll start on that WRX tonight.\r\n\r\nThat\'s cool, just send the particulars, we can update the pics when you get the new one\'s.\r\n\r\nLil Matrix is going to Disney in a couple weeks, so it\'ll be just me and the Ol\' B&amp;C (ball &amp; chain) for a week!   :???: \r\n\r\nI guess the first auction car has peak\'d.  If we can get at least $30 per car, we\'ll have the debt covered.'),(20299,'bb35ab8f75','thnx man how much has it cost so far?...'),(20300,'43641765f0','...that 4.2 of yours is definately a fluke.\r\n\r\nI did your other booster chassis tonight. The blue endbell motor in there performed just like all my 4.2 Pros. Seemed about as fast, and when doing the \'hanging the car by the back wheels test\" it only pulled it up about  a quarter of the way. Exactly on track with my FET modded cars running 4.2s.\r\n\r\nThe fact that other car was able to spin itself a around repeatedly like that is simply amazing. Even ph2ts \"whoah nellie\" turbo wont do that for you. \r\n\r\nMan, I\'m jealous, you better treasure this motor when you get it back.  :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(37319,'b18d85c4dd','[quote:b18d85c4dd=\"sg219\"][quote:b18d85c4dd=\"cj\"]These were not in the first order.\r\n\r\nPART ID	DESCRIPTION	Price 	Silver	Black	Green\r\nXME012A	ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET	$7.74	0	0	1\r\nXME012B	ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX BACK COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET	$0.00	0	0	1\r\nXME013A	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET 	$15.54	0	0	1\r\nXME013B	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX REAR COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET 	$7.74	0	0	1\r\nXME330LAN	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR LANCER) - 1PC	$5.90	0	0	1\r\nXME330MUS	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR MUSTANG) - 1PC	$3.84	0	0	1\r\nXET330FORD	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR TRUCKIN) - 1PC	$6.90	1	0	0\r\nXET330HUM	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR HUMMER) - 1PC	$5.90	1	0	0\r\n\r\nActual	$53.54	 	 	 \r\n10.00%	$5.35	 	 	 \r\nSub	$58.89			\r\nS&amp;H	$3.00			\r\nTotal	$61.89			\r\n\r\nThat is a Savings of $13.41 Off of GPM\'s regular price.\r\n\r\nIf you have any additions or corrections let me know as soon as possible.  My PayPal is cjellis@yahoo.com.  Please include your user name in the notes on PayPal.\r\n\r\nIf you do reply by February 11th  your request will not be ordered.[/quote:b18d85c4dd]\r\n\r\nJust silver and green.\r\n\r\nI won\'t be able to pay until this Saturday, after P-day clears.\r\n\r\nWhats the status of everything else?  The rest of the silver, all the green and the diffs?\r\n\r\nI need a complete set so I can start putting things together.\r\n\r\nHow much longer?\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nMike[/quote:b18d85c4dd]\r\n\r\nGot you just Silver and Green.\r\n\r\nI have recieved so far from the first DXME009T(2), XME018A(Silver), XME039F(Silver), XME039R(Silver),  XME303(silver), XET021(Silver), XET022(silver), XET028(silver), XET030(Silver), XET114R(2 Silver), XET331F(Silver).  Some I may have sent you.\r\n\r\nI hope in the next shipment from them I get some green.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37240,'9df2262355','I was thinking about something down those lines, but this is gonna make him say &quot;?????????, wha????&quot;.  It will take him a few seconds to put it all together.  He might not even be able to put it all together.  That would really kill me.\r\n\r\nIt\'s like an intellectual kick in the junk.  I couldn\'t resist.'),(32606,'9dfd43bfd9','[quote:9dfd43bfd9=\"mikirgra\"]Oh dude, that sucks so bad you lost that car. Man, I would have been pissed about that. You do some great work. Hope micro-amps didn\'t take it hard.\r\n\r\nGlad you got the car. The Ned Flanders lookin dude at my local PO said it should get there in 3-5 days, so I was startin to sweat it a little. My paypal id is graham@gte.net. Hope you like that car. It\'s pretty funky, ain\'t it?[/quote:9dfd43bfd9]\r\n\r\nYeah, funky it is  :lol: \r\n\r\nI\'ll paypal you right now Pimp and Thanx Again.  Anything else you need pertaining to 1/64, just lemme know...... 8-)'),(35176,'d6293d8227','Serious! Is the bf2 Demo mulitplayer? Yeah, my computer SHOULD be able to run it, It will be sick if we do, maybe the clan can be BitPimps LOL. Next time i see you on Msn, or pm\'s i\'ll tell you about the MetlTech.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19820,'013c6989a7','Well, in my latest post, i said i could give out Gmail accounts...\r\nnot knowing that once you used up a link, it was used up...\r\nand i cannot invite people because only a lucky few can do that...\r\nmy favor to ask is that you lock that post and i will pm the guys who wanted the gmail accounts and tell them about what i found out \r\nThank you'),(20141,'1e34a44e5f','[quote:1e34a44e5f=\"brendan123\"]hey, how ya goen?\r\n\r\nI just downloaded a php forum and i was wondering if you could help me out in installing it.\r\n\r\ncheers.[/quote:1e34a44e5f]well I\'m not certain which forum software you got, but I can tell you what typical installation is like.\r\n\r\n- download the forum software.\r\n- usually you upload it to your webserver in to a directory where your forum will live (i.e. www.domain.com/myForum/)\r\n- you\'ll have to follow the installation instructions closely. it tells you exactly what to do and you usually need to do it exactly how they say or it won\'t work.\r\n- most likely, after uploading, you\'re going to open your browser and type in a URL to a config file in your forum (www.domain.com/myForum/myConfigFile.php)\r\n- usually once hitting the config file, you\'ll be guided through setting up your forum in several steps.\r\n\r\nhope that helps ya out some'),(19822,'013c6989a7','Well, in my latest post, i said i could give out Gmail accounts...\r\nnot knowing that once you used up a link, it was used up...\r\nand i cannot invite people because only a lucky few can do that...\r\nmy favor to ask is that you lock that post and i will pm the guys who wanted the gmail accounts and tell them about what i found out \r\nThank you');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19823,'7f8c526497','[quote:7f8c526497=\"synj\"]Well, in my latest post, i said i could give out Gmail accounts...\r\nnot knowing that once you used up a link, it was used up...\r\nand i cannot invite people because only a lucky few can do that...\r\nmy favor to ask is that you lock that post and i will pm the guys who wanted the gmail accounts and tell them about what i found out \r\nThank you[/quote:7f8c526497]I\'ll lock it.'),(19824,'7f8c526497','[quote:7f8c526497=\"synj\"]Well, in my latest post, i said i could give out Gmail accounts...\r\nnot knowing that once you used up a link, it was used up...\r\nand i cannot invite people because only a lucky few can do that...\r\nmy favor to ask is that you lock that post and i will pm the guys who wanted the gmail accounts and tell them about what i found out \r\nThank you[/quote:7f8c526497]I\'ll lock it.'),(19825,'051cc1f996','word. let me know whatsup. \r\n\r\nand you will always be the xmod pimp reguardless of your job.'),(19826,'7cb7ee5687','[quote:7cb7ee5687=\"hogjowlz\"]word. let me know whatsup. \r\n\r\nand you will always be the xmod pimp reguardless of your job.[/quote:7cb7ee5687]\r\n\r\nI just got them today how about 3 pairs for $2.00 Shipped?\r\nThese are slightly larger in physical size but will still work.\r\n\r\nIf so you have paypal?  Paypal me at cjellis@yahoo.com with your address and info and they will go out saturday or monday.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19827,'7dd7887d34','I looked around, but couldn\'t find how to upload pics to the Gallery.  I registered.  What do I need to do, or did I overlook something?'),(26157,'ccbb6e4a0d','Hi,\r\n\r\nIf you know how to fix xmod steering or have a stock EP to sell please jump in the chat.\r\n\r\nThanx'),(26158,'6a3e1e2fc9','Hi,\r\n\r\nIf you know how to fix xmod steering or have a stock EP to sell please jump in the chat.\r\n\r\nThanx'),(19841,'58719f4573','[quote:58719f4573=\"DarkTari\"]That\'s cool, just send the particulars, we can update the pics when you get the new one\'s.[/quote:58719f4573]\r\nOK, it\'ll go something about like this, \r\n- Pick of the crop Precious chassis w/ notorious pink endbell motor, and a punchy blue 70mah NiCd (my favorite)\r\n- FET modded PCB\r\n- Tomy Teal gears\r\n- VW bus body from Toyeast has had the bumpers, mirror, and cop light stripped, and holes filled. The front and rear panels have been rolled under.\r\n- Fullsize Microsizer wheel conversion for that 8-spoke Empi look.\r\n- Patented specially designed piece of plastic glued into the rear end to keep the gears meshing quiet and smooth\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:58719f4573]I guess the first auction car has peak\'d.  If we can get at least $30 per car, we\'ll have the debt covered.[/quote:58719f4573]Yeah, that went amazingly well. Now the prob is collecting the money, but if they all go like that, then we\'ve done our jobs well.\r\n\r\ndave'),(19842,'375795e40e','[quote:375795e40e]Yeah, that went amazingly well. Now the prob is collecting the money, but if they all go like that, then we\'ve done our jobs well[/quote:375795e40e]\r\n\r\nTru Dat Pimp  :cool: \r\n\r\nI\'ll leave the finance part to Cabo.  I\'ll get yours on the block tonight at da stroke of 12  :-( \r\n\r\nJust let me know when you get settled.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21103,'b01fff6b8e','http://www.microrccenter.com/forum/index.php?act=ST&amp;f=13&amp;t=27139&amp;st=0#\r\n\r\nThere the best I could do on mrcc. Funny thing is I heard talk about someone suggesting to MK that I should be a mod there.  :grin: So I got to seem \"mod like\" so I can become a mod. Of course First thing I\'ll attempt to do is get the little bastard banned. Can you edit people\'s posts in whatever section you mod without anyone finding out? lol \r\n\r\nanyway do you know if stampede_fag is a member of wgu or r7r? Im friends with the rest of the idiot little kid n00bs, I can get everyone to rip on him so badly He\'ll leave and never come back (hopefully)'),(20104,'a7aa86e2a2','[quote:a7aa86e2a2]and a double post before he left... \r\nI\'m not sure who got in the last word there lol[/quote:a7aa86e2a2]\r\n\r\nHaha...he Posted a picture of a BUDDHA.....this is a PIMP site, we don\'t give a fuckin shit about some fat ass curry smellin....woah, got carried away, almost forgot I myself was of that background.  :eek: :gives:\r\n\r\nOh, and get a load of this- he says this shit in chat- \"I\'m a professional photographer, you\'re just jealous. I didn\'t spend 1800 dollars on a 8.5 megapixel camera to take some shitty pics on a cluttered desk, I\'d rather take it in nature and be a true photographer\". Imagining him saying that in some accent....LMFAO\r\n\r\nDidn\'t want to post this in the public, just thought I should tell ya in private. \r\n\r\nPE@CE'),(19850,'cdbe412050','[quote:cdbe412050=\"sg219\"]I looked around, but couldn\'t find how to upload pics to the Gallery.  I registered.  What do I need to do, or did I overlook something?[/quote:cdbe412050]I have to give ya the right priviliages, which I just did.\r\nI just haven\'t had time lately to be checking the users list to see who\'s registered lately and if they needed any special permissions.\r\n\r\nyou should have some space now.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19851,'d72888c908','Thanks :-)'),(20177,'d179f65aa7','No problem,  I really respect what you cats are doin\' with the bit pimps site.  Anything I can do to help out. let me know.'),(20168,'343b8bb81d','Naw dood I am lovin it.  Tell her to keep on rockin, but hit up some other dumb mother fuckas as well.'),(26618,'3270116565','lol, do you have a pic of your stash? Im going to make a 4X4 now, if you want, send me 2/3 chassis with controllers and ill make you one too  :grin: \r\n\r\nWhat are you doing today?\r\nKarl'),(26619,'6620bc08fd','hey evo... hvor køber du dine micro rc . morfars sælgerdem jo ikke\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPINGO  :-)'),(26620,'f298a1ec1f','I\'ve added you to msn, fancy a chat? :smile:'),(19859,'2b9d2bc4c1','Cool.  Just do go and step on it or something stupid.   \r\n\r\n[quote:2b9d2bc4c1=\"Elmer Fudd\"]  Be very, very, careful.[/quote:2b9d2bc4c1]'),(19860,'5d6f6ca901','you can use one of the freebie sites listed in the FAQ\'s and FGA\'s section.\r\nyou can register in our gallery if you wish, let me know when you do - and I can then give you some space.\r\n[quote:5d6f6ca901=\"biohazard\"]Can you help me with hosting a picture for contest? just let me know where to email picture \r\n\r\nthanks \r\nbiohazard[/quote:5d6f6ca901]'),(19861,'bf36177d64','Hey, I\'ll host your pictures, email your picture(s) to davesmoejoe@yahoo.com and I\'ll send you the link back. 8-) \r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19862,'72f7620088','thanks dave for helping me out I will email you with the picture'),(19863,'e47ee6a595','thanks crazy dave offered to give me a link,  I would still would like to register at your gallery\r\n\r\nthanks biohazard'),(21625,'eb9a31ea52','How about... errr, 3, yeah 3 of em.  Packagless is perfect.  Hit me up with the total and I\'ll shoot ya the dough.  Wish it could be 10, but my wife is giving me the evil eye nowerday w/ all the little cars I have commin in.'),(21626,'8aea230f53','[quote:8aea230f53=\"hue35\"]Hey man, I finally got some discs together for ya... not so fancy this time, but they\'re discs nonetheless... I\'ve been busy as a motherfucker. Also, I\'ve got that red KIT Racer idler gear (the one SuperFly lost) that I\'ll tape to one of the discs. So yeah, Zappa\'s Hot Rats and Over-Nite Sensation, Andre Williams\' Silky and Bait &amp; Switch, Fu Manchu - The Action is Go, and a curve ball I\'m gonna throw at ya... you heard of The Mars Volta? Strange little disc... it might not be your bag at all, but these guys are on fire... I could see it being too slick and prog-rock-like for you, but I\'m sure you\'ll pass it on to someone who might dig it, if it ain\'t your bag. So, I need your new address.\r\n\r\nAlso, I was looking for the ZZ SE mosfet tutorial, but can\'t find it... I could swear you wrote up a clean version of the work that you and ph2t and cyborgzero did... anyway, I want to order up some parts and give that a try, but I can\'t find the tutorial... can you point me to it?\r\n\r\nLater,\r\n\r\nhue35[/quote:8aea230f53]Cool, I\'ll be looking forward to hearing that stuff, I haven\'t been really finding anything new lately. \r\n\r\nI got some Fu Manchu, \"Daredevil\". I was suckered in by the dunebuggy on the cover. I\'m a sucker for dunebuggies. :lol: \r\n\r\nAnyways, at the time I thought it dragged out into too much of a monotone. That\'s my biggest bitch with most albums made in the last 5 years. So many of them seem to blend together into one constant drone from begining to end, no stand outs.\r\n\r\nI\'m diggging that Fu manchu out and giving it another listen before your disc get here.\r\n\r\nI have a couple things I was listening to, that I thought I should send to you, so I might throw you a couple surprises too. (When I get off my ass and get my shit together)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe SE tutorial, how ironic you bring that up, been meaning to get that together. Sunday night I FETed CW\'s car. I took pictures at every step of the way. I was all set to put together the tutorial tonight, but my pictures mysteriously disappeared when my wife took the camera to take picture of the kid\'s first day of school, and of coarse she didn\'t erase anything and has no idea what I\'m talking about.\r\n\r\nSo I was just being pissy and depressed about that right now as we speak. By bringing that up, not only did you give me an excuse to vent, but I think you just inspired me to go ahead and do it right now. I\'ll just make a bunch of charts, but I wanted a pic to go with each chart for visual reference, but I think just one pic of the PCB will be enough.\r\n\r\ndave'),(19869,'7e925a3b22','Just wanted to say excellent work on that Camaro again. That\'s one of them special cars where everything came together just right.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAnd also just wanted to tell you, my luck hasn\'t been getting any better the last couple days...My wife got our camera ripped at Disneyland. :( \r\n\r\nSo I immediately went searching for a cheap replacement. I was basically just trying to replace what we had for as little as possible. I got a NIB refurbished Olympus D-390 for $100. Not too bad huh? It\'s a lower model # than our old one, but has nearly identical features cause it\'s newer.\r\n\r\nAnyways, got a couple things I wanted to ask/tell you about. What I wanted to ask you about was the lense. It\'s a better lense , 5mm, but I was reading a description that said that is the equivilent to 38mm in the 35mm world. What the heck does that mean?\r\n\r\nAnd also, I searched all over for a halogen desk lamp, but no one has halogen anything, cause of that scare with the halogen lamps being a fire hazard. I finally found one at Walmart, but it\'s only 8 watts. How many watts is the one you use? Cause I have feeling that 8watts isn\'t enough. I don\'t know if you noticed, but my pics look like shit lately. I tried putting 2 of those halogen lamps on it, and it got shittier. My best bet still seemed to be, get close and hit with the flash.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the point of that story is, this new camera has white level settings for tunsten, and flourescent lighting. That should help, doncha think?\r\n\r\nI was thinking, that part of the reason my pictures were getting consistly fuzzier everytime my kid played with the camera had nothing to do with the lense, I thinking he might turned up that damn crappy digital zoom. Unfortunatly I forgot that camera even had that feature, until I was looking at similar cameras. I want my old camera back, just so I can verufy that. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19871,'27517ffb72','no prob.\r\nif I might offer a suggestion...\r\nI\'d optimize the images for the web - I noticed you have a pic in thats pretty huge - that\'s killing your space.\r\nyou\'d be able to fit alot more.\r\n\r\ntypically, 600 pixels width or height should be the limit on size (of course there are a few exceptions)\r\njust an FYI\r\n[quote:27517ffb72=\"sg219\"]Thanks :-)[/quote:27517ffb72]'),(19872,'28dd49dbe5','Thanks, I didn\'t even realize they came out that big.  I thought i shrunk them all already.'),(19873,'28dd49dbe5','Thanks, I didn\'t even realize they came out that big.  I thought i shrunk them all already.'),(19875,'0c96cd7031','Thanks for the props on the Camaro, that means more coming from you than anyone.\r\n\r\nThe \"equivalent to a 38mm lens on a 35mm camera\" thing is a little confusing... those little lenses in the digital world are their own beast, so they compare to the 35mm equivalent to confuse matters further. In 35mm land, a 50mm lens is considered \"normal\", meaning that it sees about the same as the human eye. Wider lenses, like a 28mm, are good for shooting interior because they see a wider periphery, but they distort at the edges. They also over exaggerate depth... things that are close look huge and things that aren\'t that far away look tiny. With long lenses, things that are near and far from the camera look more equal in scale, so things tend to look closer in depth than they actually are. \r\n\r\nAnyway, 38mm is aproaching normal but is on the wide side... which is good for general use. It should actually be great for little cars. The main thing is going to be using that macro mode and figuring out the close-focus range. Do some tests and figure out how close something can be to the camera before the camera can\'t focus on it. My guess is it\'s probably going to be somewhere around 7-10 inches from the lens. I just looked at a sample macro shot from a D-390 [url=http://www.imaging-resource.com/PRODS/D390/FULLRES/D39MAC.HTM]here[/url] so it\'s gonna work... those coins are pretty sharp. You\'ll probably have to shoot with the car a little bit small in the frame, then crop in on it in Photoshop or another editing tool.\r\n\r\nThe lamp I use is 50 watts, and I use a tripod because that\'s still pretty low light to hold the camera steady enough by hand. A tripod or a way to secure the camera is good. Daylight might be your best option.. the camera is gonna use a way faster shutter speed with that much more light. So, outside or a lamp and a tripod, but you don\'t wanna use a flash for things that close up.\r\n\r\nHere, I just read something else that might help out... \"The D-390 captured a fairly large macro area, measuring 7.18 x 5.38 inches\"\r\nSo, draw a box 7.18 x 5.38 inches and, with the digital zoom off and the camera pointed straight at the page (important), position the camera so that you can see th whole box on the LCD... the distance from the paper to the lens is where you wanna be. Maybe even an inch more just to be sure... any closer is too close for the camera to focus. Measure that distance and always have your car at least that far away from the camera.. if it\'s too small in the frame, crop it later.\r\n\r\nI hope this helps, and feel free to ask me more questions... I\'m sure some of that was confusing.\r\n\r\nOh... also, I\'ll need your new address. I\'m slackin\' on the next batch of discs for you, so I\'ll be shippin\' them to your new place. I\'m probably a week out, to be realistic.\r\n\r\nWell, I hope your luck takes a turn for the better real soon... and remember ya got support in da hood when shit gets bad... later, man.\r\n\r\nMat'),(19876,'f794c9632a','[quote:f794c9632a=\"sg219\"]Thanks, I didn\'t even realize they came out that big.  I thought i shrunk them all already.[/quote:f794c9632a]might wanna check, I think it\'s just 1 pic that\'s biggie sized');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19877,'cf81a1c44e','[quote:cf81a1c44e=\"biohazard\"]thanks dave for helping me out I will email you with the picture[/quote:cf81a1c44e]No problem, you do great work. :-) \r\n\r\nOk, it\'s here: http://crazybydesign.net/biohazard/MAZDAFLAME.JPG\r\n\r\nAnd damn dude, those are some sick flames. Nice.\r\n\r\nBetween you and Hue35, you guys are starting to show me up. Looks like it\'s time for me to get back into flame mode. :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(19878,'54ffc39829','well you get props on starting the flames.'),(19879,'f5122ae663','go for it, you know what to do. :-) \r\n[quote:f5122ae663=\"biohazard\"]thanks crazy dave offered to give me a link,  I would still would like to register at your gallery\r\n\r\nthanks biohazard[/quote:f5122ae663]'),(19881,'379b7dfd04','get ldkghosdjgodogxdg  high, dskrhgildfhglihdfig soon? \r\n\r\ndfitghilusdygildhlighseuighs gotta gdhifd grab hdklhtfui something xdkghki to kxdjfhgidfhgilxguytwew eat.'),(23789,'06d97fc83f','well the checks will start rolling in in a few weeks. hopefully the sanity follows  :sad:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37435,'02cb671a14','Have you gotten that prize yet?\r\nI\'m guessing not. I just tried tracking the package and still has the same information as the day it was excepted.\r\nRidiculous.'),(36143,'c16585eea7','Sounds good man.  I cant think of a reason why it cant be done.  The only tricky part of doing it with the se is that there is alot more under the hood to squeeze in there lol.  When you do the suspension mod you tend to lose a little  bit of interior room but im sure you can make it work.\r\n\r\nYour ideas sound great, let me know if i can help more.  cant wait to see what you come up with\r\n\r\nSTG'),(35852,'a14c6f4af1','Hmm well the 57 chevy is a for sure thing. I have 2 515bb bodies, so one of them could be yours. Just the murcielago is the tricky one.\r\n\r\nTo me it does not really matter, I am not to familiar with alloy parts and all, but do they benefit the chassis? And trade me what ever you think is fair.'),(34721,'4876185733','Hey Clint,\r\n\r\nWould you mind if I duplicated your tutorial (http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=6991) in our Articles section?\r\nFull credits to you of course.\r\n\r\nIf not, that\'s fine - no hard feelings (ya fucker lol)\r\nBut seriously, it\'s fine if you\'d rather not.\r\n\r\nLemme know.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34181,'46b329002f','Finks your attitude is tough, I like it. It is actually encouraging me. Thanks man I picked up some clear shells (4) for like a dollar at my hobby shop. I think I\'m might enter one even if it\'s shit. Gotta start some where.\r\n\r\nPeace...'),(27219,'95aeef71f8','hey i was wondering if you could send me the iwaver servo to this address if you can\r\n\r\nC. Ladd-Viti\r\nUniversity of California\r\n109 Cesar Chavez Center\r\nBerkeley, California  94720\r\n\r\nThanks 8-)'),(35088,'6cc78ae67d','Thanks alot. I was wondering up the Iwavers..\r\n\r\nYou see we are building a track in my uncles basement and its gonna be huge. It is actually big enough to have a short circuit 1/10th scale race as well. But we both realize 2 1/28th scale RC\'s would be kick ass to go head to head. Now he just loves collecting superior chassis. He has got plenty of vintage Tamiya shit. I only have a TB-02 Chassis with upgrades and some kick ass torque. (Just goes to show i love rippin up the track more than spending money on upgrading so much) I think I would like the Xmod, and I\'ve found an Iwaver for cheap too. But if I got an xmod i\'d probably go with an EVO. Right now I am dying for someone on the boards to post up \"Xmod for sale!!!\"...\r\n\r\nThanks alot, I will probably buy  both the Iwaver and Xmod upgrade both of em just because I love the infinity that just came out for Xmod, and the Saleen Iwaver is making it hard to keep it in my pants lol...\r\n\r\nI want to get involved more with bits but it\'s pretty tough finding all the good pieces for a cheap price for such a small thing. There is nothin in Canada fuck...'),(20172,'78cf0f438d','Well you may or may not like what I am gonna do next :lol:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20220,'6dc28e7ac7','[quote:6dc28e7ac7=\"Da Big Kahuna\"]Yeah I Know, last night I read my PM then the mods forum and saw that.\r\nThen I read the forum on another subject, then my PM and the same issue.\r\n\r\nI just went to bed after that............!\r\n\r\nI got JAC4412 prize in the mail this morning with 2 da Priority delivery confirmation. $4.80, not bad at all.  So he should get his ride by Friday.[/quote:6dc28e7ac7]yea that got confusing there for a sec lol\r\n\r\ncool man. hope he\'s happy.'),(19947,'ce586d44f2','I got some for ya.  Hows $15 + S&amp;H sound to ya.  Just PM me your info and I\'ll get them ready for the ride down under. I just have to get to the post office to find out how much shipping would be.\r\n\r\nIs PayPal cool with you?\r\n\r\nsg219@hotmail.com is my PayPal addy.\r\n\r\nDo you need anything else?  I have a ton of Xmod stuff.  About 10-12 cars worth.   Maybe one big shipment if you need more or someone else does?\r\n\r\nWell let me know.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSG219'),(24466,'de3f3d69b8','- AWD	(dont need the shaft)		\r\n- Suspention/steer kit		\r\n- rear end + shaft hold down (yellow bit at fount)  these 2 i would like 2 \r\n  get from ur spares if u have them\r\n- wheel pack		\r\n- tyres pack			\r\n- stage 2			\r\n- body+kit.. if u got some laying around i dont care about condition  \r\n  aslong as decent or else can u get a body set that has a body and the kits and the tab.. (want the civic if thats the way it ends up)\r\n\r\nthat the final revised list. also i got the cheese 2 day.. its pretty good');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24443,'b8264c31c4','[quote:b8264c31c4=\"pimp master deuce\"]Dude,\r\n\r\nI\'m a fuckin\' retard... I tried to change the email address on my account, but typed it in wrong. So, the activation email got sent to a fuckup email (hue35@earhlink.net instead of hue35@earthlink.net) address that I can\'t get to. LOL!!! Anyway, lucky I had this little bogus account so I could at least PM you. Mother fuck! Like I said I\'m a fuckin\' retard. Uh, so could you help your flunky-flunk newbie mod out of a bind here?\r\n\r\n- hue35/pimp master deuce... christ, this is fuckin\' gay.[/quote:b8264c31c4]ok, I changed hue35 to have the email of: hue35@earthlink.net\r\nand I activated the account.\r\n\r\nwhy did it go in-active?'),(31540,'0453395022','Oh WOW !\r\n\r\nYou tha MAN !!!  :) \r\nyou a true []D.[].[]V[].[]D :-o \r\n\r\nThanks so much man , i really appreciate it . :-) \r\nAs for the lith .Are they complicated to charge ?\r\nIs there a certain clip for them so i could purchase a charger here at a later date ?, i heard they where dangerous too  if you dont charge them right. Also one more question , are they hard to install ?\r\n\r\nThanks very much and i will post your item tomorrow morning anyhow , \r\nWhether i choose to wait for the lith , or not .I will have a look on\r\n\" trademe\"(new zealand ebay )\r\nand see if i can buy a lithium charger , will all the chargers work or just li-poly ones ?\r\n\r\nSorry for all the questions , but much appreciated , \r\nJ03!'),(28953,'ff168d70bf','I understand your rules but don\'t agree with them because I am selling my mini-z and won\'t be back. if you want to check my ratings go to RCU I am in perfect feedback. I just thought maybe one of your readers would like a nice deal.Please remove my membership thanks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33911,'d715079955','Y DID U GET OFF MSN'),(33918,'dce5031888','atleast i dont stick stuff up my ass'),(33914,'7571afb381','Amazing work on that man, you interested in selling it?'),(36866,'e13c5b8f4e','Thanks dude. Works good. Basically what I want to do is have all Taylors movies on the left and the media player on the right. When you click one of the movies it plays in the side media player.'),(37609,'7cbd92e558','how do i go about putting up my pics and get special permision to do so . thnx , very cool site .'),(37610,'7cbd92e558','how do i go about putting up my pics and get special permision to do so . thnx , very cool site .'),(37488,'682c250224','hmmm, i\'m stumped! it was definately working when i had it, slow steering but working.\r\nsounds like there could be some binding in the steering somewhere. check it over and as a last resort pull the servo apart and check it out.\r\ni\'d try a different servo motor too.\r\n\r\nsee how you go with that and lemme know if it works. :-o'),(36545,'4f6a47aef5','I\'ll take the 7317\'s.  They\'re good fets.  I went ahead and picked up a Spider.  I was trying to stay on a budget, but the Spider was calling me.  I really want to try and keep the MR02 as stock as possible.  The Nelly Deluxe needs a lithium setup.  I\'ll save the Nelly for another project and try out the Spider first.\r\n\r\nThink that Spider can handle the plasma-atomic with neo mags and an alloy 10 tooth pinion?  Should I give it a break in between runs?  Could it ultimately be fried if pushed too hard for too long?  Soryy for all the questions.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31544,'adafa75dc8','how thanks alot, ill think about joining and i prob will...'),(31552,'830da91d26','My addy is\r\nDavis W \r\n2329 Cherry Street\r\nDenver, Co\r\n80207\r\n\r\nAlso do you accept Paypal? If not then I cannot get the body :sad:'),(31553,'dd944edbfc','[quote:dd944edbfc=\"weazel\"]My addy is\r\nDavis W \r\n2329 Cherry Street\r\nDenver, Co\r\n80207\r\n\r\nAlso do you accept Paypal? If not then I cannot get the body :sad:[/quote:dd944edbfc]\r\n\r\nyes I accept paypal my paypal address is airo@ev1.net \r\n\r\nthanks\r\nAaron\r\nsteelwoolghandi'),(36466,'cb81f6dc90','Watup Mafia, i seen that you said you could get the iwaver boards for dirt cheap, HOW!?  :cool: Thanks'),(33421,'5929383c87','tru...\r\n\r\nE.Z. pimp you\'re alright.......eh are\'nt you the guy who sells duel cell battery shit or w.e? I wanna mod up my bit but i hate asking questions around here.....\r\n\r\nand by the way i\'m tryna earn back some respects by making an F1 chassis and gettin it to run.....'),(36929,'e857d5e99d','whats your address?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34262,'936d6bcbb6','hey man got the bodies in today man that was quick shipping! Thanks so much for the great group buy the other guys will be vary happy with the shells! They look GREAT!\r\n\r\nThanks for the great deal on these it was all greatly appreciated!  :-) \r\n\r\nAaron'),(37751,'ffc80c5e93','It\'s fairly stock, but I think I put bearings, awd kit, and a few other things in it.'),(37757,'f4b97c4010','I\'ll send mine out tommorow or tuesday, my addy is:\r\n\r\nOskar Kohanec\r\n111-405 N.Briggs Ave\r\nSarasota FL  34231\r\nUSA\r\nEarth\r\nMilky Way\r\nLocal Group\r\nSpiral Galixy\r\nUniverse'),(37760,'42f7406b9f','Clone monster was based on one BioHazard did on TinyRC.   http://www.tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;threadid=6673    He did the &quot;real&quot; way (soldered brass tubing, screws...), I took that and did what could have become the &quot;quick &amp; dirty, easy for everyone to mod&quot; way.\r\n\r\nI used one of the plastic pedistals that hold the Clones in the &quot;Snowglobe&quot;, a plastic shaft Q-tip, 2 rear axles, a weird packing clip from a dress shirt (shaped like a &quot;U&quot; and the free ends were at accute enough angles they crossed over.  I used they because they had ball ends so I wouldn\'t have to bother with another type head), some CA, and some BlueCrap.\r\n\r\nMake sure whatever means you use to mount your front rims is as wobble-free as you can manage.  Be positive that you have the 90deg. bends on the front wheel on the same plain.  Don\'t bother with adapting stock charge-pad, it\'s WAY more headache than worth.  \r\n\r\nI have a couple of Biohazard\'s original pics, I\'ll host them in my BitPimp gallery.  And just name any pics of mine that you want, and I\'ll get them up for you'),(37763,'42f7406b9f','Clone monster was based on one BioHazard did on TinyRC.   http://www.tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;threadid=6673    He did the &quot;real&quot; way (soldered brass tubing, screws...), I took that and did what could have become the &quot;quick &amp; dirty, easy for everyone to mod&quot; way.\r\n\r\nI used one of the plastic pedistals that hold the Clones in the &quot;Snowglobe&quot;, a plastic shaft Q-tip, 2 rear axles, a weird packing clip from a dress shirt (shaped like a &quot;U&quot; and the free ends were at accute enough angles they crossed over.  I used they because they had ball ends so I wouldn\'t have to bother with another type head), some CA, and some BlueCrap.\r\n\r\nMake sure whatever means you use to mount your front rims is as wobble-free as you can manage.  Be positive that you have the 90deg. bends on the front wheel on the same plain.  Don\'t bother with adapting stock charge-pad, it\'s WAY more headache than worth.  \r\n\r\nI have a couple of Biohazard\'s original pics, I\'ll host them in my BitPimp gallery.  And just name any pics of mine that you want, and I\'ll get them up for you');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31620,'1bfa228449','This how I figured out that pimpsmurf is gamecocksrocks}.... I put 2+2 together when he said he won a modelista set for 5.75 and I checked and the only set that closed at that price was the one I got out bid on{ by gamecocksrocks}..... thats how I was able to figure out who he was without him posting his ebay name on here.\r\nsee ya,\r\nfilelicker'),(34413,'775766e2c2','Ok you are just like so Bad Ass!!! I got the bodies in today and they are just Friggin cool just what I wanted the subie bodie is perfect!!!  :-o  :-o  :-o \r\n\r\nWhat do I owe ya man I can send ya some paypal just let me know!\r\n\r\noh the 3.0 motor is perfect I have a chassis it will go right in!\r\n\r\nthanks agian man I owe ya one! (or two)\r\n :-) \r\nAaron'),(32213,'bdb49d4275','[quote:bdb49d4275=\"JdmHatchback\"]I can go $90shipped and include the mini cooper roof set and a few tire sets. Let me know. Thanks![/quote:bdb49d4275]\r\n\r\nSplit the difference?... $82.50?'),(37385,'c59c2a0e4c','[quote:c59c2a0e4c=\"chrome\"]Hey cj, I was wondering on the status of the order.  I\'ve seen a few GPM parts on the forums and was wondering if you were starting to ship orders.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...[/quote:c59c2a0e4c]\r\n\r\nJust got an email from GPM\r\n\r\n[quote:c59c2a0e4c]About the back orders of PO#11233220CJS, there are arms and dampers arrived for the EVO TRUCK and will continue to have more during this week and next week.  Therefore I suggest you to have one shippment at the end of this month for grouping another parcel to you.[/quote:c59c2a0e4c]\r\n\r\nI do have some of your parts.  I was waiting on the car orders for mainly knuckles to arrive before I send everyones out.  \r\n\r\nI have for you.\r\nDXME009T 1 white\r\nXME018A 1 Black\r\nXME028 1 Black\r\nXME030 1 Black\r\nXME039R 1 Black\r\nXME047 1 Black\r\nXME190R 2 Black\r\nXME303 1 Black\r\nXME331R 1 Black\r\n\r\nIf you want those I can send them to you now.  If you want to wait for the end of the month I should have more parts per GPM.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28558,'16ab797399','can you send me a picture of the i pod it and what color were you thinking of?'),(35291,'fbafe9edaf','No problem man, just send me some clean pics of the rides if ya can. :-)'),(33339,'f7efc385fe','OK.\r\n\r\nHowever, it wasn\'t me who stole your computer. :lol: \r\n\r\nGoodluck. :-o'),(34973,'8d45acfe36','I\'m still trying to find a way to do a ball-bearing mod that does\'nt require the use of 10$ a pop imported german bearings. After I saw your bearing mod in the \"ZZSE bearings\" thread, I thought it might fit the bill. Any tips?'),(27277,'c62c4ec05d','Hey man -\r\nYou\'re not having troubles with being able to upload to the Galleries are you?\r\nJust making sure it\'s working for you still.'),(37834,'8326cec003','Yeah, just the 27 and 27a. The payment will show up to ssirpe@sympatico.ca\r\nfrom lordhelmetr342003@yahoo.com in the amount of $20 \r\n\r\n\r\nMy shipping addy is:\r\n\r\nJustin Long\r\n3 Crockett Rd.\r\nRaymond ME 04071'),(27736,'98ffb19ded','I was thinking taking one body and making an extender, like in a real limo.  My sister had an ex-boyfriend that had a stretched Chrysler LHS, and it\'s the same way, but two bit chassis\'s would have to serve as one for it to work.  The motor/heatsink/gears/axle come out of the front and the suspension/steering assembly comes out the back, and both bits would run on say, 45mhz or something.  The extension could be fabricated out of scratch stryofoam (look in my thread about a caterham dreamkit and you\'ll see what I mean) and then a mold could be cast and you just superglue everything proper.  From there it\'s just choosing gears, batteries, motors, suspenion, heatsink, and nice tires.  The idea drawn out looks much better.\r\n\r\nI don\'t have any plans laid out for the sprinter at the moment.  I like how the hood comes off though :grin: \r\nWell, keep in touch.  Gotta go, the buzz from my bro\'s bud is killing me.\r\nSmoke on,\r\nAbe  :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31453,'b702145168','[quote:b702145168=\"viperdout\"]Sorry, this might sound odd, but a lightning bolt struck about 20 feet from my house and fucked up my router, so I didn\'t have internet for the past 2 days.  Send it to ltauber@lehman.cuny.edu (I use my mom\'s paypal).   Just put your address in, and I\'ll send it out today priority.[/quote:b702145168]\r\n\r\nIts been sent :-o  and the Im gonna get the whole controller like the charger antennae and all right?'),(25370,'5241c60444','I\'m only an ass to those that deserve it. You\'re a lil confused on your politics but your still young.\r\nDon\'t let things get you down and good luck with your sickness. :-)'),(19893,'d552d1fbb2','Thanks for the answers man, it all made sense to me. 8-) \r\n\r\nDaylight does seem to work best, but it seems kinds contrasting with some paint jobs, you know what I mean?\r\n\r\nOh, and I offered to host a pic for biohazard, and he\'s got some sick ass flames going too. I got gotta brush up an my flame skills, I can\'t let all you punks come around and start showing me up. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(19894,'dbcf814152','Yeah dude, coincedentaly I told some of my co-workers today about it and they all laughed thier asses off.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19895,'534f1c63be','[quote:534f1c63be=\"crazydave\"]Daylight does seem to work best, but it seems kinds contrasting with some paint jobs, you know what I mean?[/quote:534f1c63be]\r\n\r\nAn overcast day is best, but you can also diffuse the sunlight with a sheer fabric or a dark cloth with random holes in it (called a gobo)... under a leafy tree is a similar effect. Sometimes the contrast is good but I know what you mean, it can get pretty harsh.\r\n\r\nyeah, biohazard\'s flames are sick... that car is one bad mofacki. That dude has some serious skills.'),(28306,'f6515cbfab','How\'s that Camaro treating you? :-) \r\nNever heard back, and I saw you around the forums, so I just wanted to make sure it arrived ok. \r\n\r\nGotta tell ya, I was proud of that car. I meant to make one for myself, and I just haven\'t got around to it yet.\r\n\r\nDave'),(30866,'3250713b58','I will give you $7.00 for the kit, do you have paypal?'),(19941,'78ce0ac8fe','no i probably should get it tho huh? ill do that payday.\r\n\r\nill more than likely grab 4 off ya for future wrecking.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24360,'c195952f99','Greetings,\r\n\r\nIt\'s me, jrc6805 from over at banned r/c. SInce I am not a regular member here, I don\'t want to start any shit with these kids. I just want to get rid of this x-mod I stumbled into. I imagined some fucker from here coming to banned to hawk his stuff only.....you get the idea.\r\nSo, what is the best way without causing a hassle? As of now I do not have any pics of the damned thing but will work on that this week. \r\n\r\nI don\'t know what the thing is worth fair and square either. I figure it ought to be worth $75 with all the stage two stuff that comes with. Holler back when you get the chance either here or at banned rc. I appreciate it...\r\n\r\njrc'),(19897,'a3431a9837','I can not seem to find out how to post or create a album in the gallery?  Can you direct me in the right direction please\r\nthanks'),(19898,'bc78248432','SkyLine GTRX is SOLD!  You can PM JAC4412 Let him know that as soon as you get da cash, da car will be shipped.\r\n\r\nNot bad for a $5.00 car + motor &amp; heat sink !'),(19901,'bc78248432','SkyLine GTRX is SOLD!  You can PM JAC4412 Let him know that as soon as you get da cash, da car will be shipped.\r\n\r\nNot bad for a $5.00 car + motor &amp; heat sink !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19902,'2e92c5a15e','[quote:2e92c5a15e=\"Da Big Kahuna\"]SkyLine GTRX is SOLD!  You can PM JAC4412 Let him know that as soon as you get da cash, da car will be shipped.\r\n\r\nNot bad for a $5.00 car + motor &amp; heat sink ![/quote:2e92c5a15e]no shit man - that baby netted some bank!\r\nthat\'s gotta make ya feel good - DT\'ed rides are lookin pretty saught after.\r\n\r\nI\'ll do it if ya want, but I was thinking that you should just go ahead and PM him the details, let him send the $ to you - when you get it, send off his car. I know you got other rides going up on the block so you might as well keep all the $ till it\'s over or whatever then you can send whatever you want to me (minus any of your expenses if you wish).\r\n\r\nI was thinking that\'s how we should do it for all of us. (e.g. if CD creates it, he accepts the $ and when it\'s over, sends whatever he wants my way.)\r\n\r\nI think we might run into a little confusion if we have multiple people handling the transaction so to speak. the purchaser will probably get what they bought a little quicker too.\r\n\r\nwhaddya think? good? bad? indifferent?'),(19906,'2e92c5a15e','[quote:2e92c5a15e=\"Da Big Kahuna\"]SkyLine GTRX is SOLD!  You can PM JAC4412 Let him know that as soon as you get da cash, da car will be shipped.\r\n\r\nNot bad for a $5.00 car + motor &amp; heat sink ![/quote:2e92c5a15e]no shit man - that baby netted some bank!\r\nthat\'s gotta make ya feel good - DT\'ed rides are lookin pretty saught after.\r\n\r\nI\'ll do it if ya want, but I was thinking that you should just go ahead and PM him the details, let him send the $ to you - when you get it, send off his car. I know you got other rides going up on the block so you might as well keep all the $ till it\'s over or whatever then you can send whatever you want to me (minus any of your expenses if you wish).\r\n\r\nI was thinking that\'s how we should do it for all of us. (e.g. if CD creates it, he accepts the $ and when it\'s over, sends whatever he wants my way.)\r\n\r\nI think we might run into a little confusion if we have multiple people handling the transaction so to speak. the purchaser will probably get what they bought a little quicker too.\r\n\r\nwhaddya think? good? bad? indifferent?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19907,'4ecbbb4deb','Let\'s stick to da plan we agreed on.  The money goes to you, when it\'s clear you give us the okay to send the car.  Not a lot of confusion, that way the money is handled by 1.  My expenses are void here.  Like always, I\'m just doing what I can to help out.\r\n\r\nPeace!'),(19910,'4ecbbb4deb','Let\'s stick to da plan we agreed on.  The money goes to you, when it\'s clear you give us the okay to send the car.  Not a lot of confusion, that way the money is handled by 1.  My expenses are void here.  Like always, I\'m just doing what I can to help out.\r\n\r\nPeace!'),(19913,'8709b18b1f','call me when you get this. you know why. its sunday night about 10:15pm right now.'),(19916,'8bc412cfa5','I had to give you special permissions after your registered.\r\nwhen you first registered in the galleries - you didn\'t have those special permissions so you didn\'t get to see 3 buttons that allow you to create / modify / etc. your galleries.\r\nI have changed your permissions and you should now see those 3 buttons and should be able to create your gallery.\r\nlet me know if you have troubles.\r\n[quote:8bc412cfa5=\"biohazard\"]I can not seem to find out how to post or create a album in the gallery?  Can you direct me in the right direction please\r\nthanks[/quote:8bc412cfa5]'),(19917,'696c7870ff','thanks for your help');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19920,'daa688ee49','no problem, anytime.\r\nif I might make a recommendation though with your galleries...\r\n\r\nMake sure you optimize your images for the web.\r\nyou\'re dealing with a limited amount of space so you need to optimize as much as possible so you can fit as many images as possible in to your space.\r\ntypically, images shouldn\'t be over 600 pixels in width or height. obviously sometimes that can\'t be avoided and that\'s fine, but overall - you should try to optimize to that size.\r\nas well, typically, image sizes do not go above 200 kb for large images (wallpaper size) and under 35 kb for typical shots of cars.\r\n\r\njust an FYI\r\n\r\n- Cabo\r\n[quote:daa688ee49=\"biohazard\"]thanks for your help[/quote:daa688ee49]'),(19921,'074883fad2','OKAY I CREATED MY ALBUM, BUT ONE LAST QUESTION FOR YOU.  HOW DO I LINK ONE OF MY PICTURES FROM THE ALBUMS TO MY POST.'),(19922,'fe20608039','hey i was wondering if you could tell me if toyeast.com is taking orders or not since it is not letting me register'),(30851,'2dfa09a5dc','the 5 bucks will handle the shipping. I live in shreveport , la. \r\nI will cast the body as soon as i can. i should be able to do it tomorrow.\r\n\r\n   I made my bodies the same way you made your old delivery sedan i saw in your album. I think that it took me about solid month to finish it. i forgot were the post is on bitpimps but there is a whole section as i built it up.\r\n\r\n  It will fit a clone but you will have to take the pcb cover off and tape it down( the pcb that is ) there are tabs on the body for the chassis.\r\n\r\ni have paypal and my paypal user id is (janderson9@sport.rr.com)\r\n\r\nthanks for you interest.\r\n\r\njeff');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20101,'93bb6b9971','lock this topic, im sick of the bs ive recived from this site so just lock it, im never coming here again.'),(20102,'93bb6b9971','lock this topic, im sick of the bs ive recived from this site so just lock it, im never coming here again.'),(20561,'5ca8e802c2','Right on brother.  That\'s exactly what I did.  I put a 3.8 (\"white end cap mystery motor 3.8\")  in it and it runs like a stud.  I really like 3.8 and 4.2 pro motors in the FET cars with the teal gears. I am a big fan of FET bits.  I prefer them over the dual cell or triple cell cars.\r\n\r\nI am really impressed with the paint job too.  The pictures on the site do not do it justice. I was really impressed with the finish and smoothness of your work.  I have a couple of other shells I would like painted if you have the time. Name your price.  ...take it ez................... jd'),(31093,'2d7a399bda','congratulations on the ride of the month! It\'s a very nice and unique lil rc...\r\n\r\nI recived your money for the vw body and am in the process of casting it today. \r\n\r\ni was not happy with the original mold i had for this body , so i remolded a touched up and smoothed out vw body of the one i have pictured in my gallery. this mold is perfect and i will have a casting finished today and in the mail tommorrow. \r\n\r\n thx \r\njmays'),(37732,'cd9ea11158','I have a extra unopened Iwaver02 New design I\'d be willing to part with for your testing.  I\'ll take $79.99 + S&amp;H and even through in an extra chassis plate.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37737,'5050e7ec96','I have to get a new body because when i was trying to lower it I melted the car.  Stupid lighter.'),(37739,'32b172b6d9','sure...send me a pic or two :-o'),(37740,'5050e7ec96','I have to get a new body because when i was trying to lower it I melted the car.  Stupid lighter.'),(35370,'4b3058d619','Thanx Again Pimp !  :cool:'),(28452,'94807f13c5','Alright, well thats cool, I really don\'t need controllers, so a 49 would be fine as long as the car works, 49 gets better range too and I got 2 many 27\'s, but whatever You want to do is kool.\r\nThanks'),(28127,'14ee9129dc','Get in chat bitch'),(28128,'b5b53ffa2e','Whay up bird???Yeahhhh!!!!'),(28126,'c56c61d751','Whats up???'),(28129,'8f50b824a2','people call me the space cowboy....\r\nYeah....some call me the gangster of looo\'ooove. Some people call me Maurice.....'),(28308,'83c25157aa','Hey man, any 1/64th scale chassis is pimping, a mosfet microsizer would be awesome seeing that I\'ve never had a mosfet bit before, but I reposted my for sale stuff, i.e. I added a pic, and some descriptions of what I have up for trade. So If You want more pics let me know and I can get them to You, because I took alot of pics last night. But Your offer sounds great, umm what would you want for the mosfet microsizer, MT PCB and other PCBs I have, or what. Does that microsizer steer and drive?\r\nThanks Man, just let me know what all You want for that and I\'ll get back to You.'),(28589,'c69c0d643e','[quote:c69c0d643e=\"91LudeSiT\"]Yea thats your fault one of your wonderful moderators edited it my post to say something I did not say.[/quote:c69c0d643e]\r\n\r\nNothing here is \"my\" fault. Being a smart ass is not going to score you any points. Just be cool and go with the flow. Read the rules and don\'t post stupid shit. If your post got edited, it must have been stupid. All I did was delete it and give you the warning. I am far from the harshest moderator here, and I was just trying to give you a heads up so ya don\'t get booted.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34651,'b7233db13e','Sorry you\'re so busy man, just tryin\' to jump on MSN with ya to see what else ya need as far as Bits go. Ya must be talking to a lot of people.\r\n \r\nI wanted to send the package out today, but no problem. There\'s always tomorrow.\r\nSee ya'),(34652,'1e798f03f2','can you delete all of my threads for me i just want to start over with a clean slate everything i post gets deleted or locked for an unknown reason like my gtr project threads 1st 1 got deleted 2nd got locke after i posted a pic i mean damn cant i make it 10 post without bein thrown uder the bus all my questions are simple like what is jdm or is sanding necassary then they come and bullshit person after person and the thing get locked \r\npeace'),(32941,'6519cf81db','If you change your mind the body is your\'s it realy is a must have for a collection! (if you wana do some trading I could even paint one up for ya?) \r\n\r\nYa send me some pics and if I can help ya out in any way let me know and will do!\r\n\r\nNo Doc (Falkner) neve got with me I was hopping to get his emai and chat with him! \r\n\r\nPM me when you have the pics or you can email me at airo@ev1.net. Have a great Morning! :-) \r\nAaron \r\nSWG'),(19932,'eaa9e09f95','hey i got a bunk iwaver tx. ill trade ya for a dual celled bit or some shit.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19933,'9439a6eaa4','[quote:9439a6eaa4=\"biohazard\"]OKAY I CREATED MY ALBUM, BUT ONE LAST QUESTION FOR YOU.  HOW DO I LINK ONE OF MY PICTURES FROM THE ALBUMS TO MY POST.[/quote:9439a6eaa4]right click on the image.\r\nselect \"Properties\".\r\nin the Address (URL): section, copy that entire address - that is the exact link to your image.'),(19934,'7548ffb82b','thanks again'),(19995,'e6deea8167','well, if you\'re looking for \"Dub Shop Customs\", then private message \"Hiroto34\" because that\'s all of his custom cars. But if you\'re looking for Dub City Cars, go to [url]http://www.jadatoys.com/[/url]\r\n\r\nand I can only hope that I\'m the only one you private messaged.... not EVERYBODY...\r\n\r\n\r\n~midget_man1387~'),(20164,'67cd9611d1','Dude is IBRAKEFORCOX your woman?'),(19952,'fdcc81f107','Is yo woman drinkin\' tonight?  And if not, WHY??????????????????'),(24353,'c8f5603ce4','[b:c8f5603ce4]Tip#1:[/b:c8f5603ce4]\r\n\r\nAs a practice, when cutting a convertable, Targa, or T-Top, ALWAYS stop \r\nyour cut just before the top of the door.  At that point you can file it down \r\nto where you want and not hafta build it back up with puddy.   8-)'),(19958,'e4110bf973','Hold on!!!  I think the people at the place I went were on drugs!!!  If you get a chance, go to [url]http://www.usps.com[/url] and see what you get for the shipping price.  The package should be no more than a pound.\r\n\r\n\r\nI think it will be alot cheaper than what those crackheads told me.  Go check it out and see I\'m not crazy.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19959,'618551ee2b','I\'ll give you all the electronics you need, no problem.  Plus, I\'ve been over to the Micro Downunder many times, so thats cool.  \r\n\r\nThe only thing is I think for the price of shipping your better off getting a whole chassis, which I could hook you up with no problem.  Say $30 and if you want the body $35.  I\'m just thinkin\' that if its gonna be alot to ship, you might as well make it worth it. \r\n\r\nHere is the deal with the shipping, I went to the local shipping place and asked for a general quote.  Here is what they told me.  If you don\'t have a Zip code I can\'t give you a price.  I asked how much to just get it on the Island?\r\n\r\nThis is a rough estimate remember this while reading this.  The girl working wasn\'t that brite either.  All in US currency....based on 1# package\r\n\r\n6-10 working days $45+\r\n10-20 working days $20+\r\n18-30 working days $15+\r\n\r\n(I thought ToyEast was expensive on shipping to the USA! :shock: )\r\n\r\nI have to check into this a little closer, now that I have your zip code to see how much and to where it needs to go.\r\n\r\nGive me a day or two to find out more about this whole shipping downunder thing and if I can find a cheaper method of getting stuff there.\r\n\r\n\r\nJust wanna make sure a Pimp can get what he needs.  Does anyone else need parts?  Maybe you can get a few to pitch in and get some other parts.  I have a ton of them, I\'m not tryin\' to make cash, I just like having alot of parts around for this reason, for when someone needs them.\r\n\r\nCool with you?'),(19960,'789ab90a58','I got $14.50 for a 10 oz. package, which for electonics and a box should be pretty close.  This was Airmail Parcel Post.  I wish this was simpler. \r\n\r\nAnyway just let me know what you want or need and I\'ll get it to you.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21016,'9eb8731696','You didnt lock the thread or edit my post?\r\n\r\nSorry man, I thought you were a mod. My mistake.\r\n\r\nWho locked it and edited my post...isnt the faggot part a bit immature?'),(37310,'12270e6e3d','good choice, you won\'t be disappointed :-o'),(32919,'10708743fb','Thats ok man, i\'ll just have to practice the zen art of patience, or some shit.'),(36538,'3712b478d0','So what comes with the body? and how much would that be?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nSTG'),(36566,'f8b1ac3b5d','Hey man, ive been doing some searching on the site and i cant seem to find the answer im looking for. Im installing an iwaver pcb in my zzse buggy but im a little confused about what to do with the steering POT. Do i use the existing zzse pot or do i use the iwaver pot??? ALso, ive been reading that i need to install 10k ohm resistors on the pot (whatever pot i end up using) Do What wires do i need to solder these to? The iwaver pot only has two wires but the se has three so im a little confused on the issue.\r\n\r\nAny help would be great\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nSTG'),(32376,'de4a1f7d88','hey dude!!!!!\r\n\r\nI\'m about to kill my boss!! :)\r\n\r\nI\'m even workin today, snuck home for lunch.:)\r\n\r\nConstruction, emergency \'change order\', crappy hours 16+ a day, but get a laptop at work!!!!\r\n\r\nIt s over as of tomorrow, just wanted to give a shout to tell ya I havn\'t forgotten \'bout ya, and thanks for being patient!!!!\r\n\r\nSunday-Monday we\'ll do the address thang...... :-) \r\n\r\nThanks again.....Dave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37267,'0f984756f4','Hey betty, i took a stroll over to ausmicro and saw that you were clearing shop in the xmod department.\r\n\r\nI am very interested in your BP NSX, and was wondering a couple of things\r\n\r\nFirst off is it still for sale?\r\n\r\nIs the prices in AUD or USD?\r\n\r\nHow much for regular airmail shipping to 34685 US Florida\r\n\r\nHopefully we can work out a deal :-) \r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt'),(34155,'17a9dcb269','[quote:17a9dcb269=\"steelwoolghandi\"][quote:17a9dcb269=\"MotorGong\"]Aw man!\r\nI saw you posted yesterday about sending out the Payment to Bonzer earlier next week.\r\nNow you already did! :(\r\nThat\'s okay, I think SG219 got like six of \'em? I betcha I can snag one from him. :-o \r\nSeriously, no worries. You gave ample time, and I was lazy and late to the game! :grin: \r\n\r\nDude, GREAT rides you are modding and posting!!\r\n\r\nI think I\'m in over my head with my mod, I\'ll send ya some pics and see what ya think. Prolly in a couple days. \r\n\r\nAgain, your rides are killer! It scares me away at at the same time gives me inspiration!!! :lol:[/quote:17a9dcb269]\r\n\r\nMotor I bought 3 bodies for myself so if you want one I will give one up I really did not need three but felt somone (humm like you) would get in late and want one!  :lol: \r\n\r\nI would love to see some pics of your ride! I am on MSN Messanger if you want to send them that way name: Steelwoolghandi \r\n\r\nthanks for the comments man its appreciated it took me several years to get to the point of modding that I am doing now, now I want to just get better!\r\n\r\nThanks again let me know about he TVR shell and if you want it!  :-) \r\nSWG\r\nAaron[/quote:17a9dcb269]\r\n\r\nI reformatted my computer recently, and lost my drawn-up plans and some pics.DOH!! :(  :grin: \r\nCool, I\'d love to meet up with ya on MSN sometime! I\'ll get my shiat together and get with ya soon! I gotta work in an hour, but your rides seriously give me motivation to have at it!!!\r\nThanks again man, it\'s cool to know the people here that have a heart!\r\n\r\nWARNING: This isn\'t a \'normal\' ride. I\'ll give ya a heads up.....it\'s like a street sweeper. It runs on 27 AND 49 mhz, with 2 sweeping motors for the sweeper deals. It works, but I\'m having trouble building a contraption for the sweepers.'),(26177,'10e64961ff','Sure.  What numbers can\'t you ahve exactly?  I have two sets of #6.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20471,'57cf5a9307','Hey, about that idler, I just figured it wasn\'t that big of a deal, and you\'d get to it when you got to it, but I forgot you\'d need the new address, d\'oh!\r\n\r\nSo anyways, here\'s the address:\r\n7002 W Indian School Rd.\r\nApt#1131\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nIt\'s just right up the road, same zip code even. :lol: \r\n\r\nIt\'ll be cool to check out that red gear. This green one is pretty extreme, but that\'s cool though. 8-)  \r\n\r\ndave'),(24610,'6a6ecd1588','hey im sorry 2 do this but im just working out somestuff rite now and have 2 put this on hold'),(24611,'19e331df09','[quote:19e331df09=\"merc-blue\"]hey im sorry 2 do this but im just working out somestuff rite now and have 2 put this on hold[/quote:19e331df09]\r\n\r\nIts cool.  Its not like I was makin\' money off of it. :cool: \r\n\r\nJust glad to help when I can.'),(24613,'d056c7a685','Just to keep you updated, I mailed the money order out today and you should recieve it within 5 working days.\r\n\r\nRob'),(24614,'91711f2bb7','[quote:91711f2bb7=\"Sugarfoot\"]Just to keep you updated, I mailed the money order out today and you should recieve it within 5 working days.\r\n\r\nRob[/quote:91711f2bb7]sounds good, thanks for the heads up man.\r\nI\'ll let you know when I receive it and have crazydave ship the car out to you.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (27439,'44fdb4f823','hey can i ask for a favor i know our deal didnt go to smoothly.. sorry but if i pay pal your some cash can u direct deposit it into some bodys account?\r\nthnx\r\nRohan (another bruce)'),(31841,'43af60c293','[quote:43af60c293=\"mikirgra\"]Cool DT. That\'s the right call since you spoke first as far as I\'m concerned, but I didn\'t want to screw Steve over since I didn\'t state that as ruling in my half-assed post. I\'ll offer some other bit to Steve to ease his pain.\r\n\r\nI\'m having surgery tomorrow (out-patient), so it\'ll be Monday at the earliest before I can ship this out to you. Send me the address you want it shipped to, and I\'ll get it boxed up. You don\'t need to paypal me right away. I\'m ok with it if you want to wait until I confirm for you that I\'m shipping. My paypal id is graham@gte.net.\r\n\r\nYou got any Toy-R-Us\'s in your area? I\'ll knock $10 off the price for this Lupin the III bit if you can find me the Super Slick black WRX. I\'ve ordered it twice from Amazon, and they kept sending me blue one\'s. Bastards. Anyway, let me know. If not, I\'ll let you have this bit for $30, and I\'ll cover the shipping.\r\n\r\nLater DT. You may not hear back from me until Monday.[/quote:43af60c293]\r\n\r\nGot many TRU\'s near me, I\'ll check this weekend.  Do you just want the body or whole car?'),(19968,'de8b05e6ef','i just found out i can get the voltage regulator localy so its only then NPN transistors:\r\n2N2222A NPN trans. [276-2009] &lt; product code\r\nhttp://www.radioshack.com/product.asp?catalog%5Fname=CTLG&amp;category%5Fname=CTLG%5F011%5F002%5F017%5F000&amp;product%5Fid=276%2D2009&amp;hp=search\r\ni need 2.. thnx man there tiny so wont stuff up the size or weight of the package...\r\nif u dont have any electronics knowlage just quote the product and say there transistors and u need 2.. just to make sure the guy knows wat ur on about (they need step by step instructions RS employees dont tend to be smart from what i heard)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19969,'eaa9e09f95','hey i got a bunk iwaver tx. ill trade ya for a dual celled bit or some shit.'),(19970,'4b1a8cf5e1','Hi JAC4412 -\r\nCongrats on your winning bid!\r\n\r\nYou can send cash or money order to:\r\n\r\nScott Lix\r\n16 Crystal Lake Drive\r\nSt. Peters, MO 63376\r\n\r\nonce payment has been received, the car will be shipped out immediately. I\'ll keep you notified on the progress.\r\n\r\nThanks for helping support bitPimps.\r\n\r\nFeel free to email or private message if you have any questions or comments.\r\n\r\n- CaboWabo'),(19971,'ee6152d286','Does the $30 include S and H? Sorry about nopt replying I have been on Vaca. The Money will be shipped out hopefully by tomorrow. Cheers.\r\n\r\nJAC4412'),(19972,'ee6152d286','Does the $30 include S and H? Sorry about nopt replying I have been on Vaca. The Money will be shipped out hopefully by tomorrow. Cheers.\r\n\r\nJAC4412'),(19973,'0a023fbe6b','I\'m guessing it does?\r\n[quote:0a023fbe6b=\"JAC4412\"]Does the $30 include S and H? Sorry about nopt replying I have been on Vaca. The Money will be shipped out hopefully by tomorrow. Cheers.\r\n\r\nJAC4412[/quote:0a023fbe6b]'),(19974,'4369fc6f9f','[quote:4369fc6f9f=\"hogjowlz\"]hey i got a bunk iwaver tx. ill trade ya for a dual celled bit or some shit.[/quote:4369fc6f9f]\r\n\r\nNo thanks...I don\'t really need any extra Iwaver controllers right now....Thanks for the offer though. :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19975,'4369fc6f9f','[quote:4369fc6f9f=\"hogjowlz\"]hey i got a bunk iwaver tx. ill trade ya for a dual celled bit or some shit.[/quote:4369fc6f9f]\r\n\r\nNo thanks...I don\'t really need any extra Iwaver controllers right now....Thanks for the offer though. :-)'),(19976,'894c6caee0','no crackbaby i need the iwaver tx. what you want for yours?'),(19977,'894c6caee0','no crackbaby i need the iwaver tx. what you want for yours?'),(19978,'972eed132f','[quote:972eed132f=\"hogjowlz\"]no crackbaby i need the iwaver tx. what you want for yours?[/quote:972eed132f]\r\n\r\n\r\nOH....misunderstood. \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, I don\'t have a spare...just one, to match the Iwaver chassis I have....'),(19979,'972eed132f','[quote:972eed132f=\"hogjowlz\"]no crackbaby i need the iwaver tx. what you want for yours?[/quote:972eed132f]\r\n\r\n\r\nOH....misunderstood. \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, I don\'t have a spare...just one, to match the Iwaver chassis I have....'),(19980,'8fa4567e38','dont you got a perfex? oh well nm.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19981,'8fa4567e38','dont you got a perfex? oh well nm.'),(21595,'d046b3977d','[quote:d046b3977d=\"Ahh5hit\"]Sorry about the P.M.\'s, I have pop-up blocker on and don\'t see them unless I look for them. Normal shipping for the package is $5.00 to your address.\r\n\r\nIt is packed and ready to go, as soon as I see the money hit paypal, I will ship it out. I\'m sure any pimp can vouch for me, and I\'m a moderator at TinyRC if you have any concerns.\r\n\r\npaypal: Ahh5hit@comcast.net     (thats a 5, not S)\r\n\r\nMike[/quote:d046b3977d]\r\n\r\nI trust you.  I never even questioned your integrity.  I know you\'ve been around.  Thanks for the deal. Off to PayPal!!! :-) \r\n\r\nMike \r\n\r\n\r\nHere\'s my addy one more time, I just give it with every response so that its always there.  I tend to delete things and loose them sometimes.\r\n\r\nMike Smalley Jr.\r\n3918 Inland Ave.\r\nWest Mifflin, Pa  15122\r\n\r\n\r\nEdit&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;The cash is in route!!  Via the cable system. :-D'),(19983,'95bf659d60','y do u want pics of the drivers side? lol if u have AIM, IM me.......my s/n is bigsho22288');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33204,'7fdbd70fad','$10 ea for the protector kits + $(6/2) priority shipping to me + $5.00 global priority shipping to you.\r\n\r\nWe can split the shipping to me as I\'m going to get a 3 cell protector. that would be $28.00.\r\n\r\nHit me up when you get the chance, and I\'ll order right away. I\'ve got to wait on the nelly to get here, and I\'m going to wait until the 19th to order a cheapo 3 cell charger from batteryspace.\r\n\r\nI\'ll send the X2LSPE info sheet with the serial number and such with the protectors.\r\n\r\nLater ohn,\r\n-JNY'),(35443,'9e157ccdc1','Yo Cuzz I am not tring to play anybody for a car I can bye all I remember getting a PM stating one thing I am not trippin like that and sorry if you think I am tring to run game I\'ve been thru to much and to old for that shit and I had the cash to pay for that car'),(25105,'ac08cec294','Sup I huess we don\'t have a deal since i haven\'t gotten your Bit or ZZ you said you were sending.'),(19985,'2cc747f9f7','Tried to contact you via hotmail, but for some reason it wasn\'t working.... :???: ;)\r\n\r\nYou said that you did some searching for the FETs used in your Woah Nelly turbo. \r\n\r\nHow exactly did you go about searching....did you use a specific part finder, did you enter a description and find the mosfet to match them...? \r\n\r\nOh, and what does \"Q.E.D.\" mean?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19986,'652e611819','[quote:652e611819=\"Son_Gokou\"]Tried to contact you via hotmail, but for some reason it wasn\'t working.... :???: ;)\r\n\r\nYou said that you did some searching for the FETs used in your Woah Nelly turbo. \r\n\r\nHow exactly did you go about searching....did you use a specific part finder, did you enter a description and find the mosfet to match them...? \r\n\r\nOh, and what does \"Q.E.D.\" mean?[/quote:652e611819]\r\n\r\nI dont\' have a hotmail address, so that wouldn\'t work.\r\n\r\nI can\'t explain to you how I did the searching.  It\'s called research.  I basically go to the major vendors websites and looked though their list of parts.   A lot of these sites use a parametric search (a search tool used to look for certain atributes for a part, eg: max voltage, resitance, etc...), with this I tracked down the best performing mosfets on the market.\r\n\r\nYou really are lazy dude, just do a search:\r\n\r\nhttp://dictionary.reference.com/search?q=q.e.d\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nbigbucks.'),(34473,'45a280285a',':?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (29591,'765287a337','Like I said, it\'s a donation, no worries SF, when you can you can.  Thanks'),(19994,'6646f21c37','[quote:6646f21c37=\"mitchell\"]Isnt there a site called dub city or sometin can u help me out and give me a link please[/quote:6646f21c37]yea I think there is, unfortunately I don\'t have a link for you - sorry\r\n\r\nI know some pimps on the board must know'),(20145,'284bfdf815','No problem.  Movin\' is always a hassle.  I went ahead and paypal\'d the cash....just send it when you get settled in and whatnot.'),(20146,'6bf957ebc8','[quote:6bf957ebc8=\"Jackd\"]No problem.  Movin\' is always a hassle.  I went ahead and paypal\'d the cash....just send it when you get settled in and whatnot.[/quote:6bf957ebc8]Cool man, thanks for the prompt payment. I\'ll get that out by this weekend.\r\n\r\n...and thanks again for your support.  :cool: \r\n\r\nDave'),(35403,'74244e3464','[quote:74244e3464=\"skylinekid\"]I payPaled out the money for the alloy on Sunday night and haven\'t heard anything from you, I\'m just wondering if you got it or not???? Thanks in advance :-o[/quote:74244e3464]\r\n\r\nI got that. \r\n\r\nThere have been some changes to the GPM parts that GPM is making.\r\n\r\nCurrently I have you for:\r\n\r\nPART ID	DESCRIPTION	PRICE	Cost	Green\r\nDXME009T	DELRIN MOTOR GEAR (9T) - 1PC	$1.90	$1.24	1\r\nDXME100R	DELRIN REAR BALL DIFFERENTIAL - 1 COMPLETED SET	15.50   	$0.00	\r\nDXME1224T	DELRIN MAIN GEAR (12T/24T) - 2PCS SET	3.50   	$0.00	\r\nXME018A	ALLOY MOTOR HEAT SINK - 1PC	3.50   	$2.28	1\r\nXME021	ALLOY FRONT KNUCKLE ARM - 1PR	9.90   	$6.44	1\r\nXME022	ALLOY REAR KNUCKLE ARM -1 PR	9.90   	$6.44	1\r\nXME028	ALLOY FRONT SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	7.50   	$4.88	1\r\nXME030	ALLOY REAR SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	7.50   	$4.88	1\r\nXME032	ALLOY MAIN GEAR PROTECTOR - 1PC	3.90   	$2.54	1\r\nXME039F	ALLOY FRONT WHEEL SHAFT - 1PR	3.90   	$2.54	1\r\nXME039R	ALLOY REAR Wheel SHAFT - 1PR 	3.90   	$2.54	1\r\nXME047	ALLOY PROTECTOR FOR FRONT STEERING PLATE - 1PC 	3.90   	$2.54	1\r\nXME049/0	ALLOY STEERING PLATE - 1PC	6.50   	$4.23	1\r\nXME055	ALLOY FRONT LOWER ARM - 1PR	6.90   	$4.49	1\r\nXME056	ALLOY REAR LOWER ARM - 1PR	6.90   	$4.49	1\r\nXME190R	ALLOY REAR DOG BONE (9.0MM) - 1PR	2.50   	$3.25	2\r\nXME303	ALLOY BATTERY HEAT SINK MOUNT - 1PC	7.90   	$5.14	1\r\nXME316F	ALLOY FRONT DAMPER (16MM) -1PR	5.90   	$3.84	1\r\nXME316R	ALLOY REAR DAMPER (16MM) - 1PR	5.90   	$3.84	1\r\nXME330LAN	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR LANCER) - 1PC	5.90   	$0.00	\r\nXME330MUS	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR MUSTANG) - 1PC	5.90   	$0.00	0\r\nXME331R	ALLOY REAR SKID PLATE - 1PC	3.50   	$0.00	0\r\nDXET009T	DELRIN MOTOR GEAR (9T) - 1PC	$1.90	$0.00	\r\nDXET100R	DELRIN REAR BALL DIFFERENTIAL - 1 COMPLETED SET	14.50   	$0.00	\r\nDXET1224T	DELRIN MAIN GEAR (12T/24T) - 2PCS SET	3.50   	$0.00	\r\nXET018A	ALLOY MOTOR HEAT SINK - 1PC	$3.50	$0.00	\r\nXET021	ALLOY FRONT KNUCKLE ARM - 1PR	$9.90	$0.00	\r\nXET022	ALLOY REAR KNUCKLE ARM -1 PR	$9.90	$0.00	\r\nXET028	ALLOY FRONT SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	$7.50	$0.00	\r\nXET030	ALLOY REAR SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	$7.50	$0.00	\r\nXET032	ALLOY MAIN GEAR PROTECTOR - 1PC	$4.50	$0.00	\r\nXET039F	ALLOY FRONT WHEEL SHAFT - 1PR	$3.90	$0.00	\r\nXET039R	ALLOY REAR Wheel SHAFT - 1PR 	$3.90	$0.00	\r\nXET047	ALLOY PROTECTOR FOR FRONT STEERING PLATE - 1PC	$3.90	$0.00	\r\nXET049	ALLOY STEERING PLATE - 1PC	$6.50	$0.00	\r\nXET055	ALLOY FRONT LOWER ARM - 1PR	$6.90	$0.00	\r\nXET056	ALLOY REAR LOWER ARM - 1PR	$6.90	$0.00	\r\nXET114R	ALLOY REAR DOG BONE (14MM) - 1PR	2.90   	$0.00	\r\nXET303	ALLOY BATTERY HEAT SINK MOUNT - 1PC	$7.50	$0.00	\r\nXET322F	ALLOY FRONT DAMPER (22MM) -1PR	$5.90	$0.00	\r\nXET322R	ALLOY REAR DAMPER (22MM) - 1PR	$5.90	$0.00	\r\nXET330FORD	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR TRUCKIN) - 1PC	$6.90	$0.00	\r\nXET330HUM	ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR HUMMER) - 1PC	$5.90	$0.00	\r\nXET331F	ALLOY FRONT SKID PLATE - 1PC	$3.90	$0.00	\r\n		Sub	$65.52	\r\n		Rouund	$66.00	\r\n		Shipping	$3.00	\r\n		Total	$69.00	\r\n\r\nWich is $3 more than the original amount.  To save you from paying me $11 the front clip was removed.  Also there is no rear Swing arm axles they were replaced with dog bones.  Another addition you have the option of adding is now a Rear Ball Diff.  Paypal me the $3 for the current order or let me know what you want to change.'),(36969,'bdaa44f0eb','[quote:bdaa44f0eb=\"cj\"]Have you down for:\r\n\r\nPART ID	DESCRIPTION	UNIT PRICE 	Price 	? \r\n[b:bdaa44f0eb]DXME009T	DELRIN MOTOR GEAR (9T) - 1PC	$1.30	$1.30	1\r\nDXME009TA	DELRIN MOTOR GEAR (9T) WITH ALLOY TRAY &amp; SCREWS - 1PC SET	$1.90	$1.90	1[/b:bdaa44f0eb]\r\nDXME100R	DELRIN REAR BALL DIFFERENTIAL - 1 COMPLETED SET	 $15.50 	$10.08	1\r\nDXME1224T	DELRIN MAIN GEAR (12T/24T) - 2PCS SET	 $3.50 	$3.50	1\r\nXME012A	ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET	 $11.90 	$7.74	1\r\nXME013A	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET 	 $23.90 	$15.54	1\r\nXME013B	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX REAR COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET 	 $11.90 	$7.74	1\r\nXME021	ALLOY FRONT KNUCKLE ARM - 1PR	 $9.90 	$6.44	1\r\nXME022	ALLOY REAR KNUCKLE ARM -1 PR	 $9.90 	$6.44	1\r\nXME028	ALLOY FRONT SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	 $7.90 	$7.90	1\r\nXME030	ALLOY REAR SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	 $7.90 	$5.14	1\r\nXME039F	ALLOY FRONT WHEEL SHAFT - 1PR	 $3.90 	$2.54	1\r\nXME039R	ALLOY REAR Wheel SHAFT - 1PR 	 $3.90 	$2.54	1\r\nXME039R/C	ALLOY REAR UNIVERSAL SWING SHAFT (CVD DESIGN) - 1PR	 $6.90 	$13.80	2\r\nXME039R/4WD	ALLOY REAR Wheel SHAFT FOR 4WD - 1PR 	 $3.90 	$2.54	1\r\nXME049/0	ALLOY STEERING PLATE - 1PC	 $6.50 	$4.23	1\r\nXME055	ALLOY FRONT LOWER ARM - 1PR	 $7.90 	$5.14	1\r\nXME056	ALLOY REAR LOWER ARM - 1PR	 $7.90 	$5.14	1\r\nXME190R	ALLOY REAR DOG BONE (9.0MM) - 1PR	 $2.50 	$3.25	2\r\nXME316F	ALLOY FRONT DAMPER (16MM) -1PR	 $5.90 	$3.84	1\r\nXME316R	ALLOY REAR DAMPER (16MM) - 1PR	 $5.90 	$3.84	1\r\nXME331R	ALLOY REAR SKID PLATE - 1PC	 $3.50 	$2.28	1\r\nMZ002	ALLOY 2MM LOCK NUT SET  5PCS	$3.80	$3.80	1\r\nSub	$139.24	\r\nS&amp;H 4%	$5.57	\r\nTotal	$144.81	\r\n\r\nLet me know if this is right and what color you wanted.  The Shipping on your can change depends on if I send it to Florida or your home.[/quote:bdaa44f0eb]Remove the items in bold,I would rather an 11T but that\'s not offered. Can I use the gears from the stage 2 kit with this alloy? Your update post was confusing. If I can please remove [b:bdaa44f0eb][DXME1224T DELRIN MAIN GEAR (12T/24T) - 2PCS SET $3.50 $3.50 1][/b:bdaa44f0eb] also.\r\nI want all the items in purple. \r\nI didn\'t really want to commit to this so early, but hey :-? [u:bdaa44f0eb]I\'m in[/u:bdaa44f0eb]. Please note that it would be VERY hard for me to ADD more money to this order. So if prices start going up, start dropping the &quot;non-essentials&quot; one-by-one. \r\n\r\nWith the bolded stuff removed I think it brings my total to:\r\n\r\nSub     $136.04\r\nTotal    $141.48\r\n\r\nDouble check that figure for me.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20138,'5df72a364d','[quote:5df72a364d]~sorry for language CW[/quote:5df72a364d]\r\n\r\nomg....dude, this is bit PIMPS, FYI, we\'re allowed to curse as much as we fuckin want!!'),(20139,'21fbadf35b','hey, how ya goen?\r\n\r\nI just downloaded a php forum and i was wondering if you could help me out in installing it.\r\n\r\ncheers.'),(20140,'1e34a44e5f','[quote:1e34a44e5f=\"brendan123\"]hey, how ya goen?\r\n\r\nI just downloaded a php forum and i was wondering if you could help me out in installing it.\r\n\r\ncheers.[/quote:1e34a44e5f]well I\'m not certain which forum software you got, but I can tell you what typical installation is like.\r\n\r\n- download the forum software.\r\n- usually you upload it to your webserver in to a directory where your forum will live (i.e. www.domain.com/myForum/)\r\n- you\'ll have to follow the installation instructions closely. it tells you exactly what to do and you usually need to do it exactly how they say or it won\'t work.\r\n- most likely, after uploading, you\'re going to open your browser and type in a URL to a config file in your forum (www.domain.com/myForum/myConfigFile.php)\r\n- usually once hitting the config file, you\'ll be guided through setting up your forum in several steps.\r\n\r\nhope that helps ya out some'),(19997,'656ffc0c51','[quote:656ffc0c51=\"JAC4412\"]Does the $30 include S and H? Sorry about nopt replying I have been on Vaca. The Money will be shipped out hopefully by tomorrow. Cheers.\r\n\r\nJAC4412[/quote:656ffc0c51]If you\'re in the US or Canada, yes that includes shipping.\r\nsorry for the late reply myself :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (19998,'2aff289289','No problem.. Just sent the money today.'),(19999,'d3fa49b73b','Oh yeah... BTW, just send a pm over here when you get the money and send the car out. Do I get the girl homie too? lol just joking......\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks Man! That is a sick car...\r\n\r\nJAC4412'),(20000,'652e611819','[quote:652e611819=\"Son_Gokou\"]Tried to contact you via hotmail, but for some reason it wasn\'t working.... :???: ;)\r\n\r\nYou said that you did some searching for the FETs used in your Woah Nelly turbo. \r\n\r\nHow exactly did you go about searching....did you use a specific part finder, did you enter a description and find the mosfet to match them...? \r\n\r\nOh, and what does \"Q.E.D.\" mean?[/quote:652e611819]\r\n\r\nI dont\' have a hotmail address, so that wouldn\'t work.\r\n\r\nI can\'t explain to you how I did the searching.  It\'s called research.  I basically go to the major vendors websites and looked though their list of parts.   A lot of these sites use a parametric search (a search tool used to look for certain atributes for a part, eg: max voltage, resitance, etc...), with this I tracked down the best performing mosfets on the market.\r\n\r\nYou really are lazy dude, just do a search:\r\n\r\nhttp://dictionary.reference.com/search?q=q.e.d\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nbigbucks.'),(33217,'818f53861c','Balsa products just got them back in stock, but they don\'t seem to offer faster shipping. I guess we should go with the place in florida because they have faster shipping options, which is only $3US more all together.\r\n\r\n-JNY');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (25110,'58384470e4','Calm down Cuzz I believe you  I\'ll get that out to you.'),(20468,'94eed761a2','Ah, thank you for understanding, i will DEFINETLY send next week, ive been a little pre-occupied getting ready for my job, and its over now, so everything is settling back down...\r\nwhat all am i supposed to be sending u/u sending me?'),(20469,'3c2172d41b','uhh im sending you a custom s2k a stock s2k a moded trcuk that fits bit chassis and motor works drag tiers and custom foam tiers . you are sending me a untested chassis , a accord that i won , a wrx i think and wide rear wheel kit, or you said you lost it so so bodys or some thing .  oh and im sending youi some cat5 too you asked for it .'),(20004,'2aff289289','No problem.. Just sent the money today.'),(20005,'d3fa49b73b','Oh yeah... BTW, just send a pm over here when you get the money and send the car out. Do I get the girl homie too? lol just joking......\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks Man! That is a sick car...\r\n\r\nJAC4412'),(21090,'437b63617a','I think you sabotaged yourself, and in the future should adopt a different contest strategy.\r\n\r\nSee what happened was, both your cars got high ranking votes, but in the end the votes were split between them, and ultimately lowered your rank.\r\n\r\nIn retrospect that doesn\'t seem very fair to me, but I guess that\'s the way the ball bounces. Being the newest mod, I\'m not gonna diss on the voting system. I feel partially responsible, because I voted for the XB, just because I\'m a sucker for flames, and thought the surfboards fit the theme better, but seeing how your half cab edged it out, I wished I voted the other way now.\r\n\r\nSorry, but I\'ll make it up to you by sharing my contest strategy, that apparently works, because I\'ve got three wins under my belt.\r\n\r\nDon\'t put all your marbles in your first car. Do something to wow \'em, and set a standard that people are trying to top, that you know you can beat, then pull out the stops at the last minute for your second ride. They\'ll never know what hit them.\r\n\r\nBTW, this PM is just between us, cool? 8-) \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21089,'ba1d0e4f8b','I\'ll keep an out. No, I\'ve never heard of any 5below.\r\n\r\nMike'),(20008,'240d1d27cd','Well, in the last pm i sent you, i said only a lucky few got invite links.\r\nI am one of those people!\r\nsssoooo...\r\nTo make up for what i did, i am going to give you one, and sessiz one, and cj one!\r\nAll i need is your email and your name!\r\n\r\n\r\n(no this is not a lie, why would a 13 year old want your name for other reasons :grin: )'),(20009,'702c253174','http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10003/219.jpg'),(20010,'240d1d27cd','Well, in the last pm i sent you, i said only a lucky few got invite links.\r\nI am one of those people!\r\nsssoooo...\r\nTo make up for what i did, i am going to give you one, and sessiz one, and cj one!\r\nAll i need is your email and your name!\r\n\r\n\r\n(no this is not a lie, why would a 13 year old want your name for other reasons :grin: )'),(20011,'e683b881a4','[quote:e683b881a4=\"synj\"]Well, in the last pm i sent you, i said only a lucky few got invite links.\r\nI am one of those people!\r\nsssoooo...\r\nTo make up for what i did, i am going to give you one, and sessiz one, and cj one!\r\nAll i need is your email and your name!\r\n\r\n\r\n(no this is not a lie, why would a 13 year old want your name for other reasons :grin: )[/quote:e683b881a4]superdupersleuth2002@yahoo.com\r\nSuper D Sleuth\r\n 8-) \r\nfor real though\r\n\r\nhook me up pimp.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20012,'9b63fc041e','Thats downtawn.  I\'ve seen that before, I can\'t remember what building.'),(20013,'e683b881a4','[quote:e683b881a4=\"synj\"]Well, in the last pm i sent you, i said only a lucky few got invite links.\r\nI am one of those people!\r\nsssoooo...\r\nTo make up for what i did, i am going to give you one, and sessiz one, and cj one!\r\nAll i need is your email and your name!\r\n\r\n\r\n(no this is not a lie, why would a 13 year old want your name for other reasons :grin: )[/quote:e683b881a4]superdupersleuth2002@yahoo.com\r\nSuper D Sleuth\r\n 8-) \r\nfor real though\r\n\r\nhook me up pimp.'),(20014,'8da8fcd10f','You got mail!'),(20016,'9b63fc041e','Thats downtawn.  I\'ve seen that before, I can\'t remember what building.'),(20446,'c304c19e07','[quote:c304c19e07=\"synj\"]can you help me with setting up my phpBB forums?[/quote:c304c19e07]you should read the instructions that come with it when you download it.\r\nit explains how to do it.\r\nI don\'t have time to do that for you.'),(20018,'127ba82622','Read on your forums General discussions\r\nyou will see a post i made about something... 8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20019,'7abad79247','[quote:7abad79247=\"JAC4412\"]Oh yeah... BTW, just send a pm over here when you get the money and send the car out. Do I get the girl homie too? lol just joking......\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks Man! That is a sick car...\r\n\r\nJAC4412[/quote:7abad79247]I\'ll PM you when everythings a \"go\".\r\nDarkTari might throw something in with it - who knows lol'),(20020,'36195637c9','I just sent you a PM from my backup account.  I forgot I was logged on as it.  \r\n\r\nBut, yes it is from me \"SG219\".  I use \"pnutbtr75\" as a back-up so if the power or my comp goes crazy and I\'m on BitPimps, I don\'t loose my unread messages.\r\n\r\nSo, yes the Power Brute for sale PM is from me.  Just wanted to clarify that for you.\r\n\r\nIts still $12 for everything including S&amp;H.\r\n\r\nsg219@hotmail.com is my PayPal..............'),(20021,'8b120a7fff','It came in the box, but I took it out for display and to play with a couple of times, but it works and you can have it for $800 in small bills.\r\n\r\nNo,not really.\r\n\r\nI saw them new on TowerHobbies for $10 + S&amp;H.\r\n\r\nBut hows $12 sound shipped for the lifter one. These are the Power Brutes from Hong Kong, not Target or K-mart.  Just an FYI.  There is no difference. \r\n\r\nI only use PayPal.\r\n\r\nThis is my PayPal account addy.........\r\n\r\nsg219@hotmail.com'),(21032,'ecb53099df','Unforutunaltely, i dont have an SE for sale anymore.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21664,'eb0a559be0','Keep me in mind CJ, I want a pair, but don\'t have the cash to spare right now.  Damn wifes Sewing machine just broke and fixing it will cost more than all my play money I have at the moment.  Don\'t need you to hold on to em, if you have em in 2 weeks great, if not, no biggie.  Oh Btw, is it $5 each and then $2 each for shipping, or $2 shipping for a pair?  Thanks bro'),(20023,'8da8fcd10f','You got mail!'),(20024,'f6020ce4d5','on forbes across from george akens.'),(20025,'090c4d4fbe','The old G.C. Murphy store.  Ya, now I remember.'),(20027,'f1c97edf1d','got it, set it up, all\'s good in da hood.\r\n\r\nthanks pimp!'),(26152,'8e69b422ab','[quote:8e69b422ab=\"DarkTari\"]Sup Pimp!\r\n\r\nWhadaya have left? (bodies)[/quote:8e69b422ab]\r\n\r\nHi! I have a bunch of microsizers bodies sets NIB $2ea\r\n\r\nPerfection Beetle bodies NIP $1ea\r\nPerfection Lambo or Ferrari bodies NIP $1ea\r\n\r\nNeed any sets?\r\n\r\nGot Perfection Lambo/Ferrari sets $10ea\r\nLxx Auto Modellista sets $10ea\r\nTomy BitCharG sets $15-$20 ea.\r\n\r\nAny interest in IWaver stuff? I\'ll be focusing more on Iwavers/ Mini z and selling the remainder of my New Micro RC stuff.\r\n\r\nLet me know if interested in anything. Happy Holidays!'),(20030,'090c4d4fbe','The old G.C. Murphy store.  Ya, now I remember.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20032,'14117dd50b','Sorry, but all I use is PayPal.  Its quick, easy, and safe.  I haven\'t been to a bank in all most a year.  If you ever decide to go with PayPal, just let me know.  \r\n\r\nI don\'t know if you know this about PayPal, but it is useable with a bank card/check card, as long as it has a Visa or Mastercard logo on it.  \r\n\r\nPlus, I do beleive you can use your checking account # to do it also, but you would have to look into that one.'),(20033,'6d2d7724b9','gota get there with a rattle can :)'),(20034,'73683e9682','[quote:73683e9682=\"ph2t\"][quote:73683e9682=\"Son_Gokou\"]Tried to contact you via hotmail, but for some reason it wasn\'t working.... :???: ;)\r\n\r\nYou said that you did some searching for the FETs used in your Woah Nelly turbo. \r\n\r\nHow exactly did you go about searching....did you use a specific part finder, did you enter a description and find the mosfet to match them...? \r\n\r\nOh, and what does \"Q.E.D.\" mean?[/quote:73683e9682]\r\n\r\nI dont\' have a hotmail address, so that wouldn\'t work.\r\n\r\nI can\'t explain to you how I did the searching.  It\'s called research.  I basically go to the major vendors websites and looked though their list of parts.   A lot of these sites use a parametric search (a search tool used to look for certain atributes for a part, eg: max voltage, resitance, etc...), with this I tracked down the best performing mosfets on the market.\r\n\r\nYou really are lazy dude, just do a search:\r\n\r\nhttp://dictionary.reference.com/search?q=q.e.d\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\n\r\nbigbucks.[/quote:73683e9682]\r\n\r\nlol...thanks.'),(20035,'f1c97edf1d','got it, set it up, all\'s good in da hood.\r\n\r\nthanks pimp!');
