 thing: I\'m going on vacation to North Carolina for 10 days, starting Friday, so if you could, please PM me back or w/e by tomorrow.. If not,  wont get it till after fourth of July weekend, so then take your time... but dont forget lol\r\n\r\nthanks again,\r\n\r\n~midget_man~[/quote:2462fd8fff]go ahead, you can make 1 post advertising it, just put it in the right forum.... \r\nhave fun on vacation pimp!'),(20062,'2cb9c3a1dc','Ok, sounds good to me.  I\'ll grab up that stuff next payday (July 2nd) and get it together to take to the post office to see how much shipping will be.  So, I\'d say just after the first of the month it\'ll be ready to ship.  \r\n\r\nSound cool with you.  If you come across anything else you need, just let me know.\r\n\r\nYou can go on the RS website for the price of the other stuff.\r\n\r\nelectronics--$15\r\nAWD--\r\nBearings (i have extra, not used)--$12 instead of $20\r\nSuspenion--\r\nStage 2--\r\nTransistors--\r\n______________\r\nTotal it and add $6 for me running around (it\'ll get me a good beer and cover the tax)+ Shipping.  OK?\r\n\r\nI have some extra stuff lyin\' around I\'ll throw in, but it\'ll be a little surprise.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSG219');
