gh... thnx man');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33228,'2fe4a4ef6b','LOL. Yes, I\'ve been anxious to get the order in, although I\'m still waiting on the nelly deluxe and 3 cell charger.\r\n\r\nPaypal me $28 + paypal fees. $29 should cover it. /shrug\r\n\r\nI\'ll order tonight, so you should have them in 2-3 weeks (probably 2).\r\n\r\nMy first race at badlandsrc(.com) is tomorrow. I\'m psyched. I\'ve been working on my car. Rebuild the diff, carbide balls, graphite here and there, etc, etc. I\'m tuned and ready to go! Been listening to metal all night, so I\'m pumped! :-D \r\n\r\nDid the nelly ship yet?  :) \r\n\r\n-JNY'),(20067,'aadeadf3d1','Made a mistake on the other version of the woah nelly diagram...\r\n\r\nis this better? \r\n\r\n[img:aadeadf3d1]http://img19.photobucket.com/albums/v57/amitojbatra/woahnellydiagram.jpg[/img:aadeadf3d1]'),(24684,'a8130456be','*bow downs*  I got some of these free fets (15 of them, and i was wondering if you can tell me if they are the right ones, on it they say 4562aaaw35a, i think thats what it says or somthingn very close to that lol.  And also will you be selling your boards with no fets or anything on it.  Th one you have on your RSX?  \r\nthanks you in advanced,\r\n                                    Stagg'),(33933,'c5f7c14190','Yeah you do, I told you to do it, so you must think it\'s cool.  We\'re all playing mind games with you ya dumb fuck.  Sessiz, Ryan, all of them are fuckin with your little mind.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20072,'29c2be1ecb','1st off, was prusing the galleries and noticed most of you stuff is MIA.  Did you know this.  Either way just thought I would drop that.  Now for the real question.  Was reading some old posts on Epoxy on the rear wheel of a bit.  Could you explain this too me a bit.  I understand that it holds it tight, but how do you apply this and is it always bennificial?  Sorry this post is so scatter brained, I am on hold w/ Verizon for a customer issue as we talk.  Any how thanks in advance.'),(20073,'4777477c62','Hey Finks, \r\n\r\nYeah, I am gonna redo my gallery so that the newer pics are at the front instead of the back... I just deleted them so I could rename and reload them. It\'s a dumb manual work around, but I couldn\'t see another way to do it.\r\n\r\nThe mod you\'re talking about is hog\'s original jb weld axle mod... it took me a while to figure out what the fuck he was talking about, too. I\'ll try to explain it as best I can...\r\n\r\nWhen the cars start getting faster, any slop in the rear axle can make the car pull to one side.. usually to the right because the gears push away from each other and raise the left rear of the car a bit, causing the left rear to push the car to the right. I didn\'t find a need for this until I started dual-celling and mosfetting cars... the extra torque really amplifies this problem. The fix is to level-out the axle and minimize the play. The epoxy is good because you can really pack it in ther and eliminate virtually all of the slop in the rear axle. The bad part is it\'s pretty much permanent, so if pet hair or anything gets in there, you\'re basically fucked. \r\n\r\nWhat hog does (I\'ve done 2 of these), is to pack the whole thing with epoxy putty real tight. Get it as level as possible and epoxy that fucker right in there. Once the putty is set up about half way, spin the axle gently to make sure it doesn\'t get stuck. Make sure not to move it diagonally, or it will loosen up and create some slop. Now, just spin it a bit every 5-10 minutes or so, until the epoxy is set up. Once it\'s fully cured, what I do is squirt some Lock Ease (liquid graphite lube that evaporates... don\'t run the car until the liquid evaporates) in there and hold the car while running a few charges or more... I just run a whole charge holding the FWD button, then the next charge holding the REV button, etc until it\'s broken in. You\'ll hear it free up, and it will continue to get better and better. You may need to squirt just a little bit of the Lock Ease in there a few times total.\r\n\r\nInstead of epoxy, I use a plastic rod (about the same thickness as the axle or barely smaller... if it\'s too thin it will bind too much, if it\'s to thick it will leave too much slop) and cut it the width of the chassis where the axle snaps in. Snap in the axle and put the plastic rod over it. Make sure everything is level and glue it into place with a tiny dot of super glue. A toothpick works well to apply the glue. The nice thing about doing it this way is that you can easily bust out the rod and redo it.\r\n\r\nHope that shit made sense.\r\n\r\n- hue35'),(20074,'4f4e6bcbc3','hi micro. received your parcel yesterday. everything is ok and the car is much better than I expected. I thought ZZs were huge until I saw that little thing wrapped inside the paper. It is running smoothly. Guess I\'ll have to get me some more parts now. Thanks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20075,'4777477c62','Hey Finks, \r\n\r\nYeah, I am gonna redo my gallery so that the newer pics are at the front instead of the back... I just deleted them so I could rename and reload them. It\'s a dumb manual work around, but I couldn\'t see another way to do it.\r\n\r\nThe mod you\'re talking about is hog\'s original jb weld axle mod... it took me a while to figure out what the fuck he was talking about, too. I\'ll try to explain it as best I can...\r\n\r\nWhen the cars start getting faster, any slop in the rear axle can make the car pull to one side.. usually to the right because the gears push away from each other and raise the left rear of the car a bit, causing the left rear to push the car to the right. I didn\'t find a need for this until I started dual-celling and mosfetting cars... the extra torque really amplifies this problem. The fix is to level-out the axle and minimize the play. The epoxy is good because you can really pack it in ther and eliminate virtually all of the slop in the rear axle. The bad part is it\'s pretty much permanent, so if pet hair or anything gets in there, you\'re basically fucked. \r\n\r\nWhat hog does (I\'ve done 2 of these), is to pack the whole thing with epoxy putty real tight. Get it as level as possible and epoxy that fucker right in there. Once the putty is set up about half way, spin the axle gently to make sure it doesn\'t get stuck. Make sure not to move it diagonally, or it will loosen up and create some slop. Now, just spin it a bit every 5-10 minutes or so, until the epoxy is set up. Once it\'s fully cured, what I do is squirt some Lock Ease (liquid graphite lube that evaporates... don\'t run the car until the liquid evaporates) in there and hold the car while running a few charges or more... I just run a whole charge holding the FWD button, then the next charge holding the REV button, etc until it\'s broken in. You\'ll hear it free up, and it will continue to get better and better. You may need to squirt just a little bit of the Lock Ease in there a few times total.\r\n\r\nInstead of epoxy, I use a plastic rod (about the same thickness as the axle or barely smaller... if it\'s too thin it will bind too much, if it\'s to thick it will leave too much slop) and cut it the width of the chassis where the axle snaps in. Snap in the axle and put the plastic rod over it. Make sure everything is level and glue it into place with a tiny dot of super glue. A toothpick works well to apply the glue. The nice thing about doing it this way is that you can easily bust out the rod and redo it.\r\n\r\nHope that shit made sense.\r\n\r\n- hue35'),(20098,'fee5efc65c','Hi hog. Nevermind my previous pm. I think I\'ll buy the AM set from TE. But I might be interested in one of the sport or pro sets. I\'ll get back to u. Thanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (22889,'ebec40c898','[quote:ebec40c898]Check this out Potna don\'t don\'t come at me like you some down ass nigga I\'m not somw 14yr. old kid i am a 36yr old man that\'s been around the block Cuzz I am new this fourm because i race Xmods and have my own racing league so yea you need to chill on the way you comw at catz i understand that you are one of the catz that run this fourm and that\'s str8 but Cuzz I ani\'t no punk to let anyone diss me[/quote:ebec40c898]\r\n\r\n[b:ebec40c898]NO MUTHA FUCKA! [/b:ebec40c898] [u:ebec40c898]YOU[/u:ebec40c898] look here[color=brown:ebec40c898]\"Potna\"[/color:ebec40c898] !  [u:ebec40c898]BitHigh[/u:ebec40c898], You need to bring yo ass down!\r\nI don\'t give a shit if you are new to dis forum! If you\'re 30 fuckin 6 years\r\nold, and not a 14 yr old kid,  then yo ass should be able to read and follow instructions.  \r\nShit\'s right there big as day !!!!\r\n[quote:ebec40c898]\"[b:ebec40c898]Like You Some Down Ass Nigga[/b:ebec40c898]\"?[/quote:ebec40c898]\r\nYou don\'t know who the fuck I am to be step\'n to me kid!\r\nAnd like you said, you\'re new to dis Hood so mutha fucka you need\r\nto show some respect.  You come here all wrong and shit, then when\r\nyou are corrected, you wanna break bad ass? Is that how it was growin\r\nup? Teachers try to correct you and you break bad?\r\n\r\nThat explains yo bad ass spell\'n &amp; gramma  :sad:\r\n\r\n[b:ebec40c898]Don\'t bother to respond, I don\'t wanna hear yo shit ![/b:ebec40c898]'),(20097,'73d5c42826','hi hog. do you think you can get me one of those $15.00 automodellista sets you mentioned in one of the threads? i could paypal you the cash for the set and s&amp;h costs. let me know if you can do it. thanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20079,'ad8c900cb1','Wow, nice thanks for the great reply.  As you know I am still reluctant to start Gokouing chassis, but that will end soon.  Great Tutorial/explanation.  I know it\'s Hog\'s mod but if I were you I would shoot this reply to Cabo for the How to guides.  Very well done and thanks again.'),(31071,'8943e7e4df','[quote:8943e7e4df=\"MotorGong\"]\r\nDude, ya gotta write something when ya quote, unless I\'m missing something here..... :???:[/quote:8943e7e4df]\r\n\r\n\r\nHmmm it didnt send what the hell\r\n\r\nI said i get it now lol'),(30304,'a7f2180697','[quote:a7f2180697=\"micro_man\"]hi swg i was wondering if you had sent the check and or bit for the reciver yet . that way i know when to expect it . thanks , \r\n\r\nmatt .[/quote:a7f2180697]\r\n\r\nWill send it out first thing in the morning sorry I forgot about it glad you pm\'d me. money is in the envelope and will be on the way first thing!\r\n\r\nthanks again\r\nAaron\r\nSteelwoolghandi'),(29027,'e40060a736','[quote:e40060a736=\"biohazard\"]Thanks for the opportunity to sell them on your site.  I can\'t believe the response I have had on these engines. I just have a couple of questions for you about your web site.  Do you know approx. how many hits you get on your site a month?  Also are you linked on any other web sites and finally do you sell your items on EBAY. \r\n\r\n\r\nthanks Bio[/quote:e40060a736]\r\n\r\nApprox hits is over 8,000 a moth,  Actually others are linked to me as the owner of the first Xmods FAQ.  But some link are bitPimps, MircoRC Center, Whohnelly.  I don\'t regularly sell on ebay unless I am trying to get rid of clearance items or yard sale not site related items.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28379,'37c3191fcc','do you have all of the gears springs nuckes of the truck. I didn\'t see it in the picture. I am going to make a zzmt which will have four way turning, so I really could use all of the front end parts. Also do you have any zzmt bodies.  I could use a ford 150 red or silver. let me know'),(21084,'339f2fdc74','Congratulation [b:339f2fdc74]J[/b:339f2fdc74]!\r\n\r\nGreat job on your entries, I\'ll get your prize out tomorrow so you should get it this week.  \r\nAgain your work is top notch Pimp :cool:'),(20084,'52382ec92f','hey man, I got JAC\'s $30.00 today in the mail so alls good to go and it\'s put in to the bitPimps piggy bank.\r\n\r\nI told him you would send him a private message when you get it shipped out. sound good?\r\n\r\nlata\r\nC-Dub'),(20085,'260dc3ab8f','I\'ll get it out tomorrow Morning!'),(20086,'43af2ad0c0','Hi JAC -\r\n\r\nGot your $30.00 today in the mail.\r\nI\'m sending DarkTari a PM right after this one letting him to know to go ahead and ship out your car.\r\nI\'ll tell him to send you a PM as well when he gets it sent out.\r\n\r\nThanks for the support pimp!\r\n\r\n~ CaboWabo'),(20087,'217b88b82a','Thanks!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20088,'260dc3ab8f','I\'ll get it out tomorrow Morning!'),(20089,'217b88b82a','Thanks!'),(21083,'35b173929f','thanks alot DT for the contest! I have not been able to log on to BP for two days, there must have been server problems. \r\n\r\nagain thanks for this sweet web sight!\r\n\r\nJeffrey Shane Mays\r\n532 Wilkinson\r\nShreveport, La. 71104'),(20091,'0a023fbe6b','I\'m guessing it does?\r\n[quote:0a023fbe6b=\"JAC4412\"]Does the $30 include S and H? Sorry about nopt replying I have been on Vaca. The Money will be shipped out hopefully by tomorrow. Cheers.\r\n\r\nJAC4412[/quote:0a023fbe6b]'),(20092,'69ccb9695b','YUP!\r\n\r\nI\'ll need to get his address. I\'ll PM him!'),(31251,'5e9c1bcec1','Cool! Thanks for letting me know you received it. Enjoy and if you need more, let me know.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nJDM'),(37771,'890a5b67a1','Yeah man, here are the ones i can find off hand:\r\n[img:890a5b67a1]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10078/IMG_0068.jpg[/img:890a5b67a1]\r\n[img:890a5b67a1]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10078/IMG_0069.jpg[/img:890a5b67a1]\r\n[img:890a5b67a1]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10078/IMG_0070.jpg[/img:890a5b67a1]\r\n[img:890a5b67a1]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10078/IMG_0074%257E0.jpg[/img:890a5b67a1]\r\n[img:890a5b67a1]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10078/IMG_0075.jpg[/img:890a5b67a1]\r\n\r\nIf you could id like to see a good shot from the front (lower so i can see the knuckles) and any other shots you think may help me out.\r\n\r\nAs far as the project, im not exactly sure what its goign to be yet but ill be using something like this setup\r\n\r\n\r\nTHanks man'),(20094,'c63b0eb9bf','Thanx for lookin out for yo boy!  \r\nI\'ve contacted him so he\'ll correct his mistake. \r\nIt\'s not a legal bid unless he posts it himself in the correct forum.\r\nNo rush though, this will be on Da Block all week so he\'ll have time. \r\n\r\nYou Not interrested ?????');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (22838,'5e26ac66f6','1ST OFF, DON\'T SEND ME A [b:5e26ac66f6]PM[/b:5e26ac66f6] MAKING A BID ON A CAR.  IF YOU\r\nWANT TO BID THERE IS A PLACE FOR THAT WHICH IS CLEARLY STATED.\r\n\r\n2ND, KEEP UP !  THIS SOLD BACK ON [b:5e26ac66f6]26-JUN-04[/b:5e26ac66f6]\r\n[quote:5e26ac66f6][b:5e26ac66f6]SOLD ! [/b:5e26ac66f6]  For [b:5e26ac66f6][color=red:5e26ac66f6]$27.00 [/color:5e26ac66f6][/b:5e26ac66f6]to da New [b:5e26ac66f6]Jack[/b:5e26ac66f6] Pimp in da 3rd row !\r\n\r\n[b:5e26ac66f6]Da Bus is of Da Block...[/b:5e26ac66f6]\r\n[img:5e26ac66f6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/thumb_pimpbus1.jpg[/img:5e26ac66f6][img:5e26ac66f6]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/thumb_pimpbus2.jpg[/img:5e26ac66f6][/quote:5e26ac66f6]\r\n\r\n3RD, POST YOUR BID HERE !!  http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3982&amp;start=90'),(20142,'e3199299d3','[quote:e3199299d3=\"Da Big Kahuna\"]Hey Cabo,\r\n\r\nI haven\'t heard from JAC4412 to get his address.  Do you have it ?[/quote:e3199299d3]he never gave it to me, but I do have an address from the envelope he sent with his $.\r\nwe should maybe just confirm the address with him still though just to be safe.\r\nlet me know if you want the address from the envelope.\r\nI can\'t get it tonight, it\'s locked up in the same room my wife is sleeping in lol'),(20143,'c902500778','Cool!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20296,'95925c737e','Allright, I got almost got everything for you.  I still have to track down a Stage 2 motor set.  I got everything else.  \r\n\r\nSometime next week I\'ll get the shipping cost when I get everything together and in one box.'),(20148,'6bf957ebc8','[quote:6bf957ebc8=\"Jackd\"]No problem.  Movin\' is always a hassle.  I went ahead and paypal\'d the cash....just send it when you get settled in and whatnot.[/quote:6bf957ebc8]Cool man, thanks for the prompt payment. I\'ll get that out by this weekend.\r\n\r\n...and thanks again for your support.  :cool: \r\n\r\nDave'),(20149,'d179f65aa7','No problem,  I really respect what you cats are doin\' with the bit pimps site.  Anything I can do to help out. let me know.'),(23171,'e3fb5c1693','Hey C-Dub, \r\nWhat\'s up wit Silla?  Think he\'s mad at me?\r\nGotta tellya sumthin in private Pimp.  I know he\'s givin me da silent treatment.  After I saw what was done to the Auction Post, I had no problem with him editing the gallery, I actually wanted to do the same thing as I explained in my response.  But when it came to the bidding post, as I also explained I had a format that I was sticking to cause it worked, so I deleted the pics AGAIN after he put them back in.\r\n\r\nI PM\'d him explaining why I did what I did and to get me some particulars on the ride so I can pump-it-up as much as possible but he didn\'t/won\'t respond to that or to the last post. So I did what I could and will continue to do so.  I could only pump it up as much as I could see, it would\'ve been Pimp to include any unseen mods (chassis, motor, etc).\r\nNow is it just me or is he going along the way of quikbb ?  He and I had a lil disagreement about a contest and he (as you put it ) took his ball and went home.  I can\'t understand why a lil disagreement results in such bitch\'n behavior man? Damn !  I mean he edited the post first without so much as a PM letting me know he did, I didn\'t get upset, I just changed only one of them back, and he gets a tude.  I responded as diplomatically as possible, afterall we are the IC, we should be able to work thru shit like this and not hold grudges.  We\'re all adults here!  Hell when Dave answered a question someone posted about future rides to go on the block, I edited it and inform\'d Dave that we should leave it a secret until it hits the block. That way they\'ll tune in at least every week to see what we have as opposed to only tuning in when they know of a ride that they want to bid on (not giving them a choice) and Dave had no problem, but the main thing is I informed him of what I did.\r\n\r\nIf Silla has issues with me, fuck it! He\'ll get over it.  I ain\'t kiss\'n his ass that\'s for sure! But I\'m not hold\'n any grudges either, I got enough shit goin on in my life right now to loose any sleep over dis shit.\r\n\r\nJust wanted to see what you thought.  Oh Great GaZoo ! LOL   :eek:'),(20151,'6a29188281','Alabama');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20152,'04eea28675','Jac,\r\n\r\nPlease correct and post your bids HERE !!! \r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3982\r\n\r\nIt is not valid unless it\'s bidded in the proper forum.\r\n\r\nThanx!'),(22880,'9eebcadf93','C-Dub,\r\n\r\nYou hit dude for payment?  I got his shit all wrapped and ready to go!'),(23258,'c4a86c1805','Time will tell !\r\n\r\nAs I said he never sent any specs on the ride or never put in any himself.\r\n\r\nKay Serah Serah !'),(20155,'3d22724165','Whoops, sorry man.. I haven\'t been home lately.\r\nMy addy-\r\n\r\nJacques LeBlanc\r\n295 Linehouse Road\r\nNorth Grosvenordale, CT 06255\r\n\r\nSorry for any problems...'),(20156,'98abea6933','[quote:98abea6933=\"hogjowlz\"]what the hell is wgu?[/quote:98abea6933]\r\n\r\nWGU may be We Got u at [url]http://www.wegotu.com[/url].  WGU was created by ex MRCC members.'),(35406,'2e989f26f4','To add 1 each diff to your order it would be $30.00 until we get 10 or more per diff.  So far I have 5 of each.\r\n\r\nJust add that to the previous PM'),(36690,'a45b1d00c5','Thanx man.  I apreciate it.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36692,'cd9ba57247','[quote:cd9ba57247=\"stampede_dude\"]The part you need for the rear body clip, if you would do that. I have an almost complete evo chassis and im pretty sure i would have what you need to fix the front if you know what it is, let me know. Thanks![/quote:cd9ba57247]\r\nHaven\'t had time to open it up yet!  I\'ll letcha know when I know....'),(35408,'63391a4b77','I read pretty much the same things. I am hoping to get an MR-02 soon, as for Xmods i think i will pick one up just for the fun of it. We be building a track so it would be cool to have a diverse set of cars running around.\r\n\r\nThanks.'),(20159,'e34bac7c2a','did you send a PM to JackD letting him know he won the bid for crazydave\'s bus? and tell him where to send the loot?\r\nif not or if you want me to, let me know and I\'ll shoot him a PM.\r\n\r\nif I don\'t hear back from you, I\'ll assume you\'ve contacted him, etc., etc.'),(20160,'5df72a364d','[quote:5df72a364d]~sorry for language CW[/quote:5df72a364d]\r\n\r\nomg....dude, this is bit PIMPS, FYI, we\'re allowed to curse as much as we fuckin want!!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20161,'72bbf5ac9c','i know dude, its just i dont do it often...\r\nso i thought it was proper\r\nBITCH'),(20860,'e94cde4b75','[quote:e94cde4b75=\"CaboWabo\"]as long as starsky and hutch get fet\'ed I don\'t care lol[/quote:e94cde4b75]Seriously, before the auction came up or anything, your SE was first on the FETing list, so there is still set of FETs reserved for you, actually 2, cause I\'m gonna stack your FETs\r\n\r\n[quote:e94cde4b75]no, really...\r\nyou send me whatever, whenever the auctions are over - if you have to take out expenses, do so - no worries.[/quote:e94cde4b75]Well I can sell 3 FET mods right off the bat. So this money will come right back, I just didn\'t have the cash to invest in the first place.\r\n\r\n[quote:e94cde4b75]haven\'t checked yet, but did ya vote yet for the contest winners?\r\nI kinda felt like DT was trying to say he stuck to the \"summer bling\" theme and that\'s why his choices were so different from mine.\r\nI thought I did stick to the \"summer bling\" theme and even mentioned it by picking the mods that enduced the most \"summer-time\" feel (e.g. sg\'s boat)\r\nyea sg\'s boat isn\'t prestine, but its more modding than most enteries, it\'s modding a new vehicle (boat) and as far as I know, boat says summer bling more than a car.\r\nbut whatever, I\'m probably reading way too much in to like always.\r\nI\'ll go sit in my corner lol[/quote:e94cde4b75]D\'oh! Holy F\'in shit, I completely forgot about judging the contest. Sonnafabitch, this was a tricky one too.\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna go in and vote without looking what you guys have voted, but I will say this, boats do nothing for me, they just don\'t. I will be keeping the theme of the contest in strong consideration, but Hue\'s car is easily his swan song. He easily has the best eyes on the bPs, and just deserves recognition as \"the best\". It\'s convertable, so it\'s fits the theme close enough for me. So his \'maro\' will be getting my #1 vote without further consideration.'),(20203,'747f8a723e','How mcuh you want for one of the sets of bodies?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20204,'d6a4c3201a','$3 plus shipping for the body set'),(23699,'0434bdbcea','Stoli,\r\n\r\nAppreciate the lookout but in all honesty, all is good. You\'re the one that\r\nis incorrect here!\r\n\r\n1st - you posted your opinion in the Bidding section\r\n2nd - the last bid was $53.00, he bid\'d $5.00 up so he met the $3.00  \r\n        minimum +.\r\n\r\nHe and I had words a few weeks ago about him bidding on the VW van\r\nthat went off da block 2 months earlier and he posted his bid in the Gallery.\r\nWe had some serious words goin on cause he took offense to the way\r\nI straightened him up.  All in all he was told to respect and we are cool.\r\nSo he straightened up his act and is on point now!\r\n\r\nWelcome back to post\'n again, you been at recess long enough LOL   :lol: \r\n\r\nPeace !'),(23476,'06155d302c','All Fixed, Auight,  Contact SG219'),(20207,'54cfb304fb','Thanks for the follow up playa,   I really respect what y\'all are doin with da site.............jd'),(20208,'54cfb304fb','Thanks for the follow up playa,   I really respect what y\'all are doin with da site.............jd');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20209,'9a5638f2c5','[quote:9a5638f2c5=\"Da Big Kahuna\"]I contacted him to let him know that he will be contacted by you with payment information.\r\n\r\n???????? :???:[/quote:9a5638f2c5]I guess crazydave already received the payment via paypal and is shipping etc.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?p=48334#48334'),(20210,'15e0cad5a9','Yeah I Know, last night I read my PM then the mods forum and saw that.\r\nThen I read the forum on another subject, then my PM and the same issue.\r\n\r\nI just went to bed after that............!\r\n\r\nI got JAC4412 prize in the mail this morning with 2 da Priority delivery confirmation. $4.80, not bad at all.  So he should get his ride by Friday.'),(23705,'9bf7005925','Auight C-Dub\r\n\r\nThis is the last one!  Contact BitHigh707 for Payment!\r\nThanx God this is done!  I wanna get my [b:9bf7005925]BitPimp My Ride [/b:9bf7005925]thing going soon.\r\n\r\nI\'ll introduce it to the new members of the IC later on.\r\n\r\nWhat a success ! :eek:'),(23706,'171cf8452b','[quote:171cf8452b=\"Da Big Kahuna\"]Auight C-Dub\r\n\r\nThis is the last one!  Contact BitHigh707 for Payment!\r\nThanx God this is done!  I wanna get my [b:171cf8452b]BitPimp My Ride [/b:171cf8452b]thing going soon.\r\n\r\nI\'ll introduce it to the new members of the IC later on.\r\n\r\nWhat a success ! :eek:[/quote:171cf8452b]cool, I\'ll contact him.\r\nyea no shit - this really went pretty well.\r\nit was good to see some of the rides going for such a high dollar, as they should.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (23725,'a2ed7148d1','hey man\r\n\r\nany news if the car has been shipped?\r\n\r\ncrazydave is not responding?\r\n\r\ncheers'),(23726,'8378f5afdc','sorry dude i was out of town all week. ill box her up tonight and take her to the post office tomorrow. \r\n\r\ncar + 27mhz tx and charger\r\n\r\nsorry about the delay.'),(20213,'d6a4c3201a','$3 plus shipping for the body set'),(20214,'10b17809f2','[quote:10b17809f2]Haha SG Just busting your horns. Everyone else does figured I join in.[/quote:10b17809f2]\r\n\r\nhehe...\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW, noticed you live in Queens....That\'s not too far from my location...only about an hour\'s drive from Cortlandt Manor, Westchester....'),(20215,'10b17809f2','[quote:10b17809f2]Haha SG Just busting your horns. Everyone else does figured I join in.[/quote:10b17809f2]\r\n\r\nhehe...\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW, noticed you live in Queens....That\'s not too far from my location...only about an hour\'s drive from Cortlandt Manor, Westchester....'),(20216,'9f0219b25c','i used to have an ex in mahopac.  i used to roam around Cortlandt Manor all the time');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20217,'570d80b492','stop fucking with my posts.'),(20218,'9f0219b25c','i used to have an ex in mahopac.  i used to roam around Cortlandt Manor all the time'),(20221,'f98d99a711','Oh he\'ll be REAL happy with it. I wish you guys could\'ve seen it in person, it is PIMPIN...........4REAL!  and fast!'),(35458,'f22cddca87','[quote:f22cddca87=\"arfin\"]Hey MG, i\'m downloadin\' the demo right now, so when i get back from work it sould be done, and we can play! Take care, i\'ll be on later.[/quote:f22cddca87]\r\n\r\nHey dude! I\'ve been gone for a while, so just got your PM now.\r\nWhat\'s new?\r\nDoes the Battlefield 2 work for ya?\r\nLemme know.\r\n\r\nDAve'),(35459,'46a5d8ff51','No man it doesn\'t!  :o  I meet all requirements EXCEPT my Graphic Card isn\'t compatible with the game! Sucks so hard, you made it sound so good, now Im jealous! Anyways, how you been bro?'),(23727,'71bcf70377','You will be contacted if you haven\'t been already!\r\n\r\nChill  :cool:'),(20226,'38fa51e2de','So yeah, I need to know.  Been very interested in my favorite modders that have yet to submit stuff for the Summer comp.  Are you still into bits?  And if so are you working on an entry (i.e. VW Thing)  C\'mon you gotta let me in, my lips are sealed :grin: \r\n\r\nAlso out of curiosity, did you get around to mailing me those bodies?  Like I said in the letter if you didn\'t no biggie, but if you did cool city.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31167,'35ebe54c39','Hi Aaron\r\n\r\n   I sent you the package today, the lady at the mail center said you should get it tomorrow.\r\n   I sent you two of the vw single cabs, they are OK castings, now its not a professional work of art but the best i could do!\r\n\r\nP.S. i also sent you one of my citroen bodies, its the brown ralley car in my gallery, that was my first attempt at casting.\r\n\r\nlet us see picts when you are thru with them.\r\n\r\nthx\r\n jeff mays'),(31168,'1cb1d7fd9c','[quote:1cb1d7fd9c=\"jmays\"]Hi Aaron\r\n\r\n   I sent you the package today, the lady at the mail center said you should get it tomorrow.\r\n   I sent you two of the vw single cabs, they are OK castings, now its not a professional work of art but the best i could do!\r\n\r\nP.S. i also sent you one of my citroen bodies, its the brown ralley car in my gallery, that was my first attempt at casting.\r\n\r\nlet us see picts when you are thru with them.\r\n\r\nthx\r\n jeff mays[/quote:1cb1d7fd9c]\r\n\r\nSWEEEEETT! Man thats just too cool do I need to send you more money for the extras? I can paypal you with more if needed!\r\n\r\nI cant wait to get the cars in I am looking forward to painting and customizing them!\r\nI will definatly post pictures!! I am trying to finish my Custom Ferrari but its taking longer to do but once I am done with that the VW is next!\r\n\r\nthanks agian! let me know if you need more cash!\r\nAaron\r\nSteelwoolghandi'),(20856,'19f0cc424d','Sorry about dat Dave, I thought about it after I had gone to bed......\r\n\r\n[b:19f0cc424d]GH Sims\r\n7815 Quill Point Drive\r\nBowie, Md. 20720[/b:19f0cc424d]\r\n\r\nAnd can you also include some flame stencils?  Never got any from your last offer.\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp !\r\n\r\nYeah Dude was moving to Virginia, just got a couple of PM\'s from him....');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20231,'832c12de57','Well what do you have?  I figured the VW and the Cit, but hell a Scion... MUHAHAHA!!!!  \r\n\r\nOh by the way, you didn\'t come on strong with the step by step, that kicked ass.  It was the expectation of instant recognition and the way it was put.  Trust me, your a mature guy and I understand why you said what you said (hell I almost said simular things about my work) I know it\'s all water under the bridge now.  So trust me, right now this site is in dire need to get off of the whole flame shit and get back to basics.  Bit Pimps is known world wide for our crazy mods, and other than DTs and CDs Auction bits, we havn\'t thrown out anything for 2 weeks.  \r\n\r\nAny how, throw me some JPGs if you don\'t want to post em public, I am hella interested.  Actually Check out my gallery and you will see one of my current projects.  It\'s actually lightly inspired by you, as in I constructed more than 50% by scratch.\r\n\r\nYeah so about the bodies, whatever you want do it bro, it\'s all good.  Personally I would be as honored to have one of your bodies as I would to have a C-Dub or Hugh rides.  It really is amazing what you do with plastic and putty.'),(23802,'75806a5ac0','i have 3 of them. i just use it for the extra knuckles and the differential.\r\n\r\nget a nelly dude!!!!!!! i just ran a 3.3 quarter mile on dying batteries. its ill as all hell dude.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24023,'a709c89e26','oh damn \r\n\r\n  Man I think I need to go through my stuff and add some more shit in there for you :)'),(27591,'f2a4ed3d4e','&lt;Tapping fingers on desk&gt;\r\n\r\nStill Waiting.  :?  :(  8)'),(27706,'cabed9546c','Yo-\r\nIt got here and damn, the car is cooler than I thought.  The freaking hood comes off like the initial D kit!  Pretty cool, but I still debate whether the bit was worth 25$.  Oh, well.  I need to work for an hour and a half to pay off the debt.  But shit, that ride is fucking awesome in any case.  Now I need to wait for my gloria to arrive...\r\n\r\nLate,\r\nAbe'),(28374,'68b0aad907','Ok,\r\n\r\nI sent it express cuz my aunt is soon coming to Barbados but I don\'t know when so I wanted the stuff there asap.\r\n\r\nI\'ll send the 2nd MO when i my aunt tells me she got the stuff. By that time I will also be able to send the 2nd MO by express. But I want the GPM parts.\r\n\r\nAre they all the same color?\r\nMaxx'),(33145,'d18eb16263','I have abused my truck with no problems I wouldn\'t recommend jumping off a high table or hitting a brick wall.  You need to make sure that your solder joints are solid or they will fail.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28329,'db41b9d8de','Alright I\'ll try to post them in my gallery or something, unless you want me to send it to your email address or something.\r\nJDM-R34 :cool:'),(28330,'11f1767e56','I am working on a cool truck body for the microsizers/clones and one for the ZZMT. It\'s a long process to make them, but I am working on it. What rims/ body were you looking at that you liked?'),(33141,'32b65e657c','everything is cool here, we live farther upstate in louisiana and we did not get any bad weather from katrina. thanks for asking. while i am here i am going to check out the forums and see whats been happening. maybe i will see a picture of one of my bodies in here...lol\r\n\r\njmays'),(33142,'7a433de844','I just saw your beautiful FD, and I was wondering where you got the rims for it from?  They would look awesome on my ZZSE Shelby!'),(20235,'9b0c3652b9','Check it out now, just uploaded another pic that gives a better idea.  Oh and Hugh only Re-Did his gallery for orgonizational reasons.  But yeah he has done a shitload of Cameros.'),(20291,'f68bcb29b2','Thanks bro.  I am lovin it thus far.  Your comment on the Cabrio inspired me to from now on always put progress pics up in my gallery for those that actually give a shit about the process and not just the bling.  If it turns out hot, then I\'ll post in Custom jobs.  Either way keep an eye out for what I am up to in the gallery.  Hope that baby will be done by the 17th.  It will be hot.  Thanks again for the recognition.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20292,'2d684933f3','ahh thanks very much dave, that was very helpful, i was deciding wether to pick one up or not, and your right, fets would make that thing FLY!! may have to send mine once i get it to ph2t for a biff!'),(25876,'c04bed83f6','[quote:c04bed83f6=\"micro_man\"]got the parts , and cool extra body friday . id have replyed sooner but i\'ve been very busy .thanks , it made my day to get those so i could get my camaro runing agin . that body is a nics bouns , it will be put to good use . thanks agin . have a good one , later .[/quote:c04bed83f6]\r\n\r\nYou\'re welcome. :cool: \r\n\r\nHave fun......... :-)'),(20237,'729f43bd95','Stay Tuned Pimp  :cool:'),(31171,'ceef097a86','dont sweat the extra cash! \r\ni am just proud that someone would want one of my cars.\r\n\r\nsee ya on bitpimps\r\njmays'),(20239,'c269503f73','Hey, I did 2 of your cars tonight. The Sport gave me a bitch, but I got \'er done. The booster car that doesn\'t have springs, it has a blue endbell motor in it, what is that? A 4.2 Pro? That thing screams.\r\n\r\nWhen I tested before the mod, I thought it seemed like the car was already FET\'ed. Then after I put Fets in it, that thing got sick.\r\n\r\nOne time when me and ph2t were having a discussion about stacked fets, and he was saying he judged power by holding the car by the back wheels, and letting it try to pull itself up. That\'s the test I\'ve been going by. A stock car will barely nudge it. A FETed car will pull it about a quarter the way, and a car with tri-stacked FEts will almost pull it over. Your car with that motor, spun all the way around, not once, but as long as you wanted, and fast too. No BS man, that is [i:c269503f73]the fastest[/i:c269503f73] motor I\'ve seen yet.\r\n\r\nSo what the hell is it?!\r\n\r\n :lol: Dave'),(20240,'4f92359c0b','[quote:4f92359c0b]Hey, I did 2 of your cars tonight. The Sport gave me a bitch, but I got \'er done. The booster car that doesn\'t have springs, it has a blue endbell motor in it, what is that? A 4.2 Pro? That thing screams. \r\n\r\nWhen I tested before the mod, I thought it seemed like the car was already FET\'ed. Then after I put Fets in it, that thing got sick. \r\n\r\nOne time when me and ph2t were having a discussion about stacked fets, and he was saying he judged power by holding the car by the back wheels, and letting it try to pull itself up. That\'s the test I\'ve been going by. A stock car will barely nudge it. A FETed car will pull it about a quarter the way, and a car with tri-stacked FEts will almost pull it over. Your car with that motor, spun all the way around, not once, but as long as you wanted, and fast too. No BS man, that is the fastest motor I\'ve seen yet. \r\n\r\nSo what the hell is it?! [/quote:4f92359c0b]\r\n\r\nThat it is!  A 4.2 Pro.  When those first came out I put one in each of my Booster cars unless it didn\'t perform well.\r\nThanx for everything Pimp !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20244,'4f92359c0b','[quote:4f92359c0b]Hey, I did 2 of your cars tonight. The Sport gave me a bitch, but I got \'er done. The booster car that doesn\'t have springs, it has a blue endbell motor in it, what is that? A 4.2 Pro? That thing screams. \r\n\r\nWhen I tested before the mod, I thought it seemed like the car was already FET\'ed. Then after I put Fets in it, that thing got sick. \r\n\r\nOne time when me and ph2t were having a discussion about stacked fets, and he was saying he judged power by holding the car by the back wheels, and letting it try to pull itself up. That\'s the test I\'ve been going by. A stock car will barely nudge it. A FETed car will pull it about a quarter the way, and a car with tri-stacked FEts will almost pull it over. Your car with that motor, spun all the way around, not once, but as long as you wanted, and fast too. No BS man, that is the fastest motor I\'ve seen yet. \r\n\r\nSo what the hell is it?! [/quote:4f92359c0b]\r\n\r\nThat it is!  A 4.2 Pro.  When those first came out I put one in each of my Booster cars unless it didn\'t perform well.\r\nThanx for everything Pimp !'),(28409,'bbf4dc422e','THE BODY COLORS ARE BLUE AND ORANGE, BAD COLOR ON PICTURE.  THE RIMS ARE OFF A HOT WHEEL.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28410,'bbf4dc422e','THE BODY COLORS ARE BLUE AND ORANGE, BAD COLOR ON PICTURE.  THE RIMS ARE OFF A HOT WHEEL.'),(28411,'fc37b9d8a3','Oh sorry my bad man, are those tires off a hotwheels car aswell?\r\nSo will this blue/orange body be on a panther or rally racer?\r\nJust so You know before You get these MT parts that I am missing a nut and washer thingy for one wheel and they are painted goldish-bronze color (the nuts) and I have some wires attached to the chassis but am missing some, I still have most of the parts and will throw in a spare tomy batt, and a few motors for the lack of other parts, maybe You can use those towards a bit.\r\nThanks\r\nwe can talk later tonight about when we want to mail out and address\' and that stuff later.\r\nHave a good day.\r\nThanks'),(29408,'390d6289af','Alright, it\'s all packed up and ready for shipping, so you\'ll have a body heading your way soon...Thanks dude!\r\nNight'),(28413,'a60db89a31','I will email you tonight okay');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20246,'b0953c94c1',':eek: you are an absolute idiot.  please think before you post.  otherwise people will continue to call you an idiot.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  :stfu:'),(20247,'7ac0933125','I believe that you need to shut the fuck up you fucking retard.'),(20248,'85e6e45572','[quote:85e6e45572=\"DarkTari\"]\r\nThat it is!  A 4.2 Pro.  When those first came out I put one in each of my Booster cars unless it didn\'t perform well.\r\nThanx for everything Pimp ![/quote:85e6e45572]Wow! You got really lucky, I have 3 4.2 Pros, and they\'re really fast and torquey, but nothing like that one. Actually I have one still in the package, I\'m getting kinda curious about that one now. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(20249,'f0a2ee6de3','It is hit or miss with these sometimes.  I always burn in my motors.   I\'ll send you a KIT charger &amp; chassis when you get settled.'),(23259,'82b77b5ae4','C-Dub\r\n\r\nConact Finks And get his payment info then contact Silla when payment\r\nis completed.  Da usual ! 8-)'),(20837,'6b3eca323e','I was thinking today.  Since it seems Kwibb is eternally MIA maybe it was time to replace him as a mod.  Now I am definatly saying I don\'t want to be a mod, I like slummin it too much, but SG, Bird, Betty, ph2t, Hugh and Supperfly come to mind as worth while replacements.  Maybe to spice it up have em mod for the position.  Hell you could open it up to everyone but of course be a little bias twards those pimps :cool:   Well anyhow just an idea.  Not like we really need more mods but whatever.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20252,'f40b5edd30','finks that cabrio is the shit man , i am really diggin it, i would love to have one for my vw collection, i think that i will take a thunder charger body and try and memick your car!\r\n\r\n\\great job, really awsome work on that...\r\n\r\njmays'),(20254,'6c0522521a','Yeah I know you would love that beast.  Like I said in Custom Jobs the TC bodies cut like butter, it\'s so easy to mod.  I did have to shorten the chassis by like 4-5mm and also do some inside tab adjustments FYI.  Finally and this is big IMO but the front end was set off big time by the luck I had in owning that Muscle Machines BMW and poping the front end out and shaving it down.  Hit KB Wally World or TrU and find one, trust me, well worth the $2 to make this body naughty.  Little secret but due to the ZZ wheels it does hit the chassis when I take hard turns.  GL on that bro, how does the saying go, imitation is the ultimate form of flattery.'),(20255,'f0a2ee6de3','It is hit or miss with these sometimes.  I always burn in my motors.   I\'ll send you a KIT charger &amp; chassis when you get settled.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20285,'f8f8c28b1b','[quote:f8f8c28b1b=\"synj\"]o well do you need an extra mod? :???:[/quote:f8f8c28b1b]as in moderator for the site?\r\nno we\'re pretty stacked for now.'),(20286,'6b23896539','hmm.. ok tell me when you need an extra one becasue i have tons of itme on my hands now and am willing to help fully!'),(20287,'6b23896539','hmm.. ok tell me when you need an extra one becasue i have tons of itme on my hands now and am willing to help fully!'),(20257,'1d934a002d','#1: What kind of shipping method would you recommend? I think I\'ll give ordering parts from Digikey a second chance....I don\'t think I\'ll try UPS ground...:roll:\r\n\r\n#2: Do you know if a RadioShack 1:43 Corvette can be FET modded?\r\n\r\n#3: Still thinking of a question...lol  :-)'),(20258,'1d934a002d','#1: What kind of shipping method would you recommend? I think I\'ll give ordering parts from Digikey a second chance....I don\'t think I\'ll try UPS ground...:roll:\r\n\r\n#2: Do you know if a RadioShack 1:43 Corvette can be FET modded?\r\n\r\n#3: Still thinking of a question...lol  :-)'),(20259,'9c138ae2d8','[quote:9c138ae2d8=\"Son_Gokou\"]#1: What kind of shipping method would you recommend? I think I\'ll give ordering parts from Digikey a second chance....I don\'t think I\'ll try UPS ground...:roll:\r\n\r\n#2: Do you know if a RadioShack 1:43 Corvette can be FET modded?\r\n\r\n#3: Still thinking of a question...lol  :-)[/quote:9c138ae2d8]#1 Even if you ordered UPS, you should have got your package. If you paid for something and did not get it it, you need to follow up on it.\r\n\r\nI do not like UPS for small items, it cost too much for thesame service, that\'s why I always go for the cheapest shipping.\r\n\r\n#2 FET. Short for MOSFET. Field Emitting Transistor. If has transistors in it, there more than likely are better, more expensive ones out there. As to what type of transistors are in the Vette, I have no idea, I play with bits.\r\n\r\n#3 Don\'t sit there wracking your brain trying to think of silly questions to ask. It\'s annoying. \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20260,'9c138ae2d8','[quote:9c138ae2d8=\"Son_Gokou\"]#1: What kind of shipping method would you recommend? I think I\'ll give ordering parts from Digikey a second chance....I don\'t think I\'ll try UPS ground...:roll:\r\n\r\n#2: Do you know if a RadioShack 1:43 Corvette can be FET modded?\r\n\r\n#3: Still thinking of a question...lol  :-)[/quote:9c138ae2d8]#1 Even if you ordered UPS, you should have got your package. If you paid for something and did not get it it, you need to follow up on it.\r\n\r\nI do not like UPS for small items, it cost too much for thesame service, that\'s why I always go for the cheapest shipping.\r\n\r\n#2 FET. Short for MOSFET. Field Emitting Transistor. If has transistors in it, there more than likely are better, more expensive ones out there. As to what type of transistors are in the Vette, I have no idea, I play with bits.\r\n\r\n#3 Don\'t sit there wracking your brain trying to think of silly questions to ask. It\'s annoying. \r\n\r\nDave'),(20262,'788b90a8fc','hey I was just wondering...\r\nhow were you planning to do the flames on my fade?\r\nlike is my fade going to be the color of the flames and then you\'ll paint some other color on the car for the background / base color?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20263,'529760416f','[quote:529760416f=\"DarkTari\"]It is hit or miss with these sometimes.  I always burn in my motors.   I\'ll send you a KIT charger &amp; chassis when you get settled.[/quote:529760416f]Cool. Superfly sent me one, but it was missing the idler. I\'m still dying to try KIt racer gears with FETs. I bet with that 4.2 you got, that\'d outrun any dual cell. 8-) \r\n\r\n\r\nHey, I just have to look at my door to get my address now, so here it is. :lol: \r\n\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n7002 W Indian School Rd. #1131\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nDave'),(20264,'788b90a8fc','hey I was just wondering...\r\nhow were you planning to do the flames on my fade?\r\nlike is my fade going to be the color of the flames and then you\'ll paint some other color on the car for the background / base color?'),(20266,'5b0c056d66','[quote:5b0c056d66=\"CaboWabo\"]hey I was just wondering...\r\nhow were you planning to do the flames on my fade?\r\nlike is my fade going to be the color of the flames and then you\'ll paint some other color on the car for the background / base color?[/quote:5b0c056d66]Yep, you got it. The fade will be flames. I\'ll go over the rest in some dark color, black if I have to.\r\n\r\n\r\nHey while I\'m thinking of it, the new address is:\r\n7002 W Indian School Rd. #1131\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nDave'),(20267,'4974961ef7','cool man, I was hoping you\'d say that. lol\r\n\r\ncuz the spray got a tad thick on the rear drivers side  :-( \r\n\r\nyour cover-up should hide that little ugly spot.\r\nI\'ve almost got the car done and about half way through with the controller.\r\nI\'m gonna be sending you a few decals to toss up on the controller or something.\r\n\r\nI\'m also gonna send ya some tires, I kinda remember you asking for some or something, a body or two (for shits and grins), probably a few homies (maybe palermos), and I don\'t know what else lol\r\n\r\nif I send down an extra battery and some wire with this car, you could dual cell it?\r\n\r\ndid DT get you the precious clones? the light grey chassis ones?\r\nits like it\'s a tad wider or something, I gotta modify to be able to put on a new rear axle with gear... that happen to you?\r\nanyways, I\'m gonna try to get it finished up this long weekend hopefully.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20268,'a71947c79f','you got msn?'),(20269,'a71947c79f','you got msn?'),(20270,'99dada7afd','[quote:99dada7afd=\"synj\"]you got msn?[/quote:99dada7afd]nope, sure don\'t.'),(20271,'4974961ef7','cool man, I was hoping you\'d say that. lol\r\n\r\ncuz the spray got a tad thick on the rear drivers side  :-( \r\n\r\nyour cover-up should hide that little ugly spot.\r\nI\'ve almost got the car done and about half way through with the controller.\r\nI\'m gonna be sending you a few decals to toss up on the controller or something.\r\n\r\nI\'m also gonna send ya some tires, I kinda remember you asking for some or something, a body or two (for shits and grins), probably a few homies (maybe palermos), and I don\'t know what else lol\r\n\r\nif I send down an extra battery and some wire with this car, you could dual cell it?\r\n\r\ndid DT get you the precious clones? the light grey chassis ones?\r\nits like it\'s a tad wider or something, I gotta modify to be able to put on a new rear axle with gear... that happen to you?\r\nanyways, I\'m gonna try to get it finished up this long weekend hopefully.'),(20272,'47ce93a5cf','That\'s cool, I\'ll work with the paint job. I hope this works out, kinda crazy and risky doing a cross country paint job like this, but it\'ll be cool when it\'s done.\r\n\r\nSome tires and decals would be cool. The decals nox sent me are all sloppy, there\'s only a couple usable ones in there, and I can dual cell the car no prob.\r\n\r\nWeren\'t you gonna be sending me a SE to FET? I\'ve got a set of FETs reserved for you, and it\'s getting harder and harder to save them every day. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20273,'d906356cf5','I see you have the Nikkio off road micro, i was wondering, how good is it?'),(20274,'47ce93a5cf','That\'s cool, I\'ll work with the paint job. I hope this works out, kinda crazy and risky doing a cross country paint job like this, but it\'ll be cool when it\'s done.\r\n\r\nSome tires and decals would be cool. The decals nox sent me are all sloppy, there\'s only a couple usable ones in there, and I can dual cell the car no prob.\r\n\r\nWeren\'t you gonna be sending me a SE to FET? I\'ve got a set of FETs reserved for you, and it\'s getting harder and harder to save them every day. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(20275,'4f7cae5b69','[quote:4f7cae5b69=\"crazydave\"]That\'s cool, I\'ll work with the paint job. I hope this works out, kinda crazy and risky doing a cross country paint job like this, but it\'ll be cool when it\'s done.\r\n\r\nSome tires and decals would be cool. The decals nox sent me are all sloppy, there\'s only a couple usable ones in there, and I can dual cell the car no prob.\r\n\r\nWeren\'t you gonna be sending me a SE to FET? I\'ve got a set of FETs reserved for you, and it\'s getting harder and harder to save them every day. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:4f7cae5b69]yea it is risky, but I think it\'ll work out - it\'ll be cool, I\'m already thinking about others. lol\r\n\r\noh yea, I kinda forgot you told me you had some fets set aside for it, I\'ll send it down with the rest of the stuff.\r\nthis ones gonna have all sorts of goodies in the package lol'),(20276,'4f7cae5b69','[quote:4f7cae5b69=\"crazydave\"]That\'s cool, I\'ll work with the paint job. I hope this works out, kinda crazy and risky doing a cross country paint job like this, but it\'ll be cool when it\'s done.\r\n\r\nSome tires and decals would be cool. The decals nox sent me are all sloppy, there\'s only a couple usable ones in there, and I can dual cell the car no prob.\r\n\r\nWeren\'t you gonna be sending me a SE to FET? I\'ve got a set of FETs reserved for you, and it\'s getting harder and harder to save them every day. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave[/quote:4f7cae5b69]yea it is risky, but I think it\'ll work out - it\'ll be cool, I\'m already thinking about others. lol\r\n\r\noh yea, I kinda forgot you told me you had some fets set aside for it, I\'ll send it down with the rest of the stuff.\r\nthis ones gonna have all sorts of goodies in the package lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20277,'d906356cf5','I see you have the Nikkio off road micro, i was wondering, how good is it?'),(20278,'420a6ea48a','[quote:420a6ea48a=\"grnmachnracr\"]I see you have the Nikkio off road micro, i was wondering, how good is it?[/quote:420a6ea48a]It\'s good but not great. It has excellent hop up potential. I\'ve got some stuff planned for it.\r\n\r\nHere\'s where I posted my initial impression.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3801\r\n\r\nDave'),(20279,'420a6ea48a','[quote:420a6ea48a=\"grnmachnracr\"]I see you have the Nikkio off road micro, i was wondering, how good is it?[/quote:420a6ea48a]It\'s good but not great. It has excellent hop up potential. I\'ve got some stuff planned for it.\r\n\r\nHere\'s where I posted my initial impression.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3801\r\n\r\nDave'),(20280,'2d684933f3','ahh thanks very much dave, that was very helpful, i was deciding wether to pick one up or not, and your right, fets would make that thing FLY!! may have to send mine once i get it to ph2t for a biff!'),(20281,'99dada7afd','[quote:99dada7afd=\"synj\"]you got msn?[/quote:99dada7afd]nope, sure don\'t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20282,'61f3d26dfb','o well do you need an extra mod? :???:'),(20283,'61f3d26dfb','o well do you need an extra mod? :???:'),(20284,'f8f8c28b1b','[quote:f8f8c28b1b=\"synj\"]o well do you need an extra mod? :???:[/quote:f8f8c28b1b]as in moderator for the site?\r\nno we\'re pretty stacked for now.'),(36099,'860acb5dc7','Well man sounds like no prob to send you the bodies! \r\n\r\nI am not familiar with money orders and stuff like that, if you just inform me how it works that would be great, and I would be more than happy to send you the bodies...\r\n\r\nI did not want to make it seem like I was holding you back from what you wanted. i was holding off for a reply because some other people wanted it and I told em it was not up for grabs. \r\n\r\nBut anyways get back to me soon!'),(20312,'86f1f44aab','[quote:86f1f44aab=\"payaso\"]Buy 2 of them... They are totally worth it. They\'re super fast, and don\'t really need modding.\r\n\r\nOne of my favorite cars.   Don\'t miss out. get em.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla[/quote:86f1f44aab]\r\n\r\nlol, I think I may go and pick one up in that case. :-)\r\n\r\nOh, and can we talk? I need a little more help...\r\n\r\nOn ausmicro, me, ph2t, betty.k and some other guy kinda got in a little predicament. I was questioning ph2t\'s woah nelly setup, and mucking around with the connections on a diagram to see if I could make an easier to understand version of the diagram. For some reason, they got angry and frustrated and called me stupid, told me to piss off....wtf? They got angry for such a tiny reason! Could I have a little input as to why they may have gotten pissed off? I\'m really confused...:?'),(37114,'53b1a9c2cd','Well, after nearly a week of reading I\'m opting out of getting a Micro RS4 (jury\'s still out on the Mini-T).  Picked up a new set of bearings for my MR01 and had a closer look at the MR02... is it really all that? I\'ve got a pretty good price lined up on a new one (MR02-MM).  Also have an excellent price on new Firelap 02\'s but would I be right at saying while similar, the quality in the Kosho makes up the price difference?\r\n\r\nI\'ve started selling a bunch of stuff from other hobbies to finance upgrades so you guys better not stop racing anytime soon!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20306,'1423b3f307','Well, I\'m thinking of buying one soon, noticing that they\'ve been dropped down to $25, which is a STEAL considering it\'s better than a SuperSlick. I thought I\'d ask you some questions...\r\n\r\nHow fast is it exactly?\r\nWhat kind of range does it have?\r\nWhat kind of runtime do you get?\r\nHave you thought about modding the internals?\r\n\r\nJust a few questions...\r\n\r\n-Sonny G'),(20307,'b1b7da0d29','Buy 2 of them... They are totally worth it. They\'re super fast, and don\'t really need modding.\r\n\r\nOne of my favorite cars.   Don\'t miss out. get em.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla'),(20308,'b1b7da0d29','Buy 2 of them... They are totally worth it. They\'re super fast, and don\'t really need modding.\r\n\r\nOne of my favorite cars.   Don\'t miss out. get em.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nsilla'),(20309,'7f2c6173be','[quote:7f2c6173be=\"DarkTari\"]I\'m getting your package in tha mail today.\r\n\r\nI\'ve done a WRX, all primered and ready for paint.  I\'m keeping with the summertime theme of things so I\'ve added an open sunroof and all windows rolled down.  I\'m including the bad chassis from the Celica, maybe you can toy around with it.  It is already double tab lowered in the front and sits real nice under this body, only it\'s not steady cause it was done for the Celica. you\'ll see what I mean when you get it.  I suggest double tab lowering the chassis that you\'re going to use. I\'ve taped the exhaust tip to the package tapering one end so you\'ll know which end to use.[/quote:7f2c6173be]Cool, I\'ll see what I can do. Should be pretty cool.\r\n\r\n[quote:7f2c6173be]I\'ve also included a couple goodies for ya Pimp![/quote:7f2c6173be]Right on! :-D \r\n\r\n[quote:7f2c6173be]I\'ve got this slamming azz body waitin for that Precious chassis you\'re sending.  Just gotta decide on a color.   :???: [/quote:7f2c6173be]Ummm, uh oh, I hope we\'re on the same page. To fix the rear end of that Precious, I grafted a Tomy rear end on, but I decided to take that as an opportunity to stretch it, so it is laying in 2 pieces at this point. \r\n\r\nSo is your body bit sized?\r\n\r\nIf so, I\'m thinking I could still just build a custom, lightweight flat chassis, like I did for my prostocker. \r\n\r\nHmmm, I gotta do some rethinkin\', I think. :???: \r\n\r\n[quote:7f2c6173be]Gotta go get my Swole on, lata![/quote:7f2c6173be]You go do that. :cool: \r\n\r\n\r\ndave'),(20310,'b65b3fe148','[quote:b65b3fe148]Ummm, uh oh, I hope we\'re on the same page. To fix the rear end of that Precious, I grafted a Tomy rear end on, but I decided to take that as an opportunity to stretch it, so it is laying in 2 pieces at this point. \r\n\r\nSo is your body bit sized? \r\n\r\nIf so, I\'m thinking I could still just build a custom, lightweight flat chassis, like I did for my prostocker. [/quote:b65b3fe148]\r\n\r\nDoh!  We\'re not on the same page.  I thought you were just gonna FET one of the Precious chassis and send it back with the others  :???: \r\nand I would do a body for it as our joint venture. \r\nI was suppose to send you two cars, one to replace that chassis, and one to replaced the one you wanted to keep. (the EVO) .  I can do a body for a stretched chassis, but that one would be awful hard to give up !\r\nDo you have a chassis you can FET ?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20314,'6c21758c7e','Hey Betty, are you still looking for one of those Nikkio r/c trucks? the hummer and jeep body styles?  If so my local KBtoys has them for 10$, i could hook you up with one on trade, or 12$ (shipping included)'),(20315,'7b05801619','nah, i\'m cool. but thanks for the offer man! :-)'),(20316,'15bf09aee3','maybe later.  i still have alot to do for tomarrow, but i might come over later.'),(20445,'27addfb993','can you help me with setting up my phpBB forums?'),(20318,'b65b3fe148','[quote:b65b3fe148]Ummm, uh oh, I hope we\'re on the same page. To fix the rear end of that Precious, I grafted a Tomy rear end on, but I decided to take that as an opportunity to stretch it, so it is laying in 2 pieces at this point. \r\n\r\nSo is your body bit sized? \r\n\r\nIf so, I\'m thinking I could still just build a custom, lightweight flat chassis, like I did for my prostocker. [/quote:b65b3fe148]\r\n\r\nDoh!  We\'re not on the same page.  I thought you were just gonna FET one of the Precious chassis and send it back with the others  :???: \r\nand I would do a body for it as our joint venture. \r\nI was suppose to send you two cars, one to replace that chassis, and one to replaced the one you wanted to keep. (the EVO) .  I can do a body for a stretched chassis, but that one would be awful hard to give up !\r\nDo you have a chassis you can FET ?'),(20343,'b13dca2193','Hi CW.\r\n\r\nI\'ve won the celica on the BP auction as you must be aware. I\'d like to know if I can pay for the car at the end of the month (26 July). If there\'s no problem with you guys of course. Let me know.\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nJose Azevedo');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24282,'676226138d','Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nWould you still be interrested in acquiring this\r\n\r\n[img:676226138d]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10007/thumb_bitcam3.jpg[/img:676226138d]\r\n\r\nFrom the [b:676226138d]Back Alley Auction [/b:676226138d]for your last bid of [color=green:676226138d]$53.00 [/color:676226138d]?\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=3982&amp;start=150\r\n\r\n[color=red:676226138d]Lemme Know ![/color:676226138d]'),(37142,'f91f34237f','Ordered my bearings.........\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n.....and an MR02.  If I don\'t feel like singing Happy Happy Joy Joy when I get it, I know where you live.  LOL'),(33014,'e79aee1ee4','No worries with the shipping mate, I\'m still waiting on a package Finks sent me 6 weeks ago that hasnt arrived, although I\'m thinking its gonna be a write-off.\r\nI\'ll do up a review when i get home on the mini - some mods are in order though, mainly a faster motor.   :-o'),(20322,'a2934110a8','ok.......');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20323,'aa6463709a','hey, crazy dave, i didn\'t realize you were online, check useless/dumpster forum for a thread directed at you! it\'s not flaming or anything, more of appreciation!!!'),(20324,'58a68b4602','[quote:58a68b4602=\"DarkTari\"]\r\n\r\nDoh!  We\'re not on the same page.  I thought you were just gonna FET one of the Precious chassis and send it back with the others  :???: \r\nand I would do a body for it as our joint venture. \r\nI was suppose to send you two cars, one to replace that chassis, and one to replaced the one you wanted to keep. (the EVO) .  I can do a body for a stretched chassis, but that one would be awful hard to give up !\r\nDo you have a chassis you can FET ?[/quote:58a68b4602]Yeah, I thought I mentioned a stretched chassis. I kinda had something planned with a Zip Zap body, but that\'s ok, I can rebuild this chassis bit sized. 8-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(20325,'3fa5fe77ec','You did mention a stretched chassis, but not for our joint venture.  Don\'t rearrange any plans you had for that chassis, just FET one of the one\'s I just sent and send it back, not the Celica chassis though, that\'s for you to fart around with  :-)'),(20327,'aa6463709a','hey, crazy dave, i didn\'t realize you were online, check useless/dumpster forum for a thread directed at you! it\'s not flaming or anything, more of appreciation!!!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20328,'3fa5fe77ec','You did mention a stretched chassis, but not for our joint venture.  Don\'t rearrange any plans you had for that chassis, just FET one of the one\'s I just sent and send it back, not the Celica chassis though, that\'s for you to fart around with  :-)'),(24343,'c3840c21d6','It may be available, I\'ll have Cabo contact you.\r\n\r\nThanx 4 support\'n Pimp  :cool:'),(37542,'48170b9cd9','Ah, ok.'),(35628,'506d133448','Hi:\r\n\r\nI just noticed that you were from Westchester, and was curious where, since my dad lives in White Plains.\r\n\r\n-Max'),(20330,'14f689c040','Where \"Down South\" are you located ?\r\n\r\nI see want that ride from Team DarkTari!  The Pictures do it NO JUSTICE, trust me!  It\'s gonna be a long week !'),(20331,'23370b02f4','[quote:23370b02f4=\"DarkTari\"]You did mention a stretched chassis, but not for our joint venture.  Don\'t rearrange any plans you had for that chassis, just FET one of the one\'s I just sent and send it back, not the Celica chassis though, that\'s for you to fart around with  :-)[/quote:23370b02f4]Allrighty then, sounds like a plan.\r\n\r\nDave'),(20341,'af9a743ede','shut up you dickhead.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20342,'09c60112c2','Wow, that\'s really good.  What are you, 8?  You seem to type like an 8 year old, unless I am giving too little credit to 8 year olds.'),(21070,'ad1b663b31','i am glad you like it, i was really happy with the way the paint shines! and is soooo smooth.\r\n\r\nenjoy and i am glad to help u out.\r\n\r\njmays'),(23700,'79f1469156','Sounds cool, I\'ll send ya an even $20, sound good? I want to wait till I get ahold of one of the new SE\'s with hopefully the so called new PCB, as soon as I do, I\'ll send it your way. No rush, take your tiome with it.'),(26632,'0f9c7879b2','[quote:0f9c7879b2=\"PINGO\"]ohhh i am from denmark my name is casper ! what about you?[/quote:0f9c7879b2]\r\n\r\nWEll today is my birthday. And i am 15 and my name is Everett and i am from Nevada :) if you want i can sell you one of those cars. Cause i don\'t think you have walmarts in denmark :)'),(20348,'9239351f43',':lol: \r\n\r\nsup man.\r\n\r\nhere\'s my addy, whenever you\'re ready - don\'t rush greatness.\r\n\r\nScott Lix\r\n16 Crystal Lake Drive\r\nSt. Peters, MO 63376\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks for doing that for us man. this is gonna be cool and I\'m betting going to come in handy for some self-promo! lol'),(20349,'fe8eb9abb3','I understand and I feel bad for letting you and the other pimps down, but at the moment I really can\'t get the cash. When did you want me to send the cash?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20350,'52ef718366','ah its no problem, my KB had tons of em\', figured id help some people out!'),(21072,'af94725a01','Hey DT, here she is\r\n\r\nJesse King\r\n25 Springview Ln Unit #3\r\nWest Bath, ME 04530\r\n\r\nThanks a ton Bro, this is kick ass.'),(20352,'c2c4baba06','i will send the cit this week , just when u have th eextra, think about me.\r\n\r\n\r\npeice\r\njmays'),(21075,'0b9e87c00f','Hey Pimp, Do you have any Z bodies?'),(21074,'92d00a7cc6','I\'ll get it out 2 ya Monday.\r\nCongratulations!  Great Job!'),(20556,'dc65d9a0cf','I got the VW rig last week.  The paint job is slammin\' !!  Thanks  It runs very strong too................thanks....jd'),(20557,'e2a92b0419','[quote:e2a92b0419=\"Jackd\"]I got the VW rig last week.  The paint job is slammin\' !!  Thanks  It runs very strong too................thanks....jd[/quote:e2a92b0419]Cool, I\'m glad you like it!! 8-) \r\n\r\nHey, I\'ve gotta tell ya, Them pink endbell clone motors that are in there are very torquey, and kick butt for a dual cell car, but since FET add more torque than speed, these motors don\'t see much benefits from FET, \'cause they\'re already plenty torquey.\r\n\r\nAnyways, long story short, slip a 3.8 or something like that in there, and watch that thing scream!\r\n\r\nWell thanks again for your support, and if you\'re ever looking for a FET mod, you know where to find me.\r\n\r\nDave'),(20357,'f7b0798105','alabama');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37612,'c8526f9a96','Well, my dad lives in White Plains.'),(37616,'94ab336d2d','I actually live in Oradell, NJ, and when I asked you, I was still visiting my dad who lives in White Plains, which is why I asked.  I stopped speaking to him awhile ago though, so I\'m no longer in the area much.'),(29360,'f36f5b9683','Skyline is packed up and ready to go I will send it out first thing tommorow you should have it some time next week!\r\n\r\nHave a good one!'),(25618,'01c9d8707f','[quote:01c9d8707f=\"viperdout\"]\r\nOuch.  Ph2t has no ideas on it?   I hope you figure out what kind of resistor it is and be able to replace it.  Hell, it might be used on an xmod board, which would save you 15 bucks, or if you can get it back to stock without anything looking desoldered, you might be able to take it back.  Good luck on it.[/quote:01c9d8707f]I think I\'m just gonna stick a Muscle Machines PCB in there. That\'s what Hog did, so we know that works, and I think I can do without lights. Also we know they take right to FETs and they\'re more compact. So aside from the lights that wont be too bad.\r\n\r\nI\'m just irritated because all I wanted to do was put FETs in, I\'m still enjoying the newness, and I didn\'t want to wander too far from stock. I\'m also bummin\' cause I\'m trying to figure what I\'m gonna do with yours.\r\n\r\nI posted up my prob, but he\'s on an Aussie time schedule so he probably wont get back until tonight or early morn.\r\n\r\nThis sucks, I so wanted this to go smooth. :( \r\n\r\nDave'),(20360,'c2d2cf2eba','you are probably younger than me maggot. i sent you a message to tell you to think before you post, it was a fair call.   \r\n  dont you realise how stupid you sound when you comment about shit you aint got a clue about.     \r\n\r\n e.g.\" id buy an iwaver overlander if they made one\".\r\n\r\n guess what, they dont and probably never will. the thread had nothing to do with \"would you like to see an Iwaver overlander\".   \r\n\r\n   please, so many examples could be used here to explain how stupid you sound. so just shut up and learn or talk shit and be prepared to be trated like a peice of shit. \r\n\r\n    your called a gimp for a reason.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20361,'f1a455c6a8','[quote:f1a455c6a8]you are probably younger than me maggot. i sent you a message to tell you to think before you post, it was a fair call. \r\ndont you realise how stupid you sound when you comment about shit you aint got a clue about. \r\n\r\ne.g.\" id buy an iwaver overlander if they made one\". \r\n\r\nguess what, they dont and probably never will. the thread had nothing to do with \"would you like to see an Iwaver overlander\". \r\n\r\nplease, so many examples could be used here to explain how stupid you sound. so just shut up and learn or talk shit and be prepared to be trated like a peice of shit. \r\n\r\nyour called a gimp for a reason.[/quote:f1a455c6a8]\r\n\r\nFirst, someone in that thread brought up an Overlander, and second, if Iwaver is building an MR-02, why not an Overlander.  I doubt that I am younger than you purely from your spelling skills.  I think that you don\'t know shit.  I\'ve worked on bits and xmods for years, you dumb fuck.  I have put together the fastest xmod ever made.  My zip zap does 8 mph.  Let me continue on.  The whole gimp thing was because I had the balls to argue with a moderator, which you don\'t understand.  Lastly, trated is supposed to be spelled t-r-e-a-t-e-d, and you used the incorrect form of your.  You meant to use you\'re, as in you are.  Try using the shift key to capitalize the first letter of each sentence.  Also, before I forget, telling me what to post and not post is none of your business.  You leave that up to the mods, little girl, and you\'ll do fine.'),(20362,'db2f9e0635','[quote:db2f9e0635]you are probably younger than me maggot. i sent you a message to tell you to think before you post, it was a fair call. \r\ndont you realise how stupid you sound when you comment about shit you aint got a clue about. \r\n\r\ne.g.\" id buy an iwaver overlander if they made one\". \r\n\r\nguess what, they dont and probably never will. the thread had nothing to do with \"would you like to see an Iwaver overlander\". \r\n\r\nplease, so many examples could be used here to explain how stupid you sound. so just shut up and learn or talk shit and be prepared to be trated like a peice of shit. \r\n\r\nyour called a gimp for a reason.[/quote:db2f9e0635]\r\n\r\nFirst, someone in that thread brought up an Overlander, and second, if Iwaver is building an MR-02, why not an Overlander.  I doubt that I am younger than you purely from your spelling skills.  I think that you don\'t know shit.  I\'ve worked on bits and xmods for years, you dumb fuck.  I have put together the fastest xmod ever made.  My zip zap does 8 mph.  Let me continue on.  The whole gimp thing was because I had the balls to argue with a moderator, which you don\'t understand.  Lastly, trated is supposed to be spelled t-r-e-a-t-e-d, and you used the incorrect form of your.  You meant to use you\'re, as in you are.  Try using the shift key to capitalize the first letter of each sentence.  Also, before I forget, telling me what to post and not post is none of your business.  You leave that up to the mods, little girl, and you\'ll do fine.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37651,'94ab336d2d','I actually live in Oradell, NJ, and when I asked you, I was still visiting my dad who lives in White Plains, which is why I asked.  I stopped speaking to him awhile ago though, so I\'m no longer in the area much.'),(27884,'f334251b25','so we can bail.....\r\n\r\nI talked to Hog last night on AIM.  He said he would go if he\'s not sleepin\'.'),(27885,'51ae778e99','[quote:51ae778e99=\"viperdout\"][quote:51ae778e99=\"DarkTari\"]Hey VP,\r\n\r\nIf you head up there to pickup an Nak Hummer, would you mind pick\'n up a few more. I\'m down for 3, color or frequency doesn\'t matter.  I\'m gonna suggest a group buy cause there seems to be great interrest.\r\n\r\nJust remember, if they only have 4 left, I\'m down for 3  8-) \r\nLemme know![/quote:51ae778e99]\r\n\r\nDT:\r\n\r\nIf they still have them, will buy.  I have a feeling that they are not going to be the greatest thing in the world though (I\'ll be buying one and seeing if they\'re worth the 20 bucks).\r\n\r\n-Max[/quote:51ae778e99]\r\n\r\nAuight!  20 bucks?  Put me down for 2 then.  Them mugs are kind high ??\r\nThey may not be the best, but whatever they lack.............. 8-) \r\nI got 2 Naks coming next week so I\'ll see their potential.  The old ones were great lil Micros, turbo, dual cell, great range, long run time!   I\'m gonna suggest a group buy if you don\'t mind ????'),(25622,'0a6144b194','[quote:0a6144b194=\"viperdout\"]\r\nDave:\r\n\r\nIf it takes an extra day, I can wait.  No need to rush the hell out of a tedious job.  Why not try to swap in an SE pcb?\r\n\r\n-Max[/quote:0a6144b194]Well cool, I\'m glad your willing to wait an extra day or 2. That might just give me time to work it out with ph2t, and that helps put me at ease.\r\n\r\nNow I\'m just bumming about my car. That Muscle Machines PCB was working fine, then all of sudden it started running non stop, and I can\'t figure out why, it doesn\'t even have FETs in it.\r\n\r\nI\'m just jinxed today I guess, I should stop when it gets like this, but when it\'s my only one of a car, it\'s like I just can\'t, not until my favorite toy is working again. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo I found a resistor that\'s no where near close to the one I\'m replacing, and I\'m hoping that I get enough reception, since I\'m getting a little with no resistor there at all.\r\n\r\nIf that works then I\'ll be happy again, the partial boost at least pulls the orange gears, about like it pulled the red ones. So that\'s not super exicting, but should be fun.\r\n\r\n\r\nOh and a SE board is a little weak for a monster even FETed. It should be interesting to see how the new SE boards do with FEts.\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37658,'2cdee31294','Yeah, I\'ll drop you a line if I\'m in the area.'),(27894,'f02df769b3','Cool !'),(27941,'8a4935760f','[quote:8a4935760f=\"sg219\"]If you decide to part it out....\r\n\r\nI want first dibs on the Mamba....\r\n\r\nI\'ll take the Mamba from you for $85 shipped? Let me know if thats reasonable for a used Mamba.  If not, we\'ll talk it over.  n/p\r\n\r\nThen maybe the chassis a couple of weeks later.  (the following Payday. :) )[/quote:8a4935760f]\r\n\r\nSG:\r\n\r\nSorry, someone already beat you to first dibs (actually 2 people have IMed me about the Mamba), so I\'m sorry to tell you you\'re out of luck.  To make things worse for your cause, I\'ve already gotten an offer on the thing, so it looks like it won\'t be parted out either.  I wish you luck on your quest, and if you need to go new, www.b-p-p.com has Mambas for 110, which isn\'t half bad.  I gather it\'s going into your T, so that\'ll be badass.  Sorry to be the bearer...\r\n\r\n-Max'),(20374,'502a1f6df4','Jacques,\r\n\r\nDid you get your package?\r\n\r\n    \r\nTrack &amp; Confirm \r\n \r\nCurrent Status\r\n\r\nYou entered [b:502a1f6df4]0304 0370 0001 7972 8032[/b:502a1f6df4] \r\n\r\n[b:502a1f6df4]Your item was delivered at 11:11 am on July 02, 2004 in NORTH GROSVENORDALE, CT 06255. [/b:502a1f6df4]');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24450,'cf2fcc2a09','[quote:cf2fcc2a09]There where issues when it came time to put up! I\'m not gonna Bust Out da Pimp \r\nbut we know so at this particular time I wanna stress...... \r\n\r\n[color=red:cf2fcc2a09]\"If You Don\'t Have Da Dough, Dont Make Da Bid\" [/color:cf2fcc2a09]\r\n\r\nDon\'t rely on having or getting it by weeks end! \r\nWe don\'t finance or credit period, so with that being said...... [/quote:cf2fcc2a09]\r\n\r\nThis was posted after a winning bidder defaulted on the purchase.\r\n\r\nNow you had been contacted and have not yet paid so the ride was\r\noffered to the previous bidder and he accepted. \r\nSo don\'t worry about gett\'n together da funds Pimp, the ride is gone.  :cool:'),(20389,'8c0e8669fe','How much is the shipping?'),(20390,'a105ba98ef','Yes I did. I love it! Sorry, on Vaca, I only get a couple chances to come home and get on the comp. 4th of July and stuff.\r\n\r\nSorry for the inconvience.\r\n\r\nJacques.... Thanks!'),(20370,'dc438146bb','[quote:dc438146bb=\"viperdout\"][quote:dc438146bb]shit, that was fast! but guess what, sending two copies of the same message aint gonna make me listen to you any more than one. \r\ni guess your \"fastest xmod in the world\" is your clame to fame.... \r\ni\'m sorry for wasting your time. you are the greatest, all heil viperdout... \r\nking of the xmod. its a fucking toy loser. \r\n\r\n\r\nwhat you got to say now?[/quote:dc438146bb]\r\n\r\nYou really need to stay in school.  You are still missing the previous lesson of capitalizing, you spelled claim wrong, you also spelled hail wrong, and if it\'s just a fucking toy then why do you post here?  BTW, your paint skills suck.[/quote:dc438146bb]\r\n\r\ni finished school 5 years ago. when are you graduating from primary?\r\n heil, as in \"zig heil\" (ever heard of a twat called hitler).  \r\n did i say toys are crap? no fucken way maggot!  what they aint is a real car. and so saying you got the fastest xmod makes you sound like a bigger tosser than i thought you were.\r\n whats up with my paint skillz? ahh i know, i use a brush most of the time and you wouldn\'t respect a real artist (except another bullshit artist like yourself).\r\n\r\n wheres your paint jobs maggot? i dont see nothin in the gallery. wipe your chin, your dribblin\' shit.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20366,'c7f8fb1389','[quote:c7f8fb1389=\"viperdout\"][quote:c7f8fb1389]you are probably younger than me maggot. i sent you a message to tell you to think before you post, it was a fair call. \r\ndont you realise how stupid you sound when you comment about shit you aint got a clue about. \r\n\r\ne.g.\" id buy an iwaver overlander if they made one\". \r\n\r\nguess what, they dont and probably never will. the thread had nothing to do with \"would you like to see an Iwaver overlander\". \r\n\r\nplease, so many examples could be used here to explain how stupid you sound. so just shut up and learn or talk shit and be prepared to be trated like a peice of shit. \r\n\r\nyour called a gimp for a reason.[/quote:c7f8fb1389]\r\n\r\nFirst, someone in that thread brought up an Overlander, and second, if Iwaver is building an MR-02, why not an Overlander.  I doubt that I am younger than you purely from your spelling skills.  I think that you don\'t know shit.  I\'ve worked on bits and xmods for years, you dumb fuck.  I have put together the fastest xmod ever made.  My zip zap does 8 mph.  Let me continue on.  The whole gimp thing was because I had the balls to argue with a moderator, which you don\'t understand.  Lastly, trated is supposed to be spelled t-r-e-a-t-e-d, and you used the incorrect form of your.  You meant to use you\'re, as in you are.  Try using the shift key to capitalize the first letter of each sentence.  Also, before I forget, telling me what to post and not post is none of your business.  You leave that up to the mods, little girl, and you\'ll do fine.[/quote:c7f8fb1389]\r\n\r\nshit, that was fast!    but guess what, sending two copies of the same message aint gonna make me listen to you any more than one. \r\n  i guess your \"fastest xmod in the world\" is your clame to fame....\r\n i\'m sorry for wasting your time. you are the greatest, all heil viperdout...\r\n king of the xmod. its a fucking toy loser. \r\n\r\n if your so upseat about being critisized about your posting habits then why dish some back. you got snake DNA in you or something? gotta have another bite? go on maggot.   i doubt anything is true about what you say. even if you did have an 8mile an hour bit it dont mean shit.\r\n\r\n what you got to say now?'),(20367,'011c12e0da','[quote:011c12e0da]shit, that was fast! but guess what, sending two copies of the same message aint gonna make me listen to you any more than one. \r\ni guess your \"fastest xmod in the world\" is your clame to fame.... \r\ni\'m sorry for wasting your time. you are the greatest, all heil viperdout... \r\nking of the xmod. its a fucking toy loser. \r\n\r\n\r\nwhat you got to say now?[/quote:011c12e0da]\r\n\r\nYou really need to stay in school.  You are still missing the previous lesson of capitalizing, you spelled claim wrong, you also spelled hail wrong, and if it\'s just a fucking toy then why do you post here?  BTW, your paint skills suck.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20371,'186994700c','I don\'t paint my shit.  I prefer the sleeper look rather than the ricer style of make it look cool, and leave it so it\'s so slow that it doesn\'t move.  Go buy some paint cans, dumbass.'),(20372,'b1c89d98e1','I\'m a big metal fan, and this is the best playlist by far IMO.'),(20386,'c2c4baba06','i will send the cit this week , just when u have th eextra, think about me.\r\n\r\n\r\npeice\r\njmays'),(20387,'6e91b8956d','[quote:6e91b8956d=\"mekinhux\"]I understand and I feel bad for letting you and the other pimps down, but at the moment I really can\'t get the cash. When did you want me to send the cash?[/quote:6e91b8956d]as soon as possible.\r\nwe\'ll wait 5 days to hear from you and you confirming you have sent out the money.\r\n\r\nif we haven\'t heard from you in 5 days, the car goes back up on the block.\r\nif you can\'t ship payment with in 5 days, the car goes back up on the block.'),(28035,'57abac052c','[quote:57abac052c=\"Mazda787b\"]Hey,  I saw that you are selling your Mamba Xmod.  I am VERY interested in the Mini-X reciever, as well as the Mamba 6800 Combo.  How much you want for each one, and how much for both together?  \r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nMazda[/quote:57abac052c]\r\n\r\nMazda:\r\n\r\nThere\'s a deal pending for the whole car, so I\'m not going to part it out.  RCMart has the receiver and www.b-p-p.com has a 6800/ESC combo for 110.  You dropping one in a Mini-T?  Once I sell some the stuf I\'m getting in trade I\'m going with an 8000 and a 3s li-po pack into my RC18T that\'s STILL on backorder at Tower for almost a month when they claimed it\'d be a week. :x \r\n\r\n-Max');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20378,'d3a277f888','Do You have a XMod, If so what is the best mods to increase range? Thanks :cool:'),(20384,'d4dfdb09f2','[quote:d4dfdb09f2=\"viperdout\"]I don\'t paint my shit.  I prefer the sleeper look rather than the ricer style of make it look cool, and leave it so it\'s so slow that it doesn\'t move.  Go buy some paint cans, dumbass.[/quote:d4dfdb09f2]\r\n\r\nhey maggot, learn fucking english.  \"the ricer style of make it look cool\"???\r\n\r\n what the hell you talkin boy? whats ricer style or sleeper looks got anything to do with fucking painting anyways?\r\n\r\n spraycans i got plenty of em. i use plenty of them too. but a brush will let you do things no spray can do.\r\n\r\n  and anyways, why dont you paint your shit?  because painting turds is idiots work!      seriously if you dont paint anything yourself then how can you comment about someone elses work, maggot.\r\n\r\n you aint got shit kid. who the fuck are you to tell me my skillz aint worthy. bring it on muthang!'),(20381,'8963a69a9d','[quote:8963a69a9d=\"JDM-R34\"]Do You have a XMod, If so what is the best mods to increase range? Thanks :cool:[/quote:8963a69a9d]naw I don\'t have one, so I have no info about them.\r\nyou\'d be better off asking one of the pimps in the xmod crib (if you haven\'t already)\r\n\r\nsorry I couldn\'t help.\r\ngood luck holmes.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20382,'e5780203fe','ok thanks C-Dub, just wondering if Ya did, thanks anyway :cool:'),(36909,'57b5a586bc','i got mine at local hobbie store. try one in your area\r\nfull name of the company is TEAM LOSI. item is Mini-t servo\r\nquick search got me this\r\nhttps://www.ssl-stormerhobbies.com/cgi-bin/seekpart.pl?src=ns&amp;pn=LOSB1091\r\ni\'m very satisfied with my car. i\'m using kayosho electronics, hope it will work out good for xmod pcb.'),(27613,'c9015e7e74','Hey Man,\r\n\r\nThis was TOTALLY MY BAD.  I misunderstood the posting rules for \"Lookin\' to score\" so I posted in the main Z Forum.  \r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=5528\r\n\r\nAnd I totally got what I deserved.  And quite honestly I thought it was hillarious!  But I was wondering if you\'d mind deleting the post entirely after everybody\'s had a good laugh today.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nChris'),(20403,'910e7b59b0','aite. lol\r\n\r\nkeep on me til you get it.'),(20404,'1151c44528','Hey, got the bus sent out.\r\n\r\nWhen I told you I\'d get to it last weekend, I forgot it was the 4th. So I was unable to mail it until today, but I went ahead and paid the extra for Priorty mail and a delivery confirmation #. You can track the confirmation# at www.usps.com . Here\'s the #: 0303 2460 0001 9817 4824\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get it, so I know it arrived in good shape, and I hope you enjoy!\r\n\r\nThanks again, \r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20398,'bfc42571d9','well i was on a short unexpected vacation and totally forgot about that cd. well good that you took the initiative anyhow. you still want it for further problems?'),(20399,'3ba7d268bf','Hell yeah I do....lol\r\n\r\nMy pop likes to bitch at me for herbs laying around on the tables.  He tells people that I like to have wheel barrels full of weed laying around...haha\r\n\r\nIf I can fix it with out him having to come over would be stellar..\r\n\r\nSteve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn lake circle south. Apt C\r\nSt. Petersburg FL. 33712\r\n\r\nThanks man.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(20400,'1660045f93','[quote:1660045f93=\"viperdout\"]muthang?  What\'s that mean.  I for got a \"to\" in my first sentence.  I have painted before, and it came out good, except my putty job underneath sucked 9first time I had ever bondoed).  Buh-bye, wannabe.[/quote:1660045f93]\r\n\r\nbondoed?  9first ?\r\n\r\nmuthang?= mut-hang.   loose twat.    over fucked sluts cunt hole.  you.\r\n\r\nwheres your first bracket maggot?\r\n\r\n i know you suck, you dont have to tell me!'),(20401,'3ba7d268bf','Hell yeah I do....lol\r\n\r\nMy pop likes to bitch at me for herbs laying around on the tables.  He tells people that I like to have wheel barrels full of weed laying around...haha\r\n\r\nIf I can fix it with out him having to come over would be stellar..\r\n\r\nSteve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn lake circle south. Apt C\r\nSt. Petersburg FL. 33712\r\n\r\nThanks man.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (26625,'acd02b1304','okay thanks dude!!!! where do you shop becuce zipzap dont ship to Denmark'),(26626,'12be36fa0b','I just go to Radio Shack or call 1-800-the-shac.  I would help you, but I\'m getting ready to deploy with the Marines to Iraq soon.  Hit up \"CJ\" (username).  He may be able to help you get some ZZ\'s.  CJ is a good guy.  I have ordered from him before.  He sells and trades RC stuff.  He may be able to pick something up from Radio Shack for you.'),(26628,'0f9c7879b2','[quote:0f9c7879b2=\"PINGO\"]ohhh i am from denmark my name is casper ! what about you?[/quote:0f9c7879b2]\r\n\r\nWEll today is my birthday. And i am 15 and my name is Everett and i am from Nevada :) if you want i can sell you one of those cars. Cause i don\'t think you have walmarts in denmark :)'),(20406,'decee8f8df','just to let you know...\r\none of my pals is getting ready to start some hosting.\r\nI might move over to him, but he\'s a tad more expensive than discounters.\r\nalthough he can make up for it in space, bandwidth, features, and the knowledge of knowing you\'re not on a server with a 1000 other users, etc., etc.\r\n\r\nanyways, I might move over to him, if I do, I\'ll have enough space and bandwidth that I could possibly rent out to some pimps.\r\nI haven\'t said anything yet to anyone, so keep it hush hush for now until I can figure for sure what\'s going to go on.\r\nbut anyways, think about that.\r\nwe might be able to hook eachother up because I can\'t really afford the whole thing by myself, but if I could rent out some of my space - it would help.\r\nI won\'t go in to too much detail, unless you want or are interested of course, but the gist is I\'ll have enough space and bandwidth to spare for quite a while.\r\n\r\nlet me know what you think, if you want some more info, I can get what I know so far and keep you informed.\r\n\r\nor... you don\'t even have to get the space through me, I could hook you up with him if you wanted, but I\'m guessing he\'s not selling \"smaller\" packages, he\'s looking for \"business\" type clients who need larger scale hosting solutions.\r\n\r\nanyways, there it tis - something for you to think about.'),(20408,'e9ac530a5e','You are the fuckin man cabo. :-) \r\nDefinatly keep me in the loop and remember always that I\'m a cheap ass. Alls I need is a space to put up pics for now (mainly for the threads up on here  :lol: ) I would also need room for file sharing (vid and music and whatnot). The cheapest I\'ve found so far is like $9 a month but that\'s from what you\'ve allready said \"discount\" suppliers. Not cool when I wanna scream at someone about some shit I know little about, heh. I also got a friend willing to hook me up with space for my own \"link\" dump, but he\'s either high or workin on his music or high or getting into fights or high to set the shit up.  :-( \r\nThanks man, highly apreciated.\r\nOh... see farenheight (sp?) 9/11, that shit is powerful. :-) \r\n(got a bootleg dvd if ya want one or a 3gig iso file.)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20411,'1d23ac2d89','[quote:1d23ac2d89=\"sessiz\"]You are the fuckin man cabo. :-) \r\nDefinatly keep me in the loop and remember always that I\'m a cheap ass. Alls I need is a space to put up pics for now (mainly for the threads up on here  :lol: ) I would also need room for file sharing (vid and music and whatnot). The cheapest I\'ve found so far is like $9 a month but that\'s from what you\'ve allready said \"discount\" suppliers. Not cool when I wanna scream at someone about some shit I know little about, heh. I also got a friend willing to hook me up with space for my own \"link\" dump, but he\'s either high or workin on his music or high or getting into fights or high to set the shit up.  :-( \r\nThanks man, highly apreciated.\r\nOh... see farenheight (sp?) 9/11, that shit is powerful. :-) \r\n(got a bootleg dvd if ya want one or a 3gig iso file.)[/quote:1d23ac2d89]cool, I\'ll keep ya in the loop.\r\n\r\nhaven\'t seen fahrenheit 911 yet, but wanna.\r\nprobably gonna wait for on-demand or something less than the theatre but more comfortable lol\r\n\r\nI don\'t have a dvd burner :sad:'),(20412,'020398f2f0','Shit man I\'ll send ya a dvd copy with your poster.  :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21671,'32e802a383','[quote:32e802a383=\"Son_Gokou\"]Ship the items to:\r\n\r\nA.J. Batra\r\n24 Stevenson Avenue\r\nCortlandt Manor, NY 10567\r\n\r\nI\'ll get pics of the bods soon...[/quote:32e802a383]\r\n\r\nSG Stuff\r\nc/o Mike Smalley Jr.\r\n3918 Inland Ave.\r\nWest Mifflin, Pa  15122'),(33957,'d00cbbe879','Sent you an email about your Evo.  Let me know if you got pictures or anything.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(34148,'aab90da0c5','Yep, the board arrived just yesterday, I\'ll be doing the mods on either tonight or this weekend. :-o'),(36282,'03db12b327','[quote:03db12b327=\"sessiz\"]Now that I\'m not all blurry eyed and on my way to work at 5:30 in the morning I just wanted to say thank you again. Not only did ya give me an idea on what to expect or look forward to (all I was looking for) but ya took it one step further and offered to go over what I will be presenting in my portfolio. This has earned my gratitude but good man and if I have the time to do it I will take you up on it. (hopefully any kind of interview is a month away yall know how I love to procrastinate :lol: )\r\nThen you got all gay ( :lol: ) on me and offered to print the stuff out and ship it to me. God damn it man, are you a fuckin saint or what?\r\nSeriously man I could keep on thanking ya but you hopefully get the jist of what I\'m goin on about. :-)[/quote:03db12b327]\r\n\r\nNo problem man, it\'s nice when I can do something for someone that\'s actually useful. And seriously, if you want me and hue (he does the same kind of stuff I do) to do a little pre-interview portfolio review or help putting it together, I\'d be happy to do it.\r\n\r\nOne other thing I thought about after you mentioned who the job was for and what you might be doing, is to show some kind of graphic system. Like if someone gave you (or you came up with) a picture, 3 colors, a typeface, a logo and a paragraph of copy, how would you apply it to say a 48&quot;x65&quot; window poster, an 8&quot;x10&quot; countertop display, a 8&quot;x6&quot; direct-mail postcard. Basically the idea of creating a family of designs in different formats. Keep me posted.'),(21290,'c8d2316f79','What\'s up Cdub');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21291,'abc018b492','So what do you think of this whole panther thing?\r\n\r\nKind of interesting how I AM decided to give up the review after the cat was out of the bag.'),(20568,'c5f1e1e1c9','yeah i was wonderin if you had any messenger like aim,yahoo,msn cause i really want to talk to you man your so awsome  :-D'),(24311,'52191220c5','[quote:52191220c5=\"CaboWabo\"]naw, I\'m not selling any wheels right now.\r\nyou might be able get some from someone on the site who\'s willing to trade or sell, just make a post in the \"Lookin Fo\'\" section describing what you want.\r\n\r\ngood luck on your quest holmes, sorry I couldn\'t help ya.[/quote:52191220c5]\r\n\r\nIts ok man ... I was gonna use thee killer ass chrom wheels but i can only find three what a bitch ... But tomarrow i\'m going  to walmart... and ill pick up tunerz car one with bit sized rimz i was thinking theese  :grin:  [img:52191220c5]http://i23.ebayimg.com/02/i/02/86/98/bd_1.JPG[/img:52191220c5]or some different onces :)'),(20414,'6d1e9671fb','Hey, when I said I\'d send you a FETed PCB for that car, I didn\'t realize this past weekend was the 4th, so I got nothing done.\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna try really hard to get it done this week, but if you just wanted to call your auction car done as is, I\'ll still go ahead and send it to you, and you can use it for yourself, if you\'d like.\r\n\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20415,'f1d3f452f8','Hey I had originally planned to send your 3 cars back today. (Well actually yesterday, but I didn\'t know the post office was closed. :lol: )\r\n\r\nSo anyways, I could find your address off hand, and was running late for the bus. So I decided to to just get your stuff on the next trip\r\n\r\nI also wanted to stall some time so I could make a video of how hot that 4.2 is, so I could show everybody, but that\'s where I may have jinxed myself.\r\n\r\nMy new apartment has some really bad interference, when I first charged your car, it had no forwards. I thought it was the interference acting up again, so I\'m wandering all over my apartment, shutting off TVs and fans and stuff trying to get it to work. Then I start to think that for some reason my mod failed, but I already put a drop of epoxy on it so I can\'t change it now, and I was kinda panicking. BUT do not worry you\'re car is fine. I eventually realized the back tab is cracked, and pushing down on the motor\'s heatsink fixed everything, but by this time the battery had gotton weak, and it just wasn\'t kickin\' enough to make my video. Besides the sun had gone down, and I lost my good lighting.\r\n\r\n\r\nSo I wanted to make a video showing how powerful that motor is, but now I think I\'m jinxed, so I\'m gonna leave it alone.  :lol: \r\n\r\nI figure since I\'m probably gonna mod one of the precious chassis your sending me, to send back to you, or finish the one I started, either way I can send your cars then, so I\'m not having to spend too much shipping this stuff back and forth. Cool?\r\n\r\ndave'),(20416,'b73dd63742','That\'s Cool!  You should\'ve recieved the package today (2da delivery)\r\n\r\nWe\'re gonna need something to put on Da Block next week!\r\n\r\n\r\nOUt !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37227,'46880de3ec','I guess I missed it. :sad:'),(20419,'c6e9b47a6a','[quote:c6e9b47a6a=\"sessiz\"]Shit man I\'ll send ya a dvd copy with your poster.  :-)[/quote:c6e9b47a6a]how many times I gotta say I love ya? :lol: \r\nthanks bro :D'),(20420,'afee928e0c','Sorry it took me so long to get back to you, but its been one hell of a party this past weekend.  The 4th of July up here is the biggest celebration of the year and my favorite holiday of all time!!  I\'ve been partying for about 4 days now!!\r\n\r\n\r\nAnyway here is what I got for you........\r\n\r\nbearings=$12\r\nelectronics=$15\r\nsuspension=$8\r\n2 transistor things=$2\r\nAWD kit=$15\r\n\r\nI think thats the right numbers, I have it written down somewhere. but I wanted to get a PM out to you before I forgot.\r\n\r\nSo far $58 and change, includes all my sales tax which I pay 7.5% here.\r\n\r\nI still have to get you the stage 2 motor set then package everything up and run down to see how much shipping will be.\r\n\r\nThe stage 2 set is $14.99+tax I think so you can add that on plus shipping and I think I said $6 for a good beer.\r\n\r\nSo thats where we stand, OK. :-)  :cool:'),(20422,'b73dd63742','That\'s Cool!  You should\'ve recieved the package today (2da delivery)\r\n\r\nWe\'re gonna need something to put on Da Block next week!\r\n\r\n\r\nOUt !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20520,'ea71e3e497','Hey, I got your package. 2 Precious cars, KIT racer, and the Subaru body on a chassis.\r\n\r\n\r\nOk, let me make sure I got everything straight, The chassis the body is on is the one I need to work on, I\'m putting my custom chassis under the subaru body. I FETing one of the Precious cars to send back to you, can that one be stretched?\r\n\r\nThe Subaru body looks pretty sick, I\'m thinking something race inspired. I\'m also thinking it\'s gotta be hot looking, like red and orange fading to black in an almost flame effect. I don\'t have red and orange, might have to go pick out some new colors.I don\'t know, might have to stare at it a couple days, but I\'m getting ideas.\r\n\r\nOn that KIT racer, you know what gear ratio that is? The one Superfly sent me had red gears, without counting teeth, the axle looks similar, but I never saw the idler, so the idler on this set looks to be some kind of sick gear ratio.\r\n\r\nDammit why didn\'t anyplace around here have these on clearance for $2?I missed out at both Kay-Bee, and Toys R Us wanted to charge me $9 for their last KIT racer. These are pretty cool source for good parts for $2, but $9, nevermind.\r\n\r\nWest Phoenix blows for BIT shopping. Only thing we ever had going around here was the Thunder Chargers, and thanks to me they sold out of those in about 2 weeks. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(20424,'1151c44528','Hey, got the bus sent out.\r\n\r\nWhen I told you I\'d get to it last weekend, I forgot it was the 4th. So I was unable to mail it until today, but I went ahead and paid the extra for Priorty mail and a delivery confirmation #. You can track the confirmation# at www.usps.com . Here\'s the #: 0303 2460 0001 9817 4824\r\n\r\nLet me know when you get it, so I know it arrived in good shape, and I hope you enjoy!\r\n\r\nThanks again, \r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20425,'787f2b7ea2','Thanks Playa\',  I appreciate the extra effort.  Do you do FET mods ?  I might be interested in having some done on a Booster BIT.'),(20426,'5e1426297a','Thanks Playa\',  I appreciate the extra effort.  Do you do FET mods ?  I might be interested in having some done on a Booster BIT.'),(20427,'787f2b7ea2','Thanks Playa\',  I appreciate the extra effort.  Do you do FET mods ?  I might be interested in having some done on a Booster BIT.'),(20428,'5e1426297a','Thanks Playa\',  I appreciate the extra effort.  Do you do FET mods ?  I might be interested in having some done on a Booster BIT.'),(20429,'646a1b7a4e','[quote:646a1b7a4e=\"Jackd\"]Thanks Playa\',  I appreciate the extra effort.  Do you do FET mods ?  I might be interested in having some done on a Booster BIT.[/quote:646a1b7a4e]Yeah, I don\'t advertise, but if anyone ask, I\'m more than happy to mod people\'s cars.\r\n\r\nI usually charge $10+shipping for a FET mod. \r\n\r\nHonestly, I think all the FETs I have now are gonna be used for auction cars, but I should get a new batch of FETs soon. If you\'re interested, let me know, and I\'ll try to arrange to order some more FETs sooner.\r\n\r\nDave'),(20430,'646a1b7a4e','[quote:646a1b7a4e=\"Jackd\"]Thanks Playa\',  I appreciate the extra effort.  Do you do FET mods ?  I might be interested in having some done on a Booster BIT.[/quote:646a1b7a4e]Yeah, I don\'t advertise, but if anyone ask, I\'m more than happy to mod people\'s cars.\r\n\r\nI usually charge $10+shipping for a FET mod. \r\n\r\nHonestly, I think all the FETs I have now are gonna be used for auction cars, but I should get a new batch of FETs soon. If you\'re interested, let me know, and I\'ll try to arrange to order some more FETs sooner.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20431,'6d1e9671fb','Hey, when I said I\'d send you a FETed PCB for that car, I didn\'t realize this past weekend was the 4th, so I got nothing done.\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna try really hard to get it done this week, but if you just wanted to call your auction car done as is, I\'ll still go ahead and send it to you, and you can use it for yourself, if you\'d like.\r\n\r\n\r\nDave'),(20432,'88128bd8ea','no sweat bro i didnt get anything done over the weekend either. :cool:'),(20433,'88128bd8ea','no sweat bro i didnt get anything done over the weekend either. :cool:'),(20434,'8a34f751f2','hey man just got back form the beach... all looks good..\r\nkeep me informed...'),(21666,'401bae6f43','[quote:401bae6f43=\"Whitesupra35\"]how do you tab lower my supra rides high on my seand so dus my savanah sumtin dus to help please[/quote:401bae6f43]Welle what I do is cut a strip of plastic the width of the tabs. I test fit in the boddy, and when it close, I just keep sanding untill it fitsin perfectly snug.\r\n\r\nOn the SE, I shave the tab off the front, and you know how it kinda sticks up in the front of the chassis where the boddy tab is? I basically shave that all the way off, down until it\'s level. Then I\'ll cut off a piece of the plastic I shaved to fit the body slot, and super glue that into place. With super glue it\'s important not to reposition, and to leave it until it dries thoroughly. I\'ll glob some extra on there, and give an hour or so to dry. If that too loww, I stack a piece of plastic or 2 to raise it back up.\r\n\r\nThe rear tab is trickier. You know how there\'s that area that holds the screw in, below the tab? You\'ll have to glue bits of plastic oeither side of that, until it\'s as low as you want, and then you\'ll have to carve out your tab, that you\'ll cut out from your strip you already sized, to fit around that piece sticking out the bottom of that tab. Unlessyou build up the plastic to the bottom of that thing, then you can just glue your tab straight to the bottom.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI don\'t know if that makes sense, it\'s hard to paint a visual pictures with words, but that\'s the best I can explain it.\r\n\r\ndave'),(20437,'55bf98d071','Are you back on, or using your Dad\'s comp?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20444,'27addfb993','can you help me with setting up my phpBB forums?'),(20441,'9a06fddd1a','cool\r\n :-D'),(20447,'c304c19e07','[quote:c304c19e07=\"synj\"]can you help me with setting up my phpBB forums?[/quote:c304c19e07]you should read the instructions that come with it when you download it.\r\nit explains how to do it.\r\nI don\'t have time to do that for you.'),(20448,'5e40219b95','ok, i got the forums working! yay!\r\n...but when i go to post something, where teh smilies are supposed to\r\nbe there is only the words describing the smilies.\r\nDo you know how to fix this?'),(20449,'5e40219b95','ok, i got the forums working! yay!\r\n...but when i go to post something, where teh smilies are supposed to\r\nbe there is only the words describing the smilies.\r\nDo you know how to fix this?'),(20450,'d94304133d','[quote:d94304133d=\"synj\"]ok, i got the forums working! yay!\r\n...but when i go to post something, where teh smilies are supposed to\r\nbe there is only the words describing the smilies.\r\nDo you know how to fix this?[/quote:d94304133d]no, sorry, I don\'t know. you should go to the phpbb support forums.'),(20451,'d94304133d','[quote:d94304133d=\"synj\"]ok, i got the forums working! yay!\r\n...but when i go to post something, where teh smilies are supposed to\r\nbe there is only the words describing the smilies.\r\nDo you know how to fix this?[/quote:d94304133d]no, sorry, I don\'t know. you should go to the phpbb support forums.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20453,'b9546d4fd6','lol\r\n\r\n\"that\'l be an interesting one to watch\"'),(20454,'e66b336cd5','Well, i can\'t go making a dick outta myself using my own good name...lol. I get bored sometimes... the other boards need some headaches for bein\' so shitty. They\'re almost beggin\' for it.'),(20457,'7133bb188a','damn straight. lol\r\n\r\nwe also figured out the other part of the pump meister deuche conspiracy. :-)'),(20458,'aeab3354f8','[quote:aeab3354f8=\"hogjowlz\"]we also figured out the other part of the pump meister deuche conspiracy. :-)[/quote:aeab3354f8]\r\n\r\nShit, that\'s old-school... I actually had to sit and think what you were talking about. It was hard to not fuck with the dude who couldn\'t spell his own name. Shit, you guys are like Magnum fuckin\' P.I... nice work!'),(20461,'4d455592ec','holmes..\r\n\r\njohnny holmes'),(20486,'b4122d1db9','the people at this forum were jackasses to me. i said i wouldn;t  come back for a while. as far as editing the picture, someone else did that out of hatred. every time i post they make fun of my and they change my pictures. so if u wanna talk to me my AIM screen name is bigsho22288'),(20464,'8d788975b3','DUDE, DO NOT SEND YET! I AM GOING TO THE BEACH TOMMAROW AND WILL NOT BE BACK UNTILL Sunday! PLEASE DO NOT SEND! Btw, the wide tires got lost, so instead, ill send you 2 or 3 bit bodies ok?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20465,'dea294c368','oh sounds good i could realy use bodys and that untested chassis will help out a bunch . i will go get the stuff out of the mail box , i\'ll wait to send .'),(20472,'48241e32bb','Yeah, I found the green gear to be just a little too extreme. Great top end speed, but I never had enough room to get there, and I would rather have the torque up front. Which is what you get with the red gear, even more so with the blue KIT racer gear. I almost never use stock orange gears anymore. Teal is usually my lowest, and the cars I race the most have blue and red KIT gears with mosfetted PCBs.'),(33258,'6b2103ff0b','Hey ph2t heres the pics i did not get the I have the 2 white diff but did not get them in the pic since i have to dig through my parts box to find them and its getting somewhat late here if you still need a pic of them i can pm you one tomorrow.\r\n\r\n\r\nI found 2 long AWD shafts and 1 Short AWD shaft \r\n\r\nThe cobra body Some residue from a elec tape stripe i had on there it should be removed easily with the right liquid remover or soft cloth.\r\n\r\n[img:6b2103ff0b]http://i3.photobucket.com/albums/y78/tuner1989/DSCN0409.jpg[/img:6b2103ff0b]\r\n\r\n[img:6b2103ff0b]http://i3.photobucket.com/albums/y78/tuner1989/DSCN0411.jpg[/img:6b2103ff0b]\r\nI love this cars badass look\r\n\r\n[img:6b2103ff0b]http://i3.photobucket.com/albums/y78/tuner1989/DSCN0412.jpg[/img:6b2103ff0b]\r\nThe front bumper is really the only really worn part of the car from racing on my touring track. Ouch wall!\r\n\r\nIt has most of the body kit and some pipes i slapped on the back a week or 2 ago.  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIts not in perfect condition Since i have been driving it but hey im sure it will get way more wear and tear from you. Lol &gt;:) \r\n\r\n\r\nSo in all i have the mustang with associated bk parts\r\n\r\n2 Long AWD Cup joints\r\n\r\n1 Short AWD Cup joint\r\n\r\nAnd 2 white gear diff not pictured i have to go hunting for them.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt \r\n\r\nLet me know what you think.'),(37889,'c7263fc678','Do you think you could part with one of your plasmatomics?\r\nI would order the parts to make one myself but i need one by tuesday next week, and overseas shipping can take a long time.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36149,'a709c0d513','Well, you would get everything I have for it including the H8 electronics that are currently installed and the parts that are coming for it.\r\n\r\nThere is a brand new stocker diff (I like it with thick grease better than the BB diffs), new clear chassis, new clear front gearbox and chrome gearbox. The alloy/titanium parts. oil shocks, etc, etc. Custom front bumper, titanium-shaft GPM BB diff, kyosho shock mounts. Too much to list. Buttloads of parts and whatnot. Over $1000 in it. I have all sorts of tuner parts here and there.\r\n\r\nI\'ll include the old kyosho board if you want, but it needs a turbo.board to work in anything.\r\n\r\nI\'ll take $225 including USPS Priority w/ $200 in insurance &amp; paypal fees.\r\n\r\npaypal joseph.yarbrough@gmail.com if you want it.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n-JNY'),(35926,'47eada2e08','Hey man, glad you like the design.  Im visiting my parents at the moment but when i go back to my apartment later this week ill give you a detailed description and try to find some more pictures for you.  Hope you can wait a few days.\r\n\r\nSTG'),(29629,'bfff59aba9','Did you see my post in the moderators forum this morning? I think dark tari deleted it. Cause it\'s gone now, and I don\'t think you or cabo would do that.\r\n\r\nI was saying I\'m pissed that i tried to make some nice prizes, and this has been the slowest turnout yet. I feel like thanks guys that makes me feel real good.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I gotta calm down before i take action, but if I find out DT deleted my post, I\'m out of here, I will not stand for being censored. I\'ll start my own forum, me and my wife know all that php shit.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35697,'4f28e3d216','I have to ask... You mentioned something about the brushless CD motors a while ago.\r\n\r\nWould you have an idea where to buy the neo mags needed for a project like that? I have accrued a large collection of brushless motors. I\'ve re-wound several of those stators for practice. But now comes the completion time.. I need some flat neo magnets to fit. Any ideas?\r\n\r\nAlso I need a simple brushless controller, would there be a way to salvage one from a CD drive?'),(29805,'54a51d55f0','I\'ll look.   :cool:'),(29806,'936582a68f','Hey, i had a question for ya,, what scale slot car are you using for your diecast bit?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nSporttracguy'),(37782,'7b722dd43b','Shipped :cool: \r\n\r\nYou gonna be seein it by the end of the week :)'),(36760,'f15dc3b99f','What kind of knuckles? I will send you all the bodies...what are you sendin..'),(35949,'ccbc835a27','I can\'t, but I\'ll try! :lol: \r\n\r\nThanks man, I\'m very interested in trying out this project.  Just one more question, would you consider it to be a hard project for a first project?  I haven\'t found anything willing to try that isn\'t too hard, nor do I have the time to make up a design (school, work, sleep, food....), so I am willing to try your idea.'),(30071,'d6582035d6','Well I\'ll do a review on it once I get mine. I think a lot of people respect my unbiased point of view. Seems like more people would be interested if they knew exactly what it does. I\'ve only heard a couple people mention it. When I asked about it a while back I was given link back to MRCC, and I think that place leaves a sour taste in a lot of the pimp\'s mouths. :lol: \r\n\r\nAnyways, I\'ll go ahead and make sure to get you the money this weekend so you can get it out Monday, if that is not a problem.\r\n\r\nOh yeah, and I forgot to ask, I\'m assuming you got installation instructions out there somewhere, on your website or something?\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20481,'ebecad3b68','[quote:ebecad3b68=\"SuperFly\"]Yeah, I found the green gear to be just a little too extreme. Great top end speed, but I never had enough room to get there, and I would rather have the torque up front. Which is what you get with the red gear, even more so with the blue KIT racer gear. I almost never use stock orange gears anymore. Teal is usually my lowest, and the cars I race the most have blue and red KIT gears with mosfetted PCBs.[/quote:ebecad3b68]Yeah that all makes sense. Orange gears are a bit too much with FETs. It\'s kinda hard to drive when it\'s pulling the front wheels off the ground all the time, that\'s why I was just half FETing cars for a while, but now I\'m running more cars with Teal gears, and I think that\'s ideal, but if I got hold of a set of those blue gears I bet I\'d think that was ideal. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo I\'m looking forward to trying the green gears. :smile: \r\n\r\nHave you tried stacking FETs? I recall ph2t running a car with some kind of ratio in the 3:1 range, with tristacked FETs, or his Biff turbo, or something, and it was kicking. \r\n\r\nI\'m figuring that\'s what I\'m gonna have to do to make the green gears useful, because this kinda reminds me of my original Bit Char-G trying to pull that pink endbell 3.8, back in the day. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(20483,'5091a19000','[quote:5091a19000=\"SuperFly\"][quote:5091a19000=\"ph2t\"][quote:5091a19000=\"SuperFly\"]I\'m interested in a Whoa Nelly for my MR02. I think I want the 1.1, and I think hue35 wants one as well that can be shipped in the same package. How much were they? Do you have any available for delivery?\r\n\r\nThanks man,\r\n\r\nSuperFly[/quote:5091a19000]\r\n\r\nhey mate, nelly 1.1 costs $25USD a pop, i can throw two into the same bag, shipping would be $5, 7-10 day airmail...\r\n\r\nI have two left out of my current batch that are halfway through production.  made the pcb\'s, put the mosfets on, yet to solder up the cables n shit.  I should have them done by the end of the w/e, ship \'em out early next week, no sweats...\r\n\r\nI\'m building the install doc currently, it\'s a fucken bitch, reminds me too much of my work doco, as you\'ll see when it\'s finished...\r\nbasically you solder the two fatass power wires to the batt +/- terminals, solder four wires onto the rx pcb.  the shit\'s color coded so you can\'t go wrong, lol..... \r\n\r\ndunno if you\'ve seen the latest developments man but check out the nelly thread at brucemicro, there\'s some pics of how she looks.....\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nfellow coffee freak..[/quote:5091a19000]\r\n\r\nYeah I sifted through the goku shit in that thread. You\'ve really improved it from a slick package/low profile point of view. I have to admit I did have a hard time trying to figure out why one would choose the 1.0 vs. the 1.1, and still don\'t know. The installation seems like a piece of cake compared to mosfetting bit PCBs. Are there any issues you know of with an MR02 chassis, where your wires go into the PCB?\r\n\r\nSo I\'m gonna Paypal you $55 tomorrow for 2, shipped, right?\r\n\r\nBTW, did you want me to check into ordering you some fets from Digikey?[/quote:5091a19000]\r\n\r\nhey man, paypal me the $55USD at ph2t@tpg.com.au, cheers....\r\n\r\nI\'ll catch up with you later, it\'s 2:19am here and I\'ve fuken tired....   more details shortly/.....\r\n\r\ncheers mate, \r\n\r\nmatt.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20487,'4b9ddb9eac','im dealing with a moron. ill unlock it in a few days aiaite?'),(20488,'5118ab9e29','[quote:5118ab9e29=\"hogjowlz\"]holy fuck.\r\n\r\ncharlie contributing something legit   :eek:[/quote:5118ab9e29]\r\n\r\nlol :-)'),(20489,'5118ab9e29','[quote:5118ab9e29=\"hogjowlz\"]holy fuck.\r\n\r\ncharlie contributing something legit   :eek:[/quote:5118ab9e29]\r\n\r\nlol :-)'),(21293,'9a489c0b34','Dont find tomany Polynesians on the boards ...Props  ;-)\r\n\r\nMANY Tongan and Samoan peeps over here.'),(20491,'4ffadc8bf6','what the hell is a bitGimp?'),(31467,'2a1e439a35','Hey there heres the adress as it should be written on the package . I will pack the digi-q up so as soon as the mt gets here i can post it right off for you with no delay. anyway here it is.\r\n\r\nJoe Fullager\r\n3 Dorothy Road\r\nLaingholm\r\nAuckland\r\n1007\r\nNew Zealand.\r\n\r\nmany thanks , and a pleasure doing buisness with you sir.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW : I thaught id let you have it even though the other guy said he would give me 3 body\'s and wheels/batts ect . He has made a nuisance of himself around here . You where also there first so its only fair. :cool:'),(26705,'6df06e7787','[quote:6df06e7787=\"honda_s2000\"]hey sg219 ,\r\nhave u got any zz mt\'s that u would sell me ? i will pay a descent price for one , or if you know of anyone who has a few and would flog me one,\r\ncheers,\r\nh20 :cool:[/quote:6df06e7787]\r\n\r\nI\'ll get you some prices and get back to you tomarrow.\r\n\r\nDrop me your addy so I can check shipping.\r\n\r\nSG');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (25388,'6d10768958','np, have a look around the site... this problems been encountered before many a time.   there will be information about this in topics like \"tab lowering\"   and motor clip fix in the how to section.   \r\n\r\n you\'ll learn a lot more that way, and by reading up on the older pages you will have fun along the way...   enjoy... z.'),(24886,'e458848c3b','you are beatiful'),(20493,'bc66875606','[quote:bc66875606=\"SuperFly\"][quote:bc66875606=\"ph2t\"][quote:bc66875606=\"SuperFly\"]I\'m interested in a Whoa Nelly for my MR02. I think I want the 1.1, and I think hue35 wants one as well that can be shipped in the same package. How much were they? Do you have any available for delivery?\r\n\r\nThanks man,\r\n\r\nSuperFly[/quote:bc66875606]\r\n\r\nhey mate, nelly 1.1 costs $25USD a pop, i can throw two into the same bag, shipping would be $5, 7-10 day airmail...\r\n\r\nI have two left out of my current batch that are halfway through production.  made the pcb\'s, put the mosfets on, yet to solder up the cables n shit.  I should have them done by the end of the w/e, ship \'em out early next week, no sweats...\r\n\r\nI\'m building the install doc currently, it\'s a fucken bitch, reminds me too much of my work doco, as you\'ll see when it\'s finished...\r\nbasically you solder the two fatass power wires to the batt +/- terminals, solder four wires onto the rx pcb.  the shit\'s color coded so you can\'t go wrong, lol..... \r\n\r\ndunno if you\'ve seen the latest developments man but check out the nelly thread at brucemicro, there\'s some pics of how she looks.....\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nfellow coffee freak..[/quote:bc66875606]\r\n\r\nYeah I sifted through the goku shit in that thread. You\'ve really improved it from a slick package/low profile point of view. I have to admit I did have a hard time trying to figure out why one would choose the 1.0 vs. the 1.1, and still don\'t know. The installation seems like a piece of cake compared to mosfetting bit PCBs. Are there any issues you know of with an MR02 chassis, where your wires go into the PCB?\r\n\r\nSo I\'m gonna Paypal you $55 tomorrow for 2, shipped, right?\r\n\r\nBTW, did you want me to check into ordering you some fets from Digikey?[/quote:bc66875606]\r\n\r\nOk, had some sleep so I can now make a bit of sense.......   Basically nelly 1.0 is not as good as the 1.1  There is a slight cost difference, but not enough to make it feasible in a cost structure/marketing sense.  Nelly 1.2 will be totally different and will have a new pcb construction.  1.2 will cost more but when you see that it\'s approz equal to a 16x2 stack of fets, I believe the costs are reasonable....\r\n\r\nthanks for the offer of the digikey order Greg,  I appreciate that mate. I will prolly take you up on it at a later stage as I got a batch at the mo.  I will of course re-imburse you for your efforts....\r\n\r\nas for any particular issues with an mr02 chassis and the physical wiring I really wouldn\'t know I\'m sorry.  no-one in the local group has one.  shit I want one though.  I\'ve gone through my fucken 7th first servo gear and I\'m sick of busting it!  the mr02 has the servo saver spring system on the front servo gearbox which would save $$ in the long run.....\r\nthe pcb is the same in the madforce and mr02, they both have the brake function.  from the photo\'s I\'ve seen on the net though man the layout is the same.  I\'ve got pics for the mini-z and iwaver and CJ helpout last night and got me a pic for the xmod PCB.\r\n\r\nCheers dude,\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(27248,'660ceffd9c','[quote:660ceffd9c=\"sg219\"][quote:660ceffd9c=\"Bird\"]yeah that\'s cool...\r\n\r\nI\'ll charge \'em all :-) \r\n\r\nYa bringin\' that bare xmod chassis?[/quote:660ceffd9c]\r\n\r\nYou gettin\' me high? :-)[/quote:660ceffd9c]\r\n\r\nIs the pope Polish?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20497,'71b8d23732','It was the dist. cap again!  The 3rd time in 6 months!!'),(20501,'a98cdadd6b','sorta, the inspection is up at the end of the month.\r\n\r\ndoors don\'t work\r\nleaks gas\r\nstutters\r\nleaks and burns oil\r\nemissions is all fucked up/has waiver currently\r\nneeds 2 back tires to pass\r\nneeds oil changed real bad\r\nheadlights need replaced\r\nmoney$$$money$$$money$$$ and lots of it that damn thing needs!!!!'),(20505,'c42dc27206','ya, its runnin..........'),(20574,'0adc93cb60','yeah dude its all goodi can understand how hte hectic life goes well htanx for replying ill be talking to you more threw this :)'),(27913,'f40420defa','Woooooooooooooord!!!\r\n\r\nOh... those damn turnbuckles are too long... probly for stampede or sumfin... I gotta cut them down.'),(24107,'e6286e37c2','Jae Throssel\r\n2513 South Edgewater Drive\r\nFayetteville, NC 28303'),(20509,'ad4a2ca433','Thanks, they did put a notice on it.  But when Pops talked to the office guy, he said it was cool for another day or two.  He said it would of been allright there for awhile longer if he would of just known who\'s it was.\r\n\r\nBut ya, its cool, I need rear tires real bad, real quick!!  One is getting ready to explode, a belt is broke I think!!!  Boom!! \r\n\r\n\r\nTalk to you later, time to crash in a little bit! :cool:'),(37171,'c19e3414e6','Later generation 01 pcb\'s have brakes (not 100% they were made available in ready sets as the only ones I\'ve ever personally seen were boards only)...mine\'s an older one without though.\r\n\r\nre:motor mount....  http://www.pnracing.us/new/product.php?show=product&amp;id=90\r\n\r\nI was going by this.  Say\'s it\'s usuable with the MR01 or an MR02-RM and can use either the MR01 ball dif or add another bearing(?) and use a MR02 ball diff.\r\n\r\nI would guess it requires some modification to a MR01 H-plate to fit the narrow chassis mount on the MR02. That\'s easily done though.\r\n\r\nWhen I \'stopped\' with the MR01 the MR02 hadn\'t been released so it\'s like learning all over again.\r\n\r\nre:foams\r\n\r\nYes, yes.  had a look at those on Ausmicro!  Looks like must have items!  Not sure I\'d have a use for the softs (just how soft are they?) but the mediums and hards got my attention.  You were running them on the chassis you were racing in ph2t\'s back yard right? The conrete racing video..');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (30551,'855d060f54','Just wondering what you\'ve been up to. :???: \r\n\r\nBeen workin\' on the vintage Vespa?\r\n\r\nEver cast the Impala?\r\n\r\nLater, \r\n\r\nMike'),(20524,'b3a1faadd2','Well shit, I\'m jinxed as all hell tonight.\r\n\r\nI painted that RX-7 body to see how my paint would react to these bodies, and it came out smooth as shit. So I thought it was safe to clear coat the windows on this car, but as the clear coat dried it started geting a textured effect, which essentially fooged the windows. So I can rub that out with rubbing compound in 2 days, but now I know my pictures are not gonna be perfect, and I\'m getting frustrated, so I think I got a little sloppy with my detailing. It\'s not bad, I just wanted it to be perfect, and again I had practiced on the RX-7, only to get sloppy here. :roll:\r\n\r\nSo I put it on the chassis. I got the back tab lowered, and I painted the wheels. When it\'s all together it looks f\'in pimp as hell, except the windows, but it\'s good enough for pictures. I go to take a picture, and my stupid ass battery suckin camera has sucked the batteries dry again. That is pissing me off I\'m starting to think it\'s defective. :mad:\r\n\r\nSo I\'m giving the batteries a quick zap on my xmod charger. Hopefully they\'ll have enoughj juice to eek out some pictures in a half an hour\r\n\r\n(frustarted)dave'),(20563,'9bc41606e8','It\'s all good Pimp!\r\n\r\nI looks okay.  How are the hobby shops in your area?\r\nI bought some Tamiya Acrylic Clear in a smoke that\'s great for window \r\ntinting. I\'ll try it on my latest ride.  Also I got it in red, orange &amp; yellow, it works great for lights, make \'em look real ! I\'ll speak more on that later.\r\n\r\nI\'ve tried the spray on type but it sucks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37298,'606e874244','that seems like an ok deal, there\'s probably better but you never know when they will come around.\r\n\r\ni personally wouldn\'t buy anymore iwavers, i\'m all about the mr02 now. but iwavers still work good and teach you a lot about the hobby :-o'),(32837,'3eb5f92d3d','Still not here yet...  :( \r\nI checked with the post office, and without a shipping number or something, they haven\'t got any way to track it.\r\nAlthough if it came by ground mail, they said it could take anywhere between 4 - 6 weeks.'),(32838,'15d6d94027','grrrr.  I checked w/ the post office as well and sending it via United States Postal they don\'t offer tracking at all...  If I sent it UPS or Fed Ex I would have been able to, but that would have cost easily an extra $5-$15.  Sorry about the insane delay.  Everything was written down just as you said, I just hope it gets to you soon.'),(37175,'b7f4a15fd3','Yeah, gonna have to research that mount a little more...would be sweet if it works.\r\n\r\nI think Aaron has that mount listed in the ausmicro shop...  \r\n\r\nhttp://shop.ausmicro.net/product_info.php?cPath=21_37&amp;products_id=81\r\n\r\nI do believe I\'ll be getting to know him better once I get over there.  Them is some GREAT prices.  You can really see the lack of getting hammered in shipping reflected in the prices.'),(37176,'b7f4a15fd3','Yeah, gonna have to research that mount a little more...would be sweet if it works.\r\n\r\nI think Aaron has that mount listed in the ausmicro shop...  \r\n\r\nhttp://shop.ausmicro.net/product_info.php?cPath=21_37&amp;products_id=81\r\n\r\nI do believe I\'ll be getting to know him better once I get over there.  Them is some GREAT prices.  You can really see the lack of getting hammered in shipping reflected in the prices.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37177,'634e0df2d8','aaron is the official australian distributor for pn racing so if you ever have trouble getting their stuff give him a call :-o'),(31399,'a07b433672','Hi there , \r\nI saw your red hummer on ride of the month , and basicly i wanted it .\r\nI really like it , and was wondering if you would sell/trade it .\r\nif so how much / what for.If not then dont worry .\r\nEither way , \r\nNICE RIDE !'),(26661,'aaf64a810f','i did a couple for people, i usually charged about usd$70 for the whole deal. but that was way too cheap. considering the labour and everything i really should have charged like $200!! micro engineers would probably charge more! :shock:'),(37912,'901ed9dca2','[quote:901ed9dca2=\"Maxximum Attack\"]It\'s still in florida but my skybox has moved:\r\n\r\nRasheed Sabir\r\n1900 NW 97th Ave\r\nSTE 716993\r\nMiami\r\nFlorida 33172\r\n\r\nAny word on the GPM stuff for the 2nd group buy?\r\n\r\nThanx\r\nMaxx[/quote:901ed9dca2]\r\n\r\nNot yet!\r\n\r\nI\'ll let everyone know when I do find out.'),(37913,'0efbfb9533','Can do.  It will be a few months before I really get into production mode, but if I produce one that kicks ass before then, then I\'ll send it to you for free if you give it a review.  In fact, the first one I want to work on will be a spiral armeture.  With a spiral armeture, fat comm and winding for torque with some good neo mags and a bb case it should have some interesting performance.  That may be exactly what you want.  Wont know until I make it though.  I\'ll keep everybody posted.\r\n\r\nI don\'t mind giving a few out for free at first so I can get some reviews on my motors from other people besides myself.  If I really want to sell these motors and make a few ducks off it, then I need to get some good advertisement.\r\n\r\nI\'ll be sure to send one out to you first.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34669,'df81dae55c','your never on msn any more.'),(34670,'df81dae55c','your never on msn any more.'),(30889,'223b177c53','GPM ; knuckles, shaft, cups'),(24100,'4419c3a7e9','Hey shoot me your address so I can get those cars out tomorrow.\r\n\r\nDave'),(24395,'ae2774bdc0','[quote:ae2774bdc0=\"DarkTari\"][b:ae2774bdc0]Tip#1:[/b:ae2774bdc0]\r\n\r\nAs a practice, when cutting a convertable, Targa, or T-Top, ALWAYS stop \r\nyour cut just before the top of the door.  At that point you can file it down \r\nto where you want and not hafta build it back up with puddy.   8-)[/quote:ae2774bdc0]\r\n\r\nand dont do it with a dremel :) .. thats what happend i used a dremel and sanded to mcuh... But thanx for the tip !'),(20519,'15b25b84eb','[quote:15b25b84eb=\"DarkTari\"]That\'s Cool!  You should\'ve recieved the package today (2da delivery)[/quote:15b25b84eb]D\'oh, that sucks. Our mailbox keys didn\'t work, they\'re retooling our locks. They said to check back in a couple days for the keys.\r\n\r\nAnyways, these guys are cool, they will take large packages for us. So it\'s more than likely in the office. I\'ll check in tomorrow after work.\r\n\r\n[quote:15b25b84eb]We\'re gonna need something to put on Da Block next week!\r\n\r\n\r\nOUt ![/quote:15b25b84eb]Well, if I get a chassis to put under your\'e body by Saturday, we\'re in business. That shouldn\'t be too big of a problem, but I think it\'s time to mix it up a bit. So i think hog should put his car up next. I\'m sure that thing will be butt kickin\' with just a SE battery, FETs won\'t really be necessary. I sent Hog a PM saying I\'m still gonna send him a FETed board, but he can keep that for himself. I needed to hook him up with some FETs anyways.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOn a side note, I had a couple wild projects planned, but now I\'m thinking if I pull that stuff off, I\'d have to keep \'em for myself, so my next project I hope to have done in the coming weeks is \'01 SS Camaro, chopped down to bit size, drop top of coarse. Check out that Zip Zap body, it has a really short hoodline, I think that\'d translate well into a bit, doncha?\r\n\r\ndave'),(20521,'a9ce2a543f','Sorry for not replying Dave but I didn\'t get any of your PM\'s from the 6th&gt;on til [b:a9ce2a543f]Today[/b:a9ce2a543f]  :???: \r\n\r\nDon\'t stretch anything, do a quick FET, I\'ll do da rest.\r\n\r\nFunny I read about you getting the KIT when you posted the RX7, but didn\'t get your PM\'s til today ???????  Gotta check wit C-Dub about that.\r\nI guess I need to catch up on your PM\'s to get the latest.......');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20522,'64848e3953','It\'s almost ready. I\'m giving the paint an hour to dry, meantime I\'m gonna try to dab in the details. I can get the FETs in first thing tomorrow morning, they aren\'t needed for pics.\r\n\r\nSo stay tuned, I have pics ready in the next hour or 2. (It\'s 8:00 here, 10 bitpimps time, so I\'m just cutting it. :lol:)\r\n\r\nPray nothing goes seriously wrong in the next hour, I proud of this paint job, I think it\'s pretty sick. :cool: \r\n\r\nDave'),(20523,'1f066a17c4','I\'m just getting CaveyDave\'s PM\'s from July 6th up til now today ?????\r\n\r\nAny thoughs !   Just lettin ya know!'),(20525,'87a242869a','Take your time Dave, The Celica is goin back on Da Block !'),(20526,'d6e6f5cb6f','I was just jinxed tonight. Can\'t get a decent pic without sunlight, so I\'m gonna have to shoot in the morning.\r\n\r\nHere\'s a preview.\r\n[img:d6e6f5cb6f]http://crazybydesign.net/crazycars/collab.jpg[/img:d6e6f5cb6f]\r\n\r\nDave'),(20527,'f5ecc076ee','That\'s Pimpin Dave!  I like the scheme!\r\nABout the windows, I thought I taped the insides of them, and usually when I clear coat, I remove the exterior tape from the windows but leave the inside tape on.   Removing after everthing is dried on the outside.  If you didn\'t that [u:f5ecc076ee]may[/u:f5ecc076ee] explain the window issue, if not then I\'m stump\'d cause I never had that happen and I\'ve done 3 of these already and you\'ve done a couple too.   :???: \r\n\r\nI guess I\'m all caught up now.  Thanx a lot Dave!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20529,'8dbf0fc1f8','C-Dub,\r\n\r\nPlease contact winner about payment.\r\n\r\nIf he wants to PayPal, then have him contact Dave since he\'s the only one of us IC that has PayPal...\r\n\r\nThanx!'),(20530,'a9ce2a543f','Sorry for not replying Dave but I didn\'t get any of your PM\'s from the 6th&gt;on til [b:a9ce2a543f]Today[/b:a9ce2a543f]  :???: \r\n\r\nDon\'t stretch anything, do a quick FET, I\'ll do da rest.\r\n\r\nFunny I read about you getting the KIT when you posted the RX7, but didn\'t get your PM\'s til today ???????  Gotta check wit C-Dub about that.\r\nI guess I need to catch up on your PM\'s to get the latest.......'),(20531,'87a242869a','Take your time Dave, The Celica is goin back on Da Block !'),(20551,'c024d56ebb','[quote:c024d56ebb=\"betty.k\"]fuck! lots to list!\r\n\r\niwaver: rx pcb, servo\r\n\r\nkyosho: clear chassis set, tierod, motor housing, screwset, xspeed motor, cf h plate, front springset(yellow), cf/alloy stabilizer bar, 20 degree tyres\r\n\r\nwfc: bearings, knuckles, wheelnuts\r\n\r\nxtra speed: 9t pinion, diff gear\r\n\r\nmegatech: triple alloy rear shockset\r\n\r\ntopcad: alloy bulkhead, motor clip\r\n\r\nyeah racing: crystals, wide alloy wheelset\r\n\r\nsecond hand ball diff, whoah nelly 1.0\r\n\r\n i think that\'s it. probably cost about $200us to get to this point.[/quote:c024d56ebb]\r\n\r\nWFC???\r\n\r\nOh, and what\'s the name/s of the site/s where you buy this shiat? :cool:'),(20552,'2c85abc979','toyeast\r\nhttp://www.toyeast.com/index2.asp\r\n\r\nrcmart\r\nhttp://www.rcmart.com/catalog/login.php\r\n\r\nand ebay. just hit the search section, that\'s what i do. shit from china seems to be the cheapest.\r\nand i forget what wfc stands for now, some aftermarket cheapy brand.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20534,'1f066a17c4','I\'m just getting CaveyDave\'s PM\'s from July 6th up til now today ?????\r\n\r\nAny thoughs !   Just lettin ya know!'),(37247,'0107eb641a','D\'oh!  Got an email from the guy I\'m buying the )2 from and he\'s informed me it\'s now out of stock but he should have some by the end of the week!?  I guess it\'s not that big a deal as I\'m in no rush for it.\r\n\r\nWhile hunting around some Canadian RC forums I found a used Mini-t for sale.  \r\n\r\nOne complete RTR w/bearings, 3 battery packs (1 new),  two stock transmitters and two stock ESC units, two bodies, several sets tires/rims (tires not in best shape, but still very usable) and some misc small parts (springs, etc) all for $100CAN shipped.  \r\n\r\nWanted something for rougher conditions but didn\'t want to spend a fortune.  Will see how it runs when I get it then get a few upgrades (oil dampers will be the first on the list as will some new tires). Then maybe some metal (A-Arms, shock towers, etc)'),(33319,'a4cfcca2c4','Guess what just showed up in the mo\'fuckin post!?\r\n\r\nAll present and accounted for - the box looks like it got kicked from the states, not flown, but its all here.\r\n\r\nThanks man.  Phew.  9 weeks - i was worried there for a while!\r\n\r\nOh, btw, I can\'t get the ZZSE to charge right - i turn on the controller, turn the car to OFF and put it on.  The light blinks red for about 15 seconds, then goes yellow (red &amp; green together).  Turn it on to try and run it, and no good. Any thoughts on what I\'m doin wrong?  (i\'ve checked it on all six selections on the controller too - no luck)\r\n\r\nBut jeez, just so glad it all got here safe!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37573,'9578c04a96','great, you seem like a good kid. I started here a little older than you, but I didn\'t post as much. Lurk around, pop up in active threads, sometimes you get away with asking a small question (that\'s related to the thread), and get an answer other than &quot;go search&quot;. But i suggest you do more reading than posting for now.\r\n\r\nHere\'s a job for ya, take one of your ZZ\'s and give it some custom paint, put in a racing stripe and lower it. That\'s it. But here\'s the twist, you can\'t ask anyone for help. Don\'t tell anyone that you\'re doing it. If you have any really pressing questions PM me, if the Q\'s are too easy, I won\'t answer otherwise I\'ll reply ASAP. ok?\r\n\r\nSo you come, surf the boards, see what everyone is up to, then get to work, search for how to paint, lower and maybe you can find another simple mod to do while you\'re searching, surprise me ;).\r\n\r\nWhen you drop this pimped ride on the guys, you\'ll see how involved you become.\r\nNote well, I\'m not telling you to stop posting. Throw any Qs at me and see what I come up with.\r\n\r\nMaxx'),(37254,'568b031283','Have you recieved your stuff yet?\r\n\r\nAlso the stuff you sent me, did you manage to include the bevel gear for the driveshaft in the front for AWD? I just wanted to know, because if you don\'t I have to go searchin for that part.\r\n\r\nthanks man talk to you soon.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36964,'ffe8f373d9','Have you down for:\r\n\r\nPART ID	DESCRIPTION	UNIT PRICE 	Price 	? \r\nDXME009T	DELRIN MOTOR GEAR (9T) - 1PC	$1.30	$1.30	1\r\nDXME009TA	DELRIN MOTOR GEAR (9T) WITH ALLOY TRAY &amp; SCREWS - 1PC SET	$1.90	$1.90	1\r\nDXME100R	DELRIN REAR BALL DIFFERENTIAL - 1 COMPLETED SET	 $15.50 	$10.08	1\r\nDXME1224T	DELRIN MAIN GEAR (12T/24T) - 2PCS SET	 $3.50 	$3.50	1\r\nXME012A	ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET	 $11.90 	$7.74	1\r\nXME013A	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET 	 $23.90 	$15.54	1\r\nXME013B	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX REAR COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET 	 $11.90 	$7.74	1\r\nXME021	ALLOY FRONT KNUCKLE ARM - 1PR	 $9.90 	$6.44	1\r\nXME022	ALLOY REAR KNUCKLE ARM -1 PR	 $9.90 	$6.44	1\r\nXME028	ALLOY FRONT SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	 $7.90 	$7.90	1\r\nXME030	ALLOY REAR SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	 $7.90 	$5.14	1\r\nXME039F	ALLOY FRONT WHEEL SHAFT - 1PR	 $3.90 	$2.54	1\r\nXME039R	ALLOY REAR Wheel SHAFT - 1PR 	 $3.90 	$2.54	1\r\nXME039R/C	ALLOY REAR UNIVERSAL SWING SHAFT (CVD DESIGN) - 1PR	 $6.90 	$13.80	2\r\nXME039R/4WD	ALLOY REAR Wheel SHAFT FOR 4WD - 1PR 	 $3.90 	$2.54	1\r\nXME049/0	ALLOY STEERING PLATE - 1PC	 $6.50 	$4.23	1\r\nXME055	ALLOY FRONT LOWER ARM - 1PR	 $7.90 	$5.14	1\r\nXME056	ALLOY REAR LOWER ARM - 1PR	 $7.90 	$5.14	1\r\nXME190R	ALLOY REAR DOG BONE (9.0MM) - 1PR	 $2.50 	$3.25	2\r\nXME316F	ALLOY FRONT DAMPER (16MM) -1PR	 $5.90 	$3.84	1\r\nXME316R	ALLOY REAR DAMPER (16MM) - 1PR	 $5.90 	$3.84	1\r\nXME331R	ALLOY REAR SKID PLATE - 1PC	 $3.50 	$2.28	1\r\nMZ002	ALLOY 2MM LOCK NUT SET  5PCS	$3.80	$3.80	1\r\nSub	$139.24	\r\nS&amp;H 4%	$5.57	\r\nTotal	$144.81	\r\n\r\nLet me know if this is right and what color you wanted.  The Shipping on your can change depends on if I send it to Florida or your home.'),(35866,'fa37dd2a36','Right on man,, Thanks,,, ill be waiting on a reply\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nSTG');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35867,'c827196fa1','Tomorrow\'s my wife\'s birthday, so I\'ll need a day or two to go through my stuff and see what would be good. If there\'s nothing in particular you need, I\'ll try to come up with that would be the most useful.'),(24618,'d910b0bf42','Well I can probably get one done by Team DarkTari for ya.\r\nAnswer a couple questions for me;\r\n\r\nBody Style (make &amp; mod,convertable, t-top, targa) ?\r\nColor ?\r\n \r\n\r\nLet me know and I\'ll see if Team DarkTari can come up with something.\r\n\r\nPrice will probably be the same incl s/h\r\n\r\nHolla !'),(24680,'15fde6c944','just a jeep would be awesome and yeah out of the box would be fine, thanx dude.'),(24681,'3d5cc21de0','OK, I\'ll head out to the post office for a price on shipping this week.'),(33275,'dec014769d','[quote:dec014769d=\"ph2t\"]hey dude, I\'ll take it all.\r\n\r\nI see you\'re asking for $6 shipped.  How about we make it $10 for all that.  So take $10 off the price of the deluxe fix and ship it all down together.\r\n\r\nhow does that sound?\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:dec014769d]\r\n\r\nSounds great ph2t i should be able to ship next week as im waiting for a payment.\r\n\r\nBtw do you have a site you reccomend for dry bearings for a mini-z?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt'),(24324,'1ffb54d4aa','Got them today. But I dont really notice a change in speed, I thought they were suposed to be up there in speed near the dual cell.  :???: Whats up with that.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24325,'f44654668b','[quote:f44654668b=\"KaNye\"]Got them today. But I dont really notice a change in speed, I thought they were suposed to be up there in speed near the dual cell.  :???: Whats up with that.[/quote:f44654668b]Apparently you haven\'t been reading. (No offense intended, but this subject has been covered around here numerous times)\r\n\r\nYou\'re absolutey correct, MOSFETs do not make your car go faster per say. Whoever told you FETs would give your car dual cell like speed was yanking your chain.\r\n\r\nFETs do however drastically increase the power handling, what that means is high RPM motors like a 3.8 or 4.2 can now be used to their potential. If you tested your car with the 2.2 in it, you really wont see a difference. Motors that respond well to FETs  are motors that had no torque to begin with, like TinyRC\'s R-Spec and 3.8, the Bit Racer 3.0 \"Lucifer Rotor\", Perfection 3.8 and 4.2s.\r\n\r\nAlso the extra power means you can run faster gearing like Tomy\'s teal gears or ZZ red gears, and still have powerr to spare. In fact you should have enough power to run a blue KIT racer gears with a 3.8 and still have power to spare. That set up will get you some serious speed, approaching a dual cell car, but it will be much more usable speed, because you don\'t have the weight of a dual cell car. \r\n\r\nIn fact with the stock gearing and a good fast motor, if you reverse your car, and slam it quickly into forwards, it should pull a wheelie, providing you have good traction. Because of that, I have found that my front wheels aren\'t making good contact with the ground, causing difficulty in steering, so I prefer a gear that\'s at least as fast as Tomy teal gears, to get the torque in line and my front wheels on the ground.\r\n\r\nThe only one I know who was making claims of a FET modded car that is as fast as a dual cell was ph2t, and he was running the fastest red KIT racer gears with triple stacked FETs. A regular FET mod does not quite have a enough power to pull red KIT gears, triple stacking the FETs will only make a marginal difference in power, but it\'s difference enough to pull the red KIT Racer gears, which will get you aproaching dual cell speeds.\r\n\r\n\r\nSo I\'m a little upset that your disappointed, but FETs have probably been over hyped by a lot of people besides me, so I understand where you\'re coming from, and hopefully now that you understand how FETs work, hopefully you\'ll get more enjoyment from the mod.\r\n\r\ndave'),(36325,'e2a2cd1fc3','Ive never done the iwaver board swap so you are going to have to do some searching on the site to find out the info (its there, i just cant remember where its at)\r\n\r\nA new motor in the SE is fairly simple, I normaly use a toys r us superslick motor(much larger) you will have to grind out some plastic to mount it properly and solder the leads from the pcb to the motor to get it to work. \r\n\r\nAs far as servos go, there arent any in the zipzaps.  The SE just uses a POT and a motor with some gears to steer (im not very learned on how it all works though)  \r\n\r\nFor the MT, it is only running on 2 cells stock but you an upgrade to up to 4 i think.  Mine has three in it and works great but you will need a better motor and gearing if you want it to go fast.  If you want it to just have more torque and climbing power then you can gear it down with the stock motor by using another bit gear in there (there are threads on this on the site, use the search button)  \r\n\r\nLet me know if that helps any\r\n\r\nSTG');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (27484,'43cf688dd1','I heard you said you gots one of those metl tech rcaers? are they any good? how long do they run for on one charge? how long does it take for \'em to charge? Are they faster than a new zzse? dual cell bit? is the steering (I know thet\'re \"propo\") have more steps than a zz? give me all the info and pics you got of these playa. Thanks man. Lata playa\r\n\r\n-ibb'),(27485,'ac080681c1','The metl Tech cars run for 30 mins on one charge. The steering &amp; speed is truly proportional (about 21 steps) .Team Bonzer has a little vid of the steering on www.bonzergear.com . They are fast. Maybe not as fast as a bit with a 4.2 motor but they are alot more controlable around corners. My only quibble is the controller which I don\'t like much. If they could make a more standard controller (not that difficult to do) then these things would be perfect.\r\n\r\nI have a vid in my gallery (yakboys gallery) of me racing one of the BMW\'s (very badly), The controller is hindering me a bit with correcting mistakes as you can see (I can get around my course easily with bits).\r\n\r\nIf you want specific photo\'s let me know but bonzer has good pics on his site'),(33485,'b0b50f6989','hey, got a Q... have you ever worked with a PIC16C56 microcontroller?\r\n\r\nWent to my local elec. surplus store, they have a bin of scrapped battery chargers that for some reason failed tests or whatever... So naturally i bought the entire bin for 50¢ a piece. TL494\'s, LM393\'s, high amp trannies, inductors, red/green dual color LEDs, some switch IC\'s, and ONE micro-controller to rule them all. Anyways, to get to the point, I would like to know what they can do and how well they perform it... Obviously, they can\'t perform \'EVERYTHING\' because of the various other IC\'s there... Yes, I do have the datasheet, 1.3mb, waaaay too long for me to \"read\" or even \"skim\" for that matter, so please please please help me out if you can!\r\n\r\nThanks in advance!\r\n\r\nPS:\r\nIf you get a chance and don\'t mind another forum, check out\r\nhttp://forum.4hv.org/\r\nNot to be pawning you or anything, but thats the lair of genious to which you belong... You could lend quite the helping hand with your microcontroller programming \'skillz\'.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35052,'3b541bdacf','hey man\r\n\r\nwill be selling stuff soonish okay, just gotta sort shit out first. will post a thread in the next week or two.\r\n\r\nim sorry but atm i dont know what m selling and what im keeping.\r\n\r\ncheers'),(20545,'69140f35e6','[quote:69140f35e6=\"DarkTari\"]That\'s Pimpin Dave!  I like the scheme!\r\nABout the windows, I thought I taped the insides of them, and usually when I clear coat, I remove the exterior tape from the windows but leave the inside tape on.   Removing after everthing is dried on the outside.  If you didn\'t that [u:69140f35e6]may[/u:69140f35e6] explain the window issue, if not then I\'m stump\'d cause I never had that happen and I\'ve done 3 of these already and you\'ve done a couple too.   :???: \r\n\r\nI guess I\'m all caught up now.  Thanx a lot Dave![/quote:69140f35e6]I was wondering why you weren\'t responding to my PMs. Sometimes that popup window doesn\'t come up, so you have to keep looking at the top of the page to see if you got any messages. Also if you happened to be browsing your inbox when I sent those first 2, it would say you have no new messages, because it\'s assuming you saw them.\r\n\r\nAnyways, I was playing Monster Bit Garage last night, it was pretty fun, but I didn\'t win the tool set or Monster Garage CD. Luckily I was just playing, or I would of had to blow the car up too. :lol: \r\n\r\nI was frustrated with it last night, but looking at it this morning, I just need to spend a little time with it, appaently I don\'t do well with deadlines.\r\n\r\nTo fix the windows, I\'m gonna wet sand the windows with 1000 grit, and clear coat. That should work, I\'ve fixed windows like that before, let\'s just pray I have enough clear coat left.\r\n\r\nGood to hear I got time now, so I can relax, and try to get this perfect, but I\'m actually really excited about this car, it\'s gonna be difficult to wait a week to see people\'s response. Can we give a sneel peak in flossin\', huh, can we, can we, huh? :-D  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(20546,'6e0bb368e2','[code:1:6e0bb368e2]Sometimes that popup window doesn\'t come up, so you have to keep looking at the top of the page to see if you got any messages[/code:1:6e0bb368e2][b:6e0bb368e2]Nope, it said I had no new messages ???[/b:6e0bb368e2]\r\n\r\n[quote:6e0bb368e2]Can we give a sneel peak in flossin\', huh, can we, can we, huh? [/quote:6e0bb368e2]  \r\n[b:6e0bb368e2]Uh, Uh, UH! Now what did I tell you before Lil Davy?\r\nNow off to bed with ya   [/b:6e0bb368e2]:tired: :crybad:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20547,'28bdf9028f','[quote:28bdf9028f=\"DarkTari\"]I\'m just getting CaveyDave\'s PM\'s from July 6th up til now today ?????\r\n\r\nAny thoughs !   Just lettin ya know![/quote:28bdf9028f]I\'m not 100% sure, but here\'s what I think happened.\r\n\r\nwe we\'re having server troubles earlier this week, the 6th, 7th, and 8th.\r\nI\'m guessing the PM tried to send, but since the server went down, it didn\'t make it all the way through. after awhile, it still saw the PM sitting in CD\'s \'outbox\' and then saw you login and poof - it sent.\r\n\r\nthat\'s my guess anyway lol'),(20548,'59301c21e4',':shock:  OK?'),(20570,'6b200676f8','[quote:6b200676f8=\"blankboy\"]yeah i was wonderin if you had any messenger like aim,yahoo,msn cause i really want to talk to you man your so awsome  :-D[/quote:6b200676f8]sorry pimp, but I sure don\'t. I just really don\'t have much free time for that kind of stuff. bitPimps, work, house, wife, and life take up all my time.\r\nit sucks, but I\'d be online all day and night if it were different. lol'),(21667,'37308a1381','can you do a custom supra for me??ill pay ya o and it has to be an se think about it');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20576,'75439bc0a0','hi  mekinhux , sorry for the long delay in the bit getting to u, I have been trying to finish my contest bit,  I just finished it and added the picture on my post. i will get the cit sent out to you in the morning.\r\n\r\nagain sorry\r\njmays'),(36124,'581efd46ad','Then why didnt you know about ultimaterc :? \r\n\r\nhah :)'),(36125,'cfe416e466','[quote:cfe416e466=\"mikirgra\"]Sup DT. Thanks for the reminder. I\'m working late, again, tonight. If I\'m not too spent when I get home, I\'ll dig these out, snap some pics, and holler back at ya tomorrow. Hope you had good holidays. MG[/quote:cfe416e466]\r\n\r\nHoliday was cool, just chilled all week!\r\nAppreciate the effort Pimp !  I know things are hectic so don\'t put yourself out, just didn\'t want you to forget about me  8-) \r\n\r\nHow was your holiday?'),(36126,'90f1b1e007','i know everything, i just don\'t go everywhere :-)'),(20578,'096b0a1ee6','[quote:096b0a1ee6=\"DarkTari\"]It\'s all good Pimp!\r\n\r\nI looks okay.  How are the hobby shops in your area?\r\nI bought some Tamiya Acrylic Clear in a smoke that\'s great for window \r\ntinting. I\'ll try it on my latest ride.  Also I got it in red, orange &amp; yellow, it works great for lights, make \'em look real ! I\'ll speak more on that later.\r\n\r\nI\'ve tried the spray on type but it sucks.[/quote:096b0a1ee6][quote:096b0a1ee6=\"DarkTari\"]It\'s all good Pimp!\r\n\r\nI looks okay.  How are the hobby shops in your area?\r\nI bought some Tamiya Acrylic Clear in a smoke that\'s great for window \r\ntinting. I\'ll try it on my latest ride.  Also I got it in red, orange &amp; yellow, it works great for lights, make \'em look real ! I\'ll speak more on that later.\r\n\r\nI\'ve tried the spray on type but it sucks.[/quote:096b0a1ee6]Yeah, it\'s probably fine, but I\'m gonna try to fix it one more time.\r\n\r\nAs far as LHS\'s I have none. See apparently only people with money are into hobbies, so as West Phoenix went to shit, all our hobby shops closed down. So now in order to get to a hobby shop, it\'s a about a 2 hour drive, or a 4 hour bus trip.\r\n\r\nSorry, I\'m kinda ranting, but it pisses me off that there\'s not one around here. That\'s one of my major reasons for using automotive laquers, 3m masking tape, and super glue. If I had access to a LHS, I\'d be using Tamiya paints, Pactra masking film, and some actual body putty. :lol: \r\n\r\nI could also get a hold of some that aluminum stock you use for tailpipes. :???: \r\n\r\n\r\nSpray on tint does suck. I like to use candy colors for tint. If you got some sticker type stuff that\'d be really cool, but the stuff I played with years ago (I believe it was Pactra brand) was kinda thick for bits.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20579,'2a07381520','Man I got 2 hobby shops and quite a few craft stores around me.\r\n\r\nANYTHING you need, just let me know   :cool:'),(23694,'c8023029f5','Would you be interested in doing a FET job for me if I paid ya?'),(21062,'b39d6e90f6','Yes Siree Buddy  :-D \r\n\r\nBody doesn\'t matter!\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp !'),(21063,'cbc3220066','Hey Ahh5hit,\r\nI forgot to mention only if they\'re still $5.00ea, if not let me know and I\'ll decide just how many I want. (I think they would be the same price but who knows)  :???: \r\n\r\nThanx Again!'),(21064,'b39d6e90f6','Yes Siree Buddy  :-D \r\n\r\nBody doesn\'t matter!\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp !'),(21065,'cbc3220066','Hey Ahh5hit,\r\nI forgot to mention only if they\'re still $5.00ea, if not let me know and I\'ll decide just how many I want. (I think they would be the same price but who knows)  :???: \r\n\r\nThanx Again!'),(21087,'f7feb8b3d1','Hey Mike,\r\n\r\nThanx 4 try\'n Pimp !\r\n\r\nI was looking thru a couple boxes of Micro 5hit I got and ran across 3 of then so that\'ll hold me.  \r\nDo you have any 5Below stores in your area?\r\nThey have Precious Micro\'s for $5.00  :eek: \r\n\r\nThanx Again and let me know.............'),(20582,'95ff05ead1','Yeah you probabbly get alot of this but i was wondering if you like have any messenger like aim,yahoo,,msn . if you o can i add you cause i would like totally like to talk to you cause man your the GREATEST  :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20584,'37c83d293d','[quote:37c83d293d=\"DarkTari\"]Man I got 2 hobby shops and quite a few craft stores around me.\r\n\r\nANYTHING you need, just let me know   :cool:[/quote:37c83d293d]Hmmm, maybe I should make a list and send you a money order. :???: \r\n\r\nI\'m gonna think about that. 8-) \r\n\r\n\r\nOk, sorry, to be going on about those stupid winshied, but I got it! Well almost. I got it crystal clear in the center. The edges are greatly improved, but still slightly messed up, but I realized I\'ll never get the edges good without ruining the area around the windows. So it\'s good enough.\r\n\r\nIt\'s funny, I spend twice as long fixing the windows, than painting the car. :lol: \r\n\r\nYesterday I was frustrated, and didn\'t even want to look at the car, but this morning I look at it, and it\'s pretty cool, I\'m inspired now to add more details, some seat backS, liscense plate,  and I\'m gonna try to cut out some windows to be half rolled down. :cool: \r\n\r\nSo it\'s all good now... It\'s like, no worries mate, ya know. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(20585,'74ff826b5e','Leave the sun roof open &amp; the windows down Pimp!  It\'s summer tyme !!\r\n\r\nDon\'t put too much into it Dave, It\'s goin on Da Block Next Week   :sad:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20587,'32601e66e2','Dude,  Da VW Bus went off Da Block 2 weeks ago.\r\n\r\nStay Current  :shock:'),(20588,'602f6bddc2','hi finks sorry for the long delay in the bodies getting to u, I have been trying to finish my contest bit,  I just finished it and added the picture on my post. i will get the bodies sent to you in the morning.\r\n\r\nagain sorry\r\njmays'),(21058,'acb5d39daa','Thanx Ahh5hit,\r\n\r\nI\'ll do better than that, I\'ll get you cash thru da mail.\r\nI\'m lookin to get about 10 of them, or whatever you can muster up. \r\nPrefer 49mhz but I\'ll take 27mhz.  PM me with results.\r\n\r\nThanx Again Pimp !'),(21060,'af96d0946e','What the fuck is wrong with you? I said I was fucking sorry about accusing you and that it wasnt your probelm. \r\n\r\nDo you hate yourself so fucking much that you have to go fucking around with kids 3 times younger than you? Seriously I was trying to level it, but you just have to get the last fucking remark.\r\n\r\nGo do something useful withyour life, and leave the kiddies alone...\r\n\r\nThis is the last time I come over here. I have 16 other forums to go to.'),(20592,'c783c1176b','Hey your package arrived today. You just threw all kinds of stuff in there didn\'t ya? Doing some housecleaning? :lol: \r\n\r\nThat\'s cool though, lot\'s of stuff I can make use of. I have a feeling you sent all that stuff in Zip Zap packaging for a purpose. :???: \r\n :lol: \r\nThanks :-) \r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m trying to figure a color that would work with what you\'ve done with that fade. Silver, Black, Blue, what you think?\r\n\r\nIf all goes well, I\'ll be getting that SE back to you on monday.\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW, SG deserved that bustin\' up, he did say also, like you\'re charging for other stuff. That was out of line.\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20593,'c783c1176b','Hey your package arrived today. You just threw all kinds of stuff in there didn\'t ya? Doing some housecleaning? :lol: \r\n\r\nThat\'s cool though, lot\'s of stuff I can make use of. I have a feeling you sent all that stuff in Zip Zap packaging for a purpose. :???: \r\n :lol: \r\nThanks :-) \r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m trying to figure a color that would work with what you\'ve done with that fade. Silver, Black, Blue, what you think?\r\n\r\nIf all goes well, I\'ll be getting that SE back to you on monday.\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW, SG deserved that bustin\' up, he did say also, like you\'re charging for other stuff. That was out of line.\r\nDave'),(20594,'db824b8f48','[quote:db824b8f48=\"crazydave\"]Hey your package arrived today. You just threw all kinds of stuff in there didn\'t ya? Doing some housecleaning? :lol: \r\n\r\nThat\'s cool though, lot\'s of stuff I can make use of. I have a feeling you sent all that stuff in Zip Zap packaging for a purpose. :???: \r\n :lol: \r\nThanks :-) \r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m trying to figure a color that would work with what you\'ve done with that fade. Silver, Black, Blue, what you think?\r\n\r\nIf all goes well, I\'ll be getting that SE back to you on monday.\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW, SG deserved that bustin\' up, he did say also, like you\'re charging for other stuff. That was out of line.\r\nDave[/quote:db824b8f48]awesome, glad ya got it.\r\nI tried to throw in as much as I \"thought\" you could use or want.\r\n\r\nI know your love started with the zips :wink:\r\n\r\nany of the colors you mentioned would work (blue kinda depends on the shade).\r\nI sent you something I\'m not quite so proud of so I say go crazy with it.\r\nmake it a color people don\'t expect, but doesn\'t look like a turd in a punch bowl. that\'s the attitude I had with the \"comic book\" colored car of bright burnt orange and purple / lavender. and I dug it.\r\n\r\nI say go crazy. I know you\'ll pick something complimentary. trust your \"what if\" instinct - I have a feeling it\'ll surprise us all.\r\n\r\nno rush on my fet\'ted se - whenever it gets here.\r\n\r\nman, I really wanted to talk to someone before I posted, but nobody was around. I was pretty sure he didn\'t mean that, but I can\'t let that shit just sit there for the whole world to make their own opinions on.\r\nhopefully I smoothed it out. I don\'t mean harm by it, but I want everyone to know we do all this for the \"community\" for real, and not for profit - that\'s for sure.\r\n\r\n\r\nsorry about the crappy paint job I sent you.\r\nI\'d be pissed, my standards are higher, but to be honest - I just haven\'t had the time, I\'ve been out of practice for bit, excuses, excuses, excuses.\r\nbut feel free to rap that thing. I\'m so dis-appointed with my own job, I consider myself luck to be able to send it to you to help cover up some of my fuck ups.\r\n\r\nsorry dude, I must just be outta practice - cuz I\'m not happy with what I sent you, and I\'m sure you\'re not either.\r\nI can only appoligize, it\'s gone now.'),(20595,'92b01b5bbf','hey');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20596,'d5501b9763','thanks for not tearin me up. thats all everyone does on this forum. im about to resign'),(20597,'06c116835b','Better late than never, but seriously, I am just getting back in the swing of things, been going thru a divorce...nuff said.\r\n\r\nI registered so you can do your thing now. ;)'),(23351,'4a4465447c','No problem. I decided to keep em, winter is coming up and I will need something to drive around the house besides my Zips.\r\n\r\nSorry for the confusion. Good luck in school!'),(28153,'c38a41806b','man u have a lot o cars and clones i wondered where u got ur clones and if u aint want any lol'),(28154,'136a6f60d4','Another dawg....where you from?'),(30955,'223b177c53','GPM ; knuckles, shaft, cups'),(28451,'94807f13c5','Alright, well thats cool, I really don\'t need controllers, so a 49 would be fine as long as the car works, 49 gets better range too and I got 2 many 27\'s, but whatever You want to do is kool.\r\nThanks'),(20600,'ef6a3ad64c','uhg...\r\nI hate to hear that.\r\nI\'ve heard that more than we all know, funny or not so funny - it seems to happen around the same time of year.\r\nif it makes you feel any better, you\'re not alone.\r\ntoo many bitPimps have gone through or are going through the same - myself, I\'m near it as well.\r\nwish you nothing but \"good\" man - I know it\'s hell.\r\n\r\nyou\'re all set with your gallery.\r\ntake care of #1 (you and family)\r\nbitPimps, this hobby, etc. is gonna be here for awhile.\r\n[quote:ef6a3ad64c=\"Ahh5hit\"]Better late than never, but seriously, I am just getting back in the swing of things, been going thru a divorce...nuff said.\r\n\r\nI registered so you can do your thing now. ;)[/quote:ef6a3ad64c]');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20601,'a2a90f8421','Thanks man, but I\'m pretty much over it now. I took the time to recover, rather than mask it thru hobbies which explains my disapearance.\r\n\r\nI appreciate the gallery space, makes things a lot more easier. I\'ll try not to waste too much space. ;)'),(20602,'4b3ab78dcf','[quote:4b3ab78dcf=\"DarkTari\"]Leave the sun roof open &amp; the windows down Pimp!  It\'s summer tyme !![/quote:4b3ab78dcf]Nah, I wasn\'t gonna close them up, I was thinking, ya know, maybe the woman don\'t like the hair blown, so the side windows kinda half down. I thought it would add some realism. The open windows kinda get lost in pictures, with the black interior, I wanted to make them pop out.\r\n\r\n[quote:4b3ab78dcf]Don\'t put too much into it Dave, It\'s goin on Da Block Next Week   :sad:[/quote:4b3ab78dcf]Well it\'s going out Priortyt Mail with your other cars, next Monday. Monday\'s the only day I can get out early, it\'s friggin sweltering around here, the monsoon ya know, so I ride the bus early :lol: \r\n\r\n\r\nAnyways, it\'ll be to you before the auction ends, give you a few days to give it a going over. (I figure your gonna want to give the final product a spin. 8-) )\r\n\r\n\r\nSo if I get bored between now and then, I will make improvements, it\'s in my nature. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(20603,'88315e1b0a','I just clear coated the body &amp; painted the TX tonight.  I\'ll add the finishing touches this week (exhaust &amp; interior) and give you a preview.\r\n\r\nI consider you my[b:88315e1b0a] Road Dog [/b:88315e1b0a]so you get a sneak preview   :search:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20604,'8bf8c74550','No worries bro, and grats on a killer ride.  I love those Xions.'),(20605,'db824b8f48','[quote:db824b8f48=\"crazydave\"]Hey your package arrived today. You just threw all kinds of stuff in there didn\'t ya? Doing some housecleaning? :lol: \r\n\r\nThat\'s cool though, lot\'s of stuff I can make use of. I have a feeling you sent all that stuff in Zip Zap packaging for a purpose. :???: \r\n :lol: \r\nThanks :-) \r\n\r\n\r\nI\'m trying to figure a color that would work with what you\'ve done with that fade. Silver, Black, Blue, what you think?\r\n\r\nIf all goes well, I\'ll be getting that SE back to you on monday.\r\n\r\n\r\nBTW, SG deserved that bustin\' up, he did say also, like you\'re charging for other stuff. That was out of line.\r\nDave[/quote:db824b8f48]awesome, glad ya got it.\r\nI tried to throw in as much as I \"thought\" you could use or want.\r\n\r\nI know your love started with the zips :wink:\r\n\r\nany of the colors you mentioned would work (blue kinda depends on the shade).\r\nI sent you something I\'m not quite so proud of so I say go crazy with it.\r\nmake it a color people don\'t expect, but doesn\'t look like a turd in a punch bowl. that\'s the attitude I had with the \"comic book\" colored car of bright burnt orange and purple / lavender. and I dug it.\r\n\r\nI say go crazy. I know you\'ll pick something complimentary. trust your \"what if\" instinct - I have a feeling it\'ll surprise us all.\r\n\r\nno rush on my fet\'ted se - whenever it gets here.\r\n\r\nman, I really wanted to talk to someone before I posted, but nobody was around. I was pretty sure he didn\'t mean that, but I can\'t let that shit just sit there for the whole world to make their own opinions on.\r\nhopefully I smoothed it out. I don\'t mean harm by it, but I want everyone to know we do all this for the \"community\" for real, and not for profit - that\'s for sure.\r\n\r\n\r\nsorry about the crappy paint job I sent you.\r\nI\'d be pissed, my standards are higher, but to be honest - I just haven\'t had the time, I\'ve been out of practice for bit, excuses, excuses, excuses.\r\nbut feel free to rap that thing. I\'m so dis-appointed with my own job, I consider myself luck to be able to send it to you to help cover up some of my fuck ups.\r\n\r\nsorry dude, I must just be outta practice - cuz I\'m not happy with what I sent you, and I\'m sure you\'re not either.\r\nI can only appoligize, it\'s gone now.'),(23566,'dddd99a1f3','I personally like the Kyosho alloy diff better, it\'s easier to adjust. I have it on my other MR02. The alloy motor pod is very nice, I think the extra weight actually helps the rear end stick better since the motor isn\'t over the rear like a RM. You have to get the different motor mounts for the different pinions though unless you get the adjustable pod.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32076,'2c5e0ba55c','Where did you get those adjustable kyosho alloy shock mounts? I need um! :)\r\n\r\nI see the oil shocks on rcmart, but what did you mean by \"low-downs\" in the second picture? I saw the shocks in the second picture are blue alloy looking.\r\n\r\nThanks man!\r\n\r\n-JNY'),(33017,'0b2044d50f','Oh shit, I just remembered... there was $15 in MT hop ups too..... ERGHHYQ#A%TY*#WUYITHJRS #W)  Fuckin gay.'),(35576,'151c77ee79','Hey, I just found this on the Xmod site. Just in case you\'re not familiar with David Jun, he drives and designs for Tamiya, and has been world champion in several classes.\r\n\r\n[quote:151c77ee79]Pro Tip #2  Speed Acceleration and Efficiency \r\n \r\n \r\n   \r\n  8/23/05 Name: David Jun\r\nAge: 32 \r\nHometown: Mission Viejo, CA. \r\nFavorite XMODS Body: Nissan Skyline \r\nGreatest RC Achievement: I won an expensive real car once\r\n2004 XRL Tournament: Finished 1st Place Overall\r\n\r\n\"One of the best ways to maximize your motors capabilities is to install ball bearings in your car. However, before you do, there are a few simple steps to insure you\'re getting the most from your bearings. Begin by putting all of the ball bearings in a small container such as a small empty jar with a lid. Then spray motor spray (contact cleaner) into the jar until the bearings are submerged. Put on the lid and gently shake the jar for a few minutes. The purpose is to clean out the power robbing grease that is packed into the ball bearings. Once the grease is washed out, remove the bearings and place them on a paper towel until they dry. After they are dry, oil the bearings with light bearing oil and you\'re done. The bearings can now be installed in your car and you should now have better speed, acceleration and efficiency.\"\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: This tip can reduce the life of the ball bearings. [/quote:151c77ee79]See now, that\'s basically exactly what I described to you, but I doubt my own advice sometimes, because everyone says to run your bearings dry, but I\'ve always cleaned them thoroughly, and put a drop of light oil. \r\n\r\n... but now I got it straight from the world champ, so I don\'t care what kiddies on message boards have to say about bearing care now. :lol: \r\n\r\nJust had to share that.\r\n\r\nDave'),(35704,'ee44008b5a','[quote:ee44008b5a=\"JdmHatchback\"][quote:ee44008b5a=\"DarkTari\"]Hi! I have a bunch of microsizers bodies sets NIB $2ea \r\n[b:ee44008b5a]Specifics ?[/b:ee44008b5a]\r\n\r\nPerfection Beetle bodies NIP $1ea \r\nPerfection Lambo or Ferrari bodies NIP $1ea \r\n[b:ee44008b5a]Cool ?[/b:ee44008b5a]\r\n\r\nNeed any sets? \r\n\r\nGot Perfection Lambo/Ferrari sets $10ea \r\n[b:ee44008b5a]Intrerrested! Colors? s/h?[/b:ee44008b5a]\r\n\r\nLxx Auto Modellista sets $10ea \r\nTomy BitCharG sets $15-$20 ea. \r\n\r\nAny interest in IWaver stuff? I\'ll be focusing more on Iwavers/ Mini z and selling the remainder of my New Micro RC stuff. \r\n[b:ee44008b5a]Is it too much trouble to send a detailed list of Micro RC stuff for sale?  Got any pics?[/b:ee44008b5a]\r\n\r\nLet me know if interested in anything. Happy Holidays!\r\n[b:ee44008b5a]Thanx Pimp!  Same to you ![/b:ee44008b5a][/quote:ee44008b5a]\r\n\r\n\r\nHere\'s a list of what I can remember off hand:\r\n\r\nmicrosizers body sets - supra, 350z, skyline, celica, I have a few other styles but its not coming to me at the moment. \r\n\r\nPerfection beetle bodies - colors - white, blue, green, black, gun metal, bronze, light green, silver, red, a few other colors but I know there were 11-12 different colors for the beetle bodies.\r\n\r\nPerfection lamborghini / Ferrari - red, white, black, silver\r\n\r\nThe Perfection Lambo/Ferrari sets comes with a different color lambo and ferrari body (either red, white, black, silver) \r\n\r\nAlso got Lxx VW Beetle sets with working headlights - $10ea. \r\n\r\nI might have a few 200mah batteries, 3.8 motors. \r\n\r\nFor the Tomy sets - silver s2000, black bB, Toyota Celica (not sure if its black or silver), Subaru WRX white, Nissan Gloria - $15ea ( i have more but cant remember)\r\n\r\nIm not sure on s&amp;h yet but if you decide to buy alot we can work something out. Did you need anything before xmas? Do you have an email address where I can send you some pics?\r\n\r\nThanks![/quote:ee44008b5a]\r\n\r\nXmas has me tied up, still interrested!  Do you have any rare Bits?\r\n\r\nSend all Pics to :   DarkTari@msn.com\r\n\r\nThanx Again  :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35593,'b5e5377012','Hey llama,\r\n\r\nI got a question about your 180mAh batts.  I\'m assuming that they\'re Kan\'s from a flight pack.  How long are they?  I\'m also assuming that they\'re the same width as the standard bit batts.  I just need to know the length since I may try to jam them into an epoch.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nChris'),(35703,'65f36973dd','[quote:65f36973dd=\"mikirgra\"]No chance I\'ll forget you man. Just haven\'t had a chance yet. Sorry about that. Don\'t worry though. I still got \'em, and I\'m still gonna sell them to you. The long weekend ahead might be my best chance to get them out of the closet, take some pics, and finalize this deal with you. We\'ll git er done, fer sure. Later.[/quote:65f36973dd]\r\n\r\n :-)'),(37541,'e56b760581','So, you wan\'t it??  I need cash bad so yeah..This is a heck of a deal too.'),(37332,'a1883fa715','Would you be a moderater on my forum. I\'m thinkin your gonna say no cause i dont think ya like me.'),(37333,'ce84b0408c','[quote:ce84b0408c=\"SHAUN\"]Would you be a moderater on my forum. I\'m thinkin your gonna say no cause i dont think ya like me.[/quote:ce84b0408c]\r\n\r\nShow me the site first. :-o \r\n\r\nSend me the link.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36133,'c69c5916fb','I\'m going to try this with a ZZSE, unless you can tell me now it can\'t be done.  I\'m going to The Source tomorrow to try and get a ZZMT, I have an idea of using the drivetrain to either make a custom mini-panstyle chassis with 4WD or mod it for crawling.  Might get the first one for crawling and then know more and make a better decision.'),(37339,'c42722bb67','hi man, i just got your cash, thanks! :-) \r\n\r\ni just wanna confirm the shipping address. is this correct?\r\n\r\nChris Gera\r\n4303 Radcliffe Dr.\r\nPalm Harbor, FL 34685\r\nUnited States\r\n\r\nonce confirmed i\'ll ship it out within a day.'),(36181,'7116063a89','Look, dumbfuck, don\'t think it\'s as easy as a new user ID. You just need to fuckin\' settle down.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nhue35\r\n\r\nModerator/dumbass american'),(37809,'626a983b2b','no worries, i\'ll let ya know when it arrives :-o'),(36850,'c824bcd809','do you have a prefernce on the willies coup color? do you have a fav color? I hope its not green like SG!  :lol: naw I can even paint it green. I will try the light thing on one of the bodies and send you pictures let me know if you like it and I will do it on all the bodies. (I will experiment on the mini cooper) will see what looks best.'),(37369,'ebd12fe243','struth bloke! you must be rich. usually we only let in rich white folk, the rest we tip into the sea! :lol:  (i think our government sucks a little more than yours)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37341,'0fb6e5e342','[quote:0fb6e5e342=\"Tuner1989\"][quote:0fb6e5e342=\"betty.k\"]yup, you got it! bettykay@gmail.com\r\n\r\ni\'ll keep these goods for you, i won\'t sell them to anyone else if you\'re slow paying :-o[/quote:0fb6e5e342]\r\n\r\nCool man, just sent the $ as we speak!\r\n\r\nBtw Change the shipping name that paypal gives you from Chris to Matt, the account was under my father\'s name originally.\r\n\r\nThanks for the sweet deal man, looking foward to recieving and reviving this xmod!\r\n\r\n :-o \r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt[/quote:0fb6e5e342]\r\n\r\nok, so this is it?\r\n\r\nMatt Gera\r\n4303 Radcliffe Dr.\r\nPalm Harbor, FL 34685\r\nUnited States'),(37342,'c9e6938e02','[quote:c9e6938e02=\"SHAUN\"]http://www.1-2-free-forums.com/mf/?mforum=rcworld  the site as soon As we get people were going to go to a real site , its not done yet still gotta get banner and color.[/quote:c9e6938e02]\r\n\r\n\r\nI signed up but can\'t log in. :???:'),(20609,'6f4682f5e4','[quote:6f4682f5e4=\"CaboWabo\"]awesome, glad ya got it.\r\nI tried to throw in as much as I \"thought\" you could use or want.\r\n\r\nI know your love started with the zips :wink:[/quote:6f4682f5e4]Actually, my frustrations started with Zips. :lol: \r\n\r\n[quote:6f4682f5e4]any of the colors you mentioned would work (blue kinda depends on the shade).\r\nI sent you something I\'m not quite so proud of so I say go crazy with it.\r\nmake it a color people don\'t expect, but doesn\'t look like a turd in a punch bowl. that\'s the attitude I had with the \"comic book\" colored car of bright burnt orange and purple / lavender. and I dug it.\r\n\r\nI say go crazy. I know you\'ll pick something complimentary. trust your \"what if\" instinct - I have a feeling it\'ll surprise us all.[/quote:6f4682f5e4]Hey, yeah, purple, or orange might work with that shade, maybe a copper. :???: \r\n\r\n[quote:6f4682f5e4]no rush on my fet\'ted se - whenever it gets here.[/quote:6f4682f5e4]Well, I\'m shipping a bunch of stuff on monday, so I\'m aiming for monday. 8-) \r\n\r\n[quote:6f4682f5e4]man, I really wanted to talk to someone before I posted, but nobody was around. I was pretty sure he didn\'t mean that, but I can\'t let that shit just sit there for the whole world to make their own opinions on.\r\nhopefully I smoothed it out. I don\'t mean harm by it, but I want everyone to know we do all this for the \"community\" for real, and not for profit - that\'s for sure.[/quote:6f4682f5e4]Yeah, I know what you mean, Joke or not, it just wasn\'t a cool thing to say.\r\n\r\n\r\n[quote:6f4682f5e4]Sorry about the crappy paint job I sent you.\r\nI\'d be pissed, my standards are higher, but to be honest - I just haven\'t had the time, I\'ve been out of practice for bit, excuses, excuses, excuses.\r\nbut feel free to rap that thing. I\'m so dis-appointed with my own job, I consider myself luck to be able to send it to you to help cover up some of my fuck ups.\r\n\r\nsorry dude, I must just be outta practice - cuz I\'m not happy with what I sent you, and I\'m sure you\'re not either.\r\nI can only appoligize, it\'s gone now.[/quote:6f4682f5e4]Oh, I don\'t even know what you\'re talking about. I thought you just giving a me a starting point, and you did that more tha adequately. I just can\'t get fades that smooth any more.\r\n\r\nI think you\'ll be happy when you see it all together.\r\n\r\n\r\nWell that spinnerz guy has just PMed me, can\'t wait to see what that is about. :roll:\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20611,'d5501b9763','thanks for not tearin me up. thats all everyone does on this forum. im about to resign'),(36958,'1055ecc7c1','[quote:1055ecc7c1=\"payaso\"]I\'ve been racing the shit out of my min z about the last month with the dude at work. He\'s got the XMOD evo truck, and I got the X5 BMW.\r\n\r\nHe now has seen the light, and ordered a mini Z MR-02MM Scaglietti, cause he\'s addicted.  My Q is He paid $104 for the ready set. Is that a good price?\r\n\r\nMy other Q is, now that he\'s gettin a car, he\'ll have the obvious advantage over my truck. Would you recomend a certain model. Are the MR-02MM better than the 02MR chassis\r\n\r\nWas also thinkin bout goin with a used one. Worth it, or not?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S[/quote:1055ecc7c1]\r\n\r\n$104 is a killer deal on a new ready set... that Scaglietti ia going to be a little on the tubby side, so I\'d keep that in mind. If I were you, I\'d get one of the MM cars... the Enzo, the McClaren, the BMW M3 or the Lamborghini Murcielago (I\'m pretty sure this is MM)... I have the McClaren F1, and I\'d get it again in a heartbeat. It\'s really compact, super low, and doesn\'t have much overhang in the front or back (the Enzo has a long front)... it\'s the body that\'s closest to runnin\' a bare chassis. \r\n\r\nIf you can find a used one in nice condition, grab it. Just make sure you see clear pictures. And, if there\'s a FET upgrade or a turbo, I\'d make sure to get close-ups of that stuff... if it isn\'t a clean install, I\'d avoid it. The good news is that iWaiver PCBs for that car are on the market now for about $30 (a little less), so even if somethin\' went haywire, you could get it runnin\' fairly cheap.\r\n\r\nI\'d probably get a new one, since the dude you\'re runnin\' with has a new one. Then y\'all can upgrade them as a matched pair along the way, which makes the racing better... it\'s cool when SF and I start out with a stock pair, then upgrade each a little at a time... it makes for a cool evolution.'),(32189,'04e1d716a8','hello,  this is  richh from the forums.  will you take $20 shipped for the skyline set you have for sale?  my zip is 60108, and i can do paypal.\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\nrich');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20613,'f70d1d4172','Gotta wait till Friday to see what I have left over, after bills.  (PayDay)  Hopefully it\'ll still be up for grabs and I can do this.  I\'d love to give it a good home for you. :-)'),(37314,'4412888b85','[quote:4412888b85]Just sold some Xmod shit,[/quote:4412888b85]\r\n\r\nme too, i\'ll be visiting rcmart :lol:'),(26478,'88d2a9b5d4','did it go out?'),(20615,'09c8590514','I\'m in no rush...  It\'s a great little truck, but I feel guilty for not using it. I just thought it\'d be well cared for by a fellow member..\r\n\r\nI\'m probably gonna sell the Bandit also. It\'s also RTR, so if you know anybody looking for one.\r\n\r\nLet me know. :-) \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(36982,'cad31646f6','[quote:cad31646f6=\"payaso\"]Cool, that\'s kinda what I was thinkin, but what do you mean by &quot;tubby&quot;?\r\n\r\nDid you mean the body, or chassis, cause he wanted it cause of the MM chassis over the RM one.\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks for the insight.  He also ordered the 911 Carrera body to go with it, that fucker..[/quote:cad31646f6]\r\nThat body is considerably bigger and bulkier than the McClaren, so I figured it would drive kinda tubby by comparison. I agree that the MM is the way to go, but that and the M3 are the last 2 I\'d choose, simply due to body size.'),(24516,'23f75888c5','[quote:23f75888c5]Yo I spoke with Daveand told him that my wife was in the hospital and that it was coming out the pockey for the bills and to plz hold the car he then told me that he may wanted to keep the car but I told him if that\'s what he wanted to do then that was fine and he in returned told me nah and that he understood my position and to let him know when i would be getting the car and I told hom that it would be this week here. So yes I am getting the car I am not some mark to be palying like that sorry if it seen that way Pimp\'s up hoes down.[/quote:23f75888c5]\r\n\r\nYo Pimp,\r\n\r\nWhat can I say except da ride is gone  :-? \r\n\r\nI don\'t know what your position is right now but maybe I can offer a\r\nworkable alternative. Tell me just what was it about that particular Micro\r\nthat made you bid as you did?  Body? Bitsize? Convertable, color, other?\r\n\r\nI can probably get something else done for ya at about the same price.\r\nLet me know  :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20618,'9921801735','Hello HACHI-RYOKU,\r\n\r\nCongratulations on your winning bid!\r\n\r\nYou have 2 payment options available to you:\r\n\r\n1.) US cash or money order\r\n2.) PayPal (please contact crazydave if you choose this option)\r\n\r\nIf you choose option #1, please send payment to:\r\n\r\nScott Lix\r\n16 Crystal Lake Drive\r\nSt. Peters, MO 63376\r\n\r\nOnce payment has been received the car will be shipped out.\r\nPlease provide an address where we can ship to you - you can send that address to me or DarkTari (he\'ll be shipping your car).\r\n\r\nCongratulations again and thank you for helping support bitPimps!\r\n\r\n-CaboWabo'),(20619,'283cf59367','Hey, I\'m right here.  I\'ve been traveling cross country.  Sorry about the delay.  I\'m willing to pay, but it looks like my car is back on the auction block.  What\'s your advice?\r\n\r\nI\'m in the military and have been away for 6 years.  I just recently returned to the States and I had to visit the family and introduce the new wife to everybody.  I\'m now looking for a place to live in Virginia.  I will be working here for the next few years.  I didn\'t have time to check the internet every day.'),(32272,'67081e0c7e','Cool, how much and how would you like me to pay for them?  paypal is probably the best option.\r\n\r\nHow do you like those GPM shocks over the stock?  I was thinking about getting some for my overland.  The reason i need shocks is because ive been using them on other custom cars im making (like that micro stadium truck)\r\n\r\nThanks\r\nSTG');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20624,'ae306f08f5','Sorry.  Nevermind.  I thought the celica was the rx-7 going back on the block.'),(35434,'e84d52716b','I\'d just like to know If I buy all the GPM parts for an evo car, would I still need to buy RS upgrades like:\r\n\r\nSteering\r\nAWD\r\nSuspension\r\n\r\nThe AWD is what really sparked my intrest, cuz if GPM is making diffs can i just buy all the parts and be able to convert a BONE stock evo to full GPM AWD evo?\r\n\r\nIn the group buy, i wasn\'t really following, but i saw that some of the prices had changed, what is the price now of a complete GPM for a car?\r\n\r\n\r\nThanx\r\nMaxx'),(28283,'20f3310051','I gotta stop on by soon.  Are you going to be free tomorrow?  Need to check out all your new shit fo sho.  Oh, and maybe hit up the Lancer w/ a little SE action.'),(21057,'acb5d39daa','Thanx Ahh5hit,\r\n\r\nI\'ll do better than that, I\'ll get you cash thru da mail.\r\nI\'m lookin to get about 10 of them, or whatever you can muster up. \r\nPrefer 49mhz but I\'ll take 27mhz.  PM me with results.\r\n\r\nThanx Again Pimp !'),(20626,'749f1c5ea7','Hey CD,\r\n            I need to use you for your paypal.  I just won the bid on the RX-7.\r\n\r\nAlso, I wouldn\'t mind seeing another of your cars.  I liked your last one, but I wasn\'t interested in the busses.  Got anything else coming out?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37940,'24a5fe74d2','aight pimp.......thank you for everything. You\'re great in my book..... :)'),(36417,'474f689168','Long gone mate :)\r\n\r\nBut trust me there\'ll be a surprise heading your way sooner or later ;)\r\n\r\nA.'),(37896,'ab6245197d','[quote:ab6245197d=\"HACHI-RYOKU\"]I wouldn\'t mind helping you out, but I have just enough for one in each test car right now.  I\'ve got to keep one in each car to do the comparison essay I\'ve been working on.  Also the parts for each are starting to get scarse.  If I let one go, there\'s no garauntee that I\'ll get another anytime soon at a decent price.\r\n\r\nSorry to be a taco, but if it helps any, after I finish the next two cars reviews I\'m going to take a break from all the comparisons and go into motor construction.  I\'ll be making hand wounds, plasma-atomics and other types of motors and selling them.  There just isn\'t enough people that do that.  I know, that doesn\'t really help you out now.\r\n\r\nHave you looked into an Uberdash?  Also, an Anima modified motor or &quot;Fatboy HC&quot; as they call it at Atomic mods is also a good second.[/quote:ab6245197d]\r\n\r\nYeah problem with the uberdash is it\'s plastic comm.\r\n\r\nSo you will be hand winding motors? :???: \r\n\r\nMight you be interested in making me one, i could test it out and do a full review if your serious about it. I would pay you of course.\r\nReason why i ask is i could use a nice top speed motor for my lipoly MZM, with a sideplate of torque too of course.'),(32502,'43c3108042','With shipping and everything, your total for the sub is $12.55.  Let me know if this is okay as the sub was actually a dollar more than I posted.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20630,'d047681516','Hi Mekinhux\r\n\r\n   Your citroen in on its way, and i put it on the clone bit, i never took this bit for a spin, i just popped the dome off it and changed out the bodies.\r\n\r\n   sorry for the delay and i hope that u will enjoy it as much as i enjoyed making it for u.\r\n\r\ntake care\r\njeff mays\r\n\r\nps.  look for it in 5 days, monday or tuesday :-)'),(20631,'576749dbe8','Sweet, I hope I can pick it up and do just that.  Give it some good use and a home.  I\'ll get back to you if I can do it Friday.  If someone wants to buy it, don\'t hold it for me, sell it if you can.  OK.  I just wanted to let you know I\'m interested and hopefully I can get it.\r\n\r\n\r\nMike'),(20632,'2b8c89dd44','gime the lowdown. im startin to drool.'),(20633,'46b40ce12f','It\'s an awesome little stadium truck. It\'s designed after Matt Francis National Champion race truck. The XXX-T.\r\n\r\nRead more about it here.  http://www.teamlosi.com/kits/mini-T.htm\r\n\r\nIt\'s got some scratches on the bottom of it, but it\'s in great shape. I wish I had more money to make it the best, but my other cars are taking all of my time..lol \r\n\r\nThe back tires are a little worn, but no biggie.  The next thing I was gonna get for it ws the Losi alluminum oil shocks. $29.99 for a set of 4, here it sits..lol\r\n\r\nI figured that one of the pimps would give it a good home. \r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(20634,'e3d58345a8','Dude I will take it off your hands for that price.  I was looking to buy one actually for a while now.\r\n\r\nLemme know the details and I will paypal you the money. You can Email me at devirgiliomi@coned.com or just PM me back.\r\n\r\nThanx Man\r\n\r\nMike');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20635,'46b40ce12f','It\'s an awesome little stadium truck. It\'s designed after Matt Francis National Champion race truck. The XXX-T.\r\n\r\nRead more about it here.  http://www.teamlosi.com/kits/mini-T.htm\r\n\r\nIt\'s got some scratches on the bottom of it, but it\'s in great shape. I wish I had more money to make it the best, but my other cars are taking all of my time..lol \r\n\r\nThe back tires are a little worn, but no biggie.  The next thing I was gonna get for it ws the Losi alluminum oil shocks. $29.99 for a set of 4, here it sits..lol\r\n\r\nI figured that one of the pimps would give it a good home. \r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(32508,'baa0363b28','Sure do man.  wvuchrome@gmail.com  I\'ll get it out first thing tomorrow morning, I\'ve got a lot on my list for today.  Want me to ship it to your paypal addy?\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(33035,'41e7fb17cb','Thats the bugger!!! They only ship to north america? What asses. I\'d be happy to hook you up with a couple of those. They look like they would easily fit in the $5.00 standard rate envelope (like I sent the v2.2 in), so shipping wouldn\'t be bad. It will be a couple weeks before I order it because I have exhausted my hobby budget. I can\'t wait for January when I give myself a hobby bonus for quitting smoking. I\'m going to score some serious R/C stuff. I\'m thinking along the lines of a tricked out E-Maxx or Traxxas Jato, or maybe a rc18t or mini-t. I guess it depends on the mood of the month. Generally, January is a very busy season for me, so I\'ll probably be too busy to charge batteries.  :o \r\n\r\nI\'m definately going to build a 3 cell lipo pack for my MZM/WNDeluxe. It will probably eat comms and brushes like no tomorrow, but it would definately give me the torque I lost when I went alloy. GPM still can\'t figure out why the fuck my front alloy gearbox won\'t work. I hate non-english speaking fuckups.\r\n\r\nLater man,\r\n-JNY\r\n\r\nP.S. My girlfriend says that she was serious about some updated baby pics. lol.'),(20639,'67fa04c2a5','What\'s up mike.. The truck is in great shape. Minor scratches on the bottom of the chassis, but nothing serious, and the back tires are a little worn.\r\n\r\nI was in the process of putting street tires, and losi oil shocks on it, but my other cars are taking all my time.lol\r\n\r\nIf you have the time to put into this little gem, you\'ll be surprised. It\'s a exact replica of the Losi XXX-T Matt Francis champion truck, and has potential like a mofo.\r\n\r\nMy email is down right now since my PC crashed, but I shoud have it up and running soon. If you want to send me a MO, just let me know.\r\n\r\nShould I lock the thread, and say it\'s sold? or do you want to let me know?\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20640,'3c8ce0900d','and that tx would work on a miniz?'),(20641,'9f5c11d20a','Let me check\r\n\r\nBack in a few'),(20642,'eaee48fb2e','[quote:eaee48fb2e=\"hogjowlz\"]and that tx would work on a miniz?[/quote:eaee48fb2e]\r\n\r\n\r\nIt works, but no reverse for some reason.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(20643,'67fa04c2a5','What\'s up mike.. The truck is in great shape. Minor scratches on the bottom of the chassis, but nothing serious, and the back tires are a little worn.\r\n\r\nI was in the process of putting street tires, and losi oil shocks on it, but my other cars are taking all my time.lol\r\n\r\nIf you have the time to put into this little gem, you\'ll be surprised. It\'s a exact replica of the Losi XXX-T Matt Francis champion truck, and has potential like a mofo.\r\n\r\nMy email is down right now since my PC crashed, but I shoud have it up and running soon. If you want to send me a MO, just let me know.\r\n\r\nShould I lock the thread, and say it\'s sold? or do you want to let me know?\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(20645,'5d81ff377e','I will Take it man... Say its sold!  :rockon: haha What are you doing about the Oil Shocks?  putting them in another truck or selling them?  I would be willing to take those off your hands for a price if you are willing to let them go.\r\n\r\nI have Paypal (both CC and Bank account) if you want me to pay for it that way, or I could send you a MO if thats what you prefer.  \r\n\r\nJust hook a brotha up with your lo-cal and i will expediate your payment.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20646,'afa1247b14','I had the mini T shocks on hold at the LHS, but never picked em up... The sirio big bore pipe was yelling for the T Maxxes attention....lol\r\n\r\nThe shocks are $29.99 all over the place.   I\'d hate to tell you that I\'ll have my email up, and running tonight, but if I don\'t you\'d still be waiting..\r\n\r\nIf you want to send me a MO, and get the ball rolling today, my addy is \r\n\r\nSteve Davis\r\n2508 Lynn Lake circle south Apt C\r\nSt. Petersburg Fl. 33712\r\n\r\nIf you want to wait to see if my Outlook is up tonight, that\'s cool too.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(32516,'f648a3577f','Nope, but I can get one with my webcam real quick.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(20649,'f8b2ddc4b9','Sounds great man. I will send the money order out today when i get home from work.'),(20650,'e2c35bda75','Cool, I\'ll keep an eye peeled for it. :search:'),(20651,'9f5c11d20a','Let me check\r\n\r\nBack in a few'),(20652,'eaee48fb2e','[quote:eaee48fb2e=\"hogjowlz\"]and that tx would work on a miniz?[/quote:eaee48fb2e]\r\n\r\n\r\nIt works, but no reverse for some reason.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32518,'f1b7b4a8a6','Here you go.  The white one is mine.  The yellow is yours.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?album=140&amp;pos=0\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/displayimage.php?album=140&amp;pos=1'),(20657,'bcd1dacf47','what kinda cells does she take?'),(20658,'eb362a9fe2','C-Dub,\r\n\r\nHave you gotten a response from Hachi-Ryoku?\r\nJust talked with him, he should be intouch with you about payment if not already.  He\'s moving to Va so I informed him to make the payment to you then we can settle on shipping when he gets established.  In VA I\'ll take care of the shipping.  Who knows, he may be close enough to deliver in person.  I\'ll wait for his reply.'),(20660,'723a57869c','She runs on 4 AA, but just like any electric ec, she needs more punch. They sell a 5, and 6 cell pack for it, but I never got one.\r\n\r\nLordevo or what ever his name is said he was sending me a MO for it, so we\'ll see.'),(22259,'70d8908ed8','[quote:70d8908ed8=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:70d8908ed8=\"steelwoolghandi\"]Cabo I understand if you dont agree with me but I do take extreme offence when Jowlz edits my posts to say something I didnt say! This is extremely wrong and childish and this is a practice that should not be tolerated! I am not personally attacking you Cabo but you should exercise some more restraint when it comes to your moderators attacking and changing members posts to make themselves look better!\r\n\r\nSteelwoolghandi[/quote:70d8908ed8]I have nothing against you either man.\r\nI\'ll take your comments into consideration.[/quote:70d8908ed8]\r\n\r\nCool Cabo I am not looking to have some sort of War come out of this I was just protecting a friends rep like your mod Jowlz felt he was protecting his Boys. I would appreciate if Jowlz is going to edit my post that he not put things about me personally in there as that is supposed to be the reason he was editing them in the first place? I would politely ask you to go back into the thread and delete the Derogatory edit that was made by Jowlz in the post I would thing that would be the polite thing to do and I would appreciate it. I mean if you someone is going to disagree just disagree and debate but please its poor form to attack a member personally because you disagree with him!\r\n\r\nI will refrain from posting about this subject but would appreciate if you would delete Jowlz editing of my post! \r\nThanks so much for the reply and if I can be of any service over at WeGotU or R7R please let me know.\r\n\r\nsteelwoolghandi');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20664,'3dab3cce6a','good deal. your outlook is the right one.\r\nand now... on to the fun. :D [quote:3dab3cce6a=\"Ahh5hit\"]Thanks man, but I\'m pretty much over it now. I took the time to recover, rather than mask it thru hobbies which explains my disapearance.\r\n\r\nI appreciate the gallery space, makes things a lot more easier. I\'ll try not to waste too much space. ;)[/quote:3dab3cce6a]'),(33090,'bb6d03188a','I don\'t get these people sometimes man...lol\r\n\r\nGlad I still got a few good ones left.\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(32523,'2907ed3e94','Not that I can think of off hand unless you got some MZM parts or E-maxx hop-ups I happen to not have yet. :lol: Thanks for the offer though.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(20667,'5a7cd65d03','righto dude. i doubt ill have the loot anytime real soon.'),(33710,'bd17935691','Can a ZZSE board take 3-cells w/o a FET mod? I\'ve searched and all I\'ve seen were FET posts and topics\r\n\r\nThanx\r\nMaxx'),(33758,'cf81c414c6','would this work?\r\n\r\nI am thinking about buying an x-mod evo soon when they are released. I will probably buy the turbo*bug* with a plasma-atomic moter setup that i wil be build based from your tutorial.\r\n\r\n\r\nI reailized things like the fact that the bug is *meant* for the Epoch Indoor Racer.\r\n\r\nso all-in-all would this work?      \r\n\r\n (only asking [color=blue:cf81c414c6]*not to bug you*[/color:cf81c414c6] because you are the creator of this set up and i dont wanna\' risk blowing mony on a setup that wont work)\r\n\r\nThanks alot,\r\n\r\npimptothemax');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (26986,'5aaf39123f','yeah, me too'),(32077,'a35f358b20','Of coarse, I find it the second I PM you. sorry. unfortunately, rcmart only has the rear alluminum shock stay with the different heights. shitty.\r\n\r\n-JNY'),(20670,'7504587efe','bah, trying whatever I can to get my gallery into my sig simular to what you and others have done.  Can you clue me in?'),(20671,'7504587efe','bah, trying whatever I can to get my gallery into my sig simular to what you and others have done.  Can you clue me in?'),(20673,'a3b6ff9c67','[quote:a3b6ff9c67=\"Finks\"]bah, trying whatever I can to get my gallery into my sig simular to what you and others have done.  Can you clue me in?[/quote:a3b6ff9c67]nope, you gotta ask it out in the forums and have the pimps gang rape you :lol: \r\n\r\naight just kidding.\r\ndo something like this:\r\n(minus spaces, format it however you wish, bold, italic, etc.)\r\n\r\n[code:1:a3b6ff9c67]&#91;url= http&#58;//bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/index.php?cat=10009&#93;&#91;b &#93;&#91;u &#93;My bitPimps Gallery&#91;/u&#93;&#91;/b&#93;&#91;/url&#93;[/code:1:a3b6ff9c67]\r\n\r\nnote, the address used above is the url to your gallery'),(20674,'71357e0bff','Awsome thanks CW');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20675,'71357e0bff','Awsome thanks CW'),(20676,'b22dfb533d','Hey You!!!  Is there anybody out there?\r\n\r\nCall me when you get this.'),(21022,'33c64c9ef3','Hey, got SG\'s payment, here\'s his shipping info:\r\n\r\nMike Smalley Jr.\r\n3918 Inalnd Ave.\r\nWest Mifflin, PA  15122\r\n\r\nDave'),(21023,'bc6d6aee95','Cool Dave,  I was gonna PM you today to see if you got his payment.\r\n\r\nI have his package ready to go, I\'ll get it in the mail this morning.'),(21025,'287fac05aa','di u still have the SE for sale? and would the price be anycheaper? like 16-17 shipped?'),(36844,'039b4b5867','[quote:039b4b5867=\"LBRC\"]What do you think?  \r\n\r\nSaw that the package was finally delivered yesterday and have discovered that I am more than a little anxious to know what you think of the 3 ZZMT motors in it (1 Yellow, 2 Orange).\r\n\r\nThey are my overall favorite motor option for my track, 18 x 10 feet w/ 2 foot lanes, unfortunately because the motors have to sit so close to the diff side ball bearing I couldnt seem to get one right milling it out of heavier stock and had to settle for the thin C stock with the aluminum axle and bearing tube.  Takes too long to make :-? .\r\n\r\nSo this kid says to me my brother put a ZZMT motor in an Epoch and its much faster so pompous ass that I am I show him a photo of an epoch motor beside a ZZMT motor and say its too small sonny go away. Well I was wrong, definitely big time wrong, ouch.\r\n\r\nI still doubt he even had a brother yet alone one who managed to fit ZZMT motor in an epoch motor case, not easy to do I tried it makes a mess, but he definitely was right about the motor, even one is technically faster just slow to get up to speed, and two LoL you get to decide that. \r\n\r\nI usually end up adding a little weight to the rear of the car for better traction and handling.[/quote:039b4b5867]\r\n\r\nHey man yup did get the package yesterday and my wife did not tell me until late (she forgot and let me know about 11:00 pm) I jumped up and went into my toy room and I swore the light was beaming from heaven on the box!!! (Guess it was the florescent light on the white box but still a neat effect)! \r\n\r\nThe car is Friggen HOT1 the first thing I did was oooh and ahhh over the bodies (they are really nice) then pulled out the Epoch and charged it up pulled it off the second charge and bang nothing happened?? LOL then I saw the plug was loose at the top plugged it in and put it on my pine floor and it screamed across the floor! \r\n\r\nThis Epoch is wicked fast its just too much for the house I plan to take it out this weekend to a track and try it where I have some real room! I cant tell you how happy this car has gotten me I havent been this excited since I bought my first Epoch. \r\n\r\nI will take your advice and bring something to weight the back end when I get the thing up to some speed at the track I will see if I have to add weight. \r\n\r\nThat motor setup is sweet I can see how it would be more to manufacture I am impressed it looks factory made vary nice set up! \r\n\r\nOk the bodies they are vary nice I like the detail the muscle cars made my mouth drool! \r\n\r\nI need some info before I paint them? You said you wanted one of them painted some way which one and how do you want it painted? \r\n\r\nHow do you want the lights and windows done? Are you going to add decals for the lights and such or do you want me to paint them in? The windows on the epochs are a gray color do you want them left clear or tinted? Just let me know some of the details and I will start on them ASAP!\r\n\r\nThanks again I plan to write a review and post it here and Rippers!\r\n\r\nAaron   :-)'),(20999,'036fb31fc8','aite i checked on those batteries today. they are $3.49 +shipping. special order only but they still have them. thanks dude. try a dual cell with one. i dont think a quad cell is needed lol.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (22938,'12862be244','sure man the xmod is cool, I guess I will just have to fool with it to see if I can get it to run again lol'),(31153,'56f14696e8','Hi,\r\n\r\nJust wanted to drop you a line and let you know that I shipped out your micro rc stuff today and threw in a few extra stuff too. Let me know if you need anything else. I sent it usps priority mail and delivery confirmation # is 0300 1290 0006 8791 0796. Thanks again and tell all your bit buddies where you got the hook up lol. Later.\r\n\r\nThanks again,\r\nJDM'),(20680,'f3ff5d0015','[quote:f3ff5d0015=\"DarkTari\"]C-Dub,\r\n\r\nHave you gotten a response from Hachi-Ryoku?\r\nJust talked with him, he should be intouch with you about payment if not already.  He\'s moving to Va so I informed him to make the payment to you then we can settle on shipping when he gets established.  In VA I\'ll take care of the shipping.  Who knows, he may be close enough to deliver in person.  I\'ll wait for his reply.[/quote:f3ff5d0015]yea, basically all he said was \"sorry I haven\'t responded sooner\", said he was moving and stuff.\r\nhe didn\'t say when to expect payment or if he sent payment yet or what so I\'m guessing he\'ll be sending payment ASAP.'),(20681,'94f739b9dc','I\'ll let him know!  For $40.00, I\'ll give him some slack !   :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20684,'7db3c98dbf','[quote:7db3c98dbf=\"HACHI-RYOKU\"]Hey CD,\r\n            I need to use you for your paypal.  I just won the bid on the RX-7.\r\n\r\nAlso, I wouldn\'t mind seeing another of your cars.  I liked your last one, but I wasn\'t interested in the busses.  Got anything else coming out?[/quote:7db3c98dbf]Hey what\'s up? Congrats on that RX-7, she\'s purty. 8-) \r\n\r\nPaypal email is davesmoejoe@yahoo.com\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ve got a couple special projects coming up in the future, but just a little insider tip, the next up on Da Block will be a joint project between me and Dark Tari. ;)\r\n\r\nDave'),(20685,'4be7dc4e7f','Money sent.\r\n\r\nCan\'t wait to see your new one.'),(20693,'d163419a41','Hey, we got paid, get that boy his car!\r\n\r\nBig spender, and prompt payments, I like this guy. :cool: \r\n\r\nI stuck FETs in the Subaru yesterday, and damn, that\'s a pretty good chassis. Someone\'s gonna have a lot a fun with this car. I\'m done with it now, no seats or anything, but I did stick a Cat5 attenna on there to match the paint.\r\n\r\nDave'),(20694,'9fe13f5236','Cool Shit,\r\n\r\nAs soon as he sends me an address, it\'s all wrapped and waiting!\r\n\r\nSo he PayPal\'d $40.00 right ?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (25991,'41cfff8069','Whats up Bird?  I was talking to sg219 and he suggested I talk to you.  I got a couple of Nelly\'s on the way and would like to put them in an Overland and a Iwaver 04 (when it comes).  Or an xmod if the 04 is not a candidate.  My soldering skills suck so I\'m looking for someone who can do the work.  You guys are closer to me than anyone else I see on the site.  (pocono lake).  Will pay or trade.  Although I only have zip/bit stuff to trade.  But a good amount of different shit.  Let me know if you can do it or can you suggest someone else.  Thanks\r\n\r\nVik'),(37543,'267431eebc','Whereabouts are you?\r\n\r\nLove doc'),(37544,'e56b760581','So, you wan\'t it??  I need cash bad so yeah..This is a heck of a deal too.'),(37545,'c0f8aaca8d','no, sorry :-('),(37551,'e09906562a','Hachi my bro just got a firelap 02, and my buddies got an iwaver 02, I picked my self up an mr-02.\r\n\r\nMy brother\'s car needed to be sent back, while my buddies car is under construction. I was thinking of picking up a nice alternative chassis for some hardcore upgraded, something like an underdawg. I realize the mr-02 is a much better chassis, but how are the firelap and iwaver compared?\r\n\r\nAre they the same thing, or should I be realizin the differences?\r\n\r\nLet me know, your the man!'),(21026,'ecb53099df','Unforutunaltely, i dont have an SE for sale anymore.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21027,'549843006c','[quote:549843006c=\"hogjowlz\"]special order only[/quote:549843006c]What\'s that mean?\r\n\r\n\r\n [quote:549843006c]try a dual cell with one. i dont think a quad cell is needed lol.[/quote:549843006c]I know, I\'m regretting wasting all my SE batteries in one car, but hate to break up the Prostocker, that\'s why I\'m looking to get more of those batteries.\r\n\r\ndave'),(20699,'939290304d','thnx mate we will get the cash into ur paypal in the next few days... will 6 bux cover ur beer?\r\n\r\n ohh a surprise... aslong as it not anthrax like some of the mail going around the US a while ago'),(25137,'91dbe5e5e9','yo pimp can ya do mosfet on my zz se'),(20702,'9498cad7c1','oh crap my addres\r\nalso can u tell me the postage cost so i can divide it up\r\n\r\nRohan Hamer\r\n4 houghton st \r\nNorth balwyn 3104\r\nMelbourne, Victoria, Australia'),(21002,'287fac05aa','di u still have the SE for sale? and would the price be anycheaper? like 16-17 shipped?'),(20707,'59ebd46f63','yeh np mate.. u should come past ausmicro more often...');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (22258,'24121916e6','[quote:24121916e6=\"steelwoolghandi\"]Cabo I understand if you dont agree with me but I do take extreme offence when Jowlz edits my posts to say something I didnt say! This is extremely wrong and childish and this is a practice that should not be tolerated! I am not personally attacking you Cabo but you should exercise some more restraint when it comes to your moderators attacking and changing members posts to make themselves look better!\r\n\r\nSteelwoolghandi[/quote:24121916e6]I have nothing against you either man.\r\nI\'ll take your comments into consideration.'),(21004,'7bc0b13604','I hope you do get this stuff!!!  With all the free ads all over the place saying that your involved is starting to build a nice following for you to sell to!!!!   Your name is in every thread that the GPM stuff got dropped in!!!\r\n\r\nFree advertising!!! :-)  :-)'),(21005,'65e5fd6649','What\'s the word?  Let me know cause I\'m sittin\' on a pile of stuff thats tieing up my cash.  I\'d PM you at AusMicro if I could get on over there.\r\n\r\nThanks, \r\n\r\nMike  \r\n\r\nSG219'),(21639,'904c19181f','Jesse King\r\n25 Springview ln Unit#3\r\nWest Bath, ME 04530\r\n\r\nand as for payment, I prefer to deal w/ cash if that\'s cool with you.  Will send ya a nice letter stuffed with Washingtons 8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20854,'0ae33cce55','Hey, I can\'t find your address, could you get that to me. :-) \r\n\r\n\r\nAnd I sent Hachi Ryochu both an email and a PM. Strange to pay so quickly, but be so slow to get back with an address. :???:  :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(20855,'e94cde4b75','[quote:e94cde4b75=\"CaboWabo\"]as long as starsky and hutch get fet\'ed I don\'t care lol[/quote:e94cde4b75]Seriously, before the auction came up or anything, your SE was first on the FETing list, so there is still set of FETs reserved for you, actually 2, cause I\'m gonna stack your FETs\r\n\r\n[quote:e94cde4b75]no, really...\r\nyou send me whatever, whenever the auctions are over - if you have to take out expenses, do so - no worries.[/quote:e94cde4b75]Well I can sell 3 FET mods right off the bat. So this money will come right back, I just didn\'t have the cash to invest in the first place.\r\n\r\n[quote:e94cde4b75]haven\'t checked yet, but did ya vote yet for the contest winners?\r\nI kinda felt like DT was trying to say he stuck to the \"summer bling\" theme and that\'s why his choices were so different from mine.\r\nI thought I did stick to the \"summer bling\" theme and even mentioned it by picking the mods that enduced the most \"summer-time\" feel (e.g. sg\'s boat)\r\nyea sg\'s boat isn\'t prestine, but its more modding than most enteries, it\'s modding a new vehicle (boat) and as far as I know, boat says summer bling more than a car.\r\nbut whatever, I\'m probably reading way too much in to like always.\r\nI\'ll go sit in my corner lol[/quote:e94cde4b75]D\'oh! Holy F\'in shit, I completely forgot about judging the contest. Sonnafabitch, this was a tricky one too.\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna go in and vote without looking what you guys have voted, but I will say this, boats do nothing for me, they just don\'t. I will be keeping the theme of the contest in strong consideration, but Hue\'s car is easily his swan song. He easily has the best eyes on the bPs, and just deserves recognition as \"the best\". It\'s convertable, so it\'s fits the theme close enough for me. So his \'maro\' will be getting my #1 vote without further consideration.'),(21028,'853cd07867','[quote:853cd07867=\"crazydave\"][quote:853cd07867=\"hogjowlz\"]special order only[/quote:853cd07867]What\'s that mean?\r\n\r\n[/quote:853cd07867]\r\n\r\nthat means they dont have it in the store but they can order it for you from the store and ship to yo crib.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20717,'92b01b5bbf','hey'),(20718,'0747f00b47','Glad to hear it Jacques,\r\n\r\nHave you checked out the RX7 that\'s on Da Block right Now ?'),(20719,'3700b6bdbe','glad ya finally made it over here. stick around and good shit will come to ya.  :-)'),(20720,'3700b6bdbe','glad ya finally made it over here. stick around and good shit will come to ya.  :-)'),(20721,'6f39ad3209','[quote:6f39ad3209=\"DarkTari\"]\r\nSo he PayPal\'d $40.00 right ?[/quote:6f39ad3209]Yup.  8-)'),(20722,'a813b24952','didnt you say once that you can buy zzse batteries from rat shack? do you remember the part#?'),(32721,'c089d1f31f','No worries, I\'ve been really busy and I\'ve been meaning to get the ones out that I have addy\'s for but I haven\'t had time.  I\'m having some issues with the \'ol liver and I keep having to run to Charleston (45min drive) to get tests and such done.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(20724,'f2aadc4bc8','punk'),(20725,'842a9d13a3','lol... It won\'t let me anymore with this new set up. I can still get on MSN though. Weird.\r\n\r\ni hate computers, but I love my bong....lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\ns');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32723,'24f2416c17','Your sub just went out today.  Keep an eye out, it went priority mai.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(20728,'f36750c8b3','[quote:f36750c8b3=\"payaso\"]\r\ni hate computers, but I love dong....lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n[/quote:f36750c8b3]\r\n\r\nlol im calling you later or something'),(20729,'3237b7c5be','LMAO..... Aight\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(20730,'a813b24952','didnt you say once that you can buy zzse batteries from rat shack? do you remember the part#?'),(33620,'710a0b11af','That truck is the new Traxxas Revo. The one next to it is the Maxx.\r\n\r\nThe Revo in that pic is less than a year old, and runs like a mother fucker....lol\r\n\r\nI\'d say the way it sits now, without the radio, and wheels (those are nice alloys) around the $350 range.\r\n\r\nI got some stock wheels and tires for it though.\r\n\r\nThere are some crazy cheap ones on ebay if you look around... \r\n\r\n\r\nLet me know if you need help, and once you fire up that engine, you\'ll be hooked instantly.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(20732,'e17ef4e727','[quote:e17ef4e727=\"hogjowlz\"]didnt you say once that you can buy zzse batteries from rat shack? do you remember the part#?[/quote:e17ef4e727] RSU #12413456\r\n\r\nIf they have them in stock, let me know, I\'d like to stock up on those.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20733,'e17ef4e727','[quote:e17ef4e727=\"hogjowlz\"]didnt you say once that you can buy zzse batteries from rat shack? do you remember the part#?[/quote:e17ef4e727] RSU #12413456\r\n\r\nIf they have them in stock, let me know, I\'d like to stock up on those.\r\n\r\nDave'),(20734,'b6cd71eb80','word. i wont be able to check til next week.'),(20735,'b6cd71eb80','word. i wont be able to check til next week.'),(20736,'92130432ff','hey\r\n\r\nthanks for the welcome.\r\n\r\nive been around just never had anything to say i suppose i wanted my first post to be of my track  :???: \r\n\r\nas for the best shit? you dealing pimp? LOL  :cool: \r\n\r\nbtw love those emoticons best on the web by far!!!!\r\n\r\nalso how do u get a pimp gallery do i have to subscribe or something?\r\n\r\ncheers man'),(22924,'382f26cce3','Alright I\'m sending out the first round of emails, time to get the ball rolling and find some staff members.\r\n \r\nI plan to ask everyone what articles they would like to write or what they would like to contribute to the magazine.  After that we will work on a time schedule and a layout for upcoming magazines.\r\n \r\nThanks for any help or support, oh and no shit eaters....LOL\r\n\r\n\r\nLater\r\nRipper'),(20738,'99a7385eb7','thanks for the update sg, man did i start some shiat or what with that gay post? thanks for backin me up in there...lol\r\n\r\ni cant wait to see what u have done with the bodies, i have not gotten the tabs on the undersides of the bodies perfected yet, what i had to do with my citroen is file the fron part from underneith some to get the tab to sit in there. \r\n\r\nI am not going to cast this scion! its not worthy :sad:  but i am already looking into doing another car soon, just need to figure out what i will do.\r\n\r\nthanks and i love that that lil box has served us well! fuuunnnny\r\n\r\njmays');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20739,'92130432ff','hey\r\n\r\nthanks for the welcome.\r\n\r\nive been around just never had anything to say i suppose i wanted my first post to be of my track  :???: \r\n\r\nas for the best shit? you dealing pimp? LOL  :cool: \r\n\r\nbtw love those emoticons best on the web by far!!!!\r\n\r\nalso how do u get a pimp gallery do i have to subscribe or something?\r\n\r\ncheers man'),(20740,'70c07acf10','sorry on my pocket pc\r\nask cabowabo bout the space. tell him i terrorized you on brucemicro and he\'ll feel bad'),(33635,'bc5fb3cbca','Do you mean like a skid plate, or more like a front bumper?\r\n\r\n\r\nFor skids, I\'d use a peice of styrene from a ZZ package. I little heat from a lighter, or candle, and you can bend it to shape.  It\'s durable too.\r\n\r\nDouble it up if you need to.  Really easy to work with.  Sometimes I use an old bank card.\r\n\r\nFor bumpers, I\'d use some heavy duty paper clips, and do it up... Is that what you were asking, or am I really that burnt?   lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOn a side note,  What\'s the jobs like down there?  And how\'s the cost of an apartment, or house for rent?   I\'d like to live there for a while.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks dude.'),(35373,'90e58939fc','Alright, I finally got my shit in order and put a disc together for you. Mostly what we discussed before, plus a couple of things I thought you might be interested in... I\'ll be curious what you think of some of this stuff.\r\n\r\nHere\'s the list:\r\n\r\nAlabama Thunderpussy\r\n	Staring At The Divine\r\n			\r\nBlack Label Society\r\n	1919 Eternal\r\n	Alcohol Fueled Brewtality Live\r\n	Book Of Shadows (Remastered)\r\n	Hangover Music Volume VI\r\n	Kings Of Damnation Era 1998-20\r\n	Mafia\r\n	Sonic Brew\r\n	Stronger Than Death\r\n	The Blessed Hellride\r\n			\r\nFu Manchu\r\n	Godzilla\'s Eatin\' Dust\r\n	King of the Road\r\n	The Action Is Go\r\n			\r\nHayseed Dixie\r\n	Hillbilly Tribute to AC_DC\r\n			\r\nKyuss\r\n	Blues For the Red Sun\r\n			\r\nMasters of Reality\r\n	How High The Moon (Live At The Viper Room)\r\n	Sunrise On The Sufferbus\r\n			\r\nMonster Magnet\r\n	Forget About Life, I\'m High On Dope\r\n	Monster Magnet EP\r\n			\r\nPorcupine Tree\r\n	In Absentia\r\n			\r\nThe Atomic Bitchwax\r\n	The Atomic Bitchwax\r\n			\r\nThe Mars Volta\r\n	De-Loused In The Comatorium\r\n	Frances The Mute\r\n\r\n			\r\nBlack Label Society is Zakk Wylde\'s (fairly recent Ozzy guitar player) band. These guys are new to me, but I dig the shit out of it... total Beavis and Butthead music. Straight-up hard rock.\r\n\r\nPorcupine Tree is pretty much the current state-of-the-art in the Prog-Rock world... not sure that\'s your bag, but I thought I\'d throw it in. They\'s British.\r\n\r\nMars Volta is a spin-off of At The Drive-In... also sort of in the Prog-Rock/Art-Rock vein. I really dig these here Texans.\r\n\r\nHayseed Dixie is just straight-up fun... balls-to-the-wall bluegrass versions of AC/DC tunes.\r\n\r\nThe Monster Magnet stuff I have is just OK... by no means is this the definitive shit by them. I haven\'t grabbed that stuff yet... these are a coupla records I nabbed \'cuz they were there. Spine of God, Dopes to Infinity and Powertrip are the ones I\'ll get eventually... I\'ve heard those, and they\'re all better than what I\'ve included on the disc.\r\n\r\nAnyway, there\'s a data DVD in the mail today... let me know when you get it.\r\n\r\nlater on,\r\n\r\nMat (hue35)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20742,'70c07acf10','sorry on my pocket pc\r\nask cabowabo bout the space. tell him i terrorized you on brucemicro and he\'ll feel bad'),(20743,'75439bc0a0','hi  mekinhux , sorry for the long delay in the bit getting to u, I have been trying to finish my contest bit,  I just finished it and added the picture on my post. i will get the cit sent out to you in the morning.\r\n\r\nagain sorry\r\njmays'),(20744,'d047681516','Hi Mekinhux\r\n\r\n   Your citroen in on its way, and i put it on the clone bit, i never took this bit for a spin, i just popped the dome off it and changed out the bodies.\r\n\r\n   sorry for the delay and i hope that u will enjoy it as much as i enjoyed making it for u.\r\n\r\ntake care\r\njeff mays\r\n\r\nps.  look for it in 5 days, monday or tuesday :-)'),(20746,'03b91fb0a8','Hi jmays\r\n\r\nSorry for taking so long to reply, but haven\'t been able to browse here recently. Thanks for all the work you\'ve done for me and for sending me the complete pack ready to run and in great style I must say :) I\'ll look for it this week. And I haven´t forgotten the ten bucks I still owe you, don\'t worry.\r\n\r\nOnce again thanks for everything\r\n\r\nKind regards\r\n\r\nmek'),(29960,'92718b5b70','[quote:92718b5b70]If you come across anyone with Supra bodies, let me know[/quote:92718b5b70]\r\n\r\ni found a supra body on ebay , its more $ than i have right now so im sending you the link . its going for 5 bucks with 6 dolla shipping , not bad rs whats 14.99 plus shipping from rs.com .\r\n\r\nhttp://cgi.ebay.com/ws/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&amp;category=2565&amp;item=5979137162&amp;rd=1\r\n\r\nlater , \r\n\r\nmatt');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24676,'ad3a6dc792','Don\'t worry, I got tyhis message !  Thanx!'),(33280,'abafd414df','[quote:abafd414df=\"ph2t\"][quote:abafd414df=\"Tuner1989\"][quote:abafd414df=\"ph2t\"]hey dude, I\'ll take it all.\r\n\r\nI see you\'re asking for $6 shipped.  How about we make it $10 for all that.  So take $10 off the price of the deluxe fix and ship it all down together.\r\n\r\nhow does that sound?\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:abafd414df]\r\n\r\nSounds great ph2t i should be able to ship next week as im waiting for a payment.\r\n\r\nBtw do you have a site you reccomend for dry bearings for a mini-z?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt[/quote:abafd414df]\r\n\r\nI think the mini-zracer.com shop has dry \"enduro\" bearings, but I\'m not sure.  Otherwise just buy a set of yeah racing ones from rcmart and soak them in turps and then let \'em dry.  \r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.[/quote:abafd414df]\r\n\r\nThanks ph2t\r\n\r\nBtw how\'d you get to score a Evo over in aussie?'),(37158,'676d3dcd60','Paypal Sent.\r\nThanks man.\r\n\r\n[quote:676d3dcd60=\"cj\"]Hello Clint\r\n\r\nHere is what I got you down for:\r\n\r\nPART ID	DESCRIPTION	Price 	Silver \r\nXME012A	ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS -\r\n1PC SET	$7.74	1\r\nXME012B	ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX BACK COVER WITH SCREWS -\r\n1PC SET	$0.00	1\r\nXME013A	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS -\r\n1PC SET 	$15.54	1\r\nXME013B	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX REAR COVER WITH SCREWS -\r\n1PC SET 	$7.74	1\r\n\r\nSub	$34.11	\r\nS&amp;H 	$3.00	\r\nTotal	$37.11	\r\n\r\nThat is a Savings of $13.59 off of GPM\'s regular\r\nprice.\r\nIf you have any additions or corrections let me now as\r\nsoon as possible.  My PayPal is cjellis@yahoo.com. \r\nPlease include your user name in the notes on PayPal.	\r\n\r\n\r\nThank You\r\nCJ\r\n\r\nBTW your email address on here didn\'t work.[/quote:676d3dcd60]');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37648,'ab2586c646','money sent'),(37161,'2f65e3e2a7','Hi\r\n\r\nCool, hope to see some modded ZZMT pics from you then.  :-o \r\nI picked up the jeep body off ebay, as radio shack doesnt make it\r\nanymore. Cost me an arm and a leg for it.  Xmods are pretty neat,\r\nIve got a few. 3 mustangs(cobra,65,06) and both trucks.\r\n-clint\r\n\r\n[quote:2f65e3e2a7=\"spanky\"]whats up me and my friends have bought zip zaps mt and we found the supension artical and was wondering two things. One is where did u get the jeep body and have u herd about xmod. This my first time login on to the bitpimps web page so im not sure on how im gonna get this message.\r\nThanks \r\n\r\nSpanky grin[/quote:2f65e3e2a7]'),(24381,'75b162a1f3','Sweet. I can always use another bird.\r\n\r\nSo, yeah... hook up with cj for the inductor, and I\'ll gladly do it.\r\n\r\nAbout the mill... No, he didn\'t work there, but I just started driving trucks(tri-axle dump trucks), and he was teaching me... and we are in and out of the one US Steel plant down here, and it just came up about Ohio... and he said about a plant out in Lorain... I think he might have had to haul some shit out there back in the day or something lol.'),(35149,'4b30e4addc','hey Clint, I was just wondering if you would be up for writing a quite little review for the evo msofets on the review section in the ausmicro.com shop.  you don\'t have to do it, I would appreciate it if you could though man.  No rush.\r\n\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (25937,'32d5ba0af9','[quote:32d5ba0af9=\"viperdout\"]Dave:\r\n\r\nA friend of mine is not registered here, and needed me to PM you.  Would you be willing to buy a Monster and stack the fets, then send the whole thing to him (he\'d send you money before anything).  Anyway, his email is jrjamms@comcast.net .   Thanks\r\n\r\n-Max[/quote:32d5ba0af9]Ok, I\'ll contact your friend.\r\n\r\nDave'),(33359,'c9e2e67c17','nah, didn\'t see chris. he might be home at lunchtime though'),(33365,'975f88ee5d','hey man, what\'s new?\r\n\r\njust wanted to say hi!!!\r\n\r\nI reformatted my comp and all is back to normal.\r\nI\'d love to bs with ya sometime. \r\n\r\nHow\'s the Bit?\r\n\r\nand I also dual-celled a zip :)\r\n\r\nLater!!!!!!'),(20759,'d497302264','Hey, I was waiting for good day to take pics, it\'s been cloudy every day this week. So I went ahead and took some pics with it overcast. They\'re in my gallery now.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/thumbnails.php?album=97\r\n\r\nI\'ll be shipping this out with your other stuff first thing monday. I have your address written down somewhere, but why don\'t you go ahead and give it to me again, so I have it handy. :-) \r\n\r\ndave'),(35633,'61cb2a1384','[quote:61cb2a1384=\"skylinekid\"]CJ, how much do i owe you so i can PayPal you it this weekend???? I got confused by the new posts thats why im asking!!!!! thanks in advance[/quote:61cb2a1384]\r\n\r\nI just need $3.00 to settle the first Group Buy.\r\n\r\nmy PayPal is cjellis@yahoo.com');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34829,'6d9a3b58b0','[quote:6d9a3b58b0=\"cj\"]Just got some XM018 motor heatsinks.  I have 1 Green just for you and if you want it I didn\'t get gold but I did get Champagne which is a light gold.[/quote:6d9a3b58b0]\r\n\r\nI\'ll take them. :-o \r\n\r\nHow much?'),(21009,'b4a42264d6','You\'ll never get those kids to your site until you actually have some content to draw them there.  I say start an E Store at R7R, he has a whole section devoted to peoples private E stores.  Put one up there and link it to your actual site.  Ripper is cool and if you set up shop there and brought all the traffic thru that these parts are going to create, it would be good for everyone.  You and $$$, Ripper and traffic, and me, I\'m the Xmods MOD there!!!\r\n\r\nJust a suggestion.\r\n\r\nI say get black and especially silver/chrome!!!  Those are the most popular colors and they go with anything.  Plus, if your the only one with them, it doesn\'t matter what color!!\r\n\r\nIf you need anyhelp, just let me know, and remember I\'m on your side, not the other assholes out there.  I just like messin\' with people to get a rise out of them and have something to do for a few hours each night that doesn\'t bore me to death. Let them post what they want, the real people that know whats going on will understand.\r\n\r\n :-)'),(20761,'e78c3ebf81','[quote:e78c3ebf81]I\'ll be shipping [u:e78c3ebf81]this[/u:e78c3ebf81] out with your other stuff first thing monday.[/quote:e78c3ebf81]\r\n\r\nCool !\r\n\r\nWhen you say \"this\", are you referring to the Subaru?\r\n\r\nNot neccessary, I\'ll post it and you hold on til it\'s sold.\r\nDid you get Cabo\'s body yet and will it be ready for the following week?\r\n\r\nThanx Again for doin what you did for me, really appreciate it Pimp  :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20774,'b75c8b9343','[quote:b75c8b9343]It actually don\'t have seat backs, but since it was advertised, it\'s gonna now.  [/quote:b75c8b9343]\r\n\r\n :eek:    :eek:    :eek:    :eek:    :eek:  \r\n\r\nSorry about that, I thought I saw seats in the pics.'),(20765,'976366ac0e','[quote=\"DarkTari\"][quote:976366ac0e]I\'ll be shipping [u:976366ac0e]this[/u:976366ac0e] out with your other stuff first thing monday.[/quote:976366ac0e]\r\n\r\nCool !\r\n\r\nWhen you say \"this\", are you referring to the Subaru?[quote]Yeah.\r\n\r\n[quote:976366ac0e]Not neccessary, I\'ll post it and you hold on til it\'s sold.[/quote:976366ac0e]Oh ok, so am I shipping it to the winner? If so, what I can do is take the controller from the 35mhz car I got, then I\'ll FET the 35mhz chassis to send to you.\r\n\r\nI got 2 35mhz Bit Char-G controllers, I seriously debating giving one up to add to the appeal of this car.\r\n\r\n[quote:976366ac0e]Did you get Cabo\'s body yet and will it be ready for the following week?[/quote:976366ac0e]Yeah, I\'m still deciding what color to paint it, and I got to dual cell it and stuff. I just might have one of my own projects done first.\r\n\r\n[quote:976366ac0e]Thanx Again for doin what you did for me, really appreciate it Pimp  :cool:[/quote:976366ac0e]Hey, no problem. Sorry it took so long. :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(20766,'696b4fe530','Dave,\r\n\r\nI\'m getting discombobulated here  :sad: \r\n\r\n1). You\'ll send the winner the car. (Subaru)\r\n2). You\'ve done my chassis\'s so those come to me\r\n3).  You did an extra chassis (Precious) for me, so include that too.\r\n\r\nDone Deal Pimp :cool: \r\n\r\nNo problem about the time, you got life goin on like the rest of us and that shit takes priority, period !\r\n\r\nI haven\'t heard from dude about the RX7!  I guess when he gives me an address I\'ll send it !\r\n\r\nGot the RS Vette yesterday, they\'re hard to get now at half the price.  Picked up an F150 also.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20773,'b440c34894','[quote:b440c34894=\"DarkTari\"]Is there anything that needs to be added to the Auction description?  You never gave me the chassis description..  Just add what you need.[/quote:b440c34894]I already touched it up a tad. \r\n\r\nIt actually don\'t have seat backs, but since it was advertised, it\'s gonna now. :cool: \r\n\r\nDave'),(20769,'6e8d60d954','[quote:6e8d60d954=\"DarkTari\"]Dave,\r\n\r\nI\'m getting discombobulated here  :sad: \r\n\r\n1). You\'ll send the winner the car. (Subaru)\r\n2). You\'ve done my chassis\'s so those come to me\r\n3).  You did an extra chassis (Precious) for me, so include that too.\r\n\r\nDone Deal Pimp :cool: [/quote:6e8d60d954]Yeah, that\'s what I\'m saying, we\'re straight.\r\n\r\nI was just saying the Precious chassis I send you will be 35mhz, since I \r\nwill not have a controller for it.\r\n\r\n[quote:6e8d60d954]\r\nGot the RS Vette yesterday, they\'re hard to get now at half the price.  Picked up an F150 also.[/quote:6e8d60d954]How funny, I just got back with a F150. They only had the display Vette left, I was gonna try to get them to cut  me a deal on it since it was used, but I waited in line too long, and lost interest. :lol:\r\n\r\ndave'),(20770,'e70d6ad3a1','I got the DEMO also, it was missing the antenna so I went to another RS and got a new one.  Opened a Radio Shaq account to get the 10% off, that\'s why I went ahead and got the F150.\r\n\r\nIs there anything that needs to be added to the Auction description?  You never gave me the chassis description..  Just add what you need.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21034,'ef0f8ee0ef','weve all decided thats the worst thing weve ever seen so you get last place and have to send us prizes.\r\n\r\nhaha actually i dono whats up with judging since nobody is around.'),(22942,'ca9b94833e','sounds good dude'),(36421,'a432c38061','Well, you sent me a gen 1 alloy front axle/joint cups.  I ordered a rear alloy axle.  \r\n\r\nAlso, The alloy rear lower arms cause binding in the rear axle.  Do I need to get the rear alloy towers to get them to fit right?\r\n\r\nSorry, this is kinda short and sweet.  My e-mails went into more detail.  \r\n\r\nI know GPM made the rear lower arms so I of-course don\'t hold any blame on you for that.  I just wondered if you had any essay on them.\r\n\r\nThe wrong axle is all your fault though. :grin:  But, I appreciate your service and you\'ve always been good to me in the past.  I could actually order the rear axle again and you could charge me for a front.  This would equal out the cost at least.\r\n\r\nThanx for your time.\r\n\r\nHachi'),(33811,'b917abeedb','Didnt know if you got my message or not on gsr. I shipped the pro-z and your xmod parts out on Oct. 2 Usps \r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33919,'2b8ee65a3c','If you would like a ZZMT, just Paypal me $21 USD and I\'ll get one out ASAP.\r\n\r\nThat should be enough to cover shipping and Paypal fees.\r\n\r\nIf you drop me your addy, I could calculate the shipping, to almost exactly what it would cost.\r\n\r\nGlad to help out,\r\n\r\n\r\nSG219\r\n\r\n\r\nMy Paypal addy is.....\r\n\r\nsg219@hotmail.com'),(34033,'cf8948e8c0','[quote:cf8948e8c0][quote:cf8948e8c0]Hey ph2t if i send some more paysluts your way would you be able to send another one of em wonderful nelly deluxe\'s back with my package im not much of a ebayer.\r\n\r\nAlso a link to where you found that lipo pack you used on your monster would be nice if you got one. If not i guess its search time.\r\n\r\nHope all is well down under!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---Matt[/quote:cf8948e8c0]\r\n\r\nI\'ve got one going on ebay mate, just bid on that, that\'s the way I\'m releasing tha deluxes at the moment.\r\n\r\nGoto my site and in the news section there is a link.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nph2t.\r\n\r\n[/quote:cf8948e8c0]\r\n\r\n\r\nBid on it ;) \r\n\r\nHow heated does the bidding usually become for it during the last minutes?\r\n\r\nWill i have to fight for it lol.'),(36495,'227605f004','Serious, could ya hook a pimp up, make a couple bucks out of it? :D If not it\'s all good, i can\'t get one for a week or two anyways. Thanks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32988,'71fd6a5aef','as of now, i dont do many electrical mods, mainly because if i mess it up, i cant buy another bit. (my parents wont let me... :evil: ) (im only 14) but then again i dont want an insanly fast bit, i cant control it and they are sometimes not fun to drive. but i am thinking of selling my 1:10 scale off-road buggy car, so i can take the extra $250 or so and by some bits/epochs. then i might FET some of the cars... :grin: what else can i do to make the car faster? :???:'),(31656,'796c712878','Cheers man , \r\nThats a good idea actually if you didnt want tp pay and just wanted the fastest motor . As long a radioshack dont notice . :-o \r\n\r\njoe'),(37243,'b188e2eb57',':-o'),(27065,'6a771dd16d','[quote:6a771dd16d]Hey man, you wanna stack some fets for me? lol [/quote:6a771dd16d]If you\'re serious just let me know. I charge $10 for a FET mod. $15 to stack \'em.\r\n\r\nDave'),(26750,'9286df205f','[quote:9286df205f=\"backdrift\"]hey dude, is it shipped yet? im waiting for my mom to get back from virginia to ship it since my dad is always sleeping =[[/quote:9286df205f]\r\n\r\nSent out a couple of days ago.  When was mine shipped.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (27175,'48e69a4ea3','Sorry for the incommunicado.. loooong day plus dumb shit here... you know how it is...\r\n\r\n\"B\" crew... yeah I can\'t believe they don\'t have the bruces in there yet...  lol and did you notice that we got bitPimp under our names?... Finks, Hiroto and sdog too... pretty cool shit...\r\n\r\nOH! and check this shit out JUST listed on dinball... think it\'s maaaaaaad pricey but holy shit is it dooooope!!!\r\n\r\nhttp://www.rcmart.com/catalog/product_info.php?cPath=144_596_599&amp;products_id=11505'),(29230,'cc70d72cd4','i have a full gpm car for sale, atomicmods.com V2, PNS02 motor, PNS04 motor, Liions + charger, and atomic mods superstock all for sale.. i really need to get rid of it, make an offer'),(20958,'b668894d67','Ok! thanks alot dude, i will do that in a couple.'),(21042,'a95745f80d','lol \r\n\r\nhe really tried hard this time.'),(21637,'5b5412f45d','hey just wondering does the eletrics include the servo and the top part (blakc bit that holds it down).. casue i need them...'),(21571,'e05194f9b6','Dude you really selling off all your little cars?\r\n\r\n  I would beinterested in addding a hue35 custom to my collection for sure.\r\n\r\n  I understand to though bro I have not had much time for them the last few months and get more use out of the bigger cars.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20798,'344caa3e80','In your thread where you hopped up your MR-02 with alloy parts, you didn\'t answer ph2t\'s question....that\'s just like you to snobbishly brush people off....'),(20799,'4a30c3845b','What the hell did I ever do to you???? I hadn\'t even read my other post, that\'s why I didn\'t respond...in time. I didn\'t know I was on a time limit???'),(20800,'2cf06bf0bf','Hey, I\'ve notified Dark Tari that your payment has been recieved, he\'s just waiting for you to PM him with your address.\r\n\r\nAs soon as he gets it, he\'ll get that car out to you.\r\n\r\nDave'),(24696,'0b95337725','I\'ll have DarkTari contact you, he said it\'s possible but I\'ll let you 2 talk  :cool:'),(24697,'278d91fb60','Thankz Pimpin'),(27837,'9b3906045b','Your welcome. :-) \r\n\r\nEnjoy. :cool:'),(32847,'e949ef32d0','No problem man.  Glad you enjoy it.  If you gotta fish tank, you gotta keep it out.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(20806,'abb247fe11','I\'m pretty sure there\'s no problem with this, but I just wanted to clear it through you first.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the FET stash is running dangerously low, I\'m gonna need more to finish the auction cars. It\'s a rent check, so money\'s tight until after the first. So if it\'s not a problem, I was gonna borrow from the PayPal stash, and order more FETs, and of coarse pay it back before the end.\r\n\r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20807,'abb247fe11','I\'m pretty sure there\'s no problem with this, but I just wanted to clear it through you first.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the FET stash is running dangerously low, I\'m gonna need more to finish the auction cars. It\'s a rent check, so money\'s tight until after the first. So if it\'s not a problem, I was gonna borrow from the PayPal stash, and order more FETs, and of coarse pay it back before the end.\r\n\r\n\r\ndave'),(20808,'d8d2760251','[quote:d8d2760251=\"crazydave\"]I\'m pretty sure there\'s no problem with this, but I just wanted to clear it through you first.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the FET stash is running dangerously low, I\'m gonna need more to finish the auction cars. It\'s a rent check, so money\'s tight until after the first. So if it\'s not a problem, I was gonna borrow from the PayPal stash, and order more FETs, and of coarse pay it back before the end.\r\n\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:d8d2760251]yea man, absolutely, do whatchya gotta do.'),(20809,'b56eaffacf','Did you recieve the MO yet?  should be there soon.  Lemme know when it comes');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20810,'baf9e0c52a','Good timing bro.... I just checked the post, and looky there. I gots the MO. \r\n\r\nI\'m off to ship her.  Give her a good home, and make some vids and pics..\r\n\r\nHave fun dude.\r\n\r\nI\'ll be poppin up a Traxxas Bandit RTR for sale probably tonight, so if you know anybody lookin, send em my way...\r\n\r\nDo I ship it to the return addy?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(33641,'f4f0813777','[quote:f4f0813777=\"Maxximum Attack\"]Yeah I meant a front bumper (crash bar). How will I join the bars together? to make cross members?[/quote:f4f0813777]\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'d probably use some solder, or maybe even some JB Weld... It\'s gonna be a trial, and error type thing.'),(31889,'0d4b1f180c','pimp chat'),(26859,'abfa404c02','Yeah, they rock. For real. As far as differences goes. I don\'t know.\r\nI got one only. Don\'t think they would differ. Mine was the monster patrol.\r\nThe steereng motor is hard wired clone motor(some cheap toy).\r\nit helps a lot, big difference. But it takes considerable amount of power.\r\nI would suggest tri-cell. It flies, sick air on jumps. Power adapter for charging is the must have. \r\nLast word, best micro rc for the buck you spend.\r\n And, no, i don\'t have one for sale.'),(32851,'e7e70a96a8','Nah, keep it out to play with it man.  It\'s fine to go in the tank.\r\n\r\nBTW, what kind of turtle do you have?  I used to have a red eared slider.  Dorm rules don\'t allow turtles, so I had to get rid of it last year.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (25392,'270d997dcc','yes do it now'),(20813,'d8d2760251','[quote:d8d2760251=\"crazydave\"]I\'m pretty sure there\'s no problem with this, but I just wanted to clear it through you first.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the FET stash is running dangerously low, I\'m gonna need more to finish the auction cars. It\'s a rent check, so money\'s tight until after the first. So if it\'s not a problem, I was gonna borrow from the PayPal stash, and order more FETs, and of coarse pay it back before the end.\r\n\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:d8d2760251]yea man, absolutely, do whatchya gotta do.'),(20814,'8584fcdf7f','[quote:8584fcdf7f=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:8584fcdf7f=\"crazydave\"]I\'m pretty sure there\'s no problem with this, but I just wanted to clear it through you first.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the FET stash is running dangerously low, I\'m gonna need more to finish the auction cars. It\'s a rent check, so money\'s tight until after the first. So if it\'s not a problem, I was gonna borrow from the PayPal stash, and order more FETs, and of coarse pay it back before the end.\r\n\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:8584fcdf7f]yea man, absolutely, do whatchya gotta do.[/quote:8584fcdf7f]Ok, cool man. Just wanted to check first. \r\n\r\nDamn DT had me FET up all kinds of cars, and I wasn\'t doing the math. :lol:'),(20815,'8584fcdf7f','[quote:8584fcdf7f=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:8584fcdf7f=\"crazydave\"]I\'m pretty sure there\'s no problem with this, but I just wanted to clear it through you first.\r\n\r\nAnyways, the FET stash is running dangerously low, I\'m gonna need more to finish the auction cars. It\'s a rent check, so money\'s tight until after the first. So if it\'s not a problem, I was gonna borrow from the PayPal stash, and order more FETs, and of coarse pay it back before the end.\r\n\r\n\r\ndave[/quote:8584fcdf7f]yea man, absolutely, do whatchya gotta do.[/quote:8584fcdf7f]Ok, cool man. Just wanted to check first. \r\n\r\nDamn DT had me FET up all kinds of cars, and I wasn\'t doing the math. :lol:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20816,'9864161b21','[quote:9864161b21=\"crazydave\"]Ok, cool man. Just wanted to check first. \r\n\r\nDamn DT had me FET up all kinds of cars, and I wasn\'t doing the math. :lol:[/quote:9864161b21]as long as starsky and hutch get fet\'ed I don\'t care lol\r\n\r\nno, really...\r\nyou send me whatever, whenever the auctions are over - if you have to take out expenses, do so - no worries.\r\n\r\nhaven\'t checked yet, but did ya vote yet for the contest winners?\r\nI kinda felt like DT was trying to say he stuck to the \"summer bling\" theme and that\'s why his choices were so different from mine.\r\nI thought I did stick to the \"summer bling\" theme and even mentioned it by picking the mods that enduced the most \"summer-time\" feel (e.g. sg\'s boat)\r\nyea sg\'s boat isn\'t prestine, but its more modding than most enteries, it\'s modding a new vehicle (boat) and as far as I know, boat says summer bling more than a car.\r\nbut whatever, I\'m probably reading way too much in to like always.\r\nI\'ll go sit in my corner lol'),(20818,'e065dcd758','you stay home to smoke pole all day? :lol: \r\n\r\ngod damn dude, you picked the best day not to be here.\r\nit\'s Kathy, Cindy, myself, and Kathy Marshak appeared after a bit.\r\n\r\nabsolutely nobody here.\r\nI got bitched at again from Upledger (kathy and carol).\r\nI was a good boy and played nice until I got off the phone.\r\nI fucking hate this shit.\r\nI told Tom I felt like I was being micro-managed so much that I felt it neccessary to tell everyone when I went to take a piss and how long it took so everything could be billed appropriately. lol\r\n\r\n\r\nget on that faggy AIM if you\'re gonna be on for a bit.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28873,'09fa21a55f','Thanks dude that would be great if you could order another one. I\'m also on ebay (yakboyuk) not quite as many feedbacks as you but 100% never the less. Let me know how much it\'ll be &amp; I\'ll paypal you asap. I really appreciate this\r\n\r\nDr Simon Holmes\r\naka yakboy'),(20820,'ca8d5e0fde','you know you\'re welcomed to register in the galleries?\r\nif you do, after - I can give you proper permissions to upload your images.\r\n\r\ngo fart if interested.'),(23575,'efe54291fd','No, I don\'t have the adjustable one. I have the other and all of the motor mounts for the different pinions. They didn\'t have the adjustable when I got mine.'),(20822,'9695c459ba','[quote:9695c459ba=\"Ahh5hit\"]What the hell did I ever do to you???? I hadn\'t even read my other post, that\'s why I didn\'t respond...in time. I didn\'t know I was on a time limit???[/quote:9695c459ba]\r\n\r\nlol, sorry man, hehe, I was just a bit cranky....:-) \r\n\r\nYou\'re an aight guy, don\'t mind that other message...'),(20823,'a2417b5143','Yea man\r\n\r\nMike DeVirgilio\r\n21-07 25th Road\r\nAstoria, NY 11102\r\n\r\nAwesome Stuff');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20824,'5c046859d8','Thanks man....I\'ve been keeping all of my shit on photobucket. I don\'t have any really cool rides to post at this point, so I figured there wasn\'t much of a point for me to have a BP gallery just yet. If you want I can post some pics of all the nice home mods that has been taking up all of my fucking time lately   :-)'),(20825,'6d200b6e30','Cool beans ...  I shipped it about 2 hours ago.  Put $100 of insurance on it for ya just to be safe, or incase we want to pull fraud on the PO...lmao j/k\r\n\r\nHe said 2 to 3 days , so you\'ll get it by Thursday.. Let me know when you get it.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(33631,'5546a7f257','I feel ya man...  It gets pricey, but I guess it\'s worth it. I don\'t party anymore, so my party $$$ goes there..\r\n\r\n\r\nYou wouldn\'t need to drop a grand unless you wanted to race with it.\r\n\r\n\r\nRealisticly you could get a decent RTR T Maxx truck for around $300 that will do what you want it to do, then you just have to buy fuel, and some spare parts. (depends how you drive)\r\n\r\n\r\nI love all my electric R/Cs, but just being able to re fuel, and not wait on anything is awesome, and the sound is even better..\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(20828,'3a49ece7ac','1st off this PM isn\'t intended to kiss yer ass :grin: \r\n\r\nHoly shit, if I win that ride you and DT put together for only $27 I will shit myself.  Checked out the other pics of the Subaru in your gallery and Wow!  I have been holding out for a ride that really speaks to me and that car is just amzing.  Not to mention that it is a product of you and DT.  Well anyhow, we\'ll see how it all turns out.  Just thought you would like to know that your work is being greatly admired from this pimp.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (26907,'ad268273d7','[quote:ad268273d7=\"sg219\"]Sounds good!! :cool: \r\n\r\nI\'ll probably do it sometime Saturday while the Steelers are practicing for the Super Bowl. :rockon:[/quote:ad268273d7]\r\n\r\nI told you they were for real. Good luck getting past New england and Indianapolis. Maybe we will see you in the big game.'),(35672,'7c0e4771d2','[quote:7c0e4771d2=\"hue35\"]Heh... I didn\'t even see the link to the auctions. I\'m outta my fuckin\' mind.\r\n\r\n$50 for 2, shipped?  These are about $16 each at Dinball... I haven\'t looked in a few weeks, but that\'s where the price was last month. Let me look around a bit and get back to ya... if these have dried up, I might go for that, but I was thinkin\' more like $40 shipped in my head.\r\n\r\nTalk to ya in a few...[/quote:7c0e4771d2]\r\n\r\n\r\nThats cool.\r\n\r\nI have a few.  They\'re just chillin\' here.\r\n\r\nHere\'s the link to the Mini-Z brand board on Dinball....\r\n\r\n[url]http://www.rcmart.com/catalog/product_info.php?cPath=144_21_150&amp;products_id=5983[/url]'),(35674,'4e1bfdbdbe','How much would you sell an Xmod to me with shipping and everything?\r\n\r\nIn Canadian dollars though?\r\n\r\nAre you still into bits and zips?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35865,'8e9bd3d089','Hey dude, those are some real cheap pullbacks I\'ve had forever (got those during preschool for some fund rasing thing they were doing, and to put that in perspective I got an Associate\'s degree 2 years ago).  Fully plastic except for the axles, springs, and pivots.  Just under 1.5 Bit Char-G long.  From the quality I\'d guess China or Taiwan.  No brand stamps anywhere, and if they had stickers on the bottom they\'re LONG gone.\r\n\r\nI\'ll try and see if I can find anything similar that can be ordered.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nfrizzen'),(35783,'17cfea812c','Just read your reply on the post. \r\n\r\nWhere can I get my hands on this and is it terribly expensive?'),(35979,'5cf70d40b3','Does not matter anyhow. Right now I run the car without a body, i do this to check the testing status. Once I get the body in it will look nice I hope.\r\n\r\nThe pics of the track are coming shortly...'),(32454,'267502fd43','I sent ya a pm with my new address awhile back but ya never replied and incase ya erased the pm and whatnot, here it is again....\r\n\r\nYahya Mangir\r\n435 hamilton street\r\nAlbany NY 12203\r\n\r\nThanks for all the trouble man. Sorry the group buy went the way it did man. :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36468,'b01df9244f','Hey Sg, sucks about the doc, hate goin\' to hospitals. About the bodies, take your time pimp, i\'m just happy you\'re doin\' it for me! Thanks again man, if you need anything in Canada (retired Xmods, the new MicroZ and custom rydes or w/e) you know who to pm!  :cool:'),(37761,'95279be264','Talking about the IW02M?  The one with the plug connection ports?'),(37762,'4640ee753e','[quote:4640ee753e=\"HACHI-RYOKU\"]Talking about the IW02M?  The one with the plug connection ports?[/quote:4640ee753e]\r\n\r\nNot sure\r\n\r\nI just know it is a pan chassis in black in a black box.  I have a the Saleen S7'),(36396,'bb0596d8cb','[quote:bb0596d8cb=\"HACHI-RYOKU\"]How\'s it going?  I sent you a few e-mails.  It was concerning some parts I\'ve ordered from you.  Did you get them?\r\n\r\nI ordered under the name Robert Wilson.  My e-mail is boho81@yahoo.com[/quote:bb0596d8cb]\r\n\r\nWhat was your questions?'),(20831,'6b3eca323e','I was thinking today.  Since it seems Kwibb is eternally MIA maybe it was time to replace him as a mod.  Now I am definatly saying I don\'t want to be a mod, I like slummin it too much, but SG, Bird, Betty, ph2t, Hugh and Supperfly come to mind as worth while replacements.  Maybe to spice it up have em mod for the position.  Hell you could open it up to everyone but of course be a little bias twards those pimps :cool:   Well anyhow just an idea.  Not like we really need more mods but whatever.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20832,'a197e73c29','[quote:a197e73c29=\"Sdog\"]Thanks man....I\'ve been keeping all of my shit on photobucket. I don\'t have any really cool rides to post at this point, so I figured there wasn\'t much of a point for me to have a BP gallery just yet. If you want I can post some pics of all the nice home mods that has been taking up all of my fucking time lately   :-)[/quote:a197e73c29]well, as you said about not having the \"cool\" rides \'yet biatch\' or whatever, I know.\r\nbut you do have \"informative pics\".\r\none of the other things I like pimps to use the gallery for besides showing off their work, is for \'informative\' pics (e.g. height of chassis in bit vs super-bit, etc.)\r\nI\'ve noticed you take clear, concise pictures when you do of your subject.\r\n\r\npeople hate the infamous \"red x\" in posts, so do I in \"informative\" posts - so if you feel it\'s warranted, you can post it where you know it will stay intact for as long as the post itself exists.\r\n\r\nanyways, the offer is there - you don\'t have to take it yet, you can take it later, nobody\'s gonna go limp lol :D \r\n\r\np.s. just thought of something.\r\nyou\'re getting to be a regular around here, if you haven\'t already, post up the \"Mug Shots\" thread so we can all get to know ya better.\r\nif you\'re feeling \"vulnerable\" just take a peek at the thread and you\'ll feel a lot better.'),(20833,'5c10d4c8a8','Congratulations on your winning bid!\r\n\r\n(look biatch, I\'m trying not to give you the non-typical \"pre-canned\" homo response here so bare with me lol)\r\n\r\nAlright...\r\n#1.) sorry nobody contacted you yet. our own dumb fault. call us names - we deserve it. I can only offer you a \"sorry\" and I guess a random \"homey\" to make up for it.\r\n#2.) you can pay cash or money order to me, or you can pay paypal to crazydave, if you would like to pay crazydave, please send him a PM (private message) asking for his paypal address and he will give it to you.\r\nif you would like to pay cash or money order, send it to me at:\r\nScott Lix\r\n16 Crystal Lake Drive\r\nSt. Peters, MO 63376\r\n#3.) if you want a homey to compensate for our retardness, you\'ll have to send me an address I can ship to you at.\r\n#4.) I appoligize again, I know this doesn\'t make us look \"trust-worthy\" (but you know we are) or like we are \"on top of things\" (we are, just maybe not on these type things).\r\nwe\'re not a shop. we\'ve never \"sold\" anything. and we don\'t want to be a \"shop\" or \"sell\" anything. this is kind of a once a year (if that) type thing and we\'re not looking to \"sell\", \"rip-off\", \"get rich\", or any of that type shit.\r\n\r\nanyways, you have your options, please let me know which you have chosen so I can make \"it\" happen.\r\n\r\nthanks for helping support bitPimps homey, you\'re doing your community a great deed as well as getting something kick ass in return for it. you should feel great and I hope you do.\r\n\r\nthanks again.\r\n- CaboWabo');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20834,'b49e5a93b7','Cool man....\r\n\r\nI did sign up, so hook me up and let me know what I need to do. I\'ll see if I can dig up a pic of my mug.'),(23173,'4407d31a6d','yea man, I wouldn\'t loose any sleep over it.\r\nI don\'t think he\'s pissed at ya as much as he\'s feeling hurt. of course he\'d probably never admit that he\'s hurt, but I think he was.\r\nI also think there\'s a mis-understanding there.\r\nI wasn\'t really paying much attention, but from what he told me - the way I took it was - that he was upset because only 1 picture had been put up of his ride and with no details. he said he went in and edited the post to add his pictures and stuff, came back the next day and they were gone.\r\n\r\nI made him aware that we\'re following a format there and asked if maybe where he put the pics weren\'t the right spot?\r\nhe said no, he understood that - but then he mentioned something about others having multiple pics in the \"bid\" thread - I wasn\'t aware that the \"bidding\" thread had anything but the 1 small pic, and the \"gallery\" is where the multiple, larger pics were.\r\n\r\nso I think he might be confused on the format and what goes where. or if there are multiple pics in the \"bidding\" threads for some of the rides, he might just be feeling left out or something.\r\n\r\nanyways, like you said - it ain\'t worth loosing sleep over, he\'ll get over it.\r\nI\'m sure he\'s not \"pissed\" at ya like you might think.\r\nI don\'t think he\'s going out like kwikbb did - he\'s probably just hanging back so he doesn\'t say something in the heat of the moment or whatever.[quote:4407d31a6d=\"Da Big Kahuna\"]Hey C-Dub, \r\nWhat\'s up wit Silla?  Think he\'s mad at me?\r\nGotta tellya sumthin in private Pimp.  I know he\'s givin me da silent treatment.  After I saw what was done to the Auction Post, I had no problem with him editing the gallery, I actually wanted to do the same thing as I explained in my response.  But when it came to the bidding post, as I also explained I had a format that I was sticking to cause it worked, so I deleted the pics AGAIN after he put them back in.\r\n\r\nI PM\'d him explaining why I did what I did and to get me some particulars on the ride so I can pump-it-up as much as possible but he didn\'t/won\'t respond to that or to the last post. So I did what I could and will continue to do so.  I could only pump it up as much as I could see, it would\'ve been Pimp to include any unseen mods (chassis, motor, etc).\r\nNow is it just me or is he going along the way of quikbb ?  He and I had a lil disagreement about a contest and he (as you put it ) took his ball and went home.  I can\'t understand why a lil disagreement results in such bitch\'n behavior man? Damn !  I mean he edited the post first without so much as a PM letting me know he did, I didn\'t get upset, I just changed only one of them back, and he gets a tude.  I responded as diplomatically as possible, afterall we are the IC, we should be able to work thru shit like this and not hold grudges.  We\'re all adults here!  Hell when Dave answered a question someone posted about future rides to go on the block, I edited it and inform\'d Dave that we should leave it a secret until it hits the block. That way they\'ll tune in at least every week to see what we have as opposed to only tuning in when they know of a ride that they want to bid on (not giving them a choice) and Dave had no problem, but the main thing is I informed him of what I did.\r\n\r\nIf Silla has issues with me, fuck it! He\'ll get over it.  I ain\'t kiss\'n his ass that\'s for sure! But I\'m not hold\'n any grudges either, I got enough shit goin on in my life right now to loose any sleep over dis shit.\r\n\r\nJust wanted to see what you thought.  Oh Great GaZoo ! LOL   :eek:[/quote:4407d31a6d]'),(26984,'bb280a6096','Cool....I\'ll get it shipped out tomorrow.\r\n\r\nThanks bud.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (27900,'3729c4d303','Hey dude.\r\nI just printed some test decals.\r\nI didn\'t realize I printed them on white decal, sticker paper.\r\nSo they ain\'t what I had planned, they ain\'t all that cool, but you might find some use for them.\r\n\r\nIf you want some, I need your shipping info so I can send them to you. \r\n\r\nThey\'re on the white background so you\'ll have to cut them out. \r\nJust peel them off and stick. \r\nThese aren\'t the best by far, but maybe you use them - if not, no biggie.'),(20841,'e25d783db5','you\'re all set Sdog with your Spriviliages.\r\nyou now see 3 new Sbuttons.\r\nif you have Stroubles, please look at the FAQs / FGAs threads about the Galleries.\r\n\r\nhave I worn out the Sjoke yet? lol\r\n(sorry, a little tequila over here)\r\n\r\nanyways, let me know if you have any troubles and I\'ll give ya some more wordy help.'),(20842,'9695c459ba','[quote:9695c459ba=\"Ahh5hit\"]What the hell did I ever do to you???? I hadn\'t even read my other post, that\'s why I didn\'t respond...in time. I didn\'t know I was on a time limit???[/quote:9695c459ba]\r\n\r\nlol, sorry man, hehe, I was just a bit cranky....:-) \r\n\r\nYou\'re an aight guy, don\'t mind that other message...'),(20843,'79c906717c','[quote:79c906717c=\"Finks\"]I was thinking today.  Since it seems Kwibb is eternally MIA maybe it was time to replace him as a mod.  Now I am definatly saying I don\'t want to be a mod, I like slummin it too much, but SG, Bird, Betty, ph2t, Hugh and Supperfly come to mind as worth while replacements.  Maybe to spice it up have em mod for the position.  Hell you could open it up to everyone but of course be a little bias twards those pimps :cool:   Well anyhow just an idea.  Not like we really need more mods but whatever.[/quote:79c906717c]actually, he has been replaced in a sense...\r\nNamuna (admin/mod) from TinyRC has taken his place.\r\nwe didn\'t make a mention of it and prefer not to - we don\'t care if people know, but we don\'t want to make it a \"big deal\", but Namuna is a moderator here now.\r\n\r\nwe have to choose very specific moderators around here, we have to know them on a \"personal\" level so we know if they can truely moderate here at bitPimps. we\'re not the typical forum and we can\'t have your typical moderators, therefore we get only the ones that fit with what we/the community needs.\r\n\r\nthere\'s a bunch that\'s been talked about and we like to keep just about everything a surprise. so please don\'t feel like you\'ve just gotten shot down or shouldn\'t suggest anything anymore.\r\nwe love suggestions and truth be told, lately your suggestions contain the most valid reasons for an honest response. thank you for that - it seems you\'re truely trying to help the community.\r\n\r\nanyways, yes - he has been replaced and thank you for the suggestion / comment. keep em coming, know what the \"pimps\" want and delivering is another thing we like to do and take pride in.\r\n\r\n- C-Dub');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20844,'d4a4055840','Dude, i absolutely love your Endless Z, any chance you would trade it?'),(34097,'502bb8bb40','Hey man-\r\n\r\nYou mentioned an image showing alternative contact points for Nelly wires...\r\n\r\nThanks!'),(20846,'f65dde4147','So have they been sent yet?  No worries either way, just wondering.'),(20848,'f88e25f51e','Hi Jesse:  \r\n\r\n   I had to send mekinhux his citroen i did for him and it sucked my funds dry, he lives in portugal and cost me 10 bucks...anyways i have your package already to go, i get paid thursday and will be able to get your bodies in that day. you will have them saturday fo sure. \r\n\r\nDid you ever do anything to that pep boys car?\r\n\r\njmays'),(20853,'9864161b21','[quote:9864161b21=\"crazydave\"]Ok, cool man. Just wanted to check first. \r\n\r\nDamn DT had me FET up all kinds of cars, and I wasn\'t doing the math. :lol:[/quote:9864161b21]as long as starsky and hutch get fet\'ed I don\'t care lol\r\n\r\nno, really...\r\nyou send me whatever, whenever the auctions are over - if you have to take out expenses, do so - no worries.\r\n\r\nhaven\'t checked yet, but did ya vote yet for the contest winners?\r\nI kinda felt like DT was trying to say he stuck to the \"summer bling\" theme and that\'s why his choices were so different from mine.\r\nI thought I did stick to the \"summer bling\" theme and even mentioned it by picking the mods that enduced the most \"summer-time\" feel (e.g. sg\'s boat)\r\nyea sg\'s boat isn\'t prestine, but its more modding than most enteries, it\'s modding a new vehicle (boat) and as far as I know, boat says summer bling more than a car.\r\nbut whatever, I\'m probably reading way too much in to like always.\r\nI\'ll go sit in my corner lol'),(20850,'19a64212d7','Arite that\'s cool.  As for the pepboys car, not yet, she is still stock.  That little endevor will take a while to do, after my boat the trans am and a Mini mod it\'s next on my list.  Time will tell 8-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20851,'cb70d6f887','I saw that you are looking for one, i can get them for you if you want, any chance we can work out a trade of one for a biff installed?'),(20852,'7f1c08819f','[quote:7f1c08819f=\"grnmachnracr\"]I saw that you are looking for one, i can get them for you if you want, any chance we can work out a trade of one for a biff installed?[/quote:7f1c08819f]\r\n\r\nnah, not interested anymore, but thanks......'),(20873,'b46c3b9c99','[quote:b46c3b9c99=\"crazydave\"]I\'m gonna go in and vote without looking what you guys have voted, but I will say this, boats do nothing for me, they just don\'t. I will be keeping the theme of the contest in strong consideration, but Hue\'s car is easily his swan song. He easily has the best eyes on the bPs, and just deserves recognition as \"the best\". It\'s convertable, so it\'s fits the theme close enough for me. So his \'maro\' will be getting my #1 vote without further consideration.[/quote:b46c3b9c99]straight up... damn man - judging is so hard.\r\nI go back and forth, especially after I hear pro\'s and con\'s from others.\r\n\r\nshit man, I\'m second guessing...\r\nahh, gonna stick to my guns, but yea - I can totally see where you\'re coming from'),(36788,'c7ce954133','[quote:c7ce954133=\"HACHI-RYOKU\"]If you need anybody to do a fet mod to the cars, then let me know.  I\'m sure you already have that covered, but just in case, it\'s the least I can do to support.  I would offer to paint and putty, but I know there are people here who can do that better than me.  I have a lot of extra supplies and what not.  If I know about the car that\'s chosen ahead of time, I can always send you some stuff that I may have laying around that might go good with the ride.[/quote:c7ce954133]\r\n\r\nHachi !\r\n\r\nPimp I really appreciate your offer and I may call on your services in that respect.  I wasn\'t planning on going that far but with your offer, we may can do a couple FET\'s for the lucky Pimp\'s who\'s name is picked.\r\nI\'ll be intouch!  :-o');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20876,'dd6efadd9a','sg219 is gonna be paying you paypal for his car that he won off the auction block so please send him your paypal address.'),(20877,'dd6efadd9a','sg219 is gonna be paying you paypal for his car that he won off the auction block so please send him your paypal address.'),(20878,'d4a4055840','Dude, i absolutely love your Endless Z, any chance you would trade it?'),(20880,'4c39786dc3','[quote:4c39786dc3=\"Ahh5hit\"]What the hell did I ever do to you???? I hadn\'t even read my other post, that\'s why I didn\'t respond...in time. I didn\'t know I was on a time limit???[/quote:4c39786dc3]\r\n\r\nOk, my other PM was not as detailed as it should have been...Maybe I was just jealous of your rides CONSTANTLY coming out, nonstop, and each one of them was awesome. And I guess I was saw you as a snob because you didn\'t pay much attention to my posts talking to you on TinyRC, or my emails....I dunno man, I guess I saw you as such a high ranking person, I felt jealous....Oh well. \r\n\r\nOh, and as for FETs for your MZM or MR-02....buy a Woah Nelly turbo from ph2t, better than any FET/stacks out there.....less resistance, higher current capability, low power dissipitation, yada yada.'),(20881,'b7b208da83','[quote:b7b208da83=\"Finks\"]1st off this PM isn\'t intended to kiss yer ass :grin: \r\n\r\nHoly shit, if I win that ride you and DT put together for only $27 I will shit myself.  Checked out the other pics of the Subaru in your gallery and Wow!  I have been holding out for a ride that really speaks to me and that car is just amzing.  Not to mention that it is a product of you and DT.  Well anyhow, we\'ll see how it all turns out.  Just thought you would like to know that your work is being greatly admired from this pimp.[/quote:b7b208da83]Thanks. I was pretty excited about this car. I was hoping someone would say something, but when it got flooded with bids, I took that as compliment enough, so it\'s even cooler to get a personal compliment. Thanks :-) \r\n\r\nI originally pictured it with yellow fading into orange, and I reverted to one my usual color schemes. I don\'t  know why I did  that, and that\'s my only regret.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20882,'e8451ea309','Hehe, I love it.  Makes it shout \"CD was here\"'),(20884,'4c39786dc3','[quote:4c39786dc3=\"Ahh5hit\"]What the hell did I ever do to you???? I hadn\'t even read my other post, that\'s why I didn\'t respond...in time. I didn\'t know I was on a time limit???[/quote:4c39786dc3]\r\n\r\nOk, my other PM was not as detailed as it should have been...Maybe I was just jealous of your rides CONSTANTLY coming out, nonstop, and each one of them was awesome. And I guess I was saw you as a snob because you didn\'t pay much attention to my posts talking to you on TinyRC, or my emails....I dunno man, I guess I saw you as such a high ranking person, I felt jealous....Oh well. \r\n\r\nOh, and as for FETs for your MZM or MR-02....buy a Woah Nelly turbo from ph2t, better than any FET/stacks out there.....less resistance, higher current capability, low power dissipitation, yada yada.'),(20888,'acd00b2328','[quote:acd00b2328=\"Da Big Kahuna\"]Lemme know what he decides to do and when you or Dave get his ducketts ![/quote:acd00b2328]will do, so far on daves part, he keeps the cash until everything is over and then sends to me.\r\nhe ran out of fets and we\'re letting him use a small portion from bitPimps auction to get more and then he\'ll pay it back before shipping to me.\r\nwe know he\'s good for it, so it\'s all good - but that\'s the developments I know of so far.'),(20889,'7826560081','That\'s cool, Dave will contact me so I can get this out.\r\n\r\n :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20890,'08ca4657f7','[quote:08ca4657f7=\"Da Big Kahuna\"]Don\'t worry about sendin him Da Homie, I send one out with every car \r\n\r\nIt\'s Da Pimp thing to do  :cool:[/quote:08ca4657f7]damn man. we\'re on the same wave length in too many places.\r\ntoo bad we\'re not close enough to hook up every now and then.'),(20891,'46331ed8dd','True Dat !  :cool:'),(36790,'313d644e43','Recieved this the day after I posted.....\r\n\r\n[quote:313d644e43=\"HACHI-RYOKU\"]If you need anybody to do a fet mod to the cars, then let me know.  I\'m sure you already have that covered, but just in case, it\'s the least I can do to support.  I would offer to paint and putty, but I know there are people here who can do that better than me.  I have a lot of extra supplies and what not.  If I know about the car that\'s chosen ahead of time, I can always send you some stuff that I may have laying around that might go good with the ride.[/quote:313d644e43]\r\n\r\nNow he stepped up BigTime!  I told him I may call on his services, was planning on going that far but with his offer, we may do a couple.\r\nMaybe after this thing gets started, one of the mods will step up, if not, no problem!  I\'m building a shop for shooting some after pics.  This is gonna be off Da Hook !  ( Haven\'t recieved any entries yet but it\'s still early)'),(36835,'e75a630d88','[quote:e75a630d88=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:e75a630d88=\"Da Big Kahuna\"]Recieved this the day after I posted.....\r\n\r\n[quote:e75a630d88=\"HACHI-RYOKU\"]If you need anybody to do a fet mod to the cars, then let me know.  I\'m sure you already have that covered, but just in case, it\'s the least I can do to support.  I would offer to paint and putty, but I know there are people here who can do that better than me.  I have a lot of extra supplies and what not.  If I know about the car that\'s chosen ahead of time, I can always send you some stuff that I may have laying around that might go good with the ride.[/quote:e75a630d88]\r\n\r\nNow he stepped up BigTime!  I told him I may call on his services, was planning on going that far but with his offer, we may do a couple.\r\nMaybe after this thing gets started, one of the mods will step up, if not, no problem!  I\'m building a shop for shooting some after pics.  This is gonna be off Da Hook !  ( Haven\'t recieved any entries yet but it\'s still early)[/quote:e75a630d88]\r\nThat kicks ass, I love it when the members step up like that.\r\nCool man, run with it - I\'m sure more interests will get perked soon, especially after the 1st one goes out.[/quote:e75a630d88]\r\n\r\n[b:e75a630d88]WORD [/b:e75a630d88]  :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20894,'3c32b6db04','[quote:3c32b6db04=\"DarkTari\"]And can you also include some flame stencils?  Never got any from your last offer.\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp ! [/quote:3c32b6db04]Alright, but they wont go with the cars, no time, but that\'s something I can always drop in an envelope, and mail anytime. \r\n\r\nI gotta cut some for Hog too! Damn I\'m so backed up on other people\'s mods, and I just wanna stick some dubs on the new F150. :lol: \r\n\r\nDave'),(20895,'e8451ea309','Hehe, I love it.  Makes it shout \"CD was here\"'),(20899,'a1a82c7a69','hi realy like ur one zipzap body....the white one with the 2 black stripes. and i was wundering if u could give me tht one. or sell it to me'),(20900,'96dae5aef2','Hey what\'s up?\r\n\r\nMy Paypal email is davesmoejoe@yahoo.com.\r\n\r\nMake sure DT gets your address, or I can pass it along, anything else let me know. :-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(20901,'84748259d1','Its on its way.   $$$$$$ \r\n\r\nMike Smalley Jr.\r\n3918 Inland Ave.\r\nWest Mifflin, PA  15122\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks, \r\n\r\n\r\nMike'),(20903,'a1a82c7a69','hi realy like ur one zipzap body....the white one with the 2 black stripes. and i was wundering if u could give me tht one. or sell it to me');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36818,'37c93a7c6b','[quote:37c93a7c6b=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:37c93a7c6b=\"ph2t\"]hey man, I know, slack late response.  You\'ve prolyl figured out the problem now.\r\n\r\nI take it was a DNS issue?  You running an exchange box in a BIND DNS environment?\r\n\r\nhttp://www.msexchange.org/ is an excellent site for all things exchange, just search the forums there, it may help.\r\n\r\ncheers,\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:37c93a7c6b]\r\nThanks holmes. Nah, wasn\'t a DNS issue. I still have some residual issues left-over but the main part is working now. Our network is so convoluted it\'s not even funny.\r\nI\'ve been going through that site, found some helpful info, but most really didn\'t apply to my particular situation. Again, probably just because of how our network is setup.\r\nI like coding much better than network admin. lol[/quote:37c93a7c6b]\r\n\r\ncool, no worries.  I inhereited the worse fucken network known to man when I started here.  Now it\'s good.  Took me a year to get shit sorted....\r\n\r\nfucken dumbarse admins........'),(32904,'673b07be0f','[quote:673b07be0f=\"weazel\"]Got it today and i love everything :-D[/quote:673b07be0f]\r\n\r\n\r\nGreat!!! I\'m glad it showed up un-damaged and what not.\r\n\r\nEnjoy. \r\n\r\n\r\nMotorGong\r\n\r\n(Dave)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32905,'a27011f363','[quote:a27011f363=\"richh\"]package received!  haven\'t opened it yet, and may not for awhile, but everything look great!\r\n\r\nthanks again...\r\n\r\nrich[/quote:a27011f363]\r\n\r\nGreat!! I\'m glad it showed up un-damaged and what not.\r\n\r\nI bought a GTR Set 2 months ago and still havn\'t opened it. :grin: \r\n\r\nThanks Again!!!\r\n\r\nDave'),(23445,'42e38a7914','I heard you installed FETs on bits, is this true? ($10?) If so would you be willing to hook a pair of Bits or ZZs up for me? \r\n\r\nThanks pimp, \r\nKanye.'),(21038,'1d2de6270e','well judging has been going on for a week. well know in a few days.'),(23146,'af26838422','Dude, I know what you and the other pimps are up to....\r\n\r\nLay off RCmod, just because I\'m a mod there and you hate me doesn\'t mean you have to trash the site, ok?'),(21594,'cdf3a24120','Sorry about the P.M.\'s, I have pop-up blocker on and don\'t see them unless I look for them. Normal shipping for the package is $5.00 to your address.\r\n\r\nIt is packed and ready to go, as soon as I see the money hit paypal, I will ship it out. I\'m sure any pimp can vouch for me, and I\'m a moderator at TinyRC if you have any concerns.\r\n\r\npaypal: Ahh5hit@comcast.net     (thats a 5, not S)\r\n\r\nMike'),(20908,'4b9ddb9eac','im dealing with a moron. ill unlock it in a few days aiaite?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20909,'b1893c2111','I don\'t remember if I wrote you back last night.   :drinkin: Over at Bird\'s.  When I read your PM.  \r\n\r\nAnyway thanks.  NO, I don\'t think your retarded, and its not nessasary for the Homey.  But thanks anyway.  I didn\'t think there was any problem, I just didn\'t want to be thought of as a slacker, trying to avoid payment by not contacting anyone.  Wanted to take care of business A.S.A.P.!!\r\n\r\n The only people I don\'t pay are ones with credit companies and their own cards!! :razz: \r\n\r\n\r\n :-)  :cool:  :-)  :cool:'),(27335,'bbfc263697','Yeah, well, I\'ll tell ya, I usually don\'t take sides, but I do feel betty was wrong. He doesn\'t acknowledge that the thread was moved from General, which is obvious by the second post where some kid said maybe it should be moved to where it was. \r\n\r\nSo anyways, I\'m trying to work it out behind the scenes, and I just didn\'t want you to be pissed at bitPimps as a whole, because we do act as individuals here.\r\n\r\nAnd yes I am a moderator here, so if you have any problems feel free to PM me.  :-) (Can\'t garantee I\'ll always take your side though.  :lol: )\r\n\r\nDave'),(24338,'c3840c21d6','It may be available, I\'ll have Cabo contact you.\r\n\r\nThanx 4 support\'n Pimp  :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20957,'be78b8f97b','[quote:be78b8f97b=\"grnmachnracr\"]Hello Cabo, I was wondering how I get my own photogallery, all help appreciated , thanks\r\n\r\nSupra.[/quote:be78b8f97b]first you need to register in the galleries (preferrably under the name you post as in the forum).\r\nonce you register, I can give you special permissions create your own galleries and upload images.\r\nplease view the FAQ &amp; FGA threads in the forum for more detailed information.'),(20955,'344cdeee21','Hello Cabo, I was wondering how I get my own photogallery, all help appreciated , thanks\r\n\r\nSupra.'),(20956,'be78b8f97b','[quote:be78b8f97b=\"grnmachnracr\"]Hello Cabo, I was wondering how I get my own photogallery, all help appreciated , thanks\r\n\r\nSupra.[/quote:be78b8f97b]first you need to register in the galleries (preferrably under the name you post as in the forum).\r\nonce you register, I can give you special permissions create your own galleries and upload images.\r\nplease view the FAQ &amp; FGA threads in the forum for more detailed information.'),(20923,'e0b4040142','i found panther chassis!\r\n\r\ngoto general!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20924,'e0b4040142','i found panther chassis!\r\n\r\ngoto general!'),(22934,'3bdb886a87','Just wondering if there was any updates on the package?  I am not sure if it was sent lol if not I have been buggin the mail lady for nothing lol'),(20928,'7d872f8765','how did u do tht knight rider scan .... THTS TYTE!'),(34474,'5975fb999a','Hey, I would like to see your PCB layout for the knight rider lights...\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=1005&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=15\r\n\r\nyour pics died.\r\n\r\nAlso, how did you assemble a DC-DC converter for 5V? did you modify the existing one on the PCB?'),(27946,'e4a9ba09af','hay mann do u got msn?'),(27947,'3a88b7875e','yeah.\r\n\r\nph2t@prahranpianos.com'),(33377,'8369d092d7','[quote:8369d092d7=\"sessiz\"]I paid $15 for em shipped. Doesn\'t seem like I\'ll ever get a chance to use em so I\'ll let em go for what I paid for them plus the shipping which should be minimal. (prolly could ship them in an envelope) I don\'t have paypal so we might wanna work out a trade of some sort instead of money. What would the rims be worth to ya trade wise man? :???:\r\n\r\nThe thread for the group buy I got em from is gone but you can check this thread out.\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=28&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=135\r\nYou may want to get in touch with mini bimmers and see what they can do for ya. Prolly get to choose a style you like for around the same price instead of settling. :-)[/quote:8369d092d7]\r\n\r\nI would love to get them and $15.00 is a vary cool deal I will send you the cash and whatever it cost in freight if there is something you have your hart set on that you want in trade let me know if I have it we can do that too. Thanks again just send me your address, want list etc. \r\nI am looking forward to the deal bud!  :-o \r\n\r\nthanks  :-) \r\n\r\nAaron \r\nSWG'),(33270,'cc6ee3c733','Oh man, a love note from Sessiz... if it included a naked pic of that harry ass Turk, heh, well you can keep it  :grin: \r\n\r\nHey while we are talking, you are the one I am most concern w/, what did you not get in the group buy order?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34941,'9d05f59044','6 to 8 to start sounds good (the idea of spares is good to) if you have a few of the bodies you want a certain way (color, graphics etc) let me know. I have places I can get decals and those bodies I can add the decals under the body then paint. I look forward to the bodies and giving you a good job.\r\n\r\nI can\'t wait to try out the motors and turbo just what I needed to get me back into my Epochs!\r\n\r\nAddress so you will have it:\r\nAaron W. Olmsted\r\n1941 Sayers Road\r\nBastrop, Texas 78602 \r\n\r\nLook forward to the trade man!  :-o'),(34934,'b006c34c29','I\'m pretty sure i\'ve seen them at the hobby shop.. Packaged under the Great Planes brand. you could most likely order them online as well.'),(36937,'0031a975ee','Thanks for the howdy...\r\n\r\n[quote:0031a975ee=\"crazydave\"]So that contest judging was a clisterfuck huh? I glad you spoke up. I wanted to say something in the last contest even, but before I was a mod I was one of the ones that threw a bitch, and questioned their judging in that middle of the road contest, so I just didn\'t want to be the bitch that always bitches. :lol: [/quote:0031a975ee]\r\nThanks for sayin\' that... I was starting to think I was a lone pimp with a lost cause. I got a little too worked up... OK, way too worked up, but still, I just get so fuckin\' tired of his control-freak bullshit and his selective participation on matters like that... and while he\'s ignoring some whole thing, he\'s controlling the group into moving away from it... like it\'s just gonna go away. :? \r\n\r\n[quote:0031a975ee=\"crazydave\"]And how about DT with that Big Kahuna is back shit?  :lol: \r\nApparently he\'s still trying to comprehend what you meant about passive aggressive BS. Dense ass mofo. :roll:[/quote:0031a975ee]\r\nYeah, where the hell did that even come from? It was just all of a sudden DT is in full-tilt action... everytime I read that muthafucka\'s writing, I hear it as 50% Foghorn Leghorn + 50% Mr. T... [b:0031a975ee]&quot;I say.. I say... HERE\'S HOW IT\'S GONNA BE, PIMP!!!&quot;[/b:0031a975ee] Jesus Christ already.\r\n\r\n[quote:0031a975ee=\"crazydave\"]Been digging my Xmod H2. Now that I think about it, I haven\'t charged anything else since I got it.  [/quote:0031a975ee]\r\nYeah man, I\'ve been diggin\' the looks of those... yours in particular. The silver H1 SSMT chop is badass. I\'ll have to check one out at the shack. I\'m just reluctant to open the door to a new platform. How much do you have into yours?\r\n\r\n[quote:0031a975ee=\"crazydave\"]Been bored with music. Been mostly just listening to the Reverend Horton Heat lately, because it reminds of the old school rods. Man, you gotta check out that Car Kulture Deluxe mag if you come across it. The whole mag just has that really retro, but at the same time kinda punk attitude. I\'ve been getting it at Wakmartm its bi-monthly. I always wanted to build a rat rod, and looking through this mag really makes me wish I had a place to work on a project. I want an old Model A to sand rust off of on the weekends. :-([/quote:0031a975ee] \r\nI have checked out the mag, but haven\'t bought any issues yet. There was a great episode of &quot;Rides&quot; a few weeks back that was basically a top-notch documentary on the Rat Rod scene... it\'s almost too much of a scene for me. Like, those folks just [i:0031a975ee]know[/i:0031a975ee] they\'re the coolest motherfuckers on the planet... and they are, but they don\'t have to [i:0031a975ee]know[/i:0031a975ee] it.  :lol:\r\n\r\nI\'ve been all over the map with my tunes, as usual. I\'ve been rockin\' pretty hard these days... Atomic Bitchwax, Alabama Thunderpussy, Black Label Society, Motörhead... but also goin\' back to some of the stuff that\'s just attached to my soul, like Stevie Wonder, Captain Beefheart, Zappa (I know, I know :lol: ), Miles Davis, John Coltrane, John Zorn... Stones. All over the map.\r\n\r\nWork has been about to fucking kill me dead.... the pressure is just too much. I\'m working on this brochure that was WAY the fuck over-estimated by our account execs, but the client bit. Now the pressure is on me to make this 8-page POS look like it\'s worth the 90k it\'s gonna cost, and that doesn\'t even include printing... it\'s about 3x more expensive than it should be. The folks around here who sold this nightmare don\'t really understand the problem, but they sense my stress level... they\'re scared as shit, which is where half of my stress comes from in the first place. \r\n\r\nAnd, on top of that, we got a new designer dude, and he\'s just not showin\' me the respect... not even an ounce. Day one, he\'s all bitchin\' about how this and that isn\'t how he woulda done it, telling me my ideas aren\'t gonna work out, and just general complaining... the bitch. I just put up a fuckin\' wall of fuckin\' doom around myself... blastin\' Sabbath all day out of my office, no lights on, window wide open, so it\'s about 55 degrees in here... just flat out un-fuckin-comfortable to approach me. Fuck him... I\'m the onliest mutha fucka here to help him out, and he pissed on my shoes from the git. Then, he has the fuckin\' nerve to start calling me &quot;dudems&quot;, whatever the fuck that is... I just don\'t even acknowledge that I heard it or read it in an email, but, if it happens one more time, I\'m going to come unglued. I will offer him 2 choices in how to address me... &quot;Sir&quot; or &quot;Mr. Sir&quot;... God damn, I hate newbies.  :lol:  I\'ve been telling Greg (SF) that I\'m just gonna have to go all &quot;hue35&quot; on his ass... it\'s funny \'cuz I\'m such a non-confrontational person in my day-to-day life. I only lash out at strangers who do stupid shit in public (like road rage type shit, or like the dude I threatened to beat the piss out of if he didn\'t get out of the nice old lady\'s face), or as my &quot;hue35&quot; alter-ego in the little car world. :lol:\r\n\r\nShit, I gotta git... thanks again for the PM, I\'ll talk to ya later.\r\n\r\nMat'),(32586,'d95df0945a','I am still interested in the 3.8 and the lap counter.  I would prefer to pay by PayPal, does that work for you?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32587,'8d7ee3fdda','[quote:8d7ee3fdda=\"weazel\"]I am still interested in the 3.8 and the lap counter.  I would prefer to pay by PayPal, does that work for you?[/quote:8d7ee3fdda]\r\n\r\nYou bet dude!!\r\n\r\nI think you\'ll like the 3.8. I love all kinds of different motors, and this one is different. \r\nThey say 3.8, and it does hual ass, but I think a ZZ puple 3.4 is faster on the \'higher end\'. However, it has way more torque than the ZZ 3.4.\r\n\r\nThe lap counters are kinda cool, too. You probably already know this, but you don\'t need the \'extra piece\' inside installed on the track. As long as you come within, I think it\'s approx. 6+ inches of the \'eye\', they lap counter will detect you. I don\'t really like that additional piece, maybe you\'ll find a use for it. It doesn\'t seem to increase the field of range, but I havn\'t experimented that much with it.\r\n\r\nWhat\'s your zip? We can figure out approx. shipping charges, and how we want to ship, and go from there. I\'m at 98038 if you want to check it out, too.\r\n\r\nMotorGong  ---Dave'),(37063,'c619e9d135','No dude. Their monitoring our web usage at work now, so I gotta stay on the down low. I\'m fixing my home connectivity, and I\'ll get some pics to you of my Trueno sets. You still have dibs.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37064,'9852434ec0','[quote:9852434ec0=\"mikirgra\"]No dude. Their monitoring our web usage at work now, so I gotta stay on the down low. I\'m fixing my home connectivity, and I\'ll get some pics to you of my Trueno sets. You still have dibs.[/quote:9852434ec0]\r\n\r\n :-o   :-o   :-o'),(37839,'6eb97b9f5c','definitely, I was thinking deans would do charging duties...I\'ll do you up a custom shell. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ll be sure to add a bit o green :-o'),(27838,'6e0a154019','I have a bunch if you need them.\r\n\r\nLet me know.\r\n\r\nI wish you would\'ve said something.  I could have send you some with you package.'),(20954,'344cdeee21','Hello Cabo, I was wondering how I get my own photogallery, all help appreciated , thanks\r\n\r\nSupra.'),(20945,'9fdd5ee466','did u see the control'),(20946,'7b06ad73c7','Well if past bidding habbits continue the trend this mother is mine.  Sad but true, will be my 1st Fet modded bit, maybe it will kick my ass enough to evolve me into the performance aspect of Bits.  Hmm would explain why I only drive once every two weeks but chop every night...'),(20947,'7b06ad73c7','Well if past bidding habbits continue the trend this mother is mine.  Sad but true, will be my 1st Fet modded bit, maybe it will kick my ass enough to evolve me into the performance aspect of Bits.  Hmm would explain why I only drive once every two weeks but chop every night...');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20948,'06b6981431','[quote:06b6981431]and Gokou is known to be a little bitch.[/quote:06b6981431]\r\n\r\nOh thanks..... :-('),(20949,'06b6981431','[quote:06b6981431]and Gokou is known to be a little bitch.[/quote:06b6981431]\r\n\r\nOh thanks..... :-('),(20950,'ee2d415ae0','[quote:ee2d415ae0=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:ee2d415ae0]and Gokou is known to be a little bitch.[/quote:ee2d415ae0]\r\n\r\nOh thanks..... :-([/quote:ee2d415ae0]Sorry, but that is how you\'re known around here. Just telling it like it is.\r\n\r\nIf it makes you feel any better, I think some people have grown kinda of attached to you, and would miss picking on you if you disappeared.\r\n\r\nYour attitude has changed, and you\'re doing much better, but while it may be simple for you to change, it\'s gonna take a long time and a lot of work to change peoples impressions of you. First impressions are everything.\r\n\r\nNow go play you little scamp. :-) \r\n\r\ndave'),(20951,'ee2d415ae0','[quote:ee2d415ae0=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:ee2d415ae0]and Gokou is known to be a little bitch.[/quote:ee2d415ae0]\r\n\r\nOh thanks..... :-([/quote:ee2d415ae0]Sorry, but that is how you\'re known around here. Just telling it like it is.\r\n\r\nIf it makes you feel any better, I think some people have grown kinda of attached to you, and would miss picking on you if you disappeared.\r\n\r\nYour attitude has changed, and you\'re doing much better, but while it may be simple for you to change, it\'s gonna take a long time and a lot of work to change peoples impressions of you. First impressions are everything.\r\n\r\nNow go play you little scamp. :-) \r\n\r\ndave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20952,'074b1cedfb','[quote:074b1cedfb=\"crazydave\"][quote:074b1cedfb=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:074b1cedfb]and Gokou is known to be a little bitch.[/quote:074b1cedfb]\r\n\r\nOh thanks..... :-([/quote:074b1cedfb]Sorry, but that is how you\'re known around here. Just telling it like it is.\r\n\r\nIf it makes you feel any better, I think some people have grown kinda of attached to you, and would miss picking on you if you disappeared.\r\n\r\nYour attitude has changed, and you\'re doing much better, but while it may be simple for you to change, it\'s gonna take a long time and a lot of work to change peoples impressions of you. First impressions are everything.\r\n\r\nNow go play you little scamp. :-) \r\n\r\ndave[/quote:074b1cedfb]\r\n\r\nlol...thanks, that did make me feel better......Oh, and BTW nice truck you got there in FIDC....\r\n\r\nAnd I didn\'t realize till now that you were a mod... :shock: \r\n\r\nBTW, you should get into Iwaver Mini-Z\'s, they\'re a lot more fun than Xmods, and I know that from your work with Bits and ZipZaps...and a few Xmods....you could do wonders with Iwavers. :-)'),(20953,'074b1cedfb','[quote:074b1cedfb=\"crazydave\"][quote:074b1cedfb=\"Son_Gokou\"][quote:074b1cedfb]and Gokou is known to be a little bitch.[/quote:074b1cedfb]\r\n\r\nOh thanks..... :-([/quote:074b1cedfb]Sorry, but that is how you\'re known around here. Just telling it like it is.\r\n\r\nIf it makes you feel any better, I think some people have grown kinda of attached to you, and would miss picking on you if you disappeared.\r\n\r\nYour attitude has changed, and you\'re doing much better, but while it may be simple for you to change, it\'s gonna take a long time and a lot of work to change peoples impressions of you. First impressions are everything.\r\n\r\nNow go play you little scamp. :-) \r\n\r\ndave[/quote:074b1cedfb]\r\n\r\nlol...thanks, that did make me feel better......Oh, and BTW nice truck you got there in FIDC....\r\n\r\nAnd I didn\'t realize till now that you were a mod... :shock: \r\n\r\nBTW, you should get into Iwaver Mini-Z\'s, they\'re a lot more fun than Xmods, and I know that from your work with Bits and ZipZaps...and a few Xmods....you could do wonders with Iwavers. :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37726,'ff7ca5d52b','not feeling paranoid or anything, lol, but could you do me a fave and wipe this thread?\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=7370\r\n\r\nit would be mega kiss your arse appreciated, lol...\r\n\r\nMatt.'),(37766,'ef389fb3d5','The bad thing was you asked and I didn\'t remember who I stole the idea from, until I saw his RX-7 with biohazard symbol on it.  I don\'t remember this one with flexplate and rear suspension, pics?  \r\n\r\nIf you want any angles, just let me know; I can take all the pics you want.  So what kind of project are you thinking about?'),(37769,'ef389fb3d5','The bad thing was you asked and I didn\'t remember who I stole the idea from, until I saw his RX-7 with biohazard symbol on it.  I don\'t remember this one with flexplate and rear suspension, pics?  \r\n\r\nIf you want any angles, just let me know; I can take all the pics you want.  So what kind of project are you thinking about?'),(37770,'890a5b67a1','Yeah man, here are the ones i can find off hand:\r\n[img:890a5b67a1]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10078/IMG_0068.jpg[/img:890a5b67a1]\r\n[img:890a5b67a1]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10078/IMG_0069.jpg[/img:890a5b67a1]\r\n[img:890a5b67a1]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10078/IMG_0070.jpg[/img:890a5b67a1]\r\n[img:890a5b67a1]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10078/IMG_0074%257E0.jpg[/img:890a5b67a1]\r\n[img:890a5b67a1]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10078/IMG_0075.jpg[/img:890a5b67a1]\r\n\r\nIf you could id like to see a good shot from the front (lower so i can see the knuckles) and any other shots you think may help me out.\r\n\r\nAs far as the project, im not exactly sure what its goign to be yet but ill be using something like this setup\r\n\r\n\r\nTHanks man');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37730,'f02e3835a3','[quote:f02e3835a3=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:f02e3835a3=\"ph2t\"]not feeling paranoid or anything, lol, but could you do me a fave and wipe this thread?\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=7370\r\n\r\nit would be mega kiss your arse appreciated, lol...\r\n\r\nMatt.[/quote:f02e3835a3]\r\nIt\'s dead. You can take off your foil hat now. :lol:[/quote:f02e3835a3]\r\n\r\nlol, as you can see, I have MANY uses for foil.........\r\n\r\nthanks mate....'),(37731,'7887c80f44','Hey don\'t worry about it.  I\'m not in a big rush as long as I get it.\r\n\r\nThanks.'),(37745,'74727ed26f','hey, just sending the pics you asked for, im really interested in the NSX, i really would like to get rid of my bits and get more \'mods :)  here is the link to their gallery.\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/thumbnails.php?album=395\r\n\r\nI really hope you consider my offer :-)'),(35283,'954b7b62f8','[quote:954b7b62f8=\"Bithigh707\"]Hey I was told that you do Mosfet work I have 2 ZZSe 1 ZZMT and 2 Bits I\'d like do can you help?[/quote:954b7b62f8]Yeah, I can help. I haven\'t been doing FET mods, but if you want that many cars, that kinda makes it worth my while. I charge $10 a car, so you\'re looking at $50+ return shipping. (Priorty is usually like $3.80 if you can cram them cars in one of those flat rate boxes)\r\n\r\nWhat generation are the SEs? If they are earlier generation SEs, I can do the voltage bypass, and jumper the resistors, and it will be improved, but the current generation, from the \'66 Vette on, will still be much faster with just a direct FET swap.\r\n\r\nIf you send a MT, make sure you pack it well, I\'ve had people send me those on padded envelopes, and they came with bent axles, so I\'m not completely comfortable with shipping those.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSo if you\'re still interested, let me know, and I\'ll get you my shipping address. You can Paypal me at davesmoejoe@yahoo.com The sooner I get payment, the sooner I can order FETs. I only have a few on hand, but they only take 3-5 days to get here.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36010,'64604dd3da','[quote:64604dd3da=\"arfin\"]Hey DT, do they have the Trans Am body kits? If so, could you get me a few, and i\'d throw in some extra cash for you. Thanks![/quote:64604dd3da]\r\nHaven\'t seen those lately but I\'ll check....  How many do you want?'),(28431,'01d7eb70b7','Hey Man,\r\nThanks for bring that up, I completly forgot about the springs, but sadly I can only find one spring, but I did find the washer\'s for the rims, but still missing a nut though,\r\nMissing List: 1 spring and 1 nut for rim.\r\n\r\nIf it\'s cool with you, I throw in a regular ZZ PCB.\r\nI just need to get rid of this stuff.\r\nIf this deal is ok, what i said today and last night, and You give me Your address today, I can probably ship out by tomorrow and depending on where you live it might be there Sat, or maybe Mon/Tues.\r\nJust let me know if You have any questions, and tell me if I\'m missing anything else. \r\nJust PM me Your address, or if You don\'t want to send it through PM You can email me at: JDMR33@yahoo.com\r\nThank, have a good day'),(33038,'a700bc2ce9','[quote:a700bc2ce9=\"pimpsmurf\"]Thats the bugger!!! They only ship to north america? What asses. I\'d be happy to hook you up with a couple of those. They look like they would easily fit in the $5.00 standard rate envelope (like I sent the v2.2 in), so shipping wouldn\'t be bad. It will be a couple weeks before I order it because I have exhausted my hobby budget. I can\'t wait for January when I give myself a hobby bonus for quitting smoking. I\'m going to score some serious R/C stuff. I\'m thinking along the lines of a tricked out E-Maxx or Traxxas Jato, or maybe a rc18t or mini-t. I guess it depends on the mood of the month. Generally, January is a very busy season for me, so I\'ll probably be too busy to charge batteries.  :o \r\n\r\nI\'m definately going to build a 3 cell lipo pack for my MZM/WNDeluxe. It will probably eat comms and brushes like no tomorrow, but it would definately give me the torque I lost when I went alloy. GPM still can\'t figure out why the fuck my front alloy gearbox won\'t work. I hate non-english speaking fuckups.\r\n\r\nLater man,\r\n-JNY\r\n\r\nP.S. My girlfriend says that she was serious about some updated baby pics. lol.[/quote:a700bc2ce9]\r\n\r\nlol.\r\n\r\nhook me up when you can, no rush mate.\r\n\r\nwww.woahnelly.com/baby  there\'s more on there.  but don\'t spread that link.  \r\n\r\ncoolies.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (29412,'ab8155efda','All is well lol...\n\nhad some internet connect issues...\n\nback online as of a minute ago lol'),(20965,'b668894d67','Ok! thanks alot dude, i will do that in a couple.'),(32855,'ad478f2c49','That\'s weird.  Mine worked fine, you sure the TX is on?  It has a switch on it.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(20968,'aa6954c04f','i need a lot of help with my only zz'),(20969,'50f109e77d','[quote:50f109e77d=\"riddinspinnaz11\"]i need a lot of help with my only zz[/quote:50f109e77d]that\'s what the forum is for homeboy'),(20970,'50f109e77d','[quote:50f109e77d=\"riddinspinnaz11\"]i need a lot of help with my only zz[/quote:50f109e77d]that\'s what the forum is for homeboy'),(20972,'6449050cb1','i thought u were just chillin on the site my bac\r\n\r\n    :cool:'),(20973,'52c746cc35','ok, I have no phone right now to answer your call. lol\r\n\r\ncell is dead.\r\nhouse is dead.\r\n\r\n2004 baby - jesus fucking christ.'),(20974,'807943e351','That\'s insane... Better hope you don\'t fall, and hurt yourself...lol');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34226,'bb52935110','It went above your limit.\r\n\r\nIt\'s at like $60+ now.'),(32864,'af728a0cfa','Hold on a second and I\'ll check.\r\n\r\nNeed some advice if you don\'t mind too.  Someone wants to trade me thier Sportmaxx with a Megatech Q1.6 Chianelli and tuned pipe for my Novak SS5800 BL system.  I\'ve not heard much about Megatech engines, so I\'m torn on the trade.  What are your thoughts?\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(20978,'cde3033e5e','Pick it up and dial that bitch...   I\'ll be waiting'),(33673,'c37d2155d1','These are the ones I use, but I didn\'t realize how pricey they are.\r\nhttp://xtronics.com/optivisor.htm\r\n\r\nI use the number 7\r\n\r\nThey have all kinds of cool shit to go with it.\r\n\r\nI\'m sure you could find some alot cheaper if you shop around.\r\n\r\n\r\nLet me look around, and see what I see.  \r\n\r\nI\'ll get back to you in a few minutes man.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThey do work quite well though.\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(31943,'c9cf95bea0','[quote:c9cf95bea0=\"blindrider3\"]Is that you on Micro RC CENTAR posting those pics of me?\r\n\r\nNakkah?\r\n\r\nIf so stop it now.\r\n\r\nAll the pics link to your photobucket account.[/quote:c9cf95bea0]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nwait, my account is still active. I just checked. It was another one I guessed I cancelled. \r\nBut I\'m tellin ya I\'m new, and it wouldn\'t be wise for me to do something like this. I\'m just gettin to know people and stuff.\r\nI\'m new to computers, too. But you know that from my posts at BP, I mention it often.\r\nIf I can figure it out, I\'ll even send ya the link to my photobucket account and you can check it out. :-o');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32869,'d843d4f817','Cool.  Thanks for the info on the motor.  It wouldn\'t be my first nitro, but my experience with my savage was pretty limited due to money issues at the time.  \r\n\r\nBummer to hear about your sub, mine\'s pretty sealed up too.  Hope you get a new one out of it.  The store here is sold out.  I stopped by to get some for my cousin and her sister\'s birthday.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(26738,'8e73991f7d','[quote:8e73991f7d=\"honda_s2000\"]hey ph2t ,\r\nwould you kindly look inside one of them whirly doos , and let me know of any specs u might find , cabo sed he would bu the aint got em so ihe told me to hit u up \r\ncheers,\r\nh20 :cool:[/quote:8e73991f7d]\r\n\r\nI had one a while ago.\r\n\r\nit was a daul cell, 80mah battery setup\r\ntwo motors, one for the fwd/rev, one for the front spinning action\r\npcb is bigger than the bit by about 30%\r\n\r\nthat\'s about it?  anything else you needed to know?\r\n\r\nph2t.'),(20982,'ef71acac07','Chare that \"playskool\" phone already.... :-)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20983,'653e6ed16c','Did you talk to that canuck kid over at MRCC?  He started a whole thread over an email to you!!\r\n\r\nNow the thread is 4 pages long filled with all kinds of nonsense!!\r\n\r\nIts in the Xmod forum, called \"looking 4 sum1\", I think thats how he spelled it. :???:'),(21010,'74b8c371ff','yeh im just waiting on a bank transfer to clear and then the money will be in your account ASAP.. sorry about the delay..'),(21012,'53b58d0c19','Why did you close it?\r\n\r\nIf you dont like the prices then you dont have to buy them do you. No you dont. So I prefer if you would leave my posts alone. Does some kid in the USA really affect your life so much? That you cant just leave it the fuck alone?\r\n\r\nI hope that not all the administration here isnt as corrupt. Because just because you dont agree with prices gives you no right to edit someones post, and fuck around with the topic. \r\n\r\nnever should of listened to SG...\r\n\r\nBTW, i already sold 2 bodies. One to Bird, and one to a friend. Both the same prices.\r\n\r\nGet a life, go fuck around with someone else...'),(20986,'8bfb7d34e5','Hi jmays.\r\n\r\nI\'ve received the cit on last tuesday. It\'s amazing. I really dig what you\'ve done with it. The chassis you sent me is great and despite I\'m not using it on the cit, it fits like a glove to my audi tt bit body, the one I\'m still working on and really sets it off. Thanks for all the pimpin\' work you\'ve done for me. I\'ve dedicate it a special album at my bitpimps gallery. Check it out or take a look at the complete album [url=http://img78.photobucket.com/albums/v259/mekinhux/bits/citroen_ds_coupe/]here[/url]');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35065,'84e28c20bb','Cool man. I\'m gonna talk to this guy at work, and see what\'s up, but I will call you, and let you know.\r\n\r\nThanks man.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(27011,'e9b779bfd1','Thanks again Pimp!!!\r\n\r\nI was thinkin\'.... :???: \r\n\r\nDo you have anything left?  Are you droppin\' the bit scene?\r\n\r\nI hope not. :cool:'),(25843,'20bedb67f0','Just wondering cause there was a guy on ThumperTalk.com from Oz that had the same avatar as you for a while.'),(20990,'8bfb7d34e5','Hi jmays.\r\n\r\nI\'ve received the cit on last tuesday. It\'s amazing. I really dig what you\'ve done with it. The chassis you sent me is great and despite I\'m not using it on the cit, it fits like a glove to my audi tt bit body, the one I\'m still working on and really sets it off. Thanks for all the pimpin\' work you\'ve done for me. I\'ve dedicate it a special album at my bitpimps gallery. Check it out or take a look at the complete album [url=http://img78.photobucket.com/albums/v259/mekinhux/bits/citroen_ds_coupe/]here[/url]'),(20991,'ad1b663b31','i am glad you like it, i was really happy with the way the paint shines! and is soooo smooth.\r\n\r\nenjoy and i am glad to help u out.\r\n\r\njmays');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20992,'9fdd5ee466','did u see the control'),(37251,'df29660e38','&quot;mini t\'s have a good reputation for durability so you should be fine&quot;\r\n\r\nThat\'s one of the reasons I bought it. He sent some high resolutoion pics of it and it looks solid (main tray still looks new!) There\'s the obvious dust and dirt but otherwise.\r\n\r\nWill give me 3 cars to run when I get over there, the MR01, a MR02 and the Mini-t.  Quality all around  :cool:'),(37252,'df29660e38','&quot;mini t\'s have a good reputation for durability so you should be fine&quot;\r\n\r\nThat\'s one of the reasons I bought it. He sent some high resolutoion pics of it and it looks solid (main tray still looks new!) There\'s the obvious dust and dirt but otherwise.\r\n\r\nWill give me 3 cars to run when I get over there, the MR01, a MR02 and the Mini-t.  Quality all around  :cool:'),(31345,'f7233b437f','hi there , \r\nsorry to tell you that i cant afford that , as  i live in new zealand , and the currency makes it very expensive , but if you ever have any second hand cheap ones , or clones , il take them off your hands , \r\n\r\n :cool:'),(31346,'edaac63c56','yeah, shipping would be pricy,, i just sold one to betty k and he paid close to $20 shipping,, i cut him a deal on the zz though,, something like $15 for the bit plus shipping\r\n\r\nSorry about that, the shipping just kills everyone\r\n\r\nSTG');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (20994,'036fb31fc8','aite i checked on those batteries today. they are $3.49 +shipping. special order only but they still have them. thanks dude. try a dual cell with one. i dont think a quad cell is needed lol.'),(20995,'e6b474b84b','[quote:e6b474b84b=\"sg219\"]Did you talk to that canuck kid over at MRCC?  He started a whole thread over an email to you!!\r\n\r\nNow the thread is 4 pages long filled with all kinds of nonsense!!\r\n\r\nIts in the Xmod forum, called \"looking 4 sum1\", I think thats how he spelled it. :???:[/quote:e6b474b84b]\r\n\r\nWOAH....thanks man, I owe you one....The fucking retard, like a 5-year-old, started a whole thread just because I wouldn\'t respond to his email....Omg.....What a moron...\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks for the heads up, I\'m not into Xmods anymore, more into mini-Z shit, but thanks for bringing this to my attention.'),(21044,'853cd07867','[quote:853cd07867=\"crazydave\"][quote:853cd07867=\"hogjowlz\"]special order only[/quote:853cd07867]What\'s that mean?\r\n\r\n[/quote:853cd07867]\r\n\r\nthat means they dont have it in the store but they can order it for you from the store and ship to yo crib.'),(23158,'0790e9234a','awwww whats wrong? don\'t feel like playing at r7r still?\r\n\r\n\r\nThat thread was just getting fun. Then you go and quit in the middle of it.\r\n :lol:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21046,'0a7fc762c5','[quote:0a7fc762c5=\"hogjowlz\"][quote:0a7fc762c5=\"crazydave\"][quote:0a7fc762c5=\"hogjowlz\"]special order only[/quote:0a7fc762c5]What\'s that mean?\r\n\r\n[/quote:0a7fc762c5]\r\n\r\nthat means they dont have it in the store but they can order it for you from the store and ship to yo crib.[/quote:0a7fc762c5]Oh ok thanks.\r\n\r\nI\'m probably gonna get some this weekend. :-D \r\n\r\ndave'),(21047,'91f0d94bdd','yeh the reason i need the electronics is to sell it.. most the hop ups are jamie kulhaneks stuff'),(21052,'e992ec3370','how much for the cheese i will pay at same time'),(24337,'f4b17fe016','Sure man, I totally support this site. Cash or money order? Oh ya, who do I mail the funds to.'),(21096,'5e2bd554dc','dis-regard the previous message I sent you via email.\r\nthe changes are propegating so quickly I cannot possibley control it all.\r\n\r\nso have at it! :lol:'),(21097,'a257ff41f4','Thanx Pimp,\r\n\r\nPM me if they do.\r\n I\'d like to get 10 of them if possible, if not then get what they got.  8-) \r\n\r\nThanx Again!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35453,'3067d5c69a','[quote:3067d5c69a=\"Maxximum Attack\"]I\'d just like to know If I buy all the GPM parts for an evo car, would I still need to buy RS upgrades like:\r\n\r\nSteering\r\nAWD\r\nSuspension\r\n\r\nThe AWD is what really sparked my intrest, cuz if GPM is making diffs can i just buy all the parts and be able to convert a BONE stock evo to full GPM AWD evo?\r\n\r\nIn the group buy, i wasn\'t really following, but i saw that some of the prices had changed, what is the price now of a complete GPM for a car?\r\n\r\n\r\nThanx\r\nMaxx[/quote:3067d5c69a]\r\n\r\nGPM doesn\'t make the vital center axles and red gears or the front AWD Diff YET so you will still need the RS upgrades.\r\n\r\nAs for the prices of parts.  A full car so far not including Diff would be about $80.  add $15 for the diff.'),(37650,'ca029316d6','[quote:ca029316d6=\"lekker\"]how do i go about putting up my pics and get special permision to do so . thnx , very cool site .[/quote:ca029316d6]\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=1177\r\n\r\nScroll down to the bottom of the first post.\r\nYou\'ll see &quot;How Do I Post Images?&quot;'),(21163,'8b027e4aad','Thank you CD I will check all that stuff tonite.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37337,'846abf340a','yup, you got it! bettykay@gmail.com\r\n\r\ni\'ll keep these goods for you, i won\'t sell them to anyone else if you\'re slow paying :-o'),(37345,'c42722bb67','hi man, i just got your cash, thanks! :-) \r\n\r\ni just wanna confirm the shipping address. is this correct?\r\n\r\nChris Gera\r\n4303 Radcliffe Dr.\r\nPalm Harbor, FL 34685\r\nUnited States\r\n\r\nonce confirmed i\'ll ship it out within a day.'),(36118,'d16515e178','Sam Rietta\r\n26 George Gale Road\r\nWoodbridge, Ontario\r\nL4H 2S6\r\nCanada\r\n\r\nNo problem...Tell me when it is sent! \r\n\r\nhurry...i am dyin for the pieces! lol'),(33938,'1805e5efee','okay, listen up.  I don\'t care about your middle school playground game.   I don\'t even care that you finger your asshole nightly.  I\'m not gonna judge you, just laugh at your retarded ass.  BTW, vinegar eats at copper, which is what the brushes in your motor are made of.  Bleach + Ammonia = chlorine gas, which is deadly.\r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...'),(21104,'bbc53a452a','Yes you can edit post but your sig is left at the bottom usually ( on MRCC anyway..not WGU) . Doesnt matter anyway. He apologized and after you edit it ..he isnt going to say \'Hey why did you do that ?\" when he already admitted being wrong.\r\n\r\nI appreciate the support Chewy. Big UPS!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21105,'08b56213c2','Hahaha I saw that thread where you treated stampede_fag like a little bitch! He didn\'t even respond. very nice!   :-D  I like how he continued to rip on you at mrcc because he KNOWS mk will ban you if he sees anything at all bad coming from you. what a puss.'),(21106,'f9d161e3e0','Mhmmm...he apologized there at least but still he is a bitch for not retracting his statement. Thats the LEAST he could do. If you dont mind...see if one of your friends at MRCC will edit his post in my thread (BST). I still dont know why they havent..'),(21107,'08529bb8a3','CD think you can help a brother out.. I did the fet mod like you outlined in the FAQ but for some reason the range of the car sucks ass now.. Maybe I am doing soemthing wrong?? I am using IRLML2502 fets.\r\n\r\nThanks in Advance CD,\r\n\r\nMike'),(21108,'bbc53a452a','Yes you can edit post but your sig is left at the bottom usually ( on MRCC anyway..not WGU) . Doesnt matter anyway. He apologized and after you edit it ..he isnt going to say \'Hey why did you do that ?\" when he already admitted being wrong.\r\n\r\nI appreciate the support Chewy. Big UPS!'),(21109,'f9d161e3e0','Mhmmm...he apologized there at least but still he is a bitch for not retracting his statement. Thats the LEAST he could do. If you dont mind...see if one of your friends at MRCC will edit his post in my thread (BST). I still dont know why they havent..');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21162,'f77a2c427a','[quote:f77a2c427a=\"LoRDDeVO2\"]CD think you can help a brother out.. I did the fet mod like you outlined in the FAQ but for some reason the range of the car sucks ass now.. Maybe I am doing soemthing wrong?? I am using IRLML2502 fets.\r\n\r\nThanks in Advance CD,\r\n\r\nMike[/quote:f77a2c427a]The FETs should have no effect on range what so ever.\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst thing I\'d check would be to make sure your antenna wire is not hanging by a thread. That happens to me a lot of times when I\'ve had my car apart and fiddling with it alot.\r\n\r\nNext thing I\'d check would be, there\'s a small capacitor atteching the forward and reverse output on most PCBs. That\'s there to absorb motor interference. Make sure you haven\'t done anything to that.\r\n\r\nLastly I\'d look for any stray blobs of solder that may have wandered on your PCB, or anything that looks like it\'s come loose. \r\n\r\nIf none of that works for ya, then I\'m stumped.\r\n\r\ndave'),(21114,'d31972d311','[quote:d31972d311=\"DarkTari\"]Never heard from Hog so I\'m gonna take a week break from the Auction and pick it up on Aug 1st.  I\'ll address the issue later.\r\nI didn\'t have confidence that he would come thru, you\'ve mentioned certain issues in the past about his end of the bargain on other projects, that\'s why I pretty much didn\'t want to do a joint with him unless he sent me a finished chassis. He gave all the specs but no pics.....\r\n\r\n[quote:d31972d311]So will this be ready to put on Da Block Saturday midnight EST ?? \r\nSee if you can get some pics in yo gallery so Da Big Kahuna can get that baby on Da Block! \r\n\r\nWere you serious about starting the bid at $30.00 ??[/quote:d31972d311]\r\n\r\nI\'ll post his at $30.00 if he wants ......... :???:[/quote:d31972d311]yea dude I hear ya. go for it.\r\nI\'m going to be taking the site down today for a few hours anyway (upgrading) then we\'ll be back up.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32000,'92a9bb51b9','Hi,\r\n\r\nSorry for the delay in reply. I havent checked my emails in a while. Lets see, I still have everything that you listed and I do remember that I do have some of the mini cooper roof tops. I\'ll check to make sure. I\'ll get back to you shortly and sorry for the delay in reply.\r\n\r\nJDM'),(21116,'a0fb87224c','Well I haven\'t been here for awhile. :?  I was wondering, Could I possibly get my user name changed to just \"chewy\" Thats what I have at all the other forums. \r\n\r\n\r\nThanks for anyhelp.'),(21117,'08529bb8a3','CD think you can help a brother out.. I did the fet mod like you outlined in the FAQ but for some reason the range of the car sucks ass now.. Maybe I am doing soemthing wrong?? I am using IRLML2502 fets.\r\n\r\nThanks in Advance CD,\r\n\r\nMike'),(21556,'4bd8734047','did you register on the main chat screen?   even if you\'re a bitPimps member, you\'ll need to re register in the chat room.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(21557,'1956b9d6be','Sounds good dude thanks alot.  I wish our rs up here had the shit on sale or even in stock lol.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (35404,'a49f2a6281','will do ASAP :-)'),(21119,'f77a2c427a','[quote:f77a2c427a=\"LoRDDeVO2\"]CD think you can help a brother out.. I did the fet mod like you outlined in the FAQ but for some reason the range of the car sucks ass now.. Maybe I am doing soemthing wrong?? I am using IRLML2502 fets.\r\n\r\nThanks in Advance CD,\r\n\r\nMike[/quote:f77a2c427a]The FETs should have no effect on range what so ever.\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst thing I\'d check would be to make sure your antenna wire is not hanging by a thread. That happens to me a lot of times when I\'ve had my car apart and fiddling with it alot.\r\n\r\nNext thing I\'d check would be, there\'s a small capacitor atteching the forward and reverse output on most PCBs. That\'s there to absorb motor interference. Make sure you haven\'t done anything to that.\r\n\r\nLastly I\'d look for any stray blobs of solder that may have wandered on your PCB, or anything that looks like it\'s come loose. \r\n\r\nIf none of that works for ya, then I\'m stumped.\r\n\r\ndave'),(21120,'3146e9c57c','where did he apoligize? Only thing I saw that came close was him saying you might be legit, thats it.  And don\'t worry I\'ll get someone to edit his post. I\'ve already have them working on locking the one topic he made in the general section. If they dont do it, I\'ll bitch slap stampede around until he edits his post.\r\n\r\n\r\nand when i ment editing posts, I ment can MODS edit other people\'s posts without having anyone find out? I was only joking around though.  :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21121,'00eefa895b','Dont worry about it ...he edited his post lol and gave a stunning declaration also lol.\r\n\r\nI know what you meant about the mod questions. Im just leting you know you can edit when you become a mod (as you know) but not without someone seeing the line \" Edited By : so and so\" at the bottom. I hope you do become a mod Chewy...ill check you out over there more often.\r\n\r\nI have the Beast , Hawkeye , Colossus and Doc OCk from the Ultimates.\r\n\r\nYoull see them on Ebay soon lol.'),(21122,'00eefa895b','Dont worry about it ...he edited his post lol and gave a stunning declaration also lol.\r\n\r\nI know what you meant about the mod questions. Im just leting you know you can edit when you become a mod (as you know) but not without someone seeing the line \" Edited By : so and so\" at the bottom. I hope you do become a mod Chewy...ill check you out over there more often.\r\n\r\nI have the Beast , Hawkeye , Colossus and Doc OCk from the Ultimates.\r\n\r\nYoull see them on Ebay soon lol.'),(21124,'b87733d74c','dang that stinks because I know at r7r mods can edit without anyone knowing. Its alot of fun!  8-)  (im a \"mod\" for both racing teams) \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nwhere did you get the ultimates from? were they ORIGINAlly ultimates? or did you mod them to look like the ultimates versions? Also what experience level of hawkeye? His vet version is an Insanely good click.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21125,'04ef660ecc','I got the Ultimates shipped to me from Illinois. I have 2 Hawkeyes so il have to check to see if one is a Veteran.\r\n\r\nScourge, Beast, 2 Hawkeyes , A chick , Colossus and someone else i guess ( ill have to check).'),(21126,'84f3ca65f8','Hi Cabo.\r\nI try to delete or upload pics to my bitPimps gallery and I receive this message:\r\n\r\nDestination directory albums/userpics/10044/ is not writable by the script !\r\n\r\nAny idea on what\'s happening?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nmek'),(21127,'04ef660ecc','I got the Ultimates shipped to me from Illinois. I have 2 Hawkeyes so il have to check to see if one is a Veteran.\r\n\r\nScourge, Beast, 2 Hawkeyes , A chick , Colossus and someone else i guess ( ill have to check).'),(21159,'4f66625103','Hey bro, just FYI but the late entries are missing from the Summer Swing Bling contest in the gallery and in the forums.'),(21170,'6f3c82a105','[quote:6f3c82a105=\"Finks\"]Arite C Dub, who do I send me lewt too?  This ride is friggin awsome, thank you so much for throwin the auction down for all us Pimps.[/quote:6f3c82a105]you\'ve got 2 options basically, your choice.\r\n\r\nyou can send cash or money order to me. when I receive it, crazydave will ship the car to you.\r\nor\r\nyou can pay crazydave via paypal, and he\'ll ship off your car when payment goes through.\r\n\r\nlet me know which one you prefer.\r\n\r\nno problem man, all us pimps help each other.\r\nand thank you for helping support bitPimps.\r\ncongrats on the sled!'),(21129,'f7b4cb970a','Yo cabo, I just tried to upload a picture to my gallery, and it wouldn\'t let me... this is the message i got:\r\n\r\nDestination directory albums/userpics/10031/ is not writable by the script ! \r\n\r\n\r\nis it somethin i did wrong?\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\n~midget_man~');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21130,'84f3ca65f8','Hi Cabo.\r\nI try to delete or upload pics to my bitPimps gallery and I receive this message:\r\n\r\nDestination directory albums/userpics/10044/ is not writable by the script !\r\n\r\nAny idea on what\'s happening?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nmek'),(21131,'6e95836663','[quote:6e95836663=\"mekinhux\"]Hi Cabo.\r\nI try to delete or upload pics to my bitPimps gallery and I receive this message:\r\n\r\nDestination directory albums/userpics/10044/ is not writable by the script !\r\n\r\nAny idea on what\'s happening?\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nmek[/quote:6e95836663]yes this is my error. sorry about that.\r\ntry again tomorrow, by that time I should have it all fixed up.\r\nplease let me know if you still encounter problems.\r\n\r\nthanks'),(24469,'d5120dcd85','lol so you do?? Aiight hurr is my dad\'s work address:\r\n\r\nEd Gaynor\r\n3739 Colorado Avenue\r\nSheffield, OH 44054\r\n\r\n\r\nmy dad\'s like a nazi and don\'t trust no one lol... makes me wanna go fuck some hoes!'),(21301,'4dc4abbaa0','Hawaian ...Samaoan ..Tongan...not all teh same but indeed the same brothers in arms.\r\n\r\nIm actually african american but my uncle is Tongan and many peeps close to the unit are polynesian.\r\n\r\nYou body build / power lift i see...any dietary advice ( whaddya eat and how much of it)?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21135,'adb7c140e7','[quote:adb7c140e7=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:adb7c140e7=\"midget_man1387\"]Yo cabo, I just tried to upload a picture to my gallery, and it wouldn\'t let me... this is the message i got:\r\n\r\nDestination directory albums/userpics/10031/ is not writable by the script ! \r\n\r\n\r\nis it somethin i did wrong?\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\n~midget_man~[/quote:adb7c140e7]nope, this is my mistake.\r\ntry again tomorrow, by that time I should have it all working correctly, sorry about that.\r\nlet me know if you still encounter problems though.[/quote:adb7c140e7]\r\n\r\n\r\nnah, no apologies needed... you\'re tryin.. that\'s all that matters man! I\'ve made many mistakes... mostly with my words, but anyway...\r\n\r\n\r\nand i haven\'t forgotten about my homie  :wink:  :-) .. dont sweat it tho, \'at ain\'t that important!\r\n\r\ngreat job on the site, tho!'),(24470,'05325d419f','wait, h/o...\r\n\r\nhere\'s what you need to send it to:\r\n\r\ned gaynor\r\nc/o:  the furnace works inc.\r\n3739 colorado ave.\r\nsheffield, oh 44054\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\nm/m'),(24936,'9888205de4','its all gravy man lol\r\n\r\nits been like a month or two anyway so im used to the wait\r\n\r\n\r\ni\'m def. excited mang!\r\n\r\nthanks,\r\n~migde');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24938,'02cb3946e4','No one has gotten at me about a replacement car so I am cool.'),(24955,'1919b859bf','Doin nothin YET with the wheels.....\r\n\r\nGot yo address.............\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPeace out   :cool:'),(27190,'e7e92fbbea','I understand.  The one part that I wanted to make sure I was clear about was if the steering motor was not in the slot, would it keep spinning indefinitely in one direction while the steering wheel on the controller was being turned?'),(27191,'f349214924','correct, if i pull the motor out and turn the tx wheel the steering motor spins until i center the controller.'),(36475,'be29431c4e','Sure man, what do you need to know? I think I forgot to say that the mirrors are a little shaved because of rolling it but the 2 new extras are included.'),(27193,'982b83642e','I apologize if I didn\'t get the joke.\r\n\r\nYou can leave it as is, don\'t sweat it.\r\n\r\nI\'m only tryin\' to keep a clean forum.\r\n\r\nThanks :-)'),(23176,'79ba41b75f','[quote:79ba41b75f=\"hogjowlz\"]ya. it will run as is but you need to get an inductor to fix the range. i know cj had some on hand or you can get em from digikey for 40cents a pop or so. i forget the value.  i tell ya what dude. ill throw in the bearings if i dont have to fiddle with the shit before i ship.[/quote:79ba41b75f]\r\n\r\n  Sounds easy enough to fix\r\n\r\n  Hey did you install that nelly from ph2t in one of your cars yet?  Just wondering what you thought as I was gonna send one of the xmods to him to get done.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (25455,'965992b9b6','do you want me go get you a zz monster instead of the xmod parts? i figure one plus the motor and wheel kits should make us even. cool?'),(21151,'437b63617a','I think you sabotaged yourself, and in the future should adopt a different contest strategy.\r\n\r\nSee what happened was, both your cars got high ranking votes, but in the end the votes were split between them, and ultimately lowered your rank.\r\n\r\nIn retrospect that doesn\'t seem very fair to me, but I guess that\'s the way the ball bounces. Being the newest mod, I\'m not gonna diss on the voting system. I feel partially responsible, because I voted for the XB, just because I\'m a sucker for flames, and thought the surfboards fit the theme better, but seeing how your half cab edged it out, I wished I voted the other way now.\r\n\r\nSorry, but I\'ll make it up to you by sharing my contest strategy, that apparently works, because I\'ve got three wins under my belt.\r\n\r\nDon\'t put all your marbles in your first car. Do something to wow \'em, and set a standard that people are trying to top, that you know you can beat, then pull out the stops at the last minute for your second ride. They\'ll never know what hit them.\r\n\r\nBTW, this PM is just between us, cool? 8-) \r\n\r\nDave'),(23275,'a15c5860f3','Login:bitpimps\r\nPass:bitpimps\r\n\r\nIP:65.92.93.11\r\nPort:6969');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21153,'380131d813','Arite C Dub, who do I send me lewt too?  This ride is friggin awsome, thank you so much for throwin the auction down for all us Pimps.'),(23203,'ee7ef9bc41','[quote:ee7ef9bc41=\"hogjowlz\"]i got shitloads of episodes if you want me to upload them[/quote:ee7ef9bc41]Nah, I\'ve seen every one of the first 3 seasons, at least a dozen times, they started to lose me after the 4th season, so I\'m cool with just checking in occasionally.  :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(21155,'380131d813','Arite C Dub, who do I send me lewt too?  This ride is friggin awsome, thank you so much for throwin the auction down for all us Pimps.'),(34642,'71b181c82f','[quote:71b181c82f=\"arfin\"]OMG NO! it\'s such a buz kill, i come home expecting it to be there, AND NO! It better be here tomorrow, and it better be worth it! Btw, maybe you should wait till i finish the epoch before you send out the package, because it\'s not really fair for you. It\'s up to you. It\'s gonna be cool for both of us to get something new![/quote:71b181c82f]\r\n\r\nAhhh shit mang, no worries. I think it\'s all fair and whatnot.\r\n\r\nNo \'trade\' here involved, really. I just have a bunch of Bit stuff, and this stuff is kinda rare where you live.\r\n\r\nAnd, I think you\'ll like these \'toynk\' 3.8 motors, I\'ll have to send one of those to you also!\r\n\r\n--Dave'),(32501,'3f432e763a','I have two different mini\'s.  A red one on 49mhz and a blue one on 27mhz.  Which one would you like?  Also, I checked with the PO and standard mail to austrailia is running 11.00.\r\n\r\nThat would bring your total to $20.50USD. \r\n\r\nLater,\r\nChrome...');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (31873,'52dc53766b','Booted his worthless ass:\r\nhttp://tinyrc.com/forums/showthread.php?s=&amp;postid=192020#post192020\r\n\r\nIn case you\'d like to \"love\" him for a little longer, his IP is:\r\n65.35.117.181 (or at least that\'s the IP on record).\r\n\r\nIf anybody asks, it wasn\'t me that gave you that IP!  :-)'),(21158,'8694b57305','thats awesome man! is the chick in like a black skin tight suit? I forget her name but I have her, theres another girl named viper. they have the same sculpts. Those lazy bastards.'),(21165,'8b027e4aad','Thank you CD I will check all that stuff tonite.'),(21167,'72ffa32543','Hey Finks, congrats man, you got a killer deal on that car.\r\n\r\nWell I can only get to the post office about once a week, so if you can arrange payment, and get me your address by this afternoon, I can get it out right away.\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you want to pay by Paypal, my email is davesmoejoe@yahoo.com\r\n\r\ndave'),(21168,'d815f8a1af','Hey bro, here it is\r\n\r\nJesse King\r\n25 Springview Ln.  Unit #3\r\nWest Bath, ME 04530\r\n\r\nI am one of those non pay pall bastards, want me to cut you a check or send yer ass cash?  Either way is cool for me and I will get it out today.  Just need your info as well.  Thanks again for this killer wip.\r\n\r\nFinks');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21169,'8ccbb5e9ff','oh fine bitch.'),(21171,'946f606b25','Arite gonna mail yer ass Cash, give me the info bro.'),(21172,'b446f8d2a6','Hey, just shootin you my weekly wassup.  Like I have said before no hurry, just want to stay on yer ass  :cool:'),(21173,'d815f8a1af','Hey bro, here it is\r\n\r\nJesse King\r\n25 Springview Ln.  Unit #3\r\nWest Bath, ME 04530\r\n\r\nI am one of those non pay pall bastards, want me to cut you a check or send yer ass cash?  Either way is cool for me and I will get it out today.  Just need your info as well.  Thanks again for this killer wip.\r\n\r\nFinks'),(21174,'946f606b25','Arite gonna mail yer ass Cash, give me the info bro.'),(21175,'8f5e04d6b5','[quote:8f5e04d6b5=\"Finks\"]Arite gonna mail yer ass Cash, give me the info bro.[/quote:8f5e04d6b5]sure thang, you can send to:\r\n\r\nScott Lix\r\n16 Crystal Lake Drive\r\nSt. Peters, MO 63376\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks holmes'),(21176,'8f5e04d6b5','[quote:8f5e04d6b5=\"Finks\"]Arite gonna mail yer ass Cash, give me the info bro.[/quote:8f5e04d6b5]sure thang, you can send to:\r\n\r\nScott Lix\r\n16 Crystal Lake Drive\r\nSt. Peters, MO 63376\r\n\r\n\r\nthanks holmes');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21177,'686aed046a','[quote:686aed046a=\"Finks\"]Hey bro, here it is\r\n\r\nJesse King\r\n25 Springview Ln.  Unit #3\r\nWest Bath, ME 04530\r\n\r\nI am one of those non pay pall bastards, want me to cut you a check or send yer ass cash?  Either way is cool for me and I will get it out today.  Just need your info as well.  Thanks again for this killer wip.\r\n\r\nFinks[/quote:686aed046a]Ok, then, check or money order preferred, cash not a good idea in my area. ;) :lol: \r\n\r\nMy address is:\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n7002 W Indian School Rd.\r\nApt# 1131\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nIt should get here before next Tuesday, so we\'ll plan on shipping the car then, \'cause honestly, I\'m just looking for excuses not leave the house today. :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(21178,'686aed046a','[quote:686aed046a=\"Finks\"]Hey bro, here it is\r\n\r\nJesse King\r\n25 Springview Ln.  Unit #3\r\nWest Bath, ME 04530\r\n\r\nI am one of those non pay pall bastards, want me to cut you a check or send yer ass cash?  Either way is cool for me and I will get it out today.  Just need your info as well.  Thanks again for this killer wip.\r\n\r\nFinks[/quote:686aed046a]Ok, then, check or money order preferred, cash not a good idea in my area. ;) :lol: \r\n\r\nMy address is:\r\nDavid Harrington\r\n7002 W Indian School Rd.\r\nApt# 1131\r\nPhoenix, AZ 85033\r\n\r\nIt should get here before next Tuesday, so we\'ll plan on shipping the car then, \'cause honestly, I\'m just looking for excuses not leave the house today. :lol: \r\n\r\ndave'),(21179,'4894f31f58','Actually just got a PM from CW saying to Paypal you OR Send cash to him.  So I\'ll send the cash to him if that makes sence to you.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33001,'571d339e4b','still haven\'t got it. Any luck finding out anything?'),(29203,'14d28d18ca','i\'d rather ripper asked me himself. no offence to you, i apreciate the thought. if anything i should do the editing and submit it myself really, i know where everything is and what\'s important.\r\nif you do need to read it over, go to the articles section here, all my tutorials are there with pics.\r\n\r\nso it\'s not a no, i have no problem with people refering the mod to others or posting example pics just so long as no one tries to pass off my stuff as theirs.\r\n\r\ncheers mate!! crikey bewdy bottler aussie!'),(26621,'bc72930e4f','yo pimp.  were do you have the street paper from?? your trackrox!!!!'),(31325,'012094ce78','ok any idea on a price ?\r\n\r\nvery gratefull , \r\njoe'),(31326,'ad3100436c','You can Make offer, or we can discuss it on the BP Chat?  :-o'),(31343,'2abf6708a1','Right on. That did the trick. :-o \r\n\r\nThis is a GTO chassis, so I guess you want to make note that the later ones get the jumper. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis thing does indeed scream. It is a little hard to control, but with a little practice it\'s gonna be fun. Can\'t wait to get another, so I have an evenly matched pair, but I\'m kinda wanting to wait to see if do that 9 step forward thing. That\'d be cool if you could make that one reverse step a little faster than stock.\r\n\r\nAnyways, thanks for your help. I\'m anxious to do a little write up on it this weekend. I was kinda thinking I should make a little vid with a 1st generation SE, a recent generation Vette, and the GTO with the DC mod, all FET modded with green gears and 3.4 motor. The difference between the 3 is pretty drastic.\r\n\r\ndave\r\n\r\nEDIT: The steering jitters went away, does the DC Mod fix that too? :???:'),(37681,'f8a8bf70fa','I\'d give you twenty shipped......How much do you want for the controllers?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28018,'9ac4685e32','Got the Jota shell today. Looks killer, thanx man. Totally worth the trade. I\'ll add you to my list of trusted pimps cause you good. :D'),(21181,'b446f8d2a6','Hey, just shootin you my weekly wassup.  Like I have said before no hurry, just want to stay on yer ass  :cool:'),(21183,'4894f31f58','Actually just got a PM from CW saying to Paypal you OR Send cash to him.  So I\'ll send the cash to him if that makes sence to you.'),(21185,'be876b0358','Hey, Finks is gonna be sending you the $$, so let me know when you get it, so I know when it\'s cool to ship.\r\n\r\nDave'),(21186,'be876b0358','Hey, Finks is gonna be sending you the $$, so let me know when you get it, so I know when it\'s cool to ship.\r\n\r\nDave'),(21187,'6a0a6c8e6b','[quote:6a0a6c8e6b=\"crazydave\"]Hey, Finks is gonna be sending you the $$, so let me know when you get it, so I know when it\'s cool to ship.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:6a0a6c8e6b]you betchya, will do man.'),(21188,'74dedb947b','I told you I\'d give you more info about it when I had it, and now I do :-) \r\n\r\nHere\'s the scoop if you\'re interested.\r\nTry and keep it quiet though, my host is allowing me to offer this to only a few select people. we don\'t want to load down the server with a bunch of sites and end up having a slow site like with our last host. cool?\r\n\r\n$10.00 per month or $60.00 per every 6 months gets you:\r\n- 1200 MB space\r\n- 50 GB / month bandwidth\r\n- 10 pop3 accounts\r\n- 2 domains\r\n- 25 subdomains per domain\r\n- 2 mysql databases\r\n- server management interface\r\n\r\nother benefits:\r\n- you know you\'re on a fast and reliable server that will never host anymore than a few sites, making performance stellar.\r\n- the server manager interface (plesk) is pretty nice.\r\n\r\ndrawbacks:\r\n- this isn\'t a dedicated hosting company/server, so the server is currently not being backed up on a routine basis.\r\n\r\npro and con:\r\n- support, if you have questions or need help (setup, email settings, ftp, etc.) I can probably help you, if not I can refer you to the dude running the server and he can help you. the pro is you\'ll get support from 2 knowledgable dorks, 1 of which you know. the con is there isn\'t a team of help desk dorks to give you the run around, which is back to being a pro. lol\r\n\r\n\r\nanyways, there it is, let me know if you\'re interested and want to get it setup.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21189,'6a0a6c8e6b','[quote:6a0a6c8e6b=\"crazydave\"]Hey, Finks is gonna be sending you the $$, so let me know when you get it, so I know when it\'s cool to ship.\r\n\r\nDave[/quote:6a0a6c8e6b]you betchya, will do man.'),(21190,'26c15d60fd','Sounds good to me bro. :-) \r\nNow gimme a lil bit of time to figure out exactly what I wanna do. When does he need to know by? I\'m definatly gonna need help man, I know very lil about building a website. :( \r\n\r\nThanks for the info.'),(24329,'047339430a','[quote:047339430a=\"KaNye\"]Sorry about that miss understanding, I feel kinda stupid now. I just thought I remebered people saying the actual FETs made them faster, must have been with the right gearing and motor or something along those lines. Now that someone has given me the REAL rundown of them, I understand. I probably should have tested some different set ups too.\r\n\r\nSorry again for the missundertanding, and thanks\r\nKanye.[/quote:047339430a]Hey no prob, and really man, don\'t feel stupid, there\'s a lot of hype and bogus information floating around out there, so it\'s totally understandable. \r\n\r\n\r\nDave'),(21261,'44581c6693','I will take $75 as is...I\'m not even playing with it anymore. Like I said, I belive one of the gears is stripped, but I will check it out tomorrow and let ya know for sure. I have no problem waiting, it\'s been sitting in a box anyways.\r\n\r\nMike');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21262,'d551134701','ya sounds like the cells. put fresh batts in the charger and see. are you using a normal charger? you need at least a 3 cell charger to juice up a dual.\r\n\r\ni have cases full of parts lol.'),(21263,'ecdb1d8ac1','[quote:ecdb1d8ac1=\"VooDooMafia\"]Hey CW just thought I would drop you  a line as I feel bad I have not been around in awhile.\r\n\r\n  Things have been really crazy with work (now that I am not on perental leave anymore :( ) and we are opening a new store and dumping a ton of cash into it.\r\n\r\n  Also got a new car thats taking alot of my cash I guess I shouldnt have got the TT maybe should have went with the 350Z as they are alot cheaper.\r\n\r\n  Anyway I plan to be around more now that I have net access at work now.\r\n\r\nPete \r\n\r\nVooDoo[/quote:ecdb1d8ac1]good to see ya back man, some of the pimps were wondering about ya.\r\nI know how the time thing goes, life can eat it up pretty quickly.\r\n\r\nanyways, good to see ya back bro.'),(21264,'e2b47fc7eb','[quote:e2b47fc7eb=\"VooDooMafia\"]Man been gone awhile.\r\n\r\n  I feel bad for not being able to get on teh last few months but with work and the new store we are opening things are crazy as hell.\r\n\r\n  How are the fets comeing along with the se\'s and shit.\r\n\r\n  you doing any of the fet/turbo mods to the mini z\'s or xmods yet.\r\n\r\nVooDoo\r\n\r\nPete[/quote:e2b47fc7eb]SE FET mods are ready to go. We gots that cookie cracked good. I\'ve been meaning to order FETs the last couple days, but at any rate I\'ll have some FETs by next week and be ready to go.\r\n\r\nThe mods at bitPimps are doing custom cars that we\'re auctioning off to raise money for bitPimps, been busy with that. Had an emergency move a few weeks ago, and got derailed by that, but I\'m getting back on track now.\r\n\r\n\r\nHaven\'t played with my Xmod much at all, but GPM is offering a full line of aluminum parts that gots me kinda excited. They\'re not available in America yet, but CJ is planning to try to get a distro deal.\r\n\r\nAt that point I may look into FETs, but I\'m interested in ph2t\'s \"whoah nellie\" external turbo. He\'s claiming it to be the equivilent to a 15x FET stack. That\'d be the shit.\r\n\r\nI\'m kinda looking at maybe around Christmas, investing in the Xmod, money\'s real tight right now with that move..\r\n\r\nGood to hear from you, hope you\'ll be ready to hang around again soon.\r\n\r\nDave');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21265,'82a4395bbd','If you can take paypal, I\'ll take it!!!!  Just give me that time to get the 1:1 inspected and fixed this week.   About the gear, just let me know, its no biggie, just give me a link to  where I can pick them up and I\'m good.   \r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\n\r\nMike'),(21268,'77ab07e420','oh ok just thought u may not want them casue u dont got a T'),(21272,'01b126d210','[quote:01b126d210=\"DarkTari\"]I\'ll double on it this week!  System at home is down.[/quote:01b126d210]doh, man a bunch of us have been troubles, that sucks - never fun.\r\n\r\nsounds good though, thanks man.'),(35303,'ba9d2d6615','I guess that guy has his head up his ass, cause it\'s like he\'s avoiding me now..  What a fucker. I think he\'s a shit talkin drug addict...\r\n\r\nI\'ll see if I can raise the $$$ myself.    If you have another buyer, go for it, but I\'ll see what I can come up with.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI knocked the shit outta that cold...lol\r\n\r\n-Steve'),(21274,'0f1650da05','Hey Cavey,\r\n\r\nDid you send the chassis yet?  I\'m hoping you say no, yes by UPS  :???: \r\n\r\nThere was a tractor trailer disaster late last week and guess what it was carrying?  USPO Parcels  :sad: \r\n\r\nLemme know Pimp!');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21275,'3104ecf135','Email me sims.glenn@epa.gov   home system problems!'),(21276,'0f1650da05','Hey Cavey,\r\n\r\nDid you send the chassis yet?  I\'m hoping you say no, yes by UPS  :???: \r\n\r\nThere was a tractor trailer disaster late last week and guess what it was carrying?  USPO Parcels  :sad: \r\n\r\nLemme know Pimp!'),(21670,'32e802a383','[quote:32e802a383=\"Son_Gokou\"]Ship the items to:\r\n\r\nA.J. Batra\r\n24 Stevenson Avenue\r\nCortlandt Manor, NY 10567\r\n\r\nI\'ll get pics of the bods soon...[/quote:32e802a383]\r\n\r\nSG Stuff\r\nc/o Mike Smalley Jr.\r\n3918 Inland Ave.\r\nWest Mifflin, Pa  15122'),(21553,'ba70d638dd','you ever been on beatyourtruck.com the site is awsome\r\ni have a sport maxx \r\nyou have a tmaxx right?'),(21278,'3104ecf135','Email me sims.glenn@epa.gov   home system problems!'),(21279,'e25e73e9cf','[quote:e25e73e9cf=\"DarkTari\"]Hey Cavey,\r\n\r\nDid you send the chassis yet?  I\'m hoping you say no, yes by UPS  :???: \r\n\r\nThere was a tractor trailer disaster late last week and guess what it was carrying?  USPO Parcels  :sad: \r\n\r\nLemme know Pimp![/quote:e25e73e9cf]No I didn\'t, I was trying to get an answer from Finks, but now he\'s sending money.\r\n\r\nAnyways, good thing I guess. I knew there was a reason I just really didn\'t want to go to the post office. :lol: \r\n\r\nSo yeah sorry I\'ve been lazy, the heat\'s just been killing me lately, and right now I\'m just waiting for Fink\'s payment, so I only have to make one trip.\r\n\r\nI\'m gonna be right next to the post office on monday, enrolling my kid in school, so guaranteed, that stuff goes out by then.\r\n\r\ndave'),(21280,'01f2c24c5b','I\'m back online  :-D \r\n\r\n[b:01f2c24c5b]THANK GOD 4 YO LAZY AZZ CAVEY !!![/b:01f2c24c5b] :eek:  (just jokin)\r\n\r\nThat\'s too good to hear!  When I heard about the accident the only thing I thought about was my box being thrown off the overpass into oncoming traffic and being CRUSHED !  Wouldn\'t have been too big a loss, I have so many Micro\'s that are still in the box, bubble, etc.\r\n\r\nWe gotta get something goin 4 next weeks Auction.  I\'ll post in da forum.\r\n\r\nI hear da heat down there is unbearable, stay cool Pimp  :cool:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21281,'4b6d15546e','Cabo, You getting any reports from others about getting logged off!\r\nFor instance I tried to edit my own post, I was logged in and it came back with a message \"Can only edit my own post\" Looked on top and was not logged in ??????  Just a heads up !\r\n\r\nI\'m back online at home Whoopie  :-D'),(36840,'39a41e1c16','[quote:39a41e1c16=\"HACHI-RYOKU\"]Anytime,\r\n             I can get them in and out as fast as you need.  [b:39a41e1c16]Just give me a heads up first[/b:39a41e1c16].  I\'ve already got the fets on hand and I\'ve had plenty of practice doing them in bits.  I\'m not to savy on fet swapping with ZipZaps, but I could always replace the pcb with a bit/clone pcb and give it a controller that I know would have longer range.  I\'ve got literally boxes of controllers that I\'ll never use.\r\n\r\nMy address;\r\nRobert Wilson\r\n1230 North Tomcat Court\r\nVirginia Beach, Va\r\n23454[/quote:39a41e1c16]\r\n\r\nFor Sure Pimp !'),(34979,'2c8424cbd6','I\'ll do a tutorial... Give me a day or two to set up pics.\r\n\r\nI\'ll PM you when I\'m done.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34981,'0666ff9788','Hi Man!\r\n\r\nAnother fellow brisbane pimp here.  \r\nI\'ve seen some of your posts around the place, just wanted to see if you were still around the traps, or Have you gotten out of micros?\r\nWould be nice to find someone local to race sometime :D\r\n\r\nAnyhoo, have a good one!\r\n\r\nMik.'),(34982,'2c8424cbd6','I\'ll do a tutorial... Give me a day or two to set up pics.\r\n\r\nI\'ll PM you when I\'m done.'),(21470,'feaac34ac7','Its the 45\'s that are gone I still have the 4374\'s\r\n\r\n  I am just taking offers on them I sold the others for $15.00 shipping included.'),(25100,'df5c479382','so how much do you need to print some posters of the latest ad you did?\r\nI just got the poster sessiz did for the moderators contest all framed and shit and it looks fuckin great. I\'d like to get your ad printed out and framed.\r\nyou were sayin something about posting up the original for us to print out, so if it costs you too much to print it out, I\'ll print it myself. but one way or another, I gots to get me a poster sized print out of that bad boy.\r\n\r\nI hope you and hue keep doing more - you see the response it got.'),(26427,'f01d6674ca','my addy:\r\n\r\nBrian Gaynor\r\n316 Delaware Avenue\r\nLorain, OH 44052\r\n\r\nI\'ll send asap.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21474,'cb1a2eb1f1','Thanks Bro, Can\'t Wait :-D'),(21475,'75f837f8c3','what one did you want?'),(23409,'a9c3646f02','shipping is included in the auction price. as far as the se cells the car has one in it. id say yes forsure but im broke as shit right now and jobless so i dont know when i can swing that. ask dave about that tho.'),(21477,'2c6bd17336','hey man - how goes all the modding?\r\nwanted to make sure you haven\'t sent out my Torino yet, last time we talked about it you were going to try and get it out that monday, I just wanna make sure it didn\'t get snagged in the mail.\r\n\r\nI just watched Starsky and Hutch last night and got all gung-ho and wanted to bust out the Torino lol\r\n\r\nhows the other stuff?\r\nI hope I/we didn\'t dump too much stuff on your shoulders?\r\nyou\'re doing a lot for these auctions and I don\'t wanna burn you out from it.'),(26458,'97a462b007','aiight well my original MT went to shit so I got a new one, meaning you get BRAND NEW, never been used green rims! haha I also picked up a bubble wrap envelope so I should send it today or tomorrow. It\'s lookin more like tomorrow though.\r\n\r\n\r\nI\'ll take the hummer.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks a bunch bro!\r\n~midget~'),(28482,'92ecc93f07','I had to send you he 27 because something was wrong with the 49. both of the cars were brand new too. I have had a couple of new cars not work.  You would think after they have made a couple of million of these cars the would get it right.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (23292,'50e79ce735','Ment to ask if the xmod that you sent has the crystals still?'),(21287,'01f2c24c5b','I\'m back online  :-D \r\n\r\n[b:01f2c24c5b]THANK GOD 4 YO LAZY AZZ CAVEY !!![/b:01f2c24c5b] :eek:  (just jokin)\r\n\r\nThat\'s too good to hear!  When I heard about the accident the only thing I thought about was my box being thrown off the overpass into oncoming traffic and being CRUSHED !  Wouldn\'t have been too big a loss, I have so many Micro\'s that are still in the box, bubble, etc.\r\n\r\nWe gotta get something goin 4 next weeks Auction.  I\'ll post in da forum.\r\n\r\nI hear da heat down there is unbearable, stay cool Pimp  :cool:'),(21288,'3e17737cdc','Sup dude I was going to msg you on msn but it was set to moble.\r\n\r\n  Heres teh tracking #\r\n\r\n   CX 065 032 339 CA\r\n\r\nand thats at www.canadapost.ca'),(33073,'805e34e340','[img:805e34e340]http://img398.imageshack.us/img398/9562/15252677jt.jpg[/img:805e34e340]'),(33099,'da18d0c728','the problem is with the increased voltage of the battery pack you need to somehow increase the charger output voltage of the controller.  not saying it can\'t be done, just that i don\'t know how  :sad: .');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (33131,'f4b5cc4596','cool,, do you remember how much money i owe you?  let me know and ill have it to you right away\r\n\r\nSorry again\r\n\r\nSTG'),(32584,'7f09b014ab','i can be anal too, but no problem on box condition... \r\n\r\nwhat\'s your paypal address?  \r\n\r\n$20 shipped, right?'),(21305,'3388cc651b','You comin to chat or what?'),(21307,'630b41be61','hobby grade propo is 512 steps. zipzapsSE are are only 7 each way. thats what I mean. and since \"I am a pretty little girl in my flowered sundress.\" and the threads locked. I didnt have a chance to explain that.'),(21308,'db79a0c484','And when I originally said the SEs are \'FULL\' propo (before I changed it to ARE), I meant steering and speed...Not the 512 steps.\r\n\r\nWhile I agree, is isn\'t near as smooth at the 512steps, but by virtue of the term \'propo\' and the idea of having MULTIPLE \'steps\' (not just a PULL to one side or the other) I think you can see my point that the SE is Propo.'),(21309,'b3cf2f71fb','Who exactly is Bridget the Midget? Got a pic of her? Is she hot?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21310,'f6b3e32f4d','You posted a pic of her in the fuck you forum...    She\'s hot for a little chick...lol\r\n\r\nThe girl in the pic is Bridget the Midget..lol\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S'),(21311,'2b86971209','Look...playa....I realize the thread started by Stampede Man got out of hand.\r\n\r\nI also realize that everyone is entitled to their opinion.\r\n\r\nId even agree that you have to step up and get your homies back when they are under fire (Hog)...\r\n\r\nBut do you think its fair that Hog was making statements without any FACTS attempting to make me look bad and when i called him out and made him look bad he locked the thread. \r\n\r\nIm as real as the next guy but come on. As a pimp youve got to know thats not how a man handles his biz. Hell let us get down Pimp Stlye one on one lol. He is a grown man and if he is right im humble enough in the face of God to apologize. Dont protect him orlet him make the Bit Pimps...home of MODDERS and Bit Fans....look bad. If you think i screwed up call me on it. Let me know because right now to everyone it just looks like Hog up and ran and them edited my post out of fear.\r\nIm not trying to make him look bad...i just want him to show me or explain to me the error of my ways if he so strongly believes im wrong.'),(21312,'756bfa4ba2','I checked it out today, and actually it runs! I don\'t know what I was thinking. I might have had it mixed up with one of my other RC\'s.\r\n\r\nThe only things I know are wrong with it...\r\n\r\nSmall screw missing that holds the gear cover on, but 2 out of 3 ain\'t bad.\r\nThe antenna tube is a little short from a break off during a flip.\r\nThe rear spoiler is missing, came off in a flip.\r\n\r\nNo broken pieces and is actually clean. I\'ll post pics in that thread.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21313,'2b86971209','Look...playa....I realize the thread started by Stampede Man got out of hand.\r\n\r\nI also realize that everyone is entitled to their opinion.\r\n\r\nId even agree that you have to step up and get your homies back when they are under fire (Hog)...\r\n\r\nBut do you think its fair that Hog was making statements without any FACTS attempting to make me look bad and when i called him out and made him look bad he locked the thread. \r\n\r\nIm as real as the next guy but come on. As a pimp youve got to know thats not how a man handles his biz. Hell let us get down Pimp Stlye one on one lol. He is a grown man and if he is right im humble enough in the face of God to apologize. Dont protect him orlet him make the Bit Pimps...home of MODDERS and Bit Fans....look bad. If you think i screwed up call me on it. Let me know because right now to everyone it just looks like Hog up and ran and them edited my post out of fear.\r\nIm not trying to make him look bad...i just want him to show me or explain to me the error of my ways if he so strongly believes im wrong.'),(21314,'3a08d2ba8f','Sounds and looks good.  I\'ll take it.  I can take care of a screw and a tube.  I\'ll send you your $$$$ as soon as I possibly can.  Which will probably be within the next week or so, if not definatly the 13th of Aug, my next P-Day!!  If you still don\'t mind holdin\' onto that for me.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat\'s your PayPal?\r\n\r\nThanks again,\r\n\r\nMike');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28684,'83fb00e3b0','I\'ll give a go.\r\n\r\nThanks bro.'),(35871,'1421f9e6d9','Sam Rietta\r\n26 George Gale Road\r\nWoodbridge, Ontario\r\nL4H 2S6\r\nCanada\r\n\r\nWhat is yours?'),(35936,'53ad8ca05c','Depends on your track. If you have long straightaways, use the yellow road race motor. If you have tons of turns and twists, keep the white or use the red. Never use the blue one since the torque sucks.'),(36679,'492bb9f19e','Yep t hose are RS bearings. Enjoy your parts haha, they are really nice. All these little things about them such as durability and strength will raelly make your car enjoyable.'),(21316,'31fc551bfc','hey money should go throught 2day or 2morrow... sorry about the wait.. ive been abit of a shit havnt i...'),(35046,'fde97f6d0d','My paypal is cjellis@yahoo.com\r\n\r\nThe one black/red kit with 2 XME039R would be $68.00 + $3.00 s&amp;h'),(35047,'d2d865a533','[quote:d2d865a533]OK. Made up my mind. \r\n\r\nHere\'s my list. \r\n\r\nSilver Please. \r\nFor an Evo Mustang. \r\n\r\nEverything, except: \r\nXME330LAN-ALLOY FRONT BODY LOCK PLATE (FOR LANCER) - 1PC[/quote:d2d865a533]\r\n\r\nMy paypal is cjellis@yahoo.com\r\n\r\nTotaL $63.00 + $3.00 s&amp;h.'),(35048,'2941acad4c','[quote:2941acad4c][quote:2941acad4c]\r\n1 full set of EVO car in GREEN. (stang clip) \r\n\r\n1 full set of EVO truck in SILVER. (truck clip F-150 style) \r\n\r\nI would like one of each front clip if possible.  [/quote:2941acad4c]\r\n\r\n$68.00 + $71.00 +3.00 s&amp;h + 1.00 s&amp;h \r\n\r\n$153.00 Total \r\n\r\nPayPal me at Cjellis@yahoo.com[/quote:2941acad4c]\r\n\r\nI can\'t add.\r\n\r\nforgot the motor heat sinks.\r\n\r\nEVO car and truck +s&amp;h + OG Xmods parts + S&amp;h\r\n\r\n$138.00 + $4.00 s&amp;h + $30.00 + $1.00 s&amp;h = $173.00\r\n\r\n[i:2941acad4c]used a calculator this time[/i:2941acad4c]');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21318,'16ef8a35c6','I understand what you ment. I just wanted to respond so I didn\'t sound like I had no clue what I was talking about. \r\n\r\nbtw, Nice site you live in joisey too? where at? maybe when I get one of these panthers I\'ll race your SE.  8)'),(21319,'139325035e','Dude I am still willing to but 4 or 8 if you need me too.. I can give them out as b-day presents to my little cuz\'s'),(21320,'a27dc3b523','I\'m over by the outlet malls in Secaucus m\'self.\r\n\r\nThe idea of racing someone that actually KNOWS how to drive (unlike my wife, or chasing the dog) is such an alien idea that Im STILL trying to comprehend it!  :shock:'),(28686,'d22b18da8b','Woo ha! I found a way to make it work!\r\n\r\nI knew it, I KNEW IT! I knew that thing was hung up on being set to Composite out!\r\n\r\nThe opened tray while pressing \'1\' didn\'t do the trick unfortunately, so I decided fuck it...I\'ll plug the component out cable to the Red port for Composite out...BINGO! The video was distorted, but it was clear enough for me to go through the menus and turn Composite off, now it all works again!\r\n\r\nFigured I\'d let you know that little trick in case you get stuck in a similar situation.\r\n\r\nAnd now I\'m off to watch the new remake of Doctor Who and some Carnivale.\r\n\r\nLater bro.'),(35312,'e9d707753c','Coolio man... Thanks dude.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-S');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (30038,'8acd5d0f06','Hey, so what\'s your DC mod run?\r\n\r\nI haven\'t played with my SEs for a while, and I just revived them both. I forgot how sluggish these are off the line. My biggest problem, I realized, is when I reversing out of a situation, then slamming into forwards. It seems the extra weight of the SE causes it to lag before moving. Is your DC mod gonna be much help in this situation, or is the SEs weight still gonna put it at a disadvantage?\r\n\r\ndave'),(37162,'4a9dde21b7','[quote:4a9dde21b7=\"cj\"]\r\nThis is what I got now:\r\n\r\nPART ID	DESCRIPTION	Price 	Purple \r\nDXME100R	DELRIN REAR BALL DIFFERENTIAL - 1 COMPLETED SET	$10.08	1\r\nXME012A	ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET	$7.74	1\r\nXME012B	ALLOY FRONT GEAR BOX BACK COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET	$0.00	1\r\nXME013A	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX FRONT COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET 	$15.54	1\r\nXME013B	ALLOY REAR GEAR BOX REAR COVER WITH SCREWS - 1PC SET 	$7.74	1\r\nXME021	ALLOY FRONT KNUCKLE ARM - 1PR	$6.44	1\r\nXME022	ALLOY REAR KNUCKLE ARM -1 PR	$6.44	1\r\nXME028	ALLOY FRONT SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	$7.90	1\r\nXME030	ALLOY REAR SHOCK TOWER - 1PC	$5.14	1\r\nXME039F	ALLOY FRONT WHEEL SHAFT - 1PR	$2.54	1\r\nXME039R	ALLOY REAR Wheel SHAFT - 1PR 	$2.54	1\r\nXME039R/C	ALLOY REAR UNIVERSAL SWING SHAFT (CVD DESIGN) - 1PR	$13.80	2\r\nXME039R/4WD	ALLOY REAR Wheel SHAFT FOR 4WD - 1PR 	$2.54	1\r\nXME049/0	ALLOY STEERING PLATE - 1PC	$4.23	1\r\nXME055	ALLOY FRONT LOWER ARM - 1PR	$5.14	1\r\nXME056	ALLOY REAR LOWER ARM - 1PR	$5.14	1\r\nXME190R	ALLOY REAR DOG BONE (9.0MM) - 1PR	$3.25	2\r\nXME316F	ALLOY FRONT DAMPER (16MM) -1PR	$3.84	1\r\nXME316R	ALLOY REAR DAMPER (16MM) - 1PR	$3.84	1\r\nXME331R	ALLOY REAR SKID PLATE - 1PC	$2.28	1\r\nMZ002	ALLOY 2MM LOCK NUT SET  5PCS	$3.80	1\r\n\r\nSub	$131.87	\r\nS&amp;H 4%	$5.27	\r\nTotal	$137.14	\r\n\r\nMy paypal is cjellis@yahoo.com[/quote:4a9dde21b7] Put me down for the parts listed above in purple. I just sent the money through paypal, from kinglingy@msn.com.\r\n\r\nPlease ship to:\r\n\r\n[b:4a9dde21b7]Rasheed Sabir\r\n4405 NW 73rd Ave\r\nSte 716993\r\nMiami, FL 33166-6488[/b:4a9dde21b7]\r\n\r\nI got a traffic violation from the police today, and I don\'t know how much I have to pay. So I will only be getting one set right now.\r\n\r\nThanx man \r\nMaxx'),(24418,'157872a57f','Cool,\r\nGive me your info. and I send you a money order for the $53.00.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24419,'7f381d495d','[quote:7f381d495d=\"Sugarfoot\"]Cool,\r\nGive me your info. and I send you a money order for the $53.00.[/quote:7f381d495d]you got it man. you can send the money order to:\r\n\r\nScott Lix\r\n16 Crystal Lake Drive\r\nSt. Peters, MO 63376\r\n\r\nAs soon as payment is received, the car will be shipped out.\r\n\r\nThanks again :-)'),(24420,'05a77ad143','Yes, he did vouch for me. I pm\'ed him before posting. \r\nThanks for your help...'),(32238,'06d6843bd2','[quote:06d6843bd2=\"hue35\"][quote:06d6843bd2=\"JdmHatchback\"][quote:06d6843bd2=\"hue35\"][quote:06d6843bd2=\"JdmHatchback\"]I can go $90shipped and include the mini cooper roof set and a few tire sets. Let me know. Thanks![/quote:06d6843bd2]\r\n\r\nSplit the difference?... $82.50?[/quote:06d6843bd2]\r\n\r\n$85 and I\'ll throw in 2 body sets lol...[/quote:06d6843bd2]\r\n\r\nlol... cool, as long as they\'re not celicas, bBs or beetles.  :lol: \r\nYou got any Accord wagons? Supras... RX7s... something interesting... it don\'t really matter.\r\n\r\nThanks dude, I\'ll send money in the morning... better connection at work makes that stuff easier. You should see it by 10am.\r\n\r\nThanks again,\r\n\r\nhue35[/quote:06d6843bd2]\r\n\r\nCool! I received your money via paypal. I will send them out to you tomorrow. I\'ll make sure to not put in any celicas, bBs or beetles lol. Thank you again! \r\n\r\nJDM'),(24424,'347e25952d','hey man\r\n\r\ni saw ur post about the se batts, ive been after these things for ages!\r\n\r\ncould i ask a huge favour off you man, could i purchase some of these batts of you/\r\n\r\ni have paypal and all i need is 2!\r\n\r\nif you could let us know plzzzzzzzz\r\n\r\n\r\ncheers man');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (24425,'00b8d9147a','Sure, give me an address and I\'ll send you two when I get them.  I ordered them recently by snail mail, so I\'m expecting them in about a week.\r\n\r\n\r\nYou could also get them at 1-800-the shack.  I assume it\'s difficult to get in Australia.  Here\'s the part # if you can get them from the shack.\r\nRSU #12413456, 2.4V MINI Battery\r\n\r\nIf you can\'t get them, then let me know and I\'ll send you a couple.  Don\'t worry about the cost this time, if you need more I\'ll charge you next time.'),(28355,'cd01a7cfb9','[quote:cd01a7cfb9=\"DarkTari\"][quote:cd01a7cfb9]Yep, Lake Placid, NY, which is about an hour from Canada. I\'m going back up next week, so maybe I\'ll pick one up.[/quote:cd01a7cfb9]\r\n\r\n[b:cd01a7cfb9]Any Luck yet Pimp ?[/b:cd01a7cfb9]\r\n\r\n [img:cd01a7cfb9]http://www.senario.com/images/OffRoadImage.jpg[/img:cd01a7cfb9]\r\n\r\n[b:cd01a7cfb9]I keep look\'n at that pic and wanting a couple real bad now !!!!!![/b:cd01a7cfb9]  :innocent:[/quote:cd01a7cfb9]\r\n\r\nLooks like my luck is shit.  They were out of stock.  :sad: If you find them anywhere lemme know.'),(28356,'6d6bfe2420','Will Do !  What is the name of the store , I can start there.\r\n\r\nThanx !');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28518,'5079215a8a','Hey,\r\nYou got the MT parts yet? If not they\'ll be there today, because it only took Sat and Mon for the skyline to get to me, so the MT parts shoud be there today. \r\nThanks'),(28376,'37c3191fcc','do you have all of the gears springs nuckes of the truck. I didn\'t see it in the picture. I am going to make a zzmt which will have four way turning, so I really could use all of the front end parts. Also do you have any zzmt bodies.  I could use a ford 150 red or silver. let me know'),(28519,'0f6c4b9cda','I am at work right now so it may be at home.  Sorry for not responing to your email yesterday.  I think you should go to Walmart and take a look at the lowrider trucking series.  They have some really cool rims.'),(28372,'0a273640e6','Hey man,\r\nDo You need any more pics, or info on anything, do You still want to do this deal, because I\'m sure it can help us both out, let me know man, my Screen name on AIM/AOL is JESUSPride08, if You want to talk and work all this out still.\r\nThanks'),(37888,'5bf901bcd0','It\'s still in florida but my skybox has moved:\r\n\r\nRasheed Sabir\r\n1900 NW 97th Ave\r\nSTE 716993\r\nMiami\r\nFlorida 33172\r\n\r\nAny word on the GPM stuff for the 2nd group buy?\r\n\r\nThanx\r\nMaxx');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32370,'ceecb9e548','yo! yoos in affekt NakkaH!!!!! \r\n :)'),(21324,'179cd2db1e','[quote:179cd2db1e=\"I AM\"]Look...playa....I realize the thread started by Stampede Man got out of hand.\r\n\r\nI also realize that everyone is entitled to their opinion.\r\n\r\nId even agree that you have to step up and get your homies back when they are under fire (Hog)...\r\n\r\nBut do you think its fair that Hog was making statements without any FACTS attempting to make me look bad and when i called him out and made him look bad he locked the thread. \r\n\r\nIm as real as the next guy but come on. As a pimp youve got to know thats not how a man handles his biz. Hell let us get down Pimp Stlye one on one lol. He is a grown man and if he is right im humble enough in the face of God to apologize. Dont protect him orlet him make the Bit Pimps...home of MODDERS and Bit Fans....look bad. If you think i screwed up call me on it. Let me know because right now to everyone it just looks like Hog up and ran and them edited my post out of fear.\r\nIm not trying to make him look bad...i just want him to show me or explain to me the error of my ways if he so strongly believes im wrong.[/quote:179cd2db1e]let me investigate it.\r\nI stopped following the thread when it turned away from constructive and towards insults.\r\ntypically, hogjowlz locks and edits topics/posts when he feels they\'re getting \"dumb\" or \"out of hand\" or whatever.\r\nI just don\'t know his exact motives in the post you\'re referring to - give me time to find out.\r\nI usually let just about everything fly here, allowing pimps to express their views no matter what they may be. as with anything, everyones got an opinion on it - a lot of times those opinions don\'t agree or match up - and that\'s fine.\r\npersonally, I feel if he locked the thread, it was because he felt the thread is turning useless and less about the topic and more about ripping on eachother. that\'s just from past experience, like I said, let me check in to it.\r\nyou should know by now you have every freedom to call someone out just as much as they might call you out.\r\nmaybe handle it in bitPimps chat?\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/gtchat/\r\n\r\n\r\nI think hog was making statements he thinks to be true, and in some respects they are. I don\'t think they realize where you are at geographically. If I remember right, you\'re in a pretty remote place in Alaska or Canada (not that it isn\'t remote enough lol).\r\nSo I could see shipping being more expensive for you than for \"main landers\".\r\naside from that (and I haven\'t read everything yet) it seems like you\'re trying to \"save face\" so to speak (whether it\'s founded or not) and once one person \"called you out\" on it (or debated it, or whatever you want to call it), the rest of the regular members jumped on a \"band wagon\" - you know what I mean?\r\n\r\npersonally, I don\'t look at it like you had \"ill intent\".\r\nI also look at like a pimp or two posted their own opinions (right or wrong, founded or un-founded) and the rest joined in.\r\nForum Pile On if you know what I mean.\r\n\r\nbottom line, pimps can post what they want.\r\nit might bring havok to them or they might causing it - regardless, everyone has a chance to voice their side until it gets to be completely stupid.\r\nif you feel that strongly about it and believe in it, then you\'ll stand by it all the way to the end.\r\nat this point, I\'m guessing both sides are being somewhat biased and are standing their ground. at that point its time just \"agree to dis-agree\" or whatever.\r\n\r\nif you notice, it seems to be the same handful of pimps posting to that thread - the rest of us are sitting back and watching. call it more reserved, call it pussy, call it whatever, but I\'m certain not every member here has chosen 1 side or another in this debate.\r\nI think the majority will sit back, watch others battle it out, and benefit from the information and findings that happen to come out between the insults.\r\n\r\nwe all have to remember, we\'re all dealing with fanatical geeks here.\r\n\r\nand really, everything I\'m saying here is my own personal speculations.\r\nit could be right, could be wrong.\r\n\r\nI hope you don\'t let this run you off.\r\nI think it\'s more that apparent that the majority respects your posts otherwise this thing wouldn\'t have gotten as heated as it did.\r\n\r\nbeyond that, I\'m not sure what else to say at this point.'),(21381,'8f2c2d3160','bird says: (2:00:16 PM)\r\n   hey assmuch\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:00:31 PM)\r\n   yeah?\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:00:40 PM)\r\n   you suck bug hairy balls\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:00:50 PM)\r\n   quit trying to use my car as yours\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:01:19 PM)\r\n   hmm?\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:01:34 PM)\r\n   that\'s my car that I posted...not yours\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:01:44 PM)\r\n   I didn\'t steal that from you\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:01:54 PM)\r\n   ??????\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:02:13 PM)\r\n   are you really this thick?? no wonder the bitdorks fuck with you \r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:02:29 PM)\r\n   ^o)\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:02:57 PM)\r\n   do I have to spell it out for you\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:03:12 PM)\r\n   hahaha\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:03:22 PM)\r\n   I don\'t remember posting any of your rides as my own Bird\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:03:29 PM)\r\n   Care to refresh my memory?\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:03:34 PM)\r\n   I\'m not bird!!!\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:03:45 PM)\r\n   Oh? then who is this?\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:03:56 PM)\r\n   IBrake4Cox\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:04:05 PM)\r\n   Yeah\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:04:05 PM)\r\n   I knew\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:04:09 PM)\r\n   seriously\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:04:15 PM)\r\n   no you didn\'t \r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:04:21 PM)\r\n   I saw the \"My rides\" thread by Ibrakeforcox\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:04:29 PM)\r\n   I looked at HER images\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:04:36 PM)\r\n   I am her\r\n\r\nA.