(2:11:54 PM)\r\n   ......\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:11:58 PM)\r\n   You were playing a joke on me birdie?\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:12:12 PM)\r\n   I\'m not fucking bird you dipshit!!!!!\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:13:03 PM)\r\n   lo\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:13:05 PM)\r\n   LOL\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:13:06 PM)\r\n   LMAO\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:13:09 PM)\r\n   HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:13:26 PM)\r\n   I\'d choke you if you were in front of me right now\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:13:48 PM)\r\n   how can I prove to you that I\'m me and not bird?????\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:13:56 PM)\r\n   voice chat\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:14:14 PM)\r\n   send me this message in a PM on Bitimps\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:14:15 PM)\r\n   *Pimps\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:14:30 PM)\r\n   \"I\'M IBRAKE4COX\"\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:14:40 PM)\r\n   why?\r\n\r\nA.J. says: (2:14:50 PM)\r\n   LMAO\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:15:16 PM)\r\n   that doesn\'t prove anything\r\n\r\nbird says: (2:15:24 PM)\r\n   but ok');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21658,'465db81549','how do you tab lower my supra rides high on my seand so dus my savanah sumtin dus to help please'),(21659,'465db81549','how do you tab lower my supra rides high on my seand so dus my savanah sumtin dus to help please'),(21660,'401bae6f43','[quote:401bae6f43=\"Whitesupra35\"]how do you tab lower my supra rides high on my seand so dus my savanah sumtin dus to help please[/quote:401bae6f43]Welle what I do is cut a strip of plastic the width of the tabs. I test fit in the boddy, and when it close, I just keep sanding untill it fitsin perfectly snug.\r\n\r\nOn the SE, I shave the tab off the front, and you know how it kinda sticks up in the front of the chassis where the boddy tab is? I basically shave that all the way off, down until it\'s level. Then I\'ll cut off a piece of the plastic I shaved to fit the body slot, and super glue that into place. With super glue it\'s important not to reposition, and to leave it until it dries thoroughly. I\'ll glob some extra on there, and give an hour or so to dry. If that too loww, I stack a piece of plastic or 2 to raise it back up.\r\n\r\nThe rear tab is trickier. You know how there\'s that area that holds the screw in, below the tab? You\'ll have to glue bits of plastic oeither side of that, until it\'s as low as you want, and then you\'ll have to carve out your tab, that you\'ll cut out from your strip you already sized, to fit around that piece sticking out the bottom of that tab. Unlessyou build up the plastic to the bottom of that thing, then you can just glue your tab straight to the bottom.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI don\'t know if that makes sense, it\'s hard to paint a visual pictures with words, but that\'s the best I can explain it.\r\n\r\ndave'),(21329,'6cf332a80f','yea well Im 16 so I dont think you want to be racing a kid. although you actually might live close enough. \r\n\r\nDo you know where east brunswick or new bunswick, or even oldbridge are? If we would even race then better make sure you beat me, I dont think your wife would like if a kid beat you.  :-D');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21330,'5ff36cf4bd','Cabo , you dont NEED my respect but you HAVE it. I didnt expect you to even respond to this e-mail and the very fact that youare at the very least pretending (not saying you are) to give a damn is Pimp. Im in the postion of listening to people bitch to so ill try to keep this brief .\r\n\r\nI have no problem with anyones opinion. Namuna came in and made a subject related post in regard to how he felt about the cars that i agreed with almost entirely. He stated that some mgith be upset because information wasnt given out immediately. I respect that even more. I stated why i couldnt ( not WOULDNT ) give a review at first and as SOON as i could i did. \r\n\r\nHogjowlz locked the thread without answering my direct post in regard to shipping. He blasted me and ran without acknowledging i was right. If his exscuse is \" Well ...i didnt know where you were shipping from\" it doesnt hold weight. I mentioned where i was shipping from. Same place that HE is in . Canada. He then closes the thread after saying he doesnt delete threads. But he will ock it in order to dodge being held accountable? Thats not Pimp style and smells..well...sort of feminine ya know?\r\n\r\nHog then Locks and edits my new thread in which i aplogized to Bird because he felt i came off arrogant. I apologized not because i was wrong but as a man with religious conviction i wouldnt want anyone to feel that i came off holier than though at any point so i said even though i spoke the truth im humbly sorry if he felt that i was arrogant. \r\n\r\nI then specifically called Hog out because although Stampede man started the BS thread HOG added to the fire when it could have been stopped by personally attacking me. Not where im from man. I called him on it....and he didnt say SHIT for a few post and then he said something that was border line cool in his next...Then STARTED the BS all over again. Stampede started it but Hog egged it on. \r\n\r\nHog then closed that thread and changed the content to something moronic about dogs fucking (?). Ran and hid instead of addressing me as any man would. He used his mod power to cover his ass and run. FEMININE. Dare i say Bitch like. If im wrong call me on it. If your wrong admit it and move on.\r\n\r\nI dont want to chat because what that allows is a man to scream \"Thief!\" in public, and then apologize behind closed doors. Well shit the damage is done in public so address it in public. Dont run.\r\nThats not PIMP.\r\n\r\nPeople voicing their opinion is cool. Thats why i addressed each person individually. I dont run. Hog onthe other hand took advantage of the fact that he can edit post ( like Chewys for example) and lock threads ) without anyone coming at him. Hes like a bad cop hiding behind the badge. In the hood...thats not a man.\r\n\r\nYou mentioned Right or Wrong , Founded or Unfounded Cabo. Hypothetically if he is wrong and unfounded shouldnt he man up? Or is it ok to say whatever you want if its a lie and lock it down before someone responds? What if i did that to you on another forum ya know. Shit thats almost as bad as that OTHER place ya know?\r\n\r\n\"agree to dis-agree\" or whatever.  - If someone would have said that it would have been squashed. You see how the Crazy dave question was handled. he flamed a bit but i responded with answers and it was relatively cool. But Hog would flame...get shut down...and try to save face by continuing to flame. He is supposed to STOP that not add to it.\r\n\r\nI understand most Pimps were just watching. Many contacted me to say the few flaming pimps were way off in the way they came at this. Thats fine but it doesnt matter. I can handle questions...but people editing , running and hiding without acknowledging the facts is damn near like police brutality lol. Im wrong but Im a cop so i can do it and fuck you lol ya know lol?\r\n\r\n[quote:5ff36cf4bd]we all have to remember, we\'re all dealing with fanatical geeks here[/quote:5ff36cf4bd]\r\n\r\nLMAO...count me as one . After all we are talking about htis right lol? Its allgood...my issue is just with people flaming and running. Bad biz man. \r\n[quote:5ff36cf4bd]\r\nI hope you don\'t let this run you off. \r\nI think it\'s more that apparent that the majority respects your posts otherwise this thing wouldn\'t have gotten as heated as it did. [/quote:5ff36cf4bd]\r\n\r\nNaw man...i have my hands full with my \"job\" and the otehr sites and ive been lurking here for a long time with the occasional post. This shit just went to far and a mod shouldnt abuse his power like that. He looks bad and it makes the site look bad later.\r\n\r\nCabo ...lemme say this...\r\n\r\nOut of respect for your site i didnt come here advertising cars.\r\nI never started a thread about cars. \r\nI only posted in the thread about the cars because Stamepede Dude started this ( and later apologized).\r\nI posted a review [u:5ff36cf4bd]by request of the Pimps [/u:5ff36cf4bd]once it was cool with my partner in this case.\r\nAfter that i did what any good pimp would do ...spilled the beans.\r\n\r\nIf i cant get some Air Cover for doing whats right then damn.....i dont know what to say...that makes it look like you folks dont give a fuck and can lie and say whatever about whoever whenever (doesnt that sound like that OTHER site). I dont believe that about the pimps...thats why im so surprised. if this was the otehr site maybe...but not the Pimps. This is the adult site. The mature site.\r\n\r\nAll i ask is if Hog says im lying or that after you look over the information thats in plain text only edited by Hog...after that if you think im wrong please tell me. Have Hog tell me. Ill apologize and man up. But if not then tell Pork Chop to do the same. man up. Dont hit and run and hide. Stand your ground like a man and state your case eloquently and retract the BS he said about me.\r\n\r\nThats Real Shit. thats Pimp.'),(21331,'34e30a7791','Can I get my name changed to just chewy? I made this name awhile ago and personally, Its pretty gay.');
