INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21343,'39dc01e7ea','[quote:39dc01e7ea=\"chewy\"][quote:39dc01e7ea=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:39dc01e7ea=\"chewy\"]alright. Is it ok if I do that then? I know normally on the rc forums they say no multiple accounts. \r\n\r\nBut what about my email? I still use the same email address. If you ban/deactivate this name, will I be able to use my email address for my new name?[/quote:39dc01e7ea]your name is chewy now.\r\ndon\'t do shit, I\'ve got everything changed for you.[/quote:39dc01e7ea]\r\n\r\nThanks man. Sorry to be so annoying about it.  :sad:[/quote:39dc01e7ea]no prob - now is just a bad time'),(21344,'9d3d6a5c44','alright mr. wordy... damn! lol\r\n(I\'m like that too)\r\n\r\ndon\'t let this bother you so much.\r\n\r\nunfortunately, with me/us giving so much freedom here - some can abuse that or at the very least use it to their advantages.\r\nagain, unfortunately, I can only control so much of that.\r\nif I controlled it all - the we would be like some OTHER sites that rule with iron fists.\r\nI don\'t.\r\nwe don\'t.\r\n\r\nif it makes you feel better to continue the battle, fine - I\'ll unlock the thread.\r\nthat should leave no question about bitPimps general stance on user comments.\r\nI think you and hog can work this out, and I think you two are - we\'re adults here.\r\n\r\nit\'s obvious the main people involved here respect eachother opinions just by the words that fly around in between the \"digs\".\r\n\r\nand after I sent the last PM, I got a chance to read most of the thread and though Namuna said it perfectly, like usual - that\'s why he\'s a moderator here too.'),(33080,'d9277efac0','You are cracking me up, dude! I literally laughed out loud every post you made in that discussion. That was some funny shit.\r\n\r\nrestore your foreskin, sheesh.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (36551,'3dbf1a36e1','[quote:3dbf1a36e1=\"pimpsmurf\"]I\'ve made a boo boo. I knew I was going to miss something. I left out the TX in a drunken frenzy, but I will send it out ASAP. I\'m sorry about that man.\r\n\r\n-JNY[/quote:3dbf1a36e1]\r\n\r\nNo problem man, did you get everything else?\r\n\r\nJust send out the tx asap no worries :-o \r\n\r\n\r\nHow big of a box am i looking out for coming my way?'),(21346,'39dc01e7ea','[quote:39dc01e7ea=\"chewy\"][quote:39dc01e7ea=\"CaboWabo\"][quote:39dc01e7ea=\"chewy\"]alright. Is it ok if I do that then? I know normally on the rc forums they say no multiple accounts. \r\n\r\nBut what about my email? I still use the same email address. If you ban/deactivate this name, will I be able to use my email address for my new name?[/quote:39dc01e7ea]your name is chewy now.\r\ndon\'t do shit, I\'ve got everything changed for you.[/quote:39dc01e7ea]\r\n\r\nThanks man. Sorry to be so annoying about it.  :sad:[/quote:39dc01e7ea]no prob - now is just a bad time'),(21347,'5f6cd5d30a','are you i just saw some one with your name on there i have never seen \r\nanyone with that name');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21348,'58b88de131','LOL.... Yup, that\'s me..     Cool site for larger scale R/C'),(21350,'69cbe6432a','Its actually died down man.its some what surprising though you know. \r\nI didnt expect this type of...not ttryingto disrespect you Cabo...but this type of lying  on this site.\r\n\r\nThink about ...some kid says the auction is fake.\r\nits real.\r\nSome guy says give us a review. I couldnt at first...\r\nand then did\r\nSomeone says 5 bucks is to expensive for shipping and that he can ship the same product for 2 dollars.\r\nThat turned out to be false. He lied.\r\nSome guy says i charge a 700% mark up on the cars.\r\nThat turned out to be false. He then back tracks and says 400%. \r\nThats false also.\r\n\r\nCan you imagine Cabo....if some one was lying on you like that at Tiny or MRRC lol? Youd snatch his fuckin hoe card man. You know you would lol. You wouldnt let a man lie and call you out and do nothing.\r\n\r\n[quote:69cbe6432a]if I controlled it all - the we would be like some OTHER sites that rule with iron fists. \r\nI don\'t. \r\nwe don\'t. [/quote:69cbe6432a]\r\n\r\nI feel ya. Even though dude is factually wrong you have known him for a while and it would look like you were dissing a long time homie for some dude you dont know. Im sure thats why sez did what he did...he is closer to Hog (didnt know that) than me. Im not knocking that....i know the rules.\r\n\r\nBut shouldnt the right thing be done at all times? Shouldnt it? Or only sometimes...when it benfits the homie? Shouldnt a homie say to another homie...\"eh...your wrong on this one man...\"?'),(21351,'69cbe6432a','Its actually died down man.its some what surprising though you know. \r\nI didnt expect this type of...not ttryingto disrespect you Cabo...but this type of lying  on this site.\r\n\r\nThink about ...some kid says the auction is fake.\r\nits real.\r\nSome guy says give us a review. I couldnt at first...\r\nand then did\r\nSomeone says 5 bucks is to expensive for shipping and that he can ship the same product for 2 dollars.\r\nThat turned out to be false. He lied.\r\nSome guy says i charge a 700% mark up on the cars.\r\nThat turned out to be false. He then back tracks and says 400%. \r\nThats false also.\r\n\r\nCan you imagine Cabo....if some one was lying on you like that at Tiny or MRRC lol? Youd snatch his fuckin hoe card man. You know you would lol. You wouldnt let a man lie and call you out and do nothing.\r\n\r\n[quote:69cbe6432a]if I controlled it all - the we would be like some OTHER sites that rule with iron fists. \r\nI don\'t. \r\nwe don\'t. [/quote:69cbe6432a]\r\n\r\nI feel ya. Even though dude is factually wrong you have known him for a while and it would look like you were dissing a long time homie for some dude you dont know. Im sure thats why sez did what he did...he is closer to Hog (didnt know that) than me. Im not knocking that....i know the rules.\r\n\r\nBut shouldnt the right thing be done at all times? Shouldnt it? Or only sometimes...when it benfits the homie? Shouldnt a homie say to another homie...\"eh...your wrong on this one man...\"?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34169,'73189f2cb6','Object not found!\r\nThe requested URL was not found on this server. If you entered the URL manually please check your spelling and try again. \r\n\r\nIf you think this is a server error, please contact the webmaster. \r\n\r\nError 404\r\nbitpimps.lixlink.com\r\nApache/2.0.50 (Fedora) \r\n\r\nand I use internet Explorer cuz I am a dumb sheep. :-('),(32551,'67525a0725','Tell me you have it by now DT. I\'m gonna freak if not.'),(32552,'5f8bc3e0d5','[quote:5f8bc3e0d5=\"mikirgra\"]Tell me you have it by now DT. I\'m gonna freak if not.[/quote:5f8bc3e0d5]\r\nGot it yesterday.  What is your PayPal email addres again?  I\'ll pop you Da 30G\'s  :cool: \r\nThanx Again Man!\r\n\r\nI know what you mean I was doing a favor for Micro Amps and in doing so I sent him my SE and Tomy Booster Z to FET and all that shit got lost.  I felt bad cause he won something off eBay, that the seller wouldn\'t ship over seas so he had him send it to me.  I didn\'t feel my loss too bad, replaced my Audi SE but still haven\'t found a replacement for my Z  :-? \r\nMy 1st Booster............\r\n[img:5f8bc3e0d5]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpGallery/albums/userpics/10005/ZCar-006.jpg[/img:5f8bc3e0d5]\r\nWith my Nakamichi Wheels  :('),(35024,'7b730235d5','one milllllllion dollars! :lol: \r\n\r\nbut seriously i don\'t have a deluxe, just 2 regular ones and i\'m using them both, sorry man!\r\n\r\nbut i will get in ph2t\'s ear about it and try to make him build you one :-o');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (29539,'099a220bb8','Hey man,\r\nI\'m sending out a few love letters and I need your address.\r\n\r\nMon\' with it. :lol:'),(28874,'677cafcd7f','as soon as they are availible I will order you one too! do you want 27mhz or the 49? oh and I am not doing this for proffit so just the actual cost of car and fright I will send airmail parcel post when I get it. \r\n\r\nwill let you know as soon as I get one for ya!\r\ntake care\r\n\r\nTexas pimp\r\nSteelwoolghandi'),(24754,'68132a720a','As per Cabos request to clean shits up in the hood... You still got these pics somewhere? I checked your gallery, but they werent there... if you still got them... put \'em in there and replace the red Xs, man...\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?p=57473#57473'),(21353,'38ecf47a6f','I will hold it for you. Let me check what the shipping is gonna be, but shouldn\'t be much. Did you want any kind of express/priority or just normal. It will come packed in the original box.'),(21354,'4db3fbcee8','Just normal.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21355,'139325035e','Dude I am still willing to but 4 or 8 if you need me too.. I can give them out as b-day presents to my little cuz\'s'),(21356,'67c00f9a19','Well, since the thread went down here, I\'ve got the thing going over at WGU.  I will put down a list of people who are definites and people who are maybe\'s.  I\'m also in the process of actually contacting the company about the purchase.  Thanks for your interest.\r\n\r\n-=GfµnK=-'),(21357,'ededbbc599','no offense taken man - but allow me to express my views and know it\'s not meant to be offensive...\r\n\r\nlying is everywhere, including this site.\r\nthe difference is, we\'re the ones that point them out.\r\ntypically, the majority (of lies) come from attention seeking kids. the micro rc community as a whole has come to know us for calling out liars and trying to help us little guys, you can go to almost any forum and see that (unless our posts have been deleted or what-not).\r\n\r\nI think several of our members have made some good posts to sum up the whole fiasco (e.g. Namuna, SuperFly, hue35, etc.).\r\nI also think confusion and assumptions helped to add fuel to the fire that had been dying to start, from both sides.\r\n[quote:ededbbc599=\"I AM\"]Think about ...some kid says the auction is fake.\r\nits real.[/quote:ededbbc599]\r\nI didn\'t read anyone calling it \"fake\", but the post that created the topic did \"question the legitimacy\" of the auction. hell even after we got some sort of explination, pimps were starting to thank you for the little information you didn\'t hold back on.\r\n[quote:ededbbc599=\"I AM\"]Someone says 5 bucks is to expensive for shipping and that he can ship the same product for 2 dollars.\r\nThat turned out to be false. He lied.[/quote:ededbbc599]\r\nhere\'s where you\'re both making total assumptions.\r\nhe didn\'t lie. nor did you.\r\nhe probably did ship a micro for $2.00 to Florida. I\'ve done it.\r\nHog lives in the US, not Canada.\r\nI\'ve also shipped out of the country (I don\'t believe he has), and have paid over $5.00 at times.\r\nSo I beleive your shipping charges, and as you can see in the forums, so do other pimps - you can look for their posts I won\'t directly quote them here.\r\n[quote:ededbbc599=\"I AM\"]Some guy says i charge a 700% mark up on the cars.\r\nThat turned out to be false. He then back tracks and says 400%. \r\nThats false also.[/quote:ededbbc599]\r\nso maybe his math sucks? maybe he exaggerated? I personally feel he was exaggerating to make a point, the point being that so far from the information he has, it seems to him - he can get the same stuff you\'re trying to sell - only for cheaper.\r\nnow maybe he\'s right, maybe he\'s wrong, but as we all like to claim \"we\'re all adults here\" and therefore we should all be able to make our decisions.\r\nyou can see that in the posts on the forum as well where pimps talk about believing your shipping charges, but still wouldn\'t pay 25 or 35 dollars. they\'ve made their own decision and without bashing anyone, but merely stating their personal opinion (that\'s the adult part).\r\n[quote:ededbbc599=\"I AM\"]Can you imagine Cabo....if some one was lying on you like that at Tiny or MRRC lol? Youd snatch his fuckin hoe card man. You know you would lol. You wouldnt let a man lie and call you out and do nothing.[/quote:ededbbc599]for the most part, yea - you\'re right. I\'d stand up for myself and I have. like I told hogjowlz, I have no qualms about you guys defending yourselves.\r\n[quote:ededbbc599=\"I AM\"]I feel ya. Even though dude is factually wrong you have known him for a while and it would look like you were dissing a long time homie for some dude you dont know. Im sure thats why sez did what he did...he is closer to Hog (didnt know that) than me. Im not knocking that....i know the rules.[/quote:ededbbc599]that maybe true in a lot of cases, and I do support my moderators, but we also have private discussions just like you and I are having - so no - in that sense I don\'t \"play favorites\".\r\nI think that\'s totally apparent. and while I don\'t really appreciate that you might think that I do \"play favorites\", that\'s your opinion - I won\'t knock you for it.\r\n[quote:ededbbc599=\"I AM\"]But shouldnt the right thing be done at all times? Shouldnt it? Or only sometimes...when it benfits the homie? Shouldnt a homie say to another homie...\"eh...your wrong on this one man...\"?[/quote:ededbbc599]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=4297\r\nread SuperFly\'s and hue35\'s responses here on the first page.\r\nnow tell me pimps don\'t call each other out or... \"eh... your wrong on this one man...\"?\r\nthat\'s exactly what they are doing. and those are 2 very well respected members.\r\nwhat more vindication do you want?\r\nnobody is gonna blow ya to make ya feel better. lol\r\n\r\nthose are just my thoughts and opinions on this whole subject.'),(21358,'c65da359a6','Not looking for head service but you did bring up vindication  and thats what any man would be after but i had to step back because i realized i cant telegraph and ass whoopin\' through cable wires lol.\r\n\r\nIts all good...so long as he doesnt say anything about it its done. I have had more than enough people contact me after reading the thread to let me know i wasnt in the wrong and like you said...no ones gonna blow me but that approval in my eyes is enough  :) \r\n\r\nOn ta greener pastures....\r\n\r\nI really encourage you cats to get a group purchase together once the close out on ZZSE\'s is over. You cant beat 15 as i mentioned earlier ( i wish that was the case here) but if its more expensive peep the cars. They will slowly creep up on us all...just wait  8-) \r\n\r\nThanks for handling the situation like a pimp. I didnt see the thread unlocked but at least the other one wasnt locked down and thats good enough for me.\r\n\r\nPeace');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21359,'b96fd0de80','and just when i thought it was over....http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=4297&amp;start=15\r\n\r\nyour boy makes a post in my name.\r\n\r\nHE MADE A POST IN MY NAME CABO lol. He pretended to be me. Now Thats PUNK. He lost all respect.\r\n\r\nHow cowardly is that? And then he locked it. You let your boys get way with that ?\r\n\r\nThats ok here?'),(21360,'c65da359a6','Not looking for head service but you did bring up vindication  and thats what any man would be after but i had to step back because i realized i cant telegraph and ass whoopin\' through cable wires lol.\r\n\r\nIts all good...so long as he doesnt say anything about it its done. I have had more than enough people contact me after reading the thread to let me know i wasnt in the wrong and like you said...no ones gonna blow me but that approval in my eyes is enough  :) \r\n\r\nOn ta greener pastures....\r\n\r\nI really encourage you cats to get a group purchase together once the close out on ZZSE\'s is over. You cant beat 15 as i mentioned earlier ( i wish that was the case here) but if its more expensive peep the cars. They will slowly creep up on us all...just wait  8-) \r\n\r\nThanks for handling the situation like a pimp. I didnt see the thread unlocked but at least the other one wasnt locked down and thats good enough for me.\r\n\r\nPeace'),(21361,'b96fd0de80','and just when i thought it was over....http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=4297&amp;start=15\r\n\r\nyour boy makes a post in my name.\r\n\r\nHE MADE A POST IN MY NAME CABO lol. He pretended to be me. Now Thats PUNK. He lost all respect.\r\n\r\nHow cowardly is that? And then he locked it. You let your boys get way with that ?\r\n\r\nThats ok here?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21364,'983cb5000f','City, State, Zip?'),(21365,'8b0b52e9e5','Mike Smalley Jr.\r\n3918 Inland Ave.\r\nWest Mifflin, Pa  15122'),(22297,'9e6cdca87c','Me and my friend are thinkin bouit buying all of it 50$ plus ok if you still have it we have all of it i think im not making promises but im sendin by money order if we do it ok \r\n\r\n\r\npeace'),(22298,'9e6cdca87c','Me and my friend are thinkin bouit buying all of it 50$ plus ok if you still have it we have all of it i think im not making promises but im sendin by money order if we do it ok \r\n\r\n\r\npeace'),(33557,'a2f2ebd560','http://tinyrc.com/lincoln/Worlds/MicroRC/ZZ_Catalog_Images/ZZ_MainFrame.htm\r\n\r\nSo, where\'s the program you used that creates this?\r\nWhat kind of program is it, CGI?\r\nDoes it just scour a specific section of the RS site for files?\r\nI want to take a look at the code just for giggles.'),(22301,'3ab5ff7e1f','[quote:3ab5ff7e1f=\"TallduDe\"]yeah i tried to contact big kahahouna but he did not reply.\r\n\r\ni got paypal\r\n\r\ncan u tell us the paypal email thing and how much it will cost?\r\n\r\ncheers man[/quote:3ab5ff7e1f]crazydave actually handles the paypal payments so I\'m going to refer this question to him.\r\nHe\'ll contact you with information.\r\n\r\n~ CaboWabo'),(26764,'c1de7ec62d','Hey Hog,\r\n\r\nCan ya hook me up with some Doom III action? I\'d DL it over BitTorrent, but with all the shit goin down over BT I\'m tryin to stay away from any \'questionable\' behavior.\r\n\r\nReceived my 6800GT last night and now I wanna put that badboy to USE.\r\n\r\nThanks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21656,'8fbde871b1','[quote:8fbde871b1=\"Ahh5hit\"]Sent it out today, should be there in 3-4 business days.[/quote:8fbde871b1]\r\n\r\nI\'ll let you know when I get it.\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\n\r\nMike'),(21371,'eab1dcbe1d','No Prob!\r\n\r\nGH Sims\r\n7815 Quill Point Drive\r\nBowie, Md. 20720\r\n\r\nThanx Pimp  :cool:'),(33087,'ea56157790','heh, my desk light burned out and i hit something, sent the first message...\r\n\r\n[quote:ea56157790=\"payaso\"]Cool, thanks man.   That\'s smaller than I thought.   I need one now though...lol\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve[/quote:ea56157790]\r\n\r\nwell like DT said, the company\'s gone... so if you REALLY REALLY want one, i might be able to pick another one up as they are still in stock at my local hobby store. ebay probably wont have anything... they keep getting returned cause they\'re pieces of shit stock... i put the cell phone battery in, that cured one HUGE problem... although you need a charger for it... your looking at like 10-15 minute run times with 18-20 minute charge times, the charger batteries in the controller last about 3 good charges until they need replacing... FYI its 3, 2/3 AAA batteries, they push about 600mA @ 3.6V... the cell phone battery lasts 45 minutes to an hour, takes 3 hours to charge, pushes 850mA @ 4.2V eventually works down to 500mA @ 3.1V...\r\n\r\ni guess you can run it stock if you take a 6V 1000mA AC adaptor and hook it up as the charger\'s power source...\r\n\r\ni dunno, but if you want one and cant find em anywhere, let me know...'),(29691,'69e238fbea','Sorry for the late reply dude, but just like always, I was having computer problems....lol\r\n\r\n\r\nFor the limo deal, I can probably work something out for her/you.\r\n\r\n\r\nI drive for a private dude, and he\'ll probably let me rent it cheaply from him on the side, or he might want to party with them. (he\'s 30) and that would probably make it cheaper.. (up to your sis though)\r\n\r\n\r\nNormal price for a limo rental is around 65 an hour + 20% for the driver here in FL.\r\n\r\n\r\nI might be able to do 45 an hour - the 20%\r\n\r\n\r\nMy # is (727) 418-2898  (my cell)\r\n\r\n\r\nDo they smoke/party?   Do I need to behave myself?lol\r\n\r\n\r\nWhy in the fuckin hell aren\'t you coming too?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-Steve');
