ot to level20 in beta.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (32204,'41979546fa','I can go $90shipped and include the mini cooper roof set and a few tire sets. Let me know. Thanks!'),(22253,'b1dbc959e1','Thanks for letting me know you got em. If you or anyone else you know needs bodies let me know. I gotta bunch of bodies. Have fun modifiying your new bodies! \r\n\r\nJDM'),(21759,'0bba1f0c61','dude i searched all my shit. i know i packed it when i moved. ill check the basement again but i think its awol.\r\n\r\nsoo i can a: make you a new one or b: give you something else of equal or greater value lol'),(25924,'53863d423e','http://forums.worldofwarcraft.com/serverforums.shtml'),(23790,'75e543f4fe','Cool Cool\r\n\r\n Yea my xmods get so much play now with the drift kit, but you need teh AWD kit aswell (most people have it anyway)'),(21767,'53ea0b122b','ill put the cuda on it then. its boogered up a bit but not too beat lol.'),(23823,'6855c3921e','[quote:6855c3921e=\"hogjowlz\"]you got aim dude? im keeph42[/quote:6855c3921e]\r\n\r\n  No but I will download it.\r\n\r\n  I usually use yahoo and msn\r\n\r\nBTW I got NFSU up and running we should race sometime'),(21770,'9b15d3505a','[quote:9b15d3505a=\"hogjowlz\"]ill put the cuda on it then. its boogered up a bit but not too beat lol.[/quote:9b15d3505a]\r\n\r\nThanks.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21771,'d871d77718','hej jeg hedder Casper jeg ville lige høre hvor du har købt din figur'),(21778,'aba5d4b62e','[quote:aba5d4b62e]Hey, who remember when goku came to bitpimps? \r\n\r\n...Man, look what he is doing now...[/quote:aba5d4b62e]\r\n\r\nAre you saying I\'ve gotten worse, or improved? I didn\'t get the full meaning of that.....  :('),(21781,'eccba288a9','Well im not really sure what to offer just name a price and I will go with that.'),(21782,'982c212874','hey think you can hold onto that Lambo body for me. Got to get me a Toyota Bb from HLJ for 8.09 USD.'),(21783,'879f0cd3d0','Just for teh pullback chassies I was asking $2.00 and teh Shells I was asking $4.00 \r\n\r\n plus shipping.'),(21784,'879f0cd3d0','Just for teh pullback chassies I was asking $2.00 and teh Shells I was asking $4.00 \r\n\r\n plus shipping.'),(22867,'b09663af12','[quote:b09663af12]A bit of advice... (damn that sounded Goku-esque lol)[/quote:b09663af12]\r\n\r\n....... 8-)'),(21786,'feb09b021d','Hey Gokou!\r\n\r\nWell, sorry for the misunderstanding i thought that you would get it. \r\n\r\n...But you have defiantly improved yourself since the time you got here, where you didnt even know when to say something or shut up. That was kinda why you got \"hanged up\" here at bitpimps.\r\n\r\nSo no bad feelings?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21787,'d8cc9ada5f','hey i am danish   :-) \r\n\r\n\r\nwhere do you buy yours cars and yours figurs?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfrom PINGO'),(26627,'13a81a51dd','ohhh i am from denmark my name is casper ! what about you?'),(21789,'0bdd64cadb','[quote:0bdd64cadb=\"PINGO\"]hey i am danish   :-) \r\n\r\n\r\nwhere do you buy yours cars and yours figurs?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfrom PINGO[/quote:0bdd64cadb]hi PINGO, welcome to bitPimps.\r\nwe have a few other Danish members as well, so you might get a better response if you post this in the General Bit Discussion forum.\r\nour other Danish members may be able to help you or tell you of a store near you that sells the cars.\r\n\r\nwe buy the cars from all over.\r\nusually hobby or toy stores carry them. we buy at online shops and buy, trade, and sell here on this forum.\r\n\r\nthe figures are called \"Homies\" and most of us buy them out of gumball machines / toy machines. a lot of users buy, sell, and trade with each other on this forum as well.\r\nyou can also purchase them from places like ebay or from their site at www.homies.tv\r\n\r\ngood luck!'),(21790,'7b7e5df361','can you fuckers stop posting the pullbacks for sale.\r\nI can\'t be spendin $ right now and I keep seeing pullbacks for sale.\r\nthe urge... the bug... the itch... it\'s there... it sucks.\r\n\r\n  Yo dude if you need some pullbacks for projects or whatnot let me know you know you dont need cash to shop in my hood :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21791,'7b7e5df361','can you fuckers stop posting the pullbacks for sale.\r\nI can\'t be spendin $ right now and I keep seeing pullbacks for sale.\r\nthe urge... the bug... the itch... it\'s there... it sucks.\r\n\r\n  Yo dude if you need some pullbacks for projects or whatnot let me know you know you dont need cash to shop in my hood :)'),(21855,'bef80ce519','i have ben cheated many times soo i dont know if i want to buy in here... yo dont have other sites? \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\naniway thanks'),(21793,'aadde811f4','[quote:aadde811f4=\"VooDooMafia\"]Yo dude if you need some pullbacks for projects or whatnot let me know you know you dont need cash to shop in my hood :)[/quote:aadde811f4]shit man, thanks.\r\nwhat can I trade you? I see you\'re kinda moving out of the bits and zips... I don\'t have any other scale stuff.\r\nit\'s still early and my brain ain\'t workin that good so if you think of something I might have that you want, let me know.'),(21794,'b0bc03f25a','whatever man really for you oldscholl pimps its doesn\'t even matter.\r\n\r\n  I am not really moving out of bits just making room for some new stuff.\r\n\r\n  I have about 100 bits/zips now and about 50 never opened just sitting on teh displayself so I figured if I can move some to make room for new ones I can use that cash instead of my own cash.\r\n\r\n\r\n  I have not had to much extra spending cash since I bought this http://www3.sympatico.ca/voodoomafia/tt.jpg\r\n\r\n  So I guess its more on whatever you have or I can just send them its cool.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21795,'b0bc03f25a','whatever man really for you oldscholl pimps its doesn\'t even matter.\r\n\r\n  I am not really moving out of bits just making room for some new stuff.\r\n\r\n  I have about 100 bits/zips now and about 50 never opened just sitting on teh displayself so I figured if I can move some to make room for new ones I can use that cash instead of my own cash.\r\n\r\n\r\n  I have not had to much extra spending cash since I bought this http://www3.sympatico.ca/voodoomafia/tt.jpg\r\n\r\n  So I guess its more on whatever you have or I can just send them its cool.'),(21880,'c40eb440c9','so then you are running them in a parallel circuit so youd either have the controller not working or switched on it would be generating two frequencies on the same circuit which is total bs. did you put a variac in there to lower the inductance?   give up buddy.'),(21881,'b580c8dcc3','Just wondering if you had a chance to hit RS at all?\r\n\r\n  Just wondering what ones you were able to pick up.'),(23298,'67587862e3','well channel5 is sitting in it. you want that?');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21797,'feb09b021d','Hey Gokou!\r\n\r\nWell, sorry for the misunderstanding i thought that you would get it. \r\n\r\n...But you have defiantly improved yourself since the time you got here, where you didnt even know when to say something or shut up. That was kinda why you got \"hanged up\" here at bitpimps.\r\n\r\nSo no bad feelings?'),(21798,'8bb71b01dc','lol, thanks....it\'s all good pimp...'),(21799,'b444260247','[quote:b444260247=\"VooDooMafia\"]whatever man really for you oldscholl pimps its doesn\'t even matter.\r\n\r\n  I am not really moving out of bits just making room for some new stuff.\r\n\r\n  I have about 100 bits/zips now and about 50 never opened just sitting on teh displayself so I figured if I can move some to make room for new ones I can use that cash instead of my own cash.\r\n\r\n\r\n  I have not had to much extra spending cash since I bought this http://www3.sympatico.ca/voodoomafia/tt.jpg\r\n\r\n  So I guess its more on whatever you have or I can just send them its cool.[/quote:b444260247]god damn... that car is pimp.\r\n\r\naight, lemme check what I got that you might want and I\'ll get back to ya with a list of some stuff. sound good?'),(21800,'0bd7fc6f9a','yea man whatever :)');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21801,'ee56e5a33e','to you still got any of that xmod stuff for sale?'),(21802,'0bd7fc6f9a','yea man whatever :)'),(21804,'74edbace39','hey ripper -\r\nsorry I haven\'t replied, been so freakin busy...\r\nanyways - yes that\'s fine, make your post and ask whomever you wish.\r\nall I ask is that if you get a bitPimp to write something, just give a link back to us or to the article/post/etc. it pertains to.\r\n\r\nThanks for asking.\r\n\r\nThe mag looks cool by the way.\r\n\r\n~ Cabo\r\n[quote:74edbace39=\"ripper7777777\"]Hey I think the link I sent you got changed.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.ripper7racing.com/Magazine/aug04/index.htm\r\n\r\nI\'m going to post a thread asking for writers, I would like the mag to cover from 1/18th to 1/64th scales so I\'d like to have some Pimpin Writers and maybe a section for the Pimps, also I\'d like you to have a Bit Pimp Full page ad in the next issue.\r\n\r\nWell I wanted to give you a heads up.\r\n\r\nTTYL\r\n\r\nRipper[/quote:74edbace39]'),(21805,'150a5f68ce','Oh no problem, I plan to not only credit the person &amp; bit pimps but if they wish to discuss the article here they can add a direct link to a thread discussing it.\r\n\r\nThanks for the support, I want the next mag to have some more Bit Pimp Flavor.\r\n\r\n\r\nTTYL');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21806,'150a5f68ce','Oh no problem, I plan to not only credit the person &amp; bit pimps but if they wish to discuss the article here they can add a direct link to a thread discussing it.\r\n\r\nThanks for the support, I want the next mag to have some more Bit Pimp Flavor.\r\n\r\n\r\nTTYL'),(35745,'d0740d8606','Pics are working now , let me know  :-o'),(35857,'71a1992353','Hey man, i was crusing through the older posts and i noticed some nice little buggies in the background of one of the pics. [url]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=6513&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;highlight=buggy&amp;start=15[/url]\r\n\r\nWhat size are those? and where did you pick those up at??? Im thinking of making a bit buggy and it looks like a great starting place\r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\nSTG'),(21810,'ee56e5a33e','to you still got any of that xmod stuff for sale?'),(23019,'56b77a62d0','#1: Whaddya think of my new avatar?  :-) \r\n\r\n#2: Props on reachin 7000+ posts, dat\'s more than OTP had at MRCC before....you know...'),(28623,'bb5d3767e2','Actually morfars.dk (the guys running RCinfo - the place i moderate) is talking about a future contest. \r\n\r\nDon\'t think you can enter though - he will most likely limit it to active users on the forum. However you are more than welcome to judge a contest. \r\n\r\nHehe, and IF you really want the SL/CLK/Whatever MB it is, then i\'m pretty sure you can get it at RCmart - and for a MUCH cheaper price than at Morfars(it means grandpa btw).\r\n\r\nSuperfly and Hue35 once posted some of their cars in the garage at the forum - with great succes, alot of the members got interested in 1:64 suddenly. Just tell me where you are lost and i will help you :)\r\n\r\nCheers');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (28624,'12b86bfa9f','[quote:12b86bfa9f=\"TheEvo\"]Actually morfars.dk (the guys running RCinfo - the place i moderate) is talking about a future contest. \r\n\r\nDon\'t think you can enter though - he will most likely limit it to active users on the forum. However you are more than welcome to judge a contest. \r\n\r\nHehe, and IF you really want the SL/CLK/Whatever MB it is, then i\'m pretty sure you can get it at RCmart - and for a MUCH cheaper price than at Morfars(it means grandpa btw).\r\n\r\nSuperfly and Hue35 once posted some of their cars in the garage at the forum - with great succes, alot of the members got interested in 1:64 suddenly. Just tell me where you are lost and i will help you :)\r\n\r\nCheers[/quote:12b86bfa9f]\r\n\r\nGive me the forum url again, can\'t find it  8-) \r\n\r\nThanx'),(21813,'0e90aae603','well to be honest I was just looking for\r\n\r\nwheel set- $5\r\n\r\nBeaten up civic body, $5\r\n\r\nExtremely bashed skyline body, $3 \r\n\r\n  The controllers I have no use for (if one only has 1 of the crystals then the crystal is usless aswell)\r\n\r\n  And the other stuff is missing parts that I would have to buy the sets new to get.'),(21814,'0e90aae603','well to be honest I was just looking for\r\n\r\nwheel set- $5\r\n\r\nBeaten up civic body, $5\r\n\r\nExtremely bashed skyline body, $3 \r\n\r\n  The controllers I have no use for (if one only has 1 of the crystals then the crystal is usless aswell)\r\n\r\n  And the other stuff is missing parts that I would have to buy the sets new to get.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (21816,'a2ffb706b8','How much would it set me back if I sent you the SE for FETs and all?'),(23074,'9e327086dc','www.bitpimps.lixlink.com is under contruction, right?\r\n\r\nSo is this site:\r\n\r\nhttp://bitpips.lixlink.com/\r\n\r\n :???:'),(21818,'ba56b527d2','whats shiping to \r\n\r\nL2V 2K3 in Canada?\r\n\r\nshould be more then 4 or 5 bucks as I just had a complete xmod sent for 7 bucks'),(21819,'0bdd64cadb','[quote:0bdd64cadb=\"PINGO\"]hey i am danish   :-) \r\n\r\n\r\nwhere do you buy yours cars and yours figurs?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nfrom PINGO[/quote:0bdd64cadb]hi PINGO, welcome to bitPimps.\r\nwe have a few other Danish members as well, so you might get a better response if you post this in the General Bit Discussion forum.\r\nour other Danish members may be able to help you or tell you of a store near you that sells the cars.\r\n\r\nwe buy the cars from all over.\r\nusually hobby or toy stores carry them. we buy at online shops and buy, trade, and sell here on this forum.\r\n\r\nthe figures are called \"Homies\" and most of us buy them out of gumball machines / toy machines. a lot of users buy, sell, and trade with each other on this forum as well.\r\nyou can also purchase them from places like ebay or from their site at www.homies.tv\r\n\r\ngood luck!'),(21820,'cd4299e0c3','okay but here ind denmark you cant by dogede challenger and them så do you no the name of a online shop? and at homie.tv you just cant buy one homi i relly want \"big spokey\" ore big dopey but i have to buy a set fore 25 dollars :???:');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (23148,'af26838422','Dude, I know what you and the other pimps are up to....\r\n\r\nLay off RCmod, just because I\'m a mod there and you hate me doesn\'t mean you have to trash the site, ok?'),(21822,'eabe7445b0','[quote:eabe7445b0=\"Son_Gokou\"]How much would it set me back if I sent you the SE for FETs and all?[/quote:eabe7445b0]I\'ve been charging people $10 plus shipping.\r\n\r\nYou can either ship your car to me or if you\'d like, you can pay me for an SE, and I\'ll go grab you one. I only bring that up because with them being on sale for $16.99 right now, that almost makes more sense that paying for shipping both ways.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you\'re interested, and I\'ll get you the info you need.\r\n\r\nDave'),(34657,'6ed20fe332','Been out of the loop on your Nelly stuff for a while.  Was looking to pick up a Nelly 1.3 with 1 way connections.  Checked your site.  Is your store still closed?\r\n\r\nI would really like to get my hands on a Nelly Deluxe, but it doesn\'t look like I\'ll get one of those for under $100.  Hell, the Xmod I want ot put it in isn\'t even worth that much.  That\'s cool though.  I\'m glad you\'re makin dough off of that. :cool: \r\n\r\nCheers'),(34658,'391c97d355','get on msn please.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (34659,'391c97d355','get on msn please.'),(34660,'c46f44c40c','ok'),(34663,'94090b21c9','my truck looks so fuckin kool im working on bed toper and a bed the bed toper is going to open.'),(29188,'d2887bcb2c','Sorry to contact you directly, but is there some kind of plugin that I don\'t now or is a problem with my browser (FireFox), because I never can see your file attach and since Im trying to understand a little bit how the electronics work and you are one of the persons that understands about it and appears in several forums! \r\n\r\nAny way I found this up, you myth have seen in the forum can you understand the circuit:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.math.niu.edu/~behr/RC/AP/ap-digital.html\r\n\r\nBecause he says: This is a fully digital circuit that takes the 1ms to 2ms pulse from the receiver and converts it into a pwm train at 1Khz INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37629,'2b716c89f8','Do you think you will be able to make the payment today?'),(36722,'8dac71ea66','I put in the drive shaft, those cup shafts go in the rear right? Or are they used for 4 wheel drive because i have not installed 4wd.'),(29191,'4f061a6a59','[quote:4f061a6a59=\"SuperFly\"][quote:4f061a6a59=\"betula66\"]Hi :-) ,I just wanted to ask if you\'ve got the price....[/quote:4f061a6a59]\r\n\r\nHey, tell ya what. Fuck you. If you\'ve got nothing good to say about someone who is doing you a major favor, you just need to find someone else to help you out. Good luck  :x[/quote:4f061a6a59]\r\n\r\nWhy the fuck? You didn\'t do anything man. I\'ve been waiting for your answer, but you couldn\'t even do it.\r\nYou say major favour? I say its just a fool, so  :finger: .'),(30820,'47d57aff10','ok not a problem . :)'),(30951,'17beddec7d','Dude, how was your package?  :-) \r\n\r\n[url]http://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pages/phpForum/viewtopic.php?t=6260&amp;postdays=0&amp;postorder=asc&amp;start=30[/url]'),(22325,'305f5decb0','[quote:305f5decb0=\"Stoli\"]cool thanx mang\r\n\r\nWell I want \r\n\r\nMillionaire off this one\r\n\r\nThanx dude[/quote:305f5decb0]here ya go bro\r\nyou should be able to download it from this link:\r\nhttp://bitpimps.lixlink.com/pimpbox/4.mp3');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (26636,'aab0ed2da2','i dont noo...... hey happe birthday  :D  we dont have a fuck of micro rc\'s or eny of that  :sad:'),(26637,'2626001e2e','[quote:2626001e2e=\"PINGO\"]i dont noo...... hey happe birthday  :D  we dont have a fuck of micro rc\'s or eny of that  :sad:[/quote:2626001e2e]Do you have msn messenger. If so i can help you with stuff. I can seel you some stuuf man if you need it lol NP if you want an Xmod send me the money and ill send it to you . Cause im a good friend. If you wanna be my friend :)'),(21827,'72b3e37c57','[quote:72b3e37c57=\"PINGO\"]okay but here ind denmark you cant by dogede challenger and them så do you no the name of a online shop? and at homie.tv you just cant buy one homi i relly want \"big spokey\" ore big dopey but i have to buy a set fore 25 dollars :???:[/quote:72b3e37c57]www.radioshack.com sells zipzaps, not sure if they ship to denmark or not.\r\nyour best bet for both the car/body or homie will be to make a post in the \"Lookin\' To Score\" forum and ask if anyone has what you want for sale.'),(33203,'2070f57e90','[quote:2070f57e90=\"pimpsmurf\"]*twitch* want lipo protector *twitch*\r\n\r\nhurry. they might sell out again...\r\n\r\n-JNY[/quote:2070f57e90]\r\n\r\nsorry, missed your other msg at xmodsforum mate.  I\'ll have one 2 cell and one 3 cell.  Let me know the total after shipping has been factored in.  shipping to you and then also shipping to me...  and I\'ll shoot ya some cash.');
INSERT INTO `phpbb_privmsgs_text` (`privmsgs_text_id`,`privmsgs_bbcode_uid`,`privmsgs_text`) VALUES (37486,'7badb9a481','ok. sorry dude'),(37487,'7badb9a481','ok. sorry dude'),(34690,'4183ac6375','Hey Pimp,\r\n\r\nCruisin over at RC Universe and ran across this bloke.....\r\n\r\nhttp://www.rcuniverse.com/forum/edit.asp?messageID=3517678&amp;toStyle=tm\r\n\r\nSo I sent him yo way....  8-)'),(22143,'403825dcf2','Naw dude, I have 2 \"new\" minis, it was the old school one that I was diggin on.  Enjoy it for sure.\r\n\r\nAs for the X-mods, let me make a call right now and find out.  I thought there was no real intrest.'),(24997,'f4bd348a8b','no worries ill do it a.s.a.p'),(34722,'65775ca8bb','[quote:65775ca8bb=\"ph2t\"]http://shop.ausmicro.net/index.php?currency=USD&amp;cPath=25_39\r\n\r\n(can\'t help the plug, lol.............)[/quote:65775ca8bb]\r\nShutty... since when did we ever care about a link to some place else (other than in the Sale/Buy/Trade categories)?\r\nEspecially a \'pimps\' place - people gotta know the right place to get what.\r\n\r\nJust makin sure you know there\'s no worries man.\r\nThis your home too (one of em anyways lol).'),(29232,'57b240372f','Well, im workin on a budget right now which i think is probably way below what you would want for that car. I\'m gonna be doing my upgradin a little at a time ( prolly every 2 weeks ) but with my post i wanted to know ahead of time what i wanted/needed...... You tell me a price for it and ill tell you if i can afford it, prolly not tho.');
